  },
  AvgDialog_18813_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Sandstorm 1"
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Phew, sorry, no time for you to adapt now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ramona was visibly shocked; you don't recall ever seeing her so flustered in your memory."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The girl, bombarded with questions, spoke in a trembling voice and appeared somewhat fatigued."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Am I here for a vacation?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_13 = {
    Text = "She closed her eyes briefly and gathered her strength."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
I should have realized it. The attackers showed a deep familiarity with Mythag; the Key Tomb could not have been spared.
We are close to the back door. Hurry up and leave.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_15 = {
    Text = "We can go! %player% can Link us all and then command—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
Ramona.
Those are our obligations, %player% is just a fledgling.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_17 = {
    Text = "But %player% can, I know {Male=he,Female=she} can."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Doll looks you up and down, then turns to face Ramona with a serious expression."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
If I'm not mistaken, the oath ceremony should still be incomplete.
{Male=He,Female=She} hasn't been granted the silver key yet, right?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The anomaly reached the Key Tomb before the alarm sounded. The <Blue:Mist Barrier> around Mythag is likely down."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Unauthorized entry into Mythag's restricted area is a serious offense. I thought you grew up here and were aware of that."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The situation is urgent, and %player% is no ordinary freshman, {Male=he,Female=she} is our only Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You should still remember, right? The <Yellow:Yakutsk explosion> a year ago. If it wasn't for {Male=his,Female=her} individual effort to link all the Awakers, I wouldn't be standing here arguing with you today."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The pink-haired girl didn't answer. Instead, she turned to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_24 = {
    Text = "I know you've glimpsed what's inside the <Yellow:\"Gate\">. But whether it's the future of the world or the core of Mythag, it might be more brutal than you imagine."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_25 = {
    Text = "We face a phenomenon that destroys material existence itself. Once you're <Yellow:Dissolution>-contaminated, everything about you will vanish, even memories of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_26 = {
    Text = "During the oath ceremony, the name engraved on the tombstone will turn into a pool of black mud, forgotten by all."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Answer me, are you truly prepared for this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Doll looks at you coldly, her tone flat."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_29 = {
    Text = "She appears expressionless, but deep within her frosty pupils, you catch a glimpse of a blazing fire."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
<Blue:William> Senior knows there's a ceremony at the Key Tomb today, but reinforcements haven't arrived, and the bell...
We must find a way to join them and <Yellow:eliminate the source of the anomaly>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Your answer is—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_31 = {
    Text = "My tombstone now stands in the Key Graveyard."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
You are a part of Mythag.
Perhaps, even back in Akut, you already were.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_33 = {
    Text = "There are things that only I can do."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_34 = {
    Text = "This decision may seem hasty, but who can guarantee that every moment in life is fully prepared for?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_35 = {Text = "Good."},
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_36 = {
    Text = "On behalf of Mythag's 6th principal, <Blue:Oliver Ailsey>, I hereby grant you this Silver Key, number K-0617."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
Doll takes out the Silver Key from a small, precise box and places it on your chest.
The Silver Key emits a faint glow, filling your chest with a familiar sensation.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_39 = {
    Text = "From now on, you will bear the title of Keeper, alongside the countless students and faculty of Mythag."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_4 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_40 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Now, link with me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_5 = {
    Text = "At the end of his line of sight, a blond-haired boy raises a massive black shield disproportionate to his size, fending off the attacks of an agile dual-sword warrior."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_6 = {
    Text = "He used his shield to firmly protect the pink-haired girl behind him and was forced to retreat step by step."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You recognize that pink-haired girl. She's Professor Doll, known for being hard to communicate with, and belongs to the <Blue:Awakening Research Institute>. In other words, she's a non-combatant."
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Wait... the attacker... is an Awakener?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18814_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Doll? <Blue:Clock Tower> is out of control?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Countdown: 80 minutes"
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Murphy took two steps forward, suddenly swayed, and collapsed limply against the mast."
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_11 = {Text = "Murphy?!"},
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You help Murphy up from the deck. She is barely conscious, her bangs damp with cold sweat, clinging messily to her forehead."
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Ouch... it hurts so much..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Hmm... @1... @1..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_15 = {
    Text = "She grabs your supporting hand, her pain causing her to instinctively tighten her grip, her fingers digging into your flesh. Yet, you pay no mind to the slight pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You hear the rising drumbeats — muscles not of human origin throb within the girl's chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The embryo... is draining her life."
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_18 = {Text = "Mi...@2"},
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Besides groaning in pain, Murphy could only mutter meaningless murmurs."
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A dense fog blankets the sea, but the deck is bathed in moonlight, making everyone's expressions clearly visible."
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Amidst the chaotic noise, enemies emerge from the shadows."
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The moon..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_4 = {
    Text = "What's wrong with the moon?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_5 = {
    Text = "It's getting brighter."
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Murphy swallowed the latter half of her sentence, but you know what she meant—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The time left for her is running out."
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_8 = {
    Text = "...Hurry and regroup with the others; the captain may have a quick way to dock."
  },
  AvgDialog_18815_Content_9 = {Text = "Hmm..."},
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Caught you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The bizarre giant beast now obediently lowers its head, seemingly awaiting the touch of the white-haired girl."
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The neck of the giant dog's body revealed what was clearly a crowned human head, making the scene extremely eerie."
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_12 = {Text = "Lily..."},
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The pale girl slowly approached the grotesque beast, extending her slender arm to stroke its head as if petting an ordinary animal."
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Above the neck of the giant dog's body appeared what was clearly a crowned human head, making the scene extremely eerie."
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_15 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona exchange glances, a thousand unspoken words weighing heavy in your hearts."
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Hey, you're not just going to stand there and watch, are you? The Hellhound is right in front of us."
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The mastermind we need to investigate is right here. How should I put it? \"It came without any effort\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The girl seemed not to hear, whispering into Kum's ear. The evening breeze carried her soft voice to his eardrum."
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ramona lunged forward, while the cornered monster roared fiercely, intending a desperate resistance."
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
Kum, be good and obey your master.
Only good children follow orders.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_21 = {
    Text = "As soon as the words softly fell, Lily turned around and walked towards you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Lady Daffodil said that if Koum was discovered, Lily would have to return to her mother's side."
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
Now, let's head back to the shop.
Lady Daffodil will tell you everything.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Italic:No, no, Koom, come back!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_4 = {
    Text = "This sound... Where have I heard it before?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_5 = {
    Text = "From the shadows of the lamplight, a small, shivering figure emerges."
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Koom, don't hurt Big Brother and Big Sister, okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The large dog known as \"Kuum\" sat on the ground, obediently licking its paws."
  },
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_8 = {Text = "Koom..."},
  AvgDialog_18818_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Only now do you notice that the pitch-black face isn't devoid of features; its closed eyes, flat nose, and barely visible lips are all a deep black, creating the illusion of a faceless entity."
  },
  AvgDialog_18819_Content_1 = {
    Text = "This is a background-free dialogue test 1"
  },
  AvgDialog_18819_Content_2 = {
    Text = "This is a background-free dialogue test 2"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The Wax Museum Horror"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Let's go and ask her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_11 = {
    Text = "So, beautiful and lovely lady, may we come in for a visit?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
This wax museum only opens to visitors on foggy days like this one.
As long as you are well-behaved guests, you may enter.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Are you rule-abiding guests?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_14 = {Text = "Of course."},
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_15 = {
    Text = "What are the rules?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Good, I like customers who follow the rules."
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_17 = {
    Text = "No worries, you will become obedient. Trust me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_18 = {
    Text = "This is my beloved dog, Bobby. You wouldn't want to make him angry, would you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_19 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Whoa!!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The Enlarged Wax Museum"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The girl led the three into the hall and then moved behind the reception desk, taking on the demeanor of a receptionist."
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_21 = {
    Text = "This is <Yellow:Exhibit Area 1>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_22 = {
    Text = "I remember Dorr saying that something is hidden here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Don't let your guard down, Keeper. There might be... something unpredictable lurking there."
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_24 = {
    Text = "What, afraid?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_25 = {Text = "Not at all"},
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<Small:Hm... What a strange smell.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_27 = {
    Text = "It's better if you don't know."
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_28 = {
    Text = "This is the <Yellow:Second Exhibition Area>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_29 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The Ordinary Wax Museum"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_30 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Whoa!!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_31 = {
    Text = "This is our <Shake:Masterpiece>. How is it? Isn't it vivid?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Almost identical to a real person—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_33 = {
    Text = "<Change>Giggle."
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_34 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Did I just imagine it, or did he smile just now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Oh, who knows."
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Here is the <Red:Venue Map> prepared for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Next, please enjoy your time at the exhibition~"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The Ordinary Almshouse"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Almshouse Magnified 1.2x"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The Ordinary Almshouse"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Is this... Rogers' Wax Museum?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_8 = {
    Text = "What now, <Yellow:%player%?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18820_Content_9 = {
    Text = "We need to find the location of \"Spring\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Hey, wake up!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The time for reminiscing is over! Now, let's move on to the main event—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Simulating the slimy filter of flowing D-Slime!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_12 = {
    Text = "This is a rather long filter, recommended to be used with multiple lines of dialogue."
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_13 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_14 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Alright, time's up! Now, let's move on to our weather module—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_16 = {
    Text = "It's snowing!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Achoo! Achoo! I didn't dress warmly enough today..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_18 = {
    Text = "It's on fire!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The air is dry, beware of fire hazards!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Hmm? You asked about the effect of opening and closing your eyes just now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_20 = {
    Text = "It's raining!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Hannah's heart also becomes a bit melancholic on rainy days."
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_22 = {
    Text = "After looking at so many filters, are you feeling a bit dizzy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Hehe, let's double the dose and bring out our dizzy filter!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_24 = {
    Text = "How is it? Feeling dizzy... very dizzy..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Next, let's add some romantic roses! Activate red flowers!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I don't know if it's romantic, but those with pollen allergies are in trouble, because —"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Following the Red Rose comes the Gothic Rose! Activate, Black Flower!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_28 = {
    Text = "And then there's the mysterious effect that leaves everyone puzzled, not knowing where to use it—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Blood Mist!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Ahem, this is our Eye-Opening Filter!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Looks pretty cool, so let's keep it for now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You've seen the Blood Mist. Now, let's take a look at the Black Mist."
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Pitch black—eerie—Londinium like a haunted house—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_33 = {
    Text = "You've been looking for so long that your eyes are tired. Blink to relieve them."
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_34 = {
    Text = "No, no, this won't do. I'll need to get some eyedrops later."
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Alright, that's all the filter effects for now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_36 = {
    Text = "This episode of Hannah's Filter Class has come to an end. See you again next time~!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Besides that, we have many other filters. Let's review them with Hannah!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_5 = {
    Text = "What comes to mind when you think of London in the 1900s?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The answer is definitely fog!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_7 = {
    Text = "A vast expanse of white—does it evoke memories of a bygone era for everyone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Speaking of memories, we also have a memory filter, just like this!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18823_Content_9 = {
    Text = "How's that? Doesn't it feel a bit like an old movie?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Botticelli spring"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_10 = {
    Text = "By the way, these are letters written to you by everyone from the workshop. Miss Diana asked me to deliver them to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
If you need anything here, feel free to contact us. I'll visit you as often as possible.
See you next time, Miss Sarah.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_12 = {
    Text = "As you turn toward the door, you hear a faint sound behind you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
...Excuse me... I noticed that there seems to be no letter from Aigis.
Is she... doing alright?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_14 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Sarah's face showed a hint of cautious hope, while next to you, Ramona sighed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_16 = {
    Text = "She... is fine."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Given the special circumstances, we transferred her to Mythag University Hospital. Once her condition stabilizes, she will definitely write to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_18 = {
    Text = "That's good, that's good. I... I was worried that she might resent me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_19 = {
    Text = "When I get out of here, I need to make it up to her. Do you think she would want to live with me? Just the two of us and Jenkin. She'll be happy, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_2 = {
    Text = "—Two Days Later—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_20 = {Text = "Will she?"},
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
Perhaps, but at this point, no one can guarantee it.
After all, the ones who could answer this question are gone forever.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_22 = {
    Text = "...I'm truly sorry."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_23 = {
    Text = "No... I... I can't believe it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Sarah's voice began to tremble."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_25 = {
    Text = "She's just angry, right? People say that those who are usually calm get extremely intense when they do get mad. She's like that too, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Aigis, Aigis... My dear Aigis... Forgive me... Forgive me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_27 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_28 = {Text = "Let's go."},
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_29 = {
    Text = "We... will see you next time, Miss Sarah."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
11:41, Londinium
Mystia Treaty Committee HQ
Underground Observation Room D-31]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
13:20, Londinium
Mythag University]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona step into the dense forest outside the school gate and spot Jenkins and a student in a school uniform brawling on the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_32 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_33 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_34 = {
    Text = "The rat bites the ferret."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_35 = {
    Text = "A world wonder: Rats attack and bite ferrets!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Who are you calling a rat?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Who are you calling a ferret?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Hannah? Jenkin? What are you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_39 = {
    Text = "It's not my fault! She called the guards first!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_4 = {
    Text = "...Lift the lockdown. Miss Diana is now in charge of the workshop, and Little Mike has returned."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
Oops, I just played a little joke on her.
Taking life too seriously makes it dull.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_41 = {
    Text = "So the person she was looking for is you, right? Where did you meet, Lilyan Labor Workshop? The Butcher? Ah! She's little Jenkin, isn't she?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_42 = {
    Text = "No wonder you're the top ferret in the Kingdom of Leo. Are you collecting material for tomorrow's school newspaper?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_43 = {
    Text = "It's more than that. Ramona, you know me—information is my life."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_44 = {
    Text = "So, in broad daylight, a pitiable orphan ventures alone into the deep forest. What is she seeking? Can the two people she is searching for bring her any light?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Hannah, while talking, suddenly pulls out a notebook from who knows where and looks at you expectantly, ready to jot down your every word and action."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Frontline reporter Hannah Peasley is about to begin her coverage!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_47 = {
    Text = "...I get it now. None of you from this so-called university speak like normal people."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_48 = {
    Text = "I'm innocent, really."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
It's better when she's not here.
But you, Jenkin, is something wrong?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Mythag University initiated a donation for the workshop. The effect was excellent, and with Noble Dexter's support, it can run for quite some time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Jenkin pulls out a stack of crumpled newspapers from his bag and hands them to you and Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_51 = {
    Text = "We had an agreement: you promised to help me find my sister. Now, it's time for you to keep your promise."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_52 = {
    Text = "She unfolded the newspaper and pointed to a local oddity titled <Three-Dimensional Paintings>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_53 = {
    Text = "The author wrote in a documentary style about witnessing an astonishing exhibit at the wax museum on 44 Southwark Street: the new work \"Spring\" by wax artist Rogers."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_54 = {
    Text = "To enhance credibility, they even added a photo next to it with an air of seriousness."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_55 = {
    Text = "This is a wax sculpture group modeled after Botticelli's famous painting \"Spring.\" In the center is a female wax sculpture with comical makeup and a pained expression."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_56 = {
    Text = [[
I want to protect everyone, protect Miss Sarah, protect little Mike, protect Jenkin.
I don't want them to be turned into <Yellow:wax sculptures>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_57 = {
    Text = "I don't know the address, but I walked for a long time, all the way to the west district. In a display window, there was a house. The doorplate read <Yellow:No. 44>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Rogers... a wax sculpture? And at Southwark Street <Yellow:No. 44>, this can't be a coincidence."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_59 = {
    Text = "What is it? Do you know anything?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_6 = {
    Text = "So, you can rest assured now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Aigis mentioned—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_61 = {Text = "*Cough!*"},
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_62 = {
    Text = [[
You exchanged a glance with Ramona, but it was already too late.
Upon hearing Aigis's name, Jenkin visibly became disheartened.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_63 = {
    Text = "...As for Aigis, don't be too upset."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_64 = {
    Text = [[
I'm not sad. I just... 
I promised her that she could be my little sister.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_65 = {
    Text = "She bailed, completely lacking integrity."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_66 = {
    Text = "What about that vile woman? Does she know? About Aigis..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_67 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Forget it; it's better if she doesn't know. Aigis definitely wouldn't want her to feel sad."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_69 = {
    Text = [[
So, what have you heard?
Stop beating around the bush, hurry up! You promised to help me find someone!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Aigis mentioned that when she was under control, she went to a place in the West District with the house number <Yellow:44>. Plus, \"they turned into wax sculptures\"... Could the missing people be there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_71 = {
    Text = "You scoundrel... No matter who you are, I won't let you get away!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_72 = {
    Text = "When are we leaving?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Considering that the other party might be dangerous, I'd rather you wait here for our news. However — I'm sure you have other ideas, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_74 = {
    Text = [[
That's my sister. I have to go!
Besides, you might need me to crawl through vents at some point!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_75 = {
    Text = "This idea is too specific."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Looks like I need to submit an urgent fieldwork application."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_77 = {
    Text = "I was just about to find Professor Alistair; he should be happy to let us in through the back door."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_78 = {
    Text = "If you speak up, there should be no problem. However—let's hope William can delay our report submission time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_79 = {
    Text = "As for this point, you don't need to worry."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Great, just... great.\nThank you so much, Ashe—no, %player%, Miss Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_80 = {Text = "?"},
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_81 = {
    Text = "About an hour ago, William left the school with an off-campus permit."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_82 = {
    Text = "I tried to follow him to dig up some news, but I lost him along the way and came back. Judging by the direction, it seemed like he was heading to the west side of Londinium."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_83 = {
    Text = [[
Southwark Street is in the West District.
It seems that this time, we'll have the chance to witness the renowned Investigator William in action.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_84 = {
    Text = "...I always have the feeling that he's going to scold me harshly..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_85 = {
    Text = [[
18:24, Londinium West
Southwark Street]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Thank you all for your cooperation. I can take it from here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_87 = {
    Text = [[
This won't do, sir. The orders from above are clear: we must accompany you in the investigation. 
Besides, Rogers is also our suspect; we can't let you handle it alone.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Moreover, with us around, your identity can be better hidden, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_89 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_9 = {
    Text = "We're just doing our best."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, sir. We have guns and can run fast. We won't hold you back."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Alright, stay on high alert. When necessary, prioritize your own life."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Report: Arrived at mission location, 44 Southwark Street, Rogers Wax Museum. Target confirmed: Verify possible connection between the owner of the wax museum, Rogers, and the Sculptors Association."
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_93 = {
    Text = [[
Location confirmed, investigation target identified.
May the Silver Key guide your path.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18824_Content_94 = {
    Text = "May the Silver Key guide us."
  },
  AvgDialog_18825_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ramona stepped forward, heading straight to where she had seen the silhouette."
  },
  AvgDialog_18825_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Suddenly, one of them reached out and grabbed the neck of the person beside them. A short scream, like hot oil hitting water, instantly ignited the surrounding crowd."
  },
  AvgDialog_18825_Content_11 = {Text = "Scatter!"},
  AvgDialog_18825_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Miss Mary, t-this is the yard outside. You've already seen it. Let's return to our original tour route."
  },
  AvgDialog_18825_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Oh? But I was just thinking of taking a stroll in the yard. You understand, right, Miss Sarah?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18825_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Of course, of course. I fully understand. Just, uh, how about a cup of tea first? Miss Mary—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18825_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ignoring Sarah's obstruction, Ramona walked into the front yard, her gaze searching among the workers who were engrossed in their tasks."
  },
  AvgDialog_18825_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The air is filled with sweat and a strange, damp smell, like burning coal."
  },
  AvgDialog_18825_Content_7 = {
    Text = "See, Miss Mary, I told you there's nothing to see here. Let's head back quickly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18825_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
As Sarah spoke, several workers suddenly stopped their actions.
Their lips quivered slightly, as if whispering something, and their bodies swayed gently.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18825_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Through the monocle, Ramona saw their backs gradually bulge, with black goo oozing out and crawling down their limbs as if it were alive."
  },
  AvgDialog_18826_Content_1 = {
    Text = "In the chaotic crowd, Ramona struggles to fend off the attacks of workers who have gone rogue, ensuring that the other workers can flee safely."
  },
  AvgDialog_18826_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Attendant! Call the attendant!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18826_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The sound of hurried footsteps approached. Several people in special uniforms pushed against the crowd, holding ropes and wearing serious expressions."
  },
  AvgDialog_18826_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Behind them stood a figure clad in white."
  },
  AvgDialog_18826_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Miss Mary, be careful!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18826_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Ramona sidestepped, using the momentum of the abnormal worker's attack to thrust forward. She pressed the tip of the sheathed sword against the sternum, forcing the opponent to retreat a few steps."
  },
  AvgDialog_18826_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Behind her, the caretakers came to a stop."
  },
  AvgDialog_18826_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I'll back you up. Get ready."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Bloodstained Mist"
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Seeing the slightly confused look on Aigis's face, Jenkins let out a deep sigh, picked up the heavy teapot from the tray, wrapped it in a cloth, and held it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, Miss Sarah will be angry if you play with this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
Who's playing? I'm helping you!
Let's go, let's go, hurry up! The sooner we finish, the sooner we can wrap up!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_13 = {Text = "Mm, mm!"},
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
20:27, Lily's Workshop
Front Yard]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_15 = {
    Text = "...So you actually believed that girl and are planning to wait here for some kind of dark shadow?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Considering the abnormal D-marks spotted in the Fang, and the missing \"Researcher,\" keeping watch seems like a good idea."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
...Fine, it's your own time you're wasting.
Back to the topic, any signs of Cataclysm in the workshop?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The Silver Key shows no reaction. I assume the unknown life form is not a newly formed Cataclysm but is more likely related to special D-Marks and that \"Researcher.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
I've never seen a D-Mark like this. It even looks like some kind of clumsy stitching attempt.
And his serum for controlling the mutations... Honestly, I doubt it can interfere with Dissolution.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
20:27, Lily Workshop
Cafeteria]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_20 = {
    Text = "No Cataclysm, but there is Dissolution, stitched D-Mark... Could it be them?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
Keyword read successful, "Stitched D-Mark," with a total of 37 related incidents.
Event Keywords: <Blue:Malignant Organization Activity, The Sculptors' Association>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Weren't they wiped out 14 years ago in the joint operation between Mythag and the <Blue:Committee>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The initial operation had a slip-up, allowing their core members to escape. After all these years, the investigation team still hasn't been able to track them down. Unexpectedly, we run into them here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_24 = {
    Text = [[
The nature of the situation has changed. You should prepare to withdraw.
Remember, don't act rashly, or I'll be the first to give you extra training.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Wait, Doll—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Professor Doll has left. Would you like to leave a message?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
Just as authoritarian as in the lab.
No need to leave a message. Thank you, Erica.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_28 = {
    Text = "The communicator falls silent. You look at Ramona and see the same emotion reflected in her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_29 = {
    Text = "This is our mission."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
I just don't get it. You're both helping out in the kitchen and delivering meals to Rogers.
Do you really enjoy working that much? You never take a break.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The investigation we started must be finished by us."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_31 = {
    Text = "We can't leave."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
You know I'll always support your decision, no matter what it is.
I trust you, %player%.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_33 = {
    Text = "If we can find something before the evacuation, Doll might be convinced."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Let's show her how far we can go."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_35 = {
    Text = [[
20:35, Lily's Workshop
Hallway]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_36 = {
    Text = "How far are you willing to go for that little Mike? Don't give up your own dinner every time he says he's hungry!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_37 = {
    Text = "It's okay if I skip a few meals. Little Mike is so young; he needs to eat more to stay healthy and avoid getting sick."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Do you think you're so great? If I hadn't stolen %player%'s money to buy you candy and bread, who knows how long you would have starved!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_39 = {
    Text = "But he's very well-behaved. After eating, he happily calls me \"Sister,\" and even gave me a gift!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Jenkin leaned against the side of the dining table, watching Aigis and several aides and cooks busy at work."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Isn't it beautiful? It was given to him by a kind older brother who asked for directions the day before yesterday. Everyone is so envious.\nAnd guess what? Little Mike also said—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_41 = {
    Text = "One for me, one for you. We will always be the best of friends!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_42 = {
    Text = "...Tch, who cares. Once I find my sister, we'll leave together. Then you'll be my sister, and I'll give you two sisters!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_43 = {Text = "...Aigis?"},
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_44 = {
    Text = "<Small:The fog... it's rising again... how could this be... today, of all days... the fog is back...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Hmm? It really is. There weren't so many foggy days in previous years. The weather has been quite strange lately."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_46 = {
    Text = "It reminds me of the night we first met."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_47 = {
    Text = [[
20:35, Lily's Workshop
Front Yard]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_48 = {
    Text = "This weather... Didn't that survivor mention that it suddenly became foggy the night of their incident too?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_49 = {
    Text = "The weak light of the flashlight cannot penetrate the mist. Everything around you appears shadowy, and you can barely make out the nearby iron gate."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I want to do something else too, but... but I'm so useless. I can only manage these clumsy tasks..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_50 = {
    Text = "A shadow flickered past, rousing the slumbering mist."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_51 = {Text = "That's...!"},
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_52 = {
    Text = "The tightly shut iron gate emits a piercing sound. You and Ramona quickly chase after it, only to see the open gate and the street beyond, shrouded in night fog."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Hurry, chase!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Here we go again. Who told you that you're useless?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_7 = {
    Text = "This child has been like this since he first came to the workshop and won't listen no matter what."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Diana smiled as she handed the tray with the tea set and snacks to Aigis, then patted Jenkin on the head."
  },
  AvgDialog_18827_Content_9 = {
    Text = "So, whether she can stop being so hard on herself is up to you, little Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18828_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Are we really not going to stop them? If they are from \"The Sculptors' Association\"..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18828_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Let's assess the situation and adapt accordingly. If we alert them, it will be much harder to catch them."
  },
  AvgDialog_18829_Content_1 = {Text = "Get down!"},
  AvgDialog_18829_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Is it really possible? It's incredibly versatile!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18829_Content_11 = {
    Text = "No matter what, we have to try. I'll restrain her and await your command."
  },
  AvgDialog_18829_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Ready... Go!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18829_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The blade cuts through the air, stirring up a gust behind you. Ramona sidesteps, blocks a claw strike with her sword, and then forcefully shoves you towards the stairs."
  },
  AvgDialog_18829_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Mad Sarah follows you into the basement. Her rapier clashes with the hardened black mucus, producing a loud metallic screech."
  },
  AvgDialog_18829_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You turn around and, with Ramona raising her rapier, cautiously retreat further into the room."
  },
  AvgDialog_18829_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Erica! A special Dissolution Mutant, retaining a humanoid form except for the head and possessing intelligence. Suspected to be induced by emotion-triggered Spirit waves. Solution?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18829_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Retrieving, please wait."
  },
  AvgDialog_18829_Content_9 = {
    Text = "In addition to eliminating mutants, you can use the Silver Key to influence the spirits of mutants and special mutants."
  },
  AvgDialog_18830_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah—Miss Sarah, wake up! Look at me, Miss Sarah—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18830_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
This mutation seems to be triggered by intense emotions and retains some level of intelligence. 
I have never witnessed such behavior before, completely distinct from other mutants.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18830_Content_3 = {
    Text = "What mutant, what on earth, what!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18830_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Be careful not to let her slip by; it would be troublesome if she encounters ordinary people."
  },
  AvgDialog_18830_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Go to the basement we just visited and see if you can find a way to calm her down."
  },
  AvgDialog_18830_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah! Please, don't hurt Miss Sarah!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18830_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, quickly take Aigis away!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18830_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Damn it, it's always up to me, Aigis! Hurry!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18830_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Inner peril"
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, don't scare me. I... I'm afraid. Can you come back? Or, can I go with you? Jenkin—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
The door closed silently, leaving the girl and the mouse inside.
Aigis sat on the bed, trembling uncontrollably.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Why... Even though someone was already here today... why again... why...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Tears rolled down the cheeks, wetting the sheets for the umpteenth time tonight.
Outside, the fog gradually obscured the full moon, casting everything into dimness and blurriness.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_14 = {
    Text = "What should I do... What must I do, what must I sacrifice... to"
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
00:17, Lily Workshop
Guest Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_16 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_17 = {
    Text = "...What...is this sound...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_18 = {
    Text = "How did I fall asleep?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
I remember talking to Sarah, and then I just fell asleep...
Ramona, Ramona?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
00:14, Lily's Workshop
Aigis's Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You hear no response and can only move your heavy limbs slowly, trying to focus on observing your surroundings."
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The door lock had come loose and the door was slightly ajar, letting in the cold night wind through the dark gap."
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_22 = {
    Text = "A shadow swiftly darts out from behind the tables and chairs, attacking you in an instant."
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_24 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
The sharp blade reflects a cold gleam, its short length mirroring your face.
Trained reflexes make you dodge just in time, revealing the attacker's figure.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_26 = {Text = "Jenkin?!"},
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The girl's eyes were devoid of color, her expression so dull that she appeared dazed. She was unresponsive to your calls, as if unable to perceive anything."
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Meanwhile, her movements were exceptionally agile. The blade traced a cold arc in the air, leaving you no time to think. The girl lunged at you once more."
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Dodge Immediately"
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
The moonlight filling the room suddenly turned hazy, as if veiled by a layer of mist.
A person abruptly sat up from the bed, disturbing the tranquility of the room.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Ramona, wake up!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You step back to Ramona and shake her shoulders vigorously."
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_32 = {
    Text = "How...? What's going on?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_33 = {
    Text = "It's Jenkin! She suddenly attacked me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Awaken Ramona"
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Damn, at this rate..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_36 = {
    Text = "You close your eyes and focus. The Silver Key on your chest glows faintly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_37 = {
    Text = "The bond formed by the spirit link responds to the summoner, even across great distances or between the waking world and dream cities"
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_38 = {Text = "Ramona!"},
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_4 = {Text = "...Jenkin?"},
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Blades clashed as Ramona blocked the dagger. She tilted her head slightly, glancing out of the corner of her eye to confirm your safety."
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Are you okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_42 = {
    Text = "You woke up just in time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_43 = {Text = "Jenkin?"},
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Jenkin did not respond, simply raised his dagger again."
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Looks like we'll have to subdue her first. Lure her out!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The rustling of clothes was her only response. Rubbing her swollen eyes, Aigis saw Jenkin jump out of bed and head for the door."
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Squeak? Squeak squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, are you... going to the restroom?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Seemingly ignoring his partner's question and the anxious squeaks of his mouse companion, Jenkin opened the door with his backpack slung over his shoulder, his expression completely blank."
  },
  AvgDialog_18831_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Aigis's face turned pale instantly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_1 = {
    Text = "In the darkness, a small white figure is curled up."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Give up, close your eyes, and leave everything to me.
Sarah, little Mike... everyone in your workshop will become beauty, eternal and everlasting.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_100 = {
    Text = "The ribbon tied to her hand came loose and fluttered in the wind. The girl's small body fell, forever vanishing from this night sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_101 = {
    Text = "The empty white dress and scattered square paper pieces gently landed in Jenkin's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_102 = {
    Text = "Not even a trace of warmth remained."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_103 = {
    Text = "Ai... Aigis...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_104 = {
    Text = "A golden butterfly is drawn on the paper, with its crinkled edges carefully pressed flat. It even carries a hint of candy sweetness."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_105 = {
    Text = "How... how could this be..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_106 = {
    Text = "The crimson ribbon, along with the candy wrapper, fell into the girl's hand, gently brushing her fingertips like a tender comfort from someone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_107 = {
    Text = "The girl blinked, tears blurring her vision and dripping from her lashes, silently caught by that vivid red."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_108 = {Text = "Aigis..."},
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_11 = {
    Text = "No, no...! Please, don't do this, you can't!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_12 = {
    Text = "That little mouse is your friend, right? Since you've helped me gather so many materials, I can prioritize making her eternal and free from pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_13 = {
    Text = "No! Don't hurt them! Please! I'll do anything, absolutely anything!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I once pleaded with him in the same way, but then—I came to understand his ideals.\nSurely, you will come to understand mine as well. After all, what other choice do you have?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_15 = {Text = "I—"},
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Resist? Your spirit is almost broken. If not, I couldn't influence you while you're awake."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Why not just give up? Then you can help me turn everyone here into precious materials."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_18 = {
    Text = "A huge figure froze in the distance. You quickly pulled out the Silver Key and threw it into the air, ignoring Doll and Ramona's protests."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The Silver Key hovers in the air, emitting a soft light. You close your eyes and sink into icy darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Old Charlie had a tabby cat he loved dearly. One day, she disappeared, and he searched everywhere..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
As the countless silver lights recede, one particularly faint glimmer floats before you.
You listen closely and seem to hear a girl's whisper.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
I want to protect everyone, protect Miss Sarah, protect little Mike, and protect Jenkin.
I don't want them to be turned into wax sculptures.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_22 = {
    Text = "I will protect them, even if it costs me everything—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You try to touch the small dot, and the Silver Key hums in response."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_24 = {
    Text = "...What is this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The girl lifted her face and saw a small silver key appear before her, slowly rotating and emitting a soft yet dazzling light like a star."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
She strained to move her arm, propping it beneath her body. 
Darkness enveloped her from all directions, pressing down on her and pinning her in place.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
Special little gadget. Don't move, Aigis. I don't want to lose such a useful tool as you.
If you keep this up, you'll never see your comrades again. Is that okay with you?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_28 = {
    Text = "I won't listen... I'll never listen again."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
Even if I can never eat candy again, see the people at the workshop, or see Jenkin.
Even if I die.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Next time, I will! He rummaged through the wardrobe and looked under the bed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_30 = {
    Text = "I absolutely won't let you hurt them again, never."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_31 = {
    Text = "The Silver Key flickers intensely as the girl suddenly props up her body, faintly hearing the sound of something tearing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The blindfold slowly drifted down, writhing colors replaced the darkness, and a massive pale iris appeared beneath her, as if it had been watching her for a long time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Are you... the eyes?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
Can you really lend me your power?
...It's all right, even if it's just for a moment, I... have something to say to them.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_35 = {Text = "Thank you."},
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Aigis stirred and truly opened her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_37 = {
    Text = "After a piercing wail, the monster's massive body dissolved into black slime and collapsed. The slime turned to dust, rising and darkening the wooden beams."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_38 = {
    Text = "You collapse weakly to the ground, barely enduring the throbbing pain in your head and the ensuing nausea."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_39 = {Text = "%player%!"},
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Little Aigis, look what I made for you! Isn't this eyepatch prettier than the last one?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
Your spirit power is exhausted, isn't it? I told you not to mess around.
Fieldwork is not like school; if something happens to you, no one will clean up the mess.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Forget about me, go check on Aigis."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
The sound of liquid evaporating gradually weakens and soon completely vanishes.
On the floor stained with black slime, the girl sits in silence.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_43 = {
    Text = [[
Miss Ramona... and... %player%.
I'm so glad both of you are safe.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Sorry, truly sorry. If I had spoken up earlier and admitted it sooner, perhaps everything would have ended by now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_45 = {
    Text = "I haven't hurt anyone else, right? I... I did manage to resist, didn't I?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Yes, you're brave and amazing. You protected everyone at the workshop."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_47 = {
    Text = [[
That's good... In that case, there's just one thing left.
I'll tell you everything I know.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_48 = {
    Text = "<Small:I must... hurry...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
From some unknown day, that mysterious voice arrived.
It always comes on foggy nights, creeping into our minds and making us do bad things.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Aigis, Aigis! It's sunny today, so we can definitely see the stars!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_50 = {
    Text = "The first time I noticed was one night when I got up to use the bathroom. Little Lucy was holding a knife. I saw her hide it in the closet and then climb straight into bed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_51 = {
    Text = "I was afraid she'd get scolded for her dirty pajamas, so I changed her clothes and sheets. She woke up and asked me why I was changing them, as if... she had no idea what she had done."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_52 = {
    Text = "I'm scared to death. I want to tell Miss Sarah, but I'm afraid she'll punish Lucy. I'm even more afraid she won't believe me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_53 = {
    Text = "So, I ended up saying nothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_54 = {
    Text = "After what happened with Lucy, nothing occurred for several nights. I thought it was over, but one day I woke up holding a knife."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_55 = {
    Text = "An older sister collapsed in front of me. She is crying and begging for mercy. I want to stop, but..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_56 = {
    Text = "I can't do it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_57 = {
    Text = "As long as that voice is singing, I can't do it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_58 = {
    Text = "The voice noticed I was still \"awake\" and was delighted. It said I had potential and told me to obey, otherwise it would turn everyone to stone, using them as its \"material.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_59 = {
    Text = "I said I would tell Miss Sarah, but it just laughed and said I could try to see if anyone would believe me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Aigis, it's fine to be a little capricious sometimes. Do you understand?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_60 = {
    Text = "The voice is correct; it always seems to be right about bad things."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_61 = {
    Text = "No one believes me, no one remembers what happens at night. But on foggy nights, whenever that song echoes in our heads, children are controlled by the sound and leave the Fang."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_62 = {
    Text = [[
Every child who returns is covered in blood. Every controlled child is a "dismemberer."
Some are even younger than me. If they really get caught by the police...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_63 = {
    Text = "I can't let that happen."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_64 = {
    Text = "So I hid all the bloodstained items in the backyard. I couldn't resist the voices, but at least I could prevent them from being taken by the police."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Why do the voices want us to cut other people's bodies? I don't know. I only know that what we cut off is sent to a display case in the west district, placed in front of someone's house."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Jenkin's sister... I also took her there, to a house with a door marked <Blue:No. 44>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_67 = {
    Text = [[
She was still crying when I left. I wanted to comfort her, but could only be controlled to walk back to the workshop.
Though I went out again to find her as soon as I could move, by the time I got there, she had already disappeared.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_68 = {
    Text = "She disappeared, along with the older brother whom I turned to stone that night."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_69 = {
    Text = "I don't know if they're still alive. If you find them, could you apologize to them on my behalf?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Aigis! Ta-da—Bread! Am I not impressive?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_70 = {
    Text = [[
If it weren't for me, they wouldn't have... and Jenkin wouldn't be so sad.
I... I truly owe her, owe them, owe everyone an apology.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_71 = {Text = "Aigis..."},
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Aigis gazed at the shadow cast before her, a faint light flickering in her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_74 = {
    Text = "How I wish, how I wish I could start over... If only I could, I definitely would..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Her blurry vision finally cleared. She gazed at the streets, some familiar, some unfamiliar. In a daze, it seemed as if someone was whispering in her ear."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_77 = {
    Text = "The girl blinked and gave a nostalgic smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Did you know? On days when we could see the sun, Tiyug would secretly bring me up here at night."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah never allowed us to come here. She said it was too dangerous, and we could easily get hurt."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
The girl shrank back, clutching her teddy bear.
The candy wrappers hidden inside were neatly folded and still gave off a sweet scent.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_80 = {
    Text = "But Tiyug doesn't care about any of that. Every night after lights out, he secretly takes me upstairs in the dark once Miss Sarah has finished her rounds."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_81 = {
    Text = "He, like Jenkin, is clever and brave, always knowing hidden paths and mechanisms that others don't."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_82 = {
    Text = "As long as he is with us, Miss Sarah will not find us."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_83 = {
    Text = "As long as he carries it with him, this place will always be our secret base."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_84 = {
    Text = "He was the only one who believed me — believed that I could see those black things and told me it was a witch's gift."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_85 = {
    Text = [[
He said that more contact with the stars would strengthen one's magic, but stars only appear at night after a sunny day.
However, looking at the stars is useless.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_86 = {
    Text = "I'm not a witch."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_87 = {
    Text = "I'm just a coward."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_88 = {
    Text = "A useless waste."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_89 = {
    Text = "A... murderer."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_9 = {Text = "Jenkin..."},
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_90 = {
    Text = "I can't stop the Doctor, nor the mysterious voice. I know more people will die, but there's nothing I can do."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_91 = {
    Text = "I'm afraid everyone will get hurt, afraid they'll be taken away. But what I'm most afraid of... what I'm most afraid of..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Doctor Clementine was right. Risking my life must yield something.\nBefore, I was afraid, but now—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Damn it, they were supposed to wait in the room, but now no one knows where they've gone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_96 = {Text = "That's..."},
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Aigis?! Aigis—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_98 = {
    Text = "Jenkin's voice suddenly came from below the clock tower, anxiously shouting Aigis's name, arms raised toward the sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_18832_Content_99 = {
    Text = "A bird flies across the night sky, vanishing into the thick fog without a trace."
  },
  AvgDialog_18833_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
Aigis staggered, but her speed didn't slow down at all.
Holding her head, she stifled a pained cry and ran forward desperately.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18833_Content_2 = {Text = "Aigis!"},
  AvgDialog_18833_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The girl swiftly made her way through the corridor and climbed the stairs leading to the top of the clock tower, muttering under her breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_18833_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You chase her up the spiral staircase, round and round, the air filled with the scent of wood and dust."
  },
  AvgDialog_18833_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I don't want to hurt them, please..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18833_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I don't want to... I didn't mean to do that. Stop it, stop it...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18834_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona break through from both sides but have long since lost sight of the hooded child. The other children persistently block your path."
  },
  AvgDialog_18834_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Are you... all in this... together!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18834_Content_3 = {Text = "So what!"},
  AvgDialog_18834_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Why don't you try hitting us!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18834_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You can't be so violent with children. However—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18834_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Proper education is still very necessary, don't you think?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18835_Content_1 = {
    Text = "As you approach the workshop, the street suddenly falls silent, save for a lone vagrant sitting listlessly by the road."
  },
  AvgDialog_18835_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Why is it so quiet here? Something feels a bit off."
  },
  AvgDialog_18835_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Then we should be careful, Dissolution—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18835_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Before she could finish speaking, the vagrant's body suddenly transformed. A giant black monster formed from the ooze gushing out of his chest and started writhing towards you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18836_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The pitch-black monster disperses and quickly reforms. It raises its body, suddenly splitting open from the top, emitting a harsh, screeching sound."
  },
  AvgDialog_18836_Content_2 = {
    Text = "...Save me...@4...Save me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18836_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Is it... is it speaking...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18836_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Don't make a sound!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18836_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Sha...@2...Die...Die...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18836_Content_6 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_18837_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You haven't gone far when the children, who were just fooling around, quickly gather in front of you, blocking your way."
  },
  AvgDialog_18837_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Excuse me, please... make way for the children."
  },
  AvgDialog_18837_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Na-na-na! If you've got the guts, just jump over!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18837_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You look to Ramona for help."
  },
  AvgDialog_18837_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Alright then, you'd better keep up."
  },
  AvgDialog_18838_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Get out of here! The patients have gone mad and are attacking!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18838_Content_2 = {
    Text = "They weren't crazy to begin with—Oh my God! Why are they all out?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18838_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Do you think I'm lying? Run, quickly!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18839_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
Seeing that you were tougher than they had imagined, the kids scattered and ran.
You and Ramona caught one of them.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18839_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ow, I'll talk, I'll talk! The thief who stole your stuff went to the Labor Workshop. Look there."
  },
  AvgDialog_18839_Content_3 = {
    Text = "...Feels a bit too coincidental. Do you like hanging around the workshop?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18839_Content_4 = {
    Text = "I wouldn't dare. They say that place is haunted by man-eating demons; only a fool would play there."
  },
  AvgDialog_18839_Content_5 = {
    Text = "So, your hooded companion won't be going there either?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18839_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I-I'm not lying to you! I—anyway, believe it or not!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18839_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The kid dashed off after speaking. You watched his figure disappear into the distance and sighed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18839_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Forget it, the mission comes first. Let's head to the Labor Workshop."
  },
  AvgDialog_18840_Content_1 = {
    Text = "What the heck!?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18840_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Children, come over here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18840_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Sarah hastily retreated, pulling a child with one hand. Her entire body trembled with fear, yet she still stood in front of the children and covered their eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18840_Content_4 = {Text = "Back off!"},
  AvgDialog_18840_Content_5 = {
    Text = "%player%, be careful!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_1 = {
    Text = "An apple a day keeps the doctor away."
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
08:16, Lily Workshop
Canteen]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_11 = {
    Text = "But I didn't get up at night! Aigis, why do you keep asking me this? I just slept all night and did nothing else."
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_12 = {Text = "I..."},
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_13 = {
    Text = "That's right. Why, Aigis?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
Why do you keep asking over and over, even though we've already said we don't know? 
Do you really think you know what we did last night?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I'm not, I... How could I—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You are my friend, Aigis. I don't want to keep guessing like this with a friend. Just tell me, what do you know?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_17 = {
    Text = "...Jenkin, I... I don't understand..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I wanted to ask you yesterday, what is going on with this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_19 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The second day"
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I was wondering if you just happened to find a piece of ribbon somewhere and kept it because it looked pretty."
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
However, why did you remain silent after seeing that half in %player%'s hand?
These two are clearly from the same one.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
The other kids at the table didn't notice their conversation and kept laughing and playing.
Aigis lowered her head, her shoulders raised slightly and trembling.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Can you tell me where this was found? Where is my sister?\nAnything else can be left unsaid, except for this—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_24 = {
    Text = [[
I can understand everything, be it your concerns or anything else. But you need to tell me, Aigis.
Where did my sister disappear? Please, tell me!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
I can't... I'm sorry... I don't know, I really don't know...
Jenkin, Jenkin, I'll give anything, please don't go, don't stop being my friend...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_26 = {
    Text = "What on earth are you talking about?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Gather up! Children, workers, please come to the yard! Form a line—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
08:16, Lily Workshop
Canteen]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
Sorry, I tried to conceal the patients' existence yesterday and kept insisting you were mistaken, Miss Mary.
After all, such researchers wouldn't exist in a normal workshop.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
08:15, Lilyan Workshop
Canteen]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
Speaking of this, where is the researcher? I haven't seen him around.
%lordorlady% Ash and I wanted to ask him about the experimental treatment.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
They probably went back to the research institute. They have to report back periodically.
I'm not sure about the details.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_32 = {
    Text = "So, could you give me their address?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Hmm... I'm not quite sure about the address. But today is Dr. Miller's day to see patients. Maybe you can ask him directly? It's about time—ah, look, here they come."
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You look in the direction where you greeted Sarah: Rogers and a few men in suits, carrying medical briefcases, are walking towards you. Clementine is not among them."
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Dr. Miller and Mr. Rogers!{Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe and I were just talking about you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
Did the distinguished guest mention me? How fortunate I am.
Hello, {Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe, Miss Mary. Mr. Rogers was just introducing you to me.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Nice to meet you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_38 = {
    Text = "To be honest, we are very curious about your experimental therapy. May we observe your treatment later?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_39 = {
    Text = "That's unfortunate. We've recently moved all healing to the lab, which might be inconvenient."
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_4 = {
    Text = "We need to hurry. Who knows when Doll will order us to retreat."
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Perhaps we could visit your research institute? If the effects are indeed as Ms. Sarah and Mr. Rogers claim, we would also like to contribute funds and power."
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_41 = {
    Text = "The more like-minded companions, the better. However, our research is currently at a critical stage, and we cannot accommodate visitors. I'm sure both of you can understand, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
Perhaps, or you could give them one of your business cards, Dr. Miller?
It would make future contact more convenient.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_43 = {
    Text = [[
Mr. Rogers is correct.
Once we set a time, we will be sure to treat you both well.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Dr. Miller hands you a business card that reads, \"Frederick Miller, 10 Cross Street.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_45 = {
    Text = "The overly tidy street and house numbers make you wonder if there's even a single truth on this business card."
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, please gather everyone so we can determine who requires treatment and inspection."
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_47 = {
    Text = "No problem.\nGather up! Children, workers, please come to the yard! Line up—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_48 = {
    Text = "You followed Sarah and Dr. Miller to the yard."
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Evacuate? What do you mean by evacuation?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Oh, it's nothing. Good morning, Miss Sarah."
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
Good morning, {Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe, Miss Mary.
I wonder how the two of you rested last night]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Thanks to you, I slept really well.
Miss Sarah's tea truly has an unparalleled effect.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18841_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Yes, is that so? That's wonderful."
  },
  AvgDialog_18842_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You're the murderer, you're the one controlling me... Ugh... Ahh..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18842_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Aigis, listen to me. We have a way to free you from the person trying to control you. You don't need to do this."
  },
  AvgDialog_18842_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Don't come any closer... Don't... Aaah...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Behind the Stone Wall"
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I don't want to go. I don't. I already went last time; I've been there before. I don't want to go again. I don't."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_11 = {
    Text = "But didn't you recently mention seeing black things? I consulted Dr. Miller, and he said that seeing phantasms is not a trivial matter. You must get checked again today."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
Miss Sarah, please, don't make me go.
I didn't see it, I truly didn't. Please.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_13 = {
    Text = "What if you end up like those lunatics? No, I must go. Listen to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_15 = {
    Text = "This is the child."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_16 = {
    Text = "No... I don't want to go... I've already been there once, I don't want to..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I'll go, sir."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_18 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_19 = {
    Text = "...Are you feeling unwell?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_2 = {
    Text = "I really saw it, truly! Those black, triangular things. Everyone who visits the Doctor ends up with these—so frightening, so frightening."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
I don't feel unwell; I can run and jump, perfectly healthy!
But I can see things.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Oh? What can you see?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
Like Aigis, I also see black phantasms.
Could you please help me?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Interesting. It's your turn today."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_24 = {Text = "Tiyug..."},
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid, Aigis."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I'll be back soon."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
09:00, Lily's Workshop
Aigis's Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_28 = {
    Text = "You sat in Aigis's room, listening to the girl's halting narration."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
Those taken by the Doctor return with more and more black holes on their bodies, increasing in number over time.
But no one else can see them; everyone calls me a liar.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The dark stains... are you saying my clothes are dirty? Maybe they got smudged."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
Only Tyug believed me, only Tyug. But he's dead...
He's dead, and it's all my fault.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_31 = {
    Text = "If I hadn't let him go for the check-up, if I had been stronger, if I could have done more, he wouldn't have... wouldn't have... I'm such a failure..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Don't talk about yourself like that. You're not!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_33 = {
    Text = [[
I am, I am! I can't save him, I can't save anyone, I can't do anything!
Mom was right. I'm just a burden, a useless nobody. I can't do anything...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_34 = {
    Text = "I... I can't do anything..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_35 = {Text = "So what!"},
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Jenkin's voice pierced the narrow room, leaving Aigis staring at her in a daze."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
Who cares if you can't save them? Who cares if you're scared! Who said you have to be the hero?
That was never your responsibility!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_38 = {
    Text = "But, that's everyone..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
What's wrong with everyone? Should they let a kid like you save the world? Why?
Haven't you done enough already?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_4 = {
    Text = "No! They're dark and damp, causing your hands and feet to vanish!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Jenkin pulled a crumpled ribbon from her pocket and handed it to Aigis. Its vibrant colors were identical to the one in your hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_41 = {
    Text = [[
You're neither a liar nor useless. You're my friend.
What you can't achieve alone, we can accomplish together.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_42 = {
    Text = "I trust you. Do you trust me, okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_43 = {
    Text = [[
Aigis stared at the ribbon in her hand, tears rolling down one after another.
She shook her head vigorously, the pained expression reappearing on her face.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_44 = {Text = "Aigis—"},
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, never mind. Aigis probably has her own concerns."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_46 = {
    Text = [[
It seems that the clinic might be a good direction for investigation.
Aigis, can you stay strong and take us to the clinic?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Just reach the door. If you feel uncomfortable, there's no need to go in."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_48 = {
    Text = "I understand. I... I'll take you there."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
09:11, Lily's Workshop
Temporary Clinic]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Diana, please don't go for the examination. I beg you, don't go and let them check. Diana, Diana!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_50 = {
    Text = "The space here is small, and the boundary is clearly visible. Besides a few tables and chairs, there is almost nothing, not even a single file."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_51 = {
    Text = "After we were brought in, we were required to take medicine, which made us fall asleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_52 = {
    Text = "After falling asleep, you dream of being in a very dark and cold place with no windows, only a huge glaring light shining on your face, making it feel extremely blinding."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_53 = {
    Text = "When you wake up, you'll find... those black marks... on your body..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Dark, cold, and windowless. Sounds like a basement."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_55 = {
    Text = "But the entrance to the basement of the workshop isn't here, and it's full of clutter. It's not like in the dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Could it be a hidden room?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_57 = {
    Text = "A hidden room, huh? That's my specialty. Brown!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_58 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_59 = {
    Text = [[
The rat scurried away, disappearing into a crack in the wall.
Soon, you hear squeaking from the wall opposite you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_6 = {
    Text = "There's clearly nothing dark here. Aigis is such a big liar! Big liar, long nose!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_60 = {
    Text = "There, there's an open spot!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Jenkin frantically slapped the wall. Realizing what she was doing, you joined her, deliberately pressing on the bricks."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_62 = {
    Text = "The wall suddenly sank beneath Ramona's palm. After a clicking sound from somewhere, the wall bulged slightly and slowly began to open outward."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_63 = {
    Text = "As the gaps between the bricks widened, the scent of blood and decay surged out."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_64 = {
    Text = "A dark, narrow passage leading straight downward appears before you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I didn't lie, I really didn't. I truly saw it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I really saw it... Believe me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18843_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Aigis, come. Follow me to the treatment room."
  },
  AvgDialog_18844_Content_1 = {
    Text = "What's wrong with that child?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18844_Content_2 = {
    Text = "She appears to be speaking to someone we cannot see."
  },
  AvgDialog_18844_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Could it be that she's also being controlled by someone, just like Jenkin? How is that even possible?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18845_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Try Retrospective. Other Investigators might struggle when investigating non-Awakened entities."
  },
  AvgDialog_18845_Content_2 = {
    Text = "But if it's you—with your sharpness, you definitely can."
  },
  AvgDialog_18846_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
You take a deep breath, close your eyes, and your vision plunges into darkness.
At first, there is nothing, only the sound of your breathing and Ramona's.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18846_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Gradually, you can hear the fine water droplets in the mist collide with each other, as the monsters turned to mud behind you disintegrate, and black dust drifts down gently."
  },
  AvgDialog_18846_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
The silver key hums, and you listen closely to discern the hidden melody.
It is lively, like a ballad softly calling from nearby.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18846_Content_4 = {
    Text = "\"Old Charlie has a beloved tabby cat...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18846_Content_5 = {Text = "Over here!"},
  AvgDialog_18847_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The monsters you defeated collapse into a puddle of black sludge. You look around, seeing nothing but a vast expanse of white fog."
  },
  AvgDialog_18847_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Damn, I can't see a thing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18847_Content_3 = {
    Text = "My glasses don't display much either."
  },
  AvgDialog_18847_Content_4 = {
    Text = "What to do now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18847_Content_5 = {
    Text = "If only there were a way to track without relying on sight."
  },
  AvgDialog_18847_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
Keyword reading successful, "a method to track without vision," searching...
Search complete. The Keeper may consider performing a spiritual trace.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18847_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Isn't that used by Investigators to track lost Awakeners? Does it also work on mutants?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18847_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
The principle of mental tracing is to locate unusual mental fluctuations.
In this regard, mutants are the same as Awakeners.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18847_Content_9 = {
    Text = "However — let's deal with this guy first."
  },
  AvgDialog_18848_Content_1 = {
    Text = "One by one, the mutants vanished under Ramona's sword, while Aigis's face grew increasingly pale amidst the swirling black dust."
  },
  AvgDialog_18848_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
What are you waiting for? Take me away now.
I'm the culprit. Take me, and then... bring Lucy back.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18848_Content_3 = {
    Text = "If you want her back, prove her innocence and tell us the truth, not like this. This is not a good approach."
  },
  AvgDialog_18848_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You don't understand... None of you do... I am the one and only true dismemberer."
  },
  AvgDialog_18848_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Her body sways as she lunges at the two of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
15:01, Londinium East
Lily's Workshop]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Jenkin snatched the ribbon. 
Aigis, seemingly affected by her emotions, became extremely tense.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Sis, this is... this is my sister's! I personally customized the clasp. There's no way I could be mistaken."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Her face turned even paler as she held the ribbon, as if it weighed a thousand pounds. Her fingers stiffly gripped it, as though she wanted to hold it tightly but couldn't bear to damage it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Where is she? Is she alright? Is she injured? Is she... is she..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Chirp, chirp chirp."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Yes, yes. She must have disappeared, right? You didn't find her either, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_16 = {
    Text = "We indeed found no trace of her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Then there's still hope. The ribbon was torn, so she must have escaped and hidden in the workshop. That's for sure."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You can see the shake in her eyes. But sometimes, a false belief can support someone better than a cruel truth."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Aigis pulled out a few exquisitely packaged candies from under the mattress and handed them to Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You said <Blue:Sick madman>, what kind of sick madman?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_20 = {
    Text = "We... we will find your sister. Definitely."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The girl murmured, her comforting voice fading. She looked pale, as if enduring immense pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_22 = {
    Text = "%player%. Something is going on in the front yard. Come quickly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You hurried over and saw Ramona, along with several people dressed differently from the other workers, tying up a man with ropes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The man has strange scars on his body, resembling twisted stitches at first glance. The unhealed flesh is filled with a dark, sticky fluid."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
That's a <Yellow:D-Mark>, and it seems to be in <Yellow:mid-stage Dissolution>.
You've never seen anything like it.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
Look, that's the kind of lunatic I was talking about.
See, they're still wearing their work clothes. They must have just gone mad. Scary.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
A person dressed in white pulled a syringe from somewhere.
He injected it into the man's neck. The man twitched briefly before going limp and falling silent.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_28 = {
    Text = "You restrained your expression—ordinary drugs shouldn't work on a Dissolution Body. How did this person manage it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
Several people saw the man lose consciousness, quickly tied him up, and carried him away.
Ramona tried to follow, but Sarah blocked her path.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
Hmm, I can't say for sure. Those people might seem normal one day and then go completely crazy the next.
It's really scary how their eyes and nose suddenly merge together.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
Miss Mary, don't go over there, let them handle it.
If you get hurt, how could I explain to {Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_31 = {
    Text = "No need for explanations."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_32 = {
    Text = "L-{Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Though the <Yellow:Committee> strictly controls civilian Dissolution research, there are always a few with special means. The white-clad person can instantly subdue Dissolved Bodies, clearly not simple."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
Does he know anything about these events in the Eastern District?
Is he involved in these events?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_35 = {
    Text = "What just happened? Who was that person in white from the workshop?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Th-That's just a <Blue:Researcher>—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
Miss Sarah, I hope you can be honest with us.
I don't want things to reach a point of no return either.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
You gaze at Sarah, whose eyes are evasive, with a serious expression.
Unsure if she understood your meaning, Sarah bit her lip and made a decision.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Alright. Since you put it that way... please follow me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
I'm telling you, this workshop is full of secrets.
That nasty woman has hidden quite a few things in the office alone.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
15:01, Lilyan Workshop
Temporary Medical Area]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Dozens of beds are squeezed together in the already cramped cafeteria, with all patients tied up and their hands and feet bound to the beds."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Attendants move around, some holding coarse fabric strips, ready to reinforce the restraints on the patients at any time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_43 = {
    Text = "On a bed near the window lay a gaunt old man, his eyes wide open, with a drop of black, viscous liquid seeping from the corner of his eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_5 = {Text = "Brown."},
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[

Brown popped out of the satchel, clutching two shiny rings with his forepaws.
Judging by the craftsmanship and materials, they aren't priceless, but are still quite valuable.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You thought of the ribbon adorned with a silver square buckle."
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Well, have you seen anything similar to this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18849_Content_9 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The twisted monster is barely alive, black sludge writhing with difficulty. Countless faces form and dissolve, emitting eerie sounds."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
He's... not going to make it. He seems to have only a sliver of consciousness left.
I want to communicate with him, to hear what he has to say. Is there any way to do that?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_100 = {
    Text = [[
For her, today must have been tough.
With this thought, you caught up with Ramona and Jenkin, and heard Aigis following behind you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
...There is no such precedent among regular Investigators.
However, Professor Alistair successfully communicated with the residual consciousness within the anomaly using the Silver Key.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_12 = {
    Text = "No need to say more. You take out the Silver Key and instinctively close your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
The stench of Caro rot, the cold air of the basement, and the faint vibration of the Silver Key all quickly fade away.
You are immersed in darkness, carefully listening to each cry soaked in pain.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Sister Sasha... Help me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I don't want to die, I really don't..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_16 = {
    Text = "It's her... It's that woman... She made me accept the treatment, she"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Danger... Must wait for Mythag..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You have locked onto the sound."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I am a new Keeper. Are you... a senior from the School of Management?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Amid Sarah's frantic prayers, a face with too many eyes and teeth appeared on the mutant, its mouth opening in a raspy wail."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
It's me... five days ago... Sean and I... went out to investigate the Dismemberer... and encountered a monster...
Is Sean... safe...?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
He is receiving treatment at school and is now stable.
Can you tell me what happened to you?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The monster transformed me into... took the lady away... then... someone... the person with the carving knife mark... brought me here... smashed, cut... and placed me with others..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
"They mentioned a... plan... outside the Fang... many more... 
Find them... Keepers... and... stop..."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_24 = {
    Text = "A faint voice gradually fades away. You open your eyes to see the pale human face on the mutant vanish into thin air, leaving only a dark stain on the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Are you alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I'm fine. Just now... that senior told me he was turned into a statue by an unknown life form, brought here for experiments, and then placed together with others, ending up like this."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The researchers bear the marks of carving knives."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_28 = {
    Text = "As expected, it's the Sculptors' Association. Their emblem is a carving knife."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
Not only that, but he said sculptors mentioned a plan.
A plan extending beyond the workshop.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Sha... Sha... Sister..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Ramona flicked her rapier, sheathed it, and looked at Sarah who was sitting nearby."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
Speak. You conduct human experiments and kill indiscriminately here. What is your true purpose?
And what exactly is that plan?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_32 = {
    Text = "What human experiment, what... what sculptor? I don't understand. I don't get it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_33 = {
    Text = "I just want the workshop to continue, so everyone can grow up healthy..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Healthy, my foot! Look at those patients, look at Aigis! They ruined her eyes, and you call that healthy?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_35 = {
    Text = "No, no way... I personally examined the Doctor. I tested the treatment myself. Only after confirming it was safe did I allow everyone else to try it. Impossible..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
Aigis, darling, tell me you're okay?
The doctor cured your phantasm, didn't he?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Aigis looked at you, seemingly gathering her courage."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_38 = {
    Text = "No, don't experiment on him!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_39 = {Text = "Aigis!"},
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
...Little Willy...?
Only Little Willy would call me that. Little Willy, is that you? Little Willy?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
It's you, little Aigis.
Have you made up your mind to cooperate with us?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_41 = {
    Text = "I, I... I don't..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_42 = {
    Text = "If you're sick, you need to be examined and treated accordingly. Since all of you can see the black thing, you should all receive treatment to recover as soon as possible, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_43 = {
    Text = [[
No... Tiyog, Tiyog can't see at all...! Let him go!
If you continue like this, I-I-I'll tell Miss Sarah!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Can't see? Turns out he's a little liar.\nSince he can't see, then—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Aigis! Watch your back!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_47 = {
    Text = "—It's up to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Hmm... This place is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_49 = {
    Text = "The intense light made Aigis want to close her eyes, but she found that she couldn't even blink."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I am... Mythag..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Something held her gaze fixed; she could only watch helplessly as a man in white appeared, holding a slender knife."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_51 = {
    Text = "<Big:No, please don't, Miss Sarah, Miss Sarah!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_52 = {
    Text = "The silver blade traces a long, shimmering path with the researcher's movements."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_53 = {
    Text = "<Big:Miss Sarah! Tiyug! Help! Save me! Save me!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_54 = {
    Text = "The blade draws nearer and nearer until it consumes your entire field of vision.\nThen—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_55 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Ah—!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_56 = {
    Text = [[
In the boundless darkness, she floated alone, as if enveloped by icy lake water.
Her limbs were numb and she was unable to move.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_57 = {
    Text = "It hurts... My eyes feel so uncomfortable..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_58 = {
    Text = "A kaleidoscope of writhing colors seeped in. The colors, a viscous liquid, mixed with blood and tears, flowing steadily."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_59 = {
    Text = "I was wrong. I'm clearly useless... I shouldn't have... tried to do the impossible."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_6 = {Text = "!?"},
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_60 = {
    Text = [[
It replaced the lake, the air, the scent, the sound, the touch, and life itself.
It became her entire world, enveloping her in a painful embrace.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Ms. Sarah... Tiyug... Help me... It hurts... I'm in so much pain..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_62 = {
    Text = "The writhing colors surged upward rapidly, and she suddenly fell into a white light screen. An unfamiliar impulse transformed into a myriad of colors, flooding her eyes. She tried to cover her eyes but couldn't move."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Who... are you...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_64 = {
    Text = "The excruciating pain eventually numbed. After an unknown amount of time, she finally detected a faint sound in the silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_65 = {
    Text = [[
Seeing @2's eyes is simply the best material.
If it weren't for Sarah and this kid always getting in the way, I would have used them for experiments long ago.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_66 = {
    Text = "It's not too late, Doctor. We've finally achieved @4@2, and that's worth celebrating!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_67 = {
    Text = "The noise in my ears—whose voice was it? What were they saying? As the nightmare ends, it all becomes a blur."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Aigis found herself sitting in a chair at some point, surrounded by researchers in white coats. They were talking excitedly, but she couldn't hear anything."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_69 = {
    Text = "T-Tiyog...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Is this... the missing one...!?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_70 = {
    Text = "The familiar face before me fades away like watercolors bleeding out. Before the brown irises are entirely replaced by white stone, it—or he—exhaled its final breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Ai... Ji Si..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_72 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Tyug—!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_73 = {
    Text = "When I woke up, I was in the room, and Tyog had already turned into... something terrible."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_74 = {
    Text = "If I hadn't gone in recklessly, if I had realized that I'm just a nobody... I wouldn't have provoked them, and they wouldn't have done that to Tiyug."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Impossible, this can't be real, this can't be real...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_76 = {
    Text = "<Big:Stop playing dumb!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Jenkin shoved Sarah hard, nearly knocking her to the ground. The rat on his shoulder shared her anger, baring its teeth at her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Tell me, where did that shitty doctor take everyone? Where did they take my sister! Tell me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, don't...! Miss Sarah, she didn't mean it, and she didn't know—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Did you find the person? How is he doing? Does he need assistance?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Stop shielding her! You've ended up like this, those lunatics have turned out like that, and my sister is missing—all because of her! She must pay the price!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Sorry, sorry..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_82 = {
    Text = "...Erica, contact the investigation team. We have a transport request."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_83 = {
    Text = [[
Request for assistance in the investigation is being sent.
Request sent and confirmed. Team 3 will arrive at the target location within 3 hours.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_84 = {
    Text = [[
Please, Miss Sarah.
You'll have to wait in the office until the relevant personnel arrive.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_85 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry... I truly... I'm sorry..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_86 = {
    Text = "You took a few steps and noticed that a small white figure was missing beside you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_87 = {
    Text = "She might need some time to be alone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_88 = {Text = "?"},
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_89 = {
    Text = "It's nothing. Let's go."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The mutated creature writhes in agony. Its distorted, almost human face alternates between stretching and contracting, all beyond salvation."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_90 = {Text = "Aigis?"},
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_91 = {
    Text = "You turn around and see the girl standing motionless."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_92 = {
    Text = "What's wrong, Aigis? Would you like me to take you back to rest?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_93 = {
    Text = "...Miss Sarah, will she be alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_94 = {
    Text = "We just want to ask her a few questions. Don't worry."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Will she return?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_96 = {
    Text = "She... She might come back."
  },
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_97 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_98 = {Text = "Aigis?"},
  AvgDialog_18850_Content_99 = {
    Text = [[
It's alright... Let's go, {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%.
I'll be fine.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
13:37, Londinium East
Lily's Fang]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_10 = {
    Text = "She took a metal piece and a thin nail from her pocket and inserted them into the keyhole. The mouse stood upright on her shoulder, cautiously looking around with its front paws."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The lock clicked softly. She grasped the doorknob, turned it, and pushed it inward."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Hehe, piece of cake!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
13:37, Londinium East
Lily's Fang]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, why don't you dress little Aigis up a bit? We have important guests coming today, don't we?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_15 = {
    Text = "What do you know? Dressing too well makes us appear affluent, while dressing too poorly makes us seem like a bottomless pit that drives away donors."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_16 = {
    Text = "She tugged at Aigis's dress, then wiped Aigis's cheek forcefully with some saliva on her sleeve."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Aigis, my dear Aigis, do you remember what to say when you meet the sponsor?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Understood, Miss Sarah. I was obedient, and I was still reciting it before bed last night."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Sarah nodded in satisfaction, then looked at the middle-aged man standing with his hands in his pockets."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Aigis, what are you still doing? The sponsor is coming!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Be careful, and don't say anything unnecessary, got it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Understood!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Stand properly if you understand, {Male=he,Female=she} are coming."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Couldn't find the wallet, but encountered a Dissolution Body. Is this what you call low risk...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Before you finish speaking, a familiar voice echoes in your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
Circumstances evolve, Keeper, as do missions. 
Unless you're questioning William's competence?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I fully trust Mr. Delapur's judgment. The D-Phenomenon must have worsened!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Quick reflexes. \nNow focus—Mutants signal proximity to your target."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Indeed. Look."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_29 = {
    Text = "You look in the direction she indicated. Not far away stands a metal door labeled \"Lillian's Workshop,\" with three people standing in front."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Here I am. Sorry, Miss Sarah. I... I didn't mean to keep you waiting."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Report: Arrived at the mission location."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Mission location confirmed. Verify mission objectives: infiltrate the workshop, retrieve the missing student, confirm the identity of the unknown lifeform, and stop its actions."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Mission targets verified. Entering the workshop soon. Maintain communication."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Ramona looks at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_34 = {
    Text = "How about it? Are you ready?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_35 = {
    Text = "I can manage, as long as the people inside aren't like those kids from earlier."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_36 = {
    Text = "<Small:...Not like Doll.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_37 = {
    Text = "You do realize Silver Communicators are exceptionally sensitive?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_38 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Cough, cough!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Rest assured. I will defend your brooch and cufflinks to the death, {Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Alright, you're all grown-ups now, so stop acting so childish. Hurry up! It won't be good if we're late..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_40 = {
    Text = "I'll rely on you, dear maid Miss Mary."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Keep horsing around with your undercover identities and you'll regret it during remedial training."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
The girl obediently followed, quietly turning back to wave at the potted plant in the corner.
As the footsteps faded, the girl holding the rat peeked out from the green leaves.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Finally! That insufferable woman is always in the office, even at night. Today, I've finally gotten my chance!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Squeak! Squeak, squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Relax, Aigis said they're taking that self-guided tour today and won't be back until noon. I'll search thoroughly, not missing a single hair."
  },
  AvgDialog_18851_Content_9 = {
    Text = "During work hours, the residential hallway was empty. The girl arrived at a door with an \"Administrator's Office\" nameplate."
  },
  AvgDialog_18852_Content_1 = {
    Text = "{Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe, Miss Mary!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18852_Content_2 = {
    Text = "We're fine. Just get everyone to retreat. We can handle this."
  },
  AvgDialog_18852_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Alright, okay. Oh my... Kids, kids, come here quickly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18852_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Move quickly, a tricky guy has appeared."
  },
  AvgDialog_18853_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
The riot ended, and people reformed the line.
Aigis stood among the children, pale and trembling slightly.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18853_Content_10 = {Text = "Damn it—"},
  AvgDialog_18853_Content_11 = {
    Text = "What are you doing? Stop!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18853_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Here are these, and—add Aigis.\nShe is our most beloved child."
  },
  AvgDialog_18853_Content_3 = {
    Text = "No, please... I don't want to go, I don't want to become... No..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18853_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Listen, Aigis, come here. Don't waste the adults' time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18853_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Just as the researcher reached out, Jenkin suddenly jumped out, blocking Aigis."
  },
  AvgDialog_18853_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Didn't you hear me say not to go?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18853_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Are you the new arrival?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18853_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Who cares whether she's new or old? If Aigis doesn't want to go, no one can force her!
Brown, help!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18853_Content_9 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_18854_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona are whispering when suddenly a loud commotion erupts behind you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18854_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Watch out outside! The patient has escaped! Escaped!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18854_Content_3 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The inaudible song guides you forward through the illusion. You push through the mist but never catch sight of the end."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Keep an eye on the surroundings for me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
You kneel on the ground, avoiding the bloodstains, to inspect.
No signs of petrification, but you notice several footprints with strange hues near the body.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_12 = {
    Text = "D-Slime? On the dead body... Could it be from the killer?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
This area only has D-marks aside from the workshop.
I don't believe this is a coincidence.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_14 = {
    Text = "This almost proves that the culprit is from the workshop. The remaining questions are: Who is it? Where is it hiding in the workshop? Is it the unknown life form you are searching for?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Wait a minute, this size... Are these children's footprints?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_16 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_17 = {
    Text = "...Indeed, it seems to be heading towards the workshop."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Hurry, find the child before they hide."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
20:47, Lily Workshop
Hallway]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The buildings on either side of the street silently watch you with their dark windows. Your footsteps echo in the mist, creating the illusion that you have been running alone on this street for a long time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
In the pervasive fog, the workshop felt even colder and eerier.
A man with a wooden stick at his waist patrolled the empty, unlit corridors, holding a lantern.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_21 = {
    Text = "No turning on the lights, save electricity—**. That Sarah is so stingy. And so fussy! Who would want to rob this dump anyway... Huh?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Under the dim light, a door opens silently."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Who, who's there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_24 = {
    Text = "He gripped the stick tightly and mustered the courage to step forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The old-fashioned lantern suddenly went out."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_26 = {Text = "!!!"},
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_27 = {
    Text = "An invisible force yanked him inside. The wooden door slammed shut, and the hallway returned to silence and tranquility."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
20:43, Lily Workshop
Hallway]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Two girls huddle in the faint glow of the lantern, glancing around constantly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_3 = {
    Text = "There is no beginning, no end. You will keep moving forward until life ends, until time—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The distant sound of footsteps echoes through the silent corridor, almost piercing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
Who, who is there?
Come out! I, I warn you, I have a weapon!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The hallway had no airflow, yet the flame on the wick flickered as if blown by the wind."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_33 = {
    Text = "The tray in Aigis's hands trembled, the white teacup and saucer clinking together, echoing the mournful cries of a dying fledgling."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_34 = {
    Text = "The footsteps drew closer and closer. Brown's claws dug deep into Jenkins' shoulder, baring its teeth and emitting a sharp, rodent-like hiss."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_35 = {
    Text = "As if spurred by Brown's voice, the footsteps suddenly quickened, heading straight toward the two of them."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_36 = {
    Text = "A dense shadow completely engulfed the faint candlelight. The girls closed their eyes, only to feel a rush of mist hit their faces."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_37 = {
    Text = "A hand emerged from the darkness, landing precisely on the trembling teacup and silencing it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_38 = {
    Text = "What's wrong with you guys? Why are your faces so pale?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
Mr. Rogers!
It's so dark here. We...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The Taste of Blood"
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Isn't a foggy night truly nerve-wracking and heart-stopping, isn't it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Rogers pushed the door open, and warm light poured out, dispelling the deep shadows in the hallway."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Thank you for bringing me food, Aigis, Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Rogers took the tray and placed it on the small table, then brought over a finely crafted doll from the bed, smiling at the two girls."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_44 = {
    Text = [[
As a reward, how about a pat?
George will be very happy.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_45 = {
    Text = "The doll's inorganic eyes reflect the yellow light of the lamp, silently pleading to the girl: Touch me, just once."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Touch me, and then—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Become my faithful friend."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
You suddenly come to your senses, belatedly catching a whiff of a pungent, sweetish-metallic scent.
Slowing your steps, you approach the shadow sprawled on the ground ahead.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_6 = {
    Text = "It was a shattered female corpse, the open abdomen still steaming, the face mangled and bloodied, arms missing, the cuts clean as if neatly chopped off."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_7 = {
    Text = "This technique belongs to the Dissector."
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[

Gutting and dismembering to take body parts as trophies perfectly aligns with the characteristics of the dismemberer described in the police report.
You can't tell which is crueler: Dissolution or the murderer.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18855_Content_9 = {
    Text = "But why did the song of spiritual tracing lead you here? The unknown life form's ability is clearly petrification. Or are there more than one special entities here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Burden of conscience"
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You follow Sarah to the metal door of the workshop and see several uniformed people dragging a crying, struggling little girl away."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_11 = {
    Text = "It's the Committee."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Is this what Doll meant by evacuation? Why is it happening so fast?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Let go! Where are you taking her? Where are you taking Lucy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_14 = {Text = "Wait!"},
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You pull out a hidden necklace. The Silver Key floats upright above your palm, glowing softly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Mythag University Keeper %player%, Key No. K-0617, requests to speak with the mission leader."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The person in front of you shifts their gaze away from the Silver Key and salutes you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_18 = {
    Text = "<Blue:Mystia Treaty Committee> Leader of the Third Response Team, responsible for the handover related to the investigation of Special Organization S."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Unexpected to meet a new Keeper here, my honor, {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
10:20, Lily Workshop
Entrance to the Administrator's Office]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_20 = {
    Text = "What happened? Why did you suddenly arrest the Fang members?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Please allow me to explain."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The captain waved, and an agent nearby handed over a paper bag."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You open the bag and find an old child's pajamas inside. The edges are stained with dark brown spots, hardened from dried liquid."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Arrived at 10:23 after receiving the joint investigation notice from Mythag University, and began the initial search of the workshop to confirm its status."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_25 = {
    Text = "During the search, we discovered bloodstains in the old room on the southeast side of the workshop's first floor, as well as a bloodied cleaver in the storage area under the stairs."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_26 = {
    Text = "After the workshop members identified, this nightgown belonged to a child named Lucy. Considering the bloodstains in the old room and the testimonies of screams heard last night, we decided to bring her in for investigation."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_27 = {
    Text = "It's me who screamed! I was scared by a shadow last night, but nothing bad happened! This Keeper saw it too, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Sir, this matter is not as simple as it seems. We suspect the involvement of a third party, and this child may be under someone's control. Could you please refrain from taking her away?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_29 = {
    Text = "We are aware of the illegal organization's event. Regardless of any manipulation, the perpetrator remains a perpetrator. Procedurally, I cannot allow her to remain at large."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Before you even reached the office door, a young woman ran towards you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The Committee will adhere to the relevant provisions of the <Agreement> during the investigation and will not subject her to unfair treatment. I can assure you of this."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Additionally, the car for your return to school is ready. Given the special circumstances, I will assign two Agents to accompany you and ensure your safety. Please follow me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_32 = {Text = "No way."},
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_33 = {
    Text = "The Sculptors' Association use so-called research as a front, secretly conducting human experiments in the workshop with the support of sponsor Rogers, which has led to the occurrence of abnormal dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Given the current clues, apart from the \"madness\" in the workshop, the \"Dismemberer\" active in the East District might also be one of the manifestations of abnormal Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_35 = {
    Text = "We've discovered a lot. The only thing missing is the identity of the dismemberer, which will allow us to fully uncover the truth behind the event and thwart the sculptor's plan. At this point, we cannot leave."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_36 = {
    Text = "I understand your desire to continue the investigation, but my orders—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
He suddenly pressed his Committee armband on his upper arm, as if listening to something.
It must be the Silver communicator provided by Mythag University. Are there new orders?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
<Blue:Commander Lydia>. Yes, the Keeper is unwilling to abandon the investigation.
Three days? No, I'm not questioning you... Yes, I understand. Okay, message received.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Hello, it's an honor to communicate with you, <Blue:First Keeper>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, bad news! Some people are trying to take Lucy away!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_40 = {
    Text = "You only know one person worthy of that title—your mentor who resides underground in Mythag. For the past year, he hasn't contacted anyone except you and Doll. Could it be..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Got it. Goodbye, sir."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_42 = {
    Text = "The captain stops talking and turns to you. Meanwhile, you hear your teacher's gentle voice in your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_43 = {
    Text = [[
Do what you want, %player%. I'll take care of the rest.
I have faith in you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_44 = {
    Text = [[
He told you the same thing before you left.
It seems that you don't need to go back for now.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_45 = {
    Text = "After consulting with the First Keeper, the Committee decided to allow the Keeper to continue investigating the Lily Workshop Incident. However, you only have three days. After that, the case will be handed over to more experienced Investigators."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_46 = {
    Text = "As he spoke, he turned around and began giving orders to the surrounding agents."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Transfer paused. Implement Level 5 area lockdown immediately. Suspect temporarily detained. Interrogation to follow after the transfer."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_48 = {
    Text = "No, no! Please, I'll give you anything, just don't take her away! Lucy, <Big:Lucy—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_49 = {
    Text = "It wasn't her, it wasn't her! %player%! Please help Lucy, help her!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_5 = {Text = "W-What?!"},
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_50 = {
    Text = [[
I'm sorry, but this is an absolute order, and I must carry it out.
With that said, I'll take my leave.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Swear to pierce the darkness with my sword."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_52 = {
    Text = "He saluted you again, ignoring Lucy's cries and the pleas of Sarah and Aigis, ordered his men to take the girl, and turned toward the waiting vehicle."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_53 = {
    Text = "The car door closed, blocking all sight. One after another, the cars drove away. Sarah, completely drained of strength, collapsed to her knees."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_54 = {
    Text = "<Small:I'm powerless, I'm useless, I'm not a good principal, I can't protect everyone, I can't protect the children...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, please... We all understand. You've done your best."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_56 = {
    Text = [[
<Small:Sorry, Little Mike, sorry, Aigis, sorry... Jenkin... 
Sorry, Diana, Henry, and Little Lucy...>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_57 = {
    Text = "She curled up her body, hugging her head, her sorrowful whispers gradually turning hoarse and chaotic, becoming indistinguishable."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_59 = {
    Text = [[
The brightly bustling workshop suddenly fell into an icy silence, as if submerged underwater.
An invisible pressure strikes you out of nowhere, causing you to gasp and realize that something is amiss.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_6 = {
    Text = "They wore unfamiliar uniforms and looked fierce and aggressive. After a quick inspection, they declared Lucy a suspect and could not be stopped."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Oh no, Ramona! Get everyone else out of here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_61 = {
    Text = [[
No time left.
The young administrator's head split open like a flower, spraying black slime on the ground.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Miss Sha, Miss Sarah!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_63 = {
    Text = [[
She let out a high-pitched screech, distant answering cries echoed.
Twisted limbs, Dissolution-infected Aberrants rushed out of the building.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_7 = {
    Text = "How could it be Lucy?! Clearly..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Henry and Manny are holding the door. Not sure how long they can last. Hurry!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18856_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Sarah immediately lifted her skirt and ran out."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Birdless night"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_10 = {
    Text = "As if she hadn't seen her, the girl kept walking forward, step by step."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_11 = {
    Text = "As she walked by, Aigis heard an extremely faint song."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Old Charlie has a tabby cat he loves dearly..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Lucy, where are you going? Give me the knife, Lucy!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_14 = {
    Text = "So cold... Is this... the outside? How did I end up here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I was clearly sleeping in my room, but Little Mike kept making a fuss... Ugh, my eyes hurt..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Madman... Madman! Stay away! Don't come any closer!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Ma'am, do you need help? Don't be afraid. I'll call someone over right away—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Help! Is there anyone out there? Please save me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I... I can't move?! Why, why can't my body move?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The mist gathers, making the already narrow corridor even deeper until it is completely devoured by darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_20 = {
    Text = "What a special child to have regained consciousness."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Who are you? Wh-what are you going to do to this lady?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Me? No, no, no, you're mistaken. It's not me who wants to do something to her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_23 = {
    Text = "My... my hand... what happened...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_24 = {
    Text = "It's up to you to decide what to do with her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Don't kill me, <Big:Please don't kill me!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_26 = {
    Text = "It wasn't me, it wasn't me! Put down the knife! Run, run!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_27 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Ah—!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_28 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry... I'm so sorry..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Run, hurry up!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The candle flickers in the damp air, struggling to illuminate a small area. At the edge of the light, deep in the darkness, something is approaching."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Old Charlie has a tabby cat he loves dearly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_31 = {
    Text = "My legs... My legs won't move! Help me! Help me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_32 = {Text = "Ma'am!"},
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Senior, don't go! Senior!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Please, mysterious sir, please don't do this."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_35 = {
    Text = "One day, she vanished, and he searched everywhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Quick, contact the school!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I don't want to harm them, please. I'll do whatever you say, just—don't harm them."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_38 = {
    Text = "He rummaged through the wardrobe. He checked under the bed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_39 = {
    Text = "<Shake:B-behind you!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The rustling sound turned into light footsteps as a vague figure slowly approached this dimly lit island."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_40 = {
    Text = "He wandered around the basement with the boiler burning."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_41 = {Text = "Ah... Ah!!"},
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Please! Sir! Please don't! Don't, don't, don't!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Old Charlie couldn't find his tabby cat anywhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_44 = {
    Text = "<Shake:No, no, don't come any closer... Don't come any closer... Please, please let me go...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_45 = {
    Text = "So he cried and cried—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_46 = {
    Text = "<Shake:I have a younger sister... Please... Spare my life...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_47 = {
    Text = "—Until I disappear as well."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_48 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Ahhh—!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_49 = {Text = "Don't..."},
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Little Lucy, where have you gone? You've been away for so long at night, I was starting to worry—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Why... What have we done wrong... Why must we endure this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Little Mac stood expressionless, staring straight ahead, gripping a sharp knife. His blood-soaked clothes dripped with thick liquid."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Behind him was an open door, through which a broken body could be vaguely seen lying inside the room."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Everyone heard that voice, yet no one remembers. If... if the voice goes to find Jenkin..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Poor child, are you trying to do something futile again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_55 = {
    Text = [[
...!
It-it's you...! Villain, villain! Don't control Little Mike!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Stop controlling him! Or, or I'll tell—tell..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_57 = {
    Text = [[
Tell whom, your dear Miss Sarah?
Aigis, have you forgotten how she reacted the last time you spoke to her?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_58 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_59 = {
    Text = [[
She thinks you're having a nightmare or seeing another phantasm and is preparing to send you for another "check-up."
The evidence you present is dismissed as the residue of the doctor's "patient treatment."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_6 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_60 = {
    Text = [[
Seeing you so upset hurts me too, but this is the cruel and ugly reality.
If your eyes weren't useful, I would rescue you and turn you into a beautiful Relic.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_61 = {
    Text = [[
Now, continue with what you were doing before: wipe away the traces, burn the evidence.
That's all you're capable of.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_62 = {
    Text = [[
The boy walked away with a blank expression.
Aigis entered the room and knelt beside the still-warm body of the security guard.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_63 = {
    Text = "She removed her blindfold. The man's fingertips immediately stiffened and turned white, like stone. A round metal object rolled out of his hardened hand. Just as Aigis was about to pick it up, she heard a scream from behind."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Ai, Aigis...?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_65 = {
    Text = "I killed that person, and just as I was about to dispose of the body, Miss Sarah saw me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_66 = {
    Text = "She pulled me out, wiped the blood off my hands, and assured me that everything would be fine—\"just leave it to her.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_67 = {
    Text = "I just checked; the room is spotless. Miss Sarah must have cleaned it for me.\nAnd also—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_68 = {
    Text = [[
She pulls a shiny cufflink from the teddy bear and shows it to you.
Both the style and material are identical to what you found yesterday.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_69 = {
    Text = "You've found it, the cufflink I dropped there."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The figure gradually came into view. It was a child, expressionless, staring straight ahead, holding a dagger with blood dripping from its tip."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_70 = {
    Text = [[
I can't believe it. Regardless of your motives, you're not that kind of person, Aigis.
You're a good kid. Tell us the truth, and we'll figure it out together, okay?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_71 = {
    Text = [[
......
I never told you how Tyug died.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Aigis removed the eyepatch from her right eye, revealing a pale, stone-like eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_73 = {Text = "It's me."},
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_74 = {
    Text = "I turned him into stone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Aigis, we—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Stop talking! I... am the real culprit."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_77 = {
    Text = "She took a step back, surrounded by black ooze that had appeared unnoticed, ready to strike."
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_8 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Th-th-this... Lucy...? Did you, did you k-k-kill...?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18857_Content_9 = {
    Text = "She couldn't help but turn around and vomit her meager dinner into the corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_18858_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Are those... the patients? The ones Aigis mentioned had black marks? Is this what they become?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18858_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Are these... the people who went missing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_1 = {
    Text = "In the pure black space, countless faint silver dots form a shimmering expanse, undulating like waves following an inscrutable pattern."
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The light point suddenly retreats, and the black space rapidly dissipates."
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You open your eyes and meet the gaze of a bewildered Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
01:14, Lilyan Workshop
Guest Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_13 = {
    Text = "%player%...? What's the matter? Has something happened?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Jenkin rubbed his eyes and tried to sit up, only to find his hands tied behind his back."
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_15 = {
    Text = "What's going on?! Who did this? Let me go!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You nod at Ramona, and she swiftly draws her rapier, cleanly cutting the rope around Jenkin's wrist."
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
Sorry, the situation is urgent. We had to take some protective measures.
Do you... remember what you just did?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Wasn't I just sleeping? With Brown and Aigis, I had such a chaotic dream... Wait, this isn't Aigis' room. How did I end up here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_19 = {
    Text = "What do you want from me? Are you planning to kidnap and silence me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
You are part of it, yet stand apart from it. You belong to them, but feel out of place.
You don't know exactly who they are; you only know you're here to find someone.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_20 = {
    Text = "That would not be in line with the standards and code of Mythag University Investigators."
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Ramona's sword flashed out in an instant. The silver blade hovered by Clementine's neck, but she showed no fear, casually deflecting the rapier with two fingers."
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You watch the woman in front of you warily—doors and windows are closed, yet she appeared almost out of thin air. Silent, like a ghost."
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Who are you? How do you know who we are?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Are you from the Sculptors' Association? And just now in the mist, your wings...\nAre you—human?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
I'm just a helpful third party, though I do have some personal interest.
You intrigue me, special Investigator.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_27 = {
    Text = "She smiles at you, her gaze carrying a hint of strange zeal."
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_28 = {Text = "...Why?"},
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
That's beyond my ability to speculate on.
Only that supreme being can provide you with the answers you seek.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_3 = {
    Text = "\"Sister... Sister...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
But as an apology, I don't mind answering your earlier question.
As you suspected, the human heart is made of flesh, but mine is a Silver heart.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Since that's the case, we can't let you leave."
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
If it were just me, I would gladly go with you.
But I need to consider my patients; they cannot do without me right now.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Clementine pulled out a strange pendant from nowhere and gently shook it. An overwhelming wave of fatigue instantly hit you, forcing you to lean against the table just to stay upright, unable to take a single step."
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
Ramona's rapier drooped, her head swaying, her eyes barely open.
Jenkin lay motionless on the ground, seemingly fast asleep.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_35 = {
    Text = "What... have you done..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
A small trick to let me leave here.
With your abilities, it should be easy to dispel.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Goodbye, <Blue:Pale Blind Eye>. We will meet again here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_38 = {
    Text = "She bows to you and leaves the room. Unable to hold on any longer, you collapse back into the chair."
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Clementine shut the door, humming a cheerful tune, waved down the hallway, then turned and left."
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You look toward the sound. A particularly dim light flickers in the sea of stars. Black threads, with an eerie metallic sheen, entwine it and hold it motionless."
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
In the darkness, the girl in the dress stood as still as a statue. 
She hung her head low, clutching a white blindfold tightly.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
A cheerful melody faintly emanates from the black line, like a nursery rhyme sung by children.
Old Charlie has a tabby cat he loves dearly...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_6 = {
    Text = "\"Sis... don't leave...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Jenkin's voice emerged from the light sphere. It attempted to approach you, but was instantly bound by black threads, forcing it to retreat like a marionette under control."
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
You suddenly realize that someone, or something, is controlling her.
Just as you are about to help her break free, the black threads suddenly grow thinner and eventually vanish completely.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18859_Content_9 = {
    Text = "\"No... Aigis...?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18860_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You chase Aigis to the top of the clock tower."
  },
  AvgDialog_18860_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Aigis stood on the platform, turned around, and tears mixed with blood and D-Slime ran from her covered eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_18860_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Sorry... I... can't hold out any longer..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18860_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Her body rapidly swelled, her flesh bubbling into lumps of various sizes, quickly blocking the staircase and reaching the high ceiling."
  },
  AvgDialog_18860_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Amidst the horrifying sounds of twisted and bent limbs, only a faint trace of the girl's voice lingers."
  },
  AvgDialog_18860_Content_6 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Hurry... run...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Veiled truths"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_10 = {
    Text = "One day, she vanished, and he searched everywhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You go first! Don't worry about us! Quickly contact the school!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_12 = {
    Text = "He rummaged through the wardrobe. He checked under the bed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_13 = {
    Text = "<Shake:B-behind you!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The pitch-black claws tore through the mist, grabbing at the woman's hair."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_16 = {
    Text = "A red ribbon gently floats down, and the outline of a giant eye suddenly appears in the shadows."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_17 = {
    Text = "He wandered around the basement with the boiler burning."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
The youth's eyes blinked to the rhythm of the nursery rhyme, and his face instantly lost color and hardened.
He opened his mouth, and a scream froze along with his body, turning into a statue.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_19 = {Text = "Ah... Ah!!"},
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Thick Mist engulfs the damp, dark streets. The dim lights reflect in the puddles, as if gazing at this bleak world."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Old Charlie couldn't find his tabby cat anywhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_21 = {
    Text = "<Shake:No, no, please... Please, let me go...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_22 = {
    Text = "So he cried and cried—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_23 = {
    Text = "<Shake:I have a younger sister... Please... Spare my life...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_24 = {
    Text = "—Until I disappear as well."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_25 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Ahhh—!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
08:00, Mythag University, Awakener System Building
Inside William Draper's Office]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
You sat at the desk, carefully examining the items in the tray under William's gaze:
A lifelike stone-carved hand and a piece of red ribbon adorned with a silver buckle.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_28 = {
    Text = "How about it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
You're a bit nervous. William is not just your senior, but also your training instructor.
Even though you're now a full-fledged Keeper, it still feels like you're being evaluated by him.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A leather shoe crushed the reflection in the puddle and hurried away."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
This seems to be a part of the statue. However, a hollow statue? That's a first for me.
And inside... is that blood?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_31 = {
    Text = "This connects to those two runaway students, doesn't it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Exactly. Five days ago, two students left school without authorization, heading to <Blue:East Londinium> to investigate <Red:\"The Dissecter Serial Killings\">."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_33 = {
    Text = "At night, the two of them heard cries for help near <Blue:Lilian Workshop> on Bernard Road. Upon investigation, they discovered a woman being chased by an <Yellow:Unknown Lifeform>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Two students followed the school motto and attempted a rescue but were attacked. Ultimately, the first-year student successfully escaped and returned to school at dawn four days ago, while the second-year student remains missing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_35 = {
    Text = [[
Three days ago, a first-year student awoke from fainting and recounted the event.
He told us that the creature seemed to possess petrification abilities, turning women's legs into stone.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Petrified? Could this statue be... part of the missing student?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
The survivor cannot be identified, but it is highly likely.
As for this ribbon, it probably belongs to a female victim.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Any <Yellow:Dissolution> traces? With that ability, it might be a new <Yellow:Cataclysm>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_39 = {
    Text = "That's the strange part. disaster, as the core of <Yellow:D-Rifts>, should <Yellow:Dissolve indiscriminately>. I've never heard of them attacking proactively."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Quick! It's catching up!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Besides a small amount of <Yellow:D-Slime>, we found no obvious D-Marks at the scene or in the entire East District, which is inconsistent with the <Yellow:Dissolution traits> of a D-Rift."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_41 = {
    Text = "What we can confirm now is: recent disappearances around <Blue:Lilian Workshop> and the <Red:\"Dismemberer\"> case might be related to that Life."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_42 = {
    Text = "After preliminary analysis, we believe the unidentified lifeform is likely hiding in Lily An's Fang."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Looks like we have to make a trip there."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Yes. Confirm the whereabouts of the missing student, uncover the truth behind the event, locate and stop the mastermind. That is your mission."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_45 = {
    Text = "How about it, %player%? Can you handle it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Piece of cake."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_47 = {
    Text = "I'll do my best."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Very well. Considering that the target this time may possess considerable intelligence, I suggest you obtain disguises from the logistics department before setting out, so as to avoid alerting them."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Take this ribbon with you. It might help uncover why the unknown life form attacked its owner, and if possible, identify the victim."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Three people ran frantically in the Mist, their breathing heavy, like mice under a cat's gaze amidst cheerful singing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_50 = {
    Text = "The task is not very dangerous. We will keep the communicator open. <Blue:Doll> and <Blue:Erica> will guide and assist you at any time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_51 = {
    Text = "You touched the badge on your chest. The embedded <Blue:Silver Fragment> ensures your long-distance communication."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Without further delay, let's set off."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_53 = {
    Text = "May the Silver Key guide the way."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_54 = {
    Text = [[
13:07, Londinium East
A Small Alley]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_55 = {
    Text = "A few poorly dressed, scrawny children are squatting in the alleyway, seemingly discussing something."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_56 = {
    Text = "As usual, Brown and I will take care of it. You guys distract those gullible ones and buy us some time. Meet at the back door of the bakery afterward."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Aren't you going back to the Labor Workshop?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Gotta buy some food first. The bread in that damn place is harder than a rock; I can't even swallow it. I can't take it anymore."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Mrs. Blake from the dairy shop said that once someone enters there, they can't come out, not even in death. It's so frightening. Could your sister already be...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Old Charlie has a tabby cat he loves dearly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Don't talk nonsense! Big Sister will be fine, right, Jenkin?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_61 = {
    Text = [[
The girl didn't answer and just gazed outside the alley.
The rat on her shoulder nudged her with its nose, as if to comfort her or express worry.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_62 = {
    Text = [[
On a bustling street, a pitch-black, polished car slowly comes to a stop.
Two impeccably dressed individuals step out, one of them with beautiful silver hair.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_63 = {
    Text = [[
See those two suckers? They're today's targets.
Get ready to roll!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_64 = {
    Text = [[
13:10, Londinium East
A Street]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_65 = {
    Text = "The moment you stepped out of the car, you were overwhelmed by the thick humidity and the stench of decay."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_66 = {
    Text = "A sudden wave of dizziness and intense ringing in your ears hits you. Blurry images flash through your mind, as if you've seen this scene before."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_67 = {
    Text = [[
Is it an illusion, or is it a part of your lost memory?
Before you can reminisce, a group of playful children bumps into you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_68 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_69 = {
    Text = "You clutch your bruised arm, noticing Ramona watching you with a faint smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_7 = {
    Text = "My legs... My legs won't move! Help me! Help me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_70 = {
    Text = "What's the matter?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_71 = {
    Text = [[
She pointed at your pocket. Following her finger, a saying suddenly came to mind:
"The most infamous welcome in the East District is your wallet disappearing without you even noticing."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_72 = {
    Text = "No way... my wallet!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Hurry, %player%, or you won't be able to afford cupcakes this month."
  },
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_8 = {Text = "Ma'am!"},
  AvgDialog_18861_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Senior, don't go! Senior!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18862_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ramona blocked Aigis's attack. Aigis staggered back a few steps, her hands trembling slightly, black goo oozing through her fingers as she covered her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18862_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Don't come any closer... Stay back!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18862_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The girl turned and ran."
  },
  AvgDialog_18862_Content_12 = {Text = "Aigis!"},
  AvgDialog_18862_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Stop shouting, hurry and chase them!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18862_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Aigis, are you okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18862_Content_3 = {
    Text = "She jolted and lifted her head, her gaze shifting between clarity and haziness."
  },
  AvgDialog_18862_Content_4 = {
    Text = "How... how could this happen... No, no, I wasn't asleep, don't..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18862_Content_5 = {Text = "Aigis?"},
  AvgDialog_18862_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Don't talk, don't, don't. It's not dark yet, and there's no fog at all. You can't control me, can't...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18862_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Aigis clutched her head, her small body bending forward due to an inexplicable pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_18862_Content_8 = {
    Text = "No... I don't want to be made into a wax sculpture... I refuse, I absolutely refuse..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18862_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Did you hear something, Aigis?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18863_Content_1 = {
    Text = "***She doesn't look ill, how could she have gone mad?! Aigis, be careful and dodge!***"
  },
  AvgDialog_18863_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
She said she received healing, probably around that time...
In any case, we need to lure her to a secluded place.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18863_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Before that, let's take care of these guys."
  },
  AvgDialog_18864_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona fight as you retreat, making your way to the workshop's courtyard without alerting others."
  },
  AvgDialog_18864_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The fog is back!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18864_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A dense fog has enveloped everything, and with it come eerie screeches from places unseen, gradually drawing closer to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18864_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona stand back-to-back, warily eyeing the twisted shadows."
  },
  AvgDialog_18864_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Why are there mutants here? Weren't the patients locked up?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18864_Content_6 = {
    Text = "No matter where they come from, just drive them back!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18864_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Ramona swung her rapier and proactively engaged the nearest few monsters."
  },
  AvgDialog_18865_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The mutant fell before Ramona's sword, and soon disintegrated into fine black dust, vanishing into the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_18865_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You take a deep breath and straighten your body."
  },
  AvgDialog_18865_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Be careful, Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_18865_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, I know my limits."
  },
  AvgDialog_18865_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You wipe the sweat from your forehead, panting and blinking hard."
  },
  AvgDialog_18865_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Are you alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18865_Content_4 = {
    Text = "It's fine. Just a slight headache."
  },
  AvgDialog_18865_Content_5 = {
    Text = "My brain feels like it's about to burst out of my eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18865_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You still have the heart to joke around, so it seems like nothing serious."
  },
  AvgDialog_18865_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Need a break?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18865_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Let's hurry and find Jenkin. I have a feeling it's not that simple."
  },
  AvgDialog_18865_Content_9 = {
    Text = "A small figure emerges from the mist before you. She bends her knees slightly, her body tense, clearly in an attacking stance."
  },
  AvgDialog_18866_Content_1 = {
    Text = "There isn't anyone there. Are you sure you didn't missee it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18866_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Miss Mary, where are you going? Alas, Miss Mary!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_1 = {Text = "%player%!"},
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, I'm so scared, please..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_12 = {
    Text = "What's wrong, Aigis?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, could you sing that song again, just once? I mean, if it's not too much trouble for you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Dear Aigis, listen carefully. You are the most obedient and sensible child in the entire workshop, and everyone loves you the most."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_15 = {
    Text = "So, it's okay to be a little willful sometimes. Do you understand?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Well... I-I want to hear Miss Sarah sing the nursery rhyme again."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
No problem.
Old Charlie has a tabby cat that he loves dearly...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You suddenly open your eyes and find yourself in a vibrant real world."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_19 = {
    Text = "%player%, are you alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_2 = {
    Text = "As Ramona keeps Sarah at bay, you quickly focus and immerse yourself in that gradually familiar, utterly black space."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
You nod, fighting off dizziness.
Out of the corner of your eye, you catch a glimpse of a white figure.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Aigis? It's dangerous here. Go back to Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, are you asleep?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_23 = {Text = "...?"},
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Well, Miss Sarah hasn't had a good sleep in a very long time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_25 = {
    Text = "To keep the workshop from dissolving, she was always running around, meeting the wealthy lords and ladies residing in the castle, with no time to eat or rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_26 = {
    Text = "At night, back at the workshop, she lights a candle in her office and keeps calculating whether the money from Master is sufficient."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Let's see how much the jewelry begged from the ladies and young misses can fetch."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_28 = {
    Text = "They all laughed at her and said hurtful things, but Miss Sarah never got angry. She comforted me and sang for us."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_29 = {
    Text = "She treats us well, really. She treats me very well too."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The Silver Key buzzes intensely, and the darkness before you shifts several times, gradually brightening from the edges of your vision."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_30 = {
    Text = "I was a burden to my mom, and she abandoned me. The previous administrator refused to take me in, but Miss Sarah said she was willing to take on two jobs in order to take me in."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Since then, I vowed never to be a burden to Miss Sarah and to become a useful child."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry, Miss Sarah. I've done everything I could, but I failed to protect Little Mike and failed to protect you. I'm sorry."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Aigis gently touched Sarah's cheek, then turned to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Aigis, you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Do you want to know what happened last night?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The girl forced a smile, barely recognizable as an expression of joy."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
Release Lucy, and also Miss Sarah.
I am the dismemberer Jack you've been looking for.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Sister Sasha, I'm so hungry."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Sorry, Miss Sarah, we can no longer continue to fund you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, why doesn't Mom want me anymore?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Black and white lights flash by, as if multiple movies were being projected onto a single screen simultaneously. No matter how hard you try, you can't make out the details."
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, my mom said I'm just a waste... Can I really handle these tasks?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18867_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, my mom doesn't want me anymore. Will you... will you abandon me too...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18868_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Oh my... this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18868_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, Miss Sarah. Dr. Miller will definitely help the patients."
  },
  AvgDialog_18868_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, please reorganize the team. The sooner we finish selecting, the sooner they can receive treatment."
  },
  AvgDialog_18869_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Everyone, please calm down!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18869_Content_2 = {
    Text = "I'm perfectly calm. You should ask him what he did to Aigis to make her so scared!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18869_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You know nothing! We're doing this for the welfare of humanity!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_1 = {Text = "Our secret"},
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Searched.
No relevant records found. We apologize sincerely. It is recommended to submit an Assist Investigation request.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Investigator Ramona, communicator ID I-3017, formally reports Clementine Fairfax, suspected non-<Blue:\"Covenant\"> Awakener, currently disguised as Dr. George Rogers"
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
Assist investigation request received.
Approved, transferred to <Blue:Mythag Investigation Department>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
The application has been submitted. Leave the rest to the investigation team.
There's still some time before dawn. Would you like to get some rest?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_14 = {
    Text = "No, to convince Doll, we must quickly find a breakthrough clue or a suspect."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Are you talking about Sarah."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_16 = {
    Text = "What she gave us to drink was definitely more than just tea. Plus, I find it hard to believe that someone who has lived in a workshop for so long could be afraid of shadows."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Now she thinks we're asleep, so she'll probably let her guard down."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
Go. Check the hallway first, then head to her office.
She will be our breakthrough.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
01:15, Lilyan Workshop
Guest Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
01:13, Lily Workshop
Guest Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
Aigis quietly opened the door and walked to the sleeping Jenkins.
She stood for a while, then began to sob quietly.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You're okay, you're really okay...! I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
I should have come earlier. I should have given it a try, even if I'm useless, even if I...
Doctor Clementine was right, but...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
I'll think it through, I'll know what price is enough...
I certainly will.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_24 = {
    Text = "She quietly left, and as the door closed, Jenkin silently opened his eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
01:37, Lily Workshop
Corridor]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
You quietly make your way to the spot where you recently met Sarah and Aigis.
It's at the end of the corridor, with only a door, walls, and a window overlooking the backyard catching your attention.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Ramona pushed open the door. The flashlight beam swept across the bed and wardrobe, illuminating the floating dust in the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Is this... the old room?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Ramona crouched down, ran her fingers over the brick joints, and gently sniffed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
After a particularly dazzling flash from the Silver Key, you and Ramona feel a lightness in your limbs and rush out the door.
The corridor is empty except for the two of you]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
There's a faint smell of blood, probably cleaned up.
Judging by the dampness, it happened within the hour.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_31 = {
    Text = "She shone the flashlight on the ground around her. The water stains in the cracks of the bricks faintly reflected the light, and in some of the gaps, you could even see an ominous black liquid."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
What happened? Who was injured or killed?
Was it the Dismemberer or an unknown lifeform?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Based on our earlier findings, there was only a gap of about ten minutes between the Dismemberer and us. Even though we spent some time examining the body, we shouldn't be too far behind."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
And judging by the size of the footprints, the dismemberer might even be... a child.
But when we were with Sarah in the workshop earlier, we didn't see any children with blood on them.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_35 = {
    Text = "In such a short time, completing tasks like killing, looting, escaping, killing again, and hiding one's identity is absolutely impossible for a single individual."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_36 = {
    Text = "You mean this child likely has an accomplice?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_37 = {
    Text = "They might even be accomplices, committing the second crime here simultaneously or nearly so while the other was carrying out the first."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Could it be Sarah? She had enough time and was also here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_39 = {
    Text = "There is currently insufficient evidence to make a judgment."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_4 = {
    Text = "She said she has a \"Silver Heart,\" possibly something similar to an Awakener. So..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
Ramona walked to the corner, bent down, and retrieved a small metal object from the darkness.
It was a blood-stained cufflink.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_41 = {
    Text = [[
Judging by the craftsmanship, this is likely one of the "gold and silver jewelry pieces" that Jenkins mentioned from Sarah's stash.
Let's head to the office; we might find more evidence.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
01:55, Lily Workshop
Principal's Office]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_43 = {
    Text = "I was right, %player%. Look."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Ramona took out a small brown bottle from her desk drawer. You take it and examine it, seeing a label with the drug's name and effects."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Can help patients relax their spirits and sleep — looks like this is the ingredient we added to our tea."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Fortunately, she hasn't mastered the dosage yet, otherwise tonight would have ended differently for both of us."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Speaking of which, what's going on with Jenkin? Sarah doesn't seem to have the ability to control others' spirits... Hmm? What's this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_48 = {
    Text = [[
You rummage through the drawer as you speak, pulling out a black-covered book from the bottom.
You place it on the table and open it, only to find it filled with names written in dense rows.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_49 = {
    Text = "John Douglas, Diana Wolf... Workshop Roster? Also marked with age, gender, and family status. But beyond this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You close your eyes, forcing yourself back into that illusory world, only to find everything shrouded in a hazy veil, appearing blurred and indistinct."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Each name is followed by a symbol representing the currency of the Kingdom of Leo, <Blue:Leo Fang>, followed by a number."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_51 = {
    Text = "The neatly arranged numbers and personnel information made it hard to distinguish whether it was a worker roster for the labor Fang or a shopping list from some magazine."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Everyone has a different price: men, women... and children."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_53 = {
    Text = [[
It's like treating people as commodities.
Who? Who would make such a deal with her?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Do you remember Sarah asking who was helping to treat the patients?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Dr. Miller's Research Institute. Could it be a disguise for the Sculptors' Association?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_56 = {
    Text = [[
It's possible. Let's take the key evidence with us first.
Tomorrow, we'll try to get Sarah to talk and see if we can get anything out of her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_57 = {
    Text = [[
01:50, Lily's Workshop
Somewhere in the Backyard]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Sarah struck the match and threw it into the pile of wood in front of her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Catalyzed by gasoline, the flames rapidly spread and engulfed the blood-soaked clothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Your occiput begins to throb in waves, sharp tinnitus pierces through; you clutch your forehead and have to stop attempting to recall."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_60 = {
    Text = "She stood silently for a moment, confirmed that the flames would not go out, and then turned to leave."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You've already exhausted a great deal of spirit power today. Don't push yourself."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_8 = {
    Text = "But Clementine... I can't just leave her like this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18870_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
We can call for backup.
Erica, look up Clementine Fairfax.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18871_Content_1 = {
    Text = "My wallet, my little cake..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18871_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Cheer up. Maybe we'll get extra rewards if we complete this mission successfully."
  },
  AvgDialog_18871_Content_3 = {
    Text = "If it comes down to that, I don't mind sharing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Chromatic nightmare"
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_10 = {
    Text = "...Alright, if {Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe orders it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
09:23, Lily's Workshop
Underground Chamber]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_12 = {
    Text = "This appears to be some kind of experimental operating room. In the center of the room is a modified operating table, stained with suspicious grime."
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_13 = {
    Text = "In the deep corner of the basement lies a pile of dirty clothes unrecognizable in their original form, half the height of a person, continuously emitting a foul stench."
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Th-Th-This is what kind of place?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Don't play dumb. We know all about your evil schemes with that shitty doctor."
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_16 = {
    Text = "What evil schemes are you plotting, kid? You've been making a racket ever since you got here. I'll have to teach you a lesson."
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_17 = {
    Text = "We saw your big notebook!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_18 = {Text = "...?"},
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_19 = {
    Text = "You pick up the ledger beside you, open it, and gesture to Sarah."
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
09:15, Lilyan Workshop
Principal's Office]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
Mike, male, 5 years old, 10 Leo Fang; Diana, female, 23 years old, 5 Leo Fang... 
Aigis, female, 8 years old, 40 Leo Fang.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_21 = {
    Text = "After you finish speaking, you pick up the patient list you just found."
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Mike, male, 5 years old, 5 Leo Fang; Diana, female, 23 years old, 5 Leo Fang; Aigis, female, 8 years old, 5 Leo Fang."
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_23 = {
    Text = "... Should I continue?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_24 = {
    Text = "No, it's not what you think. I—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Don't make excuses! You're turning the people in the workshop into test subjects for that \"Dog Doctor,\" all to trade for your gold and jewels!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_26 = {
    Text = "No, it's not like that! Miss Sarah said it was nutritional support for those receiving treatment from the lab, 5 Leofan each time, as agreed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_27 = {Text = "Aigis!"},
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Indeed. As for the kid talking about jewels, it's just nonsense, please believe me {Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Jenkin pulled out two silver rings from the depths of his satchel."
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Emerald necklace, ring... Strange, where is my ledger?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_30 = {
    Text = "You're saying that I conjured these two little gadgets out of thin air from the drawer on the right side of the office?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_31 = {
    Text = "How did it end up with you? Give it back—it's a gift from another sponsor!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_32 = {
    Text = "{Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe, believe me, I regard them as emergency supplies to support the workshops, how could I, how could I harm the children in the workshop for these things?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_33 = {
    Text = "How about this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_34 = {Text = "...!!"},
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_35 = {Text = "Cufflinks?"},
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_36 = {
    Text = "We entered the room from yesterday."
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
The place has been recently cleaned, but the floor is still wet, with bloodstains remaining in the cracks between the bricks.
This seems to have been accidentally overlooked and left in the corner.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
It is made with fine materials and exquisite craftsmanship.
Who else in the workshop, apart from you, the Dean, would have such decorations?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_39 = {
    Text = "No, it's not hers! It's not Miss Sarah's; it's mine! I dropped it there!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
? Who is it?
Please come in.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_40 = {
    Text = "It's her, it's her! A murderer and a kidnapper!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Ignoring Aigis's obstruction, Jenkin lunged forward and grabbed Sarah's skirt."
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_42 = {
    Text = "You scoundrels, tell me, where is my sister? <Big:Where have you taken my sister?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_43 = {
    Text = [[
You are about to step forward to intervene when a sudden chill runs down your spine.
Something is behind you, behind all of you, watching with malicious intent.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_44 = {
    Text = "You turn your head and see the dirty clothes in the corner wriggling."
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Black liquid seeps through the fabric seams, soaking the once-dry clothes and forming slimy aberrations on the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_46 = {Text = "Ramona!"},
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah."
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
Miss Mary!
May I ask if there's anything I can assist you with?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
I'm afraid I'll need you to accompany me.
{Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe has some problems, hoping you can provide some answers.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_8 = {
    Text = "{Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe? Can't it wait a little? I'm slightly busy here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18872_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I'm afraid I must insist."
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Little girl, we're doing this for Aigis' sake. Her condition is rather special, and if not properly controlled, it could become very troublesome."
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Jenkin, stop fighting!
...I'm going.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_11 = {Text = "...Huh?!"},
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_12 = {
    Text = "This is what I deserve. Once it begins, once I have... there will be no..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_13 = {
    Text = "What do you mean, \"It's what you deserve\"? On what grounds?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
Dr. Miller is right. If I relapse, it will cause a lot of trouble for everyone.
I don't want to hurt you. I... just let me go.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Are you out of your mind?! What are you doing, muttering to yourself? I clearly said no!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_16 = {Text = "Jenkin—"},
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Dr. Miller."
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Let's call it a day. We can talk about it later."
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_19 = {
    Text = "...Are you sure, Mr. Rogers?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_2 = {
    Text = "It might even hurt the people around you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_20 = {
    Text = "That's what I think."
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
Alright, I think it shouldn't matter if I skip a week.
In that case, I'll take my leave. Goodbye, Miss Sarah, Mr. Rogers, and {Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Dr. Miller bowed to you and left with several researchers."
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Intuitively, you feel you shouldn't let them go, but—everything is mere speculation at present. You don't know if they are indeed from The Sculptors' Association, nor how many there are, or where their base is located."
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_24 = {
    Text = [[
You look at Ramona, her expression gloomy, clearly sharing your concern:
Would detaining them now only tip off the enemy?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_25 = {
    Text = "I... I'm also preparing to leave, Miss Sarah. S-see you next month."
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
I'll take little Aigis and Jenkin to rest first.
Miss Sarah, how about meeting in your office later?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Huh? But, Aigis, she—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_28 = {
    Text = "She looks quite frightened. I hope to stay with her for a while so she can calm down."
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Then... alright. I trouble you, {Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe."
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_3 = {
    Text = "See, Aigis, this is what happens when you don't listen and cooperate."
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Your friends, the people around you... will all pay the price for this."
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Obey, comply, and do not resist. Know this: you have nowhere to escape."
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_6 = {
    Text = "What do you mean by \"around\"? I've been with her for so long, and nothing has happened!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_7 = {Text = "...Jenkin"},
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Aigis, don't be afraid. Watch me take care of him. Brown, bite him!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18873_Content_9 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Missing Person Notice"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Don't be so negative, we just want the workshop to get better and better"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_11 = {Text = "Hmm!"},
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You suddenly feel a jolt at your side and look down: a frail child has collapsed on the ground, trembling uncontrollably."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_13 = {
    Text = "There, there, there are monsters!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_14 = {
    Text = "A few minutes ago, at Lily's Workshop"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
In the quiet corridor, a door with a metal nameplate slowly opened.
A mouse slipped through the crack, looked around, and squeaked twice toward something behind it.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Last time you also said there was no one! If I hadn't run into Aigis, I would have been in serious trouble."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_18 = {
    Text = "That's right, that's right! Everything you said is correct. Our Brown is the best!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_2 = {
    Text = "14:01, Lily's Workshop"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, that woman has so much jewelry. I only took two rings; she won't notice!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Well... hehe, now I know where she keeps all the good stuff. When I find my sister, I'll clean out that nasty woman's treasures!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_22 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Alright, stop talking—hmm?\nWhat is... that sound?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_24 = {
    Text = "At the end of the corridor, something flickered around the corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_25 = {Text = "Brown."},
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The mouse leapt down from the satchel and, with its unique agility, silently scurried along the wall to check around the corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_27 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
Upon hearing her partner's signal indicating safety, the girl crouched and followed.
She leaned against the wall, peeking ahead, and sighed in relief when she found no one in front of her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Deciding to leave quickly, the girl pulled her head back but caught a glimpse of a pale shadow out of the corner of her eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_3 = {
    Text = "As you can see, despite our efforts, there are too many people in need, and this workshop won't last much longer. I... sigh!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_30 = {Text = "?"},
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_31 = {
    Text = "She stepped into the hallway and found an irregularly shaped white object lying on the not-so-clean wooden floor, resembling a kind of stone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_32 = {
    Text = "It appears to be part of a stone mask, crafted with great precision. Each eyebrow has been meticulously carved, appearing lifelike."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_33 = {
    Text = "What is this? I haven't seen any stone masks or statues being processed in the workshop."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_34 = {
    Text = "She tilted her head, looking around curiously, and poked with her index finger."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Why is it still warm...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_36 = {
    Text = "She was about to pick up the mask when its stone lips suddenly parted, emitting an otherworldly groan of pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_37 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_38 = {
    Text = "She stepped back in horror, catching the smell of decaying Caro with each hurried breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Monster, monster... Monster!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_4 = {
    Text = "M-Miss Sarah works so hard every day; she even sold her favorite things to support the workshop. P-please help us..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
14:37, Lily's Workshop
Aigis's Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_41 = {
    Text = "So I ran, then I bumped into you. Then you insisted on bringing me to \"rest,\" and now I'm here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_42 = {
    Text = "This time, it should be detailed enough."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_43 = {Text = "Hmm..."},
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Two children sit side by side on the bed. You look at them, especially at Jenkin, and finally ask the question."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Are you... a boy or a girl?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Are your eyes malfunctioning or what!? I'm a girl, a girl!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Confirm, confirm."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_48 = {
    Text = [[
Honestly, what kind of person is this? Are they out of their mind...? 
Are you done asking? If you're finished, it's my turn.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
Jenkin flicked his hand, pulling out a wallet from somewhere.
The familiar shape, the Mythag crest imprint: no doubt, it's your wallet, but...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Don't say another word, my dear little Aigis. If the workshop truly fails, I will never let you starve, even if it means I go hungry myself!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_50 = {
    Text = "...Why is it empty inside? Where is my money!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_51 = {
    Text = "That's not the point!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_52 = {
    Text = [[
Ahem, well, despite my appearance, I can read a little.
This doesn't contain a {Male=Lord,Female=Lady} certificate, %player%.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_53 = {
    Text = "If I tell that nasty woman who you two really are, do you think she'll have the guys at the door kick you out?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Is this a child from the Fang?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_55 = {
    Text = "No... otherwise, haha, our workshop has very strict security and does not allow people with unknown backgrounds to enter or exit."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Judging by Sarah's reaction, she clearly doesn't know Jenkins. So then—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_57 = {
    Text = "If we get caught, it won't just be my problem, right? After all, you don't belong to the workshop either."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_58 = {
    Text = "I have plenty of ways to get in. But for you, having lost your self-reliant status, it will be tough to sneak back in."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_59 = {
    Text = "...is the sponsor."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah...! I-I will be obedient, take good care of you, repay you, and not be a burden to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Never mind! Anyway, either you do me a favor, or we both suffer!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Just to be clear, I don't steal."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Do I need your help to steal something? No, I want you to help me find someone!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Go ahead and tell me your requirements."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_64 = {
    Text = "I need you to find someone for me, a very important person."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_65 = {Text = "Who?"},
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_66 = {
    Text = "My sister, Mason."
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_7 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_8 = {
    Text = "My dear little Aigis—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18874_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Watching the drama unfold between the two—mostly Sarah—you can't help but feel a bit helpless.\nThough you understand them, the help you can offer is not financial."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Little Detective"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Tsk, whatever. You almost got me caught. The responsibility is on you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
To be honest with you, I'm not actually part of this broken workshop.
My name is Jenkin, and this is Brown.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_12 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
I came here to find my sister. Her name is Mason, and she disappeared near here two weeks ago.
Has anyone by the name of Mason appeared around here recently?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry, I... I don't know... I'm sorry..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Think carefully. She's about this tall, with long hair tied up with a pretty red ribbon."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_16 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Have you seen her or not? Answer me. Were those bastards from your Fang captured her and forced her to work?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Tsk, no way. You know nothing. I have to stay, even if I have to join the workshop undercover—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_19 = {
    Text = "No way! If you join, you'll be healed. No way!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
3 days ago, Londinium East Fang
Lily Workshop]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Keep it down! You may not be afraid of being caught, but I am!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_21 = {
    Text = "I'll help you find your sister. I can hide you and bring you food, but don't join the workshop, okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Really? That's wonderful! I swear I'll repay you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_23 = {
    Text = "By the way, what is your name?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_24 = {
    Text = "I... My name is Aigis."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Nice to meet you, Aigis. From today onward, we are friends!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
15:00, Londinium East
Lily's Fang]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Later, Aigis helped me hide in the storeroom, and I searched for my sister in the workshop when the adults weren't paying attention."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
I thought we'd definitely find it when everyone was gathered during the break. 
But I didn't see anyone yesterday or the day before, so I can only check during the day while working.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
I'm not afraid of being kicked out, but I don't want any trouble, unlike you.
With your status, you can wander around the workshop without anyone minding.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_3 = {
    Text = "At midnight, the East District was enveloped in darkness. Both the streetlights and moonlight were swallowed by the dense fog, leaving only a few blurred shadows swaying in the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_30 = {
    Text = "I don't ask for much, just a glance to check if my sister is among the workers."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
If you help me, I'll return your wallet and that ID, and keep it a secret for you.
If you don't help me... Hmph!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_32 = {
    Text = "It's up to you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Why are you so certain your sister is here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You might not know, but this is the famous \"Eating Fang.\" Many people have disappeared around here, including my sister."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_35 = {
    Text = "A few days ago, I saw a <Red:dark shadow> darting around the yard at night. Something strange must be going on."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_36 = {
    Text = "......Alright, I'll help you find your sister. In exchange, you need to help me investigate the workshop, okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_37 = {
    Text = "That settles it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_38 = {
    Text = "She spits into her palm and looks at you expectantly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_39 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Two small figures stand in the corner of the Labor Workshop's front yard."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_40 = {
    Text = "What are you waiting for? Shake hands. Do you have no respect for street rules?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Shake her hand"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_42 = {
    Text = "You mimic her, spit into your palm, and shake her hand firmly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Very savvy, West Sider. I underestimated you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_44 = {
    Text = "You mimic her, spit into your palm, and shake her hand firmly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_45 = {
    Text = "A pleasure to work with you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_46 = {
    Text = [[
14:50, Londinium East
Lily's Fang]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Miss Mary, please, you must, absolutely express my sincerest apologies to {Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_48 = {
    Text = "The workshop is full of good-hearted poor folks. That kid isn't... uh, I mean, I'll teach her a lesson!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Ramona was about to reply when she caught a glimpse of a strange figure at the end of the corridor."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You're not Little Mac, and you're not Little Lucy! Who are you...?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_50 = {Text = "Miss Mary?"},
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_51 = {
    Text = "What is that...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I should be the one asking who you are! Roaming around in the middle of the night, people might mistake you for that notorious dismemberer."
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_7 = {
    Text = "It's not me! Not me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Shh! Do you even have ears? I told you to keep it down!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18875_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I... I... I'm sorry, I just... I'm not... I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Unspoken decorum"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_10 = {
    Text = "He was indeed powerful. He even cured Aigis's eyes, freeing her from phantasms."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_101 = {
    Text = [[
Even if she might know where my sister is, I... No, I don't think she's a bad person.
Let's go for now. I'll find a quiet moment later to ask her properly.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Right, Aigis?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_12 = {
    Text = "...Yes, Dr. Miller... very impressive..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_13 = {
    Text = "No way! If you join, you'll be healed. No way!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I will help you find your sister, I promise. I can hide you, but don't join the workshop, alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_15 = {
    Text = "From Jenkin's description and current reactions, this child seems to be filled with fear towards Dr. Miller and \"treatment.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_16 = {
    Text = "If that researcher is working with Dr. Miller, then this so-called \"experimental therapy\" likely involves Dissolution and D-Marks."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_17 = {
    Text = "At this moment, a few maids dressed as cooks pushed carts, bringing in the aroma of oatmeal porridge."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Oh dear, I totally lost track of time, {Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe must be starving."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
Aigis, be a good girl and find Diana to bring out the meals for the guests.
Then you can deliver the meals to the patients, alright?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
15:11, Londinium East
Lily's Fang]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Understood, Miss Sarah. I'll head out right now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The girl carried the tray, walking slowly past each bed, greeting patients who were either lucid or delirious."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Good afternoon, Granny Thompson; Good afternoon, Uncle Kelvin..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
She stopped by a bed near the window.
On the bed lay an old man, his limbs bound by cloth strips, groaning in pain.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Grandpa Robert, I've placed your meal aside. Don't forget to eat!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The girl lowered her head to adjust the old man's blanket, completely unaware that a jet-black triangle was silently devouring his face, melting his features into the dark slime."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
You need to eat well to recover quickly.
Once you're better, we can go to Delair Park together and feed the pigeons.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The old man's emaciated arm tore off the binding cloth and suddenly raised—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_28 = {
    Text = "If we had more funds, we might be able to hire more professionals, and the patients could recuperate in better facilities—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_29 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
You followed Sarah into a room filled with makeshift beds.
It seems this place was originally a cafeteria, with a dining table still in the center.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_30 = {
    Text = "You quickly turn towards the source of the sound and see a monster whose face has been completely replaced by black holes grabbing Aigis."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_31 = {Text = "Aigis!"},
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Ramona quickly reacted. She moved through the chaotic crowd and struck the monster's shoulder with her rapier's scabbard."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_33 = {
    Text = "The monster released its grip, and the nearby attendants quickly rushed over to tie the still-shrieking creature back to the bed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Grandpa Robert, Grandpa Robert—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_35 = {
    Text = [[
Amid the girl's cries, you looked at the "person" struggling in bed, feeling a wave of sorrow.
<Yellow:Advanced Dissolution>, this old man only had a few days left to barely maintain a human form.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Bandages, I've found bandages! Aigis, quickly, let me see your wound!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Grandpa Robert, hurry and help Grandpa Robert."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Why are you still thinking about others at a time like this? If the wound isn't treated promptly, it will be troublesome!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Jenkin grabbed Aigis's arm and, without hesitation, pulled up her sleeve, revealing a wound oozing with blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_4 = {
    Text = "To take care of them, we had to divert some manpower, which affected work efficiency and the workshop's revenue. On top of that, there was the strange illness..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_40 = {
    Text = "This damn lunatic scratched so hard!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_41 = {
    Text = "The slender scratch on the girl's arm is seeping blood, but compared to the grotesque black scar across her wrist, it pales in significance."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Interwoven stitches pull the skin from both sides toward the center, attempting to \"close\" the black opening, but instead making it resemble a greedy, gnawing mouth."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_43 = {
    Text = "This is a <Yellow:D-Mark>, twisted like those of the patients."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_44 = {
    Text = "...Jenkin, go fetch some water."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Jenkin nodded vigorously and dashed away."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_46 = {
    Text = [[
Ramona gently wiped the blood from Aigis with a handkerchief, avoiding her wrist.
Aigis looked at Ramona, then at you, appearing hesitant.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Aigis, is there something you want to say?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_48 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_49 = {
    Text = "No, no... I don't..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I didn't want to risk the sponsor's confidence, so I kept everything hidden. Only the main sponsor <Blue:Mr. Rogers> knows."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid, Aigis. No matter what it is, we will definitely help you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid, Aigis. Dr. Miller is here to help you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid, Aigis. It's just a shot. It won't hurt."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid, Aigis. It'll be over soon."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid, Aigis..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_56 = {Text = "Aigis?"},
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_57 = {
    Text = [[
The girl shook her head vigorously.
Just then, after calming the other workers, Sarah hurried over to you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Aigis, you're—oh my god, you're bleeding! Where are the bandages? Quick, get the bandages!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_59 = {
    Text = [[
I'm fine, Miss Sarah.
Sorry, it was my carelessness that made you worry.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You looked around, the patients showed different degrees of dissolution, each distorted like the man before"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_60 = {
    Text = "You... sigh. How many times have I told you? These lunatics are dangerous. But you refused to listen and insisted on taking this job of delivering food to them. Why are you so stubborn?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Sorry... I didn't mean for this to happen..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_62 = {
    Text = "I know you want to share the burden with everyone, but you need to assess your own abilities. Wouldn't this end up causing trouble for everyone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_63 = {
    Text = "You're really a handful. How will you ever grow up if you keep being so willful—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Have you said enough?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Jenkin returned unexpectedly, throwing a bucket to the ground and blocking Aigis."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_66 = {
    Text = [[
Every day, Aigis works so hard and helps you with so many things. What more could you possibly be dissatisfied with?
Growing up? If growing up means doing whatever you say, then it's better to never grow up at all!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_67 = {
    Text = "What's going on?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_68 = {
    Text = [[
You turn around at the sound and see two people standing behind you.
You recognize one of them: she once handed you a psychological questionnaire on the street.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_69 = {
    Text = [[
Mr. Rogers, Dr. Fairfax!
You usually come in the evening. If you had told me earlier, I would have greeted you at the door.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Strangely, the person in a white coat referred to as \"<Blue:Researcher>\" during Sarah's explanation is not here now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_70 = {
    Text = [[
I'm already very familiar with this place, Miss Sarah. No need to go through all this trouble.
By the way, why is Little Aigis crying so sadly? Did someone bully her?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_71 = {
    Text = "It's all because of that damn Sarah! She's just..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_72 = {
    Text = "As Jenkin shouted, Clementine bent down and skillfully took Aigis's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Did little Aigis encounter new troubles? Should we talk to Doctor Clementine again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Wait, who are you? Don't pull me around randomly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_75 = {
    Text = "I've known little Aigis for a long time, newcomer. Whenever Aigis felt sad in the past, she would always come to me for a chat."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_76 = {
    Text = [[
After all, talking about worries is one of the ways to heal psychologically, and I happen to be a very professional listener.
Would you like to join us? It seems that you are troubled by something as well.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_77 = {
    Text = "I'm not going. All that psychological healing stuff is just strange..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_78 = {
    Text = [[
What a pity. If you change your mind, feel free to join us anytime.
Let's go, Aigis.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_79 = {
    Text = "After the two leave, you turn your attention back to the present."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Mr. Rogers was one of the first to notice the strange illness and has been closely monitoring the patients' conditions. It was he who introduced us to Dr.<Blue:Miller>, an expert in researching rare and difficult diseases."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_80 = {
    Text = "George Rogers, nice to meet you both."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_81 = {
    Text = "He frees one hand to gently shake yours. The moment your palms touch, a wave of intense dizziness washes over you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_82 = {
    Text = [[
Everything around you melts away like wax, even the person in front of you becomes distorted.
Beneath the youthful face, pale skeletons intertwine like vines.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_83 = {
    Text = "The eerie illusion vanished without a trace after a few blinks, leaving only a sharp ringing in the ears—was this a hallucination born of exhaustion, or an omen of some kind?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_84 = {
    Text = "You have no idea. You only know that it is similar to what you experienced in the graveyard a few days ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_85 = {
    Text = "...He visits every month to check on the patients' conditions. Thanks to him, we were able to establish this care zone to heal the patients. He is the workshop's true benefactor."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, you overpraise me. I'm just an ordinary person trying to do something for the world."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_87 = {
    Text = [[
Nice to meet you, Mr. Rogers. My name is Ash, and this is my butler, Mary.
This child is Jenkin... huh?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Where did you run off to again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Aigis held Clementine's hand and followed her pace, strolling through the front yard."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Dr. Miller agreed to provide us with free treatment, only asking us to use his \"<Blue:Experimental Therapy>\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_90 = {
    Text = "I see, that <Red:\"voice\"> that always appears in your mind at night made you do bad things again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_91 = {
    Text = "I've tried locking the door, covering my ears... but the \"voice\" always finds a way to reach me, to reach everyone..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_92 = {
    Text = "They all forgot the \"voice,\" but not me. Even if I wanted to, I couldn't forget it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_93 = {
    Text = "So many people have died, including Jenkin's sister... I can't take it anymore. If this keeps up, sooner or later, we'll all be found by the police and arrested!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Do you think they are innocent?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_95 = {
    Text = "I know they are innocent! It's all because of that \"voice.\" It changed everyone, including me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Can you help me, Doctor Clementine? No one believes my warning, but they might listen to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_97 = {
    Text = "The \"voices\" that others cannot hear do not truly count as evidence, and it is difficult for people to respond to warnings without evidence. But — do not be discouraged."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_98 = {
    Text = "In this world, nothing is unattainable if you're willing to risk your life to obtain it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18876_Content_99 = {
    Text = [[
Aigis lowered her head, lost in thought.
Near the courtyard wall, behind a stack of wooden crates, a head wearing a brown hood peeked out.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Who killed cock robin"
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
The workshop was shrouded in mist, surrounded by darkness, yet it didn't seem to affect the girl.
She ran forward with all her might.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
Hurry, hurry up! If someone finds out, if %player% finds out...
They will definitely catch that person, for sure.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_12 = {
    Text = "She turned a corner and came to an abrupt stop."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_13 = {
    Text = "No, oh no..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Not you, Little Mike."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
20:50, Lily's Workshop
Aigis's Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Jenkin circled the empty room, hands on hips, and sighed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_17 = {
    Text = "She's not in the bathroom, not in the kitchen, and not even in the cafeteria. Where on earth did she go?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_18 = {
    Text = "She sat directly on the ground and reached under the mattress, feeling around."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Never mind, she'll have to come back to sleep eventually. I'll just wait here and eat candy while I wait for her!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
20:43, Lilyan Workshop
Guest Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Squeak! Squeak! Squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Don't you dare snitch! Besides, I'll buy her more —"
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
She stopped her movement and pulled something out.
A red ribbon with a silver buckle, one end roughly torn.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Is this... my sister's...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_24 = {
    Text = [[
20:50, Lily's Workshop
Front Yard]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The workshop falls into slumber under the night. You and Ramona hurry back, sensing a premonition—\nSoon, something other than you will shatter the peace."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_26 = {Text = "%player%."},
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You close your eyes again. An indescribable chill spreads like water from the back of your head to your limbs, while an unknown melody gradually fades, as if it is about to be carried away by the wind."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_28 = {
    Text = "You open your eyes and notice that the surrounding fog has thinned."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_29 = {
    Text = "I can't sense it anymore, it's like... like the sound is growing faint."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Rogers manipulated George's hand to make the wax sculpture greet Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Could the spiritual fluctuations of special individuals be related to this fog?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_31 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_32 = {
    Text = "It's coming from that direction!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_33 = {
    Text = "You immediately ran towards the source of the sound and collided with Jenkin at the entrance of the workshop."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_34 = {Text = "Jenkin?"},
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Aigis isn't in the room! That might have been—anyway, hurry up!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
Recalling the devastation seen on the street, you quicken your pace and enter the workshop. 
Soon, a glimmer of light appears ahead in the corridor.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_37 = {
    Text = "It was an old-fashioned lantern, held in hand, illuminating the faces of the woman and the child."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Aigis! I heard a scream. Are you okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
The girl curled up in Sarah's arms trembled all over, burying her face deeper into Sarah's neck.
Seeing this, Jenkins paused briefly and turned to Sarah angrily.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Hello there, buddy. Do you like George?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_40 = {
    Text = "You vile woman, did you do something bad to her? Let her go, do you hear me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_41 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
Sarah silently put the girl down.
Even with her head lowered, you could still see Aigis's tear-streaked face in the light.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Can you take her back to rest first? Aigis got lost and is afraid of the dark. She really needs some rest now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Jenkin stared suspiciously at Sarah while grabbing Aigis's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Aigis clutched Sarah's dress and began to sob softly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Go, little Aigis."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Have a good sleep, and the nightmare will be over tomorrow, alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_48 = {
    Text = "But... Miss Sarah..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Let's go. I have a light, so there's no need to worry."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_5 = {
    Text = "So beautiful, who wouldn't like it? Right, Aigis?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_50 = {
    Text = [[
The two children walk away hand in hand.
Sarah turns to you with a slightly stiff smile.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Sorry, were you two disturbed by my shouting?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Foggy days always make people uneasy, and I was startled by a shadow. Please give me a chance to apologize, and allow me to brew a pot of tea for you both."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_53 = {
    Text = "No need for such trouble, Miss Sarah. We can return on our own."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_54 = {
    Text = [[
How could that be? Please promise me, {Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe, Miss Mary. 
Otherwise, I can't sit still!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_55 = {
    Text = [[
If Miss Sarah insists so, then accompany us for a stroll in the workshop. 
Afterwards, the tea will taste even sweeter, don't you think?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_56 = {
    Text = "...Alright. This way, please."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_57 = {
    Text = [[
21:03, Lily's Workshop
Corridor to Aigis's Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, you... you go to my room first. I'll go to the bathroom."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Are you going out again? Aren't you afraid? Would you like me to accompany you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
......
Sorry, Jenkin, I... sorry, I need to step away for a moment.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_60 = {
    Text = "It's alright, I'll be back soon."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_61 = {Text = "Soon."},
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_62 = {
    Text = [[
22:00, Lilyan Workshop
Guest Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_63 = {
    Text = "It's about time. That concludes today's consultation."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_64 = {
    Text = [[
Thank you, Dr. Clementine.
Every time we talk, I feel like my mind becomes much clearer.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_65 = {
    Text = [[
It's my duty.
Tell me, do you know what to do next?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Of course. I will continue."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_67 = {
    Text = "As he said: Beauty will eventually replace all suffering."
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Aigis? Where are you going? Hey, Aigis!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
20:44, Lily Workshop
Hallway]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18877_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
Running.
Aigis is running.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ogier and Ramona pin down the resisting Jenkin from both sides."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_10 = {
    Text = "<Italic:Old Charlie's tabby, fat and dear...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_11 = {
    Text = "\"Sis... don't go...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Jenkin's voice emerges from the light. It tries reaching out to you, but is held back by the black threads, like a puppet."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
You realize something, or someone, is controlling her.
As you move to help, the threads thin and vanish.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_14 = {
    Text = "\"No... Aigis...?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The light retreats, the black space dissipating rapidly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You open your eyes to meet a bewildered Jenkin's gaze."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_17 = {
    Text = "%player%...? What happened? Something's wrong?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_18 = {
    Text = "SQUEAK SQUEAK!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Jenkin blinks her dry eyes and tries sitting up, only to find herself tied up."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Is she... hysterical...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_20 = {
    Text = "What the—?! Who did this? Let me go!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You nod at Ramona. She steps forward and cuts Jenkin's bonds swiftly with her sword."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
Sorry, something went wrong and we had to take some protective measures.
Do you... remember what you just did?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_23 = {
    Text = "What I did? We were going to break into that woman's basement, no? Brown and I hid in Aigis' room waiting—must've fallen asleep and had a weird dream..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Wait, this isn't Aigis' room. How'd I get here? What's your plan? Gonna make me disappear now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_25 = {
    Text = "You did come as promised, but something was terribly wrong about you, as if..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_26 = {
    Text = "As if you were possessed by something. In other words, you may have been hypnotized."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Hypnosis... Ah! Could it be the psychologist who took Aigis?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_28 = {
    Text = "That's quite rude. Psychotherapy is a science, not some superpower to control minds... Ah, science, similar to what those <Blue:Pygmalions> pursue."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
No. %player%, her spirit is restless.
The mental power of the Silver Key might have a calming effect.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Ramona's sword flashes out. The silver blade hovers at Clementine's neck, but she shows no fear, deflecting the rapier with two fingers."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You watch warily—doors and windows closed, yet she appeared like a ghost."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Are you with the Sculptors' Association?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_33 = {
    Text = [[
I'm just a helpful third party, though I do have some personal interest.
You intrigue me, special Investigator.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_34 = {
    Text = "She smiles, gaze carrying a strange zeal."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_35 = {Text = "...Why?"},
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Clementine steps back with a mysterious smile, bowing slightly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I've said enough tonight, enough to make my <Yellow:silver heart> tremble with excitement."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_38 = {
    Text = "A <Yellow:silver heart>... Are you an Awakener?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_39 = {
    Text = "In that case, Clementine, you are NOT leaving."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Activate your Silver Key"
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Wouldn't it be boring if our story ended today?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_41 = {
    Text = "She produces a strange pendant from nowhere. Overwhelming fatigue hits, forcing you against the table just to stay upright."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
Ramona's rapier droops, head swaying, eyes barely open.
Jenkin lies motionless, seemingly asleep.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_43 = {
    Text = "What... have you done..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_44 = {
    Text = [[
Just a small trick to get away.
You're good, and I believe you'll be fine soon enough.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Goodbye, Pale Pupilless Eye. Our paths... will cross again."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_46 = {
    Text = [[
She bows and exits.
You collapse into the chair, unable to hold on.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Clementine shuts the door, humming cheerfully. She waves down the hallway, then leaves."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_48 = {
    Text = [[
In darkness, the dress-clad girl stands statue-still.
Head hung low, she clutches a white blindfold tightly.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You stand in pure blackness, where glowing silver dots form rippling connections, moving inscrutably."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
You're part of this yet separate. You belong but feel misplaced.
You don't know what they are; only that you're here to find someone.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_7 = {
    Text = "\"Sis... Sis...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You look toward the sound—a dim light flickers among the stars,\nentangled and immobilized by black threads with an eerie metallic sheen."
  },
  AvgDialog_18878_Content_9 = {
    Text = "A cheerful melody emerges from the black threads, like a children's nursery rhyme."
  },
  AvgDialog_18879_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You exit the alley, reaching the workhouse's iron gate."
  },
  AvgDialog_18879_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A greasy-faced man lounges on a bench, a black stick at his waist, a dark pipe in his mouth."
  },
  AvgDialog_18879_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You notice a small black mark on the man's arm. A triangular wound that resembles a tiny abyss, oozing viscous dark fluid."
  },
  AvgDialog_18879_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Ramona clears her throat, stepping forward just like a haughty butler."
  },
  AvgDialog_18879_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Good morning, sir. Please inform the house a guest has arrived."
  },
  AvgDialog_18879_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Before she can finish, the guard's body contorts. Black slime erupts from his chest, forming a monstrous mass that lunges."
  },
  AvgDialog_18880_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Sis? What are those? Sis?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18880_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Yet there's nothing you can do but watch her fall, landing on the dirty sewer floor, the hard <Red:statue> shattering into chunks."
  },
  AvgDialog_18880_Content_11 = {
    Text = "...Statue? Why a statue?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18880_Content_12 = {
    Text = "No time to think. You look up to where she fell."
  },
  AvgDialog_18880_Content_13 = {
    Text = "No... can't be..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18880_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The little girl you know stands there, blindfold fallen, eyes vacant, holding a blood-red ribbon, torn in half."
  },
  AvgDialog_18880_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Don't ask, just run, Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18880_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The monsters close in, forcing you towards the abyss."
  },
  AvgDialog_18880_Content_4 = {
    Text = "She's just a kid from the slums, she doesn't know anything. She'll never pose any threat to you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18880_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Following your sister's instructions, you climb down the sewer pipe while carrying Brown."
  },
  AvgDialog_18880_Content_6 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Please, I beg of you...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18880_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Those were her last words."
  },
  AvgDialog_18880_Content_8 = {
    Text = "As the voice cuts off, a familiar silhouette plummets from above, still clutching half a red ribbon."
  },
  AvgDialog_18880_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
The ribbon was custom-made for your sister. It cost you a year's savings.
You never knew your parents; she was your closest person.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18881_Content_1 = {
    Text = "A black shadow darts from the corner, brushing past Aigis and crashing into the left wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_18881_Content_10 = {
    Text = "He suddenly breaks free and lunges at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18881_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
You focus on him:
a disheveled man, barefoot, in charity clothes, his wrists and ankles marked by bindings.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18881_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
A few attendants chase after him, trying to pull him away.
The man remains unfazed. He leans back and slams his head into the cold, hard wall.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18881_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Behind you, Aigis gasps."
  },
  AvgDialog_18881_Content_5 = {Text = "—!"},
  AvgDialog_18881_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The muffled sound of bone hitting brick increases in frequency as the man continues ramming without showing pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_18881_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
Blood splatters, leaving dark spots on the walls and floor.
You step forward to help, but the man suddenly stops moving.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18881_Content_8 = {
    Text = "He takes a deep sniff, like a dog, then slowly and stiffly turns toward you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18881_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Blood trickles down his forehead. The swollen wound has split the skin, revealing a glimpse of white bone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18882_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You didn't go far when the children, who were just fooling around, quickly gathered in front of you, blocking your way."
  },
  AvgDialog_18882_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Kind {Male=sir,Female=lady}, spare some change. Mane, Pensh, anything..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18882_Content_3 = {
    Text = "We might consider it AFTER you take your hand out of %player%'s pocket."
  },
  AvgDialog_18882_Content_4 = {Text = "Hmph!"},
  AvgDialog_18882_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The child bolts."
  },
  AvgDialog_18882_Content_6 = {
    Text = "We need to give these unfortunate brats a small lesson, don't you think?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18882_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Let's give it a shot."
  },
  AvgDialog_18882_Content_8 = {
    Text = "They seem to be in cahoots with the brown-hooded one."
  },
  AvgDialog_18882_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Alright, let's go. Standing up for justice is a civic duty."
  },
  AvgDialog_18883_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ogier runs anxiously past soot-stained brick walls caked in Londinium grime."
  },
  AvgDialog_18883_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I'm fine, and this young mister didn't mean any harm, no?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18883_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I'm so very sorry. I failed to notice the surroundings."
  },
  AvgDialog_18883_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
Clementine offers a gentle smile, brushing imaginary dust from her clothes.
She nods and graciously glides away.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18883_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Above, a rusted iron sign reads "Lilian's Workhouse."
A bored guard slouches beneath it.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18883_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
So we're here. Let's go inside and take a look.
Do you remember your disguise, {Male=Lord Ashe and his younger brother,Female=Lady Ashe and her younger brother}?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18883_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Of course, dear Mary, my housekeeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_18883_Content_16 = {
    Text = "At your service, Miss Mary."
  },
  AvgDialog_18883_Content_17 = {
    Text = "...Ugh. That'll have to do."
  },
  AvgDialog_18883_Content_2 = {
    Text = "First investigation job with my lord. Can't afford any..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18883_Content_3 = {Text = "Ugh!"},
  AvgDialog_18883_Content_4 = {
    Text = "An iron door opens, and a woman in white suddenly comes into view, colliding head-on with Ogier."
  },
  AvgDialog_18883_Content_5 = {
    Text = "<Small:Ah...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18883_Content_6 = {
    Text = "S-sorry! Are you alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18883_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona finally catch up with Ogier."
  },
  AvgDialog_18883_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Sorry, we... Huh, were you the psychologist handing out surveys earlier?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18883_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You remember me? What an honor."
  },
  AvgDialog_18884_Content_1 = {
    Text = "So many monsters in this cramped underground space..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18884_Content_2 = {
    Text = "This Workhouse is indeed something."
  },
  AvgDialog_18884_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Shh, please stay calm. It's almost over."
  },
  AvgDialog_18885_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The black creature roars, then collapses into sludge."
  },
  AvgDialog_18885_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You prop the guard's remains against the gate and enter."
  },
  AvgDialog_18885_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Around the corner, a white figure flashes by."
  },
  AvgDialog_18885_Content_12 = {
    Text = "They're... We must get back before they meet Miss Sarah. Let's sneak in through the kitchen window."
  },
  AvgDialog_18885_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Those people can help; do not resist their arrival."
  },
  AvgDialog_18885_Content_14 = {Text = "No!"},
  AvgDialog_18885_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Those people won't be daunted by what's happening here. I promise."
  },
  AvgDialog_18885_Content_16 = {
    Text = "No... we can't involve more people... It's dangerous for anyone who gets close. You KNOW that..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18885_Content_17 = {
    Text = "<Red:Mr. Anderson>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18885_Content_2 = {
    Text = "He... What... what happened?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18885_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
<Yellow:Early Dissolution Erosion>.
It shouldn't happen this early... it shouldn't happen at all.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18885_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Two voices echo through the brooch, resonating in your minds."
  },
  AvgDialog_18885_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Looks like artificial catalysis at work."
  },
  AvgDialog_18885_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
The anomalous Dissolution patterns... potentially correlate with <Yellow:Investigator Anderson's disappearance>.
The workhouse may be targeted... possibly you as well.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18885_Content_7 = {
    Text = "We'll be ready."
  },
  AvgDialog_18885_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Stay vigilant, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_18885_Content_9 = {Text = "I will."},
  AvgDialog_18886_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Looks like this one is a bit different."
  },
  AvgDialog_18886_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Time to get serious."
  },
  AvgDialog_18887_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Meanwhile—\nOgier observes the workhouse courtyard through the window."
  },
  AvgDialog_18887_Content_10 = {
    Text = "No, you can't take her away!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18887_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
You must have misunderstood us, little one.
We are doctors hired by the workhouse, and she's coming for a regular check-up.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18887_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Ogier's face flushes red, yet a sudden inspiration strikes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18887_Content_13 = {
    Text = "No way! {Male=My brother,Female=My sister} said that we will soon inquire about the situation from Aigis on behalf of Lord Ashe. You can't take her away now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18887_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Kids should learn to obey adults."
  },
  AvgDialog_18887_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
The iron door creaks open. White-clad figures file in.
Children line up in gray mist, waiting for selection.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18887_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
Among them, Ogier recognizes a familiar figure:
the small white girl who welcomed you all.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18887_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Shoulders hunched, head lowered, she wrings her dress's hem. Though frightened, she steps forward before the others."
  },
  AvgDialog_18887_Content_5 = {
    Text = "She tries making herself smaller, disappearing into her body. A tall shadow looms; she shivers, dares not move."
  },
  AvgDialog_18887_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
Conflict erupts.
The white-clad stranger grabs her arm, forcing compliance.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18887_Content_7 = {Text = "—Stop!"},
  AvgDialog_18887_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Giving in to impulse, Ogier charges between the stranger and the girl."
  },
  AvgDialog_18887_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Y-Young Master Ashe?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18888_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Grandpa Robert... why..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18888_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Be careful, he's lost his mind!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18889_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Please, don't hurt Miss Sarah. I'll tell you everything..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18889_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ai... gis..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18889_Content_3 = {
    Text = "She's not completely lost!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18889_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Take out these monsters, then subdue Sarah! We need Sean's whereabouts from her!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18889_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Understood!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ramona swiftly moves behind him, gripping his wrist with one hand and pressing his shoulder with the other. She twists his arm behind his back, restraining him firmly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
I'm n-not a stranger to this place, Miss Sarah. You don't have to.
By the way, why is Little Aigis crying so sadly? Did someone bully her?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_11 = {
    Text = "<Small:I'm fine, Mr. Rogers.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
The pressure of the matron's gaze makes Aigis swallow her words.
She bows to everyone, looks at you, then disappears behind the door.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry for hiding the ward from you. I just can't risk any possible infection..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Alas, let's not dwell on that. Allow me to introduce our long-term patron—the renowned wax sculptor, Mr. Rogers."
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_15 = {
    Text = "This ward and the treatment of patients were all made possible thanks to him."
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_16 = {
    Text = "George Rogers, nice to meet you all."
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
He frees one hand to gently shake yours.
The instant your palms touch, intense dizziness washes over you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Everything around you seems to dissolve like melting wax; even the person in front of you twists and deforms. Beneath the face, pale skeletons intertwine like vines."
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The eerie illusion vanishes in a few blinks, leaving only sharp buzzing in your ears—was it fatigue-induced? You don't know."
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Ogier quickly steps forward and, with Ramona's help, binds his hands and feet with cloth strips.
The man continues struggling, exposing a peculiar scar through his open collar.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You only know this resembles what you experienced in the graveyard the other day."
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_21 = {
    Text = "...Every month, he personally comes to check on the patients. He is truly a great benefactor and a major supporter of our workhouse."
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_22 = {
    Text = "M-miss Sarah, you overpraise me. I'm just an ordinary person trying to do something for the world."
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Speaking of which, you mentioned that you would visit with a <Yellow:friend>..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_24 = {
    Text = "That s-<Yellow:sculptor> has found inspiration and r-returned to the studio."
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_25 = {
    Text = "And these young ladies and gentlemen...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_26 = {
    Text = "...{Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} Ashe?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
Um, beg your pardon, I was distracted. Nice to meet you, Mr. Rogers.
I am Ashe. This is my younger brother Ogier and our housekeeper Mary. This is Jenkin...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_28 = {Text = "Huh?"},
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Where's Jenkin?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A deep scar runs across his chest, barely held together by twisted stitches. Black ooze still seeps slowly from the gaps."
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Rushed footsteps sound outside the ward. Sarah appears, out of breath, holding the door frame."
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Seeing everything settled inside, she relaxes for a moment, then immediately frowns and turns to the girl cowering in the corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
Aigis! Didn't I say no sponsors are allowed in the ward?
Who would sponsor us if something happens to...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_7 = {
    Text = "W-What's going on?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
You turn toward the sound and find two people behind you.
One you recognize: the woman in white whom Ogier once encountered.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18890_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
Mr. Rogers, Dr. Fairfax!
I'm sorry, please have some refreshments in the lounge while you wait. I'll come and greet you once I'm done here.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Little Detective"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Following the location in the note, you arrive at the backyard. Before getting close, you hear a childish voice murmuring near the base of the wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Remember—if the sponsor's no good, you run and bring Aigis.\nShe's definitely sent to the <Yellow:Sick Madmen> by that wench."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_12 = {
    Text = "What madmen?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Whoa! Why are you here so soon? And I told you to come alone!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The mouse scurries onto the shoulder of the hooded kid, nervously twitching its whiskers at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_15 = {
    Text = "That's not my wallet. I can't do this alone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Stop acting. I see everything—White-hair's pretending to be a butler, blondie's been asking directions, and you? Just standing there with your hands in your pockets."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Think I can't tell? You're the boss. After all, there's no \"young master certificate\" in that purse of yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Jenkin's hand flicks, pulling out a wallet from nowhere. It has a familiar texture and shape, embossed with the emblem of Mythag University—Ogier's wallet."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Right, Brown?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_2 = {
    Text = "As you can see, despite our best efforts to shelter those in need, there are simply too many! At this rate, the workhouse won't hold out much longer... I... sigh!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Hey! My wallet!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Ogier hastily reaches for it, but Jenkin sidesteps, and the wallet vanishes like magic once again."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
That's rude, blondie.
Is this how Mythag boys treat girls from the streets?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Girl... you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Are you blind? Of course I'm a girl! A GIRL!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Anyway, enough talk. You'd better listen and—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Very well, we agree to your terms. But in exchange, you'll take us to see those <Yellow:Sick Madmen> you mentioned."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_28 = {Text = "...Huh?"},
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Aren't you asking us to find someone in the workhouse for you? Now, who would that be?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_3 = {
    Text = "M-Miss Sarah works so hard every day. She even sold her favorite things to support the workhouse. Please, please help us..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_30 = {
    Text = "I haven't said anything!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_31 = {
    Text = "But you are going to. So I suggest we be honest and skip the pretense."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
You're investigating the <Yellow:workhouse disappearances>, yes?
Our objectives align. Mutual cooperation would prove beneficial.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_33 = {
    Text = "How... how did you know?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Simple. You have nimble hands and loyal companions, which allows for a stable but illegal income."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Ramona speaks while pacing habitually in the yard."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Standard operational procedure: you execute primary actions while associates provide diversion and extraction. Profit-sharing sustains the arrangement."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Independent street life offers superior autonomy over institutional dependence. Unauthorized workhouse entry carries severe penalties."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_38 = {
    Text = "But why? What drives you to stay in the workhouse, even at the risk of fines or imprisonment?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
This pattern, combined with recent disappearances, suggests one conclusion:
Someone you care about has vanished, and you suspect workhouse involvement.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The sight of their overblown act—especially Sarah's exaggerated theatrics—makes you sigh silently in frustration."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_40 = {
    Text = "The girl stares blankly at Ramona for a long moment before reacting."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_41 = {
    Text = "We've barely talked and you're following me like we're old friends..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
Including the wallet incident, we've documented sixteen interactions.
Combined with field observations, this provides sufficient data for comprehensive profiling.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_43 = {
    Text = "...Sure, fine, you're really something. Alright Brown."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_44 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_45 = {
    Text = "The mouse she named Brown squeaks and leaps from the tree, tossing the wallet into Ogier's arms."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_46 = {
    Text = "I'll show you the sick madmen and tell you what I know. But you—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_47 = {
    Text = "will help me take down that Ghost of the Workhouse and save my sister, <Blue:Mason>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_48 = {
    Text = "You follow Jenkin through the workhouse corridors."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Sis came every Thursday to pick up laundry from this place. Probably caught that \"<Yellow:Hysteria>\" disease from their dirty clothes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_5 = {
    Text = "That's when a small paper ball hits your head."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_50 = {
    Text = [[
Some charity doctor came by.
Next thing I knew, she said she's getting treatment and then disappeared.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Jenkin looks anxious."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_52 = {
    Text = "I don't get it, but lately... Her face began to blur in my head."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Sometimes her things help me remember, but it fades fast."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Ramona suddenly stops and nods at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Why'd you stop? Weren't you gonna see those sick madmen?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Regarding your sister's illness... we might have some leads."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_57 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_58 = {
    Text = "After submitting an information disclosure request via comms, Ramona turns to Jenkin and begins explaining Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, your sister exhibits a unique Dissolution phenomenon causing progressive erasure from collective memory."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_6 = {
    Text = "And who the—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_60 = {
    Text = "The body, identity, background, and social connections... will all disappear completely without a trace."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Those sick madmen's conditions resemble <Yellow:early Dissolution symptoms>. Your sister has reached advanced stages; I fear, she..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, how long has Mason... been missing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_63 = {
    Text = "27 days. I've been counting every single one."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Seeing Ramona's troubled expression, Jenkin sniffs."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_65 = {
    Text = [[
I know it's been long enough to lose hope.
But we street kids have instincts. I KNOW she's still alive out there.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_66 = {
    Text = "So... I've got to hurry. Before I forget her face completely and walk right past her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Don't be sad, we'll help you find your sister. And you will remember once you see her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_68 = {
    Text = [[
Ramona remains silent.
Under her melancholic gaze, you recall the content Doll narrated in class:]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_69 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:\"The elimination of existence is the final symptom of Dissolution, and the process is irreversible.\">"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You gesture to stop Sarah's anger, and unfold the crumpled paper. It reads:"
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_8 = {
    Text = "\"Come to the backyard alone if you want your <Del:wallit>wallet back.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18891_Content_9 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_1 = {
    Text = "A sharp mouse squeak jolts you awake. Ramona is the first to rise, turning on the light."
  },
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The sharp edge reflects cold light, the short knife revealing your face."
  },
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Who's that!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Trained reflex allows you to sidestep just enough to see the attacker."
  },
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_13 = {Text = "Jenkin?!"},
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The girl's hollow eyes are colorless; her face blank, unresponsive to your calls."
  },
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Sis... I'll make them pay..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
Her movements are alarmingly agile, blade carving cold arcs.
Before you can think, she lunges again.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
Guess we'll have to subdue her before questioning.
Ramona, Ogier, lure her to an open area!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_18 = {Text = "Aye!"},
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_19 = {
    Text = "At your command!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Brown? Why are you here alone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Squeak—! Squeak squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_4 = {
    Text = "We are not Jenkin. We don't understand what you're saying."
  },
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_5 = {
    Text = "It's about time. Jenkin should be joining us soon."
  },
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You look outside; buildings stand like graveyard statues in a faint white mist."
  },
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The door creaks open, just enough to let a cold night wind in through the dark gap."
  },
  AvgDialog_18892_Content_8 = {
    Text = "A shadow darts from behind the furniture, attacking instantly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Botticelli's Primavera"
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The mouse attacks the ferret."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Who are you calling a mouse?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Who are you calling a ferret?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Hannah? Jenkin? What are you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_14 = {
    Text = "It's not my fault! She started it! She called the guards first!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Oh, come on! It was just a joke! Life isn't fun if you take everything so seriously."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_16 = {
    Text = "So, you came looking for them, didn't you? Where did you guys meet, at the Workhouse? Ah! You must be that little Jenkin they've been talking about!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_17 = {
    Text = "No wonder you're the top ferret in the Kingdom of Leonia. Are you collecting material for tomorrow's school newspaper?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_18 = {
    Text = "It's more than that. Ramona, you know me—information is my life."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_19 = {
    Text = "So, what deep-seated secret drove a pitiable orphan into the shadows of the forest in broad daylight?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
13:20, Londinium
Mythag University]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Will the object of her obsession illuminate the truth, or drag her deeper into the dark? Frontline reporter Hannah Peaslee is about to break the story!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Hannah suddenly pulls out a notebook—from where, you don't know—and looks at you expectantly, pen poised to capture your every word and action."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_22 = {
    Text = "...I get it now. None of you from this something something university speak like normal people."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Aw, I beg you to leave me out of this."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Please don't mind her. Hannah's just being Hannah again. What can we help you with, Jenkin?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Jenkin rummages in her bag, producing a stack of crumpled newspapers, and hands them to you and Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_26 = {
    Text = "We had an agreement: you promised to help me find my sister. Now, it's time for you to keep your promise."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_27 = {
    Text = "She quickly smooths one out, pointing to a local oddity: \"Three-Dimensional Paintings\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_28 = {
    Text = "The accompanying article, written in a dramatic, documentary style, details an astonishing new exhibit at the wax museum on 44 Southwark Street: Rogers' latest work, \"Primavera.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_29 = {
    Text = "A serious-looking photo is attached for credibility."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_3 = {
    Text = "As you and Ramona approach the main entrance, a commotion draws your eyes. Jenkin and a uniformed student are locked in a messy fistfight right on the pavement."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_30 = {
    Text = "It's a wax sculpture group modeled after Botticelli's famous painting. The central female figure has comical makeup and a clearly pained expression."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_31 = {
    Text = "This sculpture in the middle... I don't know why, but she reminds me of my older sister."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Rogers... It was Dr. Miller who introduced him to Sarah. After the Workhouse incident, he mysteriously disappeared."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_33 = {
    Text = "So, he is the one who killed my sister... and... Aigis..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_34 = {
    Text = "I can't wait. When are we gonna go get him?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Since he's probably highly dangerous, I'm going to have to ask that you stay behind while we resolve the issue. Though, I'm sure you have other ideas."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_36 = {
    Text = "That's my sister. I have to go! Besides, you might need me to crawl through vents at some point!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I'm sure your only skill will prove very useful in battle."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Looks like I need to submit an urgent fieldwork application."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_39 = {
    Text = "I'm about to go talk to Professor Alistair. Hopefully he'll be willing to give us an override."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_4 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_40 = {
    Text = "I'm sure he will, since it's your request. On top of that, more importantly, we need to get Senior William to give us an extension on our field reports."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Oh, you don't need to worry about that now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_42 = {Text = "?"},
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_43 = {
    Text = "About an hour ago, William left the school with a fieldwork permit."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_44 = {
    Text = "I tried to follow him to dig up some news, but I lost him along the way. It seemed like he was heading to the West District."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Southwark Street is in the West District. It seems that this time, we will have the chance to witness the renowned Investigator William in action."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Even <Italic:William> has to go, huh..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_47 = {
    Text = "18:24, Londinium West Southwark Street"
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Thank you for your cooperation. I can take it from here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
This won't do, sir. The orders are clear: we must accompany you in the investigation.
Besides, Rogers is also our suspect; we can't let you handle it alone.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_5 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_50 = {
    Text = "And you can better hide your real identity with our resources."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_51 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, sir. We have guns and we run fast. We won't hold you back."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_53 = {
    Text = "I see. Maintain condition red. If compromised, prioritize your own life over mission completion."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Status update: Reached target location, 44 Southwark Street, Rogers Wax Museum. Primary objective: Confirm potential ties between museum proprietor Rogers and the Sculptors' Association."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_55 = {
    Text = [[
Location confirmed, investigation target identified.
May the Silver Key light your path.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_56 = {
    Text = "May the Silver Key guide us."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Our mouse's fighting the ferret."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Woah, I'm witnessing a spectacle."
  },
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_8 = {Text = "Huh?"},
  AvgDialog_18893_Content_9 = {
    Text = "A spectacle of what?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18894_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Birdless Night"
  },
  AvgDialog_18894_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I won't stay stagnant any longer."
  },
  AvgDialog_18894_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
I won't let Miss Sarah, Little Mac, Jenkin, or any of you...
I won't let people I know turn into motionless stones like T'yog.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18894_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Choking back tears, Aigis turns and runs toward the basement exit."
  },
  AvgDialog_18894_Content_13 = {Text = "Stop her!"},
  AvgDialog_18894_Content_2 = {
    Text = "This is my... crime. My sin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18894_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Aigis pauses for a moment and closes her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18894_Content_4 = {
    Text = "I am the one who killed T'yog and turned Little Willy into a candy man. I am the true Ghost of the Workhouse."
  },
  AvgDialog_18894_Content_5 = {
    Text = "From that day on, something has been trying to seize my body. Luckily, <Yellow:Mr. Anderson> helped me. He lived in my eye, teaching me how to resist the darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_18894_Content_6 = {
    Text = "But his voice grew weaker over time. Eventually, I'd lost it on <Yellow:every foggy night>... It's all my fault, all my fault."
  },
  AvgDialog_18894_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I've tried wearing an eye mask, tried tying myself to the bed, but nothing worked. The strips that held me fast during daytime were easily broken by that force at night."
  },
  AvgDialog_18894_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Aigis gently caresses her wrist, rubbed red from struggle."
  },
  AvgDialog_18894_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
Miss Sarah must have noticed something, I guess?
That's why she's so desperate, so eager to have the doctor cure me.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Who Killed Cock Robin"
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You recognize this song from a dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Your body gradually stiffens, bones cracking with every movement. Each motion feels like forcing rusty gears in a mechanical puppet. Fine powder falls within your joints."
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_12 = {
    Text = "<Italic:One day just vanished—disappeared.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Your eyelids feel leaden, forcing them shut.
In the dark world, only thick fog swirls.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<Italic:No tabby where he looked, anywhere!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
In the dark void, you stand alone.
Above boundless skies, honey-colored eyes shed syrupy tears, gazing down.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_16 = {
    Text = "<Italic:He cried and cried in deep despair—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_17 = {
    Text = "You remember the dying old man's struggle and the thick black tear at the corner of his eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_18 = {
    Text = "<Italic:—'Til Charlie, too, was never there.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Following instinct, you look up and softly ask the sky-eyes that seem to speak."
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Per Jenkin's account, the <Yellow:Ghost of the Workhouse> haunts the courtyard during fog nights, abducting victims. Investigator Anderson may be among them."
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_20 = {
    Text = "This isn't what you'd like to see, is it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
The honey-colored eyes tremble and blink.
Tears fall, landing on your cheek with a strong sweet scent.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
In an instant, the singing stops and the darkness fades. You come back to your senses once more.
You find the fog has grown somewhat thinner while you were lost.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_23 = {Text = "WOAH!"},
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The girl rushes over, recognizes you at close distance, and nervously clutches her teddy bear."
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_25 = {
    Text = "S-sponsor, why are you here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_26 = {
    Text = "We appreciate your hospitality. We're merely taking in the evening air. Is there an issue?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Foggy nights are dangerous, and you should not wander outside, or..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Or... what?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
Let me guess... or we'll be taken, right?
You know who the victims are and where they went, don't you?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_3 = {
    Text = "No time to waste then; let's head to the basement Jenkin mentioned now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Aigis stands thunderstruck, trembling and shaking her head, speechless."
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Aigis, you're a good kid. Good kids shouldn't tell lies."
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_32 = {Text = "I..."},
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Answer me, Aigis! You said we shouldn't wander around in the fog, so why are you here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_34 = {
    Text = "The girl's hands clasp tightly together."
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Please... ask no more..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Ramona, the fog has thickened again."
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_37 = {
    Text = "In the fog, pairs of scarlet eyes light up, staring with no escape."
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Don't be rash, the entrance is near the matron's office."
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
We'll wait deeper into the night and take action when Sarah is asleep.
Before that, let's rest and regain some strength.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Huh? It's getting foggy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
An unusually thick fog spreads around the area just as you speak.
The mist, which should be light and floating, now clings to you like a heavy, sticky weight.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_8 = {
    Text = "In the thick fog, you hear singing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18895_Content_9 = {
    Text = "<Italic:Old Charlie's tabby, fat and dear...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18896_Content_1 = {
    Text = "In a daze, a mysterious voice whispers in the girl's ear."
  },
  AvgDialog_18896_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Just give in. Close your eyes, and leave everything to me.
Sarah, little Mac... everyone at the workhouse will become beautiful and eternal.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18896_Content_3 = {
    Text = "No, I won't... I won't give in... Never again..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18896_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Trying to fight me? You won't last long without that meddler's help. That's why I can take you over even while you're awake."
  },
  AvgDialog_18896_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Why not just give in? And help me turn everyone here into precious materials."
  },
  AvgDialog_18896_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I won't! And Mr. Anderson is NOT a meddler!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18896_Content_7 = {
    Text = "He protected me... And I will protect everyone. I'll protect Miss Sarah, protect little Mac, protect Jenkin. And protect the kind visitors."
  },
  AvgDialog_18896_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I will protect them, even if it costs me everything—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18897_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Now, see? Struggle all you want, the changes on you won't stop, no matter how much you're willing to sacrifice."
  },
  AvgDialog_18897_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I believe in them. I believe they will eliminate..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18897_Content_11 = {Text = "<Red:Me>."},
  AvgDialog_18897_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I heard it all. You're having a really tough time finding a perfect subject like me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18897_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Your evildoings have been exposed. Now, they will all be safe when I'm gone, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18897_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The mysterious voice does not respond."
  },
  AvgDialog_18897_Content_2 = {
    Text = "That's how the world works, and everyone realizes it when they grow up. No matter how hard you try, struggle, or resist, you cannot escape the environment surrounding you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18897_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You're still young, but I don't mind teaching you this lesson early on."
  },
  AvgDialog_18897_Content_4 = {
    Text = "No, that's not true..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18897_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
Because I... am no longer alone...
I... trust them!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18897_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
{Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%, Miss Ramona, Ogier...
They are different. They are strong, and will eliminate...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18897_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The voice impatiently interrupts her with a cold sneer."
  },
  AvgDialog_18897_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Eliminate me...? They can't even find where I am, can they?
After all, even you don't know where I am.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18897_Content_9 = {
    Text = "No, that's not true..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Business as Usual"
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Rogers the sponsor vanished, leaving the workhouse's future uncertain.
In time, Lord Dexter generously provided funding and arranged the workhouse's takeover.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_11 = {
    Text = "On the day Lord Dexter takes over Lilian's Workhouse, you and Ramona return."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_12 = {
    Text = "A nun directs workers to move a small bed from the medical area."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_13 = {
    Text = "But that's not the Sarah you remember."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_14 = {
    Text = "That's strange. We've never had any sick children here, so why is this bed here...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_15 = {
    Text = "On the iron bedframe's corner, a few torn cloth strips remain tied."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_16 = {
    Text = "As if answering Aigis's wish, memory of her vanishes from workhouse minds within two weeks."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The old order breaks, and a new one rapidly forms."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
Some left, some disappeared. Some nightmares ended, some conditions persisted.
But life goes on, giving no break.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Sarah lies quietly on a small bed. Her head remains cracked, limbs bound in chains."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_2 = {Text = "Later—"},
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Can I have the key for a moment?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The accompanying Committee Captain frowns and places the key on the nightstand."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_22 = {
    Text = "I'll go check the perimeter. You guys keep an eye on things."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona quietly unlock the chains."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, do you... still remember us?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The silent monster shakes its head—if that oozing black mass can still be called a head."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Do you remember... Aigis?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_27 = {
    Text = "As if confused, Sarah repeats your words."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Ai... gis...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Her vocal organs gurgle, trembling with chaotic tones."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A unit sent by the Committee arrived at Lilian's Workhouse to escort Sanga from the basement."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_30 = {
    Text = "After a long silence, Sarah extends a clenched hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Are you... giving me something?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_32 = {
    Text = "You open your palm."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_33 = {
    Text = "A small Silver Core falls into it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Ai... gis..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Is this... her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Pieces of memories converge."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_37 = {
    Text = "As Aigis fell like a bird into night, you all rushed toward her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
Jenkin caught a ribbon, you picked up a candy wrapper, and the already insane Sarah...
Following instinct, she touched what remained of the girl's soul.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Give it to the Silver Lab. Maybe one day, we can Awaken that girl and the power within her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_4 = {
    Text = "As she rode the Committee stretcher, she looked at you with a half-smile. You read her words through lip movements."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Should we tell Jenkin?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_41 = {
    Text = [[
...Initial Awakening phases induce memory fragmentation.
Some experience complete amnesia, others retain only emotionally charged fragments requiring reconstruction.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
Aigis was modified, and her Silver Core structure is unstable.
Even if we succeed in Awakening her, she might not recognize Jenkin...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_43 = {
    Text = "I think we should tell her after things settle down."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_44 = {
    Text = "You close your hand, feeling the Silver Core's warmth, recalling the girl who always followed, nearly invisible."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_45 = {
    Text = "When you first met, she followed Sarah and greeted you with a timid welcome;"
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_46 = {
    Text = "When Jenkin took you to the ward, she hid behind Jenkin in fear."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Only that final moment of bravery transformed her into a falling star, blazing bright against twilight."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Aigis... her sacrifice saved everyone who remained."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_49 = {
    Text = "She is... a true knight."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You do understand, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_50 = {
    Text = "<Blue:Investigator Sean Anderson>... The Sculptors forcibly extracted his Silver Core after murdering him, yet he used up his remaining consciousness to assist Aigis."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_51 = {
    Text = "We couldn't even collect his remains."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Ramona, can we really save anything? Can we really change anything?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_53 = {
    Text = "This is what it takes to face Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Keeper, you are special. That's why you cannot stop here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_55 = {
    Text = [[
We must do something. Save people. Bring change.
But, even if nothing is achieved in the end...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Before the arrival of that dark night when all is forgotten, let your memory be the final witness to everything that has transpired."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The bishop of Londinium Cathedral arrived at the workhouse. After reaching an agreement with the Committee, Sarah—undergoing irreversible transformation—was housed temporarily in the cathedral under guard."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Following the children's faint recollections, you located Dr. Miller's abandoned laboratory."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The place stood deserted."
  },
  AvgDialog_18898_Content_9 = {
    Text = "William assigned an investigation team to track his whereabouts and coordinate with the Committee for a full-scale search of the Sculptors' bases."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Pitch-Black Dream"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_10 = {
    Text = "<Italic:He searched the wardrobe, checked the bed,>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The space grows tighter. A crushing pressure steals your breath, and your body stiffens, immobile."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_12 = {
    Text = "<Italic:Check the basement, his friend had said,>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Only your eyes and throat still function.
All around you, a faint, prickling pain spreads, as if insects were nibbling at your skin.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<Italic:No tabby where he looked, anywhere!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_15 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Someone... please... help...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_16 = {
    Text = "<Italic:He cried and cried in deep despair—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_17 = {
    Text = "<Shake:...@1...I... Ramon@1...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_18 = {
    Text = "<Italic:—'Til Charlie, too, was never there.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Your skin prickles as if insects gnaw at it, pain flickering faintly. A metallic taste floods your throat, silencing you, plunging the world into stillness."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You wake in total darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_20 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Somewhere, sometime, you've lived this before."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The one who pulled you from the darkness last time was—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_23 = {
    Text = "%player%! %player%, wake up!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Light erupts. Someone grabs your hand. You jolt awake, drenched in cold sweat."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_25 = {
    Text = "What was it? Another weird dream?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_26 = {
    Text = "...I'm not sure."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Since returning from <Yellow:Yakutsk>, the dreams haunt you—\nyour own, others', dreams of the past, even... glimpses of the future."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Ramona, can we go to the Keygrave together?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_29 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona walk silently in the Keygrave until you spot an ordinary yet unique gravestone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_3 = {
    Text = "It feels like a confined space—small, dark, silent, cold, devoid of light, with thin air, as if trapped inside a coffin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_30 = {
    Text = "This is your tombstone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_31 = {Text = "Ramona..."},
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I dreamed of the Yakutsk explosion... I dreamed of being buried under the rubble and you digging me out."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_33 = {
    Text = "I owe my second life to you. To Mythag."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
Finding you was a blessing for me and Mythag.
Without you, everyone here would have been engulfed by Yakutsk's <Yellow:Dissolution Cataclysm>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Still can't remember what happened before that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_36 = {
    Text = "You shake your head."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Yakutsk's swirling dust and Ramona's anxious face mark the start of your memories. Your past life seems lost to the wasteland's explosion."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Our school physician Dr. Sylvia observed memory recovery occurs progressively. Social interaction and varied experiences may help stimulate recollection."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Have you composed yourself? <Blue:William> awaits our status report."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Fear overwhelms you. You struggle, pound, and shout, but escape seems impossible."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Here's your mission briefing: Infiltrate Lilian's Workhouse covertly and locate the missing Investigator <Blue:Sean Anderson>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Vanguard teams detected no high-risk <Yellow:Cataclysm> signatures outside the workhouse, but maintain operational caution. You'll be accompanied by Ramona and additional Awakeners."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_42 = {
    Text = "I know you can link multiple Awakeners at once, but considering the physical burden... You'll be accompanied by Ogier, who's already linked with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Yes sir! I shall do my best!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Anything else we should know about Anderson's disappearance?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_45 = {
    Text = "This district represents the East District's most concentrated disappearance zone, with cases spanning six months. Investigator Anderson, being an East District native, likely uncovered critical leads."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_46 = {
    Text = "While resolving the disappearance cases would be ideal, you must keep your focus on locating the missing Investigator."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_47 = {
    Text = [[
Time's critical, and Sean's survival window narrows. Now go.
May the Silver Key light your path.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Gradually, a voice sings in the darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_6 = {
    Text = "<Italic:Old Charlie's tabby, fat and dear,>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Hello? Someone? Anyone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_8 = {
    Text = "<Italic:One day just vanished—disappeared.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18899_Content_9 = {
    Text = "It feels familiar. Yes, you've been enveloped by this suffocating void before."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Chromatic Nightmare"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
We lined up, waiting for the doctor's selection.
I felt weightless. Like air. Like nothing.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Let's choose this girl. Her condition is quite complex, and we failed to cure her last time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_12 = {
    Text = "<Shake:No... I don't want to go... I've already been there once, and I don't want to...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I'll go, sir."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_14 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_15 = {
    Text = "...Are you feeling unwell?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
I don't feel unwell; I can run and jump, perfectly healthy!
But I can see things.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Oh? What can you see?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
Like Aigis, I also see black things.
Could you please help me?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Interesting. I'll take you, then."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_2 = {
    Text = "At first, they said they came to offer help."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_20 = {Text = "T'yog..."},
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid, Aigis."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_22 = {
    Text = "I'll be back soon."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_23 = {
    Text = "T'yog never came back."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_24 = {
    Text = "They told Miss Sarah his sickness was bad, but a nice gentleman would take him. Paid for the surgery and everything."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_25 = {
    Text = "They were lying, even I could tell. But Miss Sarah believed them. She thanked them again and again."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Why, why did it come to this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_27 = {
    Text = "I walked the hallway, feeling dizzy. Bumped into someone tall."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Hello, little one. Could you tell me how to get to the new ward?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
More sick people came. Miss Sarah moved the ward to the east building.
More space. More makeshift beds.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Not sure when it started. A strange sickness spread in the workhouse. Those infected got angry fast, with black triangle marks on their heads, hands, feet."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
C-could you please not go there?
It's... it's really dangerous...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Oh? Why do you say that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
I don't know, I-I'm really sorry...
The ward is to the east.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_33 = {
    Text = [[
Thank you.
You seem to have a lot on your mind. If you feel like talking, I'm all ears.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_34 = {
    Text = "I have a little sister who is about your age..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_35 = {
    Text = "She walked east, her eye-catching red ribbon swaying in the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_36 = {
    Text = "That was the last time I saw Jenkin's sister. She was gone after that day."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I knew they saw everything through my eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_38 = {
    Text = "So I covered it with an eye patch. It was the bad eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_39 = {
    Text = "But that didn't stop the nightmares."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah sent them to the clinic. The marks didn't go away. More appeared..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Ugh... This is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_41 = {
    Text = "The light made me want to close my eyes. I tried to blink but couldn't."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Something was holding my eyelids open."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_43 = {
    Text = "A white coat man came, knife in hand. He slowly approached me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_44 = {
    Text = "No, NO! Miss Sarah, MISS SARAH!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah! T'yog! Help! Help me! <Big:NOOO!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_46 = {
    Text = "The blade came closer until it consumed my vision. And then, and then—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_47 = {
    Text = "<Shake:AAAAAHHH—!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_48 = {
    Text = [[
Dark. Cold. Like drowning in the Aethis River in December.
I wanted to get up, but couldn't.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_49 = {
    Text = "It hurts... That eye hurts so bad..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I told Miss Sarah about this, but she said..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_50 = {
    Text = [[
Doctor stuffed something in my eye, and then I saw colors.
Colors blending together, like Little Mac's spilled palette.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah... T'yog... It hurts... It hurts so, so much... I can't anymore..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_52 = {
    Text = "They were moving... the colors were shifting! Crawling into my eye like bugs. I couldn't see anything. Only colors."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_53 = {
    Text = "I was wrong. I shouldn't have asked for help..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Colors filled my head. I was losing myself..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Please... anyone... help..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_56 = {
    Text = "I was almost gone when they put something else in. Then Silver light ate the colors."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_57 = {
    Text = "It was so cold. It still hurt, but I was me again."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid, little one. I'm here to help."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Who... are you...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
Aigis, your hallucinations are getting worse.
There's no black mark here at all.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_60 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_61 = {
    Text = [[
Who I am doesn't matter.
Now, follow my pace. Together we'll resist the control of that <Yellow:foreign thing>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_62 = {
    Text = "With that voice's help, I felt less sick. I could think again."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_63 = {
    Text = "I lost count of how long it had been. It felt so long, my skin went numb. Then I heard the doctor's voice again."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_64 = {
    Text = [[
An eye that can see @2... This is the best research subject I've ever found.
I would have sourced her for experiments long ago if not for that stupid boy.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_65 = {
    Text = "It's not too late, Doctor. A successfully xenografted Silver Core implantation! It calls for a celebration!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_66 = {
    Text = "The fusion of @4's consciousness and receptor was successful. The petrification effect falls outside predicted parameters, but as long as we continue to suppress the receptor's consciousness..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_67 = {
    Text = "We should thank that foolish <Yellow:Investigator> for showing up at our doorstep. His top-tier Silver Core reduced the rejection."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Those researchers crowded me, talking loudly. They seemed so excited. Receptor? Rejection? Investigator? Words I didn't know."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_69 = {
    Text = "How about it, kid? Come on, give it a try. With just one look, your best friend will stay with you forever... as your favorite sweet treat."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_7 = {
    Text = "No, Miss Sarah, I can see it. I really can!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_70 = {
    Text = "They tightened the thing keeping my eyelids in place. Blink, and the hooks would cut."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_71 = {
    Text = [[
They brought a chair.
Tied to it was my best friend...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_72 = {
    Text = "T-T'yog...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_73 = {
    Text = "T'yog startled awake. He looked at me, then looked around."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Aigis?! Hands off me! Don't touch her!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_75 = {
    Text = "No! Don't move! T'YOG! DON'T LOOK AT ME!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_76 = {
    Text = [[
T'yog cried and struggled, but it didn't help.
He moved slower and slower, like a broken clock.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_77 = {
    Text = "As if accepting fate, he quietly looked at me. Our eyes met, and then—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_78 = {
    Text = "He began to fade like Miss Sarah's old dress. Sweet syrup leaked from his skin, covering his stone-hard body."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_79 = {
    Text = "My <Yellow:eye> watched. They kept me watching, until it—he—took his last breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Don't worry. It's not real, honey. Don't believe me? Ask Little Mac.
He's only five years old. He won't lie.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Ai... gis..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_81 = {
    Text = "<Big:T'YOG—!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18900_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
Yeah, Aigis, we should be good and listen to the doctor when we're sick.
That's what you told me when I had that fever!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_1 = {Text = "Our Secret"},
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Team order: Jenkin, Ramona, you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Behind you, Brown squeaks and pushes the wooden door shut."
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_12 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Sis and your student friend have got to be down there with that so-called ghost."
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Matches, where are those matches..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Hey, you feel that itch?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Her reminder makes you notice an inexplicable tingling spreading from your toes to your ankles, and up your back..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Jenkin finally polishes the lantern, lowering it to illuminate a small patch of ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_18 = {
    Text = "At that very moment—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Your retina is hit with a harrowing sight."
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_2 = {
    Text = "After a night's turmoil, dawn approaches."
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Countless ants converge into a dense, restless swarm."
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_21 = {
    Text = "They surge, gather, swirl, merging into pitch-black abyss."
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
Ogier stays behind to handle Sarah.
You and Ramona follow Jenkin to the "Ghost of the Workhouse" basement.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Quiet, before Sarah hears.
She'll send her goons after us.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
Ogier is keeping an eye on Sarah's movements. With him there, we'll be fine.
Tell me again what you discovered in Sarah's office last time.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Ugh, how many times do I have to say it?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_7 = {
    Text = "That nasty woman sells workhouse folks to mad doctors for experiments! Buys jewelry with the money! I found them in her drawer!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I've already shown you your friend's student ID. What more do you want?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18901_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
Alright, this room.
Last one in closes the door.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18902_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Saccharine Art"
  },
  AvgDialog_18902_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Your arrival doesn't interrupt her work. She examines the statue, adjusts the chisel's position, and continues carving."
  },
  AvgDialog_18902_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
That's got to be the Ghost of the Workhouse...
Where's my sis? Where'd you hide her?!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18902_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The ghost notices you, but doesn't respond."
  },
  AvgDialog_18902_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Ramona draws her weapon, locks eyes with you, then advances."
  },
  AvgDialog_18902_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Please be patient, and do not disturb the contemplation of art..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18902_Content_15 = {
    Text = "As she speaks, countless monsters screech from basement shadows, crashing through writhing bodies to attack."
  },
  AvgDialog_18902_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You finally pry open the iron door of the basement. An overwhelmingly thick, sickly-sweet aroma of syrup immediately assaults your senses."
  },
  AvgDialog_18902_Content_3 = {
    Text = "More shocking than the stench is the horrific scene inside: several human bodies, coated in syrup, lie scattered haphazardly across the floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_18902_Content_4 = {
    Text = "These distorted, non-human shapes writhe and struggle, dragging messy smears of syrup behind them."
  },
  AvgDialog_18902_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Dense ant swarms crawl around, greedily sipping and transporting syrup with antennae, as if facing the world's most precious treasure."
  },
  AvgDialog_18902_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Yet these aren't the true surprise."
  },
  AvgDialog_18902_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Several reddish-brown statues stand displayed. Each graceful, with a weary expression. One glance evokes awe and sanctity."
  },
  AvgDialog_18902_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Among them sits the Ghost of the Workhouse."
  },
  AvgDialog_18902_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Clearly the Ghost—her stone-colored body lightly holds a chisel, carving terrified expressions onto statues with spine-chilling scrapes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18903_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Inner Peril"
  },
  AvgDialog_18903_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Clang, clang..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18903_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You realize you're dreaming."
  },
  AvgDialog_18903_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Someone approaches, stepping on sewer pipes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18903_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
In the blur, a familiar figure runs toward you.
She grabs your hand and pulls urgently, calling out.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18903_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Run, Jenkin, run!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18903_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Behind you, countless sticky black monsters give chase."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_1 = {Text = "%player%!"},
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, I'm so scared, please... please don't go..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_12 = {
    Text = "What's wrong, Aigis?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Miss Sarah, could you please sing that song again, just one more time?
I mean, if it's not too much trouble...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Listen, dear Aigis: You are the most well-behaved and sensible child in the entire workhouse. Everyone loves you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You don't have to be overcautious all the time. It's okay to be a bit willful once in a while, got it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Then I... I want to hear Miss Sarah sing the nursery rhyme again."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
No problem.
<Italic:Old Charlie's tabby, fat and dear...>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You suddenly open your eyes to a vibrant real world."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_19 = {
    Text = "%player%, are you alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_2 = {
    Text = "As Ramona keeps Sarah at bay, you quickly focus and immerse yourself in the black space—the one you are getting familiar with."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
You nod despite dizziness. From the corner of your eye, you catch a white figure.
Aigis has slipped past you into the fray.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Aigis, come back! It's too dangerous!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
Aigis stares blankly at the fallen Sarah.
Slime keeps gushing out from the gaping wound, forming a black stream.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
Then she wades into the pitch-black pool and sits in the slime,
letting Sarah lie on her lap and patting her back skillfully.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Just like what Matron Sarah used to do when putting her to sleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah... It's all right, it's all right... Just a nightmare..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The faint glow in her eyes pierces through the blindfold fleetingly. Without the gnosis shock, you might mistake it for unshed sorrow."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Sarah's fragmented face trembles uneasily. After the soft light passes over her, she lies still as if in deep sleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah hasn't had a good night's sleep for a long time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_29 = {
    Text = "She's always been on the run, meeting wealthy lords and ladies in the castle, just to keep the workhouse together. She didn't even have time to eat or rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The Silver Key buzzes intensely. The darkness before you shifts, brightening from your vision's edges."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_30 = {
    Text = "When she returned in the evening, she'd light a candle in the office and keep calculating, trying to make ends meet with what little alms the nobility gave."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Trying to figure out what the jewelry those ladies gave her can sell for."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
They all laughed at her and said mean things, but Miss Sarah is never upset.
She even consoled me and sang for us.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_33 = {
    Text = "She treats us well, really. She treats me very well too."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_34 = {
    Text = "I was a burden to my mom, and she abandoned me. The previous director refused to take me in, but Miss Sarah said she would work two jobs to bring me here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Since then, I vowed to be no burden to Miss Sarah, but a useful child."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_36 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry, Miss Sarah. I've tried my best, but things keep going awry... I couldn't protect everyone, and I couldn't protect you. I'm sorry."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Aigis gently touches Sarah's no-longer-human cheek, then turns to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Aren't you looking for Investigator <Blue:Sean Anderson>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Aigis, you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, I'm so hungry."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_40 = {
    Text = "The girl forces a smile barely recognizable as joy."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_41 = {
    Text = [[
Let Miss Sarah go.
I'll tell you where he is.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_42 = {
    Text = "He's right here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Aigis slowly removes her eyepatch, revealing a pale stone-colored eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_44 = {
    Text = "<Red:In my eye.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I regret to tell you this, but we can no longer continue to fund you, Miss Sarah."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, did I make mommy hate me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Black and white lights flash by like multiple movies projected on a single screen. You can't discern details no matter how hard you try."
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, my mom said I'm useless... Can I really help you with that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18904_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, mommy threw me out... Will you... will you throw me out, too?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Burden of Conscience"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Stop fooling around! We know about your deals with that evil doctor! Give me back my sister!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I didn't... and these..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Sarah glances at those creatures—unsure if they can still be called human—and continues haltingly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I really don't know!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_14 = {
    Text = "We saw your big ledger!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_15 = {Text = "...?"},
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You pick up the ledger, open it, and gesture to Sarah."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Mac, male, 5 years old, 10 Florins; Diana, female, 23 years old, 5 Florins; Aigis... female, 8 years old, 40 Florins."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_18 = {
    Text = "...Should I continue?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_19 = {
    Text = "No, it's not like that. I—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Rushed footsteps ring out. Sarah appears, face full of anger, followed by a worried Aigis and a righteous Ogier."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_20 = {
    Text = "No excuses! You're using workhouse people for that mad doctor's experiments and buying jewelry with the money!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Aigis, you've been to the treatments. You know that the money was—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Yes... the laboratory provides 5 Florins per person as a nutritional subsidy during treatment sessions, as agreed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah used all of this money to buy food for everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_24 = {
    Text = "I didn't keep a single penny of that money! As for the jewelry she mentioned, it's utter nonsense. Please, {Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe, believe me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Stop lying!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Jenkin pulls two silver rings from her satchel's depths."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_27 = {
    Text = "If you didn't do it, who put these in the office drawer? You think they magically appeared there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_28 = {
    Text = "How could you take them? Give them back! They are gifts from another sponsor!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Trust me, I keep them for workhouse emergency! H-How could I possibly harm the children here for these things?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_3 = {
    Text = "How could you—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_30 = {
    Text = "If you have nothing to do with this, then how do you explain these... children?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Ramona points at the crawling monster on the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
...Children?
You mean...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Realizing something, Sarah stiffly turns her head to examine the monsters closely."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Are these the missing workers and children from the workhouse?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_35 = {
    Text = "No, it can't be..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_36 = {
    Text = "What a racket."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
Stop looking at those imperfections.
Now, behold the true beauty.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_38 = {
    Text = "She pushes the newly completed statue before Sarah."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_39 = {
    Text = "It is a child statue, its lifelike features preserved beneath a cloudy sugar shell."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_4 = {Text = "Eeek—!"},
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_40 = {
    Text = "That's... That's... Little... Willy..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_41 = {
    Text = "The statue's eyeball suddenly twitches."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Eek—Eeek—<Shake:AAAAHHHHHHH—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Sarah lets out a sickly scream."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_44 = {
    Text = "She curls up, hugging her head. Her sorrowful whispers turn hoarse and chaotic, becoming indistinguishable."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_45 = {
    Text = "<Small:I'm useless, I'm disgusting, I'm not a good matron, I can't protect anyone, I can't protect the children...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, please... We all understand. You've done your best."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Sorry, little Aigis; sorry, little Lucy; sorry, Jenkin, Henry, Diana..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Sarah raises her head, features completely distorted. Her eyes and lips twist into inhuman, dance-like contortions."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Before she can finish, the twisted sugar figure on the ground lets out a horrifying scream."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_50 = {
    Text = [[
As if submerged underwater, the surroundings plunge into cold silence.
An invisible pressure strikes unexpectedly, making you gasp as you realize something is wrong.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_51 = {
    Text = "No! Ramona! Get everyone else out of here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_52 = {
    Text = [[
Too late.
The young matron's head splits open like a flower, spraying black goo onto the ground.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_53 = {
    Text = "M-miss Sarah!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_54 = {
    Text = "She releases a high-pitched screech. The twisted bodies around her respond with wolf-like howls, rapidly mutating into Dissolution-infected monsters."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
"How could you?" That's for us to say.
Wasn't it you who hid the Ghost of the Workhouse in this basement? She told us everything.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_7 = {
    Text = "As if drawn by Sarah's scream, the semi-sugarized humanoid wriggles and crawls toward her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Listen, Miss Sarah, you can't hide this anymore."
  },
  AvgDialog_18905_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Please tell us the contact information of the Sculptors' Association, as well as the whereabouts of Investigator <Blue:Sean Anderson>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Looks Deceive"
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_10 = {Text = "Um..."},
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Told you, we're closed today. I need to go inside to find my sister."
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The kid doesn't even look at him."
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
No, I just wanted to ask...
Do you know the way to Lilian's Workhouse?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_14 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_15 = {
    Text = "<Small:What an oaf...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_16 = {Text = "...?"},
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I didn't catch that. Could you say it again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Over here, I'll show you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Look, right around that corner. Super close."
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Thick humidity and decay choke you the moment you step from the car."
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Oh! Thank you very much."
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_21 = {
    Text = "No, thank YOU actually."
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_22 = {Text = "Thank me?"},
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_23 = {
    Text = "When Ogier turns back, the stairs are empty—\nthe hooded figure now lurks at the street's end, clutching his stolen wallet."
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Ah, my wallet—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Londinium Fact #2: The East District's most infamous greeting involves wallets vanishing without notice."
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
Looks like we need to help Ogier.
Let's go, Keeper.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Dizziness strikes, your ears ringing.\nBlurry images flash—have you seen this before?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Is it an illusion, or is this part of your lost memory?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_5 = {
    Text = "No road signs or signposts... and it doesn't match the map..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Londinium Fact #1: The East District's perpetual fog and convoluted alleyways routinely disorient visitors."
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I'll ask for directions."
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_8 = {
    Text = "A kid in a tattered hood lounges by the road, dwarfed by their oversized cloak."
  },
  AvgDialog_18906_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ogier walks towards the kid and gives a slight bow."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_1 = {Text = "Malady"},
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Jenkin! How could you... We can't bring sponsors to the <Blue:ward>, remember? If they see it, then..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You wink at Ramona, and she walks over to Aigis, gently inquiring."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Aigis, could you tell us why you can't allow sponsors into the ward?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Uh... I... I mean, They... they are very weak, so..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Aigis hesitates, glancing at the patients behind her and your well-dressed entourage, unsure how to respond."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Seizing the moment, you and Ogier approach the elderly man on the bed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The old man is bound hand and foot with coarse cloth strips, secured to the bed. His body bears strange wounds like twisted stitches, unhealed flesh oozing dark, viscous fluid."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
Aigis, this inspection will determine whether we will provide financial support.
Surely you understand that no patron wants their money wasted on fraud.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Don't resist. They won't hurt you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Aigis calms after a brief pause. She takes a deep breath and replies in a voice as faint as a mosquito's buzz."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Jenkin leads you through the backyard, pointing to a small, shabby hut in the corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_20 = {
    Text = "<Small:Miss Sarah said if the sponsors see these patients, they'll think no sum of money will make a difference...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Shouldn't have listened to that woman! These sponsors will help us with the <Yellow:Ghost of the Workhouse>. They're looking for someone too—they'll find sis..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The ward is just too dangerous!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Her raised tone cuts off abruptly. She anxiously glances at the unconscious old man, then pulls Jenkin away from the bedside."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_24 = {
    Text = "What if you and the sponsors get infected..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Aigis clutches her teddy bear, retorting nervously to Jenkin. Her white sleeves slide down, revealing horrifying black stitch marks and two swollen red grooves."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Her slender arm is marred by a fissure like a giant centipede, its edges oozing black slime, evoking dread."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Aigis, that wound..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Aigis hurriedly pulls her sleeves together, shaking her head to avoid Ramona's gaze."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_29 = {
    Text = "It, it was... when I accidentally fell down the stairs."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
Through the window, you see Aigis bustling about.
She carries a metal basin, hurriedly moving soiled bandages from the bedside to a pile of dirty laundry.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_30 = {
    Text = "These sutures don't correspond to typical abrasion injuries."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
See, they can "see."
Tell them everything. They are our last hope.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_32 = {
    Text = "<Small:They will be in danger. We can't...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Listen, Aigis. Full disclosure is essential for determining appropriate assistance."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Beside you, the old man gurgles in his throat. His emaciated arm jerks suddenly, snapping the binding cloth—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Keeper, watch out!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Hmm? Need anything?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
She seems to hear someone's call. She puts down the basin, bends over, and leans by the bedside.
From your angle, only her soft voice remains audible.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Grandpa Robert, please, stay down. I'll bring you the water."
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
Don't say that. You will definitely get better.
Then we can go to Drell Park and feed the pigeons together.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
"Bang!" Jenkin pushes open the cabin door.
Aigis startles, almost spilling water on the patient in her panic.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18907_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Look—the <Yellow:sick madmen>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Unspoken Etiquette"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Aigis's face pales for an instant at the sight of the candies, but she carefully accepts them anyway."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Remember when we first met?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Hmm, I'll never forget."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
10 days ago, East District, Londinium
Lilian's Workhouse]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Darkness-shrouded East District, high night. Streetlights, moonlight, nothing penetrated the fog, leaving only blurred shadows swaying in the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
The girl in white, clutching guilt and fear, ran through the dim, empty courtyard of the workhouse...
Until she bumped into something hidden in the shadows and cried out in pain.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_16 = {Text = "Ouch!"},
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_17 = {Text = "Eek!"},
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Y-You're not Mac or Lucy! Who are you...?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I should be asking who YOU are! Sneaking around at night scaring people."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Did you get hurt back in there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Sorry... I thought it was..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_21 = {Text = "Was what?"},
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Was... the ghost... Yes, I thought it was the <Red:Ghost of the Workhouse>..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
Ghost? Nonsense. But I'll be honest with you, I'm not from this shitty place.
I'm Jenkin, and this is Brown.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_24 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
I'm here looking for my sister. Her name is <Blue:Mason>. Disappeared around here two weeks ago.
You seen her?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_26 = {
    Text = "There have been many newcomers at the workhouse, and I haven't recognized all of them..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Think hard. About this tall, long hair, <Yellow:red ribbon with square M buckle>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Comes for treatment sometimes. Never came home last time. You keeping her here to work?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
<Shake:P-patient?>
S-Sorry... I haven't seen any young female patients...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I'm alright..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Tch, whatever. Didn't expect much anyway.\nBut you almost got me caught—that's on you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Then I-I'll take you to my secret base! The matron never enters the clock tower, she won't find you there."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
Got lucky bumping into you, Aigis.
Would've been dragged out by my hood otherwise.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Don't say that. Everyone here is super nice. They are just upset by the recent mishaps..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_34 = {Text = "Aigis."},
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_35 = {Text = "Hmm?"},
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_36 = {
    Text = "I know you're close with the workhouse folks... but I thought we were friends. Are we?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Of course! I really, really enjoy spending time with you, Jenkin, just like this—eating candy and chatting."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
Then why do you lie to your friend?
Tell me the truth, Aigis.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_39 = {
    Text = "I... I don't understand what you're saying..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_4 = {
    Text = "...Are you mad at me? For bringing those people?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Found the <Blue:ledger> and <Blue:student ID> in that woman's office. I know she's selling people to mad doctors!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_41 = {
    Text = "She trusts you most, even lets you handle patients. You KNOW something. Can you please tell me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_42 = {
    Text = "I, I, <Small:I don't know...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_43 = {
    Text = [[
The girl mumbles, her voice fading.
Her face is pale, as if suffering immense pain.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Mythag excels at uncovering secrets; they will soon discover the truth."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_45 = {
    Text = "You can't live in shackles forever."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, if what's lost remains lost... does \"truth\" still matter?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Of course it matters! Nothing matters more than finding sis."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_48 = {
    Text = "I know you're afraid of that woman, why do you keep defending her? She's selling workers AND hiding the <Yellow:Ghost of the Workhouse>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_49 = {
    Text = "T-the Ghost of the Workhouse?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_5 = {Text = "No!"},
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_50 = {
    Text = [[
Yeah, it's the legend you told me about.
<Yellow:Don't wander around on foggy nights, or you'll be taken by a ghost with a knife>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Th-That was just something I made up... It's too dangerous at night. I didn't want you running around."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_52 = {
    Text = [[
Stop making excuses for Sarah! I've already found the <Yellow:basement with the ghost> and heard the <Yellow:sound of a knife>.
Is my sister inside?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_53 = {
    Text = "As \"basement\" leaves Jenkin's mouth, the last trace of color drains from Aigis's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Don't be frightened, Aigis, as He will detect the crack in your heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Follow the Silver guidance, and its light will show you the way."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, I'm sorry, I can't..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_57 = {
    Text = "With tears in her eyes, Aigis glances at Jenkin, then turns and climbs back up the clock tower, rushing down the stairs without hesitation."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Aigis! Where are you going!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_59 = {
    Text = [[
Before she notices, mist appears in the workhouse.
It comes so suddenly, shrouding everything in moisture and making all indistinct.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I just didn't want you to... be infected..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Aigis! Damn it, how did this fog get inside?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_61 = {
    Text = "From the distant mist comes the sound of flesh swelling and a faint, mist-soaked song."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_62 = {
    Text = "<Italic:Old Charlie's tabby, fat and dear...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Jenkin polishes her lantern, its faint glow feeble in the thick fog."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Distant footsteps echo through the silent corridor, almost piercing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_65 = {
    Text = [[
W-who goes there?
Show yourself! I'm armed, mind you!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Air doesn't flow in the hallway, yet the flame flickers as if blown by wind."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_67 = {
    Text = "The footsteps grow closer. Brown's claws dig into Jenkin's shoulder, baring teeth and emitting a sharp hiss."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_68 = {
    Text = "As if triggered by Brown's voice, the footsteps suddenly quicken, heading straight for Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_69 = {
    Text = "A dense shadow engulfs the faint light. The girl closes her eyes and screams loudly, but only feels mist rush at her face."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Alright then."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_70 = {
    Text = "A hand reaches from the darkness, landing precisely on Jenkin's shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_71 = {
    Text = "What's wrong? Why is your face so p-pale?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_72 = {
    Text = "R-Rogers? Have you seen Aigis?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, Aigis knows this workhouse well. She'll be fine."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_74 = {
    Text = "I understand. Foggy nights c-can be scary."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Rogers pushes the door open, and warm light pours out, dispelling the hallway's deep shadows."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_76 = {
    Text = "He picks up a finely crafted doll from the bed and smiles at the girl."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_77 = {
    Text = [[
How about a touch? You'll feel much better.
And <Blue:George> will be happy.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_78 = {
    Text = "The doll's inorganic eyes reflect the lamp's yellow light, silently pleading: Touch me, please. Just one touch will do."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Touch me, and—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Jenkin dramatically spreads her hands, revealing two tiny candies in her palms."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_80 = {
    Text = "<Red:become my loyal companion.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_81 = {
    Text = "With a \"squeak,\" Brown's scream jolts Jenkin out of her daze."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_82 = {
    Text = "No, no thanks! I don't need fancy artists like you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_83 = {
    Text = [[
Oh, my naive little mouse. In fact, beauty and art never differentiate be-between rich and poor, noble and humble.
Encapsulating suffering within beauty is tru-truly wonderful.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Rogers gazes at the cautious girl and the gray mouse peeking from her hood, his eyes burning with irresistible desire."
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_85 = {
    Text = [[
Maybe one day, I'll turn you both into wax statues as well.
How about naming it "Brown and Jenkin"?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18908_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Here, one for you and one for me. Then we're good, yes?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ghost Underground"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Ramona remains composed, delivering rehearsed lines flawlessly.
Yet Ogier's face has turned completely red.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
As expected of Lord Ashe's young heir, taking on such significant responsibilities at such a young age.
In the workhouse, we have children around his age barely capable of serving porridge...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_12 = {
    Text = "P-please don't say that..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Ramona clears her throat and quickly changes the subject."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
Hence our longitudinal field study in the East District.
Lilian Workhouse serves as our initial research site, where we expect full transparency from the matron...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Ramona briefly recounts the guard's violent outburst—omitting Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Were you aware of that, Miss Sarah? That one of your guards just attacked us?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
I can't believe it! That guard, h-he definitely isn't from our workhouse.
We don't have anything worth stealing, so why hire security?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Her awkward tone betrays the lie."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_19 = {
    Text = "But, Miss Sarah..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Your party enters the workhouse, and from a distance, you see a nun leading several children and workers, lined up to wait for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Sarah deters the girl with a glare, and the girl clearly panics."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Silence, Aigis. This is grown-up business."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The girl stares at her doll with pursed lips, silent."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_23 = {
    Text = "...Fine. Have someone take care of his body. Cover him with a cloth so the rats don't gnaw on him."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Then she turns to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_25 = {
    Text = "I beg your pardon. When the doctor arrives, I'll ask them to assist with the burial."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_26 = {Text = "Doctor?"},
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Um, well... you see, we have quite a few children here, and thanks to the generosity of our sponsors, we've been able to hire some doctors for regular examinations."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_28 = {
    Text = "It's about time for the next physical check-up."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Someone just died. Shouldn't we call the police?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
Good day, {Male=Lord,Female=Lady} Ashe, Miss Mary. I'm Sarah, the matron here.
The workhouse demands much of us, and I'm sorry we couldn't greet you at the gate.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Alas... You see, this is the East District."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Even during the disturbing <Red:ripper case>, they merely sent someone to collect the bodies with no further action taken."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_32 = {
    Text = "For people like us, getting enough food on the plate is all we can hope for; we don't have the luxury to mind much else."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_33 = {
    Text = [[
Having said that, Sarah leads you into the workhouse.
Behind you, the workers quietly formed two lines, flanking you like wardens... Or jail guards.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Ramona murmurs under her breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Londinium Fact #3 —"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_36 = {
    Text = "In the East District, human worth remains unquantifiable, for it doesn't exist."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
In the silent corridor, a door with a metal nameplate slowly opens.
A mouse slips through the crack, glances around, and squeaks twice into the shadows.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_38 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_39 = {
    Text = "\"Clear,\" that's exactly what you said last time! I'd have been in real trouble if it hadn't been Aigis."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Irritated by the lack of echoes, she frowns and nudges a distracted girl.
The girl jolts, then bows to all of you hastily.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Jenkin peeks around the corner, confirming the corridor is empty, then slips through the door and closes it behind them."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Whatever you say, whatever you say. Brown's the smartest!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_44 = {
    Text = [[
Let's see what that witch's hiding.
Rings, necklaces... Are these all gold?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_45 = {
    Text = "She wouldn't even buy Aigis candy, saying \"no money,\" while stacking up all this shiny stuff for herself!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_46 = {
    Text = [[
Key, perfect. Now we can get in and out of other places easy.
We should really thank that <Yellow:"sponsor">; now we can investigate this place proper.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Easy, Brown. We've got time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
Huh... This is... a ledger?
Mac, male, 5 years old, 10 Florins; Diana, female, 23 years old, 5 Florins...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_5 = {
    Text = "W-Welcome! We have prepared some snacks in the canteen..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_50 = {
    Text = "No way... Are they selling people at this workhouse?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_51 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Brown shrieks a warning as the wooden door groans."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Sarah finds an empty office."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_55 = {
    Text = "She slides a palm-sized slip into the drawer, slams it shut, and hurries away."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Once she's gone, Brown darts from the potted plant's shadow."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Jenkin creeps forward and pries the drawer open."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_59 = {
    Text = [[
Student ID? <Blue:Sean... Anderson>...
Aren't these the same marks on that dandy boy's fancy wallet?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_6 = {
    Text = "And this is...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_61 = {
    Text = [[
Shhh, Brown.
Stay cool... gotta keep my head straight...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_62 = {
    Text = "I've checked it all; my sister's name isn't in that ledger."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_63 = {
    Text = "We've got plenty of keys. I'll open every door in this place if I have to! No evidence can hide from me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Hold on, sis."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_65 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_66 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Darn, this is the last room."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_68 = {
    Text = [[
Pitch black and empty as a politician's promise.
We're leaving with nothing, Brown.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Ogier's presence puzzles Sarah, and she looks at you, waiting for an explanation."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_70 = {
    Text = "What? ...under the floor?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Jenkin hesitates for a moment but gently lights the lantern. She turns the flame down and leans closer to the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_72 = {
    Text = "A line of ants marches in an orderly formation into the wooden crack."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_73 = {
    Text = [[
Jenkin pries off a few nails and lifts the plank.
Underneath lies a 25-inch square iron cover.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Jenkin tries all the keys."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_75 = {
    Text = [[
None of these work!
Did she hide another key somewhere?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_76 = {
    Text = "She presses her ear against the iron plate, listening for sounds from the basement."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_77 = {
    Text = "<Italic:Scrape... Scrape...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_78 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Is this... the <Yellow:Ghost of the Workhouse> Aigis told us about?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_8 = {
    Text = "This is my younger brother, Ogier, one of the heirs of the family."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Faint footsteps echo outside the door."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_82 = {
    Text = [[
That's it, Brown.
We can't handle her alone if she got a ghost in her pocket.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_83 = {
    Text = "We need <Yellow:someone who scares her>..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Jenkin hides in the shadows, peeking out from behind the potted plant."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_85 = {
    Text = "In the hallway, Sarah is obsequiously introducing the financial status of the workhouse to the visitors."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_86 = {
    Text = "...Are those the \"sponsors\" Aigis mentioned?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Jenkin nods thoughtfully, then slips away from the dark storage room while no one is looking."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Behind her, the partially unfastened floorboards reveal a dark fissure, silently awaiting the visitors."
  },
  AvgDialog_18909_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Lord Ashe desires Young Master Ogier to develop a comprehensive understanding of the East District's conditions to facilitate effective reforms upon assuming control."
  },
  AvgDialog_18910_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Damn, the monsters keep flooding in!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18910_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ogier, seal the hatch! Ramona, focus on Sarah!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18910_Content_3 = {Text = "Roger!"},
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The situation is contained."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The blade leaves a silver trail as the hand moves."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah! T'yog! Help! Help me! <Big:NOOO!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The blade drew nearer until it consumed her vision.\nIn that instant—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_13 = {
    Text = "<Shake:AAAAAHHH—!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Aigis trembles, a shuddering scream of terror rising from her throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_15 = {
    Text = "As if summoned, the mysterious psychologist appears silently behind her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Something troubles you, little Aigis? Wanna tell Doctor Clementine?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Doctor Clementine?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Midnight workhouse visits hardly constitute standard medical practice. Explain your presence."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Don't be alarmed. There has been some unrest in the workhouse, and Mr. Rogers is concerned about the workers' and children's mental state, so he hired me to help."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ramona turns to the terrified girl, who trembles too much to speak."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I occasionally spend the night in the workhouse, just in a room near the children's."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Aigis, do you know this lady?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Clementine's arrival pulls the girl from her memories. She nods an affirmative response."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_23 = {
    Text = "She's been my little guest since my first day here in the workhouse."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Sharing your troubles is one way to heal the mind, and I happen to be a very professional listener."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The scrutinizing gaze sweeps over everyone's faces before fixing on you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_26 = {
    Text = "No thanks, we have other matters to attend to."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
What a shame. If you change your mind, you're always welcome to our journey of self-discovery.
Let's go, Aigis.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Aigis holds Clementine's hand and walks silently away."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Aigis! Where are you going?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_3 = {
    Text = "She gently rolls up Aigis's sleeve, revealing shocking stitches stark against her fair wrist."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_30 = {
    Text = "<Small:Sorry... Doctor Clementine can help me...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Saying that, the girl tugs Clementine's sleeve—something she rarely did. With the silent urging, they disappear through the workhouse door."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Aigis... I wonder what secret she's hiding."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_33 = {
    Text = "The fog is dissipating; we should rest before we delve into the basement with Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Aigis, they conducted the same experiments on you.
They bound you and forcibly performed surgery, implanting some... <Yellow:foreign objects>, right?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I, I... it was..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Ugh... This is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The intense light made it hard to keep her eyes open. Aigis tried but failed to control her eyelids."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Cold metal immobilized the muscles around her eyes. She watched helplessly as the white-robed man approached, scalpel in hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_18911_Content_9 = {
    Text = "No, NO! Miss Sarah, MISS SARAH!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The Silver Key flickers intensely as the girl props up her body. You hear something faintly, something being torn apart."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You collapse weakly to the ground, struggling to endure a throbbing headache and nausea."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_11 = {Text = "%player%!"},
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
Have you overused your mental power? You won't live long enough to witness Mythag's future like that.
Sit down and rest. Overusing your mental power will affect your perception ability.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Don't mind me, check on Aigis."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
The sound of evaporating liquid weakens and vanishes.
On the slime-stained floor, the girl sits quietly, covering one eye.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
Miss Ramona... and... {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%.
I'm so glad you're all right.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_16 = {Text = "Aigis..."},
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Come to Mythag with us. We'll find a way to cure your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You reach out to Aigis."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
Gently, Aigis places her hand on yours.
Her fingertips are cold as stone, yet in that moment, they feel as warm as the golden sunset outside.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The blindfold drifts down, writhing colors replace darkness, and a massive pale eye appears beneath her, as if watching her for ages."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Jenkin told me. What you are researching, and what the doctors experimented on us, is a phenomenon called \"Dissolution.\" It would erase one's existence, even related memories."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_21 = {
    Text = "If that's true... I have a wish."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Aigis pauses, suppressing faint sobs."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I hope everyone at the workhouse forgets about me and the pain I've brought."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_24 = {
    Text = "She raises her head and stares at you with her cold, stone-colored eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_25 = {
    Text = "You feel immobilized in that instant."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Seizing the opportunity, she turns and vanishes into the gloom, climbing to the clock tower platform."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Golden sunset rays pierce the giant transparent clock face, bathing the girl in light."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Aigis turns sideways, placing one hand on the long-unwashed glass, squinting into warm sunlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The sun's out today..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You are... an eye? My eye?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Perhaps invigorated by the rare sunny day, she wobbles to a cleaner piece of glass."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Her blurry vision clears. Gazing at familiar and unfamiliar streets, someone seems to whisper in her ear."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_32 = {
    Text = "<Italic:\"Look,\" > that voice says, <Italic:\"I told you. There's gonna be beautiful stars tonight.\">"
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_33 = {
    Text = "In the past, after each sunny day, T'yog would sneak me up here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah always forbade us to come here. She said it's too dangerous, and we could get hurt."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_35 = {
    Text = "But T'yog never listened. Every time, he'd sneak me upstairs in the dark once Miss Sarah has finished her bedtime rounds."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_36 = {
    Text = "He's clever and brave, just like Jenkin. Always knowing hidden paths and shortcuts that others don't."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_37 = {
    Text = "As long as he's with me, Miss Sarah would never find us."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_38 = {
    Text = "As long as he's with me, this place would always be our secret hideout."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_39 = {
    Text = "He told me I need to embrace the stars to strengthen my magic, although we couldn't see a single star here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_4 = {
    Text = "No, it's not! This feeling is...! It's Mr. @2!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_40 = {
    Text = "He was the only one who believed me back then. He believed I could see those black things and told me it was a witch's gift."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_41 = {
    Text = "But he was taken, just to protect me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
If I were as smart as him and as brave as Jenkin, I would have uncovered the truth.
But I'm no witch; I'm just a coward, a monster.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_43 = {
    Text = "A... murderer."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Aigis, you are a good child. You were controlled; this is not your fault."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Do you know how many people I've turned into statues?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_46 = {
    Text = "I'm terrified of what I'm about to become..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_47 = {
    Text = "...and what I have already become."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_48 = {
    Text = "But none of this matters anymore."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You will lend me your strength? But what about you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_50 = {
    Text = "I will no longer be controlled, harm anyone, or let my friends die because of me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Damn it, they were supposed to wait in the room, but now no one knows where they've gone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Wait, is that..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Aigis?! Aigis—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Jenkin's voice suddenly calls from below, anxiously shouting Aigis's name, arms raised toward the sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_56 = {
    Text = "A bird flies across the night sky, vanishing into the thick fog without a trace."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_57 = {
    Text = "The ribbon tied to her hand comes loose and flutters away. The girl's small body falls, disappearing forever from the night."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_58 = {
    Text = "The empty white dress and scattered paper squares land gently in Jenkin's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Not even a trace of warmth remains."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Thank you... I know it'll be brief, but I... have something to say to them."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Ai... Aigis...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_61 = {
    Text = "On the paper is a golden butterfly, its crinkled edges carefully pressed flat. It still carries a hint of candy sweetness."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_62 = {
    Text = "How... how could this be..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_63 = {
    Text = "The crimson ribbon and candy wrapper fall into Jenkin's hand, brushing her fingertips like tender comfort."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_64 = {
    Text = "She blinks, tears blurring vision and dripping from lashes, silently caught by that vivid red."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_65 = {Text = "Aigis..."},
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Aigis, Aigis!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Aigis stirs and truly opens her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18912_Content_9 = {
    Text = "After a piercing wail, the monster's massive body dissolves into black slime and collapses. The slime turns to dust, rising to darken the wooden beams."
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You finally catch up with Aigis and subdue her with joined forces. You urgently reach out, grab her arm, and press the Silver Key to complete the link."
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_10 = {
    Text = "No, Aigis, trust me. Mythag University has dealt with far worse situations..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Really? Ogier... Look at their bodies."
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Ogier turns to the struggling Keeper and Ramona.\nTheir bodies exude sweat in strange colors—not sweat, but fine syrup."
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_13 = {
    Text = "After Mr. Anderson's voice faded, the colors in my eyes gradually went out of control, along with my body. Even without looking, people around me would turn into stones."
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_14 = {
    Text = "How much longer can I hold on? A year, a month, a day, an hour?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Should I stay hidden behind everyone and sit it out until there's no turning back?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_16 = {
    Text = "No, I want to be as brave as T'yog, as brave as Jenkin, as brave as you. At least for this one time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
Ogier, aren't you a knight? Then you understand.
If I stay, I'm a criminal awaiting the knights' judgement.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Ogier stands stunned."
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Ogier, you once said... redemption depends on oneself."
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Please, don't do this...
I know...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Now... look at me, and judge my soul... Can it be redeemed?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Ogier gazes into Aigis's only good eye, hesitates, then solemnly lets go."
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_22 = {
    Text = "As he moves, Aigis breaks free from your control link."
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_23 = {
    Text = "In a second, the girl's body swells rapidly, her skin bubbling with blisters of various sizes, blocking the staircase and pressing against the ceiling."
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Amid horrifying sounds of twisting limbs, only a faint trace of the girl's voice lingers."
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_25 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Run... run...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You are pulled into darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The scalding, blazing darkness wraps around you like molten syrup, binding you tightly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_5 = {
    Text = "<Italic:Old Charlie's tabby, fat and dear...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Pain begins on the surface, first like ant bites, then intensifies as countless needles pierce every inch of your skin—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The link snaps violently."
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Enduring the pain, you hold the Silver Key with your left hand, trembling as you place your right hand back on Aigis's arm."
  },
  AvgDialog_18913_Content_9 = {
    Text = "It's too late..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18914_Content_1 = {
    Text = "These monsters all have D-Marks on their bodies. And... it looks as if they were sewn on."
  },
  AvgDialog_18914_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ramona taps her brooch twice."
  },
  AvgDialog_18914_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Erica, initiate search protocol for \"Stitched D-Mark.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18914_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Keyword matched, "Stitched D-Mark," with a total of 37 related incidents.
Event Keywords: Malignant Organization Activity, <Blue:The Sculptors' Association>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18914_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The Sculptors' Association?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18914_Content_6 = {
    Text = "They are a group of lunatics calling themselves \"Pygmalion,\" obsessed with <Red:biological modification>... We had several clashes with them in towns outside Londinium."
  },
  AvgDialog_18914_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Their East District infiltration demands heightened alertness... Particularly for individuals <Yellow:wielding scalpels>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ogier faces several doctors fearlessly, dodging and neutralizing their force skillfully for fifteen minutes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Now hurry up and get ready. I'll personally take you to the clinic... and little Mac as well; it's been a while since his last check-up."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I hope Mr. Rogers is willing to tell me their address."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_12 = {
    Text = "No! Please, Miss Sarah, we don't want the treatment."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Aigis gives Mac a push, who looks confused but ultimately runs back to the room."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Little Mac! Come back!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Aigis grabs Sarah's sleeve urgently, allowing Mac to escape."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_16 = {
    Text = "If... if we have to, just take me alone..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_18 = {
    Text = "What's the matter, Young Master Ashe?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Sarah immediately dons a fawning mask again."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_2 = {Text = "Enough."},
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_20 = {
    Text = "In the name of Ogier, the Grand Duke's knight, I forbid you to force Aigis's \"treatment.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_21 = {Text = "K-knight?"},
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Ogier realizes his slip, face instantly reddening. He continues haltingly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
Y-Yes, the youngest son of our house is always knighted.
Anyway, I need to take Aigis, and wait for {Male=my brother,Female=my sister} and the housekeeper. Don't make things harder for her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_24 = {
    Text = [[
Speaking, Ogier grabs Aigis's hand and runs back to the room.
The girl keeps her head down, seemingly sobbing.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Alright, that should stop Miss Sarah."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Aigis, could you tell me why you refuse the treatment for yourself and the others?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Aigis's lips press tight, a suppressed whimper escaping."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, I AM a knight. And a knight WILL protect you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_29 = {Text = "Really!"},
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
We won't force Aigis if she's not willing.
We'll take the other selected patients back to the clinic for treatment and return them after the therapy is complete.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
Ogier stammers, trying for solemnity.
Aigis looks at him, hesitates, then bursts into laughter.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
Stop it, Ogier. I've read in the books that knights always protect princesses.
Just look at me. Do I look like a princess?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Aigis gently touches her skirt's patch, speaking softly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_33 = {
    Text = [[
Then those books aren't telling the truth.
Knights don't just protect princesses; they protect commoners as well. They protect everyone.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Aigis tries to figure Ogier out."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Are you truly a knight?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_36 = {
    Text = "He pats his chest, gauntlet clinking, his expression twisting briefly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Yes, I am! I was personally knighted by a royal family. It's my duty to protect everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_38 = {
    Text = "I admire your bravery... even standing up for someone you've just met."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_39 = {
    Text = "A shame I'm not a knight, nor a princess, not even a commoner. I'm just a miserable..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Good day, Miss Sarah."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_40 = {
    Text = "She didn't finish the sentence."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Ogier, you said knights protect everyone..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_42 = {
    Text = "What about criminals? Even... murderers?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Ogier stands tall and resolute:"
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_44 = {
    Text = [[
Knights do not protect criminals.
Because knights punish criminals and protect people from them.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_45 = {
    Text = "I knew it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Not catching Aigis's sigh, he continues speaking."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_47 = {
    Text = "That's because knights are not almighty."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_48 = {
    Text = "After the sanction, knights will turn the penitent over to the priests."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Merciful priests aid every penitent... but whether their souls can ultimately be redeemed depends on themselves."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Vick gives Aigis one last glance before leaving with the others."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Depends on... themselves..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Yes, it's not too late."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_52 = {
    Text = "It's all about you@4..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_53 = {
    Text = [[
Aigis pauses, savoring his words.
Hesitant, she begins speaking slowly.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_54 = {
    Text = [[
I trust you, Ogier. I am willing to give it another shot.
So, I will tell you... the truth about those treatments.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Sarah sees the doctors out with a forced smile, but her expression turns stern as she faces Aigis."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Aigis, why are you so disobedient?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah, I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18915_Content_9 = {
    Text = "They only came because of Mr. Rogers. Now you've driven them away. How am I supposed to explain this to Mr. Rogers?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Silently, the monsters dissipate into black smoke."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_10 = {
    Text = "If you call me a monster, what would you call that one?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_11 = {
    Text = "She caresses the statue's chin in response, then lightly touches your hand's back."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You are caught in an illusion of the sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_13 = {
    Text = "A grand city constructed from green, monstrous stones that completely defies Euclidean geometry. The ornate yet unclean reliefs dazzle beautifully and eerily under the sea's refracted light."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_14 = {
    Text = "A suffocating feeling envelops you. Precious air is squeezed from your lungs and flows out through your mouth."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_15 = {
    Text = "—Then, someone grabs you, breaking the illusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_16 = {Text = "Keeper!"},
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, it's just an illusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_18 = {
    Text = "What are you trying to tell me by showing me that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Sanga lowers her eyes and does not respond."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_2 = {Text = "Phew—"},
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You recall what you learned from the Awakening Studies preparatory courses."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_21 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Aequor>, <Yellow:Caro>, and <Yellow:Ultra> are the mainstream classifications of Awakener Realms in academia. Additionally, there are some realms that have been less studied due to a lack of subjects, such as <Yellow:Occult> and <Yellow:Ether>..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Usually, the Realms are mutually exclusive, but some Awakeners possess the ability to adapt to other realms, and they are classified as the <Yellow:Realm of Chaos>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Jenkin's choked voice interrupts your thoughts. She darts among the basement sugar sculptures like a helpless mouse."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_24 = {
    Text = "I checked them all. Every face."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
She's not here...
<Big:WHERE'S MY SISTER? TELL ME!>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Ramona ends the communication with the school, her ice-cold voice cutting through your thoughts."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Confirmed unregistered Awakener. Per <Yellow:Mystia Treaty Article 12>, we must call the <Blue:Treaty Committee> for containment."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Prior to their arrival, please disclose all missing persons' locations, including <Blue:Sean Anderson, the Mythag Investigator> and <Blue:Mason the Weaver>, plus your connections to the <Blue:Sculptors' Association>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Hold on, Ramona, Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The ghost exhales gently, dispersing sugar powder from her carving knife."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_30 = {
    Text = "You wave off their questions and turn to Sanga, who wears a knowing smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_31 = {
    Text = "The one who turned these people into this... it wasn't you, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_32 = {Text = "%player%?"},
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_33 = {
    Text = "You showed me an illusion, a scene composed of the underwater world and coral carvings... That is the power from seas and dreams, the power of the <Yellow:Aequor Realm>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You glance at the grotesque, writhing candy figures. A deep breath brings overwhelming sweetness that assaults your senses once more."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_35 = {
    Text = [[
These bodies were melted into syrup and then solidified into statues...
This ability is more like the work of a <Yellow:Caro Realm Awakener>, who are often more skilled in transforming flesh.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_36 = {
    Text = "You may be involved, but the true culprit is someone else."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Talking to smart people is truly delightful."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Indeed, a friend told me about the unique materials here, and I just wanted to borrow some to shape my \"God\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Sanga speaks casually while packing carving knives into her bag."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Done.
But once again, not good enough.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
Let's go, aren't you taking me to some committee?
Can you help me pack up these statues as well?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_41 = {Text = "And..."},
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_42 = {
    Text = "She taps the stone seat beneath her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_43 = {
    Text = "You see, I'm not good on walking. Maybe you have a car at your disposal?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_44 = {
    Text = "You grab her wrist."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Who turned them into this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Are you asking me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Sanga lets out a soft sigh."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_48 = {
    Text = [[
I feel generous today, lucky you.
Go ask the matron and those doctors.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
Sarah! I knew that woman was behind this!
Just wait, I'll... I'll...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_5 = {
    Text = "She sets down the knife, half-turning toward you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Jenkin's fierceness soon becomes despondency."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_51 = {
    Text = "You step forward gently and pat her shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_52 = {
    Text = [[
No news is good news. As long as...
there's still hope.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_53 = {
    Text = [[
We don't need to disguise anymore.
Ramona, call the Committee. Jenkin, bring Sarah here.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_54 = {
    Text = "And her ledger."
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Now, my dear guests, what brings you here? What is your business with me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You... you monster!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Monster? I'd rather you call me \"Sanga.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18916_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Sanga brushes dust from the sugar sculpture's surface, noncommittal."
  },
  AvgDialog_18917_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Miss 24, what made you attack us immediately?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18917_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Attack? No, I don't fight..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18917_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Ah! So you met \"her\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18917_Content_4 = {
    Text = "I know it sounds absurd, that wasn't the real me—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18917_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Actually, she <Italic:is> me, but she's the abnormal part..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18917_Content_6 = {
    Text = "No, that's not right either. Actually, there is another me... There are several of me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18917_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Great! Finally someone who talks, and they're crazy."
  },
  AvgDialog_18918_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Miss 24, there's something I've been meaning to ask you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18918_Content_2 = {
    Text = "How exactly did you manage to emerge from a wax sculpture?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18918_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I... sorry, I feel a bit confused. The confusion has haunted me for some time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18918_Content_4 = {
    Text = "I was made into a wax sculpture before, not sure how long I've been placed there..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18918_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Suddenly, I seem to be able to move and breathe. Then—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18918_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Then you crawled out of wax like some ghost."
  },
  AvgDialog_18918_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Yes, yes..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18919_Content_1 = {Text = "Eyes..."},
  AvgDialog_18919_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The eyes of Mr. Wax... they seem strangely familiar."
  },
  AvgDialog_18920_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ahhh, wh-where did you all come from?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18920_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Achoo! So stinky... Do dead people really need perfume?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18920_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You... fine, very well..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18920_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Let me teach you proper etiquette!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_1 = {
    Text = "4:40, Rogers Wax Museum"
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Stop. Look at her wound. She's absorbed too much D-Slime..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Soon, she'll dissolve completely along with this cursed wax museum."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Dang it... Got D-Slime on me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Jenkin trembles as she extends her hand, revealing the key."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Come here, Sis."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Don't move, Jenkin! You're injured, I'll get you out of here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Come over here, Sis."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Now open your hand... Yes, just like this—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_18 = {
    Text = "24 trembles as she opens her hand, and a key falls into her palm, still warm."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_19 = {
    Text = "T-the key's clean! Did my best..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The wait feels endless until a sound of labored movement comes from above."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_20 = {
    Text = "What a shame. I'm only thirteen and haven't lived enough yet..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Jenkin sniffs again and gives you a bright smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Sis, we haven't even had a chance to talk some more, and now we have to say bye-bye again..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Do you remember what you said to me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You said... I was never alone. You said I still had you. Had everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_25 = {
    Text = "From that moment, I knew..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I'd do anything for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_27 = {Text = "Jenkin..."},
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Thanks, thank you all... One last thing..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Don't forget me, okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The sound gradually becomes clearer and louder..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The pitch-black slime surges from behind the girl, freezing her radiant smile in its final moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_31 = {
    Text = "The girl who loves funny faces, talks to small animals, and always argues with Miss Sarah..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_32 = {
    Text = "...vanishes silently, along with this wax museum."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_4 = {
    Text = "After a long while, a thin, small arm reaches out from inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_5 = {Text = "Got it..."},
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, get out now! This place is going down..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Sorry. Might... not join you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_8 = {Text = "Squeak..."},
  AvgDialog_18921_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, grab my hand, quick!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
12:25, Rogers Wax Museum
Studio]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Speak up, Brown. What did you see down there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Squeak, ugh... squeak squeak..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Hmm, what next?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Squeak squeak squeak..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Got it. Good job, Brown."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Brown says it was too dark, couldn't see much. Just brought this back."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Jenkin pries open Brown's tiny paw and pulls out a small document pouch."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Let's see... some coins, buttons, and..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_18 = {Text = "A letter?"},
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Oh, let me read what's written here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_2 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Hey, that's mine!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_21 = {
    Text = "She unfolds the letter. It contains hastily scribbled words, written in a rush."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
Jenkin,

I think I won't live much longer @2

They are turning people into wax sculptures, and soon it will be my turn @4
@2 I've talked to Mr. Davis @1
...He'll let you work in his factory.
Mr. Davis is strict, but they offer pea soup and black bread for lunch every day.
<Yellow:Remember not to backtalk him.>

Also, I left all the money in @4]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_23 = {
    Text = "She pauses at the end."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_24 = {
    Text = "She bears a peculiar expression, as if lost in deep thought, yet her mind seemed to have wandered far away."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Why'd you stop reading? There's still more to go!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_26 = {
    Text = "She places the letter in your hand without a word."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You unfold it—only greetings and a signature remain."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_28 = {
    Text = "<Italic:...Even now, I still miss the days we sunbathed together in Wood Park.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_29 = {
    Text = "<Italic:With love, Mason.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Brown, you're back!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_30 = {
    Text = "It's real... My sister exists..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_31 = {
    Text = "I won't work for Davis!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Miss Mason was definitely imprisoned here. She took enormous risks to write this letter."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_33 = {
    Text = "She never lost hope, and she never forgot about you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_34 = {
    Text = "But now I can't even remember her face..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_35 = {
    Text = "I'm useless... Sorry, Sis..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_36 = {
    Text = "A hand reaches out, gently covering Jenkin's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_37 = {
    Text = "This hand is riddled with scars. Bathed in moonlight, the bluish-black veins and wounds are unmistakable."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Don't cry, and don't apologize."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_39 = {
    Text = "That's what you warned me about."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Brown lies weakly in Jenkin's arms, wrinkling its nose before sobbing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_40 = {Text = "24..."},
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_41 = {
    Text = "At least you're still alive, and there's still hope."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_42 = {
    Text = "I believe your sister would have hoped for this as well."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_43 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_44 = {
    Text = "I... wasn't crying."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_45 = {
    Text = "You're almost normal when not crazy."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_46 = {
    Text = "The girl replies in a sullen tone, with a barely noticeable nasal quality."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Anyway, you finally find traces of Mason."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Finally some good news."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Squeak... Squeak—!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_6 = {Text = "Hmm..."},
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Brown says it stinks down there, feels awful."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Oh my, do mice get sick too? How educational."
  },
  AvgDialog_18922_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Brown's no ordinary mouse."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You tried everything, but the trapdoor remains unmoved."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Our investigation has been exposed. Now, both of the remaining exits are guarded."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I found a <Yellow:door leading to the outside> nearby. It's special, locked from the inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Rogers must have rigged with it; it can't be opened by ordinary means."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You need to go to the <Yellow:Master Office>, ahem, and get a <Yellow:key>..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I have found quite a few things. Accounts, reports, contracts... enough to keep Rogers in prison for the rest of his life."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I'll give them to you just in case, then—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_16 = {Text = "Ahh—!!"},
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The woman in white, she... she's disappeared..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You look towards where the woman once stood. It is empty now, with only the white curtains fluttering in the wind."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Disappeared... what happened?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Damn it, won't open..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I... I don't know. She was just here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Jenkin angrily rushes to 24 and grabs her hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_22 = {
    Text = "It was you, wasn't it? I heard you two whispering. Still trying to pretend you didn't know her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_23 = {
    Text = "No, no... Miss Jenkin, listen to me! Even the police need evidence to convict a criminal..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_24 = {
    Text = [[
We were all watching William, except you two.
Are you blind and deaf?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_25 = {
    Text = "She may be weird, but what if she is my sis..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I'll ask again: where'd she go?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_27 = {
    Text = "In the scuffle, 24 falls to the ground, her long hair pushed aside."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_28 = {
    Text = "What's this... 0, 2, 4?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_29 = {
    Text = "On the woman's fair neck, there is a prominent black code \"024\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_3 = {Text = "Go back."},
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_30 = {
    Text = "You saw similar patterns somewhere else not long ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
See this? They brand each successful specimen with a code.
Our <Blue:special, unique, irreplaceable>...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_32 = {
    Text = "That's... the Sculptors' Association..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_33 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_34 = {
    Text = "24 futilely clutches her neck, her face extremely pale."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_35 = {
    Text = "I knew it... She's a liar! And I actually..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_36 = {
    Text = "I see. We were all distracted by Miss 24's... episode."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_37 = {
    Text = "No ordinary victim could navigate this wax museum so freely."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_38 = {Text = "No, no..."},
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_39 = {
    Text = "24 sits on the ground, mechanically scratching the code on her neck until it becomes a bloody mess."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_4 = {
    Text = "What in the...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_40 = {
    Text = "<Shake:It's not what you think, not what you think...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I said, \"Go back.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You kidding? We barely got in!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_7 = {
    Text = "There are many... monsters down here, more than you can handle. Didn't Doll warn you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_8 = {
    Text = "What about you? We can't just leave you here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18923_Content_9 = {
    Text = "There's a B-level rift, and it will take a long time to handle. I can't leave here.\nListen, I'll say this only once—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18924_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Quiet... I hear someone approaching. Take cover."
  },
  AvgDialog_18924_Content_2 = {
    Text = "What a beautiful moonlit night!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18924_Content_3 = {
    Text = "When I was alive, on nights like this, I would sit on the marble terrace and pour myself a glass of wine..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18924_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Instead of being a maid at the wax museum like now, sob sob..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18924_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Come on, I've heard this story a hundred times. My ears are practically calloused!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18924_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Are all the items locked in the cabinet?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18924_Content_7 = {
    Text = "All set, I triple-checked it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18924_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Cabinet...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18924_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Let's move closer to investigate."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Knocked down on the ground, the woman still has blood staining the corner of her mouth."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_10 = {
    Text = "So... If I refuse to answer, will you plunge that into me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Will you do it hard, nice and deep?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Will you? Will you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_13 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_14 = {
    Text = "If you refuse to answer, we won't harm you. We'll simply ignore you and leave."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Is that clear?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Oh... I see..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_17 = {
    Text = "<Big:Stop, Ramona!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Jenkin rushes to the woman, urgently grabbing her wrist and pulling her over."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Sis... Is that you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Oh my, your blood has such a peculiar flavor... It makes my thoughts swim in circles."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_20 = {Text = "Sis...?"},
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Her wandering gaze gently falls on Jenkin, and after a moment, she suddenly laughs."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Oh my. If you're calling me sister, you must be from that life I've forgotten."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Locked underground for three glorious years... 1235 exquisite days, courtesy of my loving family."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_24 = {Text = "What the?!"},
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Nonsense! I'd never do that to you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Hmm, why not? The Dissolution helps. Ever since I fell ill, my mind swims in crimson rivers of blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You feared I'd harm others, feared I'd disgrace you, so you tucked me away so nicely..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, you're not keeping secrets from us, are you...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The woman deftly pounces on Jenkin, raising her delicate wrist."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Let me guess, you're not quite human, but not quite Awakener either..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_30 = {
    Text = "See? Pretty shackles on my wrists, my ankles, even this lovely collar around my throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_31 = {Text = "I... I..."},
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Three years of rat's blood cocktails, and now I smell like a butcher's floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_33 = {
    Text = "How could I hurt my sis? She's... she's..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_34 = {
    Text = "She's family!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Jenkin's face turns red as she clenches her fists and glares defiantly at the woman."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_36 = {Text = "...Family?"},
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Seemingly not expecting Jenkin's response, the previously noisy woman finally quiets down."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_38 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Just teasing, little mouse."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Ramona stands between you, frowning at the woman."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_40 = {
    Text = "I have no family, and I'm certainly not your sister. You're mistaking me for someone else."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Who are you? Why are you here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_6 = {
    Text = "But thanks anyway. I haven't fed properly for a long week. Your generosity is appreciated..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Ramona draws her rapier and holds it against the woman's chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I won't ask again."
  },
  AvgDialog_18925_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The woman glances at the blade pointed at her, her eyes flickering briefly before she suddenly straightens up."
  },
  AvgDialog_18926_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ouch! This tunnel's tight, my knees are scraped..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18926_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Squeak... Sob... (Jenkin is bleeding heavily... Sob...)"
  },
  AvgDialog_18926_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Just a scratch. See the exit? Jump down to the master office!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18927_Content_1 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18927_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Bad luck, Brown. Don't think I'm making it out."
  },
  AvgDialog_18927_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Squeak... squeak squeak. (Jenkin... you must be feeling awful right now.)"
  },
  AvgDialog_18927_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak? Squeak. (Can you hold on a little longer? Just a little while? The exit is just ahead, squeak.)"
  },
  AvgDialog_18927_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I... don't know... Feels like I'm burning..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18927_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Feels awful, mind's scrambled... Everything's sticky..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18927_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Don't wanna die yet..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18927_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak squeak. (Follow me, Jenkin. I'll take you out, squeak.)"
  },
  AvgDialog_18928_Content_1 = {
    Text = "What's that icky stuff on me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18928_Content_2 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_18928_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Must've imagined it! Never mind, ha... hah."
  },
  AvgDialog_18929_Content_1 = {
    Text = "So, how exactly did you win over Miss Doll?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18929_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Simple. We pose as visitors to infiltrate the museum."
  },
  AvgDialog_18929_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Scout first, retreat at the first sign of trouble."
  },
  AvgDialog_18930_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Is acting fun?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18930_Content_2 = {
    Text = "...I don't understand what you mean."
  },
  AvgDialog_18930_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Don't be nervous... I'm just curious, I won't expose you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18930_Content_4 = {
    Text = "@3 then. You won't say a word, will you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18930_Content_5 = {Text = "Wait...!"},
  AvgDialog_18930_Content_6 = {Text = "Shh..."},
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Anatomical Melancholy"
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You've been faking madness, following us, trying to hurt my sis... or someone who might be her..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You must be a spy sent by that damn association!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_12 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_13 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Aaahh!! Why won't you listen to my explanation?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Faced with your relentless questioning, 24 suddenly freaks out."
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Listen to me, you @4 LISTEN TO ME—!! AAAHHHH!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_17 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:Fine, I'm listening... Ugh, she's losing it...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_18 = {
    Text = "24 breathes heavily with veins bulging on their face."
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Hey, your face veins..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Please hear me out! They made me to! It was I who pushed you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Hehe... Yes, that's the look. I see..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_21 = {Text = "Fear."},
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_22 = {Text = "Disgust."},
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_23 = {
    Text = "<RedShake:A freak. That's me. An ugly monster abandoned like me...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_24 = {
    Text = "<RedShake:No one comes near me, no one trusts me...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Dark red arms once again emerge from within 24, tightly wrapping around her neck."
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<RedShake:I'm not a monster, I'm not a monster...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_27 = {
    Text = "She's losing control again! We need to evacuate immediately!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_28 = {
    Text = "I'm not a @4 monster... AAAAHHHHH@2!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_3 = {
    Text = "It was you? Good... At least you admit it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_4 = {
    Text = "I realized you're good, so I decided to join you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Just answer one question, Miss 24: Did you let her go?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_6 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Was this another case of coercion?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_8 = {Text = "In fact..."},
  AvgDialog_18931_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Wait. You really think we'll buy that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18932_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Help... help me... it's eating me alive—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18932_Content_2 = {
    Text = "No, please kill me... end it, END IT!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18932_Content_3 = {Text = "...?"},
  AvgDialog_18933_Content_1 = {Text = "UUGHH!"},
  AvgDialog_18933_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Huh, did she just collapse?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18933_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Let's check it out."
  },
  AvgDialog_18934_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You guys go ahead, I'll cover you... I'm n-not scared of her!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18934_Content_2 = {
    Text = "...Stay calm. Get behind me and stay there."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_1 = {Text = "Dollhouse"},
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_10 = {Text = "Mother..."},
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You're growing more accustomed to Mother's presence, I see."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_12 = {
    Text = "...M-Mr. Wax."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Magnificent, isn't she? She was quite plain before."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_14 = {
    Text = "A street singer, poor thing, ravaged by disease—her skin a canvas of scarlet lesions."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I watched the life drain from her battered body, then gathered her pieces to create this perfection."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I can't tell at all... Is this magic?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_17 = {
    Text = "This isn't magic, child. This is the art of wax."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Art of... wax..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I look at the \"Mother\": dim candlelight gives her face a jade-like glow, highlighting the smile on her lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Summer, AF 295
Scarborough, North Yorkshire]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_20 = {
    Text = "My gaze sweeps inch by inch, trying to find any trace of poverty or hardship on her, but to no avail."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Not feeling like talking? Fear not, I've no plans to sculpt you yet... You may speak freely here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_22 = {
    Text = "They say I'm s-sick, need to receive treatment, and shouldn't talk carelessly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Stutter? How did they... treat it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_24 = {
    Text = "F-fire tongs, and @2 tincture..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_25 = {
    Text = "@2 tincture? Such crude medicine."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I don't know. Mom said it would help r-relax the muscles in my throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_27 = {
    Text = "It was a painful experience. Mom was obsessed with various \"novel\" therapies and manipulated me as if I were her toy."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Every morning, I was made to stand on the high steps, my mouth filled with sharp gravel."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_29 = {
    Text = "<Italic:Sing.> Mommy told me to sing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Old Charlie's tabby, fat and dear,"
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_30 = {
    Text = "So I loudly sang the cheerful alphabet song, with blood gushing from my mouth and flowing down to my chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_31 = {
    Text = "No tears now, child. Every sculpture here cradles a tragedy."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_32 = {
    Text = "They would have rotted unnoticed, their sorrows washed into the gutters by the rain."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_33 = {
    Text = "As if their pain never existed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Never... existed..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Cruel, isn't it? I wished to help, but this rusted chisel was all I had."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Thus I became their chronicler... though soon, mere documentation ceased to satisfy."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_37 = {
    Text = "You... changed them."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Remember, then remake—this is my artistic creed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_39 = {
    Text = "A demanding path, my child, yet endlessly fascinating."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_4 = {
    Text = "One day just vanished—disappeared; he searched the wardrobe, he checked the bed..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_40 = {
    Text = "When your time comes, you'll part seas like the prophets of old."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Tongs or @2 tinctures... such trifles won't matter anymore."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
22:15, Rogers Wax Museum
Exhibition Area]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_43 = {
    Text = "You walk through the ancient and worn wax museum."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Almost no natural light enters the hall, and the few scattered kerosene lamps do little to dispel the eerie atmosphere."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_45 = {
    Text = "I've got a question..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Why are these wax sculptures smiling so weirdly?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_47 = {
    Text = "You gaze at these exquisitely crafted wax sculptures."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Some with pursed lips, some dozing off, and others holding parasols... The only thing they have in common is their radiant smiles."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
Creepy. Seriously.
Are they happy? But their eyes are totally dead.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_5 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_50 = {
    Text = "If you ask me, Rogers is all talk."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_51 = {
    Text = [[
According to our database, "laughter" seems to be one of Rogers' recurring themes.
Would you agree, Doll?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_52 = {Text = "Doll?"},
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_53 = {
    Text = "<Italic:Shhhh... Shhhhh...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_54 = {
    Text = "You tap the brooch, but there is no response. The entire wax museum is as silent as a giant tomb."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_55 = {
    Text = "The communicator is working fine, but the signal just dropped... What happened?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_56 = {
    Text = "When we entered the wax museum, I seemed to have heard an electric current... Something's interfering with the communication?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_57 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_58 = {
    Text = "I heard that too."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_59 = {
    Text = "So what now? The plan requires Miss Doll's assistance..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Mother, do I sing well??"
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Pandia's work, perhaps. Let's go back to her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Today marks the fifteenth day I have spent with \"Galatea\", my new Mother."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Looking at her gentle face and perfectly polished demeanor, I feel a sudden surge of emotion."
  },
  AvgDialog_18935_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I gently rest my head against her chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_18936_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Why go back to her... She seems shady."
  },
  AvgDialog_18936_Content_2 = {
    Text = "We can use the front desk phone to diagnose the communication failure."
  },
  AvgDialog_18936_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Got it! We'll teach her a lesson if she's behind this."
  },
  AvgDialog_18937_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Boohoo, who will return my poor spilled guts..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18937_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Here, take this back!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18937_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Won't go back in... Sniffle sniffle..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_1 = {Text = "Galatea"},
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_10 = {
    Text = "My parents are respectable and wealthy. They will give you money..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_11 = {
    Text = "As long as you let me go."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Shh... Quiet, you'll disturb her rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Come here, little one."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Closer now, no need to fear."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Observe her hands. Aren't they exquisite?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Even the purest marble would weep with envy."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_17 = {
    Text = "<Shake:B...Beautiful, sir.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_18 = {
    Text = "How unfortunate... I see no admiration in your eyes, only revulsion..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_19 = {
    Text = "No, it's not... Please give me another chance!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Summer, AF 295
Scarborough, North Yorkshire]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_20 = {
    Text = "No matter, I shall educate you properly and lift the veil from your ignorant eyes.\nNow the first lesson—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_21 = {Text = "Kneel."},
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Now I command you, kneel."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Kneel, and press your reverent lips..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_24 = {
    Text = "To Galatea, to your \"Mother.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_25 = {
    Text = "That was my first time kissing the \"Mother.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The pale hand, carefully wrapped in sticky wax oil, emitted a faint stench under the scorching heat of Scarborough's midsummer."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_27 = {
    Text = "It was the smell of death."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_28 = {
    Text = "21:00, Southwark Street"
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Calling communicator I-2069, calling communicator I-2069..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_3 = {
    Text = "This is my most precious creation—Galatea."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The 25th communication attempt failed. We have lost the connection with Investigator William Delapore."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Can you get in touch with the detectives accompanying William?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
Unfortunately, no.
Let's call it a day and report back to Mythag. No rash moves until we have more information.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_33 = {
    Text = "That's it? But we've lost contact with William, and he may be..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Bunch of scaredy-cats."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Now excuse me, my sister doesn't have time for your slow paperwork."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_36 = {
    Text = "I can go to that wax museum alone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_37 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Saying that, Jenkin turns, diving into the thick fog."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Jenkin! Don't! It's too dangerous!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Have you heard the tale of <Blue:Pygmalion>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_40 = {Text = "Let's go."},
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_5 = {
    Text = "He carved a perfect maiden from ivory, dressing and caressing her as his beloved bride..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Pouring all his devotion into her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_7 = {
    Text = "\"Galatea\"—such a lovely name, don't you think?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Forgive my rambling. You must find this tedious."
  },
  AvgDialog_18938_Content_9 = {
    Text = "No, no, sir. Please, sir..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Scarborough Summer"
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_10 = {
    Text = "George, my name is George."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_11 = {
    Text = "June @1, AF 295"
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_12 = {
    Text = "It was a chaotic day until they opened the cellar door, letting the sunlight in..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Only then did I realize that my garden, my kingdom, was merely a narrow basement."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Child! My child... I've finally found you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Quick, leave here with Mom and never return..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_16 = {Text = "George..."},
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_17 = {Text = "...What?"},
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_18 = {
    Text = "George... I want to go with George."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_19 = {
    Text = "\"George\"? You mean this little wax sculpture?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Summer, AF 295
Scarborough, North Yorkshire]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_20 = {
    Text = "George! Please, please give it back to me—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Don't rush, little one. Answer my question first."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_22 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Where did \"Mr. Wax\" go?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Mr. Wax...? I-I don't know what you're talking about..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Hehe. You really don't know? Let me ask you another question."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_25 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:How did this wax sculpture come about?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_26 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_27 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Mom, I... I'm scared.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Detective, watch your tone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Should your investigation require anything from us, feel free to contact our lawyer Franz @1. Good day."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_3 = {
    Text = "He's dead. Now, it's just you and me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The elegantly dressed woman raises her pointed chin, glances sideways at the detective, then takes the boy and leaves."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Hehe... Interesting."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The studio! Finally! You ARE useful after all!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Is, is that so... Thank you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You look around. It's another dim place."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The wall lamp in the corner flickers faintly, casting a grayish hue on the moonlight streaming through the window."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_36 = {
    Text = "An empty room filled with wax arms, legs, heads, and torsos..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_37 = {
    Text = "They are like soft, torn socks, casually piled on benches, worktables, and floors."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Freeman, Lil' John, Luke Fourfinger..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_39 = {
    Text = "They are all people I knew in White Chapel!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_4 = {
    Text = "What's your name?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
This confirms Rogers' involvement.
Furthermore, it strongly implicates the Sculptors' Association.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Ramona pokes the piled-up limbs as she speaks."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_42 = {
    Text = "All these specimens show signs of experimentation, matching what we saw in the workhouse."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_43 = {
    Text = "I knew it... Aigis was his victim as well..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_44 = {
    Text = "I'll find him and make him pay."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Rogers needs to face justice. But first, we have to locate the \"Primavera\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Finding things is my thing. Leave it to me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_5 = {Text = "G-Geor..."},
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Geor... ge..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Remember, you and I are different. You don't s-stutter."
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Let's p-practice again. What is your name?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18939_Content_9 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Maiden and Tears"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_10 = {
    Text = "George nestles into Rogers' arms and shrieks in accusation."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Rogers affectionately strokes George's fluffy golden head and lets out a sigh."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_12 = {
    Text = "An ordinary child? Little Jenkin braved the wax museum for her sister."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Isn't that right, <Yellow:Miss Mason>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Miss Mason?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Mason... Are you really my sis?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_16 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_17 = {
    Text = "24 sighs softly and reaches out to embrace Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The familiar scents hit her, awakening long-buried memories of countless days and nights."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_19 = {
    Text = "It's really you, sis... So it wasn't a dream. So good..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
3:00, Rogers Wax Museum
Special Exhibition Area]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, you're not some unwanted rat. You still have me and Brown."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, I won't let them take you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_22 = {
    Text = "24 gently touches Jenkin's cheek, then turns around and calmly looks at Rogers and his minions."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Lady Pandia, Master Rogers, we had a deal."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_24 = {
    Text = "I'll bring them over for you. And in exchange, Jenkin goes free."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_25 = {Text = "Why..."},
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_26 = {Text = "SLAP—!"},
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The whip mercilessly lashes down, leaving a fierce red mark on 24's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_28 = {Text = "UGH!"},
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
Must you question everything?
When you were vandalizing my museum, did you spare a thought for consequences?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_3 = {Text = "Wait?"},
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_30 = {
    Text = "I'll say this only once. Remove yourself."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_31 = {
    Text = "24 stands in front of Jenkin, her thin shoulder blades trembling like butterfly wings."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_32 = {
    Text = "She manages a faint smile, but it looks more painful than crying."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_33 = {
    Text = "As long as you let her go, I'll step aside..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_34 = {Text = "SLAP—!"},
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Countless lashes fall like raindrops."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_36 = {
    Text = "How vexing, my arms grow weary. Do you intend to die here today, 24?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Losing such an obedient pet would even bring tears to my eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_38 = {
    Text = "My lord, please have mercy... Let her go, and I will do anything..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_39 = {
    Text = "I'll stay in the hall forever, just as you hoped. No more running around..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Have you conceived an even more delightful training for our little mouse? Do share with the class, 24."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_40 = {Text = "SLAP—!"},
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_41 = {Text = "SLAP—!"},
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
Soon, 24's body is covered in welts.
But she doesn't move, just keeps muttering the same words.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_43 = {
    Text = "<Shake:L-Let her go... Please...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_44 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Let her go...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Bring it on, losers! Don't..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_46 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Don't hurt my sis...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_47 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Crap... Can't move a muscle. Need to retrieve that Silver Key...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Hmm, enough amusement for now. Someone, do drag her away."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_49 = {
    Text = "At your command!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_5 = {
    Text = "My lady... She's just an ordinary child from the slums. She poses no threat."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_50 = {
    Text = "No... I'm not leaving. You haven't said yes..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_51 = {
    Text = "<Big:Enough talk. Move!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Despite 24's futile resistance, they dragged her away like a rag."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_53 = {
    Text = "As she passes by, 24 suddenly looks up and lunges at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Key... %player%, the Silver Key, you can use it in battle, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_55 = {
    Text = "What in the...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_56 = {
    Text = "That silver key worked on me! Link me, let's save her together!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_57 = {
    Text = "No, you're not an Awakener. I can't possibly—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_58 = {Text = "BANG!"},
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Don't have funny ideas, or I'll blow your brains out right now!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Can we just let her go..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_60 = {
    Text = "This punch does not make 24 flinch. Miraculously, she breaks free from her restraints and lunges toward you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_61 = {
    Text = "She yanks the Silver Key from your chest and places it in your palm."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Catch her, don't let her get away!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_63 = {
    Text = "You never know without trying! I've been experimented on; perhaps I can be like them..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_64 = {
    Text = "You hold it, and I can fight, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_65 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Alright. I'll give it a shot."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_67 = {
    Text = "You activate the Silver Key in your hand. Its cold glimmer shines on your chest, illuminating 24's face—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Pale, fragile, yet unwavering."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_69 = {
    Text = "24, I command you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Three times."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_8 = {
    Text = "She called me swine 3 times, idiot 2 times, and @2 5 times."
  },
  AvgDialog_18940_Content_9 = {
    Text = "She offended George! Jenkin must die! Must die!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Medic's Manual"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Help... help me... it's eating me alive—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Black D-Slime oozed from her eye sockets, thick and ceaseless, yet she seemed not to notice."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Ugly thing! George doesn't wanna look at that ugly thing!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I reached out and pressed my palm over her right eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_14 = {
    Text = "This is better, m-much nicer. Do you want to survive?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The girl nodded with all her might."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, I'll fulfill your wish."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_17 = {
    Text = "But in another way."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_18 = {
    Text = "There you are, Mr. Rogers."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_19 = {
    Text = "And you are...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_2 = {
    Text = "It is a black, viscous substance."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You can call me <Yellow:Herbert>. I'm very interested in your wax arts... There's a nice bar across the street. Care for a drink?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You shared a drink together. What happened afterward?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Later, I accepted <Blue:Mr. Herbert>'s invitation to join him in researching some t-topics."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_23 = {
    Text = "In return, he would provide me with some \"materials\" for wax sculptures."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Understood. I have fully grasped your story, so..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Mr. Rogers, you killed \"Mr. Wax.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_26 = {
    Text = "You killed the woman in the snow."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You killed those children as well. Am I correct?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_28 = {
    Text = "I... I never..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Oh? I saw them clearly at the workhouse—those missing children."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_3 = {
    Text = "It gushes from underground fissures, drips along the veins of leaves, and even flows from people's mouths."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Mr. Rogers, since you have chosen to undergo treatment, please be honest with me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_31 = {
    Text = "We need trust between us."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Does it t-truly matter, Miss Clementine?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Whether it is important depends on your answer. Before that, everything remains unknown."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_34 = {
    Text = "However, sometimes this sense of the unknown is what exactly attracts us..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Sorry, Mr. Rogers, I shouldn't have pressed you like that."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Stop playing games, bitch. You're enjoying Master Rogers' agony, aren't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Master Rogers never tells lies."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_38 = {
    Text = "We never killed; we just... helped."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_39 = {
    Text = "We make their wax sculpture dreams come true."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_4 = {
    Text = "We call it \"Dissolution.\" It's everywhere, yet invisible."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Wrong person? No way, you're wearing their clothes..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_41 = {
    Text = "The \"Primavera\" is a collection of wax sculptures. Are you saying we're all your sisters?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_42 = {
    Text = "There was a time when Master Rogers dressed us in matching little outfits, like perfect frozen mannequins."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_43 = {
    Text = "The woman lifts the hem of her dress, rubs it gently, then brings it to her nose to sniff."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Eww, it stinks. A shame I haven't worn decent clothing in ages."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Did you just say <Yellow:Master Rogers?> Are you one of his subordinates?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Well that's another question. What will you... give me in return?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_47 = {
    Text = "In return? Very well, here it is."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Ramona takes a deep breath and suddenly thrusts her sword into Leigh's shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_49 = {Text = "Ramona!!!"},
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_5 = {
    Text = "People infected by Dissolution will gradually be forgotten by the world."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Stand down. I know what I'm doing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Now Miss, we're short on time. Can you give us a straight answer?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_52 = {
    Text = "The woman's pale face flushes red. She trembles as she laughs."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_53 = {
    Text = "...Good... So wonderfully good... The pain is just perfect..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_54 = {
    Text = "If you have questions, by all means... ask away."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Who gave you the instruction?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Sorry... This is the one answer I can never give you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_57 = {Text = "And why?"},
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Because of love."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_59 = {Text = "...Huh?"},
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Letters, records, photos... All evidence of his existence will be erased. It's as if..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Agonizing, scorching, hopeless love!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Upon her frozen altar, I offer my sobs, my whispers, and my most..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Precious soul!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_63 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Why did you become an Awakener?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_65 = {
    Text = "To survive, obviously. My sacred vow to @1..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_66 = {
    Text = "The woman gently strokes the blurred black code on her wrist, her voice soft and mellifluous."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_67 = {
    Text = [[
See this? They brand each successful specimen with a code.
Our <Blue:special, unique, irreplaceable>...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_68 = {
    Text = "\"They\"... You're referring to the Sculptors' Association?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_69 = {
    Text = "She does not respond, seemingly confirming your guess."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_7 = {
    Text = "They have never been in this world."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_70 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Is someone like her really my sis...? What do you think, Brown?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_72 = {
    Text = "The mouse leaps onto her shoulder, nuzzling against her affectionately."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_73 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Oh dear, mice love me as they always do."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Rotting, sprouting sewer-dwellers share such curious kinship with rodents."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_76 = {
    Text = "You've been in sewers too? No way this is coincidence..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Bang! Bang—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_78 = {
    Text = "The inquiry barely ends when dull thuds echo from the depths of the cellar."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_79 = {
    Text = "You hold your breath, hearing intermittent, muffled cries—low and repressed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Winter, AF @2
Londinium]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_80 = {Text = "Hungry..."},
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_81 = {
    Text = "<Change>Hungry... I'm so hungry HUNGRY HUNGRY HUNGRY"
  },
  AvgDialog_18941_Content_9 = {
    Text = "It was a winter night six years ago when I first saw snow in Londinium—and the girl lying in it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18942_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You sound exhausted. Are you hurt?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18942_Content_2 = {
    Text = "We've lost contact with Miss Doll. What's your status?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18942_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Hey, seen a girl taller than me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18942_Content_4 = {
    Text = "*Cough cough*... One at a time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18943_Content_1 = {
    Text = "A pale, thin young woman leans against the wall. Her eyes are half-closed, her face flushed, and her breathing extremely rapid."
  },
  AvgDialog_18943_Content_10 = {
    Text = "A sharp pain, like a needle piercing deeply, stabs into your neck, going deeper and deeper..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18943_Content_11 = {Text = "<Big:?!>"},
  AvgDialog_18943_Content_12 = {
    Text = "In your ear, you hear greedy sucking and swallowing. Something soft and cold clings to your neck like a suction cup."
  },
  AvgDialog_18943_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Ugh... Back... back off...!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18943_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Give it to me, give it to me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18943_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The feeling of rapid blood loss is unbearable. Your vision darkens, and your heartbeat accelerates."
  },
  AvgDialog_18943_Content_16 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18943_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I said... <Big:Scram!!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18943_Content_2 = {
    Text = "She looks hurt. Let me examine her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18943_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The woman wears a thin white dress, similar to the other two wax sculptures, and still has makeup on her face."
  },
  AvgDialog_18943_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Could this be Miss Mason? Hmm, there's something odd about her neck..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18943_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The iron shackles almost embed into the fair neck, adorned with a blood-red gem."
  },
  AvgDialog_18943_Content_6 = {
    Text = "For some reason, you are entranced, greedily gazing at the flickering light on the gemstone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18943_Content_7 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Hehe... Shiny, shiny...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18943_Content_8 = {
    Text = "<Shake:So thirsty... so thirsty... Give it to me, give it to me...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18943_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Head... My head is spinning..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Three Rules"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_10 = {
    Text = "She is a guest at the wax museum, not the target of our investigation."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Let me reiterate: we're acting as visitors to this wax museum..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_12 = {
    Text = "...and don't do or say anything stupid—You've talked my ears off!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Good. Let's move in."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
21:55, Rogers Wax Museum
Front Hall]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The furnishings are old and dusty, with a faint stench lingering in the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_16 = {
    Text = "A girl sits at the front desk, engrossed in a magazine titled \"Animal Care Guide\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Good evening, ma'am. Pardon me, is this the Rogers Wax Museum?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_18 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Is it now open to visitors?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ding-dong..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_20 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Hm hm hm, la la la..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_22 = {
    Text = "How unfortunate. Looks like this lady has some hearing problems. Let's just go in."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Jeez, such rudeness right from the start. If you're trying to catch my eye..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Then congratulations, sweetie... You just did."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_25 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Pfft. Sweetie?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Welcome, darlings! I am Pandia, curator of the Rogers Wax Museum. A pleasure, truly!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Now, what brings you here at this ungodly hour? Seeking artistic enlightenment... or are you little thieves, here to steal specimens like those prying medical students?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_29 = {
    Text = "...Medical students? Steal specimens?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A wave of intense dizziness washes over you as you open the door."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Oh my! Unless... you're here for some @2 with little ol' me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_31 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Wait... Did my mind just censor something unspeakable...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_32 = {
    Text = "We're huge fans of Master Rogers! Came to see his masterpiece—the, uh... the B-Ba..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_33 = {
    Text = "<Big:...The Baltic Sea's Primadonna! Right?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_34 = {
    Text = "...Not bad, at least she knows the Baltic Sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Wait, was it the Bosnian Prima Donna? Barbarossa? ...Or Banana?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Jenkin. No one asked."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Forgive us. My friend may lack refinement, but her passion for art burns brighter than any scholar's."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_38 = {
    Text = "I believe she meant to say <Italic:Botticelli's Primavera.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Hmm... Is that so?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Your vision darkens, and you seem to hear a faint electric current."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Sorry to let you down, sweetie, but Master Rogers happens to have an outing tonight."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_41 = {
    Text = "WHAT?! Then how are we supposed to—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_42 = {
    Text = "<Big:Jenkin.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_43 = {
    Text = [[
Ahem... I mean... It's fine. If that creep...
If Mr. Rogers isn't here, we'll just look around ourselves...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_44 = {Text = "Hmm..."},
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_45 = {
    Text = [[
The Primavera is Master Rogers' trinity of passion, genius, and sheer deviance!
Since your taste isn't utterly wretched...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_46 = {
    Text = "I might let you in—if you promise to behave."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Now, sweethearts, are you gonna behave?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_48 = {Text = "Yes."},
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Hmm... Boring."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Then a fragrance—a blend of violet and cardamom, with a hint of unique wood scent."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Okay then, rule-abiding little lambs. Come on over. Keep your tails between your legs."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_51 = {Text = "No."},
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_52 = {
    Text = [[
It's okay, it's okay.
I LOVE teaching disobedient guests a lesson!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Three days, and I'll make you all docile, good little lambs."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_54 = {
    Text = "She leads you to the exhibition hall's entrance and strikes an authoritative stance, every bit the proper curator."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Listen closely, sweeties.\nThree rules must never—ever—be broken!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_56 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:First: Do not touch the waxworks.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_57 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Second: Do not lift their covers.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_58 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Third: No blood shall spill upon these halls.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Three rules. Simple, yes?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Sniff sniff... Something smells amazing!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_60 = {
    Text = "How... peculiar. Did Mr. Rogers devise these?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Commercial secrets, hon."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Yeah right. Like rules ever stopped me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_63 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:Bet I could do whatever I want and you wouldn't notice...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_64 = {
    Text = [[
Aww, naughty mice are so delightfully tiresome.
A free tip from me, then.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_65 = {
    Text = "<Italic:You wouldn't want to try your luck.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Break them, and the consequences will make granny's shattered rouge pots look like a trifle."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Tch. Spooky act needs work."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_68 = {
    Text = [[
One last thing: We don't do guided tours.
So if anything... unfortunate befalls you...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Well, that's your problem."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_7 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Now, please enjoy your time at the exhibition!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_8 = {
    Text = "A woman sways gracefully past you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18944_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Hey, who's there—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18945_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Found it, the \"Primavera\"!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18945_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You look in the direction pointed by 24."
  },
  AvgDialog_18945_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The graceful wax sculptures in gossamer gowns dance hand in hand under the crimson moonlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_18945_Content_4 = {
    Text = "If not for their twisted smiles and tear-streaked makeup, this would be a delightful piece of art."
  },
  AvgDialog_18945_Content_5 = {
    Text = "One is missing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18945_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Mason, portraying the \"Chaste\" goddess Sereya, should be positioned in the center."
  },
  AvgDialog_18945_Content_7 = {Text = "Help..."},
  AvgDialog_18945_Content_8 = {
    Text = "A faint cry for help comes from the corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_18945_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Help... help me... it's eating me alive—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
22:30, Rogers Wax Museum
Front Hall]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Wax sculpture? But she was just talking to us!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Hey! Quit playing dead!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_12 = {
    Text = "<Italic:Hehe...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_13 = {
    Text = "A shadow lurking in the corner swiftly darts out and shoves Jenkin hard."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_14 = {
    Text = "What's that noise... Hey!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Jenkin falls unexpectedly towards Pandia. The moment they touch, she is sucked into a sticky, soft whirlpool."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Ugh! Who, <Big:who's shoving me—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Jenkin instinctively withdraws her hand. When she comes back to senses, she feels a cold, damp sensation in her palm."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_18 = {
    Text = "In her hand, she tightly clutches a piece of intestine made from wax."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_19 = {
    Text = "<Big:Aaaaah—!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Miss Pandia, may we use your telephone? We've lost contact with our friend."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Squeak squeak squeak squeak!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_21 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Holy Mary! I shouldn't have stolen Miss Sarah's money...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_22 = {
    Text = "<RedShake:Don't touch, don't touch...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_23 = {
    Text = "<RedShake:It hurts... So much pain...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Crack, crack, crack, crack..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_25 = {
    Text = "From Pandia's body comes the slow creaking of joints, rising and falling rhythmically like breathing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<Red:\"Do not touch the waxworks.\">"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Her eyes keep shifting around, and the corners of her mouth are especially unsettling."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_28 = {
    Text = "<Red:Wax Museum Rule 1: Do not touch the waxworks.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Aww, someone's been a very naughty rulebreaker. How deliciously careless of you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_3 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_30 = {
    Text = "That's, that's not fair! Someone pushed me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Oh dearie me. Our little mouse spins such adorable little lies..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
...and downright vulgar.
I was having such lovely dreams before you emptied my belly.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_33 = {
    Text = "My stomach's growling now, and it's making me blush ever so slightly..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Pandia tilts her head and playfully winks at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Well then, my ill-mannered guests—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_36 = {
    Text = "<Red:Welcome to our little paradise.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_37 = {
    Text = "As Pandia finishes, the candle flame in her belly surges, reducing her body to a puddle of transparent oil wax."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_38 = {
    Text = "All the lights in the hall go out at the same time, and darkness descends like a stage curtain."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Ding—Ding—Ding—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Why is she not responding?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_40 = {
    Text = "The bell tolls twelve times. That's when you realize that it's already midnight."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_41 = {
    Text = "The rustling sounds grow clearer. Before you realize it, the wax sculptures have surrounded you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_42 = {
    Text = "They giggle, their drawn-out tones echoing in the empty showroom."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_43 = {
    Text = "<RedShake:Heheheh...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_44 = {
    Text = "<RedShake:Eat them all, gobble them up till nothing remains!!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Jenkin waves her hand in front of Pandia and makes a few funny faces at her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_6 = {
    Text = "<Big:Hee-hee-ha! Dumb pig! Ugly freak!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_7 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Tch, boring."
  },
  AvgDialog_18946_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The hallway lighting was dim earlier, but now I can see clearly... she appears to be a wax sculpture."
  },
  AvgDialog_18947_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Scared, Brown? Just us now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18947_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak! (Brown isn't afraid, squeak. Keep going, squeak!)"
  },
  AvgDialog_18947_Content_3 = {Text = "ROAAARRR!"},
  AvgDialog_18947_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Tch, monsters still here... Half their bodies seem invisible."
  },
  AvgDialog_18947_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak squeak... (%player% said that ordinary people and mice like us can't see the Disso-something.)"
  },
  AvgDialog_18947_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Whatever, if we can't win, we run. That's my specialty!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18947_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Brown, keep up! Let's bolt!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18947_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Squeak! (I'm coming, squeak!)"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_1 = {
    Text = "AAAAAHHHHHH! <Shake:MAKE IT STOP!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Who am I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Yeah... Who am I, really?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Name, I can no longer remember it... <Red:It's gone... all gone...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Here's a new face I've customized for you. Do you like it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Who... is this? Who is the monster in the mirror?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Who are you? Who is the person in the mirror? None of this matters."
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Forget your past; it's nothing but a pile of scrap paper."
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Remember your experiment ID, <Blue:24>—it will stay with you for life."
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_18 = {
    Text = "<Shake:My life... it's all over... completely over...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_19 = {
    Text = "If you call your miserable and meaningless existence a \"life\"..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The woman tightly clutches her own neck. Her facial muscles twitch non-stop, and her eyes move rapidly, almost bulging out of their sockets."
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Yes, it has indeed left you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_21 = {
    Text = "No, no... I curse you all! <Red:Every last one of you!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_22 = {
    Text = "<Red:I curse you all, I curse you all...><RedBig:YOU WILL GO TO HELL!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_23 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_24 = {
    Text = "24... I remember now. <Shake:Just a number... just a number...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Nice to meet you. You can just call me 24. <Italic:...for now.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_26 = {
    Text = "24? What kind of weird name is that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_27 = {
    Text = "24 huddles in the corner, shaking her head desperately and refusing to say another word."
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_28 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
You seem reluctant to discuss your past. What about the wax museum?
Would you be willing to share some information?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Her spirit is becoming unstable... %player%, use the Silver Key to stabilize her now!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_30 = {
    Text = "For example, about these \"Three Rules\"..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_31 = {
    Text = "<Big:Shh!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Don't say it out loud, <Blue:\"they\"> will hear. <Shake:They're always listening...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_33 = {Text = "\"They?\""},
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_34 = {
    Text = "24 glances around warily before adopting a mysterious tone and leaning closer to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_35 = {
    Text = "<Shake:They are... right here...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The \"Three Rules\" are the taboos of this wax museum; they must never be broken."
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Ahem, I already broke one earlier."
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_38 = {
    Text = "<Big:What?!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_39 = {
    Text = "How could you, how could you be so careless?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_4 = {Text = "Got it!"},
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Oops, my bad. Besides waking up the wax figures, what else happens if you break rules?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_41 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Oh no, they're coming for me, they're coming for me...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_42 = {
    Text = "24 anxiously tugs at her hair, even pulling it out along with pieces of scalp."
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Hey... hey! Doesn't that hurt?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_44 = {
    Text = "<Shake:They've found me, they've found me...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Dark red arms slowly emerge from her body, gently wrapping around her neck, and then—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_46 = {Text = "SNAP!"},
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Ahhh, her head—!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Like a doll with its spring removed, 24's head droops heavily, her long hair almost covering her entire face."
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Click. Click. Click."
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You quickly pull out the Silver Key from your chest, its cold white glimmer slicing through the night sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_50 = {
    Text = "With the sound of bones breaking and reforming, she raises her head again, but her expression is quite different from before."
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Heh... hehehe... <Red:Too late... too late for all of us...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_52 = {
    Text = "<Red:Kill...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_53 = {
    Text = "<BigBoldRed:I'll @1 you all!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_6 = {Text = "UGH!"},
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_7 = {
    Text = "What's going on...? <Shake:Why... why can't I think straight?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Stay back! And answer my questions!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18948_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Who are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18949_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak squeak! (Jenkin, hurry up! The Disso-something is spreading and has already reached the vents, squeak!)"
  },
  AvgDialog_18949_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Looks like I'm trapped... got to deal with them quickly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18949_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Squeak... Squeak squeak. (But you're covered in... Anyway, let's get out. I won't leave you no matter what, squeak.)"
  },
  AvgDialog_18949_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Thanks, Brown!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18950_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Finally, the master office! William said key's in the desk."
  },
  AvgDialog_18950_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ignoring Brown's advice, Jenkin plunges into the unseen darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_18950_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A desk made of walnut wood floats crookedly on the black river, like a solitary island."
  },
  AvgDialog_18950_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Sniff sniff... squeak squeak! (Stay away! It smells really strange here, squeak!)"
  },
  AvgDialog_18950_Content_4 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18950_Content_5 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Need to go. Sis and %player% are waiting.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18950_Content_6 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Squeak, squeak... (But... but...)>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18950_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
Just a little bit won't kill me, right?
Might just catch a cold, school'll treat me free.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18950_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Maybe they'll even pay us big for the injury."
  },
  AvgDialog_18950_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Wish me luck, Brown."
  },
  AvgDialog_18951_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Huff... Huff... Monsters everywhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_18951_Content_2 = {
    Text = "There's no turning back now. Brown, take the key and go ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_18951_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Squeak! Squeak squeak... (Are you kidding? We're leaving this place to eat a lot of cheese together! We'll be rich with all this loot!)"
  },
  AvgDialog_18951_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Squeak! (No more living in a shabby house, squeak!)"
  },
  AvgDialog_18951_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Alright... I'll hang on a little longer. Let's get out of here together."
  },
  AvgDialog_18952_Content_1 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Must get out... Must...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18952_Content_2 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Sis, Ramona, %player%... waiting for me...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18952_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You were never alone. You have me, and you have us."
  },
  AvgDialog_18952_Content_4 = {
    Text = "There's still so much I could learn from you, <Blue:\"Master Street Survivalist\">."
  },
  AvgDialog_18952_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Got the key... Can't fail now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18952_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Squeak... (Jenkin...)"
  },
  AvgDialog_18952_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Don't look at me like that, Brown... Not over yet."
  },
  AvgDialog_18952_Content_8 = {
    Text = "If I die here, take the key to them."
  },
  AvgDialog_18952_Content_9 = {
    Text = "...Squeak, squeak squeak. (...Alright, squeak. I promise you, Jenkin.)"
  },
  AvgDialog_18953_Content_1 = {
    Text = "41, 42, 43, 45..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18953_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Wait a minute, what happened to Number 44?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18953_Content_3 = {
    Text = "41, 42, 43, 45..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18954_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You again? Didn't learn your lesson?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18954_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You... What did you say?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18954_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Try that again and next time it won't be just a key!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18954_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Outrageous..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18954_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Quick, capture them all!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Behind the Veil"
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_10 = {
    Text = "No, don't leave me alone..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_11 = {
    Text = "My child... Before you leave, I have a gift for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_12 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Take my eyes to it. Let them speak for me and watch over you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You'll surpass me. Remember this—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_15 = {
    Text = "No agony can touch you now, nor ever defeat you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_16 = {
    Text = "They will meld into the art you create, achieving eternal beauty."
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Rogers stares into George's familiar eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Mr. Wax... I-I don't understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_19 = {
    Text = "If no suffering can harm me, then why... do I feel like crying now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Come here, child, come quickly..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Answer me... Answer me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_21 = {
    Text = "<Change>Ahhhhh... Rogers, Rogers..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
George opens his mouth, but only black goo comes out.
It will never be able to answer that question.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Master Rogers, your hand and those... things... they're merging!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_24 = {
    Text = "No response from Rogers. And no more will ever come from him."
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_25 = {
    Text = "<Small:We must flee now, or we'll all...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_26 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Master Rogers, I know you'll despise me for this, but—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_28 = {Text = "Splash!!"},
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
The whip coils around Rogers' arm, tearing it off.
Blood gushes out, staining Rogers' coat red.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Mr. Wax...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_30 = {
    Text = "<Red:AHHH—!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_31 = {
    Text = "<Red:My hand, my hand...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_32 = {
    Text = "George loses his grip. The wailing wax sculptures cling to him, all sliding towards the chasm."
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_33 = {
    Text = "<Change>No, don't..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_34 = {
    Text = "His right hand, creator of countless wax sculptures, plunges with him into the endless abyss."
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_35 = {
    Text = "<Red:AAAAHHHHH—!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_36 = {
    Text = "<Red:Pandia, what are you doing... my hand...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I'll escort Master Rogers to safety. Leigh, entertain our guests!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_38 = {Text = "...Huh?"},
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_4 = {
    Text = "In the long, solitary beam of light, the boy walks alone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_5 = {
    Text = "He walks through the passage, following the call, approaching Mr. Wax step by step."
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The man is immersed in a crimson pool of wax, tears streaming down the grooves on his face."
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Mr. Wax, w-what are you doing?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_8 = {
    Text = "This failing vessel has lasted longer than expected..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18955_Content_9 = {
    Text = "To perish in wax—what sublime poetry."
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_1 = {
    Text = "No, there are far too many of them."
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Your consciousness continues to dive, gradually getting deeper, until it touches upon something strange—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Like something from light-years away in the depths of the universe, ancient, across countless stars and spans of space-time, delivering familiar yet strange messages."
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
<Change>H's ymg'...
It's you...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Countless aged voices converge, resonating like organ chords throughout the universe."
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You are no stranger to their language.\nIt's strange—considering you always fail Ancient Language."
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
<Change>Y' ymg' kadishtu ephainog ephaii...
I knew you would return...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Who are you...? What are you...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_17 = {
    Text = "What is this place?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The voices ignore your questions. They stir, they shout, and extend an invitation to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
<Change>Llll nog c'...
Let's leave together...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_2 = {
    Text = "They keep coming back!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
Ya uh'@1.
My @2...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You float in the boundless starry sky as countless meteors streak past you and flow into your body."
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Their heat almost melts your organs. You feel as if bathing a golden sun, filled with power."
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_23 = {
    Text = "In the ebb and flow of consciousness, William's indifferent voice—accompanied by the rhythmic ticking of instruments—faintly lingers in your ears."
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_24 = {
    Text = "98%, 99%..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The rift is about to close... Hold on for five more minutes, %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_3 = {Text = "No—"},
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You are once again enveloped in white wax."
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The wax greedily sucks blood, seemingly never satisfied, until it detects a peculiar taste."
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The familiar, intimate scent that belongs to @2."
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You are pulled into a deep vortex."
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
The intricate memories unfold before you like a scroll. Joyful, sorrowful, painful...
Not only your memories, but also those of others.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18956_Content_9 = {
    Text = "What... is that..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Tsk, a bit more troublesome than I thought."
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_10 = {Text = "Bam! Bam!"},
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Brother, you are shot!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Don't mind me. Just go!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_13 = {
    Text = "No, I'm not leaving... It was I who ruined you, it was I who ruined everyone..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Why, why would you do this for someone like me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
Sorry, Leigh.
I will repay the years you were locked underground with my life.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Now we're even."
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Go. Don't look back. You still have a life ahead..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_18 = {Text = "Farewell."},
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Brother... I remember... I remember everything now..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Leigh, stop gawking. Didn't you vow to be my shield?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_20 = {Text = "Leigh...?"},
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_21 = {
    Text = "I knew all her sweet nothings were lies... How infuriating, how positively maddening!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Stand properly behind me and make yourself useful, or suffer the consequences!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_3 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Leigh's gaze drifts across you for a moment, then settles on the clasped hands of Jenkin and 24."
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_5 = {
    Text = "How strange, seeing you two like this... it reminds me of something far away and..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Something I've never known..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Latest news! According to sources, The <Blue:Vampire Siblings> were recently spotted in Londinium!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Just 5 Pence to uncover the shocking scandal of the Cavendish family! 23 homeless people have already fallen victim..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18957_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Found them! They're just ahead! We must capture them this time!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Get 'em! Brown!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I-it's okay, Miss Clementine."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I feel much lighter and more at ease now, and my mood has calmed down after the wax sculpture was damaged."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Is this the magic of psychotherapy? It seems to have something in common with wax art..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_13 = {Text = "Tsk."},
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_14 = {
    Text = "George, say goodbye to Miss Clementine."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_15 = {Text = "...Hmph."},
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Goodbye—Miss Clementine."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_17 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Sob... And that's it. Even Mr. Lawrence...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_18 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Hehehe, so stupid, so very stupid...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_19 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Punish her now, peel her face right off!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Quiet, everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_20 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Punishment! Punishment! Punishment...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Hush now, my precious ones."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_22 = {
    Text = "What an annoyance! This is just a humble wax museum—why must everyone come poking around?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_23 = {
    Text = "<Big:Boom—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_24 = {Text = "Waaah..."},
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_25 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Ah! What was that noise? Could it be...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Waking, it's waking up... Run away!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_27 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_28 = {
    Text = "All fled? How pathetically dull."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Master Rogers, do come out. I spotted darling little George!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Everyone falls silent. The muffled sobs turn into long, continuous shrieks."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Those darlings wouldn't weep without cause. You've returned, haven't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_31 = {
    Text = "G-good evening, Pandia."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Did you enjoy your little chat with Miss Clementine today? I paid such a pretty penny for your treatment!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Pandia, h-hurry and leave this place quickly! And take George with you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Leave here? What absurd nonsense are you spouting, Master Rogers?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_35 = {
    Text = "We've already imprisoned an in-investigator, and now another has arrived..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_36 = {
    Text = "I have a b-bad feeling. Mythag seems to have locked their eyes on me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Fret not, Master Rogers. Let your Pandia handle these tedious trifles!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_38 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:I've planted a darling little mole among them, and sweet George will assist too. Flawless!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Did you just mention the master returning?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Half wailing, half terror, like an echo from hells."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Am I correct in assuming your real goal is to delay us until Rogers arrives?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Yes, yes! I'm guilty of endless sins, utterly unforgivable..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_42 = {
    Text = "<Big:Punish me harder!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_43 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Personally, I hope you're not Miss Mason, so I won't have to hold back."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_45 = {
    Text = "%player%, shall we investigate the creatures underground?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_46 = {Text = "Of course."},
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_47 = {
    Text = "There could be Rogers' victims down there. We can't just walk away."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_48 = {
    Text = "That's right. Let's find a passage leading underground."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_49 = {Text = "No."},
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_5 = {
    Text = "After an indeterminate time, the sounds fade."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_50 = {
    Text = "My gut tells me there's something wrong with that sound. We should keep our distance."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Remember, Keeper: We're here for investigation, not sightseeing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_52 = {
    Text = "No way you can deny that. You realize that your survival instinct has overcome your sense of duty."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_53 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:Y-You've got a point...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Good. Let's look for an access to underground areas."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Trapdoor here. Goes underground!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Yee—Hey—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_57 = {
    Text = "You use all your strength, but the trapdoor merely opens a crack."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_58 = {
    Text = "No good, it won't budge."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Our time to shine."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Wh-What's that..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_60 = {Text = "Brown, go!"},
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_61 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
Oh my. The master has returned.
The <Blue:precious pets> in the basement have missed him terribly.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
23:00, Dr. Fairfax's Clinic
One Hour Ago]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18958_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
Time's up. Thank you for your cooperation, Mr. Rogers.
I apologize for the slight misunderstanding that occurred earlier.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_1 = {Text = "Epilogue"},
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Don't forget me, okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_11 = {
    Text = "No Silver Core means she's truly, completely gone... Could someone have deliberately taken it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Or is there some clue I'm missing..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Doll said you've been skipping class a lot recently. Turns out you're here chatting with a teacher?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_14 = {Text = "Ms. Czort!"},
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, I'm not here to check your attendance. William's back. Maybe you'd like to talk to him?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I heard he's tracked down Rogers and handed him over to the Committee."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_17 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Understood... I'll go talk to him."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Goodbye, Mr. Alistair, Ms. Czort."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
One month later
Mythag, Restricted Area A-001]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The footsteps gradually fade away, followed by the heavy hum of the elevator operating."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_21 = {
    Text = "It's been a month, and {Male=he,Female=she} still can't accept that Jenkin is gone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
{Male=He is blaming himself.,Female=She is blaming herself.}
Everyone goes through this. Give {Male=him,Female=her} some time.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Long time no see, Alistair. How have you been holding up?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Talking about \"feelings\" with an old boy like me seems unnecessary."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Judging from %player%'s reaction, are you now the dean of Mythag?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Acting Dean. And... your intelligence network needs updating."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Apologies. Not many dare discuss Mythag with me these days.\nStill, congratulations on your promotion—you've earned it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Heh... This is more burden than honor."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_29 = {
    Text = "People are starting to forget those who died from Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Heard you went to the wax museum with the Committee today. Any findings?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_30 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Existential Erasure.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_31 = {
    Text = "I remember it was... AF 290 or 291. Herbert proposed his hypothesis—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_32 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:The D-phenomenon's end is the erasure of one's very existence.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_33 = {
    Text = "He was the academy's brightest star. Who could predict he'd murder his mentor so brutally?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Was it truly unpredictable? I warned them a long time ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Only poison grows in darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
Existential erasure was rare before.
Now the signs multiply...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I've alerted the Committee to watch for symptoms. Yet..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Nearly three centuries since AF 15's first Dissolution case."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_39 = {
    Text = "We still understand almost nothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You shake your head."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_40 = {
    Text = "I suspect... this new Keeper might be our key to uncovering the truth."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_41 = {
    Text = "That {Male=he,Female=she} remembers the Dissolution victims at all marks {Male=him,Female=her} as extraordinary."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_42 = {
    Text = "{Male=He,Female=She} will surpass us all."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_43 = {
    Text = "No. 44 Southwark Street, Ruins of the Wax Museum"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_44 = {
    Text = "What a ruin. Within three days, this place will turn into a pool of black mud and then completely vanish."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Where is Rogers?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_46 = {
    Text = "He and Pandia are now being hunted by the Committee hounds. Last time we met, it was in a sanatorium in Cité."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_47 = {
    Text = "They've been running wild for too long. They need this lesson."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Before leaving, Pandia gave me something, saying it was a token of apology for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_49 = {
    Text = "What is this... a personnel file?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Completely Dissoluted, without even a Silver Core fragment."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Open it and see. Surprises await inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_51 = {
    Text = "%player%...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Date of birth unknown... Admitted by Mythag last year. Never trained, yet able to link multiple Awakeners in battle..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Interesting. Who would have thought Mythag had this up their sleeve."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Looks like the \"Lantern Event\" didn't teach them a harsh enough lesson back then."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_55 = {
    Text = "It's time to visit the academy and pay my respects at the grave of my dearest mentor."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_56 = {
    Text = [[
Outskirts of Londinium
Shoreditch Cemetery]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_57 = {Text = "Miss 24."},
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_58 = {
    Text = "{Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%! What brings you here...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_59 = {
    Text = "To pay my respects to Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Few people produce Silver Cores after death. I thought you would have understood that by now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_60 = {
    Text = "You crouch down and gently brush away the debris on the small tombstone. It is blank; you have not yet decided to engrave any words on it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_61 = {
    Text = "As if... once the words are inscribed, Jenkin's departure will become a reality."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Miss 24, why didn't you reveal your true identity back at the wax museum?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_63 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Back then, I was so confused and scared... If Jenkin saw me like this, she would be heartbroken."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Jenkin's tougher than she looks—she can handle the truth."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Yes... she has always been the bravest and strongest girl I've ever seen."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_67 = {
    Text = "I heard about the academy. No trace of Jenkin's Silver Core, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_68 = {
    Text = "William hasn't found anything yet. But don't worry, Miss 24."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_69 = {
    Text = "I'll personally interrogate Rogers once we get him."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_7 = {
    Text = "But Jenkin's different..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_70 = {
    Text = "24 shakes her head."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_71 = {
    Text = "I know you won't give up. I'm just worried... my memories of Jenkin are starting to fade."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_72 = {
    Text = "I fear that one day I'll walk right past her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_73 = {
    Text = "I'll tell you when you've forgotten her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_74 = {
    Text = "That how you met, how you lived together, how she rescued you, and how she became our legendary hero..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_75 = {
    Text = "You words gradually faded, eventually dispersing in the gentle breeze."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Squeak... Squeak..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_77 = {
    Text = "A faint sound suddenly reaches your ears with a rhythmic cadence."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_78 = {
    Text = "A mouse... <Big:Brown?!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_79 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Help me, I'll return your wallet and ID, keep it secret.
Don't help... hehe!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_80 = {
    Text = "It sounds... near."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_81 = {
    Text = "You quickly turn around, and there it is—a plump little mouse in the grass behind the tombstone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Snore... Snore..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_83 = {
    Text = "The size and color... It IS Brown!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_84 = {
    Text = "You and 24 exclaim in unison."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_85 = {
    Text = "The mouse—missing since the wax museum incident—is not woken by your presence."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_86 = {
    Text = "As if it just survived a thrilling adventure and now lies exhausted at the end of the journey."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Huff... Whew... Zzz..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_88 = {
    Text = "It seems to be holding something..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_89 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_9 = {
    Text = "<Big:...The Baltic Sea's Primadonna! Right?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_90 = {
    Text = "It's a Silver Core. Jenkin's Silver Core."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_91 = {
    Text = "A Silver Core resting between its paws. An unrefined core, emitting a murky glow."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_92 = {
    Text = "From the faint glow, you seem to hear an incredibly joyful and lively heartbeat."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Long time no see, Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_94 = {
    Text = "The sky finally clears. The sun hangs high, casting golden light with just the right amount of warmth."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Wind carries the fresh scent of earth. You and 24 bathe in the warm sunlight and exchange a smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Let's go, Miss 24."
  },
  AvgDialog_18959_Content_97 = {
    Text = "The clouds have cleared, and your adventure has just begun."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Silent Collapse"
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_10 = {
    Text = "But we don't have a choice."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_11 = {
    Text = "We can give it a try."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_12 = {
    Text = "%player%, I need you to remain calm."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The path ahead is flooded with D-Slime. Even Awakeners will be affected by prolonged exposure."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_14 = {
    Text = "We can't go back the way we came. We'll need to find another exit."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Other ways... Other paths..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_16 = {Text = "Got it!"},
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Look, vent over there."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You follow Jenkin's gaze and look up. The small vent is right above you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_19 = {
    Text = "There might be access to the master office, and it should be D-Slime free..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_2 = {
    Text = "4:15, Rogers Wax Museum"
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_20 = {
    Text = "No, this passage is too narrow. We can't get in."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_21 = {Text = "I can."},
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_22 = {
    Text = "I'm the \"little mouse\", am I not?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_23 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_24 = {
    Text = "No, that's too dangerous. We can't be sure if the key is still there, or that this ventilation shaft—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Tch. You talk too much, Miss Ramona. Thought you were more direct."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I'll get this straight: First, there is no other way now, right? Better than waiting to die."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Second, I'll go with Brown. I'm in charge, it fetches the key."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Squeak! Squeak, squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_29 = {Text = "Third..."},
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You stagger through the ruins, your gasps for breath filling the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Caused you lots of trouble. Sis even got hurt for me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_31 = {Text = "So..."},
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Let me help. Can't stand being protected all the time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_33 = {
    Text = "She then leaps into the vent, disappearing instantly, just as she always did while darting through the White Chapel District."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Jenkin...! She never listens to me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Don't underestimate Jenkin. She's more agile than any of us; she'll make it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_36 = {
    Text = "...I believe in her."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Finally, you see the heavy gate ahead. Just a gentle push and—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ugh, locked."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Ahead lies a black ocean, with danger closing in and no retreat possible."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_7 = {
    Text = "This should be the gate William mentioned. The key should be in the master office."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_8 = {
    Text = "We can't go back there."
  },
  AvgDialog_18960_Content_9 = {
    Text = "This place is swimming in D-Slime... Even an Awakener wouldn't last long exposed to this."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_1 = {Text = "Undercanal"},
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ah, so drowsy, so drowsy!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_100 = {
    Text = "In the next second, she flicks her wrist, and scalding wax pours down, blooming into grotesque scarlet petals on her pale arm."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_101 = {
    Text = "Aaaaaah—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_102 = {
    Text = "Oh... such exquisite patterns."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_103 = {
    Text = "George hates loud pigs. Fill her mouth with wax to shut her up."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_104 = {
    Text = "The floating candelabrum flies to Jenkin's face, its steaming heat turning her face bright red."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_105 = {
    Text = "The candleholder is filled with scalding wax, on the verge of spilling over."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_106 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Liar... You said it wouldn't hurt...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_107 = {
    Text = "Apologies, darling, it's been ages since I was human. I'd forgotten how messy it feels..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_108 = {
    Text = "Perfect. You two, come hold her mouth open."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_109 = {
    Text = "Then just pour in the wax, and the sewer rat will be quiet forever."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Be slow again and I'll tuck you into a coffin permanently!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_110 = {
    Text = "Stop... Stop it! She's innocent in all this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_111 = {
    Text = "<Small:Sis... It hurts so bad... it hurts...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_112 = {
    Text = "No... no. I changed my mind! I don't wanna die! Stay back...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_113 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_114 = {
    Text = "...Wait a moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_115 = {
    Text = "In the chaos, you suddenly hear a soft sigh."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_116 = {
    Text = "I said... please wait a moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Sorry, Miss Pandia..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_13 = {
    Text = "<Big:LADY PANDIA—!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_14 = {
    Text = "A woman's figure drifts by like a cloud, her long skirt swirling with a white glow. She kneels prostrate before Pandia."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Lady Pandia! Please don't hurt 24 like this. If someone must be punished..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Let it be me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_17 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I've had a change of heart. You've all been such good pets. You may retreat."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_19 = {
    Text = "My lady, I know you can't bring yourself to scold me. You've always been so kind..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Splendid, the whole gang's here. Now we can prepare Mythag's grand welcoming gift."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_20 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Darling, my sweetest little morsel, would you be a dear and unhand my leg?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Your every wish is my command, Lady Pandia."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Lovely. Just like that... Now turn around, take ten graceful steps, exit this room, and never glance back."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Do we comprehend each other?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
Understood... I'll miss you terribly, Lady Pandia...
No, I already miss you now!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The woman turns around and thoughtfully closes the door before leaving."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_27 = {
    Text = "*Sigh*... How dreadfully tiresome."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_28 = {
    Text = "After making sure the door is tightly closed, Pandia takes a deep breath and returns to her usual energy."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Now my lovelies, where were we?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Though I must say, this moment took an agonizingly long time to arrive."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Breathing... so difficult."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_31 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Stay still. Your makeup requires attention."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Oh dear, the lips need more work. Hmm..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_34 = {
    Text = "It's you, Rogers..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Cold fingers brush against the corner of your lips, and you smell the pungent odor of decay."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_36 = {
    Text = "You try to move, but realize your entire body is trapped in cold, hard machinery."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Splendid. You're ideal sculpture material."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_38 = {
    Text = "%player%, you're awake!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Let me go... Ugh!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_4 = {
    Text = "24, my precious 24, come over."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Don't twitch! It was such effort to arrange you so perfectly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_41 = {
    Text = [[
See that lovely coffin there? Custom-made just for you.
You'll be experiencing a marvelous rebirth!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_42 = {
    Text = "As wax sculptures, naturally. Hehe. What theme shall we choose this time? Let me ponder..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_43 = {
    Text = "No tabby found, though he searched with care—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Searched with care, searched with care..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Ramona... Ramona?! For heaven's sake, stop that singing..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_46 = {
    Text = "She's been like this since I woke up, singing nonstop."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Your companion makes such an adorable sculpture. Master Rogers worked for a full hour."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_48 = {
    Text = "No tabby! Meow!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Well? Isn't it precious? Don't you just want to take it home?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_5 = {
    Text = "...Yes, Lady Pandia."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Tch, get your dirty hands off her!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Rogers, you're the one who knocked me out in the workshop."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_52 = {
    Text = "You're the one who got Aigis and Little Mac killed, made my sis disappear..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_53 = {
    Text = "What is Aigis?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Excuse me, but George doesn't bother with names of thrown-away things and garbage."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Who you calling names?! You pig!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Hmm, isn't it true? You're Jenkin, yes? Sarah told us stories about little Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Little Jenkin was born when her drunk daddy ran away."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Little Jenkin's mom caught Dissolution and went crazy."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_59 = {
    Text = "The crazy woman hits little Jenkin every day with brooms, belts, whatever she finds, while screaming nasty words..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_6 = {Text = "SLAP—!"},
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_60 = {
    Text = "You... You're lying..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Oh yes, her body leaks black slime too. The bed, the floor, everything sticky and wet... Yuck!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Saying that, George gives an exaggerated shiver and then giggles."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_63 = {
    Text = [[
Then the crazy woman ran off alone. Little Jenkin waited by the door, waited and waited...
Where did she go? Nobody knows.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_64 = {
    Text = "No, it's not true..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Ptooey, ptooey, George had to say it! Then little Jenkin went to the welfare house, just another trash pile."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Admit it, you're just street trash washed into Londinium's sewers by the rain!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Even your sister—didn't she leave you with excuses because she was tired of you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Shut up... <Big:SILENCE!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Jenkin trembles, her face deathly pale. She opens her mouth, wanting to say something, but in the end, she just lowers her head in frustration."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The black whip flicks, and 24 is knocked to the ground, with red welts instantly appearing on her body."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Yeah, what right does she have? For rats in the gutter, love is an absolute luxury—a candy they can only dare to reach for in their dreams."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_71 = {
    Text = "A pair of hands gently stroke Jenkin's head."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_72 = {
    Text = "P-poor, broken child. I've known so many like you—unwanted, mistreated."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Let me g-grant you release—as eternal art."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Help us? After what you did to Aigis, to little Mac..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Can you truly claim prolonging their suffering is mercy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_76 = {
    Text = "<Shake:I... I don't know...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_77 = {
    Text = [[
Worry not, lost child.
I'll shape you into breathtaking art, painless as a whisper.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, don't fall for their twisted logic!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_79 = {
    Text = [[
Rogers, you're just fooling yourself.
Do you honestly believe being a wax sculpture erases everything?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_8 = {Text = "Umm...!"},
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_80 = {
    Text = [[
Are they really willing participants?
Can you swear you've never coerced or manipulated your "materials?!"]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Stop fighting."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Kid, you're right. This world's rotten."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_83 = {
    Text = "We're stuck anyway... Now do it. I miss being with Mom."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, I know you're feeling down.\nBut remember why we're here—to find your sister. She's counting on us."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Sorry, %player%. I'm tired."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Maybe this \"sister\" only exists in my head..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Otherwise why hasn't she come to see me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Now that our little mouse has squeaked, what are we dawdling for?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_89 = {
    Text = "24, Leigh, do pour the wax. Nice and slow..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I waited until I nearly turned to stone, and still no sign of you. Had to send George to fetch you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_90 = {
    Text = "...As you command."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Lady Pandia, your words are my sacred text."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_92 = {
    Text = "So you're working together... I see, you're in on it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Heh... I'm such an idiot."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_94 = {
    Text = "The woman, holding a cup filled with wax, walks up to Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Truthfully... the sewers aren't completely awful."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Besides garbage and rotting meals, sometimes I find fresh tinned fish. Once, a bouquet of tulips."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_97 = {Text = "...?"},
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_98 = {
    Text = "Surprised? I know these tunnels better than you know your own reflection."
  },
  AvgDialog_18961_Content_99 = {Text = "Splash—"},
  AvgDialog_18962_Content_1 = {
    Text = "William, are you alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18962_Content_2 = {
    Text = "*Cough cough*... Don't mind me. Carry on the mission."
  },
  AvgDialog_18962_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, William. I'm getting you out of this."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_1 = {
    Text = "<Change>Waaah... AAAAAHHHH!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I see the passage William mentioned! Everyone, stick together and don't wander off!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Oh... Has everyone forgotten about me? I'm here under orders to stop all of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_12 = {
    Text = "<Big:Out of the way!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Leigh smiles at Jenkin and 24, whose hands remain clasped together."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Do you know why I am so familiar with the sewers, little mouse?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_15 = {Text = "...Huh?"},
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_16 = {
    Text = "That day... police officers entered the sewer. All armed with guns."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_17 = {
    Text = "My brother and I supported each other, running, and running..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
My brother was shot. I counted, one by one. 14, 15, 16...
Yes, he was shot a total of 16 times.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
He's riddled with holes, bleeding profusely. His blood smelled delicious. It was so, so enticing...
But I managed to restrain myself.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The mass of gathered wax sculptures collapses."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I didn't drink a single drop of his blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_21 = {
    Text = "What's she babbling about..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_22 = {
    Text = "It's nothing... I just suddenly changed my mind. You all go ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You're just letting us go? Are you really that nice...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Leigh doesn't answer, but simply points ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The passage is over there. I suggest you move quickly, unless you want to die here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_26 = {
    Text = "And what about you...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Leigh looks at you with a hint of surprise, as if confused by your question."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_28 = {
    Text = "She then looks up at the dripping black goo above her and gives a blank smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Goodbye, {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_3 = {
    Text = "George's head rolls to the ground, his large eyes still glaring at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_30 = {
    Text = "As you step out of the basement, you glance back at Leigh."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Black D-Slime flows on the ground and ceiling. Leigh stands in the center of the ruins, as thin as a withered weed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
You can't make out her expression, but you can sense her gaze.
She has been watching you all along.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_4 = {
    Text = "<Change>I am... perfect..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The wax sculpture gradually dissolves, like gray dye blending into a black ocean of Dissolution, leaving no trace behind."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_6 = {
    Text = "So it ends... at last."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_7 = {
    Text = "<Big:Boom—!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_8 = {
    Text = "A black torrent surges forth, swallowing everything in its path."
  },
  AvgDialog_18963_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The wax museum is dissolving completely. We must evacuate now!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Smoke and Violet"
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_10 = {
    Text = "...Five minutes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Rogers, Rogers... so we meet again."
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_12 = {
    Text = "And you are...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The last time I saw you, you were 8 or 9? Sitting among a pile of corpses and wax sculptures."
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_14 = {
    Text = "When your mother took you away, you were crying and refusing to leave."
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Heh... I've been a detective for 30 years. The moment I saw your eyes, I knew you were a complete scoundrel, a real piece of trash."
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_16 = {
    Text = "So, it's you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_17 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:I knew you killed \"Mr. Wax\" from the very beginning.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Tell me, where did you hide him afterward?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_19 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
19:05, Rogers Wax Museum
Four hours ago]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Speak. You're a stutterer, not a mute."
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_21 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_22 = {
    Text = "R-right here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_23 = {Text = "...What?"},
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_24 = {
    Text = "He's everywhere... underground, in the display window, in my nightmares..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_25 = {
    Text = "<Red:and... behind you.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The moment Rogers spoke, a thin red line appeared across the detective's neck."
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_27 = {
    Text = "His head slid from his shoulders, rolling across the ground, eyes still wide open."
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Who's there? Show yourself!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The rich scent of narcissus flows slowly through the night, enveloping William in stacks of pale purple mist."
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_3 = {Text = "Splash—!"},
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Daydreaming isn't a good habit, Investigator."
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
23:30, Rogers Wax Museum
Studio]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Help... help me... it's eating me alive—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_33 = {
    Text = "A woman's voice... Sis?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_34 = {
    Text = "That noise seems to be coming from over there. Let's check it out."
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The detectives swiftly shatter the display window glass, knocking down wax sculptures one by one."
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_5 = {
    Text = "B-brutes, this is a desecration of art..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_6 = {
    Text = "<Big:NOO!!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Mr. Rogers, you are suspected of involvement in the White Chapel District disappearances. According to <Yellow:Treaty Article 112>, we have the right to detain and interrogate you at the Committee."
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_8 = {
    Text = "<Shake:I'll go with you. Just, just don't destroy my work—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18964_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Wait, I have something to say to him."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Where do you brats come from? Are you the ones the curator mentioned...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I bet they stored files here. Let's open it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You use the key to open the cabinet door."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Artbook, paint..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Hmm, fancy engravings on this chisel. Must be worth something..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_14 = {
    Text = "These look like antiques..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Heh... Take it all, take it all..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Brown, we're rich!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_17 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Huh, what's this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_19 = {
    Text = "A newspaper lies quietly in a corner, covered with black mold. It seems to have been there for a long time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You know who we are and still standing there? Watch it or I'll scratch you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_20 = {
    Text = "<Blue:\"The Bizarre Mr. Wax Kidnapping Case?\">"
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_21 = {
    Text = "It appears to document some disturbing events from over ten years back."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The serial killer called <Blue:\"Mr. Wax\"> was never caught..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Miss Sarah talked about this case!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Some killer called \"Mr. Wax\" kidnapped people—about a hundred—turned them into wax sculptures."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_25 = {
    Text = "And then? Was he captured after all?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
Says "never caught" right here.
Cops only found a few victims at his place...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Jenkin wrinkles her nose uncomfortably as she speaks."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
Total psycho.
Couldn't sleep for a week after hearing that story as a kid.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Turning people into wax sculptures... isn't that Rogers' exact MO?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You... we'll see! Stay right here if you dare!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_30 = {
    Text = "But the killer in that photograph definitely isn't Rogers."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You look at the photo of \"Mr. Wax.\" It's a man in his thirties, extremely thin, with deep-set eyes accentuating his prominent cheekbones."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Nothing like the Rogers you remember."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Those eyes... I feel like I've seen them before."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Let's set this aside for now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Lady Chatterley lifts her skirt and quickly exits the studio."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Darn it, they slipped away."
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Heh, good riddance I say!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Now look, what's this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The cabinet key? Nice work, Jenkin!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18965_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Nothing stops Londinium's best thief!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Immortal's Whisper"
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_10 = {
    Text = "A flawless <Yellow:D-Rift>. The museum's beating heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
It warps reality itself.
Through it, discards find rebirth, and our pact was forged.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_12 = {
    Text = "As if responding to their master's return, the wax sculptures laugh even more merrily."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_13 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Rogers... Rogers...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<Shake:La-la-la-la-la~>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Pact...? Could it possibly be...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_16 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Three Rules.> The museum's devoted sentinels, punishing all who defile its beauty."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Countless fragmented wax heads emit unintelligible murmurs, then suddenly turn in unison to glare at you with wide eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_18 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Punish, punish... Hehe...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Oh no, we've been spotted. Move out—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ugh... that hurts..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_20 = {
    Text = "White paraffin spreads rapidly, instantly clinging to the rule-breaking transgressor."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Back off! Ugh..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_22 = {
    Text = "It reaches your chest and is about to crawl into your mouth and eyes。。。"
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Can't... get air..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_24 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_25 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_26 = {Text = "Ding—!"},
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Suddenly, the chime of the Silver Key echoes in your ears."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_28 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Waaa...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_29 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Rogers... Hurt... Hurt...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_3 = {
    Text = "What a stink..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The silver glimmer surges abruptly, revealing a new spell already covering the blood array."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_31 = {
    Text = "It illuminates the darkness behind the Rift, revealing William and his bulky D-Rift Observer."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_32 = {
    Text = "William...! Did you write this spell? It's so beautiful..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_33 = {
    Text = "William glances up briefly, confirms you are safe, and then continues staring at the dial in front of him."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You've arrived just in time. I almost thought you wouldn't make it this far."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_35 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Brown wriggles his hefty body and emerges from the top of William's head."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Brown! Thought I lost you...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Rift closure has progressed to 70%. Leaving now is extremely dangerous. I must stay here to stabilize the fluctuations of the Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_39 = {
    Text = "%player%, please buy me a little more time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Quiet. Look straight ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_40 = {Text = "Roger!"},
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Weren't you knocked out...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Sorry, Mr. Rogers. Sometimes, \"deception\" is an essential skill for Investigators."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Thanks to that woman, I was able to find this place."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Hmph, what a sly Investigator."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Worry not, my master. Our soldiers are not easily defeated."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Now that we're all gathered, let's erase them in one glorious stroke!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_5 = {
    Text = "A massive rift stretches before you, exuding thick black mist from within."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Around the rift, on a complex blood-drawn magic circle, you see a mountain of wax sculpture limbs."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_7 = {
    Text = "They are densely packed, stretching to the ceiling. Countless mouths grin, forming a sea of mirth."
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_8 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Hehehe...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18966_Content_9 = {
    Text = "What... is this...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_1 = {
    Text = "No tabby found, though he searched with care—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Can't control their own fate, can't help others."
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Just like me, watching Aigis disappear right in front of me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Jenkin sniffs suddenly as she speaks."
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Ugh, what am I saying.
I'm no longer a normal person after hanging with you all, heh.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_14 = {Text = "Jenkin..."},
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Ramona lets out a soft sigh and gently pats Jenkin's head."
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_16 = {
    Text = "No wonder you've been upset. Are you blaming yourself? Let me share something with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_17 = {
    Text = "When disaster strikes, it makes no distinction between a Keeper and a street beggar."
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_18 = {
    Text = "This is only my second mission with %player%. I'm barely more experienced than you are."
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_19 = {
    Text = "There's still so much I could learn from you, <Blue:\"Master Street Survivalist\">."
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_2 = {
    Text = "He cried and cried... till Charlie, too, was never there—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_20 = {Text = "Ramona..."},
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You're terrible at comforting people. But thanks anyway."
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Never there!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The cheerful wax sculptures hold hands and wobble through the dim corridors of the wax museum."
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Whew... We're safe, for now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_6 = {
    Text = "This is all my fault... I put everyone in danger."
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Don't blame yourself. There are things normal people can't handle."
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_8 = {
    Text = "...I really envy you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18967_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I hate being normal. Normal people are useless."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
Dang, lost her...
What is this place? Total mess.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_10 = {
    Text = "No lazy rats in my house!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Being neglected, the mouse wobbles its plump body, stumbling toward the corner of the office."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_12 = {
    Text = "In the corner stands a small wax sculpture covered with a white cloth, waiting patiently..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_13 = {
    Text = "...waiting patiently to be unveiled."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Good, just like that... So much food inside, all delicious cheese..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Just a little tug..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Squeak! Squeak! Squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_17 = {Text = "...Brown?"},
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Brown has climbed onto the base of the wax sculpture, his tiny paws struggling to pull at the cover."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_19 = {
    Text = "No! The wax museum's second rule is—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
This appears to be Rogers' office.
The tea on the desk is still warm. Someone was here recently.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Do not lift their covers."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_21 = {
    Text = "At least someone here is still thinking clearly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_22 = {
    Text = "No loud noises."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_23 = {
    Text = "If these rules were real, we'd already be dead."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_24 = {
    Text = "I don't remember anything."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_25 = {
    Text = "If you're trying to anger me, you've made it. Well played."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Rule 2: Do not lift their covers.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_27 = {
    Text = "We need to stop this immediately before it's too late!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Brown, stop now! Or... or I'll ditch you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Facing Jenkin's threat, the little mouse shows no fear."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Brown, who's been dozing on Jenkin's shoulder, suddenly lets out a faint cry. It opens its blood-red eyes and scans the surroundings uneasily."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_30 = {
    Text = "It squints its eyes, puffs out its chest like a boastful little general, and then skillfully lifts the cover."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_31 = {
    Text = "<RedShake:Boohoo... my eyes, my eyes...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_32 = {
    Text = "<RedShake:Too bright, too bright...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_33 = {
    Text = "<Big:Brown, you-you-you—!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Below the cloth stands a bust of an adult man."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_35 = {
    Text = "His eyebrows shoot up, his gaunt face etched with deep lines, and his lips tightly closed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_36 = {
    Text = "This face leaves a deep impression on you: the notorious wax sculptor from the newspaper."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_37 = {
    Text = "You gaze into the wax sculpture's hollow eye sockets, thinking there is something different—its eyes are gouged out."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Ding—! Ding—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_39 = {
    Text = "The bell rings again, more urgent and intense than before, echoing through the dimly lit room, as piercing as a shrill laugh."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_4 = {Text = "Squeak..."},
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Ahem, it's Pandia's special announcement time!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Oh my, my careless little mouse, you went and lifted the cover!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_42 = {
    Text = "<Red:I hereby proclaim the second rule most splendidly broken!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Brown, Brown didn't mean it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Hehe, perhaps you'd like to explain yourself to <Blue:them> when you're all cozy underground?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Oh silly me, I nearly forgot—they can't understand a word! Oh hohoho!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_46 = {
    Text = "The girl's lively laughter gradually fades from the broadcast. You begin to feel dizzy."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Oh no... My head's getting foggy..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Your head feels increasingly heavy."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_49 = {
    Text = "On this hallucinatory night, you are a moth trapped in amber, encased in the black resin of laughter and song, sinking to the deepest, darkest depths."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You're so very hungry, little mouse..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_50 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Hehe. Strangle them, strangle them, STRANGLE THEM!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_51 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Choke them, choke them...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_52 = {Text = "No, no...!"},
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_53 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Just before you suffocate, someone tightly grasps your hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Stay strong, %player%. We'll get through this."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_56 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Ramona, you're the one who's frightened. Your hands won't stop shaking...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_57 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_58 = {
    Text = "In the darkness, you hear a faint girl's laughter, as if it is far away yet seemingly close by."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_59 = {
    Text = "You too, %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I know... you're starving..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_7 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Wait, why did Brown jump down?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18968_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Don't mind it. Slept long enough, time to move."
  },
  AvgDialog_18969_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The wax sculptures... are alive?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18969_Content_2 = {
    Text = "They are alive, the moment you break the rule..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18969_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Now enjoy this magnificent night to its fullest, my pets!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18969_Content_4 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Hehehehehe...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18969_Content_5 = {
    Text = "No... There're too many of them!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18969_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Hey, Ramona! You're smart, and you've got a plan, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18969_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Given our current circumstances, we're running out of options—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18969_Content_8 = {Text = "<Big:Run!>"},
  AvgDialog_18970_Content_1 = {
    Text = "What do I do? Jenkin will be unhappy if I fail... squeak..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18970_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Huh, there's another exit here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18970_Content_3 = {
    Text = "This must be the place, definitely! Squeak squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
12:10, Rogers Wax Museum
Basement]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Scan complete: Diameter 18.54 feet, depth 65.4... a <Yellow:Class-C Rift>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The diameter is too small, no wonder it went undetected before. The next step is to confirm the active range..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Brown wanders near William, then spots a file folder peeking from a suitcase."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_13 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Squeak—<Big:Squeak Squeak!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_15 = {
    Text = "He snatches it and dashes away."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_16 = {
    Text = "...<Big:Hey!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Tap. Tap. Tap."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Tiny shoes tap on the ground. Someone approaches with unhurried steps."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Must not be discovered... Find a place to hide first."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Squeak... squeak?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Let me see, who's disturbing George's snack time?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Squeak—!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Oh, just a tiny mouse. George feels generous today, so..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_23 = {
    Text = "George throws a bloody mass in front of Brown."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Go on, eat."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_25 = {Text = "—Squeak?"},
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_26 = {
    Text = "You must be starving, you silly thing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Squeak! Squeak squeak...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Tell George you're hungry."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The mysterious voice spreads like ripples, filling the air with noisy echoes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_3 = {
    Text = "...A mouse?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_30 = {
    Text = "You're hungry... You're hungry..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Hungry@1 Hungry hungRY HUNGRY @4NGRY..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Squeak...<Big:Squeak!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_33 = {
    Text = "The mouse's eyes glow red. It bares its teeth and devours the decaying flesh greedily."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Poor dumb little mouse... My poor dumb little mouse..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Meanwhile, in the studio..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Gurgle, gurgle..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The faint sound of greedy chewing echoes in the pitch-black basement."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_6 = {Text = "...Squeak?"},
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Shh... Don't come closer. It's dangerous here."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Don't wake \"them\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_18971_Content_9 = {
    Text = "William keeps his head down, focused on the fluctuating numbers on his instrument."
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_10 = {
    Text = "As I should. My dissection grades at Mythag over the last three years? A+, A+, A++."
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_11 = {
    Text = "There's residual human tissue and blood in the cranium... just as the rumors say, <Red:the wax figures are indeed made from living people.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I knew it... Artist, almoner, my butt. Knew he's up to no good."
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You look around. The wax sculptures with sweet smiles fill the display room, like the happiest children, adults, and pets in the world."
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Who would have thought that this happiness was built with real human flesh?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_15 = {
    Text = "If he did get my sis..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I already lost Aigis... Can't lose my sister too..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Click. Click. Click."
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_18 = {
    Text = "With a faint whimper, a pair of hands emerges from the darkness, gently caressing Jenkin's cheek."
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Jenkin... <Big:Heads up! Something's behind you!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Pandia... that girl's downright weird."
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_20 = {
    Text = "<BigBold:?!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_21 = {Text = "Waaah..."},
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_22 = {
    Text = "A shadowy figure writhes slowly within the wax sculpture, like a baby eager to be born, stretching the soft wax into a nearly transparent film."
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Something's emerging from that wax sculpture..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_24 = {Text = "A head."},
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_25 = {
    Text = "A head of a woman. It slithers out of the wax sculpture, long hair covered in oily wax."
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_26 = {
    Text = "It lifts its face, revealing hollow, blackened eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_27 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Help...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_28 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Save me...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_3 = {
    Text = "When I touched that... thing in her stomach, it felt way too real!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_4 = {
    Text = "But she was clearly wax..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
Enough talk, let's put it to test.
I grabbed something when we tussled with those wax sculptures.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Y-You grabbed THIS?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_7 = {
    Text = "\"Teen Girl Tackles Chaos HEAD-ON\"... Our reporter Hannah is gonna love that HEADline."
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Ramona offers no reply, her fingers deftly probing within the cranial cavity with measured precision."
  },
  AvgDialog_18972_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You look... too good at this. Almost like Ol' Johnny, the butcher next door."
  },
  AvgDialog_18973_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ugh! Aaaaah—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18973_Content_10 = {Text = "Farewell."},
  AvgDialog_18973_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Stop, don't run!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18973_Content_2 = {
    Text = "24 breathes heavily and pushes her head again."
  },
  AvgDialog_18973_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The dislocated neck is realigned, and 24's expression gradually shifts from fierce to gentle."
  },
  AvgDialog_18973_Content_4 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18973_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You... are indeed different. Perhaps..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18973_Content_6 = {
    Text = "A fleeting smile appears on 24's face. This is the first time you've seen her smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_18973_Content_7 = {
    Text = "She slowly retreats, her pale and melancholic face mostly shrouded in shadow."
  },
  AvgDialog_18973_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Sorry, %player%. It was nice being with you all."
  },
  AvgDialog_18973_Content_9 = {
    Text = "But that's... that's it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18974_Content_1 = {
    Text = "George is so hungry..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18975_Content_1 = {
    Text = "*Cough, cough...*"
  },
  AvgDialog_18975_Content_2 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_18975_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I smell human ahead, squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18975_Content_4 = {
    Text = "But it's locked here. Gotta find the key first, squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_1 = {Text = "Hmm...!!"},
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ramona draws a rapier and lightly places it on 24's shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Miss 24, your reaction tells me everything. Lead us to the wax sculpture now, or die by my hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Make your choice."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_13 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_14 = {
    Text = "This wax sculpture... \"Primavera\", is it important to you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I'm looking for my sister, Mason."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_16 = {
    Text = "It sounds crazy, but I can't remember what she looks like..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_17 = {
    Text = "She might have been turned into a wax figure and hidden in a set called... Bottom's Primadonna."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_18 = {
    Text = "<Small:It's \"Botticelli's Primavera\"... actually, never mind.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I don't understand... You said Mason is your sister, but you can't recall what she looks like?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_2 = {
    Text = "What... is going on..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Ah! Sorry, I didn't mean to question you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_21 = {
    Text = "This place is weird. It erases memories."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_22 = {
    Text = "We might end up as clueless as Grandma Vanessa soon."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Grandma Vanessa?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_24 = {
    Text = "My old landlord. Besides rent day, she couldn't make sense of anything else."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_25 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:Dang it! Why do I only remember the bad stuff...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_26 = {Text = "I see."},
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_27 = {
    Text = "So, won't you end up like me, remembering nothing at all?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Maybe, who knows?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_29 = {
    Text = "But I don't care. I WILL recognize sis as long as she comes to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_3 = {
    Text = "24 sits on the ground, dazed, and touches her head."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Ahem... Forget I said anything."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You're just some poor sap who remembers nothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Yeah... I can't do anything, and I don't remember anything."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_33 = {
    Text = "24's tears well up once more."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_34 = {
    Text = "I'm so useless..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_35 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_36 = {
    Text = "I wanted to do more, but... but I'm so useless. These chores are all I can handle..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_37 = {
    Text = "First Aigis, now you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_38 = {
    Text = "<Big:No tears!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_39 = {
    Text = "I can't stand crybabies. <Big:They make me mad!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_4 = {
    Text = "<Shake:D-Don't kill me... I didn't mean to, I didn't mean to...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Alright, alright... I won't cry... I'm sorry..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Wipe your face, got it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_42 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:No tears, and no apologies.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Jenkin stands with hands on hips, raising her sharp little chin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_44 = {
    Text = "And who said you're useless?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_45 = {
    Text = "You will be useful by taking us to the wax sculpture, got it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Alright... alright..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Seeing 24 so obedient, Jenkin nods with satisfaction."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_48 = {
    Text = "We've wasted enough time. Let's go!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_49 = {
    Text = "That William guy's probably waiting for us to rescue him."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You're trapped here, aren't you... just like everyone else... <Italic:Just like me.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_50 = {
    Text = "No, no! The wax sculpture is in the <Blue:Studio>, not over there..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_51 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_52 = {
    Text = "You have something to say?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_53 = {
    Text = "I'm just trying to understand... Why did she fly off the handle, then suddenly cool down?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Easy. She's just a child grieving her lost friend, trying to help both 24 and herself."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_55 = {
    Text = "In her own... unique way."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I'm familiar with this wax museum. I can lead you out! <Shake:If... if I can remember...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Here's the deal: find the \"Primavera\" for us, and you'll earn your freedom."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Upon hearing \"Primavera,\" 24's pupils suddenly contract, and their eyebrows furrow."
  },
  AvgDialog_18976_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18977_Content_1 = {
    Text = "It's your fault... all of you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18978_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Master Rogers..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18979_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Don't leave George, don't leave us...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The wax museum, at long last."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_10 = {
    Text = "\"Rogers Wax Museum\"—You finally make out the weathered lettering on the sign."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, can you give me a general description of Miss Mason's appearance?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_12 = {
    Text = "My sister's gorgeous! Long hair, perfect skin..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Wait no. Her hair's short and her skin's..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_14 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_15 = {
    Text = "So, is her sister a real person in the physical world, or merely a figure wandering in her spiritual fantasies?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_16 = {Text = "Oh crap..."},
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I think I'm forgetting what sis looks like... Not just her face, even her voice..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I've seen Miss Mason's photo. She..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_19 = {Text = "She..."},
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Confirming mission objectives.
<Yellow:Mission 1: Go to the Rogers Wax Museum to find Miss Mason and Investigator William.>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Ramona frowns, falling into an eerie silence with Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Hmm... maybe we should examine the newspaper photos together?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You unfold the newspaper from Jenkin, only to find the ink seems alive, gradually dissolving—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Until you can no longer make out the report about \"Primavera\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The damaged watermarks and ink stains seem hell-bent on completely erasing Mason's existence."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_25 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_26 = {
    Text = "What sorcery is this? I've read this newspaper a thousand times."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_27 = {
    Text = "But now... I can't remember a single word."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Wait, you don't remember anything at all?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The outstanding defender of Cubism, the reincarnation of Botticelli's soul, is now in hiding at a wax museum on the corner of Southwark Street..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Quest 2: Investigate the connection between Rogers and the \"Workhouse Disappearance Case.\">"
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_30 = {
    Text = "See? I can even quote that news article word for word."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_31 = {
    Text = "The newspaper was Dissoluted. Likely a <Yellow:mass amnesia> event, yet..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Ramona and Jenkin turn to you at the same time."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Looks like it doesn't work on a certain someone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_34 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Believe it or not, this doesn't feel right at all..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_36 = {
    Text = "It seems that, without anyone realizing it, the past is altered, and the story deviates from its intended path."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_37 = {
    Text = "And you are the sole witness to these changes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_38 = {Text = "Creak—"},
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_39 = {
    Text = "The tightly shut doors of the wax museum suddenly open, as if to welcome some unexpected guests."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Please confirm."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Did the door... just open itself?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_41 = {
    Text = "...Looks like our infiltration plan needs reevaluation."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
Let's go, %player%.
<Yellow:Find Mason and William before our memories fade entirely.>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Mission objective confirmed. Beginning investigation now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
Confirmed. Communication stays on; the investigation process will be recorded.
Risk level: High. Please proceed with caution.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_7 = {
    Text = "May the Silver Key light your path."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You raise your head and gaze at the desolate street scene."
  },
  AvgDialog_18980_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Beyond the mist, a ghostly red streetlamp flickers, dimly illuminating the signs of nearby shops."
  },
  AvgDialog_18981_Content_1 = {Text = "Squeak?"},
  AvgDialog_18981_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The route is so complicated... Squeak..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18981_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I want to go home and eat cheese, squeak."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_1 = {Text = "UGH!"},
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Then you focus your spirit power, trying to awaken the sleeping Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Ramona, snap out of it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Tabby cat, tabby cat... t-tabby..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You grab Ramona's shoulders and shake her hard. Ramona blinks, her eyes gradually clearing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Hmph. Why am I even bothering with this nonsense..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Thank goodness you're finally awake!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_16 = {
    Text = "A lot's happened while you were out. Actually, 24—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I can't move and barely stay conscious, but I can still hear everything you're saying."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Shall we reintroduce ourselves, Miss Mason?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_19 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The wound is burning, it hurts so much! How could you be so cruel to me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I wanted to get you all out of here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_21 = {
    Text = "<Small:First time I've seen an artificially created Awakener. Need to consult Miss Doll...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Tsk tsk, is this really the moment for chitchat?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_23 = {
    Text = "While I didn't quite squash you flat, someone's started leaking..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You follow Pandia's gaze downward."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Crimson blood drips slowly from your arm onto the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_26 = {
    Text = "One drop, two drops, three drops..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_27 = {
    Text = "<RedShake:Blood, so much blood...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Wake up... Quickly, wake up..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Damn, I lost focus during the fight and..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Jenkin! Are you alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_30 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Wax Museum Rule 1: Do not touch the waxworks.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_31 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Wax Museum Rule 2: Do not lift their covers.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_32 = {
    Text = "As for Rule 3 of the Wax Museum..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_33 = {
    Text = "No blood shall spill upon these halls."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Bingo! Precisely!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_35 = {
    Text = "No loud noises."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_36 = {
    Text = "What a simpleton you are!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_37 = {
    Text = "If such rules held weight, you'd have perished ages ago!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_38 = {
    Text = "I don't remember anything."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Shall I refresh your memory?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_4 = {
    Text = "24 rushes to Jenkin and removes her shackles."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_40 = {
    Text = "You dear stupid thing, allow me to enlighten you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_41 = {
    Text = "<Red:Rule 3: No blood shall spill upon these halls.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_42 = {
    Text = "These rules formed our <Yellow:covenant>. Now, like so... all are broken."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Well then, rule-breaking guests..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_44 = {
    Text = "<Red:Do savor this exquisite night.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Ding—! Ding—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_46 = {
    Text = "All the pendulums in the hall begin to resonate enthusiastically, merging various chimes into a sea of sound."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_47 = {
    Text = "When taboos are shattered and rules trampled, the toll of judgment breaks the silence, emitting its sharpest threats."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_48 = {Text = "Zing—!!"},
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_49 = {
    Text = "A sudden, piercing buzz comes from beneath, accompanied by the cries of children, echoing around the wax museum."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_5 = {
    Text = "She picks up Jenkin, just as she has done countless times since they were kids."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_50 = {
    Text = "BOOOMMM—!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_51 = {
    Text = "It's as if a massive whirlpool opens up beneath your feet, eager to devour everything in its path."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_52 = {Text = "Aaaaah—"},
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_6 = {Text = "Sis..."},
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I'm better now. Go help %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Don't worry about me, I can make my own way out."
  },
  AvgDialog_18982_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The activated Silver Key infuses you with new power. You move your body, finally breaking free from the restraints."
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_1 = {Text = "Cedarwood"},
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Hey, cologne guy, you listening—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You try to keep your voices low, but can no longer suppress your anxiety and urgency."
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Cries echo one after another, and soon, a muffled response emerges from the depths."
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_13 = {
    Text = "...So noisy."
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Cough... Cough..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Thank goodness, William! I was afraid..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I'm fine, just a few scratches and bruises. But the detective with me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Daydreaming isn't a good habit, Investigator."
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I didn't expect <Blue:that woman> to have dealings with the Sculptors' Association. I wasn't cautious enough."
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_19 = {
    Text = "By the way, did you guys just see a small wax sculpture? Golden curls, wearing a black suit..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
12:40, Rogers Wax Museum
Studio]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Just come up here and look! Tons of wax figures! That style? I can find ten like that right now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_21 = {
    Text = "It's just overwhelming!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_22 = {
    Text = "...It's not an ordinary wax sculpture. Judging by your reactions, you probably haven't seen it before."
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_23 = {
    Text = "This isn't a good place to talk. Give me ten minutes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_24 = {
    Text = "We'll force open that trapdoor and come down after you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Odd, I thought the basement was supposed to house monsters?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_4 = {
    Text = "How did Brown manage to find what Miss Mason hid?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ramona takes the letter paper, flips through it, and then brings it close to her nose."
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_6 = {
    Text = "A faint cologne scent... It's William's signature fragrance."
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_7 = {Text = "William?!"},
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You crouch down and stretch your neck towards the trapdoor leading to the cellar."
  },
  AvgDialog_18983_Content_9 = {
    Text = "William, are you down there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18984_Content_1 = {
    Text = "I should be... the most perfect..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18984_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The only one..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18984_Content_3 = {Text = "Why..."},
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ugh! Am I... back?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The art symbolizing eternity slowly melts, revealing its true face."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The lady, who once smiled gently, now reveals a sinister face as she wails for her lost child."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The charming gentleman twitches constantly, but his hollow eye sockets can no longer shed a single tear."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The innocent child stares at their missing arm, letting out a confused scream."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Aaah, my hand...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_15 = {
    Text = "<Shake:I remember, I remember everything...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_16 = {
    Text = "No, no... my precious sculptures..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_17 = {
    Text = "When the beauty of art sheds its delicate veil, harsh reality arrives as expected."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The wax sculptures float in midair, weeping. They all turn their heads to glare at the instigator of it all."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_19 = {
    Text = "D-don't look at us! Go fight those Mythag brats!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The moment you open your eyes, the silver runes above the rift seem to come alive, rapidly floating and spinning..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Keep looking and George will dig out your eyes—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_21 = {
    Text = "George's hair and clothes suddenly float up lightly before he can finish."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Huh... Me too... Why...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_23 = {
    Text = "George breaks free from Rogers' embrace and flies toward the center of the rift, accompanied by the floating wax sculptures."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_24 = {
    Text = "In the pitch-black night, they drift like glowing jellyfish into the deep tunnel."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_25 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Master, help me... Please help me, AAAHHHH!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_26 = {
    Text = "George! Come back—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Rogers grabs George, but they are entwined and surrounded by more and more limbs."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Master, you can save George... right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_29 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_3 = {
    Text = "They then simultaneously release a dazzling silver light, illuminating almost every corner of the rift."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_30 = {
    Text = "This is what you've been running from, Rogers."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_31 = {
    Text = "I told you before—you can't pretend they never existed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I spent over tw-twenty years... and th-that's it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Heh... Hahahah... This isn't real, right? None of this is real..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Of course they are real... just too pale."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Music, painting, statues... All beauty and art pale in the face of true suffering."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Under the gaze of @2, everything is fragile."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Rogers kneels down, holding the melting George."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_38 = {
    Text = "This nightmare will end. I'll f-fix you... I swear..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_39 = {
    Text = "*Sobs*... It hurts... So bad..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_4 = {Text = "—!!"},
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_40 = {
    Text = "The wax greedily clings to Rogers' arm, piercing the skin and spreading deeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Rogers feels no pain. He just stares sadly at George—or, more precisely, at George's slate-green eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_42 = {
    Text = "For more than 70 sweltering summers, he gazed at those eyes in the dark."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Those slate-green eyes—their pale irises catching the candlelight, shimmering like disturbed water, swirling like an endless maze."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_44 = {
    Text = "In them, he glimpsed both genesis and ruin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_45 = {
    Text = "I won't let you leave, <Blue:Mr. Wax>..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_5 = {
    Text = "William lets out a sigh of relief and gives you an approving nod."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Well done, %player%. The rift has been successfully closed."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_7 = {
    Text = "However, we can't let our guard down. The moment before the rift closes is often the most dangerous..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_8 = {
    Text = "<Big:Boom—!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18985_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Sensing its impending demise, the rift trembles in despair, spewing forth jet-black ooze."
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, calm down!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Fact one, William Delapore is a seasoned Investigator. If even someone like him disappeared..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_11 = {
    Text = "We might be facing something far worse than the workhouse."
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Fact two: Without our help, she can't even make it to the wax museum, let alone rescue her sister."
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Fact three..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Ramona cuts the comm before Doll can finish."
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Sorry, Jenkin. You just lost your best friend. You must be feeling down."
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I give you my word: we <Italic:will> find your sister. But no more reckless actions, understood?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Wait, are you offering to go with me? But your boss..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Leave the persuasion to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_19 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You grab Jenkin's wrist, but she slaps your hand away."
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Ramona smiles and reaches out to Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_21 = {
    Text = "So... <Blue:\"Rogers Wax Museum Investigation Squad\">—assemble, shall we?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Jenkin hums softly and awkwardly holds Ramona's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Tch. Immature."
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Calm down? Me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You realize that I just lost a friend, and my sister is missing? Yet..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_5 = {
    Text = "...yet you expect me to endure your strategy meetings and reports then act like a professional soldier?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You don't trust us."
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I trust you, but not your boss."
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Correction: Technical advisor, not boss."
  },
  AvgDialog_18986_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I understand the anxiety humans feel when they lose a family member, but it's time for her to face reality."
  },
  AvgDialog_18987_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Pitch black in here. Could be a trap..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18987_Content_10 = {
    Text = "It's standard field equipment, nothing particularly special."
  },
  AvgDialog_18987_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Do you know what this is?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18987_Content_3 = {
    Text = "In the darkness, Ramona calmly turns on a flashlight, re-illuminating the path."
  },
  AvgDialog_18987_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Whoa, why's there light inside? What is this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18987_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
Scientific name: handheld electronic illumination device, commonly called a flashlight.
Prevents collisions with walls, trees, and streetlights.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18987_Content_6 = {Text = "Oh..."},
  AvgDialog_18987_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Sometimes I think your backpack's a magic hole."
  },
  AvgDialog_18987_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Think you'll pull out a full tea set someday, like in fairy tales?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18987_Content_9 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_1 = {
    Text = "May we never cross paths again in this lifetime, my dearest enemies!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Let him go. Rogers is a key member of the Sculptors' Association; we can't afford to let him run."
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Understood. Now..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You look back at the mess before you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_13 = {
    Text = "No, don't leave me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<Big:AAAAHHH—!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_15 = {
    Text = "First the legs, then the torso, and finally the arms..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_16 = {
    Text = "No... you filth, stay away from George..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Then the mouth, nose, eyes..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The wax sculptures tear George's beautiful golden head apart until it completely splits open."
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_19 = {
    Text = "<Change>Thank you, Rogers. Yummy! Eat it, eat it—!!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Stay here and Dissolute like good little stains, and never haunt my thoughts again!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_20 = {
    Text = "<Change>Give me some, just a little—!!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_21 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Don't eat me! How dare you eat me... No—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_22 = {Text = "No..."},
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_23 = {
    Text = "With George's presence, the wax sculptures and body parts, once piled like a small mountain, begin to slowly merge again."
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Black slime drips from their countless eyes, lips, and ears."
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The large head in the middle is George."
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<Change>Boohoo... So hungry, so hungry..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_27 = {
    Text = "It's your fault... all your fault..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_28 = {
    Text = "<Change>It's your fault!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_3 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_4 = {
    Text = "We can't let him get away... %player%, Ramona, can you handle this here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona nod in unison."
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The most dangerous rift is sealed. Leave the rest to us. But you, William, going alone..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Alright, I believe in you. Do come back alive."
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_8 = {
    Text = "With his farewell spoken, William packs up his instrument, grabs his suitcase, and hurries out."
  },
  AvgDialog_18988_Content_9 = {Text = "William..."},
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Greetings, Lady Daffodil"
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Her tone is soft and ambiguous, laced with a trace of high-society elegance."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Though she speaks of apologies, her expression carries no remorse, only a faint mocking glint."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_12 = {
    Text = "A Hellhound has been prowling these hinterlands of late. An early slumber might spare you its gaze."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_13 = {Text = "Hellhound?"},
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
Legend says that if its eyes catch you thrice, you'll fall into nothingness, meeting your doom.
Best be cautious, dear guests.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I thought that was just a tale to scare restless children."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Fiction or reality, who can say? Rural legends often hold a kernel of truth, don't they?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_17 = {
    Text = "You don't seem convinced."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Truth and falsehood come in pairs. One person's truth may be another's delusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
Look at me, rambling nonsense again.
Pay it no mind, dear guests. Rest well.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Led by the girl, you arrive at an unassuming shop at the street corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_20 = {
    Text = "With that, Daffodil rises and glides away, leaving only the lingering scent of her fragrance."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_21 = {
    Text = "...What were you all babbling about?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_22 = {
    Text = "I didn't catch it either."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
We're caught in an illusion.
Use the Silver Key and see for yourself.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_24 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_25 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The Dissolution in this area is far beyond normal, yet Daffodil and her wares remain untouched."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Lady Daffodil, the narcissus lady—hardly a real name."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_28 = {
    Text = "If she's a merchant dealing in contraband, using a pseudonym makes sense."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Even so, it's odd."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
A faint purple mist swirls within the shop, barely ten feet wide, yet its decor exudes refined taste.
Delicate, rustic trinkets are stacked layer upon layer on the counter, chaotic yet orderly.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_30 = {
    Text = "If you were a seasoned merchant in a town plagued by disappearances, would you so readily let three strangers in at midnight?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Also, I keep feeling something watching us."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_32 = {
    Text = "You feel that chill too?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_33 = {
    Text = [[
Don't lump me in with you.
I'm just curious which bold fool dares to treat me as prey.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
At least we have a roof to keep out the rain.
Let's take turns resting, stay vigilant, and deal with the rest tomorrow.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_35 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_36 = {
    Text = "By the way, Erica?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Greetings, autonomous automaton Erica, on standby 24/7 to provide prompt technical and informational support."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Keywords: \"Lady Daffodil,\" antique merchant."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
Searching for keywords "Daffodil," "antique merchant." Please wait.
Search results: none. Apologies, please try different keywords...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Tch, so this is Lady Daffodil's shop? Just a street-side knickknack stall."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_40 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_41 = {
    Text = "As the night deepens, lulled by Ramona and Erica's conversation, you slip into a dream..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_42 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_43 = {
    Text = "...Don't argue with her. After that incident, people said she lost her mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_44 = {
    Text = [[
She went to a doctor, claiming she could see <Yellow:hollows in people's bodies>...
Saying those hollows killed her husband and daughter.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Wasn't she always single? Where'd this husband and daughter come from?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Exactly. Isn't that just madness?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_47 = {
    Text = "If so, can we request a mental evaluation for her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Is that even necessary? Normal people don't volunteer to die while perfectly healthy."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_49 = {
    Text = "And those fanatic explorers? Their heads aren't right either. If we did mental checks, I doubt any would pass."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_5 = {
    Text = "And these... antiques? Grotesque, twisted things."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Black, viscous slime drips from the sky, shrouding your vision."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_51 = {
    Text = "It coats the <Blue:Foundation>'s steps, its doors, its counters."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Until it covers the faces of the Foundation's employees."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_53 = {
    Text = "I warn you, I reserve the right to sue you for slander."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_54 = {
    Text = [[
These black slimes... you can't see them, but they're real.
It was them. They took...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_55 = {
    Text = "They took my dearest ones..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Why? Why can't they see?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_57 = {
    Text = "It hurts, but @2 can endure, Mommy."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_58 = {
    Text = [[
No, no, this won't do. You'll vanish.
I've already lost @3; I can't lose you too.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_59 = {
    Text = "I won't leave Mommy."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I rather cherish these treasures. Don't you find a certain beauty in their weathered passage through time?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Why? Didn't you say you wouldn't leave me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_61 = {
    Text = "You can't see it either."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_62 = {
    Text = "But I can, I can see it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_63 = {
    Text = [[
They're not missing; they're sick, they're Dissolving...
Those black slimes are dissolving them...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_64 = {
    Text = [[
The woman murmurs, sinking into a deep slumber. A gentle fog envelops her, slowly cloaking her form.
From the dense mist, a deep purple shadow emerges.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_65 = {
    Text = "I came to see if it was time to reap... but this is getting far more interesting."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Fine, just keep that head for now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_67 = {
    Text = "But when you return from that frozen abyss, you'd better hand it over nicely, hmm?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_7 = {
    Text = "A haunting voice drifts from the blurred shadows, like a deep bass flowing into a tangled symphony."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_8 = {
    Text = "My apologies, allow me to introduce myself. I am Daffodil, the proprietress of this humble shop."
  },
  AvgDialog_18991_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I have no wish to intrude on your conversation.\nJust a reminder, dear guests, the night grows late—time to rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The Friendless"
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Helot murmurs, her lips parting slightly, chanting a coarse, archaic, profane incantation."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_11 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:@2—@1—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_12 = {
    Text = "What's that sound?! Damn it, my head's killing me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
You've never heard this language, yet somehow you grasp its meaning.
Endless whispers invade your cortex, their eerie cadence resounding like a nightmare.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<Change>Return to the primal nest..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_15 = {
    Text = "<Change>Return to the eternal realm..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_16 = {
    Text = "<Change>Return to the Mother's embrace..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_17 = {
    Text = "You understand, but you don't comprehend."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The warmth pressed against your side vanishes, the clutched hem falls limp, and in your blurred vision, a frail figure blurs into a faint cluster of light."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Moth...er..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Huff, huff—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Lily, don't listen!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_21 = {Text = "No, no..."},
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_22 = {
    Text = "If Lisa plays with me, won't Mommy be mad?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
Heh, as long as she doesn't know, it's fine.
You'll keep it a secret, right?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Hmm, Lily won't tell anyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Then we're good. It's our little secret, okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Finally found you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
Who... are you?
I've never seen you. You're not from around here, are you?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
I'm not here for you. I'm here for her.
Lily, do you remember me? I'm an old friend of your mom's.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Back when we worked together, she'd often bring you to the institute. After all these years, you haven't changed a bit."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You're no match for me."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
You've been away from your mom for a while, haven't you?
Uncle's here to take you back.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
Lily can't go with you.
She snuck out to play with me today. I need to take her to Lady Daffodil first.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Lily's mom told me to bring her back as soon as possible."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Lady Daffodil's just a host. Can't you, little friend, pass along a message for us?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_34 = {
    Text = "No way. If Lady Daffodil scolds me, I won't know what to do."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_35 = {
    Text = "But Lily needs to come with me now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Herbert reaches for Lily's slender arm, but Lisa steps in to block him."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_37 = {Text = "Lily, run!"},
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
The scenery behind you blurs as you flee.
All you hear is Lisa's desperate cry.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Run, don't look back, find Lady Daffodil!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_4 = {
    Text = "A jungle prey, priding itself on speed, dares to challenge the hunter's barrel—this is what happens."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_40 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Hmph, meddling pest..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_42 = {
    Text = "The black-green tide coalesces into a massive protoplasmic pustule, strange glimmers flickering across its surface."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Black tears stream from Lily's eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_44 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:@2—@1—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_45 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:@2—@1—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_46 = {
    Text = [[
A familiar timbre stretches into an alien cadence.
Such a voice shouldn't come from a child.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_47 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:@2—@1—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_48 = {Text = "%player%!"},
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Don't hurt Lily!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_5 = {
    Text = "My advantage over you—is overwhelming."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Protect yourself first!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_51 = {Text = "Got it!"},
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_52 = {
    Text = "No need to tell me—a little headache won't slow me down!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Helot hangs her head, enduring Lotan's taunts without a twitch."
  },
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_7 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_8 = {Text = "What—"},
  AvgDialog_18992_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Suddenly, a black-green tide surges around you, an ancient, bone-chilling wail echoing in your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_1 = {Text = "Fair Trade"},
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Daffodil pulls two <Blue:dossiers> from the gray mist's void, lightly brushing off their dust."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
Once the dust settles, I'll send them to your respective headquarters.
My only condition is that you part ways here, each to your own path.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Perhaps one day your roads will cross again, but that's for the gaze of Them to decide."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Those dossiers..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_14 = {
    Text = "They're about the Hellhound. You didn't think I came to Rye for antiques, did you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I need to verify the dossiers' value."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Ramona, what do you think?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_17 = {
    Text = "We were the ones attacked—calling a truce costs us nothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
But I need to confirm the dossiers' worth.
May I read the cover page?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_19 = {Text = "Naturally."},
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The babbling fades, leaving only endless silence in the car."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Ramona takes the dossier from Daffodil, her eyes darting across the lines behind her glasses. Then she nods to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_21 = {Text = "Deal."},
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
I adore straightforward guests like you.
The dossier will be mailed to Mythag University's office within seven days.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_23 = {
    Text = "And what about you, lady? Have you made your decision?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Helot stiffens, slime coalescing into a spike in her palm."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_25 = {
    Text = "I refuse. I have a mission to complete."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
You'll reconsider.
This contains details about "<Yellow:that incident>" from ten years ago.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
Daffodil produces an emblem, displaying it to Helot in her palm.
The moment she sees it, Helot's face changes.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Where did you—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Shh—\nUntil you agree to the deal, I'm not saying a word."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Lotan leaps forward, catching the collapsing Lily."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Helot frowns, opens her mouth as if to speak, but falls silent, retreating into the shadows."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_31 = {
    Text = "With a grunt, Helot points the spike at the ground, carving a deep gash, sparks flying from the friction."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I agree. But—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_33 = {
    Text = "She aims the spike at the dossier in Daffodil's arms."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You must give me the dossier now."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_35 = {
    Text = "So impatient? Pity, the price is set. Daffodil's shop doesn't haggle."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Daffodil summons gray mist, the dossier poised to vanish within it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_37 = {
    Text = "In a flash, Helot lunges at Daffodil like a shadow."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
Yet, the purple silhouette vanishes the moment Helot closes in.
Daffodil reappears leisurely behind her, still holding the dossier steady.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Clap, clap, clap.
In the pitch-black tunnel, a crisp applause breaks out.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
Haste makes waste, little one.
Well, I won't linger. Once again, bon voyage.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_41 = {
    Text = [[
The gray mist swells.
Seconds later, silence returns, and Daffodil is gone.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_42 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Helot snorts, vanishing into the darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Ramona, what about us...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_45 = {
    Text = "...Lotan, please look after Lily until we return."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Just so you know, I'm not good with kids."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Keeper, do you trust me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_48 = {Text = "Of course."},
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
Then, please close your eyes for a moment.
We're going somewhere.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Accompanying the rhythmic claps is an ambiguous female voice, tinged with approving amusement. A skirt wreathed in gray mist emerges from the edge of light and shadow, the air suddenly suffused with a faint violet fragrance."
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_50 = {
    Text = [[
You shut your eyes as told.
In the darkness, Ramona's cool hand takes yours, guiding you slowly toward a certain destination.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Thank you for the splendid performance. You all seem exhausted—how about a truce?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You say stop, and we stop? Why should we listen to you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Daffodil's shop never shortchanges its guests.
I'm here to offer a deal.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18994_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I have two dossiers, each containing the answers you seek."
  },
  AvgDialog_18995_Content_1 = {
    Text = "These pustules... I've got a bad feeling."
  },
  AvgDialog_18995_Content_2 = {
    Text = "What's wrong?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18995_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Maybe I'm overthinking it. Let's catch up with Lotan first."
  },
  AvgDialog_18996_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Over here, you rotten devil!"
  },
  AvgDialog_18996_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Hey, lass, think you can you catch me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18996_Content_3 = {
    Text = "...I'm not sure if I'm the bully or they are."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Think Before You Act"
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
William cautiously lays out several photographs from the archive.
At the center of each, an uncanny black triangle slowly exudes a dark mist.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_11 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Severe Dissolution>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The police received missing persons reports two weeks ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_13 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:It's spreading fast>, unusually so."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_14 = {
    Text = "There've also been numerous cases of hysteria in town, and the police submitted a sighting report for \"<Blue:Hellhound Cerberus>\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You suspect the \"Hellhound\" is this region's <Yellow:Cataclysm>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Precisely. Given the long-standing local legends about the \"Hellhound,\" it might even be a <Yellow:Primordial Cataclysm> newly roused from slumber."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_17 = {
    Text = "This mission will likely involve a fierce battle. I'd like \"her\" to accompany the Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_18 = {
    Text = "That battle-obsessed lunatic... After the Black Pool incident, she's been camped there, shirking her teaching duties."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_19 = {
    Text = "It'll probably take the Keeper personally asking to get her to budge."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Mythag University, Awakening Studies Department Office"
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_20 = {
    Text = "{Male=He,Female=She}'s already on it."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
Lotan sits in the farthest corner of the Black Pool, gazing up at the vast, empty sky.
That is where Tawil once appeared.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Tell me, will They awaken again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You'll face other foes—"
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Like the Hellhound, for instance."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Tch—\nThe \"Hellhound\"? Some trite fantasy spun by mortals terrified of death?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_26 = {
    Text = "We need your strength."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
And I need only the one in that pool.
Let Them awaken, and give me a proper fight.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_28 = {
    Text = "No one knows how long They'll slumber."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_29 = {
    Text = "I've existed on this planet since its genesis. No one outlasts me in patience."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
<Blue:The legend of Cerberus> traces back to 8th century BCE Greece.
The poets of that era described it thus:]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_30 = {
    Text = "And... no one knows how long They'll slumber?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You're mistaken."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_32 = {
    Text = "With you, the sole Variable, in play, Their awakening is only a matter of time, isn't it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_33 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
Relax, I'm just messing with you.
I'll come along, but we're setting three ground rules.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_35 = {Text = "Name them."},
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_36 = {
    Text = "First, I handle the fighting—don't bother me with your petty chores."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Second, don't meddle in my independent actions."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Third, if I pick an opponent, you let me face them one-on-one."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_39 = {
    Text = "And she just agreed to come?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Born of Echidna, sired by Typhon, with three heads, <Yellow:those hunted thrice by it shall have their souls bound to the Underworld>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_40 = {
    Text = "With my mere mortal frame, I could hardly drag her here by force, could I?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_41 = {
    Text = "She's surprisingly adaptable."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_42 = {
    Text = "A person—no, a creature—who's lived for eons, enduring countless upheavals, must be a master at rolling with the punches."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Let's hope the investigation goes as smoothly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_44 = {
    Text = "With records and memories erased by Dissolution, we're short on witnesses and evidence..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_45 = {
    Text = [[
Don't jinx it. If Lotan makes this trip for nothing...
We'll probably only find her back at the Black Pool.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Speaking of which, haven't we lost sight of Lotan for a bit?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Hmm, it's written with some flair, and they even listed a few sighting cases from A.F. 187."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Spare me those sightings. The cited sources are either dubious or outright fabricated."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Even that so-called description from an ancient Greek poet diverges wildly from modern scholarly research."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_8 = {
    Text = "If you're sending the Keeper out on fieldwork based on a few pages of fiction, William, I must question the investigation team's diligence."
  },
  AvgDialog_18997_Content_9 = {
    Text = "It's not that I'm unwilling to provide field evidence, it's just..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Unbroken Sanctity"
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_10 = {
    Text = "It's not that I reject outside voices, just... {Male=his,Female=her} thoughts matter too much."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Rashly piling heavy cargo on the bow or stern of a barely steady boat isn't prudent."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
...What's your take, Lotan?
On being an Awakener.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_13 = {Text = "Me?"},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_14 = {
    Text = "...Hard to say."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
When the planet was born, I awoke in the earth's cradle, surrounded by chaos.
Even a maelstrom whale feels small against the vast cosmos.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
Becoming an Awakener feels the same.
When Awakened, my spirit and will were incomplete, only stabilizing through a Silver Key link.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I don't know how former humans feel, but for me, it's like cramming a colossal beast into a frail, helpless shell."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Your strength came back eventually, didn't it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Yeah. I'm an early Mythag creation, my Awakening incomplete, taking far longer than others."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_2 = {
    Text = "{Male=He's,Female=She's} asleep?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_20 = {
    Text = "But I soon reclaimed myself, found what I wanted—to face opponents that set my blood racing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
Over billions of years, this cycle of sleep and awakening has happened countless times.
I'm used to it.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
But in near-endless time, I've concluded one thing:
Beyond seeking worthy foes, everything else is meaningless.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
You can't change your form. Instead of dwelling on it, find meaning in living as an Awakener.
The body may be shaped by the Silver Core, but what I do is my choice.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_24 = {
    Text = "That's your answer."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_25 = {
    Text = "You'll find yours too, little girl."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I look forward to the day you reach that point."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_27 = {
    Text = "May the Silver Key light your path."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
Feels sappy saying it, but fine...
May the Silver Key guide us.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_29 = {Text = "Dream"},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
Out the moment {Male=his,Female=her} head hit the pillow.
These past few days drained {Male=his,Female=her} mental strength.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_30 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_31 = {Text = "Cages."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Countless cages."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_33 = {
    Text = [[
This seems to be a cave.
Your body is no longer cold, but your heart is colder than polar ice.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_34 = {
    Text = "...Colonel... Bertrand."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Your voice is unbearably hoarse."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The girl by the campfire notices your stirring but merely glances at you with a haughty look, saying nothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Where... am I?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The girl doesn't respond."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Your consciousness clears, your gaze fixing on a mark carved on the cave wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_4 = {
    Text = "We're in the Rye Sanatorium's territory now. There might be no time to rest ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_40 = {
    Text = "...It matches the one on Cecily's map exactly."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_41 = {
    Text = "This is... the @3 Church?\nI know about you—you can bring the dead back to life, can't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
The girl glances at you again, her eyes filled with disgust.
As if annoyed by your noise, she stands and heads out of the cave, muttering under her breath.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_43 = {
    Text = "<Small:Fool.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_44 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_45 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_46 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_47 = {
    Text = [[
After a while, the girl returns,
holding a carving knife and a piece of wood.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_48 = {
    Text = "She sits by the campfire, starting to carve."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_49 = {
    Text = "You notice her fingers wrapped in bandages."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
You should sleep too.
You're still human, after all.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_50 = {
    Text = [[
...Your knife's too dull. It'll easily cut your hand.
And for carving large wood, that small blade isn't suitable.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_51 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_52 = {
    Text = "...It's all I have."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_53 = {
    Text = "I have some tools in my bag. Could you grab them for me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_54 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_55 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_56 = {
    Text = "An hour or two passes, the girl still carving intently."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_57 = {
    Text = "What's your name?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_58 = {
    Text = "<Blue:Murphy>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_59 = {
    Text = "I had a daughter. If she were alive, she'd be about your age."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_6 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_60 = {
    Text = "She died of a black disease. No one believed me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_61 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_62 = {
    Text = [[
Getting chummy won't help you.
I don't call the shots here.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_63 = {
    Text = "I don't have the key to let you out."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_64 = {
    Text = "The girl's tone is cold and harsh."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_65 = {
    Text = "It's fine, I'm not trying to escape..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_66 = {
    Text = [[
By the way, can you tell me about that "bringing the dead back" thing...
Is it real?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_67 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_68 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_69 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
...
Why did you cut {Male=him,Female=her} off back then?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_70 = {
    Text = [[
The air freezes for over ten minutes.
Just as you think she won't respond, she speaks, her tone sharp.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Suppose you got pregnant again and had a child, and they said it's your daughter reborn. Would you believe them?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_72 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_73 = {
    Text = "If she remembered me, remembered our past, then yes."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_74 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_75 = {
    Text = "After a long silence, Murphy sighs."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Humans are as foolish as ever."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_77 = {
    Text = "<Small:I thought you could see and would be different.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_78 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_79 = {
    Text = "...That corpse you were dragging, who was it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_8 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_80 = {
    Text = [[
My friend. She took care of me during this journey.
The map to get here was hers.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Friend, huh..."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_82 = {
    Text = "How is she... now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_83 = {
    Text = "<Blue:Miryam> probably turned her body into some fodder. A body with livor mortis can't even serve as fuel."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_84 = {
    Text = "The girl says chilling words with an expressionless face."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_85 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_86 = {
    Text = "...On the day of the <Yellow:ritual>, you will be held near the <Yellow:Altar>."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_87 = {
    Text = [[
I don't know why you're still conscious, but pretend to be out.
I'll place you closest to the pool's edge.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_88 = {
    Text = "When they all leave, put on a robe and slip out through the north path by the Altar."
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_89 = {
    Text = [[
Run as fast as you can and don't come back.
If you're caught, I can't help you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_18998_Content_9 = {
    Text = "For things I haven't figured out myself, {Male=his,Female=her} views could sway me."
  },
  AvgDialog_19001_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Hmph! You're tough, but Lisa's mom taught me that brains can beat enemies far stronger than you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19001_Content_2 = {
    Text = "We'll lure them away and take them down one by one!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19001_Content_3 = {Text = "Aye, sir!"},
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_1 = {Text = "Bon Voyage"},
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Quite protective, aren't you, lass?
Did ol' Dexter say something about me?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_11 = {
    Text = "A flicker of disapproval crosses Ramona's pale cheeks, but Daffodil doesn't give her a chance to retort, waving a dismissive hand to send you on your way."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
Alright, it seems I'm not welcome here.
I won't delay your trip any longer.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Bon voyage."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I thought I told you not to call this number unless it's urgent."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
How could I forget your stern orders?
Don't you want to hear what news I've brought you?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Whose movements?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Mythag University. Their Keeper is tracking \"the big one.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_18 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
Looks like you're about to lose another piece on your board.
Must sting for a master strategist like <Blue:Herbert>, no?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Looks like you're all set for the journey."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You flatter me, madam. Under that one's gaze, we're mere ants—hardly strategists. Where are they now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
You'll find out soon enough.
By the way, that "knight" you sent to intercept them? Not the best choice.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_22 = {
    Text = "A reckless brute like that will only hit a brick wall against Mythag University."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Just <Blue:trash tossed over by the Lightbearers>. If it's useless, so be it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_24 = {
    Text = "It's all because Rogers went missing, leaving me with extra headaches."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
Don't worry, you've got me.
For the right price, Daffodil's little shop of solutions will handle all your troubles.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Cough, cough>... Do we really have to use this thing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_27 = {
    Text = "This subway... smells awful."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_28 = {
    Text = "In the noisy subway car, some passengers read <Italic:The Isis Times> under dim lights, while others puff on pipes, exhaling clouds of smoke."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The stench of human sweat, tobacco, and heavy gasoline mingles into a peculiar, rotten odor."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Thank you for the \"hospitality\" you've provided."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_30 = {
    Text = "You glance at Lily by the window. She curiously studies the passengers, seats, and handrails, quiet as a doll, as if seeing this strange world for the first time."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_31 = {
    Text = "We could've taken the school's private transport, but no, you're coddling her with this junk heap. Are you spoiling her too much?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Isn't trying new things fun? I think this experience is quite rare."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Any thoughts on our next move, Keeper?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Considering the <Yellow:gaze> we felt during our clash with Herbert likely came from the true Hellhound, staying in town is the safer bet."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_35 = {
    Text = "But there's another path: escort Lily to the Rye Sanatorium and investigate Francis."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_36 = {
    Text = "She does seem more than meets the eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
Whether we stay in town or head to the sanatorium, we must stay wary of Daffodil's meddling.
Her presence in Rye at this juncture is no coincidence.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
She's unlikely to interfere directly.
From what I know, only matters tied to her collections pique her interest.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_39 = {
    Text = "\"Unlikely\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_4 = {
    Text = "My sweet child. Stay safe out there."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Haha, I've sent you the sanatorium's info. Make sure to check it, alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_41 = {
    Text = [[
Thanks for sending info Erica could've transmitted herself, Professor Dexter.
If there's nothing else, I'm cutting the line.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
Wait.
After you requested those records, I reviewed the sanatorium's known intelligence.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Any findings?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_44 = {
    Text = "In Rye's missing persons cases, the victims all had elderly or mentally ill kin, and three personally sent relatives to the Rye Sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Others may have done the same, just undocumented."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Perhaps due to inexperience, the local police recorded this but didn't investigate the pattern."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_47 = {
    Text = "I'd say that's shaky evidence. Live long enough, and who doesn't have a sick relative or two?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Still, it's the only lead we've got for now."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_49 = {
    Text = "I'll keep an eye on these possibilities."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Daffodil smiles, sizing you up, then leans close to your ear."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_50 = {
    Text = "In that case, goodnight.\nI'll pour myself a glass of red from Chaplin Winery and savor the aroma of home—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Ramona cuts the comms."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Tomorrow morning, we'll head to the <Blue:Rye Sanatorium>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_53 = {
    Text = "After that, Francis left with her assistant in the dead of night, leaving you responsible for escorting Lily back to the Rye Sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_54 = {
    Text = "At Lily's request, you chose to take the subway to the remote suburbs."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_55 = {
    Text = [[
A faint stir pulls you from your reverie.
Looking down, the doll-like girl clutches the hem of your clothes.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_56 = {
    Text = "%player%..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_57 = {
    Text = "If a girl was naughty, didn't listen to her mom, and something bad happened... would her mom be so angry she'd never want to see her again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Being playful is a child's nature. Her mom would understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_59 = {
    Text = [[
But... what if that bad thing changed her?
Made her so different her mom couldn't recognize her...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_6 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Don't forget, you've already seen the \"Hellhound\" once.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_60 = {
    Text = [[
Wouldn't it be better not to go home?
Her mom would be so angry, so sad...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_61 = {
    Text = "You know she's talking about Lisa."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Lisa, as she is now, may never return to her mother's side, surviving only as \"Koum.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Your memories begin with the Yakutsk explosion a year ago. You can't offer Lily a proper answer about family or mothers, but if it's just to comfort her..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_64 = {
    Text = "A mother won't abandon her child."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_65 = {
    Text = "They say a mother's love is the most forgiving in the world."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_66 = {
    Text = "No matter what a child becomes, if she knows it's her child, she'll embrace her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_67 = {
    Text = "A mother wants her child safe."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Children grow up, forge their own paths, and sometimes must part from their parents."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Some mothers hope their child becomes a merchant, others a scholar, or an adventurer."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Her voice, haunting and cryptic, sends a chill creeping down your spine."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_70 = {
    Text = "No matter their choices, a mother will bless them and pray for their safety."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_71 = {
    Text = "You close your eyes, a figure plummeting from a clocktower flashing in your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_72 = {
    Text = [[
Life doesn't always follow a set path.
If you err, you make amends; if you don't, you live happier.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_73 = {
    Text = "On my travels with Ramona, we met a girl... she gave up her everything, trying to make things right."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Ramona stands at your side, the light in her eyes flickering, but she does not interject."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_75 = {
    Text = "She thought her death would erase her sin, but instead, it caused her friends so much pain. If even friends felt that way, how much more pain would her mother feel?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Lily listens, her head buried in her arms, lost in thought, perhaps finding your words too obscure."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_77 = {
    Text = "The train lurches violently, followed by a chorus of screams."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_78 = {
    Text = "In the chaos, a rustle comes from below. Looking down, Lily's gaze wavers, one small hand clutching your hem tightly."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_79 = {
    Text = "She's here."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Ramona gently pulls you back, speaking with polite restraint."
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_80 = {
    Text = [[
Likely coming for us.
Keeper, Lotan, prepare for battle!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19002_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
Thank you for your concern.
If you have other matters, please contact Professor Dexter. He'll relay them to us.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19003_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You hurriedly catch up to Lotan."
  },
  AvgDialog_19003_Content_2 = {
    Text = "I am the primal creation, the ancient leviathan, the abyss's tide, the soul of Eden, the god of ruin and order, bound to the will of this planet, and I demand lodging here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19003_Content_3 = {
    Text = "This place is too small for your lot!\nThere's a sanatorium outside town—plenty of space there, suits you just fine!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19003_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You insolent—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19003_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Hold on, Lotan..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19003_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Enough talk! I'm teaching this rude bastard a lesson today! Try binding me with that Key again if you dare!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19005_Content_1 = {
    Text = "One bad news, one good news."
  },
  AvgDialog_19005_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Bad news: that man slipped away in the chaos."
  },
  AvgDialog_19005_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Good news: on the bright side, Lotan won't be short of worthy opponents."
  },
  AvgDialog_19005_Content_4 = {
    Text = "It bolted so fast, I didn't even get to warm up."
  },
  AvgDialog_19005_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Hold on, I've got a plan."
  },
  AvgDialog_19005_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
You activate the Silver Key, its starry glimmers guiding you to the source of Aliemus.
Glancing in that direction, you catch a black shadow darting past.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19005_Content_7 = {
    Text = "That way—let's go!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19007_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You can open them now."
  },
  AvgDialog_19007_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Where are we...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19007_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A dimensional passage. We're following Daffodil's footprints."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Sleeved Trump"
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_10 = {
    Text = "That makes you sound even shadier..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Come on, just like a dumb beast can't resist the scent of blood, human brats can't say no to candy."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
That metaphor is...
Wait, there's something outside.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Hm? What's that noise?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You heard it too, right? Mind checking it out?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Hey, I can see you're trying to get rid of me—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_16 = {
    Text = "%player%, you're not as heartless as her, are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Leave this to me and Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Trust us, we're pros at talking to kids."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Ramona lets out a soft sigh."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Everything in the shop seems normal. The three of you sit in a row, facing little Lily.
The scene feels almost like an interrogation...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The noise outside grows louder."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You'd better go check, Lotan. Leave the small stuff to me and Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Tch, cheapskate."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Lotan strides out of the room, Lily's anxious gaze trailing her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The scary lady's gone. We can relax a bit, right, Lily?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The girl blinks, as if truly easing up—or perhaps not grasping the situation at all."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_26 = {
    Text = "You know where Lisa is, don't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Lily nods, then shakes her head."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
Can you tell us?
Don't worry, it's just me and %player% here. We'll keep it secret and protect you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_29 = {
    Text = "I can't, because... <Yellow:eyes> are always watching Lily..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Lily fidgets uneasily, her eyes darting toward the window."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_30 = {Text = "Eyes?"},
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Hmm, lots and lots of eyes, from <Yellow:other Dimensions>..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Dimensions? Do you know what dimensions mean, Lily?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Lily suddenly clamps her lips shut, saying nothing, her eyes nervously flicking to the window."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_34 = {
    Text = "%player%, there's something outside."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_35 = {
    Text = "...What, you're sending me away too?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_36 = {Text = "No—"},
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Roar———"
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Something's really happening out there!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Lotan! What's going on?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Just as you're about to say something to ease the oppressive air, Lotan speaks first."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Stay back, I've got this!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Hey, you know where Lisa went, don't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, we're reasonable folks. We won't chase you down like that crazy hag until we get the full story."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_7 = {
    Text = "If you spill the beans on Lisa's whereabouts, that pretty lady over there might give you some candy as a reward."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Lotan, you're scaring her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19009_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Scare her? Me? I'm the sweetest big sis around, aren't I?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19013_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The Current Will Guide You"
  },
  AvgDialog_19013_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Koum, don't be afraid."
  },
  AvgDialog_19013_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Animals are sharp. They—and it—must sense something."
  },
  AvgDialog_19013_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
A guttural, croaking screech pierces the darkness,
as if vocal cords have torn, throat choked with pus.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19013_Content_13 = {
    Text = "...Why... abandon..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19013_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
Lily raises a hand, pointing into the dark.
You faintly sense it's the source of the sound.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19013_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
The Fowlers Steel Bridge spans the midnight river,
its steel struts like harp strings, weaving a dirge in the ghostly night wind.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19013_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The darkness swallows all, a deep shadow. Koum whines at the bridge's dim end, where lamplight flickers ambiguously."
  },
  AvgDialog_19013_Content_4 = {
    Text = "...Something's off."
  },
  AvgDialog_19013_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I feel it too, but I can't place what's wrong."
  },
  AvgDialog_19013_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
Isn't it obvious?
Can you hear any animals?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19013_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
None.
Utter silence, not a sound.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19013_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Even holding your breath and closing your eyes to listen, you catch only the rustle of wind and a distant howl from the far darkness, too faint to tell if it's real."
  },
  AvgDialog_19013_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Koum snorts uneasily."
  },
  AvgDialog_19014_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Tch, you went easy on me, didn't you? Lame."
  },
  AvgDialog_19014_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The communication cuts off abruptly."
  },
  AvgDialog_19014_Content_11 = {
    Text = "At the edge of your vision, a creature appears—a hairless cat with long ears, or rather, two.\nIts twin heads, stitched densely together, share a sleek, graceful body."
  },
  AvgDialog_19014_Content_12 = {
    Text = "It leaps nimbly onto the shoulder of a disheveled man with a single eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_19014_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
What a fateful encounter.
The moonlight tonight is rather splendid, wouldn't you say?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19014_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Greetings, friends from Mythag University."
  },
  AvgDialog_19014_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Dissolution investigations aren't a prizefight, Lotan. If sweating it out is the only cure for your attention deficit, I'd suggest booking a session with Sylvia for counseling."
  },
  AvgDialog_19014_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Ramona, report your observations of the anomaly."
  },
  AvgDialog_19014_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Yes. I observed viscous pustules in the Domain dimension, roughly 20 inches in diameter. When pierced, they ooze black slime with a greenish glow before dissipating naturally."
  },
  AvgDialog_19014_Content_5 = {
    Text = "There's no mention of such pustules in records related to \"Cerberus.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19014_Content_6 = {
    Text = "...It's an Awakener."
  },
  AvgDialog_19014_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
Keeper, Ramona.
Listen closely: you must watch for a man with a mechanical monocle.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19014_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Your repeated clashes with the Sculptors' Association have surely put you on his radar."
  },
  AvgDialog_19014_Content_9 = {
    Text = "He may not confront you directly, but... <Shake:@1@2...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Yesterday Again"
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Perhaps, upon learning the truth, she'll lose herself to the question of "who she is"...
I've seen it happen countless times over millennia.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_11 = {
    Text = "What is she to you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_12 = {
    Text = "She's human, my classmate."
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_13 = {
    Text = "She can fight alongside me, like an Awakener."
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_14 = {
    Text = "What she is doesn't matter."
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Before you can say more, a familiar voice interrupts."
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I'm back, %player%, Lotan."
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_17 = {
    Text = "...What's wrong? Why are you staring at me like that? Is there something on my face?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_18 = {
    Text = "No, nothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Welcome back."
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Crawling, crawling. Endless crawling.
Legs devoid of strength slither on the ground, a blurred world reflected in a ravaged retina.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_20 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_21 = {
    Text = "I've got good news and bad news."
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Good news: the university approved our plan to escort Lily back to her mother first."
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Bad news: William spotted some strange figures eyeing the sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_24 = {
    Text = "If my instincts are right... they're lurking around us now."
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
This crawling has lasted nearly twenty hours.
Her body, severed from its spiritual source, decays, her strength teetering on collapse.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Before sinking into eternal darkness, she must find that person—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
You sent her off yourself, yet now you're all rattled.
Humans are always so... dishonest.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I don't know what truth she'll hear or what choice she'll make."
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_7 = {
    Text = "...I watched her grow from a toddling child to what she is now. She's no Awakener, but... not human either."
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_8 = {
    Text = "No ordinary human could wield such combat prowess."
  },
  AvgDialog_19015_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Dexter and his lot hid her origins well, even sealing the Black Pool for it. Not just to protect Mythag, but to protect her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Thorn in Flesh"
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Then, she turns to face you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_100 = {
    Text = "...Just down this slope..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_101 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_102 = {
    Text = "Soft snow collapses beneath your feet as you black out."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_11 = {
    Text = "These must be the new friends you mentioned, Lily?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Francis nods to herself."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Greetings, I'm Lily's mother. Just call me Francis."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_14 = {
    Text = "This is my assistant, <Blue:Nymphaea>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Good evening. I'm Nymphaea Polones, but please, call me Nymphaea."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
I've heard about what happened from Daffodil.
I'm a doctor at the <Blue:Rye Sanatorium>. Lily used to live there with me.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I didn't want Lily staying in that environment too long, so I sent her to town temporarily. I didn't expect her to struggle so much adapting to the outside world."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
I'm deeply sorry for all the trouble Lily's caused you.
As an inadequate mother, I apologize.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_19 = {
    Text = "If not for Koum's still-wary demeanor, she'd seem like a slightly stern yet kind ordinary mother."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A soft knock echoes at the door. In the quiet night, the rhythmic tapping sends an inexplicable chill down your spine."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_20 = {
    Text = "No need to say that. Lily's been very sweet."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_21 = {
    Text = "She gets along great with %player%, too."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_22 = {
    Text = "I hope I can repay you both someday."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Sounds like you're leaving already?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You know I can't stay overnight without Nymphaea."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_25 = {
    Text = "And... running away isn't a solution. I need to talk to <Yellow:that one>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Director Oswood, perhaps I could ease your burden in this matter?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
No, Nymphaea, you don't need to get involved in my affairs.
The decisions I've made, I must see through myself.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Then I'd advise against taking Lily with you, especially these nights."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Here's a win-win proposal: you handle your business, and leave escorting Lily back to these friends. How about it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_3 = {Text = "Hiss—"},
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_30 = {
    Text = "That wouldn't be right. Lily's already caused them enough trouble."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
Daffodil shoots you a glance.
It seems this is your "answer."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_32 = {
    Text = "We're happy to spend time with Lily."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_33 = {
    Text = "If that's the case... I'll entrust her to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Please take Lily home, to the Rye Sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_35 = {
    Text = "23:00, Second Floor Bedroom"
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Erica, pull up all available data on the Rye Sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Rye Sanatorium, located at Lindsay Road in the southeast corner of Rye, with a twelve-year history. Its primary focus is observation and rehabilitation of mental disorders, hence its nickname, the asylum."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Current director: Francis Oswood—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Skip the surface details. Any patient records or family information available?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Koum suddenly arches its back, adopting a predatory stance like a cornered beast."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
Searching, please wait...
Due to the volume of data, retrieval is estimated to complete by 8:00 AM tomorrow.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_41 = {
    Text = [[
...Alright, thanks, Erica.
Looks like that's all we can do for today.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_42 = {
    Text = "I have a feeling this case is just getting started..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_43 = {
    Text = "As you lie in bed, drowsiness creeps in, and a hazy impression stirs in your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Perhaps you're about to have that <Yellow:dream> again..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_45 = {
    Text = [[
Welcome to the <Blue:Elworth Expedition>.
I'm the team leader; you can call me <Blue:Bertrand>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_46 = {
    Text = "I've reviewed your application. Frankly, we've prepared for three months and shouldn't be taking on non-professionals this late."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_47 = {
    Text = "But this journey is perilous, and medical personnel are essential. So, despite your brief training, we welcome you to join us in conquering <Blue:Elworth>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_48 = {
    Text = "If you feel unwell at any point, report it immediately. For safety, we'll send a distress signal and leave you with enough supplies to await rescue."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
Be aware, this means you may not complete the expedition with us.
The team will honor your contribution, but your name won't appear in the final first-explorers' record.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Sorry to disturb you so late."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Bertrand, don't be so cold. She's willing to brave that icy wilderness with us—that's already impressive, isn't it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_51 = {
    Text = [[
...In extreme conditions, the risk of death is never zero.
If you're sure, you're part of the team.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Yes, I understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_53 = {
    Text = "That's your room. During training, wake up at 6:00 AM for morning drills. Don't be late."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_54 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Ah, it's been ages since we had such clear weather! Look, you can see the mountain peaks in the distance!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_56 = {
    Text = [[
The weather's worse than expected, and our progress these past few days has been poor.
We must seize this rare clear day and move as fast as possible.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_57 = {
    Text = "And you, you're the doctor—don't collapse and make others care for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Jeez, Bertrand, clear weather's good news. Can't you consider the team's morale?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_59 = {
    Text = [[
...I'm not like you thrill-seeking noble ladies. Soldiers have duties.
I won't turn back until we reach that highest peak.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Koum whips around, scratching the floor, its spine taut, growling menacingly."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Cecily, I'm fine.\nColonel Bertrand's right—let's make haste."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_61 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_62 = {
    Text = "You abandon some supplies, driving the sled dogs and ponies forward at maximum speed."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_63 = {
    Text = "An unease stirs within you. You pull a pocket watch from beneath stacks of clothing, whispering a prayer."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_64 = {
    Text = "You're looking at your watch again. Is it special?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_65 = {
    Text = [[
Yes, I bought it from a peculiar antique shop.
I keep my daughter's photo and a lock of her hair inside. It reminds me of her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Wow, you must have an adorable daughter. I'm jealous."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Alas, I wish I had a child too. How old is she now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_68 = {
    Text = "...She was eight when she passed away."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_69 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry, I didn't know..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_7 = {Text = "Mother..."},
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_70 = {
    Text = "It's all right."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_71 = {
    Text = "So, why did you join this expedition?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Oh, because of a legend!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_73 = {Text = "Legend?"},
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_74 = {
    Text = "They say in the Elworth mountains, there's a powerful church. Those who join it receive a <Yellow:Benediction>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Some even say that the Benediction can bring the dead back to life."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_76 = {
    Text = "But Elworth is so remote, its snowfields mostly untouched by human feet..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_77 = {
    Text = "That's what makes it real, don't you think? If it didn't wield power beyond the mortal, defying life and death, why build a church there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_78 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_79 = {
    Text = [[
Sorry, did I get too excited?
...I didn't mean to disregard your feelings...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I heard there was a development, so I rushed over. Lily and our pet haven't caused trouble for the lady, have they?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_80 = {
    Text = "If that church exists, I'll pray for you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_81 = {
    Text = "To bring your daughter back to your side."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_82 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_83 = {
    Text = [[
The avalanche strikes in an instant.
Before anyone can react, the world trembles, plunging into a terrifying, absolute white.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_84 = {
    Text = "You don't know how long has passed when the bone-chilling cold and pain rouse you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_85 = {
    Text = [[
Your vision is blurred. Your hands are numb.
Your legs won't move.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_86 = {
    Text = "At the edge of your sight, beneath a snowdrift, a pale arm protrudes."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_87 = {
    Text = [[
It takes an eternity to stagger to your feet.
You stumble to the figure, barely dragging the frozen, rigid body from the snow.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_88 = {Text = "This is..."},
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_89 = {
    Text = "From Cecily's frozen embrace, a wax-paper parcel falls. You open it gently, revealing a marked map, a black-and-white photo, and a wisp of pale blonde hair."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The woman Lily calls Mother pushes open the door, heading straight for Lily. She enfolds the small figure in her arms, gently stroking her head."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_90 = {
    Text = [[
The photo shows Cecily with a light-haired man.
On the back, written: "You will return."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_91 = {
    Text = "So you, too... lost someone dear."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_92 = {
    Text = "You check the map. If the avalanche didn't carry you too far, the marked location is less than half a day's journey from here."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_93 = {
    Text = "The ponies are gone, and your rations won't last for a descent."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_94 = {
    Text = "...There's no hesitation. You never planned to return alive."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_95 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_96 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_97 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_98 = {
    Text = "Dragging Cecily's frozen body with a climbing rope, you trudge through the snow, one heavy step at a time."
  },
  AvgDialog_19016_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Luck is on your side—you pass an icy lake, helping you pinpoint your location."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Genesis Return"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Keeper... I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_11 = {
    Text = "We're partners, comrades. What matters to you matters to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Thank you... I'll be back."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
You're back.
I told you to retreat from tough opponents and keep things contained, didn't I?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
Herbert slams a newspaper on the table.
The headline blares: <Italic:Londinium Subway Incident, Suspected Attack by Mysterious Group>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_15 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Helot stands rigid before Herbert's desk, silent as a statue."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_17 = {
    Text = "What are you standing there for? Waiting for me to serve you scones and tea?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The dossier. Give it to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_19 = {
    Text = "...Dossier?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Ramona, are you okay?
You've been uneasy since we left Lady Daffodil.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
That woman, Daffodil.
She said she'd send the dossier.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Herbert's face flickers with realization, then swiftly returns to its usual calm."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Oh, you know how it is—too many university reports piling up at the mailbox."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I cleared out a bunch earlier; no idea if it's still there..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Helot scans the room, swiftly pulling a lavender-bound dossier from under the newspaper."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_25 = {
    Text = "She skims it rapidly and sets it before Herbert."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_26 = {
    Text = "What is the meaning of this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
Herbert takes the dossier, flipping through it casually before setting it down,
as if he already knows its contents by heart.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_28 = {
    Text = "What does <Yellow:Failure> mean?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_29 = {
    Text = "<Blue:Albino> told me the Sculptors' Association lost Rogers' and Francis's forces, so they sent me to assist you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Ah, sorry... I should focus on the task at hand..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_30 = {
    Text = "So, in truth, I've been abandoned?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_31 = {
    Text = "It's a long story, tied to Francis."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
You know the <Yellow:Godmaking Plan> relies heavily on the <Yellow:Twins>' power.
Since Lily was abnormally Awakened, they've never been able to create your other half...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_33 = {
    Text = "I don't care about explanations!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
<BigShake:ANSWER ME!>
Have I been abandoned?!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_35 = {
    Text = "In terms of outcome, yes, but..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Why? Why? I need to see the Lady!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Don't bother. Still think you're the noble foster daughter of the magistrate?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Tainted blood can only produce a <Blue:traitor> like you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_39 = {
    Text = "I've done nothing wrong. I didn't betray the Lady!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_4 = {
    Text = "It's just that this has troubled me for so long, I... I can't help but care."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_40 = {
    Text = "You gave food to that filthy stableman, didn't you? Who allowed that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_41 = {
    Text = "<Small:That was... my birth father...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Ungrateful wretch. The magistrate took you in as her daughter, yet you cling to your criminal kin."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_43 = {
    Text = [[
The Lady said you'll never shed those chains in her lifetime.
Sparing your life is her mercy for old times' sake.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_44 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_45 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Damnable rulers."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Wielding power to toy with others, summoning and discarding at whim..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Granting favor like precious treasures, then tossing them aside like trash."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_49 = {
    Text = "I'm going to see <Blue:Eve>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Then go take care of it now."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_50 = {
    Text = "That's pointless."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Then I'll find the <Yellow:kindred girl> and take her back to the Church!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_52 = {
    Text = "But first, I need to see Eve."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_53 = {
    Text = [[
If you're so set on it, I won't stop you.
Here's the address of the Church of the Lightbearers' Londinium branch. You'll find Eve there.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_54 = {
    Text = "I can't guarantee how she'll respond."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_55 = {
    Text = "No need. I'll find out myself."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_56 = {
    Text = "The moment Helot turns to leave, she senses something amiss."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_57 = {
    Text = "The ground softens, collapses, her steps faltering."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_58 = {
    Text = "She looks down."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_59 = {
    Text = "It's not the ground collapsing—it's her.\nWhere her legs should be, the flesh splits like sprouting buds, oozing soft, viscous orbs."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_6 = {
    Text = "But the mission—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_60 = {
    Text = "<Shake:You... why... why are you cutting... the link...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Her words are cut short by the anomaly, her fading voice dissolving into a hollow roar."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Her body rapidly swells and twists, grotesque black tumors bursting through pale skin."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Fetid pus gushes from the ruptures, trailing viscous threads."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_64 = {
    Text = "You want to take Lily to see Eve, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Sorry, but a pair of new <Yellow:Twin Divi> are already in the works."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Even if you see Eve, it won't change anything."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_67 = {
    Text = "So why not make your final moments count?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_68 = {
    Text = "In this twisted form, with your instincts—go find your other half."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_69 = {
    Text = "<Shake:@2—@1—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_7 = {
    Text = "A trip back to Mythag won't take long."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_70 = {
    Text = "At the same time, Mythag Black Pool"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_71 = {
    Text = [[
The Black Pool's edge is deserted.
Ramona steps slowly to the water, gazing at her reflection.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_72 = {
    Text = "The rippling waves settle, revealing a woman's impassive face."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Her features are nearly identical to Ramona's, save for a more mature air noticeable only on close inspection."
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_74 = {
    Text = "You knew I was coming, didn't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_75 = {
    Text = [[
I have some questions.
I want to ask... <Blue:Tawil>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
With Lotan here, you don't need to worry about my safety.
Right, Lotan?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19017_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
Hmph, obviously.
Hurry back after you're done. This kid barely talks around me.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19018_Content_1 = {
    Text = "It's been ages since I stretched my limbs—let me have some fun!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Welcome to Rye"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_10 = {
    Text = "<Blue:Lily>..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Do you like this, Lily? Want to touch it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_12 = {Text = "Yea!"},
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Lily gingerly touches the tip of the Key.
Whether it's your imagination or not, the Silver Key seems to flicker at her touch.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_14 = {Text = "Wow..."},
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
Lily suddenly clings to you tightly.
A warmth softens your heart, and you can't help but gently pat her head.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Ramona glances at you, as if wanting to say something."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_17 = {
    Text = "What's up, Ramona?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I hate to ruin this moment of peace, but—\nLast night, the Hellhound struck. And this time, there's an eyewitness."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_19 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona hurry to the farmhouse where the incident occurred."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_2 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Did I have some kind of <Yellow:dream>... my head's all foggy...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
A pungent, acrid stench of blood assaults your senses before you even step inside.
The ground is littered with foul bloodstains, half-dried in eerie dark red.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Dozens of dead poultry lie strewn about, their throats turned skyward in a posture of agonizing death."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_22 = {
    Text = "I doubt a Cataclysm like the Hellhound would target a few chickens."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Hellhound? Even a stray dog's more civilized."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_24 = {
    Text = "It's happening again, it's happening... All-Father above, my little Lisa... please be safe..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_25 = {
    Text = "%player%, look here."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The chickens' remains bear claw marks, their vibrant feathers tangled chaotically over deep gashes. Their necks are snapped by immense force, jagged bones protruding from ragged breaks."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_27 = {
    Text = "These bite marks... they don't look canine."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Flat incisors, dull canines—hard as it is to admit, these look like <Blue:human bite marks>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
Ramona turns to the female villager beside you.
She's a widow who's lived alone in the town for years, with only her daughter, <Blue:Lisa>, by her side.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Gray:But why does my chest feel so heavy...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The woman's hair is a tangled mess, her hands clasped frantically as she mutters prayers, pale lips trembling."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
Ma'am, ma'am?
Don't be afraid, we're here to help. Can you tell us exactly what happened?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_32 = {
    Text = "This isn't the first time. It started with a few hens, but now, now..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_33 = {
    Text = "The fence can't stop it, it can't. I saw it, I saw it with my own eyes!\nIt wasn't a fox last night—it was a monster!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
The widow's voice rises to a piercing shriek.
She screams hoarsely, clutching her arms with trembling fingers.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_35 = {
    Text = "What's all the fuss about? It's just a beast!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The widow seems deaf to Lotan's scolding, lost in painful memories."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_37 = {
    Text = "It's not a beast, it's not!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_38 = {
    Text = "When it came close, I saw it, clear as day—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_39 = {
    Text = "That thing had human arms, and its face... nothing! That's the <Yellow:Hellhound>! It's going to drag me to hell!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Forcing open heavy eyelids, you're met with a pair of pale, clear eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
The widow stumbles back in panic, suddenly colliding with a small figure.
Her face twists in an instant.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_41 = {
    Text = "You again, you cursed thing! Get lost! Get lost!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_42 = {
    Text = "You've already killed Lisa, what more do you want? Get lost!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_43 = {
    Text = "The widow's expression is grotesquely feral, as if she'd tear Lily apart if she could."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_44 = {
    Text = [[
You step forward, shielding Lily behind you.
Ramona silently joins you, forming a protective barrier.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_45 = {
    Text = [[
Ma'am, please calm down.
We can't confirm Lisa's situation yet; there's a chance she's still alive.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_46 = {
    Text = "You think I don't want her alive? You think I want her dead? I heard her cries when I saw the Hellhound last night!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_47 = {
    Text = "It's that monster! It must be! It ate my Lisa, my poor Lisa, my poor daughter—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_48 = {
    Text = "If not for this witch, my daughter wouldn't have gone so far from home, wouldn't have been targeted by the Hellhound, wouldn't have met her doom!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_49 = {
    Text = "My daughter, my daughter—Mommy's sorry, so sorry—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Good morning..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Clutching her chest, the widow sobs and trembles, her frail soul barely holding her body upright."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Ramona stifles a sigh and gently steadies the woman."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Don't think that way, ma'am. Your daughter might just be at a friend's house, maybe tomorrow—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_53 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Lisa will not return.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_54 = {
    Text = "The childish voice cuts off your words. Turning, you see an unreadable expression on Lily's face—hesitation, or perhaps indifference."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_55 = {
    Text = "You... What did you say?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Lisa said... she will not be coming back."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_57 = {
    Text = [[
Impossible, absolutely impossible!
Lisa's a good girl, and she'd never say that...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Lily, where did you see Lisa?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Lily simply shakes her head."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
<Shake:Whoa?!>
Ramona, what's going on?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_60 = {
    Text = [[
No, you're spouting nonsense, you devil, you witch!
Lisa was so kind to you, and you curse her, slander her!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_61 = {
    Text = "With a loud smack, the widow slaps Lily."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_62 = {
    Text = "You quickly step in to separate them."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Lily, clutching her cheek, retreats behind you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_64 = {
    Text = "There's no evidence linking your daughter's case to Lily!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Ramona shoots you a look, signaling you to stop talking."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_66 = {
    Text = "You lot, don't you dare bully Lisa's mom!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_67 = {
    Text = "And who are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_68 = {
    Text = "I'm Hank, he's John, and we're Lisa's friends!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_69 = {
    Text = "That day, Lily took Lisa to the outskirts—we saw it with our own eyes!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_7 = {
    Text = "We couldn't wake you no matter how we tried, so she wanted to check on you... Didn't expect her to fall asleep on your chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_70 = {
    Text = "No more talk, {Male=he's,Female=she's} with that devil! Let's teach {Male=him,Female=her} a lesson!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Protect Lisa's Mom!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_72 = {
    Text = "..Do you ever feel like we're always picking on kids?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
The girl reluctantly climbs off, her gaze lingering on your chest.
Looking down, you see the Silver Key, still worn even in sleep, glinting with a faint shimmer.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19019_Content_9 = {
    Text = "What's your name?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Beneath the Brim"
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
So, you're here for a legitimate, reasonable purpose.
Given this shop's nature, it's for a deal.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You didn't ask on the spot but took this detour to find me, meaning someone was present you didn't want overhearing."
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Thus, I conclude: you want information about Helot and Lily."
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Yes. More precisely, what's the connection between Helot and Lily?
What exactly does <Yellow:kindred> mean?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_14 = {
    Text = "That's not your real question."
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
What you truly want to know is about the power within you...
You've already seen someone with <Yellow:kindred> power, haven't you?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_16 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Ramona knows?! So, my deal with the Lord Dexter couldn't stay hidden from her...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Ramona's face shifts abruptly, but Daffodil continues smiling, brimming with calculation."
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, I'm not one to tattle. You can keep playing innocent with Lord Dexter."
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
But sadly, I can't give you the answer.
My deal with Mythag University, in black and white, forbids meddling in school affairs.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_2 = {
    Text = "We're here."
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
My only advice:
since you're so curious, why not ask <Yellow:Her> directly?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Ramona freezes."
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Perhaps the answer was so simple it fell into her blind spot. She'd never considered it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_23 = {
    Text = "She pinches the hem of her skirt and curtseys politely."
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Thank you for the guidance. I'll take my leave."
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Be careful. The way back isn't so easy."
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_26 = {Text = "But..."},
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Perhaps that's exactly what you want."
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
A room wreathed in purple mist appears before you.
It feels faintly familiar, yet the details subtly differ from memory.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Tracing your recollections, you finally pinpoint the difference..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The goods here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Oh my. Unexpected guests grace us."
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The traces I left on the dossier were obvious. Since you didn't erase them, I trust you're open to a visit."
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Clever, yet unassuming.
Tell me, lass, why are you here?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19021_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
No, better yet, let me guess...
You're not secretly tracking me, or you wouldn't have left such blatant marks.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You pursue the black creature until it melts into the deep night, its trace lost."
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Herbert? As in <Blue:Herbert Rosenthal>? The former Mythag researcher, wanted for murdering his mentor?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The very one. He founded the Sculptors' Association single-handedly. Let's hope your limbs are still attached."
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
He didn't cause us any trouble.
Though, he seemed to be looking for an eight- or nine-year-old girl.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Up to his old tricks... Got it. William will assign other investigators to track Herbert's whereabouts.
Your top priority remains the Cataclysm.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
After all, these Dissolution monsters are proof of the Cataclysm's presence.
Unlike Londinium's smog or Mythag University's lunatics, they're not exactly common.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Understood, but... we've got a more pressing issue right now."
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Another mutant?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Not quite that urgent—just a lodging problem.\nIf I can help it, I'm not sleeping under a blanket of snow."
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_18 = {
    Text = "<Italic:{Male=Mister,Female=Miss}, are you guests from far, far away?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_19 = {
    Text = "A tender voice interrupts your conversation."
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Scurrying away like a coward—can that even be called a <Yellow:Hellhound>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Who's there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The snow on the wall reflects the pristine moonlight, and at its center stands a maiden whiter than the moon's glow."
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
If you can't find a place to stay, <Blue:Lady Daffodil> offers rooms.
Just around the corner.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You exchange a glance with Ramona, who nods affirmatively."
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_24 = {
    Text = "A white dress, a medical tag, so young. This must be the girl Herbert is tracking, and she might hold clues to the investigation."
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
Come on, what are you waiting for?
Fancy howling with wolves all night in the wild?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_26 = {
    Text = "If you want to rough it out in the wild, I'm game anytime, but I doubt your frail little bodies can handle it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Lotan slaps Ramona's shoulder. Ramona grimaces as if she's swallowed a fly but says nothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Lady Daffodil... sounds like some rich do-gooder, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
It seemed to flee only after sensing we held no fear of it.
Its survival instincts are animalistic, but I've never heard of a Cataclysm behaving like one.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Besides, it was wounded."
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_5 = {
    Text = "True, I caught the scent of blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The communicator beeps softly."
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Finally back online. After this mission, I'm upgrading this thing."
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Doll? What just happened?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19025_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
Communication interference, a favorite trick of <Blue:Herbert>.
Looks like you've met the lunatic with the two-headed cat.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19026_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Lord Dexter said it's best not to provoke Lady Daffodil."
  },
  AvgDialog_19026_Content_2 = {
    Text = "It's fine—she means no harm."
  },
  AvgDialog_19026_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Those monsters might disagree..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Let me go, let me go! Adults bullying kids!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Investigations require more than fists—they need brains."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Who asked you to butt in?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
My apologies, my apologies.
Doll, be a bit kinder to our little lady.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Doll, Lord Dexter?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Is Ramona there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_15 = {
    Text = "For some reason, Doll's usually calm tone carries a hint of urgency."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Yes. What's wrong?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I was reviewing communication logs. Did you query Erica about someone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_18 = {
    Text = "A woman calling herself \"Lady Daffodil,\" around twenty-eight, with ash-gray hair, dealing in antiques."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Yes, but Erica said there's no record of her in the archives."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_2 = {
    Text = "First, you're the ones who attacked us."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_20 = {
    Text = "That's because, in official records, she <Blue:doesn't exist>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Doesn't exist?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You mean... she can tamper with Mythag's records?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
Not tampering, just a deal.
Mythag destroyed her paper records, and in return, she provides us with information.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_24 = {
    Text = "And causes less trouble."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Isn't it fascinating? We fight to preserve records eroded by Dissolution, yet some want their traces wiped from existence."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_26 = {
    Text = "My dear Ramona, can you hear me? How's your expedition going? If you need help, just say the word to Daddy—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_27 = {
    Text = "If you've nothing urgent, save the comms for Doll and go back to your gala, Father."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
That's so cold! Is this adolescence? I came specifically to share info.
After all, details about Daffodil are kept right here with me.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_29 = {
    Text = "You can picture Dexter raising a finger, flashing his usual flamboyant, provocative grin, tapping his temple."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Second, according to my official age, I'm not yet an adult."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_30 = {
    Text = "If Lord Dexter's brain hasn't been pickled by alcohol, here's what Mythag knows about Daffodil."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Lady Daffodil is nominally an antique merchant, but privately, she's deeply entangled with illicit groups like the <Yellow:Church of the Lightbearers> and the <Yellow:Sculptors' Association>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_32 = {
    Text = "In Mythag University's three hundred years of records, at least twenty cases bear her influence... in ways we'd rather not see."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_33 = {
    Text = "In every case, she shows up at the end and <Yellow:reaps the skulls of the dead>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Three hundred years?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Yes, three hundred years. Despite masking her presence through some special means, Lady Daffodil is undoubtedly an Awakener."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Special means? Probably the stench of corpses."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_37 = {
    Text = "If she's a dangerous Awakener, why haven't Mythag or the Committee placed her under control?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_38 = {
    Text = "You've hit the nail on the head. While humans fret over crowded trams, Daffodil has mastered <Yellow:the ability to traverse Dimensions freely>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_39 = {
    Text = "The Committee's attempts to pursue her have all failed."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Seemingly stunned by her words, the boy falls silent, staring at Ramona.
Ramona sighs, releases his arm, and gives his back a gentle push.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_40 = {
    Text = "As for us, Mythag University isn't a prison. Our relationship with Awakeners is based on voluntary cooperation. If she's unwilling, we don't force it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Exactly. Some fools scream about escaping all day, but outside Mythag's Black Pool, they've nowhere to go."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Chain a dog, then call it willing."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Strange, did I hear something barking?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Enough, both of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_45 = {
    Text = [[
Hmph.
In short, with Lady Daffodil involved, this case is likely more complex than expected.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_46 = {
    Text = "If I'd realized her anomaly sooner, maybe..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_47 = {
    Text = [[
Don't be too hard on yourself. You already thought to query Erica, didn't you?
Youngsters need experience to learn how to read a situation.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Mythag's advice: avoid entanglement with her unless absolutely necessary."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Even with the Keeper, our strongest field agent, you're no match for that cunning, seasoned woman."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Alright, go home. We won't bother Lisa's mom anymore."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_50 = {
    Text = [[
The Hellhound case doesn't fit her style, so there must be other forces at work in this town.
Get caught in a tangled mess, and you won't stand a chance against her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Understood."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_52 = {
    Text = "We will proceed with caution."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Tch. Don't expect me to tiptoe around."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Doll ignores Lotan's remark, her voice growing distant, as if turning to someone nearby."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Dexter, anything else for your daughter?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_56 = {
    Text = [[
Of course, of course.
Besides combat, be cautious with your personal dealings with Lady Daffodil.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_57 = {
    Text = "After all, well... she's a woman of considerable mature charm."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Who doesn't love beauty? I'm quite taken by her demeanor myself, but don't go falling for her wiles..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_59 = {
    Text = "With a sharp click, Ramona cuts off the comms."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_6 = {
    Text = "She turns to the still-weeping woman, softening her voice:"
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Let's go. Next, we need to talk to Lily."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Please go rest and collect yourself. We'll talk to Lily and get to the bottom of this."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_8 = {
    Text = "And we'll let you know the moment we have any updates."
  },
  AvgDialog_19028_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You'd better find me some real opponents. These kids don't cut it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Good News, Bad News"
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_10 = {
    Text = "<Small:Lily behaves, and the Lady will help Mommy... Lily behaves...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The girl holds her breath, curling up in the shadowed thicket, evading the pursuit of a sharp-edged woman."
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The thicket suddenly rustles with faint whispers."
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_13 = {Text = "Come out!"},
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_14 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_15 = {
    Text = "After suffocating silence, a figure slowly emerges from the bushes."
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_16 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_17 = {
    Text = "...Forget it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_18 = {
    Text = "This has nothing to do with you... Keep running."
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The sharp-edged woman waves dismissively, signaling the beast to leave, then turns and vanishes into the night."
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The words have hardly left his mouth when Lotan and Ramona draw their swords, facing the One-Eyed Man who appeared out of nowhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Outside the Inn"
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
Well, it seems you don't know.
Pity, shortcuts don't just appear, and slacking off is always so tricky.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Oh, by the way..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The One-Eyed Man pauses, feigning mystery."
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_24 = {
    Text = [[
The Hellhound...
It's right behind you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Trying to distract us with such cheap tricks? You underestimate us."
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
A sudden palpitation grips you, a prickling at the nape of your neck, a bone-deep oppression.
You know, with chilling certainty, this is no mere trick of the mind.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Hmm? Why are you standing still?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Lotan, turn around."
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Lotan slowly turns her head."
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_3 = {
    Text = "No need for that. I'm merely visiting a friend, with no intent to clash with you folks."
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_30 = {Text = "What—"},
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_31 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
With a deafening pant that pounds your eardrums, golden slit pupils tear through the space behind Lotan.
Their vacant gaze sweeps the earth, finally locking onto you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Your heart trembles uncontrollably, as if those eyes have watched from the edge of the cosmic sea since time immemorial—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Stay calm, prepare to engage!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
By the way, have you seen a little girl?
About this tall...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ignoring your presence, the man gestures leisurely."
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Wearing a white dress, with a small tag hanging from her..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
Meanwhile
A Grove in Rye]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Where are you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19033_Content_9 = {
    Text = "<Small:Must escape... Must find the guest...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19034_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Lily, stand aside. We don't want to hurt Francis!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19034_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Don't let your mother keep making mistakes!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19034_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Mo... ther..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19035_Content_1 = {
    Text = "%player%, hold on!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19035_Content_2 = {
    Text = "This pustule can morph to protect you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19035_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Unfurl it now to block the strikes.\nIt's okay—Lily doesn't feel pain!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_1 = {Text = "Epilogue"},
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_10 = {
    Text = "So cool! I wish I could go somewhere that far..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Speaking of which, I saw a <Yellow:sigil> at the Altar in my dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_101 = {
    Text = "What sigil?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_102 = {
    Text = "Hold on, I'll sketch it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_103 = {
    Text = "You pull out a notebook, scribbling a rough outline."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_104 = {
    Text = "Wait, I've seen that sigil before..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_105 = {
    Text = "So, how's it feel to be blown to bits, dear Miss Doll?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_106 = {
    Text = [[
Thanks to you, not a thing.
Unlike some, I'm not torn between new lifeforms and clinging to mortal flesh.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_107 = {
    Text = [[
Calling the school's public line? Seriously?
Taunting doesn't suit your usual cowardice.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_108 = {
    Text = "Easy, now. I've got good news."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_109 = {
    Text = [[
That <Yellow:Silver Core> you left me? Prime stuff.
This trip wasn't a total loss.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Alas... hope she writes back as soon as she hits the next port..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_110 = {
    Text = "But Lady Daffodil's pissed. Says her reserved skull got locked somewhere even she can't reach. Bad deal, bad luck."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_111 = {
    Text = [[
For old times' sake, a word of advice: stop chasing me.
Those who try to get one over on me end up with nothing.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_112 = {
    Text = "Nothing? I don't think so."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_113 = {
    Text = "Ever wondered why I left you that Silver Core when I blew myself up?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_114 = {
    Text = "Doll's voice is ice-cold, but to Herbert, it carries a mocking lilt."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_115 = {
    Text = "On the sketchbook by Doll's side, a clear pattern is etched."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_12 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Helot stands alone at the dock, her long hair dancing in the wind."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Ship's leaving. You boarding?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
Helot waves, signaling the ferry to leave without her.
She hasn't decided on her next stop.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_16 = {
    Text = "If you get the chance, go and explore a wider world."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_17 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Amid the sailor's shouts, Helot hooks her chain and leaps onto the deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_19 = {
    Text = "As the whistle blows, the shore fades into the distance."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Nymphaea! Mr. Crawford wants to hear that white water lily poem again—go read it to him!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Hmph... those Mythag folks..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_21 = {
    Text = "This time, I owe them one."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_22 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Back at Mythag, you collapsed on your dorm bed for three days, without food or water."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The Keeper's coma became big news, splashed across the front page of the school paper by Hannah. Students from other departments peeked at your door."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Your awakening spread just as fast, no surprise."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
Ramona later told you this.
At the time, you only felt drained, as if all strength had been sapped.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_27 = {
    Text = "When you open your eyes, the first face you see makes you think you're hallucinating."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Congrats on recovering from the dimensional backlash, Keeper. I've got good news."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_29 = {
    Text = "This mission was way tougher than we estimated, but you pulled it off. It'll look great on your final report."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_3 = {
    Text = "One moment, please."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Amazing, huh? Doll doesn't praise often."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Doll...? Weren't you... but Herbert..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I'm rethinking that praise."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_33 = {
    Text = "<Shake:No! Please, don't!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_34 = {
    Text = "I'm called <Blue:the Brain in a Vat>. The brain back at Mythag is the real me."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The <Yellow:artificial body> that got blown up? I can make as many as I need."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Can't waste them, though, or the Awakening Studies Department's budget will tank. Then you'd have to drag Ramona to perform sword dances for Lord Dexter's sponsorship."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I'd be thrilled to watch."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Oh, by the way, those dimensional monocles you used? One-use items."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Bought from that black-hearted Daffodil. One's worth about five of my artificial bodies."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_4 = {
    Text = "By the way, haven't seen Director Oswood in ages."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_40 = {
    Text = "So if you used a few extra, I suggest indenturing yourself to Lord Dexter to pay it off."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_41 = {
    Text = "It would be my honor."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_42 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_43 = {
    Text = "The stream of visitors is relentless, more exhausting than field missions."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_44 = {
    Text = "When they finally disperse, you close your eyes for a breather, ready to rest, when a familiar figure quietly appears by your bed."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Shall we... visit Lily?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_46 = {
    Text = "A small figure sits on the bed, leaning against a white pillow, gazing out the window."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Lily, %player%'s here."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_48 = {Text = "%player%."},
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
How're you feeling about my earlier offer?
Linking with %player%, becoming our partner...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The director... she's working on some important research alone. It might be a long, long time before she returns to the sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Lily turns away, avoiding your gaze."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_51 = {
    Text = [[
If... if I don't want to?
Will you lock me up... as a monster?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I didn't mean to push you. Just..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Let me handle this."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_54 = {Text = "Lily."},
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_55 = {Text = "Yes?"},
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_56 = {
    Text = [[
What happened to you... maybe everyone shares some blame.
But from another angle, neither you nor your mother were wrong.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_57 = {
    Text = [[
The root of all this evil is Dissolution...
a disease that makes people forgotten.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Because those around you forgot you, Francis obsessively chased proof of your existence."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Because she, too, began to forget you, she couldn't recognize her closest kin."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
Fair enough! Someone as brilliant as her, stuck in this rundown place? What a waste!
If you see her, tell her I wish her luck with her research.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_60 = {
    Text = "If we don't unravel the secrets behind Dissolution, tragedies like this will keep happening."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_61 = {
    Text = [[
Francis's pursuit was right, Lily... your mother wasn't wrong.
She was just led down the wrong path.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_62 = {
    Text = [[
But we'll walk the right path. We'll fight Dissolution to the end.
So, will you help us, Lily?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_63 = {
    Text = "<Small:Francis... Mom...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_64 = {
    Text = "At Francis's name, Lily sobs, clear tears rolling from her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_65 = {
    Text = "I know no one can replace your mother."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_66 = {
    Text = "But we... we can be your family too."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Family? Bah."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Lotan storms in, barging into the conversation with gusto."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_69 = {
    Text = [[
You visit Lily without me?
That's how you treat a comrade who fought beside you?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Yes, we'll wish her... all the best."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Lotan, you're... not heading back to the Black Pool?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Waiting around's boring. Field missions with you might bring some fun opponents."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Stop crying already."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Lotan pats Lily's frail shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_74 = {
    Text = "If you don't mind, you can call me Mom from now on."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_75 = {
    Text = "How's that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_76 = {
    Text = "A.F.290, Elworth"
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Francis gently wipes the grime of oil and black mud from the girl's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_78 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:If you don't mind, you can call me Mom from now on.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_79 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_8 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Feels like a weight's lifted from my chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_81 = {
    Text = "With Lotan around, and if she hangs out with Aurita and the others... Lily should fit in here fast."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Good thing not everyone's as stone-faced as you, Doll, or William. Living at Mythag would be rough otherwise."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_83 = {
    Text = "You try to lighten the mood, but Ramona doesn't bite."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_84 = {Text = "Ramona?"},
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Keeper, we need to talk."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_86 = {
    Text = [[
She used your title, not your name.
You straighten up instinctively.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_87 = {
    Text = "During this investigation, your face looked off a lot."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_88 = {
    Text = [[
The worst was when you read Francis's diary...
Your reaction wasn't what I expected.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_89 = {
    Text = [[
The first half was long-winded, but you flipped through it so fast,
like you already knew it all.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Lisa's mom, Lisa wrote again! She says she and Lady Daffodil left the Remouahe Desert, sailing across the ocean to the new Aglo Republic."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_90 = {
    Text = "I have a theory about this."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_91 = {
    Text = "<Italic:You saw her dream, didn't you?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_92 = {
    Text = "You hesitate, then spill everything you saw in the dreams."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_93 = {
    Text = [[
<Yellow:Empathy> manifesting so strongly in you...
You knew the whole story, that's why you were so resolute at the end.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_94 = {
    Text = "I've been thinking these past few days. To us, Awakeners are comrades, sometimes even friends we'd trust with our lives."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_95 = {
    Text = [[
But to Francis, Lily was a life born from Dissolution.
To her, it was no different from the monster that took her loved ones.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Just laying out the truth... were my words back then too harsh? Did I completely disregard her and Lily's feelings?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Harsh or not, Francis's cruel experiments on Lily... that's undeniable. Even if it wasn't us, the <Yellow:Mystia Treaty Committee> would've tracked them down eventually."
  },
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_98 = {Text = "But..."},
  AvgDialog_19036_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Seeing Ramona's face darken, your mind races for a new topic."
  },
  AvgDialog_19037_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Lend a hand, Doll!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19037_Content_2 = {
    Text = "No need. She's got it covered."
  },
  AvgDialog_19037_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I'm half asleep here. No tougher opponents?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19037_Content_4 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19038_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Lily, snap out of it! It's me, %player%, and Ramona!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19038_Content_2 = {
    Text = "...%player%..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19039_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Wave after wave, coming at us like..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19039_Content_2 = {
    Text = "They were ready for us?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19040_Content_1 = {Text = "Asylum"},
  AvgDialog_19040_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ramona starts, ducking into the nearest empty room."
  },
  AvgDialog_19040_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
Ugh, Bob hasn't even come to see me...
When will this end...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19040_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
I've been here years, never seen a visitor.
If he cared, he wouldn't have sent you to a place like this.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19040_Content_13 = {Text = "*sigh*..."},
  AvgDialog_19040_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Their chatter fades as they shuffle away. Ramona takes a moment to survey her hiding spot."
  },
  AvgDialog_19040_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ramona treads lightly on her toes, slipping silently through the corridor's shadows."
  },
  AvgDialog_19040_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Keeper disapproves of her choice but relents at her insistence, urging her only to withdraw quickly, success or failure."
  },
  AvgDialog_19040_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Her reasoning is sound: if only one can help Lily, Ramona—still combat-ready and adept at stealth—is the best choice."
  },
  AvgDialog_19040_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
At the third turn, dodging gossiping patients, Ramona hesitates.
A flicker of doubt creeps in about why she's here.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19040_Content_6 = {
    Text = "An indistinct call stirs within her, a vague sense of duty toward the girl."
  },
  AvgDialog_19040_Content_7 = {
    Text = "That same call convinces her Lily is in the easternmost room of the sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_19040_Content_8 = {
    Text = "If luck holds, she can slip Lily out unnoticed. Then, notify Mythag to scour the place and uncover why the Silver Technology failed..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19040_Content_9 = {
    Text = "*Cough, cough!*"
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Cracked Carapace"
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_10 = {Text = "This is..."},
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The true Hellhound."
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
This isn't your first encounter with this beast, but now you're certain:
it's the target of your investigation, the root of Rye's disappearances.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The numbing scalp, the chill down your spine—it's the same as the last two times you were \"caught,\" but sharper, more intense."
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Your vision blurs red."
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_15 = {
    Text = "In the blood-red haze, Daffodil's seductive voice whispers in your ear."
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Take it off. Don't look, and your head won't hurt."
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_17 = {
    Text = "What happens if I do?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You'll slip out of consciousness, becoming fodder for the Dimensional Hound in peace."
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Then I'll hold on."
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The ground trembles violently."
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You pull out one of Doll's vials, pop the cork, and gulp it down."
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The taste is nothing like you expected—cloyingly sweet, rushing to your head."
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_22 = {
    Text = "If I'd known it tasted this good, I'd have asked for more to mix with water."
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Smoke spreads through the room, more twisted monsters materializing."
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You wipe blood and tears from your eyes, crimson veins on your hand urging you to act fast."
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_25 = {Text = "Ramona!"},
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Yes! Cataclysm \"Hellhound\" detected—preparing for final combat!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_3 = {
    Text = "What's going on?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The runes on the walls tear apart."
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Was it an accidental scrape when subduing Lily, collateral from the fight with Helot, or something Daffodil did on her way out?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You can't recall."
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_7 = {
    Text = "It doesn't matter anymore."
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Purple, amorphous smoke seeps from the rune cracks, pooling on the floor into a shape."
  },
  AvgDialog_19041_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
Your vision strains, nerves pulsing uncontrollably.
From the warped fissures emerges a jagged, bestial monster.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19042_Content_1 = {
    Text = "We are surrounded."
  },
  AvgDialog_19042_Content_2 = {
    Text = "We didn't see this many monsters last time."
  },
  AvgDialog_19042_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Tch, where'd they even come from?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Cuckoo's Asylum"
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Aside from Mia and Koum, this is just a plain, isolated sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I jumped the gun, tipped our hand. If I'd thought it through a bit more..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Leave for now"
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
What's done is done.
Let's pull back for now. We can return once we've gathered more intel.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_14 = {Text = "Hesitate"},
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Got any ideas?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
This place... it's too ordinary.
Almost deliberately so.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_17 = {
    Text = "A doctor sets up a tidy little sanatorium in a nowhere town, hiding from the world, keeping everything in perfect order."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
And by pure chance, she rescues a child who's an Awakener?
That's too many coincidences.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_19 = {
    Text = "For now, let's contact Mythag."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Time ticks by, second by second. Leaving Francis behind, you turn the sanatorium upside down—no hidden doors, no secret mechanisms, no concealed rooms."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Ramona taps the silver pin on her chest, and you all hold your breath, waiting for the connection."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_21 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
Ten seconds pass, filled only with suffocating silence.
Your heart begins to pound.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The comms... cut off again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_24 = {
    Text = [[
...It's not that simple.
Keeper, can you sense the other Awakeners?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_25 = {
    Text = "You focus, reaching for the faint thread of resonance, but the once-tangible connection has snapped, leaving only a blinding void at the other end."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Even the links to Ramona and Lotan beside you are faint, barely perceptible."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_27 = {
    Text = "I can just about sense you two, but Mythag's completely gone."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_28 = {
    Text = "It seems <Yellow:Silver Technology> is blocked here, or rather, anything tied to <Yellow:Dissolution> is being suppressed."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_29 = {Text = "Lotan."},
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Even the forbidden office yields nothing out of the ordinary."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Yeah, what's up?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_31 = {
    Text = "We've lost contact with Mythag, and the Keeper's link to the Awakeners is weak. This is a Class Two emergency. Immediate evacuation, prioritize the Keeper's safety."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Fine, fine. I knew this trip was just babysitting duty..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Evacuate? What about Lily? And Koum?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Ramona sighs, glancing down the corridor."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_35 = {
    Text = [[
They've been with Francis for a while; she has no reason to harm them.
We're just strangers who pose a threat to her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
We're in the dark, she's got the upper hand.
Let's not rush this. We'll come back for them, prepared.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_37 = {
    Text = "The sharp clack of heels echoes through the corridor, followed by a voice as calm as still water."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_38 = {
    Text = "I assume you've checked the place again? Found anything?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_39 = {
    Text = "We're leaving."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Beads of sweat begin to glisten on Ramona's forehead."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Of course, of course. Lily rarely gets visitors, but I won't keep you if you're set on going."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Where are Lily and Koum?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
I just settled them in.
You're sharp, so you wouldn't say something foolish like taking them with you, would you?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_43 = {
    Text = "I'm grateful you brought her back, but showing up at someone's home and trying to take their daughter and pet? That's a bit rude, don't you think?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Francis twirls a strand of hair around her finger, her voice dripping with menace."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Naturally. We just thought it proper to say goodbye in person, since we traveled together."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_46 = {
    Text = "No need. They're young, worn out from the trip, and already asleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_47 = {
    Text = "I've got my hands full with sanatorium business, so I won't see you out. Safe travels."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_48 = {
    Text = "With that, Francis turns and walks away without a second glance. You watch her silhouette vanish into the corridor's shadows, realizing you're drenched in cold sweat."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Lotan, escort the Keeper out."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ramona, did the Committee say when they're sending someone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_50 = {
    Text = "What about you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Ramona draws her weapon, her face resolute."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_52 = {
    Text = "I'm going to find Lily."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_6 = {
    Text = "...I've been with you the whole time. Did you see me calling anyone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Wait—you were bluffing her?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I thought I could shake something loose, but she didn't flinch."
  },
  AvgDialog_19043_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I kept an eye out while we searched. Not a single trace of D-Mark in this place."
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_1 = {
    Text = "After the fierce battle, Lily—attacking while shielding Francis—is overwhelmed, visibly exhausted."
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_10 = {
    Text = "\"...those hunted thrice by it shall have their souls bound to the Underworld...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Right. Everyone here is seen as a dimensional transgressor—prey for the Dimensional Hound."
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Hey, you hag, you must know how to deal with this thing!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_13 = {
    Text = "...Yes. It's simple, really."
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_14 = {
    Text = "This monster's hunt is <Yellow:methodically across all dimensions>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
Therefore, in all dimensions, <Yellow:there's only one Hellhound.>
Trap It in a cage, and It can't harm anyone.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Easier said than done! How do you cage a dimension-hopping dog?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_17 = {
    Text = "...The runes on the wall. It appeared after they were broken."
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Sharp eye, lass. Those runes were sold to me by Lady Daffodil—for the price of my skull after death."
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Can you fix them?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Her black pustules are pierced several times. She's quick enough to avoid fatal hits, but prolonged fighting will drain her completely."
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Francis freezes, as if she'd never considered it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Speak! Can you do it or not?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
The pattern's etched in my mind.
But I need to draw it precisely, without a single mistake.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I need more time."
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_24 = {
    Text = "If it's just time, leave it to us."
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Lotan, let's do this!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Hell yeah, been waiting!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Don't go all out—pace yourself!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Don't just stand there! Are we letting a kid face the monster alone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_4 = {
    Text = "It's no use... no use!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_5 = {
    Text = "That beast is a <Yellow:monster of causality>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Monster of causality?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_7 = {
    Text = "It exists because of cause and effect. As long as there's a cause, there's a result."
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
<Yellow:Once someone begins dimensional travel, It pursue the transgressor.>
No matter the process, It cannot be destroyed until the hunt is complete.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19044_Content_9 = {
    Text = "This operating room was modified to exist outside time's dimension."
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Memory Fragments"
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_10 = {
    Text = "3. Attempts to Contain ■■■■ Hounds\n3.1 First Containment Experiment:\nFailed. Could not restrict their traversal.\nProposed adjustments to the array's scale and inscription precision.\n\n3.2 51st Containment Experiment:\nFailed. Could not ■■■ their traversal.\nHunted subjects cannot escape sealed spaces."
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_11 = {
    Text = "3.3 73rd Containment Experiment:\nFailed. Could not restrict their traversal.\nHowever, ■■■■ Hounds lingered in the sealed space for ■ minutes after completing the hunt, exiting via ■■■ gaps.\nProposed adjustments to the precision of cipher ■■ inscriptions.\n\n3.4 ■■■■■■ Experiment on ■■■■ Hounds:\nSuccess.\nSuccessfully confined ■■■■ Hounds in a space measuring 2.86 feet long, 2.08 feet wide, and ■ feet high.\nContinued ■■■■■■, but due to ■■ in combat ■■■■, the ■■■■ Hounds ■■■ escaped.\nCalculations suggest a similar rectangular space is the optimal ■■■■ for containing ■■■■ Hounds.\nProposed enhancements to ■■■■■■■■■.\n\n3.5 ■■■■■■■■■■■■■■■■\nContaining ■■■■ Hounds is excessively difficult, but self-confinement to evade pursuit may be viable.\n■■■■■■■■■■"
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_12 = {
    Text = "This file's blacked out to hell."
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
That's Daffodil's style.
She holds all the cards and calls it a fair trade.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_14 = {
    Text = "We done? Keep dawdling, and your little schoolgirl's gonna be monster chow."
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_15 = {Text = "Let's go."},
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Before that, we've got some trouble to handle."
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Ramona and I are peers..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Scratch that—we've got some trouble to handle."
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Or rather, YOU've got some trouble to handle."
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Honestly, I'm impressed you can nap anywhere, anytime."
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_20 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:ROAR!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_3 = {
    Text = "So, what's the situation now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Done. If a problem like this stumped me, how'd my brain be any different from Lotan's?
Put this on.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Doll hands you a small, triangular silver fragment."
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Slot it into your brooch—don't lose it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Oh, and William had someone deliver a file. Seems Daffodil sent it for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Codename: Cerberus\n\nSince the discovery of dimensions, crossing them has been taboo for most beings. The danger lies not only in alien environments and the visual strain of extradimensional data, but also in the presence of this meticulous \"enforcer.\"\n<Yellow:■■■■ Hounds can manifest in any dimension, systematically hunting all who have crossed dimensional boundaries.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19045_Content_9 = {
    Text = "1. Cases of Failed Pursuit\nOnly a few species in the cosmos can evade their gaze.\nThe ■■ race is known to use mental transfer technology to avoid the ■■■■ Hounds' sight, suggesting the Hounds lack the ability to track or hunt minds.\nVerification of their tracking logic through partial physical and mental transfers:\nExperiment 1: Transferring an untargeted subject's tail to another dimension. ■■■■ Hounds did not pursue.\nExperiment 2: Severing a targeted subject's arm and transferring it to another dimension. The subject was consumed in the original dimension. ■■■■ Hounds did not pursue the arm.\nExperiment 3: Transferring an untargeted subject's mind to another dimension. ■■■■ Hounds did not pursue.\nConclusion: ■■■■ Hounds can only lock onto targets when body and mind are unified.\n\n2. Attempts to Kill ■■■■ Hounds\n■■. Conventional fatal wounds cause ■■■■ Hounds to ■■■■.\n■■■■ Hounds are classified as undying entities; severing their form only temporarily slows them."
  },
  AvgDialog_19046_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You lost again. That's three."
  },
  AvgDialog_19046_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
So you want revenge on the betrayer, to protect Francis who saved you.
But fighting isn't about that.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19046_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
Not for protection, not for vengeance, not for validation.
Fighting is just fighting.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19046_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Your world's too small, always chasing the faint glow of someone else's light like a moth."
  },
  AvgDialog_19046_Content_13 = {
    Text = "If you get the chance, go and explore a wider world."
  },
  AvgDialog_19046_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Lotan passes her, moving forward without a backward glance."
  },
  AvgDialog_19046_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
This... can't be...
Why?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19046_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Helot kneels, defeated, her long hair coiling in pooling blood, a hoarse hum escaping her throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_19046_Content_4 = {
    Text = "If I wanted to brush you off, I'd say it's just raw power."
  },
  AvgDialog_19046_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
But that's not it.
Your moves are quick, your skills sharp.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19046_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Lotan walks past Helot, sword in hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_19046_Content_7 = {
    Text = "But you're lost. You're still searching for a reason to fight."
  },
  AvgDialog_19046_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Back at the railway bridge, you were a mindless monster... betrayed by your linker, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19046_Content_9 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_19047_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You question a few lucid patients in the sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_19047_Content_2 = {
    Text = "They describe Francis as \"strict but dedicated.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19048_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You won't see Mrs. Oswood..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19049_Content_1 = {
    Text = "As you step onto the cobblestone path outside the sanatorium, the oppressive weight finally lifts."
  },
  AvgDialog_19049_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Lotan! Time for you and Keeper to step up!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19049_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Yeah, yeah, got it! Don't order me around like I'm your guard dog!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19049_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The silver brooch gleams with renewed life."
  },
  AvgDialog_19049_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Just as you're about to contact Mythag, a voice cuts through, clearer than any comms signal—Doll's."
  },
  AvgDialog_19049_Content_4 = {
    Text = "What are you standing around for? Get over here and help!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19049_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Doll?! What are you doing here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19049_Content_6 = {
    Text = "What kind of smooth-brained logic makes you ask that? You've been <Yellow:off the grid for ten days>, and you're wondering why I'm here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19049_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Ten days?! But I just..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19049_Content_8 = {
    Text = "No time for your drawn-out detective act."
  },
  AvgDialog_19049_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Suddenly, figures cloaked in black veils surround you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19050_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Francis's office... Full circle, back here again."
  },
  AvgDialog_19050_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Might as well search it one more time."
  },
  AvgDialog_19051_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
The facility, though worn and sparsely furnished, is kept clean.
After several rounds, you find nothing beyond patients and standard medical supplies.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19051_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Risk comes with the territory."
  },
  AvgDialog_19051_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Ramona pushes open the heavy, cold wooden door."
  },
  AvgDialog_19051_Content_12 = {
    Text = "A chill wind rushes out, followed by a half-human figure that lunges with a guttural shriek."
  },
  AvgDialog_19051_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Eventually, you pause before a sign reading \"Director's Office - No Entry.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19051_Content_3 = {
    Text = "If there's a secret in this place, it's behind that door."
  },
  AvgDialog_19051_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Want me to bust it down?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19051_Content_5 = {
    Text = "No need for that. Look—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19051_Content_6 = {
    Text = "She twists the knob, and the door swings open."
  },
  AvgDialog_19051_Content_7 = {
    Text = "It's unlocked?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19051_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Trust me, I'm as shocked as you are."
  },
  AvgDialog_19051_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Let's go in."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_1 = {Text = "Sunset"},
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Back then, I didn't feel pain—not at all."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Later, things changed. Mom locked me up, did more and more experiments."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
But it's not Mom's fault.
She was locked in this room with me, unable to leave.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Because I lost control, killing so many people.
Because it... it hurt so much.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Lisa said, as my only friend, she'd try to stay with me longer."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Otherwise, she couldn't have held on."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_16 = {
    Text = "...Truth is, I couldn't hold on either."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The giant beast rips through more space, its claws slashing at Lily."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Before the faltering pale maiden, black pus forms balls and nets, deflecting Its attacks again and again."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Lily steps forward, her tender bare feet stirring black pus that pools around her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_20 = {
    Text = "But even so—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_21 = {
    Text = "She's my only mom."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Don't you—hurt my mom!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Black pus balls explode, forming spikes that pin the Hellhound's claws."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The remaining pus sprouts knife-like teeth, severing the bound ankle."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_27 = {
    Text = "It tears space apart, frozen time leaking through the cracks, the sunset swallowed whole."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
The claws dissolve into demonic purple smoke, reforming.
Alien limbs burst from the spatial rifts, lunging at Lily!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Lisa said her mom didn't recognize her, even shot her with a rifle."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_30 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona exchange a glance and join the fray."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Lisa said her mom was strict, scolding or hitting her whenever we played."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Lisa said if her mom knew she turned into a big dog because of me, she'd never forgive her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_6 = {
    Text = "But she couldn't help it. She was so hungry, and didn't want to steal, so she went home for food... and got caught."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Lily pauses."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_8 = {
    Text = "But my mom is different."
  },
  AvgDialog_19052_Content_9 = {
    Text = "She thought I was someone else, but the first time she cut me with a scalpel, she said sorry."
  },
  AvgDialog_19053_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Something's off about the smell here."
  },
  AvgDialog_19053_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Smell.
You and Koum sure think alike.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19053_Content_3 = {
    Text = "No need for smells to tell—they're here."
  },
  AvgDialog_19054_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You always pick impossible fights."
  },
  AvgDialog_19054_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
In the subway, Herbert held me back.
The second time, I showed up in my worst form.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19054_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Now, Francis has given me a fair shot at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19054_Content_4 = {
    Text = "No amount of power sources can fix a weak heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_19054_Content_5 = {
    Text = "No more talk. Feel the wrath of a vengeful soul!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_1 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Mo...ther...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Why didn't you tell your mother you can feel pain now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You feel it, so why never say it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_12 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Mother said... Good kids... don't fear pain...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_13 = {
    Text = "<Shake:But... Mom... it hurts... Lily... it really hurts...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Black tears, laced with Dissolution slime, stream down Lily's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Lily... you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_16 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Mom... it hurts...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_17 = {
    Text = "No... even if you feel human pain, you're still a monster..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
<Small:You're not my daughter...>
<Small:My real daughter... she's gone, nowhere to be found...>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
Francis staggers back in despair, knocking over the surgical table.
Scalpels scatter, slicing the doll on the nightstand and the rabbit blanket on the floor.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Lily, you don't want to fight us, do you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_20 = {
    Text = "<Italic:Ding-a-ling... Ding-a-ling...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_21 = {
    Text = "A phone rings abruptly, shattering the room's tense air. No one answers, yet a man's voice spills through the receiver."
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Hello, everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Herbert! Where's Doll?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Her? Blown to ashes in front of me, of course."
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_25 = {
    Text = "That's Mythag's unity for you—abandoning friends at the critical moment for a \"noble sacrifice.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Back to business. I've noticed \"<Yellow:the big one>\" getting closer. You're nearing the truth, aren't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_27 = {
    Text = "As a reward for your efforts, I'll generously gift you the ultimate answer."
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_28 = {
    Text = "\"Tap tap\"—a leisurely knock sounds at the door,\nits casual rhythm betraying the visitor's nonchalance."
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_29 = {
    Text = "No one answers, yet the door swings open."
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Shake:This... is the... master's... command...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_30 = {
    Text = "There stands a woman in purple, ever-smiling, poised with elegance."
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_31 = {
    Text = "What's this? No warm welcome for me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Lily, you don't want to obey your Master!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
Because you've remembered, haven't you?
You're you, not that monster anymore!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You can <Yellow:feel pain>, can't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_7 = {
    Text = "With a sharp slap, the widow strikes Lily's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Lily, clutching her cheek, retreats behind %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_19055_Content_9 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You fend off the eerie creature. Rapid footsteps echo down the corridor as the office door is flung open from the outside."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ramona's direct confrontation catches you off guard."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Francis tilts her head, unruffled, as if Ramona's words missed their mark."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Human experimentation? I'm afraid there's been a misunderstanding."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_13 = {
    Text = "This sanatorium has two floors, fewer than twenty rooms. I inspect every inch daily. If illegal experiments were happening, I'd know."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Ramona frowns."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
You can't be your own alibi, ma'am. Surely you're aware of that.
And we've got plenty of evidence against you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_16 = {
    Text = "This \"Mia\"... she's been through quite a few procedures, hasn't she?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
And Lily.
You call yourself her mother, yet you're clueless about her not being human?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Francis pauses, then lets out a wry chuckle."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_19 = {
    Text = "You've got it all wrong. Lily calls me mother, but I'm not her birth mother."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_2 = {Text = "Mia!"},
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I rescued her from a den of thieves. Her abnormalities are the work of the scoundrels who took her first."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_21 = {
    Text = "As for Koum and Mia, Lily brought them here. I don't even know where they came from."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Most people would recoil at the sight of Koum or Mia, or at least keep them away from kids."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_23 = {
    Text = "But in my youth, I had a... bizarre encounter. I've seen things most can't imagine."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_24 = {
    Text = "So, despite Koum's... unusual appearance, I kept it for Lily's sake."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_25 = {
    Text = "It's her cherished companion, and she doesn't connect easily with others. How could I separate them?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_26 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_27 = {
    Text = "If that doesn't clear things up, I'm happy to escort you through the sanatorium again, including my office."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, I'm not going anywhere until the Committee arrives."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_3 = {Text = "Roar—"},
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_4 = {
    Text = "So this is where you've been hiding. Come with me—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_5 = {
    Text = "She stops short, noticing you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I believe I mentioned the office is off-limits."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Sorry, but \"visiting\" hours are over."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Per Article 81, Clause A of the <Blue:Treaty>, no individual, organization, or institution may conduct experiments on humans or unknown entities without authorization from the <Blue:Mystia Treaty Committee>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19056_Content_9 = {
    Text = "We suspect human experimentation here, and the <Blue:Committee> has been notified. They'll be sealing this place off. Your cooperation is expected."
  },
  AvgDialog_19057_Content_1 = {
    Text = "From a shadowed corner of the steel bridge, grotesque creatures lunge, their chilling roars echoing."
  },
  AvgDialog_19057_Content_10 = {
    Text = "When she couldn't breathe, she wished she could respire like a fish."
  },
  AvgDialog_19057_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Her parents, seeking a cure, traveled constantly for trade. Too weak for long trips, they left her in a sanatorium, where poetry books were her only companions."
  },
  AvgDialog_19057_Content_12 = {
    Text = "...No one told her it wasn't a disease, but a mysterious phenomenon called \"Dissolution.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19057_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The sanatorium treated her as a plague carrier, charging steep fees. Even the meal deliverers refused to speak with her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19057_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
The longer she stayed, the less her parents could be with her.
Aside from poetry and the sea, nothing accepted her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19057_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Later, her parents died in a shipwreck. The sanatorium cast her out, leaving her to return to the sea alone."
  },
  AvgDialog_19057_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Tell me, if a doctor studying Dissolution gave her a home, treated her as an ordinary person affected by a phenomenon, shouldn't she show gratitude through action?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19057_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Now's the time."
  },
  AvgDialog_19057_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Behind them stands a girl in a black dress."
  },
  AvgDialog_19057_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Good evening. A pleasure to see you again."
  },
  AvgDialog_19057_Content_4 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry, but could you all leave Rye for now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19057_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
Nymphaea, you care for the patients. You can't be ignorant of Francis's actions here.
Even so, you're siding with her?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19057_Content_6 = {
    Text = "...Let me tell you a story."
  },
  AvgDialog_19057_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Once, there was a frail girl, scared of people, comforted only by the sea's breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_19057_Content_8 = {
    Text = "But the sea brought more than peace—it brought a terrifying disease."
  },
  AvgDialog_19057_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Her lungs... began to vanish."
  },
  AvgDialog_19058_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Don't Look Back"
  },
  AvgDialog_19058_Content_10 = {Text = "Ready"},
  AvgDialog_19058_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Everyone takes a deep breath. Lotan steps forward, pushing open the sanatorium's gates—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19058_Content_12 = {
    Text = "What the hell happened here?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19058_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The interior glimmers with an eerie, shadowy light. Walls and floors split open, revealing chasms of endless chaos and starlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_19058_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
Dimensional breach.
Francis's meddling with time and space... it drew <Yellow:The Gaze>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19058_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The keepers of time and space have caught her scent."
  },
  AvgDialog_19058_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Could it be the real Hellhound...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19058_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
Focus on our mission.
Do not engage <Yellow:It> directly.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19058_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
You leave Nymphaea on the other side of the steel bridge, pressing toward Rye Sanatorium.
Beyond the bridge, the air grows deathly still, chillingly silent.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19058_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Nymphaea was stalling. It's too quiet—the patients have probably been moved.\nThe Sculptors' Association's intel is sharp."
  },
  AvgDialog_19058_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Francis and the Sculptors' Association are allies in name only."
  },
  AvgDialog_19058_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Francis focuses on curing Dissolution, which clashes with Herbert's ideals."
  },
  AvgDialog_19058_Content_6 = {
    Text = "In her diary, she treated Herbert as just an outside collaborator."
  },
  AvgDialog_19058_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Open this gate, and we're back inside the sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_19058_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Everyone ready?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19058_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ready for a brawl?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19059_Content_1 = {
    Text = "It's quieter than I expected."
  },
  AvgDialog_19059_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Got it.\nSorry, folks, I've got an urgent matter. Feel free to explore on your own—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19059_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
Just use my name for access anywhere except my office.
Excuse me.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19059_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Francis hurries off with the patients, her figure vanishing into the corridor's shadows."
  },
  AvgDialog_19059_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Perfect chance to poke around."
  },
  AvgDialog_19059_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Exactly. If Koum's transformation happened here, there'll be traces."
  },
  AvgDialog_19059_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
A common misconception about hysterical patients.
Most of the time, they're as calm as anyone else.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19059_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Even at night?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19059_Content_4 = {
    Text = "That's where it gets tricky. Nights are when complaints spike."
  },
  AvgDialog_19059_Content_5 = {
    Text = "But I can't blame them. Most are abandoned here by their families. At night, they're prone to crying fits or episodes."
  },
  AvgDialog_19059_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Francis pushes open a ward door as she speaks."
  },
  AvgDialog_19059_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Director, you're here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19059_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Yes, how's everyone holding up?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19059_Content_9 = {
    Text = "We're fine, but Mia's been crying and asking for you. You'd better check on her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19060_Content_1 = {
    Text = "This is...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19060_Content_2 = {
    Text = "From the corner of the room, a jet-black monster emerged."
  },
  AvgDialog_19060_Content_3 = {
    Text = "its hideous stitches betraying its origins—a product of the Sculptors' Association."
  },
  AvgDialog_19061_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Francis is linked to Lily, so Helot's linker..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19061_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The <Italic:Basics of Awakener Shaping and Linking> course mentioned that, barring uncontrollable side effects, the best linkers for Awakeners are incapacitated individuals."
  },
  AvgDialog_19061_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
The sanatorium's patients...?
Because their minds are unstable, they're not afraid of losing control?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19061_Content_4 = {Text = "Exactly."},
  AvgDialog_19061_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Lily, Nymphaea, Helot... these patients are Francis's batteries."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Phew—good thing Francis reinforced the door. That racket shouldn't have drawn anyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Flattering, but science isn't like swinging a sword—every cut drawing blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_11 = {
    Text = "If we handed this to the research department's old fogies, they'd take eighteen hours and still not find the issue."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_12 = {
    Text = "But Ramona should've been out by now. A quick room search doesn't take that long..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
No need to worry. By my calculations...
she's been in there maybe ten, fifteen minutes?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Relax, my numbers are almost done."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Just take a break. We'll be in to grab your buddy soon."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
At the same time,
in the operating room of Rye Sanatorium]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Ramona stirs on a soft bed, greeted by a girl's worried face."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_18 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:Where... am I? How long was I out?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_19 = {
    Text = "She props herself up, clutching her forehead. Sunset light streams through the window, bathing the room in a warm, amber sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
These files... Francis was studying...
Dissolution?!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_20 = {
    Text = "...It feels almost cozy."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_21 = {
    Text = "No, it's not an illusion..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Ramona murmurs."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Were it not for the cold glint of surgical tools by the bed, this could pass for a girl's bedroom."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Ramona, you need to go. Take Koum... with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The girl ignores Ramona's question, dropping her words before turning to stroke Koum's head."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_26 = {
    Text = "What about you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Lily can't go; <Yellow:It> will notice."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_28 = {
    Text = "It? ...You mean the \"Hellhound\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Lily, don't be scared. We come from a university that fights anomalies. We can protect you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_3 = {
    Text = "If you wanted another tour, you could've just asked. Why all the sneaking?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
No one escapes Its gaze.
Those It mark become Its prey.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
Besides, Lily needs to stay with Mother.
She's too lonely alone.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_32 = {
    Text = "She's done cruel things to you and Koum. I won't let her walk free."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_33 = {
    Text = [[
No, Mother didn't lie.
Koum becoming like this... it wasn't her fault.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Can you tell me what you know?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_35 = {
    Text = "There's no time."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_36 = {
    Text = "A rare sorrow flickers across Lily's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Koum, take her and go."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The door creaks as the handle turns."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
Koum snatches Ramona up, slinging her onto its back.
She struggles, but black slime binds her tightly to Koum.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_4 = {
    Text = "A sigh echoes from behind the filing cabinet."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
Don't come back. Forget me, forget this place...
Mother won't hurt anyone anymore...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Under the stunned gaze of the newcomer, Koum charges forward, bowling them over."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Francis stumbles, unable to steady herself. Koum breaks through, leaping into the fathomless dark."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Ramona glances back. Lily supports Francis, standing against the sunset, her pleading eyes bidding farewell."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_44 = {
    Text = [[
Forget me.
Like everyone else...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_5 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Or perhaps..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Francis snaps her fingers. Ramona's head spins, her vision warping strangely..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_8 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:You've been swayed by her, haven't you? Stepped right into the vortex?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19062_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
"All-mighty Doll," "Genius Brain in a Vat."
Six hours and you still haven't cracked this little problem?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You battle the Hellhound for what feels like ages, yet it's not as grueling as expected."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_10 = {
    Text = "..No! Watch out!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Amid Francis's scream, purple smoke rapidly coalesces, striking at you and Ramona like lightning."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You shove Ramona aside, stepping in front of her. Human instinct shuts your eyes, bracing for nightmarish pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_13 = {Text = "Whimper!"},
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The expected agony doesn't come. A beast, pierced through by purple spikes, stands before you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The spikes vanish, leaving not a wound but a circular void."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The void seems to sap all of Koum's strength. Its massive body slumps, breath fading."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_17 = {
    Text = "It happens too fast for you to react."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Purple smoke surges again from the fissures, a colossal form tearing the cracked runes into jagged gashes."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The Hellhound reveals its true form. What appeared before was a mere sliver; now, It looms as a titanic beast, glaring at those who dared claim victory."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
It excels at mental oppression, but its claws deal scant damage.
Doll's golden vials greatly ease the mental strain.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_20 = {
    Text = "In the room's corner, the calmed pale maiden rises, stepping back from her weeping mother's embrace."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Mom, I'm so glad you recognized me."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
It was %player% and Ramona who helped me decide...
I'm so grateful to them.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_23 = {
    Text = "So, I want to help them."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Soon, the Hellhound lets out a chaotic whimper, dissolving into the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Ramona glances at the sobbing mother and daughter, sighs, and taps her brooch."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Investigator Ramona, requesting log: The \"Hellhound\" is defeated. Mission complete."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Keeper %player%, preparing to retrieve Awakener Lily, modified entity Koum, and detain suspect Francis Oswood..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_7 = {
    Text = "...Input...Zzz...Hell..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Erica's voice crackles, barely audible."
  },
  AvgDialog_19063_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Erica, you there? Can you hear me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19064_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Francis's experiments hurt innocent people."
  },
  AvgDialog_19064_Content_10 = {
    Text = "To reach Ms. Oswood, you'll have to go through me."
  },
  AvgDialog_19064_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You mean those who vanished? The cruel ones who abandoned their families here and walked away?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19064_Content_3 = {
    Text = "They remind me of so many—uncles, aunts, cousins—who stood by my bed, then vanished without a care."
  },
  AvgDialog_19064_Content_4 = {
    Text = "They were after my parents' meager inheritance, never my thoughts."
  },
  AvgDialog_19064_Content_5 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19064_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You're not letting us in, are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19064_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Nymphaea nods gently."
  },
  AvgDialog_19064_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I want to do something for Ms. Oswood, no matter what."
  },
  AvgDialog_19064_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I'm this sanatorium's only, fragile shield."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_1 = {
    Text = "See? Having a Keeper around makes things so much easier."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Don't tell me it's from the top dog of the Kingdom of Leonia."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Way more interesting—the money's from the head of the Sculptors' Association, <Blue:Herbert>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_12 = {
    Text = "No surprise there."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Here's Francis's psychiatric report."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_14 = {
    Text = "She was in therapy too?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
I knew that woman was unhinged.
Spouting nonsense worse than students during finals!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
She claimed her "husband and daughter were dissolved by black slime."
The doctor called it stress-induced delirium and prescribed sleep aids.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_17 = {
    Text = "She could see <Yellow:Dissolution>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_18 = {
    Text = "And page three—a photo of Francis with the Elworth expedition team."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_19 = {
    Text = "This photo's dated <Yellow:25 years ago>?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Is this how you treat a \"missing for ten days\" VIP?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Exactly. She should be 52 now, but recent photos show her looking identical to 25 years ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_21 = {
    Text = "What, is she working on <Yellow:immortality>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_22 = {
    Text = "That's about the extent of what your muscle-brain can grasp."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
Based on this, we searched her old lab.
It was a wreck, like eight hundred Lotans had a brawl in there.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_24 = {Text = "But?"},
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_25 = {
    Text = "But William's got grit. Coughing through the dust, he cleared the debris and found this in a crushed desk drawer."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Doll hands you a worn notebook, its brown leather cover bulging with stuffed pages."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
November 21

Everyone's congratulating me, not just for my medical career, but for finding love.
Tomorrow, after the wedding, I'll be Francis Oswood, starting a new life with @3, my husband.

January 11

We're not rushing to have kids, but @1 is still the living proof of my love with @3. I swear I'll give her the best future.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_28 = {
    Text = "July 7\nAt dinner, @1 excitedly told me about the tea party she and @3 held in the yard.\nSeeing her joyful smile, I nearly cried. If I could spend more time at home, I could laugh with them on the lawn, instead of...\nThen @3—by All-Father, the best husband and father—hugged me from behind. He said nothing, but I knew what he meant.\n\n\"No need to worry, we are and always will be the happiest family.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_29 = {
    Text = "February 7\n\nThey say I'm in bad shape, that writing things down might ease my mind—if not for me, then for @1.\n\nSo, from the beginning.\n\nOn @3 @1, while taking @1 to the amusement park, @3 collapsed. I rushed to the hospital after the call, only to see @3 smiling gently, telling me not to worry. I asked about the black hole on his shoulder. He looked puzzled, said I was overworked and needed rest, then patted my head, joking about who the real patient was.\n\nBut I saw black slime oozing from his shoulder.\n...I've seen that black slime before, somewhere. Where? Why can't I remember?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You're not missing now, are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_30 = {
    Text = "After @3, @1 fell ill too. Black slime seeped from her chest. They wouldn't believe me—they couldn't see it—but it was there, dripping like mud...\n\n@3 kept smiling, saying he passed some nameless disease to @1, that's why they both got sick. I held his pale hand, watching him waste away, the black wound on his shoulder growing, and I didn't know what to do.\n\n...They lied. Writing this down doesn't help."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
March 5
<Blue:Mr. Herbert> visited @3 and @1 again. He brought @1 her favorite biscotti.
I'm so grateful. Since they fell ill, I've taken leave from the lab, and he's patiently urged me to spend time with family.

About the black slime, he didn't dismiss me like others, didn't call it hysteria or hallucinations. Instead, he introduced me to some religious studies, mostly tied to an organization called the <Blue:Church of the Lightbearers>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The diary ends abruptly here."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Herbert, the Church of the Lightbearers... She's tangled up in something big."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_34 = {
    Text = "The diary feels incomplete. Where's the rest?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_35 = {
    Text = [[
We turned that lab upside down. Nothing else turned up.
Poor William nearly got lungfuls of dust leaving that place.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Speaking of, where's Ramona?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I was just about to tell you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Enough chatter. I've got critical intel for you, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_5 = {
    Text = "After we lost contact, we dug into Rye Sanatorium from the outside."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The place has been bleeding money for years, surviving on external funding. The biggest donor? The <Blue:Nathan Greene Foundation>. Following that lead, we found something."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_7 = {
    Text = "That foundation loves bankrolling cutting-edge tech and human boundary-pushing—airship development, glacial expeditions, high-efficiency generators, even weird stuff like soul extraction."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_8 = {
    Text = "But a sanatorium? That's not their style."
  },
  AvgDialog_19065_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Digging deeper, we found the funds were a directed donation. The foundation was just a broker. The real donor is someone else."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_1 = {Text = "She"},
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_10 = {
    Text = "That's when—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Francis lets out a scream, barely human."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_12 = {
    Text = "As if beholding the world's most terrifying sight, she hurls the watch away, stumbling back, knees buckling as she collapses."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Her eyes bulge, pupils shrinking, hands clawing at the scalpels on the floor. Their blades nick her skin, blood beading drop by drop."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Unfazed, Francis kicks frantically, muttering incoherent ravings."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_15 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Impossible, impossible, it can't be, I won't believe it!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
Ramona steps forward, retrieving the watch.
She pops the clasp and silently hands it to you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The watch's face is corroded, mottled with decay, yet its inner side is pristine, as if it had been sealed against some liquid."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Inside, a photo shows Francis holding a girl—the spitting image of the Lily you know, down to the last detail."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I suspected as much..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_2 = {
    Text = "All eyes turn to Daffodil."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Francis's diary said she \"awakened\" Lily at the <Blue:Elworth Altar>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_21 = {
    Text = "An Awakener's \"shaping\" needs a tether from this world, and the most effective is <Yellow:human tissue>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_22 = {
    Text = "In that diary, Francis wrote she kept Lily's hair in this watch, carrying it to Elworth."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_23 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Lily... is Francis's daughter>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_24 = {
    Text = [[
Francis, answer me...
Do you still think she's a monster?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Ramona's voice is soft, almost a whisper, yet in the room's oppressive silence, it's as clear as a pin dropping."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Francis shakes her head in disbelief, scooting back on the floor, crashing into the surgical table with a loud clang."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Lily, barefoot, steps toward Francis."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_28 = {
    Text = "So you finally remember... Mom..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_29 = {
    Text = "No... you... stay back..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Under everyone's gaze, she waltzes across the room with ease, placing a pocket watch in Francis's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Francis's voice is hoarse, trembling with fear, a wail of protest."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Glass shards on the floor slice Lily's tender feet, healing instantly. Deaf to Francis's pleas, she draws closer—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
She lifts the woman's bloodied hand, pressing it gently to her cheek.
Then, she beams with a happiness never seen before.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Mom, it's okay. It doesn't hurt, Mom."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Mom, do you remember? You promised to take Lily on the new subway..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_35 = {
    Text = "But it hadn't opened yet, and Lily got sick."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Even though Mom wasn't there, Lily felt what it's like to ride the subway."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_37 = {
    Text = "A huge iron block, racing through dark tunnels... like flying underground."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_38 = {
    Text = "When you come back up, you're so far from where you started."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
We... can do more things like that together.
Lily wants to do so much more... with Mom.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Herbert insisted this be returned to its rightful owner."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_40 = {
    Text = "So, Mom, touch Lily's face like before, okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Can we start over?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_42 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Francis pulls Lily into a tight embrace, sobbing uncontrollably."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Lily... Lily...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_45 = {
    Text = "What... what have I done..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_46 = {
    Text = [[
Don't cry, Mom, don't cry...
Mom didn't do anything wrong. You didn't know Lily was Lily, and Lily didn't know she was herself.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_47 = {
    Text = "If it wasn't for Mom's efforts, Lily would've vanished long ago, unable to stay by Mom's side for so long."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_48 = {
    Text = [[
Mom now remembers Lily. Lily's so happy now, like floating on a cloud...
That's enough.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_49 = {
    Text = "No, no, Lily, it's all Mom's fault..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_5 = {
    Text = "With a cryptic smile, she flashes a playful, suggestive grin at you all."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Mom will make it up to you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_51 = {
    Text = "We can ride the subway, go to the amusement park, the fair..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Wherever Lily wants to go, Mom will take you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Mom will stay with you, make you the happiest girl in the world..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Lily's already the happiest girl, Mom."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_6 = {
    Text = "If you need anything—monocles, Herbert's files—just reach out through Lord Dexter, alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Ramona grits her teeth, as if to speak, but steps aside, clearing a path."
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_8 = {
    Text = "<Small:Let's see how this plays out.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19066_Content_9 = {
    Text = "<Small:Understood.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Oi, big brain, your upgrades look like they're doing squat."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ramona, you okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I'm fine, but Lily—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
Enough with the Lily talk. Take {Male=him,Female=her} and go.
Babysitting weaklings is a headache.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_13 = {
    Text = "...I'm still here, you know."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
This must be "Koum," huh?
The Sculptors' Association's taste is getting sicker by the day.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Ramona, your Gnosis Index is all over the place. What happened?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Ramona nods, her already clouded face darkening further."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Where should I begin?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Keeper filled me in on everything before you split at the sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Ramona recounts her time alone, from staying behind to being dragged out by Koum."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_2 = {
    Text = "...You really don't respect the head of research, do you? The \"isolation\" here is tricky. I'm not an Ultra Awakener, so it's not exactly smooth sailing."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_20 = {
    Text = "And Lily gave me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_21 = {
    Text = "She glances at you, then at Doll and Lotan, her eyes complex."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
Alright, time for battle prep.
Lotan, come with me for a sec.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_23 = {Text = "Huh? Why?"},
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_24 = {
    Text = [[
No reason. You took a mental hit in that last attack, didn't you?
Let me check your Gnosis Index.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Doll shoves Lotan away."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Keeper... no, %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_27 = {
    Text = "There's something you need to see."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_28 = {
    Text = "She pauses, eyes closing, swallowing hard with tension."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_29 = {
    Text = "She hands you a file folder."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_3 = {
    Text = "%player%, try Spirit Tracing."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
I found this in a hidden compartment in Francis's office.
The notebook inside... I think Lily slipped it in.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Some calls are yours—and only yours—to make."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The file contains dozens of brief experimental logs:"
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_33 = {
    Text = "observations, and surgical records of Dissolution Patients at various stages."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You've seen similar files at Mythag, but Francis's methods push far beyond your ethical boundaries."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The notebook seems to be someone's diary, written in neat, precise script."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
March 13
I took samples of the black slime, testing its physical and chemical properties.
After incineration, a trace of silver dust remained in the crucible.
...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_37 = {
    Text = "May 3\n@1 passed away.\n@3 didn't attend her funeral—he was too weak to leave his bed."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
July 6
Like last time, the hospital handled @3's funeral.
When I thanked them for helping me through my grief, they gave me odd looks, asking what I meant by "last time."
...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_39 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You focus, feeling for faint threads of resonance in the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
You skim the pages rapidly.
For some reason, the entries feel familiar, like you've seen or heard them before.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_41 = {
    Text = "You <Italic:know> these things."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_42 = {
    Text = "At the end of the first diary, Francis resolved to go to Elworth, with no intent to return."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_43 = {
    Text = "The second diary's first half recounts, in memories, what you already know. The latter half grows chaotic..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_44 = {
    Text = [[
Professor Herbert visited again, bringing "specimens" from the Sculptors' Association.
These people, ravaged by Dissolution, won't last a month before vanishing from the world.

...To cure a disease, you must study it thoroughly.
Normal people can't see this black slime. I could never gather this many cases alone.
I'm doing this to stop Dissolution's spread, to spare others the pain my daughter endured.
...
...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_45 = {
    Text = [[
Last night, Lily lost control.
She escaped. Professor Herbert warned me that newly Awakened entities can be unstable.
...
I need to find her quickly and leave the clinic.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_46 = {
    Text = [[
No... can that place even be called a clinic anymore?
The equipment's been pulverized, organic matter reduced to viscous slime.
She flattened an entire safe into a bookmark-thin sheet...
Three researchers Herbert sent are missing too. I dread to think what became of them...
...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_47 = {
    Text = [[
Thirty-fifth modification, Silver Core implantation.
These Silver Cores, provided by Herbert, came from the Elworth Altar where I met Lily.
That place is abandoned now. Herbert found this Silver Core in the embers.
With the Silver Core, Lily gained basic communication skills and better command obedience.
...This wasn't my original goal, but knowing she won't harm others brings me some comfort.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Sometimes, I suddenly think Lily resembles her.\n...But a monster is a monster. No matter how many surgeries, she never says, \"It hurts.\"\nShe has no pain response. For a monster, a sliced abdomen healing instantly is routine.\nYet that detached gaze reminds me—my @1 is gone forever..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
Why don't you feel pain?
Why can't you feel pain like a normal person?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ramona's shadow emerges in your fog-laden mind, first as an outline, then sharper."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_50 = {
    Text = [[
Eighteenth year since leaving Elworth, 374th experiment on Lily.
A voice in my mind tells me the answers I seek lie within her.
I can't resist the urge to operate on her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_51 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:She's calling to me, like marble calls to a sculptor, like blank paper to a painter.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_52 = {
    Text = [[
...
Lily escaped again.
I have no time or means to bring her back now.
The experiments are at a critical stage, and the "@4 Hound" is watching me.
At least Lily has basic cognition now and won't harm others randomly.
And if something happens... it's a necessary sacrifice...
For the greater good of humanity...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_53 = {
    Text = [[
That girl asked if there were human experiments here... Of course not.
...These things were human once, but now they're just alien monsters.
Yes, just alien monsters.
I'm here to cure the disease that took my daughter, to spare others my pain, step by step.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_54 = {
    Text = "I'm so close to the answer, inches away..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
She moves at an inhuman speed, closing in,
faster, faster...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_7 = {Text = "Ramona!"},
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Ramona, astride a lion-like beast, charges toward you, kicking up dust as she skids to a halt."
  },
  AvgDialog_19067_Content_9 = {
    Text = "She dismounts, and Koum stretches with a lazy yawn."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Lily keeps maneuvering the black pustules against the Hellhound, her movements less nimble than before."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ramona shields your eyes, grabs a vial from your pocket, and pours it down your throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Open that door and walk out. You'll be free from Its reach forever."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_12 = {
    Text = "And... take Lily... with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You're not coming?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
It only appears to hunt prey.
If this room is empty, why would It stay?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You're all good kids. I must atone for my sins."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Please... take care of Lily."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Mom! Lily's not leaving!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Lily, be good."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
Lily won't be good! You said good kids don't cry out in pain... Lily listened.
So this time, Lily won't!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Five minutes."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_20 = {
    Text = "She raises her arm with effort, sending pustules at the purple smoke. The Hellhound pierces them instantly, splattering viscous liquid."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Francis looks at you, her gaze as earnest as her words."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_22 = {Text = "Take her."},
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_23 = {
    Text = "<Italic:This is the final plea of a sinner, a failed mother.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona act in sync."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_25 = {
    Text = "As she once did for Ramona, you and Ramona hoist Lily onto Lotan's shoulders."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Tch, heavy lifting's on me again, huh?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_27 = {Text = "Mom!—"},
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Lily, stripped of resistance, is carried from the warped space, away from Francis—\nher mother's final resting place."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_29 = {
    Text = "As you leave, you glance at the window, flickering with eerie starlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Ten minutes."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Beyond lies chaos, nothing but deep light."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_31 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_32 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Francis, covered in grime, steps toward the colossal beast."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Daffodil warned me that even the slightest tampering with time draws the monster called \"@4 hound.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Back then, I was obsessed with changing the past, stealing even a second to undo what Dissolution took."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_36 = {
    Text = "But the most important thing was always, always by my side."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I almost realized..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_38 = {
    Text = "I came alone to tell you something vital."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_39 = {
    Text = "I won't hand Lily over to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Fifteen minutes."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Have you thought this through? Give me Lily, and whether you sabotaged rituals or hid test subjects, your past won't be held against you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Your research can continue. The Association will keep funding you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_42 = {
    Text = "The Church won't hesitate to share their latest Awakener tech. You could create another \"Lily.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_43 = {
    Text = "I must decline."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_44 = {
    Text = "After all these years, Lily's become like my daughter."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Yet I was blind, locking myself in the past."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Even the monster of causality or my imprisonment in this tiny sanatorium won't stop me."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Mom, look, a subway poster..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Want to go on a trip, Lily? But we can't leave the hospital, sorry."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_49 = {
    Text = "The surgery's at a critical point. Once you're better, Mom will take you anywhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_50 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_51 = {
    Text = "So, I've made up my mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_52 = {
    Text = "My fault, my amends."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_53 = {
    Text = "You're the monster I \"awakened.\" My obsession opened the dimensional passage, bringing you here."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_54 = {
    Text = "If obsession is a form of mental strength—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Until my mind is exhausted, you won't reach my child!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Hey, you done yet?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_7 = {
    Text = "That's it, done."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Her final stroke completes the pattern, connecting like an ouroboros. The design before Francis forms a dizzying cipher."
  },
  AvgDialog_19068_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Don't stare!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19069_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Transcendence"
  },
  AvgDialog_19069_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Helot? Weren't you already..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19069_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Some meddler's been at work, huh."
  },
  AvgDialog_19069_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Yeah, sorry about that. I crawled back from hell."
  },
  AvgDialog_19069_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Keeper, remember our three rules?
Let me take her one-on-one.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19069_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, I won't lose to her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19069_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Suits me just fine."
  },
  AvgDialog_19069_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Soft pustules slither in with Helot's steps, squeezing through the door's cracks."
  },
  AvgDialog_19069_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
Kids, go keep the others at bay.
My only opponent is you, Lotan.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19069_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The room echoes with sobs, clashing with the gentle sunset."
  },
  AvgDialog_19069_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Are we calling the Committee?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19069_Content_4 = {
    Text = "She deserves a trial."
  },
  AvgDialog_19069_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Let's bring her back to Mythag."
  },
  AvgDialog_19069_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
Alright, then.
Whatever you decide, I'll follow through.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19069_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Ms. Francis, please come with us."
  },
  AvgDialog_19069_Content_8 = {
    Text = "<Italic:Sorry, she can't leave with you yet.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19069_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The clatter of chains rings out behind, like coarse, dull wind chimes."
  },
  AvgDialog_19070_Content_1 = {Text = "28 Days"},
  AvgDialog_19070_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Koum nods, motioning for you to climb onto its back.
Once you're settled, it lets out a long howl and charges toward the sanatorium.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19070_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Done with your whispering?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19070_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You snap the notebook shut, a chill running down your spine, like you've been dredged from a millennia-old ice cave."
  },
  AvgDialog_19070_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Whispering?
Wait, my Gnosis Index was fine, wasn't it?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19070_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Can't know without checking. Seeing you as lively as when you were first Awakened warms my heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_19070_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Rye's chaos is way beyond what we expected. We can't afford to waste time—let's move."
  },
  AvgDialog_19070_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Doll pulls out several oddly shaped metal monocles and test tubes\n—filled with dark golden liquid."
  },
  AvgDialog_19070_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Take these. Put them on when I say so."
  },
  AvgDialog_19070_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You coming with us, little one?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Mystic River"
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The black orb emits a grotesque squelching, the girl's lips moving in sync, her murmurs blending with the orb's noises into a low, oppressive symphony."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_11 = {
    Text = "<Shake:@2—@1—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The black orb surges toward the cultists, sparking chaos in the crowd."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You and Colonel Bertrand seize the moment, slipping into a narrow path."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_14 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_15 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You trudge through the darkness for an unknown time, pursued by distant roars, shrieks, gasps, murmurs, and ravings."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Hurry, step on my shoulders—climb up!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
With Bertrand's boost, you scramble out of the tight tunnel.
A dazzling snowfield stretches before you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Hold on, I'm snow-blind... I'll pull you up soon..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Quick, the exit's right there!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_20 = {
    Text = "It's fine, I can manage..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Before Bertrand finishes, terror twists his face."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_22 = {
    Text = "From the gap between him and the tunnel's exit, countless thick, writhing liquid tendrils erupt."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_23 = {
    Text = "They coil around Bertrand's body with a will of their own."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_24 = {
    Text = "He claws at the ground, fingers digging in, but the snow offers no grip. In a breath, he's dragged down."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Then, a nerve-wracking sound assaults your ears..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
Wriggling, chewing, bones clashing...
even the gurgle of digestive fluids against organic matter rings clear.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
...After seconds of heart-stopping horror, silence falls.
Only the snow-laden wind rustles, dusting the ground.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Nausea surges from your gut to your chest. You retch onto the snow."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_29 = {Text = "Urgh..."},
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You follow Ramona's gaze, and blinding white light floods your vision."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Tears spill uncontrollably, whether from grief or fear, you can't tell."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
You reach for the pocket watch, hoping for comfort,
but the pocket is empty.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_32 = {
    Text = "...You retrieved nothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_33 = {
    Text = "A cold hand rests on your shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Danger, Master. Please give me orders."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_35 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_36 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
After days of trekking, the pursuing monsters and cultists vanish into the snowfield.
You and the girl clear some snow, huddling by a campfire.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_38 = {
    Text = "She occasionally leaves, returning with bloody chunks of unknown creatures."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_39 = {
    Text = "You avoid questioning, roasting the meat over the fire, ignoring smell and taste to swallow the rare protein."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Your sight dissolves into a gritty white haze, like snow blindness."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_40 = {
    Text = "The girl doesn't seem to need food, but if you offer, she devours it ravenously."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Do you have a name?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_42 = {
    Text = "She chews juicy meat, shaking her head."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_43 = {
    Text = "What about... family? Do you know where your parents are?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_44 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_45 = {
    Text = "She glances at you, the distant peaks, then the boundless sky, and shakes her head."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_46 = {
    Text = "...You still need a name."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_47 = {
    Text = "How about <Blue:Lily>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Whatever Master says my name is, that's my name."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_49 = {
    Text = "I'm not your master..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
In the warped chaos, your consciousness is torn from your body, your senses hurled to a distant, frigid dimension.
The <Yellow:Dream> visits you again...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Master, careful. Something's catching up."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_51 = {
    Text = "How?! We're almost out of the snowfield..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_52 = {
    Text = [[
Your nerves sting, consciousness squeezed and pulled.
The <Yellow:Dream> rejects you, trying to expel you from its white world.
But...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_53 = {
    Text = "No... I can't let them get caught... not even in my dream...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_6 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_7 = {
    Text = "What happened in Elworth defies all <Yellow:you> know, but there's no time for confusion—more pressing matters await."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Help me... stop them."
  },
  AvgDialog_19071_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Yes, Master."
  },
  AvgDialog_19072_Content_1 = {
    Text = "A locked box on the bookshelf..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19072_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A key hidden under the painting..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The roars fade into the shadows, and the black slime on the corridor floor evaporates like boiling water."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
No rush to throw barbs.
What do you say to my offer, Miss Doll?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You don't care about human survival, do you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_12 = {Text = "Indeed."},
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_13 = {Text = "Doll?"},
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Unlike them, I shed my human body long ago. The fate of ordinary people means nothing to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_15 = {
    Text = "As a researcher chasing cutting-edge tech, who wouldn't want to cast off human ethics and run the wildest experiments?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_16 = {Text = "But..."},
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Compared to a spineless opportunist like you, I respect these folks' courage to fight against the odds."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
Enough talk.
Keep stalling, and Francis will be halfway across the ocean with Lily.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_19 = {
    Text = "As expected of Mythag's Brain—nothing gets past you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The Sculptors' Association's <Yellow:Test Subjects>—cheap and effective."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Herbert claps, and a dozen doors swing open."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_21 = {
    Text = "A bone-chilling malice spreads through the darkness, the narrow corridor echoing with grotesque roars."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Ramona, %player%!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Right here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_24 = {
    Text = "I'll handle this old friend. You stop Francis."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Those monocles I gave you—put them on to see the <Yellow:Gateway> to other dimensions."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Don't take them off unless absolutely necessary. Dizziness is normal. If it gets bad, drink a vial."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_27 = {Text = "But you—"},
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_28 = {Text = "Go!"},
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Mythag and the Sculptors' Association have been at it for years. If he could take us down, he wouldn't have waited this long."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Hope you're not thinking of something too sinister."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_30 = {
    Text = "May the Silver Key light your path."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_31 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_32 = {
    Text = "May the Silver Key guide us."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_33 = {
    Text = "You don the metal monocle and, with Ramona, charge toward the easternmost corridor."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_34 = {
    Text = "In your peripheral vision, Herbert's dozen test subjects surround Doll, salivating and restless."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Don't look! Doll said she can handle it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Trust her and focus on our mission!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Wouldn't be surprising, would it?
We're not exactly on the side of ordinary folks.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_5 = {
    Text = "If that's your mindset, why not join us?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Techs from the <Yellow:Alaemyces civilization> have fascinated me for ages."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
Rare to see you in person, Herbert.
Thought you hated showing your face.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Well, the Sculptors' Association invested heavily in this \"genius.\" If you take her down, our efforts go to waste."
  },
  AvgDialog_19073_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You're too confident. Your efforts never flowed anywhere else to begin with."
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Secret Window"
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Why else did we find nothing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_11 = {
    Text = "That light in the distance..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_12 = {
    Text = "It's the deepest obsession of the mind's owner, something they can't forget."
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Looks like a clock face."
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_14 = {
    Text = "What, she wants to be the master of time?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_15 = {
    Text = "She needed so much time to achieve her goal, so she locked herself in that room."
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Locked herself?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Yes. The cost of dimensional travel isn't something most can bear."
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Every time she leaves that room, she's taking a huge risk—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_19 = {Text = "Watch out!"},
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona sprint eastward down the corridor. Soon, a wall looms ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_20 = {
    Text = "A chaotic triangular monster rises from the black mire beneath your feet."
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Get out of here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A crude child's drawing hangs high on the white wall—a mother playing with her child—\nbut where the child should be, only black slime remains."
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_4 = {
    Text = "A dead end?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
No... trust your instincts.
Step through.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The moment you pass through the wall, the painting seems to flicker—\nthe girl's figure appears briefly, then sinks back into darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_7 = {
    Text = "This space..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_8 = {
    Text = "If I'm right, this is a passage formed by Francis's consciousness."
  },
  AvgDialog_19074_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Well hidden."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_1 = {Text = "Room"},
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Francis stands by the window, hands clasped behind her, gazing into the distance."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
You betrayed Lily's kindness.
Before Herbert got involved, we could've parted ways.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_12 = {
    Text = "We won't stand by while you commit atrocities."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Atrocities... Is that how you see me?
A freak, a lunatic, a criminal?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I'm not like Herbert. I've never willingly harmed anyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Maybe not in your eyes, but those altered humans... they might still have people who care for them."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I know you're kind, righteous people, but you're too young."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I've treated ex-convicts, shunned by everyone once their past was known, even after genuine remorse."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
People are shaped by their experiences.
After certain ones, they're no longer human, nor should they be treated as such.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_19 = {
    Text = "That's not just my view—it's how the world sees them."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_2 = {
    Text = "This is it. Lily and Francis... they should be inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Even if you don't see Dissolution victims as human, what about their families who sent them here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
They were devoured by the Hellhound, weren't they?
Your doing. And they were undeniably, purely human.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Those who abandon their sick or aging kin in this remote sanatorium—don't they deserve punishment?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Not death. You have no right to judge them."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_24 = {
    Text = [[
I have no right to judge them...
And you have the right to judge me?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
Do you know where we are? This is my daughter's room.
Time here is frozen at the dusk she vanished.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
I tried everything to keep her, even if it meant selling my soul to the devil.
But... no devil came, and she was still taken.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
I gave <Blue:Lily> her name, but she's not my daughter.
She's just a monster, the same age as my girl.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_28 = {
    Text = "On the surgical table, the hole in Lily's chest slowly knits shut, color returning to her vacant eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_29 = {
    Text = "She's the perfect test subject. No matter how many wounds I inflict, she heals. Surgery never stops for pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_3 = {
    Text = "We're out of the dimensional passage. How do you feel? Still dizzy or nauseous?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_30 = {
    Text = "But all I wanted was my daughter! A normal girl who cries, laughs, and whines to me when she hurts!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Those people... those who abandon their loved ones... they've already lost their humanity!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_32 = {
    Text = "People who've lost their humanity—can you still call them human?\nMonsters becoming the Hellhound's prey—isn't that fitting?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_33 = {
    Text = "You're beyond reason."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_34 = {
    Text = "For once, we agree."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Francis steps forward, gently caressing Lily's pale, tender cheek, her tenderness jarring against her vicious words."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_36 = {
    Text = "I knew you won't understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_37 = {
    Text = "She murmurs, her voice barely audible."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_38 = {
    Text = "By the third repetition of her whispered chant, you discern the cadence—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_39 = {
    Text = "<Italic:@2—@1—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Much better. Even if something hits me, I'll push through."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_40 = {
    Text = "<Italic:@2—@1—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_41 = {
    Text = "<Italic:@2—@1—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_42 = {
    Text = "The dormant monster stirs. Lily, once prone, rises stiffly, her eyes glowing an eerie green."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_43 = {
    Text = "<Change>Return to the primal nest..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_44 = {
    Text = "<Change>Return to the eternal realm..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_45 = {
    Text = "<Change>Return to the Mother's embrace..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_46 = {
    Text = "<Change>For Mother, eliminate them."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_47 = {Text = "Hiss—"},
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Ramona, find a way to wake Lily!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Understood!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_5 = {
    Text = "With a deep breath, you push open the door, dripping with viscous slime, and step into the final chamber."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_6 = {
    Text = "A timeless sunset bathes the room, its cozy, girlish decor radiating warmth."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
The doll on the nightstand, the pink dress on the rack, the lace-trimmed canopy...
all starkly out of place in the sanatorium's grim chill.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_8 = {
    Text = "At the center, on a surgical table, lies a familiar small figure, a gaping hole in her chest, still as death."
  },
  AvgDialog_19075_Content_9 = {Text = "Lily!"},
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Mouth of the Mad"
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ramona responds with a soft \"Mm,\" but the sound is swallowed by the void, and silence reigns once more."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Lily, you're about to see your mom. Are you excited?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Yeah... Mom..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Lily's delicate hand clings tightly to your fingers, her palm faintly damp with sweat. You give it a reassuring squeeze."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_14 = {
    Text = "If you don't want to stay here, how about coming with us to Mythag?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
My father took me in years ago; I'm sure he wouldn't mind another.
I'd love to have such a sweet little sister.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_16 = {
    Text = "It's not about that. Lily, she..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
<Blue:Helot>. If you're asking my role, I'm something like her sister.
More precisely, our powers are <Yellow:"of the same origin">.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_18 = {
    Text = "If Helot speaks true, the gentle child holding your hand is undoubtedly an <Yellow:Awakener>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
I get it. But we've got you, don't we?
A temporary link should hold until we can connect her to the Black Pool at the university.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_2 = {
    Text = "As you cross the railway bridge into the Rye Sanatorium, dawn breaks over the horizon, casting a pale glow."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Lily's grip tightens. Her eyes dart between Ramona and you, brimming with unease."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
Lily... still wants to be with Mother.
Because... Lily only has one mother, and Mother only has one Lily.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
Mother didn't choose to become like this.
<Small:She lost something precious, and she's trying to take it back, that's why...>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Her voice fades to a whisper, nearly drowned by the sound of her own breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_24 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:Hiss—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_25 = {
    Text = "You've finally arrived. Welcome to Rye Sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Lily, why don't you go rest with Nymphaea for now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
Come on, Lily.
You must be exhausted from the journey.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Lily hesitantly takes Nymphaea's hand, casting a lingering glance back at you before disappearing down the corridor."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Thank you all for coming. Allow me to introduce myself properly."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
Dust swirls in the air, stirred by the opening of the heavy doors, filling the corridor with a peculiar, acrid stench.
Though the day outside is bright with snow-dusted sunlight, the hallway remains shrouded in oppressive gloom.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
I'm <Blue:Francis Oswood>, the director of this sanatorium.
Everyone here just calls me Francis, and you're welcome to do the same.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Judging by your attire, you two are students? And this one..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
That's right, we're first-year students at Mythag University.
Lotan... well, think of her as our escorting professor.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_33 = {
    Text = "I see. Brings back memories. My student days are long behind me, along with the focus and conviction I once had."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Your eyes remind me of my younger self, though... there's a flicker of doubt in them today, unlike last night."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_35 = {
    Text = [[
Something happen?
Or perhaps... you've opened a box that should've stayed shut?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_36 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I wouldn't dare compare myself to you, Professor Oswood."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
If you'd stayed in academia, you could've made waves in medicine.
But you stepped away, vanished from the scholarly world.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Old stories, not worth dwelling on."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_4 = {
    Text = "This place gives me the creeps."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Hardly. You were part of the first <Blue:Elworth Icefield Expedition>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_41 = {
    Text = "I can't help but wonder how a scholar like you ended up hired by a place like this."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Less hired, more chosen. I chose this sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_43 = {
    Text = [[
You must know the expedition was far from a "success."
I was the sole survivor. Everyone else was buried under the snow.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_44 = {
    Text = "It changed me. I started questioning whether, in our pursuit of \"progress,\" we've lost something far more precious—and what that loss truly means."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Is this place your answer?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_46 = {
    Text = "A couple of rounds each day, chatting with those labeled \"hysterical,\" then retreating to my office to think."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Compared to chasing the next big breakthrough, I prefer this quieter life."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Your compassion is inspiring."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Kind words. But it's just surface effort. It doesn't truly change their lives."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_5 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_50 = {
    Text = "I disagree. You've given these stigmatized patients a home, a chance to reclaim normalcy."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Francis offers a faint, noncommittal smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Let's hope so."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_53 = {
    Text = "But you didn't come to hear me preach. Come, let me show you around the sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You give Lily a gentle pat, urging her to lead the group onward."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The empty corridor echoes with the sound of your footsteps, each dull thud reverberating with an unsettling weight."
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_8 = {
    Text = "This place reeks of disinfectant, like it's been pickled in it. Doesn't it make your nose itch?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19076_Content_9 = {
    Text = "As if to shatter the oppressive silence, Lotan deliberately stomps her boots, creating a rhythmic clatter."
  },
  AvgDialog_19077_Content_1 = {
    Text = "I don't get you people. Just stab through more pustules, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19077_Content_2 = {
    Text = "...Protect... Mother..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Sixth Sense"
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_10 = {Text = "......"},
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
The ritual ends.
The lead woman descends from the high Altar, followed by a procession of black-robed emissaries, moving like a migrating ant colony.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_12 = {
    Text = "<Blue:You> struggle to rise, shedding soaked clothes, and find the ceremonial robe Murphy mentioned behind a boulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You change quickly, ignoring the cold, and grope toward the northern passage."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_14 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_15 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
The passage is narrow, forcing you to stoop.
No light penetrates here, only pitch-black darkness.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Can I... really escape from here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You reach for the pocket watch that gave you strength, but it's gone."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_19 = {
    Text = "...It was your last tie to @1 in this world."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Perhaps exhaustion has taken its toll. Doll told you to take a break, but you drift into a hazy sleep..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_20 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Luckily, the ritual's over, and the cave is empty."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You rummage through your old clothes, finding no watch, then search the pool's edge where you were placed."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_23 = {
    Text = "...Something's off."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The water level has dropped."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The comatose sacrifices in the pool have curled up unknowingly, like infants in a mother's womb."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Your hand brushes the \"mud,\" finding your watch. As you turn to leave, you notice a figure beside you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_27 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_28 = {
    Text = "He's still breathing... You hesitate, then try to wake him."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
With Cecily gone and no reason to return,
you figure saving one is better than none.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_3 = {
    Text = "And plunge once more into a harrowing <Yellow:Dream>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_30 = {
    Text = "<Small:...Colonel Bertrand, Colonel Bertrand.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You call softly. He stirs awake."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_32 = {Text = "Where...?"},
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_33 = {
    Text = "We were used as cult sacrifices. It's a long story—we need to escape, now."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Just then, the black pool's surface ripples with eerie light."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_35 = {
    Text = "It flashes three times in seconds, then goes dark."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Footsteps echo from all directions."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_37 = {
    Text = "You're surrounded."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The circle tightens, black figures closing in like walls, suffocating those within."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
On the distant platform, Murphy stands beside the lead woman,
her expression a mix of disgust and resignation.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_4 = {
    Text = "<Italic:He shall return... through the perverse @2, He shall rise from @4, heralding @3's advent...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_40 = {
    Text = "...Can I still escape?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_41 = {
    Text = "...Can I see @1 one last time?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_42 = {
    Text = "...Or is this the way for us to be reunited?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_43 = {
    Text = "...If only... I could see..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_44 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Bubbles gurgle in the black pool."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_46 = {
    Text = "From their center emerges a pale maiden."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_47 = {
    Text = "In her hand, a viscous black orb, an eye-like mass with shark-like teeth, lurches forward with her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_48 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Orders. Please give me orders, Master>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
The woman on the Altar chants.
Your nerves tighten as black slime coats your body, sealing your mouth and nose.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
Your face is submerged, yet breathing comes easily.
The black pool feels like a mother's amniotic fluid, lulling you into slumber.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Can't sleep... mustn't sleep..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_8 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19078_Content_9 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_1 = {Text = "21 Grams"},
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Don't say that. Among Mythag's "graduates," don't I count as a success?
Not many walk out of that place alive.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I even pray for him sometimes, hoping he can stand like a normal man again."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Thanks for the sentiment, but Alistair's outliving your other mentor, at least."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Alistair's blessed with luck—he'll probably witness the world's end.\nShame you won't see that day."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_14 = {
    Text = "How long can you hold out, surrounded by these things?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Won't know till I try."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You honestly think you can take on all these test subjects alone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Don't assume I'm as dim as you, Herbert."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Your voice is as grating as ever, Doll."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_19 = {
    Text = "It's worth more than that caveman brain of yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Now, it's you and me."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
Your colleagues might not agree.
If there was a button to shut you up, they'd press it without a second thought.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You're underestimating Mythag's tolerance—and my value."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_22 = {
    Text = "My mistake. But even the sharpest mind's helpless against monsters surrounding it, no?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
Helpless?
Watch closely, and see what I've got in place of human hands.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_24 = {
    Text = "May the Silver Key light your path."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Doll's pupils begin to warp."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Ready, you amoebas?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Wait! Are you out of your mind?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_28 = {
    Text = "An explosion roars like thunder, shaking the cramped corridor."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Metallic bodies shatter, fragments embedding into the dim walls."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Herbert, are you still chasing that absurd dream of yours?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Agonized shrieks erupt and cut off abruptly."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_31 = {
    Text = "...A deathly silence follows, lasting dozens of seconds, with only thick smoke coiling through the sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
Cough, cough... Damn it, Doll...
Good thing I came prepared...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Before Herbert, a shield of lifeless test subjects piled high, metal parts lodged in skin and bone, utterly devoid of life."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_34 = {
    Text = "With her body blown to bits like that, I wonder how much of what's left is still useful..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_4 = {
    Text = "If you could tell absurdity from greatness, you might choose your words differently."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_5 = {
    Text = "No lifeform escapes Dissolution. Your obsession just leaves a trail of wreckage."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Doll casts a disdainful glance at the twisted creatures dubbed \"wreckage.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Your taste is as ghastly as ever. I don't recall Mythag teaching you that."
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Seems Alistair took charge and erased my grand work after I left. Speaking of which—how's he doing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19079_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You still care about him? He'd be ashamed to hear it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19080_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
You're sparing my life?
If this place falls, people like us will be homeless again.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19080_Content_2 = {
    Text = "We're not here to destroy."
  },
  AvgDialog_19080_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I just contacted Lord Dexter. He's happy to do some charity and take over operations."
  },
  AvgDialog_19080_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The innocent can stay, and he'll ensure supplies."
  },
  AvgDialog_19080_Content_5 = {
    Text = "...He talks a big game, but his promises are solid."
  },
  AvgDialog_19080_Content_6 = {
    Text = "After we leave, this sanatorium will run smoothly again. It'll still be your home."
  },
  AvgDialog_19080_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
But... Mrs. Oswood...
Please, don't hurt her. Everything she did was for a greater cause...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_1 = {Text = "Resolve"},
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Who goes there—<BigShake:Captain!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The tall man couldn't respond to the girl right away. Out of breath, he had to lean against the cabin wall to stay upright."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Elton took several deep breaths and managed to steady himself with Celeste's help."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_13 = {
    Text = "And Celeste..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_14 = {Text = "You..."},
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_15 = {
    Text = "They became even weaker."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The captain who gave her a chance and the Awakener who halted the <Red:aberration> within her are gradually losing their Life."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Fear... The fear of death, the fear of loss overwhelms the mind, leaving it blank."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_18 = {
    Text = "...I...you all..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_19 = {
    Text = "It's all right, Murphy. There's no need to be afraid."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
22:45  
Sonanil  
Cargo Hold 3]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_20 = {
    Text = "There's always a solution. Everything will be fine. Don't worry about us."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Leaving Celeste's support, the captain staggered but steadied his body, then reached out—ruffling her hair hard."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Don't touch so hard! My hair is all messed up!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You always say that! Look at yourself, you can barely stand!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_24 = {
    Text = "It's fine now, see? I've already recovered."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_25 = {
    Text = "What about them? The two students who accidentally boarded the ship?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_26 = {
    Text = "They bought us some time; now everyone's attention is on the power room."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Power room... Miryam is in the power room!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
They are clear-headed, knowing what they can and should do.
That university... it has trained the kids quite well.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_29 = {
    Text = "But we're not powerless. As long as we're close enough to land, Celeste can transfer them ashore."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The hard soles thudded rhythmically on the deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_30 = {
    Text = "But your body..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_31 = {
    Text = "No worries, I can afford this bit of Life."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Colluding with the cult and turning a blind eye to your <Blue:suffering>... My sins are already heavy enough. I don't want to bear the lives of two more innocents."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_33 = {
    Text = "My... suffering?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_34 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The one who delivered you to Miryam was me."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_36 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
You were the most precious "cargo" I transported after joining the cult.
That perfect voyage won me Miryam's favor.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_38 = {
    Text = "So when I asked for your help, you agreed without hesitation..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Once we are close enough to the coast, I'll have Celeste take you off the ship. Stay as far from the sea as possible."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Captain... Celeste..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_40 = {
    Text = "As if in response to the captain, Celeste shook the compass in her hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Do you mean for Celeste and me to go together?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Those two students have transportation; just turn their car into a <Yellow:Domain>..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_43 = {
    Text = [[
Don't joke around! Do you really think you can hold off those two monsters?
You're not even a Seafarer, just a mere human!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_44 = {
    Text = "I hope you can escape from all this. Consider it my final wish."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_45 = {
    Text = "The worst outcome is to be buried at sea, right? I should have sunk to the bottom with the Sonanil long ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Murphy clung stubbornly to the hem of the captain's coat, refusing to let go."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_47 = {
    Text = "The Awakener had no intention of participating in this dispute. Sensing the Keeper's state from the other side of the link outside the door, he prepared to head to the power room."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_48 = {
    Text = "—Wait! Where are you going?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_49 = {
    Text = "The girl forced the cabin door open and grabbed a tentacle."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ramona, and %player%... why haven't they returned yet?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_50 = {
    Text = "How did you know I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_51 = {
    Text = "So, you're the \"Tulu\" Ramona mentioned? Are you going to help them?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_52 = {
    Text = "What I do is none of outsiders' business to comment on."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_53 = {
    Text = "I'm going as well."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Murphy! If you fall into Miryam's hands, all our efforts will be in vain."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_55 = {Text = "I know."},
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_56 = {
    Text = [[
But... I can't do it...
I don't want to die, but... what if they sacrifice themselves before reaching the shore...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_57 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:I... don't want... that to happen...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_58 = {
    Text = "*Cough, cough!*"
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_59 = {
    Text = "I mean... I can't stay in the Domain forever. To truly escape, I need the help of those two students."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Murphy bit his lip, pacing anxiously. He occasionally kicked a crate or tugged at the securing ropes."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_60 = {
    Text = [[
I can't just go to the school and tell the principal that their students sacrificed themselves to help me.
I need them alive. I want to become their guest with dignity.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_61 = {
    Text = "I won't be distracted protecting you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_62 = {
    Text = "I don't need your protection. I know the Seafarer's weak points well and can take care of myself."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Alright, if you insist."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_64 = {
    Text = "What kind of expression is that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_65 = {
    Text = [[
I once thought you weren't worth their sacrifice.
Now it seems I was wrong.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_66 = {
    Text = "What riddle are you talking about? Go away, go away!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_67 = {
    Text = "This child... Well, if that's her choice, so be it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Celeste, maintain full speed ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_7 = {
    Text = "They'll be fine, right...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_8 = {
    Text = "She can't calm down to pray, can't sit in peace."
  },
  AvgDialog_19081_Content_9 = {Text = "Bang—!"},
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_1 = {
    Text = "What are you waiting for? Do I need to invite you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Quick! You go down first!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_11 = {
    Text = "No way! You're an ordinary person. I have a duty to protect you—<BigShake:Ah!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The girl pretends not to hear your nagging. Taking advantage of her small stature, she nimbly moves behind you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_13 = {
    Text = "—Then, he gave you a hard kick and sent you flying into the pitch-black doorway."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:Ouch, ouch...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The girl followed closely and jumped in. She forcefully shut the iron door, skillfully turned the winch, and locked it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Whew — should be safe for now."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The girl pressed the switch, and after a few flickers, the old light bulb cast its glow around the room, dispelling the darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The cargo hold is spacious and empty, with scattered goods secured in the corners. Dust dances in the dim light, creating an atmosphere of long-abandoned decay."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_19 = {
    Text = "A muffled knocking sound continues to resonate above your head, each thud reverberating through your skull."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Hidden door?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_20 = {Text = "My head..."},
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Your temples throb with each strike, intense pain tearing through your left and right brain, stomach acid rising to your throat once again."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_22 = {
    Text = "They shouldn't be able to get in for a while... Huh?! What's wrong with you?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Don't, don't scare me! Don't die!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Phew, finally lost them."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_25 = {
    Text = "This door is sturdy. We should be safe here for now... <BigShake:Damn it!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Damn it, damn it, damn it! You've ruined everything! My entire plan is in shambles! I need to come up with something..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_27 = {
    Text = "By the way, you'd better remember my name well—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_28 = {
    Text = "The anxious face of the girl and the fragments in her mind gradually overlapped, merging two similar yet distinct scenes into a single picture."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_29 = {Text = "Murphy...?"},
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_3 = {
    Text = "What secret door? How can you joke with me at a time like this?! Are you out of your mind?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Are you... are you alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_31 = {
    Text = "That hurt a little."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_32 = {
    Text = "No way, did you get injured from a fall?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_33 = {
    Text = "In the dim light, she tiptoed to check on your condition."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_34 = {Text = "—!"},
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_35 = {
    Text = "What's the matter?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_36 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:N-Nothing...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_37 = {
    Text = "<Small:Looks like there's something useful in this shipment...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Murphy mumbled indistinctly, moving stiffly to the pile of crates and searching for something."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_39 = {
    Text = "(Approach her)"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_4 = {
    Text = "It's not like we haven't been in a cabin before. Stop dawdling and get ready!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Murphy's violent unpacking scattered the packing paper and straw all over the floor, quickly turning this corner into a mess."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_41 = {
    Text = "No... This box contains broken jewelry."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_42 = {
    Text = "You glance inside the crate and see a set of platinum jewelry in a royal style, adorned with pearls and diamonds that appear to be priceless."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_43 = {
    Text = "...What the heck, they're all ritual items."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_44 = {
    Text = "The second chest is filled with various odds and ends and herbs: a stone bowl, sage, myrrh... Without alchemy knowledge, one might mistake it for a merchant's stock."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Found it! Quick, crouch down."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_46 = {
    Text = "A sticky paste is smeared onto the back of your head. Its coolness, tinged with a hint of spiciness, eases the pain to some extent."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_47 = {Text = "This is..."},
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Hey! Don't touch that."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Murphy hands you a jar of ointment."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Is it safe down there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_50 = {
    Text = "The label bears no recipe or drug name, only a strange symbol—it is clearly a homemade potion."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_51 = {
    Text = "...Is this déjà vu? The pattern on the ointment label seems familiar."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Here it is. Don't worry, it won't kill you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_53 = {
    Text = [[
Ever since I was little, I've always used this ointment for any external injuries.
How is it? Doesn't the pain go away as soon as you apply it?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_54 = {
    Text = "She was extremely worried about you tumbling down the stairs and hitting your head; her eyes were full of guilt when she looked at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_55 = {
    Text = "The pain is gone."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_56 = {
    Text = "See, I told you it's effective—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Receiving an affirmative answer, Murphy finally relaxed and revealed a smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_58 = {
    Text = "The back of your head feels a bit better, but your temples still ache faintly.\nSeeing her relaxed demeanor, a voice inside you whispers—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Some things can be explored further after meeting up with <Blue:your partner>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_6 = {
    Text = "How would I know?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Better than being caught by these lunatics and fed to the fish! Stop dawdling and get ready."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The enemy is fast. You struggle to delay their attack while the girl pulls up the iron gate."
  },
  AvgDialog_19082_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Beneath the doorway, an iron staircase extends into the immeasurably deep darkness below."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Warped reality"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_10 = {
    Text = "By the light, she saw countless black wounds of varying sizes scattered across the smooth surface of \"Mother\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_11 = {
    Text = "\"I'm sorry...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Black slime surged, shattering the tranquility at the bottom of the pool."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_13 = {
    Text = "\"The 'Mother' let out a sharp wail, her tentacles thrashing about, sending something into the chick's chest.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Slippery and cold, the soft limbs entwine her. The black pool water no longer blocks her mouth and nose but instead lifts her life like amniotic fluid."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
<Change>"I'm sorry..."
"I still... don't want to die..."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The surface remains calm for ages; even the howling polar winds cannot ripple the viscous pool."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Lady Miryam, could it be that the saintess has already...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_18 = {
    Text = "She was born at the last Stellar Align, a child who can \"see.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_19 = {
    Text = "No one in the world deserves the recognition of the divine bloodline more than her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The fledgling with broken wings fell into the black pond."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_20 = {
    Text = "With murmured whispers, the water surface suddenly boiled as if the energy from the earth's core was about to burst forth."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Thick, viscous black water overflowed from the pool, covering everyone's feet and flowing toward the woman's bare feet."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Through the murmurs of the young acolytes, she silently walked the path paved with dark liquid, plunging her hands deep into the pool—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_23 = {Text = "—Wow"},
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_24 = {
    Text = [[
The girl clung to her hands and leapt out of the pool.
Black liquid streamed down the contours of her face, resembling two horrifying tear tracks.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Wow, not bad. It seems like <Blue:Divine Fetus> has acknowledged the new <Blue:Mother>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Goliath suddenly spoke in a mocking tone, but no one present paid any attention to his sarcasm."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Saintess... has succeeded? We've done it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Miryam gently closed her eyes, released the hands tightly clasped with the girl's, and turned to face the fanatical followers."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_29 = {
    Text = "She raised her arms high, black liquid flowing along the texture of her skin, instantly dyeing her veil a deep black."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The high priest's murmured prayers, both ethereal and firm, pierced through the black ooze, transforming into blades that split the fledgling's chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Prayers rose and fell, finally harmonizing in the cold cavern — frenzied, twisted, and deafening."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_31 = {
    Text = "The Divine Mother has arrived!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_32 = {
    Text = "It will revive from @1 and bring about the Arrival of @2!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_33 = {
    Text = "It will revive from @1 and bring about the Arrival of @2!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Three months later"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_35 = {
    Text = "You're giving that woman more and more headaches. Weren't you well-behaved a few months ago? What, don't want to listen to Mom anymore?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The girl glanced at Goliath, forcefully drove the chisel into the wood, and threw both the tool and the material aside."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Mom... M-Mom?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Where... did you learn to say that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Dictionary! Look, \"an adult female caring for children with an emotional connection.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Crimson liquid rises from the chest, blooming eerily on the still, black water—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_40 = {
    Text = "No, I won't be your mom."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_41 = {
    Text = "You are the Holy Maiden of the Order, the destined one... If you wish, you may call me by my name."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Hmm... Milly... Am?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Yes, Holy Maiden."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_44 = {
    Text = "I am your loyal servant."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_45 = {
    Text = "...She's not my mother, never was."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Only the higher-ups of the Church of the Lightbearers know my origins. I don't have a mother; I'm just their gift to Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Oh? She actually told you about this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_48 = {
    Text = "For a prisoner with an execution date already set, knowing any secrets makes no difference; I'll take everything to the grave anyway."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_49 = {
    Text = "This is also that woman's compensation to you. You know, on the day the divine embryo was transplanted into your body, our High Priest didn't rest all night."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_5 = {
    Text = "She keeps sinking, with blood-stained roots, into the deepest depths, into a soft and chilling embrace."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Guilt can torment her severely."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Guilt? Are you kidding? She doesn't have that emotion."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_52 = {
    Text = [[
How heartless of you, little princess.
A girl being too cold will make her mother sad.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_53 = {
    Text = "You're so annoying! I already told you, she's not my mom anymore!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_54 = {
    Text = "That's not necessarily true. Do you want to hear a story?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_55 = {
    Text = [[
<BigShake:I don't want to hear it, and I don't want to see you!>
If you're only here to mock me, you can leave!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_56 = {
    Text = "No, you want to listen."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Goliath's tone suddenly grew deeper, carrying the authority of a battle-hardened veteran, nearly causing both of Murphy's hearts to stop."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_58 = {
    Text = "She suddenly realized—giants were never toys for her to play with at will.\nShe was simply overstepping her bounds, and he was more than happy to watch the show unfold."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Y-Yes, please go ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_6 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_60 = {
    Text = [[
A mysterious cult ensures the absolute purity of bloodlines; all marriages are arranged by the cult leader.
Those who marry outsiders and have children will eventually face consequences.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_61 = {
    Text = "During the last settlement, the Executor brought back a baby girl — one who can see <Yellow:spiritual entities>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Baby girl..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_63 = {
    Text = "She had stayed too long in the hidden compartment beneath her mother's body. When the cultists found her, she was nearly choked to death by <Red:her biological mother's blood>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_64 = {
    Text = "That ordinary, unremarkable woman's greatest achievement in life was giving birth to an exceptional daughter and trying to prevent the church from taking her away."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_65 = {
    Text = "—What a wonderful mother-daughter bond! I'm almost moved to tears."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Goliath... you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Why... Why are you telling me this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Melancholy is never a good thing. Remember, <Blue:God>'s development depends on the host's state."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Do something you like: cause some chaos, whip the Seafarers, mess with your maid... anything goes."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_7 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Goliath unilaterally ended the conversation, patting her on the head without a trace of warmth."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_71 = {
    Text = "As he left, he glanced at the wooden sculpture Murphy had thrown into the corner. The girl's craftsmanship was poor; the figure on the wooden base was large and grotesque, evoking a sense of revulsion in anyone who saw it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_72 = {Text = "Tsk"},
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_73 = {
    Text = "After Goliath left, the space fell silent. Even the sacrificial victims in the cage made no sound."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Murphy sat by the campfire for a long time, until the light dimmed and the fire was about to go out. She then snapped out of her daze and patted her cheeks."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_75 = {
    Text = "She kicked a nearby cage hard, causing the gaunt woman inside to shrink back into the corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Hey, you heard all of that just now, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Yes, yes..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_78 = {
    Text = "I'm not helping you for nothing. Once you escape, find a way to come back and take me with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_79 = {
    Text = "I'm afraid I don't have that much ability. I'm just an ordinary scientist..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
She saw it.
She looked up. "Mother" lowered three pairs of eye stalks to meet her gaze.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_80 = {
    Text = "So come up with something! With the brain of a scientist, surely you can think of at least one solution!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Seeing the girl struggling to hold back her tears, the woman recalled the face of her daughter, now faded from memory, and finally felt a pang of compassion."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Don't be too upset."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Whenever I hit a research bottleneck and couldn't sleep, I would sneak into my daughter's room, sit by her bed, and watch her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_84 = {
    Text = "She is so small, so well-behaved... Just thinking that everything I've done is for her brighter future makes all the fatigue worthwhile."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_85 = {
    Text = "I was once a mother too, so I know... Your birth mother must have eagerly awaited your arrival. There is definitely someone in this world who loves you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_86 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Have you said enough? Stop interfering in my affairs and worry about saving your own life!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_88 = {
    Text = [[
"I'm sorry..."
"I... don't want to die..."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_89 = {
    Text = "I don't want... it to end like this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19083_Content_9 = {
    Text = "It was a colossal crimson beast, with blood-stained areas turning transparent white. \"Mother\"emitted a faint glow, temporarily illuminating a small world."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You let the driver leave."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_10 = {
    Text = "From the very beginning, their attacks had a purpose: to drive us here—to <Blue:Dock No. 2 at Pier 3>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_11 = {
    Text = "But there doesn't seem to be anything special here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Yes, there's nothing special about Berth No. 2."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The real problem is the <Blue:ship> docked here."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_14 = {Text = "Ship?"},
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Ramona's words stirred up a fierce wind, instantly dispersing the fog clouding the mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_16 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_17 = {
    Text = "A massive ship silently appears behind you, blocking the moonlight and plunging everyone into darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Was this ship just here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_19 = {
    Text = "It might have always been there, but for some unknown reason, we've been ignoring it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Too many enemies, and our retreat is blocked."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The outer hull is heavily rusted and faded, making the ship's original paint scheme unrecognizable. Even the name painted in white is hard to decipher."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Sona... Neil?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
<Blue:Sonariel>.
Erica, is there a record in the Mythag Archive?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The Sonanir, formerly under <Blue:Black Star Shipping>, served as a passenger liner for transoceanic routes. After the company's bankruptcy, it was anonymously acquired, re-registered, and converted into a cargo ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Senior William! Do you know this ship?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_25 = {
    Text = "AF 288, the Sonanil sank in a storm. Years later, sightings of the <Blue:\"Ghost Ship\"> began to appear along the North Sea coast."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Mythag investigators once boarded the Sonaniel, but did not bring back any useful intelligence."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_27 = {
    Text = "No usable intelligence retrieved..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_28 = {
    Text = "But that means the investigator returned to school safely, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
Yes, despite losing some memories, boarding did not cause any other abnormalities in his body. 
After a short period of recuperation, he returned to the forefront of the investigation.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The moonlit sea still stirs with ripples. In the depths where light doesn't reach, who knows how many enemies remain hidden."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Can you connect that senior to the communication?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_31 = {
    Text = "It's unfortunate that before you joined Mythag, he fell in action during a mission."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_32 = {Text = "Wait!"},
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Ramona, you don't mean to..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Yes, I don't think they'll make us wait for rescue."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The encirclement is tightening, and the enemy's weapon is already at your feet."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_36 = {
    Text = "We are boarding now."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Retreat@2—!@1! Teach@1!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_5 = {
    Text = "After shrinking the encirclement to the minimum, the Murloc monsters did not continue their attack but instead held a stalemate with you at a berth, muttering strange and indistinguishable whispers."
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Has the attack stopped?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_7 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Ramona, what's wrong?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19084_Content_9 = {
    Text = "No matter if they drove us north with their numbers or blocked the exit in the end, the enemy always left us an escape route."
  },
  AvgDialog_19085_Content_1 = {
    Text = "It's finally over..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19085_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The Seafarer's fish-like lower jaw opened to its maximum extent, with the linking membrane between the upper and lower jaws stretched to a translucent state."
  },
  AvgDialog_19085_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Driven by fear, hope, and faith, it erupted with unimaginable vitality. It suddenly rammed into you and screeched as it stormed out of the power room."
  },
  AvgDialog_19085_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Oh no, he's getting away!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19085_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Murphy kicks the unconscious Seafarer, its fish-like body rolling limply away."
  },
  AvgDialog_19085_Content_3 = {
    Text = "They shouldn't be able to keep fighting anymore... just some pitiful ones. Leave them alone."
  },
  AvgDialog_19085_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Hurry and leave here."
  },
  AvgDialog_19085_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Goo... Goo..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19085_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Among the fallen seafarers, one struggles to rise, using a broken weapon to support their body."
  },
  AvgDialog_19085_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Why... why... from @4 Lord's side... why?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19085_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Oh, Mother Goddess, Mother Goddess... Gulp, gulp...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19085_Content_9 = {
    Text = "...My lord, @4 my lord!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19086_Content_1 = {
    Text = "A gray-blue hand burst from the rubble, its webbed fingers gripping Murphy's boot."
  },
  AvgDialog_19086_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Goo, Goo..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19086_Content_3 = {
    Text = "This guy is still alive!? He was clearly buried under the rubble."
  },
  AvgDialog_19086_Content_4 = {
    Text = "God... God@1..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19086_Content_5 = {
    Text = "...Don't come near me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19087_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The stench of corruption gradually wafts into your nostrils."
  },
  AvgDialog_19087_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The seafarers were summoned by their leader, streaming out from all sides of the cabins."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Heavy footsteps echoed from the other end of the deck. A gruff male voice spoke in an unfamiliar language, and the surrounding enemies retreated like a tide."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ramona turned around, but no one was there. The two had become separated in the enclosed enemy encirclement."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Oh no! <Yellow:%player%>!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_12 = {
    Text = "From behind the stacked crates nearby came an unusual rustling sound."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Stop hiding, I know you're there. This is no time for your antics, \"Young Master Ashe.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Ramona shook her head helplessly. She flicked the blood off her sword, sheathed it, and walked towards the corner piled with crates."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_15 = {Text = "@1@2...!"},
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_16 = {Text = "Wh...!"},
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
Fierce attacks pierced through the crates and impaled the enemy.
The blue-black blood smeared on the tentacles mixed with splintered wood, emitting a foul stench.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The master of the appendage violently shook off the alien body clinging to it, causing the cargo box to collapse with a crash.\n—The figure of the boy appeared before Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_2 = {
    Text = "My lord! This is the High Priest's command..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_20 = {Text = "!?"},
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Awakeners cannot leave the Mythag Realm without the Field Operations leader's approval and the Investigator's link. I thought you were aware of this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Awakener Tulu, Archive No. 6291, Codename <Blue:\"The Sleeping Lord\">"
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I believe you are well aware that your so-called \"precepts\" are meaningless to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Also, don't use that ridiculous codename to refer to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_25 = {Text = "Tulu."},
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I'm not like those stubborn Committee members; Awakeners aren't beasts that need shackles, and now isn't the time to talk about \"running away.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
My concern is that you are not on the field mission list and have not been linked with anyone.
If you stay away from Mythag's<Yellow:Core> for too long, you risk losing control.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_28 = {
    Text = "No worries, I won't be controlled by so-called instincts."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
The Awakener retained the form of a youth, yet every move he made exuded the overwhelming aura of a superior being.
A single, fleeting glance from him was enough to make one's hair stand on end.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You mean..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_30 = {Text = "...Whew."},
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Ramona let out a long sigh and met his gaze once more."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_32 = {
    Text = "—I just want to know, why are you here?\nYou've been in a deep sleep for years. Not even the <Yellow:Silver Key Ceremony> mutation could wake you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_33 = {
    Text = "But now, you're here at the risk of losing your sanity... What happened on this ship must hold great significance for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
Everything that happened here began because of me.
As for the details, they are none of your business.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Oh? So the murlocs chasing us have nothing to do with me? Or is the missing Keeper unrelated to me as well?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_36 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
The immediate priority is to find the Keeper and leave this ship.
So, I won't ask further.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_38 = {
    Text = "You may remain silent for now, but you know I will find the answers."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_4 = {
    Text = "...Alright, I understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Don't leave! Who exactly are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The Awakener youth put away his weapon, turned to glance at Ramona, and then vanished from the deck along with his swarm."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_7 = {
    Text = "What... is this all about?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_8 = {
    Text = "We can't worry about that now. Their real target isn't us... Take this chance to find a way off the ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_19088_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Let's be cautious and avoid those murlocs... Keeper!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19089_Content_1 = {
    Text = "In just half an hour with Murphy, you've vomited three times."
  },
  AvgDialog_19089_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Intense dizziness and nausea always come together, with refluxed stomach acid burning the throat and causing a faint, lingering pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_19089_Content_3 = {
    Text = "My head hurts..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19089_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
You're not going to die, are you?
I... I'll go get help! Wait for me!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19089_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Don't go alone. It's too dangerous."
  },
  AvgDialog_19089_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
I feel much better, really.
Let's go. My partner is still waiting for me.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19090_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
Murphy gazed at the sky swirling with strange lights.
Birds circled beneath the glowing screen, bending soft light that shielded against possible storms outside.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19090_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Yes. In other words, both Murphy and we consider <Blue:Miss Celeste> to be crucial.
And now... she is likely under the control of Miryam, the leader of the Seafarers.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19090_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Damn... that woman..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19090_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Murphy clutches her chest, her expression grave as she gazes towards the boundary of the Domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_19090_Content_13 = {
    Text = "All she cares about is the rebirth of the gods; nothing else matters to her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19090_Content_14 = {
    Text = "She will kill everyone, and in the end, this monster will gnaw on my heart until nothing remains."
  },
  AvgDialog_19090_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I don't want... to die like this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19090_Content_16 = {
    Text = "For a moment, silence spread like the stillness of death."
  },
  AvgDialog_19090_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The notes of the Seafarers' Cult repeatedly emphasize the importance of <Blue:Align>, and the birth ritual must be conducted at a specific time. This is why that woman put me to sleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_19090_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
The captain speculates that His growth might be related to the rules of celestial movements.
Thus, Celeste created this isolated Domain centered around the ship.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19090_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
We guessed correctly. Since leaving the true sky, It has fallen silent.
If we hide in the Domain during this alignment, It may sleep forever.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19090_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Wait, Celeste?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19090_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Can someone explain to me? Who is \"Celeste\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19090_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Huh? Haven't I explained it to you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19090_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Celeste is the captain's partner and an Awakener.
She controls the Sonaniel, which should have sunk, and created this Domain.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19090_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Does it also depend on her whether we can return to the mainland?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Murphy's mood sank, and you didn't know how to comfort her. Meanwhile, Ramona was lost in thought, gazing at the seabirds in the sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
According to the Royal Observatory's calculations, the moon should reach perigee around <Blue:St. Patrick's Day>.
The current moon phase defies scientific laws.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Can you speak English?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
Yes, it was a night with an exceptionally large moon.
The moon was so bright that all the other constellations were invisible.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Wh-What?! It's actually today..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Even if we manage to escape from the Seafarers, the thing inside my heart will still kill me."
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_15 = {
    Text = "If there's another way to isolate the celestial bodies, it might buy you more time."
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_16 = {
    Text = "<Big:Easy for you to say!> Stopping time, creating space... None of these are child's play. Even I know it's not that simple."
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Wait, there's one! Francis!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Lily's Room!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Yes. Doll and Ms. Winkle are researching that room, hoping to create a space safe from hunting for experiments."
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_2 = {
    Text = "To escape the dangerous air pressure on the ship, the flock of birds dispersed, and the seabirds flew straight toward the strange light—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The research is taking shape. Before our departure, Ms. Winkle has already begun preparations for animal testing."
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Don't waste your effort."
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
Your school... can't possibly be on the sea, right?
Returning to land from here and then rushing to your school... there's simply no time for that.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Moreover, Celeste is still in that woman's hands... It's uncertain whether this ship will reach the shore."
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_24 = {
    Text = [[
Instinctively, you glance at Ramona.
Her brows are furrowed, yet her posture remains resolute. She is still contemplating a way to ensure the safety of everyone.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_25 = {Text = "Ramona"},
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_26 = {
    Text = "She stared at you for a moment, then finally smiled with knowing understanding."
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Let's go, if that's what you wish."
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_3 = {
    Text = "One, two, three... They charge toward the sky, desperate to escape, but the Domain gently blocks them."
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The curtain momentarily turned transparent under the relentless impact of the seabirds. This fleeting moment was precisely captured by Ramona—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Was the Domain... gone for a moment?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Yes... indeed, I felt it pulse."
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Celeste strained to create a domain blocking celestial pull. 
Defending against the Seafarers' attack is too much for her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19091_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Celestial bodies... Wait, is it nighttime outside? What do the stars and moon look like?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19092_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Here is the map."
  },
  AvgDialog_19092_Content_11 = {
    Text = "This level has an entrance to the power room... Go check it out. The footprints lead that way."
  },
  AvgDialog_19092_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Acting recklessly is dangerous and unwise."
  },
  AvgDialog_19092_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Precisely because it's dangerous, we must go.
I can't let the Keeper face the enemy alone.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19092_Content_14 = {
    Text = "...Alright, if you insist."
  },
  AvgDialog_19092_Content_2 = {
    Text = "There are some traces here."
  },
  AvgDialog_19092_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The seawater dampened the dust, leaving chaotic traces in the cargo hold: webbed footprints, serpentine drag marks, and fabric dragging marks..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19092_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Shoeprints!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19092_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ramona squatted by the stairs, examined for a moment, then stood up and gently stepped on the footprint."
  },
  AvgDialog_19092_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The patterns match the student uniform shoes. The Keeper has been here."
  },
  AvgDialog_19092_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Here's another pattern."
  },
  AvgDialog_19092_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The shoe size is smaller than mine, probably left by a child."
  },
  AvgDialog_19092_Content_9 = {
    Text = "No way to track; the footprints disappear here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_1 = {
    Text = "He's an Awakener!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Maniacal laughter echoes in the Domain, and the atmosphere becomes increasingly tense—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You all go ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_12 = {Text = "What?"},
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Don't be so alert, dealing with runaway mice isn't my job... Tch, <Blue:Lantern> Those useless people can't even handle this."
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Thanks to them, this ceremony has become even more exciting."
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Not only connected with <Blue:Church of the Lightbearers>, but also with the <Blue:Ritual> you mentioned..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Goliath... Who are you, really?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
Who am I? <Big:Hahahaha!>
Why not ask the person next to you?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I, and these seafarers... Can't you guess? After all, you are the supreme..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Overstepping!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Such astonishing power! Even by Awakener standards, few can hope to match it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Terrifying, truly terrifying—but alas, I am not one of your loyal subjects."
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_21 = {
    Text = "I still need to prepare for the ceremony. No time to get entangled with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Even if you keep hiding with those tentacles, you know it — only you can give that woman what she wants."
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_23 = {
    Text = "—Goliath, wait!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Oh? What else can I assist you with, Miss?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_25 = {
    Text = "I admire those who have the courage to challenge authority. You have one more chance to ask a question before I lose my patience."
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Regarding..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_27 = {
    Text = "I have more questions about the Church of the Lightbearers..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_3 = {
    Text = "This power..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_4 = {
    Text = "As soon as Tulu's hesitation became apparent, the giant thoughtfully paused its attack."
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I see... So you're hanging out with people from Mythag University."
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Goliath eyed the two with a naked, piercing gaze, then burst into laughter."
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_7 = {
    Text = "<Big:Ha, hahaha!> Fascinating, truly fascinating!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_8 = {
    Text = "What kind of expression would <Blue:that woman> show if she saw this scene—would she go insane?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19093_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Hahaha, I can't wait for that moment!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
22:00
Sonaniel
Power Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The ship is dangerous. I'll steer it as close to the shore as possible, but you'll have to use the lifeboat to drift back to land."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_11 = {
    Text = "What about you? It's dangerous to stay here since the ship is crawling with enemies."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_12 = {
    Text = "This is our ship, with <Blue:Celeste>'s Domain on board. We'll be fine."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The Awakener girl named Celeste glanced at everyone, letting out a barely audible hum."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Domains are the embodiment of Celeste's will. Those Seafarers, who are not acknowledged by her, should be kept outside the Domains."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Could it be...?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
Our boarding caused instability in the Domain.
Even if I released the gangway, the Seafarers still breached the Domain from elsewhere... Right?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Sorry, we..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_18 = {
    Text = "It's not your fault. Letting you on board was a decision we made together."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_19 = {
    Text = "\"Protecting humanity\" is a shackle weighing on Celeste, and as her companion, I will support her to the best of my ability."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Too dangerous! Didn't I tell you to keep away?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Ugh...! Cough, cough, cough!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_21 = {Text = "...!"},
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The captain starts coughing violently; the Awakener girl's body flickers for a moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Tulu suddenly appeared beside Celeste, his otherworldly tentacle resting on her shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Her presence is extremely faint; I doubt she can maintain her sanity for much longer."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Celeste won't lose her mind; I won't let her become an uncontrollable monster."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_26 = {
    Text = "With your frail mortal life and fleeting wisdom, where does your confidence come from?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_27 = {Text = "Tulu!"},
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
Don't rush, young lady.
The Awakener is right.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Maintaining Celeste's existence isn't cheap... but there are always ways."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
You have just seen that I have the ability to handle these seafarers.
My name is Ramona. Are you the captain?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Celeste's reactions were always faint, like a lifeless yet exquisite painting, or the figurehead of an old ship, quietly overlooking the world and the sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_31 = {
    Text = "But at that moment, as if in response to Captain Elton's words, she slightly bowed and touched the brim of his hat."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Ramona noticed the captain's condition—this tall man was breathing very weakly, trembling uncontrollably as he stood."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Your body..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_34 = {
    Text = "I'm fine, just an old problem."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_35 = {
    Text = "By the way, why are you alone? I clearly saw two students—\nCeleste, can you sense where the other student is?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
The girl whose name was called keeps her gaze on her fingers, not immediately responding to the captain.
After a while, Celeste slowly looks up at Ramona.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
...No more.
Except for Elton, Murphy, and...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_38 = {
    Text = "There's no one else... except you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_39 = {
    Text = "How is that possible?! We were apart for just half an hour."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Elton, or simply call me Captain."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Moreover, I can feel the connection with the Keeper, {Male=he,Female=she} must still be on the ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_41 = {
    Text = [[
Don't rush, student. Things will work out.
If your fellow student is as excellent as you, {Male=he,Female=she} will be fine.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Don't forget the shoe prints."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Shoe prints..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_44 = {
    Text = "That's right! The Keeper might be acting with a child."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_45 = {
    Text = [[
Child? I see...
That's <Blue:Murphy>, the only passenger on this ship.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Captain Elton took a cigarette box out of his waist pouch. Just as he pinched the last bit of tobacco, a wisp of white mist brushed against his hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_6 = {
    Text = "He let out a deep sigh and put the cigarette pack away."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You're from Mythag University, aren't you? I recognize that uniform."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Yes, many years ago, a senior student from our school boarded this ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_19094_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
Too bad, it's not a good time right now.
On any other day, I could have poured you a drink and had a nice chat.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_10 = {
    Text = "No... no... he promised me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The emaciated woman finally showed a reaction. She blankly looked up, muttering to herself."
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_12 = {
    Text = "My almighty God will wield His power... To judge those heretics who forged falsehoods!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_13 = {
    Text = "She drew the dagger from her waist, its blade enveloped in a mist of purple-black flames, exuding a chilling aura of death."
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The dagger is on fire!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Fake... Die!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Get behind me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_17 = {
    Text = "—The cold and eerie Death Fire on the dagger ignited the coal dust."
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_18 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Yaaah!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Amidst the chain reactions of fire and dust, the air expanded rapidly, and the roaring buzz of the blast enveloped everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_2 = {
    Text = "These buildings are disappearing."
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_20 = {
    Text = "In front, rapidly expanding flames; behind, a bulkhead torn open by an explosion."
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_21 = {
    Text = "%player%, give me your hand!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The impact tore through the ship's metal; amidst the interplay of phantasmal lights and flames, you narrowly missed the girl's outstretched hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_23 = {
    Text = "—You fall into the Aequor."
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_3 = {
    Text = "This is the illusion Miryam created, perhaps her so-called <Blue:Divine Realm>..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
the Divine Realm has returned... The obsession that sustained her for thousands of years has been shattered.
Tulu, do you have any words of comfort?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_5 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The enemy regained some sanity from the chaos and shed their monstrous form."
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Miryam lay weakly in the black dust, her eyes vacant and lost in illusion, unmoved even as Tulu approached."
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Don't be obstinate, Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_19095_Content_9 = {
    Text = "This is our era, our <Blue:Eternal Kingdom>, and its disappearance is inevitable."
  },
  AvgDialog_19096_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Is our communicator expensive?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19096_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The Silver used in the core can be traded for a property in central Londinium on the black market."
  },
  AvgDialog_19096_Content_3 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The attack broke through one side of the power room wall, with snake-like shadows entwining in clusters, disrupting the previously evenly matched battle."
  },
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You didn't have to get dragged into this."
  },
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Elton gritted his teeth and stepped forward, positioning himself in front of Ramona and Celeste."
  },
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Master Priest, I don't understand what you mean."
  },
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Even now... are you still clinging to your delusions?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The woman stepped to the forefront of the Seafarers' group, and Ramona got a clear look at her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_15 = {
    Text = "This was the woman who had appeared during their first ambush after boarding the ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Unforgivable... Unforgivable, inexcusable!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Celeste! Hurry!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Celeste raised the compass high, the flowing light swirling like birds around Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_19 = {
    Text = "In the blink of an eye, she was forced out of the power room by this irresistible force."
  },
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Among the ethereal shadows, a graceful female figure slowly entered the power room.
Her presence seemed to still the air around her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_20 = {Text = "Ramona?!"},
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_21 = {Text = "It's you!"},
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_3 = {Text = "Oh no...!"},
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_4 = {
    Text = "My treasures and hopes..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Captain Elton, I once trusted your loyalty... And this is how you repay me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Power capable of forming a shape... Could she also be an Awakener?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Celeste, get this female student and her Awakener out of here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Wait a minute?! Captain, maybe we can help—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19097_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Through the smoke stirred up by the swarm of snakes, Ramona tried to spot Tulu, but the young Awakener was nowhere to be found in the power room."
  },
  AvgDialog_19098_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
<Yellow:Dissolution> What is this? This black wound?
Her true mother was also covered in these marks.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19098_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Half a year ago, when I awoke from my slumber, the Dissolution was as small as a sesame seed. As it grew, so did the wound..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19098_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Sometimes, in the quiet of the night, I can even hear the sound of liquid flowing from the wounds..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19098_Content_4 = {Text = "Murphy..."},
  AvgDialog_19098_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Put away your pitying expression and deal with these guys first."
  },
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
22:30  
Sonanil  
Deck 3]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
She lacks a century of experience, advanced knowledge, and worldly adventures.
Setting aside her role as the Church's Holy Maiden, her life is even simpler than that of other girls her age.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Remove the brooch"
  },
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Take this and stay here."
  },
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Legacy, inheritance?
I warn you, don't throw your lives away recklessly!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_14 = {
    Text = "This is a communicator. Although it's temporarily out of order in the Domain, the school is definitely trying to contact us."
  },
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
If you can see <Yellow:Dissolution>, then you must have sufficient spirit power to use this communicator.
Focus your mind when the brooch lights up, and you will establish contact with the other person.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_16 = {
    Text = "What's going on... Putting on such a heroic act, ready to face death."
  },
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Murphy clutched the brooch."
  },
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Hey! Hurry back! If the ship docks, I won't wait for you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Wait, where are you going?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
Miss Celeste is unable to handle the enemy, but perhaps we can. 
Stopping the heretical ritual is also one of the duties of a Mythag Investigator.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
You guys?! Don't be absurd, this is suicide!
She's a monster, a monster! No one can stop her!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_5 = {
    Text = "If this were the last hour of my life, I wouldn't waste it on prayer."
  },
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I believe you wouldn't either, right? Otherwise, why go to all the trouble of escaping from the cult?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_7 = {Text = "I..."},
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_8 = {
    Text = "This isn't just for you. Remember, we're also waiting to get off the ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_19099_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ramona's subtle comfort didn't work; Murphy was still at a loss, his face revealing unease."
  },
  AvgDialog_19100_Content_1 = {
    Text = "These Seafarers... have completely taken on the appearance of fish."
  },
  AvgDialog_19100_Content_10 = {
    Text = "That's correct... This is something only we can accomplish."
  },
  AvgDialog_19100_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Brace yourself, the enemy is approaching!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19100_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Was Murphy raised by people who looked completely different from her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19100_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Yes, so I'm truly surprised that she shares similar values with ordinary people. It's a miracle."
  },
  AvgDialog_19100_Content_4 = {
    Text = "However, we need to pray for another miracle at this moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_19100_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Stop the ritual"
  },
  AvgDialog_19100_Content_6 = {
    Text = "That's right. If the ritual continues, who knows what kind of monster will hatch from Murphy's body."
  },
  AvgDialog_19100_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
Our strength alone can't end this.
But if we just rescue Miss Celeste and let Murphy leave the ship first...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19100_Content_8 = {
    Text = "This is something only we can accomplish."
  },
  AvgDialog_19100_Content_9 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19101_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Schoolgirl! Keep away from here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19101_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The middle-aged man shouted loudly, attracting the attention of most of the Seafarers."
  },
  AvgDialog_19101_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Given his attire, he must be the captain."
  },
  AvgDialog_19101_Content_4 = {
    Text = "And the girl beside him... I can't allow them to be in danger."
  },
  AvgDialog_19101_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Goo... Intrusion...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19101_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Be careful, the enemy has spotted us."
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_1 = {Text = "Hiss——"},
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_10 = {
    Text = "But it's alright; we will safely return to land."
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Murphy... Are you alright? There's no need to push yourself."
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Who is forcing themselves? I didn't see anyone—wait, isn't there one right in front of me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Someone survived the <Yellow:explosion> but hit their head and is still pretending to be fine."
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Wait, wait? Who are you referring to?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You're really tough, but looking at you, I'm afraid your head still has some internal injuries—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_16 = {Text = "Ah!"},
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The hull roared again, as if on the verge of breaking apart, and the deck beneath my feet trembled slightly."
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The Sonanil is losing control... I don't have much time left."
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_19 = {
    Text = "We need to find the captain, his crew, and Ramona, and get off the ship as soon as possible."
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A sharp tip pierces through the grey-blue chest, liquid splashes, and the Seafarer crashes to the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Murphy's words pierce your mind once again, but this time, instead of the desire to vomit, you feel an unprecedented clarity."
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Murphy, what did you just say?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Is it just your brain that's damaged, or is there more?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I said, WE NEED TO FIND THE CAPTAIN AND <Blue:RAMONA>—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_24 = {
    Text = "That's the one!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Murphy, from start to finish, I never mentioned my partner's name to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Where did you learn the name \"Ramona\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_3 = {
    Text = "...Sorry, I can't let you go."
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Murphy lowered his eyes, stared at the dagger for a moment, and finally wiped off the gray-green viscous liquid on it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_5 = {
    Text = "He was just about to warn them... Damn, is there someone leading the Seafarers on this ship..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Let's go. We can't stay here for long."
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The Power Room has been destroyed"
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Yeah... it's completely in ruins now."
  },
  AvgDialog_19102_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Murphy stands by the hatch, glancing back at the chaos in the power room, eyelashes trembling uneasily"
  },
  AvgDialog_19103_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ramona, do you have any idea how to get that thing out?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19103_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ramona looks at Murphy, then at you, her face full of difficulty."
  },
  AvgDialog_19103_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Say what you want, don't be shy."
  },
  AvgDialog_19103_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Your blood vessels have fused with your aorta; even the most skilled surgeons cannot guarantee the success of such a surgery."
  },
  AvgDialog_19103_Content_5 = {
    Text = "It is currently in a dormant state... There is still time to find another way."
  },
  AvgDialog_19103_Content_6 = {Text = "Hibernate?"},
  AvgDialog_19103_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Did you say He is in hibernation?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19103_Content_8 = {
    Text = "It's only temporary."
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Murphy stomped his foot heavily and reluctantly approached the wall-mounted plan."
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Phew, <Small:I thought you didn't get it either.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_11 = {Text = "Also?"},
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
<BigShake:No, nothing!>
Take a good look.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_13 = {
    Text = "As you command, as you command."
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_14 = {
    Text = "We are under the staircase on the fore side... Murphy, where do you think the others are? The cockpit on the aft deck?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_15 = {
    Text = "How would I know! But if you want to reach the cockpit, you must go through the deck or the Power Room."
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_16 = {
    Text = "There are too many enemies on the deck; it's safer inside the cabin. Take a detour through the power room...<BigShake:Ugh!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_17 = {
    Text = "<Blue:\"Power Room\"> seems to carry a certain force, as a fierce wave of dizziness strikes your brain again the moment the last syllable is spoken."
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_18 = {
    Text = "An intense wave of nausea prevents you from staying upright. You suddenly slam into the bulkhead and begin retching violently."
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_19 = {
    Text = "*Cough, cough! ... Ugh...*"
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_2 = {Text = "Hmm..."},
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Are you alright?! Why are you throwing up again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Let me take a look."
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_4 = {
    Text = "As the floor plan comes into view, a strong sense of déjà vu washes over you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_5 = {
    Text = "In <Blue:the past>, in <Blue:dreams>, at <Blue:some unknown point in time>, you seem to experience similar things."
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Beside me is a proud and headstrong girl, also on the unfamiliar ship, examining the grooves carved into the metal nameplate."
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The sense of déjà vu is like an invisible fishhook, and you are the poor fish that took the bait, being irresistibly dragged to the other end of the mire—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_8 = {
    Text = "What's on your mind?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19104_Content_9 = {
    Text = "...Nothing, maybe I'm just too tired."
  },
  AvgDialog_19105_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The power room isn't as lively as you imagined: there are no muscular workers, no blazing boilers."
  },
  AvgDialog_19105_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Murphy gazed at the dagger for a moment, then suddenly climbed up the pile of rubble with hands and feet, reaching for it—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19105_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Murphy, be careful!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19105_Content_12 = {Text = "Ah!"},
  AvgDialog_19105_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Only the unforgettable sparks fly everywhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_19105_Content_3 = {
    Text = "How could this happen here...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19105_Content_4 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Cough cough>...The smell is unbearable."
  },
  AvgDialog_19105_Content_5 = {
    Text = "A massive hole appeared in the bulkhead, and the icy wind rushed into the cabin. Murphy pinched his frostbitten earlobe, stepped over the flames, and walked into the wreckage."
  },
  AvgDialog_19105_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Hmm? Seems like there's something..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19105_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Among the ruins, something reflects a striking light."
  },
  AvgDialog_19105_Content_8 = {
    Text = "—It is a dagger, resting quietly amidst the extinguished embers. Despite the dust covering its blade, its sharpness remains evident."
  },
  AvgDialog_19105_Content_9 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19106_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Someone is coming."
  },
  AvgDialog_19106_Content_2 = {
    Text = "...Front Gate, Seafarer."
  },
  AvgDialog_19107_Content_1 = {
    Text = "This dock is enormous."
  },
  AvgDialog_19107_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I agree with your view on Herbert, but don't forget, Dissolution can also cause such group mutations"
  },
  AvgDialog_19107_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Hope it's not the <Yellow:Cataclysm> that caused this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19107_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Stay sharp, we're nearing the north gate exit."
  },
  AvgDialog_19107_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
After a series of battles, only a few enemies remain in your way.
Ahead, just a few small fry await to be defeated by you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19107_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Are these enemies... related to what we are investigating?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19107_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Cannot deny the possibility. According to intelligence from Doll's spy equipment at Herbert's, the Church of the Lightbearers has many affiliated organizations, including The Sculptors."
  },
  AvgDialog_19107_Content_6 = {
    Text = "But the members of the Church of the Lightbearers we met in Lai Town were much more elegant."
  },
  AvgDialog_19107_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You are being surrounded by real \"small fry\"—hunched humanoid bodies with fish heads peeking out from beneath tattered hoods."
  },
  AvgDialog_19107_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Whenever they attack, you can smell the stench of decaying life."
  },
  AvgDialog_19107_Content_9 = {
    Text = "It also cannot be ruled out that The Sculptors' Association is involved. Herbert is a jerk who toys with Life in the name of immortality."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
Right, right. Didn't you just mention a male leader?
Did that guy say anything... anything at all?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_10 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_11 = {
    Text = "What riddles is he referring to?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Goliath, that guy..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_13 = {Text = "Murphy."},
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_14 = {
    Text = "What... what are you doing? Why are you suddenly looking at me like that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
You know the <Blue:Seafarers> well, can identify their elite guards, and even know their leader.
Since we met, I haven't mentioned <Blue:Goliath> once.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You were once a member of the Seafarers, possibly holding a high rank... or perhaps they are here for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_17 = {
    Text = "So you are the <Blue:Sainted Maiden>, <Blue:Puppet Princess>, and <Blue:Key Sacrifice for the Seafarers> that Goliath mentioned, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_18 = {Text = "I'm not!"},
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_19 = {
    Text = "How do you explain your familiarity with Goliath and your evasion of the leader?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ramona gave Murphy a deep, scrutinizing look — with her unique gaze."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I'm just... a maid... an ordinary maid. There are countless girls like me in the Order's base!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Humans should be extremely rare among seafarers in appearance. Otherwise, their battle prowess would not require cooperation with the Church of the Lightbearers."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_22 = {
    Text = "If you're just an insignificant human maid, why would they make such a big fuss to hunt you down?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_23 = {
    Text = "It's all... just..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Do you think it's all a coincidence? I don't think so."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The captain who brought you aboard has also been labeled a \"traitor.\" While the Seafarers are hunting you down, they have not spared them either."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Have you met the captain and Celeste? Are they still safe?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
They fell into the hands of the female leader, Miryam.
The result of "Betrayal" by the Seafarer... I reckon you know better than I do.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_28 = {
    Text = "<Small:No, no way... She's still counting on the captain to serve her.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_29 = {
    Text = "When it comes to transporting inventory, there are more than enough ships that can travel between the continent and the pole."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Alright, I will relay his conversation with me to all of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Ramona's expression was calm and resolute. She pressed forward relentlessly, even using the uncertain safety of the two captains as a psychological weapon, which greatly increased the psychological stress."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_31 = {Text = "Ramona..."},
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_32 = {
    Text = "You're almost starting to feel sorry for Murphy—just then, Ramona winks at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Years of mutual understanding allow you to instantly grasp her meaning"
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Murphy, we need to know what happened."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Only then will we have a chance to survive, and only then can we help you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_36 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_37 = {Text = "Alright..."},
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Church of the Lightbearers? Hah, it's no secret."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The Church of the Lightbearers helps collect the <Yellow:materials> needed for rituals. In return, the Seafarers occasionally do some shady work for them..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The Seafarers' appearance makes it difficult for them to walk among the world, and they desire our power... Just a mutual exploitation between oddities, clinging together for warmth."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Then what exactly is the \"ritual\" you speak of..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Ha! This is the second question.\nLet me make this clear, young lady—I have no obligation to report to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19108_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
Run, run faster.
Once the moon rises, you won't have a chance to survive.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19109_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
Although they're seafarers, these guys are tougher than before. 
Murphy, any ideas?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19109_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Deal with these guys first."
  },
  AvgDialog_19109_Content_2 = {
    Text = "They are <Blue:that woman's> personal guards. Even among the monster-infested Seafarers, they are the elite."
  },
  AvgDialog_19109_Content_3 = {
    Text = "\"That woman\"... Do you mean the leader of the Seafarers?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19109_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Miryam, her name is Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_19109_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The boss's personal guard... No wonder they're tougher than the rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_19109_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Tulu was with me until just now, but after encountering Miryam, he disappeared somewhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_19109_Content_7 = {
    Text = "With his strength, dealing with these so-called \"personal guards\" is a piece of cake."
  },
  AvgDialog_19109_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Tulu?! What is he doing here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19109_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ramona's expression hardened as she lifted her sword once more."
  },
  AvgDialog_19110_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Schoolgirl, why have you stopped moving forward?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19110_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Yes, the Linker's sanity and life will rapidly deteriorate."
  },
  AvgDialog_19110_Content_11 = {
    Text = "To preserve Celeste, I made a <Blue:deal> with the leader of the Seafarers."
  },
  AvgDialog_19110_Content_12 = {
    Text = "She regularly provided medicine to keep me barely alive. In exchange, we consistently transported inventory for the Seafarers."
  },
  AvgDialog_19110_Content_13 = {
    Text = "This implies you're their collaborator... if so, why are you attacked by the seafarers?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19110_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Because... I <Blue:betrayed> that person."
  },
  AvgDialog_19110_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Captain, I have a question I'd like to ask you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19110_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You have some connection or unresolved conflict with the seafarer, don't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19110_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The Seafarers have similar appearances, but you can distinguish differences among them... Yet, you will still be subject to their attacks."
  },
  AvgDialog_19110_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Don't be so nervous, I'm a genuine human."
  },
  AvgDialog_19110_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
But unlike your top Mythag students, I'm just an ordinary person.
I have no talent for linking with Awakeners and can't see <Yellow:Dissolution>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19110_Content_7 = {
    Text = "During the Awakener's rebirth, their consciousness is inevitably polluted by <Yellow:unknown entities>, which leads to their loss of control..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19110_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Since you're a student at Mythag University, you should know how to suppress an out-of-control situation, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19110_Content_9 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Spirit Link>... But if an ordinary person without talent attempts the link..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19111_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Miss Ramona, Keeper! Over here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19111_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Alright, be extremely careful!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19111_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The driver jumped back into the car, and the sound of the engine starting drew the attention of many enemies."
  },
  AvgDialog_19111_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Hey! Look up at the stars, over here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19111_Content_2 = {
    Text = "It's Mr. Driver!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19111_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Not far ahead, a familiar middle-aged man anxiously rattled the iron chain on the door, his face filled with worry."
  },
  AvgDialog_19111_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Miss Ramona, I can't open this lock."
  },
  AvgDialog_19111_Content_5 = {
    Text = "No worries, I can cut the chain directly. Please step back."
  },
  AvgDialog_19111_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Only 10 meters away from freedom."
  },
  AvgDialog_19111_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The rustling grows louder as things emerge from the shadows one after another, making the air even more damp and heavy."
  },
  AvgDialog_19111_Content_8 = {
    Text = "So many of them?! They're blocking our path!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19111_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Driver, you're not a combatant. Leave quickly!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19112_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
These guys are the elite among Seafarers.
Be careful, don't get hurt.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19113_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The instant you take a step forward, the air grows heavy and humid."
  },
  AvgDialog_19113_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Breathing and heartbeat are heavily suppressed, causing an inexplicable sense of panic."
  },
  AvgDialog_19113_Content_3 = {Text = "It's her!"},
  AvgDialog_19114_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
22:10  
Sonaniel  
Cargo Hold 3]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19114_Content_2 = {
    Text = "It seems like they've stopped chasing us."
  },
  AvgDialog_19114_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Whew... Finally, I can take a breather."
  },
  AvgDialog_19114_Content_4 = {
    Text = "There is no completely safe place on this ship. Stay alert."
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Goo... Goo..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_10 = {
    Text = "\"The stars are rising to their rightful places\" — indicating that you understand the conditions of the ritual."
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_11 = {
    Text = "\"All-in, desperate struggle\" — It shows that you understand the enemy's situation."
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Summoning Ritual — What is going on? And where did these murlocs come from?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You follow Ramona's example and point out, one by one, the information revealed by Tulu's words and actions."
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_14 = {Text = "...I see."},
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
It was my oversight not to notice your anomaly.
Being involved in such an event as a human seems to have had some impact on you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_16 = {
    Text = "\"Such an event?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Someone's coming."
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_18 = {
    Text = "As soon as Tulu finished speaking, a slight tremor came from beneath your feet. A figure charged toward you from the other end of the deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Wow—Help me—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
These humanoid bodies, with characteristics of aquatic life, emitted strange whimpers.
The sounds were disorderly and piercing, yet you somehow understood their meaning.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_20 = {
    Text = "They're catching up!!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_21 = {Text = "Caution!"},
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The girl, panting heavily, rushed to your side. Following her across the deck were undoubtedly more enemies."
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_3 = {
    Text = "They're saying... \"Return it to us\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_4 = {
    Text = "What should I give back? I have nothing in my hands—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Even the brooch has vanished without a trace."
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_6 = {
    Text = "It's a desperate struggle, a final gamble. Pay no heed to their words."
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Under Tulu's command, the tentacle swept the last enemy overboard. The splash marked the temporary end of the battle."
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Alright, no one is disturbing us now. Can you explain it clearly?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19115_Content_9 = {
    Text = "What exactly needs to be explained?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19116_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Special Elixir"
  },
  AvgDialog_19116_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The throbbing toe brings you back to reality. Seeing the girl beside you and the shrinking circle, you steel yourself for battle."
  },
  AvgDialog_19116_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Tulu, prepare for battle!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19116_Content_12 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19116_Content_13 = {Text = "...Tulu?"},
  AvgDialog_19116_Content_14 = {
    Text = "At this crucial moment, the people suddenly disappeared... Well, it seems we have to rely on ourselves."
  },
  AvgDialog_19116_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Huff... Huff..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19116_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Thank goodness I found you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19116_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The girl rushed to your side, clutching the hem of your cloak as if it were a lifeline, speaking in gasps."
  },
  AvgDialog_19116_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The enemies leave you little room to breathe, raising their weapons and charging at you with a roar."
  },
  AvgDialog_19116_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Mother@2—!@1Mother!@2!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19116_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The chaotic roars grow clearer in your ears.\nJust a little more, just a little more, and you'll be able to understand what they want—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19116_Content_8 = {
    Text = "In the moment you were distracted, the girl stomped hard on your leather shoe."
  },
  AvgDialog_19116_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Are you just going to stand there and watch? Do something!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19117_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The two of them walked towards the power room. As they got close enough, a cacophony of noise came from behind the hatch."
  },
  AvgDialog_19117_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A battle is taking place!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19117_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Don't be reckless."
  },
  AvgDialog_19118_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Before the words faded, the hatch was smashed open from the inside, and several seafarers were thrown out of the power room amidst flowing light."
  },
  AvgDialog_19118_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
They are surrounded by Seafarers. We need to help them escape.
The Power Room has a back door. We can go around from there.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19118_Content_2 = {
    Text = "In the innermost corner of the power room, the two besieged individuals also turned their gaze towards the door — the white figure among them locked eyes with Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_19118_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
Pure, noble, transcendent, fragile; countless adjectives flashed through Ramona's mind.
Then, an incredible realization arose within her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19118_Content_4 = {
    Text = "She is also..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19118_Content_5 = {Text = "...Humans."},
  AvgDialog_19118_Content_6 = {Text = "Protect..."},
  AvgDialog_19118_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The flowing light silently blocked Ramona, keeping her outside the power room."
  },
  AvgDialog_19118_Content_8 = {
    Text = "This light... It's the same as the light screen forming the boundary of the Domain!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19118_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Looks like she's the master of this Domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_19119_Content_10 = {
    Text = "She kicked away a few planks, revealing a trapdoor on the deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_19119_Content_2 = {Text = "Hmm!"},
  AvgDialog_19119_Content_3 = {
    Text = "They have reinforcements. I can't hold on any longer."
  },
  AvgDialog_19119_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Below deck! There shouldn't be as many <Blue:Seafarers> gathered there."
  },
  AvgDialog_19119_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You scanned the deck and noticed a hatch leading downward."
  },
  AvgDialog_19119_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Not to mention the door is locked — we can't even get past them to reach the door."
  },
  AvgDialog_19119_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Enemies chased from the other end of the deck, brandishing weapons and flesh, creating an impenetrable barrier"
  },
  AvgDialog_19119_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Don't go that way."
  },
  AvgDialog_19119_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The girl took a few steps back on her own, and you quickly moved to shield her as you followed."
  },
  AvgDialog_19120_Content_1 = {
    Text = "What happened to you while we were separated? You actually encountered the enemy leader."
  },
  AvgDialog_19120_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The One Who Treads Across All Seas?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19120_Content_11 = {
    Text = "This title is truly..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19120_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
I teamed up with Tulu, and we only had a slight advantage against him.
Perhaps he truly possesses such strength.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19120_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Speaking of which, why is Tulu on the ship?
Unlinked Awakeners are prone to delusions once they leave campus.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19120_Content_14 = {
    Text = "On our own, I'm afraid we won't be able to restrain the out-of-control Tulu."
  },
  AvgDialog_19120_Content_15 = {
    Text = "It seems Tulu is very stable for now, but it's unclear how long this will last."
  },
  AvgDialog_19120_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Sounds like that Tulu is pretty tough, huh? Then just ignore him!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19120_Content_17 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Those guys are about to catch up!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19120_Content_2 = {
    Text = "It's a long story involving Tulu, mysterious enemies, human captains, and Awakeners..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19120_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Speaking of which, the leader of the Seafarers on board is not just Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_19120_Content_4 = {Text = "...!"},
  AvgDialog_19120_Content_5 = {
    Text = "While acting with Tulu, we briefly fought a male Awakener calling himself <Blue:Conqueror of the Seas>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19120_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
His attitude towards us... especially towards Tulu, is quite perplexing.
Although he belongs to the Seafarers' faction, he appears indifferent to the success of the <Blue:Ritual>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19120_Content_7 = {Text = "Ritual?"},
  AvgDialog_19120_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Is this the purpose of the Seafarers? To conduct pagan rituals on the ship?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19120_Content_9 = {
    Text = "It's still unknown, but I think Tulu might know the full story behind it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19121_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ambushed from all sides"
  },
  AvgDialog_19121_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The Drapur Investigator is expected to arrive at Dock 3 in half an hour."
  },
  AvgDialog_19121_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Half an hour is too long. There are too many enemies on the southern road. We'll try to break through from the north."
  },
  AvgDialog_19121_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The driver has been notified to meet at the north exit of the third dock."
  },
  AvgDialog_19121_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Unknown enemy? Is it <Yellow:Church of the Lightbearers> and their associates?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19121_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Would you like to record new enemy intelligence?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19121_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Erica, please, not now."
  },
  AvgDialog_19121_Content_16 = {
    Text = "It is a humanoid creature with no prior sighting records. I will submit a report when I return."
  },
  AvgDialog_19121_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Keeper, protect yourself and prepare to break through."
  },
  AvgDialog_19121_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
21:00
Port Town - Brillport
Third Dock]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19121_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Shake:—Watch your back!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19121_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Detected unexpected high-frequency sound waves, communication auto-linked.
Once again, good evening, Keeper, Ramona.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19121_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Looks like someone was scared out of their wits."
  },
  AvgDialog_19121_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Please avoid unnecessary verbal interference with field agents."
  },
  AvgDialog_19121_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
Alright, alright.
So, do you need help?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19121_Content_8 = {
    Text = "We need reinforcements!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19121_Content_9 = {
    Text = "We engaged an unknown enemy at <Blue:Dock 3> in <Blue:Brillport>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19122_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Those hideous faces, just looking at them feels like an insult to evolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_19122_Content_2 = {
    Text = "They jostle, their cold weapons clashing with a piercing sound. In the midst of the chaos, they seem to encircle something..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_1 = {Text = "No escape"},
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Launch an attack at the dock, trapping the enemies beneath the gangway, their lifeless fish eyes fixed on you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_11 = {
    Text = "They failed to keep up with the gangway..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Ramona lowered her voice and whispered."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_13 = {
    Text = "We were used as guinea pigs. Once we set foot on the deck, we will likely lose our value to them."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_14 = {
    Text = "So... I have an idea."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You step onto the last step of the gangway."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Ramona, something's not right! Hold on for a moment!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The gangway trembles, and the enemies give you no respite. They stop observing and begin climbing up using both hands and feet."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_18 = {Text = "Clang—!"},
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Ramona's full-strength slash shattered the fixed clasp, causing the gangway to fall without making even the slightest sound of a heavy object hitting the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
21:10
Port Town - Brillport
Third Dock]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_20 = {
    Text = "At least they can't board from this gangway anymore."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Wait, this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Like birds kissed by the sky, your eyes are gently brushed by the warm breeze, and the world before you is turned upside down."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The massive full moon disappeared from the sky, aurora-like halos swirling around the ship and casting strange-colored spots on the deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Visions flood your minds, and it takes a while before you regain the ability to speak."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Interesting..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Ramona, what are your thoughts?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Interesting, very interesting. The gangway fell without a sound — suggesting we might be in an isolated space."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_28 = {
    Text = "This is a visible <Yellow:Domain>!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The mist protecting the school is powered by <Yellow:Silver chip technology>. Who knows what power will control this ship?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The acrid stench of rusted steel assaults your nose with every step, the gangway groaning underfoot."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Could it be an Awakener?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_31 = {
    Text = "No similar records in the Archive, but theoretically, it is possible for Awakeners to create independent spaces—would you like to hear the specifics?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Please... spare me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Consider the occasion!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Sorry, sorry, please forgive my curiosity."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Doll, did you all hear it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Ramona taps her brooch, and a shimmer glides across the communicator's surface."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_37 = {Text = "Hmm...?"},
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
Ramona turned sideways and pointed at your communicator.
You tried to focus as usual, but it didn't work at all.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Spirit power is like a tear dropping into the sea, returning to silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Despite the lack of maintenance and repairs, the hull itself is relatively intact, albeit aged."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_40 = {
    Text = "My communicator has also lost connection."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_41 = {
    Text = "The communicator appears undamaged, but it cannot send messages."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_42 = {
    Text = "<Small:Why are there so many things that can block communication? Last time, it happened at the wax museum too...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_43 = {
    Text = "The technology spawned by Silver is not omnipotent. Besides, our research on Silver itself is still in its infancy."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_44 = {
    Text = "...Otherwise, should we disembark?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Take a look around the deck. You might find another way to disembark."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Be mindful of your surroundings, and offer a prayer that this ship won't set sail."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_47 = {
    Text = "<Big:Woo—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Like a lark responding to an opera singer's flourish, the prolonged whistle answered Ramona's prayer."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_49 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_5 = {
    Text = "There are no obvious signs of seawater erosion, and there are no barnacles or oysters below the waterline..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_50 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_51 = {
    Text = "I know what you want to say, but please, not now."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_52 = {
    Text = "We can't set sail with the Sonanil. This ship has too many suspicious aspects."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Check the other end of the deck. Large ships should all be equipped with lifeboats. Perhaps we can lower one and evacuate via the sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Wait... I think I hear something."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Fish-like faces appeared on the deck, the culprits who forced you onto the ship closing in step by step."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_6 = {
    Text = "What have you discovered?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The Sonanil lacks the characteristics of a sunken ghost ship, which is inconsistent with the records of it having sunk in a storm."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_8 = {
    Text = "If I get the chance, I'd like to thoroughly investigate the origins of this ship..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19123_Content_9 = {
    Text = "But now is clearly not a good time."
  },
  AvgDialog_19124_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ah... Why... Why!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19124_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Miryam doesn't look quite right."
  },
  AvgDialog_19124_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Isn't this the perfect opportunity? Hurry up and rescue <Yellow:%player%> now."
  },
  AvgDialog_19125_Content_1 = {
    Text = "As Miryam's mind fluctuated, the seafarers' group became unstable, and chaos quietly spread."
  },
  AvgDialog_19125_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The snake's tail lashed out against the cabin walls, creating a resonant hum in the steel."
  },
  AvgDialog_19125_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The long-accumulated soot rises, falling like a soft black snow in the power room."
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Pursuit of stars"
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Whatever you think happened, I made the decision. I am the master of this ship.
Celeste has almost no self-awareness. How could she possibly change me?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Is that so?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I can let you awaken her, and I can also turn her back into a pile of silver sand."
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_13 = {Text = "You!"},
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_14 = {Text = "It's now!"},
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_15 = {Text = "Bang—!"},
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_16 = {Text = "Hmm!"},
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The attack struck Ramona's external shield solidly. The shield shattered with a flash after only half a second."
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Schoolgirl?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_19 = {Text = "Ramona!"},
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
22:35
Sonaniel
Power Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I'm fine, don't come over!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
While being distracted and trying to protect others, I'm no match for this woman.
I'll do my best to hold her attacks at bay. You take them and leave first.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You'll come to meet me, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_23 = {
    Text = "What's worrying you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Ramona swung her sword, dispersing the attacking snake shadows, and then gave you a quick smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_25 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Captain, hurry!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_27 = {
    Text = "—As if being chased by a raging beast, you frantically sprint out of the cabin."
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Moved by the fact that we are both wanderers, I bestow upon you the Rite of the Departed."
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Her arrival signifies the fulfillment of your long-held wish. Surely, you have received ample comfort from your departed loved ones..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
My wish, the great expectation bestowed by God, is <Blue:that child>.
Return the Saintess... no, the Godmother to me.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_6 = {
    Text = "By the grace of our god, when He is reborn within the holy virgin and the divine realm descends once more... you too shall enter the divine realm and find eternal peace."
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_7 = {
    Text = "High Priest, I was also shocked to learn about the Goddess Mother's disappearance. But as I said, she is not on the ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Why bother pretending and acting like a fool?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19126_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I once admired your intelligence and persistence. What changed your loyalty to me? Is it this <Yellow:Golem>? So weak and fleeting..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Sea Treader"
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I don't expect you to lend a hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_11 = {
    Text = "But if everything truly \"started because of you,\" I hope to at least not hear any insensitive remarks from the culprit."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_12 = {Text = "Keeper..."},
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Those creatures attacked from the south side of the deck, the Keeper couldn't rush straight into the enemy's encirclement, {Male=he,Female=she} isn't that foolish."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_14 = {
    Text = "There must be an unnoticed hatch entrance on the north-side deck where we were."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_15 = {Text = "You..."},
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_16 = {
    Text = "What's wrong? Any other discoveries?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I wonder, how do you perceive \"those monsters\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Webbed fingers, fully fish-like above the tailbone, retaining some intelligence."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Their forms are smooth and natural, unlike the works of the Sculptors' Association, who always botch their experimental pieces."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
21:30
Sonnanir
Deck]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I originally thought that their appearance was the result of a mutation caused by <Yellow:Cataclysm>, but during these few battles, I did not notice any obvious <Yellow:D-Mark> on them."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_21 = {
    Text = "They... are more like a cruel joke that evolution has played on humanity."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
"A foolish joke played upon humanity."
This One found your metaphor... amusing.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
Thanks, but that doesn't make me any less alert around you.
Especially after you casually remarked on my relationship with the Keeper.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_24 = {
    Text = "I won't take action against you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Is that so? Then why won't you disclose the real reason for leaving school without permission? Is it really that hard to admit?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I have no obligation to explain myself to you, but if necessary, I will lend my assistance."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The Keeper and I hope to investigate the clues of the Church of the Lightbearers and find a way to escape safely from this ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_28 = {
    Text = "I don't think there's a conflict of interest between us; otherwise, I wouldn't have the chance to be here talking to you. Being honest is mutually beneficial."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_29 = {
    Text = "My affairs are none of your concern."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Ramona clung to the ship's railing, half of her body hanging over the side."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_30 = {
    Text = "See, it's precisely this attitude that makes you untrustworthy."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Your display of anger makes you very human."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_32 = {
    Text = "To be honest, the coldness you display makes it hard to believe that you once lived as a human."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Arguing is a waste of time for both of us. Let's head back to the north deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Ramona calmly ended the conversation, walked past the young Awakener, and headed back to where she had first boarded."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Watch out, enemy attack!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_36 = {Text = "What?"},
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The tip of the extended rapier pierced the light screen, stirring a small, peculiar vortex in the seemingly empty air."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_5 = {
    Text = "After a moment, she sheathed her rapier and stood firmly on the deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The ship has set sail, but due to the light curtain, it is impossible to determine the direction using reference points."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Port, destination, shipowner... none of these matter. The priority is finding the Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I thought that with your ability, you wouldn't have to blindly obey the so-called \"Keeper\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_19127_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You don't need a link to stay rational; you can fight on your own"
  },
  AvgDialog_19128_Content_1 = {
    Text = "<Blue:Seafarer> are mostly physically frail. This giant sword belongs to another master; handle it with care."
  },
  AvgDialog_19128_Content_2 = {
    Text = "What do you call these murlocs?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19128_Content_3 = {
    Text = "They're closing in. Be careful."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_1 = {Text = "Lost light"},
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Do you know us?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_11 = {
    Text = "If there's anything that <Blue:\"Wick\"> hates with a passion, you are one of them... However, I've always had a soft spot for the clever ones."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Lamp wick, lantern... Could <Blue:\"lamp wick\"> refer to special figures in the Church of the Lightbearers?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The Seafarers' appearance makes it difficult for them to walk among the world, and they desire our power... Just a mutual exploitation between oddities, clinging together for warmth."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
You must be a highly valued collaborator controlling the Seafarer forces. 
Or are you also one of the "Wicks"?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
Though my form is <Yellow:Flickering Candlelight>, the vision I pursue differs greatly from that of other wicks.
You save the world from <Yellow:Black Filth>, and this does not conflict with <Blue:the return of the Divine Realm>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
The wise should not be lost in the mundane.
Though the divine land is interwoven with bloodlines, it is not averse to welcoming new blood.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Serve us, join the revival and return of the Divine Realm, and attain ultimate glory... Thus, we shall walk in the land of bliss."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_18 = {
    Text = "If the revival you speak of involves using the living as sacrifices and the innocent as vessels for monsters."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I can't do that, and the Keeper wouldn't approve either."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
22:55
Sonaniel
Power Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_20 = {
    Text = "<Big:Insolent one!> You should feel honored to serve as the vessel for a god's rebirth."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_21 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Good, you've successfully provoked her... Now, guide her to attack! If her attack breaches the hull, there's a chance to escape in the chaos...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_22 = {
    Text = "This time, I misjudged. There's no need to waste words on fools..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_23 = {
    Text = "<Gray:It's now!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Yo? Looks like you're getting along well."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Various scenarios replayed in Ramona's mind, but reality pointed to the possibility she deliberately ignored."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_26 = {Text = "%player%!"},
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Goliath drags you by the cloak into the power room."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Ra...mona..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The Link with Tulu has completely drained you, and it will be hard to resist until you get a chance to rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
After landing the first blow, Miryam did not make another move.
The pain-immune Seafarers alone were enough to put Ramona in a tough fight.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_30 = {
    Text = "I've brought this kid back as well. What do you think? Should we get rid of him?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_31 = {
    Text = "This farce must come to an end."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_32 = {
    Text = "No time left to figure out the situation. Power erupts from the shadows, coalescing into a massive and solid snake-like energy form."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_33 = {
    Text = "The giant serpent thrashes wildly in the space, its pupils finally locking onto you—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_34 = {Text = "Stop!"},
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The giant serpent entwines around your waist, effortlessly lifting you high."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Enough, let go of that student."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Who's there!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_38 = {
    Text = "A voice as familiar as ever leaps across the chasm of history, gentle like an offshore breeze yet stirring great waves in the heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Miryam, I said, let go of that student."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
She didn't glance at Ramona again.
With her eyes half-closed, she stood leisurely in the corner of the room, like a holy statue.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_40 = {
    Text = "This farce must indeed come to an end."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Ah... Ah..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_42 = {
    Text = "A hoarse whimper escaped his throat, like overburdened gears, or rather, the collapse of an altar."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Her eyes widened to the extreme, the dark purple irises shedding their color, her demeanor no longer exuding the cold arrogance she displayed when facing you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_44 = {
    Text = [[
My Lord... How could you be here...
Why do you... carry the scent of <Blue:Golem> on you...?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_45 = {
    Text = "The cold, slippery snake scales slide over you, tightening like a predator's constriction."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_46 = {
    Text = "<Blue:My Lord>... my esteemed <Blue:King>..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_47 = {
    Text = "You promised me... You promised me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Miryam, <BigShake:Are you defying my orders!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_49 = {
    Text = "No... I can't... My King... I must not defy..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_5 = {
    Text = "<Gray:To her, the lives of the Keeper and I are just insignificant weeds.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_50 = {
    Text = "<Gray:There's a chance!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_6 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Perhaps I can use this to do something...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_7 = {Text = "Stop."},
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Under Ramona's wary and puzzled gaze, the Seafarers retreated behind their master like the ebbing tide."
  },
  AvgDialog_19129_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
You belong to that university.
So young... You're still an apprentice, right?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Crew member"
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Opera house?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_11 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:%player%> joined Mythag and has been on missions every time he leaves. I've always wanted to show him around Londinium."
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The opera house is a household-name landmark. With a new show debuting, it makes perfect sense to start your tour there."
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_13 = {
    Text = "But you don't expect to be a mere spectator."
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_14 = {
    Text = "...Sometimes I find your perceptiveness terrifying, like a king from a fairy tale who can see into people's hearts."
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_15 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I can indeed appreciate the beauty of art. Since childhood, my father often took me to theaters and art exhibitions, and even hired a teacher to instruct me in art appreciation."
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_17 = {
    Text = "As I grew up, the more I understood the world's hidden happenings, the less I could enjoy art with an appreciative heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I think if we can't find the origin of <Yellow:D-Phenomenon>, all these beautiful things will dissolve into Illusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Friends, family, and lovers vanish one by one. In the end, no matter how many remain, this world will become a desolate wasteland where no one understands the essence of art."
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
21:50
Sonnanir
Deck]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Nothing in this world can truly last forever."
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Go with the flow, seize the opportunity... What's wrong with that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_22 = {Text = "...Heh."},
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Why are you laughing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_24 = {
    Text = "It's not just me who doesn't want to \"follow the trend.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
You once said, everything here "started because of you."
At first, I didn't fully believe your words due to your reticence,]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_26 = {
    Text = "But after Goliath appeared... I now believe that, although your powers all stem from the Deep Sea Realm, the connection between you runs far deeper than that."
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_27 = {
    Text = "That warrior is evasive and changes the subject. You've only just met him, so why do you trust his words so readily?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_28 = {
    Text = "What truly made me trust him was your attitude."
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_29 = {
    Text = "If you truly followed fate without any resistance or desire to make amends... you wouldn't be here, would you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_3 = {Text = "Hmm..."},
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Ramona's words showed no mercy. Words that were not originally meant to attack became sharp knives, ruthlessly shredding someone's cover."
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Tulu squinted, maintaining a tilted headrest position, his gaze sliding past Ramona and drifting toward the sea reflecting an eerie light."
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I cannot and will not force you to confess here. This is not the right time or place to bare our hearts."
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_33 = {
    Text = [[
The top priority is to find the Keeper and then figure out a way to return to land.
Check below the deck; you might find some clues.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_4 = {Text = "Hmm..."},
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Still troubled by the warrior's words?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Ramona let out a deep sigh, revealing a rare expression of distress."
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Things have become more complex. Who would have thought these fish-people... the Seafarers, are really connected to the Church of the Lightbearers."
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_8 = {
    Text = "This mission was supposed to be just a routine <Yellow:Field Investigation>. After verifying the contents of Francis' diary, we can quickly return to Londinium."
  },
  AvgDialog_19130_Content_9 = {
    Text = "If you're lucky, you might catch the debut of a new show at <Blue:Londinium Opera House>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You are lifted upside down into the air by the giant snake, blood rushing to your head, vision darkening."
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_10 = {
    Text = "...%player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Am I in heaven?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Sorry, we're still on the Sonanil. And the crisis is imminent..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_13 = {
    Text = "<Small:Unforgivable...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_14 = {
    Text = "In the name of @3, This One, the 18th Acting Envoy of Lemuria, command you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
Lemuria has sunk, and civilization has come to an end.
Chief Priest Miryam, cease your folly!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Folly...? I've been <Yellow:wandering alone for ten thousand years>, acting for the return of the Divine Realm... is that merely folly?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Not real... Damn counterfeit..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
Master... My Lord... <Red:The True God>... Murphy...
Yes... I still have Murphy...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_2 = {
    Text = "In a daze, you caught a glimpse of two girls... They were surrounded by the Seafarers. Why are they drawing closer?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
Now... there is still room for redemption.
Return to the Order, and you will remain the revered "Divine Mother".]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Your funeral will be the grandest ceremony in the history of the Divine Realm, admired by tens of thousands... Your name will also be inscribed in the annals of history, passed down through the ages."
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Return to me, together we shall... execute this <Blue:blasphemer>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Execution... This vile person, disguised as my lord!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The giant snake dissipated and reformed, as Miryam's power distorted and transformed the space."
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Miryam! I command you to stop!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_26 = {
    Text = "False god, counterfeit, deceiver, blasphemer... No @1@2... Not allowed to use the form of @3@4!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
At a certain moment, the phantom above the power room solidified.
An indescribable, twisted structure rose from the ground.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_28 = {
    Text = "<Change>Irreverent ones... Irreverent ones... Unrestrained and uncontrollable▼▼▼▼▼▼▼▼!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Miryam emitted harsh, incoherent noises and clutched her neck with both hands as her body warped and elongated."
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Ramona! Now!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Be careful! She's losing control!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Ramona took a deep breath, bent one knee slightly, and leapt high with energy gathered at her feet—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The tip of the rapier penetrates the serpent-scale energy, piercing the giant serpent's vital point."
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Hey, hey! Someone is about to fall!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You also fall amidst the roar of the giant serpent."
  },
  AvgDialog_19131_Content_9 = {
    Text = "—and then fell into a trembling, warm embrace."
  },
  AvgDialog_19132_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Damn, these guys just keep coming after us..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19132_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Even without orders, the sheer number of Seafarers formed a wall between Miryam and Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_19132_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Without the Keeper's instructions, the brain must manage both strategic calculations and muscle coordination... How much longer can it endure?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19132_Content_5 = {
    Text = "<Big:Everyone, move out of my way!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19132_Content_6 = {Text = "Murphy!?"},
  AvgDialog_19132_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The seafarers recognized Murphy, \"carrying\" the gods, and instinctively withdrew as she approached. She ran through the encirclement of monsters."
  },
  AvgDialog_19132_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Stop making a racket. You want to get close to that woman, right? Follow me, and I'll clear the way."
  },
  AvgDialog_19133_Content_1 = {Text = "Apostle"},
  AvgDialog_19133_Content_10 = {
    Text = "...Alright, please lead the way."
  },
  AvgDialog_19133_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
22:00
Sonaniel
Power Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19133_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
When the Seafarer boarded the ship, Murphy was not with us.
Celeste, where is she now?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19133_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The girl Awakener closes her eyes, and a few light particles drift out from the compass in her hand, quickly fading away."
  },
  AvgDialog_19133_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Murphy... Crew Quarters."
  },
  AvgDialog_19133_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The dormitory is located at the stern. I'll take you there."
  },
  AvgDialog_19133_Content_7 = {
    Text = "But your body..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19133_Content_8 = {
    Text = "It's just a walk from the bow to the stern. I'm not that fragile."
  },
  AvgDialog_19133_Content_9 = {
    Text = "No matter what happens — there's always a way to solve it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19134_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Did our loud noises attract them here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19134_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Now's not the time to talk about this. Let's get rid of them first."
  },
  AvgDialog_19134_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Go to the aft castle! <Yellow:%player%> and I have already cleared out the Seafarers over there!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_1 = {Text = "Dagger"},
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I've lived on this ship for months. I know every vent and rat hole as well as the back of my hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_11 = {
    Text = "But we weren't even crawling through the vents, just wandering around the cabin."
  },
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I... I just rarely come down here alone. Usually, I stay with the captain and the others."
  },
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_13 = {
    Text = "There is a plan on the wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_14 = {
    Text = "What do you mean? Don't you trust my memory?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I said we can find them, and we will! The captain must be this way!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_16 = {
    Text = "But this is the fifth time we've passed by this staircase."
  },
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
My partner is waiting to meet up with us. She must be anxious now.
Please, Lord Murphy, take a look at the map.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_18 = {Text = "...Hmph!"},
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_2 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_3 = {Text = "Hmm..."},
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_4 = {Text = "Murphy..."},
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Quiet! You're disturbing my thoughts."
  },
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
You remain indifferent about "interrupting Murphy's thoughts."
But you know you must stop her from "thinking" any further.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You've been going back and forth, up and down in the cabin for quite a while."
  },
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Are you lost?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19135_Content_9 = {
    Text = "No! It's impossible for me to get lost!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19136_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Captain, can you bring the ship to shore immediately?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19136_Content_2 = {
    Text = "If we could have done that, the Sonaniel wouldn't have been caught by the Seafarers."
  },
  AvgDialog_19136_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
Come closer, even closer... Just let you go... I can do it...
The shore is within reach.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19136_Content_4 = {
    Text = "As long as we are close enough to land, you can get everyone off the ship, right? Celeste."
  },
  AvgDialog_19136_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Everyone..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19136_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Watch out, they're catching up!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_1 = {Text = "Run Away"},
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Keeper, enough is enough."
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Clumsy, truly clumsy."
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The pretentious performance drew boos from the audience. With scowling faces, they stormed the stage and attacked the lead actor—Murphy landed a sharp elbow strike to your stomach."
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_13 = {
    Text = "*Cough, cough, cough!*"
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Respond to her with boundless energy"
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_15 = {
    Text = "To address your partner's concerns, you flashed a vibrant smile, a twisted grin, revealing exactly eight teeth—making you look just like one of Rogers' creations."
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_16 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Looks like you've been doing well while I was away."
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Neither... nor..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Yes, I haven't seen any seafarer chasing young students who end up rolling on the ground with a sore waist."
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
22:10
Sonaniel
Outside the Power Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Murphy squeezed forward, wedging himself between you and Ramona—while also managing to bump your sprained lower back."
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_21 = {Text = "Hiss—"},
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_22 = {
    Text = "By the way, aren't you going to introduce us to each other?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_23 = {
    Text = "My name is Murphy—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The enemy crashed through the inner hatch, stumbling toward you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Amidst the coal dust stirred by the believers, a slender and tall woman walked with devotion and madness."
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Run!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_3 = {Text = "Keeper!"},
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Finally found you. Are you injured?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_5 = {
    Text = "My partner's expression shifted between shock, delight, and worry. Such vivid expressions were rarely seen on her face."
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Respond to her in a faint voice"
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Therefore, when Ramona looked worried, you clutched your abdomen and pretended to be on the verge of death."
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Ramona... I never expected... to see you again..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19137_Content_9 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19138_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[

Murphy didn't hesitate much; she pulled Ramona to the side and began unfastening her clothes.
As the last button on the front came undone, Ramona saw the "god" within the girl.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19138_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A patch of transparent skin is clearly visible on the chest, pulling at the surrounding skin and muscles, causing the entire chest and abdomen to take on a grayish, decaying white hue."
  },
  AvgDialog_19138_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Such an anomaly exposed the organs in her chest; Ramona saw a young heart of pale crimson and a milky \"egg\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_19138_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Countless fine threads emerge from the \"Egg\", tightly entwining with Murphy's veins, mutually dependent."
  },
  AvgDialog_19138_Content_5 = {
    Text = "If it weren't for its presence already squeezing Murphy's heart, it would seem to blend seamlessly with the transparent chest cavity, not appearing as a foreign object."
  },
  AvgDialog_19138_Content_6 = {
    Text = "It embodies Chaos and silence, with an inverted triangular black Orison, like a bizarre artwork."
  },
  AvgDialog_19138_Content_7 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Dissolution>... This thing has already been dissolved."
  },
  AvgDialog_19138_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Have you seen enough?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19138_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Sorry, my mistake. Please put your clothes back on."
  },
  AvgDialog_19139_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The towering man makes no attempt to suppress his anger, kicking away the Seafarer at his feet, pulling the giant blade from the deck, and speaking harshly."
  },
  AvgDialog_19139_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You are the man who appeared back then!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19139_Content_11 = {
    Text = "\"That man,\" sounds terrible."
  },
  AvgDialog_19139_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I am <Blue:Goliath>. Remember, this is the name of one who has conquered the seas!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19139_Content_13 = {Text = "Engage!"},
  AvgDialog_19139_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
You were tasked with finding the <Blue:Holy Maiden> and retrieving the <Blue:key sacrificial item> for the ritual... Is this really who you found?
Aside from being female, does she bear even the slightest resemblance to the <Blue:Puppet Princess>?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19139_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Your vision is no better than that of a dead fish."
  },
  AvgDialog_19139_Content_4 = {Text = "Gulp..."},
  AvgDialog_19139_Content_5 = {
    Text = "<Big:Everyone, move out of my way!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19139_Content_6 = {
    Text = "A dark-skinned giant stands at the front, and the Seafarers obediently retreat to a distance under his orders."
  },
  AvgDialog_19139_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Hmph, isn't this the poor soul used as a <Blue:stepping stone>? Why are you still on the ship? I did give you a chance to leave."
  },
  AvgDialog_19139_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Heavy footsteps echoed from the other end of the deck. A gruff male voice spoke in an unfamiliar language, and the surrounding enemies retreated like a tide."
  },
  AvgDialog_19139_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Don't leave! Who exactly are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19140_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Student, you look pale."
  },
  AvgDialog_19140_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Thul... Hu..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19140_Content_11 = {
    Text = "In the darkness, a few sources of light stood out sharply, but chasing them proved futile, and your Spirit was completely blocked by the Seafarers."
  },
  AvgDialog_19140_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Student! Wake up!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19140_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Captain...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19140_Content_14 = {
    Text = "A formidable foe is approaching, run!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19140_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
There are too many enemies.
If their assault doesn't let up, I don't know how much longer I can hold on...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19140_Content_3 = {
    Text = "With his strength, dealing with these so-called \"elite soldiers\" comes naturally."
  },
  AvgDialog_19140_Content_4 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Tulu>?! How is he here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19140_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I have an idea! Captain, please hold off the enemies for now."
  },
  AvgDialog_19140_Content_6 = {
    Text = "We can't hold on much longer. Whatever you're planning, do it quickly."
  },
  AvgDialog_19140_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You close your eyes, your mind sinking into darkness, once again chasing the sparkles in the <Yellow:Spirit World>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19140_Content_8 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:...Too much, too much!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19140_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Like stepping into a summer forest pond, the croaking of frogs resounds like war drums... Each Seafarer leaves their own mark."
  },
  AvgDialog_19141_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Enough, they are but insignificant people."
  },
  AvgDialog_19141_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The silent figure standing at the back row of the enemy finally spoke."
  },
  AvgDialog_19141_Content_3 = {
    Text = "That was an adult woman, her body wrapped in black gauze, standing out among the ugly, deformed fish-men."
  },
  AvgDialog_19141_Content_4 = {
    Text = "End this farce... and bring back <Blue:Divine Mother>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19141_Content_5 = {
    Text = "She turned and walked towards the bridge tower. At her command, a tall young man stepped forward from the group of mermen."
  },
  AvgDialog_19141_Content_6 = {
    Text = "A human with fins... No... Could it be an <Yellow:Awakener>?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19142_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Another miracle"
  },
  AvgDialog_19142_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Aigis, Miss Mason, Lily, Lisa... So far, we've met many people whose bodies have been modified."
  },
  AvgDialog_19142_Content_11 = {
    Text = "But transplanting <Blue:\"Gods\"> into living bodies? This is truly..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19142_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Whether you believe it or not, what I'm saying is the truth."
  },
  AvgDialog_19142_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Sorry... It's just that all this is too incredible to believe."
  },
  AvgDialog_19142_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Murphy, may I take a look at that... \"God\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19142_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You still claim you don't believe!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19142_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Fine, there's nothing wrong with that. It's too dark here; let's go up."
  },
  AvgDialog_19142_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
22:20
Sonnanil
Third Cargo Hold]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19142_Content_3 = {Text = "This..."},
  AvgDialog_19142_Content_4 = {
    Text = "This is truly shocking!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19142_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The Seafarer Sect, Church of the Lightbearers, gods..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19142_Content_6 = {
    Text = "And that prisoner... it's <Blue:Francis>, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19142_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Do you know her? That liar, that pest! She never came back to help me! In the end, I had to figure out a way to escape on my own!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19142_Content_8 = {
    Text = "She has her own troubles..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19142_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Hmph... I don't blame her. Not long after this thing was inserted, Miryam drugged me to sleep... I have no idea how much time has passed. She might have come by, but I missed it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_10 = {
    Text = "In the fleeting moment before the blade fell, you focused once more and closed your eyes, sinking into darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You chase the brightest light around you, your spirit squeezed by countless presences in the crowded darkness, your brain torn apart with excruciating pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_12 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Just a little more... the final push!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You desperately \"reach out\" and grasp the star in your hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_14 = {
    Text = "As if my soul had left my body, my vision suddenly rose, pulled away from my body by an irresistible force."
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You see yourself, see Celeste, see Ramona... Finally, you see the young king sitting atop the bridge, his expression cold."
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_16 = {
    Text = "He initially gazed down at the chaos on the ship with a disdainful look, but then seemed to realize something and looked up at the shimmering sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_17 = {
    Text = "In the high skies, <Yellow:your> gaze pierces through Celeste's Domain, meeting his surprised eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_18 = {Text = "Whoosh—!"},
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The thick tentacles parried the fatal blow, but before their master could reach you, the Master of the Great Blade had already seized you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Investigators of Mythag University, is this all you've got?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_20 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Hahahahaha>, interesting, very interesting."
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
Is that kid linked with you now?
Great, I can't wait to see that woman go crazy.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_22 = {
    Text = "<Big:Overstepping! Let him go!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I need to bring someone back to report. If it's not this kid, it has to be the captain."
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Don't mind me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Take the captain and lead them to safety!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_26 = {Text = "You..."},
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Protect them and let them leave!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_28 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
The Awakener's power... 
You are the second leader of the Seafarer Cult.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Second place? Ha, <BigShake:Just a pathetic ant boasting!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_6 = {Text = "Hmm!"},
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Continuous battles have left you utterly exhausted. Attempting to establish a link with the Awakener once again, you feel your vision fading in and out."
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Not bad, you blocked that hit, but can you handle the next slash?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19143_Content_9 = {
    Text = "<Gray:This is the last chance...!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Eye of the storm"
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_10 = {
    Text = "A giant full moon hangs high in the night sky, with a misty haze shrouding the sea. The smell of gunpowder and the salty sea fills the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The gentle and rhythmic sound of waves pushing against each other cradles the boat, drifting towards an unknown destination."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
No doubt, you're on a ship, all alone.
Ramona is not by your side, and there is no one else in sight.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Attempting to connect the communicator"
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Ramona? Can you hear me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Miss Doll? Erica?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You waited a long time for your companion's voice, only to realize that the <Yellow:brooch> symbolizing your identity was not on your lapel."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_17 = {
    Text = "...Now the situation is different."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_18 = {
    Text = "While not as severe as losing the Silver Key, losing the brooch used for communication means being cut off from companions and support."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Calm down, calm down.\nThink back to the beginning—why am I on this ship...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Francis's Diary... Harbor..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Ready to set off? I'll be your partner as always."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_22 = {
    Text = "This time... the Church... affiliates... you must—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You just recalled some scattered images, and then intense pain shattered your memory."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_24 = {Text = "...Ugh!"},
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Acid reflux burns your throat, making fresh air a luxury."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Whew — What just happened?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_27 = {
    Text = "I left school with Ramona... Yes, Ramona, I need to find her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_28 = {
    Text = "If it's her, she should know what happened."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_29 = {Text = "—!"},
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_3 = {Text = "Hmm..."},
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The metal emits a sharp wail; this steel behemoth likely can no longer withstand the sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_31 = {
    Text = "We shouldn't stay here for long."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Eager to find a partner, you endure the dull pain at the back of your head and the nausea, taking two steps while holding onto the ship's railing."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Don't make any reckless moves."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_34 = {Text = "Tulu?!"},
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_35 = {Text = "You..."},
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_36 = {
    Text = "How are you awake?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_37 = {
    Text = "The young Awakener glances at you, his calm yet dignified gaze lingering on you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_38 = {
    Text = "I will pretend I didn't hear your disrespectful words this time."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Why are you here as well?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Is it dawn... yet?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_40 = {
    Text = "The young Awakener raises an eyebrow in surprise, scrutinizing you carefully."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_41 = {
    Text = "You still have the energy to joke around, so it seems you're alright."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
Like Lotan, Ogier, and others, Tulu is one of many Awakeners under <Yellow:Mythag>'s supervision.
But during the year of training at Mythag, you could count the number of times you saw Tulu on one hand.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_43 = {
    Text = "It is said that Tulu is asleep most of the time, waking up only on rare occasions. Naturally, Tulu has been excluded from the list of field Awakeners."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_44 = {
    Text = "At this moment, you are tightly bound by an invisible <Yellow:Link>, feeling Tulu's storm-like spiritual energy."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_45 = {
    Text = "I... have a Link with you?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Foolish question."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Wait, do you know where Ramona is? We left school together."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Now is not the time for jokes; there isn't much time left."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_49 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Invocation Ceremony> has not yet ended; the stars are rising to their destined places."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Dizzy with throbbing temples."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_50 = {
    Text = "\"Descent Rite\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_51 = {
    Text = "The moment the question left your lips, the atmosphere between you and Tulu instantly froze. The air grew so heavy that you began to doubt whether you had the right to ask him anything."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_52 = {
    Text = "However, <Yellow:\"Descent\"> is an exceedingly sensitive and crucial keyword for the Mythag Keepers."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_53 = {Text = "Tulu, I..."},
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Prepare to face the enemy."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_55 = {Text = "What?"},
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_56 = {Text = "Plop..."},
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_57 = {
    Text = "With a sound like flapping diving fins, enemies surged out from the shadows."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_6 = {
    Text = "My throat feels as if I swallowed a mouthful of spicy soy sauce, every breath accompanied by suffocating blockage and pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Eyes open, headache, unfamiliar place."
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Oh my, couldn't we have a more creative opening?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19144_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You stood up, and an unexpected scene suddenly came into view."
  },
  AvgDialog_19145_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The enemy attack left Ramona with little time to react; her sword didn't even have a chance to be drawn—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19145_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The giant blade was violently hurled from a distance at the two, its force tearing through the air and generating a powerful shockwave."
  },
  AvgDialog_19145_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A sturdy appendage coiled around Ramona's waist, yanking her away from the impact point of the giant blade."
  },
  AvgDialog_19145_Content_4 = {
    Text = "After Ramona steadied herself, Tulu's tentacles quickly withdrew to join the attack"
  },
  AvgDialog_19145_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Looks like we have no choice but to cooperate now."
  },
  AvgDialog_19145_Content_6 = {
    Text = "No need for words."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Tragic Embarkation"
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Don't worry. Proceed and rendezvous with the others.
I must confirm why they cling to the ritual.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Tulu's investigating solo—he wants to confirm what keeps the Seafarers going."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Tulu? So you've met since the blast—is he okay after the fight and explosion?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You recall every exchange with Tulu after the blast—he stays remarkably calm."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Tulu is way sharper than me after I wake up from my coma, and I sense no issues through the link."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You tuck Tulu and Ramona's link deep in your spirit realm, instinctively hiding the storm that ravaged your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The shattered dome of Gnosis rebuilds slowly, the soul-ripping pain fading. Right now, you don't want to burden your exhausted partner with more worries."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_17 = {
    Text = "You were in a coma?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Don't worry—I'm perfectly healthy now. Celeste healed me completely."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_19 = {
    Text = "You glance guiltily at Celeste—the mentioned Awakener looks back.\nYou wink at her, and she just watches for a moment, silent."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Time until Alignment:
80 minutes]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_20 = {
    Text = "If you say so..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Murphy's parasite needs surgical removal fast—the longer it develops inside her, the worse it is for everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_22 = {
    Text = "We need to hit land soon, but... I can't feel the ship moving."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Captain, you and Celeste can't manage sailing the Sona-Nyl back anymore, can you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_24 = {
    Text = "...Correct, it's a miracle Celeste can still hold on—for both of us."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_25 = {
    Text = "What about the lifeboats?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Elton shakes his head."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The lifeboats are unpowered—rowing all of us back? Not realistic."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_28 = {
    Text = "No... is there really no way out?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Elton pats Murphy's head reassuringly. Looking up, he finds himself surrounded by the tense stares of you and Ramona. He pauses, then chuckles dryly."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_3 = {
    Text = "These corals... where'd they sprout from?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Don't forget..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_31 = {
    Text = "The Sona-Nyl is a ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I maintain her power system yearly by the book—her engine room's always fired up."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_33 = {
    Text = "If we can reach the bridge..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_34 = {
    Text = "But... our fight with Miryam badly damaged the engine room, not to mention the explosion she triggered after..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Hmm... forgot about that... Without boilers for power, even reaching the bridge won't help."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_36 = {
    Text = "No... there are still some."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_37 = {
    Text = "%player% and I came through the engine room—it's wrecked, but at least two boilers are still burning."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Two boilers? That's enough to move her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_39 = {
    Text = "So can we check the bridge now? Honestly, I've been curious for ages—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_4 = {
    Text = "His gaze sweeps over the oddly shaped corals, finally settling on the largest, most eye-catching one."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Shh, shh, quiet! Enemies incoming!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The coral clusters erupt from D-Marks, roughly shoving aside the deck, pointing straight at the upper bulkhead."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
We call these D-Hyperplasia.
In short, the closer to a regional Dissolution core, the more likely these growths appear.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Dissolution... Again."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The infested individuals among the Seafarers probably also tie back to the spreading Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_19163_Content_9 = {
    Text = "About that..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Unknown Astral Path"
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_10 = {
    Text = "As for the Seafarers' whereabouts... when we arrived at sea, the Sona-Nyl had already sunk completely, and we found nothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Where is Goliath?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_12 = {
    Text = "No idea. Maybe he turned into a real fish, maybe he drowned, or maybe he escaped on a lifeboat. By the way, we're trying to salvage Miryam's Silver, but no luck so far."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Let's not talk about that. I'm here to interpret the inspection report for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Doll places a stack of paper reports on the desk, indicating that you should look through them yourself."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_15 = {
    Text = "After three full days of body examinations, you're physically and mentally exhausted and are desperate for an answer."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Go ahead, tell me the bad news. I can handle it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_17 = {
    Text = "About your health..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You appear very healthy, except for anemia, with no other abnormalities."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Doll pauses, then continues."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Three days later. Mythag University"
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_20 = {
    Text = "As for the cause of anemia... our current guess is that too much blood was drawn during the three days of tests."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Really? But I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Based on reports from Ramona and others, the injuries you sustained on the ship would have killed an ordinary person nine times over. Even a monster with nine lives couldn't withstand this."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I'm starting to suspect that you might have troll blood in you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Your heart is in your throat, and the tension has every muscle in your body tightly wound."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Just kidding, there are no trolls in this world, at least not within the known human realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Your house arrest has been lifted. If you want to chat with the comrades who faced life and death on the Sona-Nyl, they are in the school courtyard bidding farewell to the captain."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_27 = {Text = "Farewell?!"},
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Yes, although Mythag University has no shortage of places to stay, Elton clearly did not want to remain in one place."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_29 = {
    Text = "You hurriedly grab your coat, nod to Doll as you get out of bed. But just as you're about to leave the dorm room, Doll stops you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You're up early today. Why the worried look? You look like William when you make that expression."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_30 = {
    Text = "...I'm glad you returned safely."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Alright, go now. They're waiting for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Keeper, we are here."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Everyone stands in the school courtyard. After three days, everyone's state seems to have recovered quite a bit."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_34 = {
    Text = "—Except Celeste. She remains half-transparent, like a beautiful phantasm that could be blown away by a breeze."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Upon defeating the Divine Fetus and the disassembly of the Sona-Nyl, a familiar white wind enveloped you. Celeste performed a long-distance teleport, bringing everyone back to land."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_36 = {
    Text = "As a consequence, Captain Elton's spirit was severely damaged. Even after receiving treatment at Mythag University, the link with Celeste cannot be restored."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_37 = {
    Text = "That young researcher finally let you out. I was worried that I wouldn't see you before I left, and I was feeling quite troubled."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_38 = {Text = "Captain..."},
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Long story short."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_4 = {
    Text = "I'm still thinking about what happened at sea... those Seafarers, that \"False God\" who vanished into dust over the ocean..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_40 = {
    Text = "The captain walks to you and waves at Celeste, whose body is transparent to the point of being barely visible."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_41 = {
    Text = "She is as perplexed as you are, but quietly drifts to your side—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Give me your hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_43 = {
    Text = "You reach out."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Elton gently lifts her translucent hand and places it on your outstretched palm."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_45 = {
    Text = "No matter what, make her stay."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_46 = {
    Text = "She suffered enough in her lifetime; there's no need for her to live for my wishes anymore."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_47 = {
    Text = "...Is this your wish as well?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Elton is stunned by her words, but after a few seconds, he bursts into hearty laughter."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_49 = {
    Text = "The next \"voyage\" of Celeste is in your hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_5 = {
    Text = "From the epicenter where the \"False God\" dissipated, the nearby Domain world has undergone a drastic transformation. Such a situation has never occured before, not after any of the previous eradications of the \"Cataclysm.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_50 = {
    Text = "...Alright."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_51 = {
    Text = [[
The moment you link with Celeste, a fragile yet powerful consciousness floods your mind.

Though you are standing on land, your chest feels the suffocation as if drowning.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Celeste's form is no longer ethereal; she truly exists in this world."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Elton waves goodbye one last time as you watch him set off on a new journey to find his lost home."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Speaking of which, where's Caecus? He had the closest relationship with the captain; why didn't he come to see him off?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Ramona points at a nearby tree. Hiding in its shade is Caecus, his gaze tightly following the starting car until it completely disappears into Mythag's misty outskirts."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Caecus's mood hasn't been great. His life has changed completely during his time on the ship. Let him have some peace."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Perhaps you would like to meet Murphy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_58 = {
    Text = [[
Mythag University

Outside the Awakener Dormitory]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Murphy, it's me."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_6 = {
    Text = "What changed?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_60 = {Text = "Come in."},
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_61 = {
    Text = "The logistics department prepared the most luxurious dormitory for Murphy. When you open the door, Murphy is sitting on a soft wool mattress, drinking tea, with the tea tray casually placed on the bed."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_62 = {
    Text = "How do you... feel?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_63 = {
    Text = "How I feel? Feel about what? The boring desserts here? That we finally sank the Seafarers? Or that I'm suddenly an Awakener?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_64 = {
    Text = "I... I'm sorry. I did it without your permission..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Are you talking about turning me into an Awakener?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I know this might not be the result you were hoping for... but I just..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_67 = {
    Text = "I just... didn't want to lose you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_68 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_69 = {
    Text = "I feel a sense of relief."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The environment is more dangerous, the mutants are stronger, and our Silver Technology, along with the abilities of Awakeners, are severely limited there... The expedition team has named this situation the <Yellow:\"Regional D-Effect\">."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_70 = {
    Text = "The feeling of a heart that no longer beats is strange and terrifying. But..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_71 = {
    Text = "I truly feel an unprecedented sense of liberation."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Murphy's expression is relaxed, not feigned. Based on your understanding of her, she truly isn't good at lying."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Really? You weren't there when I said goodbye to the captain. I thought..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_74 = {
    Text = "What? You thought I was hiding under the covers, having a cry?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Why would I be sad? Didn't he tell you? He promised he'd visit me and Caecus every Silverfrost Eve."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Honestly, Elton dragged me here for tea and lectured me all morning. He went on and on about how I should be free and not let this Awakener business define me. Hmph, as if I needed him to tell me that."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Anyway, would you like to try some snacks? The brownies from the kitchen are actually pretty good today—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_78 = {
    Text = "But you just said the university desserts are bland..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_79 = {
    Text = "The fork is already at your mouth, and you take a bite of the cake."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Good news: the Regional D-Effect is currently localized; bad news: we can't control its appearance or movement. It's as slippery as a catfish in oil."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_80 = {
    Text = "The chocolate's sour, sweet, and bitter flavors melt together in your mouth, while the nut oils blend them perfectly, making the brownie dance on your taste buds."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_81 = {
    Text = "You and Murphy sit by the bed, chatting casually and finishing off a five-person afternoon tea dessert."
  },
  AvgDialog_19170_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Anyway, that sea area has been designated as a Regional D-Effect forbidden zone by the Committee. I think it will disappear from the already scarce resource map of the Kingdom of Leonia forever."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
...Hmph.
<Small:At least you still remember Ramona...>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The warmth of a living presence cuts through the darkness, but a searing pain erupts from your forehead, radiating to your limbs."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Someone flicks your forehead with a sharp snap."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_13 = {Text = "Ouch!"},
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You can still feel pain? Guess you're not doing too bad then."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I... I just remembered everything."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Ramona, Tulu, Captain Elton, Celeste, the Seafarers, and you with that... thing inside you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Lumping me in with that monster is bad enough, but you couldn't even think of me before the Seafarers?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I—I didn't mean it like that..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Murphy huffs, hauling you up from the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Reality Reboot"
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I knew something was off after that explosion. Acting all weird like that—turns out you really did bang your head..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_21 = {
    Text = "There's just one thing I'm still fuzzy on..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_22 = {
    Text = "When Miryam triggered that explosion in the engine room, who got us out of there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Gotta be Celeste, right? No one else on this ship could pull off that kind of white light."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The sea's embrace turned sharp, the water reacting with your scorched skin in a choking struggle. Blind chaos, like a specter in the night, tore and broke your body."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Then, that chaos bore a flicker of warmth. In the boundless dark, loneliness, helplessness, and despair receded swiftly, a mysterious glow shining in the frigid cosmos."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_26 = {
    Text = "As if touched by the universe's mercy, your consciousness teetered on the edge of the spiritual realm. Your body melded with the sea's oxygen, and you snapped your eyes open, feeling the water rush in."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Finally, a gentle light sliced through the ocean's darkness. A pale blue force reached for you—a goddess of safe passage extending her hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_28 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Indeed, the force that pulled me from the water was unmistakably Celeste's.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_29 = {
    Text = "You close your eyes, recalling the moment the flames seared your vision, when a warm light tore and stitched your will back together."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Wake up, %player%, come on, snap out of it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_30 = {
    Text = "<Gray:But that earlier force... it wasn't Celeste. It was too alien, yet also familiar...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Hey, you zoning out again? I didn't hit you that hard, did I? I totally went easy on you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Murphy mutters, tiptoeing to brush your bangs aside. Her flick was measured—just enough to snap you awake without lingering pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_33 = {
    Text = "I'm just worried about the others... From the fact that it's just you and me here, the explosion must've been too chaotic for Celeste to control everyone's landing."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_34 = {
    Text = "We need to find Ramona, then join up with the captain and the others."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_35 = {
    Text = "You sure you're okay? If you're feeling off, you better speak up."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Yeah, I'll let you know."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Don't—don't scare me like this... Get up already!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The girl's sobs hammer against your eardrums, wrenching your consciousness from the torrential flood of memories."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
Memories flicker like slides jammed into a battered projector.
Each shift of the frame sends a scream shrieking from the depths of your soul.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Urgh... Ramo... na..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19196_Content_9 = {Text = "You..."},
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Scrapping just pulls more in. Play it smart, avoid fights."
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Okay, that makes us square."
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I held back. Or you'd be thirty feet back."
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Ha! Like you could. Stop fooling around—I saw you hanging from Miryam's hold!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The thick air clears, her worry and gloom pushed aside by rivalry."
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Sure, Miss Murphy—Lady Murphy."
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Hey! You're teasing me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Murphy swings a fist high, but drops it softly, grazing your shirt."
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Mercy, milady—ow!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Hold up, something's there."
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Your ears pick up a weird, low hiss, mixed with a particularly rhythmic beat."
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Murphy? You hear me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_20 = {
    Text = "That's Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You can tell <Italic:that>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You signal Murphy with your eyes. She nods tight-lipped, and you both dash toward the noise."
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
Time until Alignment:
90 minutes]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The girl stays hunkered by the coral, zoned out, your call missing her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You squat beside her, eyeing the coral, and her fixed, almost blank stare."
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Playful payback or just for fun—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You warm your hands and flick her forehead—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_7 = {Text = "Ow!"},
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_8 = {Text = "Hey!"},
  AvgDialog_19200_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Murphy grabs her forehead, set to boss you around, but then realizes it's her fault and chokes back the rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_19967_Content_1 = {
    Text = "To be honest, I'm not interested in bullying children."
  },
  AvgDialog_19967_Content_2 = {
    Text = "To be fair, I have some <Yellow:precious collectibles> with me. You can choose one from them."
  },
  AvgDialog_19967_Content_3 = {
    Text = "They will produce some <Red:unexpected effects>. Want to give it a try?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19967_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Sorry, ever since I was a child, my elders have warned me not to accept things from strangers."
  },
  AvgDialog_19967_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Is that so? What a pity... Your life has lost a lot of fun from now on."
  },
  AvgDialog_19967_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Refusing me may result in severe punishment~"
  },
  AvgDialog_19968_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Black slime orbs, glinting with eerie green light, dart through the car, searching for a target."
  },
  AvgDialog_19968_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Glass windows shatter into chilling fragments with a nerve-wracking crash."
  },
  AvgDialog_19969_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
The driver slams the brakes, the train shuddering to a halt.
Panicked passengers leap off, scattering in all directions.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19969_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Emergency—protect the civilians!\nDoll, Doll, can you hear me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19969_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Detecting... communication interference... Silver Key fluctuations... possible... zzzt... resonance..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19969_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
What's that saying? Distant water can't quench a nearby fire.
Looks like it's my time to shine.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19969_Content_2 = {
    Text = "W-What's that thing?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19969_Content_3 = {
    Text = "On the tracks ahead, in the tunnel's darkness, a figure stands illuminated by the lights—an impossible silhouette."
  },
  AvgDialog_19969_Content_4 = {
    Text = "A tall woman, her gaze sharp as knives, calmly faces the oncoming train."
  },
  AvgDialog_19969_Content_5 = {Text = "Found you."},
  AvgDialog_19969_Content_6 = {
    Text = "In a fleeting instant, the woman vanishes—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19969_Content_8 = {
    Text = "No, she does not vanish; she's charging toward the speeding train!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
The maddened monster howls in anguished fury.
The vengeful crimson flames spark their last, then die unwillingly.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_10 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
The black monster writhes, screeching, finally collapsing exhausted in a ruined corner.
She strains to keep her eyes open, their vacant gaze glimpsing a faint, whitening chaos.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
The horizon reveals a feeble dawn.
But it no longer concerns her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_13 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Why... did you... abandon... me...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Whose child is this... Can't find your master either?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_15 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Help... help...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You're badly hurt."
  },
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
I'm sorry, I can't be your master.
I already have Lily.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_18 = {Text = "But..."},
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_19 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:If it's just a linker you need, there's plenty here, aren't there?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ramona raises her rapier, preparing a final farewell to the creature once called Helot."
  },
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_4 = {Text = "Lotan?!"},
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Lotan's blade blocks the descending rapier."
  },
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
Let her rot on her own.
An Awakener without a link won't last twenty-four hours in this world.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_7 = {
    Text = "In her state, she won't make it to dawn."
  },
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
She can't harm anyone now.
Let her meet death quietly.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19970_Content_9 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19971_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Is that voice saying something?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19971_Content_2 = {
    Text = "I think I heard something like... \"abandon\"..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19971_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A monster like that near the sanatorium..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19971_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Francis is hiding more secrets than we thought."
  },
  AvgDialog_19971_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Whatever the case, we'll have to cross this bridge to find out."
  },
  AvgDialog_19972_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You traverse the dimension, the sound of dripping water bypassing your ears, resonating directly in your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_19972_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A chaotic churn swells in your chest, straining to burst free."
  },
  AvgDialog_19972_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Unconsciously, you hold your breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_1 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You're not with the Sculptors' Association. Why are you working for them?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Oh? How do you know I'm not?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Those \"artists\" with their carving knives aren't as bold as you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Who are you, and why do you want her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
<Blue:Helot>. If you're asking my role, I'm something like her sister.
More precisely, our powers are <Yellow:kindred>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_15 = {
    Text = "She needs to return to her <Yellow:master>'s side, so I'm here to take her."
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Ramona nods, then gently pats Lily's head."
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Lily, do you want to go with her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Lily looks up fearfully, her eyes darting between Helot and Ramona, then settling on you, pleading for help."
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Encourage her"
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A razor-sharp spike slices through the air, aimed at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_20 = {
    Text = "It's okay, say what you really feel."
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
Lily's grip tightens.
Then, slowly but firmly, she shakes her head.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_22 = {
    Text = "See that? She doesn't want to go back to some \"master.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Helot raises a hand, a fierce gust swirling around her, poised to unleash a storm."
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_24 = {
    Text = "She doesn't get a say in this."
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Then bring it on!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Before you can call to Ramona, the crisp clash of blades rings out."
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
Lotan stands boldly before you, fearlessly meeting the foe.
A strand of hair drifts from her brow.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Hmph, not bad."
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You're not my target. Step aside."
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_8 = {
    Text = "No can do. It's been ages since I stretched my limbs—how about you spar with me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19973_Content_9 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19974_Content_1 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19974_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The eerie veiled figure vanishes at the edge of your vision. You chase after it, but come up empty."
  },
  AvgDialog_19974_Content_3 = {
    Text = "These people are..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19974_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Doll's tracking their origins, but we've got no solid leads yet."
  },
  AvgDialog_19974_Content_5 = {
    Text = "These guys are somewhat interesting. Guess playing house with kids isn't so bad once in a while."
  },
  AvgDialog_19974_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Home is... past the <Blue:Fowlers Steel Bridge>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19974_Content_7 = {Text = "Let's go."},
  AvgDialog_19975_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Those creatures are strays lost in the dimensional passage, or byproducts of Dissolution Erosion."
  },
  AvgDialog_19975_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Reckless dimensional travel is like diving ten thousand meters underwater without gear or climbing Elworth's icy peaks in just a shirt."
  },
  AvgDialog_19975_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Most can't withstand the strain of dimensional travel."
  },
  AvgDialog_19975_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Far from setting traps, Lady Daffodil chose a passage with bearable pressure—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19975_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Is she... inviting us?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19975_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
The exit's ahead. We'll meet Lady Daffodil again soon.
Then we can get answers.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19976_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
It's here.
The Hellhound you've awaited opens its crimson-gold pupils behind you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19976_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Its gaze pierces from an unreachable height,
sharp and menacing, slicing through space like a blade.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19976_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You can't fight—you can only flee."
  },
  AvgDialog_19977_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The snowy town lies silent, fluffy snow reflecting cold moonlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_19977_Content_10 = {Text = "Now!"},
  AvgDialog_19977_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The shadowy black creature, startled, bolts but is snared by the trap, unable to move."
  },
  AvgDialog_19977_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The monster lowers its head, growling softly as if warning you to stay back."
  },
  AvgDialog_19977_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Can you make it out?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19977_Content_14 = {
    Text = "No, it's like... it has no face."
  },
  AvgDialog_19977_Content_15 = {
    Text = "At the center of the monster's lowered head, you faintly discern a human-like outline, but where features should be, a black void swallows all light."
  },
  AvgDialog_19977_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Pin it down, Lotan! I'll take the left, you take the right!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19977_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Piece of cake!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19977_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The three of you huddle behind a broken fence, cloaked in the deep night, glancing back occasionally."
  },
  AvgDialog_19977_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Hey, is this ambush really gonna work? With just a few chickens?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19977_Content_4 = {
    Text = "We wait and see. Try to hold back and don't charge out."
  },
  AvgDialog_19977_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Hmph, waste of my time."
  },
  AvgDialog_19977_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Shh, something's coming."
  },
  AvgDialog_19977_Content_7 = {
    Text = "A canine paw emerges from the shadows, accompanied by heavy breathing."
  },
  AvgDialog_19977_Content_8 = {
    Text = "One step, two steps."
  },
  AvgDialog_19977_Content_9 = {
    Text = "It lunges, swift as thunder."
  },
  AvgDialog_19978_Content_1 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19978_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The earliest Hellhound reports surfaced <Blue:ten days> ago. Mastering these tangled paths in ten days isn't easy."
  },
  AvgDialog_19978_Content_11 = {Text = "What now?"},
  AvgDialog_19978_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Ramona turns. Following her gaze, you spot scattered drops of black-red liquid along the trail."
  },
  AvgDialog_19978_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Blood loss usually saps strength—it'll have to come out to feed again. We just need to be ready."
  },
  AvgDialog_19978_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Lotan flicks her sword with a sneer."
  },
  AvgDialog_19978_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
Even better. If it's alive, it can be caught, killed...
Meeting me, it might be happier dead than alive.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19978_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Let's go. We need to be ready before dark."
  },
  AvgDialog_19978_Content_2 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19978_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You chase the black creature through several intersections, only to lose its trail after it darts into a narrow alley."
  },
  AvgDialog_19978_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Damn it, where'd it go? That thing's as slippery as a sewer rat!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19978_Content_5 = {
    Text = "This should be a dead end. It shouldn't have escaped, unless—"
  },
  AvgDialog_19978_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Someone helped it? Or... invisibility?! Lotan, stay sharp!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19978_Content_7 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19978_Content_8 = {
    Text = "...Both are dramatic twists, but the reason's likely simpler. This alley probably has <Blue:hidden passages or forks> not on standard maps."
  },
  AvgDialog_19978_Content_9 = {
    Text = "This town predates the Flood, thriving in livestock and ceramics. Its sewers and alleyways form a complex network no map can fully capture."
  },
  AvgDialog_19979_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You dare not look up, cannot turn back."
  },
  AvgDialog_19979_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Even glancing at the shadow it might cast on the ground sends shivers through you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19979_Content_3 = {
    Text = "In this dim dimension, you lack the strength to resist."
  },
  AvgDialog_19980_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Pathetic. Just losing a Silver Link reduces you to this."
  },
  AvgDialog_19980_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The pustule-ridden monster ignores Lotan's taunts, roaring and charging at its foes."
  },
  AvgDialog_19980_Content_12 = {
    Text = "<Change>Give her... to... me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19980_Content_13 = {
    Text = "If she can seize that girl... and become a pair of Twin Divi with her..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19980_Content_14 = {
    Text = "She won't be abandoned, won't lament her origins, won't be a pawn at others' beck and call."
  },
  AvgDialog_19980_Content_17 = {
    Text = "<Change>Hand her... over... to me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19980_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Lost the ability to even speak?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19980_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
Then let your blade carry your words, your rage.
Show me your fury!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19980_Content_2 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:ROAR—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19980_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Not long into your advance through the dark, a viscous monster slithers from beneath the bridge, its massive form dragging countless slime orbs, crashing before you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19980_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The creature raises its vaguely humanoid upper half, scanning you, its gaze lingering on Lily, growing frenzied."
  },
  AvgDialog_19980_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Give her... to me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19980_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Lotan steps forward, meeting the monster's eyes with haughty defiance."
  },
  AvgDialog_19980_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Chains shatter, limbs swell and distort, but the grimy face beneath tangled, matted hair still betrays its owner's identity."
  },
  AvgDialog_19980_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You're... Helot..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19981_Content_1 = {
    Text = "A whirlwind-like figure closes in, the air thick with the omen of imminent battle."
  },
  AvgDialog_19981_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Lotan grips her sword hilt, ready to fight."
  },
  AvgDialog_19981_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Lily, do you know her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19981_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Lily clings tightly to your hem, stepping back, shaking her head, then nodding."
  },
  AvgDialog_19981_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Lily knows... she's here for Lily."
  },
  AvgDialog_19982_Content_1 = {
    Text = "I've got a bad feeling... We might lose it this time."
  },
  AvgDialog_19982_Content_2 = {
    Text = "When it comes to hide-and-seek, Lotan's no match for that elusive Hellhound."
  },
  AvgDialog_19983_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Lotan! Hold up! Chasing like this won't work."
  },
  AvgDialog_19983_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Got a better plan?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19983_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Let's split up and corner it in the alley ahead!"
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_1 = {Text = "Got it!"},
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The grotesque beast now docilely lowers its head, as if awaiting the white girl's touch."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Atop the giant canine's neck sits, unmistakably, a crowned human head, rendering the scene profoundly eerie."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_12 = {Text = "Lily..."},
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The white girl slowly approaches the grotesque beast, extending a slender arm to stroke its head as if petting an ordinary animal."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Atop the giant canine's neck sits, unmistakably, a crowned human head, rendering the scene profoundly eerie."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_15 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona exchange glances, a thousand words in your hearts, yet unsure how to begin."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Hey, you're not just gonna stare, are you? The Hellhound's right here."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The mastermind's right beside us. What's that saying? \"No effort, all reward\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The girl, as if deaf to Lotan, whispers into Koum's ear, her soft voice carried by the evening breeze."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ramona leaps forward. The cornered monster roars fiercely, struggling in a last stand."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
Koum, be good. Obey your master's orders.
Only those who obey are good kids.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Her words fall gently. Lily turns and walks toward you."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Lady Daffodil said if Koum is found, Lily must return to <Blue:Mother>'s side."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Let's go back to the shop. Lady Daffodil might have something to say."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_24 = {
    Text = [[
The journey is silent.
Daffodil, holding a pipe, lounges casually on a high wooden chair, as if awaiting your arrival.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
I told you, a large dog can't hide among people.
Lily, you haven't forgotten our <Yellow:punishment>, have you?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Yes, Lily remembers."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Enough riddles. Spill it—what's the deal with this Hellhound?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
Patience, my dear guests.
I'll explain in due time.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Or would you rather take Koum back, close the case, and call it a day?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Italic:No, no! Koum, come back!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Koum isn't the real Hellhound."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Daffodil flashes an approving smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Fascinating. What's your theory?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Three incidents have struck Rye: <Yellow:livestock attacks>, <Yellow:Lisa's disappearance>, and <Yellow:Hellhound rumors>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_34 = {
    Text = "The torn livestock seemed ravaged by a beast... but the marks on them are <Yellow:human bites>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Now that we've captured Koum, a quick comparison of the bite marks should confirm—\n<Yellow:it's the culprit behind the livestock attacks>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
But <Yellow:the Hellhound has nothing to do with it>.
Koum lacks that oppressive aura... that malice from beyond Dimensions.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_37 = {
    Text = "A villager's shotgun left unhealing wounds on it, and Lotan took it down single-handedly. It's not strong enough to be the shadow looming over this town."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_38 = {
    Text = "So I suspect <Yellow:there are two Hellhounds in this town>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_39 = {
    Text = "An intriguing guess. Anything else?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_4 = {
    Text = "That voice... sounds familiar."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_40 = {
    Text = "The human bite marks on the birds, combined with the Sculptors' Association's activity here... I suspect Koum is a product of their modifications."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_41 = {
    Text = "The remaining question is: who's the victim in this tragedy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_42 = {
    Text = "While chasing Koum, we noticed it's intelligent and intimately familiar with Rye's labyrinthine paths... suggesting it lived here as a human for some time."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Lisa's home is in the town center. For a beast or thief, targeting homes near the woods would be more natural—yet it had a reason to feed here."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_44 = {
    Text = "I took a chance. I bet the \"Hellhound\" chose Lisa's home because it held special meaning to it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_45 = {
    Text = "So we set bait at Lisa's doorstep, and my hunch was confirmed."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Combined with Lily's claim that \"Lisa won't come back,\" I suspect Lisa can no longer face her mother—perhaps because she's been <Red:transformed> beyond recognition."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Putting it all together, the true identity of this \"Hellhound\" becomes clear—\n<Yellow:Koum is Lisa>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_48 = {
    Text = "To test this, I placed bait at Lisa's doorstep and successfully \"captured\" it."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
Koum, crouched nearby, lets out a low whimper.
Lily strokes Koum's... Lisa's head, as if comforting her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_5 = {
    Text = "A small, trembling figure steps out from the darkened lamplight."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Lisa was such a good girl. Even starving, she only wanted to \"eat\" at home."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_51 = {
    Text = "You're sharp, lass. No wonder Professor Dexter sings your praises."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Thank you, but the professor also told me about your \"illustrious deeds,\" Lady Daffodil."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Just ordinary business dealings, hardly worth mentioning."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Your deductions are spot-on. Koum is indeed \"Lisa,\" and the ones behind her inhumane transformation are, as you know, old acquaintances of yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_55 = {
    Text = "I'd rather not have acquaintances like that."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Even without your hint, these stitches point straight to the Sculptors' Association."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_57 = {
    Text = "...The Sculptors' Association."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Those lunatics calling themselves <Yellow:Pygmalion>, buzzing around like annoying flies. Irritating pests."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_59 = {
    Text = [[
Aptly put. Now for the main point.
With your intelligence network, you've surely noticed the Sculptors' Association's recent frenzy.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Koum, don't hurt them."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Their frenzy stems from their leader, Herbert, recently acquiring <Red:classified documents>."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_61 = {
    Text = "I won't divulge the contents, but I can confirm they've ignited his wildest fantasies."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_62 = {
    Text = "He's now pushing his experiments forward at all costs."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_63 = {
    Text = "What is his goal?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_64 = {
    Text = [[
That's as much as I'll share.
After all, you're not my <Yellow:only client>, are you?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Daffodil taps her pipe, a sly smile playing on her lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Very well, two more questions, if I may."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_67 = {
    Text = "About the other \"Hellhound\"... what do you know?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Or perhaps you haven't been in town long enough to know its secrets?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Oh, you caught that, did you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The large canine called \"Koum\" sits on the ground, obediently licking its paw."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_70 = {
    Text = "I can't lay out the full story of that Hellhound, but I'm not entirely clueless."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_71 = {
    Text = "However, in this exchange shop, answers don't come free."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_72 = {
    Text = "What do you want?"
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Hmm, let me think..."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Daffodil's gaze sweeps over you, Ramona, and Lotan, then lingers on Lily."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_75 = {
    Text = "She then gives an enigmatic smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Since you treated me to such a splendid show, I'll offer a tempting discount."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Come now, your \"answer\" and its \"price\"... have arrived."
  },
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_8 = {Text = "Koum..."},
  AvgDialog_19984_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Only now do you notice that the pitch-black face isn't featureless. Closed eyes, flat nostrils, and barely visible lips, all starkly black, create the illusion of a void."
  },
  AvgDialog_20082_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Phew... What's going on... The climbing difficulty has increased significantly compared to before. It's never been this... this tough!"
  },
  AvgDialog_20082_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The snow mountain begins to awaken, and the terrain is constantly changing. Hold my hand—"
  },
  AvgDialog_20082_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You grasp Helot's hand and struggle to climb out of the rock crevice, only to see Lily opening her arms to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_20082_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Lily, it hurts... Give me a hug, it'll get better soon."
  },
  AvgDialog_20082_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You picked her up as instructed. Lily was well-behaved all the way, but now her state seems a bit off..."
  },
  AvgDialog_20082_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Lily, just hold on a little longer, it will be over soon..."
  },
  AvgDialog_20082_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The black rocks on the ground still have some patches of snow. You stomp your foot and find that the ground has turned somewhat sticky."
  },
  AvgDialog_20082_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Soften the mountain, trying to slow us down... It won't succeed!"
  },
  AvgDialog_20233_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Have you noticed? His weakness is the \"Dead\" behind him."
  },
  AvgDialog_20233_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Let me give you a \"little gift\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_20475_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Finally... I've met you."
  },
  AvgDialog_20475_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The snow mountain has started to devour you... You must defeat the monsters and destroy the core as soon as possible!"
  },
  AvgDialog_20475_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Helot nods, pulls out the black spike, and charges at the monster—"
  },
  AvgDialog_20475_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You fought hard and finally reached the mountaintop guarded by the azure-blue monster."
  },
  AvgDialog_20475_Content_3 = {
    Text = "At the silent snow mountain peak, a flickering blue fire burns fiercely, like the beating heart of the snow mountain."
  },
  AvgDialog_20475_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You can't stop us."
  },
  AvgDialog_20475_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Her voice echoed across the desolate snow mountain. The blue monster floating in the air stared at her, and the massive floating beast gave no response at all."
  },
  AvgDialog_20475_Content_6 = {
    Text = "My legs... can't move..."
  },
  AvgDialog_20475_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You look towards Lily. The pitch-black rocks have melted into liquid, and Lily's legs are already half swallowed by the black sludge."
  },
  AvgDialog_20475_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You pull with all your might, but Lily's legs remain trapped in the flowing black sludge, sinking deeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_20475_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Helot's heel is caught by the sludge, the mountains under the dark red light shimmering with an ominous glow, as if pulling them both into Hell."
  },
  AvgDialog_20483_Content_1 = {
    Text = "As the envoy of @2, This One demands you to stop!"
  },
  AvgDialog_20483_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Her mind devoured by anger, the creature once known as Miryam paused only briefly before resuming its mad attack."
  },
  AvgDialog_20483_Content_3 = {
    Text = "She has already deemed me an imposter... In that case, I can only respond in the Lemurian way."
  },
  AvgDialog_20483_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Miryam... 
May this strike from ancient times... bring you enlightenment.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_20503_Content_1 = {
    Text = "She can no longer be allowed to be consumed by anger. If she loses complete control, she will become an utter monster."
  },
  AvgDialog_20503_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
At that point, everything will be irreversible.
Subdue her, or... kill her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_20503_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
My most loyal subject...
May you... never lose your way again.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_1 = {Text = "Sisyphus"},
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_10 = {
    Text = "It's... someone important to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
The ancient black vortex swallowed {Male=him,Female=her}.
I could only watch as the storm of the Black pool swept across Mythag.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_12 = {
    Text = "All the Silver carefully stored by the Awake Department was dissolved in the Black Pool."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Most existing Awakeners are out of control, screaming, fainting, wailing, dazed, and laughing maniacally..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Czort and William organized the final evacuation and completely sealed the mist barrier."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I was sealed alone in the Black Pool."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_16 = {
    Text = "After what seemed like an eternity, I finally found a method in the knowledge Tawil had imparted to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_17 = {
    Text = "A passage—it can take me back and undo the tragedy that has occurred.\nBut neither I nor Tawil can foresee the consequences of such an action."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Taking such action purely for oneself is truly reckless."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I begin to wait."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Passage Activation Count: 0"
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
Until that day.
Mr. Alistair sat in a wheelchair, pushed back to the Black Pool by the worn-out Doll.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_21 = {
    Text = "See, she's here after all."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Even if it's the end of the world, I won't make a bet with you, Alistair—especially now that it really is the end."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_23 = {Text = "...?"},
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Ah, you don't know yet. The outside world has ended, Mythag..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Let me put it this way: we are all that remains."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Has everything vanished?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Clean and neat."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_28 = {
    Text = "If not for the loss of the last place that could serve as a lab, this planet would be a perfect testing ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_29 = {
    Text = "...Then, there's nothing to be concerned about."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_3 = {
    Text = "On the day of the Black Pool anomaly, Tawil rushed to me and gently embraced my soul."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_31 = {
    Text = "I close my eyes, feeling the power coursing through me. Over the long wait, I've become intimately familiar with it. Now, it brings a vitality that I had long forgotten."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I will find a way to change all of this."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_33 = {
    Text = [[
A tearing pain engulfs me, reminding me of that afternoon.
Did %player% feel this much pain back then? Or was it even worse...?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Tragedy must not happen again."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Passage Activation Count: 1"
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_36 = {
    Text = "When Tawil rushed at me, I pulled the Keeper back half a step."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
Why?
You founded Mythag to change the future, right?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Why are you still doing this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Tawil said nothing, just raised her hand, summoning the same storm as before."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Then, the black tide began to surge."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Passage Activation Count: 2"
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_41 = {
    Text = "When Doll asked us to flee with the Keeper, we did not insist."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_42 = {
    Text = "We went through the back door outside the graveyard, through the thin mist barrier, and through the dark and mysterious woods."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_43 = {
    Text = "The scene suddenly opened up—a bustling street in Londinium, with ordinary people living their happy daily lives."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_44 = {
    Text = "However, this happiness didn't last long."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_45 = {
    Text = "A black, viscous shadow caught up with us from behind."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_46 = {
    Text = "This time, a hundredfold or even a thousandfold more things have vanished before my eyes than before."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Passersby walking happily on the street suddenly find themselves unable to move — immersed in black mud, their feet lose their \"existence\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_48 = {
    Text = "They tried to move but fell into the invisible muck, and finally..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_49 = {
    Text = "They lost their very existence."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_5 = {
    Text = "%player%, grab hold of me, %player%!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Passage Open Count: 3"
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_51 = {
    Text = "I concealed the existence of the clock tower and the Black Pool, persuaded the Keeper to leave the campus alone, and set out to face Tawil on my own."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Without the Keeper's command and the help of companions, I couldn't even reach the Black Pool. On the way, I was defeated by other uncontrolled Awakeners."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Passage Activation Count: 4"
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Passage Activation Count: 5"
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_55 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Passage activation count: @3"
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_57 = {
    Text = "How many times has it been?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Do I have to watch the world and see %player% die again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_59 = {
    Text = "If no matter what I do, {Male=he,Female=she} as a Keeper is bound to die, then let {Male=him,Female=her} not become a Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I stretched out my hand as far as I could."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_60 = {
    Text = [[
I concealed {Male=his,Female=her} ability, leaving {Male=him,Female=her} in Yakutsk.
As long as {Male=he,Female=she} lives, I don't mind moving forward alone.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_61 = {
    Text = "This time, I didn't even manage to leave the graveyard."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_62 = {
    Text = "You sat by the Black Pool, with Ramona dressing your wounds and narrating her pain in a calm tone."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_63 = {
    Text = "I've tried escaping the campus, and I've also tried facing Tawil head-on."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_64 = {
    Text = "I tried bringing along Lotan, Ogier, Doll, and others I met on campus, and also tried not taking any of them."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Tried gentle negotiation and resorted to violence."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_66 = {
    Text = "But, it all seems futile."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Later, I began to refine my battle techniques."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_68 = {
    Text = "The only remaining possibility is to pierce her core during the anomaly in the Black Pool, when Tawil reveals her true form."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Must be fast, very fast."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Just like in Yakutsk, if I could hold onto {Male=him,Female=her}, {Male=he,Female=she} could save us from despair during the storm."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_70 = {
    Text = "So fast that it left Lotan at a loss, rendered Doll speechless, and caught Tawil off guard."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Everyone I meet has become a target for honing my swordsmanship. On this path, I no longer have anything called \"companions\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_72 = {
    Text = "I no longer converse with the Keeper; I focus solely on honing the \"Sword of Fate\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Did you succeed?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_74 = {
    Text = "I succeeded... yet failed."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_75 = {
    Text = "That day, Tawil reached out to me with both arms."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_76 = {
    Text = "With my finely honed intuition, I thrust a full-force strike at the flash concealed in Tawil's chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_78 = {
    Text = "The sound of clashing hard metal echoes, vibrating the wrist gripping the rapier."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Tawil's form dissipated into silver ashes."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Not to mention—"
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_80 = {
    Text = "It's over, finally..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_81 = {
    Text = "It's over...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_82 = {
    Text = "%player%, we succeeded —"
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_83 = {
    Text = "<Big:%player%!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_84 = {
    Text = "There is no Keeper behind me."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_85 = {
    Text = "A hand is sinking into a black vortex."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_86 = {
    Text = "That day, I leapt into the Black Pool."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Then, I briefly caught a glimpse of a future that didn't belong to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_88 = {
    Text = "\"Tawil\" remains standing, but no longer with the same composure."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Before anyone else could react, it suddenly spread its silver wings and lunged at Ramona — at another me."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_9 = {
    Text = "{Male=He,Female=She} is my friend."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Time seems to have frozen."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_92 = {
    Text = "The Keeper dashed forward, blocking the other me."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_93 = {
    Text = "I understand now."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_94 = {
    Text = "The future of the world is not mine to choose or change."
  },
  AvgDialog_21363_Content_96 = {
    Text = "One step, a chasm of fate."
  },
  AvgDialog_21364_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Let's get on."
  },
  AvgDialog_21364_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Wait, Ramona! Doll and Ogier aren't here. You can't do it alone..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21364_Content_3 = {
    Text = "It's too late. Tawil has already roared and spread her six silver wings."
  },
  AvgDialog_21364_Content_4 = {
    Text = "A familiar warm and sour sensation burns your eyes. This time, it's even more intense and piercing, and the tears stream uncontrollably."
  },
  AvgDialog_21364_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ramona turns her head and whispers softly to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_21364_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Link with me and give me one final command."
  },
  AvgDialog_21364_Content_7 = {Text = "Keeper."},
  AvgDialog_21365_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A swift sword strike instantly ended the battle. Ramona flicked the slime off her sword, never once looking back at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_21365_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You stare in shock at her seemingly cold back, feeling a wave of unfamiliarity."
  },
  AvgDialog_21365_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Is this... really a memory?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21365_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ramona stepped over the still-fading mutant corpse and ran towards the square, sword in hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_21366_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You hurriedly caught up with Ramona and pried open the elevator door at the last second before it closed, risking getting your hands caught."
  },
  AvgDialog_21366_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Will the Artificial Domain sever the Link?
What exactly is it that you're seeing?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21366_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
You don't know.
You don't even know when you'll be able to leave.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21366_Content_12 = {Text = "Ding—"},
  AvgDialog_21366_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Ramona stepped out of the elevator and threw an answer over her shoulder:"
  },
  AvgDialog_21366_Content_14 = {
    Text = "It hasn't been for a long time."
  },
  AvgDialog_21366_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Huff... Huff..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21366_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Only now, after entering the \"Artificial Domain\", did you finally see her face for the first time."
  },
  AvgDialog_21366_Content_4 = {
    Text = "La, Ramona?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21366_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ramona stands before you, a black blindfold covering her eyes. She looks displeased, seemingly annoyed that you delayed her descent."
  },
  AvgDialog_21366_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You... are not the Ramona I know, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21366_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
The elevator rumbles.
Ramona faces you, remaining silent.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21366_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You cautiously sense the link between you, but find nothing"
  },
  AvgDialog_21366_Content_9 = {Text = "No link..."},
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Not goodbye"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The scene of the Black Pool faded like a photograph losing its color, and the outline of the Awakening Device faintly revealed where \"Tawil\"had originally been."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Although I know it's impossible, but..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Hope we can meet again."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The artificial domain gradually dissipates. You sit before the awakening device, gazing at Ramona on the recliner."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Then she was surprised to find that she was still wearing the eyepatch that belonged to the other \"Ramona\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_15 = {
    Text = "...Ramona...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
...That's something I didn't expect either.
I'm glad to see you again so soon, %player%.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Are you really \"Ramona\"?! What's going on—"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I'll answer this question."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
A familiar voice suddenly startled you.
You turned around and found Doll standing behind you, even casually taking a sip of tea.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You look at the \"Ramona\" in front of you, at a loss for words."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Before you arrived, Ramona and I conducted a simple test on the artificial Domain device to see how far her spirit could extend and the strength of the Domain formed."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_21 = {
    Text = "During testing, <Blue:Gnosis Meter> suddenly indicated abnormal fluctuations. The Domain fully expanded in just 3 seconds, forming an independent field that encompassed Ramona, the door, and some instruments."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Fortunately, despite the high <Yellow:Gnostic Index>, the Domain remained stable and was not affected by mental fluctuations."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Unfortunately, the moment you stepped in, you entered the Domain. I couldn't enter for some reason, nor could I see inside"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_24 = {
    Text = "This situation has never occurred in previous experiments, and since you are inside, I can't afford to act rashly."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Fortunately, I pre-set the duration of the Artificial Domain, so all I have to do is wait here for a while."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Is this why you're drinking tea?! Wait, that rich aroma—cupcakes! \nYou're starting afternoon tea right away."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
Recording data doesn't take much time, and as I mentioned earlier, I can't see what's inside the Domain.
Otherwise, my morning would be much busier.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Have you figured out the problem?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Doll glanced at \"Ramona\", visibly restraining her curiosity, and continued to explain to you:"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_3 = {
    Text = "She has experienced and shouldered too much. Her expression remains cold, but her hands are gentle as she bandages you."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_30 = {
    Text = "According to the current analysis, the reason the Artificial Domain read the memories of this \"Ramona\" instead of following the original plan to read our Ramona's memories is due to only one possibility."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Namely: <Yellow:\"A certain spiritual resonance\" exists between \"same origin Awakeners\">, which, amplified by the awakening device, breaks through dimensional boundaries, causing two highly similar spirits to <Yellow:\"briefly overlap\">, resulting in the erroneous construction of the domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The reason this \"Ramona\" was able to come to our world may also be due to <Yellow:Spirit Resonance>."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Same origin... Does that mean they share a common source of power?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You could say that the combat power of the Awakener is essentially \"borrowed\" from high-dimensional beings we refer to as <Blue:\"Genesis\">"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Awakeners with the same <Yellow:\"Genesis\"> are called <Yellow:\"Same Origin Awakeners\">."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_36 = {
    Text = "But aren't you the same person?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Perhaps, to some extent, that's true. But, we have different experiences and memories."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_38 = {
    Text = "And, compared to our Ramona, this \"Ramona\" uses power differently. Her spirit is also closer to their \"genesis\"—you have come into contact with <Yellow:Tawil>, haven't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Yes. With her help, I opened a passage to the past."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_4 = {Text = "I..."},
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_40 = {
    Text = "No wonder, compared to our Ramona, your ability is more..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_41 = {
    Text = "I'm really curious about you, and all the other Awakeners closer to Genesis."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Seeing Doll about to ask someone to assist with her experiment, you quickly changed the subject."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_43 = {
    Text = "A more Genesis-like Awakener, could it be called <Yellow:\"Genesis Awakener\">?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Genesis Awakener? That's a nice name. You've shown rare cleverness this time, %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Do you have any more questions?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Do you... want to stay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_47 = {
    Text = "After the device is turned off, the effect of mental amplification gradually fades, and their resonance also weakens."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_48 = {
    Text = "As for keeping the instrument on all the time—sorry, it has a range limit.\nSo, unfortunately, no matter what you think, she ultimately has to return to her own world."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
It's impossible for them to coexist right now. How can one Body host two Spirits?  
But in the future, who knows? Maybe <Small:... No, if we use... need to collect data...>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_5 = {
    Text = "It's alright. You don't need to say anything."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_50 = {
    Text = [[

Doll's voice lowered as she gradually fell into her own thoughts.
"Ramona"smiled at you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_51 = {
    Text = [[
When you need me, use the link between us to call me.
By borrowing her body, I can act briefly in this world]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_52 = {
    Text = "The passage has been opened. As long as I am still conscious, I will definitely come to your side."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Was Ramona conscious when you were there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_54 = {
    Text = [[
During my awakening, the Ramona you are familiar with will be completely asleep.
In other words, she will not be aware of my existence.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Please convey the message regarding me to her on my behalf."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Do all Same Origin Awakeners experience similar situations?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_57 = {
    Text = "For example, using Erica's parts to assemble another automaton—"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_58 = {
    Text = [[
What are you thinking? Didn't you hear me say "highly similar spirits" just now?
Apart from your counterpart in another world, no other spirit meets that standard.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_59 = {
    Text = "But who knows? Maybe by leveraging the artificial domain, we'll slowly find everyone's \"genesis awakener\", and if that happens..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Just stay a little while longer before you head back."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_60 = {
    Text = "You look on helplessly as the girl in front of you gets lost in deep thought. At this moment, \"Ramona\" gently touches your hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_61 = {
    Text = [[
I should head back.
I shouldn't overstay my welcome.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_62 = {
    Text = "You hesitate for a moment but still can't find the words to ask them to stay."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Is there anything you want to tell Ramona?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_64 = {
    Text = "She remained silent for a long time, took a deep breath, and then spoke with feigned calmness."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Please tell her... she is very fortunate."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_66 = {
    Text = "I... feel a bit envious."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Leaving this sentence, \"Ramona\" sat back in the recliner, slowly closed her eyes, and her breathing gradually became calm."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_68 = {
    Text = "You know, the one who awakens in the future will be that familiar, wise, and detached assistant."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_69 = {
    Text = "That cold, masked girl still gazed at the boundless, pure black night sky from the black pool in another dimension."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Go back? You know—"
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Awaiting a call from a distant dimension."
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
I know.
You don't belong to me, nor to my world.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21367_Content_9 = {
    Text = "But knowing that there is still one world untouched by destruction, and that you are still safe, I... am content."
  },
  AvgDialog_21368_Content_1 = {Text = "All in"},
  AvgDialog_21368_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Before you could issue a command to Ramona, she moved."
  },
  AvgDialog_21368_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The stench of blood hits your nose. Students scream and scatter before the writhing black monster — it's just like the day you were awarded the Silver Key."
  },
  AvgDialog_21368_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The day Ramona was injured."
  },
  AvgDialog_21368_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Is this... the Key Granting Ceremony?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21368_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Rain seeps into your clothes, bringing a chill. You shiver, momentarily feeling as if everything that happened was just an illusion, and you never left this disaster."
  },
  AvgDialog_21368_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Looks like Doll activated the Artificial Domain early. I wonder about Ramona..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21368_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Vision suddenly halted; amidst the chaos, a familiar figure stands with their back to you, facing the wind."
  },
  AvgDialog_21368_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Holding the rapier steadily, you point it towards the now unrecognizable \"Emily,\" who once introduced herself to you at the cemetery gate."
  },
  AvgDialog_21368_Content_9 = {Text = "Ramona!"},
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_1 = {
    Text = "\"Tawil\" remains standing, but no longer with the same composure."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Before you appears the face of a woman with an indifferent expression."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_12 = {
    Text = "She reached out and lightly tapped the Silver Key on your chest"
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The Silver Key flashes a faint response."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You are the variable, the answer to both the beginning and the end."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Hopefully, you are the turning point..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_17 = {
    Text = "White six-winged monsters, mud monsters scattering in an assault, shadowy twisted Awakener forms..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_18 = {
    Text = "They all turned into a pool of black water and then vanished without a trace."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_19 = {
    Text = "You held the Silver Key to your chest and exhaled slowly."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Before you can react, it suddenly spreads its silver wings and lunges at Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_20 = {Text = "...Why."},
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_21 = {Text = "?"},
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Why are you blocking my way?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Don't you know it's dangerous?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Aren't you afraid of death?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_25 = {Text = "I—"},
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I don't want you to die."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Ramona's blindfolded eyes are gazing into the unknown, the dark fabric slightly damp, as if soaked with tears."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_28 = {
    Text = "I've seen it too many times. I don't want to..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_29 = {
    Text = "She took a deep breath and swallowed the rest of her words."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Time seems to have frozen."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The girl who had been cold and emotionless just moments ago now seems to have regained her emotions. She trembles, cautiously approaches, and gently rests her head on your chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Tears fall on the mistakenly injured shoulder, the sharp pain entwining through the nerve endings along the blood vessels. Your body trembles uncontrollably, but in the end, the warmth of the tears completely softens it."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Ramona, I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_33 = {
    Text = "She gripped your hand tightly, as if you were the last kite. All she could do was pray that you wouldn't disappear in the winds of time."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Stop taking risks... %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You sprint at your maximum speed and block Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_6 = {
    Text = "A silver rapier thrusts from behind, piercing your left shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_7 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The white monster stares directly at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_21369_Content_9 = {
    Text = "It silently gazes at you with its faceless, pale body."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_1 = {Text = "Sunset"},
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_10 = {
    Text = "At that time, I didn't feel any pain at all. Truly, not a single bit."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Later, things changed. Mom locked me up and conducted more and more experiments."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
But it's not Mom's fault.
Because Mom is locked up with me in this room that we can't leave.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Because of me, I lost control and many people died.
Because of me... it hurts too much.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Lisa said that since she's my only friend, she'll try to stay with me a little longer."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Otherwise, she wouldn't have lasted this long."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_16 = {
    Text = "...Actually, I can't hold on any longer either."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The giant beast tore through more space, its claws slashing directly at Lily."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_19 = {
    Text = "In front of the faltering pure white maiden, black slime coalesced into spheres and webs, repeatedly neutralizing her attacks."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Lily's tender steps move forward barefoot, with black pus gathering and taking shape at her feet."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_20 = {
    Text = "However, even so —"
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_21 = {
    Text = "That's my one and only mother, too."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Never — harm my mother!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The black goo burst, forming spikes that pinned down the hellhound's claws."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The remaining sticky ball opens its razor-sharp teeth and bites through the bound ankle."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The claws dissipated into a demonic purple mist, then reformed once again."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_28 = {
    Text = "It completely shattered space, with time slowly escaping from the fissure. The rays of the setting sun were entirely devoured."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Lisa said that her mom didn't recognize her and wounded her with a hunting rifle."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_30 = {
    Text = "It opens its otherworldly maw and lunges at Lily!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Lisa said that her mom is very strict. Every time she plays with me, her mom hits and scolds her."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Lisa said that if her mom finds out she turned into a big dog because she went out with me, her mom definitely won't forgive her."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_6 = {
    Text = "But she couldn't help it; she was too hungry. Not wanting to steal from others, she went home to find food... and that's when her mother found out..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Lily paused for a moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_8 = {
    Text = "But my mom is different."
  },
  AvgDialog_21391_Content_9 = {
    Text = "She mistook me for someone else, but when she first cut me with the scalpel, she apologized."
  },
  AvgDialog_21392_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
The driver urgently pulled the handbrake, causing the train to jolt and slow down.
Confused passengers hastily got off the metro, scattering in all directions.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21392_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
Emergency! Protect the civilians!
Doll, Doll, can you hear me?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21392_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Detected... communication interference... Silver fluctuation... suspected... zzrr... Resonance..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21392_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
There's a saying: "Distant water can't extinguish a nearby fire."
It seems it's time for me to take action.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21392_Content_2 = {
    Text = "What... what is that?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21392_Content_3 = {
    Text = "On the tracks ahead in the dark tunnel, illuminated by the light, stands a figure that cannot possibly exist."
  },
  AvgDialog_21392_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The tall woman stood poised, her gaze as sharp as a blade, calmly confronting the onrushing train."
  },
  AvgDialog_21392_Content_5 = {Text = "Found you."},
  AvgDialog_21392_Content_6 = {
    Text = "In just a fleeting moment, the woman's figure disappeared—"
  },
  AvgDialog_21392_Content_8 = {
    Text = "No, she hasn't vanished! She's assaulting the speeding train!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21761_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Performing 10 quick fade-to-black tests"
  },
  AvgDialog_21761_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
[Old Film] Test, 2
End]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21761_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Next, we will conduct the eye-closed test"
  },
  AvgDialog_21761_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Closing your eyes isn't a looping effect; remember to end with 2."
  },
  AvgDialog_21761_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Proceed with a flash of red light,1"
  },
  AvgDialog_21761_Content_17 = {
    Text = "A flash of red light is not a looping effect. Remember to end it with 2."
  },
  AvgDialog_21761_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Conducting [Mist] test, 1"
  },
  AvgDialog_21761_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
[Mist] Test, 2
End]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21761_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Conducting [Light Rain] test, 1"
  },
  AvgDialog_21761_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
[Light Rain] Test, 2
End]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21761_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Conducting [Old Film] Test, 1"
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Friend compendium"
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Why are you walking so unsteadily? Did you hurt your leg?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You looked back at the path you had taken: to avoid the D-slime spreading across the ground, your footprints formed a strange arc in the mud."
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Or... should Aurita carry you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_13 = {
    Text = "No, no need. I just thought this path would be more fun. Don't you think so, Aurita?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Like playing hopscotch!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Yes, like playing hopscotch."
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_16 = {
    Text = "...Aurita, let's play shadow tag?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I'll walk ahead, and you follow my footprints... How does that sound?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Hmm... It's not impossible! You go first, and Aurita will show you the way."
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Aurita obediently stepped back a couple of paces to make way for you, nearly stepping into the D-slime while hopping."
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Hmm~ Hmm hmm hmm~"
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You tugged her sharply, but she blinked, still smiling blissfully as the game began."
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Choo-choo—The train departs! Central Plaza—To the left!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Aurita hummed a cheerful tune, walking beside you on the streets being dissolved."
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The dark, unlit windows show that this place has long been deserted. On both sides of the silent street, only the outlines of ruined houses remain."
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_5 = {
    Text = "What about the residents? Did they leave their homes before the D-Phenomenon outbreak? Did they find new places to live, or..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Viscous black liquid silently flows at your feet. You take a deep breath, suppressing the nausea that almost leaps out of your throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Or... have they never left their beloved home?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_8 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_21801_Content_9 = {
    Text = "A hum of deep thought pulls you from your worries. Aurita looked you over and finally asked, puzzled."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Aquatic palace"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Really! Thank you, Granny!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Grannny Betty quickly consoled Aurita and watched the girl hop into the nearby ruins before turning to you with a smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Why did you deliberately send Aurita away? What is it that you want to tell me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Don't be so guarded, I just want to... tell a story."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Once, this was a fishing port. Some ambitious youths went to the city, while others stayed home to fish... It was as peaceful as any other fishing village."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The changes occurred quietly, leaving only women and children behind."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Fishing boats set sail, but only broken keels drift back to the shore with the current."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Black water flows over the dam, eroding the streets into ruins."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_18 = {
    Text = "When Aurita realized, her playmates, family, and even all the residents of the town had vanished without a trace..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Wait, what about you, Granny?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The old woman, calling herself Betty, smiles as she sizes you up, subtly assessing your worthiness as a friend of Aurita."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_20 = {
    Text = "She shakes her head, gesturing for you to look at her lower body."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
D-slime flowed out from under her linen skirt.
Her lower body was almost entirely immersed in dissolution and illusion.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_22 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_23 = {
    Text = "How is your body feeling now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The old woman chuckled and patted your shoulder, just like a true elder would."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid, young one. Don't be afraid."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_26 = {
    Text = "\"Granny Betty\" has long since disappeared; it is the child's obsession that has kept me here."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
As they spoke, a gust of wind blew in a flyer from somewhere.
Most of the patterns on the paper were blackened by D-slime, but the slogans were still faintly visible.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_28 = {
    Text = "\"Betty's Bakery, homemade bread from the grandmother of the hometown\""
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Oh dear... it seems \"Betty\" may not even be my real name."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_3 = {
    Text = "After a long while, she withdrew her gaze and patted Aurita's back."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_30 = {
    Text = "...Why are you telling me these things?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Granny Betty glanced at the collapsed old building not far away, where Aurita was \"treasure hunting,\" stirring up a cloud of dust."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I told Aurita many lies to avoid making her sad."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_33 = {
    Text = "For instance..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_34 = {
    Text = "\"Home in the Sea\""
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_35 = {
    Text = [[
Did she really tell you that? It seems like she truly believes this story...
But other than weaving lies, what else can her real mother-in-law do?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
Can we tell her that her parents will never return?
In this town with no future, such words are too cruel.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_37 = {
    Text = "So, I have a request... Please, please keep this a secret from her."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Don't tell her what's happening in reality... At least, let her leave with a happy heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_39 = {
    Text = "This is my wish, and... hers as well."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Aurita, could you go play by yourself for a while?
Grandma will chat with this new friend and come find you soon.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Granny Betty's tone was sincere, even pleading."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_41 = {Text = "Leave?"},
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_42 = {
    Text = "There's absolutely nothing at all!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Did Grandma really hide the clay figurine over there? Aurita has turned the place upside down!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_44 = {
    Text = [[
Aurita's gloomy voice caught your attention; she stood on the ruins with her back to you.
This time, you finally noticed a fleeting black stain on her back.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_45 = {
    Text = "A gaping hole dominates its small body—clearly a large D-Mark."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_46 = {
    Text = [[
You were startled and turned to look at the spot where "Granny Betty"once stood.
All that remained was a pool of viscous liquid, merging with the dark, stagnant water.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_47 = {
    Text = "In the sewage, the ceramics reflect a soft and warm light."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Pick up the figurine"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Unexpectedly, after \"Granny Betty\" disappeared, what remained was not a clay figurine shaped like an old woman."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Can't chat with Aurita?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_50 = {
    Text = "A round and plump canopy with fine, dense tentacles, decorated with clover-shaped blue glaze on a porcelain-white base."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Wow—it's Aurita's favorite jellyfish!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_52 = {
    Text = "You really cheated! You tricked Aurita into looking over there, but it's clearly in your hands!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Don't, don't be mad... Look, what are these?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_54 = {
    Text = "You manage a strained smile, pulling out \"Poni\" and \"Snow White\" from your pocket, and hand them to Aurita along with the \"Jellyfish\" figurine."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_55 = {
    Text = "All for Aurita?! Thank you, my friend!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_56 = {
    Text = "The Water Tank ~Aurita's Aquarium~"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Palace~Friends and the Palace in the Water~"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Aurita hummed a song, lost in the joy of her new toy. Werther, Poni, Snow White, and Granny Betty seemed to leave no mark on her heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Huff... Huff... Is everyone okay with standing like this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Sweetie, conversations among adults might bore you. Isn't our little Aurita the one who hates boredom the most?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Move \"Poni\" a bit farther outside; having a horse indoors feels a little strange."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Very reasonable! By the way, did you name it \"Poni\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_62 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Aurita's Palace is all set!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Aurita's future home, her underwater home..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Aurita wants to sleep in the room next to her parents and occasionally sleeps with them!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_66 = {
    Text = "The puppy wants to sleep on Aurita's bed, the pony in the living room—or in the garden."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Jellyfish can drift anywhere, and Aurita's friends all drink hot cocoa by the fireplace..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Hmm... underwater... can we light the fireplace?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Aurita's eyes blinked, revealing a hint of drowsiness. She let out a long yawn, her gaze becoming hazy."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Sniff...sob... But I want to stay with Grandma..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Is Aurita feeling tired?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Aurita... can still... play..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Sleep well, Aurita."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_73 = {
    Text = "The fireplace will burn warmly."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_74 = {
    Text = "The served cocoa will have a lot of sugar added to it."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_75 = {
    Text = "When you wake up, all your friends will be there."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Whew... friend..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Don't... leave Aurita alone..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Good child, would you like to play a game with Grandma?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21803_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Aurita wants to decorate her friends' homes, right? Granny hid several clay figures nearby... If Aurita finds them, they're all hers."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_1 = {Text = "Silent day"},
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Oh... No! The water inside is not drinkable! You've already had so much of it."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I nearly drowned; it wasn't just from drinking water."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Facing the girl's puffed-up, innocent expression, you feel a sharp pain in your lungs. After taking several deep breaths, reason finally fills your mind again."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_13 = {
    Text = "With will and memory resonating, you finally realized that, once again, you had entered the Awakener's memory—"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Drowning... drowning..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Aurita is an excellent swimmer! Become friends with Aurita, and you'll never drown again!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Aurita bustled around the bed, making a fuss as she struggled to light the room's stove."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_17 = {
    Text = "As the girl coughed from the ash, the room gradually warmed up. Damp clothes emitted wisps of steam, and her frozen limbs began to thaw."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Aurita... you're Aurita, so this is your home..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Hmm! This is Aurita's home, and you're a guest Aurita invited from the sea!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_2 = {
    Text = "*Cough... cough!*"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Fragments of bodily memories surface, and you gradually come to understand the role you play in this dream—"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_21 = {
    Text = "In the storm, a crew member fell overboard and was kindly carried ashore by the waves. Eventually, the girl in front of him dragged him home..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Such an ordinary identity."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You've gradually grown accustomed to the surreal experience of \"entering dreams.\" Generally, as long as you've witnessed the memories that form this dream, you'll wake up at the right moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The current problem is that you cannot confirm Aurita's \"memory\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Aurita's \"memory\" is a mystery. The Dissolution has devoured her past before she was awoken, making it difficult to find enough details from her childlike words to piece together the full picture."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Now might be the perfect time to fill in the gaps in Aurita's records."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_27 = {
    Text = "What's the matter? Why haven't you said anything for so long?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_28 = {
    Text = "If you don't want to play with Aurita, I can send you away..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Are you leaving so soon?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Under the heavy blow, liquid was forced out of the airway, and the salty seawater unexpectedly surged up the throat, performing a lively cancan dance on the tongue."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Seeing... the guest off?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You mean you're going to play with Aurita!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
Great, great, great!
New guests, new friends, join Aurita's <Yellow:new partners in the aquarium>!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_33 = {Text = "Aquarium?"},
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Aquarium? Could it be that you're referring to that glass tank?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_35 = {
    Text = "That's Aurita preparing for their new home!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The girl waved excitedly, and you finally took a close look at the glass tank filled with water by the window—"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
It features exquisite castle scenery, but the ripples stirred by the cycle of life are nowhere to be found.
It appears to be nothing more than a sunken fairy tale.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_38 = {
    Text = "New partner?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Yes! Aurita's new friends! When Aurita returns to the sea to reunite with her family, all her friends can come visit."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Wow! You've had so much water!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Lying on soft bedding, Aurita's words still send chills down your spine for no apparent reason."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_41 = {
    Text = "It is only then that you realize — it's too quiet."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
The sound of insects chirping, the wind blowing, and leaves colliding with each other...
The sound of chatting, laughing, and shoe soles rubbing against the road...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_43 = {
    Text = "The world is dead silent; only Aurita, the master of dreams, is alive."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Aurita... Does she live here alone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Alone? Nope. Werther, Snow White, Poni... all of Aurita's friends are in town! Plus Granny... Aurita's <Yellow:Granny>, also lives here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Oh right! Granny! Granny said that if Aurita makes a new friend, she must introduce them too!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Mentioning \"Grandma\", Aurita's eyes light up. She jumps back to the bedside, trying to pull you up, but suddenly freezes as if remembering something."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Do you want more water?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_49 = {
    Text = "It's drowning..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The scent of seawater and blood fills your overly-soaked nostrils. With a violent cough, even coarse sand is expelled from deep within."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_50 = {
    Text = "I'd like to meet Aurita's family too. Can Aurita take me to see her grandmother?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Hmm! Grandma should be at the central square!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Aurita skipped downstairs, and you, no longer hesitating, patted your cheeks to fully wake yourself up."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_53 = {
    Text = "It's starting to rain outside—"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Aurita's voice comes from outside; her crisp and lively tone is less distinct through the wooden door."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_55 = {
    Text = "You take a deep breath, push the door open, and leave the small building where Aurita lives."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_56 = {
    Text = "The house tilted as it was devoured by the ground, with fine black mist flowing from both distant mountains and nearby floating streams."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Before your eyes lies a town engulfed by Dissolution—"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Aurita enjoys a light drizzle; it's cool and refreshing!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Hmm... but let's find you an umbrella anyway."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Is this... me...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_60 = {
    Text = [[
All is silent, shrouded in darkness.
In the chaos, only Aurita's figure remained vivid.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Slowly opening your eyes, you see an unfamiliar ceiling."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Old, tidy, but devoid of character. Only a water-filled glass tank makes it feel less like an ordinary hotel room."
  },
  AvgDialog_21805_Content_9 = {
    Text = "What are you looking at? The homes of Aurita's friends?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21813_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
...@2...Tower...
@4]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21813_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Huh...? What was his name again...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21813_Content_11 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_21813_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Aurita, don't forget, we're going to the central square to find your grandma."
  },
  AvgDialog_21813_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Right! Let's go this way—"
  },
  AvgDialog_21813_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Aurita quickly left the \"runaway\" buddy behind and pushed you toward the destination."
  },
  AvgDialog_21813_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You step around the pool of D-Slime that was once \"Werther,\" feeling a mix of emotions."
  },
  AvgDialog_21813_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Living in a town consumed by Dissolution, yet unable to see or feel its presence."
  },
  AvgDialog_21813_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Her world is dying, yet she remains... completely oblivious."
  },
  AvgDialog_21813_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The mutated body fell stiffly, like over-tanned leather, merging with the D-Slime on the ground and eventually disappearing from sight."
  },
  AvgDialog_21813_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Huh...? What about Werther?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21813_Content_4 = {
    Text = "How did he disappear so quickly! Aurita clearly wasn't playing hide and seek..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21813_Content_5 = {
    Text = "On the ground where \"Werther\" once sat, a small ceramic newsboy lies."
  },
  AvgDialog_21813_Content_6 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_21813_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Aurita, Werther has left you a gift."
  },
  AvgDialog_21813_Content_8 = {
    Text = "No way—Wow! It's the ornament promised to Aurita!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21813_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Aurita wants to put it in her friends' homes! Thank you, thank you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21814_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ah! It's Werther!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21814_Content_10 = {
    Text = "When Aurita returns, we'll definitely take everyone to visit."
  },
  AvgDialog_21814_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Before you could ponder the subtle chill in Aurita's words, Aurita's \"friend\"suddenly moved."
  },
  AvgDialog_21814_Content_12 = {
    Text = "...@2...Tower"
  },
  AvgDialog_21814_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
The boy staggered to his feet, black liquid oozing from him.
D-slime glued him to the ground, and the sound of tearing flesh was horrifying as he stood up.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21814_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Sure! Werther, don't worry. I'll definitely reserve the most luxurious room for you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21814_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Beneath that pale skin, the muscles pulse strangely, as if something is about to break through—"
  },
  AvgDialog_21814_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Aurita, be careful!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21814_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The girl gives your back a strong pat, and at her gesture, you look towards the boy sitting at the street corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_21814_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
Aurita excitedly ran to him, revealing a dark stain on her back.
But before you could get a clear look, she zipped past like the wind.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_21814_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Witt, take a look at our new friend!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21814_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The boy curled up in the corner, head down, and showed no response to Aurita's approach."
  },
  AvgDialog_21814_Content_6 = {
    Text = "{Male=He,Female=She} is taller than everyone, when we return to the ocean palace, let's have {Male=him,Female=her} lead the way! Surely very imposing!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21814_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Ocean Palace?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21814_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Granny said that Aurita is a child of the sea, and that one day we must return to the water."
  },
  AvgDialog_21814_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Like Aurita's parents, they have gone ahead to prepare their new home underwater! Once everything is ready, Aurita will reunite with them along with her grandma."
  },
  AvgDialog_21815_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Aurita pushes you through the decaying town; as time passes, the already overcast sky grows even darker."
  },
  AvgDialog_21815_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Yes! Transform into a seahorse!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21815_Content_11 = {
    Text = "While speaking, the neighing and heavy breathing of horses could be heard nearby. The heavy hoofbeats made it hard to tell if \"Poni\" was another Dissolute."
  },
  AvgDialog_21815_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Poni? Poni—"
  },
  AvgDialog_21815_Content_13 = {Text = "Hiss—"},
  AvgDialog_21815_Content_14 = {
    Text = "This time, you were prepared and quickly grabbed Aurita's collar, stopping her from rushing towards the skeletal giant."
  },
  AvgDialog_21815_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Aurita, how far are we from the square?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21815_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The girl climbs onto your back, looks around cautiously, and finally points to a corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_21815_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Over there! After passing the stable, go 50 meters north!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21815_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Did they used to raise horses here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21815_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I have now! Poni is also my friend, and I wanna to take it back to its home in the sea!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21815_Content_7 = {
    Text = "At that moment, Poni will turn into..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21815_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Transform into..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21815_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Turn into a seahorse?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21816_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Snow White! It's Snow White!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21816_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Aurita slipped away again, rushing towards something lying in the D-slime—"
  },
  AvgDialog_21816_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A black puppy."
  },
  AvgDialog_21816_Content_4 = {
    Text = "S-Snow White?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21817_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Small toys were left the first two times, so this time should be no exception..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21817_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You casually picked up a pitchfork from the stable and stirred the D-Slime that was once \"Poni\". Sure enough, a particularly exquisite ceramic pony gleamed in the light."
  },
  AvgDialog_21817_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Pick up \"Poni\""
  },
  AvgDialog_21817_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You hesitate for a moment, but eventually take off your coat and pick up the ceramic pony through the fabric."
  },
  AvgDialog_21817_Content_5 = {
    Text = "What are you doing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_21817_Content_6 = {
    Text = "When you had almost grown accustomed to Aurita's voice filling the desolate world, a hoary voice suddenly rang out, making you straighten up with a start."
  },
  AvgDialog_21817_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Granny—Aurita has brought a new friend to meet you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_21817_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The aged face lit up with a gentle smile. She affectionately patted Aurita's head before turning to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_21817_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Hello, young one. I'm Granny Betty from Aurita. Just call me Granny, like this child."
  },
  AvgDialog_21818_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Snow White lets out a low whimper, its limbs gradually dissolving into D-Slime, no longer retaining its canine form."
  },
  AvgDialog_21818_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Where \"Snow White\" vanished, a palm-sized white ceramic puppy lay quietly."
  },
  AvgDialog_21818_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Pick up \"Snow White\""
  },
  AvgDialog_21818_Content_4 = {
    Text = "So you really are white..."
  },
  AvgDialog_21875_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Looks like the trap's got it."
  },
  AvgDialog_21875_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Use these tools to secure it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_1 = {Text = "Ah! —"},
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_10 = {
    Text = "There... there is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_100 = {
    Text = "I don't get it... What's the point of something that no one can comprehend?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_101 = {
    Text = "Hmm... I think poetry isn't just words or images; it's like a key."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_102 = {Text = "A... key?"},
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_103 = {
    Text = "Yes! A person's heart is like a box filled with many emotions. This box is locked, and these emotions are usually kept inside, hard to take out."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_104 = {
    Text = "Poetry is the key to unlocking this chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_105 = {
    Text = "Actually, poetry doesn't need to be understood, or even read."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_106 = {
    Text = "Everyone, whether they read poetry or not, sooner or later, will find this key at some moment in their life."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_107 = {
    Text = "You'll surely become the best keysmith!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_108 = {
    Text = "Liar... You just said you didn't get it."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_109 = {
    Text = "I don't understand what you're saying, but I trust you, Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You stand at the edge of the garden plaza. Visible D-Rifts spread upward from beneath the small building, encompassing the open space in the center of the garden."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_110 = {
    Text = "This poem, \"The Abode of Roses,\" is your first piece. From today onward, I will help you treasure all your poems."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_111 = {
    Text = "I'll use pins to keep them together, and when I have money, I'll print a beautiful poetry collection!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_112 = {
    Text = "She extended her hand, which she had kept behind her back. The hands were covered in wounds from thorns, dark and rough, completely unrecognizable as those of a young girl."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_113 = {
    Text = "This... this is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_114 = {
    Text = "The new nobles say that Cité is a city of flowers and poetry. A good poem can earn you a bouquet of roses..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_115 = {
    Text = "My roses bloomed today. Not many, and all were used to pay the rent and land lease."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_116 = {
    Text = "But while they weren't paying attention, I secretly kept a flower..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_117 = {
    Text = "That scarred hand presented a slightly damaged yet still vividly red rose to Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_118 = {
    Text = "A fine poem, Horla... In the future, I'll trade my flowers for your poems!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_12 = {
    Text = "That is... our garden... no... Colette, no..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Horla lowered her head. Colette walked up to her, lifted her chin, and directed her gaze toward the center of the garden."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You know, Horla... Many years ago, I watched that great fire start right here."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I've transformed this place into a plaza and erected my statue here... See, I understand symbolism too."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Watch closely. See it clearly. That is where we live... That is our garden. Soon, everything there will disappear."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_17 = {
    Text = "My life truly began the day you died. Today, it will once again move towards brilliance..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The black rift spreads rapidly. Soon, the entire luxurious villa is engulfed."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Garden, ashes, doodles, poetry, memories, laughter, oaths... Everything has sunk into the endless darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Your surprise attack successfully defeated the monster summoned by Colette. The world within the poem trembled, revealing a portion of Cité's true form."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Tick-tock—"
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Huh? What's wrong with my eyes...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Was that... heartache just now? Why..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_23 = {
    Text = "A tear slid down Horla's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Tears fall to the ground, like drops into a still lake. Silent ripples spread, brushing past every pale heart in this illusory world."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_25 = {
    Text = "!! No... this feeling..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Colette noticed the change in her emotions. She looked at Horla beside her in surprise."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_27 = {
    Text = "<LightGray:Is this... Horla's ability to spread emotions?!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_28 = {
    Text = "<LightGray:Her ability might prove useful! I must seize this opportunity...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_29 = {
    Text = "You want to kill me and use the poem to get the life you desire... No matter what you did, I've never hated you, Colette."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_3 = {
    Text = "But the moment you approached Colette, countless flower vines erupted from the soil around her. The spikes on the vines pierced your bodies, binding you tightly."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The Colette I once knew was my best friend. But if you destroy this place... only the current Colette will remain."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_31 = {
    Text = "I can't... let the Colette I once knew be erased by you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Look at yourself, Horla... What else can you do besides writing poetry?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_33 = {
    Text = "You're right... Apart from writing poems, I'm not good at anything else..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Cité, the city of flowers and poems, is our home... But all the roses have withered here, Colette..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_35 = {
    Text = "These roses are the ones you once gave me. Today, I am returning them to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_36 = {
    Text = "She takes a step forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_37 = {Text = "Poof—"},
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_38 = {Text = "Horla!!!"},
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Sharp thorns tear her clothes and pierce her flesh, but she doesn't care."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You... got my clothes dirty..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_40 = {
    Text = "A massive rose spike pierced her heart. Her blood flowed down the black vine, passing the first branch."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_41 = {
    Text = "The black flowers wither rapidly on the branches. A red rose bud appears, unfurls, and blooms."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Blood flows along the vines, like the veins of leaves, spreading to every corner of the city."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Where it passed, the deep darkness faded. It restored color and emotion, flowers and poetry to Cité."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_44 = {
    Text = "So... much pain..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Heart... feels as if it's been pierced..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_46 = {
    Text = "That's... Mother! Mother..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Child... my child has been born..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_48 = {
    Text = "As the blood spreads, scenes unfold before people's eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_49 = {
    Text = "It is the newborn's rebirth, the mother's lullaby, and the lovers' farewell."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Do you know how much this outfit cost?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_50 = {
    Text = "That was the most precious moment in your lives."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_52 = {
    Text = "The immense pain that Horla endured spread throughout all of Cité, rippling with her blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Rose spikes pierce countless hearts. Crimson flowers blossom within every one."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Colette, you own all of Cité, yet you still live here."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Living in the house we once dreamed of, in the garden where we once lived together..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_56 = {
    Text = "You once saved my life. This poem, written with life, is for you and for the garden."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_57 = {
    Text = "This is a poem written for the garden in spring."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Horla... you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Tears washed away her delicate makeup, but she didn't care, letting them leave messy traces on her face."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Colette's anger quickly vanished. She resumed her noble and composed smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Colette couldn't remember when her tears had started to flow."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_61 = {
    Text = "—Past scenes unfold clearly before her. For the first time, she truly understood Horla's poetry. She finally realized what she truly cherished."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Not just her. Everyone in the Cité understood Horla's poem. They were moved by Horla's emotions and could not move."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_63 = {Text = "It's now!"},
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_64 = {
    Text = "You were well-prepared, your powerful spirit power allowing you to break free from Horla's emotions."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_65 = {
    Text = "You break free from the thorns and snatch the poem collection from Colette's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Farewell... Cité in the poems!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_67 = {
    Text = "A flash of silver. Under intense light, the D-mark on the poem evaporates and dissolves rapidly."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_68 = {Text = "Ugh! —"},
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_69 = {
    Text = "A sharp pain strikes you. The heavy loss of spirit power overwhelms you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_7 = {
    Text = "It's all right, it's all right..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_70 = {
    Text = "That poetry collection, purged of Dissolution, turned into a pile of yellowed old drafts, simply clipped together with a basic clip, and fell to the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Ah! Ah!!—"
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Countless monsters roar, fall to the ground, and gradually revert to human form."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Desire fades, emotions return. The foundation of this world crumbles."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Colette felt it."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_75 = {
    Text = "She felt her power fading. She felt defeat approaching. She summoned thorn-like blades and walked towards Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_76 = {
    Text = "\"Colette,\" victory... When the old lady's dog passed away and she gave me its name, you were right beside me."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_77 = {
    Text = "This is the dog's name, but I've never changed it. I need to remind myself not to lose again."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_78 = {
    Text = "You're right. I can't forget you, can't forget everything here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_79 = {
    Text = "I want to win. I just want to win. What's wrong with wanting to win?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_8 = {
    Text = "To confront me in my garden, you must be both brave and foolish."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Sorry, Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Colette sobbed in anguish, slowly approaching Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_82 = {
    Text = "The Domain is vanishing. Your plan has failed, Colette!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Even if you attack her now, it won't change a thing!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Struggling to approach Horla, the intense pain immobilized you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_85 = {
    Text = "The spike extends towards Horla's head."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_86 = {Text = "Wait!!"},
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_87 = {Text = "*Snap*—"},
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_88 = {
    Text = "A rose was cut. Colette took it and handed it to Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_89 = {
    Text = "A fine poem, Horla... I'll trade my flowers for your poem."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You've wasted your last chance to escape... This celebration, you'll have to see it through with me."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_90 = {Text = "Bang—"},
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Perhaps the Domain's dissolution changed the gardener."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Or perhaps the gardener's transformation caused the Domain to dissolve."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_93 = {
    Text = "The Cité in the poems is gradually disappearing, and the power supporting Colette has also vanished."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Her body turned into a pool of black sludge, mixed with scattered petals, sinking into the ground in front of Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Colette, Colette, are you finished reading?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Hmm... I've finished reading... but I don't quite understand it."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Ah, is that so...? This is my first poem. It's not very good..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_98 = {
    Text = "It's not you, Horla. I don't really understand anyone's poetry."
  },
  AvgDialog_22111_Content_99 = {
    Text = "I asked many people around me, and they couldn't make sense of it either."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The Garden of Forking Paths"
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_10 = {
    Text = "It would be a pity if even my best friend couldn't see it."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Across the garden, the old woman smiles at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_12 = {
    Text = "My sculptor friend told me that only those with a certain Gift can become Awakeners."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_13 = {
    Text = "So envious, Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You notice the traces of Dissolution on her and the person standing behind her."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The Sculptors' Association... It seems the situation here was caused by the gardener and the members of the Sculptors' Association."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Do you have that poem with you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The relics of an old friend must be preserved well, of course."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Also, just a reminder, this isn't your collection of poems—it has always been mine."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Cité turned out like this... Was it your doing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You are... Colette..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_20 = {
    Text = "This place should be called \"My Cité.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Do you remember? Our greatest dream used to be simply buying a house."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_22 = {
    Text = "What about now? The poetry, the people, the land... and the building we've always dreamed of."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Look, dear Horla. Now, all of Cité is mine."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Colette, this question has puzzled me for many, many years..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Horla's fingers nervously twist together. She looks up, her bright eyes fixed on Colette."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Why are you doing these things... Why have you changed into what you are now..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Colette smiled and shook her head."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_28 = {
    Text = "You are so clever that you can write beautiful poems without ever leaving your house. But when it comes to people, you truly understand nothing about them..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_29 = {
    Text = "I have never changed, Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Horla slightly parts her lips, staring straight at the old woman across a burned garden."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_30 = {
    Text = "No... impossible... you once clearly..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Sometimes, I really envy you. I envy your talent, your gifts, and even your innocence."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_32 = {
    Text = "But why... why do you get to live so innocently?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_33 = {
    Text = "—Horla, people like us don't have the luxury of innocence."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_34 = {
    Text = "It's not like that, Colette..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_35 = {
    Text = "I don't care about those things from the past at all. Please return our Poem and restore Cité to normal..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Don't you care?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Hearing a funny joke, Colette laughed loudly, nearly unable to straighten her back."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_38 = {
    Text = "You don't care... What gives you the right to be indifferent?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Save your pity, Horla. You never understood me. You understand nothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_4 = {Text = "!!!"},
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_40 = {
    Text = "She stood up, regained her graceful composure, and nodded to the person beside her."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_41 = {
    Text = "The ritual begins tonight. I'll leave things here in your hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Ritual? What are you trying to do?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Colette ignores you, adjusts her clothing, and walks into the building."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_44 = {Text = "Wait!"},
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_45 = {
    Text = "You try to chase after her, but the building suddenly vanishes and reappears behind you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_46 = {
    Text = "You discover that the garden's structure was completely inverted, like a living creature."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Has the structure of this garden changed?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_48 = {
    Text = "I wrote about a garden of life in my poetry... but the garden in the poems isn't like this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_49 = {
    Text = "The poem is in the hands of the gardener; she must have altered the structure here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_5 = {
    Text = "She is... the florist..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_50 = {
    Text = "It's still unclear how this place was formed. However, it seems that finding her may prove quite troublesome."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Let's hurry and chase after them!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Approaching the building with Horla, you suddenly hear her gasp."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_53 = {
    Text = "{Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, what do you see here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Horla points to the steps. A small white envelope lies where they just stood."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_55 = {
    Text = "You pick up the letter and open it."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_56 = {
    Text = "\"To Mr. Herbert — Colette\"..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_57 = {Text = "Click—"},
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Hearing the living room door open, the man didn't turn around and continued to gaze out the window with great interest."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_59 = {
    Text = "What a beautiful garden, Ms. Colette."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_6 = {
    Text = "It's wonderful to see that you're still so young."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Your mansion is enviably prestigious."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Only thanks to Mr. Herbert. Without your help, I would have died from Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Not to mention, you can have even more than before..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Each party gets what they need. I need your help to verify the possibility of unifying the Domain with the real world."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_64 = {
    Text = "The dissolved poem produced such a unique domain. Even the dissolved verses could disturb real objects."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Not even Mythag can find many research projects this interesting."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_66 = {
    Text = "If one can always live in falsehood, then falsehood ceases to exist."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Your wisdom is truly astonishing, madam."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_68 = {
    Text = "How is our ritual preparation coming along?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Almost there... As per your instructions, the ritual will begin next month."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_7 = {
    Text = "How did you spot Horla?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_70 = {
    Text = "According to your statement, by that time, the dissolution of the poem will spread and may even affect the entirety of Cité?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_71 = {
    Text = "I don't remember you being someone who cares about morals."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Of course. But I care about what I have... Will my Domain still be stable by then?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Heh... Rest assured, ma'am. The formation of the Domain is closely related to Dissolution. The stronger the Dissolution, the more stable your Domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_74 = {
    Text = "The Domain's coverage is still limited. Once the ritual is complete, it will spread across all of Cité."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_75 = {
    Text = "By then, all the power and wealth in Cité will be yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_76 = {
    Text = "An inexorable victory. Ah, Colette... haven't you always been a winner?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_77 = {
    Text = "The florist walked to the window and looked at her garden."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_78 = {
    Text = "She tried to maintain a dignified noble smile, but the wine glass in her hand trembled uncontrollably."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_79 = {
    Text = "The noblewoman's face was reflected in the swaying wine glass, like a festering wound."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I've already told you the answer."
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_80 = {
    Text = "<Italic:We will all be winners, Mr. Herbert.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_22120_Content_9 = {
    Text = "In the new Cité, all things of beauty should be seen."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_1 = {
    Text = "A Belated Funeral"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Perhaps it's been affected by that great fire."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_11 = {
    Text = "No matter what, this should be the place we are looking for."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Horla, where did you place the poem?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_13 = {
    Text = "When the fire broke out, I dug a small pit to protect the poetry collection, placed it in a box, and buried it."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_14 = {
    Text = "We lived in a greenhouse where roses are grown. You can find it by crossing the flower bed."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_15 = {Text = "Ah!"},
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Is there danger?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Ah, no... {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, look there."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Horla excitedly points to a wall. A rough sketch is drawn on it with colored chalk."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Two little girls in dresses are playing at being a lady and a maid."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_2 = {
    Text = "We're here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_20 = {
    Text = "When we lived here, Colette and I would often play this game together. Sometimes I would play the noble, sometimes she would."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_21 = {
    Text = "This painting was done by her, though it doesn't look very good. However, we didn't have more chalk at the time."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_22 = {
    Text = "She dyed this dress red with juice from the roses... It's barely visible now, what a pity."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Horla's fingers gently brush over the simple line drawing, a faint smile lifting the corners of her lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Colette... the gardener who burned you to death, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_25 = {
    Text = "She was also my best friend."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Growing up in the flower house was nice, but a bit cramped. We dreamed of having a home in the manor someday."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_27 = {
    Text = "However, in the end, I never got to live there..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Horla gazed regretfully at the magnificent villa ahead and continued walking forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_29 = {
    Text = "{Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, through this rose garden, we're almost there."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Walking northeast through the bustling Medici Avenue in Cité, you soon arrive at a beautiful apartment area."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Rose garden? Where is the rose garden..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_31 = {
    Text = "The backyard of this mansion used to be filled with roses."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Were they Colette's?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Hmm! At that time, we had just been driven out of our old manor and had nowhere to go..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Wait! Colette... I just saw the sign. Is this the Countess's garden?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Didn't you say you hadn't seen a garden for a long time? Well, this is the most beautiful garden in this area."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Colette, let's hurry... If we get caught, it will be a lot of trouble!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_37 = {
    Text = "No, it won't. Look—"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_38 = {
    Text = "She picked a rose and placed it in Horla's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Ahhh! Colette, we're going to end up in prison..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_4 = {
    Text = "A palace-like mansion stands before you, conspicuous and magnificent."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_40 = {
    Text = "No one's going to jail. Horla, look over there!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Following Colette's direction, Horla saw a greenhouse cultivating valuable roses."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_42 = {
    Text = "The flower room contained two beds and their few belongings."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Colette... What is this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_44 = {
    Text = "I've rented this place."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_45 = {
    Text = "But... how did you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_46 = {
    Text = "She just noticed that the necklace Colette's mother had left her was no longer around her neck."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Colette! You..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Shh~ None of that matters, Horla. What matters is, this isn't some count's garden—this is <Italic:our garden.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_49 = {
    Text = "We'll eat and sleep in the greenhouse... I'll sell the flowers that grow on this land to buy us clothes and food."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_5 = {
    Text = "But... why has this place changed like this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_50 = {
    Text = "One day, I'll even buy us a home in that building!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_51 = {
    Text = "But... what can I do...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_52 = {
    Text = "All I can do is write poems that no one reads..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_53 = {
    Text = "To be honest, I don't understand your poems either... But it doesn't matter. Just write whatever you want to write."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Everyone has something they are born to do. I was born to strive for this garden and that house."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_55 = {
    Text = "And you, you were born to write poetry."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Since then, she supported the two of us with the flowers from this garden."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Although it was extremely tough and we were far from buying a house, we were actually quite happy during that time."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Until one day, the publisher sent me my first payment for my poems..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Although she later locked you in the greenhouse and set the fire, you don't seem to hate her."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_6 = {
    Text = "In the vast garden at its foot, gray withered grass grew everywhere. You walk into the garden."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Hard to say... Maybe. I don't really know what to think."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_61 = {
    Text = "I only know that, if it weren't for those poems, none of this would have happened..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_62 = {Text = "Horla..."},
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Horla's visions unfold before you. Her sorrow seems tangible, spreading and permeating everything around."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_64 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry! {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper... I've made you sad again..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_65 = {
    Text = "It's all right, don't restrain your emotions."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Let's continue searching for the poetry collection."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_67 = {
    Text = "The poem is buried over there! {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, please follow me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_68 = {
    Text = "You walked through the winding paths in the garden, circled around the burnt wooden frames, and arrived at an open space behind the yard."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_69 = {
    Text = "We're here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The closer you get, the dimmer the colors around you become... Are these also part of the imagination of your poetry?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_70 = {
    Text = "She points to a small spot in the middle of the backyard. The surrounding roses had turned to ash and fertilizer, now overgrown with black weeds."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_71 = {
    Text = "The report from Mythag says they found Horla's Silver on a scorched clearing."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_72 = {
    Text = "—That is where the poem is buried. That is her final resting place."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Strange... There's a hole here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_74 = {
    Text = "The poem collection... the poem collection should have been buried here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_75 = {
    Text = "It hasn't been there for many years."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_76 = {Text = "!!!"},
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_77 = {Text = "Who?!—"},
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_78 = {
    Text = "A familiar voice sounds. You abruptly turn around."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_79 = {
    Text = "The back door of the villa opens, and the noblewoman you met on the ship stands at the entrance, looking down at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I can't quite remember... But it shouldn't be, right...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_80 = {
    Text = "After the great fire, I held a grand funeral for you. It's a pity that you couldn't see it yourself."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Seeing you on the ship made me happy. I haven't felt this happy in a long time."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Decades... Decades, and we finally meet again..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Welcome home, Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_22121_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Perhaps it's because you've written death into some of your poems."
  },
  AvgDialog_22122_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Countless monsters surge onto the stage."
  },
  AvgDialog_22122_Content_2 = {
    Text = "This isn't working. Horla, stay close. Let's break through from this side!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22122_Content_3 = {
    Text = "But if that's the case... Colette will destroy this place..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22122_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Now is not the time to hesitate. There are too many monsters, and we can't stop Colette now... Trust me, Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_22122_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Seeing your determined gaze, Horla still doesn't understand your meaning, but she nods."
  },
  AvgDialog_22122_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I... I understand..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22122_Content_7 = {
    Text = "{Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, be careful!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_1 = {Text = "The Poet"},
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Bright light from an unknown source illuminates the roof and tables of the roadside café."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Let's go, {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, we're heading to the rose garden... to where I died."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Horla bathes in the light, her feet swinging in the air to an unknown beat."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I remember reading in the newspaper that March Street was originally an ordinary street, but it gained fame because a painter created a piece for this café."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I really love this story and once wrote a poem about it. In the poem, the artist eventually settled at No. 99, End of March Street."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I think it's not that March Street encountered the painter, but rather that the painter encountered March Street."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Cité has become so strange, yet you seem not at all afraid, even quite enjoying it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Here, you don't have to interact with people, yet you can encounter many new and fascinating things."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I can't quite put it into words, but I always feel more at home here than when looking at the newspapers and photos of Cité..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Ah, look, {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper! It's the stars!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Stars? But there seems to be neither day nor night here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Two cups of coffee... thank you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You look up. Next to the shimmering golden stars, white petals unfold."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Huge daisy-like stars transform the sky into a garden."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Cité is a city of poetry and flowers... Without those urgent matters, it would indeed be quite enjoyable."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_23 = {
    Text = "After thirty minutes, we encountered about a hundred citizens without any attacks... That tram must not have lied to us."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Ah, so {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper has been observing all along?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_25 = {
    Text = "I have no choice. Some gaze at the stars, while others must watch the ground beneath their feet."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Though not gifted in poetry, as the Keeper of Mythag, I can still handle this task."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The contact is at 101 March Street. Get ready, let's go."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_28 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_29 = {Text = "Boom—"},
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Soon, a raccoon dressed in a waiter's uniform brought you two cups of coffee."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_30 = {Text = "Who?!"},
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Unsure of the dangers here, you cautiously observe your surroundings."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Ah, greetings to both of you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Phew... We meet again..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Hello! Madame Butterfly, Mr. Caterpillar!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_35 = {
    Text = "What are you doing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_36 = {
    Text = "My husband and I had dinner and were preparing to take a stroll down the street."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_37 = {
    Text = "What a coincidence! I heard the poem written by that young lady—it's absolutely beautiful!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Thank you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Are the two of you lost?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Speaking to strangers? You've made great progress already, Horla!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_40 = {
    Text = "The roads here don't match the markings on the map, and the house numbers are all messed up..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Excuse me, do you know where No. 101 March Street is located?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_42 = {
    Text = "101... I don't remember if there is a No. 101 on March Street."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Is that so..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_44 = {
    Text = "This place isn't very large. Let's continue searching slowly."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Sorry for not being of much help."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Take your time with the search. Enjoy your stay in Cité~"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_47 = {
    Text = "After bidding farewell to the Butterfly Lady and Mr. Caterpillar, you continue to make your way through the streets of March Street, checking the numbers on the doorplates one by one."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Hmm, I don't recall March Street being this long..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_49 = {
    Text = "We've checked the whole street twice already."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Only one person, and they look like an animal, but I suppose it's not nothing..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Huh? But I don't see where No. 101 is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_51 = {
    Text = "The first time I didn't notice, but the second time I carefully observed all the door numbers."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_52 = {
    Text = "March Street... There is no No. 101."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_53 = {
    Text = "The highest house number here is this one."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_54 = {
    Text = "You stand by the wall at the end of the street. The metal nameplate on the small building ahead has been replaced with a painting."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_55 = {
    Text = "March Street... No. 99."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Who's there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_57 = {
    Text = "The door bursts open, revealing a thin figure before you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_58 = {
    Text = "On the paint-stained, tattered clothes is the face of an insect."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Are you thieves?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Although I'm not sure whether it's a good thing, there are finally more people around."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Uh... no, we're tourists here to visit a friend. He's at 101 March Street..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_61 = {
    Text = "What's the number?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_62 = {
    Text = "1... Uh, No. 88."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_63 = {
    Text = "You said 101. There's no 101 here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_64 = {
    Text = "You liars... You stole my painting! It was you who stole my painting!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_65 = {
    Text = "With the painter's movements, the surrounding scene suddenly changes."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_66 = {
    Text = "A few dazzling and bizarre colors suddenly appeared on nearby buildings, resembling a complete painting torn apart into chaotic hues by some unknown force."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Is this... Dissolution?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Uncertain of the principle behind this phenomenon, you quickly retreated with Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Give me back my painting!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Didn't Mr. Caterpillar say that most people won't harm us as long as we don't act strangely?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_70 = {
    Text = "His hand reaches for you. Before it touches you, strange colors surge around him like a flood, engulfing and devouring him..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Soon, the eerie colors stop writhing. You silently observe the scene before you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_72 = {
    Text = "The school badge on your chest emitted a silver glow."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Cité... Did something happen again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_74 = {
    Text = "A building has disappeared."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_75 = {
    Text = "The location is on March Street..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_76 = {Text = "No. 99."},
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_77 = {
    Text = "You look at the remaining doorplate numbered 99, taking a deep breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_78 = {
    Text = "We can't let things continue like this... Without a contact, we need to think of another way."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_79 = {
    Text = "{Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, I have a guess..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Hope no more bees come to \"sing\" for me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_80 = {
    Text = "No, not a guess. I'm certain."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_81 = {
    Text = "This isn't Cité!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_82 = {
    Text = "...Horla, what are you saying?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_83 = {
    Text = "I mean, this isn't the real Cité."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_84 = {
    Text = "This isn't the real Cité...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_85 = {
    Text = "The Caterpillar Train that requires a poem for a ticket, Madame Butterfly, only No. 99 March Street, the Painter, Daisy Stars..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_86 = {
    Text = "These things we've seen, I've always felt they were extremely familiar. It was only just now that I finally remembered why."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_87 = {
    Text = "These things have all appeared in my poetry collection. Everything here is just as I imagined in my poems..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_88 = {
    Text = "{Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, this is not the real Cité."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_89 = {
    Text = "This is the <Yellow:Cité of my imagination>..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_9 = {
    Text = "On the spacious street, citizens with various animal heads come and go, showing no signs of aggression."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Under the chaotic colors of March Street, Horla slowly spun around, gazing at everything that belonged to her poems."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_91 = {
    Text = "The light falls like a veil, illuminating her face, which is filled with curiosity, sorrow, and confusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_92 = {
    Text = "I see... No wonder there are so many bizarre things here."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_93 = {
    Text = "But how did Cité end up like this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_94 = {
    Text = "I don't know either... Some things here aren't exactly the same as in my poems."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Everything in the poem should have been beautiful and eternal... I don't know why it turned out this way..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_96 = {
    Text = "But I think, if we want to resolve the issue here, we might need to find that poem first."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Do you still remember the way?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_98 = {
    Text = "In my poetry, March Street is close to home. I always remember the way back."
  },
  AvgDialog_22125_Content_99 = {
    Text = "She faces the residential area, sorrow like a tangible mist enveloping you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22126_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Huff... Huff... {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, there are too many monsters to handle..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22126_Content_10 = {
    Text = "—Breaking through to seek reinforcements is just a ruse. This is the opportunity you've been waiting for."
  },
  AvgDialog_22126_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Restrain her, Horla!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22126_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You suddenly turn around."
  },
  AvgDialog_22126_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Horla paused for a moment, understanding your intention, and then charged towards Colette with you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22126_Content_14 = {Text = "This is!!"},
  AvgDialog_22126_Content_15 = {
    Text = "A giant flower-shaped monster takes form from the vines around the square, blocking Colette's path."
  },
  AvgDialog_22126_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Good idea, Keeper. But I won't let any surprises affect my plan."
  },
  AvgDialog_22126_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Listen, Horla. This poem is written for you—"
  },
  AvgDialog_22126_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The Dissolution is growing larger. If this continues, we will be trapped here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22126_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I overheard your conversation when you arrived in Cité."
  },
  AvgDialog_22126_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Looking for reinforcements? I won't give you the chance, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_22126_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Under Colette's command, hordes of monsters rush to the exit, completely blocking your way."
  },
  AvgDialog_22126_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The opportunity has arrived. Only once."
  },
  AvgDialog_22126_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Huh? ...What... what do you mean..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22126_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Your peripheral vision catches Colette dispatching all the monsters backstage to block your escape route."
  },
  AvgDialog_22126_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Around her, the number of monsters has decreased significantly, making it possible for you to attempt something."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_1 = {
    Text = "City of Flowers"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_10 = {
    Text = "These beautiful scenes seem to make Horla forget those painful memories, as well as the strangers around."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Hello, if you're not getting in, I'll be leaving. Other passengers are waiting."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_101 = {
    Text = "You watch it warily. The Caterpillar Train seems friendly enough..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_102 = {
    Text = "Excuse me, does this train go to Medici Avenue?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_103 = {
    Text = "Of course, of course... This tram can take you anywhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_104 = {
    Text = "A railcar that can go anywhere, huh... Sure, that makes sense."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_105 = {
    Text = "Anyway, at least this vehicle is indeed for carrying passengers."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_106 = {
    Text = "The caterpillar's body opens, revealing a tidy seat inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_107 = {
    Text = "Seeing Horla's expectant eyes, you sit down."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_108 = {
    Text = "Excuse me, how do I pay for the ticket?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_109 = {
    Text = "Free of charge."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Her eyes shimmered as she followed you through this picturesque city."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_110 = {
    Text = "Looks like today isn't all that bad, at least there's a free ride..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_111 = {
    Text = "Not free. To obtain a ticket for this car, you need to pay with a poem."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_112 = {Text = "???"},
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_113 = {
    Text = "Ah, that's right... This young lady must be a local."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_114 = {
    Text = "Horla, how do you even know these rules..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_115 = {
    Text = "I'm not quite sure... That's just how I remember it."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_116 = {
    Text = "It's not costly; each rider just needs to write a simple sentence."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_117 = {
    Text = "I'll go first..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_118 = {
    Text = "She approaches the front of the bus and whispers something into the fare box by the driver's seat."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_119 = {
    Text = "Ah... What a beautiful poem! Please take a seat, miss."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_12 = {
    Text = "...It's impressive that you still have the heart to think about this now."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_120 = {
    Text = "Can I take a look as well?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_121 = {
    Text = "I... I'm a bit embarrassed... I'll write it in secret to you after returning, {Male=Keeper Sir,Female=Madam Keeper}."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_122 = {
    Text = "It's your turn, {Male=Sir,Female=Madam}."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_123 = {
    Text = "Hmm, let me think..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_124 = {
    Text = "The trolley car inched along the tracks like a caterpillar."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_125 = {
    Text = "My analogy is quite ingenious, akin to something else."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_126 = {
    Text = "Hurry up, let's head to Medici Avenue!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_127 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_128 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_129 = {
    Text = "Generally, you need to rewrite a sentence, but that lady's poem could purchase season tickets for all seats, and I don't wish to endure any more torment. Please, take a seat."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Horla, don't you think the city of Cité has become strange?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_130 = {
    Text = "The caterpillar opens its eyes, and a bright light shone from them."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_131 = {
    Text = "It moves steadily forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_14 = {
    Text = "No, although I've forgotten what Cité looks like, I think it should look like this."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_15 = {
    Text = "This lady is correct. Cité, a city of flowers and poetry, should indeed look like this."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The noblewoman smiled and patted Horla's back."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_17 = {Text = "Heh heh..."},
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Only now seeming to realize there was a stranger beside her, she smiled awkwardly, blushing as she hid herself slightly behind the parchment."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_19 = {
    Text = "A clear bell rings, and a carriage appears before you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_2 = {
    Text = "This... This is too..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Ah, my ride is almost here... I'm afraid I can't stay with you any longer."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_21 = {
    Text = "I didn't expect you to come, so I didn't prepare a gift... Here, this is for you. I hope you won't dislike it."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_22 = {
    Text = "She extends her hand, presenting something to Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_23 = {Text = "This is..."},
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_24 = {
    Text = "A rose stained with watercolor trembles slightly in the wind from an unknown direction."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Horla looks up joyfully to express gratitude, but the old woman has already boarded the carriage."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Farewell, Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The carriage moves forward, soon blending into the distant ink painting."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_28 = {
    Text = "This elderly lady is truly kind. But there's something a bit strange about her..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Indeed... Oh dear, I forgot to ask her for directions."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Cité, the city of flowers and poetry."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Never mind, let's look for someone nearby."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Such a big city, yet there are so few people on the streets... It's truly strange."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Changes in visual features, discrepancies in numbers... The witnesses' accounts were not wrong."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_33 = {
    Text = "...Indeed. That's roughly the situation in Cité."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Things are strange here, but no danger or signs of Dissolution have been found yet."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Horla and I are preparing to move forward, find the contact as soon as possible, and verify the situation here."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The school is preparing to assign reinforcements, but it will take some time."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Understood. Until then, leave the investigation in Cité to us."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Turning off the Silver communicator, you vigilantly scan your surroundings."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_39 = {
    Text = "This city seems to be enveloped by a peculiar filter, with all the buildings standing bizarrely like haphazardly smeared oil paintings."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Today's Cité truly lives up to its name."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_40 = {
    Text = "You've been walking down this street for ten minutes without seeing anyone. The only things here are the strange buildings by the roadside, surrounded by clusters of blooming flowers."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_41 = {
    Text = "In broad daylight, I've walked for so long without seeing a single person... Do people in Cité not go out?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_42 = {Text = "Ah!"},
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Why did you hide inside the parchment again...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_44 = {
    Text = "<Italic:La, laa, la-aah~>"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_45 = {
    Text = "A resident hums an unfamiliar tune, passing by the intersection ahead, showing only their back."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_46 = {
    Text = "He wears a suit that looks overly tight, and the shape of his head appears somewhat odd."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Ah... Thank goodness, finally I see someone."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_48 = {
    Text = "You quickly step forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Hello, sir."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Led by the noblewoman, you walk forward, overwhelmed by everything that catches your eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Ah, hello, dear {Male=Sir,Female=Madam}! May I ask how I can be of assistance to you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_51 = {Text = "!!!"},
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_52 = {
    Text = "He turned around. Above the suit was the enormous head of a bee."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_53 = {
    Text = "What's wrong, {Male=Sir,Female=Madam}? Did I say something inappropriate that made you uncomfortable?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_54 = {
    Text = "No... <Italic:cough—> No."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Excuse me, could you tell me how to get to Medici Avenue?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Ah, {Male=Sir,Female=Madam}, you're new to Cité, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_57 = {Text = "Yes."},
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_58 = {
    Text = "No wonder, you don't even know the most famous street..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Rest assured, the citizens of Cité are very hospitable. Medici Avenue is just..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You walk down the misty streets, touching the stained bricks on the buildings, plucking sycamore leaves like color ink."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_60 = {Text = "Hmm—"},
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_61 = {
    Text = "This Mr. Bee didn't finish his sentence and suddenly started convulsing all over."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_62 = {
    Text = "A pair of large membranous wings tore through his coat, melting and dripping like butter under the scorching sun."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Honey, Mr. Bee! ..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_64 = {Text = "Snap—"},
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_65 = {
    Text = "The humanoid bee's body fell to the ground, turned black, then crumbled into powder and dispersed into the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_66 = {
    Text = "These aren't the typical symptoms of Dissolution..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_67 = {
    Text = "You examine the surroundings carefully once again."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Surrounded by buildings resembling abstract paintings. Observing the occasional distant residents, you can see their bodies resemble various plants and animals."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_69 = {
    Text = "—The Cité before me appears as if it were taken straight out of some bizarre dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_7 = {
    Text = "This city seems to be shrouded by a peculiar filter, with all buildings and plants standing in an extremely surreal, watercolor-like appearance."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_70 = {Text = "Ding—"},
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_71 = {
    Text = "The badge on your chest gleamed silver. You established the communication."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Professor Doll, I just encountered an atypical dissolution mutant..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Call from Cité. A citizen turned into D-Dust on a busy street."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_74 = {Text = "!!!"},
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Exactly the same as what I encountered here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_76 = {
    Text = "But I'm in Cité, and it's nothing like a bustling city."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Indeed, there's no interface between the real world and the Domain here. But if it's not a Domain, why would this place and these people become like this... It doesn't make sense."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_78 = {
    Text = "It seems that this Domain is different from ordinary ones, a completely independent space."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_79 = {
    Text = "But its impact on Cité is real and tangible."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_8 = {
    Text = "{Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, look at this house, does it seem like there are some lines floating on it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_80 = {
    Text = "No matter what, we need to find the cause before things escalate further."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Understood."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Communication ends. The atmosphere becomes heavy."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_83 = {
    Text = "{Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper... Mr. Bee, has he passed away?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_84 = {
    Text = "You look at Horla and pat her on the back."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_85 = {
    Text = "This is not the real Cité. Perhaps, it's just some kind of illusion..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_86 = {
    Text = "I hope so..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Horla picks a sycamore leaf and places it on the remaining D-dust."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Let's go to Medici Avenue and find the contact for investigation."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_89 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Like poetry inscribed on buildings... so beautiful!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Look, {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper! A tram!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_91 = {
    Text = "You walked forward for a while, and a dark mass came towards you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_92 = {
    Text = "There are trams, but we didn't see the stop, so we're not sure if they go where we want to go."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Have I told you? From the fence of the old garden, you could see the tram passing by, but I've never actually rode one."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_94 = {
    Text = "I believe I recall it can go anywhere. Regardless, I still would like to board it, at least just once."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Every time I see that tram, it feels like a giant..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Hello, may I offer you a ride?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_97 = {Text = "!!!"},
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_98 = {
    Text = "On the winding tracks, a giant caterpillar stops in front of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22127_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Ah! Just as I remember! It's the Caterpillar Train!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Lingering Fragrance"
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_10 = {
    Text = "...I have some matters to attend to, please excuse me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Hey hey hey! Miss Nymphaea!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_12 = {Text = "Hannah."},
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Wait a moment, Keeper! I urgently need to see Miss Nymphaea! This could very well be headline news!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Horla sent me to find you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_15 = {Text = "Huh?!!!"},
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Hannah came to a sudden stop."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_17 = {
    Text = "She asked me to give this to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The Abode of Roses, by Horla Colette..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Is this... Horla's poem?! And a new pen name, too?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Miss Nymphaea! Miss Nymphaea!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_20 = {
    Text = "She asked me to pass on the message that, if you think it's good, to please help her publish it in—"
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_21 = {
    Text = "No problem, no problem! It doesn't matter if the poem is good or not, as long as it generates some buzz!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Also, Keeper, is Horla willing to accept my exclusive interview?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Just quietly take me to see her, and..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Be too greedy, and you might not even get that poem published."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_25 = {Text = "Oh..."},
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I gave the poem to Hannah."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You once told me that the poems didn't bring misfortune, but I couldn't believe it."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Only after this did I truly come to understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Thank you, {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Ah, Miss Hannah, you've come to see me again..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_30 = {
    Text = "You can save these words for when Hannah interviews you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Ah... no, no... I still don't dare to talk to others... but I'll adjust gradually!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Just kidding. I've already declined her on your behalf."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Horla lets out a deep sigh. You approach her."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You know, even if Hannah publishes that poem, few people would actually care."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_35 = {
    Text = "What people really care about is the stories and topics surrounding that collection of poems."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Hmm, I know, {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Even in a city like Cité, there are very few true poetry readers..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_38 = {
    Text = "And you don't mind that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_39 = {
    Text = "For Colette, this is the best way to pay tribute."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Well I'm glad to see you too!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_40 = {
    Text = "As for the poem itself..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_41 = {
    Text = "She plucked a petal from a rose above her eye and brought it to her nose."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_42 = {
    Text = "In Cité, even where flowers are not visible, their fragrance fills the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Poetry, like flowers, doesn't always need to be seen..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_44 = {
    Text = "She turned her head and smiled at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_45 = {
    Text = "{Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, do you believe that too?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Few in Cité read poetry, but I believe roses have long since bloomed in their hearts."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_47 = {
    Text = "She raised her hand. Crimson petals drifted gracefully away from her palm."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_48 = {
    Text = "The wind carries the scent of roses, as if blowing from Cité decades ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Um, I have an urgent matter to ask you about..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I don't know where Horla is."
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_7 = {
    Text = "What?! How is that possible! She's been back for a whole day and still hasn't contacted you?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Could the rumors about the two of you not getting along be true?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22128_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Is it due to mutual disdain among literature enthusiasts? Or have you turned into romantic rivals?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_1 = {Text = "Psalm 1843"},
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Horla... it's fine. They're just figures from the poem, so don't worry."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_11 = {
    Text = "This cage must be a product of Dissolution. Buy me some time; I'll find a way out soon."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Ah, I almost forgot. You're still so shy, Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Horla slowly peeked out from under the parchment."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Colette, I have read the letter you wrote to Herbert..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I'd really like to hear how you plan to persuade me at this moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I'm not trying to persuade you... I understand why you're doing this."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Heh... What?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_18 = {
    Text = "For fame and power, sacrificing me, sacrificing poetry, sacrificing Cité... All of this, I can understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I love writing poetry, Colette. I try to listen to the voices of all people and things... You're my best friend—how could I not hear your heart?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Lady Colette! The citizens of Cité will forever remain loyal to you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_20 = {
    Text = "But after Dissolution spreads... this garden will be erased from everyone's memory..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_21 = {
    Text = "All that has happened here, the happy and sad days we spent together... Can you really just let it all go?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Colette paused for a moment, then burst into laughter. Her laughter grew louder and louder, almost causing her to forget to maintain her noble demeanor."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I thought... you wanted to say something to me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Cité has so many people whose lives I don't care about. Do you think I care about a measly garden?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_25 = {
    Text = "She took a deep breath and straightened herself up."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Horla, you've been popular since you were young. Even though I'm the one who worked hard to support us, people always praised you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You possess remarkable talent, but so what? There are some truths you will never comprehend."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Poetry, emotion, memories, morals... All just burdens. Only power and fame are truly eternal."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Well said! Lady Colette!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Move! You're blocking my way!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The square erupts in applause and cheers, drowning you in a wave of sound."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Listen, Horla. Hear the voices of the Cité people."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_32 = {
    Text = "In this world, poetry holds no meaning. In another world, it is the same."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_33 = {
    Text = "So that's what you think... I understand, Colette."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_34 = {
    Text = "To be honest, I'm really glad that you could come here."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_35 = {
    Text = "At the most crucial stage of my life, you have once again become my witness."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_36 = {
    Text = "She raises her arms."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_37 = {
    Text = "In the square, everyone knelt down before her."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_38 = {
    Text = "No poetry, no preaching. Only imagined fanatical worship. Only pure power."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_39 = {
    Text = "The earth begins to tremble. You notice the dissolution visibly spreading from the poem's center."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Ms. Colette! Ms. Colette, look over here!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Watch, Horla. Watch me secure another victory—"
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_41 = {Text = "Clang—"},
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_42 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_43 = {
    Text = "A flash of silver light. The cage vanishes, and you and Horla fall to the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_44 = {
    Text = "It may have been a mistake to bring me here as a spectator, Ms. Colette."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Mythag's Silver Key... Even Mr. Herbert is quite envious."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_46 = {
    Text = "But I'm curious—even in a place like this, what can you do even if you manage to escape from the cage?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Rose Square is packed. All of Cité's citizens have gathered here. From above, it looks like a writhing, massive black mass."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_6 = {
    Text = "What an inspiring scene... wouldn't you say?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Colette, dressed in her finest, stands on the grand stage, elegantly waving down."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Behind her, a black cage of unknown material confines you and Horla, hanging backstage."
  },
  AvgDialog_22129_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Under the crowd's gaze, Horla finds herself curled up beneath the parchment, trembling uncontrollably."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Perhaps the old man who was smoking just now is a secret member of the Committee."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Y-Yes... Madam..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_101 = {
    Text = "Horla, did you disable your shroud?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_102 = {
    Text = "I haven't... Madam, can you see me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_103 = {
    Text = "In the new Cité, all things of beauty should be seen."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_104 = {
    Text = "The new Cité..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_105 = {
    Text = "Ah, we've arrived."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_106 = {
    Text = "You turn around."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_107 = {
    Text = "A painting like you have never seen before unfolds before your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_108 = {
    Text = "The cruise ship collides with the shore buffer, producing a dull thud."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_109 = {
    Text = "You and Horla stare in bewilderment, seemingly forgetting how to walk."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I always felt there was something very mysterious about him... Who knows?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_110 = {
    Text = "My car won't arrive for a while, so let me show you around."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_111 = {
    Text = "She raises her hand, her arm tracing an elegant arc."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_112 = {
    Text = "Welcome to Cité, distant guests."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Sunlight bathed the deck. Horla closed her eyes, arms slightly open."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Noticing your gaze, she shyly pulled her hands back and hid them behind her back."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Not bad, much better than I expected."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I thought you'd want to turn back after seeing so many people on the cruise."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I thought about it at the time, but I didn't have the courage to tell you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Ah! {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, look! It's the Szenyér river!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The boundlessness of the sea only lasted a short while. Soon, a lighthouse rose slowly from beneath the horizon."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Behind it, a wide estuary and the blurred cities on both banks came into view."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_2 = {Text = "Home"},
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Miss Nymphaea! Miss Nymphaea!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Hello, may I ask what I can assist you with?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Have you seen Horla? It's urgent!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Don't you have a poetry club or something? According to my informant, Horla seems to frequently attend your events."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You're so close to her, you must know where she is, right?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I last saw Horla two months ago... She dislikes crowded places."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Do you have her poems? Your poetry club must have collected many of her works, right?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_27 = {
    Text = "If you have it, I'd be willing to pay a high price for it."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Hannah, do you have something to ask her about?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The school newspaper hasn't had much attention lately. Horla has never liked being interviewed, not even to publish her own poems."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Alright, Horla, the passengers next to us are gone."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_30 = {
    Text = "If we can publish her poems or even conduct an exclusive interview with her, this month's school magazine sales will definitely double!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_31 = {
    Text = "I've already thought of the title: \"Garden and Spring—The Untold Stories of Young Poet Horla\"..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_32 = {
    Text = "...According to statistics, the current number of sightings has reached double digits."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_33 = {
    Text = "According to eyewitnesses, the changes in Cité don't seem to be caused by ordinary dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_34 = {
    Text = "The current Cité is very..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_35 = {Text = "Very...?"},
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_36 = {
    Text = "In the words of an eyewitness, \"It was beautiful.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Dissolution... beautiful?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The lack of logic is a common characteristic of eyewitness testimony."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_39 = {
    Text = "From their chaotic words, it can be concluded that the uniqueness and impact of this event are extremely rare, yet the exhibited risk is minimal, creating a stark contrast."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Really? You're not deceiving me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_40 = {
    Text = "We have not encountered a similar event. Whether it is the result of dissolution remains unknown."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_41 = {
    Text = "What did the contact in Cité say?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_42 = {
    Text = "The contact reported that everything was normal, so the level of this event isn't high. But we still need to send someone to Cité to check..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_43 = {Text = "Bang—"},
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Before Doll finished speaking, a white figure slipped into the office like a ghost and hid behind the curtain."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_45 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_46 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Horla, if you're hiding from someone... you forgot to close the door."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Ah! I'm so sorry! I've caused you trouble... {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper! Miss Doll!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_49 = {
    Text = "She hurriedly closed the office door, and quickly hid behind the curtains."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_5 = {Text = "...Really."},
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Horla! Where are you? Horla!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Come out, dear Horla! We just need a short interview~ It won't hurt, I promise!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Hannah's voice drifts away from outside the door."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Finally started bullying Horla? It seems the pressure from the school paper's sales has indeed become quite significant."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_54 = {
    Text = "It's fine if you don't want to do the interview. Just hand over a few of the many poems you've written to Hannah, and she'll leave you alone."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_55 = {
    Text = "I... don't really want to..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Those poems only bring misfortune... I don't want that to happen again."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Recalling what Horla had experienced, you understood her meaning and nodded."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_58 = {
    Text = "I should be outside, not in a crowded place like the school..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_59 = {
    Text = "{Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, can I ask for your help with a solution?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Horla peeked out from under the large parchment, cautiously looking around."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_60 = {
    Text = "To be honest, I don't have any good solutions for dealing with that ferret's agility and sense of smell."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_61 = {
    Text = "—However, if you'd prefer to be outdoors, there is a way I can help you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Ah... Do I really have to go out..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Where would we go?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_64 = {
    Text = "You pick up the photo on the table and wave it in front of her."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Cité, your home."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_66 = {
    Text = "The cruise silently drifts, houses and flowers on both sides slowly fading behind, vanishing at the bend of the Szenyér River."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Horla closed her eyes. A smile blossomed on her face."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_68 = {
    Text = "It's the wind of Cité! Cité is the city of flowers, and even the wind carries the scent of flowers."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Even after all these years, the moment I smell it, I remember."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_7 = {
    Text = "After confirming there were no strangers around, she let out a long breath and crawled out from under the parchment."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Do you miss the sights of Cité?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Of course! But I've always lived in the greenhouse. I haven't really been to most of the places in Cité."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_72 = {
    Text = "I've written many poems about Cité's scenery, but those are fiction... If there's a chance this time, I'd like to see those places."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Where do you want to go the most?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_74 = {
    Text = "The place I want to visit the most... hmm, it would be the garden where I used to live."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Every rose season, the garden is in full bloom with roses, as if living in a dream!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Just not sure if the roses and the poem book are still there after that fire..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_77 = {
    Text = "When the fire broke out, I couldn't escape, so I buried my poetry collection in the garden. This time, I intend to find it."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_78 = {
    Text = "After all you've experienced in Cité, I didn't think you'd like this place or want to see that poem again."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Those things have nothing to do with this land or its people... Cité is a beautiful place."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You know they can't see you, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_80 = {
    Text = "As for the poem... I can't say, {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_81 = {
    Text = "It brings much pain to those around me, which I dislike, but... it is also my most precious possession."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Whether to preserve or destroy it, I still want to find it."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, I will definitely take you to see it. I'm just not sure if we can still find it after all these years."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_84 = {
    Text = "A black butterfly flutters gracefully and lands on Horla's outstretched fingertip."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Look, {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, a butterfly!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_86 = {
    Text = "If a butterfly lands on someone, it means that, in the butterfly's eyes, this person's life is like a flower."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_87 = {
    Text = "To the Cité people, a life like a flower always brings good fortune~"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Exactly, Miss. You smell like roses."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Cité has many beautiful rose gardens; you will feel right at home here~"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Not necessarily. Among the travelers could be Awakeners, researchers with special equipment, or gifted individuals..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_90 = {Text = "!!!"},
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Horla, be careful!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_92 = {
    Text = "You've never witnessed a butterfly speak. You gently pulled Horla back."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Wow, a talking butterfly?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Mrs. Butterfly, sorry... I-I'm not very good at small talk..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_95 = {
    Text = "No aggression, not like a Dissolution Mutant... nor a Phantasm..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_96 = {
    Text = "The pitch-black humanoid butterfly flapped its wings and swayed to and fro as it left the cruise ship. You looked around cautiously. The Szenyér River still flowed quietly."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Humans becoming butterflies... a beautiful image, isn't it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_98 = {
    Text = "A well-dressed noblewoman appears beside you without your notice. She turns her face toward the Szenyér River and gives Horla a slight smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_22130_Content_99 = {
    Text = "However, miss. The rose on your eye is far more beautiful than a butterfly."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Garden Elegy"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Poor child... you and Horla are like sisters..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_100 = {
    Text = "You take out the poem."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_101 = {
    Text = "Do you miss it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_102 = {
    Text = "I miss it very, very much... But it's okay, {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_103 = {
    Text = "She wiped away her tears and shook her head with a smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_104 = {
    Text = "For me, for Colette, and for all of Cité, this poem brings only endless pain..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_105 = {
    Text = "{Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, may I?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_106 = {
    Text = "Hand the poem to Horla"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_107 = {
    Text = "I'll miss it. But it should exist only in my memories."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_108 = {
    Text = "Farewell..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_109 = {
    Text = "Flames ignited in Horla's hand. Soon, the poem turned into a pile of ashes in the fire."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Horla is gone. You must live well. Her spirit will bless you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_110 = {
    Text = "This book and I should have shared the same fate, reduced to ashes long ago... There wouldn't be such trouble now if it had."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_111 = {
    Text = "Finally, the problem is solved."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_112 = {
    Text = "{Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, I don't seem to notice any changes?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_113 = {
    Text = "With such a widespread impact, it may take some time to dissipate. Let's leave for now..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_114 = {
    Text = "Do you like this room, Horla? Everything here has been kept just as it was decades ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_115 = {Text = "!!!"},
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_116 = {
    Text = "The poem is already burned... Your plan has failed, Colette."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_117 = {
    Text = "The poems? Oh, you mean this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_118 = {
    Text = "She waved, and a new collection of poems appeared in her hand, identical to the one that had been burned."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_119 = {
    Text = "Black dissolution liquid drips onto the ground from the poem."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Don't let her be sad... Colette, live a good life."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_120 = {Text = "!!!"},
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_121 = {Text = "You..."},
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_122 = {
    Text = "It's a trap... Horla, prepare to attack!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_123 = {Text = "Clang—"},
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_124 = {
    Text = "A cage suddenly appears beside you, trapping you inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_125 = {
    Text = "This is... there shouldn't be such things in the poem..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_126 = {
    Text = "Such words were indeed never written in Horla's poems."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_127 = {
    Text = "Sorry, but this is my poem collection. Anything I want will appear here."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_128 = {
    Text = "Smiling, she raised her hand and tucked the poem collection into her chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_129 = {
    Text = "...In this Cité, I am the sole master."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_13 = {
    Text = "At first, many people came to comfort her. Gradually, everyone drifted away, leaving her alone with her thoughts."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_130 = {
    Text = "Ding—Ding—"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_131 = {
    Text = "Listen, Horla. The midnight bell has tolled."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_132 = {
    Text = "Today is Cité's grandest festival... I am honored to have two distinguished guests here to witness the ceremony."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_133 = {
    Text = "Guards, take them to the square."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_134 = {
    Text = "I have prepared the best seats for our two distinguished guests."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Colette stood motionless beside the ashes of her painstakingly maintained conservatory, letting the embers scorch her face."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_15 = {
    Text = "A tear slid down her face, quickly evaporating in the lingering warmth of the flames."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Horla, they were right... You will bless me. You won't hate me."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_17 = {
    Text = "You won't hate me for taking everything from you—your talent, your life... Even so, you still won't hate me."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You are so kind and noble. In your presence, everyone else appears vulgar and petty."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I've tried so hard to live... But compared to you, why am I always the contemptible one?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Fire! Quick, put it out!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_20 = {
    Text = "So cruel, Horla. You don't give me a single reason to hate you. You force me to live out my remaining days in pain..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_21 = {
    Text = "A sob. Colette wipes away her tears. Ash smears across her face, decorating it haphazardly."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_22 = {
    Text = "She imitated a noble, proudly raising her head and smiling at the garden now reduced to embers and ashes."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_23 = {
    Text = "...Goodbye, then, Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_24 = {Text = "Plop—"},
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_25 = {
    Text = "A tear falls on the poem collection, producing a clear sound in the room."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_26 = {
    Text = "It's been many, many years since I've felt this way... Horla, you're still just as full of surprises as before."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You ask, why didn't you leave your own image in the poem?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_28 = {
    Text = "It was truly difficult seeing you again... What a pity."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Lady Colette, the midnight bell is about to toll. Please make preparations."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_3 = {
    Text = "It's too late... Nothing remains of the garden..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Hmm, understood."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_31 = {
    Text = "She sits in front of the mirror while the maid carefully wipes away her tears with a handkerchief."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Today is a big day. Even the best audience has arrived... The makeup must not be ruined today."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_33 = {
    Text = "She gazes intently at herself in the mirror, curling her lips into a smile befitting nobility and victory."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_34 = {
    Text = "{Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, this way!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The path to the clock tower is truly complex... and there are many monsters standing guard along the way."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_36 = {
    Text = "In the poem \"The Bells of the City of Poetry,\" the path to the clock tower is a maze. It symbolizes the confusion in the hearts of the city's residents."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_37 = {
    Text = "A fitting image."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_38 = {
    Text = "What untimely rhetoric..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Avoiding the monsters' search, you arrive at the top floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Has everyone been rescued?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_40 = {
    Text = "The clock tower is right there! Just go through this corridor."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Is there only one monster guarding this place?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_42 = {
    Text = "The other monsters must have gone elsewhere... This one should be the one responsible for ringing the bell."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Do you think there's a way to deceive him?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Sure, it should be possible... As the poem goes, the envoy of the sculpture will deliver a letter to the bell-ringer, which signals the arrival of midnight."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Great... Horla, you act as an envoy and trick him into ringing the bell. I'll take it out before it reacts."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Huh? I... I have to... lie to a stranger...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Uh... nevermind, I'll go instead... You stay here, and if they make any sudden moves, help me subdue them."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_48 = {Text = "Hmm!"},
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_49 = {
    Text = "You adjust your clothing and step forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Most of them, yes... But one is still in the greenhouse..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Who's there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_51 = {
    Text = "I am the envoy of Lady Colette."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Ah... So it's the envoy..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_53 = {
    Text = "I'm here to deliver a message. Midnight approaches."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_54 = {
    Text = "You hand the bell-ringer the letter Colette had written to Herbert. He accepts it respectfully."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_55 = {
    Text = "But... Your Excellency, the envoy, the current celestial signs show that it is not yet midnight..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_56 = {
    Text = "There was an error in today's celestial observation."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_57 = {
    Text = "How dare you question Lady Colette's decision?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Understood...! I'll get it done right away!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_59 = {
    Text = "The bell-ringer presses a button. The intricate gears begin to turn, and the hammer falls, striking the massive bell."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_6 = {
    Text = "How pitiful... Two children, just as life was beginning to improve."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Ding—Ding—"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_61 = {
    Text = "The hammer falls repeatedly as the twelve chimes of midnight echo across Cité."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Envoy, the midnight bell has rung."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Great... Next, we can attend Lady Colette's celebration."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Ah, great Lady Colette, it is my fortune to ring the bell for your celebration. To see your handwriting is my..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_65 = {
    Text = "my...? \"Dear Mr. Herbert — Colette\"..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_66 = {
    Text = "This is not a command to ring the bell... You...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Before he could finish, several lines of text floated into his mind, and his eyelids drooped."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_68 = {
    Text = "After swaying twice in the air, the heavy body thuds to the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Horla peeks out from behind the wall and waves at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Colette, Colette... don't be too sad."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Looks like he'll miss the celebration. Let's go."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Ding—Ding—"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_72 = {
    Text = "The twelve chimes ring out clear and distant, announcing the arrival of midnight."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_73 = {
    Text = "People stepped out of their homes and gathered on the streets of Cité, like a black river, slowly flowing toward the square outside Colette Garden."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_74 = {
    Text = "The day has finally arrived! I'm about to meet Lady Colette!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Ah, Madam Colette, the sole poet and the faith of all Cité..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_76 = {
    Text = "I've heard that this ceremony will be the grandest ever. If only I could stand below the stage and shake her hand..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Dream on. So many people want to meet Madam Colette. What makes you think you can cut to the front?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Just thinking about it... it's not against the law, is it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Trust me, don't overthink it. Just relax and watch with me from the outside."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The fire ignited in an instant. Perhaps it was due to the high temperature, an old man's cigarette butt, or something else."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_80 = {
    Text = "A distant glimpse of Lady Colette and hearing her speak is enough for me."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_81 = {
    Text = "The door opens softly. You cautiously peek inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Come in. The bell rang, and everyone went to the square."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Horla, is this the place?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Horla didn't reply immediately. She looked around the room, her eyes glistening."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_85 = {Text = "Horla?"},
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_86 = {
    Text = "It looks exactly the same as it did when we were kids..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Even with so much, even having all of Cité... this place has always been where Colette's dreams lie."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Horla's emotions spread once more, and you felt your heart being touched."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_89 = {Text = "Horla..."},
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Flames rose in the garden filled with dry grass, engulfing the greenhouse. Before people could react, it had already subsided."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Ah! I'm sorry, {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper... I always struggle to control my emotions..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_91 = {
    Text = "No worries, that's perfectly normal."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_92 = {
    Text = "No one should abandon their past."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Thank you... {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_94 = {
    Text = "We spoke about it before. Colette said that once we buy this house, she would place all her precious items in a special display cabinet for all the guests to see."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Jewelry, handbags, fine clothing... and a poetry collection signed with her name."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Led by Horla, you arrive at a delicately crafted glass display case."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_97 = {
    Text = "On the central shelf of the showcase, the thick, lavish poem book lay quietly, like a monarch sleeping in a palace."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_98 = {
    Text = "\"The Abode of Roses,\" authored by Colette..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22132_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Back then, this poem collection was just some papers pinned together... Now, it looks quite different."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Statue Rhetoric"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Help Ms. Colette! Catch the intruder! Quick, search!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_11 = {
    Text = "A group of monsters with varied shapes rush into the building, passing by not far from you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Monsters from the world of poetry have invaded the real world..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Their ceremony is about to begin. We need to hurry."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Peering out, you see the monster went somewhere else. You grab Horla and quickly run upstairs."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Horla, let's go up the stairs and find... huh?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You climb the stairs, only to find that they don't lead to the upper floor and end abruptly halfway up."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_17 = {
    Text = "This... What's going on..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I once wrote a poem about a staircase that breaks off halfway, much like our lives filled with unexpected twists and hardships."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_19 = {
    Text = "But this is clearly not the world of my poem, how could it be..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_2 = {
    Text = "{Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, has the poetic world... disappeared?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_20 = {Text = "Ah! I see!"},
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Horla suddenly lifts her head, too excited to stop herself from jumping."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_22 = {
    Text = "It's Colette! This place is important to us... She specifically preserved it and remodeled it according to the description in the poem!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I knew it, Keeper! Colette isn't that kind of person!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_24 = {
    Text = "This is the first time you've seen Horla so delighted. You exhale deeply."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Not wanting to shatter her illusion, you gently patted her on the shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Maybe... You're familiar with this place. How about letting you take the lead?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_27 = {Text = "Hmm!"},
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Led by Horla, you evade the monsters' search and continue moving forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_29 = {
    Text = "{Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, up ahead is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Look back outside."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_30 = {Text = "Shh!"},
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You quickly cover Horla's mouth and pull her to the corner of the wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_32 = {
    Text = "What are we supposed to be doing here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Fool! Lady Colette ordered us to guard this place because... because..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_34 = {
    Text = "...In short, Lady Colette ordered us to stand guard here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_35 = {
    Text = "We've been keeping watch for so long and haven't seen anything. Won't we miss the ceremony?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_36 = {
    Text = "No, the bell hasn't rung yet. We can't go anywhere until it rings!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I'm truly looking forward to witnessing Madam Colette's live creation..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Madam Colette's live performance happens only once a year. Get ready, soldiers. We'll be competing with all of Cité for seats!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Why don't we head over now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Horla looks outside the door."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_40 = {
    Text = "...because we need to stay here."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_41 = {
    Text = "So... what exactly are we doing here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Fool! Madam Colette ordered us to guard this place!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_43 = {
    Text = "These two don't seem very smart..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_44 = {
    Text = "There is no other way, Horla. Get ready to clear them out."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Horla nods at you. You hold the silver key, and Horla takes out paper and a pen."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_46 = {Text = "Ah!!—"},
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Accompanied by silver light, elegant script appears in the air, inscribing itself into the monsters. The two monsters fall into a deep sleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_48 = {
    Text = "After defeating the monsters, you hid in the room behind them."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Looks like a storage room... It should be safe here for now."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The garden outside still retains the appearance of the world described in poetry, but the indoor world is identical to the real world, with no trace of the Domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_50 = {
    Text = "We can rest here and then find Colette... Horla? You don't look well."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Ah... Is that so?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Were you frowning just now, thinking about something?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Oh... {Male=Sir,Female=Madam} Keeper, I was thinking about the conversation between those two monsters earlier..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_54 = {
    Text = "When I was eavesdropping earlier, it felt so familiar... I just now finally remembered."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_55 = {
    Text = "In that poetry collection, I wrote a poem about the statue in the City of Poems."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Poetry City is a city-state that feeds on poetry. It has no king; their faith lies in a statue."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Each year on the festival day, when the clock tower chimes, the statue comes to life and writes a poem for the people of the city."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Its poetry is so beautiful that it can sustain the entire city for a whole year."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Every year on the festival day, people gather at the square where the statue stands to listen to the poems it creates live..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_6 = {
    Text = "This should be the real Cité. It seems we've passed through a Link point between reality and the Domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_60 = {
    Text = "I see. Colette altered the statue's image into her own..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Where is the clock tower?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_62 = {
    Text = "When I was writing poetry, I had no idea what the outside world was like... So that clock tower was modeled after the one next to this building."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_63 = {
    Text = "The two buildings are connected, and you can cross over via a covered bridge."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_64 = {
    Text = "...Horla, can you guess where Colette hid the poem?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_65 = {
    Text = "It should... be okay... right...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_66 = {
    Text = "There is an extremely luxurious room in this building, belonging to the Countess. She stays here once or twice a year on occasion, while the maid regularly cleans it in her absence."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Colette loved that room and even snuck me in to see it. She said that once she made some money, she would definitely live in that room."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_68 = {
    Text = "I think she and the poetry collection will both be there."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_69 = {
    Text = "I see... I have a solution!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Wherever it is, we must find Colette and retrieve the poem..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Are you going to Colette's room to grab the poem? But there are many monsters here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Yes, there are many monsters here; we probably won't be able to handle them."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_72 = {
    Text = "So, we'll distract them first, then go to her room to get the poem."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_73 = {
    Text = "But they're so alert now... what can we use to distract them?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Use the clock tower."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Clock tower? ... Ah! I understand!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Let's ring the bell at the clock tower early. This way, the monsters will gather in the square, and no one will stop us!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Exactly. Colette needs to prepare for her performance. She won't carry such a thick poetry collection; it will likely be kept somewhere safe in her room."
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Use this time gap to go to her room and destroy that poetry collection!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Knock knock knock—"
  },
  AvgDialog_22133_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The floor shakes violently. You quickly pull Horla and hide behind a door."
  },
  AvgDialog_22145_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Please... I'm not worth it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22145_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Aigis, I can help! We can stabilize the spirit!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22145_Content_3 = {
    Text = "To prove your point, you pull out the Silver Key from under your cloak—it shines with warm light, like dew, like sunshine."
  },
  AvgDialog_22145_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The key... Mr. Anderson said something about it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22145_Content_5 = {
    Text = "<LightGray:But it's too late... really too late...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_22145_Content_6 = {
    Text = "She's running to the clock tower! Stop her!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_1 = {Text = "Eyes open"},
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Meeting Host?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Thick smoke rises from the stern, where the power room is located."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_101 = {Text = "Oh no!"},
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_102 = {
    Text = "You steady yourself against the ship's railing and walk toward the rising smoke."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_103 = {
    Text = "The smell of blood and gunpowder fills my throat, and every breath while walking brings a stabbing pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_104 = {
    Text = "Ramona, Murphy, Celeste... We need to meet up with them quickly."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_105 = {
    Text = "No sooner had we taken two steps than a violent tremor, nearly tearing the ship apart, surged from beneath our feet."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_106 = {
    Text = "In a massive explosion, flames shoot skyward, and the scorching air throws you violently to the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_107 = {
    Text = "—The last thing I saw before losing consciousness was a seabird gliding across the night sky bathed in full moonlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_11 = {
    Text = "How did you sleep?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_12 = {Text = "Doll?!"},
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid. Now is not the time to hold you accountable for trampling the lawn on a weekday afternoon."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<Gray:That means it will be pursued sooner or later...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Ramona avoided your gaze, as if the back of her head said \"unable to help.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Francis' diary mentioned some information about <Yellow:\"Church of the Lightbearers\">—by the way, you haven't reviewed those three compulsory lessons yet."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Church of the Lightbearers, believing \"Dissolution is a divine blessing and humanity's only salvation,\" tricks the ailing into joining and contracting Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
Thank you for your repetition, Professor Dexter.
However, I think Erica wouldn't appreciate you interfering with her work.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_19 = {
    Text = "My bad, the rest of the time is up to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Why are you sleeping here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Francis left many clues pointing to the Church of the Lightbearers, among which \"Resurrection of the Dead\" is particularly noteworthy."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_21 = {
    Text = "With Lily's appearance, we have reason to suspect that the Church of the Lightbearers has mastered the method to summon Awakeners."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Isn't the existence of Awakeners supposed to be top secret in the world?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
Seems you didn't pay attention in Awakener history class.
I'm starting to wonder how you passed the initial test.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Mythag is not the only one mastering Silver awakening or similar technologies."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The origin of the Awakener can be traced back to before the Pluvial period. Murals found in the tombs of the 19th Dynasty of ancient Remouahe appear to depict the summoning of the Awakener."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The \"golem\", which is closest in technology to the Mythag awakening system, is inherited from the Wizard clan of the Levant region."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_27 = {
    Text = "I got sidetracked."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_28 = {
    Text = "From the descriptions of faith and rituals in the diary, Francis encountered a <Yellow:Church of the Lightbearers> that differs from the information we have."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Your next field task is to verify the contents of the diary."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Wake up, you'll catch a cold sleeping here."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Francis documented his whereabouts before departing for the polar region in his diary.\nThis time, we'll head to where she boarded the ship—Brillport Town. There might be clues left there."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Ready to set off? I'll be your partner as always."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The travel pack has always been ready."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Need to sleep a bit more?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
No need!
I fully understand the task requirements and have recalled all the details from last night!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_35 = {
    Text = [[
Then, let's set off now.
If we leave today, we might catch the premiere of the new production at the Londinium Opera House upon our return.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_36 = {
    Text = "I'll go find the driver. See you at the school gate."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Ramona's figure quickly disappears from view, and you prepare to return to the dorm to fetch your belongings."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_38 = {Text = "Keeper."},
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_39 = {
    Text = "This time, we may have direct contact with the Church of the Lightbearers."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Hmm... Ramona?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
Uncovering their hidden secrets is secondary. Your primary task is to stay alive.
I don't know where to dig up another Keeper from the ruins.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Don't be so hard on the young."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
But Doll is right.
The cultists you've encountered so far are merely peripheral members. The true core of the cult has yet to emerge.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Does it sound like the professor is familiar with the Church of the Lightbearers?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Ha, haha... Just a fateful relationship."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_45 = {
    Text = "If necessary, Mythag will send more experienced investigators or even request assistance from the Mystia Treaty Committee to resolve this matter."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Make sure to come back alive."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Understood. We'll return safely."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_48 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_49 = {
    Text = "What are you still looking at? They've already set off."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_5 = {
    Text = "How long have I been asleep?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, they are sensible children."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_51 = {
    Text = [[
I have no worries.
Even if we need to train a new Keeper, the funds will come from the Dexter family's bank account.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Take better care of yourself. I just heard that someone's daughter is going on a date at the opera house."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Young one..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_54 = {
    Text = "It is night."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_55 = {
    Text = "A regular ship to the polar region? Are you crazy? There's no such thing as a regular ship here, and no church or religious organization either!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Stop asking. We're just ordinary fishermen and we don't know anything!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Madam, please wait—"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_58 = {
    Text = "You're oppressing us villagers just because you have the backing of the city lord!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_59 = {
    Text = "We absolutely had no such intention—Hey!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Who knows? You even missed the pre-departure meeting this afternoon."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_60 = {
    Text = "The woman slammed the door shut. If Ramona hadn't pulled you back in time, you might have gone back to school with a crooked nose."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Brillport... This town is strange."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_62 = {
    Text = "This is the third door we've knocked on, but no one is willing to share information about the town with us."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_63 = {
    Text = "We were just asking for directions. They seem to be collectively covering something up—it's very unusual."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Let's check the dock. There might be some clues."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_65 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Is something wrong?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_67 = {
    Text = "It might be a phantasm. It seems like there's a voice in the wind."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_68 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_69 = {
    Text = [[
Hey, perfect timing. Two out-of-towners just walked in.
Stop them? Saves us the trouble of finding others.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_7 = {Text = "Meeting?"},
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Drive them toward the ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Heh, you sly devil."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Go, Caecus. Your chance to shine has arrived."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_73 = {
    Text = "As you command, Lord Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Countdown: Three Hours"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Wait! Don't close the door yet!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_76 = {
    Text = [[
The girl ignored your words and slammed the door shut.
The monster's tentacle, caught in the door, was severed and twitched a few times before going still.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_77 = {
    Text = "My companion is still outside!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Huh?! Is there anyone else on the ship?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_79 = {
    Text = [[
Surrounded by so many monsters, even a deity couldn't escape.
Stop thinking about that person. I'll take you to the captain to see how we can get you off the ship.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_8 = {
    Text = "It's about Francis —"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_80 = {
    Text = "She's strong. She'll be fine."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Yes, yes, she'll pull through. I'll take you to her after meeting with the captain."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_82 = {
    Text = "However, I can't guarantee how much is left..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Who are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_84 = {
    Text = "This is what I should be saying, you stowaway! The captain said that boarding without permission is considered stowing away."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Miss, you misunderstand. We had no intention of smuggling; we only boarded the ship because we encountered monsters and had no other choice..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Save those words for the captain. I don't care."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Damn it, damn it, damn it! You've ruined everything! My entire plan is in shambles! I need to come up with something..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_88 = {
    Text = "By the way, you'd better remember my name well—"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Countdown @2 minutes"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Never mind, let the meeting host explain it to you personally."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_90 = {
    Text = "We are boarding now."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Have you seen enough?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_92 = {
    Text = "That's right. If the ritual continues, who knows what kind of monster will hatch from Murphy's body."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Fake... Die!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_94 = {
    Text = "%player%, give me your hand!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Just before the cloak was soaked by the seawater, a familiar breeze rippled across the surface."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_97 = {
    Text = "I remember now... I failed to grasp her hand and fell into the sea... No, wait... This is the deck of the Sonanil."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_98 = {
    Text = "The dreamy and warm hues were replaced by pale moonlight; the shroud enveloping the ship shattered, vanished, and sank into the Aequor."
  },
  AvgDialog_22297_Content_99 = {
    Text = "The curtain... disappeared?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22403_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Are we at Aurita? Are we at Aurita?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22403_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Shh, didn't you see they were tied up? How can you save them in your condition?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22403_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Brown, it's our time to take the stage!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22403_Content_4 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_22403_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Jenkin and her animal companions sneaked into the shadows of the set, leaving Aurita fuming as she paced behind the camera."
  },
  AvgDialog_22403_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
Don't rush, you'll get your turn.
Later, let Master Casiah give you some "grand scenes."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_22403_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Really?! Thank you, Master Casiah!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22403_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Master? Hmm~ That's more like it."
  },
  AvgDialog_22406_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Stop! Where are you taking my beloved item?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22406_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ew!? Rat saliva!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22406_Content_11 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_22406_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Gave Houdini a big lick!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22406_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The battle is imminent. The captured girl looked at her companion, who stood protectively in front of her, with an inscrutable expression."
  },
  AvgDialog_22406_Content_14 = {
    Text = "—She gritted her teeth and squeezed out a jet-black pustule from her back!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22406_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Shadows descend, claws stretch from another realm, and demonic wraiths block the path of the brave adventurers, menacing and fierce."
  },
  AvgDialog_22406_Content_3 = {
    Text = "In the name of the Knight..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22406_Content_4 = {Text = "Ahem!!"},
  AvgDialog_22406_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
Cough, cough. I swear on my honor as a Londinium Detective, I will protect everyone!
You won't get any closer!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_22406_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Oh—Detective G, as my defeated opponent, haven't you had your fill of failure?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22406_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Then don't blame me for being impolite!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22406_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Ranger, this is the moment!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22406_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The furry ranger swiftly moved through the darkness, climbing onto Houdini's thigh at an almost invisible speed and took a fierce bite..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_1 = {
    Text = "We won... We won!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The assistant held the Nocturnal Ranger high, temporarily shielding the ranger's beautiful fur."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Hey!! Corpse, stop talking! Keeper! Lotan! Do something!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Lotan shook her head, a phantom of a whale-like creature appearing behind her. Just as she was about to pull everyone out of the water, a light figure plunged into it."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Water! It's water~ Aurita's favorite sea!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Make a wish to me, those in need! The ocean will respond to all your expectations!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Detective G and the Night Ranger exchanged glances and simultaneously pushed the long-silent girl in white towards the Ocean Elf."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_16 = {Text = "...?!"},
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Please, please take us away from here."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Casiah, half her body already submerged in water, curled her lips into a satisfied smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Magic illusions shift and transform with a wave of her hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The evil sorceress was defeated by the combined efforts of everyone. She collapsed to the ground, weakly reaching out her hand toward a button."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_20 = {
    Text = "In the blink of an eye, everyone was soaked in water."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_21 = {
    Text = "No one is spared."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Are you serious!?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The elf returned to the freedom of the sea, and everyone escaped Houdini's workshop. Doesn't this fulfill the girl's wish?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You have a point, but... how can this story reach the ending Lily desires?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_25 = {
    Text = "\"The girl lived happily ever after with her mother.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
"Tsk, this is the last time I'm babysitting for you.
Don't ask me to do such troublesome favors again."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Lily, officer, look! What's in the water over there?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_29 = {
    Text = "A massive spine rises from the water, a colossal beast that has dwelled in the Aequor of Kadath since the birth of the planet. It answers the call of Life, emerging through the veil of time!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Lotan saw this, threw the speaker to you. She walked over to Casiah and whispered in her ear."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_30 = {Text = "Lotan...?"},
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Are you ready to go? If not, your story will come to an end in this water."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Wow! A big fish!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Don't rush, one at a time. Miss Lotan's back is quite spacious."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Can you, a half-baked sea sprite, stop hogging the spotlight? Clearly, Bru... No, the Night Ranger and I are the real heroes here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_35 = {Text = "Um..."},
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The big fish is Aurita's companion! So Aurita must sit at the front!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_37 = {Text = "Um...!"},
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Lily, Lili... I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Can I sit in the front?"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_4 = {
    Text = "What scheme are you up to now? Don't make it impossible for everyone to clean up the mess."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Considering you're younger than me... Be careful! There's no seat on the big guy's back."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Aurita wants to be with her companions!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Hey! Why are you so slippery!? If you can swim, don't climb up here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_43 = {
    Text = "The behemoth bellows through its airway, leaping out of the water with laughter and hope."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_44 = {
    Text = "The light of dawn pierces through the clouds and mist, draping the sea, colossal beasts, and adventurers in shades of red and pink."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_45 = {
    Text = "So, so high—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Detective G, the Ocean Sprite, and the assistant of the Night Ranger joined forces to catch the girl, preventing her from slipping off the back of the giant beast."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_48 = {
    Text = "A few people laughed and played, smearing water on each other's clothes."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_49 = {
    Text = "At that moment, the brave girl suddenly looked straight over, her face adorned with an exceptionally radiant and gentle smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Oops, just a little test—"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_50 = {
    Text = "A lily that missed its flowering period,"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_51 = {
    Text = "The moment of blooming has finally arrived."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_6 = {
    Text = "As the smile on Casiah's face slowly widens, the sound of an undercurrent enters everyone's ears."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Come forth, flood! Witness Master Houdini's finale — the ultimate water tank escape!"
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The water level rose rapidly, soon covering the children's feet, then their calves... Finally, it reached their thighs, making it difficult for them to move."
  },
  AvgDialog_22708_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Casiah!!! What are you doing?! Are you trying to drown us?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The black masses recede like a tide, and the compartment regains its tranquility."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Blood-red rose petals flutter down, and a pungent stench of decay lingers in the pitch-black booth."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The masked shadow silently appeared behind Lady Sorel."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Excuse me, ladies and gentlemen. Next, please enjoy—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_14 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_15 = {
    Text = "A blooming rose pierced through Sorel's chest, its dewdrops shimmering with an eerie blue light in the dark."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_16 = {
    Text = "This... what is this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The shadow appeared for only an instant before vanishing, leaving Sorel staring in confusion at the blood flowing from her chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Ahhhh!! Madam, your chest..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Blood? Disgusting... Karen, clean it up for me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You step forward and firmly grasp Sorel's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Don't step back, Lady Sorel! You'll fall!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Lady Sorel!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Ahhh, someone fell off the building!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_24 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Th-That looks like Lady Sorel...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Golden-hued wine spills from the glass, dancing in the air with vibrant rose petals."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Help... help me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The extravagant and opulent music still lingers throughout the opera house."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Her eyes were filled with fear and confusion. Driven by the instinct to survive, she reached out to you, but narrowly missed as your fingertips almost touched."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_3 = {
    Text = "This place is unsafe, Lady Sorel. Please follow me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_30 = {
    Text = "This peerless beauty has finally fallen, along with her beloved fine garments, wine, flowers, and applause."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_31 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:First Artificial Domain Investigation Log>\n\n■Domain ID: M-B04-001\n■Setup Time: A.F. 315, June @1, 8:00-9:00 PM (The day of Sorel's death).\n■Setup Location: Covent Theatre"
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_32 = {
    Text = "■Domain Owner: Sorel @2\n■Domain Intruders: %player%, Ramona\n\n■Objective: <Yellow:Investigate Sorel's fall and @3>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_33 = {
    Text = "■<Yellow:Investigation Results>\n\nPreliminarily identified the culprit as a <Red:masked shadow>.\nSorel fell to her death. The Keeper evacuated the Artificial Domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
Mythag Lounge
After the first Artificial Domain ends]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Are you awake?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_36 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Ugh... my head... it hurts...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Heart rate and blood pressure are normal. Spirit power fluctuation value is slightly high but within a controllable range."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Not bad. It seems that after the last <Blue:Ramona's Artificial Domain>, you have gradually adapted."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Thanks to my continuous improvements to the Domain, we can now even set its start and end times as well as locations."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_4 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Of course, the research funding Miss Czort applied for also played a 1% role."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Is it really only 1%...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_42 = {
    Text = "What about Ramona? We went in together..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Rest in the next room. Don't worry, she's fine just like you. Her body is not harmed."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Did you catch the culprit in Lady Sorel's Domain?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_45 = {
    Text = "You shook your head."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_46 = {
    Text = "I only had time to catch a whiff of the killer's scent, like...<Red:the smell of decaying rose petals.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Everything in front of me feels unreal, my thoughts keep switching and jumping."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_48 = {
    Text = "From the fall of the opera house to the murder in the alleyway, from the cheering crowds to the scheming maid..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Until it finally came to a stop three weeks ago, the beginning of the story—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_5 = {
    Text = "How dare you touch my lady's hand, and so tightly..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_6 = {
    Text = "As the maid spoke, she suddenly leaned close to your ear."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_7 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:Hey, you promised we were just here to watch! You lied to me!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_8 = {
    Text = "... I'll explain it to you later."
  },
  AvgDialog_23346_Content_9 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23347_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You are forcefully pushed back by a powerful force."
  },
  AvgDialog_23347_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The world dissolves into petals, and you plunge into an endless sea of flowers."
  },
  AvgDialog_23347_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Aaaah—!!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23347_Content_4 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Second Artificial Domain Investigation Log II>\n\n■Domain ID: M-B04-002\n■Setup Time: Holocene 315, June 11th, 8:00-9:00 PM (The day of Sorel's death).\n■Setup Location: Covent Theater"
  },
  AvgDialog_23347_Content_5 = {
    Text = "■Domain Owner: Sorel @2\n■Domain Intruders: %player%, Ramona\n\n■Objective: <Yellow:Based on the results of the first Domain intrusion, locate the source of Silver's fluctuation on the first floor.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23347_Content_6 = {
    Text = "■<Yellow:Investigation Results>\n\nAn unidentified entity @2 interrupted the investigation. The Keeper lost most of the related memories.\n<Red:The Keeper was forced out of the Domain and is in critical condition.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23348_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Both of you, please wait."
  },
  AvgDialog_23348_Content_2 = {
    Text = "We have urgent business with the old gentleman. Could you inform him?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23348_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Sorry, my master is suffering from a severe infectious disease and is unable to receive visitors."
  },
  AvgDialog_23348_Content_4 = {
    Text = "We can talk to him from the carriage, without getting any closer."
  },
  AvgDialog_23348_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The fully armed man ignores your proposal. This is the busiest market in the West District; starting a battle here will definitely attract everyone's attention."
  },
  AvgDialog_23348_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You don't want to invite unnecessary trouble."
  },
  AvgDialog_23348_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Just quietly follow them and see what they are up to."
  },
  AvgDialog_23349_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You follow the carriage through winding paths and, without realizing it, end up in a desolate countryside far from the city."
  },
  AvgDialog_23349_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Let's go in and take a look."
  },
  AvgDialog_23349_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A dense fog enveloped everything, leaving only the faint black silhouette of the carriage ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_23349_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The outline gradually blurred and eventually vanished without a trace."
  },
  AvgDialog_23349_Content_4 = {
    Text = "What a place... Londinium is so foggy these days, seriously hampering the efficiency of the police and investigators."
  },
  AvgDialog_23349_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Through the thick fog, the ancient mansion shrouded in sorrow looms in the distance."
  },
  AvgDialog_23349_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The pine wood on the mansion's surface splits into cracks, silently exuding a gloomy aura."
  },
  AvgDialog_23349_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Fog, an abandoned mansion, the strange death of a socialite, a mysterious old gentleman... Yes, all the elements of a novel are present."
  },
  AvgDialog_23349_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Do you think the elderly man might be inside?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23349_Content_9 = {
    Text = "This area is desolate as far as the eye can see. I'm afraid we have no other choice."
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You pull back the heavy curtain."
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_10 = {
    Text = "...Are you awake?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_11 = {Text = "?"},
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You quickly turn your head, but there is no one behind you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Lady Sorel?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Sorel quickly regained her composure and forced a smile at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_15 = {
    Text = "We've known each other for less than half an hour, and you've already apologized to me three times."
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_16 = {
    Text = "If you truly wish to apologize, using this would demonstrate greater sincerity."
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Sorel swirled the golden liquid in her glass."
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
The person I'm waiting for hasn't arrived. How about playing a game with me?
I'll ask you three questions. If you can't answer them...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Sorel gently placed the glass on the table and casually pointed to the champagne in the cart beside her."
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You have finally returned, my knight."
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Let's have a drink."
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Sorel sits in the corner with a smile, still looking radiant as ever."
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Thank goodness you're safe."
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Didn't you say you would protect me? I've been waiting for you for such a long time."
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_6 = {
    Text = "She smiled nonchalantly, but her tone carried a hint of subtle melancholy."
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Sorry, Madam Sorel..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_8 = {
    Text = "<Red:Hehe.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23351_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Sorel suddenly focuses behind you, her pupils filled with unease."
  },
  AvgDialog_23352_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The moment the door opened, a stench of decaying flowers hit. The hall was filled with red roses, which were wilting due to neglect."
  },
  AvgDialog_23352_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ramona glanced at the sky outside."
  },
  AvgDialog_23352_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Let's wrap up the investigation for today. I've noted the location of this residence, so we can check its property records later."
  },
  AvgDialog_23352_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Hmm. Tomorrow's operation will proceed as usual."
  },
  AvgDialog_23352_Content_13 = {
    Text = "First, get the invitation from Karen. Then, I'll guard Lady Sorel on the 2nd floor, and you keep an eye on the 1st floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_23352_Content_14 = {
    Text = "If you're lucky, you might even meet the old gentleman in the carriage."
  },
  AvgDialog_23352_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ugh... the same scent as that masked shadow."
  },
  AvgDialog_23352_Content_3 = {
    Text = "There's nothing here... It appears that no one has lived here for a long time."
  },
  AvgDialog_23352_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You glance around the dim, damp hall. It's empty, with cobwebs swaying in neglected corners, and the floor scattered with wilted petals and fallen leaves."
  },
  AvgDialog_23352_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Hmm, there's a painting hanging here."
  },
  AvgDialog_23352_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Hanging at the staircase corner is an elegantly framed portrait, softly depicting a richly dressed woman."
  },
  AvgDialog_23352_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The woman's makeup is delicate, but her drooping eyes and tightly pressed thin lips give her a gloomy and uneasy appearance."
  },
  AvgDialog_23352_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Egg tempera? It's a technique rarely used nowadays."
  },
  AvgDialog_23352_Content_9 = {
    Text = "That's strange. This painting doesn't have a speck of dust on it, as if someone is taking care of it regularly."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_1 = {Text = "Egg"},
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ramona frowned, her eyes filled with worry."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_11 = {Text = "Ramona..."},
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
Perhaps we could enter the Domain once more?
I will guard Lady Sorel upstairs, and Ramona will keep watch downstairs.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The Artificial Domain is not a tourist spot you can visit at any time. Your top priority now is to rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_14 = {
    Text = "However, we also need to take some <Yellow:extreme measures> to push the investigation forward..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I thought entering Artificial Domains was radical enough."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_16 = {
    Text = "A rare \"cunning\" smile appears on Doll's usually calm face."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I have a more radical plan, but it depends on whether you're willing to take the risk."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Brinsburg Road, 23:00"
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Hahaha! What a wonderful night and fine wine!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_2 = {
    Text = "What else? Besides the masked figure, did you find any other clues in the opera house?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Mr. Nicholas, your vintage special blend was the lifesaver that got me out of prison."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_21 = {
    Text = "If Mythag is a prison, then your adopted daughter is the warden? Hahaha..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Dexter's cheeks flushed red, his eyes dreamy. He placed a finger on his lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Shh... I sneaked out this time. Don't let Ramona find out."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_24 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_25 = {
    Text = "I envy you, Mr. Dexter. You have someone who truly cares about you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_26 = {
    Text = "And me? Not long ago, my true love left me—her body still warm—and my father has also passed away!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Nicolas said, then squatted down and began sobbing."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Sorel... I will definitely avenge you once I catch the culprit!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_29 = {
    Text = "<Gray:The love of my life? Interesting... at least three friends have told me the same thing.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_3 = {
    Text = "While patrolling the first floor, the Silver Meter detected a brief data fluctuation, but it quickly disappeared."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_30 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Madam Sorel is truly admirable.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Hmph~ Her singing is full of genuine emotion, deeply moving me~"
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_32 = {
    Text = "In the silent alleyway, a well-dressed gentleman staggered along the cobblestone path, his shadow stretched long by the dim streetlights."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_33 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:I live for happiness!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_34 = {
    Text = "<RedItalic:Tonight's many tears are unforgettable.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_35 = {
    Text = "<RedItalic:Let our beautiful blood stain the stained glass, illuminating the grand feast.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The low chant echoed through the empty street as a masked shadow drifted from the corner to Dexter."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Good evening, Noble Dexter."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
Uh... you sang it wrong.
The next line should be "Her eyes brimmed with tears, leaving me deeply captivated."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Shadow suddenly nodded in realization and slapped his forehead in frustration."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Therefore, the culprit is most likely a guest from the first floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Oops. I wanted to put on a grand performance before killing you, but I even got the lyrics wrong."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Kill me...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Frankly, you appear to be a reasonable gentleman. Why take the life of an innocent bachelor in the dead of the night?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_43 = {
    Text = "The shadow innocently shrugged."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_44 = {
    Text = "I am but a humble servant, and all that I do is to fulfill my master's wishes."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_45 = {
    Text = "With that, it swiftly dissipated like ink, vanishing into the boundless night."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_46 = {Text = "...Huh?"},
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_47 = {
    Text = "A sudden chill pierces my back, followed by an overwhelming scent of rotting flowers, a sickly sweet aroma that almost makes me gag."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Watch your back, Mr. Dexter."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, I don't dislike you; in fact, I quite admire you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ramona nodded."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_50 = {
    Text = "So I'll try to make your death as painless as possible—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_6 = {
    Text = "After Lady Sorel's fall from the building, the scene was sealed off for a long time, and everyone provided a statement."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Most of the guests on the first floor are from the middle class and have no connection with Lady Sorel."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_8 = {
    Text = "It seems the investigation has reached a deadlock."
  },
  AvgDialog_23353_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Among the nobles who attended the funeral, few have survived. Dexter is now in grave danger."
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Maid's wish"
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Move aside, give me three scoops! I still have several daughters at home..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Can a small fraudster have an invitation to \"The Name of the Rose\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_12 = {
    Text = "She is not only a little liar but also a genuine maid to Lady Sorel."
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You cleared your throat and stepped forward, pulling out your investigation badge from your pocket"
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Londinium Police Investigation. Please step back, everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_15 = {Text = "Police?!"},
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Today's deal, I mean event, ends here! Karen suddenly remembered she had urgent matters..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I mean, except for you, Miss Karen. The others may leave now."
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The crowd gradually dispersed. Karen fidgeted uneasily, but soon calmed down."
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_19 = {
    Text = "She carefully examined you and Ramona, then suddenly broke into a radiant smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Just to clarify, this isn't your ordinary bathwater!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Yes, Officer, Karen won't go anywhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Well... Karen is just a humble maid. I wonder what I could possibly do to help you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Don't worry. We're not interested in your little business, just need you to..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_23 = {Text = "Whoa—!!"},
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_24 = {
    Text = "A bucket of cold water pours over you and Ramona, instantly soaking both of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_25 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_26 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_27 = {
    Text = "She wasn't lying; it really smells like roses inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Heh heh! So you're trying to fool me into going to jail with you, huh?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_29 = {
    Text = "<Big:Catch me if you can!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Karen added rare bath salts from Ceylon, along with 18 spices such as lavender, citrus, and clove..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Karen made a face at you, lifted her skirt, and ran away as fast as she could."
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Don't run! Just wait until I catch you—I'll teach you a lesson!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Finally, steam it with rose petals from southern Constantin for a day and a night. Even now, the fragrance still lingers!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The secret to Lady Sorel's eternal youth lies within this fragrant bath water..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_6 = {Text = "Whoa—!!"},
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Oh my gosh, that's amazing! Can it heal the scars on my face...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Don't push... Line up, everyone! Listen up, five Florins per scoop!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23354_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Give me a scoop! I was here first...!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Lady's guide"
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Boss... I found this beneath the wheel!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Another rose? Heh, quite confident. It seems this killer is issuing a challenge to us."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Check which nobles who attended the funeral are still present."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_13 = {
    Text = "They are in great danger now."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Mythag Underground Passage"
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_15 = {
    Text = "They walked through the dim underground passage, their somewhat disordered footsteps echoing around them."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_16 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_17 = {
    Text = "It's rare to see you like this. Don't tell me you're too scared to sleep because of the ghost?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Sure. Now, everyone in the circle is on edge. Just writing letters of condolence has nearly killed me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Still have to deal with those pesky detectives and tabloid reporters..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Brinsborough Road, 19:30  
Three weeks after Lady Sorel's death]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
Stay at school for the next couple of days.
As the survivor of the funeral, you are now our top priority for protection.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, I'll keep an eye on him and correct someone's bad habit of drinking and messing around."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Hanging out? It's clearly normal social entertainment, yet you make it sound so terrible."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_23 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:Ahem, please calm down, both of you...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_24 = {
    Text = "I heard Lady Sorel turned into a handful of Silver after her death. She is now being extracted in the Awakener department, awaiting <Yellow:Second Awakening>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_25 = {
    Text = "You're well-informed. However, the success rate of a second Awake is extremely low. Don't count on it."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Understood. I just didn't expect a Silver to emerge after an Awakener's death. What is different about the new Awakener compared to the original one?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
Will inherit the predecessor's memory and personality, but with significantly reduced abilities.
Therefore, I have always reminded our Awakener to avoid reckless deaths.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
Does Lady Sorel, as an Awakener, have any special skills?
Someone of her status must be incredibly powerful.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Doll shook her head."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Hurried footsteps echo through the narrow alleyway. Beyond the distant onlookers, the detectives of Londinium are busy."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
Her records are top-secret in Mythag, even I have no access.
But I heard it's about some... well, rather frivolous skills.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_31 = {
    Text = "This explains why she, an Awakener, was still assassinated in the opera house in full view of everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Floating? Could it be something like charming the opposite sex or eternal youth?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Perhaps, but I have no interest in pointless speculation."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Top Secret Information... Why?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Of course, it's because she holds a high position. Sorel and Mythag have long maintained close ties with the government, but her origins remain a mystery."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_36 = {
    Text = "What about the other victims? Family ties, financial transactions, political stance... I need to know everything. Who benefits the most from these cases?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_37 = {
    Text = "The investigation is ongoing, but progress is slow. These nobles' social networks are more complex than the branches of the Isis River."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The celebrities attending the funeral are dying one by one."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Given the current situation, Dexter will likely become the next target..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The deceased is @1: Baron Cavendish, 32 years old. After leaving a gathering with friends in the middle of the night, he was found here at 4 AM."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, that's precisely why I brought you here."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_41 = {
    Text = "While speaking, you have already arrived at your destination. Doll stopped and pointed to a locked door in the corner of the dark room."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_42 = {
    Text = "You once entered Ramona's Artificial Domain through it, an unforgettable memory."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Since traditional investigation is difficult, try using <Yellow:Artificial Domain>."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Got it! I can return to the scene via Lady Sorel's Domain and conduct a thorough investigation!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Sorel's Domain alone isn't enough; we need the Domains of her <Blue:maid Karen>, and even more related individuals, to gather clues."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Is Karen the maid?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Doll nodded."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_48 = {
    Text = "She was devastated by Sorel's death and vowed to fully cooperate with our investigation to find the real killer."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
Mythag, Artificial Domain Entrance
Before departure]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_5 = {
    Text = "It's already the 7th noble to die under unusual circumstances. I remember the first one was..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Once everything was ready, Ramona turned to look at Dexter."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Don't leave the school, and don't wander around inside it. Wait for us to return."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Here we go again with that tone you use to pacify children. Do you remember that I am your elder, your respected father?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_53 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_54 = {
    Text = [[
Alright, alright, I surrender...
I'll stay here every day, not going anywhere, and I promise not to cause any trouble for everyone.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Dexter still wore his usual smile. He placed his hands on your and Ramona's backs, giving a gentle push forward—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Let's go, kids. My life is in your hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_6 = {
    Text = "<Red:Duke Harold>. I remember this case very clearly. It was a Porsche—there are only a few in the entire kingdom!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Too bad it was smashed into scrap metal... At the time, Duke Harold, his butler, and the driver were in the car, and all three of them died."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The only thing these deceased have in common, besides being celebrities, is that they all attended Lady Sorel's funeral three weeks ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_23355_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Could it really be as the tabloids say, haunted by the <Red:Ghost of Lady Sorel>..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Rosefuneral"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Hannah hasn't gathered more intel from the police station yet... But that's okay, Reporter Hannah never gives up! Now I'm back with new info!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Intelligence 1: It is said that the cemetery was adorned today with thousands of \"Red Celebration\" roses transported from Constantine, costing a total of 10,000 Florins!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Intel 2: Guess who I just saw outside?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The Cavendish family, the Duke and Duchess of Windsor, and what everyone cares about most..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<Big:The Esteemed Duke Harold and His Only Son, Nicholas Harold!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Back then, the news of the father and son dueling over Lady Sorel caused quite a stir..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Meanwhile, at the Woodlawn Cemetery..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Today, we gather to remember and honor Sorel: @1's life."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_18 = {
    Text = "She is the Father God's most devout daughter, a virtuous and admirable woman..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Achoo...<Big:Achoo!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Outside Woodlawn Cemetery  
Three weeks ago]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Duke, have you caught a cold? You've been sneezing non-stop."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The smell of these gaudy flowers is unbearable... It must have cost at least several thousand Florins to bring them here."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Sorel maintained her nouveau riche attitude until the very end, which is quite admirable... Achoo!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Truly admirable."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Such behavior provides plenty of gossip for journalists and citizens. No wonder she has become a popular icon in Londinium."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Hmph. Pitiful tricks."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Dexter shrugged and glanced around, feeling bored."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Elegantly dressed elites gather in small groups before the grave, their deliberately hushed discussions occasionally drifting into earshot amid the officiant's prayers."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_28 = {
    Text = "<Gray:A country girl pretending to be a foreign noble...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_29 = {
    Text = "<Gray:The clothes she was buried in were made of flannel, right? The texture feels great...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Zzz... Zzz..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_30 = {
    Text = "<Gray:...the king's mistress... and the prince... yet the queen turns a blind eye...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_31 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_32 = {
    Text = "It seems this lady isn't very well-liked."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_33 = {
    Text = [[
Dust to dust, ashes to ashes.
Lady Sorel's soul has entered Elysian, returning to the Father's embrace...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Noble Dexter, judging by your reaction, you seem to disagree with our view on Lady Sorel?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Are you one of her admirers? Or rather... used to be? Will be?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_36 = {
    Text = "A burst of quiet laughter erupted from the crowd, and Dexter frowned."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I didn't have much personal interaction with Lady Sorel during her lifetime, nor am I interested in the conflicts between her and you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_38 = {
    Text = "However, my common sense tells me that discussing the deceased at a funeral is not something a gentleman should do."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Beware of a female ghost knocking at midnight."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Ahem... Are the camera and light meter ready? Clumsy, hurry up!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_40 = {
    Text = "...May the Father God protect my child."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Night falls. A brand-new Ferdinand Porsche car travels on the uneven gravel road."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Damn, those tabloid reporters are everywhere I go."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_43 = {
    Text = "There's a rumor going around that Nicholas and I got into a huge fight over Sorel. What nonsense!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_44 = {
    Text = "How could commoners understand the Duke's true thoughts? They would rather believe in those clichéd, absurd love stories."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Love, huh. Nicholas also told me it's called \"love.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_46 = {
    Text = "I usually turn a blind eye to their antics, but this woman has set her sights on the hunting grounds in the outskirts of Shoreditch."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Greed will inevitably bring disaster, so don't blame us for being ruthless..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_48 = {Text = "—!!"},
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_49 = {
    Text = "The car screeched to a halt, the sharp braking sound piercing the tranquility of the night."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_5 = {Text = "Buzz..."},
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_50 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Ouch!! My back...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Your driving skills are getting more and more absurd, Fred. Have you forgotten how to brake?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_52 = {
    Text = "<Shake:No, sir... there... there's something... ahead...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_53 = {
    Text = "The shadow stood alone in the cold moonlight, with a smile painted in blood extending to the hollow corners of the mask's eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_54 = {
    Text = "He stood at the end of the deserted alley, arms outstretched, softly humming a cheerful drinking song."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_55 = {
    Text = "<RedItalic:Let's raise our goblets high; the wine within is intoxicating.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_56 = {
    Text = "<RedItalic:Happy times may be delightful, but a sincere death is even more precious...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Good evening, Mr. Harold."
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Ready to shoot? Great... 3, 2, 1, action!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Good morning, friends of Mythag! This is Hannah, your school reporter, bringing you an exclusive report!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The funeral of <Blue:Lady Sorel>, a socialite beloved by the citizens of Londinium, is being held at Woodlawn Cemetery, not far from me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23356_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Time flies! It's been a whole week since the mysterious death of Lady Sorel at the opera house."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You're a smart person, Sorel. Mr. Binder is the best connection we can make, got it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_11 = {
    Text = "It's fine if you don't like him. As long as you obtain his property, you can do whatever you wish and date whomever you desire."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_12 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I don't like this, Father."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
Families like ours can't afford to do as we please.
Look at your mother's illness. Can you bear to see her suffer like this?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_15 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Cough, cough... Don't worry about me, Sorel. I won't last much longer anyway...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_16 = {Text = "Mom..."},
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Sorel, your mother and I are old now. You are our only hope."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_18 = {
    Text = "We didn't pour so much money into you out of charity; we expect returns someday, got it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Don't do anything you'll regret."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_2 = {
    Text = "245 years before the Alluvial Era, southern Constant"
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_20 = {
    Text = "On a silent night, the girl sat by the bed, gazing absentmindedly at the bright moonlight outside the window."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_21 = {
    Text = "She hugged her knees, silently cheering herself up as she used to."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid, Sorel. You'll find a way."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_23 = {
    Text = "<Red:What a pity... Is this the price of beauty?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_24 = {
    Text = "<Red:Even the most flawless moon, once fallen to the mortal realm, will be tainted by dust.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The mist in the corner rustles and writhes, coalescing into a chaotic human figure."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_26 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Who are you? I'm calling for help—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Shh... I am but a wandering soul creeping through the world; my identity is fictional, and my appearance is a disguise."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Nice to meet you. You can call me <Red:\"N\">."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Sorel, my beautiful Sorel. Here's a new dress I bought for you, your favorite white one."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_30 = {
    Text = "For some indescribable amusement, I gather and rewrite stories.\nWhen I encounter intriguing humans, I don't mind offering help—within reason."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_31 = {
    Text = "So feel free to tell me your confusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
The voice of the dark mist is low and melodious, with an inexplicable allure.
The girl gradually calms down.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_33 = {
    Text = "My father isn't wise enough, and Mr. Binder is far from an ideal match. He is greedy and addicted to gambling; within three years, he will squander the family fortune."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_34 = {
    Text = "But I'm too weak to fight back against them."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_35 = {
    Text = "As for my mother... She is always crying. She cannot help me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The girl lowered her head, her expression gloomy."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I'm exhausted. Exhausted from constantly worrying about money, exhausted from the feeling that my fate is in someone else's hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_38 = {
    Text = "You said you could help me, so can you give me a large sum of money?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_39 = {
    Text = "I'm afraid not, my child."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_4 = {
    Text = "That's beautiful, thank you, Father. But it looks too precious..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Kill for me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Hahaha... That's not something a 13-year-old lady should say, but it's precisely why I chose you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
Sorry, I can't kill for you.
But I assure you, if we sign a contract, you will get some "necessary assistance."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_43 = {
    Text = "These methods are not direct, yet they are deadly enough."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_44 = {
    Text = "They will help you climb to unprecedented heights, take in unseen vistas, and you'll never have to marry an old, bald gambler."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_45 = {
    Text = "The girl listened quietly, a smile slowly appearing on her icy face."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_46 = {
    Text = "I've always been a pretty and popular child since I was young. Many people approached me, wanting to be friends."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_47 = {
    Text = "They eye me like jackals, each one eager to get something back from me with interest — just as my father used to say."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_48 = {
    Text = "So I realized early on that miracles would never arrive for me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_49 = {
    Text = "I'm not stupid, Mr. N. You've thrown out so many tempting terms, so..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Yes, it's very valuable. It cost me a full 200 sterlings."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_50 = {
    Text = "What is the price?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_51 = {
    Text = [[
Londinium Outskirts
Lambert's Residence]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Mr. Lambert, you are accused of being involved in the murder of Lady Sorel. Please come with us."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Time seemed to have long since stopped. Pale daylight poured down, draping the empty hall in a white veil."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_54 = {
    Text = "The desolate wind keeps blowing through the cracks of the shattered window, rustling the roses and dead leaves on the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Ahem, you've finally arrived... I've been waiting for you for such a long time..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_56 = {
    Text = "The decrepit old man sinks into the soft velvet chair, gently swirling a glass of red wine."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_57 = {
    Text = "If I say she wasn't killed by me, would you believe it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_58 = {
    Text = "As the sole beneficiary of Sorel's will and recently buried in debt due to gambling, you have the perfect motive for crime."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Furthermore..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_6 = {
    Text = "200 sterling?! My father's annual income is only... No, we must return it immediately."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Ramona pulled out the exquisite dagger."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Here is what we found at the crime scene: a precious import from the Far East."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_62 = {
    Text = "We found its seller, and the antique dealer admitted that Mr. Lambert had purchased it two months ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Perhaps you could explain why you brought it to the opera that day?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Reason? Hehehe..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_65 = {
    Text = "The creaking sound of a chair reaches my ears."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Lambert struggled to his feet and took slow, painful steps toward Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_67 = {
    Text = [[
Because she deserved to die.
It was I who elevated her to a high position, granted her wealth, status, and fame... I orchestrated everything from behind the scenes.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_68 = {
    Text = "What about her? After becoming successful, she not only failed to repay me but also wanted to distance herself from me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Take a look at this house... I've pawned everything I could, leaving only a house full of roses."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You deserve the best, Sorel."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_70 = {
    Text = [[
This was my wife's favorite flower when she was alive.
After her death, the only bond between Sorel and me was also lost.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_71 = {
    Text = "So I decided to kill her..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Petals drift down from the sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_73 = {
    Text = "The old man looked up, most of his face devoured by D-Slime, black goo streaming down from the corners of his eyes like tears."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_74 = {
    Text = "...just like I'm determined to kill you all."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_8 = {
    Text = "In three days, Mr. Binder will visit our home. At that time, wear this dress and get along well with him."
  },
  AvgDialog_23359_Content_9 = {
    Text = "...That arrogant old man? I don't like him."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Fate's prisoner"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_10 = {
    Text = "<Red:Hehe.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_11 = {
    Text = "<Red:I like {Male=him,Female=her}.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_12 = {
    Text = "She seems to be afraid of something."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_13 = {
    Text = "...Do you really want me to play this game with you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Lady Sorel hesitated for a moment and then nodded gently."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_15 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Two glasses of champagne should be fine...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
I accept your proposal. Let's settle this quickly.
What is the first question?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_17 = {Text = "Hmm..."},
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Sorel propped her chin with one hand, her slender fingers lightly tapping her cheek."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_19 = {
    Text = "First question: How did Mythag know someone would come to kill me tonight?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Drink, drink?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_20 = {
    Text = "If you can't answer, can I reasonably suspect that you are also involved to some extent?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_21 = {
    Text = "This isn't a question that can be answered lightly..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You picked up the champagne from the table and gulped it down in one go."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Unexpectedly, the pale golden liquid has a light and delicate taste, with a hint of citrus aroma."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_24 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Hmm... It's actually quite tasty.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Drink slowly, Keeper. This bottle is worth a house in the downtown area of Londinium."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Ahem... <Big:What?!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Next is the second question. This one is from the ladies of Londinium..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Sorel gives you a slight smile. For some reason, you have a bad feeling."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Who is the birth mother of Noble Dexter's daughter?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Miss Doll said I'm not old enough to drink, and I can't drink during investigations either...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_30 = {Text = "Poof—!!"},
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You spit out the wine you hadn't yet swallowed. Sorel raises an eyebrow, and Karen immediately wipes the spilled wine off the table."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_32 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:Tsk tsk, even a small bite is money! That's enough for me to buy a new necklace at Harold's Department Store...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_33 = {
    Text = "I didn't expect Lady Sorel to be interested in such boring gossip. What a surprise... Ha, haha."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Here's a secret: We \"socialites\" spend at least half our day immersed in gossip."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Otherwise, how do you think <Blue:Madame Sorel's Salon> keeps running?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_36 = {
    Text = "... imaginable."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Don't buy into this whole foster father-daughter act. According to insider rumors, the child's biological mother is actually the mistress of a certain influential figure..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
Don't, don't talk nonsense.
Lord Dexter is upright and self-respecting. He is nothing like what people think...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_39 = {
    Text = "%player%, the communicator has been on the entire time. I heard everything."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Sorry, Lady Sorel."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_40 = {
    Text = "I advise you not to waste your efforts; even I don't know who my birth mother is."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_41 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Not sure if it's the alcohol, but you suddenly feel a bit dizzy."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_43 = {
    Text = "It's absolutely not what everyone thinks it is? Then what exactly is it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_44 = {
    Text = "You shake your head and pick up the wine glass from the table."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Is this question important to you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_46 = {
    Text = "It doesn't matter, it's just to make up three questions."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_47 = {
    Text = "<Red:Good job, Sorel. Next...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Sorel gently presses down on the glass in front of you. For some reason, you feel as if the muscles on her face twitched momentarily."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Hey kid, don't drink recklessly. Let's consider this drink on you. What I really want to ask is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_5 = {
    Text = "What if I told you that I've always known who wants to kill me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_50 = {
    Text = "As soon as the words left her mouth, Madam Sorel's face suddenly began to twist and blur..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Then completely transformed into another appearance."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Good evening, {Male=sir,Female=miss}. Please allow me to convey my greetings through another's words."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_53 = {
    Text = "In ten minutes, you will completely forget the entire content of this conversation, so don't be afraid to answer any of my questions."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_54 = {
    Text = "My question is also quite simple..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_55 = {
    Text = "His face is enveloped in a thick black mist. You can't make out his features, yet he feels strangely familiar."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_56 = {
    Text = "It feels like a very long time ago. You might have crossed paths somewhere, or perhaps he stood afar, watching you, lingering for a long while."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Was your previous name @2?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_58 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_59 = {
    Text = "The world seemed to recede like a tide in an instant."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_6 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_60 = {
    Text = "All the sounds disappeared, and all the images vanished."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_61 = {
    Text = "His lips moved silently, but you knew he had accurately spoken your <Yellow:original name>."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_62 = {
    Text = "%player%? It's completely silent over there. What's happening?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_63 = {
    Text = "You open your parched lips, but no sound comes out."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_64 = {
    Text = "A dense buzzing noise incessantly entwines and agitates deep within your consciousness, tearing at your nerves with madness."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_65 = {
    Text = "<Change>I don't know..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_66 = {Text = "...?"},
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Stay right there, %player%. I'm coming up now—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_68 = {Text = "Bang!"},
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_69 = {
    Text = "The lights in the theater suddenly went out."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Play this game well with me, and I will tell you the answer."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_70 = {
    Text = "At the sole source of light in front of the stage, that familiar yet strange shadow appeared once again."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_71 = {
    Text = "He holds a rose, eerie chants emanating from the writhing black mist on his face."
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_72 = {
    Text = "<RedItalic:Prisoner of Fate.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_73 = {
    Text = "<RedItalic:You disguise yourself as an apostle of light to deceive the masses, venturing into forbidden unknowns in pursuit of truth.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_74 = {
    Text = "<RedItalic:Lost memories grow and pour from hollow eyes, your pitiful future dies in the melody of the flute.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_75 = {
    Text = "<RedItalic:Now, I command you—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_76 = {
    Text = "<Red:Open your eyes.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Threat?
You frowned, about to refuse her, but then noticed another detail.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23360_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Beneath the playful banter lie constricted pupils and slightly whitened knuckles."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Drinking song"
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ah! Wh-Who are you? This is Madame Sorel's private box!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Karen orders you to leave immediately. Don't spoil the lady's mood... <Big:Ouch!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You push aside the chattering maid and approach a lavishly dressed woman."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Enveloped in fine silk and jewels, she glimmers like a blooming rose under the lights"
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Such a fragile, tempting-to-crush glimmer."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_15 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Now is not the time to admire beauties; we have less than half an hour left, %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Huh? Ah...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Good evening, Lady Sorel. Londinium Police Dept @2 Investigation Unit, %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_19 = {
    Text = "@2 Investigation Department...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ladies and gentlemen, good evening."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Don't try to fool me. Everyone in the circle knows that the @2 Investigation Department is just a front for Mythag, attached to the police department."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_21 = {
    Text = "But you look unfamiliar... the new kid Mythag just took in?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_22 = {
    Text = "It's always Mythag! Every time you come looking for my lady, it never spells good news! Either someone has died, a disaster has struck, or you're here to borrow money..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Sorel lightly raised her eyelashes and glanced at Karen, seemingly nonchalant."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Karen, this is not a place for just anyone. How did {Male=he,Female=she} get in, is it related to you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Ah, ah? Madam, what are you saying! Karen's loyalty is as pure as the <Blue:Cameo> ruby on your crown!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:Of course, please don't misunderstand. There's absolutely no intention of coveting it...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_27 = {
    Text = "In short, my lady, Karen will dig it out for you now—a loyal heart!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Shh... Karen. One more word, and I'll punish you with a Leo Fang."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_29 = {
    Text = "She gave the maid an indisputable order in a gentle tone."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The story I am narrating tonight takes place in the foggy Londinium."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_30 = {
    Text = "What?! A...<Small:Wow!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Karen belatedly covered her mouth, not daring to utter another word."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Sorel takes a sip of champagne, her light red eyes cautiously watching you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_33 = {
    Text = "It's almost time for my favorite track. I don't want to miss it. So..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You have one minute. Speak up. What do you want?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_35 = {
    Text = "8:40, 20 minutes remaining."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
Understood.
Madam Sorel, please follow me to leave this place.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_37 = {
    Text = "<Red:Someone is going to assassinate you.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_38 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_39 = {
    Text = "As they spoke, black slime continuously oozed from the floor and ceiling of the booth, then congealed into writhing masses."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_4 = {
    Text = "@1 year, a country girl arrived by carriage and transformed this place into a city blooming with roses."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_40 = {Text = "Sob sob..."},
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_41 = {
    Text = "<Change> Awooooo—!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Beautiful flowers continually bloom in the city's corners, becoming the perfect nourishment for stories."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Love, desire, hatred. And of course, of course... there's also what you and I love the most..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_7 = {
    Text = "<Red:Murder.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Next, please enjoy the show in silence—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23361_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You draw back the dark red curtain before you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Camellia dame"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You have the right to refuse. Leave those people to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Then, use your second Awake to make a dramatic public revival, clearing yourself of suspicion."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_101 = {
    Text = "After all, no one would be foolish enough to think that a dead person is the murderer."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_102 = {
    Text = "Am I right, Lady Sorel?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_103 = {
    Text = "Heh... Your reasoning is cute. So, how do you explain this shadow?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_104 = {
    Text = "It killed someone in plain sight. How can you prove my relationship with it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_105 = {Text = "Scent."},
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_106 = {
    Text = [[
Last time you pounced on me, I smelled it. You all have the same scent...
<Red:The scent of decaying roses>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_107 = {
    Text = "Isn't it actually an existence like your avatar?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_108 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_109 = {
    Text = "As expected of a Keeper, your sense of smell is sharp."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Those people up there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_110 = {
    Text = "Sorel removed the red glove from her right hand, and a strong stench of decay immediately spread."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_111 = {
    Text = "Beneath the jagged, intersecting scars and scratches, dark red letters faintly appear."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_112 = {Text = "<Red:\"N\">"},
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_113 = {
    Text = "Sorel slowly raised her hand to just below her nose and gently sniffed."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_114 = {
    Text = "See this scar on the back of my hand? As long as it exists, my contract with <Yellow:Him> will remain in effect."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_115 = {
    Text = "I must continue to incite conflicts and create chaos as He demands... Those deceased nobles are the sacrifices I offer to Him."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_116 = {
    Text = "But I'm already tired of it. Humans and most Awakeners crave order by nature; only madmen find pleasure in endless chaos."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_117 = {
    Text = "The cost of breaking this contract is simple: <Red:Death>."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_118 = {
    Text = "...So this was your ultimate goal all along."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_119 = {
    Text = [[
Sure. The so-called nobles, including my father, are merely side dishes.
Dealing with them doesn't cost lives.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_12 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_120 = {
    Text = "He never reveals Himself. In fact, He hasn't responded to me for a long time."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_121 = {
    Text = "For countless nights, I knelt and wept, praying that He would release me from the contract."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_122 = {
    Text = "However, I heard nothing and saw nothing. The only response was a deathly silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_123 = {
    Text = "So I don't want to wait any longer. This time, I'll sever this contract myself"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_124 = {
    Text = "...even at the cost of death."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Sorry, this isn't something you're able to know right now."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_14 = {
    Text = "It's alright, Miss Doll."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I still have some doubts and theories. It would be best if I could verify them in the Domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Doll nodded."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Remember the info dealer you met in the Domain? We conducted an investigation into her supplier and discovered a big surprise."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The identities, profiles, and networks of those deceased nobles..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Here's the investigation report just sent back from the police station. Open it and take a look."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Mythag Infirmary"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You take the investigation report and start flipping through the pages."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_21 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_22 = {
    Text = "So it is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_23 = {
    Text = "What do you need me to do in there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Doll hands you a thick file folder."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_25 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:It's simple, just a negotiation.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
The third artificial domain: Covent Theater
On the day of the "Rose Name" performance]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The magnificent singing flowed ceaselessly in the theater, like a floating stream."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_28 = {
    Text = "The audience below showed astonishment, swaying gently to the melody of the music, already lost in the dream woven by the notes."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Speaking of which, this play was once called \"Death of the Rose\""
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I heard things are going well with Ramona. How about you? How are you feeling now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The protagonist is a country girl exploring Cité on her own. She has nothing but her youthful and pretty face."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Just like how I was back then."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The lady is a princess in exile. How can a country girl like me compare to you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Heh... The so-called foreign princess is nothing but a facade. I'm a true-born country girl from Constance."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Ah... <Big:Ah!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_35 = {
    Text = "<Gray:I can't believe the lady just told me such a significant secret!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_36 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Could it be that I gave the invitation to that curly-haired guy, and the lady found out and wants to kill me to silence me...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_37 = {
    Text = "\"Rose Death\" was my favorite play when I was a child."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Visiting friends, recovering from illness, and shopping..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_39 = {
    Text = "I've come up with many excuses just to stand outside the theater and listen for five minutes."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Feeling much better."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
I'm just too busy. Piano, embroidery, and etiquette...
I have to learn every skill that pleases the nobles.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_41 = {
    Text = "The lady's elegance surpasses even that of the royal princess! Isn't this what the proverb says, uh, \"The early bird catches the worm...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Ah, no, opportunities are only for those who are prepared!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_43 = {
    Text = "<Gray:I'm such a fool. Tonight might just be my end, heh...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_44 = {
    Text = "I finished listening to the opera intermittently later on, but I didn't like its ending."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_45 = {
    Text = "That country girl successfully infiltrated Cité's high society, fell in love with an incompetent nobleman, and ultimately died because of him."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Such a sad ending... Karen doesn't like it either. Karen hates tragedies!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Yeah, nobody likes tragedies."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_48 = {
    Text = "After purchasing the theater, the first thing I did was change the title and ending of \"Rose Death.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
I can finally do whatever I want.
Or so I <Yellow:thought> I could finally do as I pleased.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_5 = {
    Text = "That's good. It seems Winkle's medical tech tinkering is somewhat useful after all."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Sorel gazed entranced at the golden liquid in her glass, watching the bubbles gurgle up from the bottom."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Wealth, fame, knowledge... People pursue these because once they possess them, they attain freedom."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_52 = {
    Text = "The freedom to change the ending of an opera you dislike, or the freedom to buy a cameo ruby you adore"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Humans are just that simple a creature."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Madam, why bring this up all of a sudden? It's quite heavy, haha..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_55 = {
    Text = "You've always been a clever child. Even without me, you'll be just fine."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Sorel gently patted Karen's head."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Master, Mistress..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_58 = {
    Text = "So, you're saying this because you plan to abandon Karen..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_59 = {
    Text = "No one will abandon you, Karen. You have always been free."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Next, I won't beat around the bush. %player%, you may need to prepare to enter the Artificial Domain once again."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_60 = {Text = "Hiss..."},
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_61 = {
    Text = "A black shadow gradually rises in the corner and silently glides towards Sorel's back."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Sorel listened intently to the melodious singing from below the stage, seemingly oblivious to the commotion behind her."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_63 = {Text = "Hiss..."},
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_64 = {
    Text = "The rustling sound gradually weakened, and the shadow no longer moved."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_65 = {Text = "Hmm...?"},
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Sorel turned around in surprise."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Good evening, Lady Sorel. It seems you have lost something?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_68 = {
    Text = "<Change>Madam..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_69 = {
    Text = "The shadow in your hand felt like a piece of rag, softly tossed in front of Sorel."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_7 = {Text = "What...?!"},
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Catching this guy wasn't easy. Thanks to our last encounter, I finally figured out its battle patterns."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_71 = {
    Text = "<Red:I'm back...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Sorel didn't even glance at the shadow at her feet. She stared at you intently, her expression grave."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_73 = {
    Text = "You again... Why have you returned? Wasn't the lesson from the last Domain enough for you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_74 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Miss Doll's guess was correct; she realized she was in a Domain.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_75 = {
    Text = "I just wanted to confirm a few things."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_76 = {
    Text = "You swiftly lift the mask off the shadowy figure's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_77 = {
    Text = "The next second, the shadow dispersed like ink dissolving in water."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_78 = {
    Text = "A single deep-red rose rests quietly between you and Sorel."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_79 = {
    Text = "The white eggs on the petals gently wriggled, slowly crawling onto Sorel's skirt and merging with her."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Doll frowned and instinctively touched the glass apparatus containing a fresh brain."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_80 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Game over, Lady Sorel."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_82 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Third Artificial Domain Investigation Log>\n\n■Domain ID: M-B04-003\n■Setup Time: A.F. 315, June @1, 8:00-9:00 PM (The day of Sorel's death).\n■Setup Location: Covent Theatre"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_83 = {
    Text = "\n■ Domain Owner: Sorel @2.\n■ Domain Infiltrator: %player%.\n\n■ Infiltration Goal: <Yellow:Uncover Sorel's conspiracy and engage in \"necessary\" negotiation.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_84 = {
    Text = "You again! Lady Sorel, leave this guy to Karen..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Sorel shook her head."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Stand down, Karen."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_87 = {
    Text = "%player%, you rushed in just to show me this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Lady Sorel, who always enjoyed grandeur, came to listen to the play on the day of her death, accompanied only by her personal maid."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_89 = {
    Text = "What kind of talk is this? Is it wrong for the lady and me to quietly enjoy the music?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_9 = {
    Text = "This is not my decision. If possible, I hope you can stay here obediently until the day you are fully recovered."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, Miss Karen. Remember those merchants on Lincoln High Street who sold information about Sorel's whereabouts?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_91 = {
    Text = "We have investigated. <Yellow:The information they have was released by you.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Selling employer information is a serious crime. I guess you have your master's permission."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_93 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_94 = {
    Text = "<Shake:N-No way...> It was Karen herself who wanted to earn some extra cash. It has nothing to do with Lady Sorel!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_95 = {
    Text = "You cannot falsely accuse my lady like this!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Ignoring Karen's protests, you turn to look at Lady Sorel."
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_97 = {
    Text = [[
As for those deceased nobles, almost all of them had conflicts with you in terms of politics and commerce.
May I reasonably infer...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_98 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:You staged your own death and used it to remove all obstacles, including your father.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23362_Content_99 = {
    Text = [[
Publicly declaring Mr. Lambert as the sole beneficiary of the will was merely to entice him into taking risks.
Even if he failed, the weapon and motive would still attract police attention.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Masked harmony"
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Received. Everything on the second floor is currently normal."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_11 = {
    Text = "There are about twenty minutes until the performance... With nothing else to do, I'll go find Lady Sorel first."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Sure, be cautious. May the Silver Key guide your way."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The same play, the same corridor."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You skillfully draw back the curtain of the luxurious private box."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_15 = {
    Text = "With the rich aroma of wine and the clinking of jewelry, a soft object suddenly falls into your arms."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You've finally arrived. I've been waiting for you for such a long time..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Sorel affectionately wraps her arms around you, her warm breath making your face flush."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_18 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Wait, wait for me?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_19 = {
    Text = "So, where's the discussion... Wait, aren't you Mrs. Bernard?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Second Artificial Domain: Covent Theatre
The day of Sorel's death]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Cough. Londinium Police Department @2 Investigation Unit, %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
Don't try to fool me.
Everyone in the know is aware that the @2 Investigation Department is merely a front for Mythag at the police station~]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Oops, did I let your secret slip...? Sorry, I think I've had a bit too much to drink."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Sorel said, touching her rosy cheeks."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_24 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Why is she drinking...? She was completely sober last time.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_25 = {
    Text = "It's you! Madam, this guy is a robber, {Male=he,Female=she} stole Karen's invitation!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Weren't all the invitations sent out? Why are there still some left?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_27 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_28 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Uh, actually... In fact, this...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Karen stammered, like a machine that had jammed."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Second Artificial Domain Investigation Log II>\n\n■Domain ID: M-B04-002\n■Setup Time: Holocene 315, June 1st, 8:00-9:00 PM (The day of Sorel's death).\n■Setup Location: Covent Theater"
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
Sorry for the embarrassment, {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%.
My maid means no harm, she's just a bit silly.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Today is a day worth celebrating! The theater I invested in is performing my favorite play."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Sending someone at this time, are those old fogeys at Mythag doing this on purpose?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Sorry to bother you, Lady Sorel. We have received intelligence indicating that someone will attempt to assassinate you tonight."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_34 = {
    Text = "It's not safe here. Please follow me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_35 = {Text = "I refuse."},
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_36 = {Text = "...?"},
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Sorel took a light sip of the champagne in her glass, fluttered her long lashes, and gave you a friendly wink."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_38 = {
    Text = "You were sent to protect me, right? Since I already have a little knight, why leave?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Unfortunately, reality isn't as beautiful as a picture book. A lone knight cannot save the princess; he can only help her escape."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_4 = {
    Text = "■Domain Owner: Sorel @2\n■Domain Intruders: %player%, Ramona\n\n■Objective: <Yellow:Based on the results of the first Domain intrusion, find the source of Silver's fluctuation on the first floor>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Run away... But to where? Somewhere the bad guys can't find?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_41 = {
    Text = "You can think of it this way..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Pfft. Is there really a place in this world where bad people can't be found? I've never seen such a thing."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_43 = {
    Text = "At the 10:30 direction, a man is sneaking up. Quickly head to the right exit; we'll trap him together."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_44 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Sorry, Lady Sorel. I'll be back shortly."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Good, we came prepared this time, avoided Karen's bathwater, and managed to snatch two invitations from her."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_6 = {
    Text = "This is truly satisfying!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I must say, your nimble dodging left a deep impression on me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Ahem, let's get back to the main topic. Any disturbances on the first floor?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23363_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Temporarily safe. Last time in the Domain, there was dimmed Silver activity at the ten o'clock direction. I'll keep an eye on it this time."
  },
  AvgDialog_23364_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
Second Artificial Domain: Covent Theatre
Second-Floor Hallway]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23364_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Good. The second Artificial Domain capture operation starts now!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23364_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You stretched your limbs and swiftly charged at the man."
  },
  AvgDialog_23364_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Be careful. He's just around the corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_23364_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Small:Shh... Don't speak. I see him.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23364_Content_4 = {
    Text = "A man conceals himself not far from the box, almost blending with the shadows behind him. His heavy, sluggish breathing indicates that he is an elder."
  },
  AvgDialog_23364_Content_5 = {
    Text = "As soon as you finished speaking, the shadow subtly wriggled for a moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_23364_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Who's there?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23364_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You were at least 30 feet away from him, yet you were still discovered."
  },
  AvgDialog_23364_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You're quite sharp, saving me the trouble of greeting you. Ramona, are you ready?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23364_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Always ready for battle."
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_1 = {Text = "Hmm—!!"},
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_10 = {
    Text = "What is this—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_11 = {
    Text = "When I came to my senses, there was no one in sight."
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_12 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_13 = {
    Text = "This guy isn't the masked shadow. It might be an enemy's trick."
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I'll go after him. You quickly check Sorel's booth."
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Understood. Stay in touch."
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_16 = {
    Text = "After Ramona hurriedly left, you picked up the item the man had just thrown."
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_17 = {
    Text = "This is an exquisite and sharp dagger with intricate carvings on the hilt, appearing quite expensive."
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Does he really think he can kill Lady Sorel with this thing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Moreover, for an elderly person, his movements are surprisingly nimble... A Dissolution patient?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The old man is easily knocked to the ground by you. He quickly raises his hand and tightly covers his face with his sleeve."
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_20 = {
    Text = "If it's a mutated Dissolution patient, they might've killed Sorel"
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You scratched your head in confusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The performance is about to begin. Anyway, let's head back first."
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Alright, who are you? Why did you attack Lady Sorel?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Interrogate me? Heh... What do you think you are? Tell me, who is your boss?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_5 = {
    Text = "François or Oliver @2? I need to... *cough* talk to him."
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_6 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The man unhesitatingly named two high-ranking officers at the police station, his tone filled with barely concealed arrogance and nonchalance."
  },
  AvgDialog_23365_Content_8 = {
    Text = "He suddenly raised his hand and fiercely threw a glowing object."
  },
  AvgDialog_23366_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
First Artificial Domain: Lincoln High Street
The Day of Sorel's Death]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23366_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Friendly reminder: It's already 6:15 PM, and we still need to figure out how to get an invitation to enter the opera house."
  },
  AvgDialog_23366_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Specifically, it's an invitation to tonight's premiere opera <Blue:\"The Rose Name\">"
  },
  AvgDialog_23366_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You give Ramona a confident smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_23366_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Don't worry. I've already scouted ahead; obtaining the invitation is simple."
  },
  AvgDialog_23366_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Just follow me, Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_23366_Content_2 = {Text = "Hmm...!"},
  AvgDialog_23366_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Cough... Cough..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23366_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The bustling cityscape unfolds before you. As night falls, the streetlights come on one by one, illuminating the dazzling shop signs along the roads."
  },
  AvgDialog_23366_Content_5 = {
    Text = "People hurry through the streets, their laughter blending with the sounds of carriages into a joyful symphony."
  },
  AvgDialog_23366_Content_6 = {
    Text = "It's been a long time since I last came to the West District, and it hasn't changed a bit!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23366_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I think we can go down Lincoln Street. There's a sweet shop with the best cupcakes in the world!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23366_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I wonder what the little cakes in the Artificial Domain taste like..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23366_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ramona raised her wrist and checked the time expressionlessly."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Fallen verdict"
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Heh, those guys still have quite the appetite.
If I agreed to everything, wouldn't all these years of effort go to waste?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_11 = {
    Text = "How can that work?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_12 = {
    Text = "If you refuse, Mythag will terminate the second Awake and announce your actions to the world according to the additional terms."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_13 = {
    Text = "In fact, I'm afraid you have no other choice, Lady Sorel."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_14 = {
    Text = "No other choice? You still don't know me well, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Announce to the world... Should I reveal the existence of Dissolution or Awakeners?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_16 = {
    Text = "How about you choose one?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_17 = {
    Text = "With a smile on her lips but icy coldness in her eyes, you know you've already offended this lady."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Fortunately, her reaction was calculated by those bigwigs, so you have no choice but to stubbornly use the preset speech."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Sorry, Lady Sorel. Please don't regard this negotiation as a threat; it is a mutually beneficial collaboration. The higher-ups are absolutely sincere about it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
A contract... I understand.
It grants you special abilities, and in return, you must work for it.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_20 = {
    Text = "<Red:So boring, I'm sleepy.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The music had stopped at some point, and the entire opera house was as silent as a massive tomb."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_22 = {
    Text = "All actors, guests, and even Karen appear to be frozen, staring at you and Sorel with hollow eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_23 = {Text = "...Uh?"},
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Sorel rested her cheek on her hand, gazing at the stiff faces, and sighed softly."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_25 = {
    Text = "From the moment you stood before me again, I knew this would be the outcome."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
The worst has happened...
You probably have no idea about the presence you've summoned, Keeper.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Her voice was soft, as if afraid of disturbing that presence."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_28 = {
    Text = "A shadow from the last Domain flashes through your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Are you saying it exists...?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_3 = {
    Text = "No wonder your avatar looks so much like Him, since you have borrowed His power."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Trying to use Mythag to restrain me, those people above are smart, but they missed one thing—they didn't account for your existence."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_31 = {Text = "...Me?"},
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Knock, knock. Knock, knock."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Low drumbeats echo from afar, followed by the faint and monotonous sound of a flute."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Then you hear the singing."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_35 = {
    Text = "<RedItalic:Betrayer of fate.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_36 = {
    Text = "From the darkness, a figure steps into the spotlight. Mist floats around their face like dark tentacles, slowly unfurling to the sound of a flute."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Its song is hoarse and profane, carrying the enduring pulse of endless tides."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_38 = {
    Text = "<RedItalic:You blossom in the decaying mud, climb the towering green vines, and trample equally insignificant beings.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_39 = {
    Text = "<RedItalic:Your desires know no bounds, and your soul has long since decayed.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_4 = {
    Text = "This is none of your concern, little investigator."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_40 = {
    Text = "<RedItalic:In your morbid rose garden, I witnessed it. That silent slaughter...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_41 = {
    Text = "<Red:About to begin.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Now you've got the truth you wanted. What are you going to do next?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_6 = {
    Text = "To be honest, I really can't do much."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I'm merely following orders to negotiate with you. Here are the terms drafted by the higher-ups. Please review them, Madam."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You hand over the pre-prepared documents to Lady Sorel."
  },
  AvgDialog_23367_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Sorel quickly scanned the densely packed entries on the black-and-white paper, a mocking smile playing on her lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Don't even think about running!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_10 = {Text = "Whoa—!!"},
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You were so frightened that you hurled the rose violently."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_12 = {
    Text = "It's all eggs."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_13 = {Text = "...Yeah."},
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_14 = {
    Text = "This is crucial evidence. Go and pick it up."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I don't want to go."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Great, since neither of us wants to go, then—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Ramona turned her head to look at Dexter."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_18 = {Text = "?"},
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Someone was whispering behind my back, calling me the Warden, right? Now, the Warden commands you to pick up that flower."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You step forward, grab the shadow's mask, and yank it off with great force."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Disclaimer: I didn't say this. It was that drunk kid, Nicholas..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_21 = {
    Text = "But you didn't refute it, did you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_22 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Alright, I'll pick it up."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Dexter fiddled with his exquisite cufflinks, rolled up his sleeves, and walked over dejectedly."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_25 = {
    Text = "<Gray:What a terrifying smile... I'd better not offend her casually in the future.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Miss Doll says that Lady Sorel's Artificial Domain has been fully debugged and is ready for us to enter again."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_27 = {
    Text = "How about it? Are you confident in catching the culprit this time?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_28 = {
    Text = "You gave a slight nod."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_29 = {
    Text = "I smell something peculiar... I think I know how to locate him."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Surprisingly, there is no face under the mask as you expected—accurately speaking, there is nothing at all."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_4 = {
    Text = "He vanished like a wisp of mist."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Huh, what's this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_6 = {
    Text = "A blood-red rose rests quietly at your feet."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Another rose? I heard a rose was left at the scene of the previous cases as well..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You ponder deeply, suddenly feeling a tingling sensation at your fingertips."
  },
  AvgDialog_23368_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Lowering your head, you notice several plump white maggots crawling out of the flower petals and onto your hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_1 = {Text = "Hmm—!!"},
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Open your eyes and look at the water on us. Did you give us a chance to explain?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Uh... Let bygones be bygones! Since we're here for business, Karen should display a professional attitude to show respect."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_12 = {
    Text = "With that, she opens her chubby palm to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_13 = {
    Text = "One invitation costs ten Florins, two invitations cost twenty. No bargaining."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The show is about to start. You wouldn't want to miss it, would you, esteemed Officer?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You run your hand through your tangled, wet hair and let out a long sigh."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Ramona, my patience is running out. How about we give her a good beating first?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_17 = {
    Text = "...and so on."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Miss Karen, it's fine if we don't go to this play."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_19 = {
    Text = "But what would Lady Sorel think if she knew her most trusted maid was selling bathwater outside?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Karen was cornered at the end of the alley, frantically shielding her chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I-I'm not afraid! People like you would never get to meet Lady Sorel, liar!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_21 = {
    Text = "What does it matter if I can't see you? I'll go to the opera house entrance right now and loudly expose everything you've done..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_22 = {
    Text = "<Big:Wait a moment!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Karen hurriedly got up, rummaged in her apron for a while, and then handed you two crumpled invitations."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_24 = {
    Text = [[
Here, take it all!
Hmph, always oppressing the common folk. Be careful, or you might encounter ghosts if you keep taking night walks!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Thank you for the kind words, Miss Karen. We will be careful."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_26 = {
    Text = "You reached out joyfully. Just as you were about to touch the invitation, Karen slowly raised her hand and took it back."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You'd better just be here for the show. Don't get any funny ideas."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_28 = {
    Text = "If anything happens to Lady Sorel, Karen won't forgive you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_29 = {
    Text = "<Red:He won't let you off either.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Don't catch me, don't catch me... <Big:Aaah!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_30 = {Text = "He...?"},
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Oh dear, it seems Karen accidentally let it slip. What a mistake!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
In short, do your job and don't ask unnecessary questions.
Farewell, my dear officer~]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Karen playfully winked at you, then struggled to lift the bucket and waddled away with great effort."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
Mythag Lounge
After the first Artificial Domain ends]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_35 = {
    Text = "You received an invitation from the maid. What happened afterward?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_36 = {
    Text = "As I mentioned earlier, we entered the theater smoothly and found Lady Sorel on the second floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_37 = {
    Text = "But we still failed to stop the killer..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Help... help me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_39 = {Text = "Help me..."},
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_4 = {
    Text = "I haven't done anything yet."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_40 = {
    Text = "I watched her fall from upstairs, along with the flowers and champagne... That's everything that happened in the first Domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_41 = {
    Text = "The downfall of a beauty is truly regrettable. You look as if you're on the verge of tears."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
It's fine.
The purpose of entering the Domain is to reconstruct the crime scene, which provides clues for the subsequent investigation.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Got the invitation from that sneaky maid... Not bad, you've improved"
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, we're not going to catch you. We just need a small favor."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_6 = {
    Text = "We need two invitations to \"The Rose Name.\" I guess Miss Karen should have some left?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Rose Name...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Karen lowered her hands from her chest, her big round eyes darting around in a circle."
  },
  AvgDialog_23369_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
So the officer wanted an invitation too. Why didn't you just say so?
Grabbing people right off the bat is pretty frightening...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I see you're having so much fun performing, I can't bear to interrupt."
  },
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Call Squad B-01 and A-03 to surround the target immediately."
  },
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The rustling sounds came from all directions on the street, followed by chaotic footsteps."
  },
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Very soon, the field agents from Mythag surrounded the shadow."
  },
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I see, you feigned drunkenness to lure me out."
  },
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Great acting, Mr. Dexter, especially the singing part."
  },
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Thank you for your support. Let me tell you a secret: when I was a child, my dream was to become a renowned opera singer in the West End..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Before the words faded, the shadow swiftly drifted away, moving with the grace of flowing water, without a trace of hesitation."
  },
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_18 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I haven't finished speaking yet... Quickly, catch him!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Dexter fell to the ground in a mess, gripping his cane futilely in front of his chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Sir, I think there might be a misunderstanding between us..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Oh, what misunderstanding? Go ahead and tell me your story."
  },
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The shadow leaned down, the mask merely an inch away from Dexter's nose."
  },
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Uh! N-no need to get so close..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Dexter's scalp tingled as he suddenly turned and shouted toward the corner behind him."
  },
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_8 = {
    Text = "<Big:You lot, have you had enough of the show yet?!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23370_Content_9 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_1 = {
    Text = "While enjoying a small cake, you lead Ramona into a secluded alley."
  },
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ah, this delicate fragrance! <Shake:I feel like I can barely breathe...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_11 = {
    Text = "What do you mean? This fan is also a limited edition item brought back by Lady Sorel from Lemoisy!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Look, the Eye of the Pharaoh is even embedded on it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Hahaha, have you seen what the Pharaoh's eyes look like? <Shake:Beware of the curse~>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You... what do you mean?! Are you questioning Lady Sorel's taste?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_15 = {Text = "...?"},
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_16 = {
    Text = "What are these people doing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Ahem... Quiet, everyone, quiet! The thrilling moment is about to arrive!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Here comes our blockbuster product! That is—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_19 = {
    Text = "<Big:Bathwater used by Lady Sorel just last week!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Glug glug... Hmm, this little cake tastes exactly like the one I had in real life!
Ramona, would you like to try a bite too?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You hold the cupcake to Ramona's mouth. She sighs and reluctantly takes a small bite."
  },
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Hmm... Not bad."
  },
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ahem, back to business. Didn't you say you were going to help me find the invitation?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, the invitation won't get lost. This trick was taught to me by Hannah; it's something most people wouldn't think of."
  },
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Hey, look over there."
  },
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You pointed to the end of the alley. A crowd had gathered there, chatting loudly and waving their arms excitedly, creating a cheerful and lively atmosphere."
  },
  AvgDialog_23371_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Hehe, these nylon stockings are an exclusive from the \"Lady's Guide\"! I heard Lady Sorel bought them all, so they aren't available on the market..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Crimson revel"
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_10 = {
    Text = "\"Instead, you receive an invitation to 'Rose Name'.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
Stop, no more newspaper.
I'm also a citizen of Londinium. I know these rumors just as well as you do.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Ahem, I almost forgot that there's someone who has to wake up early every day, drink tea, and read the newspaper, living like an old granny despite being so young."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Staying informed about the current state of global affairs and news can be very helpful for investigations."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Since everything is for work... let's get back to work."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The performance is tomorrow. Why come a day early? My frail spirit power is already on the verge of collapse..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Dexter told me that Sorel is a woman who loves extravagance. She often books the entire second floor of the theater for her and her friends to enjoy."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_17 = {
    Text = "So her booth location varies each time she appears—of course, safety considerations come into play here."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
I see.
But the killer seemed very sure of her location... Could it be that someone close to Sorel leaked the information?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_19 = {
    Text = "As you say this, an image of Karen appears in your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Second Artificial Domain: Lincoln High Street
The day before Sorel's death]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_20 = {
    Text = "That big-mouthed maid is highly suspicious..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_21 = {Text = "Bang!!"},
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Someone bumps into your shoulder as they pass by. You frown and turn away, but your wrist is firmly grasped."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_23 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:Hey, I noticed you standing in front of Lady Sorel's poster for a long time. Are you also a fan of hers?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_24 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:I'm selling Lady Sorel's box number for tonight at a low price, along with the passage she'll take when she leaves...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_25 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:Want to see the goddess up close? Tonight is your best chance. Don't miss it!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_26 = {Text = "...?"},
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_27 = {
    Text = "I knew Sorel was popular, but I didn't expect it to be to this extent..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_28 = {
    Text = "I have just one question: Is it really necessary?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
Tsk, so it wasn't that after all.
Don't block the way. This is a regular meeting spot for us Sorel worshippers...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Second Artificial Domain Investigation Log I>\n\n■Domain ID: M-B04-002\n■Setup Time: A.F. 315, June @1, 2:00-6:00 PM (the day before Sorel's death).\n■Setup Location: Lincoln High Street"
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Wait, who told you about Sorel? Tell me, and I'll pay you double the price."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_31 = {
    Text = "As expected of Ramona, she's still as sharp as ever."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Uh... What? Why do you care so much? Are you guys cops or something?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_33 = {
    Text = "In the midst of the commotion, a luxurious carriage slowly comes to a stop in front of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_34 = {
    Text = "A pale, slender hand adorned with jeweled rings extends, clutching a stack of Rose Scrip."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Ahem... I've purchased your information, little girl."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_36 = {
    Text = "A strange, elderly voice came from the carriage. The owner of the voice seemed seriously ill, coughing constantly like an old, broken bellows."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Wow! Th-this much money? All mine?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The person in the car seems a bit impatient and is about to pull their hand back."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_39 = {
    Text = "The girl hurriedly slipped a note over, then swiftly snatched the gold voucher away, smiling so hard that her eyes squinted into a thin line."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_4 = {
    Text = "■Domain Owner: Sorel @2\n■Domain Intruders: %player%, Ramona\n\n■Objective: <Yellow:Investigate the surroundings of the theater for more clues.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Here is the information you requested! Noble and generous sir, wishing you a speedy recovery and a long life!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Before the girl could finish, the carriage sped away."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_42 = {
    Text = "This old man doesn't seem to be a fan of Sorel. Let's follow him."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The bustling streets are filled with pedestrians and carriages, permeated by a joyful festive atmosphere."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Only one day remains until the opera performance, and posters for the show have already covered the streets."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Interestingly, Madam Sorel, as a shareholder of the theater, occupied most of the poster space. No one really cared about the content of the play."
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_8 = {
    Text = "\"'Rose Name' was the first opera performed after Lady Sorel invested in <Blue:Covent Theatre>.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_23372_Content_9 = {
    Text = "\"Nowadays, a mark of high society is neither wearing silk from the East nor owning an antique vase from Lemwasi...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You sent the driver off—lots of enemy reinforcements?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Their assault was deliberate—to corner us here at Third Wharf, Berth 2."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_11 = {
    Text = "But this spot seems ordinary..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_12 = {
    Text = "True, Berth 2 holds no significance."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The issue is the <Yellow:ship> docked here."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_14 = {Text = "Ship?"},
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Ramona's words unleashed a gale, scattering the fog in your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_16 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_17 = {
    Text = "A colossal vessel materialized behind you, eclipsing the moon, shrouding all in shadow."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Post-manifestation, the encircling fish-people erupted in cheers, then exhibited bizarre behavior."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Look at them!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Too many; retreat's cut off."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The fish-people formed a queue, leaping toward the ship like suicidal possums heedless of life."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Weirder still, as webbed hands neared the hull, faint fluorescence rippled, repelling all boarders into the water."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_22 = {
    Text = "This ship... is rejecting the fish-people?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The outer hull's rusted and faded, original markings illegible, its name in white paint barely discernible."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_24 = {Text = "Sona..."},
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
<Blue:Sona-Nyl>.
Erica, any Mythag records?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Sona-Nyl, formerly of <Blue:Black Star Shipping>, passenger liner for transoceanic routes."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Post-Black Star bankruptcy, anonymously acquired privately, reregistered and converted to cargo."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_28 = {
    Text = "William, you know this ship?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_29 = {
    Text = "In 288 A.F., Sona-Nyl sank in a storm. Years later, North Sea coasts reported \"<Blue:ghost ship>\" sightings."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Moonlit waves rippled; in unlit corners, who knew how many lurked."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_30 = {
    Text = "A Mythag investigator boarded once but returned no usable intel."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_31 = {
    Text = "No usable intel..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_32 = {
    Text = "But he returned safely to campus, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_33 = {
    Text = [[
Yes, memory gaps aside, no other anomalies.
Brief convalescence, then back to the front lines.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Can we patch him in?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_35 = {
    Text = [[
...Regrettably, no.
He perished in a mission before you joined Mythag.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Wait! Ramona, you can't mean..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Yes, they won't let us wait for rescue."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Fish-people pivoted weapons toward you, no longer assaulting the Sona-Nyl. Circle shrank; you and Ramona backed against the hull."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Ramona inhaled deeply, touching the lowered gangway."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Back @2—! @1! Order @1!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
Unlike the repelled fish-people, her fingers met solid hull.
You exchanged glances and pressed your hand to the ship.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Mild resistance halted your hand mid-air, then vanished; steel's chill penetrated your glove, numbing your scalp."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_42 = {
    Text = "The Sona-Nyl <Yellow:accepts you>."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Boarding now."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Tightening the noose at a certain berth, the fish-people halted their advance, muttering inscrutable gibberish in a standoff."
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Why aren't they attacking?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_7 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Ramona, what is it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23841_Content_9 = {
    Text = "From herding us north to sealing the exit, they've always left a path."
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The captain told me about a safehouse behind that door."
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_10 = {
    Text = "This grumpy crowned brat's Tulu, and the other one's name is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_11 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I, uh... I never asked your name..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Murphy scratched her head sheepishly, ducking behind the captain and leaving the awkward introduction to the only adult present."
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I'm %player%, a student at Mythag University."
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You're the captain, right? Our records say a senior from our school once boarded the Sona-Nyl."
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The captain pulled a cigarette case from his pouch, pinching the last bit of tobacco, but Murphy lightly swatted his hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Didn't you promise me you'd quit smoking?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The captain gave a wry smile and pocketed the case."
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
I recognize that uniform. Shame it's not a better time.
Should you come another day, I'd pour you a drink and we could have a proper chat.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_2 = {
    Text = "What was the knock we agreed on... three light, one heavy? Light light heavy light?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Elton. My name's Elton."
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_21 = {
    Text = "While you introduced yourselves, Murphy wandered the dim cabin. When she reappeared in your sight, her face was etched with confusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Captain, isn't Celeste with you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_3 = {Text = "—Eek!"},
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_4 = {
    Text = "As Murphy racked her brain for the signal, sweating with urgency, the door flew open from within. A hand yanked her inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Tulu quickly propped the door to keep it open. You exchanged a glance and slipped inside together."
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_6 = {
    Text = "C-Captain! Thank goodness, you're here waiting for me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_7 = {
    Text = "A middle-aged man with dark skin, dressed in a sailor's uniform, patted Murphy's head with a fond gesture."
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Keeping one's word is something adults must adhere to."
  },
  AvgDialog_23842_Content_9 = {
    Text = "So, will you introduce your friends?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ramona, watch out!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You drew your Silver Key, attempting to link and suppress the erupting Awakener boy."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_12 = {
    Text = "But you sensed the anomaly instantly: his mind was utterly stable, tethered by a serpentine chain to something nearby."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_13 = {
    Text = "—To his Linker."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_14 = {
    Text = "A twisted shadow slithered from the Seafarer horde, slamming into your hand gripping the Silver Key like lightning. The force hurled you against the railing."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Caecus, that's enough."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_16 = {
    Text = "L-Lady Miryam! Give me one more chance—I'll deal with these two."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The woman crowned with thorns glanced at him, silent. Her gaze shifted to Ramona, then to you, finally lingering on the faintly glowing Silver Key at your chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_18 = {
    Text = "A Silver Key..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_19 = {
    Text = "In the next instant, a snake-like shadow shot from beneath her veil, coiling up your body."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ugh...! Mere lowly humans—how are they this tough..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_20 = {
    Text = "It was indeed a \"snake\"—a violet energy construct wrapping your wrist tightly, its ominous fangs poised menacingly at you—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Hands off {Male=him,Female=her}!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Ramona whirled and hurled her rapier, shattering one snake-shadow eyeing you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_24 = {
    Text = "In the next second, her legs burst with astonishing strength. She leaped over the pair like she was flying, reaching your side in a flash. She yanked you into a roll, dodging the snake-shadow's renewed assault while drawing her weapon."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_25 = {
    Text = "We're no match for that woman—get to the lifeboat!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Ramona gave you no chance to argue, shoving you into the lifeboat."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
She vaulted onto the gunwale, knees bent for balance, then slashed sideways with precision.
The lifeboat's securing mechanism shattered, and a massive wave of weightlessness engulfed your mind.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_28 = {
    Text = "<Big:Ramona!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Ramona dangled half off the ship. A snake-shadow snared her ankle, dragging her back over the railing."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The boy stared in disbelief, eyes wide. In the skirmish, Ramona's flurry of sword strikes had wounded his fins and tail. Grayish-red blood flowed freely across the deck, seeping into the planks."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The lifeboat tipped in its descent. Darkness and bone-chilling seawater flooded your throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_31 = {
    Text = "In your final glimpse, Ramona reached out to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Ramona slumped on the deck, rubbing her ankle with a furrowed brow."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_33 = {Text = "Crack—"},
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_34 = {
    Text = "She gritted her teeth, snapped the dislocated joint back into place. Her face twisted briefly before resuming its usual composure."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The woman, poised like a leader, strode to Ramona and looked down at her."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Silver Key, Link, Awakener..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I overlooked your appearances at the harbor. Now it's clear—the prophecy of <Yellow:Our Lord> comes true. None can halt the stars' alignment. All in this mortal world heads where it must."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The harbor... You're the one who ordered these Seafarers to chase us, using us to breach the ship's Domain boundary."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Miryam offered no denial, a devout smile gracing her elegant face."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_4 = {
    Text = "He leaned on his weapon to stay upright, clearly unable to parry your attacks any longer."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Students from Mythag University—as nourishment for <Yellow:Our Lord>, none could be more fitting."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Miryam turned away from Ramona, unconcerned by the weapon still clutched in her hand. She seemed utterly confident, as if Ramona's resistance had ceased."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Or rather, she was certain it wouldn't pose any threat."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_43 = {
    Text = [[
This is your last chance, Caecus.
Take her below. Guard her well.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_44 = {
    Text = "She'll be the final piece of the ritual. Once <Yellow:Our Lord> is reborn, He'll devour the fool's sweet flesh."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_45 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:He> will raise our city from the sea, restore our kingdom to this chaotic world, forging a new future for the Seafarers."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You're different from those fish-headed monsters. And your power..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Ramona flourished her sword, its tip drawing a graceful yet lethal arc, pointing straight at the kneeling boy."
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You're an Awakener... right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Insolent! Our bloodline far surpasses you wretched humans—you've no right to call Seafarers monsters!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23843_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ramona's words stung the boy's nerves. He surged with power, his dorsal spines bristling as he knocked her sword aside."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The tentacles smashed down heavily. The Seafarer's body crumpled into fragments, yet miraculously spared the girl's spot."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ah! Speaking of rituals... Did they hurt you, miss? You're clutching your wrist—is it sprained?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I'm no \"miss\"—I have a name."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Murphy. Call me Murphy."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Murphy, I've had first-aid training. Mind if I check your hand?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The girl eyed you hesitantly but ultimately allowed your approach, extending one hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You gently held her hand, pushing up her sleeve. She wore thick winter clothes. Aside from slight redness from tugging, no other injuries showed."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Probably a minor strain. Rest for a few days and it'll be fine."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Sensing Murphy's mood ease slightly, you bypassed the injury, suddenly gripping her upper arm firmly."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_18 = {
    Text = "What are you doing?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
You know the Seafarers' leader Miryam, yet they're hunting you.
Murphy, who are you really?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Tulu retracted his limbs, eyeing the gray-green and red-white slurry upon them. Disgust flickered on his face, vanishing as he discreetly wiped the filth on the deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_20 = {Text = "I-I..."},
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_21 = {
    Text = "That was when Tulu finished inspecting the runes and joined the conversation."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_22 = {
    Text = "That rune is a Seafarer hypnosis ritual. Those guys wanted her asleep to avoid complications..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Before Tulu finished, Murphy's face turned ashen. Her kicking and biting struggles against you ceased, as if pondering something."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_24 = {Text = "Murphy?"},
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_25 = {Text = "—Thud!"},
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Agonizing pain struck your forehead. The impact spun your world. Murphy seized the chance to break free, clutching her head as she fled deeper into the cabin."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_27 = {
    Text = "I knew you weren't good people!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_28 = {
    Text = "W-wait... hear me out..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Murphy clearly ignored your feeble plea. Her figure soon vanished around the corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Huff... Huff..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_30 = {
    Text = "...Tulu, why didn't you stop her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_31 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Don't look at me like that. I hadn't anticipated her head being so hard."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The girl clutched her wrist, breathing heavily, looking utterly shaken."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_5 = {Text = "You okay?"},
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Stay back!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You took but half a step forward, and the girl shouted tensely, her eyes brimming with wariness."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Seeing this, you halted, raising your hands to show harmlessness."
  },
  AvgDialog_23844_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Don't be scared—we're not bad guys. If not for us, that snake-faced creep would've used you in some ritual, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You snuck across the deck, Murphy pursing her lips and pointing to the nearby bridge, signaling the engine room lay inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_10 = {
    Text = "A massive cleaver was brutally hurtled toward you from afar, its force ripping the air, unleashing a fierce shockwave."
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_11 = {Text = "Watch out!"},
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_12 = {
    Text = "A sturdy tentacle coiled around your waist, yanking you from the blade's impact point."
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Most Seafarers are frail, favoring light weapons. This cleaver belongs to another—stay sharp."
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Frail... I agree with your take on these fools."
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_15 = {
    Text = "But as frontline fodder, mindless drones couldn't be handier."
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_16 = {
    Text = "A burly, towering man dragged a long tail fin, kicking aside groveling Seafarers at his feet, lumbering toward you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_17 = {
    Text = "He yanked the blade free from the deck where it embedded deeply. His tone mocked, his gaze appraising you with keen interest."
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_18 = {
    Text = "An Awakener ranking above Seafarers... This guy's in league with Miryam too?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_19 = {
    Text = "\"In league with Miryam\"? Tch, what an ugly way to put it."
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_2 = {
    Text = "If you could distract the Seafarer guards at the door, you'd be able to slip in unnoticed..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I am Goliath.\nRemember it—the name of one who conquered the seas!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You nodded in understanding, fumbling in your pocket for something to toss, when heavy footsteps approached."
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Murphy gasped, her face paling with fear. She scanned around, then yanked off a crate's tarp and scrambled inside, hands and feet flailing."
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_5 = {
    Text = "<Small:Murphy?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The crate fell silent and still, like a black hole swallowing her whole."
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Quiet—someone's coming."
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
The one who dismissed the Seafarer guards in ancient tongue was undoubtedly a giant.
Your angle hid his form, but his shadow on the deck loomed enormous.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23845_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Vast enough to trample mountains, devour sun and moon—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23846_Content_1 = {
    Text = "This wharf is massive."
  },
  AvgDialog_23846_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Hope this isn't <Yellow:Cataclysm> influence..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23846_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Don't let up—we're nearing the north gate."
  },
  AvgDialog_23846_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
After battles along the way, few foes remained in your path.
Only a handful of small fry stood between you and escape.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23846_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
These enemies... could the Church of the Lightbearers have sent them?
If not, it's too coincidental.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23846_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
I can't rule it out.
But the Lightbearers we met in Rye were far more refined.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23846_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Besieging you were literal \"small fry\"—hunched humanoids, fish heads peeking from ragged hoods."
  },
  AvgDialog_23846_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Each assault brought the rot of decaying life."
  },
  AvgDialog_23846_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Can't discount the Sculptors' Association either—Herbert's a bastard who toys with life under \"experiment.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_23846_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I like your take on Herbert. But remember, Dissolution can cause mass mutations too."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You and Tulu ducked into a hidden nook. He stood guard while you plunged into the dreamlike spirit realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ordinary humans manifested faintly in the spirit realm. Without this swarm of Seafarers, spotting Murphy on a ghost ship should've been straightforward."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Your mental tendrils fumbled through the Seafarer cluster, clumsily shoving aside one mote after another."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_12 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Murphy's mind... which one's hers...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_13 = {
    Text = "As you silently chanted Murphy's name, an ethereal female voice suddenly tuned into your wavelength."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_14 = {
    Text = "When you opened your eyes again, the spirit realm had twisted into an entirely different vista."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_15 = {
    Text = "At the horizon's end, a warped, skewed city erupted from the ground. The chaotic mental clamor no longer plagued you. Utter silence prevailed, broken only by a lone dim light radiating ceaseless cold."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Who... is this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Lady Miryam, those expedition teams wrecked the Elworth altar! The alignment's passed, and the thing we awakened..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_18 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Lady Miryam... This is Miryam's spirit realm?!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_19 = {
    Text = "That's no Divine Mother fit to birth Our Lord! It's nothing but a killing machine!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The familiar drowning sensation ebbed away. An intangible wind surged through your mind. You opened your eyes. The spirit realm struck you as both familiar and oddly unfamiliar."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_20 = {
    Text = "...No matter. We'll just await the next stellar alignment.\nI've endured five thousand cycles—what's one more turn?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Tell the Church of the Lightbearers to remove that flawed specimen."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_22 = {Text = "Y-yes..."},
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_23 = {
    Text = "But the new vessel for birthing Our Lord... what now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Didn't you say the current vessel, corrupted by Dissolution, couldn't hold out another twenty-five years?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_25 = {
    Text = "We can't see the Dissolution, but the vessel's weakening—it's plain to everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The new Divine Mother..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Miryam lowered her gaze to the girl napping by the pool's edge. In the dim polar ice cavern, the girl's pink hair shone vividly, brimming with vitality."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Encircled by cultists, she cradled the sleeping girl."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Barefoot, she ascended to the altar's pinnacle, toward the frigid stone throne embodying utmost honor."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Gray:...A ship?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Savoring the human warmth for a prolonged silence, she spoke softly yet audibly to all."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_31 = {
    Text = "The new Divine Mother... has already been granted by the heavens."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Murmurs burst forth among the prostrate cultists."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Murphy? The Divine Maiden? But isn't she..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Yeah, she's Lady Miryam's adopted daughter..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Even if the Church of the Lightbearers stops supplying new Awakening materials, surely Lady Miryam wouldn't sacrifice Murphy..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Isn't the high priestess being too rigid? Seafarer doctrine claims the Divine Realm fell tens of thousands of years ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Murphy's a kid we all watched grow... The high priestess has waited millennia—what's a little more time to find a new host?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_38 = {
    Text = "But word is, the Divine Maiden was born during the last alignment. No one's more suited, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_39 = {
    Text = "The babble of voices elicited no reaction from Miryam. Instead, the din roused Murphy, who stirred awake."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_4 = {
    Text = "A white sailing vessel bobbed at the horizon's edge—pristine, fragile, alien."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_40 = {Text = "This..."},
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Miryam, w-what's happening? Why bring me here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Miryam offered no reply, instead reaching to smooth Murphy's tousled hair."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_43 = {
    Text = "When she spoke again, her words resounded with finality."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_44 = {
    Text = "The Divine Mother has come! He shall awaken from @1, ushering in @2!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Elworth altar, expedition teams..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Could it be Francis...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_47 = {
    Text = "The thought scarcely formed before an icy chill seized your nape. A serpentine glare fixed upon you, hurling you out of Miryam's spirit realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_48 = {Text = "Urgh...!"},
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Any luck? Found her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_5 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Must be because the Sona-Nyl's in a special Domain. It's actually warping the spirit realm.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_50 = {
    Text = "The irregular exit left you reeling. You steadied yourself on Tulu's tentacle."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_51 = {
    Text = "I wandered into Miryam's spirit realm. Now she knows I'm alive."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_52 = {Text = "!?"},
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Webbed feet pounded the deck, drawing nearer. Whether Miryam had reversed the trace or not, Seafarers were encircling you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Hey! What're you spacing out for—come with me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Murphy beckoned from a doorway."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_56 = {
    Text = "You and Tulu shared a look and dashed toward her lead."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Miryam perched at the bridge's apex, eyes half-shut, hand to her brow, appearing weary."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Yo, rare sight—you looking like that. What, done playing pretend with our little princess?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Watch your words, Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Myriad glowing motes swirled around the ship, like stumbling into a summer woodland pond, with frog croaks rising and falling like drumbeats... Each Seafarer carried their own distinct imprint."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_60 = {
    Text = "The Divine Mother... No mortal frame can evade the destiny I've decreed for her."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_61 = {
    Text = "So confident, yet you haul me up here? I was in the thick of chasing that captain."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_62 = {
    Text = "...The other Mythag student, {Male=he,Female=she}'s still breathing."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Eliminate {Male=him,Female=her}. {Male=He,Female=She} can't interfere with the ritual. It must unfold at this alignment..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Our Lord shall be reborn this night."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_7 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Stay calm, stay calm... Tulu's the closest to me, Ramona's the one I'm linked to...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_8 = {
    Text = "In the gloom, a handful of light sources gleamed brightly, but chasing them proved futile. The Seafarers' presences walled off your mind like an iron barrier."
  },
  AvgDialog_23847_Content_9 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Move... get out of the way.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23848_Content_1 = {
    Text = "A stiff boot sole stomped down hard on the Dissolution Mutant, splattering D-Slime across the floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_23848_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Jeez, you done interrogating?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23848_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Murphy stomped her foot, pointing at you behind Tulu."
  },
  AvgDialog_23848_Content_12 = {
    Text = "{Male=His,Female=Her} partner is still in Seafarer hands, right? If you keep dawdling and wasting time, and something happens to her—don't blame me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23848_Content_13 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23848_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Tulu glanced sideways at you for a moment, as if gauging your expression."
  },
  AvgDialog_23848_Content_15 = {
    Text = "My partner's in peril, and we've been fighting non-stop—Tulu's just on edge.\nHope you don't mind our rudeness."
  },
  AvgDialog_23848_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Please lead us to the captain... to someone who can help find Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_23848_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Murphy lowered her swinging shovel, shaking her hand in disgust, as if flinging off the D-Slime that hadn't even touched her."
  },
  AvgDialog_23848_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Whew... Good thing it wasn't a Seafarer, or I wouldn't have dared swing...\nYou guys are too slow—let's move."
  },
  AvgDialog_23848_Content_4 = {Text = "Hold."},
  AvgDialog_23848_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Tulu's tone was icy, but recalling his words about the enigmas surrounding Murphy, you chose silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_23848_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Though the cabins you've led us through show no Seafarer traces, the deeper we go, the more mutants we encounter."
  },
  AvgDialog_23848_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You've been guiding us straight into danger."
  },
  AvgDialog_23848_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Dissolution Mutants?... Oh, you mean these monsters?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23848_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Captain said the ship had some Cataclysm outbreak once. Some sailors turned into freaks, but he couldn't bear to clear them out, so he locked most in the hold."
  },
  AvgDialog_23849_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The hatch creaked open a crack, dazzling light pouring into the dim hold."
  },
  AvgDialog_23849_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Without the distant prowling Seafarers, the Sona-Nyl might truly have been a secluded utopia..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23850_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Miss Ramona, Keeper! Over here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23850_Content_10 = {
    Text = "These fish-people were ambushing us?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23850_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Driver's non-combat—get out now!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23850_Content_12 = {
    Text = "R-Right. Be careful!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23850_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The driver scrambled in; engine roar drew enemy eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_23850_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Hey! Stargazies—over here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23850_Content_2 = {
    Text = "It's the driver!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23850_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Ahead, the familiar middle-aged man rattled the chained gate anxiously, looking troubled."
  },
  AvgDialog_23850_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Gate's locked—what now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23850_Content_5 = {
    Text = "No issue—I'll sever the chain. Step back."
  },
  AvgDialog_23850_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The driver retreated to avoid the blade. Ramona raised her weapon chest-high, inhaling to gather strength—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23850_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Rustling grew; shapes emerged from shadows in succession, thickening the air with damp heaviness."
  },
  AvgDialog_23850_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Fish-like foes blocked you from the gate; the driver yelped, tumbling onto the hood."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Such insane power...! Terrifying even by Awakener standards."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The mad cackle echoed through the domain, ratcheting up the tension."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Relax, I'm not finishing you here."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Those Lightbearer incompetents can't even handle basic security, letting this runt sneak in... But thanks to their screw-up, this ritual just got way more entertaining."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Church of the Lightbearers... Seafarers are tied to them?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Ha? Don't lump me with those lunatics. Seafarers' forms make blending in tough, and they crave our power... Freaks using each other, huddling for warmth—that's all."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Not just linked to the Lightbearers, but this <Blue:ritual> you mention..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Goliath... who exactly are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Who am I? Hahahahaha! Why not ask your sidekick?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Where I—and these Seafarers—came from... You can't guess? After all, you're the supreme..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_19 = {Text = "Insolence!"},
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_2 = {
    Text = "This strength..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Scary, scary—but sorry, I'm no loyal subject of yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_21 = {
    Text = "I've got ritual prep to handle—no time to tangle with you further."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Go ahead, scurry around with your tentacles tucked. But you know—the thing that woman wants, only you can provide."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The envoy who siphoned power from that impotent god... Ugh!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_24 = {
    Text = "His taunts barely ended when violet phantoms erupted from the scar across Goliath's neck. They coiled like scarves around his throat, finally solidifying into serpents."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Goliath's face contorted at the phantoms' emergence, their fangs sinking into the neck wound."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Pain and venom intertwined, twisting his features into a grin, shark-like teeth quivering with thrill."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Ha, ha... Petty bitch—can't stand a word against her ethereal god."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_28 = {
    Text = "A gutless, heartless coward... hah!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The phantoms yanked sharply, bowing the giant's spine into an arch, forcing him into prostration."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Miryam bestowed upon you the power granted to her."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_30 = {
    Text = "This all you got!?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Controlling you with inscrutable faith, letting the Cataclysm raze your civilization—a fanatic... Ha, in the end, He never even existed; it's all your delusion!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The phantoms constricted abruptly. Goliath coughed, spewing blood droplets."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_33 = {
    Text = "H-he's...?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_34 = {
    Text = "An ancient punishment... Used in Lemuria to chastise and tame unbelievers and prisoners."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Tulu gazed at Goliath—still wearing his feral smirk—and sighed."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
Miryam's doing?
...Wait! Doesn't this mean Miryam knows where we are?!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Ha, no need to freak out."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Goliath braced his cleaver to rise.\nHe wiped blood from his face with the back of his hand—the torment seemed a mere itch."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Just a leash from an arrogant fool who thinks she's in control."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Oh? How would a runt like you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Scram. Don't get taken out by some random grunt before I get my fill of this show."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_41 = {
    Text = "—Goliath, wait!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Oh? What's up? I like gutsy challengers. You've got one question before I lose patience."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Ramona... how's my partner now? What are you planning with her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Ha... First off: I don't eat women.\nSparing her for now—that's Miryam's call."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_45 = {
    Text = "The current Divine Mother... the vessel for birthing a new god... is just some insignificant pink-haired brat. With that Divine Mother's puny frame, there's no way she can stifle the new god's first cry."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_46 = {
    Text = "The phantoms vanished when he ceased mocking the \"God.\" He flexed his neck side to side, shouldered his cleaver, and strode off, unconcerned about turning his back."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_47 = {
    Text = "—Before he turned, you distinctly saw him glance at Murphy's hiding crate."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
Tulu's hesitation prompted the giant to pause his assault, pondering.
He squinted, sizing Tulu up from head to toe, his gaze lingering on the ostentatious crown.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_6 = {
    Text = "That crown's design...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Goliath's pupils contracted, his raw, piercing stare fixed on you both. Then, he burst into unrestrained laughter."
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Ha, hahahaha! Interesting—how interesting!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23851_Content_9 = {
    Text = "If that woman saw this, what face would she make? She'd snap, right? Hahahaha, I can't wait for that moment!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Eye of the Storm"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Eyes open, head pounding, unfamiliar surroundings."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_100 = {
    Text = [[
Tulu sweeps another fish-headed monster over the rail before glancing your way.
He grips the hatch frame, but his next move defies expectation.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_101 = {
    Text = [[
Don't worry. Proceed and rendezvous with the others.
I must confirm why they cling to the ritual.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_102 = {
    Text = "The hatch slams shut, plunging you and the girl into utter darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_103 = {
    Text = "The girl huffs in defiance, deftly cranking the winch to secure the lock."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_104 = {
    Text = "Whew—should be safe for now."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_105 = {
    Text = "She flicks a switch. The ancient bulb flickers, then floods the space with light, banishing the shadows."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_106 = {
    Text = "And you finally behold the \"seaweed\" cushioning your fall."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_107 = {
    Text = "Body and mind sink into hell's darkest lava—this is no mere seaweed.\nYour palm roots in a crimson mire of unidentified tissues, jagged bones pricking painfully."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_108 = {
    Text = "Arcane runes smeared by fluids resemble a garish ballroom carpet—clearly, a minor pagan rite has unfolded here."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_109 = {
    Text = "Decay permeates the cabin; fish remnants alone couldn't produce such stench. Larger, fattier participants must have joined this macabre revelry."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_11 = {
    Text = "How many times has this happened? Can't there be a fresher way to start?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_110 = {Text = "Urgh..."},
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_111 = {
    Text = "Typical Seafarer mess—they never clean up..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_112 = {
    Text = "The girl mutters, eyeing your sprawl on the altar with distaste. She circles you, then hauls you up by your cleaner arm."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_113 = {
    Text = "With Tulu up there, they won't chase us anytime soon...\nI'll find something to cover this altar—the smell's awful."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_114 = {
    Text = "Your temples pulse in rhythm, agony splitting your skull. Bile surges, and you double over, retching uncontrollably."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_115 = {
    Text = "Huh?! What's wrong?! Don't scare me like that!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_116 = {
    Text = "Stay back!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_117 = {
    Text = "I'm not just some little girl; I have a name."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_118 = {
    Text = "Murphy. Call me Murphy."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_119 = {
    Text = "Her anxious face merges with fragmented memories, blending two similar yet distinct scenes into one."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You force yourself upright, and an unexpected sight floods your vision."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_120 = {Text = "Murphy...?"},
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_121 = {
    Text = "Y-You okay? Did the altar gross you out that bad?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_122 = {
    Text = "She circles you again, then—under the dim light—tiptoes to inspect your state."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_123 = {Text = "—!"},
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_124 = {
    Text = [[
That's a nasty fall...
I think there's something useful in this shipment...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_125 = {
    Text = "Murphy mumbles indistinctly, stiffly rummaging through the stacked crates."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_126 = {
    Text = "No... this one's busted jewelry."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_127 = {
    Text = "You glance over: a coral, pearl, and lapis lazuli headdress lies there, pricey-looking. Its eerie design induces a dizzying haze."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_128 = {
    Text = "...Damn, all ritual junk."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_129 = {
    Text = "The second crate brims with oddities: stone bowls, sage, powders... To the uninitiated, it might pass for an apothecary's stock."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_13 = {
    Text = "A massive full moon hangs in the night sky, ethereal mist blanketing the sea, the air thick with gunpowder and the briny tang of saltwater."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_130 = {
    Text = "Got it! Here—squat down."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_131 = {
    Text = "A paste smears your scalp, cool with a spicy bite, easing the pain somewhat. Hair clumps under the ointment, prompting you to comb it—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_132 = {
    Text = "Hey! Don't mess with it yet! It's not poison."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_133 = {
    Text = "Murphy hands you the jar. No ingredients or name on the label—just a bizarre pattern, clearly homemade."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_134 = {
    Text = "...Déjà vu? That design on the label... you've seen it somewhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_135 = {
    Text = "Growing up, they'd slap this on every scrape or bruise."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_136 = {
    Text = "Well? Feels better already, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_137 = {
    Text = "She eyes you nervously, guilt plain over the stair tumble."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_138 = {
    Text = "Yeah... not hurting now."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_139 = {
    Text = "Temples still throb faintly, but the back of your head feels soothed."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Waves lap gently at the hull in a soft, rhythmic cadence, cradling the vessel as it drifts toward an unknown destination."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_140 = {
    Text = "Your gaze drifts to the ruined \"altar\"; Murphy has already draped cloth over it to spare you another bout of nausea."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_141 = {
    Text = "Now, crimson and gray-green fluids bleed through the burlap, forming a grotesque shape—like a peculiar dagger, or an infant on the cusp of its first cry."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_142 = {
    Text = "See? Told you it works—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_143 = {
    Text = "Affirmation relaxes her, drawing out a smile.\nGazing at her eased form, an inner voice whispers—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_144 = {
    Text = "She is the eye of the storm. She holds the key to it all."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I'm on a ship?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_16 = {
    Text = "No doubt, you are aboard a steamer far out at sea. Ramona is nowhere near, and no sign of life meets your gaze."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
Easy, easy.
Let's think this through from the start. Why am I on this ship...?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Something about Herbert... the pattern... Francis's diary... the harbor..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Once you're ready, we'll set off. I'll be your partner, as always."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Keeper! Don't let go of my hand!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_20 = {
    Text = "This time... the church... secrets... you have to—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_21 = {Text = "...Ugh!"},
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Fragments of memory surface, only to be shredded by a searing pain.\nBile rises, scorching the throat—fresh air suddenly a rare luxury."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Whew—Ramona and I left the school together... yes, Ramona.\nI need to find Ramona. She'd know what's going on."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Connect the communicator"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Ramona, can you hear me? Where are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Ignoring the soul-deep ache, you activate the Silver communicator as usual."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_27 = {
    Text = "That's when you find the <Yellow:brooch>—signifying your identity—is missing from your lapel."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_28 = {
    Text = "What? How?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
Steady, steady...
There's still a way. Just try Spirit Tracing.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Your nose stung with the acrid stench of burnt coal. After a fleeting moment of connection, you were yanked downward into the abyss by gravity."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_30 = {
    Text = "You draw a deep breath, willing away the discomfort, and plunge once more into the depths of your spirit."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_31 = {
    Text = "A constellation of lights twinkles—each a vibrant soul, far more numerous than you'd imagined."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_32 = {
    Text = "So many people on this ship? That's odd..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_33 = {
    Text = [[
Suppressing curiosity and a baseless dread, you focus inward.
The link acts like an unyielding umbilical cord, drawing two radiant spirits toward you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Two links? Besides Ramona, was someone else on this mission?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Your probing stirs ripples; one Gnosis seems startled. Before you can sense more, He turns sluggishly, then fixes on your position."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_36 = {
    Text = "A chill races up your spine. Whatever is linked on the other end is coming for you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Without time to ponder the stranger on the other end, instinct pulls you from the spirit realm, and you bolt in the opposite direction."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_38 = {Text = "—!"},
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_39 = {
    Text = "As if by cruel coincidence, the ship lets out a piercing wail the moment your foot hits the deck—a metallic beast's death cry, signaling its surrender to the sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The familiar voice and warmth faded swiftly, replaced by a creeping chill and dampness that clawed at the spine."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
Plunging into the spirit realm like that, blind to the peril.
Reckless. Arrogant.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Soft, cool tentacles like orange pulp steady your teetering form, holding you firm."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_42 = {
    Text = "I did not expect such rashness from you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_43 = {Text = "Tulu?!"},
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_44 = {Text = "You..."},
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_45 = {
    Text = "You're awake?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_46 = {
    Text = "The young Awakener glances your way, his gaze calm yet commanding."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_47 = {
    Text = "I shall overlook your impertinence... this time."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_48 = {
    Text = "What are you doing here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_49 = {
    Text = "The young Awakener raises a brow in mild surprise, appraising you with a measured stare."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_5 = {Text = "Keeper!"},
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_50 = {
    Text = "You still have the spirit for jests. You seem unharmed, then."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_51 = {
    Text = "The brief lapse in our link must have been mere disturbance to the Gnosis."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_52 = {
    Text = [[
Like Lotan and Ogier, Tulu is one of the many Awakeners under <Yellow:Mythag's> administration.
Yet in your year of training there, you've glimpsed him only a handful of times.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Tulu spends most of his days in slumber, his awakenings rare as comets. Assigning him to fieldwork with investigators? Unthinkable."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Yet now, an invisible <Yellow:link> binds you tightly, his storm-like Gnosis ceaselessly scouring your mental domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Link lapse? No... wait, how are we even linked? And why are you outside the school?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Foolish questions. This is no time for games—the girl's time is running short.\nThe Seafarers persist with The Ritual of Descent. <Yellow:The stars are aligning in their destined positions>."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_57 = {
    Text = "The girl? The Ritual of Descent?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Tension thickens between you and Tulu. After a pause, he sighs deeply, his youthful face etched with unchildlike gravity."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_59 = {
    Text = "What do you remember?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Was that... a dream?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Ramona and I left for the investigation... as for the rest..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_61 = {
    Text = "You shake your head. Whether from external force or not, one thing is clear: your body resists recollection."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_62 = {
    Text = "\"The stars are rising to their destined positions\"—you know the ritual's conditions."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_63 = {
    Text = "The Ritual of Descent—what's going on? And who are these fish-people?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_64 = {
    Text = "I can't recall the details, but the link doesn't lie. We're allies here—Tulu, tell me what's happened."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Weariness shadows Tulu's features. He closes his eyes, as if gathering his thoughts."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_66 = {
    Text = [[
My oversight, failing to notice your distress.
For a human to be ensnared in this... it has taken its toll.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_67 = {
    Text = [[
But "The Ritual of Descent" is a term too sensitive for a Mythag Keeper.
As you press for more, Tulu's tentacles bar your path.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Someone approaches. Stay alert."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_69 = {Text = "Plop..."},
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Is it dawn yet...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Urgent footsteps mingle with the slap of webbed feet, vibrations rumbling beneath. A figure barrels from the deck's far end toward you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Gur... gurgle..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Wah—help—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Help me!! %player%!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_74 = {
    Text = "The girl dashes to your side, gasping for breath, clutching your cloak like a lifeline."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Give... @2... @1ther! @2!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_76 = {
    Text = "These humanoid foes with aquatic traits let out eerie whines. The sounds are chaotic and grating, yet their intent pierces through."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_77 = {
    Text = "They're saying... \"give her back to us\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_78 = {
    Text = "The disordered roars clarify in your ears.\nJust a bit more, and you'd grasp what they wanted—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_79 = {
    Text = "In that distracted instant, the girl stomps hard on your boot."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Every bone in your body feels as if it has been shattered and reassembled as you are overwhelmed with an untimely fatigue.
Your temples throb, and the eyes are so dry that each blink feels like being pricked by needles.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_80 = {Text = "Hiss—"},
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Are you just gonna stand there? Do something!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_82 = {
    Text = "And you! Stop staring—focus! Don't let them grab us."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Tulu averts his gaze from you both. His tentacles whip fiercely, sweeping the relentless assailants overboard one by one."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Reinforcements incoming. They're after you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_85 = {
    Text = "The girl purses her lips, then brightens with a spark of inspiration."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Into the cabin! We can shake them for now."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_87 = {
    Text = "She backs away a few steps, and you shield her as you follow. Kicking aside planks, she reveals a hatch in the deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_88 = {
    Text = "A hidden door?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Hidden door? Must you tease me at a time like this!?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Your throat feels like you just swallowed a mouthful of something thick and acrid, with every breath bringing suffocating blockage and pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_90 = {
    Text = "It's not like you've never been belowdecks—stop dawdling, get ready!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Tulu raises no objection. Under his silent cover, you and the girl yank open the iron hatch."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Beneath lies a metal ladder descending into unseen depths."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Quick! You first!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_94 = {
    Text = "You can't fight—I have to protect you—ah!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Ignoring your protests, the girl—slender and agile—slips behind you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_96 = {
    Text = "—And with a solid kick, sends you tumbling into the black void."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_97 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:Ouch, ouch...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_98 = {
    Text = "You land in what feels like soft seaweed, the fishy reek and salty brine assaulting your senses, spinning your already aching head."
  },
  AvgDialog_23852_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Hey! You! Don't just hang there—get down!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23853_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
One blink, and she's gone...
Searching like this is hopeless. Maybe we should find Ramona first...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23853_Content_2 = {
    Text = "No, we can't let her go!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23853_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Ahem... I mean, she might hold the key to unraveling the Seafarers' mystery."
  },
  AvgDialog_23853_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Judging by how well she knows them, she must be aware of their goals."
  },
  AvgDialog_23853_Content_5 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23853_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Alright, I'll try Spirit Tracing to find her.\nThis is my first time tracking a human with it—can't guarantee it'll work."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_1 = {Text = "Dagger"},
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Honestly, I only just remembered your name."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
...Ah! Don't tell me that kick down the hatch knocked something loose!
Damn it, why now of all times...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Murphy scratches her head in frustration, clearly at a loss."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The whole story... it's too complicated to explain. And this isn't exactly safe. We need to join up with the others first."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_14 = {Text = "Others?"},
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The Sona-Nyl's captain and his crew, and Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Oh! Can you try that thing again? The one where you dive into the spirit realm to find people."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
Spirit Tracing? You know Ramona, Tulu, and even that I can do Spirit Tracing...
What happened before?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Stop dawdling! Find Ramona's position first—I'll explain on the way."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Sinking into the spirit realm proves agonizing like never before, your consciousness scraping through thorns, laced with pinpoint pains. And when you finally spot the familiar glow—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Tulu said we should rendezvous with the others... Hmph, easier said than done."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_20 = {Text = "Snap—"},
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_21 = {Text = "Urgh...!"},
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Your mental tendrils barely graze your mind's edge before snapping like dry vines."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Soul-rending agony pierces your temples, dropping you at Murphy's feet."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_24 = {
    Text = "H-Hey?! Don't scare me—don't die on me?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_25 = {
    Text = "I-I'm fine..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Spirit Tracing is usually your forte, but now your body blocks your spirit wanderings."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You're certain: it's your own body expelling you from the spirit realm, not some mysterious entity."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_28 = {
    Text = "@2... gurgle..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_29 = {
    Text = "That's the Seafarers—they've found us!\nCan't stay here. Follow me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
Murphy paces the hold, her agitation plain to see.
You draw a deep breath and call out to her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Murphy strains to haul you up, your weight making her legs quiver. You shift your balance toward the bulkhead, and with her support, you stagger deeper into the ship..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You halt before a heavy iron door, marred by eerie dents and bulges. From the ill-fitting seams wafts the acrid tang of smoke."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Murphy, are we going in?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Shh, let me listen..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Murphy gently releases you, presses her ear to the door, and listens intently with eyes closed."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Seems empty. Let's hide in here."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Before Murphy pushes it open, you glance at the label—\"Engine Room.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_37 = {
    Text = "No bustling scene awaits: no burly workers, no roaring boilers—just sparks flying everywhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Cold, rigid bodies litter the floor—the fish-headed monsters that pursued you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Murphy and Tulu call them \"<Yellow:Seafarers>.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_4 = {Text = "Murphy."},
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Massive breaches gape in the bulkheads, admitting gusts of chill wind. Murphy rubs her reddened ears, steadying you as you step over flames into the ruins."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Cough, cough... this stench is unbearable."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_42 = {
    Text = "This place... saw a fierce battle?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Fierce battle? That's putting it lightly for what went down here."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Oh... right, you don't remember."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Amid the debris, something gleams conspicuously."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Before you identify it, Murphy's face twists—part horror, part sorrow."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_47 = {
    Text = "I don't know when she turned into this raving lunatic..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Her lips curl as she haphazardly recounts the \"past,\" edging toward the glint in the rubble."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_49 = {
    Text = "She wouldn't listen to a word, no matter how I begged—she insisted on this ritual..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Maybe we should just hunker down in a corner..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_50 = {
    Text = "—The gleam is an oddly shaped dagger, resting amid dying embers. Despite the dust, its edge screams sharpness."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_51 = {
    Text = "She used to be so kind to me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Murphy stares at the dagger for a moment, then scrambles into the wreckage on all fours, reaching for it."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Gur... gurgle..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Among the fallen Seafarers, one props itself up on a broken weapon, staggering to its feet, bulging eyes—nearly popping from sockets—fixing murderously on Murphy above."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Why... why... from the High Priestess... why?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Divine Mother, Divine Mother... Gurgle, gurgle...! I've found the Divine Mother!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_57 = {
    Text = "High Priestess, High Priestess! The ritual nears, <Big:THE RITUAL NEARS!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_58 = {
    Text = "The Seafarer's fish-like jaw gapes impossibly wide, the membrane connecting it stretched translucent."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_59 = {
    Text = [[
Driven by fear, hope, and faith, it erupts with unimaginable vitality.
The Seafarer shoves you aside, screeching as it bolts for the engine room exit.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_6 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Murphy! I have something to tell you!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_60 = {
    Text = "No—he's getting away!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Shlkk——"
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_62 = {
    Text = "A keen point bursts from the gray-blue chest, fluids spraying as the Seafarer crumples."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Murphy stands guard at the door, unnoticed until now, gray-green ichor dripping from the dagger's tip."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Fabric shreds cling to it, carvings clogged with flesh. Murphy trembles visibly, yet her grip remains ironclad."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_65 = {
    Text = "...Sorry, can't let you go."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Murphy eyes the dagger a while longer, then wipes away the Seafarer's blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_67 = {
    Text = "He was going to alert the others..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Leaning against the door, Murphy surveys the engine room's devastation, lashes fluttering uneasily."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_69 = {
    Text = "But <Blue:Miryam> is already... why won't they give up..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Don't yell like that! What if you draw the Seafarers right to us!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Murphy murmurs the name, triggering an inexplicable dizziness. You blink through the nausea before voicing your question."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Who's Miryam?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_72 = {
    Text = "She's the Seafarers'... the fish-people's leader."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Then this \"Divine Mother\"..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_74 = {
    Text = "The question triggers mechanical swallows, tension mounting."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Your body knows the answer, yet subconscious dread blocks recall."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_76 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Murphy looks up, sorrow swirling in her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_78 = {Text = "It's me."},
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_79 = {
    Text = "I'm the pitiful wretch infested by monsters, the destined vessel for a pagan god's rebirth."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Fine, what is it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_80 = {
    Text = "I... am the Seafarer cult's \"Divine Mother.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_81 = {
    Text = "As the final word escapes Murphy's lips, white light explodes before your eyes, laced with agony."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Hey?! Hey! %player%?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Your body topples backward uncontrollably, low-frequency hums circling your ears, the girl's cries drowned in pain's torrent."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_84 = {
    Text = "At the light's end, an intangible gaze fixes upon you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_85 = {
    Text = "The unknown entity judges you—whether your shattered skull merits mending, whether your unraveling soul can be rewoven."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Eyes wide, consciousness slips from your form..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23854_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
I... I'm a bit confused on what's happening.
Why am I on this ship? How do I know you...?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23855_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Murphy, stop running! We aren't bad people!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23855_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Like any bad guy would admit they're bad!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23855_Content_3 = {
    Text = "He's even figured out the rune's purpose, and you still claim you're not with the Seafarers!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23855_Content_4 = {
    Text = "It's an incantation written in ancient Lemurian. Anyone versed in Lemurian would read the rune without issue."
  },
  AvgDialog_23855_Content_5 = {
    Text = "And you do realize that Lemuria was a civilization lost before human history even began, don't you? Even at Mythag, there're only a handful of papers on Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_23855_Content_6 = {Text = "...Hmph."},
  AvgDialog_23855_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Just hurry up."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Warped Reality"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_10 = {
    Text = "W-what? Why're you staring like that? What's with you two?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Goliath... you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_101 = {
    Text = "Why... why tell me this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_102 = {
    Text = "Brooding's no good. Your state affects the god's growth, you know."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_103 = {
    Text = "Next alignment's in twenty-five years. I bet Miryam's coming soon to put you under."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_104 = {
    Text = "Do something fun—wreck stuff, whip Seafarers, torment your maids... whatever."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_105 = {
    Text = "Goliath cut the talk unilaterally, patting her head roughly, devoid of warmth."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_106 = {
    Text = "As he left, he eyed the wood carving Murphy had tossed in the corner. Her skill was awful—the squat, grotesque shape atop the wooden base repulsed at a glance."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_107 = {Text = "Heh."},
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_108 = {
    Text = "After Goliath departed, the space fell utterly silent. Even the caged sacrifices awaiting slaughter made no sound."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_109 = {
    Text = "Murphy sat by the campfire for ages, until the light dimmed and embers faded. Only then did she slap her cheeks as if snapping from a dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You knew it was Goliath from his footsteps. And earlier, your words showed your familiarity with Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_110 = {
    Text = "She kicked a cage hard, recalling the woman who wrecked the ritual months ago... the one who escaped Miryam through sheer grit."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_111 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_113 = {
    Text = [[
"I'm sorry..."
"I... don't want to die..."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_114 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_115 = {
    Text = "I don't want... to end like this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You're deep in the Seafarers' organization—a member, high up even. Or rather, they're here for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You're the Seafarers' Divine Mother, the vessel to birth the new god... right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<Big:I'm not!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Then explain your familiarity with Goliath and Miryam, and why you're fleeing the Seafarers."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I'm just... a maid... an ordinary one. Girls like me are a dime a dozen at the cult's base."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Human appearances are rare among Seafarers. Otherwise, with their combat prowess, they wouldn't need to ally with the Church of the Lightbearers."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_18 = {
    Text = "If you're just some irrelevant human maid, why the massive hunt for you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_19 = {
    Text = "It's all... this is just..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Murphy, Murphy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Murphy, I need to know what's going on."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Only then do we stand a chance of surviving. Only then can we help you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_22 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_23 = {Text = "Fine..."},
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_24 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_25 = {
    Text = "A fledgling bird with broken wings plunged into a black pool."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The high priestess's murmured prayers drifted firm and elusive. Fanatical words pierced the black slime, turning into blades that sliced open the fledgling's chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Crimson liquid welled from the wound, blooming eerily on the now-still black surface—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Yet she kept sinking, blood-trailing roots delving to the depths, into a soft, chilling embrace."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_29 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You can come out now—Goliath's gone."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_30 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
She saw it.
Looking up, "Mother" lowered three pairs of eye stalks, meeting her gaze.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
It was a colossal crimson entity, its blood-soaked parts turning translucent white.
"Mother" emitted a faint glow, briefly illuminating a small patch of space.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_33 = {
    Text = "By that light, she saw countless black wounds, large and small, scarring \"Mother's\" smooth skin."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_34 = {
    Text = "\"I'm sorry...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Black slime churned, shattering the pool's calm."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_36 = {
    Text = "\"Mother\" let out a shrill wail, tentacles writhing as they delivered something into the fledgling's chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Slick, icy soft tentacles wrapped around her. The black pool no longer clogged her mouth and nose—instead, like amniotic fluid, it buoyed her life."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
"I'm sorry..."
"I still... don't want to die..."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_39 = {
    Text = "The surface held a prolonged calm. Even the howling polar winds couldn't ripple the viscous pool."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_4 = {Text = "R-really?"},
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Lady Miryam, could the Divine Maiden have already..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_41 = {
    Text = "She was born at the last <Blue:stellar alignment>—a child who \"sees.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_42 = {
    Text = "No one in the world is worthier of the divine bloodline's recognition."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_43 = {
    Text = [[
The gaunt woman stood encircled, perched at the highest vantage overlooking all.
Veils obscured her features; even close aides couldn't fathom her thoughts.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_44 = {Text = "Murphy..."},
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_45 = {
    Text = "With the murmur, as if geothermal energy surged forth, the surface abruptly boiled."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Thick, viscous black water overflowed the banks, lapping over feet, flowing to the woman's bare soles."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Pushing through the young cultists' hushed gasps, she silently trod the black-liquid path, plunging her hands deep into the pool—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_48 = {Text = "—Splash"},
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
The girl clung to her hands, leaping from the pool.
Black liquid traced her facial contours, like two ghastly tear streaks.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_5 = {
    Text = "It's fine. The Seafarers on deck followed him off.\nHere, take my hand—I'll help you out."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Heh, not bad. Looks like <Blue:God> accepted the new <Blue:Mother>."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Goliath's abrupt remark dripped mockery, yet no one minded his sarcasm anymore."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_52 = {
    Text = "The Divine Maiden... succeeded? We did it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Prayers rose in waves, harmonizing in the frigid cavern—fanatical, twisted, deafening."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Miryam, as you wished, I've done what you asked."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_55 = {
    Text = "He... is pulsing here now."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Not just Murphy—Miryam heard it too.\nTwo hearts with mismatched rhythms throbbed in the girl's chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Now, answer my question?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Ask anything."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Did you raise me from the start... just for today?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_6 = {
    Text = "As soon as Murphy stood, Tulu's tentacle coiled tightly around her ankle with your silent nod."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_60 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_61 = {Text = "No."},
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_62 = {
    Text = "You're my \"Divine Maiden,\" meant to bridge the divine realm... Afterward, your soul would ascend there."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Today's rite was unplanned... but fear not.\nAfter the god-birth ritual, I'll preserve your essence—you won't wander the eternal night."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Soul, essence..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_65 = {
    Text = "My death was set for this so-called \"stellar alignment\" from the beginning, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_66 = {
    Text = [[
Miryam closed her eyes briefly, turning from questions to face the frenzied followers.
She raised her arms high. Black liquid slid along her skin's grooves, instantly dyeing her veil a deep black.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_67 = {
    Text = "The Divine Mother has come!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_68 = {
    Text = "He shall awaken from @1, ushering in @2!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_69 = {
    Text = "He shall awaken from @1, ushering in @2!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_7 = {
    Text = "W-what?! I know ditching you to face Goliath alone was crappy..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Three months later"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_71 = {
    Text = [[
You're giving that woman more headaches. Weren't you such a good girl a few months back?
What, not listening to mommy anymore?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_72 = {
    Text = "The girl glanced at Goliath, stabbing her knife viciously into the wood, tossing tool and material aside."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Mom... mommy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_74 = {
    Text = "You... where did you learn that term?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Dictionary! Look: \"Female adult who cares for a child, with emotional bond.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_76 = {
    Text = "No... I won't be your mommy."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_77 = {
    Text = "You're the cult's Divine Maiden, a destined one of glory... If you wish, call me by name."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Uh... Miry... am?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Yes, Divine Maiden."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_8 = {
    Text = "B-but if he was after me, getting caught means I'm done for! I-I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_80 = {
    Text = "...She's not my mom, never was."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Only the higher-ups in the Church of the Lightbearers know where I came from. I have no mom—I'm just their gift to Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Huh? She told you even that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_83 = {
    Text = "To a prisoner with a death sentence, secrets don't matter—they'll all go to the grave with me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_84 = {
    Text = "That's her way of making it up to you. You know, the day they implanted the God in you, our high priestess grieved sleeplessly."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Grieved? What a joke—she doesn't feel that."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_86 = {
    Text = [[
So cold, little princess.
Girls too icy make mommy sad, you know.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Shut up! I said she's not my mom!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Don't be so sure about that. Wanna hear a story?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_89 = {
    Text = [[
<BigShake:No, and I don't wanna see you!>
If you're here just to mock me, get out!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_9 = {Text = "Murphy."},
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Nah, you do."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Goliath's tone turned grave, laced with battlefield authority. Murphy's two hearts nearly skipped from it."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_92 = {
    Text = "She suddenly realized—the giant was never her plaything to toy with.\nShe'd pushed her luck with her status, and he'd just enjoyed the show."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Y-Yes, please go ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_94 = {
    Text = "There's this secretive cult obsessed with pure bloodlines—all marriages decreed by the head. Anyone marrying outsiders and breeding gets purged eventually."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_95 = {
    Text = "In the last purge, the enforcer brought back a baby—a girl who could see spirits."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_96 = {
    Text = "A baby girl..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_97 = {
    Text = "She'd hidden too long in a secret compartment under her mom. By the time cultists found her, she nearly choked on her birth mother's blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_98 = {
    Text = "That mediocre nobody woman's greatest feat? Birthing a top-notch daughter and trying to keep the cult from taking her."
  },
  AvgDialog_23856_Content_99 = {
    Text = "—What touching mother-daughter love. Brings a tear to my eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Fate's Seed"
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_10 = {
    Text = "How much longer?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Longer for what?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The God. How long until It is born?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_13 = {
    Text = "...I don't know. Why don't you check for yourself? From the way you talk about Miryam and Goliath, you're already neck-deep in this, aren't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
The girl didn't hesitate. She began unbuttoning her clothes with brisk determination.
As the last button came undone, you saw the "god" within her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Her torso beneath the open shirt was starkly transparent, the skin and muscle stretched taut, rendering her chest and abdomen a ghostly, decaying white."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The anomaly laid bare her organs: a pale red heart, young and beating, and a milky \"egg.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Countless fine threads sprouted from the egg, intertwining with Murphy's blood vessels in a symbiotic dance."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Were it not for the way It pressed against her heart, It might have seemed a natural part of her translucent body, not some foreign intruder."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Chaotic yet silent, It bore a frozen inverted triangle of black marks, like a grotesque work of art."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The Seafarer cult, the ritual wrecked by expedition teams, the previous host tainted by Dissolution... and the \"God\" inside you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Dissolution... that thing's been marked by Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Had enough of staring?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Sorry... please, button up."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Murphy lowered her head, adjusting her clothes while glancing at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You kept mentioning \"Dissolution.\" Is that what you call those black wounds on It?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The previous vessel... the one who truly carried this thing, was covered in those marks."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_26 = {
    Text = "If Dissolution hadn't weakened her, I wouldn't have been..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
Her voice trailed off.
She swallowed the rest of her words, pressing a hand to her chest, her expression shadowed.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
Tulu, you saw what that god looks like.
How long until It's fully grown?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
It's remarkably robust, nearly complete...
Only the guidance of the stars remains to spur It to tear through Its vessel's body.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You've encountered plenty of people with modified bodies—Aigis, Miss Mason, Lily, Lisa..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_30 = {
    Text = "I am astonished you can still move freely, even now."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_31 = {
    Text = "So... it's already that close..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I haven't lost consciousness yet because <Blue:Celeste> helped me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_33 = {Text = "Celeste?"},
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
Murphy gazed at the sky, swirling with strange, luminous hues.
Birds wheeled beneath the shimmering veil, the light soft and warped, shielding the ship from any storm beyond.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The Seafarer cult's notes obsess over the <Blue:stellar alignment>, insisting the birthing ritual must happen at a precise moment. That's why that woman wanted me asleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
The captain figured the god's growth might be tied to celestial cycles.
So Celeste wove this isolated Domain around the ship.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_37 = {
    Text = "We nailed it—since we left the true sky behind, It's gone dormant. If we can stay on this ship through this <Blue:stellar alignment>, maybe It'll sleep forever."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_38 = {
    Text = "So Celeste created this Domain, and she's the one steering the supposedly sunken Sona-Nyl."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
Sounds like she's an Awakener too.
Wait... is she the one you said could help find Ramona?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_4 = {
    Text = "But transplanting a <Blue:\"God\"> into a living person? That's just..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Exactly. Nothing on this ship escapes her notice."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_41 = {
    Text = "She must be with the captain, hiding from the Seafarers. If we find her, tracking down your friend will be a piece of cake."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_42 = {
    Text = "In other words, whether we help you first or save Ramona, Celeste is the key."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Tulu fell silent, tilting his head to watch you, waiting for your decision."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Indeed, whether to return the ship to land, halt the birthing ritual, or rescue Ramona, the only path forward was to find Celeste."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_45 = {
    Text = [[
Murphy, lead the way.
Find the captain. Find Celeste.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_5 = {
    Text = "What's with that look? Don't believe me? Fine, I didn't expect you to get it right away."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Sorry... it's just, this is all too bizarre to wrap my head around."
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Murphy, can I see that... \"God\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_8 = {
    Text = "And you say you're not doubting!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23857_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I-I'm just..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23858_Content_1 = {Text = "The Ambush"},
  AvgDialog_23858_Content_10 = {
    Text = "We're at <Blue:Bridgeport Town>'s <Blue:Third Wharf>, engaged with unknown hostiles."
  },
  AvgDialog_23858_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
Summoning nearest field investigators...
Investigator Delapore expected at Third Wharf in thirty minutes.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23858_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Thirty's too long. South road's swarming—we'll break north."
  },
  AvgDialog_23858_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Driver notified for pickup at Third Wharf north exit."
  },
  AvgDialog_23858_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Unknown hostiles? Not the <Yellow:Church of the Lightbearers>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23858_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Log new enemy intel?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23858_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Please, Erica—not now."
  },
  AvgDialog_23858_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Humanoids with undocumented aquatic traits; report forthcoming upon return."
  },
  AvgDialog_23858_Content_18 = {
    Text = "%player%, stay on guard and prepare for breakout."
  },
  AvgDialog_23858_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Three hours earlier
Port Town Bridgeport
Third Wharf]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23858_Content_3 = {
    Text = "%player%, watch out behind you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23858_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
Detecting unalerted high-frequency waves; comms auto-linking.
Once again, good evening, Keeper, Ramona.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23858_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Sounds like someone's scared witless."
  },
  AvgDialog_23858_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Please refrain from unnecessary verbal interference with field personnel."
  },
  AvgDialog_23858_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Fine, fine.
So, need a hand?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23858_Content_9 = {
    Text = "We need backup!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_1 = {Text = "No Escape"},
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Just as I thought—they're not following us up..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Ramona lowered her voice to a whisper."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_12 = {
    Text = "These fish-people are blocked by the Sona-Nyl, but for some reason, the ship let us aboard."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_13 = {
    Text = "We're the key to getting in. Once they're on board too, we're disposable."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Exactly. So... I've got an idea."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You stepped onto the final rung of the gangplank."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Your eyes were brushed by a warm breeze as gentle as the sky's caress upon a bird in flight, and the world seemed to be inverted before you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The massive full moon vanished from the sky. Aurora-like halos twisted around the ship's hull, casting eerie hues across the deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Ramona, something's wrong!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The gangplank shuddered. Now that you were safely on deck, the fish-people abandoned their watch, scrambling up with hands and feet."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Three hours earlier
Port Town Bridgeport
Third Wharf]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Too late—they're coming up."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Ramona swung her sword with full force, shattering the securing latch. The gangplank plummeted, but no thud echoed from below."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Your heart pounded wildly. The ship's anomalies flooded your mind. It took a moment before either of you could speak again."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_23 = {
    Text = "At least they can't board from this one."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The sights on this ship... definitely fit my stereotype of a ghost ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_25 = {
    Text = "No sound when the gangplank fell—means we're probably in some isolated space. Interesting, huh?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_26 = {
    Text = "This is a visible <Yellow:Domain>."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The fog around the school runs on <Yellow:Silver Technology>. Wonder what force powers this ship?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Could it be an Awakener?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_29 = {
    Text = "No records like this in the archives, but theoretically, an Awakener could create an isolated space—you want the details?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The acrid tang of rusted iron assaulted your nostrils. With each step, the gangplank groaned underfoot, teetering on the brink of collapse."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Spare me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Doll, you hearing this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Come on, read the room!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Sorry, sorry. Forgive my curiosity."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Doll, you hearing this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Ramona tapped her brooch. A faint glow flickered across the communicator's silver surface."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_36 = {Text = "Huh...?"},
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
Ramona leaned over and tapped your communicator.
You focused your mind as usual, but nothing happened.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Your mental energy dissipated like tears in the ocean, fading into silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Looks intact on the outside, but no signal's going out."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_4 = {
    Text = "No signs of maintenance or repairs, but aside from the age, the hull looks solid enough.\nNo obvious saltwater corrosion, and nothing clinging below the waterline—no barnacles, no oysters..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_40 = {
    Text = "<Small:Why's everything always jamming comms? Last time in the Wax Museum too...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_41 = {
    Text = [[
Silver tech isn't foolproof.
Besides, we're only scratching the surface with Silver anyway.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Hope those fish-people don't climb up somewhere else..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Yeah. Stay alert, and pray this ship doesn't set sail."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_44 = {
    Text = "<Big:Woo—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_45 = {
    Text = "As if a lark answered an opera singer's trill, a long horn blast echoed Ramona's prayer."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_46 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_47 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_48 = {
    Text = "I know what you're thinking, but please—not now."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_49 = {
    Text = "We can't sail out with the Sona-Nyl. Too many red flags on this ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona climbed the rickety gangplank side by side. The path ahead dissolved into a swirling fog, obscuring everything beyond."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Check the other side of the deck! I see ropes for a lifeboat—let's try escaping on the water."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Hold up... I hear something."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Fish-like faces emerged on deck. The culprits who chased you aboard closed in."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Find anything?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The Sona-Nyl doesn't match the profile of a sunken ghost ship. It contradicts the records of it going down in a storm."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I'd love to dig into this ship's history, but now's not the time."
  },
  AvgDialog_23859_Content_9 = {
    Text = "She glanced back. The enemies who herded you onto the gangplank clustered below, their vacant fish eyes locking onto yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The Indulgent"
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Finally, a face both familiar and strange."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_11 = {
    Text = "*Cough, cough, cough...!*"
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Dry air mixed with seawater lingering in your windpipe, irritating your respiratory tract like never before. Muscles spasmed, unleashing uncontrollable coughs."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The green-haired boy furrowed his brow slightly. Under his control, tentacles wrapped around you once more, then—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The tentacles contracted with precise force several times, expelling seawater and small fish from your throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_15 = {
    Text = "*Cough, cough...* Thank you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_16 = {
    Text = "No need for thanks. Your voice is too loud—it'll draw the other Seafarers."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_17 = {
    Text = "...I mean, for pulling me out of the sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
Though becoming an Awakener was not my wish, Mythag University did end my millennia-long slumber.
By reason and sentiment, I won't abandon a "Keeper" to death.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
But... you shouldn't be here, right?
The roster for this investigation only includes me and Ramona.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Water poured endlessly into your body.
Nostrils, ear, throat, eyes... every orifice in your upper body filled with seawater.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Without approval from the field operations leader, and unlinked by an investigator, Awakeners aren't allowed beyond Mythag's boundaries. I thought you knew that..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Awakener Tulu, File No. 6291. Codename: \"Slumbering Sovereign.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You know those so-called \"rules\" at Mythag University mean nothing to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_23 = {
    Text = "And don't use that foolish codename on me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_24 = {Text = "Tulu."},
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_25 = {
    Text = "I'm not one of those rigid types from the committee. To me, Awakeners aren't beasts to shackle."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
My concern is you're not on the field mission list, unlinked by anyone.
Stray too far from Mythag's <Yellow:Black Pool> for too long, and you'll slip into frenzy.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_27 = {
    Text = "No matter. I won't be ruled by so-called instincts."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
The Awakener retained his boyish form, yet every word and gesture carried the authority of a superior.
A mere fleeting glance sufficed to make one's hair stand on end.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_29 = {Text = "...Sigh."},
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Your blood reacted with the seawater in some way. Cells expelled from your frame, replaced by what seemed like coarse salt and grit flowing through your veins."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_30 = {
    Text = "—I just want to know what you're doing here.\nYou slumber year-round, not even stirring for the anomaly at the <Yellow:key-bestowal ceremony>."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Yet you risk losing your sanity to come here... Whatever happened, it must mean a lot to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
Everything unfolding here stems from me.
As for the details, they're none of your concern.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Really? None of my concern, even when Ramona and I crossed paths with that woman Miryam, and you could barely show up to help?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_34 = {
    Text = "I owe you no explanation, but if necessary, I'll lend aid."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Tulu's tight-lipped stance nearly ignited your anger, but reality preserved your reason."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Your hands clenched then relaxed yet again. After a few deep breaths, you finally turned to the Awakener boy before you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Ramona's in the Seafarers' hands. Tulu, I need your help."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Tulu lifted his head, gazing into your eyes for a long moment, as if brewing words of refusal."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Just as his lips twitched, ready to utter a reply, a girl's piercing scream echoed from the cabin depths."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_4 = {
    Text = "They scraped your body and soul from within. Your lungs brimmed with liquid. As your body sank, consciousness faded, worries for your partner squeezed out by pain and suffocation..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Is that Ramona!? Let's go!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_41 = {
    Text = "We don't know how many Seafarers are aboard. Rushing in unprepared is truly foolish."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_42 = {Text = "Foolish?"},
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_43 = {
    Text = "If, as you say, you won't abandon a \"Keeper\" to death..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Tulu, I'm about to walk to my doom."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Tulu cradled his head without reply, but as you turned to dash deeper into the cabin, you caught the boy's faint, almost imperceptible sigh."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_5 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Ripples stirred the sea surface, crashing against your eardrums. You struggled to open your eyes. Something dove beneath the waves, silhouetted against the light."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_7 = {
    Text = "It wrapped nimbly around your waist, like seaweed... no, not seaweed, but some soft yet incredibly tough muscle..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_8 = {Text = "Swish—"},
  AvgDialog_23860_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The elongated muscle dragged you upward. Pink light from the Domain's sky entered your vision, followed by the beams of the lower deck, then the flickering electric lamps in the cabin."
  },
  AvgDialog_23861_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Their grotesque features alone felt like a blasphemy against evolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_23861_Content_2 = {
    Text = "They shoved each other, their crude weapons clanging harshly. Amid the chaos, they seemed to cluster around something..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23862_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Damn it, damn it, damn it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23862_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The Seafarers should've been barred by the Sona-Nyl's Domain. If not for this creepy little black-caped weirdo, I could've slipped away to the new continent without a worry..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23862_Content_3 = {
    Text = "But... they took down so many Seafarers... Could they actually be telling the truth?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23863_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
But... when did Miryam start pulling these tricks?
Sending people to lure me back... that's not her style.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23863_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Murphy? You there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23863_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Tch, you guys are relentless."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Crew Member"
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You pulled that mental trick to poke into Miryam's head, and now she knows \"you're alive\"... Even a dead fish on the beach could tell you're not with them."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_11 = {
    Text = "What is this safe place you speak of?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Quit asking so much—just keep quiet and follow me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Murphy paid no mind if you and Tulu were keeping up. She deftly pushed open another hatch and slipped through with ease."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_14 = {
    Text = "As you prepared to follow, Tulu extended a tentacle, blocking the way between you and the door."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Keeper, do not drop your guard around this girl."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_16 = {Text = "Why?"},
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Tulu sidestepped your question with one of his own."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Tell me, how do you view the Seafarers?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Seafarers? Webbed digits, bodies fish-like above the tailbone, retaining some intelligence."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Murphy led you through the cabins, tiptoeing to evade the Seafarers' patrols."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Sleek and natural forms—not like the Sculptors' Association's messes; those guys always botch their experiments into horrors."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_21 = {
    Text = "I figured their looks came from mutations after <Yellow:Cataclysm> exposure, but in these fights, I haven't spotted any clear <Yellow:D-Marks> on them."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Seafarers... more like evolution's dumb joke on humanity."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_23 = {
    Text = "They revere Miryam as high priestess. Less a tribe, more a group bound by faith."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_24 = {
    Text = "\"Evolution's dumb joke on humanity\"—I appreciate your metaphor."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_25 = {
    Text = "This girl—Murphy. When we found her, Seafarers prostrated around her. And given her familiarity with Miryam, she's no ordinary follower."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Tell me, was \"Murphy\" present in Miryam's spirit realm?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You opened your mouth, but before your vocal cords vibrated, a muffled yelp and garbled noises echoed from beyond the door."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Where are we headed?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Somewhere safe, to find someone who can help."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Isn't your partner kidnapped? I know a person who knows every inch of this ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Find her first, then have her locate your friend... Beats running around like a headless chicken, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Speaking of which, you don't think we're bad guys anymore?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Murphy shot you a glare, huffing like a cat."
  },
  AvgDialog_23864_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I'm not some idiot—I heard everything you and tentacle-boy said."
  },
  AvgDialog_23865_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Enough. They're insignificant."
  },
  AvgDialog_23865_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
A figure stood silent at the rear of the horde, now speaking.
An adult woman, her body shrouded in black veils, stood out starkly among the hideous, deformed fish-people.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23865_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The alignment draws near. Loyal seafarers, believers in the Divine Realm—end this farce... Welcome back the <Blue:Divine Mother>. Welcome the God's return."
  },
  AvgDialog_23865_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
At her command, a boy unlike the surrounding fish-people stepped forward.
He bowed deeply to the woman, his tone brimming with unmasked loyalty and pride.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23865_Content_5 = {
    Text = "As you command, Lady Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_23866_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Over there!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23866_Content_10 = {
    Text = "What are you doing!? You don't have the right to lay hands on me! Let me see Miryam if you dare!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23866_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Miryam... that's the woman's name! So this girl knows the leader, but why are these Seafarers hunting her..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23866_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Before you could sort it out, thick tentacles grazed your shoulder, lunging fiercely at the Serpentine Seafarer."
  },
  AvgDialog_23866_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The latter was caught off guard but quickly reacted, hissing with forked tongue as it tangled with Tulu's tentacles."
  },
  AvgDialog_23866_Content_2 = {
    Text = "@1Divine... Mother @2..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23866_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Several Seafarers formed a circle, surrounding a corner of the cabin. They chanted in grating tones, nearly drowning the girl's sobs."
  },
  AvgDialog_23866_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Stay... away from me! Don't even think of dragging me back!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23866_Content_5 = {
    Text = "That's... not Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_23866_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The Seafarer leader prostrated reverently before the girl, while others gripped her limbs with webbed palms."
  },
  AvgDialog_23866_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The leader rose abruptly. Only then did you see that beneath \"her\" veil writhed several dancing snake heads, utterly bizarre."
  },
  AvgDialog_23866_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The snake-headed one traced odd runes on the floor, then accepted a sack from a Seafarer. A nauseating stench emanated from within."
  },
  AvgDialog_23866_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Fangs tore a gash in the sack. Rotten viscera spilled like sardines, landing squarely on the runes. Putrid odor instantly permeated the cabin."
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Madman's Cleaver"
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_10 = {
    Text = "But look what's in front of us.\nJust a sealed wall—not even a vent to crawl through."
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I... I just don't come down alone much. Usually I'm with the captain and crew."
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_12 = {
    Text = "There's a deck plan on the wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_13 = {
    Text = "What's that supposed to mean? You doubting my memory?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I said I can find it, so I can—the captain's gotta be this way!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
My partner's waiting for our help.
Please, Lady Murphy, check the plan.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_16 = {Text = "...Hmph!"},
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Murphy stomped hard, reluctantly leaning in to examine the bulkhead's deck plan."
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_18 = {Text = "Hmm..."},
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Let me see."
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Weird... I remember the captain saying to head toward the engine room if there's trouble..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_20 = {
    Text = "To reach the engine room, we must take these stairs up to the main deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Y-yeah! I remember now—the engine room's sealed tight, but with only one way in and out, it's safer."
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_22 = {
    Text = "So we'll have to head back to the deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Ramona and I got ambushed by Seafarers up there... The deck's probably crawling with patrols—we must be careful, avoid fights if possible."
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_3 = {Text = "Murphy..."},
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Shush, you're interrupting my thinking."
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
You kept quiet on "interrupting Murphy's thinking."
But you knew you had to stop her from "thinking" any further.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Under Murphy's lead, your trio reached the hold's end. Ahead loomed a cold steel bulkhead, with only an upward staircase—no way forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Are you lost?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_8 = {
    Text = "No way! I don't get lost!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23867_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I've lived on this ship for months—I know every vent, every rat hole."
  },
  AvgDialog_23872_Content_1 = {Text = "Apostle"},
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The black mist quietly released Sorel, surging aimlessly in all directions."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The world around you begins to fall apart."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The dome peeled away like wisps of willow, and the visible world warped, tore, and shattered like sails in a strong wind."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
8:58PM
2 minutes until Domain collapse <Red:2>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The Domain is collapsing! Just hold on until the last second and avoid being touched by this black mist..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You stagger to the edge of the terrace."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Oh no... We have no way out!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Behind you, the roaring and surging black mist rolls in like ocean waves."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Ahead lies a black abyss that stretches as far as the eye can see."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
8:59PM
1 minute until Domain collapse <Red:1>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Sorel gently holds your hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_2 = {
    Text = "...Has He left?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_20 = {
    Text = "This time, you must hurry up, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_21 = {
    Text = "In the next second, all of you plunge into the profound darkness ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The wind howls in my ears, like the gentle breath of the gods stirring in their sleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Sorel tightly grips your hand, her tangled hair blending into the darkness. Suddenly, she laughs."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_24 = {
    Text = "What are you laughing at?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_25 = {
    Text = "...You now look like a true knight."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_26 = {
    Text = "A respected and true knight, forced to rescue a false princess."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You gaze at her face, so close to yours. Unlike her former flawless self, she now bears scars and is filled with weariness."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_28 = {
    Text = "I think... you actually look like a true princess now."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Sorel's eyes gently curved, like the surface of a bottomless lake reflecting soft starlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Sorel gently closed her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_30 = {
    Text = "It is my honor, %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The ever-spreading black mist is left far behind. You hold Sorel tightly, letting yourself fall rapidly into the darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_33 = {
    Text = [[
9:00PM
<Red:Domain Collapse>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Thud—Thud—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The chimes of the hour drift leisurely, sinking all the way to the end of the Abyss."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Then you heard the Domain shatter, like a heart breaking unnoticed in the distance."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_37 = {
    Text = "You also hear the sound of your bones shattering in unison and flesh flying."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_38 = {
    Text = "A faint scent of roses reaches your nose. You close your eyes, feeling relieved for the first time."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_39 = {
    Text = "■<Yellow:Summary of the Third Artificial Domain Investigation>\n\nWe drove off N and the black mist before the Domain collapsed.\nI'm not sure if it worked, but after Sorel's second awakening, her hand was clean, with no contract marks.\n\nMs. Doll said that the first words Sorel spoke upon waking were—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_4 = {
    Text = "I can no longer sense Its presence. It must have left."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_40 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:We escaped together.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_5 = {
    Text = "He has always been a guy who avoids trouble."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_6 = {
    Text = "What about this black mist...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Don't touch them, or you might be taken to an unexpected dimension."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Knock, knock. Knock, knock."
  },
  AvgDialog_23880_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You seem to hear a rapid pulse from the depths of the universe, with black mist surging and receding endlessly."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Huh... Has He disappeared again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_10 = {
    Text = "My plan has been discovered... Ugh!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Sorel let out a low groan. Strands of mucus oozed from the letters carved on the back of her hand, slowly creeping up her body."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The sharp knife slices through the thorns without hesitation, tearing the elegant dress and exposing the scarred skin beneath."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Sorel grips her blade, her expression as calm as water, not even blinking."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_15 = {
    Text = "This knife doesn't belong to Mr. Lambert...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Yeah. I knew from the start that he was hiding outside, holding that knife."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Too bad, I waited and waited... In the end, he still ran off and left this knife behind."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Heh... My dear father, what else can he do but bring me trouble?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_19 = {
    Text = "He can't even manage to kill me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Just playing a game of hide and seek with us. Hiding in the shadows, savoring my fear and pain..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Sorel slashed at the overgrown vines, cutting away all the necrotic Caro."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_22 = {
    Text = "She looked up at the pitch-black, seemingly endless ceiling."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You must be pleased now, seeing me in such a sorry state..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_24 = {
    Text = "As always, she received no response — except for the mist entwining her body."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Is this the punishment for breaking the contract? I won't fall here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_26 = {
    Text = "When I first emerged from the countryside of Constan, I was alone, with neither money nor fame."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
Lies are my disguise, rumors are my weapon, and the masses are my ladder to climb higher.
Everything in this world serves my purpose.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_28 = {
    Text = "I've made it this far, neither because of my father nor N."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The only thing I truly rely on is myself."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_3 = {Text = "Hmm—!!"},
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_30 = {
    Text = "I chose to make a contract with Him. I chose to break it. I chose..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Get rid of my father forever."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_32 = {
    Text = "She gently grasps your wrist."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_33 = {
    Text = "This shadow is merely a projection of It in the mortal realm and not without countermeasures."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_34 = {
    Text = "As long as I can <Yellow:hold out until the Domain concludes>, I will remain the resurrected Sorel, and the contract will become void."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Help me get through this difficult time, and I will consider your conditions."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_36 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Even at a time like this, you're still only \"thinking it over\"...? >"
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
I know what you're thinking.
Don't worry, I can agree to about 70% of these terms. Those old guys should be popping champagne in celebration.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_38 = {
    Text = "But this is merely an artificial domain. You won't suffer any damage in reality. Why...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_39 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Sorel collapsed to the ground. Beneath her, a dark red bloodstain slowly spread under her skirt."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_40 = {
    Text = "A pleased sigh comes from above, as if relishing your fear and helplessness."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Black mist continuously escaped from her eyes, nose, and throat, then devoured the entire opera house."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_42 = {
    Text = "A rift tore through the darkness, like the universe opening its giant maw, with planets rolling inside aimlessly."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_43 = {
    Text = "It's as if the gods lazily opened their eyes from a dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_44 = {
    Text = "No light, no belonging, no sensation."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_45 = {Text = "Boom—"},
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_46 = {
    Text = "With a loud crash, the terrace you are on becomes the only island in an ocean of darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Sorel knelt before the rift. Countless arms formed from the fog clutched her tightly, attempting to drag her into the rift behind."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Lady Sorel!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
Can you see... It is an existence that defies the laws.
Reality and dreams are meaningless to it.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Madam, you... you're bleeding!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Black mist pierces her body, then pours out of her eyes, nose, and ears with frenzied force"
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_51 = {
    Text = "More and more blood spilled from the corner of Sorel's mouth, but she gave you a faint smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Help me. Let's drive It back together."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_53 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Money, power, or anything else. Just get me out of here, and I'll fulfill your wishes as much as possible."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_55 = {
    Text = "She struggled closer to you, but there was no trace of pleading on her face."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_56 = {
    Text = "It's more about the survival desire of an animal on the brink of death, desperately doing anything to stay alive."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_57 = {
    Text = "%player%... Don't you still owe me a drink? Remember?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_58 = {
    Text = "To help, or not to help?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Knowing that she could tear up her promise at any moment, you still decide to take a gamble."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Sorel carefully wiped away the blood from the corner of her mouth. Even at this moment, she would never lose an ounce of composure."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_60 = {
    Text = "I promise you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Please don't misunderstand. I just want to ensure the negotiation goes smoothly..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Sorel's lips curled slightly, her eyes sparkling like stars, illuminating everything around in the silent night."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_63 = {
    Text = "You are not merely a knight, but a wise one."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_7 = {
    Text = "She struggles to lift her head, staring directly into your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_8 = {
    Text = "He is very interested in you. Your repeated intrusions into my mind have finally drawn His attention."
  },
  AvgDialog_23881_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Where blood flowed, grotesque roses bloomed, and sharp thorns transformed into a pitch-black mist, slowly entwining her body."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Lamprey elixir"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_10 = {
    Text = "<Red:Bang—!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Good, there's a reaction. Prepare for the second electric shock."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_12 = {
    Text = "<Red:Bang—!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_13 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Phew... finally saved."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Welcome home, %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
Mythag Infirmary
Two Hours Later]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Miss Sylvia, why are you here as well...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I heard someone entered the Artificial Domain twice in a row. As a psychological counselor at Mythag, I have to check on everyone's mental state."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Sorry, Miss Sylvia, for the trouble..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Adrenaline isn't working, blood keeps flowing from my eyes and nose... and ears as well."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Sylvia gently shook her head."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, this time I came prepared—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_22 = {
    Text = "This time, I brought my latest creation, <Blue:Lamprey Oolong Tea>, which has an invigorating and refreshing effect~"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Lamprey? Oolong tea? How are they combined..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_24 = {
    Text = [[
This tea exudes a strong ominous vibe, both in name and scent.
You reluctantly took a few sips.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_25 = {
    Text = "How is it? You're its first tester."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Ramona didn't even take a look before rejecting it... So heartless..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Bitter. It's just too bitter."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Sylvia looks at you eagerly, and you reluctantly take another two sips."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Not bad... I must say, its taste is impressive and truly invigorating."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Heart stopped. Maybe try what Winkle said... electric shock..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_30 = {
    Text = "In half an hour"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_31 = {
    Text = "What's happening in the Domain?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Ramona said you were drinking with Lady Sorel, joking about Dexter, and then you suddenly went out of contact."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_33 = {
    Text = "...I've been discovered."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_34 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Lady Sorel's consciousness, or perhaps something else, detected my intrusion into the Domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The shadow on the stage... is a powerful presence."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_37 = {
    Text = "It spotted me and told me to get lost."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_38 = {
    Text = "I see, we underestimated Lady Sorel. The shadow might be part of her consciousness..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Driven by a protective instinct, it will expel all intruders."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_4 = {
    Text = "No, this is far too risky."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Perhaps... it seems like there's a gap in my memory. I feel that the shadow said something really important..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Lady Sorel's Silver refinement went smoothly. These questions will have to wait until her second Awake to ask her directly."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Do we still need to enter the Domain for investigation?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Oolong tea is indeed effective; you keenly notice Doll's rare moment of averting her gaze."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_44 = {
    Text = "...Don't rush, take a good rest first."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Knock, knock."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_46 = {
    Text = "A series of regular knocks sounded, and Dexter walked in with his long legs."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Thank goodness you're finally awake. Ramona was crying and throwing a tantrum to visit you, almost tearing my clothes apart."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_48 = {
    Text = "How about trying this cup of oolong tea? It helps refresh your mind and rid you of unnecessary delusions."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_49 = {
    Text = "How can this be? I can't possibly accept the special blend Miss Silvia prepared just for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_5 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_50 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_51 = {
    Text = "You look upset? Let's talk about something cheerful."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_52 = {
    Text = "This time, you made significant breakthroughs in the Artificial Domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_53 = {
    Text = "I was quite worried about the nobleman you met inside, so I went out for a drink with some friends from the police department."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_54 = {
    Text = "...Drinking is your true purpose, isn't it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Ahem. In short, they told me that on the day Lady Sorel passed away, there was actually one person who left without providing a statement."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_56 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Hasn't everyone given their statements?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_58 = {
    Text = "They didn't tell the truth. This guest holds a very noble status, someone they cannot afford to offend."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Dexter finishes speaking and slaps a newspaper down in front of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_6 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_60 = {
    Text = "The newspaper had a sensational headline in large print: \"Father-Daughter Bond! Sorel names father as sole heir,\" accompanied by a photo."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_61 = {
    Text = "In the photo, Sorel is embracing an old man named <Blue:Lambert> with deep emotion. Of course, while wiping away her tears, she deliberately shows off the turquoise ring on her hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_62 = {
    Text = "This ring quickly became a popular trend that year, with various imitations emerging one after another."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Identify this man. Is Mr. Lambert the gentleman you saw in the Artificial Domain?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_64 = {
    Text = "At that time, he only revealed one hand. It was thin, as if he were seriously ill, and adorned with many rings..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_65 = {
    Text = "The elderly man in the photo is dressed lavishly, his face obscured. You notice his hands tightly clutching Sorel."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_66 = {
    Text = [[
The same flamboyant style, the same slim figure, even the age spots are in the exact same place...
It's him.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_67 = {
    Text = "We also came across a mansion filled with roses inside. I suspect it has something to do with Lady Sorel..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Dex nodded in approval."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_69 = {
    Text = "I asked a friend to check, and that mansion is now registered under the name of Sorel's father, Mr. Lambert."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Let's proceed. Prepare for the first electric shock."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_70 = {
    Text = "In the Domain, someone holding a knife is pacing outside Lady Sorel's box. Judging by the figure, it is likely Mr. Lambert."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Alright, it all comes together now. <Yellow:Mr. Lambert is a key suspect.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_72 = {
    Text = "What about that masked shadow? We saw him kill Sorel with our own eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Perhaps an accomplice, but let's capture Lambert first."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_74 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_75 = {
    Text = "I've heard that Sorel and Mr. Lambert are very close and often attend social events together. I didn't expect there to be such a story behind it."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_76 = {
    Text = "A father plotting to kill his own daughter? Unheard of."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Dexter shrugged indifferently."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_78 = {
    Text = "The closer one gets to power and money, the farther they drift from humanity. The people in this circle are masters of acting."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_79 = {
    Text = "What about you, Noble Dexter? Are you also good at acting?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_8 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Dexter was stunned for a moment, then burst into laughter."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_81 = {
    Text = "My answer has no value, my child. Trust your own judgment."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_82 = {
    Text = "...let's get back to business. Where did Ramona go?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_83 = {
    Text = "She recovered quickly and went with the police to arrest Mr. Lambert."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_84 = {
    Text = "This old fox is extremely cunning; don't give him any chance to escape."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_85 = {
    Text = [[
Mythag University
School Office]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Now it's just the two of us. Let's have an open and honest conversation."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_87 = {
    Text = "%player% and Ramona are clueless, but I'm not so easily deceived."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_88 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Sorel's been an Awakener for centuries. Where does this father come from?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_89 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Am I... dead...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_90 = {
    Text = "It's best not to ask about her; it won't help. I'm not the final decision-maker for this investigation task."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Nice, it seems we've really taken on quite the mess."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_92 = {
    Text = "The situation might be more serious than you think. <Yellow:Above> sent people today, asking me to chat with %player% alone, to assign new tasks to {Male=him,Female=her}."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_93 = {
    Text = "...Even the higher-ups were alarmed..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Sorel is no ordinary Awakener. The power and resources behind her are formidable, even surpassing those of your family."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_95 = {
    Text = "The higher-ups will never allow Mythag to handle events related to her independently."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_96 = {
    Text = "I don't care what those old men are scheming. I have only one bottom line—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_97 = {
    Text = "The safety of those two children."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_98 = {
    Text = "Doll lets out a barely audible sigh."
  },
  AvgDialog_23882_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Believe it or not, this is also my bottom line."
  },
  AvgDialog_23883_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Not only roses, but also hints of lavender and citrus..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23883_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Could it really be Lady Sorel's bathwater?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23883_Content_3 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23883_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Is this important to you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23883_Content_5 = {
    Text = "If it really is her bathwater, what are you planning to do?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_1 = {Text = "For sorel"},
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_10 = {
    Text = "As for her poor father, he was labeled the murderer who harmed his own daughter and was even accused of assassinating a noble."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Lambert's entire body trembled, a sharp and high-pitched laugh continuously escaping from deep within his throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_101 = {
    Text = "I did say that only complete death could end our contract, and you believed it without hesitation"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_102 = {
    Text = "Weak souls always place their hopes on the mercy of the powerful and firmly believe in the rules governing this world."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_103 = {
    Text = "But all of this is merely our game."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_104 = {
    Text = "<Shake:You're not him... you are...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_105 = {
    Text = "Lambert envelops himself in a thick black mist, his figure twisting and mutating with each breath of the fog..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_106 = {
    Text = "<RedItalic:I make the rules, and I break them.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_107 = {
    Text = [[
Long time no see, Sorel.
I've missed you so much that I borrowed Mr. Lambert's body.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_108 = {
    Text = "It's truly heartbreaking... It seems you don't want to see me and have tried every possible means to get rid of me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_109 = {
    Text = "The endless black mist surged out, piercing through Sorel's body."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Speaking of which, Sorel really should thank you. If you hadn't pulled her out of the artificial Domain..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_110 = {
    Text = "No, no... Our contract... I clearly broke it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_111 = {
    Text = [[
But you turned around and signed an agreement with those fools.
You once belonged to me. How could I bear to see you constrained by them?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_112 = {
    Text = "Of course, I'm here to guide you back. The hide-and-seek in the Domain was just a small welcome gift. Did you enjoy it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_113 = {
    Text = "Sorel knelt down in pain. On the back of her pale hand, a familiar letter faintly appeared for an instant and then quickly vanished."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_114 = {
    Text = "As fleeting as a human's transient life."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_115 = {
    Text = "I've planned for so long... was it all in vain?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_116 = {
    Text = "<Gray:No, I don't believe it... There must be a way...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_117 = {
    Text = "A gentle breeze blew by, making the crimson rose petals flutter. Sorel caught a faint scent of flowers from distant memories."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_118 = {
    Text = "Sorel, do you know the language of roses?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_119 = {
    Text = "Hmm... Unwavering love?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You shook your head."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_120 = {
    Text = "Not only that. I heard that in faraway Londinium, roses also symbolize beautiful aspirations."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_121 = {
    Text = [[
Aspiration for love, family, and all the beautiful things in the world.
Sorel, you will become an aspiration for everyone in the future.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_122 = {
    Text = "Becoming the aspiration of the people...? Why?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_123 = {
    Text = [[
Because you are like this rose, beautiful and resilient.
You will never be like me, always in tears.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_124 = {
    Text = [[
My daughter never cries easily, nor does she give up easily.
She will grasp her own destiny with her own hands.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_125 = {
    Text = "Sorel wiped the blood from the corner of her mouth and clenched her skirt. She still couldn't look directly at N's face, but her voice no longer trembled."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_126 = {
    Text = [[
Master, you are afraid.
You fear Mythag, as well as that fledgling Keeper.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_127 = {
    Text = "N The black mist beneath the brim quivers slightly, and a hoarse yet delighted laugh emanates from within."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_128 = {
    Text = "That's not fear, my child. Don't you humans have a saying, \"apprehensive when nearing home\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_129 = {
    Text = "I indeed have some unavoidable reasons driving me to keep my distance from Mythag and %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I'm just a negotiation tool assigned from above. If she dies completely, won't the negotiations be wasted?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_130 = {
    Text = "So you didn't want to stay in the Domain for too long, which gave us a chance to escape."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_131 = {
    Text = "Master, you have walked the human world for thousands of years, so you must surely know—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_132 = {
    Text = "When a person is driven into a corner, fear no longer resides in their heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_133 = {
    Text = "Well, today I've become your captive once again because of my weakness and foolishness."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_134 = {
    Text = [[
But it's alright.
Once, twice... As long as there's the slightest chance to escape, I won't let it slip away.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_135 = {
    Text = "Whether it's Mythag or %player%, it makes no difference to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_136 = {
    Text = "Aren't you fond of betting with others? How about a wager with me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_137 = {
    Text = "Your growth never ceases to amaze me. So, what's the wager?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_138 = {
    Text = "Sorel gently closed her eyes. She prided herself on being rational, always detesting risk."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_139 = {
    Text = "Life can be different. Life itself is a huge gamble, and no one can remain unscathed."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_14 = {
    Text = "So... just a routine task, that's all."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_140 = {
    Text = "The stakes are... everything I have."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_141 = {
    Text = [[
Alright, this is where the story comes to a pause for now.
As for the future fate of that Rose Maiden, let's wait and see.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_142 = {
    Text = "To ensure this ending doesn't feel too perfunctory, allow me to add a few more words."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_143 = {
    Text = "Humans or Awakeners... You naively believe you can escape me and create your own future."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_144 = {
    Text = "<Red:But all of this is in vain.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_145 = {
    Text = "You can never get rid of me, just like you can never escape <Yellow:Destiny>."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_146 = {
    Text = "Remember..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_147 = {
    Text = "When you tried to avoid <Yellow:Destiny>, you had already encountered <Red:Destiny>."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_15 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Whoa! Lady Sorel has appeared!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Crowds gathered along the roads early. This is Lady Sorel's first public appearance since the falling incident."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_18 = {
    Text = "She wears a magnificent dress, calmly accepting everyone's admiration amidst the swirling rose petals, looking like an incredibly exquisite doll."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Long hair glistens with a golden glow in the sunlight, like flowing ribbons."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Londinium Downtown
A month later]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Lady Sorel! <Big:Lady Sorel—!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Oh my god, she just looked at me, she looked at me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona are pushed aside by the noisy crowd, only able to watch Sorel from afar."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Tearing up contracts, eliminating rivals, and kicking her deadweight father to the curb—in just a month, she surpassed her goals."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_24 = {
    Text = "No longer controlled or manipulated by others."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Sorel held her head high, gracefully passing through the flowers and applause, heading toward her future."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_26 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Suddenly remembered, this is the first time I've seen her outside the Domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_28 = {
    Text = "On the day Sorel successfully Awakened, everyone was ordered not to visit."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_29 = {
    Text = "You only know that she later engaged in a week-long tough negotiation with the so-called <Yellow:upper echelon>, and both sides eventually signed a secret agreement."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Breaking News!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_30 = {
    Text = "As for the contents of the agreement, you have no right to inquire."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You seem a bit distracted. Is something on your mind?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_32 = {
    Text = "...I almost failed to recognize her in this state."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Sorel in the Domain seems much more vivid. She might impulsively hug you or offer you expensive champagne..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Will unhesitatingly drag you down into the abyss together."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_35 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
She might not remember anything.
I even suspect that using me to kick out N was part of her plan...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Something cold suddenly brushed against my cheek for an instant."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_38 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Hiss—! What's going on...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_39 = {
    Text = "How could this be? It's only been a few days, and you've already forgotten me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You won't believe it! Lady Sorel, who fell to her death recently, has come back to life!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Miss Karen..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Karen smiled and handed you a champagne bottle tied with a ribbon."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_42 = {
    Text = "My lady is very grateful for your assistance in the Domain and has specially entrusted Karen to deliver a grand gift to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_43 = {
    Text = "You take the ice-cold champagne, curiously examining it."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_44 = {
    Text = "It's the champagne you drank in the Domain. In the sunlight, the golden-green bottle gleamed faintly with a golden glow, clearly indicating its high price."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Treasure it, this bottle of wine is extremely expensive!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_46 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:If I were you, I'd definitely sell it and live a life without worries!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_47 = {
    Text = "So she remembered everything..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_48 = {
    Text = "You raise your head in surprise."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I've heard that she survived an assassination attempt by her father @2: Lambert and was mistakenly declared dead by a quack doctor!"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Sorel gets closer and closer to you. In the moment when you pass by each other, she gives you a slight smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_51 = {
    Text = "A clean floral scent reaches the tip of my nose, like a newly bloomed rose basking in the morning sun, completely free from any trace of decay."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Red petals danced in the sunlight, golden hair waving like the sea, shimmering with the sun's Glimmer."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_53 = {
    Text = "The moment she looked at you, a slight crack appeared in her perfect makeup, drawing you closer."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Amidst the bustling crowd, you seem to hear her say—"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_55 = {
    Text = "You still owe me a drink, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_58 = {
    Text = [[
Londinium Outskirts
Lambert's Residence]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_59 = {
    Text = "The gloomy old man sat in the desolate hall, silently watching the uninvited guest who had pushed the door open."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_6 = {
    Text = "After she had been buried in the coffin for nearly a month, on a dark and stormy night, the ranger Jacob suddenly heard knocking coming from inside the coffin..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Good afternoon, Father."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_61 = {
    Text = "What a rare visitor, Sorel. I've lost count of how many times you've turned me away since I went bankrupt."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_62 = {
    Text = "I thought you had long forgotten that you even had a father."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Is this how you treat your savior? It took me a great deal of effort to get you out of prison."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_64 = {
    Text = "You're smart enough to use a will to lure me in, but do you really think I'd believe you rescued me just to save my life? Cough, cough..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_65 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_66 = {
    Text = [[
I heard that when the police took you away, you accepted your "crime" without any argument.
Why?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_67 = {
    Text = "From the moment you fell from the building, I knew. I was no match for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_68 = {
    Text = "My daughter is a devil who could mercilessly kill herself and send her own father to the gallows."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Because I have an excellent teacher, my dearest father."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Calling the second Awake a resurrection, nice spin."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_70 = {
    Text = "The old man laughed heartily, then glanced at the portrait hanging on the wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_71 = {Text = "Go, Sorel."},
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_72 = {
    Text = "If your mother Rebecca were still alive, she wouldn't want to see us in this state."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Sorel walked over the petals and fallen leaves to her father."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_74 = {
    Text = "She crouched down and gently rested her head on the old man's trembling, withered knees."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Don't avoid me, Father. This should be our final meeting."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Remember when I loved resting on your knee as a child..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Lambert remained silent, his decaying body trembling slightly for a moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_78 = {
    Text = "We are the same kind of people. An unceasing ambition flows through our veins, turning us into demons of fame and power."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_79 = {
    Text = "I can never hate you, just as I can never hate myself."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Now Sorel's popularity among the people has soared. I've heard that six or seven related plays are already being prepared in the West District."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Lambert gazed at his deceased wife's portrait, tears streaming down."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_81 = {
    Text = [[
Is that so... But when I look at your mother's face, I feel sorrowful.
I am different from you, Sorel.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_82 = {
    Text = "I don't want to become like you... I don't want to..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_83 = {
    Text = "I see, I see it all... Reviving you and then allowing Dissolution to spread to you, it was all part of N's plan, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_84 = {
    Text = "The purpose is to monitor and disgust me. His taste remains as terrible as ever."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_85 = {
    Text = "How do you know?! How dare you mention the name of that esteemed person..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_86 = {
    Text = "What an irony. First, we father and daughter became slaves to power, and now we have both become His slaves."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Isn't fratricide and cannibalism His favorite spectacle to watch?"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Father, my contract with Him ended long ago. We are both free now."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_89 = {
    Text = "I set aside some money and got you a fake ID. Now you can go anywhere you want."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Yeah. She became a living legend."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_90 = {
    Text = "As long as you never show up in front of me again this lifetime, you can do whatever you want."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_91 = {
    Text = [[
Heh... Are you mocking me?
In this miserable state, I can't go anywhere...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_92 = {
    Text = [[
I will get you the best doctor.
You are my father. As long as you wish, you can survive until the day the world meets its destruction.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Sorel let out a long breath as she spoke."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_94 = {
    Text = "I've waited long enough for this day. Now I finally have enough chips to cut all this off myself..."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Farewell, my father."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_96 = {
    Text = "<Red:Hehe.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_97 = {
    Text = "A short, familiar snicker abruptly pierces your ears."
  },
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_98 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_23884_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Farewell? Sorel, my naive Sorel..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_1 = {Text = "Hmm!!"},
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Even willing to kill their own daughter..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Lambert slowly picked up the wine glass on the table and took a small sip of the red wine inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Heh... To you, of course, I can no longer taste this drink."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_13 = {
    Text = "But you know what? When I swallow it, my memories and imagination keep telling me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_14 = {
    Text = "This is a Montachet wine from @2 years. Initially, it should have a licorice aroma, and after two hours, you'll notice a strong rose scent..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Lambert took a deep sniff of the red wine in his glass, a look of deep satisfaction spreading across his face."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_16 = {
    Text = "It's just imagination. Sooner or later, you'll have to face reality, Mr. Lambert."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Yes, imagine! It's a powerful force."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The imagination of money, power, and desire... It can corrupt the purest monk and turn the lowest thief into a prophet."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_19 = {
    Text = "And my dearest daughter? She dared to take away my last shred of imagination."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Mr. Lambert, you have no way out. Please cooperate with our work."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The only valuable thing I have left is this bottle of wine. This is the cruelest thing in the world..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_21 = {
    Text = "So I was forced to commit this despicable crime."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Now you can take me away and pin all the crimes on me alone."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
Unlike some people, I'm just an insignificant nobody.
In this world, my life or death doesn't matter.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Reading between the lines... Are you implying something, Mr. Langbert?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Lambert did not respond. He smiled faintly and spread his hands toward the crowd."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Take me away, Officer."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Outside the mansion, it was noisy, and the detectives were still busy nearby."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Looking back at the mansion, its dilapidated exterior shrouded in an everlasting gloom, like a shipwreck submerged deep beneath the sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Ramona gently took off the badge from her chest and opened a communication with Dexter."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Lambert leaned on his slender beechwood cane and suddenly burst out laughing."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The target has been captured and has confessed to the crime."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Well done, just as expected of my daughter."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_32 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_33 = {
    Text = "What about her? After becoming successful, she not only failed to repay me but also wanted to distance herself from me."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Repay. Ramona silently mulled over this word."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Father, what would you have me do for you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_36 = {
    Text = "What? Is this some new code you and %player% came up with? I can't understand what you mean."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Hmm... For example, helping you earn a lot of money, or conducting some investigations or research for you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Hold on... Hold on! I wouldn't dare make such a request. Just stay alive, that's all that matters."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Accompanied by a gentle electric hum, Dexter's rambling became somewhat unclear, causing Ramona to chuckle."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_4 = {
    Text = "What's so funny about this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Father, thank you."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_41 = {
    Text = "You're acting really strange today, suddenly so formal. What are you thanking me for?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Ramona lowered her head, the tips of her shoes lightly grinding the fallen leaves beneath her feet. These shoes were also bought for her by Dexter."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Little dress, music box, pink-necked longhorn beetle... Dexter bought her many things. But he never asked for anything in return."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Everything."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid, little girl... I'm just laughing at myself."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Black D-slime flows from the eye sockets, like black tears."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
Symptoms in the late stage of Dissolution... 
If I'm not mistaken, your internal organs have already turned into D-slime.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You can't smell the roses, feel the warmth of the sun, or taste the wine."
  },
  AvgDialog_24075_Content_9 = {
    Text = "For someone like you, worldly wealth and power have long since lost their meaning. Why do you still pursue them?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_1 = {
    Text = "A rotting stench crept into your nostrils."
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_10 = {Text = "Urgh..."},
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Investigators from Mythag University, plus the Awakener who stole Lemuria's power... Is this all you've got?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Tulu stepped in front of you as Ramona knelt beside you, sweating, struggling to pull out Goliath's blade."
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Tulu, get them out."
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Are you out of your mind?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Ramona yanked harder at the weapon, the blade slicing her glove, dark red blood soaking her sleeve."
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I'll be fine. Miryam wants someone to feed her newborn god, right? Protect Celeste and Murphy, stop the ritual... I'll find a way out."
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Your mind went blank, spinning excuses even you couldn't believe."
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_18 = {Text = "You..."},
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Get them out!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
The Seafarers, summoned by their leader, poured from every cabin.
Leading the pursuit was the giant you dreaded most.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_20 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Tulu didn't argue further. He gave you one last look, as if confirming your resolve."
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Tulu! Put me down!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Two sturdy tentacles wrapped around Ramona and Celeste. In an instant, Tulu carried them deep into the corridor."
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Goliath laughed wildly, yanking his blade free. He crouched before you, gripping your chin to force your gaze."
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_25 = {
    Text = "I told you: don't get taken out by some random grunt before I get my fill of this show."
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_26 = {
    Text = "His tone was half-mocking, half-sincere, his true intentions impossible to read."
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
But you've got guts, I'll give you that.
Too bad Miryam's got her heart set on dragging someone back to answer for this.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Was it mere toying, or did Goliath harbor some disloyalty toward Miryam..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_3 = {
    Text = "What a relentless enemy...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Don't engage him! Tulu, cover our escape!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You pulled Ramona away, desperate to flee the cabin."
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Goliath fought with his usual blunt ferocity, smirking as he hurled his massive cleaver toward your retreating figures."
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_7 = {Text = "Watch out!"},
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You shoved Ramona forward, but the blade pierced your calf, pinning you to the floor. Your communicator dropped from your chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_24078_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Agony blinded you, a buzzing roar drowning out Ramona's scream."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Pursuit of Stars"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Each time Ramona shifted, even just to ease her pain, Caecus shot her a wary glance, weapon trained on her."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Caecus, you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
Stay put!
Don't think you can pull anything under Lady Miryam's nose. I'll keep you in line.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_13 = {
    Text = "<Gray:...Completely shutting me out. Is he scared of Miryam?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<Gray:An Awakener linked to another Awakeners—Miryam must be something extraordinary...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Ramona took a deep breath, steadying herself to ignore the nagging pain in her ankle while scanning the engine room for any opportunity."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_16 = {
    Text = "When the lock clicked, her muscles tensed."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Cough, cough... This place reeks of stale decay."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The woman's graceful figure stood in stark contrast to the Seafarers. Her face twisted with disgust, clearly reluctant to walk alongside the cult."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Hey! Lend a hand, would you? I'm wrangling an Awakener here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Outer Sea Freighter: Sona-Nyl
Engine Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_20 = {
    Text = "An Awakener?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Ramona snapped her head toward the door. A girl in a white dress, bound by the black-clad cultist, met her gaze."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Pure, pristine, transcendent, fragile—countless descriptors flashed through Ramona's mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_23 = {Text = "...Human."},
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The black-clad cultist shoved the Awakener girl. She masked her faint surprise, her face returning to an emotionless void."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_25 = {
    Text = "What are you worried about? If she posed more threat than you, would Miryam have us drag her back to the outpost?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
Hmph... nesting in this filthy, rundown dump.
These savages have no class.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
That's enough. Once we're done and back at the <Yellow:Lightbearer outpost>, you can gripe all you want.
Don't forget, we're on their turf now.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_28 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Lightbearer outpost... these two are from the Church of the Lightbearers? So they're tied to the Seafarers after all.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The woman snorted, taking the rope binding the Awakener girl and yanking her roughly to Caecus."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Coal slag piled into mounds, and the damp-skinned Seafarers shuffled through the engine room, their tail fins dragging muddy black trails across the floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Lady Miryam asked me to tell you: keep an eye on both of them."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Despite the Lightbearer's rudeness, Caecus remained eerily calm. He pulled the Awakener girl to Ramona's side and resumed his silent vigil."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_32 = {
    Text = "One freak after another, trying to \"rebirth\" a Dissolution-tainted god-king? Utter nonsense."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_33 = {
    Text = "I don't know why <Blue:Lady Lantern> even bothers with these lunatics. You already botched your shot twenty-five years ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_34 = {Text = "Pipe down!"},
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Yo, quite the party."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_36 = {
    Text = "A deep, gruff voice cuts through, silencing the Lightbearer Devotees instantly."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Lord Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
Caecus bows his proud head to the giant, his tone thick with reverence.
Goliath ignored his loyalty, turning to the Lightbearers Devotees with keen interest.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Why stop? I'm all ears. Keep gossiping about Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_4 = {
    Text = "<Gray:There's only one exit. From my position, a full sprint would take seven seconds, but...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_40 = {
    Text = "He gave them no chance to backpedal, his gaze shifting sharply to the doorway."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Bet no one's dared say that about the \"Divine Realm\" to your face, huh, Miryam?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Miryam's figure melted into the shadows at the door. Her expression was unreadable, but a bone-chilling cold radiated from her."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_43 = {
    Text = "<Gray:When did she get there?! I didn't even notice her approach...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_44 = {
    Text = "A frigid breeze crawled across the floor, draining the color from the Lightbearers' faces. Had she returned with Goliath? How much had she heard?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_45 = {
    Text = "But to Ramona's—and the Lightbearer Devotees'—surprise, Miryam didn't erupt in rage or show a hint of displeasure."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_46 = {
    Text = "She surveyed the room with lofty disdain, as if the commotion were mere birdsong."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Goliath, how's your task going?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Ha... those Mythag rats are good at scurrying. I told you, unless we tear this ship apart, I won't find them. Besides, we've got a hostage, don't we?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Goliath gestured with his massive cleaver toward Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_5 = {
    Text = "She leaned down to rub her ankle. Though she'd treated the dislocated joint, the swelling was unavoidable. Even a light touch sparked a burning pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Keep this lady in hand, and her partner'll come sniffing around soon enough."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Speaking of which, why'd you drag Elton's Awakener here? Where's Elton?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_52 = {
    Text = "The ritual draws near. The Divine Mother's condition is critical. My acolytes know the sleep runes, but if possible, I don't want her to suffer."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_53 = {
    Text = "As long as Celeste is in our grasp, Elton will deliver the Divine Mother to keep the Sona-Nyl from spiraling out of control..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_54 = {
    Text = [[
<Gray:So this Awakener controls the ghost ship Sona-Nyl.
This Domain must be her work.>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_55 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Wait... maybe there's a way.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_56 = {
    Text = "While all eyes were on Miryam, Ramona brushed the Awakener girl's hand. Celeste looked up, her face devoid of emotion."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_57 = {
    Text = "<Small:Celeste... I might have a way to get us out.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_58 = {
    Text = "A flicker of astonishment pierced the fog in Celeste's eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_59 = {
    Text = "<Small:You're the Domain's master. If you could make it vanish for a moment, cause chaos among the Seafarers...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_6 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Pain level around four. Based on this semester's mobility assessment, my speed's down twenty percent...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Celeste didn't respond, only blinked. Ramona wasn't sure if she understood, but her gloves were already slick with nervous sweat."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_61 = {
    Text = "<Small:Is this... your wish?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Ramona froze but nodded instinctively before her mind caught up."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Celeste raised her compass high. Radiant streams swirled around her skirt, then vanished without a trace."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_64 = {
    Text = "At that moment, the true North Sea air swept in, cold and damp. Shouts erupted from the deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Moon! The moon!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_66 = {
    Text = "In that instant, the engine room plunged into darkness. An alien, profound silence spread, swallowing all forms, but Ramona's adrenaline surged."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_67 = {
    Text = "<Small:Now!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Ramona grabbed the Awakener's hand, channeling all her strength into her legs. She barreled through the Seafarers, sprinting for the exit."
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_7 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Not enough time. The engine room's their stronghold now. Too many enemies—I'd be stopped by Seafarers before reaching the door.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_8 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Besides... this guy's watching me like a hawk.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24079_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The Seafarers prepared for the \"ritual,\" while the Awakener boy loyally fulfilled his duty, guarding her without moving an inch."
  },
  AvgDialog_24080_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You shook your head, pressing a finger to your lips to signal silence. But as your gaze swept to the figure in the shadows, you nearly gasped aloud."
  },
  AvgDialog_24080_Content_2 = {
    Text = "<Small:That's Celeste, an Awakener...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24080_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You'd seen her in visions aboard the Sona-Nyl—a familiar yet alien shadow. This was Celeste, the one controlling the Domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_24080_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The key figure, supposedly in Miryam's clutches, had escaped with Ramona. Shocking, yet somehow expected."
  },
  AvgDialog_24080_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Your partner was never one to sit idly by."
  },
  AvgDialog_24080_Content_6 = {
    Text = "<Small:...Wait, that's Tulu, File No. 6291?!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24080_Content_7 = {
    Text = "<Small:Let's meet up with the captain and Murphy first. I'll explain everything.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Another Miracle"
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Captain, you're shaking all over."
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_11 = {
    Text = "...Old habit. I'm no handpicked student from Mythag University like you. Just an ordinary guy—no ironclad mental strength, no ability to see <Yellow:Dissolution>."
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_12 = {
    Text = "During an Awakener's rebirth, their consciousness is inevitably tainted by unknown entities. That taint drives their loss of control."
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_13 = {
    Text = "A link is one way to suppress it, but if the linker is an ordinary person without the gift..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_14 = {
    Text = "What are you guys talking about? What's this \"loss of control\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Elton took the cigarette case Murphy picked up, chuckling softly as he caught her kicking the stray tobacco into a corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_16 = {
    Text = "It means if we don't find Celeste, this ship might go haywire and sink."
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Murphy's face twisted, her lips trembling, at a loss for words."
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Easy, easy, don't be scared."
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_19 = {
    Text = "He patted Murphy's stiff head reassuringly before turning to you and Tulu."
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_2 = {Text = "Celeste..."},
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I can sense Celeste's general direction. You got Murphy to me. I trust you can help me find Celeste, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Tulu, can we?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Tulu didn't answer. Instead, he pulled open the safehouse door, signaling he'd take the lead."
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Elton closed his eyes and let out a long sigh, as if he could exhale the filth within him."
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
When the Seafarers boarded, Celeste and I weren't together.
I've been waiting in this safehouse, and you're the first to find me.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_5 = {
    Text = "How—how could that be? Celeste isn't built for fighting. What if she..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_6 = {
    Text = "She's fine. The link between us is steady."
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Link? So Celeste really is an Awakener..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Elton gave a bitter smile, reaching instinctively for his cigarette case. But as his fingers brushed the cold metal, his hand shook violently, and the case clattered to the floor, spilling tobacco everywhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_24081_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You suddenly noticed Elton's hands trembling, whether from lingering shock or sheer exhaustion."
  },
  AvgDialog_24082_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Tulu, what're you looking at?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24082_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The linker's mind and body are struggling to sustain the Awakener's power.\nMaintaining a Domain that shields the celestial pull—it's likely pushed that Awakener to her limits."
  },
  AvgDialog_24082_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Shielding celestial pull... Murphy!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24082_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Everyone turned to Murphy at your shout. She clutched her coat's front, fingers twitching uncontrollably."
  },
  AvgDialog_24082_Content_13 = {
    Text = "She tilted her head back, her throat's cartilage writhing in pain. Each breath scorched her lungs, every cell quivering under the strain."
  },
  AvgDialog_24082_Content_14 = {Text = "Murphy?!"},
  AvgDialog_24082_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Something's wrong with her. Take out those things drawn by the scent."
  },
  AvgDialog_24082_Content_2 = {
    Text = "After dispatching another wave of enemies, Tulu paused at the ship's railing, frowning as he studied the Domain's boundary enveloping the vessel."
  },
  AvgDialog_24082_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The Domain's presence is weakening."
  },
  AvgDialog_24082_Content_4 = {
    Text = "To escape the ship's oppressive air, flocks of seabirds scattered, darting toward the iridescent light."
  },
  AvgDialog_24082_Content_5 = {
    Text = "One, two, three—they slammed into the sky, desperate to break free, only to be gently repelled by the Domain's barrier."
  },
  AvgDialog_24082_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Under the relentless collisions, the Domain grew transparent, revealing a full moon, impossibly close and round."
  },
  AvgDialog_24082_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The moment flickered and passed, yet everyone caught it."
  },
  AvgDialog_24082_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Did the Domain just... vanish for a second?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24082_Content_9 = {
    Text = "No, that's impossible! Celeste would never..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24083_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
Guided by Celeste, they wove through the maze-like cabins.
Soon, they ducked into a dim chamber.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24083_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The heavy door creaked open, amber light spilling into the cabin. Her taut nerves relaxed when she glimpsed the familiar cloak."
  },
  AvgDialog_24083_Content_11 = {Text = "Keeper."},
  AvgDialog_24083_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Heavy footsteps thundered through the deck above, each one like a hammer of fate, striking fear into their souls."
  },
  AvgDialog_24083_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Small:Such heavy steps... Celeste, do you know who's making that noise?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24083_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Celeste shook her head, her face once again expressionless."
  },
  AvgDialog_24083_Content_5 = {
    Text = "<Small:Could it be someone the Seafarers sent to hunt us? I hope Keeper doesn't clash with them head-on. Without me, {Male=he,Female=she}'s no match...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24083_Content_6 = {
    Text = "...They're here."
  },
  AvgDialog_24083_Content_7 = {Text = "What?"},
  AvgDialog_24083_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Before Celeste finished, rapid footsteps echoed on their deck, growing closer until they stopped outside their cabin."
  },
  AvgDialog_24083_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ramona signaled Celeste to stay still, gripping her weapon and hiding behind the door."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You laid Murphy across your lap. Her muscles felt rigid, like holding a stone statue."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_10 = {
    Text = "She's been in this Domain too long, hence the intense reaction. Now that the Domain's stabilizing, she'll recover soon."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Before Tulu finished, Murphy sat up, drenched in sweat. She touched her chest, her face blank with confusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I... I'm still alive..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_13 = {
    Text = "We need to remove It quickly. Even if this Domain blocks the celestial pull, Its presence alone is a burden on you."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Easy for you to say..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You recalled the parasite clinging to her heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Its vessels fused with her aorta. Even Londinium's finest surgeons couldn't guarantee such an operation."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The Sona-Nyl's Domain had stalled the celestial influence. Could there be another way to buy Murphy more time?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Time... time... stop..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_19 = {Text = "Murphy..."},
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Captain, do you know what's happening to her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The captain lifted her with slow, careful movements, as if handling fragile porcelain."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Kid, I saw you thinking. Got a solution?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Not exactly a solution... and it's risky."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
At this point, risk's the least of our worries.
Spit it out. Anything to get Murphy out of danger...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Mythag University has been working on \"time-stopping\" research."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_25 = {
    Text = "You mean the rune you brought back from Rye Sanatorium..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Exactly. Doll and Ms. Winkle are studying it, hoping to create a space safe from the <Red:Dimensional Hound> for experiments."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The research is taking shape. Before we left, Ms. Winkle was already prepping animal tests."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Don't bother."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Your school... it's not on the sea, is it?\nGetting back to land, then to your school—there's no time."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The god... the god inside her..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Besides, Celeste... if she's in that woman's hands, whether this ship even makes it to shore is anyone's guess."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_31 = {
    Text = "That's why we need to move faster. Captain, can you point me to Celeste's general location? Tulu and I will find her. You and Murphy, get back to the safehouse."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_32 = {Text = "No way!"},
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_33 = {Text = "Captain?"},
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Elton realized his outburst and reached for his cigarette case, only to remember the tobacco was long gone when he opened the empty box."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_35 = {
    Text = "...Don't go after Celeste."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Why? Captain, do you know something?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Elton stepped back from supporting Murphy, his tall frame half-hidden in the shadows as he looked down at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Celeste... she's with Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_39 = {Text = "What?!"},
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Tulu's expression shifted subtly. A tentacle, under his control, coiled around Murphy's left arm."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_40 = {
    Text = "That giant... Goliath, found me and Celeste the moment he boarded. He took us to Miryam..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Moved by our shared fate as wayward souls, I gifted you the means to bring the departed back to this world."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Her presence fulfilled your deepest wish. Surely you've found solace in your lost kin..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_43 = {
    Text = [[
But my wish, the great hope Our Lord bestowed upon me, lies with that girl.
Return the Divine Mother to me.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_44 = {
    Text = "As High Priestess, I swear: when Our Lord is reborn, when the Divine Realm rises... you too shall enter it, finding eternal peace."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_45 = {
    Text = "High Priestess, I was shocked to hear the Divine Mother went missing.\nBut I've told you—she's not on this ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Why play the fool with such pretense?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_47 = {
    Text = [[
I once admired your cunning and resolve. What changed your loyalty to me?
This frail <Blue:Golem>?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_48 = {
    Text = "It was my call. I'm the master of this ship. Celeste has barely any will of her own—how could she sway me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Is that so? I gave you the power to awaken her, and I can reduce her to a pile of silver dust."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_5 = {Text = "Silence."},
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_50 = {Text = "You...!"},
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Find the Divine Mother. Bring her to me, whole and unharmed."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_52 = {
    Text = "This is your last chance, Elton."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Tulu closed his eyes, sensing through his tentacle. For a moment, the deck was filled only with the sound of waves against the hull and Murphy's pained whimpers."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The seconds stretched agonizingly. Just as your patience neared its breaking point, Tulu withdrew his tentacle."
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_8 = {
    Text = "How is she?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24084_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The moment the Domain faltered, the \"false god\" inside her felt a powerful pull."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Seafarers don't feel much pain. I used to step on their tails as a kid—hardly anyone reacted."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Just this once. Disconnect yourself when we return to campus."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You nodded, gripping your Silver Key tightly. Closing your eyes, you sank into darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You chased the brightest spark in your vision, your mind squeezed by countless presences in the crowded void, your brain torn with agony."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You strained to \"reach out,\" seizing that star."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_14 = {
    Text = "As if your soul left your body, your vision soared, pulled by an irresistible force."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You saw yourself, saw Miryam, saw a city tilting in a flood... and finally, a cold, regal young king atop a mountain."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
Opening your eyes again, a torrent of Gnosis jolted your nerves like an electric shock.
Painful, yet brimming with unprecedented power.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Heh... finally, the moment I've been waiting for."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Tulu struck first at Goliath, denying him the chance to act."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_2 = {
    Text = "That means they'll keep getting up... we can't guarantee each swing is a killing blow—this fight will wear us down."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
His tentacles slammed into the coal slag, kicking up a cloud of black dust.
As the dust fell, Miryam's figure emerged.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Miryam, you see that? This fake brat's linked up with someone—"
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The serpent launched a storm of blows at Goliath, its force hurling him against the engine room's iron wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Like a meteor crashing to earth, Goliath embedded in the bulkhead."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Outrageous."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Foul thing. You dare defy Our Lord, stealing Lemuria's divine power..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Miryam advanced, head bowed, her bare feet rippling the air like leaves on water."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Outrageous... no one, no one but me can awaken the Divine Realm's Envoy!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Something... something's wrong with her! Run!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
In an instant, the shadows cloaking the engine room solidified.
Indescribable, twisted structures rose from the ground.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_3 = {
    Text = "It's just me, Tulu, and the Keeper who can fight. Our combat options are limited..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_30 = {
    Text = "King... My Lord... Murphy... Murphy..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
It's not too late.
Return to the cult, and you remain the revered Divine Mother.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Your funeral will be the grandest rite in the Divine Realm's history, revered by thousands... your name etched in eternal annals."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Come back to me. Together, we'll... execute this <Blue:blasphemer>."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_35 = {
    Text = [[
Punish this filth masquerading as Our Lord, restore His power to Him.
Only then will Our Lord be whole.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Miryam, open your eyes and see who I am!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_37 = {Text = "Silence!"},
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The serpent dissolved and reformed, the space warping under Miryam's power."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_39 = {
    Text = "False god, counterfeit, charlatan, irreverent one... unbeliever... Do not use @2's form!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Mid-sentence, Ramona's eyes lit up."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_40 = {
    Text = "<Change>▼▼▼▼phemer... blasph▼▼▼▼... B▼▼▼▼▼▼▼▼▼!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Her voice devolved into shrill, incoherent noise, her hands clawing at her throat as her body stretched and contorted."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Watch out! She's losing control!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Tulu and the Keeper... you haven't linked, have you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Not yet. Are you saying I should link with Tulu..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Links didn't just suppress an Awakener's innate madness—they channeled their Aliemus, enhancing combat performance."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Simply put, the link could boost an Awakener's fighting ability."
  },
  AvgDialog_24091_Content_9 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_1 = {Text = "Eyes Open"},
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_10 = {Text = "Host?"},
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Before you got far, a violent tremor, strong enough to tear the ship apart, surged from below."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_101 = {
    Text = "Amid the massive explosion, flames roared skyward, the scorching air hurling you to the deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_102 = {
    Text = "—Before your consciousness faded again, the last sight was seabirds streaking across the full moon's sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_11 = {
    Text = "How was your sleep?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_12 = {Text = "Doll?!"},
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Don't panic. Now's not the time to chew you out for napping on the lawn during work hours."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<Gray:So you'll chew me out later...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Ramona avoided your gaze, her back practically screaming \"you're on your own.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Francis's diary mentioned some details about the Church of the Lightbearers—oh, right, you haven't reviewed those three mandatory courses yet."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The Church of the Lightbearers worships the idea that \"extinction is divine salvation and humanity's only redemption,\" luring sick patients to join and contract Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
Thanks for the recap, Professor Dexter.
But I doubt Erica appreciates you stepping on her toes.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_19 = {
    Text = "My bad, my bad. The floor's yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Why are you sleeping here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Francis left plenty of clues pointing to the Church of the Lightbearers, especially their \"resurrection of the dead\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_21 = {
    Text = "With Lily's appearance, we have reason to suspect they've mastered the art of summoning Awakeners."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Aren't Awakeners supposed to be top secret?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
Looks like you didn't pay attention in Awakener history either.
I'm starting to wonder how you passed the initial tests.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Mythag isn't the only one with Silver Core Awakening Tech or something like it."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Awakeners date back to before the Flood. Even in the tombs of the nineteenth dynasty of Remouahe, there are murals hinting at summoning rituals."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The \"Golem\" tech closest to Mythag's Awakeners comes from the sorcerer clans of the Levant."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Now back on topic."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Based on the beliefs and ritual details in the diary, the \"Church of the Lightbearers\" Francis encountered doesn't quite match our intel."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
Also, that remote imaging device I left with Herbert sent back this rune.
We suspect Herbert's the middleman linking Francis to the Church of the Lightbearers.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Wake up. You'll catch a cold out here."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Your next field mission is to verify the diary's contents—and investigate this rune's connection to the Church."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Francis documented her movements before heading to the polar region.\nWe'll go to her embarkation point—Bridgeport. There might be clues there."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Once you're ready, we'll set off. I'll be your partner, as always."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_33 = {
    Text = "My gear's always packed and ready."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_34 = {
    Text = "No need for another nap?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_35 = {
    Text = [[
No need!
I've got the mission down, and I remember all the details from last night's briefing!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
Then let's move.
If we set off today, we might catch the premiere of Londinium Opera House's new show on our way back.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I'll grab the driver. Meet me at the school gate."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Ramona's figure vanished from sight, and you turned to head back to your dorm for your gear."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_39 = {Text = "Keeper."},
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Ugh... Ramona?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_40 = {
    Text = "This mission might lead to direct contact with the Church of the Lightbearers."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Uncovering their secrets is secondary. Your top priority is staying alive. I don't know where I'd dig up another Keeper from the rubble."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Don't be so hard on kids."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_43 = {
    Text = "But Doll's right. The cultists you've faced before were just outer-ring grunts. The Church's true core hasn't surfaced yet."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Sounds like you know a lot about them, Professor?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Ha, haha... just an old entanglement."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_46 = {
    Text = "If needed, Mythag will send seasoned investigators or even request aid from the Mystia Treaty Committee to handle this."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Do come back alive."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Got it. We'll make it back safe."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_49 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_5 = {
    Text = "How long was I out?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_50 = {
    Text = "What are you staring at? They're already gone."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Don't worry. They know what they're doing."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_52 = {
    Text = "I'm not worried. Even if we need to train a new Keeper, the funds come from the Dexter family's account."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Worry about yourself. I heard someone's daughter is off to a date at the opera."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Ha, haha... kids these days..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_55 = {Text = "That Night"},
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_56 = {
    Text = "A regular ship to the polar region? You must be crazy! There's no such ship here, and no churches either!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Stop asking. We're just simple fishermen. We don't know anything!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Ma'am, please wait—"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_59 = {
    Text = "You're city bigshots bullying us country folk!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Who knows? You even missed this afternoon's pre-mission briefing."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_60 = {
    Text = "That's not our intent—hey!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_61 = {
    Text = "The woman slammed the door. If Ramona hadn't pulled you back, you'd have gone back to school with a crooked nose."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Bridgeport... this town's weird."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_63 = {
    Text = "That's the third door we've knocked on, and not one person will share a scrap of info about this place."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_64 = {
    Text = "We're just asking for directions. It's unnatural how they're all covering something up."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Let's check the docks. Maybe we'll find a lead there."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_66 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_67 = {
    Text = "What's wrong?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Maybe it's my imagination, but I thought I heard voices in the wind."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_69 = {
    Text = [[
Hey, perfect timing. Two out-of-towners just walked in.
Should we grab them? Saves us the trouble of finding others.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_7 = {Text = "Briefing?"},
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Herd them toward the ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Tch, devious jerk."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Go, Caecus. Your time to shine."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_73 = {
    Text = "As you command, Lord Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Countdown: Three Hours"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_75 = {Text = "—Thud!"},
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Agonizing pain struck your forehead. The impact spun your world. Murphy seized the chance to break free, clutching her head as she fled deeper into the cabin."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_77 = {
    Text = "I knew you weren't good people!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_78 = {
    Text = "W-wait... hear me out..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Countdown: @2 Minutes"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_8 = {
    Text = "It's about Francis—"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Boarding now."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Had enough of staring?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_82 = {
    Text = "The moment the Domain faltered, the \"false god\" inside her felt a powerful pull."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_83 = {
    Text = "You fake... Die!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Keeper! Don't let go of my hand!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_86 = {
    Text = [[
The sea's embrace turned sharp, the water reacting with your scorched skin in a choking struggle.
Blind chaos, like a specter in the night, tore and broke your body.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Then, that chaos bore a flicker of warmth. In the boundless dark, loneliness, helplessness, and despair receded swiftly, a mysterious glow shining in the frigid cosmos."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_88 = {
    Text = "As if touching the universe's mercy, your consciousness teetered on the edge of Gnosis. Your body melded with the oxygen in the sea, and you snapped your eyes open, water flooding from the corners."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Finally, a gentle light sliced through the ocean's darkness. A pale blue force reached for you—a goddess of safe passage extending her hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Never mind. Let the host fill you in."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_90 = {
    Text = "I remember now... Miryam's dying struggle triggered the explosion. I couldn't hold Ramona's hand and fell into the sea... but no, this is the Sona-Nyl's deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_91 = {
    Text = "That final force that helped me... was it Celeste? She pulled me from the deep..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Then the others must be okay too!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_93 = {
    Text = "The dreamy warmth gave way to stark moonlight, the veil shrouding the ship shattering, dissolving, and sinking into the deep."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_94 = {
    Text = "The veil... it's gone?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Thick smoke billowed from the stern—where the engine room lay."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_96 = {Text = "Oh no!"},
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Ignoring the searing pain from your soul's depths, you leaned on the railing, staggering toward the rising smoke."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_98 = {
    Text = "Your throat was choked with blood and gunpowder, each breath a torture."
  },
  AvgDialog_24092_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Ramona, Murphy, Celeste, Tulu... I have to find them fast."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_1 = {Text = "Resolve"},
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Who's there—Celeste!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Elton took several deep breaths, facing the three who stumbled in."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Tulu's tentacles supported Ramona, her face grim, muscles trembling with strain."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_13 = {
    Text = "That uniform... you're %player%'s partner."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Ramona scanned the group. Besides Tulu, whom she'd met at school, and Celeste, who escaped with her, there were two unfamiliar faces."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_15 = {
    Text = "These were Murphy and the Sona-Nyl's captain—the ones Keeper risked everything to protect."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
Ramona Dexter. Call me Ramona.
Skip the pleasantries. I need to know everything happening on this ship, short and fast.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Who are you, why are the Seafarers after you, and what's this \"ritual\" Miryam's obsessed with..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_18 = {Text = "I—I'm..."},
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Elton cut off Murphy's rushed attempt to speak, knowing the pressure would muddle her explanation."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Outer Sea Freighter: Sona-Nyl
Third Cargo Hold]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I'm Elton, and that's my partner Celeste, the only other crew on this Sona-Nyl."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_21 = {
    Text = "In my youth, Miryam helped me awaken Celeste. In return, we sailed the Sona-Nyl between continents and the polar regions, hauling supplies for the Seafarer cult."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_22 = {
    Text = "In the end, we got hunted by Miryam for helping Murphy escape the cult."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Murphy carries the false god Miryam aims to summon. I don't know if it's a true deity, but if the ritual happens, Murphy won't survive."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Murphy shared fragments of her story—her body, her ties to Miryam, her past in the cult..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_25 = {
    Text = "So much has happened..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I'll have Celeste steer full speed toward land, but I can't promise we can save %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Before Elton finished, everyone staggered as the ship lurched—Celeste was indeed pushing it faster."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Cough, cough..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Captain! Running the ship this fast is too much for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Hard-soled boots clacked rhythmically on the deck, each step heavy and dull."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_30 = {
    Text = "...It's nothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_31 = {
    Text = "I turned a blind eye to your suffering while colluding with the cult. My sins are heavy enough."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_32 = {
    Text = "My... suffering?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_33 = {
    Text = "I'm the one who delivered you to Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_34 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_35 = {
    Text = "You were the most precious \"cargo\" I ever transported for the cult. That flawless voyage earned me Miryam's favor."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_36 = {
    Text = "So that's why, back at the cult's base, you agreed to help me without hesitation..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Once we're close enough to shore, I'll have Celeste get you off this ship. The farther you get from the sea, the better."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_38 = {
    Text = "As if in response, Celeste spun her compass."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_39 = {
    Text = "You mean for Celeste to go with me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Celeste, %player%..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Ramona caught the captain's meaning first."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_41 = {
    Text = "The Keeper and I can arrange transport. If Celeste can extend her Domain to our vehicle..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Exactly. That'll buy you enough time."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Are you kidding? You think you can hold off those monsters? You're not even a Seafarer—just a plain human!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_44 = {
    Text = "No, leave that to us."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_45 = {
    Text = [[
Stopping pagan rituals, guarding the world from the unknown...
That's the duty of everyone at Mythag University.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Are you crazy too? You don't even know if we're lying to you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Keeper chose to trust you, so I'll trust you too."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_48 = {
    Text = "The captain steadied himself, then reached for Murphy—\nruffling her hair roughly."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_49 = {
    Text = "<Small:Hey! Don't rub so hard! You're messing up my hair!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_5 = {
    Text = "And Tulu... why aren't they back yet?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_50 = {
    Text = "I want you to break free from all this. Let that be my final wish."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_51 = {
    Text = "The worst that happens is I go down with the Sona-Nyl. I should've sunk with her long ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Murphy clutched the captain's coat, stubbornly refusing to let go."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Ramona clenched her fist, then, with a resolute glint, handed Murphy an object—a communicator from Mythag University."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_54 = {
    Text = "An... heirloom?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_55 = {
    Text = "It's a communicator. It may not work in this Domain, but the school must be trying to reach us."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_56 = {
    Text = [[
If you can see Dissolution with your own eyes, you must have enough mental strength to use it.
Focus when the brooch lights up, and you'll connect with someone on the other end.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Even if the Keeper and I don't make it back, our colleagues will help you."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Murphy took the brooch, staring at its intricate metalwork, her eyes suddenly red."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_59 = {
    Text = "What's with this... like you're marching off to die."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Murphy paced anxiously, unable to sit still. She kicked a crate, then tugged at its securing ropes."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Tulu, uninterested in the argument, stood at the door, sensing the flow of power, ready to head to the engine room."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_61 = {
    Text = "—Wait! Where are you going!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_62 = {
    Text = "The girl shoved the door open, grabbing a tentacle."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Are you going to save {Male=him,Female=her}?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_64 = {
    Text = "My actions are not for outsiders to question."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_65 = {
    Text = "I'm coming too."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Murphy! Don't be reckless."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_67 = {
    Text = [[
You stay here. Tulu and I will help the Keeper escape.
If you fall into Miryam's hands, our efforts are for nothing.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_68 = {Text = "I know."},
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_69 = {
    Text = [[
But... I can't...
I don't want to die, but... what if you don't come back?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_7 = {
    Text = "They better not be in trouble..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_70 = {
    Text = "I... don't want... that to happen..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_71 = {
    Text = "I can't stay in this Domain forever. If I want to truly escape, I... I need you to vouch for me."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_72 = {
    Text = [[
I can't just show up at your school and tell your headmaster their students died for me.
I need your introduction. Neither of you is allowed to die.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_73 = {
    Text = "I won't waste energy protecting you."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_74 = {
    Text = "I don't need your protection. I know the Seafarers' weaknesses by heart. I can handle myself."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Fine, if you're that determined."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_76 = {
    Text = "What's that look?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_77 = {
    Text = [[
I thought you weren't worth their sacrifice.
It seems I misjudged you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_78 = {
    Text = "What's with the riddles? Move it, move it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Murphy pushed Tulu with one hand, pulled Ramona with the other, and they vanished into the ship's shadowy corridors."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_8 = {
    Text = "She couldn't settle down to pray or rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_80 = {
    Text = "She... fine, if that's her choice."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Celeste, keep us at full speed."
  },
  AvgDialog_24093_Content_9 = {Text = "Bang—!"},
  AvgDialog_24094_Content_1 = {
    Text = "As Miryam's mind wavered, the Seafarers' cohesion faltered, chaos creeping in."
  },
  AvgDialog_24094_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The Seafarers recognized Murphy, the vessel of their God, instinctively parting as she approached. You jogged through their ranks."
  },
  AvgDialog_24095_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Tulu's tentacles swatted away encroaching Seafarers, guarding the rear."
  },
  AvgDialog_24095_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Though dim-witted, the Seafarers grew restless.
Whispers spread through their ranks, ancient and obscure, making Tulu frown.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24095_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Their suspicions will only enrage Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_24095_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Suspicions? You understand their words?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24095_Content_5 = {
    Text = "No time for Tulu to explain—Miryam translated their ancient tongue with action."
  },
  AvgDialog_24095_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Her dagger slashed through several Seafarers' throats, bathing her in gray-blue blood as she waded through their cluster."
  },
  AvgDialog_24095_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The god-king reborn? No...\nOur Lord will only descend at the stellar alignment—guided by the ritual!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24095_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Only my ritual can bring the God-king, and the Divine Realm! MY ritual!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24095_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Seafarers... let these blasphemers witness the majesty of the Divine Realm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_1 = {Text = "Lost Light"},
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Their limbs twisted, their half-faces frozen in the moment of death, congealed blood forming incomprehensible runes, filling the air with death's fervor."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
Your "God" probably won't like such creepy offerings, huh?
Their envoys went missing on our watch. How you gonna explain that to the Church of the Lightbearers?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Before Goliath finished, the scar on his neck constricted, seizing his muscles."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I did not forge your head with Lemuria's blood for you to blaspheme my God, Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_14 = {
    Text = "My great, almighty Lord draws strength from my prayers and knows my devotion through my sacrifices."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_15 = {
    Text = "As for those Lightbearer envoys... rude, foolish, insignificant dregs. If the Lightbearers complain, I'll have no need to walk with them further."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Miryam wiped the blood from her fingers and finally turned to you. A lingering stench of decay clung to her, each inch closer tormenting your sanity."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_17 = {
    Text = "What did you... do to them?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You're different from them."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Miryam ignored your question. She looked at you, her eyes like a still abyss harboring millennia-old bones."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Outer Sea Freighter: Sona-Nyl
Engine Room]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You possess the most unique soul I've seen since becoming an Awakener... brighter and darker than your companion's."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_21 = {
    Text = "A Keeper of Mythag University... I cherish the gifted. I truly wish you could bask in Our Lord's divine light."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The clever shouldn't be buried in the mundane. The Divine Realm, woven from sacred blood, welcomes foreign veins."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Your hope to save the world from corruption doesn't clash with the <Blue:rebirth of the Divine Realm>."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Serve us, join the rebirth and revival of the Divine Realm, and walk in eternal bliss with me."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_25 = {
    Text = "If your so-called rebirth and revival mean using living people as sacrifices, turning the innocent into vessels for monsters..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
Sorry, I can't do it.
Your ritual is barbaric and cruel. I see no trace of reason or civilization in it.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_27 = {
    Text = "To be the vessel for God's rebirth, the cornerstone of the Divine Realm's return—that's the ultimate glory!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_28 = {
    Text = "I misjudged you. No need to waste words on fools... this farce ends now."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Power erupted from the shadows, formless energy coalescing into a massive, solid serpent."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Miryam stood at the room's center, eyes half-closed, poised like a sacred statue. Even as Goliath roughly tossed you before her, she merely flicked her gaze your way."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The giant snake thrashed wildly, its eyes locking onto you—coiling around your waist, lifting you effortlessly into the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Stop, Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Who goes there!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_33 = {
    Text = "A voice, achingly familiar, leaped across history's chasm—soft as an offshore breeze, yet stirring a tidal wave in your heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Miryam, I said, let that one go."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_35 = {
    Text = "And true. This farce ends now."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_36 = {
    Text = "I don't know your face, but your presence... it carries traces of Our Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_37 = {
    Text = "A flicker of pity crossed Miryam's face. Her eyes, like flowers battered by a sudden storm, brimmed with endless sorrow and pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Cold, slick scales slid across your body, the serpent tightening like a predator strangling its prey."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Tears carved indelible trails down her face. She stared at Tulu, as if to pierce his soul, to unravel their shared history from eons past."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_4 = {
    Text = "That look was cold as a viper's, radiating cruelty and detachment—you were neither her match nor part of her food chain."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
<Blue:My Lord>... my glorious <Blue:King>...
How could You... bear the taint of an Awakener?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Who defiled Your sacred relics? Who... broke our covenant?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_42 = {
    Text = "You dangled upside down in the serpent's grip, blood rushing to your head, vision fading to black."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_43 = {
    Text = "But in your haze, you glimpsed two girls... surrounded by Seafarers, drawing closer."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Ramona! Now!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Ramona took a deep breath, bending one knee, channeling energy beneath her feet, and leaped high—"
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Her rapier's tip pierced the serpent's scales, striking its vital point."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Hey, hey! {Male=He's,Female=She's} gonna fall!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_49 = {
    Text = "You plummeted amid the serpent's roar..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Where are the others?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_50 = {
    Text = "—into a trembling, warm embrace."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_51 = {
    Text = "...You okay, %player%?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Ramona... I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Sorry, now's not the time for a reunion."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Ramona held you, sprinting away from Miryam without looking back."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_55 = {
    Text = "You glanced back at Miryam. The serpent reformed, her gaze falling on you and Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_56 = {
    Text = "A predatory stare, like a viper eyeing its prey."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Tulu! Don't engage her. Get Murphy out first."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Didn't I tell you? Mythag's little rats are good at scurrying. Catching this one was hard enough."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
But the others don't matter anymore, do they?
Looks like you've built the altar for your "God" already.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Miryam turned slowly, her serpentine shadows dissolving, bathing her in purple radiance like a baptized devotee."
  },
  AvgDialog_24096_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The altar behind her came into view, the engine room's dim light casting eerie shadows on her face. At its center lay two unrecognizable bodies."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_10 = {
    Text = "By the way, does your leg still hurt? It's not bleeding anymore."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I barely feel it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
As you discussed future plans, Miryam's illusion peeled away like melting snow.
The enemy regained some sanity from her frenzy, shedding her monstrous form.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Miryam lay weakly in black dust, her gaze vacant, unresponsive even as Tulu approached."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Stop clinging to delusion, Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Our era, our <Blue:Eternal Realm>, its fall is sealed."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_16 = {
    Text = "No... no... He promised me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_17 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:You> promised me."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The emaciated woman finally showed a reaction. She blankly looked up, muttering to herself."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_19 = {
    Text = "My almighty God will wield His power... and judge these unworthy heretics who made this false thing!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_2 = {
    Text = "These structures are fading. Is it... over?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_20 = {
    Text = "She drew a dagger from her waist, purple-black flames like thick fog coating the blade, radiating deathly chill."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You fake... Die!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_22 = {
    Text = "—Cold, sinister flames ignited the coal dust."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_23 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Aaahhh!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_24 = {
    Text = "In the chain reaction of fire and ash, a deafening blast engulfed everyone, the ship lurching sharply to one side."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Flames swelled before you, the bulkhead behind torn open by the explosion."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Keeper! Don't let go of my hand!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Your nose stung with the acrid stench of burnt coal. After a fleeting moment of connection, you were yanked downward into the abyss by gravity."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_28 = {
    Text = "The familiar voice and warmth faded swiftly, replaced by a creeping chill and dampness that clawed at the spine."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_29 = {Text = "Keeper!"},
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_3 = {
    Text = "This is the illusion Miryam conjured, perhaps her vision of the <Blue:Divine Realm>..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Time froze in that moment. The searing heat cut your skin like a thousand blades, every tendon baked brittle as cicada wings."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_31 = {
    Text = "A chaotic, deafening horn pierced your spirit realm, shattering the reason and peace you've known for the past year. In this endless instant, you felt the unrest and struggle of chaos."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_32 = {
    Text = "But in the end, all was consumed by flame, your consciousness fading into boundless darkness..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The God's realm, the eternal Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_5 = {
    Text = "\"Lemuria\"... I recall some Mythag historians debating its existence."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Had catastrophe not struck, it would stand where..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Since it's all history, can we talk about this city after we're safe? Let's deal with this thing first."
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Ramona, once we're ashore, we'll leave the Domain and contact the school.
Tulu, stay on the ship and take care of Murphy for a while.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24097_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Right, we'll need a surgical table ready with the time rune. Extracting the parasite might require Acting Dean Czort herself."
  },
  AvgDialog_24260_Content_1 = {
    Text = "She's recovering again...? Our attacks did nothing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24260_Content_2 = {
    Text = "No... look at those two energy serpents. They're thick with Miryam's essence. We might need to take them down first..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24260_Content_3 = {
    Text = "When the Divine Realm stood, she could summon only one serpent shadow. After millennia of dormancy, she might now command up to <Yellow:eight> vassal shades."
  },
  AvgDialog_24260_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Lemuria's secret rites... we can't let her rage consume her. If she fully loses control, she'll become a true monster."
  },
  AvgDialog_24261_Content_1 = {
    Text = "We took down all her shades, but why is she still...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24261_Content_2 = {
    Text = "She's forcing the ritual, but this is just her illusion... without the stars' guidance, it'll only burn everyone's souls."
  },
  AvgDialog_24261_Content_3 = {
    Text = "High Priestess Miryam! In the name of @2's Envoy, I command you to stop!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24261_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Her mind consumed by fury, the creature once called Miryam paused only a moment before resuming her frenzied assault."
  },
  AvgDialog_24261_Content_5 = {
    Text = "She thinks I'm a fraud... so be it. I'll face her in Lemuria's way—subdue her, or... kill her."
  },
  AvgDialog_24261_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
Miryam... my most loyal vassal...
May you... wander no more.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24282_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Next, test screen shake 2"
  },
  AvgDialog_24282_Content_2 = {
    Text = "In theory, the character art should shake along with the background."
  },
  AvgDialog_24282_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Next, test left and right movement 2"
  },
  AvgDialog_24282_Content_4 = {
    Text = "In theory, the character illustration should move along with the background."
  },
  AvgDialog_24282_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Test Complete"
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_1 = {
    Text = "No, there are too many people... Things will only get worse..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_10 = {
    Text = "No, Lord Goliath—!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_11 = {
    Text = "It feels as if everything before my eyes has been paused."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Your body's instincts override your control. It lunges forward, desperately shielding Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_13 = {Text = "Hmm—"},
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_14 = {
    Text = "A blade slashes your throat. You tremble as you clutch your bleeding wound, your mind in chaos."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Are you out of your mind? What are you doing here?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I don't know... My body moved on its own..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Sorry, Lord Goliath..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_2 = {
    Text = "I... can still... kill!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_20 = {
    Text = "A poisoned arrow whizzed through the air, striking Goliath's shoulder and causing him to fall toward you."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Goliath... The giant Goliath has finally fallen!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_22 = {
    Text = "His head belongs to me! No one dares take it from me!!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The sea emitted a deep, angry tremor. The giant blocked the blazing sun before crashing down."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Your blood converges, turning the azure sea crimson."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_25 = {
    Text = "You hear the wind, the waves, and distant cheers and fights. Ahead lies nothing but endless slaughter and humiliation."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The salty seawater stings the wound on your neck, making you wince in pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Goliath isn't much better than you."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Seeing you in such a sorry state, he still manages to flash you a malicious grin."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_29 = {
    Text = "I'd say... you really should take a look in the mirror and see how absurd you look right now."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The heavy blare of horns echoed across the sea. Lured by generous rewards, warriors flocked to join the hunting game."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Sure enough, you're useless."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Goliath was nearing his limit. He swung his giant blade once more, but in his sluggish movement, someone seized the Fissure."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_6 = {
    Text = "He dropped to his knees, the wound exposing stark white bones, blood flowing like a never-ending stream."
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Now is the time! Finish him off in one go!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24296_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The encircling warriors swarm like bloodthirsty sharks."
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_1 = {Text = "Hmm—!!"},
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Under great reward, brave men will surely appear. The warriors let out excited cheers, their weapons clashing and resonating with the thrilling sound of battle."
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Yeah, what's there to be afraid of? We have so many people!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Cut off the hand holding his knife first!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The once-cowering warriors roared and surged forward like bloodthirsty locusts."
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Heh... my dearest kin. I taught you how to fight, how to kill, and how to survive."
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_15 = {
    Text = "But I never taught you how to escape when facing an enemy much stronger than you."
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Goliath licked the blood from the corner of his mouth, revealing his fangs."
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_17 = {
    Text = "...because you have nowhere left to run."
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_18 = {
    Text = "With that, he casually grabbed their throats, lifted their heads, and smashed them together—"
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_19 = {Text = "Bang!!"},
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A frenzied cleaver chopped the ship into pieces, leaving Glen to retreat with only one leg remaining."
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Yellow and white fluids mixed with fragmented blood spewed out. Goliath laughed heartily, his pupils burning with a bloodthirsty malice."
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Hahaha! I heard someone wants to take my head?"
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_22 = {
    Text = "If you've got the guts, line up and come get it one by one!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Weren't you injured? How could you...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Sorry, dealing with a minion like you doesn't require my full strength."
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Goliath stands proudly at the bow, his massive blade carving an arc before him, keeping his former comrades at bay."
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Is there anyone else who wants to come up and play with me? One is not enough to kill!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Intimidated by the giant's terror, the warriors cowered like pups, none daring to step into the forbidden curve ahead, as if it were a taboo place."
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_8 = {
    Text = "A bunch of good-for-nothings! With such severe injuries, he's no longer the once-dominant ruler of the seas."
  },
  AvgDialog_24297_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I, the warrior Glen, swear on my life: Whoever brings me this head shall have my wealth, land, and women!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Wait, Ramona!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Miss Ramona!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_11 = {
    Text = "From your angle, you could only see Ramona slightly tilt her head and say something, while Ogier turned pale, supporting Doll as they stepped back."
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Ramona shook off the black goo from her sword tip and strode towards the clock tower, expressionless."
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Ramona, wait!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_14 = {
    Text = "This is not a memory."
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_15 = {
    Text = "This isn't even the Ramona you know."
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Cold, ruthless, intimidating—your partner is not like this."
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_17 = {
    Text = "She won't step over the bodies of her former comrades, won't harm Lotan, nor ignore your call..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Ramona, Ramona!"
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Her figure gradually fades into the distance. With no other options, you can only quicken your pace to catch up."
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
In the school square, the madly frenzied Lotan is on a killing spree.
Ogier does his best to protect Doll, dangerously close to faltering.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Before you can catch up, Ramona raises her rapier and mercilessly thrusts it towards Lotan's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ramona, Danger—"
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_6 = {
    Text = "As the rapier approached Lotan's forehead, a void emerged at the tip, and Lotan's fierce expression went blank for a moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The next moment, with a flash, Lotan's Silver shattered."
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_8 = {
    Text = "This... can't... be..."
  },
  AvgDialog_24415_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The rapier was drawn without mercy, its sharp tip tracing a chilling line that nearly grazed Ogier nearby."
  },
  AvgDialog_24422_Content_1 = {
    Text = "<Gray:The deceased senior, the school graveyard... This should be Ramona's memory of the Key Ceremony day.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24422_Content_2 = {
    Text = "<Gray:But I remember, back then...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24422_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
Thank you, Keeper. You saved me once again.
If not for this Link, I would probably be in grave danger right now.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_24422_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Dragging this out is disadvantageous; we must bring this to a swift conclusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_24422_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Phew, sorry, no time for you to adapt now."
  },
  AvgDialog_24422_Content_6 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Whose memory is this? That Ramona, what on earth...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_24422_Content_7 = {
    Text = "<Gray:No, we must catch up with her immediately.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25177_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Tawil's state has recovered?! How is this possible?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25177_Content_2 = {
    Text = "In my memory of this battle, It didn't demonstrate such abilities."
  },
  AvgDialog_25177_Content_3 = {
    Text = "No... definitely not."
  },
  AvgDialog_25177_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Or rather, it never existed."
  },
  AvgDialog_25177_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ramona lowers her head and gazes at the silver key on your chest, murmuring."
  },
  AvgDialog_25177_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The only variable... It turns out..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25177_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Ramona concealed her shock and once again pointed her sword at Tawil."
  },
  AvgDialog_25177_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Continue issuing commands and bring this to an end...
The Keeper.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_1 = {Text = "Piper"},
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid. I'll find a way to get you out of here."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The villagers only stare back in silence. There is no hope in their eyes—but no hostility, either."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Wait, the maid..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_13 = {
    Text = "My father and brother are locked away below. I have to save them—"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Do any of you know a maid named Susanna?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Susanna? That's my big sister!"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_16 = {
    Text = "A child's clear voice pipes up from the corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_17 = {
    Text = "By the flickering light of a single candle, you notice an old man lying in the shadows with a wide-eyed boy huddled beside him."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Susanna is my daughter... Has something happened to her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_19 = {
    Text = "She's deeply worried about you. She was trying to find a way to save you."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Cambrian Castle
Underground Prison]]
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_20 = {
    Text = "We can't leave this place..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The old man's body is riddled with Dissolution holes. The black ichor seeping from his wounds has long since stained the straw beneath him."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_22 = {
    Text = "We stayed here of our own free will. Once the sickness takes hold, you lose your mind... you turn into a monster."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_23 = {
    Text = "It's true. There were so many murders nearby... Then the Lady came through house by house. She gathered the sick and brought us here."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_24 = {
    Text = "If someone didn't want to be quarantined, she let them leave the fiefdom—so long as they swore never to return."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_25 = {
    Text = "But here, we get porridge and sweet bread every day!"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<Gray:I see. Did we completely misjudge her?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Has Lady Wanda treated you well since she took over the fief?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Well? I don't know. I've never actually seen her. I've only heard the stories—that she's cruel, that she killed her four husbands, that she's a devil in the flesh."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_29 = {
    Text = "But since she's been here, she's done a lot of good. Life is much better than it used to be."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The heavy iron door slams shut behind you."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_30 = {
    Text = "She taught us how to farm properly and herd sheep. Every festival, she takes the wool to the <Blue:Charich> market herself. It brings in a lot of coin."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_31 = {
    Text = "That's right. She actually seized the Charich market from Count Goodrich. They've been at war over it for nearly a year..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The villagers all begin talking at once, sharing stories of Wanda's management: farming, smelting, livestock, estate law..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_33 = {
    Text = "You are stunned by how deeply Wanda is involved in every aspect of the fief. She is certainly no idle, pleasure-seeking noble."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_34 = {
    Text = "She's a good ruler. It's just a tragedy that the Dissolution found her."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_35 = {
    Text = "<Gray:A spread this massive... there has to be a D-Rift nearby.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The iron door behind you suddenly creaks open."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Wanda stands at the entrance, the candle in her hand bathing her silhouette in a warm, orange glow."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Let this one out. I have something to say to him in private."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
Cambrian Castle
Garden]]
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You turn around and find yourself surrounded by pairs of glowing eyes, watching you like predators in the dark."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_40 = {
    Text = "You walk together across the soft grass until you reach the edge of the lake."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_41 = {
    Text = "At midnight, the lake is a dark mirror, reflecting the fragmented shards of the moon above."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_42 = {
    Text = "I think you've realized by now: Cambrian is facing a catastrophe, and I am powerless to stop it."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_43 = {
    Text = "But you... when you fought those monsters in the castle, you handled them like a seasoned veteran."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_44 = {
    Text = "<Gray:It is my profession, after all...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Weren't you in your chambers at the time, My Lady? How do you know so much about that fight?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_46 = {
    Text = "I have eyes and ears everywhere in Cambrian. If a single freesia wants to bloom, it needs my permission first. There is nothing I do not know."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_47 = {
    Text = "And what about that maid? If you knew she was a spy, why keep her around?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Wanda waves a hand dismissively."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_49 = {
    Text = "She's just a pitiful, ordinary human. She couldn't hurt a hair on my head if she tried."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_5 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Woaaahhh!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Besides, she's a competent servant. Finding a human who actually does as they're told is no easy feat."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_51 = {
    Text = "In short, I need you to end this Dissolution. Don't rush to refuse—we can discuss the price later. I'll give you whatever you want."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Surely you wouldn't let these villagers die such meaningless deaths, would you... my dear \"monk\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_53 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_54 = {
    Text = "You keep saying \"you humans,\" and then there are those strange bone-spikes... Lady Wanda, you aren't human at all, are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_55 = {
    Text = "A being from a distant world who cares about the lives of common peasants. What are you really after?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Faced with your interrogation, Wanda raises an eyebrow and suddenly bursts into laughter."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Did I say something funny?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_58 = {
    Text = "No... Hahaha! I'm just so happy. In all the years I've spent here, I've finally met someone else who doesn't belong \"here\"—just like me."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_59 = {
    Text = "How did you—"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_6 = {
    Text = "As your vision adjusts to the gloom, you finally see the reality of the cell."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Wanda places a slender finger gently against your lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Shh... Follow me. I want to show you something."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_62 = {
    Text = "You make your way through the woods to the tranquil edge of the lake."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Sometimes, I have these wonderful illusions... as if I can see my old city reflected in the depths of this water."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_64 = {
    Text = "A massive city made of black monoliths. Its borders were constantly expanding, stretching toward an unseen horizon..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_65 = {
    Text = "The deep blue lake is almost fathomable. As you listen to her description, the alien silhouette of that city begins to take shape in your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Black spiral spires, strange obtuse walls..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Back then, I had a grand palace. Over a thousand servants attended to my every need."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Just as you said, I never cared whether those minions lived or died."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_69 = {
    Text = "I did exactly as I pleased. My servants, my city... they were all just manifestations of my will and ambition."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Sitting, lying, or leaning against the cold stone walls—the room is packed with ragged villagers."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Then, my planet was struck by the catastrophe you call the \"Dissolution.\" Everyone died."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_71 = {
    Text = "I sat alone in that hall for a long, long time, watching my palace and my capital turn to ash."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_72 = {
    Text = "To be honest, it was a terrible feeling. No one wants to experience that twice."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Lady Wanda... I'm sorry, but I can't help you."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Don't worry about that. Tell me what's holding you back, and I will provide whatever you need."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_75 = {
    Text = "You shake your head."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_76 = {
    Text = "It's more than that. Our current environment... it has some... peculiarities."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_77 = {
    Text = "You cannot close a D-Rift while inside a dream state."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_78 = {
    Text = "<Gray:How do I even begin to explain that to her?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Because we are in a dream, you can't help me... is that it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Their skin is riddled with Dissolution scars; some have already lost half their bodies to the rot. The air is thick with the stench of sickness and impending death."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_80 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_81 = {
    Text = "You... you've noticed?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Wanda gazes down at the black city in the water, her eyes shimmering with fragmented white moonlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Since coming here, I've had many dreams. About wars, disasters, time... but never once about my capital."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Just when I was about to forget it, I met you, and then saw it again at the bottom of the lake."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Did you know? When a dying man sees the Piper moving through the fog, he feels neither fear nor curiosity."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_86 = {
    Text = "He simply follows the Piper in silence, going to a place of his own."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Wanda lets out a soft sigh."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_88 = {
    Text = "My lost capital... it is beautiful, like a dying man's dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_89 = {
    Text = "She gently strokes the silent, blind attendant by her side."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Wanda actually locked all of you away in here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_90 = {
    Text = "<Change>My Lady..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Cambrian is my second home. I haven't spent much time here, yet it's already time to say goodbye."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_92 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry, Lady Wanda..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Wanda waves a hand dismissively. When she looks up again, the gloom has vanished from her face."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Don't worry. Since I chose to be the lady of this fief, I must take responsibility for everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Isn't it just dying together? Then let's die gloriously."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_96 = {
    Text = "What are you planning to do?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Wanda offers a cryptic smile and winks at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_25186_Content_98 = {
    Text = "A magnificent farewell banquet."
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Four Weddings"
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You follow the maid's lead, the heavy, cloying scent of cosmetic powder clinging to your skin."
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_11 = {
    Text = "This is a classic fortress of the old world, its walls built from massive stone blocks to withstand any siege."
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_12 = {
    Text = "It looks drafty. It must be freezing in the winter."
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Wait, what is that...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_14 = {
    Text = "A black, corrosive sludge begins to ooze from the cracks in the masonry."
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The liquid gathers silently on the floor, pulsating as it knits itself into a physical shape."
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_16 = {Text = "Roar—!!"},
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_17 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Do you feel that? Something is nearby...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_18 = {
    Text = "They're here... the monsters are back!"
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Get behind me."
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_2 = {Text = "Splash—"},
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_20 = {
    Text = "But aren't you a—"
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The maid stares in disbelief at the heavy chains binding your wrists and ankles."
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You close your eyes, reaching into the depths of your consciousness to grasp the faint links to other Awakeners."
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Though your power is muffled by the monk's fragile spirit during this dream, and your summons are weakened, still—"
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_24 = {
    Text = "It is more than enough to handle the likes of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A bucket of ice-cold water is dumped over your head."
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_4 = {
    Text = "A dull throb pulses in your chest as someone delivers two sharp kicks to your bruised ribs."
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ugh! Cough, cough..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_6 = {
    Text = "<Change>The bedchamber. To the Consort."
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You've lost count of how many times you've been woken up this way..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You let out a weary sigh and allow the attendants to haul you up and out of the room."
  },
  AvgDialog_25187_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Bathing, dressing, grooming..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
Cambrian Castle
Wanda's Bedchamber]]
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Forgive me... I don't follow your meaning, Lady Wanda."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Oh? Your face tells a very different story."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Wanda tilts her chin toward the ring lying on the floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_13 = {
    Text = "That ring was a gift from my <Blue:fourth husband>. Do you know why he eventually... vanished?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<Shake:N-no... I wouldn't know...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_15 = {
    Text = "He was once known as the 'Plantagenet of Cambrian.' A truly magnificent warrior."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_16 = {
    Text = "But later, he conspired with rival lords to overthrow me. He even went so far as to poison my wine and my food."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_17 = {
    Text = "A pity. He'll never be able to poison anyone ever again..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Wanda reaches out and strokes the cold cheek of her servant, her eyes brimming with a mock, tender affection."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Am I right, my dear husband?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You're finally here, Mr. Vayne. Come closer and help me remove these rings."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_20 = {
    Text = "<Change>My Lady... Love..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The blind attendant leans submissively into Wanda's embrace, seemingly relishing her touch."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_22 = {
    Text = "?! You actually turned your own husband into..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Enough. My bedtime story is over. Now it's your turn, little monk."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Think very carefully. Is there <Italic:really> nothing you want to tell me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Wanda's smile vanishes, replaced by a mask of cold indifference. She radiates a crushing pressure that makes it nearly impossible to draw breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_26 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_27 = {
    Text = "At this point, any further deception is futile. You pull the note from your pocket and hand it to her."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Lady Wanda, I can explain! This wasn't my idea!"
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_29 = {
    Text = "You're the one who gave him this note, aren't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Wanda sits before a sprawling vanity mirror. She extends her slender fingers toward you, weighted down by a stack of opulent rings."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Wanda lazily lifts her gaze toward the maid standing nearby."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Yes... I gave it to him."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The maid's head is bowed, her entire body trembling. Then, she takes a sharp breath and straightens her back."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Demon! You're a heartless demon!"
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_34 = {
    Text = "My father and brother are locked away in the dark below. I have to save them—"
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_35 = {Text = "BOOM—!"},
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Jagged bone-spikes erupt from the floor, forming a lethal cage around the girl."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I have zero interest in your tragic little tale. Guards! Throw her out."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Lady Wanda, she's just an insignificant pawn in all of this. Please, there's no need to be so heartless..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Before you can finish the thought, Wanda seizes you by the throat, hoisting you up until you're eye-level with her."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The blind, limbless servant stands like a ghost behind her, a silent sentinel in the cold moonlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_40 = {
    Text = "You speak when I permit it. Is that understood?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_41 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Cough... gah...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Are you so addicted to this 'monk' persona that you've forgotten yourself? You dare act the saint in my presence?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_43 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_44 = {
    Text = "How did you... know...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Wanda releases her grip, and you collapse in a heap. She leisurely crosses her legs, enjoying the sight of you gasping for air."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_46 = {
    Text = "I grew bored of human parlor tricks centuries ago. You are certainly not Vayne @2."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Throw him in the dungeon. Don't let him out until he's ready to tell the truth."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_48 = {
    Text = "<Change>As you command!"
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You approach her with heavy steps. As you lower your head to slide the rings from her fingers one by one, your mind keeps drifting back to that hidden note."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_6 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Where exactly is this \"usual spot\"...?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_7 = {
    Text = "What is it? You look as though you have something to say to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_8 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_25188_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Your hand trembles. An opal ring slips from your grasp, clattering onto the floor and rolling toward the edge of the bed."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The Outcast Queen"
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Still not awake? Let's help him cool off."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_11 = {Text = "Nngh...!!"},
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_12 = {
    Text = "A sudden, icy chill shocks your chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_13 = {
    Text = "<Change>Still no reaction... My Lady..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Then just cut it off. Make it a clean stroke."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_15 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_16 = {
    Text = "<Big:Cut? Cut what?!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_17 = {
    Text = "You are bound to a cold iron rack. A heavy guillotine blade hovers less than ten inches above your thighs, poised to drop—"
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Wait, hold on... <Big:Gah!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_19 = {
    Text = "A sharp pain flares in your chest. Your robes are in tatters, revealing a map of gruesome, jagged scars."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Once upon a time..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_20 = {
    Text = "It's clear this body has endured horrific abuse."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You're finally awake."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_22 = {
    Text = "A low, velvety voice—laden with authority—echoes through the vast hall."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The noble Lady Wanda leans lazily against her attendant, squinting at you with cold interest."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_24 = {
    Text = "What is the meaning of this?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_25 = {
    Text = "\"To indulge in lewdness, to surrender to one's lusts...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_26 = {
    Text = "What's the next line? Keep reciting, little monk."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_27 = {Text = "...?"},
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_28 = {
    Text = "What's wrong? You spent weeks chanting those scriptures at my city gates. Did you forget them the moment you stepped inside?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The city gates... the scriptures..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_3 = {
    Text = "She rules over everything she sees."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_30 = {
    Text = "After such brutal punishment, this body's consciousness is a fractured mess. You focus your mind, slowly piecing together fragments of memory."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_31 = {
    Text = "<Blue:Vayne @2>, 23 years old. Born in southern Shropshire. He was ordained as a monk in the Cambrian Diocese three months ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Devout and compassionate, he was sickened by Lady Wanda's decadent lifestyle. Every morning, he would stand at the castle gates to recite holy verses in protest."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Vayne lasted twenty-three days before the guards finally lost their patience and dragged him inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_34 = {
    Text = "\"To indulge in lewdness, to surrender to one's lusts...\" The next part is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Hmm. Truly forgotten? In that case, let's just cut him in half."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Wanda yawns and gives a languid wave of her hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_37 = {Text = "Release!"},
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The rack gears groan as they turn. The blade begins its descent, and the rush of cold air ignites your survival instinct."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Wait! Wait! I remember! I remember!"
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_4 = {
    Text = "At night, she sits alone on a high terrace, watching the planets as they roll slowly through the void."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_40 = {
    Text = "<Shake: \"...shall suffer such punishment as a warn... a warning...\" >"
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_41 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Damn it... if only I had Ramona's memory.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_42 = {
    Text = "<Change>My Lady... a spy..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_43 = {
    Text = "The silent attendant's throat twitches as he lets out a thick, raspy gurgle."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Oh? Do go on."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_45 = {
    Text = "<Change>Diocese. Scriptures."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_46 = {Text = "I see..."},
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_47 = {
    Text = "My little pet tells me you might be a spy. A monk sent by the Diocese who can't even remember his basic verses? How suspicious."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_48 = {Text = "However—"},
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_49 = {Text = "BOOM!!"},
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_5 = {
    Text = "She sings to herself, whispers to the stars, and sometimes drifts into sleep without even realizing it."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Rigid, bone-like spikes erupt from the floor, stopping inches from the blind servant's throat. Wanda lifts her gaze and gives him a frigid stare."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_51 = {
    Text = "You speak when I permit it. When I do not, you are a mute. Is that understood?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_52 = {
    Text = "<Change>I obey. Understood."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_53 = {
    Text = "The blind attendant falls silent instantly, retreating back into the shadows of the corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_54 = {
    Text = "The hall falls so silent you could hear a pin drop on the cold stone."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Glass in hand, Wanda approaches you with steps that are both graceful and predatory."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_56 = {
    Text = "She reaches out, her long nails grazing your chest before lingering at the pulse of your neck."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_57 = {
    Text = "He says you're a spy. <Red:So... are you?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Wanda narrows her cobalt-yellow eyes. She hides her cruelty well, but it flickers dangerously behind her gaze like a spark in the dark."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_59 = {
    Text = "If your next answer fails to please her, those nails will surely tear through your throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
She has always done exactly as she pleases.
Before the Cataclysm, she was the Queen; after the Cataclysm, she is the only thing left.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_60 = {
    Text = "You take a steadying breath and force yourself to look her directly in the eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_61 = {
    Text = "If I were a spy, I wouldn't have chosen this identity."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_62 = {
    Text = "First, it's too high-profile. It invites far too much scrutiny and trouble."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Second, it's suicide. Everyone in Cambrian knows that Lady Wanda loathes monks above all else—agh!"
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Icy wine spills over your neck, stinging as it seeps into your raw wounds."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Wanda tosses the empty glass aside and flashes a sharp smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_66 = {
    Text = "I certainly don't like monks. And? Keep going, Mr. Vayne."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_67 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_68 = {
    Text = "<Shake:If I were a fake... I'd have been killed ten times over... before ever setting foot in this hall...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Wanda bursts into laughter, seemingly delighted by your response."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_7 = {
    Text = "And so, she continues to do as she pleases."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_70 = {
    Text = "How surprising. It seems you aren't such a dull, stuffy little creature after all."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_71 = {
    Text = "I like clever people. But I love those who are both clever and beautiful."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Wanda pats your cheek with mock affection before raising her voice to call her servants."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Take him away. Scrub him clean and bring him to my bedchamber tonight."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Her bedchamber? What for...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_75 = {
    Text = [[
No one bothers to answer you.
Wanda yawns and exits the hall in a grand procession, surrounded by her retinue.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Seeing your bewildered expression, a nearby maid rolls her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_77 = {
    Text = "You really don't get it? You're to attend her bed tonight. It's an opportunity most people would kill for..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_78 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Attend her bed?!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Your vision swims, and you lose consciousness once again."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Yes, everything she sees is hers to rule—though it has all long since crumbled into cosmic dust."
  },
  AvgDialog_25189_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
Is a queen without subjects still a queen?
Wanda doesn't know the answer.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_1 = {
    Text = "<Change>Aargh..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
<Yellow:Meet at the usual spot @1 at 9 PM on the 17th> to discuss the plan.
Beware @1 the Woman of @2 Thorns.

Your old friend,
Guderian]]
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_11 = {
    Text = "<Gray:A \"plan\"? What kind of plan?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_12 = {
    Text = "\"My little pet tells me you might be a spy... A monk who can't even remember his basic verses.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Was that servant right? Am I actually a spy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I can't believe I missed such critical information in his memories... He must have been tortured past the point of sanity."
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You hide the note away, your mind racing with new questions."
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_16 = {
    Text = "What are you staring for? The Lady has no patience. The last person who was late has been rotting in a cell for two years."
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_17 = {Text = "...Hey."},
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You lean toward the maid, keeping your voice barely above a whisper."
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_19 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:Are you one of Count Guderian's moles too?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You repel the encroaching monsters with ease."
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Ahem! Stop muttering and keep moving!"
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The maid snaps at you, but her eyes flicker toward you with unmistakable eagerness and secret meaning."
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_22 = {
    Text = "<Gray:My dear, you're making this a little too obvious.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_23 = {
    Text = "What now? Carry out Vayne's original plan, or surrender the truth to Wanda?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_24 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Truth be told, I'm quite curious to find out what this Count is actually plotting...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Gray:The corrosive ichor has reached the heart of the castle. How could Wanda be unaware of this?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_4 = {
    Text = "It's true then. He really is <Blue:\"that gentleman\"> the Count mentioned."
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_5 = {
    Text = "If it's him, then surely he can..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_6 = {
    Text = "A scrap of paper is suddenly pressed into your palm."
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You look up to see the maid, who had just been cowering behind you, standing tall once again with her usual mask of cold arrogance."
  },
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_8 = {Text = "?"},
  AvgDialog_25190_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You unfold the note. It's covered in scribbled cipher, but using Vayne's memories, you manage to decode the message."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Night of Death, Mead & Songs"
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_10 = {
    Text = "What this woman is thinking, no one can guess. However—"
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The Cambrian plague is beyond cure. If those infected are released, heaven knows what would happen."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Regardless of Wanda's intention, her actions indeed saved the surrounding fiefs..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Cambrian Castle
Banquet Hall]]
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You push open the heavy wooden door of the hall."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Dazzling light spills across the room like fallen stars. The air is thick with the sweet aroma of wine and gourmet food."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The peasants of Cambrian have put on their finest clothes, dancing joyfully to the rhythm of the music."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Though the world outside is submerged by Dissolution, the hall remains full of cheer."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Is this the legendary apple pudding? I've never tasted anything so delicious in my life..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Hahaha! I'm so happy! If I die tonight, it was all worth it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Guderian's Fiefdom
Hunting Grounds]]
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Dance! Come on, everyone dance!"
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You push through the bustling crowd and find Wanda seated at the far end."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_23 = {
    Text = "She leans languidly against her attendants, the red wine in her glass catching the light like a polished ruby."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Good evening, Master Monk. I thought you'd be too pious to join our absurd revelry."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Sometimes I want to satisfy my curiosity."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Besides, with D-slime everywhere outside, where else could I possibly go...?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Someone tugs gently at the hem of your robe."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_28 = {
    Text = "You're... Susanna's brother!"
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_29 = {
    Text = "I have a name, you know! Everyone calls me Little Beckman."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_3 = {
    Text = "What? You're telling me Wanda fused the bolts shut and is holding a ball for every peasant in Cambrian inside that castle?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Good evening, Little Beckman. Where has your sister gone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Big sister and the others who weren't sick left together..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Little Beckman bows his head, dejected. He sniffs, then looks up at you with wide, watery eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Good sir, will you dance with me? I don't have a partner, boo-hoo..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Little one, monks aren't permitted to dance."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Now I declare that you are permitted. Forget those outdated rules."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_36 = {
    Text = "In Cambrian, I—<Big:AM THE LAW ITSELF!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_37 = {
    Text = "You look into Little Beckman's hopeful eyes and swallow your refusal."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_38 = {
    Text = "I'm afraid I've never learned how to dance, but I can certainly spin around with you for a bit."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_39 = {
    Text = "You take Little Beckman's hand and lead him into the center of the hall, joining the sea of villagers swaying to the melody."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_4 = {
    Text = "It's the absolute truth! I heard those who weren't infected have all left. The only ones left at that dance are those who are terminally ill."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Skirts flutter and twirl in the candlelight like a thousand colorful spinning cupcakes."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_41 = {
    Text = "You drift through this golden ocean of light and song, finally submerged by the rising bubbles of joy."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Little Beckman's footwork is no better than yours. He wiggles aimlessly to the beat, his face flushing a bright, happy red."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Hahaha! So happy! This is the best day of my life!"
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Sir, grab my hand! Let's spin together!"
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_45 = {Text = "Hurry up!"},
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_46 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Faster!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_47 = {
    Text = "<Red:Faster...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_48 = {Text = "Fast@2..."},
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Little Beckman, what's happening to your face...?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Hahaha! I went through so much trouble to plant a mole by her side... it seems I wasted my effort."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_50 = {
    Text = "<Change>Dance with me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Inky D-slime begins to pour from the boy's eyes, yet he continues to smile as he reaches for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_52 = {
    Text = "A sudden, cold wetness touches your nose. You look up and see black ichor dripping slowly from the crystal chandelier."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_53 = {
    Text = "One drop. Two."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_54 = {
    Text = "You look around in a panic, only to realize that many people's clothes, arms, and faces are all beginning to rot."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_55 = {
    Text = "But they still dance joyfully."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Sir, why are you ignoring me? Don't you like me anymore...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_57 = {
    Text = "The boy wraps his sticky hands around you, sorrow overflowing from his hollow eye sockets."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Stay with me... Stay with me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_6 = {
    Text = "With a plague that horrific, she doesn't even try to escape. She just locks them all in to wait for death..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Is it true, as the rumors say, that she has gone completely mad?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Your words are quite intriguing. Was she ever a woman of sound mind to begin with?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25191_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Uh... well..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You finally wrench yourself away from Little Beckman, only to see the entire hall mutating."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_10 = {
    Text = "If we are destined for the grave, why shouldn't we depart with joy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Or should we huddle in our beds and weep alone just to satisfy your image of how the dying ought to behave?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I told you. In Cambrian, I am the law."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The Queen commands: Dance! Keep dancing!\nPast, present, and future—we shall never fear death."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_14 = {
    Text = "At Wanda's command—"
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The atmosphere in the hall is pushed to its peak."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_17 = {
    Text = "<Change> Dance, dance..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Mad. They've all gone completely insane..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The banquet hall has become a massive graveyard. The oozing D-slime is like a swarm of lice hidden beneath a silken robe."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You look on in bewilderment at everything unfolding before your eyes. Even in your wildest fever dreams, you have never witnessed a scene so phantasmagoric."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Everyone is insane. Everyone is scarred."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_22 = {
    Text = "But everyone is happy."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_23 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_24 = {
    Text = "I once heard someone say: Those who cannot hear the music think the dancers are mad."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_25 = {
    Text = "You tear open your collar and collapse to the floor, utterly exhausted."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_26 = {
    Text = "It's funny, in a way. I once vowed at Mythag's grave to face life and death without fear... yet I was never truly ready to face death."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You've given me a new perspective—though I hope I never have to face such a dilemma."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_28 = {
    Text = "You pick up a glass and offer a toast to Wanda across the sea of black ichor, spilled wine, and scattered flowers."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_29 = {
    Text = "To courage."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_3 = {
    Text = "No. Too many people are mutating at once..."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Wanda laughs heartily and raises her glass toward you."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_31 = {
    Text = "To death. Our most magnificent and sweetest demise."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The sweet scent of rotting corpses fills your nostrils, accompanied by a cacophony of wails, sobs, and laughter."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_33 = {
    Text = "But they never stop dancing."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_34 = {
    Text = "The Queen never abandons her people. Soon, they will march together into this magnificent feast of death."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_36 = {
    Text = "This time, at last, she is not alone."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Can you still recall that scripture? The one you recited at the gates?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_38 = {
    Text = "...I remember."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_39 = {
    Text = "<Red:Indulging in lust and giving in to unchecked desires shall be punished by eternal fire as a warning.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You instinctively look toward Wanda."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Then are you ready? Ready for the eternal fire?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_41 = {
    Text = "In the gathering darkness, you hear only a distant, fading laughter."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Like shards of a meteor falling into a lake, the sounds sink slowly into the depths of your consciousness."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Until, at the very end, there is only silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Through the bustling crowd, Wanda smiles and raises her glass to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Scared already, little monk?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I don't understand. Are you just going to stand by and watch them go mad and die?"
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Wanda bursts into laughter, black tears tracking down her cheeks. Her own skin is already riddled with wounds from the Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_25199_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Nothing is eternal, little monk. Not even the gods you worship."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_1 = {Text = "Piper"},
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid. I'll find a way to get you out."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The villagers merely watch you in silence, their eyes devoid of both hope and hostility."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_12 = {
    Text = "By the way, that maid..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_13 = {
    Text = "My father and younger brother are both imprisoned by you below. I must save them—"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Do you know a maid named Susanna?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Susanna, it's your older sister!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_16 = {
    Text = "A crisp child's voice came from the corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_17 = {
    Text = "By the dim candlelight, you notice an old man lying in the corner and a boy with round eyes beside him."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Susanna is my daughter... What has happened to her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_19 = {
    Text = "She is deeply concerned about your safety and wants to get you out."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Cambrian Castle
Underground Prison]]
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_20 = {
    Text = "We can't leave here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The old man shook his head. His body was covered in Dissolution holes, black goo oozing out and staining the straw beneath him."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_22 = {
    Text = "We chose to stay here voluntarily. After falling ill, people go insane and turn into monsters."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Yeah, there have been many murders nearby... Later, the lady led people to check house by house and locked up the sick in here."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_24 = {
    Text = "If you don't want to be locked up, then leave the fief and swear never to return."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_25 = {
    Text = "You can have porridge and sweet bread here every day!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<Gray:I see. Could it be that we misunderstood her?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Has Lady Wanda treated you well since she arrived at the fiefdom?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Is that so? I don't know. I've never seen her; I've only heard that she's cruel, has caused the deaths of four husbands, and is the embodiment of evil."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_29 = {
    Text = "But during her time in the fief, she did many good deeds, and our lives have indeed improved significantly compared to before."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The heavy iron door shuts tightly behind you."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_30 = {
    Text = "She taught us to farm and raise sheep. Every year during the festival, we would take the wool to the summer market and make a tidy sum."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_31 = {
    Text = "That's right, the Charich Market was seized by her from Earl Goodrich. They've been fighting over it for almost a year..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Villagers eagerly share stories about Wanda managing her fiefdom: farming, livestock, smelting, and estate management..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_33 = {
    Text = "You are amazed at Wanda's profound understanding of her fief's affairs; she is nothing like those pleasure-seeking lords."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_34 = {
    Text = "A decent lord, but unfortunately encountered Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_35 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Such a large-scale spread... There must be a D-Rift nearby...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The iron door behind suddenly opened."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_37 = {
    Text = "You turn around to find Wanda standing outside the prison gate. Her tall figure blocks the candlelight in the hallway, casting a warm orange glow on her silhouette."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Let this guy out, I have something to say to {Male=him,Female=her} alone."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
Cambrian Castle
Garden]]
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You turn around and unexpectedly encounter several pairs of glowing eyes, surrounding you like beasts in the pitch-black shadows."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_40 = {
    Text = "You walk together on the soft grass, all the way to the edge of the lake."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_41 = {
    Text = "The lake at midnight is a dark mirror, faintly reflecting the fragmented moonlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_42 = {
    Text = "You should understand that Cambrian is now experiencing severe Dissolution disasters, and I am powerless to stop them."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_43 = {
    Text = "And you, when fighting those monsters in the castle, were so skilled—it was as if you were a professional."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_44 = {
    Text = "<Gray:I am indeed a professional at this...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Wasn't the lady in her chamber at the time? How does she know so clearly?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_46 = {
    Text = "My eyes and ears are everywhere in Cambrian. Even the freesia here needs my approval to bloom. There's nothing I don't know."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Where is that maid? Knowing she is a spy, why keep her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Wanda waved her hand indifferently."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_49 = {
    Text = "She's just a pitiful ordinary human; she can't lay a finger on me."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_5 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Waaah!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Besides, she has served me quite well. Finding a satisfactory human servant is no easy task."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Anyway, I need you to resolve the Dissolution. Don't rush to refuse—price and such can be discussed. I'll meet your demands."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_52 = {
    Text = "You can't bear to see these villagers die innocently either, can you, dear \"Monk\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_53 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_54 = {
    Text = "In the last meeting at the sleeping quarters, Madam mentioned \"you humans,\" combined with your special abilities... Lady Wanda, you are not human, are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_55 = {
    Text = "A presence from a distant land, powerful and brutal, yet concerned with the villagers' lives. What is the lady's true purpose?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Faced with your questioning, Wanda raised an eyebrow and suddenly burst out laughing."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Do you find what I just said amusing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_58 = {
    Text = "No... Hahaha! I'm just so happy. After all these years, I've finally met someone else who doesn't belong \"here,\" just like me."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_59 = {
    Text = "How do you know—"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Once your vision adjusts, you can finally make out the scene before you."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Wanda gently places her index finger on your lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Shh... Follow me. I'll show you something."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Did you know? From the reflection of this lake, you can see the city where I used to live."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_63 = {
    Text = "You've moved closer to the lake. The deep blue water is nearly bottomless, faintly revealing aquatic plants and blurred black boulders."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_64 = {
    Text = "The moonlight illuminates the deep lakebed, and you finally make out the black spiral spire and blunt-angled walls on the stone."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_65 = {
    Text = "There's... a city underwater?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Back then, I had a grand palace with over a thousand servants attending to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Just as you said, I never cared about the lives of my minions."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_68 = {
    Text = "I always act on my desires. My minions, and even the entire city, are extensions of my ambition and desires."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Later, my planet was struck by what you call \"Dissolution,\" and everyone perished."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Sitting, lying down, leaning against the wall... All of them are ragged villagers."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_70 = {
    Text = "I sat alone in the hall for a very long time, watching my palace, my capital, and everything I owned turn to ruins."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_71 = {
    Text = "To be honest, this feeling is terrible, and no one wants to experience it a second time."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Madam Wanda..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I can't help you this time. Closing the D-Rift is too complex for me to handle alone."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, tell me your concerns, and I'll provide all the help you need."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_75 = {
    Text = "You shake your head."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Not just that... Our current environment also has some, uh, peculiarities..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_77 = {
    Text = "During the Dream Phase, you cannot perform complex actions such as closing rifts."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_78 = {
    Text = "<Gray:How should I explain this to Mrs. Wanda...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Since we're in a dream, you can't help me, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Their bodies were covered in D-Marks, some mostly corroded, the air filled with sickness and death"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_80 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Have you noticed?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Wanda gazed down at the black city in the water, her eyes shimmering with fragmented white moonlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Since coming here, I've had many dreams. About war, disaster, time... but never once about my capital."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Just when I was about to forget it, I met you, and then saw it again at the bottom of the lake."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Did you know? When a dying person sees the piper moving through the fog, they feel neither fear nor curiosity."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_86 = {
    Text = "He will quietly follow the Piper to a place of his own."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Wanda let out a deep, melancholic sigh."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_88 = {
    Text = "My lost capital, beautiful like a dying man's dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_89 = {
    Text = "She gently stroked the silent, blind attendant by her side."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Wanda actually locked you all in here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_90 = {
    Text = "<Change>Madam..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Cambrian is my second home. I haven't spent much time here, yet it's already time to say goodbye."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_92 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry, Mrs. Wanda..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Wanda waved at you. When she looked up again, the gloom on her face had completely disappeared."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Don't worry. As the lord of this fief, I must take responsibility for everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Isn't it just dying together? Let's die gloriously."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_96 = {
    Text = "What are you going to do?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Wanda flashed a mysterious smile and winked at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_34830_Content_98 = {
    Text = "A magnificent farewell banquet."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You finally got rid of Little Beckman's entanglement, but the villagers are continuously mutating"
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_10 = {
    Text = "If we are destined to die, why not depart with joy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Or should we curl up in our own beds, weeping alone, fulfilling all your imaginings of the dying?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I told you, in Cambrian, I am the law."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The queen commands: Dance, keep dancing! Past, present, and future, we shall never fear death."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_14 = {
    Text = "At Wanda's command—"
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The atmosphere in the hall was pushed to its peak."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_17 = {
    Text = "<Change> Dance, dance..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_19 = {
    Text = "They've all gone... completely insane..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The once joyous banquet hall transformed into a massive graveyard, with D-Slime oozing like lice beneath a luxurious robe."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You look on in bewilderment at everything unfolding before your eyes. Even in the wildest dreams of madness, you've never witnessed such phantasmagoric scenes."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Everyone has gone mad. Everyone bears scars."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_22 = {
    Text = "But everyone was happy."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_23 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Alright, I give up."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_25 = {
    Text = "You loosen your collar and collapse to the ground, utterly exhausted."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_26 = {
    Text = "How ironic. I once vowed at Mythag's grave to fear neither life nor death, yet I was never truly prepared to face it."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You taught me a lesson, Wanda."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_28 = {
    Text = "You raise your glass towards Wanda, toasting across the dark mucus, splashing red wine, and scattered flowers."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_29 = {
    Text = "—To our sweetest and most glamorous death."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_3 = {
    Text = "No, there are simply too many people who have undergone mutations..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The sweet scent of decaying corpses reaches your nose, and you hear the wails of countless mournful cries."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_31 = {
    Text = "But they never stopped dancing."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The Queen never abandons her people. Soon, they will march together to this magnificent feast of death."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_34 = {
    Text = "This time, she is finally not alone."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Can you still recall that scripture? The one recited at the city gate?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_36 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_37 = {
    Text = "<Red:Indulging in lust and giving in to unchecked desires shall be punished by eternal fire as a warning.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Are you ready?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_39 = {
    Text = "When suffering from Eternal Fire punishment."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You instinctively glance in Wanda's direction."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_40 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_41 = {
    Text = "In the darkness, you only hear distant laughter."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_42 = {
    Text = "They are like fragments of a meteor falling into a lake, slowly sinking into the depths of your consciousness."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Until the very end, you hear nothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Amid the bustling, joyful crowd, Wanda smiles and raises her glass to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Scared already, little monk?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I don't understand. Are you just going to stand by and watch as everyone goes mad and dies?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Wanda laughed heartily, black tears streaming from her eyes. Only then did you notice that her body was covered in wounds caused by Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_34831_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Nothing is eternal, little monk, not even the gods you revere."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_1 = {
    Text = "After dropping another wave drawn by noise, you finally get a breather."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_10 = {
    Text = "These fluids aren't corrosive, but some basic precautions are required—better safe than sorry."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Before you can stop her, Ramona rips fabric from the Seafarer's clothes, wraps the tip of her weapon, and probes the corpse's abdomen, stirring its guts."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_12 = {
    Text = "...Has she always been like this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Don't be shocked—it's her academic spirit in action."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Done.  I've severed the vessels anchoring the parasite."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_15 = {
    Text = "With a flick of her sword tip, the lifeless parasite rolls out, murky sludge spreading along deck seams in all directions. The captain quickly pulls Celeste to a new spot."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The parasite looks like a jelly, tentacled mass, yet up close, it echoes a mammalian embryo. Even through the skin, it radiates deep blasphemy."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Ramona frowns, sheathing her rapier and picking up the Seafarer's spear. She lightly slices the parasite's jelly skin—"
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Black pus gushes out. Murphy yelps and leaps back several steps."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_19 = {
    Text = "What? Is something there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Why are these Seafarers' bellies all swollen like that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Black! Black liquid! Captain, don't you see it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona exchange glances—the gush from the parasite is unmistakably your \"old friend\": D-Slime."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_22 = {
    Text = "These Seafarers showed no signs of infestation before the explosion..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Before the explosion... before the explosion... before the Domain vanished!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The domain vanished?! Celeste, you can't sustain the Domain anymore?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_25 = {
    Text = "After the captain's affirmative nod, Ramona pieces it all together."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_26 = {
    Text = "She turns gravely to Murphy, who's pulling the captain around, dodging the flowing D-Slime."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The unborn \"god\" has become the Cataclysm's core, influencing every living thing on board."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_28 = {
    Text = "The mentally frail, muddled Seafarers took the brunt of it—these parasites are likely a form of D-Hyperplasia manifesting."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_29 = {Text = "A form?"},
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Murphy edges warily to a defeated Seafarer, with Ramona close behind."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_30 = {
    Text = "You head toward where you and Murphy heard the noise, and return to the lower deck, leaving the hiding cabin."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_31 = {
    Text = "The cabin overrun with D-Hyperplasia stands silent, the growths sprawling wilder and more chaotic than when you left."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_4 = {
    Text = "They exchange a look before joining hands to roll the Seafarer's limp body over."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The abdomen was bulged grotesquely by the parasite inside, its skin stretched thin and transparent, its organs nearly visible."
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Moving—it's moving!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The parasite writhes under everyone's eyes, bloating the host's abdomen. The stretched skin loses its texture—"
  },
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_8 = {Text = "Splat!"},
  AvgDialog_34965_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The Seafarer's gut deflates like a balloon. The parasite stops moving. Ramona swings her sword toward empty space, flicking grime off the tip."
  },
  AvgDialog_34966_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Deprecated, pending deletion"
  },
  AvgDialog_34967_Content_1 = {Text = "@2..."},
  AvgDialog_34967_Content_10 = {
    Text = "This time you enter the spirit realm successfully, but as you try opening your eyes to trigger the link, bizarre blurry images flood your mind like jumbled slides."
  },
  AvgDialog_34967_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You stare into the inner void, trying to withstand the odd pressure, but your spirit crashes hard to the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_34967_Content_12 = {Text = "Ngh...!"},
  AvgDialog_34967_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Kid, you've got a nosebleed."
  },
  AvgDialog_34967_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Startled, you twist to wipe your nose with the fabric on your shoulder. Sure enough, the black cloth is stained with dark blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_34967_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You're wiped—let me carry Murphy."
  },
  AvgDialog_34967_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You shake your head, mustering strength to steady Murphy."
  },
  AvgDialog_34967_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I'm good, keep going."
  },
  AvgDialog_34967_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Groundless despair and struggle shroud Murphy's consciousness, weaving her mutters into cage after cage."
  },
  AvgDialog_34967_Content_3 = {Text = "Tu...@1..."},
  AvgDialog_34967_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Are you calling for Tulu?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34967_Content_5 = {Text = "Why..."},
  AvgDialog_34967_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Her hands clench involuntarily, her body trembling in fear."
  },
  AvgDialog_34967_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
Tulu... yeah, if Tulu were here, he'd know how to wake you.
Even if he couldn't, at least he could make you feel better...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_34967_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Wait... the link. I can try calling him again through the link."
  },
  AvgDialog_34967_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You glance back at Ramona, who's still fending off Seafarers, then breathe deep, closing your eyes to sink into the spirit realm..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Overload Safeguard"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_10 = {
    Text = "When the stars take their rightful stations, the heavens shall guide This One's rebirth. In that hour, the Divine Realm too shall ascend, and once more shall the light of dawn fall upon Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Who's there!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_101 = {
    Text = "The eavesdropper raises a bone spear and flees—Ramona chases, catching only a black robe vanishing down the corridor."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_102 = {Text = "...Caecus."},
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_103 = {
    Text = "That Awakener boy doesn't lose control—neither did Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_104 = {
    Text = "Captain, you say Caecus links to Miryam... are you sure about that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_105 = {
    Text = "As far as I know, yeah."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_106 = {
    Text = "Doll, you hear that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_107 = {
    Text = "That means the Seafarer's High Priestess Miryam is still active."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_108 = {
    Text = "As for the Keeper's coma... for the whole past year in Mythag, {Male=he,Female=she} has never had sudden blackouts."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_109 = {
    Text = "I can't tell what's wrong with {Male=him,Female=her} without a full exam."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_11 = {
    Text = "This is the covenant between the divine and this humble vessel..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_110 = {
    Text = "\"William's squad has cleared out the docks; we are waiting for your return... Come back alive, all of you.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_111 = {
    Text = "\"Meanwhile Sona-Nyl, Engine Room\""
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_112 = {
    Text = "Fragile deck planks and steel frames can't block the Gnosis waves—the energy shockwaves sweep the blasted engine room."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_113 = {
    Text = "From charred wreckage and ruins, she stirs stiffly—like a wolf lured by the scent of blood, or a puppet without thought."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_114 = {
    Text = "Her every move pulled by some unknowable force, face blank, she slowly shoves debris aside, crawling from the ruins."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_115 = {
    Text = "No one knows what grim obsession and power drives her—her lovely face is smeared with grime, eyes hollow and gray, with no spark, yet flickering with eerie light."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_116 = {
    Text = "Like terror rising from despair's abyss."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_12 = {
    Text = "...No, this is our pact."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Now, embrace a temporary slumber."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_14 = {
    Text = "High Priestess Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Floods and waves follow, subjects drowned before getting a chance to say farewell to loved ones, crushed to dust by nature's might."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_16 = {
    Text = "We promised..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I won't give up on her."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Is that... %player%...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Murphy struggles up, dazed, gazing around."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_2 = {
    Text = "My head... hurts..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Her familiar group huddles nearby, murmuring. At her voice, they all turn."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Murphy! How are you feeling now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Her vision clears gradually. Murphy rubs her eyes, spotting %player% in the circle's center, deep in sleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_23 = {
    Text = "W-what happened to {Male=him,Female=her}?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Not sure... there are no obvious injuries—{Male=he,Female=she} shouldn't have passed out like this."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Our link is stable... unnaturally so."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_26 = {
    Text = "We did a routine check before leaving—%player% was fine then..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Murphy, were there any odd signs during your time with %player%?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_28 = {
    Text = "From after the blast, before finding you? Let me think..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_29 = {
    Text = "H-Hey?! Don't scare me—don't die on me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Where... am I? %player%? Where are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_30 = {
    Text = "I-I'm fine..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Wake up, %player%, come on, snap out of it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Don't—don't scare me like this... Get up already!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_33 = {
    Text = "At least twice... first when trying that tracing trick to find people, then when {Male=he,Female=she} just collapsed—but woke up quickly."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Will... {Male=he,Female=she} be okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Ramona looks at her partner—%player% lies peacefully beside her, sunk in a coma, face flushed and calm, like {Male=he,Female=she} is savoring a sweet dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_36 = {
    Text = "A hard-to-name emotion swells in her, gaze lingering on that serene face as the world quiets."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
I... don't know...
Maybe someone at school can help, but...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Do you want to contact your school? Maybe try the radio..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_39 = {
    Text = "The captain swallows the rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_4 = {
    Text = "She gets no response—the endless flow of water echoes in the deep dark."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Radio's on the bridge—and heading back now is suicide."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Ah, right! You have those magical communicators, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Ramona's eyes light up. She chides her own panic quietly, and presses her school badge communicator."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Sizzle—sizzle sizzle—"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Ramo... *&..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Doll?! Is that you!?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Kee... %#... ship**...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_47 = {
    Text = "I can't hear you. We're too far from land—beyond communicator range."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Wait, maybe I can amp the signal briefly."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Ramona yanks off her brooch, prying open the communicator shell with a pin she carries."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Water, endless water."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Where... did you get that needle from?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Better safe than sorry—always prep more than you need."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Ramona tinkers with the internals. It's not long before she uses the simple pin to bypass the communicator energy core's final safety layer."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_53 = {
    Text = "A quietly churning mass of Silver appears before everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Silver... so Silver Cores below the Gnosis awakening threshold get turned into tools?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Save the mechanics, and the ethical debate, for when we're back at school."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Next, I'll short the core—a burst of massive Gnosis fluctuation should amp the communicator temporarily."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Only in theory, though... Give me some time. I'll try."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Two minutes later"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Murphy, hold this part, will you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Black waves tower higher than Elworth's tallest peaks. They crash straight into the city, washing away history and future, drowning them..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_60 = {
    Text = "What's it for?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_61 = {
    Text = "It's a Stabilizer for the Silver. Remove it, and the activated core will let me short it."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Hold it steady—I gotta reinstall it later. Without it, the core can't cool down—it might explode."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_63 = {Text = "Eek?!"},
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_64 = {
    Text = "One minute later"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Ramona rearranges the communicator's guts—gears and mystery wires all pulled and recombined."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_66 = {Text = "Done!"},
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Murphy crouches beside her, timidly holding the part, but peeks curiously anyway."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_68 = {Text = "That it?"},
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_69 = {
    Text = "One last step—everyone, eyes shut, don't look this way."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_7 = {
    Text = "This is Your divine prophecy—no one can fault it."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Ramona covers Murphy's eyes with her hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Blinding white bursts from the communicator, spreading outward like sky lightning, bleaching the hold pale."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Energy surges like crashing waves, rippling out instantly."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_73 = {
    Text = "The fluctuation hums, like stellar tones from deep space, the communicator glows mysteriously, as if linking distant galaxies."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Ramona? Can you hear me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_75 = {
    Text = "I've never been happier to hear you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_76 = {
    Text = "To stabilize the comms, I burned twenty times the daily dose of Silver. Quick, what's your status? How is everyone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Ramona briefs Doll on the ship's events: the descent ritual, the Seafarer cult, Murphy, the Keeper's coma..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_78 = {
    Text = "I'll need Francis's lab results to halt the \"god's\" growth... got it. Bring that girl back—Winkle and I will prep the room."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Winkle, you have two hours to amp anti-hound measures."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Whose... voice is that...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Experiment's unstable, unstable... must do something now—immediately! Or we'll lose control, and lose it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Erica, take Winkle away."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_82 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Erica found Seafarer data in the archives—don't get your hopes up, it's just a bit."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Flood time, new continent sightings reported: A group of \"ugly, fish-like\" refugees waded seas, vanished in floods."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_85 = {
    Text = "They claimed to be the inheritors of an ancient civilization, with blood bestowed by \"God\" flowing through their veins."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_86 = {
    Text = "These people are born as humans, but the divine blood gradually transforms them into what you see now."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_87 = {
    Text = "So that boy will end up fish-like too..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_88 = {
    Text = "You mean Caecus? If you wanna know about him, I can tell you."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Ramona nods, urging the captain on."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_9 = {
    Text = "O, the divine realm's most faithful devotee, my eternity, the kingdom's future... I entrust to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_90 = {
    Text = "\"Caecus... that kid's a Golem too—an Awakener in your terms. Linked to Miryam, probably.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Linked to Miryam?! An Awakener linking another—that's unheard of..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Ha, that woman's a monster through and through."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_93 = {
    Text = "The cult doles out stabilizers to keep my mind steady. After the last contact went mad, Caecus became the new delivery guy."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_94 = {
    Text = "During those years, we met quarterly... I taught him drinking, fishing, spotting the morning star in summer, picking off dry scales in winter..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Haha... I thought we were friends. So when he messages me for one last delivery, I didn't hesitate."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_96 = {
    Text = "But... he sells out the Sona-Nyl's position to the cult."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_97 = {
    Text = "No one ever taught him right from wrong—he's never found meaning beyond the Seafarers."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_98 = {
    Text = "If betraying me buys his spot in the cult... I won't hold it against him."
  },
  AvgDialog_34968_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Metal clangs abruptly—Ramona snaps to combat stance, shielding the captain and Murphy."
  },
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The ship groans again, a creaking wail echoing as it lurches like a vessel caught in a tempest. The hull sways erratically, metal debris clattering across the floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_10 = {
    Text = "No thanks—I'm not making someone wounded lug me around."
  },
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_11 = {
    Text = "She eyes you up and down, then turns away, a bit flushed."
  },
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_12 = {
    Text = "But... thanks."
  },
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_13 = {
    Text = "What was that shake? Celeste didn't plow us into some current, did she...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
I figure... Celeste's losing her hold on the Sona-Nyl.
Hauling us from that blast probably wiped her out.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_15 = {
    Text = "She was weak already, and now..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Murphy presses her chest, forcing an awkward grin."
  },
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_17 = {
    Text = "It's okay. We hit the shore, and we're safe..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The lights flicker in time with your breaths. As the room dims, foes emerge from the shadows..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_2 = {Text = "Eek?!"},
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A grotesque snap, like bones breaking, reverberates from somewhere. Before you or Murphy can react, the ship surges, tilting violently to one side."
  },
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_4 = {Text = "Murphy!"},
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You grab a protruding metal pipe to steady yourself, reaching for Murphy, but she's already stumbled to the far end of the engine room."
  },
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I'm fine! Don't yell like I'm about to drop dead!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The cabin settles, leaving only scattered wreckage as evidence of the violent jolt."
  },
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Murphy, still shaken, steadies herself against the bulkhead, legs trembling as she approaches."
  },
  AvgDialog_34969_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Did you hit anything? Do you need help?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You first—I'll watch your back!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_10 = {
    Text = "What the hell..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You walk near a coral, its shine graceful and pretty. In Londinium auctions, a piece like this would pull thousands of Leonian Florins."
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_12 = {
    Text = "—If not for the roots digging deep into a small D-Mark."
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_13 = {
    Text = "It's D-Hyperplasia."
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_14 = {
    Text = "In <Italic:Fundamentals of Dissolution Phenomena>, Doll explained D-Hyperplasia: at some point, D-Marks might sprout Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_15 = {
    Text = "There's no pattern as to when or what kind, but one thing is certain: D-Hyperplasia appears only where a Cataclysm lurks."
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_16 = {
    Text = "These scream ocean. A Cataclysm tied to the Aequor Realm is close."
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_17 = {
    Text = "A Cataclysm..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Murphy moves next to you, staring at the D-Mark under the coral. With one hand on her chest, the other skims the coral's rough top."
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Behind you, a big thump. Turning, you meet eyes with a Seafarer trapped by the D-Hyperplasia."
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Without argument, Murphy darts behind the door you're holding."
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_20 = {Text = "Gurgle..."},
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Murphy goes quiet, not reacting. You step up, blocking her from the Seafarer."
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Mutants and creatures of the sea, lured by your scent, rush in. Claws nick your cloak as you slip through."
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You slam against the door while Murphy locks it. The door blocks scent and sight, and the metal-scratching shrieks soon die down."
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Huff, huff... They just don't quit."
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Murphy, flip the light—huh?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_7 = {
    Text = "A creepy glow hits your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Branchy things burst through deck cracks, twisting and shoving for room. With steady snaps, the floor gives way under them."
  },
  AvgDialog_34970_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Corals, anemones, and unnamed sea creatures, thick and strong, force the deck apart inch by inch."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Carrying Murphy on your back, you flee the bridge with Elton and Celeste, with Ramona close behind."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Goliath, why?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_11 = {Text = "Why what?"},
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You defied Miryam openly, letting us slip away multiple times..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Don't deny it—you've made it obvious."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I know in the engine room, you provoked Miryam on purpose—you didn't want a full clash with us, or rather... Tulu."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Mentioning Tulu makes your brain ache again—that baseless pain, like midnight gales ravaging your sanity, scorching nerves and will."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_16 = {Text = "Ugh..."},
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The familiar sensation of collapsing washes over you. It's a soul-deep pain, like wounds nearly healed being torn and stitched over."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Keeper? Keeper?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Ramona seems to sense your distress, keeping an eye on Goliath while gently touching your arm supporting Murphy."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Just as you're about to descend the stairs, the giant leaps down from above."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_20 = {Text = "I'm fine."},
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You whisper back to Ramona's concern. You draw a deep breath, and let the salty sea air push down the bloody tang rising in your nose."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Then you look up at Goliath again. He watches you with amusement, as if your pained twitches entertain him, a smug, wild grin on his face."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Clearly... you're not fully loyal to the Seafarers, scoffing at their faith, their god..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Miryam's defeated—there's no reason for hostility between us now.\nWhy... why obsess over Murphy suddenly?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_25 = {
    Text = "If you wanna die knowing, use those clever brains and figure it out."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The high priestess martyred, the Seafarers leaderless..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Whether I forge a new empire or lead these fools to eternity... what should I do?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_28 = {
    Text = "To seize power."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_29 = {
    Text = "You want to lead the Seafarers, and become the cult's sole new head."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_3 = {Text = "Watch out!"},
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_30 = {
    Text = "For that... you need the \"Divine Mother,\" to complete the ritual, and solidify your position..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_31 = {
    Text = "University pups, but sharp enough."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
Hand over Murphy.
Do it quick, and when my legions crush human civilization, I won't make it hard on you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Don't bother."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_34 = {
    Text = "I, uh... I never asked your name..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Growing up, they'd slap this on every scrape or bruise."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Well? Feels better already, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_37 = {
    Text = "The girl's weight bears down on you—your back, arms, legs, all tremble uncontrollably."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_38 = {
    Text = "We promised to take her back, to help rid her of that parasitic \"god.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_39 = {
    Text = "You grit your teeth, mustering strength to hold the burden of her soul."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Ramona darts in front of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_40 = {
    Text = "I won't give up on her."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Buzzing erupts in your ears, chaotic flutes piping through the hum."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_42 = {
    Text = "This absurd symphony makes your eyelids flutter, your brain swarming with unease and disorder."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_43 = {
    Text = "You sense an odd fatigue—a familiar fatigue, an unprecedented fatigue. Nerves numb gradually, limbs growing limp and weak."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_44 = {
    Text = "The world before you blacks out in waves, heavy curtains quietly shrouding your reality. Noise and chaos recede, silent flutes like invisible feathers brushing your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Can't sleep... can't drift off."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_46 = {
    Text = "You fight the inexplicable drowsiness, but to no avail. Ramona's voice fades rapidly. Before grasping what's happening, you crash hard to the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_47 = {Text = "Tu..."},
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Your brain struggles to process what's happening, but one thing is certain: the algae-green tentacles block the giant's blade, and they likely feel as soft as orange pulp."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I admire folks who fight back with guts, but I hate stubborn idiots more."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Goliath snaps the weathered iron stairs and bars your path with his massive cleaver."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Mythag students... Hah, so naive."
  },
  AvgDialog_34971_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Do you honestly think you can escape? With this rickety old ship, this barely intact Golem, and her Linker?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_1 = {Text = "Pyre Moth"},
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Caecus bows his head, glancing at his flame-scorched tail fin, silent."
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_11 = {
    Text = "As for our dear high priestess..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Goliath's gaze sweeps boldly over you all, lingering on Celeste and the captain."
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I doubt they kindly saved her from the blast's heart... am I right, you guys?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_14 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Go on, Caecus.\nShow me your worth—prove you're fit for my ranks."
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_16 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Yes, Lord Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Caecus, what are you doing!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
Caecus looks at the captain, hesitating.
After a few silent moments, he draws a deep breath, as if resolved.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Goliath ducks into the bridge, his massive frame nearly sealing off that side of the door."
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry, Mr. Elton."
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_21 = {
    Text = "He swings his weapon, slamming the cabin wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The metal vibrates with a massive echo, like rage roaring from a trapped abyss—deafening even to the striker."
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Seafarers! The Stellar Alignment nears!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_24 = {
    Text = "In Lord Goliath's name, seize the Divine Mother from these fools! The ritual must proceed tonight!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You're sharper than those sky-gazers. Almost makes me hesitant to grant you the full power of the deep-sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Keeping you in this half-human, half-fish state seems more useful."
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_5 = {
    Text = "My lord! The High Priest promised me a complete form..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The young Seafarer's breathing comes to a halt: his fish-like eyes widen in tension, fixed on Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_7 = {
    Text = "High Priestess? Tsk..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Goliath ignores the boy's stare—or rather, the kid's petty zeal doesn't warrant his notice."
  },
  AvgDialog_34972_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You were in the engine room blast—we both witnessed that power. Without me, you'd be silver dust by now."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Under Ramona's cover, you climb the stairs. Elton helps with Murphy's weight—even so, reaching the four-story bridge takes effort."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Keeper, you can come in."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You nod. With Ramona's help, you lay Murphy down."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Her breathing steadies a bit. It no longer sounds as labored as before."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Looks like her body's adapted temporarily to the parasite's oxygen consumption. But if this lasts too long, I'm worried it'll cause permanent damage."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Yeah, we need to get her out fast."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Captain, how's the bridge?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Some gear's busted—the horn and radio switches are jammed. But core power controls and the steering wheel are fine."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Elton speaks as he deftly turns the central wheel, yanking pistons one by one."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You poke your head from the hatch, peering at the deck's far side—chimney-like vents puff thin white smoke. Soon, splashing sounds come from the stern."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_19 = {
    Text = "That's the rudder working, right? We're turning."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Huff, huff... finally here."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Elton nods, letting out a deep breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Sona-Nyl's a big girl—she turns slow and clumsy, but once set, we can go to full speed."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_22 = {
    Text = "How's Murphy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Not deteriorating for now, but the parasite's squeezing her heart, messing with blood flow..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_24 = {
    Text = "And that parasite's the Dissolution Cataclysm's source—being this close to the <Yellow:\"Cataclysm core\">, I'm worried the Dissolution will affect Murphy too..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Dissolution... yet again."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_26 = {
    Text = "That damn thing—how much more will it steal from my world...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Captain, you remember other things lost to Dissolution?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Elton shuts his eyes, pipe creaking as it's clenched, as he breathes deep a few times, calming his turmoil."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The silent Awakener glances at Elton, stepping slowly before him, extending her now semi-transparent hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Elton nods, fishing the keys from his pack, and teams up with Ramona to shove open the bridge door."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Celeste... did it affect you? Sorry, I'll keep my temper."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_31 = {
    Text = "He looks at you and Ramona, his tone softer."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Dissolution... I've got a long history with it."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_33 = {
    Text = "My past... I lost it to the rot."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Damn! These corals made it here too!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Captain, hold up—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Elton charges into the bridge, with Ramona chasing after."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The bridge is larger than expected, with a rare two-level layout—it's grander than any bridge you've seen in a photo."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You can imagine that the Sona-Nyl was a shining paradise on the sea before its conversion into a cargo ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_34973_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Huff... good thing the captain locked it. Aside from D-Hyperplasia, no mutants or Seafarers got in."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_1 = {Text = "Parasite"},
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_10 = {
    Text = "A blast like that could make your ears ring for days."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Yeah, at least my eardrums still feel intact."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Keeper, how are you—wait..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I... I couldn't grab the Keeper's hand... {Male=He,Female=She}... {Male=he,Female=she}..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Easy now. The Sona-Nyl's Domain also covers the nearby waters too—Celeste wouldn't have missed {Male=him,Female=her}."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Celeste blinks, as if confirming the captain's words."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_16 = {
    Text = "But our link cut out for a second..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_17 = {
    Text = "It came back fast, but that floating sensation where I couldn't even talk—it wasn't just me."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I did reach {Male=him,Female=her}, but..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Celeste stops midway, freezing like a cog out of place. Her lips twitch a few times, but nothing comes out."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The instant her fingertip brushes the Keeper's hand, a gentle, wordless white wind slams into the explosion's ground zero."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Elton pats her back soothingly, finishing for her."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_21 = {
    Text = "But we haven't tried moving anything bigger than a rat before."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Moving living things on the ship stems from Celeste's hold on the Domain. But with me weakening, her aim... might not be so accurate."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_23 = {
    Text = "{Male=He,Female=She} and Murphy could be tucked in any corner of this rig."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Thank goodness... Sorry, Captain, I got worked up—hope I didn't come off rude."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Anyway... the Sona-Nyl's a converted liner for cargo. The cabin count is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Seven decks, 648 rooms."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Going door-to-door would take ages..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Captain, can you and Celeste manage alone? I need to head out now to track down the Keeper and Murphy quickly. Their situation is getting more and more dangerous."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Elton meets her resolute eyes, then chuckles."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_3 = {
    Text = "It's such a soft force, yet it hauls Ramona into an endless white void with surprising power. As coordinates flip wildly, her guts feel like they're being twisted dry."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_30 = {
    Text = "No need to rush, missy. Celeste and I can try again."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_31 = {Text = "Try what?"},
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Celeste, scout their positions."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Celeste stares at the captain emotionlessly for a moment before nodding faintly. She lifts the compass—"
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_34 = {
    Text = "The Awakener shuts her eyes, white light swirling in her palms, distant seabird cries faintly echoing..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_35 = {Text = "Ngh...!"},
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Captain! Stop!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Elton's pained grunt snuffs out the light."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Celeste looks at the captain, then Ramona's anxious face, and finally stares blankly at her fingers."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Ramona props up the captain, fingers checking his pulse, her look turning serious."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Cough, cough..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Linking an Awakener, creating Domains, preserving drowned sailors' memories... every time you push Celeste to use her inhuman powers, it drains your life away."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Saving us from that engine room blast... that used up the last of your reserves, didn't it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Elton takes a few deep breaths, easing his heart's spasms."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_43 = {
    Text = "—Then, he holds a wooden mug up to Ramona.\nWho knows where he pulled that from."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Want a sip? Might ease the ringin'."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_45 = {
    Text = "...No thanks. Mythag's rules frown on us drinking."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_46 = {
    Text = "The captain looks unsurprised. He tilts back to down the strong liquor in one go, and tosses the mug aside."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Cough, cough, cough...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_48 = {
    Text = "This stuff's rough."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Linking an Awakener takes massive mental strength. Even Mythag's rigorously-trained investigators unlink and recuperate post-mission—so a regular person..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Celeste lowers the compass, gasping. With the captain's support, she sits down, hands folded in her lap, looking even frailer than before."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Captain, your condition..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Don't sweat it. When I chose to link with Celeste, I knew this day was coming."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Elton's smile now holds a touch of peace, like he's truly braced for the reaper."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Celeste closes her eyes too. Her form grows more transparent, but the link to the captain gleams brighter—solid enough to see plain."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_54 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_55 = {
    Text = "With the Awakener fading, the Sona-Nyl becomes storm-tossed driftwood, slammed by wave after wave to dizzying heights."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_56 = {
    Text = "The cabin's power buckles under the impact. One last spark arcs, plunging the room into darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Everything fades except the enemy's low snarls, cutting sharp."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Ramona readies her weapon, signaling the two behind to stay quiet. She edges to the door, braced, a faint clock tick rising from her Gnosis surge."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Time seems to stand still in a silent limbo. Her nerves are strung so tight, she can hardly track its passage—five seconds, twenty, a minute? Or has the flow of time been suspended?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_6 = {
    Text = "How're you feeling?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Get in front of me. I'll cover the rear. Don't let them touch you."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_61 = {
    Text = "As if I need you telling me that! It's pitch-black—Ramona's not here, and there's no sign of life. So much for your hunch..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_62 = {
    Text = "No... she's nearby. I'm sure of it."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Metal clatters suddenly. Before you can react, the door is yanked open and hands reach out, hauling you and Murphy in."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_64 = {
    Text = "The wires in the deck's framework hum faintly once more, the bulbs flickering rapidly before glowing dimly at last."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Ramona scrambles for her dropped rapier, a surprised grin spreading."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Thank goodness, you're okay..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_67 = {
    Text = "I thought... I'd have to enter the ocean to find you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Celeste shakes her head silently. In Ramona's foggy mind—still reeling from the blast and trauma—she can't tell if that's positive or not."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_8 = {
    Text = "As their gazes shift to her, Ramona opens her mouth to speak, but a low buzz fills her ears, her brain firing off warning signals."
  },
  AvgDialog_34974_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ugh... my ears are throbbing..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34975_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ramona, cover me! I'll grab Murphy—we'll break out the other way!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34975_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ramona stands with her back to you, fully focused on the endless Seafarer onslaught, but her unyielding stance is her answer."
  },
  AvgDialog_34975_Content_3 = {Text = "Watch out!"},
  AvgDialog_34975_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Spotting a Seafarer sneaking from the shadows toward Ramona, the captain wrenches the wheel hard one way."
  },
  AvgDialog_34975_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Inertia sends the ship lurching suddenly, like a panicked beast twisting. Cabin clutter slams to one side, chaos rippling through the battlefield."
  },
  AvgDialog_34975_Content_6 = {
    Text = "With Celeste's help, you manage to get Murphy onto your back. As if ready for the turn, she steadies you through the tilt."
  },
  AvgDialog_34975_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Ramona thrusts her sword through an attacker's chest, glancing back and nodding at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Thick fog clings to the sea's surface, but the deck gleams bright under the full moon. Even the most subtle expression is clearly visible under the moonlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Only a few steps forward, and a thud rings out behind them. Everyone turns to see Murphy on her knees, her upper body slumped forward, nearly flat on the deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_11 = {Text = "Murphy?!"},
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You rush over, lifting the collapsed Murphy off the deck. Her consciousness fades, her bangs matted with cold sweat, and plastered messily to her forehead."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_13 = {
    Text = "@1... hurts..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Ugh... @1... @1..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_15 = {
    Text = "She clutches your supporting hand, pain making her fingers dig deep—yet you barely notice the minor sting."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You hear the growing drumbeat—not the heart, but a parasite in the girl's chest, pulsing as it devours her life force."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The \"god\"... is draining her life."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Mir... @2..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The parasite on her heart is the Cataclysm's core—if this continues, she..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The moon..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You look up at the bridge's square window—pitch black, like a whale's maw swallowing light from afar."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Murphy, can you hear me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_22 = {Text = "Murphy?"},
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_23 = {
    Text = "In His... @2"
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Murphy's breathing loses rhythm. She is tangled in uneasy, dangerous dreams—there is no response to your calls."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_25 = {
    Text = "...Hang in there."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Let me carry her, kiddo."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You're weaker than me—I'll do it. Ramona, keep watch. I've done weight-training. I can handle Murphy."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Elton doesn't insist. With his help, you hoist Murphy's knees, letting her slump onto your back."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_29 = {
    Text = "You muster all your strength to steady her, and draw a deep breath, ready to climb the stairs—"
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_3 = {
    Text = "What's with the moon?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The comatose girl lies on your back, mumbled whispers slipping past your ear."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_31 = {
    Text = "God... @2... @4..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Aside from groans of pain, Murphy only mutters meaningless words. Amid this chaotic babble, enemies emerge from shadows."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_4 = {
    Text = "It's getting brighter, and..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Murphy swallows the rest, but you know what she means—"
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Her time's running short."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Let's hurry to the bridge. Captain, lead the way."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_8 = {
    Text = "We need to cross the deck to get to the bridge's top floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_34976_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ramona nods, shielding the captain as she steps forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_34977_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Eek! %player%, do something—they're snagging my boots!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34977_Content_2 = {
    Text = "That cabin—block 'em with the door!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Annihilation"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Orphanage..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_100 = {
    Text = "What're you yelling for!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_101 = {
    Text = "The hem of Celeste's skirt revealed a girl, nearly startling me off my feet."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_102 = {
    Text = "She looked... familiar. I swear I had seen her somewhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_103 = {
    Text = "You let this rude girl aboard, Celeste?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_104 = {
    Text = "I told you to stop yelling! Do you want those Seafarers to hear us?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_105 = {
    Text = "And who are you calling rude?! My name is Murphy, Murphy!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_106 = {
    Text = "I remembered her—from deep memory, at a ritual."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_107 = {
    Text = "After the \"Divine Mother\" was afflicted by Dissolution, Miryam chose a new \"vessel\" for the divine embryo, sinking her into a decades-long sleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_108 = {
    Text = "With the Stellar Alignment near, the priestess woke her up. This shipment was supplies for the \"Divine Descent Ritual.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_109 = {
    Text = "The baby I bottle-fed in storms would be denied growing up forever."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_11 = {
    Text = "N-No way. My family..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_110 = {
    Text = "I know you—you're not Seafarers, just delivery associates... Get me out of here, as far as possible—and these treasures are yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_111 = {
    Text = "Like magic, she pulls crude wood-carved statues from her bag. They make one dizzy at first glance, revered by the Seafarers but worthless to outsiders."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_112 = {
    Text = "Murphy... wants to come with us."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_113 = {
    Text = "She... Dissolution..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_114 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_115 = {
    Text = "She was my distant ancestor, a victim of barbaric customs in a bygone era—and the only proof that my \"homeland\" had ever existed."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_116 = {
    Text = "The experiences from her past life had sealed Celeste's \"self\" deep within her soul. I couldn't deny her first request to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_117 = {Text = "Besides..."},
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_118 = {
    Text = "Let's sail, Celeste."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_119 = {
    Text = "You... agreed to take me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Have you really lost it? We played on these streets when we were kids. I snuck over the orphanage wall with food for you, and got chased three blocks by the nun—that's all gone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_120 = {
    Text = "If Celeste wants it, I'll get you as far as I can."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_121 = {
    Text = "Wow... you dote on her that much?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_122 = {
    Text = "Cheeky brat. I could change my mind, and toss you into the ice sea anytime."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_123 = {
    Text = "Stingy... fine, I won't ask again."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_124 = {
    Text = "Besides... it was I who sent Murphy down this path."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_125 = {
    Text = "A path riddled with Dissolution, leading to ruin and oblivion."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_126 = {
    Text = "I must atone for this."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_13 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Sorry, buddy—must be a post-voyage haze, mixing dreams with reality. Haven't seen you in years—how about a drink at the old spot tonight?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Heh, ol' John's whipped up a new whiskey flavor—top-notch! Let's do this—no going home sober!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Yeah... no going home sober."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I didn't know any mine shaft, had never been to an orphanage, and ol' John was a stranger's name."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_18 = {
    Text = "All I knew was everything about that town was slipping away."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_19 = {
    Text = "My childhood, my parents, my siblings—dismissed as some absurd dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A.F. 21 Early Autumn Southern Leonia"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Even I was starting to believe it."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_21 = {
    Text = "But dreams are not that hard to forget."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_22 = {
    Text = "A.F. 22 Deep Winter Elworth, Seafarers' Sanctuary"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_23 = {
    Text = "This shipment is daily supplies and... the bodies of nineteen failed experiments, from... the church."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The sender's details are smudged by seawater—you still good to sign off?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Confirming... all correct..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_26 = {
    Text = "As I spoke, the hunched contact snatched the manifest from my hand. He didn't seem to care what I said, just mumbling \"confirm\" vaguely."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Polar winds whipped off the contact's hood, revealing an utterly grotesque head."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Eyes huge and bulging, lids that couldn't close, and gill-like flaps linking jaw to collarbone—it had a fish's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Swallowing revulsion and nausea, I tipped my hat anyway."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_3 = {
    Text = "How could you not know that town!?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_30 = {
    Text = "If that's all, the Sona-Nyl will leave tonight. Next delivery will come in about 114 days."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_31 = {
    Text = "@1... safe travels... to you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_32 = {
    Text = "...Hold on."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_33 = {
    Text = "As I was about to board, an unfamiliar woman's voice stopped me."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_34 = {
    Text = "It was an adult woman in a black veil, dressed too lightly—even barefoot. In Elworth's polar chill, she stood out starkly."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_35 = {
    Text = "High Priestess, High Priestess..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The contact dropped flat, body smacking cold black rock with a cringe-inducing thud."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_37 = {
    Text = "After ten years at sea—through grit, luck, and shady jobs—I owned my ship and was a captain now. But being a captain meant nothing in this secretive cult."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_38 = {
    Text = "I had never met the higher-ups, but from the Seafarer's reaction, I knew her status was lofty."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_39 = {
    Text = "So I knelt like him without hesitation."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_4 = {
    Text = "At the @2 River's mouth, backed by the @3 Mountains... that's where we grew up!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_40 = {
    Text = "High Priestess."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Stray spirits swirl around you. Boatman, do you carry relics of the dead?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Relics of the dead..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_43 = {
    Text = "At the priestess's hint, I popped open the pocket watch—the dial was covered by a swirling silver."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Yes, the Gnosis inside is faint... but it's a Silver Core, no doubt."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Each Silver Core holds a forgotten memory... do you wish to awaken this one?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_46 = {
    Text = "A forgotten memory..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_47 = {
    Text = "My past was denied by all. This silver fluid, fished from <Yellow:what was once my hometown>, might be my last clue."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_48 = {
    Text = "I do...! Please, High Priestess, guide me."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Complete the next voyage... then I'll share the method to awaken a Silver Core."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Did sirens steal your brain during your time at sea? That spot has been marshland since the Flood."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Bring my <Yellow:hope>. Bring it to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_51 = {
    Text = "The Seafarer High Priestess Miryam assigned me a new task. That voyage's cargo: a <Yellow:baby girl>."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Before, I'd only held my younger siblings in those \"dreams.\" Sadly, those happy, peaceful memories faded when I woke up."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_53 = {
    Text = "The westerly winds dragged out the trip—in the final week at sea, all fresh water went to this little one."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_54 = {
    Text = "She didn't mind my knotted beard, giggling in my arms."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_55 = {
    Text = "I handed her to the High Priestess."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_56 = {
    Text = "A.F. 31 Summer Solstice Atlas Ocean"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_57 = {
    Text = "All compasses have failed, waves have smashed the rudder!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_58 = {
    Text = "The bo-boilers flooded! We're dead in the water!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_59 = {
    Text = "What did you do?! I can't steer now—the currents pushing us into the thunderstorm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_6 = {Text = "Marshland?"},
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Now is not the time for blame!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_61 = {
    Text = "First mate, take the crew to lower the lifeboats. Pack 'em tight, and paddle clear before the vortex sucks us in."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_62 = {
    Text = "What about you, Captain?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_63 = {
    Text = "...Just get out fast."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Two years had passed, and I had done the priestess's secret methods countless times—none had made that Silver Core glow."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Endless failures and effort nearly made me quit chasing the truth... the truth of my hometown's vanishing."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_66 = {
    Text = "I sent most of the crew to lifeboats, then sank with Sona-Nyl, clinging to memories of my past."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_67 = {
    Text = "In the endless descent, wind brushed my face."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Wind squeezed the water out of my lungs, blew away wound-corroding salt, and lifted a sinking dream in the deep."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Then, I saw her—a girl, enveloped by gentle breezes and white birds."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Yeah! Word is there was a mine shaft, and a river shifted in the big flood, caving it in. Some lord bought the land a couple years back, he's planning to build a park or something."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_70 = {
    Text = "My name is Celeste. As long as you need me, I'll be here."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_71 = {
    Text = "She was a trace of my homeland's existence, a fairy tale from elders' lips in my youth. She proved my haunting past was real."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Her arrival proved that I was not a rootless lunatic."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Three Months Ago Elworth, Seafarers' Sanctuary"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_74 = {
    Text = "New Leonia branch supplies: 135 crates. Association sacrifices: 12 bodies. Horn Island groceries: 120 crates... all checks out."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Cough, cough..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_76 = {
    Text = "You're vital to the order—take care of yourself."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Oh, the order finished a new batch of <Blue:stabilizers> early—got your quarter's share here. I'll hand it—"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Shh—save it for our scheduled meetup, the usual spot: <Yellow:Brilpert, Third Wharf, North Berth 2>."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Celeste and I will wait for you there. We're planning to gather some special ingredients from the Inter sea. How about a dinner then?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_8 = {
    Text = "But... my home..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_80 = {
    Text = "It'd be... an honor."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_81 = {
    Text = "I heard that Lady Miryam has awakened the <Blue:Divine Mother> from her slumber, so Our Lord could return on the next Stellar Alignment."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_82 = {
    Text = "The next three months will likely be extremely busy. But I will definitely make our appointment."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Alright, it's settled then. I'll see you in three months."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_84 = {
    Text = "That boy, who once carried the blood of a Seafarer but now bears the body of a Golem, smiled shyly—To me, Caecus was just a kid."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_85 = {
    Text = "He was very much like the younger sibling who existed in my memories—a shy and sensitive boy."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Welde Sea's storming soon—you should leave quickly."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Yeah, no sailing into ice gales."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Saying goodbye to Caecus, I brushed past the last piece of \"cargo\" being unloaded and walked onto the ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_89 = {
    Text = "That thing was still breathing, white cloth rising faintly. Black slime dripped from it, something fading away."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You hit the sea right after leaving the orphanage—you haven't been back in over a decade, but you've forgotten that much? Are you sick or something?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_90 = {
    Text = [[
Control your curiosity, Elton!
Don't <Red:look>.
Don't <Red:think>.
<Big:Don't>... <RedBig:FACE IT>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Celeste, I'm back."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_92 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Time to sail—as planned."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_94 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_95 = {Text = "Celeste?"},
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Alright, setting sail... to the Aglo Republic."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_97 = {
    Text = "No, no—the destination is the <Blue:Inter Sea>, we're grabbing local ingredients. Why are you spacing out? Did something happen on board?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_98 = {
    Text = "...Yes, Inter Sea, setting sail."
  },
  AvgDialog_34978_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Celeste! Look at me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_1 = {
    Text = "All clear on my side. Captain, the Keeper and I will scout ahead—you can follow with Murphy and Celeste."
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_10 = {
    Text = "But you... don't you like it a lot? You used to come to tune the engine often—I saw it."
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Hey, hey! What are you doing—"
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Elton bends down and pinches Murphy's taut cheeks."
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_13 = {
    Text = "If you wanna make up for it, just stay alive."
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Elton doesn't give Murphy a chance to respond. He pushes her, gently, from behind, nudging her, stumbling, out of the eerie, abyssal cabin."
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Murphy stands at the next cargo hold's door, watching the captain across the meter-wide corridor."
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_16 = {
    Text = "He helps Celeste out of the D-Hyperplasia-filled room first, handing her to Murphy, then steps back into the dark to pull the door shut."
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_17 = {Text = "Captain..."},
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Still watching me? Those two are getting ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Do you really mean it? You and Celeste risked your lives for me—you really... don't want anything in return?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Alright, thanks."
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_20 = {
    Text = "C'mon, kiddo, I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Captain—Murphy— Where are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_22 = {Text = "Coming!"},
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Finally, he closes the door behind him, the fluorescence on his coat vanishing with it."
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Well, Murphy, just promise me you'll live a good life. Grow up, get a job, make some money. Then you can buy me the latest model of car. Deal?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Elton peeks from the cabin door, confirming the path's safe for now, then turns to the side and waves Murphy and Celeste over."
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_4 = {
    Text = "At the cargo hold's exit, Elton pauses. He turns back to the car wrecked by coral-like D-Hyperplasia, a hint of regret in his voice."
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_5 = {
    Text = "This is an experimental four-cylinder engine model... this beauty never even hit the road. A shame."
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_6 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Murphy bites her lip, glancing at the ruined car, then sneaks a few peeks at Elton."
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_8 = {
    Text = "What's with that look?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34979_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Are you scared? Relax, I'm not asking you to buy me a new one."
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Crisis Moon"
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_10 = {
    Text = "We believe you."
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_11 = {Text = "Kiddo..."},
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Mythag University's fought Dissolution for centuries, and countless investigators have given their lives."
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Plenty lost to it—the world forgets them bit by bit, and even their letters sprout D-Marks."
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You two aren't scared?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Scared... of course. Of course I am. Who isn't terrified of being wiped from existence?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_16 = {
    Text = "But someone has to face it, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_17 = {
    Text = "If we back down, our colleagues who fell during investigations, those erased by Dissolution..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_18 = {
    Text = "If we back down, their existence becomes meaningless."
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_19 = {
    Text = "For our future, and those already gone, we'll treat even the wildest theory as fact and investigate."
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Elton's confession leaves you and Ramona speechless. You stare at her mutely, reading the same shock in each other's eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_20 = {Text = "Heh..."},
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Looks like madmen still make up the majority."
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_22 = {Text = "Woo—"},
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
The horn blares, startling everyone.
Elton reacts first, lunging for the console to manually stop the whistle.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Damn! The whistle lines got wrecked by those corals!\nThat noise—soon those things will figure out someone's on the bridge."
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Ramona rushes outside the bridge, and you follow, both leaning over the rail to look down—"
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Wandering Seafarers on the lower deck crane their necks up, locking their dead fish eyes on yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Well? The Seafarers didn't spot us, did they?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_28 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Captain, focus on steering."
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A hometown erased by Dissolution, Celeste as the sole proof it ever existed..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_30 = {
    Text = "As for external distractions... the Keeper and I will handle it."
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The guilt from handing Murphy to the cult yourself... is that why you turned on the Seafarers?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Elton crouches by Murphy, brushing away the sweaty hair stuck to her forehead. After checking her condition, he sighs deeply, then stands to face you again."
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_6 = {
    Text = "If I hadn't given her to Miryam, she wouldn't have been possessed by that so-called \"God\". She wouldn't be lying here, dying."
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_7 = {
    Text = "It sounds like a joke, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Humans are great at recording history—even ancient games have records. How does a whole town vanish without a trace?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34980_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Forget my rambling—consider it a worthless bedtime story I made up."
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ramona, you're..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_10 = {
    Text = "It's gone... How?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_11 = {
    Text = "What's gone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
The gash on your calf is gone.
But I saw it clearly... the enemy's blade pinned you there.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_13 = {
    Text = "That's why you ordered me to take Celeste away. That's why I had to leave you behind..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You can't forget that bone-deep pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Like an executioner ignoring the condemned, Goliath yanked the weapon free, with no care for your agony."
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Blood soaked your uniform, flesh splattered on Goliath's hand. Your calf was nearly severed—only terror and adrenaline kept you conscious."
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Though the ache still tugs at your nerves... it's gone. That horrific wound—vanished."
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
The fabric is torn with two huge holes, but the skin beneath is smooth.

Pale from lack of light, but healthy and whole.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Your wound has healed? Must be Celeste's doing."
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Shh... keep it down. Seafarers are still out there."
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Murphy trots to Celeste, and gently grabs a white ribbon from her shoulder—it looks like a bandage now."
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You look up at Celeste, meeting her gaze. With her linker's body failing, she's deteriorating, seeming to lack even the strength to speak."
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Her lips move, letting out a faint whisper. You've never studied lip-reading, yet you clearly see—"
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_23 = {Text = "Not me."},
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_24 = {
    Text = [[
It wasn't her.
You're absolutely certain of it.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_25 = {
    Text = "That surge of energy was vast, like a cluster of stars. It couldn't have come from Celeste, who is already very weak."
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Ramona grips your hand tightly, scanning you head to toe. No chance to talk—she runs hands over your injuries..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You took quite a beating from Miryam and Goliath. I need to check for infections or deterioration..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Miryam's power had crushed and twisted your waist—but there's no pain from Ramona's touch."
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
She circles behind, sniffing the medication, and lifts the back of your hair.

After eyeing the mess a bit, she falls oddly silent for a moment.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_7 = {
    Text = "...Who slathered ointment all over your head? There's blood, but no wound."
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Cough... So there's no injury? I saw blood back there and thought..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34981_Content_9 = {
    Text = "She squats by you, peering closely at your calf."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You poke your head from the bridge door—Seafarers litter the deck. Some normal-looking, some parasite-bloated, some snake-like..."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Come look at this one."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Ramona brushes aside tangled seaweed and bits of coral, revealing the Seafarer buried beneath."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_12 = {
    Text = "It's dead too—eyes cloudy gray, slimy skin wrinkled and quickly dehydrated. Still, you recognize it clearly."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Its skin is white, standing out among the drab Seafarers—like a goose around sparrows, or a white steed among gray donkeys."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I remember it—no signs of parasitic infestation, and we didn't hold back... but what's special about it? Looks normal to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Think again—when did we clash with white-skinned Seafarers?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Hmm... when Goliath was chasing us?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Wait, Goliath?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Right—the white ones... are Goliath's guards."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Goliath... has no one seen him since the engine room fight?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Huff... that was tough.
If Tulu were here, handling these would've been easier.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_20 = {
    Text = "He was gone before the explosion."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_21 = {
    Text = "We've made a potentially fatal mistake: completely overlooking Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Just as Ramona finishes speaking, a massive impact shatters the door."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The fish-like Awakener boy retracts his halberd, looking down at the sprawled Seafarers. The shadow of a huge pipe hides half of him, obscuring his expression."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_24 = {Text = "Caecus!"},
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
Caecus notices the captain, then turns away, ignoring everyone inside.
He steps aside, bowing deep toward the deck, welcoming his new master.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_26 = {
    Text = "My lord, they are indeed on the bridge."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The giant walks in with heavy steps, gripping the doorframe overhead, blocking all moonlight outside."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
Time until Alignment:
60 minutes]]
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_3 = {
    Text = "No noise from the stairs below—we should have a break for now."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You nudge the lifeless Seafarer at your feet."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_5 = {
    Text = "In the fight, you targeted its sudden parasite bulge as a weak spot—its skin tore from your attack, spilling sticky gore."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Not sure if this Dissolution-tainted blood is toxic—looks mixed with plenty of D-Slime. Ramona, shall we toss these overboard?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Wait... Doll said we shouldn't, I think."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The <Italic:Mythag University Investigator Field Manual> states clearly: due to unclear mechanisms of propagation, avoid letting D-Slime enter natural ecologies whenever possible."
  },
  AvgDialog_34982_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Glad you remember Doll's lectures, but ecology's not the priority now."
  },
  AvgDialog_34983_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You kids still up for it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_34983_Content_2 = {
    Text = "It's just dazed Seafarers and some Dissolution Mutants."
  },
  AvgDialog_34983_Content_3 = {
    Text = "They move randomly—with no commanding leader. They seem drawn by the horn—we can manage them."
  },
  AvgDialog_34983_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Good—if you need help, try calling Celeste's name in your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_34983_Content_5 = {
    Text = "She's lost control of the ship now, but this vessel's been her turf for years. I bet her power left traces that'll aid you."
  },
  AvgDialog_34983_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Pushing to full speed—hold on, watch for seasickness!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Night of death & song"
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_10 = {
    Text = "What is this woman thinking? No one can guess. However—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The Cambrian Plague is incurable. If those infected are released, who knows what will happen."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Regardless of Wanda's intention, her actions indeed saved the surrounding fiefs..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Cambrian Castle
Banquet Hall]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You push open the heavy wooden door of the hall."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The dazzling lights resemble stars scattered across the earth, while the sweet aroma of wine and gourmet food floats in the hall."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The villagers of Cambrian put on their finest attire and happily danced to the rhythm of the music."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Even though the outside has long been submerged by Dissolution, the hall remains full of cheer."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Is this the legendary apple pudding? I've never tasted anything this delicious in my entire life..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Hahaha, I'm so thrilled! It's totally worth it, even if I die!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Guderian's Fiefdom
Hunting Grounds]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Dance, let's dance together!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You push through the bustling crowd and see Wanda sitting at the far end."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_23 = {
    Text = "She lazily leans against the undead servant, holding a glass of red wine and leisurely watching you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Good evening, Monk. I thought you wouldn't attend this banquet."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Sometimes I want to satisfy my curiosity."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Besides, there's D-slime everywhere outside. Where else can I go...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The corner of my clothes was gently tugged."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Are you... Susanna's younger brother!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_29 = {
    Text = "I have a name too. Everyone calls me Little Beckman."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_3 = {
    Text = "What? You say Wanda melted all the locks and is hosting a lavish ball in the castle with all the Cambrian villagers?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Good evening, Little Beckman. Where has your sister gone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_31 = {
    Text = "My sister and the others who weren't sick left together..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Little Beckman lowered his head in frustration. He sniffled and then looked up at you with his big, round eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Brother Cultivator, would you like to dance with me? Little Beckman has no partner, boo-hoo..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Kid, monks cannot dance."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Now I declare that you may dance. Forget those old clichés."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_36 = {
    Text = "In Cambrian, I—<Big:am the law itself!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_37 = {
    Text = "You gaze into Little Beckman's hopeful eyes and silently swallow your refusal."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I'm not a good dancer either, but I can spin around with you a little."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_39 = {
    Text = "You take Little Beckman's hand and walk to the center of the hall. There, the villagers are dancing gracefully to the melody of the music."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Absolutely true! I heard those who weren't infected have all left, and the final ball attendees are all those terminally ill individuals."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_40 = {
    Text = "The long skirt flutters gracefully to the music, like countless spinning colorful cupcakes."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_41 = {
    Text = "You drift through a golden sea of lights and music, eventually overwhelmed by the ever-surging bubbles of joy."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Little Beckman's dancing skills are clearly no better than yours. He moves awkwardly to the rhythm of the music, and soon his face turns red."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Hahaha, so happy! Today is Little Beckman's happiest day!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Brother Cultivator, take my hand and let's spin around together!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Faster, even faster!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_46 = {
    Text = "<Red:Faster...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_47 = {Text = "Quick@2..."},
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Little Beckman, your face?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_49 = {
    Text = "<Change>Dance with me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Hahaha! I went through so much trouble to plant a spy by her side, but it seems unnecessary now."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Black D-slime kept flowing from the boy's eyes as he smiled and reached out to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Your nose suddenly feels a chill. You look up, and black slime slowly drips from the chandelier."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_52 = {
    Text = "One drop, two drops..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_53 = {
    Text = "You look around in panic and notice that many people's clothes, arms, and even faces are already showing varying degrees of decay."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_54 = {
    Text = "But they still dance happily."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Cultivator Brother, why are you ignoring me... Don't you like little Beckman anymore..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_56 = {
    Text = "The boy reaches out with sticky hands to hug you, sorrow spilling from his hollow eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Stay with me... Stay with me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Such a dreadful plague... Not only did she refuse to leave, but she also locked everyone up to await death..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Is it true, as the rumors say, that she has gone completely mad?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Your words are quite intriguing. Was she ever a woman of sound mind?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35167_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Uh... This..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35529_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Captain, do you really trust that little fish guy's words? He's not just a lowly errand runner in the cult."
  },
  AvgDialog_35529_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Caecus... he simply craves recognition too much."
  },
  AvgDialog_35529_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I know you might have concerns about him, but I know that kid well enough. The fact that he comes to us on his own shows that he has already taken a stand in his heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_35529_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I'll enter the bridge first to check the situation. If everything is fine, I'll call you in."
  },
  AvgDialog_35529_Content_2 = {
    Text = "If I remember correctly, Miryam herself provides the spirit power keeping Caecus rational... You confirmed it yourself."
  },
  AvgDialog_35529_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Moreover, if we hadn't trusted the message he sent, we wouldn't have stayed at that port..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35529_Content_4 = {Text = "Message?"},
  AvgDialog_35529_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Murphy glances at Elton, and after receiving his silent nod of approval, she clears her throat and continues."
  },
  AvgDialog_35529_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Our initial plan was to stay in the Sona-Nyl Domain for a full six months to avoid the Alignment."
  },
  AvgDialog_35529_Content_7 = {
    Text = "After this, we would journey across the world, evading the Seafarer's pursuit while searching for a way to remove the parasite, but..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35529_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
But during a supply stop, I received a message from the intermediary.

The message said that Caecus was willing to give me the medicine for one last time.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35529_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Is the location set to Bridgeport? That's the fishing town where the Seafarers caught up with us on the ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_35530_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
Tulu, please protect Murphy and Celeste outside the bridge.

Ramona and I will follow the captain inside to check the situation.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35530_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Tulu doesn't object. Using his tentacles, he stops Murphy from following and pulls her and Celeste into the shadows by the door."
  },
  AvgDialog_35530_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Elton steps up to you and brushes your hand off the hatch."
  },
  AvgDialog_35530_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Let me take care of it."
  },
  AvgDialog_35530_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The bridge is indeed empty of Goliath, with only a few Seafarers wandering around in a daze."
  },
  AvgDialog_35530_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
No sign of an ambush.

The captain was right... Caecus wasn't lying.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35530_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Haha, I told you, Caecus isn't bad by nature... He just wasn't taught what's right."
  },
  AvgDialog_35530_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Time for you to deal with the remaining few. Don't let them mess with my wheel any longer."
  },
  AvgDialog_35531_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona take a detour and finally arrive at the door on the other side of the engine room."
  },
  AvgDialog_35531_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ramona whispers and points at the Seafarers affected by the \"Cataclysm,\" who have grown parasites from their bellies."
  },
  AvgDialog_35531_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Avoid them as much as possible. Checking the boilers is our top priority."
  },
  AvgDialog_35531_Content_2 = {
    Text = "This door was caught in the crossfire during your battle with Miryam. The door panel is completely deformed, hanging precariously on the frame. You manage to squeeze through without much effort."
  },
  AvgDialog_35531_Content_3 = {Text = "This—"},
  AvgDialog_35531_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Ramona quickly covers your mouth and pulls you behind some iron plate debris."
  },
  AvgDialog_35531_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Spear-wielders, swordsmen, hunchbacked figures, crawling on the ground..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35531_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Everywhere you look are Seafarers in various poses. They pace around the engine room ruins, piling up charred materials from the explosions."
  },
  AvgDialog_35531_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You search your mind for a while before finding a word to describe this behavior—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35531_Content_8 = {Text = "\"Nesting\"."},
  AvgDialog_35531_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Indeed... They exhibit typical nesting behavior. Perhaps influenced by the Cataclysm core, attempting to spawn those hyperplasias..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_1 = {Text = "Precipice"},
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_10 = {
    Text = "They have to be proficient. Look at the moon outside the window."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
The moon is too large and too bright.

Methods such as Lunar Distance and Star Selection are ineffective in this environment.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Guided by Ramona, you turn to look at the extraordinarily large full moon."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_13 = {
    Text = "It is abnormally large, covering the night sky and sea with a glimmer identical to that of the full moon."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You realize it's getting closer. So close that your spirit seems to feel its abnormal radiation, both chilling and scorching."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Huff... Huff..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_16 = {Text = "Align..."},
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Murphy's breathing grows louder, and as all eyes turn to her, each breath comes with a whistle-like sound, almost like air leaking."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Murphy? Are you alright? Let me help you sit down and take a rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I'm perfectly fine! Cough, cough..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Celeste, what's the wind direction?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Murphy raises her voice to answer you but accidentally chokes and begins coughing violently."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Everyone sees that she's barely holding on."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_22 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_23 = {
    Text = "But I'm feeling a bit \"uncomfortable.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_24 = {
    Text = "My legs are out of strength, and my head still aches a little."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_25 = {
    Text = "As you speak, you sit down against the wall of the bridge."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_26 = {
    Text = "With your \"fall,\" Murphy no longer pretends that everything is fine. She instantly loses her strength and moves along the wall to your side."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Then I'll... take a break... One moment..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_28 = {
    Text = "She leans against the wall and slides to the ground, no longer caring about whether her posture is ladylike or not."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_29 = {
    Text = "She wants to find a support point to keep herself from completely collapsing. After some fumbling, she leans on your shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Celeste reaches out the door, eyes closed, sensing your direction and feeling the sea breeze hitting her slender wrist."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Just a moment..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
In just a few seconds, rapid yet rhythmic breathing reaches your ears.

Murphy loses consciousness once again.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Horrifying bluish-black marks appear on Murphy's face, like plant roots deeply embedded under her skin, draining her fragile life."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_33 = {
    Text = "The God I commune with hails from myriad stars. Even a mere replica is beyond human resistance."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_34 = {
    Text = "The host's blood flow is being severed by the Fetus."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_35 = {
    Text = "What if we perform the surgery now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Keeper, we simply lack the necessary conditions to perform surgery on her right now."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Maximum speed has already been reached. With the power boiler damaged, we can't go any faster."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Unable to perform surgery, and no way to return to land in time... Is there truly no solution?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Tulu glances at the enormous moon outside the window and shakes his head."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_4 = {
    Text = "West Wind, 22 knots."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Are even you at a loss? Is there nothing you can do, you who delivered the prophecy of the gods' revival?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_41 = {
    Text = "How could you possibly know..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_42 = {
    Text = "From Miryam's attitude towards you and her fragmented words before falling into madness, the truth is not hard to deduce."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Only the betrayal of the deity could drive the devout to such a state of madness."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_44 = {Text = "...Yes."},
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Indeed, I did deliver such a prophecy to her, but the so-called \"oracle\" does not exist."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_46 = {Text = "What?"},
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Long before the flood arrived, I lost the ability to glimpse the future from His dream./nI don't know where He went; He might have awakened, or He might have left."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Then, your prophecy..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Miryam is a devout believer, dedicated to the Divine Realm and driven by my will."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Roger that, adjusting course."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_50 = {
    Text = "I only hoped my words would comfort her in her final moments, never expecting she would take them as gospel and seek to rebuild the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_51 = {
    Text = "All of it was..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_52 = {
    Text = "It is entirely my fault."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_53 = {
    Text = "The next second, it is as if the world has hit the pause button, all sounds fading away."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_54 = {
    Text = "If not for Murphy's faint breath on you, you might think that even time has come to a standstill."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Wait... I can't hear the sound of the propellers hitting the water anymore."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Elton comes to his senses, paces around the console, and tries every operation he can think of, but to no avail."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_57 = {
    Text = "The Sona-Nyl floats quietly in the waves, like a lonely giant embraced by the sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_58 = {
    Text = "The power supply is having issues. I'm going to the engine room to check it out."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_59 = {
    Text = [[
Let me handle it. I know a little about mechanical structures.

If it's just ignition and simple repairs, I can manage.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Elton stands at the wheel again. With no enemies to interfere, he steers the ship with a newfound sense of confidence."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_60 = {
    Text = "I'll go with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Tulu, I entrust the safety of everyone else to you while Ramona and I investigate."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Tulu nods and extends a tentacle to help you gently lay Murphy on the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Last time I maintained the hull, I replaced the spark plugs in several boilers. If the fire goes out, you can reignite it by adding enough coal and using the device."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Alright, let's head over now."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_65 = {
    Text = "You nod at Ramona and are just about to move when an icy hand gently grasps your ankle."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Murphy struggles to sit up, the black marks on her face fading as oxygen flows in and out."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_67 = {
    Text = "She is as weak as a withered flower now. Her voice is a spent whisper, yet still carries a core of defiance."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_68 = {
    Text = "You will return... right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Yes, we will return."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_7 = {
    Text = "He and Celeste work together to control the large freighter, which usually requires at least a team to operate."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_70 = {
    Text = "You crouch down beside her, gripping her hand tightly, attempting to transfer warmth to her."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Didn't we promise to take you back to the mainland?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Gusts occasionally send sprays of water into the air, but under their control, the Sona-Nyl remains as steady as a toy floating in a bathtub."
  },
  AvgDialog_35532_Content_9 = {
    Text = "They are so proficient. They know which direction to go without any instruments."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Old Friends, New Friends"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Am I still myself?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Who... am I?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_12 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_13 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Lost in an unknown place, you are not sure how much time passes."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You feel nothing but the gradually intensifying sound of the flute."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Stop it... Stop it! This is no time for music; I still have things to do!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The sound of the flute grows stronger, but as it surpasses the threshold of human tolerance, it suddenly stops, leaving only indistinguishable white noise echoing in the void."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_18 = {
    Text = "<Change>Eternal..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_19 = {
    Text = "A lingering sound echoes from the depths of the universe, akin to chaotic sleep-talking or the restless tossing that disturbs the stars."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Your consciousness detaches from your body, drifting and lingering in an illusory dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_20 = {
    Text = "A silver glow blooms in place, and your taut nerves begin to unravel."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Your consciousness space is as bright as daylight. Before you can react, you feel a sudden plunge—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_22 = {
    Text = "{Male=He,Female=She} is about to awaken."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Keeper, %player%! Can you hear my voice?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_24 = {
    Text = "...What happened?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_25 = {
    Text = "With Ramona's help, you sit up and look around, finding yourself in a cargo hold, surrounded by D-Hyperplasia and your companions."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_26 = {
    Text = "How are you feeling?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You look down at your hands, trying to hum the melody you just heard, but find that you can only exhale in bursts."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_28 = {
    Text = "I feel... okay."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_29 = {
    Text = "You've fainted three times now. Are you really okay? Don't lie to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Where... am I?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Frequent sudden fainting within a short period... That could mean intracranial or nervous system injuries."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Ramona speaks as she meticulously checks your head again, gently pressing almost every inch of your skull with her fingertips."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_32 = {
    Text = "No fractures are found, but if there is a hematoma or other infection... we must return to the school and let Doll examine you before making a diagnosis."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_33 = {
    Text = [[
The top priority is to return to land and hurry back to school.

This is crucial for both you and Murphy...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Murphy silently stares at you for a long time before she shakes her head, her expression blank."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_35 = {
    Text = [[
You're in this state already, so don't try to play the hero.

You should leave.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_36 = {
    Text = "You take the lifeboat. Whether you row or drift, with Tulu and Ramona there, getting back to shore won't be a problem. As long as... As long as..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_37 = {
    Text = "<Small:As long as I'm not there to cause you more trouble...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_38 = {
    Text = "I am not leaving before the parasite in your body is dealt with."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Murphy stomps her foot, points at you and Ramona, then at the captain and Celeste."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Surrounded by darkness, the small silver light around you is quickly devoured by the encroaching blackness."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
What about them?

What if this "God" hatches and is so big that it sinks the ship?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_41 = {
    Text = "We are not leaving, either."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_42 = {Text = "Huh?!"},
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_43 = {
    Text = "On the day we officially became Investigators, we swore upon our existence to fight against Dissolution at all costs."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_44 = {
    Text = "We are prepared to spend the rest of our lives accompanied by death and madness, even if our own demise awaits us ahead..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_45 = {
    Text = [[
Don't make me laugh! Stay and you're all gonna die!

This parasite in me is a monster, a god!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Then if this were the last hour of my life, I will not waste it on prayer."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_47 = {
    Text = "I believe you think the same, right? Otherwise, why would you go to such lengths to escape the cult?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_48 = {Text = "I..."},
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_49 = {
    Text = "This isn't just for you. Remember, we're also waiting to get off the ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You feel something slipping away from your spirit realm. You reach into the darkness and find it's a fragment of your memory."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_50 = {
    Text = "The parasite within you has now become the core of the Dissolution Cataclysm, meaning you are now also one of the responsibilities of the Mythag Investigators."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_51 = {
    Text = "I promised not to give up on you... I won't break my promise."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_52 = {
    Text = "...Crazy. All of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Murphy sniffs, swallowing the sob in her voice."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_54 = {
    Text = "So, what do we do now? Goliath's crew has taken the bridge. We can't sail the ship like this."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Celeste, how much longer until we dock?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_56 = {
    Text = [[
Empty load, northeast wind at 15 knots.

...Kadath Standard Time, 60 minutes.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_57 = {
    Text = "How much time do we have left..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_58 = {
    Text = "There's still time."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Celeste stares blankly at the captain, as if trying to confirm something."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_6 = {
    Text = "In your memory, Ramona brings you back to Mythag University. Doll greets you at the school plaza, showing concern for Ramona and harboring doubts about you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Her form has already become translucent, as if she's vanishing from reality. Captain Elton reaches out to pat her head, but in the end, he only touches the air above her."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Celeste, accelerate."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Captain! What are you doing!? You and Celeste are in such a poor state, you can't use your abilities to steer the ship anymore!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_63 = {
    Text = "The Awakener nods slightly and raises both hands. The compass in her hand moves on its own, emitting faint glows."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Elton, stop!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Caecus bursts through the cabin door. As soon as he steps inside, Ramona and Tulu both stand up to block his way."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Celeste lowers her hand in confusion, looking at Elton, awaiting the next command from her Linker."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_67 = {
    Text = "I'm not here to fight you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_68 = {
    Text = "I... have something I want to give you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_69 = {
    Text = "His gaze sweeps over everyone and comes to rest on Captain Elton."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_7 = {Text = "Then..."},
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Elton waves his hand at you, approaching Caecus while signaling Ramona and Tulu to lower their attack stances."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Don't come any closer...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Don't get too close. If I pick up too much of your scent, other Seafarers will notice me."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_73 = {
    Text = "He throws a glass vial onto the deck, allowing it to roll towards Elton's feet with the tilt of the ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Medicine to stabilize the spirit... Are you giving me this medicine of your own free will?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_75 = {
    Text = "If you're worried about the safety..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Elton doesn't give Caecus a chance to finish. He pulls out the cork and swallows a handful of pills without hesitation."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_77 = {
    Text = [[
Don't get me wrong, kid.

I'm just worried that you might face internal punishment from the Seafarers.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_78 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_79 = {
    Text = "They won't find out. The one in charge of these medicines already died during this operation."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Then your memories rapidly fade away, like flowing water."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Caecus closes his eyes, his expression calm. You can't tell if he mourns his fallen comrades."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Captain, if you still trust me... please take a detour back to the bridge."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_82 = {
    Text = "I'll go back now and try to divert Lord Goliath, but if I suggest evacuating everyone, it will seem too deliberate."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Lord Goliath will definitely leave people to guard the bridge. As for those Seafarers who stay behind, I am powerless."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Caecus finishes speaking and turns to leave."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Caecus, wait!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_86 = {
    Text = "This is not the right time for us to catch up, but..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_87 = {
    Text = "You said you wouldn't resent me for my betrayal. Is that true?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_88 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Absolutely."
  },
  AvgDialog_35533_Content_9 = {
    Text = "An eerie, distant flute sound pierces your mind like a hook, instantly sealing off all your senses."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The coal chute of this boiler is jammed. It looks like it has been broken for a long time."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ramona nods, crouches in the shadow cast by the boiler, and begins inspecting the machinery."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The captain is right; the spark plug is new."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_12 = {
    Text = "To the naked eye, the boiler's outer wall appears undamaged... It looks as good as new."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_13 = {
    Text = "This is a sheltered corner; the wind blowing in from the hull's breach shouldn't have affected the boiler... Where did it go wrong?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Maybe it ran out of fuel?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Ramona nods, walks around to the front of the boiler, and pulls open the door. She freezes in shock."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_16 = {
    Text = "What's the matter?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Before you can react, Ramona quickly pulls you towards the doors of the engine room, not caring whether her steps disturb any nesting Seafarers."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The furnace is wet! Someone deliberately doused the power boiler!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_19 = {Text = "A trap?!"},
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_2 = {
    Text = "It seems like everything here was affected by the explosion, and there's no way to ignite it."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You run into Caecus near the exit, whose slender frame casts an exceptionally large shadow on the ground. Several Seafarers standing behind him, intensifying the tension and danger in the cold air."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_21 = {Text = "Caecus..."},
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Don't look at me like that..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Caecus's eyes flicker, his lips quiver as if he wants to say something, but in the end, he turns his head aside, avoiding your and Ramona's scrutinizing gaze."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Did you plan this from the very beginning? Carefully designing every step to lead us into a trap./nWere all the things you told us merely a disguise?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_25 = {Text = "I..."},
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_26 = {
    Text = "You haven't experienced what I've been through, so you don't understand what the power of the Seafarers means..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You won't understand, and <Yellow:you shouldn't be here>... If I were you, I'd be trying every means to <Yellow:escape from Lady Miryam>."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Caecus's tone, intonation, and even grammar become strange, no longer resembling standard Leonian."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_29 = {
    Text = "If someone is forcing you to do something against your will..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona exchange information in hushed tones to not get caught."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_30 = {Text = "No! Stop!"},
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Caecus suddenly shouts, his face changing rapidly. A suffocating fear emanates from the depths of his eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_32 = {
    Text = "He stiffly reaches for his neck, revealing a dark ring identical to the mark you saw on Goliath earlier."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_33 = {
    Text = "The ancient punishment from Lemuria is slowly tightening, making his breathing hurried and labored."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Even though Awakeners don't need oxygen to breathe, the excruciating pain contorts his face with an indescribable expression of agony."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_35 = {Text = "Sorry..."},
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Sorry... I... have no choice but to..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_4 = {
    Text = "All dozens of boilers in the engine room have gone out. You and Ramona are forced to check them one by one."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You touch cold boiler after cold boiler. The surrounding Seafarers amplify your fear to the extreme."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_6 = {
    Text = "It feels as if your heart is pounding beneath your skull, leaving you to hear nothing but its rhythmic beating."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Then, the intense heartbeat suddenly comes to a halt."
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Ramona, I've found it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35534_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
The outer wall of the recently extinguished boiler is still scorching hot, and steam rises in thin wisps from your gloves as they touch it.

But you have no time to worry about that. Excitedly, you call out to your partner in a low voice.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35535_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Caecus kneels heavily on the ground, his weapon becoming a crutch that supports his defeated body. With his last ounce of strength, he grips the spear shaft as if holding onto the last ray of light."
  },
  AvgDialog_35535_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Caecus, you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35535_Content_3 = {
    Text = "He breathes heavily, seemingly muttering a few words./nTo make out his mumbled speech, you have to crouch down in front of him."
  },
  AvgDialog_35535_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Go... <Big:RUN!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35535_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Caecus suddenly pushes you, loses his balance, and falls hard onto the cold, hard ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_35535_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The next second, a familiar set of footsteps approaches you through the crowd of Seafarers."
  },
  AvgDialog_35535_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Caecus, you shouldn't have let me down."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Moth-Trapping fire"
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The sound of the wind... I remember a large opening was blown into the engine room."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The Sona-Nyl has been sailing north, and the temperature on the sea surface is very low. Without anyone adding coal to the furnace, the fire might be extinguished by the sea wind."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_12 = {Text = "Phew..."},
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_13 = {
    Text = "What's the matter?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Nothing. I just feel... a bit unreal."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
Getting ambushed at the port, meeting Murphy and the captain, confronting Miryam, then the explosion...

We left school just before dinner, yet it feels like we've been at sea for two months.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_16 = {
    Text = "What a busy night. If Professor Doll knew, she would coldly praise my rare diligence."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_17 = {
    Text = "\"Well done, Keeper. Tonight's experience will be a significant highlight on your final report.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You respond to Ramona with a deliberately casual tone. She emits a few indistinct nasal sounds, struggling hard not to burst into laughter."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_19 = {
    Text = "You're not going to rat me out to Doll, are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Time until Alignment:

<Red:20 minutes>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I would've done so when I contacted her earlier if I wanted to."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_21 = {
    Text = "\"Oh, Professor Doll! %player% selflessly put {Male=himself,Female=herself} in danger, suffering grave injuries and falling unconscious!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Shh! Please don't—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_23 = {
    Text = "But... Wait, you talked to her already? Is the communicator working now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Yes. When the Domain was still intact, the signal was initially cut off. Then after Celeste's power began to weaken, communication was still hindered due to the distance."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Ramona rummages through her pocket and pulls out a broken communicator. The panel engraved with the Mythag University emblem is removed, revealing burnt internal gears."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I tried adjusting the baseline frequency of the communicator to contact the school. Though brief, it was enough to explain things clearly."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Doll and her team will be responsible for preparing the \"Divine Fetus\" separation surgery, and William has already arrived at the port to help us once we get there."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_28 = {
    Text = "But during this time at sea... we'll have to rely on ourselves."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_29 = {
    Text = "We must protect Murphy, keep Goliath at bay, and help Captain Elton sail back to land... Luckily, Tulu is helping us, and Caecus seems willing to lend a hand as well..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
You and Ramona return to the exterior of the engine room.

The growth of D-Hyperplasia is worsening, visibly spreading along the way.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Otherwise, with just the two of us... we probably wouldn't have made it this far."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_31 = {
    Text = "We must prevent the birth of the \"Divine Fetus.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_32 = {
    Text = "If the ritual is allowed to proceed, who knows what kind of monster will hatch from Murphy's body."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_33 = {
    Text = "That's right... For Murphy and the world, the birth of the \"Divine Fetus\" will only bring disaster."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Besides, it has become the core of a Cataclysm. We can't afford to ignore it."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_35 = {
    Text = "This is something only we can accomplish."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_36 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_37 = {
    Text = "That's correct... This is something only we can accomplish."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Let's cheer up. There's still much to be done."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Ramona presses her ear against the door and listens for a moment. After confirming there is no sound inside, she nods at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_5 = {Text = "Crack—"},
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The door that once allowed you and Murphy to come and go freely is now stuck in the frame due to the rapidly growing coral. No matter how hard you and Ramona try, it won't budge."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_7 = {
    Text = "There's another door to the engine room. Let's go around."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Other than the wind, I didn't hear anything just now, but it's better to be safe than sorry."
  },
  AvgDialog_35536_Content_9 = {Text = "Good."},
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Lemuria's \"Glory\""
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The human helpers of the Divine Mother are not worth mentioning; the real threat is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_11 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:\"Our Lord\"> is on the tip of his tongue, but Caecus takes a deep breath and swallows it down."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_12 = {
    Text = "...The real threat is that counterfeit god Mythag summoned... He is the real enemy of us Seafarers."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Not bad. It seems those ridiculous formalities can no longer bind you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Once this is all over, I'll personally link with you and make you my Awakener."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
You're one last step away from the top.

Don't disappoint me, kid.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Y-Yes, sir. I'm honored..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_17 = {
    Text = "He obediently lowers his head while Goliath rampages through the engine room, which is already indistinguishable from ruins."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The giant blade drags across the desolate scars, splitting the ash and dust after the explosion like a newly carved river."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Didn't you say there was a special situation in the engine room that only I could resolve?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Tsk, bad luck."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Y-yes... I felt it, felt it... through the link..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Lady Miryam... Yes, I sensed Lady Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_22 = {Text = "AAAH!"},
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The giant delivers a heavy kick to the back of his knee, and the pain from the bone displacement forces Caecus to collapse onto his knees amidst the rubble."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Caecus is terrible at lying and stumbles over his words. His clumsy lies can't even convince himself, let alone Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Forget about that crazy woman! Haven't you realized it yet? She doesn't care about you fish people at all!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_26 = {
    Text = "She desires only that god—the despicable deity who abandoned her and the Lemurians in prehistoric times, vanishing without a trace!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_27 = {
    Text = "<Italic:I... I'm going to die...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Goliath grabs Caecus's hair and yanks it upward, forcing Caecus to look up and meet his gaze. Cold sweat rolls into his eyes, stinging his fragile mucous membranes."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_29 = {
    Text = "<Italic:I will die... I will die for betraying Lord Goliath...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_3 = {
    Text = "After ignoring His subjects for thousands of years, now that little dwarf wants to stir up trouble."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The very next moment, Caecus is slammed to the ground by Goliath, like a broken mast."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Scram, go round up those wandering fools."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
Caecus flees the engine room.
After Caecus becomes long out of sight, Goliath mounts his weapon by the burning power furnace.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_33 = {
    Text = "...Whew, as expected of the \"Divine King\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_34 = {
    Text = "A mere swipe of a tentacle leaves a gaping wound on the giant's lower back. Strange-colored blood quietly oozes out, seeping into the crevices of his dark skin."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_35 = {
    Text = "You really don't hold back... Heh."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Doesn't matter... With the Divine Fetus as my puppet, those fools remaining in Elworth will bow to me as their king."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_37 = {
    Text = "A once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. No one can take it away from me."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Goliath retrieves his weapon from the fire and presses the giant blade against the wound without hesitation."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Under the intense heat, muscles rapidly atrophy, accompanied by the smell of burning metal. The wound no longer oozes bluish-black fluid."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The young Seafarer follows the giant closely, step by step, in silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Lord Goliath, most of the Seafarers on the ship are here."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_41 = {
    Text = "After being away for a while, Caecus returns visibly tired, but Goliath doesn't care."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_42 = {
    Text = "These are the only ones left?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Yes... and due to the spread of <Yellow:Dissolution>, many are unable to fight now."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_44 = {
    Text = "These are enough."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Gurgle... Lord Goliath..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_46 = {
    Text = "High Priestess... Gurrr... return... @2..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Words slipping from the Seafarers' mouths make Goliath frown. They are unrecognizable, incomprehensible, their meaning rejecting him—rejecting those without divine blood flowing within."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_48 = {
    Text = [[
Enough...

Open your eyes and see the reality!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_49 = {
    Text = [[
The High Priestess is dead, but the Divine Mother still lives!

We still have a chance to continue the ritual. Retrieve the Divine Mother! Bring forth the Divine Fetus!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Kid, what do you think?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_50 = {
    Text = "This great blade will not fail its mission... I will become the sharpest sword of the new god!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Gur... Gurgle... @2 Return..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_52 = {
    Text = "He will return... He will return!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_54 = {
    Text = "The disjointed prayers eventually merge into a chant-like flow, greatly annoying Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_55 = {
    Text = "In the Seafarers' fervent prayers, amorphous energy streams drift through the hull breach, entwining around Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_56 = {
    Text = "The familiar pain and tightness make Goliath clutch his neck; veins bulge at his temples, and his eyes strain, wide and bloodshot."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_57 = {
    Text = "The shackles that bind him since he linked with the \"Apostle of the Sea\"... shackles he once thought he escaped after that explosion..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_58 = {
    Text = "They punish him once more for his blasphemy against \"God.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_6 = {Text = "I... Me?"},
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_60 = {
    Text = "By the time the giant reacts, the mist has condensed into thick, tangible sludge, transforming into an alien dagger pressed against the wound on his neck."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Philistine..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_62 = {Text = "You..."},
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_63 = {
    Text = "\"Philistine.\" There is only one person who knows Goliath by that term now."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Lady Miryam?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_65 = {Text = "Miryam..."},
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_66 = {
    Text = "After a brief moment of contemplation and silence, the Seafarers erupt in joyous cheers."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_67 = {
    Text = "High Priestess! <Big:High Priestess!> <BigShake:Her Holiness is back!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Haha... I'm so glad you're alright."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Goliath tries to push the dagger away but ends up cutting his finger on its suddenly sharpened tip."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Startled, Caecus widens his eyes. He is completely unprepared for the question."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_70 = {
    Text = "I know what you're thinking, Philistine."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_71 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Eliminate the traitors, clear the obstacles for our Lord's descent... Remove the impostor, and reclaim the Divine Mother."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Then, I may still grant you a death with dignity."
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_74 = {
    Text = [[
Time until Alignment:

<Red:30 minutes>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Is there some communication barrier between us? Or is there a third person with a brain here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35537_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Y-Yes... I'm very sorry, Lord Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_35538_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Is our communicator expensive?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35538_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The Silver in it can be traded for a property in central Londinium on the black market."
  },
  AvgDialog_35538_Content_3 = {
    Text = "But why are you suddenly asking about it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35538_Content_4 = {
    Text = "N-Nothing..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35820_Content_1 = {
    Text = "How is Caecus doing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35820_Content_2 = {
    Text = "No reaction, and it doesn't seem like he's going to attack us."
  },
  AvgDialog_35820_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Focus on the Seafarers first. Keep an eye on Caecus."
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The fake god collapses and disassembles amidst cries, gray-blue dust filling the sky and falling slowly."
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_10 = {
    Text = "In Bridgeport, where the Keeper and I boarded the ship. We're... back?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_11 = {
    Text = "We are back."
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Keeper, Tulu, Captain Elton, Celeste, Caecus... and Murphy."
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_13 = {
    Text = "And there's William Delapore."
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_14 = {
    Text = "S-Senior William..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_15 = {
    Text = "When you left the school, it was just a two-person team. Now, it seems the car I prepared can't accommodate everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_16 = {
    Text = "William's sharp gaze sweeps across the port. Finally, he lets out a deep sigh and smiles."
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Welcome back, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_18 = {
    Text = "William approaches. You try to say something, but your gaze uncontrollably blurs for a moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_19 = {
    Text = "All fatigue, confusion, and pain vanish into the void. The image of your companion running anxiously towards you becomes the last frame in your memory, followed by a wave of dark tranquility..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Be careful, don't inhale this dust."
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Before the words are finished, the deck beneath their feet begins to shake violently. The ship lets out a sharp creak, like the last cry for help from someone drowning."
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Oh no?! Is the ship... sinking?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The ship rocks chaotically, and holding onto the railing is futile. The world collapses around you, and the falling dust completely obscures your vision."
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You can no longer see the moon, can no longer see the sea, and it is difficult to make out your companions."
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Just before the counterfeit dust engulfs everything, the world becomes extraordinarily clear."
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The unceasing sound of the waves has quieted down, and under the clear night sky, the moonlight feels especially gentle and serene."
  },
  AvgDialog_35821_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Is this... the port?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Twisted Stars"
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The phantom serpent suddenly raises its head high, lifting Murphy into the moonlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Pairs of tiny, delicate black hands emerge from the girl's chest, writhing and weaving together, layer by layer, enveloping her body into a massive black cocoon."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_12 = {
    Text = "With a muffled growl, hands and black threads use the giant snake as a frame, entwining the cocoon tightly around its massive body."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The cocoon's shell turns transparent from swelling. Countless hands intertwine to form a throne, lifting up a pale heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Ph@1...@1nafh @3..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Miryam kneels at the bow, bowing to the extremely twisted entity."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The wind carries distant, unknown whispers, like a serpent hissing in the shadows, making your hair stand on end."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_17 = {
    Text = "How... How did Murphy fall under Miryam's control?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Ramona and Caecus support you on either side. The three of you stand in a straight line, looking up at the gigantic monster that blocks the moonlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_19 = {
    Text = "It's too late... Beyond redemption now."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You follow Miryam's swimming direction and hurriedly make your way to the main deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_20 = {
    Text = "This is what I wanted to warn you about... Lady Miryam ordered me to extinguish the last power boiler, intending to lure you into the trap we set and capture all of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Although the Divine Mother... although Lady Murphy didn't go with you, it gave Lord Goliath an opportunity to seize her."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Linking with Caecus feels like an adrenaline shot to the spirit, gradually piecing sanity back together through the pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The screeching flute sound and whispers in your mind cease. You blink, feeling clarity in the spirit realm for the first time since the explosion—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The formation of the giant cocoon brings heavy pollution to the surrounding Domain, making it hard to locate Murphy in the murky liquid inside. But undoubtedly, you see a spark of life."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_25 = {
    Text = "No, there's still time."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_26 = {
    Text = "She's still alive. We still have a chance. No matter what... Let's try to get closer to them first."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
But you're injured... No, I will go alone.

Caecus, could you keep an eye on %player% for a while?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Ramona rarely refuses you so firmly. She removes your hand from her arm and solemnly entrusts you to Caecus."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Yes... I'll do my utmost."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The moment the last step is complete, an unknown behemoth rams into the freighter, causing it to tilt and veer off course."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Wait, I never said you can go alone!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Caecus pins you down with one hand, effortlessly stopping your struggle."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_32 = {
    Text = "But Ramona has only taken a few steps when Caecus's ear fin twitches sensitively."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_33 = {
    Text = "The next moment, he drops his weapon, grabs you, and rolls away from where you had just been standing. A giant blade flies in from afar, shattering the deck and sending splinters flying everywhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_34 = {
    Text = "%player%! Caecus!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Caecus shakes his head, indicating he is fine. After checking that you have not sustained any new injuries, he picks up his weapon and stands guard in front of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_36 = {
    Text = "It is then that you notice his dorsal fin is grazed by the blade. The tissue, once as tough as a swordfish's fin, is now ruthlessly torn and hangs crookedly on his back."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_37 = {
    Text = "With a face contorted by pain, Caecus still straightens his proud back, facing the sneering giant in the distance."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Lord Goliath, please do not come any closer."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
He uses all his strength to push you towards Ramona.

With his thin body, he stands between you and Goliath.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_4 = {Text = "Watch out!"},
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Trust Caecus! Let him hold off Goliath while we sneak around through the cargo hold to approach that thing!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Caecus and Ramona support you from both sides, finally coming to a standstill together."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The next moment, accompanied by the roaring of the waves, a massive shadow looms over you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Look! There it is!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35822_Content_9 = {
    Text = "That's... That's Murphy!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35823_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Did you just use Spirit Tracing? But your body..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35823_Content_2 = {
    Text = "I'm fine... Ugh!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35823_Content_3 = {
    Text = "As the pain-relief effect from the adrenaline rush suddenly fades, your legs go limp. If Ramona hadn't supported you, you'd probably be lying on the ground right now."
  },
  AvgDialog_35823_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Don't try to use spiritual power again. Not until you've had a thorough check-up."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Path Astray"
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Lady Miryam... I... I did not..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_11 = {
    Text = "He tries to escape this torment, but the more he struggles, the stronger the ancient power becomes, mocking his helplessness and frailty."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_12 = {
    Text = "His peripheral vision finally falls on you and Ramona, a fleeting look of desperation flashing across his eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Enough! Miryam!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Ramona understands and draws her sword to block Miryam. The blade points at the woman's slender neck, with dark blood flowing down along the metal texture."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_15 = {
    Text = "But the pain on Caecus's face does not lessen in the slightest. He kneels on the ground in a sorry state, unable to lift his head."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_16 = {
    Text = "We will protect Murphy and stop the ritual. As long as we are here, your grand plan is destined to fail."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_17 = {
    Text = "You can torment this Awakener linked to your spirit all you want... We're not giving up."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_18 = {
    Text = "...Is that so?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Miryam looks up, revealing an enigmatic smile. Her eyes are tainted by madness, filled with an indescribable menace."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Miryam stands atop the ruins, jagged metal shards cutting her feet, dark blood flowing."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Those who walk with the false king, those who desecrate my Lord's power... Your feelings have never been a concern for this shallow existence."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Her tone rises, exuding a chilling madness that seems ready to devour everything."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Miryam abruptly pulls her hand back, and Caecus collapses like a discarded puppet."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_23 = {
    Text = "He kneels down, lying on the ground, throat muscles twitching, celebrating the survival of his body with violent coughing."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Get up and keep fighting, Caecus."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Surrounding her, the eager Seafarers surge forward and surround you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_26 = {
    Text = "This is your last chance. Stand up and clear these people... clear the enemies of the Divine Realm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Wherever she stands, a chilling trail of blood follows, emanating an icy dread."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_4 = {Text = "Miryam..."},
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Miryam glances at you, her demeanor lofty, showing no sign of defeat."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_6 = {
    Text = "If not for the constant pain signaling from her body, the scene of her losing sanity and transforming into madness would seem like your imagination."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Caecus, you shouldn't have let me down."
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
She completely ignores you and Ramona, advancing step by step towards Caecus.

As she draws closer, the black ring around Caecus's neck begins to flicker once more.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35824_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The black ring, like a dark vine, tightens its ominous grip with each beat of Caecus's heart, consuming his life force like shadows at dusk creeping over the streets."
  },
  AvgDialog_35825_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Tsk. I hope I wasn't so annoying when I was a baby."
  },
  AvgDialog_35825_Content_10 = {
    Text = "A pale pink barrier shatters with a crack, accompanied by the sound of light footsteps approaching. The sound pierces your muffled eardrums with unprecedented clarity."
  },
  AvgDialog_35825_Content_11 = {
    Text = "To punish the crybaby, how could we forget the great \"Mother\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35825_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Murphy! Your <Yellow:Awakener Transformation>... It succeeded!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35825_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Hmph... I'll deal with you later. Now, time to settle things with this monster!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35825_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You can fall asleep anywhere. You must have been an exceptionally well-behaved baby."
  },
  AvgDialog_35825_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Ramona replies jokingly. The hand wielding her sword trembles uncontrollably, clearly reaching her physical limit."
  },
  AvgDialog_35825_Content_4 = {
    Text = "But as the tentacle of the \"Divine Fetus\" swings down again, Ramona resolutely charges forward, deflecting the swinging tentacle."
  },
  AvgDialog_35825_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The immense force strikes her right hand, nearly knocking the weapon out of her grip. But she simply takes a deep breath and tightens her hold on the rapier once more."
  },
  AvgDialog_35825_Content_6 = {
    Text = "We must deal with It before reaching the shore."
  },
  AvgDialog_35825_Content_7 = {
    Text = "In the corner of your vision, an unusual cold is spreading. By the time you realize it's another tentacle, it has already slid behind you—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35825_Content_9 = {
    Text = "This thing has tormented me for so long... Are you planning to get rid of It alone? I absolutely won't allow it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Internalized Flame"
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Murphy, how are you feeling?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Murphy sits in the corner of the bridge. The tip of her ponytail casually rests on her shoulder. She looks pale and disheveled, a far cry from her once arrogant and spoiled self."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Murphy? Hello?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Her eyes are hollow and confused, gazing down at her chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Gently stroking her chest, her fingertips draw tiny circles over her heart. Beneath lies her fragile human heart, a ticking time bomb consuming her life."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Every heartbeat is filled with pain, tormenting her body. But what is truly terrifying is the horror and unease gnawing at her spirit."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Getting more active... It is constantly moving."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Murphy's thoughts gradually sink into the mist of her heart. She closes her eyes, attempting to have a silent conversation with the parasite consuming her."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_18 = {
    Text = "But before Murphy can wait for a response from the Fetus, her attention is drawn to the sound of something heavy hitting the ground outside the bridge door."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_19 = {
    Text = "After raising his tentacles high once more, a sharp pain pierces Tulu's soul. The sudden suffocation shatters his gathered strength, and the tentacles crash onto the deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Those two students have been away for so long..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_20 = {
    Text = "It's Lemuria's secret punishment..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Tulu? What's happening?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Don't come out!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_23 = {
    Text = "His guts feel like they are being torn apart by this force. Tulu pants heavily as he knocks down another Seafarer, then can no longer stand."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_24 = {
    Text = "It's the pain transmitted through our link... the Keeper is in trouble."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_25 = {
    Text = "More Seafarers surge onto the deck platform outside the cabin. The smell of seaweed and rotting plankton instantly envelops everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_26 = {Text = "Goliath..."},
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Oh... I'm not sure whether that woman understands people too well, or if all of you are just too naive."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_28 = {
    Text = "I just wanted to give it a try, but I didn't expect you to actually split up as that woman planned — even knowing the Seafarers are still hunting you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_29 = {
    Text = "That woman... Could Miryam really still be alive?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Elton turns the wheel a few times in vain; as expected, there is no control feedback."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Goliath spits blood, his tone disdainful and mocking—mocking himself."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_31 = {
    Text = "As a <Yellow:\"Golem\">, we don't die that easily, but..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
Goliath squats before Tulu. Even on one knee, he towers over Tulu's small frame.

He looks down, watching cold sweat drip into those light orange eyes.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_33 = {
    Text = "But even someone as supreme as you is ultimately just a fragile existence, held together by tenuous links of sanity."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
Whatever Miryam did to your Keeper... it seems to have affected you, too.

Well, that works in my favor.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Goliath turns away and moves past Tulu, heading towards the inner side of the bridge."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Elton steps forward to shield Murphy, but Goliath doesn't even bother to spare him a glance."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_37 = {
    Text = "What are you going to use to stop me? This semi-transparent girl?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Elton instinctively glances at Celeste, seeking encouragement from the usually silent Awakener."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_39 = {
    Text = "But he receives no usual response. Even after taking the medicine from Caecus, Celeste's presence remains precarious."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_4 = {
    Text = "I hope they didn't run into any trouble..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Elton hesitates."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_41 = {
    Text = "I'll go with you. Don't give them a hard time."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_42 = {Text = "Murphy?!"},
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Tulu seems shocked upon hearing this. He struggles to stand up again, but the excruciating pain from the spiritual link shatters his focus, scattering his rationality to the corners of his limbs."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_44 = {
    Text = "It's all right... No need to do all that for me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_45 = {
    Text = [[
Oh? Have you finally come to your senses, our Divine Maiden?

Don't try anything stupid, or you'll drag everyone down with you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_46 = {
    Text = "I know... what to do..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Murphy takes two steps forward, stands in the moonlight, and looks back at those she cares about and those who cared for her. Her figure seems lonely and blurred."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_48 = {
    Text = "No matter if it's a ritual or something else... this time, I know what to do."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The sea surges under the pale moonlight. The ship sways in the waves, and the deck creaks with the ship's motion."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Tulu, like an immovable statue of a deity, stands outside the door, blocking those Seafarers who seem never to tire."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I know what you're thinking. The link between me and %player% is still intact."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_8 = {
    Text = "As he speaks, his tentacles skillfully throw another enemy into the sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_35826_Content_9 = {
    Text = "May {Male=he,Female=she} be safe..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
Seafarers carry divine blood, the key to our master's passage through countless calamities...
The stars are aligning; our lord's rebirth is imminent... Cowards do not deserve to walk alongside us in the Divine Realm.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Caecus, head down, uses his weapon to prop himself up."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Yes... this is your last chance, your final opportunity to prove your loyalty to the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_13 = {
    Text = "He skillfully spins the spear and finally points it at Miryam... At his \"master.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Caecus dares not meet Miryam's gaze, but he stands between you and her, like a frail but reliable wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Sorry, Lady Miryam. I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_16 = {
    Text = "No need for that. You are not a Seafarer... I knew from the start."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Miryam chuckles, her unusually purple eyes turning to you and Ramona, seemingly losing interest in Caecus."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Caecus relaxes his held breath, and the next second, as his exhalation brushes against his skin, he feels his body sink."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
His legs can no longer support his upper body, and he collapses to the ground. His abdomen inflates like a balloon.

Spines suddenly grow from him, breaking through his clothes, revealing fish-like dorsal fins.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Raise your head, Caecus."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_20 = {
    Text = "<Change>Lady... Miryam..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_21 = {
    Text = "His eyeballs quickly turn into a decayed grey-white, crushed by deforming muscles. Tiny scales begin to appear on the skin, transforming the pained moans into an eerie dirge from the abyss."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Miryam severed her link with Caecus!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Shh... Stay calm. Don't panic."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Miryam bends down and touches Caecus's face. Her hands are soon covered with a sticky, slippery liquid, proof of Caecus's transformation."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_25 = {
    Text = "This is your trial... Only by truly embracing the power of deep sea can you receive Our Lord's call..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Unlike the wild, complete monstrous transformation before, Miryam now appears exceptionally calm and self-possessed, dangerous yet elegant."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_27 = {
    Text = "But the shadow behind her, whispering and deforming, and the D-Slime left on her lips each time they meet, fully expose the spreading darkness within her."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_28 = {
    Text = "This... is... His trial for me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_29 = {
    Text = "It's the \"Cataclysm\" effect! She actually allowed Dissolution to erode her spirit..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Continuing to fight the Seafarers is pointless. We can't keep holding them back. If he remains in a trance state, we'll have to leave him in Miryam's hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Blasphemous @2! This is my Lord's trial! He cleansed my Silver Core and granted me a second chance!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_31 = {
    Text = "This is His grace bestowed upon me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Wake up! Caecus!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_5 = {
    Text = "How could a kid like you be associating with the Seafarers?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You say you're already a Golem? Sorry, I didn't mean to bring it up..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I just think you're not as fragile as you imagine yourself to be./nYou choose to escape a painful environment. Doesn't that mean you have a stronger heart than most people?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
I'm your friend, Caecus.
No matter how you view yourself, I'll encourage you to take the right step.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35827_Content_9 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_1 = {Text = "This is..."},
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Elton chuckles and waves at the group who are almost out of the dock area."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Kids shouldn't meddle in adults' affairs. Whether I never find my lost homeland or Celeste gradually fades away, I'll accept it if that's our fate."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Go with them, kid. Don't miss us too much."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I'm not a kid!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Go ahead. Don't look back."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Go where you want and do what you like."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Something feels off. The captain seems almost too calm."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_17 = {
    Text = "To uncover the forgotten past, he traded a half of his life time for Celeste."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Will he let it go so easily?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_19 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Yes. We're on land."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_20 = {
    Text = "A four-wheeled car speeds through the countryside, races across the streets of Londinium, charges into the deserted wilds, and finally comes to a stop in a square."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_21 = {
    Text = "This is the place."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
It's been a long time. I thought you weren't coming back this time.
My brain tells me that you've brought back some serious trouble.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_23 = {Text = "Brain?"},
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You... Are you Professor Doll?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Do you already know me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Ramona and %player% mentioned you... and your ongoing time stasis experiment."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Oh? How did they introduce me to you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Murphy instinctively glances at %player%, who winks at her, clearly not wanting her to tell the truth."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_29 = {
    Text = "She closes her eyes, trying to recall the Keeper's stories about Mythag University. However, everything flows away like water, the images slipping through her fingers as soon as they take shape."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Of course I know!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Murphy becomes exceptionally obedient around Doll..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_31 = {
    Text = "She probably never attended school, which might explain her deep reverence for knowledge."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Hey! I heard that!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Let's skip the formalities."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
The time stasis project is still in the research stage and has not been verified through animal testing.

Once you enter that room, there will be no turning back.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_35 = {
    Text = "So, have you made your choice?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_36 = {Text = "Choice...?"},
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Do I no longer have to be pushed around by others' decisions?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Can I... make a choice?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_39 = {
    Text = "No... no, this isn't right... I shouldn't be here... I was prepared..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Don't get too excited. If your blood pressure rises, the parasite's activity will increase.
I suppose you wouldn't want to be gutted halfway through, would you?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Is this another nightmare that defies my will, correct?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Has \"It\" been born?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Is it all over? But I clearly... made up my <Yellow:resolve.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Murphy's memories and consciousness wander in the illusion, while the world beneath her crumbles and dissolves. Panicked, she reaches out for %player%, but only grasps a handful of dust."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_44 = {
    Text = "%player%...? Where are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_45 = {
    Text = "She plunges into a chaotic darkness. Her hearing spikes, but she can only hear her own deafening heartbeat. Stars tumble through the deep space, scraping the dimensional barrier and leaving a wake of sorrow."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Didn't you promise... that you wouldn't abandon me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_47 = {
    Text = "You almost \"lost control\" just now, didn't you? Did something happen to those two?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Tulu clutches his chest, revealing a rare expression of lingering shock."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_49 = {
    Text = "......No matter. Goliath has taken Murphy. The Keeper now fights a battle beyond their strength—they shall require This One's intervention."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
Keeper, stop teasing her.
Don't worry. Miss Celeste has bought us some time, and we will return to Londinium safely.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Go ahead. Celeste and I will be fine."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_51 = {
    Text = "...Is something wrong? Is everyone alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Looks like Miryam has completely given up on you, Caecus."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Caecus struggles to stand up again and again, Goliath's taunts no longer able to shake his resolve."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_54 = {
    Text = "You are not truly loyal to Lady Miryam either... right, Lord Goliath?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Sorry, but I won't let you through."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Why... why? Why did you make the decision for me again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_57 = {
    Text = "The cocoon's outer wall is too thick, and the internal fluid is murky. We can't see Murphy's state inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Caecus can't hold Goliath off for long. Let me try Spirit Tracing again."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_59 = {
    Text = "No! Your spirit realm can't take this again! Once it collapses, no amount of body repair will save you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Thank you, Ramona... Talking to you really makes me feel at ease."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_60 = {
    Text = "But Murphy, she—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_61 = {
    Text = "All of you... You're the same. A bunch of self-centered people."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_62 = {
    Text = [[
No one has ever asked for my opinion... Hmph.
Surviving at the cost of your sacrifices... Did I ever say I wanted that?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Luckily... <Yellow:That thing> is still here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_64 = {
    Text = "The freighter rocks in the giant waves, each surge lifting the ship off the sea's surface. You climb out of the cabin, look up at the black cocoon above, and shake your head at Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_65 = {
    Text = "—Then, ignoring her resistance, you grasp the trembling Silver Key and sink once more into the spirit realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_66 = {
    Text = "In the dark, empty space covered by D-Slime, a tiny spark symbolizing life and intelligence shines even more brilliantly."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_67 = {
    Text = "—A sacrificial blade shines, reflecting the cold, eerie moonlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_68 = {Text = "—AAGH!!"},
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Hmph, a certain someone really needs to learn from you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_70 = {
    Text = "A burst of light suddenly erupts, forcefully throwing you out of the spirit realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_71 = {
    Text = "The dazzling light stings your eyes, causing uncontrollable tears."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_73 = {
    Text = "The murky liquid drains away, and your eyes finally refocus on the girl."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_74 = {
    Text = "The blade sinks deep into her chest, and the moonlit girl opens her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_75 = {
    Text = "The full moon, a symbol of death, looms close, yet there isn't a trace of fear on her youthful face."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_76 = {
    Text = "I did it... I truly did it."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_77 = {
    Text = "I... pierced it... It won't be born..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Then... They can..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_79 = {
    Text = "The hand gripping the knife falls weakly, as crimson, viscous, and dark liquid flows from the blade, dripping through her fingers into the sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Murphy turns back to look at the dock where Elton and Celeste remain by the boat, watching her from afar."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Blood rapidly drains from her body; Murphy's skin turns deathly pale, yet she exudes an unusual vitality."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_82 = {
    Text = "No... No, <Big:NONONO> <BigShake:AHHHHH—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Oh Lord, forgive me, forgive this child, forgive Your devout believer..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_84 = {
    Text = "The Stellar Alignment, it's near... It's near..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_86 = {
    Text = "The \"placenta\" shatters, and the \"heart\" also collapses—countless hands burst forth from the body, crushing the chest cavity."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_87 = {
    Text = "A deformed hand grips the unrecognizable remains, overlapping and swelling, overlapping and swelling—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Ah... You heard me... You responded to me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Celeste, Captain? Aren't you coming along?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_90 = {
    Text = "They push a deformed entity into the moonlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_35828_Content_91 = {
    Text = "<Big:My Almighty Lord...!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35829_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You and Ramona, exhausted and battered, finally manage to struggle close to the \"Newborn.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_35829_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Don't apologize to me. It's not your fault... it's no one's fault."
  },
  AvgDialog_35829_Content_11 = {
    Text = "On the contrary, we are the final barrier that can prevent this thing from entering human society."
  },
  AvgDialog_35829_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, with the severe air pollution in Londinium, he'll never find his way into the city."
  },
  AvgDialog_35829_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Cracking a joke to ease the tension, you exchange one last look with Ramona and take a resolute step—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35829_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
Time until Alignment:
0 minutes]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35829_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The \"Newborn\" in the translucent black cocoon has a twisted form, resembling a giant and fragile primate embryo."
  },
  AvgDialog_35829_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The head is large and round, with clumsy limbs twitching as if searching for a direction to grow."
  },
  AvgDialog_35829_Content_4 = {
    Text = "It exudes an indescribable evil aura, causing you and Ramona to exchange a glance—this entity might be able to command the Aequor, but it is by no means the genesis of Tulu's power."
  },
  AvgDialog_35829_Content_5 = {
    Text = "This thing... Do we really stand a chance?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35829_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I don't know."
  },
  AvgDialog_35829_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You grab Ramona's hand, your muscles stiff and tired, forcing a strained smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_35829_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Sorry... I don't know if we can return to Mythag this time."
  },
  AvgDialog_35829_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ramona firmly grips you without hesitation."
  },
  AvgDialog_35830_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Still no response from Caecus?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35830_Content_10 = {
    Text = "My ship is docked at the pier. Why not come aboard and warm up?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35830_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Caecus froze in place, and after a long while, he finally spoke in a stiff manner."
  },
  AvgDialog_35830_Content_12 = {
    Text = "No need to flatter me if you want to maintain relations with the order."
  },
  AvgDialog_35830_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Flatter you? Nah. I'm not the type to stand by and watch someone freeze to death in the snow."
  },
  AvgDialog_35830_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Elton seized the moment of Caecus's distraction, stepped forward two paces, and firmly grabbed his cold, thin arm."
  },
  AvgDialog_35830_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Make a friend, will you? I'm Elton. Do you have a name, kid?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35830_Content_16 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35830_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Caecus. Just call me Caecus."
  },
  AvgDialog_35830_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Looks like he's spacing out..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35830_Content_3 = {
    Text = "At this crucial moment?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35830_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Here's this quarter's medication. Take it every seven days if you don't want to go crazy and become a zombie."
  },
  AvgDialog_35830_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Caecus placed the medicine on the ground and gently pushed it, letting the bottle roll toward the man standing ten feet away."
  },
  AvgDialog_35830_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The winter night wind howled. He tightened his large black robe and hurried into the darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_35830_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Wait... it's about to snow. This natural harbor isn't the Seafarers' usual stop. Where will you go to take shelter from the snow?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35830_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The tail end of Elton's words was swallowed by an especially fierce and bone-chilling gust of wind. The hood of Caecus's black robe was suddenly blown back, revealing a pair of fish-like ear fins trembling in the cold wind."
  },
  AvgDialog_35830_Content_9 = {
    Text = "His heart tightened, and he awkwardly pulled up his hood, leaving in a more hurried and clumsy manner."
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Filthy@2... Ugh!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Suddenly, everything falls silent. The Seafarers who have been clamoring to drive him out stare dumbfounded at the woman on the platform, awaiting their master's next orders."
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Lift your head."
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_12 = {
    Text = "He finally mustered the courage to look up, gazing at her with reverence as if she were his fated goddess."
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Lady Miryam... I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_14 = {
    Text = "No doubt, you are a descendant of the Ornn family... You bear some resemblance to your ancestors."
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_15 = {
    Text = "But... you are too weak."
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_16 = {
    Text = "His heart sank. Just looking at Miryam drained all his courage, making it impossible to refute her conclusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Since I've already awakened you, out of respect for the Ornn family, I can maintain your existence as a Golem... From now on, it's your responsibility to oversee the Seafarers and their human collaborators."
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_18 = {
    Text = "As a \"halfblood,\" you should understand best how to communicate with humans."
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The Seafarers brandish their weapons; the cold steel reflects a silvery glow under the moonlight, causing Caecus to squint involuntarily."
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Through blurred vision, he sees Miryam's feet. His memory flashes back to a time when he lay prostrate beneath a cold altar."
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Outsider... Gurgle..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Finally... he finally reaches this place."
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Get... @1... GET OUT!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_7 = {
    Text = "His obsession with his origins and the Seafarers leads him here."
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Halfblood... Filthy! <Big:FILTHY!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35831_Content_9 = {Text = "Quiet."},
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Enough... The Philistine has finished his task."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You endure the pain and, with rationality, guide your spirit tendrils into Caecus's mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The house in his spirit realm crumbles. If you stop moving, mocking and scornful voices pour out from every corner, gnawing at the intruder's will like parasites."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You follow the moans of distress and find Caecus curled up in a corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_13 = {
    Text = "His spirit is squeezed and marginalized, confined to a room resembling a ship's cabin. If it weren't for the rhythmic sounds like SOS signals, you might almost overlook his presence."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_14 = {Text = "Caecus..."},
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You reach out to him, and the moment your consciousness connects, a strong sense of suffocation surges up your throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The hypoxia reaction once again brings back the dizziness and pain you thought had passed, causing a momentary grimace on the faces of all connected to your spirit."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Ramona is the first to bear the brunt, immediately breaking out in a cold sweat and collapsing to her knees."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You reach out to help her, but feel dizzy and stagger two steps before collapsing to the ground—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Be careful."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Miryam retreats to the edge of the hull's crack, gripping the sharp steel. Her expression is concealed in the shadow cast by her crown, and you can only see her lips move slightly, as if she is saying something."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Huff... huff... For a moment, I felt death was just around the corner..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Keeper, what has happened to your body?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You catch your breath and shake your head, steadying yourself with Caecus's help."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_23 = {
    Text = "No time to explain, we, we must—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_24 = {
    Text = "We must get to the deck! It's a trap set by Lady Miryam and Lord Goliath!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
Ramona doesn't ask further, nor does she immediately follow you and Caecus.

She scrapes the damp coal residue from the boiler and quickly adds some dry coal.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The spark plug rotates, rapidly evaporating the remaining moisture, and the smell of burning once again fills the engine room."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Let's get out of here first. Caecus, you lead the way."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_3 = {
    Text = "—And then, she lets go, falling into the sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The sea surface illuminated by moonlight is suddenly disturbed, creating a trail of foam that splits the waves and extends all the way to the other side of the ship."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Go check on Caecus!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Caecus can no longer speak; each attempt only produces more and more mucus, as if his extra organs have already been assimilated."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_7 = {
    Text = "He has nearly lost his human form. Luckily, he remains lucid, merely curling up in pain instead of descending into the madness like Helot."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You crouch in front of Caecus and grasp his hand without hesitation."
  },
  AvgDialog_35832_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Link with Caecus."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Grand slam covenant"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_10 = {Text = "Bang!"},
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The vase swiftly flew past George's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I'm going crazy from boredom at the wax museum every day. Don't I even have the freedom to sing?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Someone keeps singing, and George keeps cursing, hehe."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Lord Rogers, rein in your beloved pet; it has turned into a genuine demon!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Hmm... Botticelli... Spring..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Where should I find the model this time...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_17 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Since there's nothing else to do anyway, why not play some cards?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Pandia skillfully pulled out a deck of cards from the drawer and slapped it on the table."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Artificial Domain: Rogers Wax Museum"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Bridge again? George doesn't like playing bridge. \nBesides, without the vampire servant, we're still one short—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Pandia pointed to the corner. By the neglected cabinet, \"24\" was cleaning the exhibits inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Count her in, and we're all set."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Hmm... Are all the rules clear now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Understood."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_25 = {
    Text = "This guy is even wearing glasses. Is he a poor man from the East District pretending to be knowledgeable? How embarrassing!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Are you really sure? This is quite complex—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_27 = {
    Text = "52 cards, 13 per player. Win each round at @21 tricks. The contract is set at 6 tricks as the base. Only tricks above @16 count as winning tricks."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Uh... not bad."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_29 = {
    Text = "I suddenly see your potential. How about we team up?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Ah! The prince on a white horse descending from the heavens~"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Lord Rogers, if I win, will you grant me a request?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Hehe, someone is about to be reminded of their limits!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Tell me, what is your request?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Don't you still need a model for your wax sculpture collection? I can be your model."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Wow~ Miss 24, are you volunteering to rush to your death?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_35 = {
    Text = "\"24\" silently lowered her head, her knuckles gripping the broom turning faintly white."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_36 = {
    Text = "<Gray:\"Spring\" is a work Rogers plans to exhibit at the fair. Being selected as a model will increase its exposure and allow more people to see it.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_37 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Jenkin...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Sure. Miss 24, your bone structure is smooth and elegant, making you perfect for this role."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_39 = {
    Text = "I'm so, so glad you willingly joined my great art."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_4 = {
    Text = "He stepped through this door and took my heart away—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_40 = {
    Text = "In Two Hours"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_41 = {Text = "Tsk..."},
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_42 = {Text = "Ah..."},
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Wow, a grand slam! 24, teaming up with you is such good fortune, la la la~"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_44 = {
    Text = "You two, pay up!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Rogers grinned and tossed out a few silver coins."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Who would have thought that we have a hidden expert here? Truly impressive."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_47 = {
    Text = "How is this possible... This guy didn't even grasp the rules just now!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_48 = {
    Text = "George has been secretly observing 24 for a month, confirming she is a genuine fool. How could she be so smart..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Grace, George. Grace. Deadbeats never grow tall~"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_5 = {Text = "I,"},
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_50 = {
    Text = "George's face turned bright red with anger."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Cheating, she must be cheating!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Just some simple math problems. Based on the current table information, the calculated probabilities of the distribution of 4 spades are 0.023, 0.183, and 0.412..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_53 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Wow, can't understand at all."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_55 = {
    Text = "...0.314, 0.069. Therefore, I will prioritize @1 and @2 when clearing the round, and perform the calculation based on your card sequence..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Listening to \"24\"'s meticulous recap, George lowered his head and began counting on his chubby fingers."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_57 = {
    Text = "No way. Why can't I figure this out...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Objections! All of it is just excuses! Do you think spouting things we don't understand will let you escape punishment?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_59 = {
    Text = "George lunged at \"24\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_6 = {Text = "Of,"},
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Let me see if you're hiding something—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_61 = {Text = "Boom—!!"},
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_62 = {
    Text = "The roof of the wax museum mysteriously opened up with a huge hole, and something heavy slammed into George, crushing him into a pulp."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_63 = {Text = "Awoo!!"},
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Before he could utter a complete sentence, George fell silent forever."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Ahem... What's this sticky substance on my butt...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Huh, wasn't I supposed to go back? How did I end up at the wax museum?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_67 = {
    Text = "{Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%, are you alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Miss Mason, you're here too?! Am I still in the Domain..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Ahhh! It... it fell from the sky..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_7 = {
    Text = "<Big:Heart!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Joe, George?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Rogers stared in shock at the mangled George beneath you, his eyes filled with endless anger and sorrow."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Pandia... Grab them!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Tsk tsk, someone has spent too much time with vampire slaves and learned to sing."
  },
  AvgDialog_35984_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Awful, just awful!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_1 = {Text = "Hmm—!!"},
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_10 = {
    Text = "No, my wax sculptures..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Before you can react, your wrist is tightly gripped."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Hurry and follow me to leave."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_13 = {
    Text = "In the silent night, three people ran hand in hand through one intersection after another."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Whew... Miss, uh, Glasses-24, how much longer do we have to keep running...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_15 = {
    Text = "This will do. Rogers wouldn't want to come to such an unsightly burial ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_16 = {
    Text = "This time, it's all thanks to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_17 = {
    Text = "That little guy has his eyes glued on me, and their spies are everywhere in the wax museum. All 23 of my escape plans have failed."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_18 = {
    Text = "It was just an accident... We don't even understand how we ended up here."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Huh, aren't you surprised? Coming face to face with another version of yourself."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Not bad. Looks like the <Red:little guys> underground should wake up and get to work..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_20 = {
    Text = "\"24\" and Mason look at you in unison, as if you had asked a very strange question."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_21 = {
    Text = "I don't understand what you mean... There are many 24s in the world, and we will always encounter them."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_22 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Could it be the strange rules of this Domain...?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Forget it, never mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_24 = {
    Text = "I need to go home now; Jenkin must be worried about me."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Wait, Miss 24!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_26 = {
    Text = "\"24\" strides forward; she has more important things to do. However—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Knock, knock."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_28 = {
    Text = "It feels as if my internal organs are being tugged by invisible strings, rapidly detaching from their original positions."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_29 = {Text = "Hmm—!!"},
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The little guy below..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Something nearby... Who's there?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_31 = {
    Text = "\"24\"clutched their chest and bent over in pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The next second, the soil beneath her knees quickly turned white, and the entire world became a vast expanse of whiteness."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Upon opening my eyes again, the sky and the snow-covered land merged into a mysterious illusion, with only the endless mountains standing ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_34 = {
    Text = "All is bathed in pale blue polar sunlight, cold and sharp, devoid of joy or sorrow."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_35 = {
    Text = "She knelt at the foot of the snow mountain."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_4 = {
    Text = "They're probably referring to the wax sculptures we saw in the basement of the wax museum."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_5 = {
    Text = "If it's them, then it's bound to be a grueling battle..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_6 = {Text = "Plop"},
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_7 = {
    Text = "In a neglected corner, someone used a candle to ignite George's remains."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_8 = {
    Text = "In no time, the wax museum was engulfed in raging flames."
  },
  AvgDialog_35985_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Oh no, it's on fire!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_1 = {Text = "\"origin\""},
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Huh? Miss Winkle said my Domain is terrifying, filled with fierce monsters..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
It's all just her imagination.
But I did see something special, like "you."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_12 = {Text = "Me...?"},
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You chuckled softly and winked at her."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_14 = {
    Text = "This is a secret between \"her\" and me. I'll tell you more about it in the future."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_15 = {Text = "Sis—!!"},
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Jenkin suddenly jumps out from the nearby flowers."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I've returned from wandering with Aigis. Guess what we found?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
Jenkin waved a red ribbon in his hand.
Unlike the ones Mason usually uses, this one had a yellowed bell attached to its end.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_19 = {
    Text = "A gentle breeze passes, and the bell chimes crisply, like a joyful sprite."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Mythag University, Campus 
 Three days later]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_20 = {
    Text = "This is something seen in the Domain..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Huh, you've seen her in the Domain too? Then you must have met the sister who turned into a cat!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Don't... don't say it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_23 = {
    Text = "How can you say that? This ribbon is an extremely, absolutely, and incredibly important memento!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_24 = {
    Text = "During that time, I took care of you and played with you every day. It was so much fun!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Jenkin gently placed the ribbon into Mason's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I remember someone once said that they wanted to be a cat in their next life."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_27 = {
    Text = "If only we could remain carefree like this, I could continue to take care of you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_28 = {
    Text = "All the fish snacks and catnip, leave it to me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Mason smiled down, his fingers brushing the cool, soft ribbon."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I see. Shortly after killing Albino, you were taken away by the Sculptors' Association."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Being a cat? That's something for the next life."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Right now, I just want to live well as \"Mason\", along with everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Huh... It seems that this Domain has changed Sister greatly. She wasn't like this before."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_33 = {
    Text = "I testify that Miss Mason is telling the truth."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You and Mason exchanged a smile, thoughts returning to the moment just before the Domain collapsed..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_35 = {
    Text = "I see... I understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_36 = {
    Text = "You are the origin of everything, and also the end of everything..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_37 = {
    Text = "As the last glimmer of starlight vanishes, the world seems to be swallowed by black ink."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_38 = {
    Text = "You hear bells from afar, like roars of chaos from the depths of the mantle."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Is the Domain... collapsing?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_4 = {
    Text = "This is the story of what happened later."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Grab my hand, {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_41 = {
    Text = "You tightly hold Mason's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_42 = {
    Text = "At that moment, your blood seemed to flow into her body effortlessly, and your consciousness merged as one."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_43 = {
    Text = "You feel yourself slowly drifting off to sleep, countless dreams coming one after another, carrying you into the depths of darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_44 = {
    Text = "When you open your eyes again, you find yourself standing alone in a cave. Beneath your feet flows a shimmering golden river, akin to the veins of the earth."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Is this the starlight I saw before... Have they all gathered here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_46 = {
    Text = "<Red:Return, return...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_47 = {
    Text = "You follow the flow of starlight deeper into the cave."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Is this...?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_49 = {
    Text = "This place seems to be the ultimate source of all twisted, deformed, and filthy things."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Hmm. I remember it all now. It wasn't a pleasant memory..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_50 = {
    Text = "The light gray mass trembled and expanded, fissioning out writhing deformed monsters, like a stomach in constant struggle."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_51 = {
    Text = "However, before they reached the shore, they fell back into the pool and were devoured by the gaping mouths on the mass."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_52 = {
    Text = "These monsters' silhouettes seem somewhat familiar... Could it be..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_53 = {
    Text = "You suddenly have a strong intuition. You wade through the gray slime and approach the lump."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Mason... is that you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_55 = {
    Text = "The mass paused for a moment, then began to gently writhe again."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_56 = {
    Text = "It makes a rustling sound, like a friendly greeting."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_57 = {
    Text = "You gaze at the monsters kneeling by the pool. They struggle to move, twitching in the slime, yearning to return to the embrace of the mass"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Like those pilgrims seeking miracles in the wind and snow"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_59 = {
    Text = "<Red:The root of all impurity, filth, and misfortune...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You gently hold Mason's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_60 = {
    Text = "<Red:Return...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Because it is where all rivers end, no matter how far apart they may be, they will eventually converge here."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_63 = {
    Text = "I see... So you are the destination they long to return to. Is this what you do every day?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_64 = {
    Text = "With a frail body, pulling those scattered personalities back together and striving to maintain the appearance that \"normal people\" should have."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Like a weary mother awaiting the return of her wandering child, she has even forgotten her own identity as a mother after enduring prolonged periods of division and fusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_66 = {
    Text = "...No wonder I dreamt of those past events."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_67 = {
    Text = "The last time I saw these stars, I suddenly felt that I was very much like them."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_68 = {
    Text = "...there are differences too. They know where their home is, but I've even lost my memories"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Your nose suddenly feels a bit sour. You gently touch the flesh, feeling its tranquil pulse."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_7 = {
    Text = "It's all in the past, Miss Mason. I assure you, it will never happen again."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Mason... Will I also find my home someday? Just like you are doing now..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_71 = {
    Text = "The flesh writhes, splitting at the end to form a soft, slimy tentacle that gently wipes away the tears from the corner of your eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_72 = {
    Text = "<Change>It definitely will...</Change>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_73 = {
    Text = "<Change>Don't shed tears..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_74 = {Text = "Rumble..."},
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_75 = {
    Text = "A faint tremor rises from the depths, splitting the rock walls with cracks."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Time until Domain collapse: <Red:0> minutes"
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_77 = {
    Text = "You turn around and leave the cave."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_78 = {
    Text = "As you reach the cave entrance, you can't help but look back at her one last time."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Farewell, Miss Mason."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Thank you... {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Joy, sorrow, pain... Different personalities and emotions come and go, but she remains in that cave."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_81 = {
    Text = "—She's alive."
  },
  AvgDialog_35987_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[

I should be the one thanking you.
When the Domain collapsed, you gave me a lot of encouragement and comfort.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Sleepless serpent"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_10 = {
    Text = "She trembled, raising her hands high, gazing at the pitch-black dome, muttering indistinct murmurs."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The root of all impurity, uncleanness, and misfortune..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Return... <Big:Return!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Ugh... My head hurts..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The murmurs spread outward in ripples. Mason clutches his head in agony and kneels behind \"24\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Stop talking... <Big:Stop talking>!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_16 = {
    Text = "She lunged forward and hugged \"24\", who was covered in blood, from behind."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Please, stop talking..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Mason struggled to grasp \"24\"'s raised hands, their blood and tears mingling together. Yet, it was all in vain."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_19 = {
    Text = "<Red:Return, return...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The barefoot woman crawls forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_20 = {
    Text = "<Red:Share this filthy and unclean feast!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Miss 24, don't—!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Twisted, deformed arms sprout from \"24\"'s body. Bathed in blood and moonlight, then—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Gently yet firmly twisted \"24\"'s neck."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_24 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_25 = {
    Text = "There was no expected bloodshed. \"24\"'s body turned into tiny golden starlights, like fireflies dancing in the dark night."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Huh... What is this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Starlight gently surrounds Mason, some entering her body, others dancing on her fingertips, and then drifting away lightly."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_28 = {
    Text = "...I've seen these starlights."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_29 = {
    Text = "In dreams, in reality... they have come to take \"us\" away."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Her long hair trails on the ground, tangled with dead grass, snow, and clotted blood, having lost its former luster."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_30 = {
    Text = "You reach out to touch the starlight. A warm sensation flows through your fingertips, as if a hidden connection exists between you and the stars."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_31 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Strange, I suddenly feel a bit sad...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_32 = {Text = "Boom—!!"},
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_33 = {
    Text = "After the last starlight disappeared, you felt a familiar, angry tremor coming from deep underground."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Damn, is the Domain collapsing again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Grab my hand, Miss Mason!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_36 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Artificial Domain Investigation Log II>\n\n■ Domain ID: M-C06\n■ Crash Date: Year 315, December 17th\n■ Crash Site: Southwark St @2"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_37 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:■Investigation Results>\n\nHunting other \"24\" shadows / Unclear suicidal tendencies / Religion @2?\nWhat is the connection between them?\n\n...More clues are needed."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Meanwhile, outside the Artificial Domain..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_39 = {
    Text = "At the Domain entrance, researchers in white coats are busy coming and going."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Near her, buried in the snow and hanging from the trees, were the desiccated corpses of \"24\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_40 = {
    Text = "It's been a day, and %player% still hasn't woken up. Would you like to apply for a forced Domain interruption?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_41 = {
    Text = "%hisorher% vital signs are stable, seemingly unaffected by any drastic changes."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Observe for a longer period."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_43 = {
    Text = "What about Miss 24 if we delay any longer? The Committee has long wanted to use this case as an opportunity to intervene in Awakener management..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Winkle desperately clutched his head."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_45 = {
    Text = "<Shake:It's all my fault for being too eager to research her Domain. Now our Keeper has become Sleeping Beauty. What should we do...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, we already have a plan for this. William is on his way to conduct an investigation in the East District."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_47 = {
    Text = "As for %player%... give {Male=him,Female=her} a bit more time."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_48 = {
    Text = [[
Bernard Clinic
East Londinium]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Per Chapter 3, Article 2, Clause 13 of the Mystia Treaty, Awakeners violating secular laws must first be subject to investigation by the Committee."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_5 = {
    Text = "No one ever explained what they came to such heights to seek."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Chapter 3, Article 3, Section 2: If the suspect's behavior suggests evasion or escape, the Review Committee has the authority to immediately detain them"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Chapter 4, Article 1: Any organization or individual that harbors Awakeners..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_52 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Mr. William, are you listening to me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_54 = {
    Text = "<Small:... listening.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_55 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Don't waste your effort. The bodies and evidence were cleared out long ago. You won't find anything here."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Is that so? May I ask what this is?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_58 = {
    Text = "William carefully picked up a cluster of translucent dried material with tweezers."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_59 = {
    Text = "It looks like some kind of snake shed. But what does it have to do with this case?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_6 = {
    Text = "She only knows that @2 is waiting for her, at the place where ice and light fade away."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_60 = {
    Text = "It's already December. How could there be a snake shedding its skin?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_61 = {Text = "Splash!"},
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_62 = {
    Text = "A sudden clatter of equipment came from the inner room of the clinic."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_63 = {
    Text = "What sound?! This place was sealed off ages ago..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_64 = {Text = "Come out."},
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_65 = {
    Text = "The sound of unhurried footsteps drew near, and an unusually pale man walked out from the inner room."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Good evening, Officer."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_67 = {
    Text = "I am a colleague of Dr. Bernard, sent by the higher-ups to retrieve his research materials..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_68 = {
    Text = "The man's eyes were half-open, seemingly a bit drowsy. He handed over a business card with a smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Royal Medical Association Registered Physician, Pierce @2..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_7 = {
    Text = "<Red:Unclean. Impure. Ominous.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Sorry, we've already investigated Dr. Bernard's social circle. If I remember correctly, this Pierce is a man in his 50s."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Alright, who exactly are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Hehe... Truly impressive, Committee. Your photographic memory is truly admirable."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_73 = {
    Text = "He suddenly opened his eyes, the cobalt-yellow vertical pupils gleaming coldly in the darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Alright, I'll play with you for a while."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_75 = {Text = "Hiss..."},
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_76 = {
    Text = "An icy, slippery sensation touches my face."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_77 = {
    Text = "The ceiling is now crawling with pale little snakes, silently writhing and falling like raindrops."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Snakes... They're everywhere!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Ceiling, floor, walls... Snakes crawled everywhere, like countless pale waterweeds drifting in a silent black river."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The root of all impurity, uncleanness, and misfortune..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Calling squads A-2 and B-1, danger detected inside. Get into position now."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_81 = {
    Text = "William quickly pulled out the Silver Key, but the man before him had already vanished without a trace."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_82 = {
    Text = "I know you're still here. Come out."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_83 = {
    Text = "The thick air around quivered slightly for a moment, then relaxed pleasantly."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_84 = {
    Text = "A faint \"hiss\" whispers by your ear, like a cold breeze gently brushing against your cheek."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Just a small token of my appreciation. Please take good care of them, Investigator."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Good night."
  },
  AvgDialog_35988_Content_9 = {
    Text = "\"24\" suddenly knelt on the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Awaiting comedy"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I saw it too! You two holding hands, your hair flowing, looking as beautiful as dolls!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Shh! Keep quiet and don't disturb everyone watching the show!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_12 = {
    Text = "On a makeshift stage, a clown with heavy face paint is performing for the audience."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Long ago, in the snow mountains of the Endless North, at the end of an ancient river, a gray monster slumbers~~~"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Hello everyone, I am that monster. <BigShake:Roar—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_15 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Waaah—> Huh, isn't that Jenkin?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_16 = {
    Text = "No one knows the monster's origin or name, except for its voracious appetite—every winter, the residents at the foot of the snow mountain fill baskets with delicious food and fine wine..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Light a silver candle and place the basket in the river closest to your home, so the monster can receive the offerings."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
I-I have a question!
Aren't monsters supposed to live in the snow mountain? How can they receive offerings from the river?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Because the end of all rivers lies at the foot of the snow mountain, no matter how far apart they are, they will eventually converge here."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Artificial Domain: Lily Poorhouse, East District"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Oh... what's next?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Chomp chomp chomp, I've received everyone's offerings! I'm very happy and have decided to reward you all!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_22 = {
    Text = "After Jenkin finished speaking, he lowered his head, and his hair started shaking violently like an engine."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Stop shaking, all the fleas are falling out... Huh, is it snowing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Wow, it's really snowing!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Silver paper snowflakes flutter down. Aigis hides behind you, quietly scattering the small paper pieces."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<Small:Shh... Sir, please pretend you didn't see Aigis...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Before long, candles of various colors quietly lit up, gently enveloping the children's faces in a warm orange glow."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Every year, when the first snow falls, silver candles and baskets filled with gifts drift down the river."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_29 = {Text = "Squeak—"},
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Cough, cough, my back...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Here comes the basket full of gifts!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Sarah walked out with a smile, pushing the small food cart."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Wow!! Plum pudding, salmon salad, and...roast suckling pig!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Wait a moment. What should we say before the meal?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_34 = {
    Text = "The children exchanged glances and answered in unison—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_35 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Happy Silver Frost Festival—!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_36 = {
    Text = "I had no idea there was such a legend behind the Silver Frost Festival. This is the first time I've heard of it."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_37 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Miss Mason's Domain is like a dream. I can move freely between scenes without anyone questioning my presence.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_38 = {
    Text = "<Gray:All scenes and characters can be freely combined. Such a sight has probably never appeared in reality...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_39 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Perhaps this is Miss Mason's deepest wish?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Really sorry, {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%! I seem to have gained some weight recently..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Miss Mason, aren't you going to join them?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_41 = {
    Text = "You pointed to a spot not far away. The children were still gathered around the clown, listening to her tell those elaborate and fantastical stories."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_42 = {
    Text = "I'm a boring person; my jokes just make people sleepy."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_43 = {Text = "Waaah..."},
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Sister Mason, Jenkin... she bullied me...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Hmph, can't win so you tattle? How embarrassing! Who told you to say I had fleas just now!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Shh—Mike is a brave little knight, and little knights must not cry."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Mason gently wiped away little Mike's tears and snot, softly comforting the sobbing boy."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Sister Mason, Bobby Bear's eyes are gone..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Aigis walked over, clutching the doll."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_5 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Just a few? Miss Mason, could you please get off me first...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Let me see... Oh no, it seems to be really lost. How about I sew a new one for you tonight, little sister?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_51 = {Text = "Hmm~!"},
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_52 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Hmph, always causing trouble for my sister!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_54 = {
    Text = "But Miss Mason was also very happy, which I rarely see her like this."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Sarah sits beside you, resting her chin in her hands, smiling as she watches Mason surrounded by children."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Being needed is also a kind of happiness."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_57 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Gradually, more and more children gathered around Mason, leaving the clown neglected."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Is there anyone who still wants to hear a story? A long, long time ago..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Huh, have I entered a new Domain?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_60 = {
    Text = "A long time ago..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_61 = {
    Text = "It's late at night, and the children have all returned to their rooms. The orphanage has once again fallen into its usual tranquility."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_62 = {
    Text = "The show ends, the crowd disperses—\nHey!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Leaving behind only the lone clown to clean up the mess, accompanied by its solitary reflection."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_64 = {
    Text = "The clown muttered while shaking his head and glanced at the shadow in the corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_65 = {
    Text = "It's truly saddening, don't you think?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_66 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Ah, I've heard of you long ago: the infamous \"Killer 24\", who comes and goes without a trace, delighting in the hunt for personhood."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_68 = {
    Text = "The personality you have targeted won't last more than three days—<BigShake:Whoa!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Terrifying! But why isn't the clown in front of you afraid or dodging?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Are you angels?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Hmph, acting all mysterious."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_71 = {
    Text = "The jester burst into laughter, a glint flashing in his eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Because the killer is unaware, those inferior and unstable personalities cannot survive even a single day."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_73 = {
    Text = "They are born from countless random moments and should vanish forever after fulfilling their destined mission."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_74 = {
    Text = "What is the mission of \"Clown 24\"? Of course, it's to bring joy to Jenkin and everyone during the Frostsilver Festival."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_75 = {
    Text = "The clown breaks into a wide smile, the face paint transforming into specks of golden stardust."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_76 = {
    Text = "I've already gone above and beyond my mission, it's time to head back~"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Where to return to?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Of course, let's return to where we <Yellow:first began>."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Let me tell you a secret: Every personality is like a drifting weed, and our shared wish is to become whole again."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The girl blinked her big eyes at you, pointing to the large hole you had smashed through the ceiling."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Laugh together, cry together, and feel the love and trust from Jenkin..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Heh, how dare you mention Jenkin. Do you know what my mission is?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_82 = {
    Text = "<Red:Kill all those who seek to gain without effort. Leave none alive.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_84 = {
    Text = "In the pitch-black night sky, a flock of crows suddenly took flight, flapping their wings and flying away from the treetops."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_85 = {
    Text = "It is a tranquil winter night."
  },
  AvgDialog_35989_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Aigis saw it all. You flew down from the sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Golden fugue"
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You have been separated for too long."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_11 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_12 = {
    Text = "It seems like this is the first time I've dreamed about the past."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You clutch your head, feeling as if an invisible thread is pulling your consciousness away from the bed."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You then opened the window and saw the first snowfall of the New Year."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Wow, it's snowing!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The excited shouts of children echoed through the silent night sky. Accompanied by chaotic footsteps, the orphans gathered downstairs."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_17 = {
    Text = "So much snow, shimmering and beautiful."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Aigis wants to build a snowman, just like little Bobby."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_19 = {
    Text = "This is easy, I'll handle it—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You had an incredibly long dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Ta-da! Take a look at my masterpiece!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Hmm... it doesn't quite look like Little Bear Bobby. It, it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_22 = {
    Text = "It looks like a dog! A pug!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_23 = {
    Text = "<Big:Hahahaha!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Nonsense! How could I possibly look like a dog?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_25 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Children laugh and play in the alleys. Mason, already awake, stands beside you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_27 = {
    Text = "She reached out her hand and caught a few gentle snowflakes in her palm."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_28 = {
    Text = "The snowflake quietly lay in her palm, quickly melting into cold water, shimmering with golden starlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Huh, it's the light we saw last time..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Countless starlights fly out from the windows of the corridor next door, merging into a golden river in the night sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_31 = {
    Text = "They flow gracefully, extending all the way to the distant moonlit mountains."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_32 = {
    Text = "It's the scent of that clown lady. She has left us."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_33 = {
    Text = "But I don't feel sad... It seems like she left of her own will, as if returning home."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Going home..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_35 = {
    Text = "I heard it too... their wish to return home."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_36 = {
    Text = "These wishes are so intense that they made me dream of past events."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I no longer dare to hope for returning home; I'd be content just to recover some past memories."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_38 = {
    Text = "You let out a light sigh and rub your head somewhat sheepishly."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Let's not talk about those depressing things. Tell me about yourself, Miss Mason."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_4 = {
    Text = "In the dream, the sky was like a torn cemetery, with black substances pouring in like ink."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_40 = {
    Text = "I heard you started making a living in Londinium at a young age. Do you still miss home?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Mason looked at Jenkins and Little Mike wrestling downstairs, and smiled gently."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_42 = {
    Text = "My memory is terrible. When I was a child, the nuns at the church school said I wasn't suited for studying."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_43 = {
    Text = [[
Parents, hometown... I can't really remember, nor do I want to.
Memories are meant to preserve joy.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_44 = {
    Text = [[
In the fairy tales I've read, only happy and warm places can be called home.
I want to be a home for Jenkin and Brown.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_45 = {
    Text = [[
I see.
Miss Mason, you are far stronger than I imagined.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_46 = {
    Text = "You weren't like this when we first met at the wax museum."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_47 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Looks like Miss Winkle's \"Menophin Super Stabilization Therapy\" is actually effective.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Everyone is doing their best to help me. How can I not change at all?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_49 = {
    Text = "I hope I can help everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You lie face up beneath the fissure, your heart as close to the earth as possible."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_50 = {
    Text = "You stretch lazily, gazing absentmindedly at the tranquil residential area below."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Not sure if it's your imagination, but you seem to see a shadow standing at the end of the dark alley, gazing at the river of light in the sky along with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_52 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_53 = {
    Text = "It was the starlight from that time..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Here's a secret: Every persona is like a drifting weed, and becoming whole is our shared wish."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Laugh together, cry together, and feel the love and trust from Jenkin..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_56 = {
    Text = "...are nothing but pitiful delusions."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_57 = {
    Text = "The wind blows gently, and snowflakes drift in the air like soft cotton, aimlessly floating around."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_58 = {
    Text = "The starlight gradually fades, and your consciousness seems to drift away with it."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_59 = {
    Text = "I wonder what the next Domain waiting for you will be like?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_6 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_60 = {
    Text = "You're actually looking forward to it a bit."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_61 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Artificial Domain Investigation Log III>\n\n■Domain ID: M-C06\n■Collapse Time: December 24, AF 315\n■Collapse Location: Lily's Orphanage"
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_62 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:■Investigation Results>\n\nI saw the snow and the golden starlight dancing within it.\nFor some reason, they always remind me of the past. Mist rises, light falls, laughter fades.\nIt's a tranquil winter night.\n\n<Yellow:Happy New Year.>\n\nP.S. Miss Sarah's frosted cupcakes are delicious."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You close your eyes, feeling the tremors from deep within the mantle. It's a melancholic and ancient rhythm that reminds you of your home."
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
After an unknown amount of time, you hear faint laughter and feel someone take your hand.
You return the long-lost warmth with a gentle squeeze.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35990_Content_9 = {
    Text = [[
Mother.
Before you could cry out, tears had already begun streaming down your face.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_1 = {Text = "Ends here"},
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_10 = {
    Text = "<Red:Unclean. Impure. Ominous.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Golden starlight continuously spills from the wound, flickering fragilely in the air before finally flowing into Mason's body."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_101 = {
    Text = "Only together... are we the true Mason Meow..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_102 = {
    Text = "The real Mason..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_103 = {
    Text = "That is where all rivers end. No matter the distance, they will eventually converge here."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_104 = {
    Text = "I heard... their wish to return home."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_105 = {
    Text = "Here's a secret: Every persona is like a drifting weed, and becoming whole is our shared wish."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_106 = {
    Text = "Mason gently closed his eyes, feeling the golden circulation of starlight within."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_107 = {
    Text = "She saw her face and viscera, the clown, the scholar, and countless faces of herself."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_108 = {
    Text = "Her face was reflected in the shattered mirror, all eyes turned towards her, infinite tranquility, infinite sorrow."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_109 = {
    Text = "Those were her shadows, tears, and cracks, as well as her bone flesh flowing deep beneath the earth."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I must go... I have to cross over..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_110 = {
    Text = "They were forced to tear her body apart, to be born, to wander, and finally returned with weary bodies."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_111 = {
    Text = "<Red:End here, end with me.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
Hey, don't run off. I'm still grooming you.
Ow, why are you biting!?

<Gray:Honestly, compared to the cats in Mythag, your sister is quite well-behaved...>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Faint laughter echoes from afar, carrying the familiar warmth and affection she yearns for, as if it were right beside her."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Jenkin Meow?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The cat stood upright, straining to locate the source of the sound."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_16 = {
    Text = "<Red:Return.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Hmm—no, I'm not going there, meow!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, I want to return to Jenkin... to everyone..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Back off... <Big:Back off, meow!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The sleeping cat had many dreams."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
Alright, alright, we won't touch you.
Why did you suddenly leap so high? Have a nightmare?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_21 = {
    Text = "\"24\" alertly scanned the surroundings, with \"Pupil\" and nose tip constantly twitching."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Sniff sniff... There are bad guys nearby..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_23 = {
    Text = "She leapt up, pouncing toward the corner. However—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_25 = {Text = "Sob sob..."},
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_26 = {
    Text = "\"24\"lies on the ground, whimpering. Dark red blood slowly seeps from its gaping wound."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Not bad, you're alert. Too bad you chose the wrong opponent."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Is that you?! Miss Mason has been missing since a while ago, could it be—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Shadow chuckled and threw the battered Mason in front of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The slowly drifting patches of light under the eaves in the afternoon, steaming white porridge giving off wisps of steam, old bells, and colorful candy wrappers..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_30 = {
    Text = "{Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%... cough cough, I'm sorry..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_31 = {
    Text = "The shadow lifted its foot and slowly ground it into Mason's wound."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Hmm... Aaaah!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_33 = {
    Text = "I told you, I'll deal with you one by one."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_34 = {
    Text = "As Mason groaned in pain, the wind stopped, the dust settled, and even the sunlight was frozen in an eternal moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Even Jenkin beside you stands as silent as a sculpture."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Meanwhile, the surrounding space suddenly shook a few times, and the sky started to peel away."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_37 = {
    Text = "The vast sky plummets from on high, shattering into pieces."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Domain collapse...? No, it's worse than that. What's going on?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Shadow sneered and kicked the barely breathing Mason beneath him."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_4 = {
    Text = "And the snow mountain."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_40 = {
    Text = "You didn't know, did you? This one is our <Yellow:core personality>. If she dies, chaos will ensue here."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_41 = {
    Text = "What you're doing is tantamount to suicide. Why?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
This is a world where the strong prey on the weak. No one has decreed that she must be the dominant personality.
Am I correct, Miss Mason?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Don't harm %player%{Male=sir,Female=madam}... {Male=he,Female=she} is the savior of Jenkin..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Heh... A weak and incompetent coward."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_45 = {
    Text = "You didn't notice their clumsy lies."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_46 = {
    Text = "The scalpel cuts into your body, and you do not resist."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Forced to help them, you do not resist."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_48 = {
    Text = "You watch your dearest family enter the poorhouse without trying to stop them."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_49 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Huh, where is this place?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_50 = {
    Text = "In the end, you didn't even fulfill your duty as a \"sister.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_51 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_52 = {
    Text = "You discarded all memories onto us like trash. You walk through the campus, under the sun, leaving us to chew on pain in the dark."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_53 = {
    Text = [[
You are the root cause of everyone's suffering.
Now, do you really think you can restrain me?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_54 = {
    Text = "<Red:You are not worthy of this body.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_55 = {
    Text = "It's not up to you to decide whether we're a match—hmph!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_56 = {
    Text = "You kneel on the ground, feeling dizzy. On the other side, the shadow breathes steadily, slowly approaching you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_57 = {
    Text = "No... I can't even stand right now. I need to stabilize my main personality's spirit first."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_58 = {
    Text = "You climb over to Mason and take her hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Miss Mason, don't let her influence you—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Jenkin—Meow—Meow—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Is it... because I'm too weak...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_61 = {
    Text = "If only I were a little stronger..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_62 = {
    Text = "If it had been her, Mason's fate today would have turned out differently..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Heh, painful, isn't it? Multiply your current pain tenfold, a hundredfold—that's how we feel!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Yes, yes, yes."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_65 = {
    Text = "You are unworthy of using this body, body, bo, bo, body."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Sorry, sorry, sorry, sorry..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_67 = {
    Text = "I'm not Mason, I can't be Mason—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_68 = {Text = "Meow."},
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_69 = {
    Text = "The injured cat moved beside Mason, gently licking its bleeding wound."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
The faint meow of a cat was quickly drowned out by the wind and snow.
Majestic, barren mountains loomed ahead, casting a hazy bluish light over the land.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Then she lowered her head again, rustling with something."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Here, don't cry, meow."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Something was placed in my palm amidst the Illusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_73 = {
    Text = "A soft, cool fabric with a rusted bell attached to one end."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_74 = {
    Text = "None of the \"24\" are redundant, because..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_75 = {
    Text = "You are a clever and nimble scholar"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Lord Rogers, if I win, will you grant me a request?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Don't you still need a model for your wax sculpture collection? I can be your model."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_78 = {
    Text = "<Gray:\"Spring\" is Rogers' work planned for the exhibition. If selected as a model, it will increase exposure and allow more people to see it.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_79 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Jenkin...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Sniff sniff... Hmm?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_80 = {
    Text = "You are everyone's source of joy."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Long ago, in the snow mountains of the Endless North, at the end of an ancient river, a gray monster slumbers~~~"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Hello everyone, I am that monster. <Shake:Roar—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_83 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Waaah—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_84 = {
    Text = "You are an adorable cat"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_85 = {
    Text = "So sleepy, awoo..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Gurgle, gurgle..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_87 = {
    Text = "It really purrs like a cat... just like those cats on the Mythag campus."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Hey, what's making you laugh!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_89 = {
    Text = "She now looks happy, truly like a carefree little cat."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_9 = {
    Text = "She smelled the sounds. They drifted in the air, wordless and without rhythm, like a mother's gentle call."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_90 = {
    Text = [[
Yeah... They are all great "24".
Compared to them, I'm completely useless...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_91 = {
    Text = "You gently shook your head."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_92 = {
    Text = "On the contrary, you are stronger and braver than them because—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_93 = {
    Text = "You are the best sister in the world."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Master, all of this is my fault."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_95 = {
    Text = "She's just a kid from the slums, knows nothing, and won't pose any threat to you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_96 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Let her go...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_97 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Let her go...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_98 = {
    Text = "The cat extended its fluffy paw to hold Mason's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_35992_Content_99 = {
    Text = "There are brave Masons, and there are cowardly Masons. There are smart Masons, and there are foolish Masons.\nNone of this matters because —"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Pilgrim's chant"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_10 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Emaciated, long-haired, and possibly possessing more than one pair of upper limbs.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_11 = {
    Text = "According to <Blue:'Southwark Street Dissolution Event Report: C06'>, creatures matching the appearance and activity range perfectly exist here"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[

This report was filed in the Unified Archives by Mythag University.
Are you now attempting to deny its authenticity?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_13 = {
    Text = "It's a bit of an overreaction to question the reliability of the eyewitness reports, gentlemen."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Instead of wasting time playing word games, why not ask the person involved directly?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Miss 24, do you remember what you were doing at 9:15 PM on December 17th in <Blue:Dr. Bernard's Clinic>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_16 = {Text = "Huh? I..."},
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Just a reminder: According to <Blue:Dr. Bernard>'s medical records, you were the last patient he examined before his death."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_18 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_19 = {
    Text = "What have I done?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The barefoot pilgrim crawls forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_20 = {
    Text = "<Red:...Of course, kill him.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Miss 24? Are you listening?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_22 = {
    Text = "One punch, two punches, three punches... I smashed his handsome face to pieces, leaving not even a bone."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The taste of blood lingered on me for an entire week."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_24 = {
    Text = "<Small:Unfortunately, the suspect is evasive. Based on the terms in the <Agreement>, the Committee has the authority to take them back immediately.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_25 = {
    Text = "<Small:No. Miss 24 is different from other Awakeners. She—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<Small:She suffers from hysteria; she's a lunatic, as we all know. But does that mean a lunatic can kill a respected doctor at will?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_27 = {
    Text = "<Small:This is unreasonable, Miss Doll.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_28 = {
    Text = "<Red:I am a murderer.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Miss 24...? <Big:Miss 24!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The wind and snow of the Far North conceal the pilgrim's face. Her toes are cracked, her vision is blurred, and her blood leaves a long trail in the snow."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Wake up! I haven't even started the injection yet! It's not time to sleep..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Huh... What is this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Thank goodness, you're finally awake!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Mythag Lounge"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_34 = {
    Text = "I've heard your memory has been quite confused lately. Let me explain a bit."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The last inquiry about <Yellow:Dr. Bernard's Death> caused a rather unpleasant dispute with the Review Committee."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The final conclusion is: seven days. We only have seven days to uncover the truth."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_37 = {
    Text = "If I remember correctly, this happened before you were sent to the wax museum, so we knew nothing about it"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The files have been sealed away for months; who knows where they managed to dig them up from. Besides, conducting an investigation in a chaotic place like the East District is nothing short of a dream..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_39 = {
    Text = "So, we've decided to have %player% enter your Artificial Domain for investigation. We need your slight cooperation..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_4 = {
    Text = "But she still marches resolutely and unwaveringly toward the peak."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_40 = {
    Text = "I see. Sorry, I've been feeling drowsy lately..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_41 = {
    Text = "It feels like a terrible storm is brewing inside the Body, yet its host remains oblivious."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_42 = {Text = "Wait."},
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_43 = {
    Text = "\"Am I truly the master of this body?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_44 = {Text = "Ding—!"},
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Winkle quickly pulls out a prepared syringe."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_46 = {
    Text = [[
Don't worry, I'm here for this. 
One shot, and your muddled brain will clear up...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_47 = {
    Text = "<Shake:This way, %player% will suffer less inside. After all, nobody knows what might be in there. What if a disaster strikes...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Or encounter a terrifying being like \"N\" again—<Big:Ah!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Winkle anxiously scratched his head, gasping in fright."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Yes—\nBeneath those white mountains, in the depths of the dark cave, lies the source of all impurities <Red:Source>."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_50 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Damn it! Why am I losing so much hair again...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Miss 24 needs calmness, not your anxiety and hair. Winkle, please leave promptly after the injection."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_52 = {
    Text = "In 10 minutes"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Are you feeling better now, Miss 24?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_54 = {
    Text = "I'm fine, just a bit dizzy... Where is %player%?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_55 = {
    Text = [[
Already in the Artificial Domain Passage.
Rest assured, this time we've set the duration to only half an hour and won't linger for too long.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_56 = {
    Text = "What about Miss Ramona? Didn't she accompany you during the investigation?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Given the rather... unstable mental state of Domain owners, we cannot imagine what might appear inside the Domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Ramona's spirit power may not be able to withstand it."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_59 = {
    Text = "24 lowered his head in frustration and silently clutched the corner of the blanket."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_6 = {
    Text = "That is her fear, her nightmare."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Miss Doll, what if I say... the killer is truly me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_61 = {
    Text = "I remember. That day, I went to the clinic, and then—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Shush... I can't guarantee that there are no spies planted by the Committee here."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Doll recalls Sylvia's image, trying to put on a comforting smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Miss 24, you probably don't understand yourself as well as you believe."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_65 = {
    Text = "The so-called \"truth\" you see may not be real."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_66 = {
    Text = "I don't understand... Not real...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_67 = {
    Text = "You've been in Mythag for several months now, but we know nothing about your condition or your past experiences."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Consider this Domain investigation an opportunity to rediscover yourself, Miss 24."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_69 = {
    Text = "We all want to get to know you better."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_7 = {
    Text = "It is also her final destination."
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I don't accept your so-called \"evidence.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_35993_Content_9 = {
    Text = "This so-called eyewitness report only proves that the perpetrator is a non-human entity and cannot identify any specific individual."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Shadow tale"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_10 = {
    Text = "<Red:Hiss...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_11 = {
    Text = "In the darkness, faint sounds emerge, like a viper hissing in a deserted corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Snake... Who's there?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Tap-tap-tap."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The hurried footsteps draw near, and long hair swiftly brushes past your face."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Miss Mason?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Let go of me... Hey, who are you? Are you with <Yellow:that woman>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Huh, don't you remember me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_18 = {
    Text = "<Gray:I remember now. The murder took place before Miss Mason entered the wax museum, back when we hadn't met yet...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Tap, tap, tap."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_2 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Artificial Domain Investigation Log>\n\n■Domain ID: M-C06\n■Setup Time: December 17, AF 315, 9:00-9:30 PM\n■Setup Location: Dr. Bernard's Clinic"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Unlike the previous hurried steps, these footsteps are steadier."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_21 = {
    Text = "<Shake:She's coming... She's coming...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Who's coming?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_23 = {
    Text = "She... no, \"I\" have arrived!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_24 = {
    Text = "<Big:\"I'm coming to kill me!\">"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_25 = {Text = "?"},
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Fists whistling through the wind strike at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_28 = {
    Text = "<Big:All of you, die!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_29 = {
    Text = "In 10 minutes"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_3 = {
    Text = "■Domain Owner: Mason @2\n■Domain Infiltrator: %player%\n■Objective: <Yellow:Investigate Dr. Bernard's Death>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Please calm down, Miss...\"24\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_32 = {
    Text = "You stand before Mason, barely holding back the fierce assaults of the shadows."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Take one more step, and I won't show any mercy."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Heh, looks like the crybaby has found himself a helper."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The dim light outlines a familiar slender figure: long hair, a white dress, and blood-red irises."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_36 = {
    Text = "It's another \"24\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_37 = {
    Text = "No time left... Don't worry, I'll deal with each of you one by one."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_38 = {
    Text = "It will be your turn soon."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Without another word, \"24\" left promptly."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_4 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Cough cough... so smelly...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_40 = {Text = "Wait—"},
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Stop chasing her. We can't defeat her..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_42 = {
    Text = "What's going on? Why is there another you here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_43 = {
    Text = "I don't know... She just suddenly appeared and said she wanted to kill me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Was that doctor also killed by her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_45 = {
    Text = "So it was her who did the killing?! No, not only that... there's also the snake in hibernation..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Thousands of snakes @2 kill their own siblings, with fingers in their mouths... Mmm..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Miss Mason? Do you know what you're saying?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_48 = {
    Text = "What? It's not about what you say, but what you do! That's what Mr. @2 taught me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Mason is completely immersed in his own world, muttering a string of chaotic ramblings."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The clinic is enveloped in a thick, bloody stench, with medical equipment, books, and case files scattered all over the floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_50 = {
    Text = "You... I feel like I've seen you somewhere before..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_51 = {
    Text = "%player%... You are the Keeper!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_52 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_53 = {
    Text = "How did you suddenly remember who I am?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_54 = {
    Text = "You suddenly feel a headache."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Don't rush in; I haven't finished speaking yet."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_56 = {
    Text = "24's Domain differs from those of Ramona and Sorel. She lacks a stable personality, which will inevitably be reflected in her Domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Different personalities are isolated yet intertwined. You might even see many 24s within them."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_58 = {
    Text = "All of it—people, places, time... perhaps none of it is real."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_59 = {
    Text = "If it's all fake, is there any point to my investigation?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Dr. Bernard's body lay slumped against the wall. His head was mutilated beyond recognition."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Sure. Even if there's only a one percent chance of it being true, we must seize it."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_61 = {
    Text = "We all know that Miss 24 is not someone who kills indiscriminately."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_62 = {
    Text = "None of this is real... Stay calm, %player%. First, clarify your investigation targets."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_63 = {
    Text = "You examine Mason's finger. It is very clean, with no signs of injury or struggle."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Ms. Mason, do you have any grievances against Dr. Bernard?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_65 = {
    Text = "He... he treated me, but recently I've been feeling itchy all over. It's really strange..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Mason spoke casually, scratching the white eyeball growing from his Dissolution wound."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Of course, she was completely unaware of her own behavior."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_68 = {
    Text = "He healed you. Then, did you two start arguing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Later... later, I couldn't remember anything..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_7 = {
    Text = "\"30-year-old male, 6 feet tall, graduated with honors from Londinium University's medical school...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_70 = {
    Text = "I see, I understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_71 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Memory loss is a key sign of split personality. Something might have occurred during the treatment, causing the shadow personality to emerge and kill the doctor...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_72 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Next, we just need to rewind the Domain time by an hour and see what happened back then...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_73 = {
    Text = "You raised your hand and glanced at your watch."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_74 = {
    Text = "The Domain is about to end. Let's wrap up this investigation for now."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Miss Doll might be overthinking it; this Domain is much simpler than Lady Sorel's..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_76 = {
    Text = "You stretch lazily, then crouch in front of Mason, looking directly into her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Miss Mason, your illness is no ordinary one. It's not something any doctor with a fancy diploma can cure."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Next time, remember to find us at Mythag, got it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Mi, Sa, Ge..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_8 = {
    Text = "\"Known for their generosity, they have been providing voluntary medical services in various parts of the East District for many years...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Yes, Mythag University. We are professionals."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_81 = {Text = "Oh..."},
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Plop. Plop."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_83 = {
    Text = "The walls above begin to crumble bit by bit, the Domain is no longer stable."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Farewell, Miss Mason."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_85 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_86 = {
    Text = [[
The time is now 9:30 PM.
A cold wind howls past, and outside the window, a few crows let out lonely cries.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_87 = {
    Text = "You're still standing firmly in the clinic, with Mason kneeling beside you, wearing a bewildered expression."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Hmm... {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} Keeper, aren't you planning to leave again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_89 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Uh, is the equipment malfunctioning?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_9 = {
    Text = "An impeccable record, no wonder the police and the Committee value it so much."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_90 = {Text = "Boom—!!"},
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_91 = {
    Text = "The next second, the world rapidly collapses, and you fall into a bottomless abyss."
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_92 = {
    Text = "<Big:Aaaaaaa—!!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_93 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Artificial Domain Investigation Log I>\n\n■Domain ID: M-C06\n■Setup Time: December 17, AF 315, 9:00-9:30 PM\n■Setup Location: Dr. Bernard's Clinic"
  },
  AvgDialog_35994_Content_94 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:■Investigation Results>\n\n—Keeper Missing."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Why... why..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Driven by desperation and with no one to turn to, it is \"24\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Those who find happiness in a simple life are\"24\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Tormented by the Sculptors' Association, it is also \"24\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_13 = {
    Text = "No... If it weren't for your cowardice, we wouldn't have been caught by that doctor..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_14 = {Text = "Shh..."},
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Mason gently covered the shadow's lips. She leaned down and whispered in its ear."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Here's a secret: <Red:That doctor was killed by me.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Impossible. How dare you...?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Killing isn't difficult. I didn't have a weapon, so I used my hands to—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_19 = {
    Text = "By the end, my hands were numb, and all I could see was blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The Shadow is defeated by you. She collapses on the ground, with tiny light particles drifting from her body."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I must ensure that he is completely dead. As long as he still draws breath, he will surely harm the children of the orphanage and Jenkin..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_21 = {
    Text = "He's just like those people in the Sculptors' Association, no — he's even more terrifying..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_22 = {
    Text = "He's a true demon."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_23 = {
    Text = "So it was you... It really was you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_24 = {
    Text = "What was I doing back then... I didn't know anything..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Mason gently shook his head."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_26 = {
    Text = "It was the courage lent to me by you and the other \"24\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
All "24" combine to form one "Mason".
No "24" can exist in isolation.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Just like all rivers converge to one place, all \"24\" will also converge to one place..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Mason gently kissed Shadow's forehead."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_3 = {
    Text = "How could someone as powerful and enraged as me... lose to you, lose to this coward..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_30 = {
    Text = "It belongs to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The shadow's body transforms into starlight, scattering around Mason and merging into her skin."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_33 = {
    Text = "I see... I understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You are the origin of everything, and also the end of everything..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_35 = {
    Text = "She gradually lost her voice in the warm embrace."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Starlight flickers like fireflies in the night, appearing and disappearing, until it finally vanishes."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Good night, my \"one twenty-fourth\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_38 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Artificial Domain Investigation Log IV>\n\n■Domain ID: M-C06\n■Fall Time: Year 315 of the Flood, December @1\n■Fall Location: Camberwell Street, East District"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_39 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:■Investigation Results>\n\nThe Domain came to a quiet conclusion.\nAfter that, Miss Mason's condition stabilized significantly, bringing immense joy to everyone.\n\n<Yellow:We are gradually getting closer to the true Miss Mason.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_4 = {Text = "Because..."},
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
Mythag University, School Office
One day later]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_41 = {
    Text = "What? The Committee has withdrawn the accusation?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_42 = {
    Text = "While you were away, many interesting things happened. They're now busy dealing with the snake infestation alongside the city's environmental department."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Snake infestation...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Doll spreads out an issue of the \"Londinium Post\" from a few days ago in front of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_45 = {
    Text = "\"Recently, a sudden influx of albino snakes of unknown species emerged from the late Dr. Bernard's clinic, causing severe disruptions to local transportation and daily life...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_46 = {
    Text = "\"Eyewitnesses claim this was the most horrifying scene they've ever witnessed. If readers also witnessed this, please contact a psychologist at @2...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_47 = {
    Text = "\"Number@4...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Next to the news, there's a photo where you seem to recognize a few familiar faces from the Committee."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_49 = {
    Text = "They hold nets, tirelessly cleaning up the constantly emerging little snakes, their faces revealing fatigue and impatience."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_5 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_50 = {
    Text = "That so-called \"Doctor Bernard\" has serious problems."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_51 = {
    Text = "We found members of the Royal Medical Society, but the photos they provided are completely different from the descriptions given by nearby residents."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_52 = {
    Text = "In other words, the deceased stole the identity of this Dr. Bernard. However, it is still unclear whether this fake doctor is truly dead."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_53 = {
    Text = "After all, not even a trace of a body can be found at the scene..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_54 = {
    Text = [[
Dec 17th, The Day of the Incident
Dr. Bernard's Clinic]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Today's treatment is over. Miss Mason, you are recovering well."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Really? But everyone says my condition is getting worse..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_57 = {
    Text = [[
I fear my understanding of "serious" differs from that of other humans.
Have you taken all the tinctures I prescribed on time?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_58 = {Text = "Splash!!"},
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_59 = {
    Text = "The doctor accidentally knocked over the files at hand, scattering the yellowed pages all over the floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Leave it to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Sorry, the East District has been hit by frequent outbreaks recently, and the clinic's documents are piling up—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_61 = {
    Text = "No worries! You're a busy doctor working day and night. Leave the small task of picking things up to..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_62 = {Text = "Well..."},
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_63 = {
    Text = "The hand stopped less than 2 inches from the file. It was a stack of identity documents, and Mason could barely make out a few somewhat familiar words."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Experiment Report, Transfer Record...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_65 = {
    Text = "<Shake:These are... the missing children from the orphanage! No, it's even worse...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_66 = {
    Text = "In the corner of the exposed file at the bottom, Mason saw Jenkin's slightly stubborn face."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Is this your sister? I've seen her. She's always worried about you and even tried to sneak in."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_68 = {
    Text = "He smiled faintly, his expression growing gentle."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_69 = {
    Text = "I once had many siblings... They only feared me, so I devoured them all."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_70 = {
    Text = "All of them... eaten?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, Miss Mason. I didn't eat your friends; I just sent them to a <Red:safe place>."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_72 = {
    Text = "So, you're the mastermind behind these disappearances..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_73 = {
    Text = "<Shake:This joke isn't funny at all, Mr. Bernard...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Mr. Bernard... Are you referring to it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_75 = {
    Text = "The man spoke, extending a long tongue from his mouth, which coiled around a bloody severed finger."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_76 = {
    Text = "He's too big; I still can't process it."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Let's reintroduce ourselves. I'm <Yellow:Albino>, the pharmacist of the Sculptors' Association."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Aaaaaah—!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Mason's legs gave out, and he collapsed heavily to the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Mason sat beside the shadow, holding the motionless shadow in his arms."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_80 = {
    Text = "<Shake:You're a bad person... You even want to take Jenkin...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_81 = {
    Text = "The man adjusted his glasses and quickly jotted down notes on the medical record."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Pupils dilated, body trembling violently, heart racing... You must be extremely terrified right now. Are you cold?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_83 = {
    Text = "No... Stay back..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Soon, you will faint due to insufficient blood flow to the brain, just like other dull humans."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_85 = {
    Text = "He lifted his head from the medical record, a faint gleam of excitement flickering in his golden vertical pupils."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Or... will you react in a different way?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_87 = {
    Text = "20 minutes later"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_88 = {
    Text = "I've killed someone... I actually killed a doctor... They won't believe me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_89 = {
    Text = "No, why did I just kill him...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Because... you didn't accept all \"24\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Mason snapped out of his daze and hastily left the scene."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_91 = {
    Text = "The man's body slumped against the wall. His head had already shattered, and blood kept seeping out."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_92 = {
    Text = "After an unknown amount of time, a series of black curse marks suddenly lit up on the corpse's neck."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_93 = {
    Text = "The curse coils like a snake, the shattered Caro gathers and reforms..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Until the end, the \"corpse\" slowly sat up."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Phew... Not bad, those tinctures worked. Her potential has been fully unleashed."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Albino extended his long snake tongue and leisurely licked the blood off his face clean."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_97 = {
    Text = "The prey has matured. It's time to report to our Guild Master."
  },
  AvgDialog_35996_Content_98 = {
    Text = "He picked up the medical record at his feet and left in a leisurely manner."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_1 = {
    Text = "All-knowing cat"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Tsk, Brown and I are more than enough to handle you grunts."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_11 = {
    Text = "What did you say?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Little Mac waved his hand, and the unruly children immediately fell silent."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You know the rules, right? If you lose to us, you must hand over control of Camberwell Street."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_14 = {
    Text = "—Forever."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Stop dawdling! If you want to fight, bring it on!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Squeak! Squeak! Squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Very well, I hereby officially announce that the 13th \"Camberwell Battle\" has now begun.\nBrothers—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_18 = {
    Text = "<Big:Charge!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Artificial Domain: Camberwell Street, East District"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Ouch! Ouch... There are just too many of them..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_21 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Creak...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Hmph! This is what you get for stirring up trouble everywhere. Now you know how powerful we are!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Charge forward, everyone! Victory is just ahead—"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_24 = {Text = "Meow~"},
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_25 = {
    Text = "An angry cry with a hint of childishness interrupted the small skirmish before them."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Don't bully Jenkin!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Cat... cat-person? No, it's Sister Mason?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Before he could react, three red scratch marks appeared on Little Mike's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A desolate cold wind blows, lifting the withered leaves."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_30 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_31 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Waaahhhh!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Children scattered in all directions. The deafening cries echoed all the way to the overlooked alley corners."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Never expected to see a 24 like a cat... Miss Mason, shall we go out and take a look?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_34 = {
    Text = "No one responded to your request. During the recent skirmish, Mason vanished without a trace."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Miss Mason...? Leaving without saying goodbye?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_36 = {Text = "Slurp."},
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_37 = {
    Text = "A wet sensation brushes against the side of my face."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_38 = {
    Text = "You turn your head in disbelief, only to see \"24\" clinging to you like an oversized doll, flashing you a flattering smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Meow, meow?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Little Mike stood at the end of the alley with a group of children. Hands on his hips, his expression was extremely serious."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_40 = {Text = "...?"},
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Sniff sniff... There's a rat, meow!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_43 = {Text = "Squeak@3!"},
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_44 = {
    Text = "A chilling scream pierces the sky. You look down to see \"24\" holding Brown in its mouth."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_45 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Squeak Squeak Squeak Awooo!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Brown wriggled his soft body vigorously, with his whiskers twitching rapidly."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_47 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Quick, quick! Look, what's that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Jenkin skillfully picked up a shard of mirror from the ground and reflected it towards the opposite wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Tap. Tap. Tap."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_50 = {
    Text = "In an instant, intense flickering spots of light appeared on the stone wall, successfully catching the attention of \"24\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Shiny Meow!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_52 = {
    Text = "\"24\" shot away with a swoosh, leaving Brown sobbing uncontrollably on the spot."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Whimper... Squeak..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_54 = {
    Text = "*sigh* Ever since we consulted that quack, my sister's condition has worsened."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Quack? You mean Doctor Bernard?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Who else could it be? \"Miracle Doctor\" or \"Savior of the East Side Poor\"? Bah!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_57 = {
    Text = "There's no such thing as a free lunch. I bet he has ulterior motives..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Dr. Bernard is a good person, meow!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Originally chasing the light spot, \"24\" suddenly peeked out from behind Jenkin."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The girl walked steadily, the wind lifting her tattered cloak."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Alright, alright, he's really good. He's the best doctor in the world."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_61 = {
    Text = [[
Jenkin skillfully smoothed "24"'s hair.
"24"squinted, looking quite pleased.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Little Jenkin is also a good person, meow."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_63 = {
    Text = "When did Miss Mason first exhibit these... peculiar symptoms?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_64 = {
    Text = "After seeing that quack doctor three or four times, one day she suddenly told me that she was actually a silver cod."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Later, she devised a plan to destroy the fish fry restaurant, claiming it was to save her comrades"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_66 = {
    Text = "<Gray:I see. I placed too much trust in the Committee and overlooked the Doctor's actual qualifications.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_67 = {
    Text = "<Gray:He might be a lackey of the Sculptors' Association, ike Dr. Miller...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_68 = {
    Text = "So sleepy, awoo..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_69 = {
    Text = "\"24\"Stretched out, gave a long lazy stretch, then naturally leaned on Jenkin's shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You've arrived, just as promised. Alone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Gurgle, gurgle..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_71 = {
    Text = "She fell asleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_72 = {
    Text = "It really purrs like a cat... just like those cats on the Mythag campus."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_73 = {
    Text = "You curiously crouch in front of \"24\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_74 = {
    Text = "The sunlight evenly bathed her face, turning the fine hairs golden."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Hey, what's making you laugh!"
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_76 = {
    Text = "She now looks happy, truly like a carefree little cat."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_77 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_78 = {
    Text = "My sister used to say that life was too hard. If she could be reincarnated, she would want to become a cat."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Jenkins suddenly pulled a red ribbon from his pocket. This was Mason's usual ribbon, with a rusty bell hanging at the end."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_8 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Don't worry. Whether it's a cat or a silver codfish, they're all my sisters."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_81 = {
    Text = "However, to keep you from running off, I need to tie a bell on you."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_82 = {
    Text = [[
Jenkin gently tied the ribbon around "24"'s wrist.
"24", still asleep, just slightly wrinkled their nose.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Here, this is what I took from Little Mac and his gang. Make sure you wear it securely."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_84 = {
    Text = "The afternoon sun, like overflowing time, gently flows past you. Jenkin gazes at the mottled shadow of the house cut by the sun and softly closes his eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Sister is very busy. She takes care of me and Brown, works multiple jobs at the same time, like a machine that never malfunctions."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Now that this machine has fallen, it's finally my turn to take care of it."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_87 = {
    Text = "She needs me."
  },
  AvgDialog_35997_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Impressive, you dared to come alone. You are a worthy opponent."
  },
  AvgDialog_35999_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Cursed binding"
  },
  AvgDialog_35999_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I remember everything..."
  },
  AvgDialog_35999_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Memories flood in with the starlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_35999_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Those memories, artificially created and shattered by violence, surged into Mason's mind and then quickly receded like the tide."
  },
  AvgDialog_35999_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Until the very end, she arrived at the foot of the snow mountain, the entrance to a pitch-black cave."
  },
  AvgDialog_35999_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Follow the river flowing beneath your feet to reach the lair of the slumbering beast."
  },
  AvgDialog_35999_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Knock, knock. Knock, knock."
  },
  AvgDialog_35999_Content_8 = {
    Text = "It was a heartbeat like that of an old clock, the shared heartbeat between her and the beast."
  },
  AvgDialog_35999_Content_9 = {Text = "I see..."},
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The \"False God\" completely breaks free from Its fragile yet resilient mother. Murphy is thrown from a great height and ultimately crashes heavily onto the deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_10 = {
    Text = "A Silver Core."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Murphy isn't dead, but a Silver Core has already formed inside her. This contradicts what you learn in class."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_12 = {
    Text = "But there's no time to think. Driven by an almost instinctive impulse, you grasp Murphy's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The Silver Key hanging on your chest emits a trembling chime. A dazzling silver light bursts from your clasped hands, bright enough to illuminate every corner, engulfing everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Time becomes boundless in the light, and souls are repeatedly compressed and folded within endless time."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_15 = {
    Text = "In this eternal moment, pain always accompanies you, urging you to let go of the Silver Core piercing your palm."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_16 = {
    Text = "—You refuse. The excruciating pain mercilessly invades your consciousness, shattering the tissues inside your skull. Blood clotted with lumps gushes from your mouth, nose, and ears."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_17 = {
    Text = "You hold Murphy's soul tightly."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The light collapses to the origin, and the eerie flute sound that makes you drowsy resurfaces, forcibly capturing your attention."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_19 = {
    Text = "You feel your hand go empty."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_2 = {
    Text = "All of her bones shatter on impact, her chest cavity is torn open by herself, and further shattered by the emerging \"False God\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_20 = {
    Text = "After the silver light fades, the deck before you is empty, leaving only bloodstains behind."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_21 = {Text = "Keeper!?"},
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Ramona trembles as she wipes the blood oozing from the corner of your eye, but only smears it, leaving your face covered with bloodstains."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_23 = {Text = "Murphy..."},
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Ramona's shock and questions are just forming when a low sound comes from the bow, like the murmur of a creature from the Abyss in slumber, carrying an ominous atmosphere."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_25 = {
    Text = "You both instinctively turn your heads to look, and see the entity named \"Miryam\" staring at the God with almost fanatical devotion. She kneels at the bow of the ship, arms outstretched towards the faux god."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_26 = {
    Text = "And those countless black hands open their embrace to her. They gently encircle her waist, lifting the devout follower to their mouths."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_27 = {
    Text = "—<Red:SNAP>."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_28 = {
    Text = "The next moment, the sounds of chewing and swallowing rise in succession."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_29 = {
    Text = "As if finally breaking free from some unknown boundary of terror, the newborn lets out a purring sound of satisfaction, as if digesting the rare feast of \"Miryam.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Waves continuously crash onto the deck, washing away pools of blood beneath her, as if to completely erase any trace of her existence."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The \"Newborn\" in the translucent black cocoon resembles a large, fragile primate embryo. Its limbs twitch clumsily, as if searching for a direction to grow—"
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
Time until Alignment: 
<Red:0> minutes]]
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_4 = {
    Text = "This kind of injury... we can't handle it."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
Murphy's lower lip still quivers, but her eyes have started to grow unfocused.

Unable to bear the sight of this tragic scene, Ramona grits her teeth and looks up at the "False God."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Stop It. If such a massive Cataclysm core isn't dealt with on the ship and reaches land... the consequences will be unimaginable."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Keeper, it's time to act. For Murphy's sake."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Wait a moment! I might have a way."
  },
  AvgDialog_36227_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You stare intently at the mangled tissue beneath Murphy's ribs. You see that thing."
  },
  AvgDialog_36276_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The outer part... isn't Its true form?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_36276_Content_2 = {
    Text = "This is what Miryam pursues. What she longs for is the \"God\" that can bring her the revival of the past..."
  },
  AvgDialog_36276_Content_3 = {
    Text = "We can't afford to be careless now, not even for a single moment!"
  },
  AvgDialog_36276_Content_4 = {
    Text = "This ugly thing is fully awake... I can feel it."
  },
  AvgDialog_36277_Content_1 = {Text = "Keeper!"},
  AvgDialog_36277_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Tulu! You're finally here."
  },
  AvgDialog_36277_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Dealing with Elton's enemies took some time... <Small:Wait, Murphy?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_36277_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Tulu's eyes slide past the \"Divine Fetus\" and finally land on Murphy. She, who is now an Awakener, has tentacles on her skirt wildly swaying in the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_36277_Content_5 = {
    Text = "......The Fetus's power originates from the same source as mine, meaning It is also my kin. Though I cannot command It directly, my Royal Authority, revered by tens of thousands of Lemurian subjects, is unmatched by any counterfeit deity."
  },
  AvgDialog_36277_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Opportunity knocks but once. Use my power as Lemuria's King... and unleash divine retribution upon It!"
  },
  AvgDialog_37962_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Next test: Screen Effect - Continuous Red"
  },
  AvgDialog_37962_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Next test: Screen Effect - Starlight"
  },
  AvgDialog_37962_Content_14 = {Text = "End"},
  AvgDialog_37962_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Next test: Screen Effects - Lighting"
  },
  AvgDialog_37962_Content_19 = {Text = "End"},
  AvgDialog_37962_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Next test: Type 9 Scrolling Text"
  },
  AvgDialog_37962_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
Spring, the most auspicious dawn. The gradually whitening mountaintop begins to show light, with lilac clouds gently drifting above.
Summer comes at night. When the moon is out, it goes without saying, and during the moonless dark night, there are also swarms of fireflies. If it rains, it becomes even more evocative.
Autumn presents dusk. The sunset shines near the mountain's edge, crows return to their nests, flying over in groups of three, four, or two, adding to the melancholy. Sometimes, one might see the silhouette of a small flock of geese, flying across the far sky, which is also charming. Moreover, after sunset, there still exists the sound of the wind and the chirping of insects.
Winter presents dawn. When it snows, it goes without saying; sometimes the frost is thick, even without snow or frost, the cold air is biting enough to light a pot of fire and carry coals through the corridor, which seems quite appropriate; it's only a pity that by noon, the coals in the pot become covered in ash, leaving little to appreciate.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_37962_Content_22 = {Text = "End"},
  AvgDialog_37962_Content_5 = {Text = "End"},
  AvgDialog_37962_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Next test: Character art zoom-in effect"
  },
  AvgDialog_37962_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Enlarge artwork (1.5, 0.3)"
  },
  AvgDialog_37962_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Character Art Enlargement and Restoration"
  },
  AvgDialog_37962_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Test complete, chirp~"
  },
  AvgDialog_38725_Content_1 = {
    Text = "A faint blue glow envelops you, dispelling all your fatigue and pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_38725_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The Father God bestows \"The blessing\" upon you."
  },
  AvgDialog_38725_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Bishop Salvador!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38725_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You are the pale messenger, the flame that dispels the darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_38725_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You will end all this suffering, I will provide you with all the help you need."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Blood Sigil"
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Indeed. Perhaps... perhaps it is a cult?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Scenes flash in your mind—a girl with a dagger, a woman in a black veil, and a room deep within Rye Hospital that can never be opened..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_12 = {
    Text = "How many organizations like that of the <Yellow:Seafarers> and the <Yellow:Church of the Lightbearers> exist in this world, and how many more people will become their sacrifices?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Your Excellency, has Edward ever mentioned anything to you?
Be it about other religions, ancient beliefs, or even folk legends?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Salvador puts down the handkerchief, turning towards you. Despite his eyes being covered with a black gauze, you can still feel his discerning gaze."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_15 = {
    Text = "If so... Do you plan to investigate this matter?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
Yes. I... have had contact with similar organizations, I know how dangerous they can be.
I would rather like to not see any more victims in cases such as these.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
You have a bright soul, %player%, warm, strong...admirable.
May the light of the Father shine upon you, as it does upon all members of <Yellow:Mythag>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_18 = {
    Text = "How did you—"
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The former bishop was my friend. He managed the Church for decades. He knew a great many things."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The wooden door slowly closes behind you, shutting out the vendors' cries and the clamor of the busy crowds. You cannot help but breathe in the solace of the silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I will do my best to assist, but I'm afraid I know of little else."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_21 = {
    Text = "...Come to think of it, Edward was not the first victim of this sort of... cult."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Half a year ago, a young man named Philip in the Church District was sentenced to death for murdering his wife."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
When he was first imprisoned, I visited him at the warden's invitation.
He was pale, extremely thin, and refused to communicate with anyone.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_24 = {
    Text = "I sat with him all day, and as I was leaving, he said the only words he had spoken that day."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_25 = {
    Text = "\"Do you see all this black <Red:blood>?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Before his execution took place, he took his own life."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The entire room was covered in blood—on the floor, walls, and the ceiling. Just standing there was enough to make one feel suffocated by the gore. Yet beneath all the gruesome bloodstains, I discovered a strange symbol."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Shallow and small, as if scratched by but a fingernail. If not for the blood seeping into the crevice, I might not have noticed the thing."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Next to the symbol, there was an even fainter mark."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Your Excellency, the water you asked for."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The mark was crooked, as if carved by someone who has lost all his strength or drunk with the delirium of madness. Guided by the Father, I recognized it—it was indeed a word."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_31 = {
    Text = "<Red:Purification.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_32 = {
    Text = "That cult you theorise of is cautious and extremely skilled at hiding themselves. If Edward hadn't mentioned \"purification\" during that incident earlier, I would not have known that he had fallen deep into their clutches."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Do you remember what that symbol looked like, perhaps? Mythag might have some records that might prove useful."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Of course. Please, extend your hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_35 = {
    Text = "He extends a finger, lightly drawing a simple symbol onto your palm."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_36 = {Text = "This...!"},
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_37 = {
    Text = "You quickly take out your pocket notebook, hastily copying the pattern Salvador drew."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_38 = {
    Text = "My Lord, what is the matter? What are those symbols?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Inverted triangle, a dot in the middle—"
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Thank you, Ogier."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_40 = {
    Text = "This...This is the symbol of the Church of the Lightbearers..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_41 = {Text = "Bang!"},
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Suddenly, the Church door is flung wide open. Sophia grips the door tightly, her hair messy and panting for breath. She stands bathed in the outside sunlight, yet her shouting rings loud and clear."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Bishop Salvador, something's wrong! The people outside—"
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Don't block the way, let us in!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_45 = {
    Text = "A hand shoves Sophia aside, filling the once peaceful Church with piercing shouts and curses."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_46 = {
    Text = "More than a dozen citizens rush in, some holding brooms, others with rolling pins. One of them waves their fist, still bearing Edward's bite marks."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Bring out that scoundrel Edward! We have a score to settle with him!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Salvador takes a clean handkerchief from his pocket and wets it in the water-filled bucket, beginning to carefully wipe the dust from Edward's damaged skin."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_6 = {
    Text = "A slightly damp cloth brushes across his chest, drawing your gaze to his prominently visible ribs — he is far too thin, as if he has just survived a great famine."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_7 = {
    Text = "<Small:...Sinful... blood... purification...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Blood, sin... Although you're not familiar with <Blue:Chantry of Life>'s <Blue:\"Holy Scriptures\">, these sanguinary concepts don't seem to match your first impressions of this religion."
  },
  AvgDialog_38727_Content_9 = {
    Text = "This \"Innocent Haven\" and \"Purification\"... they don't appear to be from the \"Scripture\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ignite the White Hope."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Please...Erase their pain and soothe their hearts."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Grant forgiveness to the sinner, bestow upon them \"The blessing\"... After all these years, you really haven't changed at all, Bishop Salvador."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_101 = {
    Text = "The pyre cannot change you, nor can resurrection. When will you finally see reality? Perhaps—"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_102 = {
    Text = "She extends her hand into the air, as if touching something invisible."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_103 = {
    Text = [[
The <Yellow:Keeper> with a pale yet warm soul foretold can introduce more variables.
Do you think {Male=he,Female=she} would be willing to join us?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_104 = {
    Text = "A giant hound emerged from the shadows beside the woman, its twisted limbs somewhat resembling the mutated Sophia. It snorts in response to the woman's words."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_105 = {
    Text = "Well, tomorrow is always a new day."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_106 = {
    Text = "Let's go, dear. If we get the chance, we'll meet them again."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The people's eyes become vacant, their bodies relax. Panic and fear dissippate, replaced by calmness and tranquility."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Free them from the torment of suffering. Grant them \"The Blessing\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The tidal light surges outward, and everyone closes their eyes, as if immersed in tranquility."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The warm sun overlooks all. All seems perfectly normal, except for the chaotic square that bears witness to the recent madness."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
The tablet softly clicks, dissolving into the unseen shadows of the night.
Salvador straightens his clothes and walks to Sophia's side.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_16 = {
    Text = "...You shouldn't have saved me."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_17 = {
    Text = "\"All who find their way back can return to my embrace.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
"Because you are all my children, and I love you all."
But you are wrong, Bishop, and so is the "Holy Scripture".]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Some people never change."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The tablet rises once more."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_20 = {
    Text = "What brings you here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Sophia, I—"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Shut up! Isn't it enough that you caused the deaths of my sister and mother? Do you now come to their graves to gloat?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I'm here to apologize. I didn't expect..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Sophia laughed sharply."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Did you apologize to <Blue:Thompson> like this after causing the death of his only family member and <Blue:Millie>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_26 = {
    Text = "You make me sick, Edward Bailey."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_27 = {
    Text = "I truly regret it what I did, Sophia. I know I can't earn your forgiveness—"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_28 = {
    Text = "If you truly regret it, you shouldn't have gone to see Bishop Salvador on the day Thompson killed you."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Yes, I know how you survived, you coward. <Yellow:The Lightbearer> told me."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The bishop's decision to grant you \"<Yellow:The Blessing>\" was his most foolish mistake. You deserve to die, Bailey, by cruel and brutal torture."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_31 = {
    Text = "I didn't want this either. I tried to control myself, I really did! After The Bishop saved me, I reported to the Church every day and volunteered at your charity weekly. Do you remember?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I want to be better, I really do. It was that Aglo guy—he said it was a foolproof deal and asked me to introduce a guarantor. I'm a victim too!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Even now, you're still evading responsibility. Even now... you haven't truly repented."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_34 = {
    Text = "She takes out a silvery object from the inner pocket of her skirt. Its smooth surface glinted faintly in the sunlight, casting an ominous reddish glow."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_35 = {Text = "Sophia...?"},
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_36 = {Text = "Repent."},
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
Follow the teachings of the righteous Lightbearer, and purify the sins within your soul.
Only then can you attain forgiveness.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_38 = {
    Text = "What are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_39 = {
    Text = "I... I'm Edward..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Amidst the bustling crowd, Salvador raises his hand, the continuous stream of blood from his body flowing onto the tablets before him. A blue light flows along intricate patterns, bright and dim, breathing gently."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
The mirror flashes, and the kneeling young man's eyes grew dazed once more.
Trembling, he raised the stick in his hand and struck himself hard.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_41 = {
    Text = "I'll ask once more: What are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_42 = {
    Text = "I am a sinner."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_43 = {
    Text = "What sin have you committed?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Greed... Desire... I have allowed evil to taint my soul, and then inflict pain upon the innocent."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_45 = {
    Text = "What should you do?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_46 = {
    Text = [[
Repentance to the gods and those I have wronged...
I must endure the whip, bleed until the black sin flows out, until <Red:purification> is attained.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Judgment Day is approaching. Only pure souls may enter the Innocent Haven."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_48 = {
    Text = "<Red:May the lantern remain lit>."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Just like you, even after two lifetimes, you still made the same mistakes."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_5 = {
    Text = "All-Father of Genesis, our merciful Creator, please hear my prayer."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_50 = {
    Text = "...How did you know?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_51 = {
    Text = [[
Is it important?
Your sin of arrogance runs so deep, Bishop. Your soul must be utterly filthy.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Tell me, sinner, why don't you repent for the sins you preach against?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_53 = {
    Text = "...because that is not a crime."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_54 = {
    Text = "The Father's Relics always bear His light. Anyone can be blinded, but just as easily, anyone can rediscover the Father's light."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_55 = {
    Text = "We cannot deprive someone of their whole life because of a single moment's action."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_56 = {
    Text = "You say that, but have you ever considered those harmed by them?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_57 = {
    Text = "When those Edwards regain the light, how many Millies must be sacrificed? How many Olivias?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Sin is sin, and wrong is wrong. Once committed, there is no turning back."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_59 = {
    Text = "She looks to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Gentle blue tendrils radiate from the tablet, passing through the crowds and dispelling the lingering scent of blood, leaving a faint fragrance."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Take me away, throw me into your corrupt laws. But remember, Judgement Day will come."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_61 = {
    Text = "At that time, you will all be banished from the Innocent Haven."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_62 = {
    Text = "The mirror has been secured, Keeper. The affected civilians have been sent to major hospitals and will be discharged after check-ups."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_63 = {
    Text = "The official statement is that this was a mass hallucination event caused by a toxic gas leak at the factory. The city government will issue a public apology tomorrow and take disciplinary actions against the responsible individuals."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_64 = {
    Text = "I understand. Thank you for your hard work."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_65 = {
    Text = "This is what we should do."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_66 = {
    Text = "The young man in uniform hesitates for a moment, then spoke:"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_67 = {
    Text = "How did you manage to do that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_68 = {Text = "Do what?"},
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_69 = {
    Text = "The situation was so chaotic, and yet with just yourself and an Awakener, you limited the casualties to around a dozen—almost a miracle."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The people standing slowly sat down."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_70 = {
    Text = "You and Ogier exchange a quick glance. The young knight coughs lightly with his hands behind his back."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_71 = {
    Text = "This is probably the unspoken understanding between my lord and me."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_72 = {
    Text = [[
Regardless, I extend my gratitude to you on behalf of the First Response Team of the Committee. 
In the midst of the crisis, you didn't abandon our people, allowing them to return home safely. Moreover...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_73 = {
    Text = [[
Many of us grew up here; the Church District means a lot to us.
Thank you for everything you've done.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_74 = {
    Text = "That's what we should do."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_75 = {
    Text = "There is never too much gratitude."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Miss Sophia... What will become of her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Interrogate her. We will pass judgment on her after finding out where the mirror came from."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_78 = {
    Text = "The heretical ritual caused widespread chaos and numerous casualties... The Bishop hopes she will not be sentenced to death, but I am not optimistic."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_79 = {
    Text = "What awaits her will not be a good outcome."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Those sitting there, mouths agape, stare blankly at the miraculous scene before them."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Bishop Salvador."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Are you leaving?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_82 = {
    Text = "I am. Thank you for your help with this event."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_83 = {
    Text = "This all started because of me, and you even kept my identity a secret. I should be the one thanking you."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Are you really not coming back with us?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Don't worry about the parish. As long as the conditions are right, we allow Awakeners to act freely."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Thank you for your kindness, but, I would rather stay here."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_87 = {
    Text = [[
Father God revived me here, likely hoping I could help more people.
If you have need of, <Yellow:The Pale Fire>, come to me anytime. I will give my all to you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_88 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry, but... What exactly are the <Yellow:Pale Messenger> and the <Yellow:Pale Fire>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_89 = {
    Text = "It is the prophecy of the Father in the Scripture."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Those who lost consciousness, or even stopped breathing, slowly opened their eyes in the gentle breeze."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Boundless darkness will descend upon the world, the soul that is pale and warm is the emissary of hope, {Male=he,Female=she} will ignite the white flame to illuminate the path forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_91 = {
    Text = "It can't possibly be me, right? There are so many people in the world."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_92 = {
    Text = [[
Even though my eyes are covered, I cannot mistake the brilliance of a soul.
Yours is so warm and bright. In all these years, I have never seen another like it.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_93 = {
    Text = "The young Keeper turns and walks away. Salvador watches the glimmer, whispering a prayer as the door swings open for the final time."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_94 = {
    Text = "May you illuminate the darkness with faint hope."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_95 = {
    Text = [[
<Yellow:Report on Anomalous Events in the Londinium Church District>

A.F. 315 @2@3, Londinium Great Church District, a sudden outbreak of violence occurred in the square in front of the Londinium Church of Father's Eternal Blessings. Citizens present exhibited severe violent behavior and self-harm, making normal communication impossible.
...
Abnormal behavior worsened after contact with an unknown light source, escalating into large-scale cannibalistic acts. Investigations revealed that the unknown light source was actually a handheld mirror made of polished pure silver. This mirror gathers energy by reflecting sunlight and moonlight. Individuals exposed to the mirror's reflections are driven by their most powerful inner desires, including but not limited to: violence, voracity, and somnolence, leading to even more extreme actions.
The mirror was recovered by Keeper %player% and Awakener Ogier. Preliminary analysis indicates it contains Silver or Silver-like components. For more details, please refer to the special equipment research report provided by the Department of Special Equipment Research at Mythag University.
...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_96 = {
    Text = [[
Upon interrogation by the Mystia treaty committee, <Yellow:Sophia Chastain> admitted to joining the Church of the Lightbearers three years ago and obtaining a ritual mirror from the church leader, Temple Light (namely <Yellow:Ms. Eve>), during the last Mass.
When the agent further questioned her, Sophia Chastain began to pray and gave no further response.
...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_97 = {
    Text = "The setting sun dispels the lingering haze in the sky. The church bell tolls, and the ship's whistle sounds at the riverside dock."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_98 = {
    Text = "On the rooftop of a tall building, a cloaked figure stands alone with their back to the sun."
  },
  AvgDialog_38729_Content_99 = {
    Text = [[
Even after sacrificing the mutated sinners, no <Red:Stigmata> appeared.
It seems the value of <Yellow:that mirror> is just that.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38841_Content_1 = {Text = "Hmm!"},
  AvgDialog_38841_Content_10 = {Text = "My Lord!"},
  AvgDialog_38841_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The next moment, a giant tablet falls right in front of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_38841_Content_13 = {
    Text = "People driven by madness rush at you, blood is everywhere, chaotic and heart-wrenching screams... All of this is isolated behind the tablet."
  },
  AvgDialog_38841_Content_14 = {
    Text = "A hand clad in a black glove rests on your forearm, the cool fabric easing the pain and wiping away the blood trickling down your arm."
  },
  AvgDialog_38841_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The person who bit you has vanished. Standing beside you, gripping your forearm, is a bishop clad in a black robe."
  },
  AvgDialog_38841_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Four stone tablets float behind him, each engraved with intricate runes glowing with a flowing blue light, like miniature galaxies."
  },
  AvgDialog_38841_Content_17 = {
    Text = "A strand of blue light flowed from his arm to you. You looked down, and the bite on your forearm had stopped bleeding and was healing before your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_38841_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Salvador... Bishop?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38841_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Blunt teeth bite into clothing, tugging fiercely. The person, driven mad by hunger, is now gnawing on your arm with all their might."
  },
  AvgDialog_38841_Content_3 = {Text = "My Lord!"},
  AvgDialog_38841_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Seeing your movements restricted, the equally hungry people around you also turn their gaze toward you."
  },
  AvgDialog_38841_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Kill them! Otherwise, they'll keep coming. Hurry up and kill them!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38841_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Pairs of crimson eyes gaze at you, hands reaching out, followed by gaping mouths with sharp white teeth."
  },
  AvgDialog_38841_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Ogier's shout was infinitely prolonged."
  },
  AvgDialog_38841_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You hear the sound of fabric tearing."
  },
  AvgDialog_38841_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The heat strikes again, followed by a sharp sting — you know the attacker has finally sunk their teeth into your hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Our failing"
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_10 = {
    Text = "M-My Lord..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_11 = {
    Text = "So red, why is it so red? Everywhere is a deep, overwhelming red, suffocating you. You must leave this light... you must leave..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Cool, then the incense of the Church."
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Blue light illuminates part of the darkness. You snap your eyes open to see Ogier kneeling before you, a stream of black liquid trickling from the corner of his mouth."
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Exactly like during chain break training with him."
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_15 = {Text = "Ogier!"},
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Focus your mind quickly; the Silver Key trembles on your chest. After a brief silver flash, Ogier stands up again."
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Purify, <Big:Purify!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The mirror in your hand grows brighter. Just as you're about to shield your eyes, a shadow falls before you."
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_19 = {
    Text = "A gigantic tablet hovers before you. Complex runes glow faintly in blue, dimmer than before."
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The blood moon hangs high, its crimson light acting as the most potent catalyst, instantly igniting the crowd."
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You turn around, only to find that Salvador is nowhere to be seen."
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Ogier, seize that mirror."
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_22 = {
    Text = "But, my lord, you—"
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I can take care of myself. The Bishop has bought us little time, hurry up!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_24 = {Text = "Yes!"},
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Brawls escalated into brutal beatings, self-harm spiraled into suicide, and those who were already actively seeking death began ending their lives in unimaginable ways."
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The metallic scent completely overwhelmed the lingering incense. Under the red light, the splattered blood appeared as black as ink, and the people driven to madness looked monstrous, like fiends."
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_5 = {
    Text = "In this hell on earth, only Sophia's dress remains clean. She wipes the blood splattered on her face and bursts into laughter."
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Flow, let the evil within your body flow! Let the black sin pour out!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Repent, sinners! Purify your filthy souls before the stern Lamp Bearer delivers judgment!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Holding the mirror, a crimson light flickers, piercing your eyes and even penetrating through them, directly into your mind and spirit."
  },
  AvgDialog_38842_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Something keeps tightening more and more. What is it? It feels so uncomfortable, so painful... I feel like throwing up."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Purge the sin"
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
*Cough, sputter*, a puddle of liquid splattered on the ground.
The smell of blood grew even stronger.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Now she's dead... <Blue:Millie> is dead...! <Blue:Thompson> That lunatic wants me to join her in death. I... I don't want to die, Bishop, but I also..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry, I'm sorry... Forgive me, Your Grace. Only the Father can forgive me, only the Father..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_13 = {
    Text = "\"...He is willing to embrace those who have erred, as long as they sincerely repent.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_14 = {
    Text = "A faint blue light shone upwards, illuminating parts of the stained glass. The Father God on the window gazed down quietly, just as He had for centuries."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Under Salvador's hand, the young man's injuries healed rapidly, leaving behind hardly any scars."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Open your eyes, Edward, and cherish the opportunity granted to you by the Father."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
Blue light snaked over you, wiping away all pain and fatigue.
You felt lighter, brimming with unprecedented energy.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Bishop Salvador... is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The runes on the tablet pulsed rhythmically like breathing, with more blue light spreading in all directions like the roots of a giant tree. Countless instances of damage and death, weeping and wailing, were alleviated by this sudden miracle."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Bishop... Bishop Salvador..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The scent of Church incense lightly brushes past your nose, faint and subtle, almost non-existent, yet it completely masks the smell of blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_21 = {
    Text = "...Awakener."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_22 = {
    Text = "He twists suddenly, mouth open to bite your hand. Teeth and hot breath approach your arm, making your hair stand on end. You tense up, bracing for the pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Suddenly, a hand clad in a black glove covers your arm."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The cool fabric and the calming, reassuring scent of the Church's incense spread out."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
Did you heal me like this back then?
Is this... your Ability?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Salvador looks at you, his gaze still gentle and even compassionate through the white bandages."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You've saved those sinners once again."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_28 = {
    Text = "A cold voice interrupts your words. You turn around and, unsurprisingly, see Sophia's figure."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_29 = {
    Text = "You are endowed with a <Yellow:\"Blessing\">, possessing power that ordinary people do not have, yet you only indulge these sinful souls, allowing them to spread suffering."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_3 = {Text = "Edward?"},
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_30 = {
    Text = "You are the greatest sinner here, Salvador. I swear to make you face your sins."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Miss Sophia, what on earth are you talking about?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Don't you understand yet? The bishop before you, this hypocrite who abuses divine power, conceals his true identity and repeatedly rescues those wicked individuals from the brink of death."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_33 = {
    Text = "In the name of mercy, he gave them chance after chance, causing the righteous to suffer repeatedly — it can't go on like this."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_34 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Lantern> guided me, and <Yellow:Pure Silver Lantern Bearer> entrusted me with a mission, prompting me to begin the trial of light."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_35 = {
    Text = "She raised her hand, aiming a strangely shaped handheld mirror at the night sky. The sunlight turned crimson the moment it entered."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Today I will <Red:purify> the sin and welcome an innocent paradise."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_37 = {
    Text = "The sky suddenly darkened, and the sun disappeared from view. Meanwhile, a red phantom grew larger.\nIt was the moon—a massive, blood-red moon."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Darkness devoured the entire sky, and moonlight poured down, staining everything in a glaring red."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Sinners, cut open your flesh and let your sins flow out—"
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The sweet, metallic scent grew stronger with each step. Salvador had long abandoned his ordinary vision, but upon awakening again, he could see the light belonging to souls."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_40 = {
    Text = "The people who were fighting each other suddenly turned their heads and tore into their own flesh with blades and teeth."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Eliminate those who refuse to be purified!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_43 = {
    Text = "They turn to you one by one, their eyes reflecting the light of the red moon."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_5 = {
    Text = "At this moment, the soul before him floated up and down in the darkness, nearly extinguished."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Oh my goodness, Edward, help me. I'll take you to the hospital."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_7 = {
    Text = "No! I... No. This is my own doing."
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
The soul flickers again, growing even dimmer.
His time is running out.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38843_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You warned me not to thrive on others' pain, not to deceive. I should have changed, but I never listened... *cough*!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_1 = {
    Text = "A spear swept the ground, hitting the young man's calf. The youth, driven to madness, staggered and fell. You seized the opportunity to pin him down and lock his arms behind his back."
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Sophia, Sophia, I know I was wrong, Sophia. Please purify me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Love, Edward...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_12 = {
    Text = "It's me, it's me! I shouldn't have deceived your sister. I regret it, I truly regret it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_13 = {
    Text = "He crawled forward on his knees, crying and bowing awkwardly to Sophia."
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The demon has blinded my eyes and tainted my soul. Please punish me, purify me! Judgment is approaching, and I don't want to be expelled from the land of the innocent!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Calm down, Edward. What exactly are you referring to?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Please, Sophia!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Edward, stop."
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The young man, still in a bowing posture, raised his head and looked at Salvador in a daze."
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_19 = {Text = "Bishop...?"},
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Let go of me! Let me purify! Let me purify!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_20 = {
    Text = "A dazzling flash of light streaks across the edge of your vision. Before you can blink away the residual spots in your eyes, you hear Edward's voice teetering on the brink of madness."
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
No... no... you too are a <Red:sinner>, we are all sinners!
Repent and purify yourselves! Or else we will all burn in endless torment!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The young man's body wobbled and fell straight to the ground. Ogier silently put away the lance used to knock him out and turned to look at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Get him to safety before he hurts anyone else. Then call the police and let the professionals handle it."
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Everyone in the Church has left; it should be empty now."
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
Let's do it.
Hopefully, he'll be more lucid when he wakes up.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_27 = {
    Text = "He crouches down, helping you lift Edward off the ground and onto his shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Let me do it, {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_29 = {
    Text = "No worries, I'm used to taking the hits. Standing up would actually make it harder to counterattack."
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_3 = {
    Text = "What's going on?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
This... I'll leave it to you.
I'll stay here a bit longer to see if anyone needs help after being scared or hurt by Edward.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You nod and are about to turn around when a light similar to the one before flashes at the edge of your vision again."
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_32 = {Text = "?"},
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_33 = {
    Text = [[
Are you okay, %player%?
If your body doesn't feel well, I can handle it alone.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
It's nothing, probably just the light reflecting off the glass into my eyes.
Let's go.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_4 = {
    Text = "A steady voice sounds behind you, and the surrounding chatter gradually fades away until it falls silent. People automatically make way for the bishop in a black clerical robe to pass through."
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Bishop Salvador, blindfolded, walks towards you with uncanny accuracy. Sofia, her face filled with worry, follows closely behind."
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Sophia... Sophia!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The young man suddenly became agitated. With unexpected strength, he broke free from your grasp and lunged toward Sophia—"
  },
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_8 = {Text = "Caution!"},
  AvgDialog_38844_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Then suddenly knelt down."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Ogier threw his spear with great force, pinning it to the silver mirror."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Where am I? How did I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Your Excellency Bishop, is that you? What has happened to you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Please... wait..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The blue light had completely dissipated without anyone noticing."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Salvador knelt between the tablets, raising his head toward you, with two streams of bloody tears flowing beneath his white bandages."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_15 = {
    Text = "My lord, what is the matter with the bishop?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_16 = {
    Text = "It must be that the Link lacks spirit power, but such severe instability... I've never seen it before."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_17 = {
    Text = "My Link... was... the former bishop here... I can't... overextend him..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Pale Messenger... please... please..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
He trembled as he raised his hand, gently placing it on your shoulder.
But you could barely feel its weight anymore.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Fragments of the silver mirror fell like stars, and with them, the crimson moon, riddled with cracks, shattered completely."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_20 = {
    Text = "He is fading quickly, unless —"
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You held Salvador's hand and closed your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
Darkness.
Darkness is so peaceful, like an embrace, like a deep slumber.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Scattered light points emerged in your mind: the panicked citizens around, the determined Ogier, and the weak bishop emitting a faint, nearly invisible blue light."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You approach it and hear muffled voices."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_25 = {
    Text = "My family has always been dedicated to eliminating suffering and spreading the blessings of the Father. How did it come to this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Shut up! How dare you slander my father like that! He is not that kind of person! Not at all!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Your Excellency Bishop, why is the world always filled with suffering?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_28 = {
    Text = "If there were no sinners in the world... would people like my sister, my mother, and the children in the orphanage no longer suffer at the hands of others?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Is it possible to escape suffering and live happily ever after?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The monster lets out a mournful scream and collapses with a thud. Its massive body quickly dissolves into a pool of dark blood, leaving only a human-like figure crawling on the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_30 = {
    Text = "This is my responsibility."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
Salvador's figure appeared beside you.
Memories shifted before you; he seemed to have no expression, but you could sense a hint of sorrow.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I've always known that she harbored resentment in her heart. I thought she would let it go, but instead, she allowed it to grow."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_33 = {
    Text = [[
He said you saved him that day, Bishop Salvador. Is that true? But why?
He has done so many terrible things and deceived so many people. Why did you help him?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
Second chance? Who can give my family a second chance? Who can give my sister and mother a second chance?
They are dead, Bishop Salvador. They have returned to the Father's embrace, leaving only me...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Only I remain..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Father God, have mercy and grant me another chance at life. I should have done better, but now I am repeating my mistakes."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Those thieves, gamblers, and addicts do not come to you seeking forgiveness or a second chance, but for self-comfort! An excuse to continue doing wrong!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
The sinner shows no remorse and will never repent. Endless tolerance only disheartens the righteous and emboldens the wicked.
If this continues, you won't be able to save anyone.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
I forgive them and offer them solace, just as I forgive everyone and offer solace to all.
Everyone is blessed with the Father's love, and everyone has the ability to stray and return to the right path.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
The blood moon fades, and sunlight once again shines upon the ground, illuminating the person lying in a pool of blood.
Sophia stares blankly at the sky, still murmuring.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Suffering is what the All-Father does not wish to see, what He hopes to resolve, and what I, as His emissary, must dispel it."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_41 = {
    Text = "The suffering I caused must be atoned for by myself."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_42 = {
    Text = "He reached out and gently brushed. The yellowed memories rippled away like water, then gathered into points of light symbolizing his Spirit."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_43 = {
    Text = "He turns to you and presents the glowing light in his hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_44 = {
    Text = [[
Please help me, Pale Messenger.
Relieve them of their suffering so they can peacefully complete their journey.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Accept the Light Point"
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_46 = {
    Text = "A blue light sways like a spider's thread before you, one end linked to an aged but gentle Spirit, the other end delving into the light point before you."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_47 = {
    Text = "You carefully cut the thin thread and dye it with your own color."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_48 = {
    Text = "White follows the silk thread inward, inward, as light spots appear, gradually dispelling the darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_49 = {Text = "Thank you."},
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
<Yellow:Eve>... I have failed you, failed the <Yellow:Lightbearer>...
I couldn't purify them, couldn't cleanse their sins...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Bearer of the light... You, shaped from pure silver... I implore you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_7 = {
    Text = "She took a breath in, and then never exhaled again."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The square is in disarray—people wounded by monsters lie on the ground; many have lost their lives, while others moan in agony, unable to comprehend why they have ended up like this."
  },
  AvgDialog_38845_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ugh... My head hurts..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_1 = {
    Text = "White hope ignited"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Those who had lost consciousness and even stopped breathing slowly opened their eyes in the breeze."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Please erase their pain and soothe their hearts."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_12 = {
    Text = "People's gazes become vacant, their bodies relax further. Panic and fear disappear completely, replaced by a sense of calm and tranquility."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_13 = {
    Text = "End their suffering and grant them blessings."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The tide-like light surged outward, and everyone closed their eyes, as if immersed in tranquility."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The bright moon overlooks everything as always; only the chaotic square serves as proof of the madness that just occurred."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The tablet softly clicked and dissolved into the unseen shadows of the night. Salvador adjusted his clothing and walked to Sofia's side."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_17 = {
    Text = "...You shouldn't have saved me."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_18 = {
    Text = "\"All who find their way back can return to my embrace.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
"Because you are all my children, and I love you all."
But you are wrong, Bishop, and so is the "Holy Scripture"]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The tablet rises once more."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Some people never change."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_21 = {
    Text = "What brings you here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Sophia, I—"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Shut up! Isn't it enough that you caused the deaths of my sister and mother? Do you now come to their graves to gloat?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_24 = {
    Text = "I'm here to apologize. I didn't expect..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Sophia laughed sharply."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
Did you apologize to <Blue:Thompson> like this after causing the death of his only relative and <Blue:Millie>?
You disgust me, Edward Bailey.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_27 = {
    Text = "I truly regret it, Sophia. I know I can't earn your forgiveness—"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_28 = {
    Text = "If you truly regret it, you shouldn't have gone to see Bishop Salvador on the day Thompson killed you."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
Yes, I know how you survived, you coward. <Yellow:Lamp> told me.
Giving you the "<Yellow:Bless>" was the bishop's dumbest decision. You should die, Bailey, die in agony.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_30 = {
    Text = "I didn't want this either. I tried to control myself, I really did! After the bishop saved me, I reported to the Church every day and volunteered at your charity weekly. Do you remember?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_31 = {
    Text = "I want to be better, I really do. It was that Aglo guy—he said it was a foolproof deal and asked me to introduce a guarantor. I'm a victim too!"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Even now, you're still evading responsibility. Even now... you haven't truly repented."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_33 = {
    Text = "She took a silver object from the inner pocket of her dress. Its smooth surface glinted faintly in the sunlight, turning the reflected light into an ominous red."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_34 = {Text = "Sophia...?"},
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_35 = {Text = "Repent."},
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
Follow the teachings of the righteous lamp-bearer, and purify the sins within your soul.
Only then can you attain forgiveness.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_37 = {
    Text = "What are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_38 = {
    Text = "I... I'm Edward..."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
The mirror flashed, and the kneeling young man's eyes grew dazed once more.
Trembling, he raised the stick in his hand and struck himself hard.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Salvador raised his hand, and blood flowed continuously from his body and surroundings towards the tablet."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_40 = {
    Text = "I'll ask once more: What are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_41 = {
    Text = "I am a sinner."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_42 = {
    Text = "What sin have you committed?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_43 = {
    Text = "I am greedy, I indulge in desire, I allow evil to taint my soul, and then inflict pain upon the innocent."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_44 = {
    Text = "What should you do?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_45 = {
    Text = [[
I must repent to those I have wronged, and to the gods.
I must endure the whip, bleed until the black sin flows out, in order to achieve <Red:purification>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Judgment Day is approaching. Only pure souls may enter the Innocent Haven."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_47 = {
    Text = "<Red:May the lantern remain lit>."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_48 = {
    Text = [[
Sinners won't change. As long as they exist, suffering will never disappear.
Only by removing them all can the world attain peace.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_49 = {
    Text = "...The Father's Relic always holds His light. Everyone can be misled, but also rediscover His light."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Blue light flows along the lines once more, pulsing with a rhythm akin to breathing."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_50 = {
    Text = "We cannot deprive someone of their whole life because of a single moment's action."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_51 = {
    Text = "You say that, but have you ever considered those harmed by them? For every Edward who finds the light, how many Millies must be sacrificed? How many Olivias?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Sin is sin, and wrong is wrong. Once committed, there is no turning back."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_53 = {
    Text = "She looks at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_54 = {
    Text = [[
Take me away, throw me to your corrupt laws. But remember, the day of judgment will arrive.
On that day, you will all be banished from the land of the innocent.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_55 = {
    Text = "The special items have been secured, Keeper. The affected civilians have been sent to major hospitals and will be discharged after check-ups."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_56 = {
    Text = "The official statement is that this was a mass hallucination event caused by a toxic gas leak at the factory. The city government will issue a public apology tomorrow and take disciplinary actions against the responsible individuals."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_57 = {
    Text = "I understand. Thank you for your hard work."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_58 = {
    Text = "This is what we should do."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_59 = {
    Text = "The young man in uniform hesitated for a moment and then said:"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Father of Creation, merciful Creator, please hear my prayer."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_60 = {
    Text = "How did you manage to do that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_61 = {Text = "What?"},
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_62 = {
    Text = "The situation was chaotic, yet with just yourself and an Awakener, you limited the casualties to around a dozen—almost a miracle."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_63 = {
    Text = "You and Ogier exchange a quick glance. The young knight coughs lightly with his hands behind his back."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_64 = {
    Text = "This is probably the unspoken understanding between my lord and me."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_65 = {
    Text = [[
Regardless, I extend my gratitude to you on behalf of the First Response Team of the Committee. 
In the midst of the crisis, you didn't abandon our people, allowing them to return home safely. Moreover...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_66 = {
    Text = [[
Many of us grew up here; the Church District means a lot to us.
Thank you for everything you've done.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_67 = {
    Text = "That's what we should do."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_68 = {
    Text = "There is never too much gratitude."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Miss Sophia... What will become of her next?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Moist blue roots extend from the tablet, penetrating the dense crowd. A cool breeze disperses the lingering scent of blood, leaving behind a faint fragrance."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Interrogate her. We will pass judgment on her after finding out where the special item came from."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_71 = {
    Text = "The heretical ritual caused widespread chaos and numerous casualties... The bishop hopes she will not be sentenced to death, but I am not optimistic."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Bishop Salvador."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Are you leaving?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Yes, thank you for your help with this event."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_75 = {
    Text = "This all started because of me, and you even kept my identity a secret. I should be the one thanking you."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Are you really not coming back with us?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Don't worry about the parish. As long as the conditions are right, we allow Awakeners to act freely."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Thank you for your kindness, but, I would rather stay here."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Salvador turned to the altar, revealing a gentle smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The people who were standing slowly sat down."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_80 = {
    Text = [[
Father God revived me here, probably hoping I could help more people.
If you need, <Yellow:The Pale Fire>, come to me anytime. I will give my all to you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_81 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry, but... What exactly are the <Yellow:Pale Messenger> and the <Yellow:Pale Fire>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_82 = {
    Text = "It is the prophecy of the Father God in <Yellow:\"The Holy Scripture\">"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Boundless darkness will descend upon the world, the soul that is pale and warm is the emissary of hope, {Male=he,Female=she} will ignite the white flame to illuminate the path forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_84 = {
    Text = "It might not be me, right? There are so many people in the world."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_85 = {
    Text = [[
Even though my eyes are covered, I cannot mistake the brilliance of a soul.
Yours is so warm and bright. In all these years, I have never seen another like it.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_86 = {
    Text = "[See how the main line is designed here, see if it's necessary to mention lantern-related information]"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_87 = {
    Text = "The young Keeper turned and walked away, and Salvador watched the glimmer, whispering a prayer as the door swung."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_88 = {
    Text = "May you illuminate the darkness with faint hope."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_89 = {
    Text = [[
<Yellow:Londinium Church District Anomaly Report>

A.F. 315 @2@3, Londinium Cathedral District, a sudden riot erupts in front of the Church of Father's Eternal Blessings square. The crowd exhibits severe violent behavior and self-harm, unable to communicate normally.
...
Abnormal behavior intensifies after an unknown light source flickers, evolving into widespread cannibalistic behavior. Upon investigation, the unknown light source is identified to be a hand mirror made of mirrored silver. The mirror absorbs energy via sunlight and moonlight, individuals exposed to the mirror's reflection will be driven by their strongest inner desires, including but not limited to violence, gluttony, and somnolence, leading to extreme actions.
This mirror was retrieved by Keeper %player% and the Awakener Ogier, initially determined to contain components of Silver or similar to it. For details, refer to the research report issued by the Special Equipment Research Department of Mythag University.
...
During the interrogation by the Mystia Treaty Committee, <Blue:Sophia Chatzan> admitted that she joined the Church of the Lightbearers three years ago and obtained the ritual mirror from the church leader, Lantern (i.e., <Yellow:Yves> lady) during the last church activity.
When agents inquired further, Sophia Chatzan lowered her voice to pray, offering no further responses.
...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Those sitting there, mouths agape, stared blankly at the miraculous scene before them"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_90 = {
    Text = "The setting sun dispelled the lingering haze in the sky. The church bell tolled, and the ship's whistle sounded at the riverside dock."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_91 = {
    Text = "On the rooftop of a tall building, a cloaked figure stands alone with their back to the sun."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_92 = {
    Text = [[
Even after sacrificing the mutated sinners, no <Red:Stigmata> appeared.
It seems the value of <Yellow:that mirror> is just that.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Grant forgiveness to the sinner, bestow upon them \"The blessing\"... You really haven't changed at all, Bishop Salvador."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_94 = {
    Text = "The pyre cannot change you, nor can resurrection. When will you finally see reality? Perhaps—"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_95 = {
    Text = "She extended her hand into the air, as if touching something invisible."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_96 = {
    Text = "The <Yellow:Keeper> with a pale yet warm soul foretold can introduce more variables. Do you think {Male=he,Female=she} would be willing to join us?"
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_97 = {
    Text = "A giant hound emerged from the shadows beside the woman, its twisted limbs somewhat resembling the mutated Sophia. It snorted in response to the woman's words."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_98 = {
    Text = "Well, tomorrow is always a new day."
  },
  AvgDialog_38846_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Let's go, dear. If we get the chance, we'll meet them again."
  },
  AvgDialog_43774_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Soon enough, patches of lush green poked up behind the relentless dunes."
  },
  AvgDialog_43774_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The dry season spared no mercy, making the title \"Oasis\" a charitable indulgence for this faint rivulet—yet it sufficed to replenish your water pouches."
  },
  AvgDialog_43774_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I'll handle the water. %player%, watch over Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_43774_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Keeper guards Ramona, I guard the Keeper.
Because this oasis ain't just for wandering strangers...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43774_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Got \"natives\" too, don't we?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_1 = {Text = "Oasis"},
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_10 = {
    Text = "That Lady Daffodil... her style's not exactly something I'd endorse."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Alistair's readings show the Black Pool has been unstable since this year's Keybestowal Ceremony."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_12 = {
    Text = "It might mean Tawil's stability is returning. I'd suggest ramping up monitoring..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_13 = {Text = "Hold on."},
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Got a suggestion, Professor Doll?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I'd suggest you humans tune up your senses to avoid spilling Mythag secrets when outsiders are eavesdropping."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Doll's nudge brought a subtle violet scent drifting in as an elegant woman rose smoothly from the guest sofa."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_17 = {
    Text = "No need to panic—the Gray Mist Sea provided me with the Black Pool's readings days before you poked your gadgets in."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_18 = {
    Text = "But let's skip the small talk. I'm dropping by with critical intelligence from another outfit, a special delivery for Mr. William here."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_19 = {
    Text = "All about the Aeon of Desire—the <Yellow:\"Mother Tree.\">"
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_2 = {
    Text = "I, too, once slumbered, but now I am awake.\nThe beasts of the desert shall drink from the ▼▼ river, they shall rest upon its banks, for no one shall make them afraid."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_20 = {
    Text = "So, for a handful of chit-chat from \"Lady Daffodil,\" we're stranded in this godforsaken desert stuck in the stone age."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Mythag's top dogs gamble as hard as I do."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Weeks of this sandblasting, and my favorite coat's fraying to bits. Any chance for a clothing upgrade budget?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_23 = {
    Text = "If you're really buying a new coat and not dumping it on some backroom bets, go ahead, Mr. Ryker."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_24 = {
    Text = "One night at the tables nets me a fresh coat plus startup cash for the next game. Win-win, yeah?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_25 = {
    Text = "William cleared his throat, nipping the idle chatter."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Tawil the <Yellow:Aeon of Sagacity> is sleeping in Mythag's Black Pool. The <Yellow:Aeon of Rapture> roams the world in disguises. But the <Yellow:Aeon of Desire>'s whereabouts has always remained a mystery."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Daffodil's intelligence confirms the Mother Tree site was sealed by the <Yellow:Storm Wall> in A.F. 225. It's been ninety years since anyone last accessed the area."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_28 = {
    Text = "The Aramites are preparing a huge sacrifice to taint the Mother Tree and kick off a worldwide Dissolution wave."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Your mission objective is simple: follow the local nomadic Aramites and neutralize the ritual's core, the Mother Tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Two weeks ago, Operation Remouahe"
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Yeah, yeah. But forget the grand speeches—handling the crap at hand is priority one, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Look at the lass—she's white as a sheet from dehydration. If we don't find water pronto, we're all toast from thirst."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Quit exaggerating, I'm fine!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Come on, lass. We've all just polished off our stashes, but you haven't hit your pouch since yesterday, have you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_34 = {
    Text = "What's sloshing in there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_35 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_36 = {
    Text = "You grabbed Ramona's pouch—it was hefty, with dark shapes swirling inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Ryker tipped it up, and thick black goo spilled out."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_38 = {Text = "D-Slime."},
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Ramona, when did your pouch..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_4 = {
    Text = "This was supposed to be the <Yellow:Mother Tree>—nobody mentioned these things!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_40 = {
    Text = "A couple days back.\nI kept an eye on it—it looks like only mine was hit."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_41 = {
    Text = "From mixing it up close with those freaks?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
We'll worry about the why later. Refill's urgent now.
Ryker?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_43 = {
    Text = [[
Sure, sure. But luck's not for scavenger hunts, you get me?
If I'd known this gig was the reason you hauled me out, I'd have played sick...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Ryker griped, sniffing the hot air for traces of moisture."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Westward bound—water must be that way, no doubt."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Ramona drove her blade through the beast rushing her. Its tentacles spasmed briefly, then slumped onto the dune. The mangled limbs dissolved into the grit, sinking beneath the shifting waves in seconds."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_7 = {
    Text = "After all, the so-called Mother Tree legend has only vague records in Mythag's library."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Most of the Remouahe Kingdom is still uncharted in human history—except for the Aramites appearing in markets now and then, nobody knows what's hiding in those sandstorms."
  },
  AvgDialog_43775_Content_9 = {
    Text = "But Mr. Alistair confirmed the Mother Tree intel from Lady Daffodil."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_1 = {Text = "Heads up!"},
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The thing let out a nightmarish wail, its slime-slick limbs thrashing feebly before it spasmed and crumbled away."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_11 = {
    Text = "A camel train topped the far dune; the hound barked happily, bolting to the woman leading it."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Good boy, good boy."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Yes, I get it all. You did great—you'll earn that treat you deserve."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_14 = {
    Text = "She swung off her camel, meeting your gaze head-on."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Your gear screams outsiders. You look beat; must've roughed it through Remouahe."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Sipping from the Aram Holy River? That's kismet. Care for some hospitality at our camp?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
Meanwhile
Mythag's Subterranean Black Pool]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Free intel just isn't your style, and you don't front tabs. If Mythag didn't pay for it, someone did."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Who's pulling strings to get Mythag's Keeper into that desert?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_20 = {
    Text = "It seems there's no use trying to leverage a falsehood with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Too bad, the deal is ancient history now. I can't picture the buyer's face anymore."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_22 = {Text = "...I see."},
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
Remouahe
Holy River]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_24 = {
    Text = "So, Julie, the ley lines in Remouahe woke you up? Dreams called you to lead the Aramites?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Sounds straight-up legendary!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I dismissed it initially, of course, but the dreams persisted—night after night. A whole people waiting out there... as a Divine Envoy, how could I turn my back?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Lucky you heeded the call, or we'd still be flailing around like idiots forever!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_28 = {
    Text = "It is the Aramite's honor to host distinguished guests like you, Mr. Ryker."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_29 = {
    Text = "You prop Ramona on the camel; ahead, Juliette and Ryker's chuckles and whistles float back."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Ramona wobbled, her rapier barely blocking the monster's slashing claws."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Despite the other Aramites urging her to ride, Juliette insists on walking, giving up her ride for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Isn't that too much for a ruse?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Somebody's gotta cozy up to the locals in your crew."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Alas, Mr. Ryker's got card skills and a charm to match mine."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
I hope your lordship isn't mangling the word "match."
I still recall your pout after Ryker cleaned you out at poker that night.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_35 = {
    Text = "As Londinium's top table shark, a rare loss calls for a bit of moping—totally fair."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_36 = {
    Text = "You blew every cent and skipped breakfast the next day."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Squabbling isn't for patients—rest up."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Ramona's rasp echoes in your hold, her unnatural fever pulsing through with each bump."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_39 = {
    Text = "The heat comes weirdly quick; a bad feeling hits your nerve."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Behind you—"
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Check that out."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Restless beats thrum in the sandy gusts, dust choking your breaths with eerie tightness."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Camel bells toll far and lingering; heat twists the sunset into warps. The horizon's rim sprouts tent dots like hazy illusions."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_43 = {
    Text = "After weeks of slogging, you finally find the target of this investigation—Aram."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Aramite camp's up ahead. To play it safe, I'll peel off solo."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Perfect timing—I've got a lead I want to chase..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ramona couldn't spin fast enough. A beast burst from the sand, its tentacles fusing into a spear, hurtling down at her spine—"
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_6 = {Text = "Clang—"},
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_7 = {
    Text = "A hulking hound leaped from the flank, slamming the creature down."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The blindsided monster shot out bloody feelers, ready to choke the dog mid-bite."
  },
  AvgDialog_43776_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ramona tumbled back, jabbing her rapier straight into its eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree serves as the earthly Proxy for one of the <Yellow:three Aeons>—<Yellow:Tifere Yesod, the Aeon of Desire>."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Studying these remains could prove pivotal in deciphering the Dissolution Phenomenon."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Now, let the opening rite commence."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Shall we call some students in for assistance?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_14 = {
    Text = "No need. It's merely a matter of opening the lid."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Word has it that youngsters from the Elke Kingdom grapple with bears from childhood. Our acting dean Czort must also possess formidable prowess, no doubt."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Czort advances, inhales deeply, braces her frame, and unleashes her full might in a heaving thrust—"
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The lid holds fast."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
Acting like you're still in your heyday?
When's the last time you even stepped into the training hall?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Aww, but the acting dean's workload is relentless. I'm sure Ms. Czort would've loved to train more."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_2 = {Text = "Thais"},
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I'll give it a try."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Your eyes roam the coffin's expanse: the flaking black-and-gold veneer, the elaborate etchings encircling its form, the radiant jewels studding each corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You press against the lid, but it yields nothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Gritting your teeth, you pierce your fingertip with a sharp bite, and—braving the sting—trace a bloody streak across the wood."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_24 = {
    Text = "A thunderous rumble echoes as the coffin slowly yields."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_25 = {
    Text = "What slumbers inside was once a mummy..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Now reduced to faded linen scraps, tangled bandages, and a seething pool of inky sludge."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Dispatch the wood and fabric to the lab for compositional breakdown."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Dating analysis might reveal the mummy's identity."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_29 = {
    Text = "That's unnecessary."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_3 = {
    Text = "One week after Operation Remouahe"
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_30 = {
    Text = "I know who she is."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Your fingers brush the inscribed runes lining the coffin's interior, their ridges forming a name seared into your memory."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_32 = {Text = "Thais."},
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_33 = {
    Text = "May she rest in peace at last."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The ornate coffin rests in the subterranean depths of Mythag. Its black-and-gold lacquer evokes ancient origins and the shadowed history you're about to uncover."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_5 = {
    Text = "It lies in solemn grandeur, whispering of a lost civilization's vanished splendor and the epic saga you've lived through."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_6 = {
    Text = "We're looking at the spoils claimed by %player% during Operation Remouahe."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The Aramite nomads call what lies within the \"Remains of the Mother Tree.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Your eyes linger on the intricate carving at the coffin's heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_43777_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The tree emblem is carved into the lid's enigmatic surface. Its branches sprawl abundantly, and its roots coil like serpents, casting faint, elusive gleams in somber tones."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Oh, right—Ryker, a moment please."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Well, well—what a clever trick."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_100 = {
    Text = [[
Ah, I see!
So you're just a visitor to Remouahe!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_101 = {
    Text = "Remouahe's long overdue for fresh faces!\nI'll have everyone prepare the grandest bonfire feast—you must have the time of your life!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_102 = {Text = "A feast?"},
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_103 = {
    Text = "That's right! Aramites may lack worldly knowledge, but our hearts are wide open."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_104 = {
    Text = "Survive the feast, and you're one of us!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_105 = {
    Text = "As family, no punishment for you so long as you swear not to spill what you've seen in this tent."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_106 = {
    Text = "Savor Aramite hospitality at the feast!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_11 = {
    Text = "No sooner do you reach the camp than a crowd of Aramites in traditional garb swarms Juliette's camel train."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Miss Juliette's back—bring out the prepared offerings!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Miss Juliette brought guests?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Miss Juliette, we spotted a Nubian cluster eight hundred meters south—there are about thirty of them!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Got it. I'll handle them one by one. Is Alva in the Queen's tent?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The chieftain took a squad to scout the Nubia."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Understood. I'll escort our guests to rest first. Please wait for me in the chieftain's tent."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The Aramites scatter in a flurry as Juliette tugs the reins, turning toward you."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_19 = {
    Text = "As you can see, Aram affairs keep us busy. As the envoy, I handle some of the odd jobs for them now and then."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_2 = {Text = "Yeah?"},
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_20 = {
    Text = "That said, staying the night requires the Queen's and chieftain's approval. Feel free to rest in my tent or talk with the Aramites."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_21 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_22 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Let's pool what we know."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_24 = {
    Text = "According to Juliette, the <Yellow:Mother Tree> withered long before the <Yellow:Storm Wall> appeared."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_25 = {
    Text = "With the Mother Tree's decline, the Holy River's tributaries are drying up, desertification worsening—no way for villages to survive here now."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_26 = {
    Text = "This squad carries the Mother Tree's remains, seeking a way through the Storm Wall to revive it."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Those monsters—Nubia, are a recent plague in Remouahe."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Aramite society is pretty primitive; Juliette, the Awakener who crushed Nubia attacks, is seen as a divine envoy with godly power."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Hold up—someone's coming."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Before we enter the settlement, we should address your... presentation."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Resting well, everyone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_31 = {
    Text = "If you're ready, one of you shall meet the Queen as a representative."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_32 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_33 = {
    Text = "As dusk deepens, the sunset bleeds crimson across the sky. Desert hawks wheel once more, their final cry echoing before they settle into barren branches."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Under Juliette's guidance, you arrive before a tent of singular design."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_35 = {
    Text = "This is the Queen's tent. By Aramite custom, all honored guests must earn the chieftain's permission under the Queen's witness."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Please wait here for the chieftain—I have matters to attend to."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Remember: do not enter."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Offending the Queen is beyond my ability to fix."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_39 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Keep this sachet of incense on you at all times—tucked in your tie, dangling from your cane, or even behind your ear, whatever you like."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_40 = {
    Text = "A breeze stirs the flap, glimpses of the interior flickering through the gap."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_41 = {
    Text = "An inexplicable thirst rises in your throat, urging you to peer within."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Somehow, a whisper in the ether insists: this tent harbors all you seek on this journey. Lift the curtain, and answers await."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_43 = {
    Text = "The winds howl lonely, carrying grains of sand. No one watches."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Enter the tent"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Peek inside the tent"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_46 = {Text = "Do nothing"},
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_47 = {
    Text = "You know little of Aramite ways; miss this chance, and who knows when you'll approach this tent again."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_48 = {
    Text = "No half-measures—you slip the flap aside unseen and step within."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Just a quick look—if caught, you can talk your way out.\nTelling yourself that, you lift the curtain for a furtive glance."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ryker takes the small incense pouch and tucks it into his left glove."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_50 = {
    Text = "A wave of vertigo crashes over you; seconds pass before the world sharpens."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_51 = {
    Text = [[
You know next to nothing about the Aramites yet.
To play it safe, better do nothing.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_52 = {
    Text = [[
Like pearls tumbling, a laughter both teasing and inviting drifts from behind.
From beneath the tent flap extends a swath of pristine, silken veil.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_53 = {
    Text = "A wave of vertigo crashes over you; seconds pass before the world sharpens."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Your vision clears on the tent's interior: at its center rests a coffin."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_55 = {
    Text = "An inexplicable compulsion makes you walk towards it. When you come back to your senses, your fingers are already brushing the gem-encrusted golden edges."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_56 = {
    Text = "<Gray:This is—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_57 = {
    Text = "You plunge into the tree's vision."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_58 = {
    Text = "A seed burrows into rich black soil, its frail roots shattering their husk to breach the earth."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Countless tendrils erupt as writhing tentacles, clawing skyward along invisible rungs, quivering leaves howling in feral rage."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_6 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Swollen tree knots rupture in gouts of black pus, splattering into the crystal river like shattered floes."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_61 = {Text = "Boom!"},
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_62 = {
    Text = "The tree topples in thunder, a rotten log drifting downstream—its shape eerily coffin-like..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_63 = {
    Text = "...So this is... the remains of the Mother Tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Your mission objective is simple: follow the local nomadic Aramites and neutralize the ritual's core, the Mother Tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_65 = {
    Text = "According to Juliette, the Mother Tree withered long before the Storm Wall appeared."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_66 = {
    Text = "This squad carries the Mother Tree's remains, seeking a way through the Storm Wall to revive it."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_67 = {
    Text = "In other words, charge in and torch the Mother Tree's remains in that coffin, and your mission would be accomplished."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_68 = {
    Text = "But escaping the Aramites afterward? Will there even be time to plan?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Your heart hammers, affirmation and doubt twisting into knotted coils."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Ramona, what's wrong?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_70 = {
    Text = "A chant rises like prayer—"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Death draws near. Dissolution dawns."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_72 = {
    Text = "The mother's remains vanish, blood and seed wander the earth, devoured by newborn beasts."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Skies and gods cloak in gloom, until the foreign envoy arrives."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_74 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree revives the Holy River, crowning the departed. Her bloodline will return to Aram."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Why are your eyes clouded by darkness?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_76 = {
    Text = "And who is singing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Traveler from afar..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_78 = {
    Text = "A chuckle shatters your reverie. You look up: atop the coffin stands a woman's silhouette, arrived unbidden."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_79 = {
    Text = "She smiles with mirthful eyes, her hands lifting her skirts like a bride curtsying, bending to regard you."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Look at Ryker's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_80 = {
    Text = "I am Thais, Queen of Aram. Traveler from afar, have you brought a tribute?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_81 = {
    Text = "She leaps down, sauntering to your side, her sly gaze circling you."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_82 = {
    Text = "What surprise do you offer me, {Male=lad,Female=lass}?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_83 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Juliette chose you to meet me under the Queen's watch—you must be highly regarded."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Didn't she warn you about the penalties for disturbing the Queen?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_86 = {
    Text = "The tent flap parts as a stern-faced Aramite woman in her mid-thirties strides in."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Thais scrambles back atop the coffin, assuming a regal poise like a haughty sovereign on her throne."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Oh, our esteemed guest..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_89 = {
    Text = "The intruder's crisp voice cuts her affected tone short."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_9 = {
    Text = "L-Lord Dexter!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Alva, Chieftain of Aram."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Juliette briefed me on your background."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_92 = {
    Text = "But she skipped the crucial bit—young one, what is your purpose in Remouahe?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_93 = {
    Text = "The sudden query jolts you; instinct takes the wheel—"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Conducting scientific survey"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Sightseeing"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_96 = {
    Text = "...No other motives?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Her piercing stare bores into yours, as if peeling away the lie."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_98 = {
    Text = "You steady your nerves, masking unease to field her probe."
  },
  AvgDialog_43788_Content_99 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_43789_Content_1 = {Text = "Settlement"},
  AvgDialog_43789_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A swift horse gallops from the tents, reining up sharply before Juliette."
  },
  AvgDialog_43789_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I'm afraid there's urgent business, everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_43789_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Those monsters we just fended off—the locals call them Nubia—a whole contingent is eyeing the camp right now."
  },
  AvgDialog_43789_Content_5 = {
    Text = "For the camp's safety, I need to clear them out."
  },
  AvgDialog_43789_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Mind if we tag along?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43789_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I would hate to impose on you all."
  },
  AvgDialog_43789_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Julie, your problems are our problems. Don't you fret about it! A few Nubia are hardly a wager."
  },
  AvgDialog_43802_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Where are we..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43802_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
The Mother Tree's sea of consciousness.
Trace back from its coffin, and here we are.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43802_Content_3 = {
    Text = "This child... He got too close to the Mother Tree's root, adrift from our world. He can't fit in anymore."
  },
  AvgDialog_43802_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Silver slurry surges, drawing you toward distant shores."
  },
  AvgDialog_43802_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Do you hear the sounds?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43802_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Drips of water. Silver Cores humming in resonance."
  },
  AvgDialog_43802_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Listen closer."
  },
  AvgDialog_43802_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You hear various cries of life: a newborn's wail, an elder's final tear before death..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43802_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Those tears morph in seconds to triangular voids of Dissolution growths, erupting toward you with ferocious speed and fury."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_1 = {Text = "Feast"},
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You should be resting."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_100 = {
    Text = "A tolling bell resounds from nowhere; clarity crashes in."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_101 = {
    Text = [[
Overwhelming terror floods you as you wrench free from Thais's grasp.
Turning, you find her still gazing at you with fevered hunger.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_102 = {
    Text = "Ramona bolts upright, her icy stare locking on Thais's ardor."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_103 = {
    Text = "<Change>{Male=He,Female=She} is not your subject."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_104 = {
    Text = "<Change>You cannot force {Male=him,Female=her}..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_105 = {
    Text = "<Change>Shu...-Ni...urath..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_106 = {
    Text = [[
Though channeled through Ramona's throat, you know instinctively: this tongue is by no means hers.
It belongs to the Higher Being lodged within her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_107 = {
    Text = [[
Fine, you're such a spoilsport.
What a shame, to let a beautiful sapling go to waste...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_108 = {
    Text = "Thais releases your arm with lingering reluctance, departing the tent amid a teasing murmur."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_109 = {
    Text = [[
We shall meet again.
Next time, don't pull away.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_11 = {
    Text = "No—for some reason, a voice keeps telling me this investigation... it has to be me."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Ramona's tone brooks no argument, and you shared the same suspicion; logic and sentiment alike forestall any rebuttal."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Where's Ryker?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
He's out front, thick as thieves with those Aramites.
Thanks to him, we've at least pieced together their situation.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_15 = {
    Text = "As we know, the Mother Tree vanished overnight years ago. Soon after, the Storm Wall veiled its ruins—the Holy River's source."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Not long ago, Juliette arrived as the envoy of legend. Guided by dreams, she scattered Nubia swarms for the Aramites, drawing near the Storm Wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Yet they failed to breach it."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_18 = {
    Text = "All this lives on in the Aramites' traditional songs."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Ramona's pallor deepens with every word."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Bonfire feast?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Let Doll explain the lyrics."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
I'm not reciting that drivel.
For stable recitation, there's a better specialist.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Erica, at your service—"
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Death draws near. Dissolution dawns."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_24 = {Text = "Wait—"},
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Erica presses on, deaf to your command, her voice a mechanical drone."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The mother's remains vanish, blood and seed wander the earth, devoured by newborn beasts."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Skies and gods cloak in gloom, until the foreign envoy arrives."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Envoy—descends—creak—descends—creak—hee hee, envoy—"
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The shrill, emotionless timbre echoes unnaturally through the tent."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Juliette's face clouds with hesitation."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_30 = {Text = "Hold on."},
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_31 = {
    Text = "An alarm blares, followed by rustling pages, twisting screws, clanging metal."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Apologies. I just checked Erica's diagnostics, but there is no fault source yet."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Never mind. The song's last line... I'll handle it."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_34 = {
    Text = "...The Mother Tree revives the Holy River, crowning the departed. Her bloodline will return to Aram."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_35 = {
    Text = "From an efficiency standpoint, mentioning you had heard it before sooner would've saved us time."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_36 = {
    Text = "What did you see in the Queen's tent?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Before you can reply, fervent calls ring from outside."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Honored guests, the feast awaits!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_39 = {
    Text = "You pause, then lean to Ramona's ear, whispering the vital truth."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_4 = {
    Text = "As I mentioned earlier, Aramites, being a primitive tribe, hold many \"unique\" traditions that outsiders might struggle to understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_40 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree's remains lie in the Queen's tent."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_41 = {
    Text = "With your charm and wit, you'd even win over Chieftain Alva!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_42 = {
    Text = "You're too kind—I heard the real storyteller here is Miss Juliette."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_43 = {
    Text = "You mean the envoy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Her tales might not top your \"Final Wager\" yarn, but chatting with her feels like a spring breeze."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_45 = {
    Text = "And that \"Inverted Pupilless Eye\"... it stirs something profound, straight from the soul..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Oh? Talking about me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Medinet's raving about your gift for stories."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Mind if I join?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_49 = {
    Text = "The pleasure is all mine, my lady."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The bonfire feast stands as the prime example."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Nubia raids have been ramping up lately. We should do the bonfire rite."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_51 = {
    Text = [[
Don't mope! New guests are a good omen.
Here, down a few!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_52 = {
    Text = [[
You too, honored guest! Have some more!
Enjoy the feast; we'll offer you the finest we have!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_53 = {Text = "Cheers!"},
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_54 = {
    Text = "I don't drink..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_55 = {
    Text = "You raise your cup, clinking with the boisterous Aramites."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_56 = {
    Text = "When their guard slips, you tip the contents discreetly away."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_57 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree's remains rest mere paces from the revelry. This is hardly the moment for indulgence."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_58 = {
    Text = "What a shame! Only a rite with spirits hits perfection!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_59 = {
    Text = "No matter how they urge you to try their drink, you politely decline."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The details... you will find out tonight."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_60 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree's remains rest mere paces from the revelry. This is hardly the moment for indulgence."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_61 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_62 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_63 = {
    Text = "As the Aramites' spirits rise, the feast surges to frenzy."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Warriors hoist Aramite women aloft like palanquins, parading through the throng."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Hazy-eyed women pluck glistening grapes, flinging them into the crowd as they laugh."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Oh, nice! Over here, toss me a couple!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_67 = {
    Text = "As if hearing him, the woman steers her bearers to Ryker, then dives into his arms."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Whoa, miss! I'm afraid my body can't take your weight..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Before Ryker finishes, the scene freezes you in shock."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_7 = {
    Text = "...So the Aramites' migration targets the Mother Tree's old site too?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_70 = {
    Text = "She rips off her robe, bare skin pressing toward him."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Her gesture ignites the air: all Aramites shed garb and armor, the gathering dissolving into a sea of carnal abandon."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_72 = {
    Text = "With Ryker frozen in place, she doesn't miss a beat—diving straight for the Aramite warrior at his side, her lewd moans echoing in the din."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_73 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Come on, join us—savor the bonfire's deepest ecstasy!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Run! Back to Ramona's tent!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Mind blank, you heed Ryker's cry, sprinting—no, fleeing—toward Ramona with all haste..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Outside the tent, the woman taking care of Ramona has vanished."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Ramona lies fever-delirious, spared the rite's madness—perhaps a mercy."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_79 = {
    Text = "That was..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_8 = {
    Text = "That's right—and they can't pierce the Storm Wall either."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_80 = {
    Text = [[
The bonfire rite. Yeah...
The Aramites' bonfire rite is a primal mating ritual.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_81 = {
    Text = "We've established distance from the chaos here—I'll stand watch outside, keep stragglers away."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_82 = {
    Text = "You stay with Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_83 = {
    Text = "These primitive... lunatics."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Against the din beyond, the tent falls eerily still, save Ramona's labored breaths from the heat."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Faint moans and cries seep through the heavy canvas, stirring unwelcome turmoil in you."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_86 = {Text = "...Ryker?"},
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Such a shame—you were hoping for someone else?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Queen of Aram—Thais—parts the flap and enters, pressing close without restraint. Her gossamer veil clings to your arm, a brazen invitation."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Come—embrace Aram's bloodline, become one of us."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ah, Keeper. Doll and I were analyzing next steps."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Come to me, embrace me... give me your blood, your seed..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Fire dances in her fervent eyes, her flushed cheeks betraying a fevered craving."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Just one drop—once our flesh mingles, She shall grant the future we yearn for..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Let us... bear heirs for the tribe, and share an eternity of..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Your brain screams refusal. You know nothing of Aramite ways, and this madness could drag you into abyss."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Yet your limbs won't obey; the siren's call commands flesh and spirit, stirring primal urges long dormant within."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Sober as you are, the world swims in drunken haze: blurred beauty, ethereal lightness, haunted only by life's primal call."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Reproduce, reproduce."
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_98 = {
    Text = "<RedBig:Propagate, propagate!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_43803_Content_99 = {
    Text = "<Big:Scatter seeds upon the earth, let our <Red:bloodline> flood Kadath!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_43804_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Don't worry. Lady Alva is stern but fair."
  },
  AvgDialog_43804_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
We'll have a proper chat in my tent later.
First, let's get rid of these Nubia.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43804_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I've seen you in action. Dispatching these foul things shouldn't be a problem for you, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Proliferate"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The noise outside has stopped."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Visit Chieftain Alva"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Consult with Juliette"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Yeah, circling in place won't cut it."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Ryker shoves the flap aside, his body tensing mid-stride."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_15 = {
    Text = "What's wrong, Ryker?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Ryker doesn't answer. Curiosity draws you behind him."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_17 = {
    Text = "He draws a ragged breath, forcing a hoarse rasp from his throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You two... stay back."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Come on, Ryker. We can't hole up in this tent forever..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_2 = {
    Text = "When did I... fall asleep?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Your words falter."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
Ryker was right. You regret laying eyes on this.
But the atrocity makes you unable to look away.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You see an inferno of blood. A horrifying aftermath of procreation. A blasphemous nightmare defying human bonds and nature's laws."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Even a vermin warren falls short of the carnage: newborn limbs and placentas twist into malformed husks, crimson slurry seeping into the desert's weave."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The air reeks of fluids laced with soul-rusting iron, churning your gut."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_25 = {
    Text = "A gust lifts the Queen's tent flap, and Thais emerges languidly."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Dawn's first ray pierces the sky as she points to the dune-sundered horizon."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_27 = {
    Text = "In that instant, wails erupt from countless tents—newborn cries weaving a symphony of fragile life."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Yet no joy stirs in you, only chill from crown to toe."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Nubia raids have been ramping up lately. We should do the bonfire rite."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Silence cloaks the tent; last night's warped, fevered revelry fades like a nightmare dissolving."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
That wasn't a morale boost, but a breeding muster to swell ranks.
What do they see life as? Some tool for survival?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Records tie the Aeon of Desire's Authority to reproduction and propagation."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree rooted at the Karage River's source—the Holy River—enriching banks and shores, granting Aramites fertility beyond the ordinary."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Sustained by the Holy River's nurture, Aram blood endures in Remouahe's harsh wastes across generations."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Nurture, fertility, endurance... these tender words manifest in such filth and cruelty."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Our options are laid out."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Stick with the Aramites' march, or break off and improvise our goal."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Discarding malformed fetuses for peak breeding rates? In civilized eyes, that's mass murder—I know you can't ignore it."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Plus, riddles abound in this mess. Notice the deformity rate?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_39 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree's gift of overnight conception and birth—why does it yield barely one healthy in ten?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_4 = {
    Text = "No idea—I woke to find you out cold."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
See? From an investigator's or sleuth's view, the first path's a lock.
We must stay close to the target and truth, right?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Before you decide, the caravan stirs—from the chieftain's tent, Aramites dash between shelters, shouting orders. Everyone leaves their tents, packing gear."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_42 = {
    Text = "What's happening?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Nubia! A huge Nubia swarm's hitting the camp! Front guards are losing it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Right on cue. They just wrapped up their feast, and Nubia immediately strikes?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Who knows? It's always like this; those cursed beasts never let up!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_46 = {
    Text = "You lot should run too! No one's got time to protect you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_47 = {
    Text = "We need to see Alva. Where is she?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Chieftain's up front, commanding!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Left flank, form up! Migration's not done—let no Nubia through!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Where's Ryker?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Naen, hold your side! If your limbs shake, fall back—Vajet, take over!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_51 = {
    Text = [[
What are you doing here?
Can't you see the front's a mess?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_52 = {
    Text = "We do not welcome guests who refuse to birth our \"Seed.\" Now see yourselves out!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Chieftain Alva, a word please?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_54 = {
    Text = "%player%'s intrusion into the Queen's tent was merely an accident. The Queen took no offense, correct?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_55 = {
    Text = "If we are assigning blame, I share half for leaving {Male=him,Female=her} alone without explaining the rules."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_56 = {
    Text = "You stare at Juliette, and she blinks at you with a subtle shake of her head, warning you to hold your tongue."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_57 = {
    Text = "You can't fathom why she would defend you, but there is no reason to refuse."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_58 = {
    Text = "With Nubia strikes mounting, they might lend a hand against these abominations."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_59 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Ramona nods toward the flap."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_60 = {
    Text = "They can follow you, then."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_61 = {
    Text = [[
You must keep them out of the main tent's sight.
Or the consequences will be worse than banishment.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Ryker slumps against the entrance in deep slumber, stirring at your movement. His velvety ears twitch, lashes fluttering before his slit wolf eyes crack open."
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Yesterday's... rite—that wasn't a dream, was it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43805_Content_9 = {
    Text = "For a Londinium gentleman's decorum, I'd never judge another's customs lightly, but those primitives' rite... it crossed every line."
  },
  AvgDialog_43806_Content_1 = {
    Text = "If these brutes come in waves, my old bones are toast."
  },
  AvgDialog_43806_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Hold on, is that—"
  },
  AvgDialog_43806_Content_11 = {
    Text = "A figure hauls the Nubia across the sands, hood slipping in the wind to reveal moonlight-glinting golden locks."
  },
  AvgDialog_43806_Content_12 = {Text = "William!"},
  AvgDialog_43806_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Alva says these are just small-pack leaders—the real threat's far worse."
  },
  AvgDialog_43806_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Enough—just keep me ignorant and carefree before we see them."
  },
  AvgDialog_43806_Content_4 = {
    Text = "No relaxing yet! %player%, over there!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43806_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The grotesque silhouettes you've grown numb to emerge from night-shrouded dunes, shambling toward you."
  },
  AvgDialog_43806_Content_6 = {
    Text = "More stragglers?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43806_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Come at me! I'll show you how I do a winning streak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43806_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Wait. Something's off..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43806_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Upon closer look, this Nubia's movements drag with unnatural stiffness."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_1 = {Text = "Trail"},
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Just like in battle..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_11 = {Text = "A failure."},
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Bet you two are itching for the senior's breakdown by now."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_13 = {
    Text = "William adjusts his glasses, nodding your way."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_14 = {
    Text = "This is the only intact Nubia specimen we've secured so far."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Before this year, sightings were near myth. Its emergence in the Remouahe Desert is recent, yet it's overrun the wastes in no time, encroaching on Aramite lands."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Mutation alone doesn't explain its rise; engineered origins fit the timing and traits better."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_17 = {
    Text = "You mean someone's making these Nubia?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_18 = {
    Text = "William nods, a glint of approval in your deduction."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_19 = {
    Text = "And covering tracks as well. Slice any part, and tendrils knit the wound inside, hiding scars."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_2 = {
    Text = "At the heart of the crude, primal tent, the Nubia's limp form looms like a black mountain of flesh, dim lamplight twisting even shadows into grotesque menace."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Fatal damage triggers swift evaporation—no traces for study.\nNote that standard D-Slime doesn't vanish so fast."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Their \"creator\" is hiding something."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Structure's intriguing, but I'm more hooked on their patterns."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I've been grilling the Aramites these days. They told me the Nubia swarms strike whenever they stay in one place for too long, or hold a rite."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Gut says these things are herding the Aramites somewhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_25 = {
    Text = "William unfolds a map, marking Nubia hotspots."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Factor in Aram migration routes."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Ryker pins red thread with tacks, tracing the path from Aramite tales."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Black omens trail the crimson line, pressing inexorably, nudging it toward the Holy River's headwaters."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Your instincts rarely miss."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_3 = {
    Text = "William extracts a surgical kit from his greaves' lining: scalpel, shears, fine-toothed forceps, hemostats arrayed like a steel platoon."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The Holy River's source. Shrouded in the Storm Wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Someone resents Aramites lingering outside it—shrinking their range, forcing a breach."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Puzzle's taking shape: why and how laid bare."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Now, the big one—who?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
Too few clues for now.
Let's sync recent sightings first; they'll sharpen the call.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_35 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_36 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_37 = {
    Text = "We need more information about Nubia."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Core mission stands: probe the Mother Tree's remains in the Queen's tent, and sabotage when ripe."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_39 = {
    Text = "I'll press my research on Nubia."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Didn't expect you to carry this around, William. Planning a career change to healer?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Something tells me Aramites and the Mother Tree's truth hide behind these things' origins."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_41 = {
    Text = "William turns, donning his cloak."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Leaving already, William?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Before dawn breaks.\nCareful—don't let Juliette know."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_44 = {
    Text = "William ducks the flap, nearly colliding with the newcomer."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Since our first encounter near the Holy River, I've smoothed your path without harm. So why the wariness, Mr. William?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Tension coils in the cramped tent; silence hangs, the once-scorching desert breeze turning chill."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Juliette breaks the silence after a few seconds."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Just teasing—no need to freeze up."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Miss Juliette, you're overselling it. We've had a blast together; William's just a lone wolf, hates mixing with strangers..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_5 = {
    Text = "William ignores the quip, his brows furrowed in focus as he makes the first careful incision."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Ryker spins yarns effortlessly; you catch Ramona rolling her eyes from the pallet."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Ahem—so, anyway, Miss Juliette's late-night visit means something pressing, I guess?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Not earth-shattering—come, I'll tell you the details in my tent."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The blade slices into the Nubia's bulk—no anticipated gush of black slime."
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Taut like a wire, William sinks the edge deeper, then drags downward—"
  },
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_8 = {Text = "Sizzle—"},
  AvgDialog_43807_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The pierced Nubia melts into sludge in an instant, vaporizing away; the table gleams pristine, as if no abomination ever fouled it."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_1 = {
    Text = "This mind-space gathers every Aramite soul from ancient days to now."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Juliette kneels by the cradle, intoning a wordless hymn."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_11 = {
    Text = "It has no lyrics, yet you know the melody."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_12 = {
    Text = "She cradles the swaddling, sinking it into the river."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Sands swiftly entomb the fragile life."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Death draws near. Dissolution dawns."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The beautiful and melancholic song is laced with sorrow, winding with the Holy River into the distance."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_16 = {
    Text = "4:00 AM, Guest's Tent"
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Let's review the facts."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_18 = {
    Text = "To Aramites, without the Mother Tree's revival, the Holy River dries—the whole Remouahe turns to endless waste."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Juliette aims to revive the tree and integrate them into the modern world."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The Aramites... are weeping?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_20 = {
    Text = "But Daffodil's sources warned us about the risk of a global-scale Dissolution once the Mother Tree reborns."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree's remains sit in the Queen's tent. Destroy it before we pass the Storm Wall, and we can wrap this with minimal cost."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_22 = {
    Text = "So, the question: how trustworthy is Daffodil? Is her source solid?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Alistair did his best—confirmed deliberate leak, but accuracy's a toss-up."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_24 = {
    Text = "But burning the remains rashly might take away the Aramites' last chance of survival..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
Nobody has any chance of survival against Dissolution.
Don't let misplaced mercy impair your judgment.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Easy, Doll. I'd storm their holy rite to burn that tree if you asked me to."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_27 = {
    Text = "I'm with %player%. We know too little about the Aramites; striking now would be reckless."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_28 = {
    Text = "I will continue researching the Nubia.\n%player%, Ryker—I'm leaving the Mother Tree's remains to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Yes—their spirits wail.\nFor sin in birth, for terror in death."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
If I can lead the Aramites through the Storm Wall and reclaim the Mother Tree...
They will crown me the new leader.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Then, I'll end this cursed rite and free Aramites forever from this barren hell."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Everyone will dwell in a pristine paradise, unburdened by sins."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_7 = {
    Text = "%player%, please lend me your strength."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You wake up from the dream. The infant in Juliette's arms has stopped breathing."
  },
  AvgDialog_43808_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Let him return to the Holy River."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Origin Flow"
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Juliette ruffles the boy's fuzzy head."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_11 = {
    Text = "All right. If you need anything..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The boy eyes you warily."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Just wake me."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The boy departs; Juliette offers you an apologetic smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Sorry—he gets overprotective sometimes."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You guessed right: he's the quickest to grow in this batch."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_17 = {
    Text = "By contrast..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Juliette leads you to a simple cradle."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Look at this one."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_2 = {
    Text = "2:00 AM, Envoy's Tent"
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_20 = {
    Text = "It's an infant in swaddling; tree-like dark veins crawling on his skin."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_21 = {
    Text = "There is no outward deformity, but the Mother Tree's blight has already coursed through."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Try touching his skin."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You touch the child's skin as instructed. It is not the soft, smooth skin of a baby that you expected, but the parched rasp of cracked bark."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
The envoy's tent is filled with pallets, where kids curl in slumber.
A spirited boy approaches as you enter.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Lady Juliette, you're back."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
Neferure, my good child.
Everyone settled?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Yes, Lady Juliette."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_7 = {
    Text = "These children..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Until today, you'd seen no minors among the Aramites."
  },
  AvgDialog_43809_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Neferure, off to bed.\nTucking them all in wasn't easy—Chieftain Alva will reward you tomorrow."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Serendipitous Flames"
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The sharp-tongued man barks at you—dazed, flailing awkwardly beneath the spotlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The girls around you spin like swans, every movement graceful and in sync, their poise a dance in itself."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_12 = {
    Text = "But someone moves like a wild duck among swans. You are that unfortunate someone."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You quickly realise this is a dancer's body—but it remembers nothing. Even standing feels unsteady, let alone recalling the intricate steps."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Always a handful... Living up to your reputation as our \"prima ballerina.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The prima ballerina? That's... me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_16 = {
    Text = "No one answers. The dancers glide past without pause—until an elbow knocks into you."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_17 = {
    Text = "You stagger two steps, lose the rhythm, and are shunted to the edge of the stage. But there is no escaping the critical stares from below—"
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_18 = {
    Text = "There are no rows of seats beneath the stage. Just pairs of tables and chairs arranged across an open floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Tasselled silk tablecloths shimmer beneath scattered jewels; the masked audience's faces glow eerily under the lights."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Un, deux, trois. Un, deux, trois... Very well. Neat and elegant!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_20 = {
    Text = "What's wrong with that kid in front? A misstep?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Hmph... They don't care about dance. Don't you get what kind of people they are?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_22 = {
    Text = "True. Ah, that body really is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_23 = {
    Text = "<Small:These people aren't just ordinary spectators...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_24 = {
    Text = "What are you standing around for?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_25 = {
    Text = "A pampered, plump hand yanks your bare arm, pulling you into the shadows behind the curtain."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_26 = {
    Text = "You nearly ruined everything! This is the final rehearsal before the real show! What were you thinking?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I, I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_28 = {
    Text = "The music crashes in waves against your ears, vision dimming with every beat. The dance steps vanish into fog. His tug gives you a chance—you try to leave the stage—"
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
Don't move. I need someone to balance the formation when I go on.

Go to the back left and fill the gap. Mirror my steps.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The strings and woodwinds murmur in the background, weaving with the rhythmic stomp of feet to form an orderly, graceful harmony—a dance of sound that stirs the soul."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_30 = {
    Text = "He's shoved aside—replaced by a slender, pale hand pulling you forward. In his startled eyes: surprise... then delight."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_31 = {
    Text = "The newcomer's steps are light and sure, gently parting the disjointed group, guiding you into formation."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The dancers glance at each other but say nothing. They merely scoff, lower their heads, and resume the dance."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Quick! Spotlight on her! Elizabeth has returned to the stage! First appearance in three months!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_34 = {Text = "Elizabeth?"},
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_35 = {
    Text = "You mouth the familiar name, straining to catch a glimpse of the girl who dragged you into the light."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_36 = {
    Text = "You lift your eyes, and a burst of searing flash from the balcony blinds you."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_37 = {
    Text = "—When your sight clears, she's already leapt to the front."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
The dancers part, leaving room for her sweeping gown.

On this modest stage, she is the only star, a mesmerizing witch at the heart of it all.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_39 = {
    Text = "That's Elizabeth, the Yadri Dance Troupe's star performer... She's stunning."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_4 = {
    Text = "What's going on..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Manager, I thought Miss Elizabeth was unwell. Wasn't she out of this show?"
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Ladies and Gentlemen, our beloved Elizabeth presents you... a surprise performance! Yes, a surprise!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Though ailing, as the production's director, she won't let a single misstep mar the stage!"
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_43 = {
    Text = "The Troupe Manager puffs out his chest, his gaze scanning like a strutting rooster."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_44 = {
    Text = "The dancer's pointe shoes thud like drums. You look up—and cold green eyes meet yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Your body reacts instantly, threat pulsing through every limb. Within two beats, you've rejoined the formation."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_46 = {
    Text = "You've got it... Good."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Be a leaf on the tree. Hide from their gaze."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Never let those filthy eyes... find you again."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Stirred from a deep sleep by the music, your limbs stretch instinctively, though your eyes remain unbearably heavy."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Your lids press together tight—no matter what, they refuse to part. Not even a sliver of light slips through."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Ugh... This feeling... Someone else's dream, again..."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Amid the deafening music, you gradually regain control of your body. But just as your eyes begin to sense the light, your limbs freeze."
  },
  AvgDialog_43816_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Great job, girls. Keep the rhythm steady—hey! Stay focused!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44435_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Cursed binding"
  },
  AvgDialog_44435_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Memories flood in with the starlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_44435_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Those memories, artificially created and shattered by violence, surged into Mason's mind and then quickly receded like the tide."
  },
  AvgDialog_44435_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Until the very end, she arrived at the foot of the snow mountain, the entrance to a pitch-black cave."
  },
  AvgDialog_44435_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Follow the river flowing beneath your feet to reach the lair of the slumbering beast."
  },
  AvgDialog_44435_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Knock, knock. Knock, knock."
  },
  AvgDialog_44435_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The heartbeat was like that of an old clock, shared by her and the great beast."
  },
  AvgDialog_44435_Content_8 = {Text = "I see..."},
  AvgDialog_44435_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I understand it all..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Why... why..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Those who find happiness in a simple life are\"24\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Tormented by the Sculptors' Association, it is also \"24\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_12 = {
    Text = "No... If it weren't for your cowardice, that doctor wouldn't have..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_13 = {Text = "Shh..."},
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Mason gently covered the shadow's lips. She leaned down and whispered in its ear."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Here's a secret: <Red:That doctor was killed by me.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_16 = {
    Text = "How dare you...?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Killing isn't difficult. I didn't have a weapon, so I smashed his head open like a walnut with my bare hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_18 = {
    Text = "By the end, my hands were numb, and all I could see was blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I must ensure that he is completely dead. As long as he still draws breath, he will surely harm the children of the orphanage and Jenkin..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Shadow was defeated by you. In the mindscape, she lies prostrate on the ground, with tiny light particles drifting from her body."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_20 = {
    Text = "He's just like those people in the Sculptors' Association, no — he's even more terrifying..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_21 = {
    Text = "He's a true demon."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_22 = {
    Text = "What was I doing back then... I didn't know anything..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Mason gently shook his head."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_24 = {
    Text = "What you actually know is the courage that you and the other \"24\" lent me."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_25 = {
    Text = "All \"24\" combine to form one \"Mason\". No \"24\" can exist in isolation."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Just like all rivers converge to one place, all \"24\" will also converge to one place..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Mason gently kissed Shadow's forehead."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_28 = {
    Text = "It belongs to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The shadow's body transforms into starlight, scattering around Mason and merging into her skin."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_3 = {
    Text = "How could someone as powerful and enraged as me... lose to you, lose to this coward..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_30 = {
    Text = "I see... I understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You are the origin of everything, and also the end of everything..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_32 = {
    Text = "She gradually lost her voice in the warm embrace."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Starlight flickers like fireflies in the night, appearing and disappearing, until it finally vanishes."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_34 = {
    Text = "...Good night, my \"one twenty-fourth\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_35 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Artificial Domain Investigation Log IV>\n\n■Domain ID: M-C06\n■Fall Time: Year 315 of the Flood, December @1\n■Fall Location: Camberwell Street, East District"
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
<Yellow:Investigation Results I>

The domain concluded in a mundane manner.
Afterward, Miss Mason's condition improved significantly, bringing great joy to everyone.
We are gradually getting closer to the true Miss Mason.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_37 = {
    Text = [[
Mythag University, School Office
One day later]]
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_38 = {
    Text = "What? The Committee has withdrawn the accusation?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Yeah. They're busy dealing with the snake problem alongside the City Environmental Department now."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_4 = {Text = "Because..."},
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Snake infestation...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Winkle spreads out the \"Londinium Post\" from a few days ago in front of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_42 = {
    Text = "\"Recently, a sudden influx of albino snakes of unknown species emerged from the late Dr. Bernard's clinic, causing severe disruptions to local transportation and daily life...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_43 = {
    Text = "\"Eyewitnesses claim this was the most horrifying scene they've ever witnessed. If readers also witnessed this, please contact a psychologist at @2...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_44 = {
    Text = "\"Number@4...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Next to the news, there's a photo where you seem to recognize a few familiar faces from the Committee."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Wearing masks and holding nets, they tirelessly clear the endless stream of small snakes, their faces revealing fatigue and impatience."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_47 = {
    Text = "That so-called \"Dr. Bernard\" is a big problem."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_48 = {
    Text = "We found someone from the Royal Medical Society, but their description of the man is completely different from what William saw."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_49 = {
    Text = "In other words, the deceased stole the identity of this Dr. Bernard. However, it is still unclear whether this fake doctor is truly dead."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_5 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_50 = {
    Text = "After all, not even a trace of a body can be found at the scene..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_51 = {
    Text = [[
Dec 17th, The Day of the Incident
Dr. Bernard's Clinic]]
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Today's treatment is over. Miss Mason, you are recovering well."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Really? But everyone says my condition is getting worse..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_54 = {
    Text = "I fear my understanding of \"serious\" differs from theirs. Have you been taking the prescribed tinctures on time?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Splash—!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_56 = {
    Text = "The man accidentally knocked over the files beside him, scattering yellowed pages all over the floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_57 = {
    Text = "You are a hardworking doctor who labors day and night; leave the small task of picking things up to..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_58 = {Text = "Well..."},
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_59 = {
    Text = "His hand stopped just short of 2 inches from the file. It was a stack of identity records, and Mason struggled to make out a few somewhat familiar words."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Let me take care of it."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Experiment Report, Transfer Record...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_61 = {
    Text = "<Shake:These are... the missing children from the orphanage! No, it's even worse...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_62 = {
    Text = "In the corner of the exposed file at the bottom, Mason saw Jenkin's slightly stubborn face."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Is this your sister? I've seen her. She's always worried about you and even tried to sneak in."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_64 = {
    Text = "He smiled faintly, his expression growing gentle."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_65 = {
    Text = "I once had many siblings... They only feared me, so I devoured them all."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_66 = {
    Text = "All of them... eaten?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, Miss Mason. I didn't eat those children. I just sent them to a <Red:safe place>."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_68 = {
    Text = "So you're the mastermind behind these disappearances..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_69 = {
    Text = "<Shake:This joke isn't funny at all, Mr. Bernard...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Mason sat beside the shadow, holding the motionless shadow in his arms."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Mr. Bernard... Are you referring to it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_71 = {
    Text = "The man spoke, extending a long tongue from his mouth, which coiled around a bloody severed finger."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_72 = {
    Text = "He's too big; I still can't process it."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Let's reintroduce ourselves. I'm <Yellow:Albino>, the pharmacist of the Sculptors' Association."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Aaaaaah—!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Mason's legs gave out, and he collapsed heavily to the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_76 = {
    Text = "You... you must also take Jenkin..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_77 = {
    Text = "The man adjusted his glasses and quickly jotted down notes on the medical record."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Pupils dilated, body trembling violently, heart racing... You must be extremely terrified right now. Are you cold?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_79 = {
    Text = "No... Stay back..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Because... you didn't accept all \"24\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Soon, you will faint due to insufficient blood supply to the brain, just like other dull humans."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_81 = {
    Text = "He lifted his head from the medical record, a faint gleam of excitement flickering in his golden vertical pupils."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Or... will you react in a different way?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_83 = {
    Text = "20 minutes later"
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_84 = {
    Text = "I've killed someone... I actually killed a doctor... They won't believe me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_85 = {
    Text = "No, why did I just kill him...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Mason snapped out of his daze and hastily left the scene."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_87 = {
    Text = "The man's body slumped against the wall. His head had already shattered, and blood kept seeping out."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_88 = {
    Text = "After an unknown amount of time, a series of black curse marks suddenly lit up on the corpse's neck."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_89 = {
    Text = "The curse coils like a snake, the shattered Caro gathers and reforms..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Driven by desperation and with no one to turn to, it is \"24\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Until the end, the \"corpse\" slowly sat up."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Phew... Not bad, those tinctures worked. Her potential has been fully unleashed."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Albino extended his long snake tongue and leisurely licked the blood off his face clean."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_93 = {
    Text = "The prey has matured. It's time to report to our Guild Master."
  },
  AvgDialog_44436_Content_94 = {
    Text = "He picked up the medical record at his feet and left in a leisurely manner."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Golden refrain"
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The pale calm of the sea is broken as a dark purplish-black sea serpent suddenly lunges, entwining everyone tightly."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Hmm... Aaaahhh!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_12 = {
    Text = "With a faint hiss, the snake's body transforms into a pitch-black blade, piercing through the person completely."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_13 = {
    Text = "<Big:Stay Back>... Huh?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_15 = {
    Text = "A soft, chilly sensation emanates from the neck where the black snake entwines, gradually healing the wound."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_16 = {
    Text = "My wounds... have all healed?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The black snake leaves you without hesitation and swiftly coils tightly around Glen."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Run, the witch is... coming..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The pitch-black snakes slithered out from Glen's eyes and mouth. He collapsed before he could utter a complete sentence."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Lament for the Apostle of the Sea.
Lament for our light, our hope.

We wail, weep, and shed tears over our fate of being exiled to the ocean.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_20 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_21 = {
    Text = "In no time, countless broken corpses were floating on the sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_22 = {
    Text = "This is a silent massacre."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_23 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Is it over? Impressive, as expected from Miryam.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You helped us... Who are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The woman in black veil remains silent. She stands at the bow, with a dense fog separating you from her."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Seems so near, yet so far away."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The woman gazed at the stunned Goliath, a faint smile playing on her lips. She extended her finger toward the distance, as if issuing a silent invitation."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_28 = {
    Text = "She then turned the bow and departed leisurely."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Wait, don't go...<Big:Don't leave!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Vision suddenly dims; the glaring sunlight gradually vanishes, and a thick fog blankets the entire sea surface."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The mist dissipates, and a ray of sunlight pierces through the clouds, casting a golden hue on the waves."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You blinked, and the sea's end was already empty."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The storm subsides, and you and Goliath cling to the only intact plank, gasping for breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_33 = {
    Text = "The once azure sea has long been stained red with blood, and you drift like floating duckweed."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Still couldn't get the ship... Now I don't even know how to get home."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Not going home."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Goliath propped up one leg, staring blankly in the direction Miryam had departed."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I've decided. I'm going to find that witch. Will you come with me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Ahem, \"Only a fool would entrust their life to someone else.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_39 = {
    Text = "You deliberately lower your voice, mimicking Goliath's earlier tone and repeating what he said."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Oh, please protect those plagued by misfortune.
Cast your compassionate gaze upon us...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Hmph, that's because the stakes aren't high enough. I've never seen a power that can crush everything in an instant."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Moreover, she just helped us and even extended an invitation to me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_42 = {
    Text = "But what if... it's a trap?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_43 = {Text = "Trap..."},
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Do you remember the question you asked me before?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_45 = {
    Text = "...The important thing is, thanks to you, my lord, both of us are alive now."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Why do you think that is?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Now I know the answer."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_48 = {
    Text = "What is the answer?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_49 = {
    Text = "A flock of seabirds suddenly flew together. Their white wings flapped like clouds in flight, freely drifting in the sea breeze."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ancient, eerie songs drift. A woman's silhouette appears and disappears at the bow, like a ghost roaming in the mist."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Goliath was not bothered by the flock of birds. He stared ahead, his eyes shining with excitement."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Because I am Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Goliath, the longest-reigning leader in Philistine history, an indomitable giant, and a legendary tribal hero."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Even if only one follower remains, as long as there's a glimmer of hope, I can rise again."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_54 = {
    Text = "That witch is my last chance. Only she can grant me absolute Power."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Even if it's a trap, I'll go."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Why save me, then? A \"good-for-nothing\" like me probably can't be of any help to you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_57 = {
    Text = "You deliberately emphasized the pronunciation of a word, causing Goliath to burst into laughter."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_58 = {
    Text = "The sunlight breaks through the clouds, casting a golden glow. Strands of hair gently dance under the azure sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_59 = {
    Text = "There's no way a commander without troops can succeed in this world."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Huh, is someone singing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Little one, you're not useless. You are the sole follower of the giant Goliath, and no one can replace you."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_61 = {
    Text = "When I achieve my dominance, at the very least, I'll appoint you as a tribal chief!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_62 = {
    Text = "...Not necessary."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_63 = {
    Text = "The sky gradually darkened. The glow of dusk resembled shimmering golden rivers flowing across the horizon."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Hey, you know what? Heroes can only be heroes because of people like us."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_65 = {
    Text = "<Small:So I'm important too, got it...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_66 = {
    Text = "<Small:Hmm...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Fragmented words scatter like dandelions in the sea breeze, carried far, far away."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_68 = {
    Text = "You and Goliath sat on a thin wooden plank, looking like tiny leaves drifting in a golden sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Nobody knows where you will ultimately sail to."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_7 = {
    Text = "<Shake:The witch, it's the witch!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_8 = {
    Text = "How could this be... Could the legend actually be true..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44437_Content_9 = {
    Text = "<Red:Mercy. Mercy. Mercy...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_1 = {Text = "\"origin\""},
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Huh? Miss Winkle said my Domain is terrifying, filled with fierce monsters..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_11 = {
    Text = "That was all her imagination. However, I did see something special, like \"you.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_12 = {Text = "Me...?"},
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You chuckled softly and winked at her."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_14 = {
    Text = "This is a secret between \"her\" and me. I'll tell you more about it in the future."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_15 = {Text = "Sis—!!"},
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Jenkin suddenly jumps out from the nearby flowers."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I've returned from wandering with Aigis. Guess what we found?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Jenkin waved a red ribbon, different from the one Mason usually uses, with a yellowed bell at its end."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_19 = {
    Text = "A gentle breeze passes, and the bell chimes crisply, like a joyful sprite."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Mythag University, Campus 
 Three days later]]
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_20 = {
    Text = "This is something seen in the Domain..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Huh, you've seen her in the Domain too? Then you must have met the sister who turned into a cat!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Don't... don't say it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Why can't I say it? This ribbon is an important memento!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_24 = {
    Text = "During that time, I took care of you and played with you every day. I was so happy."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Jenkin gently placed the ribbon into Mason's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I remember you once said that you wanted to be a cat in your next life."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_27 = {
    Text = "If only we could remain carefree like this, I could continue to take care of you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Mason smiled down, his fingers brushing the cool, soft ribbon."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Being a cat? That's something for the next life."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I see. Shortly after killing Albino, you were taken away by the Sculptors' Association."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Right now, I just want to live well as \"Mason\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Jenkin looks at you with some surprise."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Huh... It seems that this Domain has changed Sister greatly. She wasn't like this before."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_33 = {
    Text = "I testify that Miss Mason is telling the truth."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You and Mason exchanged a smile, thoughts returning to the moment just before the Domain collapsed..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_35 = {
    Text = "I see... I understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_36 = {
    Text = "You are the origin of everything, and also the end of everything..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_37 = {
    Text = "As the last glimmer of starlight vanishes, the world seems to be swallowed by black ink."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_38 = {
    Text = "You hear the distant sound of bells. Dong—Dong—"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Is the Domain... collapsing?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_4 = {
    Text = "This is the story of what happened later."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Grab my hand, {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_41 = {
    Text = "You tightly hold Mason's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_42 = {
    Text = "At that moment, your blood seemed to flow into her body effortlessly, and your consciousness merged as one."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_43 = {
    Text = "You feel yourself slowly drifting off to sleep, countless dreams coming one after another, carrying you into the depths of darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_44 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_45 = {
    Text = "You stand in the cave, with a shimmering golden river flowing beneath you, like the veins of the earth."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Is this the starlight I saw before... Have they all gathered here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_47 = {
    Text = "<Red:Return, return...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_48 = {
    Text = "You follow the flow of starlight deeper into the cave."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_49 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Hmm. I remember it all now. It wasn't a pleasant memory..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Is this...?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_51 = {
    Text = "This place seems to be the ultimate source of all twisted, deformed, and filthy things."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_52 = {
    Text = "The light gray mass trembled and expanded, fissioning out writhing deformed monsters, like a stomach in constant struggle."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_53 = {
    Text = "However, before they reached the shore, they fell back into the pool and were devoured by the gaping mouths on the mass."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_54 = {
    Text = "These monsters' silhouettes seem somewhat familiar... Could it be..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_55 = {
    Text = "You suddenly have a strong intuition. You wade through the gray slime and approach the lump."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Mason... is that you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_57 = {
    Text = "The mass paused for a moment, then began to wriggle gently. It emitted a rustling sound, like a friendly greeting."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_58 = {
    Text = "You gaze at the monsters kneeling by the pool. They struggle to move, twitching in the slime, yearning to return to the embrace of the mass"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Like those pilgrims seeking miracles in the wind and snow"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You gently hold Mason's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_60 = {
    Text = "<Change>The root of all impurity, filth, and misfortune..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_61 = {
    Text = "<Change>Return!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Because it is where all rivers end, no matter how far apart they may be, they will eventually converge here."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_63 = {
    Text = "I see... So this is what you do every day?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_64 = {
    Text = "With a frail body, pulling those scattered personalities back together and striving to maintain the appearance that \"normal people\" should have."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_65 = {
    Text = "...No wonder I dreamt of those past events."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_66 = {
    Text = "The last time I saw these stars, I suddenly felt that I was very much like them."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_67 = {
    Text = "...there are differences too. They know where their home is, but I've even lost my memories"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Your nose suddenly feels a bit sour. You gently touch the flesh, feeling its tranquil pulse."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Mason... Will I also find my home someday? Just like you are doing now..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_7 = {
    Text = "It's all in the past. I assure you, it will never happen again."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_70 = {
    Text = "The flesh writhes, splitting at the end to form a soft, slimy tentacle that gently wipes away the tears from the corner of your eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_71 = {
    Text = "<Change>Definitely will."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_72 = {
    Text = "<Change>Don't shed tears."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_73 = {Text = "Rumble..."},
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_74 = {
    Text = "From deep within the mantle comes a faint tremor, tearing open cracks in the rock walls."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Time until Domain collapse: <Red:0> minutes"
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_76 = {
    Text = "You turn away from the cave. As you reach the entrance, you can't help but take one last look back at her."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Farewell, Miss Mason."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Joy, sorrow, pain... Different personalities and emotions come and go, but she remains in that cave."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_79 = {
    Text = "She is alive."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Thank you... {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_44438_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I should be the one thanking you. When the Domain collapsed, you gave me a lot of encouragement and comfort."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Golden fugue"
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_10 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_11 = {
    Text = "It seems like this is the first time I've dreamed about the past."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You clutch your head, feeling as if an invisible thread is pulling your consciousness away from the bed."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You then opened the window and saw the first snowfall of the New Year."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Wow, it's snowing!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The excited shouts of children echoed through the silent night sky. Accompanied by chaotic footsteps, the orphans gathered downstairs."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_16 = {
    Text = "So much snow, shimmering and beautiful."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Aigis wants to build a snowman, just like little Bobby."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_18 = {
    Text = "This is easy, I'll handle it—"
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Ta-da! Take a look at my masterpiece!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You had an incredibly long dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Hmm... it doesn't quite look like Little Bear Bobby. It, it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_21 = {
    Text = "It looks like a dog! A pug!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_22 = {
    Text = "<Big:Hahahaha!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Nonsense! How could I possibly look like a dog?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_24 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Children laugh and play in the alleys. Mason, already awake, stands beside you."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_26 = {
    Text = "She reached out her hand and caught a few gentle snowflakes in her palm."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The snowflake quietly lay in her palm, quickly melting into cold water, shimmering with golden starlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Huh, it's the light we saw last time..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Countless starlights fly out from the windows of the corridor next door, merging into a golden river in the night sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_3 = {
    Text = "In the dream, the sky was like a torn cemetery, with black substances pouring in like ink."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_30 = {
    Text = "They flow gracefully, extending all the way to the distant moonlit mountains."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Mason gently closed his eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_32 = {
    Text = "It's the scent of that clown lady. She has left us."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_33 = {
    Text = "But I don't feel sad... It seems like she left of her own will, as if returning home."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Going home..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Miss Mason, I heard that you went to work in the city at a young age. Do you still miss your home?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Mason looked at Jenkins and Little Mike wrestling downstairs, and smiled gently."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_37 = {
    Text = "My memory is terrible. When I was a child, the nuns at the church school said I wasn't suited for studying."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Parents, hometown... I can't quite remember, nor do I want to. Memories should be used to preserve happiness."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_39 = {
    Text = "In the fairy tales I've read, only happy and warm places can be called home. I want to be a home for Jenkin and Brown."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You lie face up beneath the fissure, your heart as close to the earth as possible."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_40 = {
    Text = "I see. Miss Mason, you are far stronger than I imagined."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_41 = {
    Text = "You weren't like this when we first met at the wax museum."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_42 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Looks like Miss Winkle's \"Menophin Super Stabilization Therapy\" is actually effective.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Mason smiled, his eyes crinkling."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Everyone is doing their best to help me. How can I not change at all?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_45 = {
    Text = "I hope I can help everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_46 = {
    Text = "You stretch lazily, gazing aimlessly at the pitch-black residential area below."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Not sure if it's just your imagination, but you seem to see \"Shadow 24\" standing at the end of the dark alley, gazing at the light river in the sky along with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_48 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Here's a secret: Every persona is like a drifting weed, and becoming whole is our shared wish."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Knock, knock. Knock, knock."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Laugh together, cry together, and feel the love and trust from Jenkin..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_51 = {
    Text = "It's all just pitiful delusions."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_52 = {
    Text = "The wind blows gently, and snowflakes drift in the air like soft cotton, aimlessly floating around."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_53 = {
    Text = "The starlight gradually fades, and your consciousness seems to drift away with it."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_54 = {
    Text = "I wonder what the next Domain waiting for you will be like?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_55 = {
    Text = "You're actually looking forward to it a bit."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_56 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Artificial Domain Investigation Log III>\n\n■Domain ID: M-C06\n■Collapse Time: December 24, AF 315\n■Collapse Location: Lily's Orphanage"
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_57 = {
    Text = [[
<Yellow:Investigation Results>

I saw snow, as well as golden starlight dancing within it.
For some reason, they always remind me of the past. Mist rises, light falls, and laughter gradually fades.
It's a tranquil winter night.

<Yellow:Happy New Year.>

P.S.: Miss Sarah's frosted cupcakes are delicious.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You close your eyes, feeling the tremors from deep within the mantle. It's a melancholic and ancient rhythm that reminds you of your home."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_7 = {
    Text = "It's unclear how long it has been when you hear faint laughter and feel someone take your hand. You return the grasp, holding onto this long-lost warmth."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Mother. Before you could cry out, tears had already streamed down your face."
  },
  AvgDialog_44439_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You have been separated for too long."
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_1 = {
    Text = "No, there are too many people... Things will only get worse..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_10 = {
    Text = "No, Lord Goliath—!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_11 = {
    Text = "It feels as if everything before my eyes has been paused."
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_12 = {
    Text = "This body's instincts surpass your control. It lunges forward, desperately shielding Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_13 = {Text = "Hmm—"},
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_16 = {
    Text = "A blade slashes your throat. You tremble as you clutch your bleeding wound, your mind in chaos."
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Are you out of your mind? What are you doing here?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I don't know... My body moved on its own..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Sorry, Lord Goliath..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_2 = {
    Text = "I... can still... kill!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_22 = {
    Text = "A poisoned arrow whizzed through the air, striking Goliath's shoulder and causing him to fall toward you."
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Goliath... The giant Goliath has finally fallen!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_24 = {
    Text = "His head belongs to me! No one dares take it from me!!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The sea emitted a deep, angry tremor. The giant blocked the blazing sun before crashing down."
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Your blood converges, turning the azure sea crimson."
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You hear the wind, the waves, and distant cheers and fights. Ahead lies nothing but endless slaughter and humiliation."
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_28 = {
    Text = "The salty seawater stings the wound on your neck, making you wince in pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Goliath isn't much better than you."
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The heavy blare of horns echoed across the sea. Lured by generous rewards, warriors flocked to join the hunting game."
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Seeing you in such a sorry state, he flashes you a wicked grin."
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_32 = {Text = "...Waste."},
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Goliath was nearing his limit. He swung his giant blade once more, but in his sluggish movement, someone seized the Fissure."
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Goliath knelt, exposing white bones through his wounds, blood flowing like a never-ending stream."
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Now is the time! Finish him off in one go!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44440_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The encircling warriors swarm like bloodthirsty sharks."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Giants' Chronicles"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Goliath let out a disdainful snort from his throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_11 = {
    Text = "What nonsense about witches? You can't actually believe their lies, can you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Only fools would entrust their lives to others."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_13 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Witch...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_14 = {
    Text = "According to Goliath's Awakener file, this so-called \"witch\" is undoubtedly Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Though the subsequent development was not as expected, Miryam did save Goliath's life."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You are gravely injured, my lord. I'm afraid there is no other way—"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_17 = {Text = "Bang!!"},
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_18 = {
    Text = "With tremendous force, your fragile throat is tightly gripped, lifting you off the ground to come face-to-face with the giant."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I'll say this only once: Don't look at me with that kind of gaze, and don't speak to me in that tone."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The sun scorches the sea, as if to wither all life in this endless heat."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The last thing I, Goliath, need is the pity of the weak."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Goliath spoke calmly, his expression unchanged, as if discussing the weather with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_22 = {
    Text = "But you are so close that you can clearly see his eyes, red with pain and frustration."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_23 = {
    Text = "At this moment, he seemed to shed his glory as the sea overlord, becoming just another lost fish in the endless ocean, like you."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Sorry... uh, my lord..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_25 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Woo—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The deep sound of a horn drifts in from afar."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The weight on the neck suddenly lifted. Goliath released his grip and looked towards the direction from which the horn's sound came."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_28 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Cough... Phew, I'm saved...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Interesting... Are you worried that I won't die quickly enough, so you've all come together to see me off?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You and Goliath cling to the plank, the only island in the vast sea. Under the scorching sun, you feel dizzy again."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Before long, the massive fleet surrounded you, leaving the swaying wooden planks as the only island in this vast sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You are already surrounded."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Allow me to introduce to everyone the most valiant leader in Philistine history! The unyielding giant of immense power! The awe-inspiring, peerless tribal hero—"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_33 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Lord Goliath!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_34 = {
    Text = "The sunlight reflecting off the sea is too intense; you can only catch a glimpse of a black figure standing at the bow, looking down at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The newly arrived brothers may not know, but this lord was gravely injured in a duel and nearly captured, pushing our entire clan to the brink of an unprecedented crisis!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The impending doom devoured most of our people! Praise you, my dearest Lord Goliath!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Hehe... How could I dare to claim all the credit for such a great achievement, Glen?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Who was hiding behind me, too afraid to fight, and who was the first to drop their weapon and run home crying?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_39 = {Text = "You...!"},
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_4 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Sorry, I'm not feeling well... I'll rest for a bit...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Glen's face flushed red, his cloudy eyes trembling before finally locking onto you."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Oh, even if the tribe disperses, the leader still has a... very adorable follower."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Perishite's shame — a waste who can't even withstand a single punch within the tribe, yet seeks to follow you in becoming a warrior..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Hahaha...!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Goliath looks up, surprised to see you through the crowd's laughter."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Hey, little one, did you come to follow me of your own accord?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_46 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Uh... That's how I remember it...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Isn't it touching? I just casually mentioned the witch, and this little fool took it seriously, eagerly wanting to follow you here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Can't be stopped, haha—"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_49 = {Text = "Splash!!"},
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_5 = {Text = "Bang!"},
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_50 = {
    Text = "The laughter abruptly stopped. A fierce wind howled, and a severed leg rolled before everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Aaaah... my leg, my leg!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_52 = {
    Text = "The once-dominant sea lord stands like a mountain before Glen, exuding an aura that chills the heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_53 = {
    Text = "That fly has been buzzing around my ear for a while now..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Goliath leisurely wiped the blood off his blade, then looked up and gave Glen a cold smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Glenn, did I just ask you a question?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_6 = {
    Text = "A shirt stained with sweat and blood is thrown over your head, causing you to jump up immediately due to the stench."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Cough... Ugh!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You're suffering from heatstroke. Place this on your head to shield yourself from the sun, and don't remove it."
  },
  AvgDialog_44441_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Thank you, my lord... Where should we go next? To find the witch?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_1 = {Text = "Hmm—!!"},
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I, the warrior Glen, swear on my life: Whoever brings me this head shall have my wealth, land, and women!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Under great reward, brave men will surely appear. The warriors let out excited cheers, their weapons clashing and resonating with the thrilling sound of battle."
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Yeah, what's there to be afraid of? We have so many people!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Cut off the hand holding his knife first!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The once-cowering warriors roared and surged forward like bloodthirsty locusts."
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Heh... my dearest kin. I taught you how to fight, how to kill, and how to survive."
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_16 = {
    Text = "But I never taught you how to escape when facing enemies many times stronger than yourselves."
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Goliath licked the blood from the corner of his mouth, revealing his fangs."
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_18 = {
    Text = "...because you have nowhere left to run."
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_19 = {
    Text = "With that, he casually grabbed their throats, lifted their heads, and smashed them together—"
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A frenzied cleaver chopped the ship into pieces, leaving Glen to retreat with only one leg remaining."
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_20 = {Text = "Splash!!"},
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Yellow and white fluids mixed with fragmented blood spewed out. Goliath laughed heartily, his pupils burning with a bloodthirsty malice."
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Hahaha! I heard someone wants to take my head?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_23 = {
    Text = "If you've got the guts, come and take it @1!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Weren't you injured? How could you...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Sorry, dealing with a minion like you doesn't require my full strength."
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Goliath stands proudly at the bow, his massive blade carving an arc before him, keeping his former comrades at bay."
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Is there anyone else who wants to come up and play with me? One is not enough to kill!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Glen looked around in a panic."
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Intimidated by the giant's terror, the warriors cowered like pups, none daring to step into the forbidden curve ahead, as if it were a taboo place."
  },
  AvgDialog_44442_Content_9 = {
    Text = "A bunch of good-for-nothings! With such severe injuries, he's no longer the once-dominant ruler of the seas."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Burning Ice"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Walked off? Half-baked?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_11 = {
    Text = "This body you currently inhabit still won't answer your questions. Her memories lie hidden in some unknown corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You push through the crowd of dancers chattering like excited birds, reaching toward the girl who's turning to leave."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Liz, where are you going?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_14 = {
    Text = "That's right. Liz."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The black-clad dancer who saved you is none other than Liz, the Awakener you know."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_16 = {
    Text = "This dream belongs to her. The girl who always locks herself in Mythag's dancing studio."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_17 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Liz turns, her lips twitching as if to speak—"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Elizabeth, dear Elizabeth. I knew you couldn't leave the stage behind—"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_2 = {
    Text = "<Small:Huff... Huff... Finally, it's over.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The Troupe Manager squeezes in beside her with a oily grin, his voice almost grovelling."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Liz gracefully steps back, like a butterfly fluttering out of his reach."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_22 = {
    Text = "No one dares to stop her. They can only watch as she disappears down the passage. The manager's smile freezes, then curdles."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Putting on airs? Tch! I would've had my way with that little bitch if it weren't for—"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_24 = {
    Text = "What're you staring at?! Get ready for the next dance! Upset those lords and you'll be the ones paying!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The girls flinch, but in the end none dares to protest. They all obediently climb down and return to formation."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_26 = {
    Text = "And you. What was your name again...? Never mind, it's not important."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The manager picks a beautiful dancer with a lazy flick of his finger. She steps forward with an overjoyed smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Manager, I'm Caroline..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Caroline, Carol, doesn't matter. You're doing the curtain call."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The music ends. You freeze, holding your pose alongside the others, ready for thunderous applause."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_30 = {
    Text = "At your age, you won't be on stage much longer. This is your last shot at stability."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Thanks, Manager!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_32 = {
    Text = "He heaps insult upon insult, but she bows her head, dignity discarded at his feet. The scene is suffocating."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_33 = {
    Text = "...But you can't stay here. You didn't come to someone's dream to become a ballet star."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Seizing the moment, you bow and try to vanish into the crowd."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Liz's backstage door is within reach, but a pudgy hand clamps onto your wrist and yanks you into the wings."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Aw, ow... Manager, you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_37 = {Text = "—SLAP!"},
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The blow rings in your ears. Your cheek flushes and swells instantly, pain blooming across your skin."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_39 = {
    Text = "(Try to slap him back)"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_4 = {
    Text = "But only hushed whispers rise from below."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Dancers keep to a vegetarian diet and frail routines. Offstage, this body is weak."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_41 = {
    Text = "But you are not. Even in dreams, your Awakeners can knock this creep flat—"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Your fists clench, but you force the rising anger back down."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_43 = {
    Text = "(Hold back your anger)"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_44 = {
    Text = "...No. It's not worth it. It wasn't your face anyway."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_45 = {
    Text = "You are not the protagonist of this dream. Lashing out could sever your connection to its owner—maybe for good."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Do you even realise what you've done?! I named you prima ballerina—and you repay me by ruining a crucial rehearsal?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Do you know how humiliating this is? You forgot your steps, nearly ruined our reputation!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Me? But if I'm the principal, then Liz..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Liz? Hah! If she hadn't quit, you'd never get a whiff of this title!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_5 = {
    Text = "...Price...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Quit... Liz was the original principle? Then why..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Too many questions! Get to your room, now!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_52 = {
    Text = "The manager has lost his patience. He grabs you and shoves you into a cramped, dim room."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_53 = {
    Text = "The door slams. He shouts from the other side:"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Pray you remember Elizabeth's steps—or you'll be sold to the House of Bliss!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_55 = {
    Text = "What... what kind of place is that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_56 = {Text = "—Click."},
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_57 = {
    Text = "The lock turns coldly. You know you won't get a response tonight. He's gone."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Oily bastard! May you spend the night stuck on the toilet!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_59 = {
    Text = "You kick the door in frustration. The ancient wood doesn't budge and remains silently wedged in the doorframe."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_6 = {
    Text = "What's the rush? Anyway... performance... auction..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_60 = {Text = "Hngh—!"},
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_61 = {
    Text = "You overestimated the strength of pointe shoes. A piercing pain shoots through your big toe, as if the nail bed had been flipped by your kick."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_62 = {
    Text = "You yelp, tumble onto the bed, curl up and whimper."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Someone knocks on the window."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_64 = {
    Text = "You hadn't locked it. The visitor climbs in with ease."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_65 = {
    Text = "So fierce most of the time, yet all tongue-tied when scolding someone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_66 = {
    Text = "She stands by the bed, leaning over with hands behind her back. Her ash-grey hair brushes your cheek."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_67 = {Text = "Liz—!"},
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Shh. Quiet. The dorm wall is thin. When the music stops, the audience might hear."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_69 = {
    Text = "She presses a chilled cloth to your cheek."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Before you can make out the guests' words, the curtain descends—cutting stage from audience like night from day."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Ssss—Cold!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_71 = {
    Text = "We were slapped on this side, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_72 = {
    Text = "She sits and rolls the cloth gently across your face, your grimace twitching with every pass."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Ice cubes...? Where'd you get them?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_74 = {
    Text = "From that old pig's private cellar."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Old pig? You mean the manager? —Ow, gentler!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_76 = {
    Text = "It's midsummer—ice is rare. He'd never give it to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_77 = {
    Text = "She presses harder."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_78 = {
    Text = "I didn't ask. I took it."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Liz lets go, pulling you up to sit. She rummages through a simple ice pack and fishes out a small ice cube, placing it in your mouth."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_8 = {
    Text = "So beautiful... the real ending to \"Swan Elegy\"... If she hadn't stepped in, I can't imagine..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_80 = {
    Text = "A strange sweetness spreads with the cold, easing the burn on your face. You press the cloth back to your skin."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Did you skip the stage today because you overheard something?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_82 = {Text = "What?"},
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Her gaze hardens. She cups your cheeks and locks eyes with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Did you learn the truth about the troupe? Did the manager or agents force you to—"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Anger and worry rise in her emerald eyes. Her palms grow colder than the ice."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_86 = {
    Text = "You set the pack down and meet her gaze."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_87 = {
    Text = "What about you, Liz? What did they force YOU to do?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_88 = {
    Text = "She looks away uneasily, her eyes drawn to the starlight beyond the window."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_89 = {
    Text = "The city sleeps; only the clatter of carriage wheels echoes in the street."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_9 = {
    Text = "To our rescue? You're giving her too much credit! If she hadn't walked off, we wouldn't have needed to replace her with a half-baked lead..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44811_Content_90 = {
    Text = "But those cruel, laughing voices pierce the wall, still lingering from the stage."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_1 = {
    Text = "A Midsummer Night's Dream"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Elizabeth Salle... Salle, Salle, I remember this is the name of a royal dance troupe."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_100 = {
    Text = "You're crying..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_101 = {
    Text = "Liz abruptly moved closer to you, cupping your face with her hands and wiping away the fallen tears with her thumbs."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_102 = {
    Text = "This means you agree with me, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_103 = {
    Text = "The gray-green eyes were inches away, and this time you clearly saw the struggle and pain within them. She waited for you almost desperately, waiting for your positive answer."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_104 = {
    Text = "...Yes. You're absolutely right."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_105 = {
    Text = "You recall the conversation with Liz in the archives of Mythag University."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_106 = {
    Text = "Dancing... should be pure. A true dancer should express their heart through their steps, not just their body."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_107 = {
    Text = "Liz's eyes lit up, her joy clear to see."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_108 = {
    Text = "We are indeed the same; you can understand me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_109 = {
    Text = "So, could you help me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Yes, the founder of the Salle Dance Troupe was my grandfather."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_110 = {
    Text = "Help you? Liz, do you have any plans?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_111 = {
    Text = "I don't want their evil to keep spreading... I will end it here. With my own hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_112 = {
    Text = "Okay. I'll help you. What do I need to do?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_113 = {
    Text = "Liz touched your face, her tone softening, with a touch of sadness and guilt in her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_114 = {
    Text = "The manager is wary of me; he definitely won't believe I'd step on stage..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_115 = {
    Text = "She picked up the cloth of the makeshift ice pack with two fingers; most of the ice had melted, and the fabric was so wet it could be wrung out."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_116 = {
    Text = "A wave of unexpected drowsiness suddenly washed over him, even his breath was caught in his throat—"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_117 = {
    Text = "Liz... Elizabeth... What have you done..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_118 = {
    Text = "You're the principal he picked. He'd only turn to me if you were absent..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_119 = {
    Text = "Liz covered your mouth and nose with a cloth, and a sweet, familiar yet uncomfortable scent spread through your nostrils."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Oh... I see. Elizabeth, can I call you Liz? Do you like dancing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_120 = {
    Text = "The ice... it's laced..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_121 = {
    Text = "...I can't believe you managed to bite down on that ice cube for so long. It finally melted."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_122 = {
    Text = "You'll be fine. I've seen the manager use this drug to make \"unruly girls\" comply... It's just like a deep sleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_123 = {
    Text = "That's right, after waking up, everything will come to an end..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I really love dancing, sir. Just one look, and I can remember the steps. And when I was twelve, I choreographed an entire ballet."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Oh? You can choreograph dances too? How did the audience respond to it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry, Manager. My dance drama has never been staged. My parents always said they'd disown me if I kept dancing, and even my grandfather hit me several times because of it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_16 = {
    Text = "<Small:Didn't know that old man Salle was such a master of pretense...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Manager? Did you just say something?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Ahem... I'm saying, Old Salle really wasted your talent!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The manager circled Liz, sizing her up with a gaze as if she were a precious work of art."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Through a corridor, the whispers of people conversing in the theater could not be heard clearly. You only sensed that those sounds were tinged with disdainful and superior mockery."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Your arm muscles are more beautiful than any of the other girls in the group. They may be slender, but from your dance audition, they're definitely strong!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_21 = {
    Text = "And the ratio of your waist to your legs... Liz, you're a born dancer! Hiding you and your talent at home is simply a desecration of art!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Do you mean that the Yadri Dance Troupe will accept me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_23 = {
    Text = "That's right! Absolutely. Not only will you join the dance troupe, but you'll also become the new principal, my new star! Your ballet—it'll have its premiere at the largest theater in Londinium!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The new principal? But if I were to become the principal, what about Miss Deneuve, the current prima ballerina of the troupe... I've heard she's especially proud and exceptionally skilled..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
Now we have you, and that's what matters! 
Sign this contract to join the group, and I guarantee I can make you an A-list star!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The manager held Liz's hand, and the latter, filled with joy and resolve, solemnly signed her name on the paper."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_27 = {
    Text = "And the girls' eyes, filled with either disdain or pity, were all taken by her as jealousy of her recognition."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Three Months ago"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The last whip turn. Un, deux, trois, well done."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_3 = {
    Text = "...Don't listen to those voices."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Liz's forehead broke out in a cold sweat from the tension. Only after the dancers accurately completed their moves did Liz finally let out a sigh of relief, smiling at the performers she'd worked with day and night."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Great... Amazing! Just half a scene left, and my \"Swan Elegy\" will be complete."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Liz wanted to hold the dancers' hands and hug the girls, but they sidestepped one by one to avoid her enthusiasm."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Everyone... what's wrong? Just a bit more effort, and we can bring \"Swan Elegy\" to the stage next month."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Oh... sorry, I got carried away. Thanks to everyone, \"Swan Elegy\" could be born; it's the collective creation of our Yadri Dance Troupe—"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Enough, Liz! We've put up with it for so long, and that manager is just—"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Stop talking! Think about Deneuve's fate!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Another dancer held her anxious friend. The first dancer showed a look of lingering fear as her gaze darted around."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Miss Deneuve's... fate? The manager said she retired to go home and take care of the elderly... Didn't she?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Taking care of the elderly, huh? The place the manager chose for her is indeed a good one; Count Geoffrey is very old, after all."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Liz moved her hands up and gently covered your ears."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_40 = {
    Text = "I guess he truly dotes on Deneuve, choosing only elderly gentlemen with one foot in the grave for her... Perhaps it won't be long before she gets a huge inheritance and travels the world."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Hey! Didn't the manager explicitly tell us not to mention this to her!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_42 = {
    Text = "The Old Count, select, inheritance..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_43 = {
    Text = "What are you... talking about?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_44 = {
    Text = "For the sake of your genuine love for dance—leave the dance troupe. I can only say so much."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Shh, don't say anything! Quickly hide backstage, the manager's here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_46 = {
    Text = "The sound of leather shoes echoed from the other side of the stage, and dancers with closer ties quickly pushed each other backstage, leaving Liz alone under the spotlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_47 = {
    Text = "She received a long and grand applause: from the manager who brought her into the dance troupe. His eyes shone with what could only be described as a fanatical light, making Liz feel a slight discomfort."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Liz, you're a true genius. This ballet will elevate the company—and your value—to unparalleled heights!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_49 = {
    Text = "My... value?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Weren't you always curious about the reason I quit the performance?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Count Geoffrey is willing to cover the dance troupe's operating costs for three months just to meet you. This is fantastic news."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Manager, I don't understand... Who is this Count? Why would he go to such lengths for me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Count Geoffrey is our troupe's greatest benefactor. He highly values talented dancers."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Listen to me, the Countess passed away unexpectedly ten days ago. This is your perfect opportunity."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Count Geoffrey..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Stop talking! Think about Deneuve's fate!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Miss Deneuve's... fate? The manager said she retired to go home and take care of the elderly... Didn't she?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Taking care of the elderly, huh? The place the manager chose for her is indeed a good one; Count Geoffrey is very old, after all."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_58 = {
    Text = "I guess he truly dotes on Deneuve, choosing only elderly gentlemen with one foot in the grave for her... Perhaps it won't be long before she gets a huge inheritance and travels the world."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_59 = {
    Text = "The late Count's wife was Miss Deneuve, the former principal, correct?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Then, in a soft, measured tone, through her hands, the deep voice made its way into your ears."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_60 = {
    Text = "...Who told you that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_61 = {
    Text = [[
Manager, please be honest with me. 
"A meeting with the Count"... Is it really that simple?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Liz stared intently at the paunchy manager, her gaze intense, causing him to instinctively turn his head away from her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Tell me, did you sell Miss Deneuve to Count Geoffrey?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_64 = {Text = "Sell?"},
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Seeming to have caught a loophole in Liz's words, the manager gained confidence, puffed out his chest, and spoke with certainty."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Deneuve married the Count of her own free will! As for what happened after their marriage, that's not something a lowly Dance Group Manager like me can casually comment on—they are nobles!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_67 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_68 = {
    Text = "So, the dance troupe has always been your tool for seeking fame and recognition—a ladder to curry favor with the powerful..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Yeah. Right!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The Yadri Dance Troupe has a long history and is renowned throughout the Federation, often invited by nobles and even royal families... When I was very young, I had already heard of the troupe."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Do you know how the audience sees us, how they see you? The poor look up to you, while the rich are all choosing you! Look around the continent—every troupe is the same."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_71 = {
    Text = "My family isn't! They're also members of the dance troupe, they..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Old Salle really wove a beautiful dream for you. You know nothing of the dealings of the Salle Dance Troupe? Your grandfather was the most notorious pimp in the entire Constante Federation!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Are you with me now? In this world, there's no such thing as pure art!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_74 = {
    Text = "The contract you signed when you joined proves I have full control over you—so you can't go anywhere until you're willing to \"see\" the Count!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Alright, I won't leave the theater."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_76 = {
    Text = "I'll give you credit for knowing when to back down, as long as you—"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_77 = {
    Text = "But as a result, I will not continue participating in the rehearsals of \"Swan Elegy.\" I won't teach you the steps of the final act."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_78 = {Text = "You—!"},
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_79 = {
    Text = "I won't let you continue to tarnish my work; it won't be your tool for dealing with the nobility."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_8 = {
    Text = "A year ago, on a midsummer's night, I ran away from home and joined the Yadri Dance Troupe."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_80 = {
    Text = "I want to quit the performance."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_81 = {Text = "Now"},
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_82 = {
    Text = "The harsh reality makes you sweat and makes your scalp tingle. The ice pack in your hand melts away unnoticed, the water running down your arm and soaking through your dance dress."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Actually, the Dance Group Manager... is engaging in such activities."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_84 = {
    Text = "You... haven't you realized their wickedness?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_85 = {
    Text = "You're the new talent unearthed from the masses by that pig, just like me a year ago. I thought you'd discovered something too, and that was why you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_86 = {
    Text = "No, I was just really nervous..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Everything Liz said is swirling around in your head, and you instinctively want to believe her, but..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_88 = {
    Text = "You glanced at the calendar by the bed; this dream was very close to your \"reality.\" Less than thirty years ago. Elizabeth Salle was alive."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_89 = {
    Text = "In your time, ballet performances were absolutely elegant occasions. Under Lord Dexter's patronage, you accompanied Ramona to several shows by different companies."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_9 = {Text = "a year ago"},
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_90 = {
    Text = "If the dance troupes used to be so corrupt, what led to such a drastic change?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_91 = {
    Text = "But why did you go on stage to save the show tonight? I mean, since you've already walked off..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Liz looked up at you, like an elder looking at a silly child—despite being technically still a minor."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Because I can't bring myself to."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Before I learned to walk, I already knew how to swing my arms in ballet motions. While other children my age played hide-and-seek, I secretly practiced walking on tiptoe in the warehouse, and I was so happy."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_95 = {
    Text = "I can't give up dancing, nor can I let go of my work... I can't bear to see the manager fill \"Swan Elegy\" with clumsy and vulgar steps."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_96 = {
    Text = "He's using this to humiliate me... to humiliate my art."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Liz gripped your hands tighter and tighter, with such force that you felt like you were about to dissolve into her pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_98 = {
    Text = "At that moment, your soul seemed to understand her anger and sorrow—so did this body."
  },
  AvgDialog_44812_Content_99 = {
    Text = "You blinked uncontrollably, tears clinging to your lashes, making the world before your eyes blurry."
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Swan's Elegy"
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_10 = {
    Text = "What is this smell... It's so familiar."
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The moment your hand touches the door, you feel the heat permeating the backstage corridor, and wisps of smoke seep into the room through the cracks."
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Is it fire?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Common sense tells you that the room's door won't hold for long. If the structure of this theater is just simple wood, the entire building will soon be engulfed in flames."
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
To leave the room, but not through the door, your gaze shifts to the only window.
If Liz could have climbed in through the window... then so can you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Sure enough, a carriage is parked below the window. You climb out and step onto the carriage roof, easily leaving the second-story room."
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You follow the sound to the front square of the theater. The square is filled with a chaos of voices, and guests dressed in fine attire jostle one another in their rush to escape the theater—"
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Get out of my way! I am the butler of Count Geoffrey. Let me through first!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_18 = {
    Text = "She's gone mad! She's lost her mind!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_19 = {
    Text = "You quickly grab the noble lady whose bun had come undone from running so fast."
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_2 = {Text = "Crackle."},
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Excuse me, what happened in the theater?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You're a dancer?! Don't touch me! You're with that lunatic from the Second Theater, aren't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Second Theater... is it Liz? Could it be Elizabeth? The girl in the black dance dress?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You know that madwoman! And you claim you're not her accomplice! Someone beat that dancer to death for me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The lackeys and some onlookers exchange glances, clearly unwilling to break the law for the noble's sake."
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_25 = {
    Text = "I'll give 100 Leonian Florin to the first person who cuts off a head! No, make it 300!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_26 = {
    Text = "A large sum of money is flung at the trembling laborers, driving them to raise their tools and charge at you—"
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
Holding your head, you wake slowly. You don't know how much time has passed; it's still night outside the window.
It might have been just half an hour, or it could have been an entire day.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_4 = {
    Text = "It's the smell of highly concentrated ether... The manager actually froze such a dangerous substance in ice blocks."
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_5 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Liz fed me ice cubes as soon as I came in, so... no matter how I ended up answering her, she had already decided to spike my drink from the very beginning..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Elizabeth Salle. Liz... What do you really want to do?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_8 = {Text = "Crackle."},
  AvgDialog_44833_Content_9 = {
    Text = "A primitive, charred natural aroma invades your nostrils, rushing into the depths of your brain and forcefully displacing the lingering effects of the medication."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You muster the courage to push open the door of the First Theater. Though the flames haven't yet reached here, thick smoke and heat slam into your face, stinging your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The dancer trembles violently, as if she's heard the name of a demon."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Elizabeth's gone mad! She drugged the food for the audience and everyone else! Everyone passed out!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Only those like me, who are overweight and not allowed to eat, and some ladies who skipped meals to stay slim, managed to get away..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Hey! Hey, don't run! I said don't go in!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You ignore the dancer's warning and rush toward the Second Theater."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_15 = {
    Text = "@2 Garden, Second Theater"
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_16 = {Text = "Liz!"},
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Pushing open the door to the Second Theater, the scene makes your blood run cold. Fainted guests and dancers lie scattered across the floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The once bustling lobby is now silent, with flames spreading everywhere. Only the areas marked by D-Mark have been spared—some things in this world even fire cannot consume."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_19 = {
    Text = "You shouldn't have come."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Cough, cough..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Liz stands in the corner of the stage. You cannot see her; only her voice carries from across half the theater."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Liz, did you start this fire?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
A bitter chuckle comes from the stage, and you know the question is too weak.
Whether or not Liz lit the fire, the fate of her and "you" are already sealed.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_23 = {
    Text = "█A.F.29@1 @2 Garden's Second Theater caught fire during a performance of the ballet \"Swan's Elegy\".\n█Including Count Geoffrey, a member of the royal nobility, and others, a total of 13 nobles, 25 servants, 12 dancers, and 1 dance group manager perished in the flames.\n█After investigation, the arsonist was identified as the deceased prima ballerina \"Elizabeth Salle\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Liz doesn't respond. She still has her back to you, and moves one hand back and forth, as if winding something."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_25 = {Text = "All set."},
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_26 = {
    Text = "She takes two steps forward and stands still at the center of the stage. Then fluid music pours out, blending with the crackle of the flames."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_27 = {
    Text = "This will be the true curtain call of \"Swan's Elegy\". Guess I'll have to make do with phonograph for music, though."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_28 = {
    Text = "You let the musicians go because they were innocent, didn't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_29 = {
    Text = "You're innocent, too. You can still leave. I've been watching you for a while. I know you're not with them."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You tear off a piece of tablecloth, knock over a decorative vase, and use the water from the flowers to wet the cloth."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_30 = {
    Text = "I... No, I desecrated your art. I nearly ruined your \"Swan's Elegy\", remember?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Liz kneels on the stage, extending her hand to beckon you closer. Only now do you notice the stage is covered in black slime—could it be D-Slime?"
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_32 = {
    Text = "You've just taken two steps toward her when a gust of wind slams the theater windows open. The silent flames are suddenly fanned alive, racing to bite at the stage curtains."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Liz! Come down, the fire's spreading!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_34 = {
    Text = "The lintel collapses with a deafening crash, charred beams smashing to the ground, throwing up clouds of ash and sparks, and igniting the cashmere carpet."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Liz, Elizabeth! Don't do anything stupid! Let's leave here together. There's still time!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Please, give this world another chance... Thirty years from now, ballet will be regarded as one of the finest forms of art! Just give it some time..."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Liz lies at the edge of the stage and extends her hand toward you once more."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Her palm is smeared with D-Slime, yet when it touches your cheek, it carries the warmth of a living person."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_39 = {
    Text = "I know I can't put an end to all of the evil in this world today... I've always known that."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Covering your mouth and nose with the damp cloth, the humid air, rich with an earthy, rooty scent, fills your lungs. You crouch down and feel your way forward slowly on the carpet."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_40 = {
    Text = "All I want is to light up a fire. A fire to reveal the darkness, to let justice shine through. I have no other choice."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_41 = {
    Text = "With that, she pushes you away with all her might."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I drugged you without your consent."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Are you sure you're not leaving? You can still jump out the window."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_44 = {
    Text = "You shake your head and sit at the stage's edge, arms wrapped around your legs."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_45 = {
    Text = "You count the people in dance dresses in the theater, including Liz, and there are only 11."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_46 = {
    Text = "So that makes you the 12th to perish in the flames."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Well. Then I'll make you my only audience today."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Elizabeth Salle, presenting a solo performance of \"Swan's Elegy\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Liz bows to you and casually lifts the burning curtain; the D-Slime on her hands and body ignites instantly—no, it is tar."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_5 = {Text = "—Ow!"},
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Crimson fireworks bloom silently along the hem, like trembling swan wings rising from the ashes."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Liz spins gracefully, each turn drawing her closer to the fire meteor streaking across the night sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_52 = {
    Text = "The daughter of art cries out her final chapter, the flames rolling over the stage—yet there is no fear in her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_53 = {
    Text = "The phonograph is consumed, reduced to cinders. As the final note fades into the firelight, her silhouette melts into the blaze."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_54 = {
    Text = "In her final leap through the flames, some found closure, while others glimpsed a new era."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The running girl collides with you, and you both tumble to the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Why are you still going in?! Run, hurry!"
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You recall this dancer. According to Liz's description, she seemed especially warm and kind."
  },
  AvgDialog_44835_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Is Liz inside?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_1 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_10 = {Text = "N..."},
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Why am I remembering how I gained this form now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Is it because I heard that man's name, or am I having a dying flashback?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Old memories from a long, long time ago are flooding back."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Before becoming \"The Beast,\" I was just an everyday detective—the kind who'd grab a couple of drinks and a game after getting paid."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_15 = {
    Text = "My freakish luck earned me quite some jobs from the Londinium inspector—clues or suspect spots."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_16 = {
    Text = "No reason to turn down easy cash."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Until one day, the perp I nabbed vanished from lockup, leaving perfectly intact silver cuffs dangling in the wind."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_18 = {
    Text = "None of my business, of course. I just hit the usual underground casino to blow the fresh commission."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_19 = {
    Text = "You're... that runaway suspect!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A massive transparent claw materializes high above, slamming Ryker against the wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Oh, you must be the guy who caught me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Wouldn't mind tagging along back to jail for a couple days—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_22 = {
    Text = "He rattled the dice cup in his hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_23 = {
    Text = "But you gotta beat me first."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_24 = {
    Text = "I didn't think I'd lose."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_25 = {
    Text = "I was twenty-five, never tasted defeat."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Once I focused hard and let the casino lights, dice rolls, and card flips sink in..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_27 = {
    Text = "My gut told me the answer."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_28 = {Text = "Roll 'em."},
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Hold up—you haven't said your stake."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Blood trickles from Ryker's mouth; air squeezes from his lungs, each breath a struggle."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_30 = {
    Text = "What do you want?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_31 = {
    Text = [[
I wasn't planning to bet anything.
Whatever it was, I'd win anyway.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Go ahead—you can name anything."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Hmm... How about that cigar?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_34 = {
    Text = "He pointed to the one in my mouth."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_35 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Sorry, but your cigar is mine now."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_37 = {
    Text = "He snatched the lit cigar from my hand, grinned, and took a deep drag. Ignoring my shock, he puffed white rings mockingly."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Another round?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_39 = {
    Text = "That day, I lost my wallet, cane, deerstalker, tie, and suit."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You're gonna run out of bullets eventually. What's the point of dragging this out further?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_40 = {
    Text = "We played high-low, blackjack, Texas hold'em."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Hundreds of games, zero wins."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Finally, he pulled a revolver."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Russian roulette—a brutal game wagering lives."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Gamblers take turns firing at themselves until the lone bullet hits someone's temple."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_45 = {
    Text = "I pulled the trigger without a second thought; the bullet claimed my life without mercy."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_46 = {
    Text = "I chased that man named \"N,\" betting 316 rounds to make him confess."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Didn't peg you for the justice type."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Nah, nothing to do with justice—I just never lose."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_49 = {
    Text = "But you lost to him that day. Why would you say \"never\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Your every gasp for air, every heartbeat... it just further fuels my show."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_50 = {
    Text = "This isn't a vocabulary quiz, my friend."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_51 = {
    Text = "I just... never, ever lost before. Plain and simple."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_52 = {
    Text = "I am fated to win, no matter what. So I was curious how that guy was able to bend fate."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Chasing curiosity at the cost of your life? Folks call me crazy, but now I'm not sure who's crazier between us."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_54 = {
    Text = "You're exaggerating. Folks spend lifetimes chasing Dissolution cures. Herbert's after human ascension; Aramites seek eternal bloodlines."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Everyone spends their lives on maybe-fruitless pursuits—my curiosity's no different, so it's not a real cost."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Plus, that guy made me a new body. We're in a new bet—now I've got endless time to explore new worlds. Could be a blessing in disguise."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_57 = {
    Text = "I'll take this one bullet and a momentary pain. He'll show up and bet opposite me for sure. And I know he'll make himself win."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_58 = {
    Text = "This time, N, I bet you can stop %player% from reaching the ritual site."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Ryker presses the revolver to his temple."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The more you struggle, the more my cage tightens."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_60 = {
    Text = "You have too much confidence. It's reckless."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_61 = {
    Text = [[
What if I told you N has been pulling strings behind everything?
Do you still think he would help you?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Ryker sighs softly."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_63 = {
    Text = "As a fellow thrill-seeker, you never grasp human emotions—so your take on joy's never quite peak."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_64 = {
    Text = "I'm betting this life on it—I bet he'll honor the deal."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Bam. A gunshot sounds."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Followed by seconds of silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_67 = {
    Text = "What the... Can't you give me a heads up before shooting yourself?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Cheerful laughter erupts from somewhere high and distant, behind reality's scenes."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Splendid, splendid! Still as bold as ever—I made no mistake giving you this flawless form.\nVery well! I'll savor your life's dregs and grant your wish."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The one who gave you that form—his name is \"N,\" right? Is he that stingy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Two pitch-black, gold-rimmed dice appear in Ryker's palm."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Roll the dice—a natural 1, and I'll devour your foe."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Ryker laughs, coughing blood that sprays under the spotlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Couldn't ask for more."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Ryker tosses the two dice."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_75 = {
    Text = "They clatter and roll."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_76 = {
    Text = "When it comes to luck..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_77 = {
    Text = "One die stops at 0."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_78 = {
    Text = "I never lose."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_79 = {
    Text = "The other halts at 1."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The claw releases; Ryker plummets, coughing hard, slumping weakly to the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Next instant—the higher being's unrestrained laugh, and the magician's gut-wrenching scream."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Black D-Slime corrodes the entire drape, leaving two crescent scraps fluttering to the sand."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Like a certain man's mirthful, crinkled eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_45413_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You're barely Awakener material—Gnosis Index over 21 yet?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_1 = {Text = "M-Monster!"},
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The re-remains are... in the secret chamber up ahead!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Meanwhile—Abandoned Factory Ducts"
  },
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_12 = {
    Text = "A boy crawls through factory ducts, rust and coal smearing his fine features to a mottled black."
  },
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_13 = {
    Text = "He creeps softly, trailing the group below."
  },
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I warned Lady Juliette from the start—those travelers are no good..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_15 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_16 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_17 = {
    Text = "At the secret chamber's threshold, the wolf-headed man kicks the iron door flying, dust billowing. He leaves one Aram soldier bound at the entry; the rest file past the wreckage."
  },
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The boy slides from the duct, freeing the guard's hood and ropes."
  },
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Shh, don't alert them. Go warn Chieftain Alva while I tail them..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You fight Nubia every day, yet you freak out at my look?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Now speak. Where did you hide the Mother Tree's remains?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_4 = {
    Text = "By the Mother Tree, we'll tell you nothing—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Oh? Really?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Ryker crouches, a wolfish huff rasping a low growl; fangs clack sharp in the factory hush."
  },
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Know what it's like getting torn by a wolf? Let me picture it: fangs sinking deep, ripping flesh and nerve in bloody chunks—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_8 = {
    Text = "<Shake:N-No, don't eat me—I'll talk!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_45414_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Hey, you—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45415_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The storm rages fiercer; Aram soldiers howl, panic, shout, beg, curse."
  },
  AvgDialog_45415_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Countless Aramites turn toward Thais, kneeling in solemn devotion."
  },
  AvgDialog_45415_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The frenzied sand spirits calm under the prayer's soothing; the storm gradually fades."
  },
  AvgDialog_45415_Content_12 = {
    Text = "It's the Queen! It's the Queen!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45415_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Praise the Queen!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45415_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The Queen's eyes are still upon us!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45415_Content_15 = {
    Text = "We... We made it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45415_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You spot the figure on a dune."
  },
  AvgDialog_45415_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You recognize the silhouette. It's Thais."
  },
  AvgDialog_45415_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The storm... is it dying down?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45415_Content_5 = {
    Text = "With the howling winds whipping her veils, she chants an unknown prayer, stepping slow and steady into the dark sandstorm."
  },
  AvgDialog_45415_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The thunderous roar deafens, yet the prayer cuts through clear, echoing inside your skull."
  },
  AvgDialog_45415_Content_7 = {
    Text = "In the sky-devouring gale, she converses calmly with some entity lurking in the desert sands."
  },
  AvgDialog_45415_Content_8 = {
    Text = "It's the Queen! She's come to save us—to save Aram!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45415_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The Aram group, frantic to escape moments ago, suddenly halts."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You know these monsters, little one?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Under Mother Tree's grace, Aramites have been able to counter high infant mortality with unnatural breeding speed."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_11 = {
    Text = "That's why the bonfire feast... we can't survive without it."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Ask her about Nubia."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I have no clue on their origins, but they carry a familiar scent."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Sometimes, those Nubia feel like Aramite kin."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_15 = {
    Text = "...You say they're herding Aramites to breach the Storm Wall?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I guessed as much. The Aramites crave passage beyond that Storm Wall too. To find the Mother Tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_17 = {
    Text = "It's still futile, though. The Storm Wall yields only to recognized envoys."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_18 = {
    Text = "More questions?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Ask her about Juliette."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Hmm, no—compared to these beasts, you're the stranger one. The real monster."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_20 = {
    Text = "One more—that \"envoy\" Juliette. Tell me about her."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The Foreign Envoy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_22 = {
    Text = "That's my question for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_23 = {
    Text = "%player%, do you trust that envoy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_24 = {Text = "I do."},
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_25 = {Text = "I don't."},
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Before you can speak, Thais leans in, fingertip grazing your lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_27 = {
    Text = "No rush. Take your time."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_28 = {
    Text = "We still have... plenty of time."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Now, little monster, what would you like to know?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Ask her about the Bonfire Feast."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Sigh. I'm still sad about that night."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Never thought someone would refuse siring an heir for Aram's Queen."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_7 = {
    Text = "In a word: do you think this desert is fit for human thriving?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You remember the scouring gales, parched springs, nocturnal predators, venomous crawlers, and reservoirs tainted by Dissolution. You shake your head."
  },
  AvgDialog_45416_Content_9 = {
    Text = "But we can't leave."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree's branches seem sentient, stretching greedily in all directions; human outlines flicker within, movements clumsy and pained."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ramona! Ignite the Mother Tree with Silver Flames! Only you can do it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Silver phantoms assault the Mother Tree's roots; silver flames erupt, becoming a blaze of destruction."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Tongues of fire slither up the trunk like silver serpents; branches writhe and scream in the rampage, hissing sharply—as if the Mother Tree wails in torment."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Wait—the tree's toppling, and the Keeper's still up there!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, dear—I'll return {Male=him,Female=her} safe and sound."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The colossal tree shakes; the earth trembles."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You lose footing, plummeting straight down—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_17 = {
    Text = "How high? A thousand feet? More?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Then, a warm, soft embrace catches you."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Good child, you've done wonderfully."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The first to form a throat groans, struggling free from the Mother Tree's grip, plummeting from on high into the Holy River."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_20 = {
    Text = "On her chest, the white jade you fastened gleams against her silky skin."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Thais unhooks it, swallows it, biting gently."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
I'll return to the Holy River, nurturing the whole earth.
This is my parting gift to you.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_23 = {
    Text = "In the instant you plunge into the raging Holy River, her lips meet yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Your breaths entwine. Your souls merge into one."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Her tongue slips in—warm, wet, tender yet insistent."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The kiss mingles love's sweetness, blood's tang, and a small, round... something."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The tree's seed."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_28 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_29 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_3 = {Text = "...Splash!"},
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_30 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_31 = {
    Text = "It's over... Though not in the way I envisioned."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_32 = {
    Text = "As descendants of the Aeon of Desire, the Aramites obsessed over bloodline continuity.."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_33 = {
    Text = "We revered the Mother Tree, blending its essence into our bones, seeking superhuman fertility."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Our belief was that if even one descendant survived the black doom, our civilization would endure to the next cycle."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_35 = {
    Text = "But we were wrong."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Their true sustainer wasn't a single descendant; they were utterly enslaved to reproduction, chained by an uncontrollable breeding urge across the ages."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_37 = {
    Text = "In centuries of exile... only Alva truly pushed Aram forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Tawil, you were right. We should trust human will."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Even in endless darkness, even if the light of hope is faint... Humans never yield; that spirit alone can change fated futures."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_4 = {Text = "Splash!"},
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Now, I have found a new answer."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_41 = {
    Text = "So, Tawil, lend me your chosen successor. Be generous, will you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_42 = {
    Text = "I will entrust my seed with {Male=him,Female=her}."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_43 = {
    Text = "The seed will root, sprout, grow into a beautiful tree—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Like how the first Mother Tree was born."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_45 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_46 = {
    Text = "This final seed... I plant it within you."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Until it spreads my blood across the earth, you must not die..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_48 = {
    Text = "You will remember me. Never forget me."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Tides surge."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Splash! Splash!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_50 = {
    Text = "That warm embrace pushes you away."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_51 = {
    Text = "In the current's tumbling assault, you see her drift deeper into the river."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_52 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_53 = {
    Text = "A pale, slender hand grabs you—familiar, firm."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_54 = {Text = "%player%!"},
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Aramites fall, one after another."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Seconds later, small heads bob up, struggling toward shore."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The branch beneath your feet quakes."
  },
  AvgDialog_45417_Content_9 = {Text = "It's time!"},
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Cough, cough... You outnumbered me. Shameless!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
No need.
The Mother Tree's seed is not inside.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I never imagined the Aramite Mother Tree's remains had been Dissoluted to this extent..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Herbert and Casiah fade into distant dunes, finally giving the three of you a moment to breathe."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_13 = {
    Text = "We can tell Alva to retrieve the remains now."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_14 = {
    Text = "No rush—it's our best chance to probe the remains, no?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Besides... check out the corner where Casiah was standing."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_16 = {
    Text = "From the remains' crevice, black slime slowly seeps out, flowing into deliberately chiseled grooves in the floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Wait—I saw this in the Queen's tent..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_18 = {
    Text = [[
Which means this wasn't Casiah's doing. It's a structure built by the Aramites.
They're extracting D-Slime from the remains for some purpose.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Allow me to satisfy your curiosity."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_2 = {Text = "But hey..."},
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_20 = {
    Text = "No one noticed Juliette's return. She appears behind the iron gate, walking toward you over the stone steps."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Since we're all entangled in mysteries, I'll cut to the chase: does Mythag know about the three Aeons?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
Ramona and Ryker both turn your way.
You pause, weighing Juliette's conduct, then nod.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Since you've heard of the Aeon of Desire, this will be easier to explain."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The so-called Mother Tree's remains... are in fact the mummified corpse of <Yellow:Tifere Yesod>, the Aeon of Desire."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_25 = {
    Text = "For the Aramites, the most crucial part is the fluid accumulated in this coffin."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_26 = {
    Text = "It seeps endlessly from the mummy."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_27 = {
    Text = "We both know what it is... it's D-Slime."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Tifere Yesod's divine power slows the Dissolution's erosion dramatically, and from it, the Aramites draw their power of fertility."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Wait, you mean..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Casiah's stage is all set!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Ramona begins to retch."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You... You brew <Yellow:drinks> from the Mother Tree's <Yellow:D-Slime>... Liquid from a corpse..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_32 = {
    Text = "That's why they fell into a frenzy, why they gained that abnormal fertility..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Not from their bloodline, but from this mummy."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_34 = {
    Text = "With the Mother Tree gone and its power waning, deformities keep rising."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_35 = {
    Text = "You've noticed it too, right? The Dissolution black mist drifting from those Aramites."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The Aramites differ from ordinary humans; at their core, they're all the Mother Tree's offspring."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_37 = {
    Text = "If the Mother Tree is fully Dissoluted, it's not just their fertility that vanishes—every existing Aramite will perish."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_38 = {
    Text = "That's why the Aramites must breach the Storm Wall and revive the Mother Tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_39 = {
    Text = "I don't know why Mythag sent you to Remouahe, but based on the trust we've built, I'll share the Aramites' deepest secret with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_4 = {
    Text = "A transparent giant claw rips through the air, smashing the flimsy wall. Casiah vaults atop, riding off toward the distant desert."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_40 = {
    Text = "If you stop the ritual, every Aramite you've seen in Remouahe will die—without exception."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Receiving the message, William arrives at the tent again in the dead of night."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Ramona's asleep?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Yeah, burning up badly."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Regarding the Aeon of Desire... Tell me what you make of Juliette's findings."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_45 = {
    Text = "I don't know."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_46 = {
    Text = "We should have realized when we heard about that twisted bonfire feast."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_47 = {
    Text = "This method of reproduction is nothing like the usual Kadathians'."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Besides, Ramona's been feverish ever since arriving in Remouahe."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Did she get sick because of this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_5 = {
    Text = "See you around!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_50 = {
    Text = "I have a theory..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_51 = {
    Text = "You've met Tawil and know about <Blue:Ramona: Timeworn>. You should know her connection to Tawil by now."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_52 = {
    Text = "The powers of the three Aeons repel each other. The water in Remouahe comes from the Aeon of Desire's bloodline—it's poison to Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_53 = {
    Text = "The closer to the Holy River's source, the stronger this repulsion gets."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_54 = {
    Text = "The Aramites will try to breach the Storm Wall again tomorrow."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Ramona must stay outside the Storm Wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_56 = {
    Text = "The three of us will handle the rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_57 = {
    Text = "No way—I'm part of Mythag too, I can't..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Ramona struggles up from the bedding, swaying unsteadily, nearly collapsing back down."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Ramona, you're in no shape for this."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_6 = {Text = "Hey—"},
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_60 = {
    Text = "You tuck the blanket around her. The girl, assailed by heat, glares at you shakily but says nothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_61 = {
    Text = "You are not leaving me behind alone..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Let them go. It could be a diversion—the Mother Tree's remains are still here."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Casiah shakes the flask in her hand, rolling with black slime."
  },
  AvgDialog_45418_Content_9 = {
    Text = "That's it? I could snag the coffin too."
  },
  AvgDialog_45419_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The Sculptors' Association's hulking lab spawn crashes down, air thick with acrid rust."
  },
  AvgDialog_45419_Content_10 = {
    Text = "In Aram lands, priorities aren't yours to set, outsiders."
  },
  AvgDialog_45419_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
Her anger echoes hollow in the factory voids.
Aram's chieftain commands dozens of soldiers to block your way out.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45419_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The soldier you'd stashed outside—now freed, somehow—trails her, pointing your way."
  },
  AvgDialog_45419_Content_13 = {
    Text = "That does it. The truce is over, outsiders."
  },
  AvgDialog_45419_Content_2 = {
    Text = "...It's not here."
  },
  AvgDialog_45419_Content_3 = {
    Text = "No, it was here."
  },
  AvgDialog_45419_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Ryker's fingertip skims the floor, then lifts to pinch and blow.
Dust drifts from his black gloves, dancing in window light.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45419_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I can see some faint foot prints."
  },
  AvgDialog_45419_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
Shadows of the broken window stripe the concrete slab etched with a coffin's outline.
Yet the coffin is not there.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45419_Content_7 = {
    Text = "We should've known. Lady Daffodil wouldn't sell intel to just one buyer."
  },
  AvgDialog_45419_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Should've priced an exclusive, perhaps?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45419_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Stow the wit. The Mother Tree's remains remain our priority."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Lady Alva, please allow me to have a few words with {Male=him,Female=her}."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Her expression twists with unnatural zeal; words tumble fast, body leaning in, eyes ghostly."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I'll see you again, Pupilless Eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_12 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_13 = {
    Text = "No, this isn't over. Because she urged you, with utmost sincerity, to call her name."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Recalling Thais's gaze, you activate the Silver Key."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Silver threads sway, pull, seek..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_16 = {
    Text = "At the thread's end—nothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Dissolution has devoured her entirely. Not even you can find her now."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Still hoping she'll return? The Aramites heed only me now."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Thais... Thais!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Juliette's words break the stalemate."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_20 = {
    Text = "If she could show up, if she could reveal Aram's future to Alva..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_21 = {
    Text = "With a single word from her, you wouldn't have to face Alva blade-to-blade."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Thais... THAIS!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Your cries are futile. Your last words to her were accusations."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Her existence has been Dissoluted. Without a Silver Core, you can't reach her at all."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_25 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Hmm? Has this journey made you too arrogant to ask for help?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Or are you just a useless crybaby without me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Either way, you have reached here alone after losing all companions. That grit deserves praise."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_29 = {
    Text = "So, I'll lend my Authority to her—and to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_3 = {
    Text = "If you insist."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The desert's calm shatters with a sudden gust; the horizon darkens fast, as if all light succumbs to the oncoming fury."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_31 = {
    Text = "A sandstorm roars like an enraged behemoth, sweeping in tons of grit, blotting sun and sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_32 = {
    Text = "In this rampaging force, a colossal silhouette flickers, shifting amid the dust."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_33 = {
    Text = "The Storm Wall..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_34 = {
    Text = "The Storm Wall... I summoned it with my Authority."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_35 = {
    Text = "You're... Thais...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_36 = {
    Text = "It brims with endless power; as dust dances wildly, the shadow leaps, warps—like an ancient desert monster hunting in the gale."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Its form immense and terrifying: coiled massive head, razor claws, ponderous hooves—all glimpsed in swirling sand."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_38 = {
    Text = "You're not entirely wrong to call me that."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_39 = {
    Text = "But I'm not the Queen you expect."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Guards, don't let them harm the envoy."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_40 = {
    Text = "To wield my power, chant my sacred name aloud.\nI am the Aeon of Desire—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_41 = {
    Text = "The vast, bizarre shadow fades; the figure you seek emerges from the howling storm."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Grit whirls mercilessly around her, yet her steps remain unshaken."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_43 = {
    Text = "<Change>Tifere Yesod."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_44 = {
    Text = "The Queen! The Queen has returned!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_45 = {
    Text = "The Queen's eyes are always upon us!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_46 = {
    Text = "She has always watched over Aram, past and future flowing in its blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Lady Thais..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Aramites, heed me! The ancient prophecy has been fulfilled! The Mother Tree returns, crowning the departed!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_49 = {
    Text = "The Queen walks the sands once more, reclaiming her throne!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_5 = {Text = "Yes!"},
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Aram's one true Queen, Lady Thais—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_51 = {
    Text = "shall have your will and loyalty!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Juliette leans close, whispering at arm's length."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Returning to the Holy River is Aram's destiny. I'm merely... hastening it a bit."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_8 = {
    Text = "When His gaze blankets all of Kadath, they'll merge with the river into a new world."
  },
  AvgDialog_45420_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Isn't that your will too?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45421_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Who's there?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45421_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ambush in the front and pursued from behind—lovely."
  },
  AvgDialog_45421_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Can't let these Aram soldiers spot us."
  },
  AvgDialog_45421_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Guess we're diving deeper then?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45422_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
Tricky. We don't know the remains' exact spot.
The factory is a maze. There's too many rooms; we can't search every one of them.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45422_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You'll hide somewhere and back me up! Stay unseen. I'll blindfold 'em!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45422_Content_2 = {
    Text = "I got a plan."
  },
  AvgDialog_45422_Content_3 = {
    Text = "We snag an Aram guard, tie him up and grill him."
  },
  AvgDialog_45422_Content_4 = {
    Text = "And then? Do we silence him by burying him in the sand, or let him go and put ourselves on the wanted list?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45422_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Whoops—didn't think that far. Rookie move."
  },
  AvgDialog_45422_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
He says it breezily, totally unconcerned.
That sly lilt hints at a backup plan.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45422_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Any way to pry clues without blowing our cover?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45422_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Simple as pie."
  },
  AvgDialog_45422_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ryker peels the incense patch from his glove, his green-glow eyes flashing in the dark."
  },
  AvgDialog_45423_Content_1 = {
    Text = "This, this can't be! The Storm Wall has no end!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45423_Content_2 = {
    Text = "We can't breach it—the Queen has forsaken us!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45423_Content_3 = {
    Text = "She's forsaken us long ago!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45423_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Screams and wails fill the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_45424_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The Queen shall protect us!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45424_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The Queen shall protect Aram!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45424_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Small:Thais isn't even here...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_45424_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The Nubia's pack is still swelling!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45424_Content_5 = {
    Text = "That's it—we gotta push on with these lunatics!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_1 = {Text = "Wager"},
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Your eyes snap open. Aside from the dawn light outside, everything remains as it was when you lay down."
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I've figured it out. It's the motive."
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_12 = {
    Text = "If all this was the Church of the Lightbearers' doing, there's no need to leave that lantern inside the Nubia."
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Piecing together what we've seen on this trip, the real culprit has to be—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Ryker rips through the tent's fabric with his claws, and a sneaky magician emerges with the endless dunes."
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You two, from the Sculptors' Association."
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Tee-hee, busted? I was hoping to listen in a bit longer."
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Her tone is bubbly, no trace of nervousness from getting caught."
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Casiah, you—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Hey now, debts to the debtor! I didn't kill your Senior William, so no vendetta on me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You drag yourself back to the tent, where Ryker sits quietly in the corner, chin in hand, lost in thought."
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_20 = {
    Text = "My gig's simple: Snag this one..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_21 = {
    Text = "She points at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_22 = {
    Text = "And bring {Male=him,Female=her} to the one I serve."
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Tomorrow's bound to be a rough fight. Why aren't you resting?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
You go ahead and crash.
My gut's feeling is... there is one more unsolved puzzle in this "crime scene."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You wash up and collapse from exhaustion."
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_6 = {
    Text = "In the chaotic dream, countless faces—familiar yet strange—flash through your memory, blurred, raspy, grotesque, each calling your name in turn."
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I want to live..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_8 = {
    Text = "<RedBig:I want to live...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_45425_Content_9 = {Text = "Enough!"},
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Farewell Kiss"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You draw a deep breath, ready to head back to the tent, when Thais beckons from behind it."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_100 = {
    Text = "But Aramites rely too much on the Mother Tree's power."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_101 = {
    Text = "That dependence is like a fragile sand tower: seemingly sturdy, but one tidal surge wipes it out."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_102 = {
    Text = "But I cannot easily let them abandon even the smallest, faintest thread of hope."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_103 = {
    Text = "I don't get it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_104 = {
    Text = "To make farewells less painful, reunions are precious... you don't need to get it. For now."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_105 = {
    Text = "But one day, we will all face the same doom."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_106 = {
    Text = "You fall speechless."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_107 = {
    Text = "When that inevitable day comes... remember to call my name."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_108 = {
    Text = "She plants a soft kiss on your forehead."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_109 = {
    Text = "Your mind reels, and she sways back. You extend your hand, but she's out of your reach."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
Tomorrow is the Mother Tree's rebirth ritual.
What would you want with me now, Your Majesty?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_110 = {
    Text = "You watch her receding figure shrink, finally dissolving into a grain-like speck, vanishing in the pristine moonlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The words come out sharper than you intended."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
I... saw it.
What happened to your companion... I'm so sorry.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_14 = {
    Text = "An inevitable silence lingers between you."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_15 = {
    Text = "This has nothing to do with Aram."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_16 = {
    Text = "It's not Thais's fault, you remind yourself—but your words prick like a wary hedgehog in the dunes."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The rebirth ritual... you must have preparations too, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You try to soften it, but it still lands like a cold brush-off."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Where do you think the Aramites will go once the Mother Tree revives?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
In this journey, you've witnessed many departures.
But not once has death felt so suffocatingly understated.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You stay quiet."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_21 = {
    Text = "I know why Mythag came to Remouahe, and why you've held back so long."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_22 = {
    Text = "I'm grateful—you gave Aram a chance."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_23 = {
    Text = "But that chance is no more."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Thais, you know the Mother Tree's contaminated by Dissolution, don't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_25 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I know, I... knew it all along."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Then you should realize Mythag won't stand by and let Dissolution spread."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
I'll stop the Mother Tree's revival.
Thais, we're enemies now.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The once-refreshing sea of sand turns thick and sticky; inhaled dust scrapes your throat, leaving a faint ache."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
Of all people, it had to be William.
Mythag's legendary investigator, your mentor on this path.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_30 = {
    Text = "To your surprise, Thais doesn't pull away—she draws closer, wrapping you in her embrace."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Sweet child, I understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I mean no harm to you or your companions, nor would I ever act against Aram's interests."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_33 = {
    Text = "But the Aramites have no other path. Long ago, the Queen's power waned—it could barely protect the Mother Tree anymore."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Had to borrow Remouahe's ley lines, summoning the Storm Wall to hide its location."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_35 = {
    Text = "You mean... the Storm Wall was summoned by the Queen's power?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Yes. The Storm Wall... wards off false envoys."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_37 = {
    Text = "But every ritual claims so many Aramite lives!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_38 = {
    Text = "As long as our fertility endures, Aramites won't die out."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_39 = {
    Text = "So you just allow them to cling to this cursed rite, letting them fall to the Storm Wall time and time again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Who could possibly kill a legend like him, silently, just steps away?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_40 = {
    Text = "This is every Aramite's fate. We were born here and raised here."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Your twisted faith has killed countless people!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Not just your people... and now William, too..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Your voice cracks faintly; you barely recognize it as your own."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Tell me, Thais—you don't really believe in this, do you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Thais offers no answer."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_46 = {
    Text = "She simply tightens her hold."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_47 = {
    Text = "I know you're exhausted, angry..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_48 = {
    Text = [[
I know you resent me. You don't understand why.
But I have my reasons.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Let me tell you a story—a very long one."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You stagger back weakly, collapsing against a tall figure."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Long, long ago—millennia before the Flood—a civilization worshipped a deity called the Mother Tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_51 = {
    Text = "But the Tree's will was too elusive to stabilize their rule. To fix this, the empire hatched a terrible scheme:"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_52 = {
    Text = "They selected many girls, forcing them to drink the Mother Tree's crimson sap and bathe in its juices until one girl successfully merged with the entity."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_53 = {
    Text = "From then on, this \"puppet girl\" was said to embody the Tree's divine will."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_54 = {
    Text = "But no one ever listened to her or obeyed her words. The girl had no will of her own; she was merely a mouthpiece, repeating the commands recited to her by the King of Nineveh."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_55 = {
    Text = "She was fifteen when she first spoke out in rebellion."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Why? Why kill him? He's Amayet's father!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_57 = {
    Text = "He violated the taboo, Thais. He fled the battlefield."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_58 = {
    Text = "The battle was lost! He was the only survivor—he couldn't fight that many enemies alone!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_59 = {
    Text = "You're too young to understand war, Thais."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I get how you feel, but this ain't the time to break down."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_60 = {
    Text = "He should have charged ahead and died honorably."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Isn't one survivor better? With him alive... Amayet could become a warrior, his brother too, and Amayet's future children..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_62 = {
    Text = "My decision is final."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Proclaim the Mother Tree's will: the sinner shall be devoured alive by insects."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_64 = {
    Text = "I didn't say that!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Proclaim the Mother Tree's will: the sinner shall be devoured alive by insects."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_66 = {
    Text = "I DIDN'T SAY THAT!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Proclaim the Mother Tree's will..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_68 = {
    Text = "No, don't...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_69 = {
    Text = "The sinner shall be devoured alive by insects."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_7 = {
    Text = "He... left us the key info."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_70 = {
    Text = "The girl's desperate, piercing cries went unheard."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Wh-who are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Hush, kiddo—keep it down. And follow me quickly."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_73 = {
    Text = "You're not the first puppet. Whenever a girl try to act against them, she is sacrificed to the Holy River."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_74 = {
    Text = "I was born bathing in the Mother Tree's sap—I'm immortal!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Silly child, that's a lie. Everyone drowns in water."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_76 = {Text = "I won't."},
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Who are you, anyway? I've never seen you before."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_78 = {
    Text = "I clean your garden, leaving before dawn—so you've never spotted me."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_79 = {
    Text = "But you know my grandson. His name was... Amayet."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The Church of the Lightbearers is behind the Nubia.\nDaffodil wasn't bluffing—stopping the ritual's a must now."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Did the girl escape?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_81 = {Text = "No."},
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_82 = {
    Text = "In that moment, the girl realized a lot."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_83 = {
    Text = "That soiled gardens don't clean themselves."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_84 = {
    Text = "That some things exist unseen."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_85 = {
    Text = "That being forced to stay silent... is such agony."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_86 = {
    Text = "...On the sacrifice day, she jumped into the Holy River willingly."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_87 = {
    Text = "In that instant, the girl's will resonated with the Tree's."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Then, the Tree asked her:"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Will you become my vessel, giving birth to my flesh and soul?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Stars twinkle in the vast night sky; the desert breeze finally steadies your ragged breaths."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_90 = {
    Text = [[
Through the soul's wondrous harmony, the girl heard the tree's voice.
That night, she learned of the knowledge tied to the <Red:Black End>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Black End... you mean Dissolution?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_92 = {
    Text = "The girl returned to the Tree's side, no longer bound by the king's commands. All people obeyed her only, commanded by their shared bloodline."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_93 = {
    Text = "She became one with the Tree. More than personal survival, her burden was ensuring her whole kin would escape the impending doom."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_94 = {
    Text = "When the Niniveh Empire fell, she led a group deep into the desert's heart, into untrodden storms, to preserve the last of her people."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_95 = {
    Text = "And those people became... the nomadic Aramites?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Much later, the girl vanished again."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_97 = {
    Text = "No one heard her voice; no one sang her name."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_98 = {
    Text = "But all followed her will, breeding desperately to evade the end..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45426_Content_99 = {
    Text = "To preserve the seed of their bloodline when the inevitable catastrophe befalls them."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_1 = {Text = "Dance"},
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Worry not, Czort. The young will carve their own path ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_100 = {
    Text = "You follow her gaze: Ramona jogs toward you, with Ryker close behind—swift yet poised, elegance unbroken."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_101 = {
    Text = "Remember: tonight's our secret."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_102 = {
    Text = "You turn—Thais vanishes, with only winds keening over dunes."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_103 = {
    Text = "Before you, sands bear a black D-Slime stain, merging with the earth."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_11 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You stir from haze, the vast starfield blazing clear and boundless above."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_13 = {
    Text = "How did I... drift off?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Long desert marches weary the soul. It's nothing unusual."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I have more questions..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The endless dream wrenches you from the trek's strain; queries cascade through your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Why did Ramona's water turn to D-Slime?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Who's unleashing these Nubia?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_19 = {
    Text = "What lurks beyond the Storm Wall?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_2 = {
    Text = "▼▼ dwells in chaos; none foresees the end.\nWhat must come lies in my words, but ears and eyes fail the throng,\nonly the silent overrun the earth."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_20 = {
    Text = "What drives the enigmatic envoy Juliette?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_21 = {
    Text = "What's behind the Aramite ritual?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_22 = {
    Text = "And Thais—this Thais before you—can she truly be trusted?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Since arriving in Remouahe, anomalies cascade without cease, riddles hounding you breathless."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You need to stay calm. You need to think."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_25 = {
    Text = "No need to ponder—you're already exhausted. Time to rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_26 = {
    Text = "You turn to see a full moon bathing Thais's flawless skin in translucence."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Beyond the Storm Wall... all your questions will answer themselves."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Beyond the Storm Wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Juliette said as much—must you follow some shadow's whim into its heart?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Tawil's monitoring data steadies at last."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Or does some cosmic force propel all toward the storm's eye, pilgrims in thrall?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Thoughts churn unchecked, seeding doubt and dread in your mind's depths."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Can't sleep?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Close your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Thais's breath brushes yours, just inches apart."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Close your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Refuse to close your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Your eyes are so bright... unclouded by the road's toll."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Thais presses a fingertip to your lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Her face hovers near, moonlight gilding her skin in a soft halo."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You have done well."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_40 = {
    Text = "You feel her approach: gentle, warm exhalation."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_41 = {
    Text = "A scent that stirs old echoes."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_42 = {
    Text = "How long since we drew this close?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Coolness ghosts your lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_44 = {
    Text = [[
You open your eyes: Thais's finger rests on your lips.
Her face hovers near, moonlight gilding her skin in a soft halo.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Did you know? In your eyes, I see calamity, ancient embers, the cosmos's breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_46 = {
    Text = [[
Your journey's worn you thin, hasn't it?
Yet your stare holds firm, untainted.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Stars couldn't sway you; sands may not either."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_48 = {
    Text = "I don't understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_49 = {
    Text = "You don't have to—not yet."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
We cannot let our guard down yet.
In three centuries, the Black Pool's never stirred so relentlessly.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Thais rises, strolling down the dune."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Under such stars, mere sitting squanders the night."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Wind lifts her diaphanous veil; she sways across the yielding sand."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Let me present Aram's dance."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Bells chime; she raises one arm, swaying into motion's dawn."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_55 = {
    Text = "She bends, unfurls—wild, then restrained."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_56 = {
    Text = "I've been waiting for the one."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Her form bends boneless, her steps serpentine grace."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_58 = {
    Text = "A guardian to steer Aram to the future."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_59 = {
    Text = "She spins and sways. Even the lingering blur of her movements whisper innate poise, uncanny pliancy."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
No need to worry too much; it is inevitable.
Whether "They" choose to hide in the past, or the future... It cannot last forever.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Isn't that Alva?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Thais glances sidelong, lashes low, fingertip's bloom grazing sighing lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Alva's a fine one, but unready to forge new paths."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_63 = {
    Text = "And Juliette? Isn't she the Foreign Envoy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_64 = {
    Text = "You said Juliette seeks to let Aramites leave the desert, yes?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Thais extends her arms, her gaze drifting to moon-tipped fingers, as if loosing unseen birds."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Those who could leave have done so. Aram binds no one. It's the soil's pull and the desert's rhythm; those who stayed can only survive here."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Besides, that's not the answer I crave."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_68 = {
    Text = "The answer you crave... what is it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Written in the songs long ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_7 = {
    Text = "It's not \"Them\" that I worry about. It's the {Male=boy,Female=girl}."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_70 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree revives the Holy River, crowning the departed. Her bloodline will return to Aram."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Reviving the Holy River makes sense—who are the departed? How do we return bloodlines to Aram?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_72 = {Text = "Shh—"},
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Details tangle too deep; @1's prophecy yields no full map."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_74 = {
    Text = [[
All you need is to trust me entirely.
You will trust Aram's Queen.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Desert blooms unfurl in the moon's gloom; she lifts, whirls, steps—etching intricate, ancient rhythms in the sand."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Believe in me, and I'm yours alone—your absolute, singular secret weapon."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Moonlight softens her contours to enigma, her eyes swirling wordless longing."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_78 = {
    Text = "If this dream must end—\nDistant stars bear witness."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Wait, Thais—your feet—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Then that would be beyond our meddling."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_80 = {
    Text = "You cry out in panic."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_81 = {
    Text = "She treads on ripples—no, black ripples fan from her toes."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Veil's hem flutters like lily pads, scattering obsidian beads."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_83 = {
    Text = "That's... D-Slime...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_84 = {
    Text = "She dances in the dreamy Dissolution pool, stepping again and again onto the ebon surface."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_85 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_86 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Deaf to your pleas, she sways to the unheard cadence."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_88 = {
    Text = "She turns to you, her form blooming; the necklace you clasped gleams at her throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_89 = {
    Text = "She beckons you to dance; instinctively, your palm meets hers."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Mythag has staked three centuries on this; the one chosen to carry the torch cannot stray from the objective."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_90 = {
    Text = "She draws your hand, guiding your fingers to the pendant's pulsing jade—like a living heartbeat."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_91 = {
    Text = [[
A meteor streaks the firmament.
Her eyes outshine the stars.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Lips part; the night breeze carries her murmur."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Can I entrust them to you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_95 = {
    Text = "The feast's pull grips anew; unbidden, you whisper."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Yes—absolutely."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_97 = {Text = "Good."},
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_98 = {
    Text = "Thais smiles."
  },
  AvgDialog_45427_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Your friends have arrived."
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Casiah's red silks whirl everywhere, shattering cups and plates in the tent."
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_10 = {
    Text = "She yanks off the massive magic hat, revealing an unexpected person inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_11 = {
    Text = "It's you? Why?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Aw, just a smidge of luck."
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Casiah glances frantically out the window; %player%'s silhouette bounces away on camelback."
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Three dice punch through the drape, grazing Casiah's cheek."
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Oh, so you're sticking around?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Fine, reflect on your mistakes in the void dimension!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Illusions swallow the surroundings; paint-like colors flood the view. When the vibrant chaos settles, the area morphs into the magician's stage."
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Step right up to Casiah's Miraculous Magic Carnival!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
You and Ryker exchange a glance.
Right now, the priority is breaking free to halt that Aram sacrifice ritual twisted by the Church of the Lightbearers.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Casiah's top hat hurtles toward you; you and Ryker split as planned, but the hat chases straight after—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Hmph, guess which hat's got the Keeper?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Left one's empty, right one's empty too!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Ta-da! Actually, neither—look, {Male=he's,Female=she's} in Casiah's drape!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_7 = {
    Text = "A red silk drape erupts from a void rift, swirling into unsteady waves, binding you tight like a crimson mummy."
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_8 = {
    Text = "How'd you like {Male=his,Female=her} new look? Got that Aram flair, huh?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45429_Content_9 = {
    Text = "It's telekinesis! Now, time for my pickup."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Convergence"
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree... Isn't it right there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_100 = {
    Text = "You race toward the camp below the dunes."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_101 = {
    Text = "The instant your fingers brush the flap, dread overwhelms you."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_103 = {
    Text = "This fear differs from facing the Hound or the Sacred Fetus..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_104 = {
    Text = "It's bone-deep, inescapable, irreparable—an unspeakable horror."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_105 = {
    Text = "A drifting nightmare, a malformed delusion, an unbearable, suffocating reality."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_106 = {
    Text = "A massive, feral monster sways its slime-like tendrils, William's lean frame dangling on them like a lone reed."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_108 = {
    Text = "The scar on his forehead—from his mad mother's burn—now a shallow trench, oozing crimson sludge."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_109 = {
    Text = "The Silver Key shatters at his chest, Mythag's standard gloves soaked in blood, ominous slime dripping upward in defiance of gravity."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_11 = {
    Text = "On the distant horizon, where the earth meets the sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_110 = {
    Text = "Behind that swaying nightmare—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_111 = {
    Text = "A colossal mound of flesh gapes like a Venus flytrap."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_112 = {
    Text = "The folds of placentas and deformed infants, clear as blood-red brands in your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_113 = {
    Text = "In the bloated, twisted mass's center lies what he's relentlessly pursued, sought—the final gift for your journey."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_114 = {
    Text = "That's the Nubia's core revealed—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_115 = {
    Text = "A tiny lantern."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree towers into the clouds, as if beyond the world."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You mean you can see the Mother Tree?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You tilt your head skyward, extending your hand to trace its outline."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_15 = {
    Text = "A withered, skeletal tree... towering, but so alone..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Perhaps... the Mother Tree vanished due to Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Remember? %player% retains memories of things erased by Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You unfold the newspaper from Jenkin, only to find the ink seems alive, gradually dissolving—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Until you can no longer make out the report about \"Primavera\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Then, ▼▼▼ shall return to her throne,\nChaos shall be banished.\nThose who witness this shall rejoice,\nAnd those who serve the Queen shall rejoice."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The damaged watermarks and ink stains seem hell-bent on completely erasing Mason's existence."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_21 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_22 = {
    Text = "What sorcery is this? I've read this newspaper a thousand times."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_23 = {
    Text = "But now... I can't remember a single word."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Wait, you don't remember anything at all?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_25 = {
    Text = "\"The outstanding defender of Cubism, the reincarnation of Botticelli's soul, is now in hiding at a wax museum on the corner of Southwark Street...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_26 = {
    Text = "See? I can even quote that news article word for word."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The newspaper was Dissoluted. Likely a <Yellow:mass amnesia> event, yet..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Ramona and Jenkin turn to you at the same time."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Looks like it doesn't work on a certain someone."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_3 = {
    Text = "That squad... only three made it back, including Neferure."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_30 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Believe it or not, this doesn't feel right at all..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_32 = {
    Text = "It seems that, without anyone realizing it, the past is altered, and the story deviates from its intended path."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_33 = {
    Text = "And you are the sole witness to these changes."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_34 = {
    Text = "As the vessel for the Aeon of Desire, the Mother Tree must have left a profound mark on the planet."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Her tenacious vitality slows the Dissolution's erosion a thousandfold."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_36 = {
    Text = "So, to you, she hasn't fully vanished yet."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Give it another century or millennium, and the Aramites will likely forget the Mother Tree even existed."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_38 = {
    Text = "But their ritual might capture that faint remnant of her presence."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Like the Awakening Ceremony?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_4 = {
    Text = "But the Aramites still look thrilled. This kind of sacrifice... it's probably routine for them by now."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Exactly. The Awakening Ceremony uses an investigator's mental strength to manifest a spirit anew from the Silver. The Mother Tree's \"rebirth\" should be similar."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_41 = {
    Text = "%player%, what does the Mother Tree look like to you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Hmm... how should I put it... I saw a bare trunk growing in barren soil... there was nothing \"Motherly\" or \"Bountiful\" about it."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_43 = {
    Text = "It looked almost as if... the Mother Tree is in its final moments."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_44 = {
    Text = "The Aram ritual is tomorrow. You all not crashing yet?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_45 = {
    Text = "My dissection's almost done."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Still on about your autopsy even at a time like this...\nThough you're right—we're missing one last piece."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_47 = {
    Text = "%player%, this is our final chance."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_48 = {
    Text = "He's up dissecting; what's keeping you awake?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_49 = {
    Text = "I... am recalling a dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You survey the once-silent crowd; their eyes gleam like oases."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_50 = {
    Text = "One of those recurring dreams you have."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Pitch black, just the roar of surging tides crashing against the shore."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Your heart beats with the water's rhythm. Countless hearts beat along."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Those countless heartbeats merge into a black river, the dark tide rushing unchecked to the sea's mouth, staining the whole ocean ink-black..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Heard your dreams often hold prophecies."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Sometimes memories, sometimes foresights."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Either way, it means those lives were truly devoured by Dissolution..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Don't overthink it. Even without Dissolution, humans keep marching on—and vanishing—along the way."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Talking like this, feels like we should drag William in, crack open some booze."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Mythag's legendary investigator—he's seen more weirdness than bets I've won."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_6 = {
    Text = "O Mother Tree above, please enrich Aram's soil and waters, safeguard our generations."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_60 = {
    Text = "You tap the brooch on your chest, calling William."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_61 = {
    Text = "I should've... should've realized sooner."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_62 = {
    Text = [[
At the tent's center, the Nubia corpse lies gutted, incisions smooth and precise.
Look closely, and you can sense its faint, heaving breaths.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_63 = {
    Text = "That's the pinnacle of countless experiments—the throb on the edge of life and death."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_64 = {
    Text = "They're able to control Dissolution's progress, making the Nubia vanish in unusual ways."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Our enemy has an unnatural grasp and command over Dissolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_66 = {
    Text = "He sets down the scalpel, draws a deep breath—the foul stench like blood hits, triggering a violent cough."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_67 = {
    Text = "And that hymn..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_68 = {
    Text = "The mother's remains vanish, blood and seed wander the earth, devoured by newborn beasts."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Skies and gods cloak in gloom, until the foreign envoy arrives."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_7 = {
    Text = "When you revive, we'll offer you our sweetest waters..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_70 = {
    Text = "The beasts comes before the Envoy."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_71 = {
    Text = "That's why Juliette lingered outside the Storm Wall, why she was so sure we'd breach it that time."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Juliette isn't the legendary Foreign Envoy..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_73 = {
    Text = [[
She's from the Church of the Lightbearers, fabricating that dream summons to win the Aramites' trust.
Her goal.... likely to join them and contaminate the Mother Tree and Holy River.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_74 = {
    Text = [[
The true Foreign Envoy...
No need to guess. It should be you, Keeper, without a doubt.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_75 = {
    Text = "No. There must be more."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_76 = {
    Text = "An odd feeling of dread urges William to push his conclusion further."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_77 = {
    Text = [[
And these anomalous links...
It's the Sculptors' Association. It's Herbert's work.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_78 = {
    Text = "If your reasoning stopped one step back, you could've left Remouahe in peace."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Gotta hand it to Mythag's legendary investigator—always the one ahead, nailing the answer."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_8 = {
    Text = "They just can't stop chanting about the Mother Tree—I wonder how magnificent it really is."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_80 = {Text = "Herbert!"},
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Easy now. I've always trusted your prowess, more than anyone else."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_82 = {
    Text = "They seem to trust you plenty, too. Or why else would they leave you here alone, without even an Awakener tagging along?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_83 = {
    Text = [[
Takes one to know one.
If I recall correctly, your Awakener disconnected with you back in Rye.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_84 = {
    Text = "As for the one you hired... I doubt Lady Daffodil would openly oppose Mythag University."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_85 = {
    Text = "So you think I can't kill you here."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_86 = {
    Text = "I never underestimate my foes—especially the one who murdered Professor Crowley."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_87 = {
    Text = "I know, of course I do."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_88 = {
    Text = [[
During the studio investigation, at the Sentinel Ridge ritual...
None of the servants of higher will could stop you, let alone mere Awakeners.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_89 = {
    Text = "So when I heard Mythag sent you, I knew I had to prepare thoroughly."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ryker... what are you talking about...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Ramona: Timeworn, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Channeling worlds somehow, then hosting a spirit from another world that is closer to higher existences in a kindred body."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Herbert strokes the two heads of the strange cat on his shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Good kitty, I love you both equally."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_94 = {
    Text = "<Blue:Helot: Catena>. Your move."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Hello? William?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Five seconds."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Ten seconds."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_98 = {
    Text = "William's just a hundred paces away in the tent, but the comm stays dead silent."
  },
  AvgDialog_45430_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Unease surges, fear hammering your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_45431_Content_1 = {Text = "Remains"},
  AvgDialog_45431_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Better now. William's not here, and I can't leave you two alone."
  },
  AvgDialog_45431_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Her cheeks still flush faintly; you brush her brow, and it feels cooler than before."
  },
  AvgDialog_45431_Content_12 = {
    Text = "This place..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45431_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Unlike the Aramites' raw primal sprawl, these are ruins of human civilization: a long-abandoned factory."
  },
  AvgDialog_45431_Content_14 = {
    Text = "After the Flood, Remouahe's regime pushed industrialization here—factories, schools."
  },
  AvgDialog_45431_Content_15 = {
    Text = "But Aramites, favoring nomadic life, provided little support for desert industrialization. These buildings eventually crumbled with desertification and regime shifts."
  },
  AvgDialog_45431_Content_16 = {
    Text = "They didn't waste these rooftops, though. They used the abandoned factory to store goods that required ventilation, moisture protection, and heavy security—such as the Mother Tree's remains."
  },
  AvgDialog_45431_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Heads up! Something's coming!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45431_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
You were gone in a blink.
Who were you talking to?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45431_Content_3 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45431_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
All you need is to trust me entirely.
You will trust Aram's Queen.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45431_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Remember: tonight's our secret."
  },
  AvgDialog_45431_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Your pause doesn't escape the detective's notice."
  },
  AvgDialog_45431_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
Our little friend's holding back a secret.
No worries! As an understanding grown man, I won't pry.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45431_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Ramona and I tailed the Aramites earlier, and we've pinpointed the Mother Tree's remains.\nNo time to waste—we should sneak in at midnight."
  },
  AvgDialog_45431_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ramona, how's your condition?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_1 = {Text = "Storm Wall"},
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The Storm Wall isn't a physical barrier... it's a veil the Mother Tree draws around herself for concealment."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Without the intent to face her, you won't even glimpse it, much less break through."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_12 = {
    Text = "That's why they need the Foreign Envoy."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The formation fans out on both sides, spacing every five or ten paces, forming a long serpent of human bodies."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Everyone takes their place, standing firm."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Alva hoists the banner high, and in unison, they drag their spears across the barren sand, stirring up blinding dust, chanting a distant, eerie hymn."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Death draws near. Dissolution dawns."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The mother's remains vanish, blood and seed wander the earth, devoured by newborn beasts."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Skies and gods cloak in gloom, until the foreign envoy arrives."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree revives the Holy River, crowning the departed. Her bloodline will return to Aram."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_2 = {
    Text = "I'm fine. Alva's already mustering the squad. Let's catch up."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Returns bloodlines... to Aram..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The desert sun vanishes unnoticed, the sky turning overcast, the wind changing its pitch."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_22 = {
    Text = "An inexplicable dread grips you; you briefly zone out, then a scream snaps you back."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_23 = {
    Text = "It—it's here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_24 = {
    Text = "In that focused instant, you grasp what the \"Storm Wall\" truly means."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_25 = {
    Text = "A gray curtain swallows sky and earth, surging in to blot out the heavens."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_26 = {
    Text = "It mimics a tidal wave yet isn't—vast and lifeless, moving while seeming frozen."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Its edge laps the ground like a colossal beast's tongue, devouring the Aram line into the fog, ripping and digesting them in the storm's maw."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Keep dancing! Don't stop!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The Foreign Envoy is with us; the Queen will open our path to the Mother Tree!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Today, we set out for the Storm Wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_30 = {
    Text = "You catch Juliette smirking."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Chieftain, Chieftain—this storm's too vicious! We can't take the losses—let's fall back!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_32 = {Text = "No!"},
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Her voice rings with authority, yet the wind makes it tremble."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_34 = {
    Text = "The bonfire rite's deformities are spiking higher each time. At this rate, Aram's bloodline will fade into oblivion before we reach the Mother Tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Juliette curls her fingers into a ring and blows a clear, resounding whistle, its lingering note carried by the storm to unseen horizons."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_36 = {
    Text = "I am Envoy Juliette. I've heard the Queen's will—today, we will breach the Storm Wall!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Everyone, advance! No retreat!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_38 = {
    Text = "As the envoy commands—advance! No retreat!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_39 = {
    Text = "<Small:There's no... turning... back...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Warriors, are you ready?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Hold up, Keeper! A huge pack of Nubia coming up from behind... At least two hundred!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Behold! This is the Queen's decree. Your only way lies ahead!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_42 = {
    Text = "The Nubia roars, charging straight at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You notice the soldiers following Alva. Their solemn expressions reveal their resolve to face death."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The young man at the front has sharp features and stands ramrod straight—he seems familiar."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The Storm Wall?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You gaze into the distance: clear blue skies, unobstructed view, no hint of a sandstorm."
  },
  AvgDialog_45432_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Juliette steps forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_1 = {Text = "Epilogue"},
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_10 = {
    Text = "But at least we averted the worst."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_11 = {
    Text = "If the Mother Tree revived under the church's control, the contamination would've spread far beyond Remouahe's northern deserts."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Still, we've suffered the heaviest blow since Mythag's founding."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_13 = {
    Text = "William's body... yielded no Silver Core."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_14 = {
    Text = "We've lost Mythag's finest investigator forever. There is no chance to even partially revive his consciousness."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Today, his remains will be laid to rest here."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_16 = {
    Text = "William was the most gifted investigator I know. His sharp insight, fearless attitude, and exceptional skills stand out among us all."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Mr. Alistair!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Amid the creaking of the wheelchair, the crowd made way for Alistair."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_19 = {
    Text = "William was shadowed by mystery in life, but his brilliant deeds will shine like eternal stars."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The Keygrave drizzles with fine rain, just like the Keybestowal Ceremony day."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Death stalks us all. In the face of Dissolution, we have little time for mourning."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_21 = {
    Text = "%player%, come with me. About Tawil, the three Aeons, Dissolution... there is much you need to know."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Didn't think your indifference to colleagues extended to skipping his funeral."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I can't stand that atmosphere."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Besides, with the Aeon of Sagacity awakening, Aeon of Desire sinking, Aeon of Rapture appearing... William's gone, so it's my turn to sweat."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Aeon of Rapture appearing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The traces from William's death scene weren't fruitless."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_27 = {
    Text = "A Silver Core of the Ultra Realm—tests show it's Casiah's."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Plus, we detected signs of the Aeon of Rapture's activity—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Who allowed you to treat my toy so carelessly, forcing me to personally retrieve him?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Everyone stands solemnly before the engraved tombstone, witnessing a true funeral."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Thanks for the bailout, Mr. N."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Next time we meet, you shall say: thank you, dear Lord N, for your broad-minded mercy, magnanimous generosity, and forgiving grace..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Ryker scratches his furry head."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Nah, that doesn't sound right—we agreed that until I beat you once, you'll make me relive failure and death's pain over and over, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Dying again means reviving first—so you'll definitely bring me back."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_35 = {
    Text = [[
Aww, you're good at finding loopholes.
Think I'll always play along?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Well, you're a big shot with broad-minded mercy, magnanimous generosity, and forgiving grace... So yeah. You will."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Hmm. That depends on what spectacle you stage for me next."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_38 = {
    Text = [[
With that parting shot, N's silhouette vanishes.
Ryker turns to the group.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
Anyway, I'm back.
Lord Dexter, up for another round?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Today, a new comrade joins our ranks."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Meanwhile, Remouahe Desert"
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_41 = {
    Text = "There, there—easy now."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_42 = {
    Text = "My loyal, obedient hound—sniff out the duo's trail for me."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Only then can I report to the Pharaoh."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_44 = {
    Text = "The boy huddles in the factory corner, peeking toward the distance now and then."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_45 = {
    Text = "We've made it this far—should be safe for now..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Next, gotta figure out how to make him understand the outside world."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Before that one finds us."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_48 = {
    Text = "He doesn't notice his shadow stretching long in the windowed light."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_49 = {
    Text = "That elongated shadow suddenly sprouts an eerie grin."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
It's an honor to be part of Mythag.
I'll fight alongside you all to save humanity's future.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_6 = {
    Text = "On the day she left Remouahe, Alva stood by the Holy River, cupped a handful of water, and drank it."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_7 = {
    Text = "No one dared to ask what it felt like to watch her entire tribe dissolve into the torrent before her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_8 = {
    Text = "But in this downpour, Alva's resolute expression convinces you she's chosen her new path."
  },
  AvgDialog_45433_Content_9 = {
    Text = "In this investigation, we faced our toughest foe. We failed to stop the Church of the Lightbearers from contaminating the Mother Tree. The Aramites have been erased from history."
  },
  AvgDialog_45434_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You thread the factory's tight paths, dodging ancient, rust-groaning machines."
  },
  AvgDialog_45434_Content_10 = {
    Text = "But I choose to trust the Keeper, just as Mythag does."
  },
  AvgDialog_45434_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Wait—that's what the soldier mentioned!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45434_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Rounding heavy machines, a shattered window looms; below it lurks your old foe—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45434_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Even in Londinium, outfits this size are rare."
  },
  AvgDialog_45434_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A few decades, and it's rust."
  },
  AvgDialog_45434_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
A.F. 308, Remouahe Kingdom openly invited Aramites to settle in <Blue:Nasha>, the capital city.
Obviously, no one took the offer.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45434_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Aramites lack the will or means for industrial society—they revere rawer, transcendent powers."
  },
  AvgDialog_45434_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Thought people like us might understand them better than most."
  },
  AvgDialog_45434_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Do you believe <Yellow:Silver Technology> can change the future of humanity?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45434_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Humanity's future? Blind to it—three centuries' probe hasn't touched Dissolution's core."
  },
  AvgDialog_45434_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Any path may lead to the destination... or the end of doom."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_1 = {Text = "Magic"},
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_10 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Words alone prove nothing. We'll reclaim the Mother Tree's remains, and return them to Aram."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Alva broods, weighing your claim."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Finally, she seems to come to a conclusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The convoy will set out for the Storm Wall tomorrow afternoon."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You will return the remains to us before then..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_16 = {
    Text = "...or you are banished for good."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Alva and the soldiers file out one by one, leaving the vast factory empty except for the three of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Not bad—you spun quite the tale there."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Alva didn't really buy it; she just needed an explanation."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_2 = {
    Text = "<Small:Well, should I say there's always a slip-up? This guy's tougher than we thought.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_20 = {
    Text = "She clearly noticed we didn't have the remains yet—whether she forces us to hand them over or uses our strength to find them, it's more in her interest than clashing with us outright."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_21 = {
    Text = "So we must find the Mother Tree's remains in a day. Got a plan?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Let's just say I have an idea worth trying."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You shut your eyes, plunging into mental depths."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_24 = {
    Text = "A chant rises like a prayer."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Death draws near. Dissolution dawns."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The mother's remains vanish, blood and seed wander the earth, devoured by newborn beasts."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_27 = {
    Text = "A chuckle shatters your reverie. You look up: atop the coffin stands a woman's silhouette, arrived unbidden."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Can I entrust them to you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_29 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
Ryker scratches his nape.
The stalwart Aram soldier glares at him fiercely, but recoils as Ryker flashes his teeth.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Tumultuous thoughts flicker, splice, merge in your skull."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_31 = {
    Text = "A faint, ethereal thread of colorless guidance forms, pointing toward the final answer."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree's remains are right here."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_33 = {
    Text = "You gently touch the wall, then close your eyes and plunge your hand in without hesitation, grasping a soft piece of fabric, then yank it out—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Hey—stop, stop—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The \"wall\" crumbles; false glow yields to blinding sunlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Hey, you messed up my cloak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Should I say enemies meet on a narrow road, or that our alumni bond keeps drawing us together?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Francis's research was limited to Dissolution. The cipher in that sanatorium was your doing."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_39 = {
    Text = "These test subjects might slip past the guards into the factory unnoticed, but moving the remains is a big job—it couldn't happen silently."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Chieftain Alva, I recruited them to guard the Mother Tree's remains..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_40 = {
    Text = "We couldn't see the remains because of an <Blue:illusion>—you shifted this wall inward by two meters."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Impressive. You've come a long way from the {Male=guy,Female=girl} who ditched {Male=his,Female=her} allies and ran last time we met."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_42 = {
    Text = "So, Casiah, your illusions are way too easy to break."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Hmph, you get what you pay for. Mythag's field agents are all so emotionally stable—hardly worth the pennies."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_44 = {
    Text = "I've got fancier tricks up my sleeve. Getting Lady Daffodil to open a portal and ship this lousy coffin out for you wouldn't be hard, but..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_45 = {Text = "Hmm?"},
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_46 = {
    Text = "It'll cost extra!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Lady Daffodil knows my finances aren't great. If she bleeds me dry, she'll lose a loyal customer, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Slow and steady wins the race, after all."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Ahem! Maybe you two can haggle over prices after we're done here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_5 = {
    Text = "So that gives them the right to tie up my soldier and interrogate him about the relic's location?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Ryker tosses the dice in his hand, then hurls it forcefully—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_51 = {
    Text = [[
Her top hat flies up, scooping the speeding die inside, then returns to its owner.
Casiah tugs at the brim and shakes it, letting the pulverized die dust cascade down.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_52 = {
    Text = "See? They're not gonna let you off easy."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_53 = {
    Text = "My Mythag alumni—how about we both back off a step, for old times' sake?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_54 = {
    Text = "I'm here for the Mother Tree's remains; and Mythag—I bet you want to <Yellow:purge its contamination> to keep it from tainting the Holy River."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Let's strike a deal: the remains are mine, the Mother Tree stays dead, and we both head home. Isn't that a win-win?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_56 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Contamination>? Looks like Daffodil fed the Sculptors more than us."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_57 = {
    Text = "If that's the case, we can't hand over the remains."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Then let's kick off Casiah's magic show a bit early!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Inspiration strikes as you recall the monster you encountered earlier."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Moments ago, we spotted Herbert, the Sculptors' Association head, entering the factory where the remains are kept—that's why we're here."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Herbert is a man driven by selfish desires, scavenging for relics with special powers everywhere. We suspect he's after the power of the Mother Tree's remains."
  },
  AvgDialog_45435_Content_9 = {
    Text = "We had no choice but to act urgently and force the information from the soldier, but unfortunately, we were still one step too late."
  },
  AvgDialog_45436_Content_1 = {Text = "Ember"},
  AvgDialog_45436_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Why... the Mother Tree's remains are still intact..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45436_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Haven't you figured it out yet? The so-called Mother Tree's remains were just a decoy."
  },
  AvgDialog_45436_Content_4 = {
    Text = "All we truly need is the \"Foreign Envoy\" and Aramite flesh."
  },
  AvgDialog_45436_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Now, that foolish envoy—namely, you—have opened the Storm Wall for me, and the Aramites have drunk the river water laced with lantern ash."
  },
  AvgDialog_45436_Content_6 = {
    Text = "My grand vision is underway. All that's left is waiting for the Mother Tree to grow."
  },
  AvgDialog_45436_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Ah, I can hardly wait to see Dissolution blanket the earth, the divine realm's gates flung wide..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_1 = {Text = "Necklace"},
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The throng lingers."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Alright, everyone, back to your tasks."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_12 = {
    Text = "We're off to the Storm Wall in two days; I need my beauty sleep too!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_13 = {
    Text = "We've kept your rooms spotless, waiting for your return. Soothing incense is lit—by the Mother Tree, may sweet dreams enfold you."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_14 = {
    Text = "In an overlooked nook, Thais vaults from the coffin, blending effortlessly into the crowd."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Spot the Mother Tree's remains?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Keeper's had eyes on it nonstop."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Wait. Where's the Keeper?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Excuse me! Make way, please."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_19 = {
    Text = "You weave a few bends, shoving through the press, scanning for Thais."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_2 = {
    Text = "That market is quite a spectacle!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Frustration at losing the trail wells up in your chest. Sighing, you turn back, only to find Thais in the building's shadow, beckoning with a smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Looking for me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You follow Thais as she glides through alleys in uncharacteristic silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_23 = {
    Text = "At a stall brimming with trinkets, she halts, leaning close to whisper in your ears."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Could you buy me this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Your gaze follows her finger to a metal collar."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Sharp eye, {Male=sir,Female=miss}! Want a closer look?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_27 = {
    Text = "It's my daughter's handiwork! Picked the materials herself. That lapis center? Even texture, rich hue, you spot quality!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_28 = {Text = "No lapis."},
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_29 = {Text = "No lapis?"},
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The envoy! The envoy's caravan's back!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Eh? The lapis is the crown jewel—you sure you don't want it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Add that lapis, and the funds Mythag entrusted to you will be quite threadbare."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Yeah, skip the lapis."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Sure. I'll wrap it for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You and Thais reach the village edge; windswept sands stretch endlessly, vultures tracing lazy arcs with aged cries."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Kara craftsmanship, passed down for generations—still flawless."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_36 = {
    Text = "She traces the collar's etchings, flipping the gem mount toward you."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_37 = {
    Text = "This pattern is the Mother Tree's emblem—my own design."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Now, my envoy from afar... will you fasten this for me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_39 = {
    Text = "You take the collar; Thais tilts her head, your arm encircling neck and brow, breaths mingling."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Villagers choke the narrow lanes, proffering tributes for Juliette aloft in their hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_40 = {
    Text = "A gem resembling white jade crowns the pendant, its milky sheen veiling life's faint blush—like a maiden's coy flush, blooming just so."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_41 = {
    Text = [[
Mmm, I like it. For this gift, I'll answer your questions.
You've got plenty of them, I believe?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_42 = {
    Text = "But first—unwelcome guests approach. Shall we punish these tone-deaf pests together?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Lady Envoy, this one's for you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_6 = {
    Text = "At the tail of the line, Thais lounges atop a coffin carried by four Aram warriors."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Compared to the roaring welcome for Juliette, the sparse cheers Thais receives render her title as the Queen a hollow echo."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Thank you. The blazing sun must be a test for you, yet you're still here, welcoming us. Your warmth is unforgettable."
  },
  AvgDialog_45437_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You must be tired. Please rest now and enjoy the night's peace."
  },
  AvgDialog_45438_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Juliette... Why..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45438_Content_2 = {
    Text = "No point hiding now."
  },
  AvgDialog_45438_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The Aramites trade the blood of their deformed for proliferation—their very existence is filth and sin."
  },
  AvgDialog_45438_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Born bearing original sin, they're fit only as kindling for the Pure Land's foundation."
  },
  AvgDialog_45438_Content_5 = {
    Text = "And the most valuable among them, that precious child is already mine. He is worthy for the new world."
  },
  AvgDialog_45438_Content_6 = {
    Text = "A human-faced hound crouches at Alva's feet."
  },
  AvgDialog_45438_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Shoo, shoo. Such a good child. You're my chosen one."
  },
  AvgDialog_45438_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Nefe...rure..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45438_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Go, child—guard the Mother Tree's rebirth. Tear your enemies apart."
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_1 = {
    Text = "What's all the commotion?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_10 = {
    Text = "What proof do you have?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
You rememember William's gruesome death.
He was slain by some vile monster tied to the Church of the Lightbearers.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_12 = {
    Text = "But you've got nothing solid against Juliette at the moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Please, think back on the days we've shared."
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Do you really believe {Male=his,Female=her} wild claims?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Doubts ripple through the crowd. They do not trust you."
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_16 = {
    Text = "%player%, I'm heartbroken. Until now, I've trusted you, overlooked your rudeness in Aram, even pleaded your case to the chieftain."
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_17 = {
    Text = "It seems I misjudged you."
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Lady Alva, please forgive my mistake."
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Your personal grudges are irrelevant. Today, the ritual must proceed to its completion."
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The crowd gives a path."
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Anyone who interferes with the Mother Tree's rebirth will become a sacrifice!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_3 = {Text = "You?"},
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Yes—we've got urgent news."
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Juliette... she's been deceiving you all along."
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_6 = {
    Text = "She's not the legendary envoy, and she doesn't have any power to revive the Mother Tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_7 = {
    Text = "She couldn't even breach the Storm Wall, because it's Thais's—the Queen's creation, a barrier against the faithless!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You scan around; Juliette stands at the crowd's head, your words stirring no ripple in her."
  },
  AvgDialog_45439_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Do you have proof for these accusations?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45440_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Lady Juliette... will... reward me... right..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45440_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Of course, dear. You've been such a big help."
  },
  AvgDialog_45440_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree... is taking shape."
  },
  AvgDialog_45441_Content_1 = {Text = "Rival"},
  AvgDialog_45441_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ryker kicks the rusted iron door wide, dust swirling."
  },
  AvgDialog_45441_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Eerie, familiar snarls and creaking joints echo from all sides."
  },
  AvgDialog_45441_Content_4 = {
    Text = "No kidding. Are those the Sculptors' Association's lab freaks?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45441_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I see them too."
  },
  AvgDialog_45441_Content_6 = {
    Text = "What a brawl. I smell something fishy."
  },
  AvgDialog_45441_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree's remains are there! B-by the window!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45441_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Let's go. Stall any longer, and he'll wet himself."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_1 = {Text = "Dream"},
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_10 = {
    Text = "That won't do, Alva."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_100 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_101 = {
    Text = "A long sigh echoes through the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_102 = {
    Text = "You're a flawed puppet, after all. You take far too much effort to control."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_103 = {
    Text = "The stronger your devotion to sacrifice for Aram... the fiercer your resistance when you find out the truth."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_104 = {
    Text = "Fortunately, I saw this coming."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_105 = {
    Text = "Time's about right. All of you, your beloved Mother Tree..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_106 = {
    Text = "shall claim your flesh and lives."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_107 = {
    Text = [[
I open my mouth, stunned to find no sound emerges.
The world comes to a horrifying halt.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_108 = {
    Text = "No, it's not the world; my senses halt, each faint blink spanning centuries."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_109 = {
    Text = "In this drawn-out stasis, only my former comrades—one Aram soldier after another—charge heedlessly to the Holy River."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_11 = {
    Text = "How about this: <Blue:Haleman> just sent an invite, asking me to sample her fine wines."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_110 = {Text = "Splash—"},
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_111 = {
    Text = "Sound and color rush back."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_112 = {
    Text = "One by one, they leap unflinching into the river's torrent, arms outstretched, embracing the Mother Tree's withered trunk."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_113 = {
    Text = "They cry and howl in mad, indescribable frenzy."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_114 = {
    Text = "Their skin sags like mud; fluids drain from their bodies, joining the river's torrent."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_115 = {
    Text = "Bones soften like flesh; limbs twist inhumanly, stretch, entwine—fusing blood and flesh into the sacred tree's bloated branches."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_116 = {
    Text = "Slowly, agonizingly, they merge with the sacred tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Come with me. We'll drink till dawn. What do you say?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Lady Thais, I'm afraid..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Soldiers follow orders—you said it yourself."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Now, here's my order for you: We will drink till dawn. Together."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_16 = {
    Text = "So you want a utopia without bloodshed or tears?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Who would've thought! Our rigid chieftain is dreaming such naive dreams deep down her heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Lady Thais, please don't tease me like this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_19 = {
    Text = "No, I'm not teasing you."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Alva, you've been summoned for quite some time now. But you've been doing drills and chores all day! You even turned down Karune's banquet."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I nourish all of Remouahe with my flesh and blood, to keep the Aramite bloodline flowing forever."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_21 = {
    Text = "I make them breed endlessly, hoping at least one can escape Its gaze and carry my will through cycles of beginning and end..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Aren't we equally naive and foolish, you and I?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_23 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Asleep already?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Fine. You weren't Aram-born anyway. You shouldn't be trapped in this barren desert, Alva."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_26 = {
    Text = "When my life ends, you will leave Remouahe, and link with someone new."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_27 = {
    Text = "That day... is coming soon."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_28 = {
    Text = "I sat in the Queen's tent; outside, funeral wails pierced with raw grief, pain, and denial."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_29 = {
    Text = "To weep for someone trusted—that's a kind of fortune.\nOn the battlefield, we rarely had time for tears over fallen comrades."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Don't you want anything from me? Any reward you'd like?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_30 = {
    Text = [[
For me, the critical question was Aram's path forward, now that the Queen was gone.
If the Aramites stopped thinking, paralyzed by grief, then I would think for them.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Lady Thais never trusted me. I always knew that."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_32 = {
    Text = "To Aramites, blood defined kin; with foreign veins, I'd forever be an outsider."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_33 = {
    Text = "But Aram needed a leader—in spirit and in flesh."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_34 = {
    Text = "I'll take the chieftain's role, guarding Lady Thais's coffin."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Every step Aram takes would be under <Red:Lady Thais's> watchful eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Every step Aram takes would be under <Red:the Queen's> watchful eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Every step Aram takes would be under <Red:@1's> watchful eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_38 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Why am I here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_4 = {
    Text = "As long as Aram thrives in peace, that's reward enough for me, Lady Thais."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_40 = {
    Text = "That coffin holds... right, the Mother Tree's remains."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Why are we keeping the Mother Tree's remains in the Queen's tent?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_42 = {
    Text = "...Nevermind. I don't remember."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_43 = {
    Text = "But it's fine."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_44 = {
    Text = "<Big:Once the Mother Tree revives, <Red:everything> will be okay.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_45 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_46 = {
    Text = "In centuries of my duty, I've trained many successors."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_47 = {
    Text = "I believed a hero will bring Aram dawn."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_48 = {
    Text = "The first died to a snake bite."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_49 = {
    Text = "The second died to the storm."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You don't even like Aram, do you? You won't touch the bonfire feasts."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_50 = {
    Text = "The third to someone else's jealousy."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Desert hazards and twists are endless; the longest survivors aren't fierce crested eagles or venomous vipers, but silver ants active just ten minutes a day."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Pinning hope on one person is foolish."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_53 = {
    Text = [[
And our number was dwindling too fast.
One unforeseen storm can claim whole squads.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_54 = {
    Text = "At our lowest, Aramites shrank below a hundred."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_55 = {
    Text = "<Red:At this rate, Aram would end on my watch.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Tomorrow night... we resume the bonfire rite."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_57 = {
    Text = [[
At the rite, they sang and drank freely.
At dawn, countless infants are born over night.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Holding a crying newborn, tears welled up in my eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_59 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree's grace was a divine miracle for Aram—and I dismissed it as heresy from my narrow view."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_6 = {
    Text = "No need to deny it—it's obvious.\nThis place is full of wild revelers; you don't fit in."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_60 = {Text = "But..."},
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_61 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree's power was fading."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Infant deformities rose."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_63 = {
    Text = "I scrambled until an elder woman mentioned—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Remember that hymn?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Death draws near. Dissolution dawns."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_66 = {
    Text = "The mother's remains vanish, blood and seed wander the earth, devoured by newborn beasts."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Skies and gods cloak in gloom, until the foreign envoy arrives."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_68 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree revives the Holy River, crowning the departed. Her bloodline will return to Aram."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Find the <Yellow:Foreign Envoy>, and we might witness the Mother Tree's rebirth!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_7 = {
    Text = "But living solely for duty—doesn't it feel stifling?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Thais, Thais!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_71 = {
    Text = "I hear it. I hear someone calling out a certain person's name."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_72 = {
    Text = "My head is splitting. Countless silver needles stab my brain, a shrill noise tears at my ears, and my blood roars audibly through my veins."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_73 = {
    Text = "<Big:THAIS! THAIS—!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Thais. Who is that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Ignore those distractions—they'll only cloud your focus."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_76 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree nears her return. Doesn't that fill you with joy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Thais—I've definitely heard the name somewhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_78 = {Text = "But where?"},
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_79 = {
    Text = [[
Was it on the battlefields, while I was alive and flesh? I remember my comrades' dying smiles, the commander's cold replies...
No. Not back then.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Lady Thais, you know this.
In life, I was a soldier. Soldiers follow orders.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Drudgery, feasts, beast defenses after I was Awakened..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_81 = {
    Text = "After I was Awakened...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Who Awakened me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_83 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_84 = {
    Text = "<Red:Thais.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Why did I forget her name?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_86 = {
    Text = "I called for her every day, over and over..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Amid the raging sandstorm, I finally see the person I've been longing for."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Each step etches deep in the wind-worn earth, stirring tearful waves in my chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Lady Thais..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You're my linker.\nSafeguarding Aram is your wish—and thus mine."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_90 = {
    Text = [[
I've been waiting for you.
I knew you'd return. I knew you never abandoned Aram.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Aramites, heed me! The ancient prophecy has been fulfilled! The Mother Tree returns, crowning the departed!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_92 = {
    Text = "The Queen walks the sands once more, reclaiming her throne!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Aram's one true Queen, Lady Thais—"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_94 = {
    Text = "shall have your will and loyalty!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Finally, finally. I've endured to this moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_96 = {
    Text = "So please... Will you praise me now, my Queen?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Praise me for the centuries of restraint, for my endless persistence, for finally finding the envoy that brings forth your rebirth..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_98 = {
    Text = "Together, we will make Aram a utopia without bloodshed or tears, a flawless paradise."
  },
  AvgDialog_45442_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Ah, Lady Thais. Why do you shake your head at me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_1 = {Text = "Return"},
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Now alone, you need an ally. You remember Thais's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
All you need is to trust me entirely.
You will trust Aram's Queen.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_12 = {
    Text = "And you know she will repay you with the same trust."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Thais? Who?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Who else? Thais, your Queen!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Are you nuts? Want to see the Queen? Then slit your throat with this blade!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The Queen... what happened to her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_17 = {
    Text = "\"What happened?\" Her Majesty has been dead for centuries—spout more disrespect, and you're dead too!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_18 = {
    Text = "His serious expression chills you to the core."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_19 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Nearly a thousand Aramitess gather by the Holy River, their low chants rippling, weaving into a chaotic symphony with distant beast howls."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You stare at the ritual's heart in the distance."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
The coffin rests quietly on the tall altar frame.
Naturally, no trace of the Thais you know.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
Not just there.
There is no trace of her anywhere.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The tent flap parts as a stern-faced Aramite woman in her mid-thirties strides in."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Thais scrambles back atop the coffin, assuming a regal poise like a haughty sovereign on her throne."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Oh, our esteemed guest..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<Red:The intruder's crisp voice cuts her affected tone short.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You should have known. Alva would never interrupt her Queen's speech... <Red:If she could hear Thais talking.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_28 = {
    Text = "The envoy! The envoy's caravan's back!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Villagers choke the narrow lanes, proffering tributes for Juliette aloft in their hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A massive wooden altar stands amid the crowd, the coffin etched with cryptic symbols displayed atop it, surrounded by eyes brimming with fear, fervor, and anticipation."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_30 = {
    Text = "At the tail of the line, Thais lounged atop a coffin carried by four Aram warriors."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Compared to the roaring welcome for Juliette, <Red:the sparse cheers Thais received render her title as the Queen a hollow echo.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The people of Aram didn't see their Queen sitting on the coffin."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Could you buy me this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Your gaze follows her finger to a metal collar."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Sharp eye, {Male=sir,Female=miss}! Want a closer look?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_36 = {
    Text = "It's my daughter's handiwork! Picked the materials herself. That lapis center? Even texture, rich hue, you spot quality!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_37 = {Text = "No lapis."},
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_38 = {Text = "No lapis?"},
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Eh? You sure you don't want it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The moment you step in, you're met with harsh resistance."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Add that lapis, and the funds Mythag entrusted to you will be quite threadbare."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Yeah, skip the lapis."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Sure. I'll wrap it for <Red:you.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_43 = {
    Text = "The vendor was only responding to your words."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Finally, you spot a familiar figure on a dune."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_45 = {
    Text = "You recognize the silhouette. It's Thais."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_46 = {
    Text = "The storm... is it dying down?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_47 = {
    Text = "With the howling winds whipping her veils, she chants an unknown prayer, stepping slow and steady into the dark sandstorm."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_48 = {
    Text = "The thunderous roar deafens, yet the prayer cuts through clear, echoing inside your skull."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_49 = {
    Text = "In the sky-devouring gale, she converses calmly with some entity lurking in the desert sands."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Who goes there!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_50 = {
    Text = "It's the Queen! She's come to save us—to save Aram!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_51 = {
    Text = "The Aram group, frantic to escape moments ago, suddenly halts."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Countless Aramites turn toward Thais, kneeling in solemn devotion."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_53 = {
    Text = "But they are kneeling towards empty space... Only you can see Thais's dress fluttering in the sandy wind."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_54 = {
    Text = "As the vessel for the Aeon of Desire, the Mother Tree must have left a profound mark on the planet."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Her tenacious vitality slows the Dissolution's erosion a thousandfold."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_56 = {
    Text = "So, <Red:to you, she hasn't fully vanished yet.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Give it another couple centuries, <Red:and the Aramites will likely forget the Mother Tree even existed.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_58 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_59 = {
    Text = "They've never seen a Queen named Thais; what they worship, kneel to, is mere hearsay—an empty phantom."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_6 = {
    Text = "This is the ritual's critical phase—no outsiders allowed!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_60 = {
    Text = "The Thais who showed you around, danced for you, and posed on the coffin <Red:never existed in their eyes>."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_61 = {
    Text = "But you're certain, absolutely certain she exists."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_62 = {
    Text = "You remember those moonlit memories."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_63 = {
    Text = "You remember the lingering warmth on your fingertips."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_64 = {
    Text = "You remember her soft whispers."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Did you know? In your eyes, I see calamity, ancient embers, the cosmos's breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Your journey's worn you thin, hasn't it? Yet your stare holds firm, untainted."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_67 = {
    Text = "The twisted stars couldn't sway you; desert sands may not either."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_68 = {
    Text = [[
Her breath mingles with yours.
Star seas burn in her depths.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_69 = {
    Text = "I have to end the Aramite ritual."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I need to see Thais!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Thais... must be waiting there for me."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You won't misread the clues William left for you: Nubia, false envoy, Mother Tree's contamination... all point to the Church of the Lightbearers' schemes."
  },
  AvgDialog_45443_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ramona, William, Ryker... none of your Mythag companions is at your side."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Beneath the Mother Tree, Alva kneels in tears, powerless."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Only through narrow cracks could I glimpse the light from the other world."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_11 = {
    Text = "In those fleeting gaps, I trailed Aram's nomadic path."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I witnessed your resolve to shoulder leadership in chaos."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I witnessed your determination to abolish the bonfire rite, your agony at those succesors' untimely ends, your reluctance restarting the rite."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I witnessed your hustle for water and supplies, your grueling stands against hordes of beasts."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Alva, you've done well."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Even I couldn't have done better."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Leave the rest to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Thais caresses Alva's head, then turns to face the countless Aramite soldiers."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I am the earth's mother, the Proxy of the Aeon of Desire."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_2 = {
    Text = "My Lady... I... failed... Aram..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I am Thais, Heed my sacred name: <Yellow:Tifere Yesod>."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_21 = {
    Text = "In Aram's one true Queen's name, I challenge you—devourer of life, sower of death, false Mother Tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_22 = {
    Text = "From your depths, I shall free Aram's people, forging their path to survival."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Aram's children—if you can still hear me, awaken!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The world freezes for an instant."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Yet seconds later, Aram's ranks resume plunging into the Holy River like tireless, heedless lemmings."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Pointless. You and the Mother Tree share the same roots, both tainted by Its will. In your state, you can't shake the corrupted Mother Tree's resolve."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Of course I know."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Without that, why centuries of wandering?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_29 = {
    Text = "I hid the Mother Tree's form in the Holy River, bore Dissolution in my flesh to conceal its seed—wasn't it all for this moment?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_3 = {
    Text = "No need to worry. I hear you, Alva."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The time has come!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_31 = {
    Text = "In the name of Tifere Yesod, Aeon of Desire, I call on <Yellow:Tawil>—honor our millennium-old pact."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_32 = {
    Text = "As the Foreign Envoy arrives, with your incarnation as conduit, dispel the shroud over Remouahe for me."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_33 = {
    Text = "A piercing wail echoes through the sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Thais opens the coffin; inside, a fever-flushed Ramona tumbles out."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Finally... My time has come..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Hiding in here to tag along—clever thinking, girl."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Good thing you did. Going back out there to fetch you would've cost precious time and countless lives."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The voice in my head... told me... I had to hold on..."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_39 = {
    Text = "But even without her...\nI'm %player%'s assistant—in the direst moments, I must be at {Male=his,Female=her} side."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Because no one understands the pain of being unheard better than I."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_40 = {
    Text = "That's my duty as their one and only, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_41 = {
    Text = "She bites down hard on <Bold:one and only.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Awakening Their power on this land intensifies the strain on your body."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_43 = {
    Text = "I would not resort to this if any other path remained."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_44 = {
    Text = "We came here to halt the ritual, and I will see this through to the very end!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Good! Ramona, suppress the Aeon of Desire—%player% and I will crush the Mother Tree!"
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_46 = {
    Text = "A deafening wail splits the sky; silver phantoms streak across the desert heights."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_47 = {Text = "—"},
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Your body lightens; the next second, you're dropped before a foul, reeking tumor."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Aramites devoured by the Mother Tree cluster here in egg-like forms; translucent pores reveal twisted, blurred faces, red-black sludge gushing endlessly from holes, feeding the once-clear Holy River."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I followed Aram's caravan, wandering for centuries."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_6 = {
    Text = "No one saw me. No one heard me."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
I was once the feasts' most beautiful dancer, Aram's most beloved Queen.
But my dances went unseen, my decrees unheard.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Within Dissolution lied another world."
  },
  AvgDialog_45444_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Pitch-black, lifeless, despairing."
  },
  AvgDialog_46539_Content_1 = {
    Text = "After a year of training and recent field investigations, you are now qualified for Traphase trainings."
  },
  AvgDialog_46539_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Of course, the battles are fought by Awakeners—though during traphase, some entities will experience <Yellow:distortion> of physical boundaries."
  },
  AvgDialog_46539_Content_11 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:The Awakeners' combat abilities>, <Yellow:Realm Barriers>, and even <Yellow:Battle Rules> differ greatly from reality."
  },
  AvgDialog_46539_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Your Awakeners' <Yellow:development progress> will be lost, but <Yellow:the same applies to your opponent>. In a way, it can be said that \"Traphase\" is a <Yellow:fair duel>."
  },
  AvgDialog_46539_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Activate the trphase device and challenge yourself in battle. All questions will be answered through combat. May the Silver Key light your path."
  },
  AvgDialog_46539_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Speaking of that, have you heard about \"Traphase\" before?"
  },
  AvgDialog_46539_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I know a bit about it."
  },
  AvgDialog_46539_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Very well, but according to the school's regulations, I must give you a more comprehensive explanation of the risks and rules."
  },
  AvgDialog_46539_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Never heard of it."
  },
  AvgDialog_46539_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Then I'll start from the beginning and explain everything to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_46539_Content_7 = {
    Text = "In our research on the substance named Silver, we discovered that the vibration waves produced by Silver during oscillation can occasionally cross physical boundaries. We refer to the location where these vibration waves occur as <Yellow:Phases>."
  },
  AvgDialog_46539_Content_8 = {
    Text = "And \"Traphase\" is a specialized training method that utilizes phases to engage in <Yellow:simulated battles> with yourself from another dimention, thereby achieving the effect of improving spirit and battle awareness."
  },
  AvgDialog_46539_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Myself from another dimension..."
  },
  AvgDialog_46700_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Gnosis Index 89.8, Tide Frequency 762Hz, still rising..."
  },
  AvgDialog_46700_Content_2 = {
    Text = "\"It's <Yellow:D-Tide>, no question. All departments, assume positions. Monitoring team, report the Gnosis Index live. Strategy team, draft contingencies immediately. Action team, artificial domain is go—prepare to infiltrate the D-Effect Zone via spiritual dimension."
  },
  AvgDialog_46700_Content_3 = {Text = "D-Tide?"},
  AvgDialog_46700_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The periodic surges in the consciousness dimension within the Black Pool, influenced by tidal forces, could trigger severe disasters in connected <Yellow:Regional D-Effect Zones> if not handled properly."
  },
  AvgDialog_46700_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The floating anomaly mentioned by Lady Czort during the key-bestowal ceremony is a sign of the D-Tide outbreak."
  },
  AvgDialog_46700_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Unknown mental tides disrupt Domain stability. The environment inside D-Effect Zones changes rapidly. <Yellow:Awakeners and enemies alike will be affected>..."
  },
  AvgDialog_46700_Content_7 = {
    Text = "We can save the explanations for later in class. First wave of D-Tide is here. Lock in and fight!"
  },
  AvgDialog_46700_Content_8 = {
    Text = "May the Silver Key guide you all."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Even though it's just another ordinary night on the field, you always feel uneasy sleeping when you're away from school."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ogier, are you feeling unwell?"
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_11 = {
    Text = "My lord, I... I do not... It's them..."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Ogier strains to lift the uncontrollable Formless Spawns around him. What had once hovered around him like his power now becomes unusually active—"
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_13 = {Text = "Slurp."},
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Active enough that, when you get close to take a look, they \"lick\" your face like a cat's tongue."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_15 = {
    Text = "My Lord—?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I... I do not... mean to..."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_17 = {
    Text = "You push away the Formless Spawn that nuzzles up to you like a cat, your fingers sink into Ogier's soft golden hair and gently stroke it."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_18 = {
    Text = "It's alright, take your time."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I... I don't know why, but today I desperately want to stay by your side. This feeling is so strong that even the Formless Spawns are beyond my control..."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The sounds of the world become especially striking in the darkness, particularly those youthful yet heavy breaths—"
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_20 = {
    Text = "<Small:Could it be the influence of the Holy River and the Mother Tree?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_21 = {
    Text = "If I have disturbed you, my lord..."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_22 = {
    Text = "It's all right."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_23 = {Text = "R-Really?!"},
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You pull Ogier into the room, forcefully push him onto the bed, and then drag a chair over to sit by the bedside."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Stay with me tonight. That way, you can get a proper night's sleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_26 = {
    Text = "How can I spend the night on my lord's bed? It is improper—"
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You wrap Ogier in a blanket, and he wriggles like a caterpillar until you place your hand on his forehead."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Sleep, sleep..."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_29 = {
    Text = "You haven't heard many lullabies, and the tune you unconsciously hum now is just one of Londinium's many eerie nursery rhymes."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Still awake, Ogier? We still have investigation tasks waiting for us after dawn."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_30 = {
    Text = "But Ogier's bright eyes gradually dim, like the evening star sinking into the mist before dawn."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Zzz... M-My Lord..."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_32 = {
    Text = "You stand by his bedside for a long time, watching him until his breathing grows steady and the stars outside dim. Only then do you gently touch the stray hairs on his forehead and tiptoe out of the room."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Sleep well, good child."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_4 = {
    Text = "M-my lord! Ogier does not mean to disturb your rest. It's just... it's just..."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ogier holds his weapon, leaning against the corridor, standing guard outside your door like a knight sculpture."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You do not know how long he has been standing foolishly in the hallway. When you open the door, he reflexively tries to salute you but staggers weakly."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_7 = {
    Text = "—Watch out!"
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You steady the boy who almost tripped, but it only makes Ogier more flustered."
  },
  AvgDialog_46733_Content_9 = {
    Text = "His face flushes, and he fumbles around, seemingly trying to contain some invisible overflow while also wanting to flee from your side."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Forgive me, Keeper, please don't look at me right now."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The woman's hand grips your arm. Her knuckles are long and strong; even through the fabric, you can sense the thin calluses left by years of handling firearms."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Throughout these long years, I have grown accustomed to enduring the Holy River's influence... Yes, She is divine and merciful, ensuring the continuity of our people. Yet what I seek cannot be found in Her fervor."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_12 = {
    Text = "While you're delivering such an upright speech, Alva... your actions don't seem to match the words, do they?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_13 = {
    Text = "What I mean is, I am perfectly calm right now. My actions do not stem from the Holy River, nor from any external force."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<LightGray:<Italic:(No, you look anything but calm.)>>"
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_15 = {
    Text = "\"Look\" might be inaccurate; even with your sight obscured, you know these actions are certainly not what the usual Alva would perform."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_16 = {
    Text = "...But the person in question clearly does not agree."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Because I already know what I should guard and whom I should serve to achieve the vision I aspire to."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Therefore, I am wondering—if, right now, I can choose to follow my instinct and explore things I have never touched before."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Alva's delivery is extraordinarily steady, as if she is merely reporting on a training plan."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Alva, are you sure you're alright? You don't sound good."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_20 = {
    Text = "But her heartbeat betrays its owner; that clamor cannot be easily hidden, unlike the light before your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_21 = {
    Text = "This former votary of Justice is clearly engaged in another war against herself."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You can push me away at any time, or knock me unconscious."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Or—guide me."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_24 = {
    Text = "On the path of this endless pursuit, I shall dedicate eternal loyalty to you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_25 = {
    Text = "I wish to always stand guard by your side."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The voice of this usually resolute and steadfast woman is now low and trembling. Her forehead presses against the back of your head, her hand concealing your vision in total darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_4 = {
    Text = "After the current training session, Alva uncharacteristically burst into your room, performed a thirty-second challenge of gasping for breath, and then forcefully turned your bewildered gaze away."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_5 = {
    Text = "...I am thinking, %player%, I am thinking."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You do not know what she is thinking, but reason tells you that, besides a single syllable of confusion, it is best not to make any other sound."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You do so, and Alva responds to your awkward rigidity with a knowing laugh."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I know what the influence of the Holy River comes from, and what it signifies."
  },
  AvgDialog_46734_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I have served many beings, but I have always pursued only Justice. Even if, in the eyes of many, so-called Justice may only be a fleeting illusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_46735_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Friend! Come with me!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_46735_Content_10 = {
    Text = "New friends! Aurita's glands split into so many, many new friends today!"
  },
  AvgDialog_46735_Content_11 = {
    Text = "She laughs excitedly, shoving the toxic jellyfish into your hands all at once."
  },
  AvgDialog_46735_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Everyone says they want to be with you, so Aurita wants to be here, too!"
  },
  AvgDialog_46735_Content_13 = {
    Text = "<Italic:So many jellyfish... glad I'm not prone to allergies.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_46735_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<Italic:Still, even if I were, I'd be willing to take a few adrenaline shots to my heart to see Aurita's happy smile.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_46735_Content_2 = {
    Text = "<Small:This voice... could it be...?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_46735_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Hold on, let me get the door—"
  },
  AvgDialog_46735_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The intruder bursts into the room without warning, slamming into you with a heavy thud."
  },
  AvgDialog_46735_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You stumble back while trying to steady the girl, but gravity wins out; you fall to the floor with her in your arms, the world spinning around you."
  },
  AvgDialog_46735_Content_6 = {Text = "Look!"},
  AvgDialog_46735_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Before you can even scramble up, Aurita thrusts her \"hands\" in front of your face."
  },
  AvgDialog_46735_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Her umbrella-shaped arms are cupped together, cradling a cluster of thumb-sized jellyfish."
  },
  AvgDialog_46735_Content_9 = {
    Text = "What are these?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_1 = {
    Text = "<Italic:So many tears tonight, such an unforgettable sight~>"
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Your maid must have prepared some sobering tea. Shall I fetch it for you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_11 = {Text = "Don't—"},
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Sorel tugs your arm, and you both tumble onto the plush chaise. Even while disheveled, the goblet in her hand remains perfectly steady."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The manor is shrouded in darkness; only the golden liquor in her glass refracts the moonlight, casting a hazy, intimate glow between you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I'm not drunk. I don't need any sobering tea."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_15 = {
    Text = "My salon... has never been this quiet, yet it makes me feel so peaceful."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_16 = {
    Text = "At every grand gathering in the past, I always counted my guests in my mind: those who accepted my invitation, those who bought their way in, those who sneaked in... I made sure to remember every face."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_17 = {
    Text = "If someone accepted the invitation but never showed up, I remembered them too... Those people must be holding secrets that I've yet to grasp."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I can't help but feel restless about these hidden threats, anxious about a future I cannot control..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_19 = {
    Text = "As she speaks, she lifts your chin with a single finger, preventing your gaze from drifting away."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Lady Sorel? Karen sent word that you wanted to see me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_20 = {
    Text = "But regarding the unknown \"you,\" I feel only curiosity."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Perhaps... you and I can nurture the most gorgeous, most resilient bud together."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_22 = {
    Text = "And stand side by side... where no one else can ever reach..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_23 = {Text = "Mmm..."},
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Her words trail off unfinished. Her body goes limp, her entire weight collapsing softly onto yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The goblet slips from her fingers and rolls onto the marble floor, liquor soaking instantly into the tile seams. Her wine-scented breath, soft and intoxicating, quietly floods your near-melted mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Ah... my little Keeper, you're here."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_4 = {
    Text = "L-Little Keeper?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Before you react, Sorel brings a glass of wine to your lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_6 = {
    Text = "As she leans in, a heady aroma of wine wafts from the tips of her hair and the hem of her gown. Intoxicating spirits mingled with blossoms and fruits, carried on her warm breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Lady Sorel, you're drunk again."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Drunk? Perhaps. I suppose I am indeed a little tipsy."
  },
  AvgDialog_47150_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Seeing that you refused to take a single sip, Sorel shakes her head in feigned annoyance, pulling the goblet back and taking a few delicate sips herself."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Hearken, O Stars"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I am here, Deborah. I am right here."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_100 = {
    Text = "...Where are the guards?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_101 = {
    Text = "While you were toasting and drinking, we were already slaughtering your personal guards."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_102 = {
    Text = "As for your armies outside the city... don't bother trying to contact them."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_103 = {
    Text = "Blood stains every corner of the hall. Screams echo off the walls like a symphony from Hell."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_104 = {
    Text = "Those who didn't drink the tainted wine tremble, their bodies too weak to even draw a sword or flee."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_105 = {
    Text = "Goliath admires the bloody masterpiece, savoring the terror on their faces. He sighs with satisfaction and lifts his massive blade."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_106 = {
    Text = "Drink the wine and become a fish-man, or perish here. Make your choice."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_107 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_108 = {Text = "Ah!!!"},
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_109 = {
    Text = "A piercing scream strikes the stone tablets, producing a dull, heavy echo."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Miryam? What... what are you doing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_110 = {
    Text = "She tries to struggle, to escape, but Miryam holds her fast. She cannot move an inch."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_111 = {
    Text = "She longs to faint, but her mind remains painfully sharp, forced to confront the agony and fear."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_112 = {
    Text = "Repeat after me: \"The devout shall be embraced—for the Lord beholdeth their devotion.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_113 = {
    Text = "Deborah's blood splatters across Miryam's form. She remembers doing the same to her father on the temple altar many years ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_114 = {
    Text = "Farewell is but a prelude to a grander reunion, is it not, my Lord?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_115 = {
    Text = "She gazes intently at Deborah's abdomen as her blade moves to complete the final stroke of the diagram."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_116 = {
    Text = "Come now, Deborah. Speak. 'The yearning souls...'"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_117 = {
    Text = "Miryam's hand probes Deborah's abdomen, stirring and tearing."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_118 = {
    Text = "Deborah's hoarse voice rasps in agony. Her bloodshot eyes fly open in madness, staring directly into her own viscera."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_119 = {
    Text = "\"...shall be answered—for the Lord heareth their prayers.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_12 = {
    Text = "This isn't funny, Miryam. Please, let me down."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_120 = {
    Text = "Miryam tears something away. It should be painful, but Deborah no longer feels it."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_121 = {
    Text = "Her mind has gone numb; her emotions and senses have abandoned her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_122 = {
    Text = "She vaguely sees Miryam pull a bloody mass from her open abdomen."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_123 = {
    Text = "Sa... Sa..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_124 = {
    Text = "Sarah. Miryam had told her it was her younger sister's name."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_125 = {
    Text = "She and Nord had agreed to name their daughter this, but she never got the chance to tell Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_126 = {
    Text = "<Italic:Name her Sarah...> Deborah's lips move, but she can no longer find her voice."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_127 = {
    Text = "\"Lord, may our hymns pierce the abyssal gloom, that we may ascend with Thee—into the eternal void, where silence and madness reign as one.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_128 = {
    Text = "Miryam tenderly kisses her goddaughter, her lips stained by the infant's blood. As she closes Deborah's eyes, blood drips from the corner of her mouth."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_129 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_13 = {
    Text = "No, Deborah. This is no jest. There is nothing more sacred in this world than what is to come."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_130 = {
    Text = "Tap... tap... tap..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_131 = {
    Text = "Faint footsteps echo from within the house."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_132 = {
    Text = "This humble shack, built of dark stone tablets, is an exact replica of the home where Miryam once lived."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_133 = {
    Text = "In this room, she has bid farewell to her mother, her father, her sister, and her friend."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_134 = {
    Text = "In this room, she will find them again."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_135 = {
    Text = "The footsteps stop at the threshold."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_136 = {
    Text = "Praise be to the High Priestess!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_137 = {
    Text = "Praise be to the High Priestess!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_138 = {
    Text = "Goliath drops to his knees. Behind him, a multitude of fish-people roar the same words in unison as they fall to the earth."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_139 = {
    Text = "They surround the shack like an endless tide, awaiting a command from the deep."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_14 = {
    Text = "What are you doing? Miryam... didn't you say I was your best friend?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_140 = {
    Text = "Miryam walks toward the crowd, cradling the blood-slicked infant. The fish-people part to make a path for her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_141 = {
    Text = "The stars are right. The King's Divine Fetus has been implanted within the Holy Child. Soon, the King shall return to this world."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_142 = {
    Text = "The King shall protect his righteous subjects and bring forth the Divine Realm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_143 = {
    Text = "Divine Realm! Divine Realm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_144 = {
    Text = "The fish-people cheer and dance in a frenzy of madness. Miryam stands at the center, starlight illuminating her face, streaked with blood and tears."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_145 = {
    Text = "Our Lord's word shall spread across the world. High Priestess, give this flock a name."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_146 = {
    Text = "Cold, burning eyes turn slowly. Miryam surveys her soldiers, her subjects. She offers them a priestess's smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_147 = {
    Text = [[
We fare towards the sea, following in His footsteps.
We fare across the sea, bringing back His Divine Realm...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_148 = {
    Text = "The world will call us... Seafarers."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_149 = {
    Text = "Seafarers! Seafarers!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You... you once had another friend named Deborah, too. Is this not fate, Miryam? Please... don't hurt me."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_150 = {
    Text = "Amid the deafening chorus of fish-people, Miryam raises the baby high with both hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_151 = {
    Text = "In place of her heart, the Divine Fetus emits a pure white glow beneath the stars."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_152 = {Text = "Waaahhh—"},
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_153 = {
    Text = "Silence falls. The blood-slicked infant squirming in the ruins lets out her first, belated cry."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_154 = {
    Text = "The stars listen in silence to that oracular cry. A single star falls, carving a mournful streak across the night sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_155 = {
    Text = "—Another tale of the stars is about to begin."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Never, Deborah. How could I ever bring myself to hurt you? You are my best friend. My only friend."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_17 = {
    Text = "She caresses Deborah's face, wiping away the tears of terror. The cold, slimy touch sends a shiver through Deborah."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I will never, ever harm you. I am simply bestowing upon you a gift."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_19 = {
    Text = "A... a gift?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ornn Territory, Ritual Altar."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I wished so desperately to be the one to carry the Divine Fetus. But you saw what happened when I tried—I am unworthy."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Not everyone is fit for such an honor. My only regret is that I cannot experience it myself."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Deborah, I am your daughter's godmother. I shall grant this supreme honor to my goddaughter... and to you, my only true friend."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I am willing, Miryam! I will let her be the vessel... she can have the honor."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_24 = {
    Text = "But she isn't due for three months! I can't... I can't do it yet..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_25 = {
    Text = "It's too late, Deborah. It is far too late."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Miryam watches her with a tender gaze, her voice softening."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_27 = {
    Text = "She is the perfect choice. She must be born today."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_28 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Edmond Territory, Banquet Hall."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Tick... tock..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_30 = {
    Text = "And now, let us welcome the host of tonight's festivities—Goliath of the Ornns!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Thunderous cheers erupt in the hall. Goliath takes the stage, his gaze sweeping slowly over the crowd."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Edmond, Pappas, Enom... members of every great house are gathered here."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Their exquisite silks are stained with histories of slaughter; their laughing eyes shimmer with the light of greed."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Masters of land and time, yet slaves to their own power and lust."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Goliath offers them a smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Friends, today marks the formal birth of the Seven Families Alliance. The finer details of our accord will be presented shortly."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_37 = {
    Text = "For now, let us feast! To land, to gold, and to power—cheers!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The crowd roars, raising their goblets. Course after course of opulent dishes are laid upon the tables."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_39 = {
    Text = "The celebration begins. Nobles drink to the spoils they are about to divide, their revelry drowning out the world beyond the doors."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The sound of dripping water echoes in Deborah's ears. She slowly opens her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_40 = {Text = "Outside."},
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_41 = {Text = "Ah—!"},
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Who are you—ugh!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Abisha wrenches his blade from the guard's corpse."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Phew... If I couldn't understand the gargling of these fish-freaks, I wouldn't be stuck doing their dirty work."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_45 = {
    Text = "He looks at the Deep One soldier beside him and sighs."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Are all the other exits secure? Are the families' personal guards dead?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Good. Guard every door in this castle. Have one squad stay with me by the banquet hall; we'll wait for Lord Goliath's next command."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_48 = {
    Text = "It'll be an hour or two before the main army realizes something is wrong. Let's pray Goliath finishes this before then."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_49 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_5 = {
    Text = "She is in a chamber enclosed by dark stone tablets. Starlight pours through a hole in the ceiling, illuminating her belly."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_50 = {
    Text = "No... Miryam... please!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Please... I beg of you... for the sake of our friendship... spare me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_52 = {
    Text = "I offer you the ultimate glory, yet you treat our friendship with such insult, Deborah."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_53 = {
    Text = "No matter. My Lord understands your terror. Our bond will not be broken by these petty outcries."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_54 = {
    Text = "She reverently places the idol of Tulu by the altar and bows before it."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Praise the Lord... Lemuria, the Great King... Tonight, I welcome your return."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Have patience. The stars are moving into alignment."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_57 = {
    Text = "She rises and walks toward Deborah with a gentle stride. A bizarre ceremonial dagger glimmers in her pale hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_58 = {
    Text = "No! Miryam! I'm begging you... please... don't do this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Look at me, Deborah. Look into my eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_6 = {
    Text = "She is naked, her belly heavily swollen, veins mapping her skin clearly under the starlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_60 = {
    Text = "I know you are afraid. I have seen many believers tremble when they reach the end of this life."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_61 = {
    Text = "But fear not. You are a chosen subject of the Divine Realm. Everything you suffer now will be repaid ten-fold there."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Come, pray with me, Deborah."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_63 = {
    Text = "No... Miryam... please..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Repeat after me: \"The suffering shall be recompensed...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_65 = {
    Text = "The... the Suffering... no, Miryam..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Repeat after me: \"The wicked shall be scourged—for the Lord judgeth their iniquity.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Miryam chants the prayers as she moves to her friend's side."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Let me say one thing to Nord! Miryam... just one word to him..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_69 = {
    Text = "<Big:AAAHHHHHHH!!!—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_7 = {
    Text = "What's happening? Miryam?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Agony flares in her abdomen. She looks up and sees Miryam's pale, serpentine hand driving the dagger deep, carving a crimson path across her belly."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Miryam is deaf to the shrill screams. She does not see the face twisted by terror and pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_72 = {
    Text = "The blade moves with a steady hand as warm blood sprays across Miryam's face. Chanting with devout fervor, she ascends the stairs to the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_73 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Kill Miryam! Divide the Ornn family! Long live our alliance! Cheers!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Glasses clink as unrestrained greed mingles with the aroma of wine and meat."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Goliath licks his lips, savoring the intoxicating flavor."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Come on, keep going. What's the matter with you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Your... your face..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_79 = {Text = "My face?"},
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_8 = {
    Text = "She tries to rise, only to find her limbs lashed to the stone altar. She is paralyzed."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_80 = {
    Text = "He looks at the mirror-like tiles beside him and sees a face resembling a fish."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_81 = {Text = "Ah!!!"},
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Wounds open on his chest as if carved by invisible daggers. His ears and eyebrows vanish; his eyeballs bulge and migrate to the sides of his head."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Agony pierces through the haze of alcohol and adrenaline. He collapses to the ground, retching in pain, his hands frantically clawing at his face."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_84 = {
    Text = "What is this? Ah!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_85 = {
    Text = "One, two, three... in the luxurious banquet hall, the nobles fall to the ground one after another."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Crimson gashes appear on their bodies, blood and flesh forming ancient, grotesque patterns."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Their wails of agony converge into a grand symphony. Blood sprays, filling every goblet."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_88 = {
    Text = "This is... this is... a Deep One ritual!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Precisely. A Deep One ritual. You have all heard of the tragedy that befell the Ornn family, haven't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Hands reach out and take hers. They are cold and slick, like a pale serpent."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Why... Goliath?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_91 = {Text = "Why?"},
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Goliath seems to hear a hilarious joke. He rises from the high seat and takes up his blade."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Working with you would have earned me a small scrap of Ornn territory."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_94 = {
    Text = "But by working with Miryam, I gain power beyond your comprehension. I can turn your entire houses into fish-people and seize all your wealth."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Tell me, Mr. Edmond, if you were in my position, what would you choose?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_96 = {
    Text = "We... we won't go down without a fight!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_97 = {
    Text = "That's right! Goliath, by the honor of the Enom family, we will—ugh!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_98 = {
    Text = "A massive blade descends, splitting the young noble in two. His honor dies with him."
  },
  AvgDialog_47164_Content_99 = {
    Text = "The doors fly open as a tide of fish-people floods the hall."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Bosom Friend"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Don't be nervous, Mr. Edmond. Miryam stripped me of my freedom; we share a common enemy."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Miryam, don't worry too much. We can find another way together."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_101 = {
    Text = "There is no other way, Deborah. Only one option remains."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_102 = {
    Text = "She looks up, wipes her tears, and gently caresses Deborah's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_103 = {
    Text = "Long-forgotten questions resurface, buried by years and now filling her mind with the scent of dust."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_104 = {
    Text = "Deborah, do you have faith in the King?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_105 = {Text = "Of course."},
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_106 = {
    Text = "Deborah, do you know what faith is?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_107 = {
    Text = "My teacher once told me that faith is the sum of all responsibility and meaning. It leaves room for nothing else."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_108 = {
    Text = "You're making it sound so complicated."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_109 = {
    Text = "It's actually quite simple. Deborah, you have been my only true friend since the very beginning."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Miryam possesses immense power. You have many brave warriors, but eliminating her will come at a staggering cost."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_110 = {
    Text = "I promised you supreme honor. I promised you would be the first citizen of the Divine Realm, and that your home would be the happiest of all."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_111 = {
    Text = "I will keep that promise, Deborah. I will remember your hopes for the future. I bestow this honor upon you now."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_112 = {
    Text = "The Divine Realm will arrive, and the path leading to it will bear your name. Every believer, every citizen, will remember you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_113 = {Text = "!!!"},
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_114 = {
    Text = "Wait, Miryam, I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_115 = {
    Text = "Deborah doesn't have time to feel fear. Before she can finish speaking, a serpentine black mist coils into her body. She feels a wave of dizziness and collapses onto Miryam's shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_116 = {
    Text = "You can't do this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_117 = {Text = "I must."},
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_118 = {
    Text = "Father and the King wouldn't want to see you like this!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_119 = {
    Text = "You're only a nine-year-old child, Miryam. You don't understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I am willing to cooperate. This is my sincerity."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_120 = {
    Text = "Father and the King desire to see the arrival of the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_121 = {
    Text = "I am fulfilling their wishes, am I not?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_122 = {
    Text = "But... this is wrong."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_123 = {
    Text = "Only the Divine Realm is right."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_124 = {
    Text = "Miryam's voice is calm, as if she is stating a piece of common knowledge that everyone should know."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_125 = {
    Text = "Little Miryam stares at her future self. Confident, determined, and powerful—the undisputed High Priestess of Lemuria and the lonely emissary of the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_126 = {
    Text = "The daughter who once trembled under the ruins, calling for her father, no longer has any connection to her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_127 = {
    Text = "I see. I suppose it's time for me to go."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_128 = {
    Text = "She gazes at her older self sorrowfully."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_129 = {
    Text = "I hope you find your Divine Realm, Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Guards carry several chests into the parlor. As they open, a dazzling golden light reflects off Old Edmond's face, leaving him momentary dazed."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_130 = {Text = "I will."},
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_131 = {
    Text = "She knows it is the final blessing and farewell. Little Miryam departs, as if she never existed. Miryam doesn't cast a single glance toward the spot where she vanished."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_132 = {
    Text = "She hugs Deborah, gently patting her back while softly humming a Lemurian lullaby, as if soothing a child to sleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_133 = {
    Text = "Outside, the sun sets as the stars begin to follow their appointed paths."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_134 = {
    Text = "—The moment when the stars align is almost here."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I feel your sincerity, Mr. Goliath. What is your plan?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I have already visited the Pappas, the Enoms, and several other prominent families."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Their armies are beginning to gather. Before they march, I believe we need to hold a summit."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I will tell you everything about the Ornn family and offer my counsel."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I'll ensure you kill Miryam at the lowest possible cost. And..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_19 = {
    Text = "He leans in close to Old Edmond's ear."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Please sit, Goliath of the Ornn family."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_20 = {
    Text = "To be honest, Mr. Edmond, I am looking for a partner for a deep collaboration."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_21 = {
    Text = "To be blunt, the Edmond family is not considered particularly strong among the great houses. That is exactly why I wish to work with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_22 = {
    Text = "I can offer you a portion of the Ornn family's wealth and lands—even Miryam's power."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_23 = {
    Text = "What I seek is a deep alliance. After all, our goals go far beyond simply defeating Miryam and the Ornns, don't they?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The old man gazes at Goliath, sharing a knowing smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Hehehe... you ambitious little brat."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_26 = {
    Text = "You have a long-term vision, Mr. Goliath. Indeed, the fall of the Ornn family is merely the prologue."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Our alliance will surely herald a new dynasty for this land."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_28 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Sister... Father... Ah!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The old man's words retain a veneer of aristocratic refinement, but he makes no effort to hide the disdain in his tone."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Miryam? Miryam, are you alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Miryam wakes with a start, her back drenched in sweat."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The figures of her father and sister vanish, replaced by Deborah's concerned face."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Were you dreaming about your family?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_34 = {
    Text = "I saw my father and sister. They both had fish-like faces... Father said they've lived that way for tens of thousands of years."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_35 = {
    Text = "He asked me, 'How much longer must I wait?'"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Deborah... I can no longer remember what my father looked like."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Miryam falls silent, leaning weakly against the bed rail."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Deborah presses a handkerchief to Miryam's forehead and gently pats her back."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_39 = {
    Text = "You've been having nightmares lately. Your wounds haven't fully healed, so don't dwell on such things."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Mr. Edmond, I fully understand your hostility toward the Ornn family."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_40 = {
    Text = "It's alright. Once you recover and bring the Divine Realm here, you'll be reunited with your family soon enough."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_41 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry, Deborah. Whether in Lemuria or here, you've helped me so much."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_42 = {
    Text = "There you go again, saying things I don't understand. Why apologize for that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Miryam shakes her head without further explanation. She gazes at Deborah's swollen belly with a complex expression."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_44 = {
    Text = "My wounds are mostly healed. You're about to become a mother; you should focus on taking care of yourself."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_45 = {
    Text = "I'm just as healthy as she is."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Ah! Miryam! Miryam, listen... she's kicking me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Really? Let me hear."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Miryam leans down, pressing her ear to Deborah's belly."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Ah, it's true... I hear her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The Ornn family has embarked on an... unusual path."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Look, little one. This is your godmother, our High Priestess, Miryam. It was she who sensed you; that's how we knew you were a girl so early."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_51 = {
    Text = "One day, she will take our whole family to the legendary Divine Realm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_52 = {
    Text = "When that time comes, your father will still be the High Priestess's driver, and I will still be her maid."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_53 = {
    Text = "There is no need for drivers or maids in the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_54 = {
    Text = "That won't do. That wouldn't be nearly as much fun as staying with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Miryam gazes at Deborah's belly, a complex smile playing on her lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Deborah, you are my only friend. There is something I want to..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_57 = {
    Text = "High Priestess, Lord Goliath is waiting at the door."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_58 = {
    Text = "...Let him in."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_59 = {
    Text = "It looks like I'll have to wait a little longer for that surprise."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Unusual? You freaks... your existence is a blasphemy to everyone on this continent."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Deborah makes a playful face at Miryam and retreats to the next room. Goliath enters, watching Deborah's retreating figure with a thoughtful look."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_61 = {
    Text = "How is the communication with the other families progressing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_62 = {
    Text = "The land dwellers are certainly smarter than the Philistines, but as long as they are human, their desires remain much the same."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_63 = {
    Text = "I told each family they would be our closest allies. We'll kill you together, wipe out the Ornn family, and then I'll divide the land and power among them."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_64 = {
    Text = "The promise is full of holes, but those men are megalomaniacs who believe standing at the top of the world is their destiny. They don't doubt me for a second."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Their armies are already gathering. Only a few days remain until the stars align. We shall hold a feast then."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_66 = {
    Text = "It will surely be a magnificent banquet."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Goliath grins maliciously, revealing shark-like, pointed teeth."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_68 = {
    Text = "You have done well."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_69 = {
    Text = "And on your end? How are the preparations for finding the Holy Child?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Believe me, Mr. Edmond, it was an accident. Miryam, that witch, is responsible for all of this."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_70 = {
    Text = "I have searched everyone within the Ornn family's influence."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_71 = {
    Text = "I found some infants set to be born at the exact moment of alignment, but their families do not believe in the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Such children are unworthy of being the vessel for the King."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_73 = {
    Text = "To be born at that precise moment and have a family of believers is indeed a difficult condition."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_74 = {
    Text = "The Ornn territory is narrow, and your faith hasn't had time to spread. Our options are limited."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_75 = {
    Text = "It's a shame Deborah's child isn't due for another three months. She would have been perfect."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_76 = {
    Text = "What now? Should we settle for one of the other infants born during the alignment?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_77 = {
    Text = "If the implantation fails again, the Divine Fetus may be damaged. I cannot allow the King to face such a risk."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_78 = {
    Text = "That is a problem... I can't think of any other way to help you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Goliath leans back in his chair. Catching the direction of Miryam's gaze and the look in her eyes, he suddenly sits bolt upright."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I know you and several other families are secretly discussing a siege against the Ornns."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Wait... you aren't thinking of..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Miryam turns her head slowly toward Goliath. Her eyes send a wave of cold up his spine to his brain."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_82 = {
    Text = "As expected of you, Miryam. You're truly a f@1cking lunatic."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_83 = {
    Text = "But don't worry, I don't mind. My choice was the right one. Only by working with a madwoman like you can we achieve the impossible."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Go make the preparations. I must begin preparing my ritual as well."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Heh... the moment of stellar alignment will surely be a splendid night. See you then, High Priestess."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_86 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_87 = {
    Text = "The door opens, and the gentle light of the setting sun falls on Deborah."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_88 = {
    Text = "She hums a local tune while caressing her swollen belly, her mind likely filled with preparations for the baby or potential names."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Seeing Miryam enter, she waves her over."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Old Edmond's body suddenly tenses as he sits up straight. Goliath takes note of this and offers a small smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Miryam, are you finished talking? How did it go?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Very well. Goliath is well-prepared."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Wonderful! Does that mean we'll be welcoming the Divine Realm soon?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Miryam smiles at her. Having spent so much time together, Deborah easily catches the fatigue hidden behind it."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Miryam, you look exhausted."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_95 = {
    Text = "You said Goliath's side is going well... what about our side? Is there a problem?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_96 = {
    Text = "I can't find a suitable candidate, Deborah. Our faith has not yet spread, and there is no qualified Holy Child."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_97 = {
    Text = "I wanted to wait until the next alignment, but my father is pressing me, the King is pressing me... I can't wait any longer, Deborah."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_98 = {
    Text = "She hugs Deborah, burying her face in her abdomen. Tears fall, soaking Deborah's dress."
  },
  AvgDialog_47165_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Sigh. If only my child were due a few months earlier, she could have helped you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Phantom of the Past"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I originally planned to come back when I had the time, but before I could, I got caught up in the mess of Iglenn's rebellion."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Hah. You're getting sharper, little one."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_101 = {
    Text = "Then why, Lord Goliath? Why spare her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_102 = {
    Text = "If I kill her, yes, I'd be free. But what's the point of freedom?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_103 = {
    Text = "Goliath gazes at the flock of birds skimming the sea and closes his eyes in comfort."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_104 = {
    Text = "I can settle scores with the tribes that defeated the Philistines, or continue raiding the coast with my tribe. But that's all there is to it."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_105 = {
    Text = "Miryam gave me power, but it's not enough. Far from enough."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_106 = {
    Text = "It's just brute strength. Against the real armies of those kingdoms, we'll still be hunted down, fleeing across this sea forever like stray dogs."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_107 = {
    Text = "What I want is something far stronger than what Miryam can give me."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_108 = {
    Text = "—It's called Power, Abisha. Compared to power, freedom is insignificant."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_109 = {
    Text = "A crimson gleam flickers in his eyes as he licks his lips, smiling with delight."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Is this your homeland?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_110 = {
    Text = "Miryam now controls House Ornn. I can use her to magnify that influence a thousandfold."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_111 = {
    Text = "And when the time is right... I will take it all from her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_112 = {
    Text = "But Miryam is so powerful... this risk is too great..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_113 = {
    Text = "Abisha, I am the leader of the Philistines, remember? We've been failing and fleeing. I will lead the Philistines to victory."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_114 = {
    Text = "As for risks... what do you think I have left to lose?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_115 = {
    Text = "The giant gently pats Abisha's shoulder, then rises and walks to Miryam's bedside."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_116 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_117 = {
    Text = "My King... my Lord... You have forsaken me... Why..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_118 = {
    Text = "Blood seeps through the bandages on her chest, but Miryam doesn't notice. She lies on the bed in weakness, staring blankly at the endless sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_119 = {
    Text = "Ever since you woke up, you've been muttering that same sentence all the way. Don't you have any other lines?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The island's appearance has changed significantly. It might be Lemuria, or perhaps something else; I'm not sure."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_120 = {
    Text = "You look like a dead fish hanging from a hook."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_121 = {
    Text = "That Divine Fetus can be sustained by a body. I sensed it very clearly... My method is correct!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_122 = {
    Text = "But the King rejected me... The King rejected me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_123 = {
    Text = "Golia watches the flickering shadows of agony and confusion in her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_124 = {
    Text = "The King told me that when the stars align, He will return, and Lemuria will rise again..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_125 = {
    Text = "Stars, the stars... Could it be related to the stars...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_126 = {
    Text = "I see. I see! The King's power comes from the stars. Perhaps only those born under the correct alignment can nourish the King's Divine Fetus..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_127 = {
    Text = "The next star alignment will soon arrive. I can find a newborn... cough cough..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_128 = {
    Text = "Excitement flares in Miryam's eyes. She suddenly stands up, but the movement aggravates her wounds, sending her into a fit of coughing."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_129 = {
    Text = "Take your time to recover. If you die here, your King won't survive either."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Over tens of thousands of years, many things can change..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_130 = {
    Text = "Whether it's searching for the Holy Child, nurturing the Divine Fetus, or gathering followers... everything you need to do next requires a great deal of money, power, manpower, and authority."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_131 = {
    Text = "I don't have time to worry about these..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_132 = {
    Text = "This is precisely why we're working together. I have time—plenty of it."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_133 = {
    Text = "The power of House Ornn alone is not enough for what lies ahead. We need the support of more great houses across this continent."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_134 = {
    Text = "All the resources of House Ornn are at your disposal. Handle these matters."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_135 = {
    Text = "Before the next celestial alignment, I will find a suitable vessel for the King's Divine Fetus."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_136 = {
    Text = "Miryam slightly turns her head and glances at Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_137 = {
    Text = "Power, authority, wealth, dignity... I know what you seek to do, Philistine. And I don't care."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_138 = {
    Text = "I keep you alive because you are smart enough. Don't do anything stupid."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_139 = {
    Text = "Goliath shows a wicked smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Miryam sifts the fine sand through her fingers. Memories flood back—the fall of her homeland, the moment she stood among the fish-people, hopelessly watching the sea devour everything in Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_140 = {
    Text = "As you wish, Your Grace."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_141 = {
    Text = "Miryam, we're home!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_142 = {
    Text = "Along the winding coastline of House Ornn's territory, the grotesque fish-people, drawn by their mistress's return, line the shores in dense ranks to welcome her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_143 = {
    Text = "Goliath looks at their strange forms, the blades in their hands, and their loyal, empty eyes with satisfaction."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_144 = {
    Text = "He looks past them to the endless fertile land beyond, like a shark eyeing a dying whale."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Now, she has reappeared here. And soon, she will bring Lemuria back to these waters."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Where did you find the statuette? Take me there."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_17 = {Text = "Follow me."},
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_18 = {
    Text = "What did you say you were looking for earlier? The King's Remains? What's it used for?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_19 = {
    Text = "To awaken the King, we must find the silver substance left behind after the King's death. It is essential for the ritual."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The hull scrapes against the fine sand as the boat comes to a stop on the shore. Miryam steps off, gazing at the solitary island before her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_20 = {
    Text = "What exactly does that ritual involve? Is it similar to the one you used to turn us into fish-people?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_21 = {
    Text = "So, are you going to dig up your King's corpse? He's been dead for tens of thousands of years; his body would probably crumble at a touch..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_22 = {Text = "Tch—"},
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The purple glow on his neck flickers, and the excruciating pain makes Goliath gasp."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Show any further disrespect to the King, and the punishment will be far worse. Lead the way. And watch your tongue."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_25 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Black mist parts the weeds and dense thickets, revealing a small bay before everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Huh, when I looked from the other direction earlier, I didn't see this bay. And the bay itself looks so strange..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_28 = {
    Text = "That's right, its appearance changes or even vanishes when observed from different directions. So I suppose it must be some kind of sorcery or something..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_29 = {
    Text = "It's a dream. A dream created by the King to protect Lemuria from invaders!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The island is extremely small, like a jagged reef. Ancient, tangled vegetation clings to its rough surface, telling a long tale of solitude."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Miryam's gaze begins to fill with excitement."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_31 = {Text = "\"Dream\"?"},
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Where was that statuette found?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Right there."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Goliath points to an altar not far away. It is overgrown with weeds, barely recognizable."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Deborah takes out the statuette of Tulu and places it on the altar. The base fits perfectly into the indentation."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Seems like... nothing has changed... Did I place it wrong?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_37 = {
    Text = "If it worked just by placing it, I would have gone in long ago and taken all the valuable items."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_38 = {
    Text = "He looks at Miryam for guidance. She walks to the altar, takes out a dagger, and cuts her finger."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_39 = {
    Text = "A drop of crimson blood falls from her pale fingertip, landing on the statuette."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The lost Lemurian civilization is an ancient legend passed down among the Philistine tribes."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_40 = {Text = "Whoosh—"},
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_41 = {
    Text = "A ripple seems to spread through the air. The tiny island beneath their feet starts to tremble."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_42 = {
    Text = "What's this...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_43 = {
    Text = "The shape of the bay begins to blur. The seawater swirls and rises straight up, forming a massive whirlpool, like a giant gate standing open, inviting them in."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_44 = {
    Text = "My Lord, this is the tomb you prepared for yourself... The last ember you left to restore Lemuria is waiting inside, isn't it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Hey, wait! Are you out of your mind?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Miryam walks excitedly toward the center of the vortex, ignoring Goliath's calls. Goliath curses under his breath and follows her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_47 = {
    Text = "We are... underwater?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_48 = {
    Text = "We can breathe and talk here... It's truly a miracle!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_49 = {
    Text = "A narrow stone staircase appears, leading to the unfathomable depths. One by one, they follow Miryam down."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_5 = {
    Text = "After a coastal raid, my fleet was blown off course by a storm and ended up here."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_50 = {
    Text = "What is that... up ahead?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_51 = {
    Text = "After walking along the stone steps for who knows how long, a magnificent ruin looms into view."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_52 = {
    Text = "The dark stone pillars stand solemnly like beheaded sentinels, lining the path with halberds in hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Walls and roads made of giant stones have cracked and decayed, with dirty algae crawling over their remnants, bearing witness to past glory and many millennia of desolate solitude."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_54 = {
    Text = "The group trudges through the seawater and gravel, climbing the broken steps."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Is this... the Throne of Lemuria?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_56 = {
    Text = "A broken stone throne stands at the end of the path. Seated upon it is a withered skeleton, hand propping its chin, gazing wearily at the remnants of past dreams."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_57 = {
    Text = "It's you, my Lord... It's your remains! I've found you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Tens of thousands of years... it's been tens of thousands of years since I last saw you…"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Miryam bows devoutly and kneels before the bones."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The statuette was found right here."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Then she stands up, her hands probing into the skeleton's filthy cavity. When she withdraws them, a faint silver light appears amid the gloom of the ruins."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_61 = {
    Text = "A silver orb rests in Miryam's hand, its surface shimmering with flowing light, casting dreamlike reflections across the seafloor. Miryam leans closer, listening to its breathing."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Is this... the silver substance you mentioned?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_63 = {
    Text = "It's not exactly what Talis described... but this must be what I'm looking for!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Are you sure...? This thing doesn't look like anything good..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Speak disrespectfully of the King again, and I will grant you the most agonizing death."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Just kidding, why so serious..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_67 = {
    Text = "You said that what Talis described is different, so his method probably won't work. What's your plan now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_68 = {
    Text = "I can hear a heartbeat from it... It's the King's heartbeat..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Its life is fading, I can feel it... Give it life, and the King will be resurrected! Yes, it must be this way!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Was there anything else?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_70 = {
    Text = "She draws her dagger."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Miryam! What are you doing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_72 = {
    Text = "To nourish the King with my own life, to cradle his rebirth... What supreme honor... This is my mission!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Bless me, Deborah..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_74 = {Text = "Thud—"},
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_75 = {
    Text = "The ritual dagger plunges into Miryam's chest. She twists the blade, carving out a bloody cavity."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Blood gushes in torrents, swirling through the seawater and veiling the ruined throne. The skeleton bathes in the warm blood, watching the scene with cold indifference."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Miryam seems completely unaffected by the pain, her smile growing increasingly feverish."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_78 = {
    Text = "She cups the silver, shimmering orb and inserts it into the hollow of her chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_79 = {Text = "Ugh—"},
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_8 = {
    Text = "There are a few scattered around. I've shown you most of them already."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_80 = {
    Text = "The moment the orb enters Miryam's body, it emits a strong glow and writhes in a frenzy. It is resisting."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Miryam's life flows into it, devoured, only to be spat back out."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Flames scorch every inch of her skin; blades flay every strip of her flesh. Endless pain crashes over Miryam, yet she forces her lips into a twisted smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_83 = {
    Text = "My Lord... please... accept... me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_84 = {Text = "Thud—"},
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_85 = {Text = "Miryam!"},
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Miryam can't hold on any longer. She collapses into unconsciousness."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Get that cursed thing out of her and get her aboard."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_88 = {
    Text = "But Miryam said..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_89 = {
    Text = "If you want her to live, do it right now."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I've searched the entire island and found no ruins, only these trinkets."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_90 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_91 = {
    Text = "The mist has lifted, and the waves have settled into a rhythmic hum. The island has dwindled into a lonely inkblot against the horizon."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Goliath leans against the gunwale, savoring the gentle sway of the boat."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Lord Goliath, you seem to be in a good mood. Does this sunshine remind you of the Philistine coast back home?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_94 = {
    Text = "The coast? Hah. I am just thinking: if I kill Miryam now, I can go anywhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Huh? My lord, that may not be a... good idea..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Miryam's power far surpasses mine. She is severely injured now; if I miss this chance today, there may never be another."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_97 = {
    Text = "You won't really do that."
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_98 = {
    Text = "What? Do you think I'm some kind of soft-hearted fool?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47166_Content_99 = {
    Text = "It's not that... If you truly intended to kill her, you would have done so by now, rather than chatting with me here."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Behind the Mist"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_10 = {
    Text = "How pathetic. The giant casts a final gaze at his dying follower nearby, cracks a grim smile, then closes his eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_100 = {
    Text = "You already have ways to control me. My loyalty to you should be even more steadfast."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_101 = {
    Text = "Our partnership remains effective—there is no sharper blade at your disposal. Accept my service, and let our cooperation continue."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_102 = {
    Text = "As you know, I am not a loyal person, but what you need is my ability, not my loyalty, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_103 = {
    Text = "Miryam looks at Goliath in surprise, and after a moment, she smiles."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_104 = {
    Text = "Your tricks and your vileness surprise me... You're right, Goliath. A person like you can do many things that I cannot."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_105 = {
    Text = "Shall we continue our collaboration?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_106 = {
    Text = "Goliath smiles and extends his hand. Miryam turns away without a glance, walking towards the boat's canopy."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_107 = {
    Text = "From now on, address me as High Priestess."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_108 = {
    Text = "Goliath withdraws his hand, touching the mark on his neck. He smiles as he gazes at the sea, his newly grown fangs glinting sharply in the sun."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_109 = {
    Text = "Pleasure doing business with you, High Priestess."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Lament for our light, for our hope."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Exiled to the sea by fate, we wail, we lament, and we shed all our tears..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_13 = {
    Text = "<Italic:A deathbed hallucination>, the giant thinks dimly."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_14 = {
    Text = "An ancient, eerie chant drifts into his ears. Through the thick mist, a woman's figure emerges in his blackening vision."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Ah, Miryam, it's him, that Philistine giant! The coast is full of legends about him..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_16 = {
    Text = "But, is he dying?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_17 = {
    Text = "He won't die."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_18 = {
    Text = "A soft, chilly sensation comes from where the onyx serpents entwine his neck. The giant's murky, dark eyes gradually become clear."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Witch, it's the witch!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_2 = {Text = "@2—"},
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_20 = {
    Text = "What the House Ornn encountered has spread across the seas. Now she emerges from the mist of rumors, standing before them."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Philistine hyenas finally snap to their senses. They begin to flee or pounce onto her small boat for a final, desperate fight."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Miryam looks at the stunned giant, smiles faintly, and points into the distance. Then she pats Deborah on the shoulder, and they begin to turn the boat around."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_23 = {
    Text = "She has no interest in the hyena's running and struggling."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Onyx serpents slither, hunt, bite, and devour. In the thick fog over the sea, more and more broken bodies begin to bob to the surface."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The silent slaughter ends swiftly, leaving only blood-tinged waters and the giant's bewildered, staring face."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_26 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Miryam, why leave now that you have found him?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Seeking our Lord is a sacred mission. He would not wish for me to discuss it in such a filthy place."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_29 = {
    Text = "But you didn't say a word to that big guy... Will he come for you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_3 = {
    Text = "With a low grunt, the giant pulls out the sharp arrow pierced into his shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Ladies, wait a moment!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_31 = {
    Text = "A voice pierces through the thick mist. Deborah sticks her tongue out at Miryam, gradually bringing the boat to a stop."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Soon, a battered wooden boat stops in front of their vessel."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_33 = {
    Text = "The poison hasn't been fully purged from your system. Given the Philistines' sailing speed, you can rest for a while before returning to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_34 = {
    Text = "A scratch like this is nothing compared to the stakes of the deal I intend to make."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_35 = {
    Text = "I never said I wanted to make a deal with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_36 = {
    Text = [[
I don't want to waste your time, Lady Witch.
I know about Lemuria, and I believe that's why you sought me out.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Do you know what I want?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_38 = {
    Text = "What you did to the Philistine at Ornn's manor has spread across the seas. Frankly, I never put much stock in such legends before."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_39 = {
    Text = "But here you are, seeking me out in person. There must be a reason for this."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Poisoned blood splatters from his shoulder onto the deck, staining as a swamp of filthy black under the sunlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Rumor has it that you're very interested in those black statuettes. I found them, and I know what they represent."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Tell me what you know."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Before that, Lady Witch, perhaps we can strike a deal."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_43 = {
    Text = "I have witnessed your great power... I believe you should be able to bestow this power upon me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_44 = {
    Text = "I have many ways to make you talk, Philistine. What makes you think you're in any position to bargain?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_45 = {
    Text = "You misunderstand, my lady... You saved my life. Even if you do not wish to trade with me, I will still offer what I know without reservation."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_46 = {
    Text = "What I want to trade with you is not this information."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Then what else can you provide?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_48 = {
    Text = "My loyalty."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_49 = {
    Text = "I am not interested in your loyalty, Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Well played, Iglenn... The Philistines... resort to these tricks now..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Is that so? I heard about your control over House Ornn, truly impressive... Lady Witch, you need hands for something grand, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_51 = {
    Text = "How many people truly serve you after all your painstaking efforts? Who will govern in your name while you seek what you desire?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Frankly speaking, my lady, you are powerful, but matters of the heart, power, and true killing are not your forte."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_53 = {
    Text = "I don't know what your great endeavor is. But I am certain you will need my help."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Please accept my loyalty! It will be of great benefit to you and bring no harm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Miryam silently gazes at him. After a moment, she gives a slight nod."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Your persuasion has convinced me, Goliath. You have proven your ability."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Now, cast your blade into the sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_58 = {
    Text = "My blade..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Goliath glances at the giant blade that had been with him for years. Gritting his teeth, he casts it into the sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_6 = {
    Text = "His vision blurs, and his mind turns sluggish. He can no longer hold himself up. With a thunderous crash, he collapses onto the deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_60 = {
    Text = "The boat shakes, as if something is stirring the sea beneath it."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Miryam reaches out. The giant blade leaps from the sea, now gleaming with a dark, unfamiliar glow."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_62 = {
    Text = "The massive blade settles into her slender grasp as lightly as a feather."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Do you fear pain?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_64 = {
    Text = "I relish the pain, my lady."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Goliath smiles, dropping to one knee before Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Miryam places the giant blade against Goliath's neck."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Lord Goliath!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_68 = {Text = "Thud—"},
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_69 = {
    Text = "The massive blade slashes into Goliath's neck, easily severing it in two, and blood spurts out."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Goliath... The giant Goliath has finally fallen!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Before his follower can react, a faint purple-black light flickers at the wound on Goliath's neck."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_71 = {
    Text = "It slithers across his dark skin, carving an intricate and ancient pattern."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_72 = {Text = "Ugh!!!—"},
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Intense pain crashes through Goliath. It doesn't just come from the wound but surges from every inch of his body."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Sweat rolls down the giant's forehead. He grits his teeth, his whole body trembling as he fights against the pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_75 = {
    Text = "In excruciating pain, his ears elongate into fin-like blades; his teeth multiply into jagged, overlapping rows, and his eyes blaze crimson."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Lord Goliath... you... you now..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_77 = {
    Text = "This is an incredibly long ordeal. Goliath feels as if he has endured a year of excruciating pain. During this prolonged period, he died in pain and was reborn amidst agony."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_78 = {
    Text = "When his mind finally clears, he realizes the ritual has long since ended. He is lying face down on the boat, his sweat from the pain soaking the planks beneath him."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_79 = {
    Text = "He gazes at his reflection on the sea. The fish-people features are clearly visible on his giant body. A ferocious shark is revealed before everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_8 = {
    Text = "His head is mine! No one shall take it from me!!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_80 = {
    Text = "The depth of your transformation is determined by your own potential. You are very talented, Goliath."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Enjoy your strength."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_82 = {
    Text = "An unprecedented surge of power courses through Goliath's body. He effortlessly lifts the giant blade beside him and swings it toward the water."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_83 = {Text = "BOOM—"},
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_84 = {
    Text = "The calm sea surges with towering waves, tossing two small boats and causing them to rock violently."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Hehehehe... Hahahaha!!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_86 = {
    Text = "In the midst of violent shaking, Goliath bursts into loud laughter. He turns to Miryam; the red glow in his eyes flares fiercely."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Thank you, Lady Witch. I will savor every bit of the power you have bestowed upon me."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_88 = {
    Text = "But I'm afraid I won't have time to pledge my loyalty to you. The Philistine traitors and enemies are waiting for me to slay them."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Don't blame me. Blame yourself for letting your guard down. From now on, I'll honor you with the blood of my enemies!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The Philistines, who have cowered before Goliath moments ago, now swarm him like frantic, rapacious hyenas spotting a lion's corpse."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Goliath suddenly swings his blade at Miryam. However, as the mighty blade approaches her, it abruptly freezes in mid-air, losing all its power."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Urgh—ah!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Violet light flickers along the scar on his neck like a serpent's tongue. He collapses in agony as the piercing, bone-chilling pain returns with a vengeance, and the power within him vanishes without a trace."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_93 = {
    Text = "What... have... you... done..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_94 = {
    Text = "I am the High Priestess of Lemuria. I am indeed not skilled in the matters you mentioned, but I know human nature very well, Philistine."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Your pain and power are both gifts from me. No matter where you are, no matter how strong you become, I can strip your power and bring back your pain at will."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_96 = {
    Text = "You said you relished the pain, didn't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Impressive... Lady Witch..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_98 = {
    Text = "Tell me what you know, and I will grant you a painless death."
  },
  AvgDialog_47167_Content_99 = {
    Text = "It's just a minor episode... Why bother, Lady Witch?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Blood Banquet"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_10 = {
    Text = "It's okay, it's okay, just a family gathering. Are you feeling better?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Hahaha, it's not that simple!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_101 = {
    Text = "Spells, bodies, and..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_102 = {
    Text = "His bleary eyes snap open, and he suddenly hisses a harsh, silent incantation."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_103 = {Text = "Ah!—"},
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_104 = {
    Text = "Miryam kneels on the ground. Needle-like pain assaults her spirit, overwhelming her with immense suffering."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_105 = {
    Text = "@2, do you think I don't know what you're thinking?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_106 = {
    Text = "Call me \"Father\" and do things for me... But what you truly desire is something else, isn't it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_107 = {
    Text = "Miryam, I don't know what your hometown was like, but clearly, your people have no idea how the game of power is played."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_108 = {
    Text = "If I were a fool, I would have been drowned in the stable when I was six and never made it to today."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_109 = {
    Text = "The mental pressure tightens like an invisible noose. Miryam's agony intensifies."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Much better. Ah—Brother has arrived as well?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_110 = {
    Text = "You're powerful, but so what? You're just a hound; you do what I tell you to!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_111 = {
    Text = "My purpose is now fulfilled; I have no use for you for now. Reawakening you might be troublesome, but keeping a weapon with its own thoughts is even worse."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_112 = {
    Text = "So, just die once more. Don't worry, I'll let you see the sun again when I have need of you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_113 = {
    Text = "Talis glares at Miryam, chanting another string of spells. The invisible rope tightens into a noose around Miryam's neck."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_114 = {
    Text = "Talis suddenly tightens his grip on the noose..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_115 = {
    Text = "??! What's... happening?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_116 = {
    Text = "The noose is still there, but Talis cannot feel his control over it. No matter how he casts spells, the rope just lies there, motionless."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_117 = {Text = "Whoosh—"},
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_118 = {Text = "Ah!!—"},
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_119 = {
    Text = "A sharp pain surges through Talis's body. A long, straight gash opens across his chest, as clean and deliberate as if carved by a ritual dagger with reverent precision."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Talis smiles and gives him a bow."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_120 = {
    Text = "The hall falls dead silent. Guests freeze in place. Guards raise their weapons, circling Miryam, but dare not draw closer."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_121 = {
    Text = "This... What is this...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_122 = {
    Text = "It's the conversion ritual of fish-people."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_123 = {
    Text = "In the past, I had to use a dagger to cut open a person's body and infuse divine blood inside. But now that's unnecessary."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_124 = {
    Text = "Simply drink my blood, let my power serve as the catalyst, and the ritual is complete."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_125 = {
    Text = "Your blood... is added, added to..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_126 = {
    Text = "The wine, yes. Everyone at this banquet has already partaken."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_127 = {
    Text = "Miryam stands up and brushes the dust off her clothes."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_128 = {
    Text = "You... Planned this all along..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_129 = {
    Text = "The people of this world have changed. Faith, family, dignity... none of it holds any value in your eyes. I know this all too well, Talis."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I've just arrived as well. Just about to present my gift to Father."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_130 = {
    Text = "No worries, I'll bring forth a better world. Helping you become the head of House Ornn will make the family my instrument in this sacred endeavor."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_131 = {
    Text = "You have base hearts, unworthy of the Divine Realm. But you completed the mission of my rebirth—so consider this my gift in return."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_132 = {
    Text = "We... we could have made a deal... You don't have to..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_133 = {
    Text = "A hound has no right to negotiate. So I have no choice but to become your master. Now, I believe I've earned that right."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_134 = {
    Text = "I want to resurrect someone. Tell me, what should I do?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_135 = {
    Text = "If I tell you... will you let me live?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_136 = {Text = "Aaaah!!—"},
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_137 = {
    Text = "Miryam says nothing. Another deep wound appears on Talis's body, blood gushing out from it."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_138 = {
    Text = "I'll tell you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_139 = {
    Text = "In my study... inside the desk... there's a book that records all my research."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Alright, now all you brothers are here."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_140 = {
    Text = "Everything about the golem is written inside!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_141 = {
    Text = "Miryam glances at him and nods."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_142 = {
    Text = "I know you're telling the truth."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_143 = {
    Text = "You're right, the Lemurians knew no games of power."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_144 = {
    Text = "However, once a person has a divine mission to accomplish, learning such things is not difficult at all."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_145 = {
    Text = "That's right, that's right... So can I leave now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_146 = {Text = "Ahhh!!!"},
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_147 = {
    Text = "Wounds continue to appear on him. The lines of blood and flesh intertwine, forming a pattern from an ancient civilization."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_148 = {
    Text = "Meanwhile, the same lines appear on most of the guests and guards. Screams mingle with gushing blood, splattering every corner of the grand hall."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_149 = {
    Text = "The elegant banquet hall has turned into a hell of blood and flesh, filled with the wails of House Ornn members."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The banquet is being prepared. Before that, there are some important matters I need to discuss with you. It's about my final arrangements."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_150 = {
    Text = "Talis's face begins to deform. Fish scales spread across his skin. His once piercing cries grow hoarse and faint, tinged with the briny stench of the abyssal sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_151 = {
    Text = "This land is already rotten... I will show them a perfect Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_152 = {
    Text = "The King was telling the truth. The Divine Realm is arriving... I already know where to find Him. Just wait a little longer, and we will soon be reunited."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_153 = {
    Text = "Talis's anguished cries have almost ceased. Under the powerful influence of Miryam, his transformation is even more complete than that of any ancient Lemurian."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_154 = {
    Text = "She leans down, touching Talis's deformed face and scaly arms. Amidst the blood and cries filling the room, she weeps—and she smiles."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_155 = {
    Text = "It has been a long time, Father."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_156 = {
    Text = "She offers her most tender greeting to the writhing, suffering creature before her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Father! Please don't say such things..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The second son takes two steps forward and supports the elder's arm. The elder gently pats the back of his hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Let me finish. I know my own condition well enough. Some things need to be arranged in advance if House Ornn is to prosper."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_19 = {
    Text = "After tonight's banquet, I will appoint my second son as the head of House Ornn. I plan to enjoy a few years of leisure myself."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Greetings, Father, the eternal head of House Ornn."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Father, but... this is so sudden. I'm not ready yet..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You are the finest heir of House Ornn, with the noblest lineage and the best upbringing. This was my promise to your mother, and I will fulfill it."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Rest assured, I've already spoken with the family's old allies. Your brothers will also help you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_23 = {
    Text = "He glances at his other sons."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Your fiefs will remain unchanged. I know you're all close with your brother. The title of patriarch is merely a name; we are all one family and must remain united."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_25 = {
    Text = "As for you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_26 = {
    Text = "He looks up, staring at Talis."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Your fief won't change either. However, you've been meddling in far too many affairs lately."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_28 = {
    Text = "You're aging as well. Hand over the command of your army to your brother. I think you, like me, should enjoy a more relaxed life."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_29 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Talis bows, and Miryam, standing behind him, gives a slight nod to the elderly man in the main seat."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_30 = {
    Text = "This is a command I cannot refuse, isn't it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_31 = {
    Text = "The old man seems prepared for the reply, leaning back into his chair."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Three days ago, I sent troops toward your base."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_33 = {
    Text = "I've always been aware of your ambitions. But you're still my son, so I'll give you a choice."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_34 = {
    Text = "This decision is made for the long-term good of House Ornn. I hope you do not resent me for this."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_35 = {
    Text = "...How could I, Father? I must thank you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Talis lets out a relieved smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_37 = {
    Text = "On the way here, the thought of what I would have to do tormented me beyond words…"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Thank you, and thank you all, my brothers. Now, I am free from any burdens."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_39 = {
    Text = "The old man taps the arm of his chair. A squad of guards rushes out from behind the curtain, surrounding Talis and Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The old man waves impatiently."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Next to him, the second son widens his eyes; his voice growing hoarse from tension."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_41 = {
    Text = "\"Father? What is this...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Thorough as always, Father. You stationed my personal guards outside the city. You stripped me of my weapons. You left me with no chance at all."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_43 = {
    Text = "A bastard born of a maid, uneducated, spending all day on your laughable alchemy, and your ridiculous ambitions... You have no feelings for your family; all you desire is power."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_44 = {
    Text = "I've put up with you long enough; I've done my duty."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_45 = {
    Text = "The soldiers draw their swords and approach. Talis waves, and Miryam steps forward. Behind her, black mist gathers and coils."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_46 = {
    Text = "This maid? ..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_47 = {
    Text = "I agree, Father. You've tolerated me, perhaps far too long."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Now enjoy the fruits of my absurd alchemy, Father!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_49 = {
    Text = "The soldiers sense danger and lunge at them."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_5 = {
    Text = "\"As the older brother, you should set an example for others. Can't you even teach a servant proper manners?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_50 = {Text = "Swish—"},
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_51 = {
    Text = "A snake-like mist flickers past a soldier's face. In the next moment, a headless body collapses to the floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Th-This is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Before the other soldiers can react, coils of serpentine black mist appear beside each of them."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_54 = {
    Text = "The black mist entwines their bodies, hissing, tasting the air, savoring their fear."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_55 = {
    Text = "No... please..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_56 = {
    Text = "A few wisps of black smoke linger in the air. The black snakes strike, and the room erupts in a chorus of rhythmic screams."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Soon, the screams cease. The members of House Ornn collapse amidst gore and severed limbs, throats choked with whimpers."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Open your eyes wide and take a good look at the result of my alchemy—my \"daughter.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_59 = {
    Text = "In these past few months, I've used every possible means to conceal her existence, all for this very day."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Ah... Never mind, you probably wouldn't understand these things anyway."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_60 = {
    Text = "It's the generous gift I prepared for you. Do you like it, old man?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Talis watches the trembling, speechless old man with a satisfied smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_62 = {
    Text = "You're absolutely right; only with prior planning can House Ornn prosper and flourish."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, Father. I've always loved this family... and my dear brothers."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Leave House Ornn to me, and I will make it thrive—"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_65 = {Text = "Poof—"},
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_66 = {
    Text = "A sharp knife plunges into the old man's withered chest. The last thing he can see is the bastard's triumphant smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_67 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_68 = {Text = "Everyone."},
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Clink—clink—clink—"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_7 = {
    Text = "...I stand corrected, Father."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_70 = {
    Text = "A silver spoon taps against an intricately carved goblet, its sound sharp and crisp."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_71 = {
    Text = "The noisy banquet hall falls silent. Everyone turns their gaze towards the main seat."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_72 = {
    Text = "The bloodstains on the seat have not yet dried. Talis inhales the metallic scent of the air, savoring the fearful gazes pinned upon him."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_73 = {
    Text = "I know, I know. You all came for my father's birthday banquet. Still, I am truly grateful for your presence."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_74 = {
    Text = "A grand show would be utterly dull without an audience."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Thank you all for coming. Today, all of House Ornn gather to witness the most important moment of my life."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Especially my beloved brothers..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_77 = {
    Text = "He stands up, raising his glass towards the corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Under the watch of a squad of fully armed soldiers, Talis's younger brothers sit at a table, terrified and silent."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_79 = {
    Text = "With their help, today, you will witness a great turning point."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_8 = {
    Text = "A rush of hurried footsteps echoes outside the door. A young man bearing a faint resemblance to Talis bursts into the hall."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_80 = {
    Text = "The history of House Ornn will be completely changed today."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_81 = {
    Text = "He draws his sword and stabs it into the wooden table."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_82 = {
    Text = "I, Talis, a bastard, a baseborn son. From today onward, I am the head of House Ornn, the absolute dictator!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Ladies and gentlemen, you are now my new friends. We will forge a powerful alliance, and all enemies will be crushed beneath it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_84 = {
    Text = "The guests might have been friends of the former patriarch, but not anymore. Their allegiance had shifted, as it always does, to the victor."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Amid Talis's grand, ringing speech, the guests raise their glasses."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_86 = {Text = "To Talis!"},
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Hahaha... To you, my friends! To our great alliance! To the bright future of House Ornn!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_88 = {Text = "Cheers!"},
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_89 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Father! Sorry, I was sick yesterday and have only just gotten up..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Clinking glasses, lively chatter. People, some sincere, others merely playing their parts, blend into the banquet, becoming a part of it."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Miryam stands by, smiling, watching the guests and the rules of this new era."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Talis, drunk with joy, settles back into the main seat. He raises his glass to everyone, drinks heartily, and relishes this moment of immense happiness in his life."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Miryam, to you as well... you are my pride!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_94 = {
    Text = "You have no idea how much I've done to find you, to awaken you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Those \"silver substances\" you mentioned earlier..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Yes, exactly, those silver substances... Gold? Gems? Hahaha, they're all trash!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_97 = {
    Text = "What's the silver substance? What is alchemy? It's power! In the face of power, what is wealth? It's merely a byproduct of power."
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_98 = {
    Text = "Alchemy is power... Miryam, you are the embodiment of power! Cheers!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47168_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Is it true that all it takes to revive someone is that silver substance?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_1 = {Text = "Old Friend"},
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Talis brought me back to life; he must know something. I'll find a way to bring you back through him!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_100 = {
    Text = "He will pay for his hesitation."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_101 = {
    Text = "Our food and water will only last two or three days..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_102 = {
    Text = "You're barely a mouthful, but if I'm really starving, I won't be too picky about eating you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_103 = {
    Text = "Don't worry. To thank you for your loyalty, I'll make it quick while you're dreaming."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_104 = {
    Text = "Lord Goliath! I am your loyal follower—please don't scare me like that..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_105 = {
    Text = "But, my lord, let's not give up so soon. Iglenn sent us to find the witch who killed our clansmen. If we succeed and return with her, maybe he'll be satisfied and let us live."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_106 = {
    Text = "Naive little one, Iglenn isn't that kind. Besides, there's no witch—just a lie to deceive the tribe."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_107 = {
    Text = "But now that things have come to this, I hope this legend is true..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_108 = {
    Text = "The giant opens his eyes, staring across the boundless sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_109 = {
    Text = "If such a person truly exists, perhaps I really can accomplish something."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_11 = {
    Text = "\"When the stars are right, Lemuria will end its hibernation and rise again unto the world.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I will bring you back. I will restore Lemuria... That is what you told me. Please rest assured, I will fulfill my mission!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_13 = {
    Text = "She gazes fervently at the shadow."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The shadow remains silent. His face is obscured by light and tendrils, making his expression unreadable. He lowers his head and lets out a soft sigh."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The faint sigh cracks through the void like a thunderclap. The light begins to scatter, fleeing into the dark."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_16 = {
    Text = "My Lord? My Lord?..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_17 = {
    Text = "MY LORD!!..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The bright light stings Miryam's eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_19 = {
    Text = "As her vision clears, the statuette rests securely on the windowsill."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Absolute silence. Absolute darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Carved from dark stone with intricate detail, the king rests his chin on his hand, reclining on a throne entwined with tentacles, quietly watching Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Sunlight rises behind him, haloing his form in a soft, blurred glow."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Miryam smiles and bows devoutly to the statuette."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Please be patient, my Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Miryam, I just heard you talking in your sleep again... Are you okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Hmm... I'm alright, Deborah."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_26 = {
    Text = "You're always talking in your sleep. I've heard it so many times."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The maid steps forward and gently presses her hand to Miryam's forehead. Miryam stares blankly at her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Why are you staring at me like that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_29 = {
    Text = "I was thinking, Deborah is such a lovely name."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_3 = {
    Text = "She stands in the darkness, and no matter which direction she looks, she can only see the eternal void."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Heh heh, you think so too? A slave's child isn't supposed to have a name, but the old mistress liked me and gave me this one. And I love it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_31 = {
    Text = "The face of that friend in Miryam's memory overlaps with the face of the maid."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Priestess Deborah once helped Miryam become the High Priestess, and perhaps Maid Deborah will also help Miryam usher in the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_33 = {
    Text = "What a wonderful coincidence. What a divine fate. Miryam looks at her and smiles unconsciously."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Your forehead isn't even warm... Why do you seem a bit dazed..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_35 = {
    Text = "If anything happens to you, Lord Talis will have my head."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_36 = {
    Text = "We might both be \"maids\" in name, but you're far more precious than the rest of us!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_37 = {
    Text = "We are no different. Everyone in this world is merely a servant of the great existence."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Sigh, you're rambling again..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Deborah, you've talked to me about many things recently. This place is unfamiliar to me, and I'm grateful to have someone to talk to."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Miryam feels herself becoming a lightless star, her energy converging toward a certain place—a sensation that fills her with aching, ancient nostalgia."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_40 = {
    Text = "You are my dearest friend. You always have been."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_41 = {
    Text = "She smiles and takes the maid's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Let's go. Lord Talis should be waiting for us."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_43 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_44 = {
    Text = "I'm gonna tell you one more thing, but you mustn't tell anyone else!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Rest assured, I won't say a word."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_46 = {
    Text = "And you don't have to preface every secret with that phrase. This is the fifth time you've said it today."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Besides, your \"secret\" about having a crush isn't much of a secret at all. I think pretty much everyone in the manor already knows who it is."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_48 = {
    Text = "No way! I've hidden it so well... You're just trying to trick me into saying his name!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Ugh, anyway, now this is serious: I think Lord Talis is plotting something big. Something dangerous."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_5 = {
    Text = "She gazes in that direction—light surges forth, coalescing into a blurred silhouette there."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_50 = {
    Text = "He is incredibly cunning. Just be careful!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Is that so?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Miryam says it with the same gentle smile—no surprise, no alarm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Absolutely! Look at him; he's had you kill quite a few people recently. Those were all friends of House Ornn, people who were really close to Lord Talis's father..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_54 = {
    Text = "He appears to get along with these people as if they were his close friends, but then he turns around and has you kill them all."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_55 = {
    Text = "I know you don't want to do this, but there's no way around it—you have to follow Lord Talis's orders."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_56 = {
    Text = "This world may be free of natural disasters, but the hearts of this world are far more terrifying than any calamity."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_57 = {
    Text = "In such an imperfect world, killing will always exist. It's something we cannot avoid."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Sigh, I just don't understand... Why must kingdoms and families constantly fight with each other? There are still so many people who can't even live decently."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_59 = {
    Text = "I just hope to find a quiet little place in the future, build a house, and live there with Nord..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_6 = {
    Text = "My Lord... Is that you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_60 = {Text = "Oops!..."},
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Realizing she has let it slip, Deborah's face turns red, and she quickly claps her hands over her mouth."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_62 = {
    Text = "It's alright. Everyone knows you have feelings for that young coachman. Even Lord Talis has mentioned it to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_63 = {
    Text = "She smiles and gently pats Deborah's flushed cheek."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Rest assured, Deborah. In the future, there will be a perfect world."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Really? How do you know?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_66 = {
    Text = "It's true, Deborah. There are things I will share with you in time. I will make you the first believer of this new era and the first citizen of the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_67 = {
    Text = "I will bring forth a perfect Divine Realm... This is my mission."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Keep me waiting here while you stroll along chatting with Miryam, having a grand old time, are we?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Talis's grim voice interrupts their conversation."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The figure woven from light sits leaning on a throne, chin resting on one hand, silently watching Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_70 = {
    Text = "I sent you to fetch Miss Miryam, and this is how you carry out my order?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Addressing her by name, walking side by side... Soldier, drag this unruly wretch out and dispose of her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Lord Talis! Please spare me... I... I just..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_73 = {
    Text = "It's my fault. It has nothing to do with Deborah. Please, \"Father,\" forgive her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Talis glances at Deborah and waves his hand impatiently."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Since Miryam has pleaded for you, I'll let it slide this time. Should there be a next time, no one's plea will save you. Now get lost."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_76 = {
    Text = "My daughter, come, come this way..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Deborah bows to him, discreetly winks at Miryam, then goes outside and closes the door behind her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Talis's voice immediately warms up as soon as he begins talking to Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_79 = {
    Text = "You've done exceptionally well these past few months, truly outstanding."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_8 = {
    Text = "My Lord... I died carrying doubt toward you. That is my sin..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Back when I was obsessed with alchemy, my father always said I was wasting my time. But being a maid's child, nothing I do would ever win his approval... A maid's child, hmph."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_81 = {
    Text = "His grip on the hilt tightens; veins on his hand bulge, and then slowly relax."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_82 = {
    Text = "It's different now, Miryam. With you, I have an army... No, you're far more powerful than an army!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_83 = {
    Text = "We can create more golems like me. The ritual requires a large amount of spiritualpower; I can assist you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_84 = {
    Text = "I've been thinking about this as well. However, that silver substance isn't something you can find just anywhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_85 = {
    Text = "\"Silver substance...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_86 = {
    Text = "I'll explain it to you later when I have time. No need to rush for now. With you here, it's enough for me to accomplish what I want."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_87 = {
    Text = "He takes a deep breath, grips his knife, and gazes at the ocean outside the window."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_88 = {
    Text = "It won't be long before my father's 70th birthday. I'll bring a gift to the capital of House Ornn to celebrate his birthday."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Our preparations are almost complete. When the time comes, we'll present him with a valuable gift. Right, Miryam?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I do not dare ask for your forgiveness... I'll bear my sin! But before that, I will finish what must be done!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Sure, \"Father.\" It will be an invaluable gift for the entire House Ornn."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_91 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_92 = {
    Text = "A few days later."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_93 = {
    Text = "On the sea, a wooden ship drifts alone."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Lord Goliath, the tribespeople's ships are no longer in sight."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_95 = {Text = "Good."},
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_96 = {
    Text = "The giant drops his blade, leans against the mast, and closes his eyes to rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_97 = {
    Text = "The wounds from battle, the schemes and betrayals of his kin afterwards... He was careless. He has no one to blame but himself."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_98 = {
    Text = "Even someone like him feels tired. Weary to the bone."
  },
  AvgDialog_47169_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Heh, Iglenn the coward. He wants to kill me but fears tarnishing his reputation. Exiling me under the pretext of hunting a witch—what a troublesome tactic."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Dark Statue"
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_10 = {
    Text = "\"Wake up, return to your family's embrace...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Soon, the voices of the Philistines are silenced forever."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_101 = {
    Text = "Miryam seems oblivious to everything happening around her. She walks towards the remains inside, devoutly picking up the dark statuette for a closer inspection."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_102 = {
    Text = "\"It's a Lemurian statuette... Yes, a Lemuria statuette...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_103 = {
    Text = "\"This is the golem... This is the power of a golem!!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_104 = {Text = "@2@3..."},
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_105 = {
    Text = "Talis stands up, his face flushed with excitement. He chants a spell and waves his hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_106 = {
    Text = "Miryam feels a strong power from the other end of the Link, but it vanishes before causing any real damage."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_107 = {
    Text = "\"Golem, I am your Linker, and I gave you life. From now on, I am your father.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_108 = {
    Text = "\"Your abilities are formidable, but if I so desire, I can always reduce you back to a mere corpse.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_109 = {
    Text = "\"Your fate is bound to mine. If I die, you won't be able to survive either.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_11 = {
    Text = "\"Father!...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_110 = {
    Text = "\"So, don't entertain any improper thoughts. Serve me faithfully. Help me become the head of the House Ornn.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_111 = {
    Text = "\"Father\"? \"Father\"... The King was right; I am the one who must bear the fate! I know what to do now. I can accomplish so many things...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_112 = {
    Text = "\"Rest assured, Father. Miryam will surely stand by your side and help bring back the Divine Realm!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_113 = {
    Text = "Miryam gazes at Talis with an eager and strange look. It is as if her eyes were piercing through him, focusing on something far beyond his comprehension."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_114 = {
    Text = "It's as scorching as the sun, yet as dark and cold as the abyssal deep."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_115 = {
    Text = "\"What Divine Realm? You mean the lands of House Ornn? A strange habit, but no matter. Do as you wish.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_116 = {
    Text = "\"Those Philistines are still enjoying my castle and estate. Miryam, kill them. Show me what you can do.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_117 = {
    Text = "\"As you wish, 'Father.'\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_118 = {
    Text = "Miryam bows to Talis and walks out."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_119 = {
    Text = "Blood drips from the dark statuette. Behind Miryam, black snakes extend like wings, revealing their sharp fangs."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_12 = {
    Text = "She snaps her eyes open and leaps out of the sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_13 = {
    Text = "\"She's awake! Master Talis, she's awake!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_14 = {
    Text = "\"Where is this?...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Miryam finds herself in a spacious and luxurious hall, kneeling at the center of a ritual magic circle."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The people around her, dressed in strange clothing and shouting excitedly, have faces she has never seen before."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_17 = {
    Text = "A middle-aged man stands outside the magic circle, looking at her with both exhaustion and excitement."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_18 = {
    Text = "\"It worked... I summoned the golem! I've spent my entire life researching... and finally succeeded!!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_19 = {
    Text = "\"Where... where is the King? This isn't Lemuria?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_2 = {
    Text = "\"In the name of @3, I call upon you, my child...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The maid, who looks somewhat familiar, stares at her in confusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_21 = {
    Text = "\"Lemuria? What is that?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_22 = {
    Text = "\"Probably some kind of ancient civilization... Who knows?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_23 = {
    Text = "\"Judging by her attire, she must be someone important... My efforts have not been in vain!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_24 = {
    Text = "His gaze at Miryam grows increasingly intense. He approaches her and reaches out to place his hand on her forehead."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_25 = {
    Text = "\"I am your Linker... Now, open your eyes and witness it all...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Reality briefly disappeared. Countless pieces of information flood into Miryam's mind, like a vast ocean rising to drown her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_27 = {
    Text = "She sees her homeland sink, witnesses the sea change, and observes the island connect to the mainland."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_28 = {
    Text = "She sees new civilizations born, new nations established, new followers chanting new prayers, and new kings ascending new thrones."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_29 = {
    Text = "She watches as the long years swiftly pass with countless days and nights, and Lemuria disappears from the world's memory without leaving a trace."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_3 = {
    Text = "\"Let your family's embrace soothe your weary body; let the scent of home heal your wandering soul.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_30 = {
    Text = "\"I have been asleep... for over ten thousand years?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_31 = {
    Text = "\"Sleep? Hahaha... No, no. You died once.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_32 = {
    Text = "\"It was me! I awakened you and gave you life again!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_33 = {
    Text = "\"Quick, tell me what abilities you have and how you can help me.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_34 = {
    Text = "\"Lemuria... vanished without leaving a trace...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Ignoring Talis's urgent questions, Miryam remains lost in her thoughts."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The changes in the world, the disappearance of her homeland, ten thousand years of time—all of this left her newly awakened mind unable to think clearly."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_37 = {
    Text = "The maid slaps her own forehead and sighs."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_38 = {
    Text = "\"Oh no, Lord Talis... she doesn't seem very bright, does she?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_39 = {
    Text = "\"But it's okay. I'll take good care of her for a while, then she might...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_4 = {
    Text = "\"Father?...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_40 = {Text = "\"Ah!—\""},
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_41 = {
    Text = "A commotion comes from far outside the house."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_42 = {
    Text = "\"What's that noise?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_43 = {
    Text = "\"Philistines... Philistine invasion! The soldiers are guarding the awakening ceremony; the coastal defenses have been breached!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_44 = {
    Text = "\"Warning! Philistine... Ah!...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_45 = {
    Text = "A guard runs while shouting. Before he can finish, a giant harpoon flies from afar, piercing his heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_46 = {
    Text = "A group of dark-skinned, unarmored foreign warriors, shouting strange battle cries, surrounds them from all sides."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_47 = {
    Text = "\"Quick... Golem! Kill them for me!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_48 = {Text = "\"...\""},
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Miryam collapses on the floor, lowering her head in a daze, and does not respond."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Consciousness and perception gradually return to Miryam. Half-awake, she feels herself enveloped in warm seawater."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_50 = {
    Text = "\"@2! Can't believe we awoke a useless one...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_51 = {
    Text = "\"So this is what the inside of House Ornn castle looks like. Truly luxurious.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_52 = {
    Text = "\"You savages! This is the territory of House Ornn. If you don't want to be slaughtered by our army, get the hell out right now!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_53 = {Text = "Shhk—!"},
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_54 = {Text = "\"Ah!!\""},
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_55 = {
    Text = "The harpoon pierces his shoulder, and he lets out a scream, clutching the wound in pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_56 = {
    Text = "\"If you bark again, next time it will pierce your eyeball, then your throat.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Everyone inside the room is controlled, while the guards outside are killed by harpoons. The Philistine paces around inside, greedily observing everything."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_58 = {
    Text = "\"Goliath used to say often, never lay a finger on the castle of House Ornn; it is an extremely dangerous thing. But now? We are standing right inside the Ornn family's castle.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_59 = {
    Text = "\"Everything here will soon be ours!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The sound echoes faintly. The sun's outline pierces through the water, vaguely appearing above."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Next to him, another Philistine warrior eagerly raises his harpoon."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_61 = {
    Text = "\"That's right, Goliath is a coward! We should have listened to Iglenn. He should replace Goliath as our chieftain!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_62 = {
    Text = "\"Boss, once you seize Ornn's castle, Iglenn will definitely appreciate you when we return!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_63 = {
    Text = "\"If I hadn't been in the middle of the awakening ceremony, your ambush wouldn't have succeeded... You despicable savages!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_64 = {
    Text = "\"Golem! I saved you! If I die, you won't make it either! Hurry... snap out of it, DO SOMETHING!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_65 = {
    Text = "\"Her? You're pinning your hopes on a woman? Hahaha...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_66 = {
    Text = "The Philistines' mockery echoes in the room. The Philistine captain shakes his head, grabs Talis by the hair, and takes out a dagger."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_67 = {
    Text = "He turns to Miryam. A statuette dangles at his waist. She suddenly widens her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_68 = {
    Text = "\"Where did you get that statuette?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_69 = {
    Text = "\"Yo... So you can talk, huh? I thought you were a half-wit.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_7 = {
    Text = "This is a dreamless slumber. Miryam doesn't know how long she has slept—perhaps a day? Or a week?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_70 = {
    Text = "\"Statuette, where did it come from?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_71 = {
    Text = "The captain puts down his knife and looks down at the statuette on his belt."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_72 = {
    Text = "It is made of some ancient, dull stone material, depicting a figure seated on a throne. Strange tentacles sprawl outward, veiling the figure's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_73 = {
    Text = "\"Heh... This? Goliath found it. Gave it to me for my bravery.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_74 = {
    Text = "\"I risked my life for him, and this is the reward he gave me. Some useless junk left behind by whatever stupid civilization made it.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_75 = {Text = "\"...Oh?\""},
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_76 = {
    Text = "The captain is still speaking when he suddenly notices the woman in front of him standing up."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_77 = {
    Text = "He looks her over with interest—her strange attire, those bizarre yet expensive accessories."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_78 = {
    Text = "\"What did you just say about this statuette?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_79 = {
    Text = "\"I said it's useless garbage. Just like you. What's wrong? Are your ears as bad as your mouth?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Gradually, her consciousness becomes clearer, integrating with her body. Vaguely, she sees a group of people reaching out to her from the surface of the sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_80 = {
    Text = "\"Captain, stop wasting time with her. Just slit her throat... Ah!!!!...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_81 = {
    Text = "The black mist appears almost in an instant."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_82 = {
    Text = "It condenses into several enormous serpents, lunging hungrily at the Philistine warrior."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_83 = {
    Text = "His knife falls from Miryam's neck. The hand holding it is bitten off by a black snake, blood splattering and soaking Miryam's clothes."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_84 = {
    Text = "The black snakes surge toward the Philistine, devouring him before he could let out more screams."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Only a few remains and a pool of blood are left on the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_86 = {
    Text = "\"This... this is...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Everyone in the room is stunned by the sudden horror, starting to doubt their own eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Miryam looks down at her hands. A gradually brightening smile appears on her face."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_89 = {
    Text = [[
She turns towards the Philistine captain, ...but she's not looking at him.
She is staring at the statuette at his waist. Tears fill her eyes.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Father, Mother, Sister, Elder Priest, King, Deborah... They're all reaching out their hands, inviting her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_90 = {
    Text = "\"My Lord, I see you again... It turns out everything you said was true...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_91 = {
    Text = "\"I've truly been reborn! I now possess power far greater than before!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_92 = {
    Text = "\"My Lord... I apologize for my doubts... You never lied to me...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_93 = {Text = "\"AHHH!!!\""},
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_94 = {
    Text = "The fearsome witch is immersed in complex emotions. Years of burning, pillaging, and slaughter have given the Philistine an almost animal instinct for danger. He knows this is his only chance."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_95 = {
    Text = "He roars, holding a knife, and charges at Miryam with all his speed."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_96 = {Text = "Hiss—"},
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_97 = {
    Text = "The black snake materializes from thin air in a way he can't comprehend, piercing through his body."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_98 = {
    Text = "Inside and outside, some Philistines rush forward with weapons, some flee in all directions, and some kneel to beg for mercy."
  },
  AvgDialog_47170_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Miryam didn't care about their brave or despicable choices. The black serpent appears and vanishes, toying with, biting, and hunting these lowly lives."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The Virtue of Lies"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Noticing Deborah's expression, the believers nod in understanding."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Words from my teacher... those were all lies, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_101 = {
    Text = "All calamities have been dismissed in recent years... Lemuria is closer and closer to the Divine Realm... Just one step away, we're just one step away..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_102 = {
    Text = "Surely You will bring the Divine Realm, my Lord! I am your faithful servant, and I will always..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_103 = {
    Text = "I've searched for so long... But God's presence is nowhere to be found in dreams."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_104 = {
    Text = "Tulu shifts his gaze from Miryam's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_105 = {
    Text = "Our civilization will perish—destined, inevitable... This is God's last message."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_106 = {
    Text = "Fine weather and calm seas are merely the last dawn of Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_107 = {
    Text = "Facing this catastrophe is the punishment adjudicated on the King and his High Priestess."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_108 = {
    Text = "So... so you mean that... the Lemurians, along with all their prayers and hopes and offerings, were a deception..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_109 = {
    Text = "Everyone, from birth to death, lives under this deception, right, my Lord?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_11 = {
    Text = "They kneel before Miryam in silence. Reverence and expectation glitter in their eyes, which all fix on the High Priestess."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_110 = {
    Text = "Your teacher has already told you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_111 = {
    Text = "I want the words from You, my Lord..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_112 = {
    Text = "Please, tell me with Your own voice that our prayers are meaningless. Please confirm it as a prophecy, that those pioneers who sacrificed everything—intellect, emotions, dignity, who huddled in this pool, are waiting for nothing but a distant lie..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_113 = {
    Text = "Please, tell me with Your own voice... that the Divine Realm... will never arrive..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_114 = {
    Text = "No bursting cries, no insane hysteria. She looks into Tulu's eyes and utters all her questions. Amid her words, there is silence unraveling. Amid silence, there is a collapse unspoken."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_115 = {
    Text = "She stares unblinkingly, like the fish-people around her—no thoughts, no emotions."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_116 = {
    Text = "Like fireworks fading into their extinguish, yearning, burning, longing for the distant dawn with her last spark."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_117 = {
    Text = "Tulu closes his eyes and takes a deep breath. In that moment, those gazes reminded him of many pasts."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_118 = {
    Text = "Perhaps he recalls those mortals who have lived in deception for generations."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_119 = {
    Text = "Perhaps he recalls the believers who sacrificed their intellect, emotions, and dignity, and those who devoted their souls only to have them distorted."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Faithful followers of our Lord, may He always bless you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_120 = {
    Text = "Perhaps, he just recalls that before this deception of eternal slumber, he, like every Lemurian, once believed he could bring a new dawn to this land."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_121 = {
    Text = "Offering hope to his people is the natural duty of a sovereign, the sole meaning of this deception. So be it. Let it continue."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_122 = {
    Text = "Tulu opens his eyes and steps before Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_123 = {
    Text = "I haven't spotted the God for a long time... but I know He is still there, deep in the dreams."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_124 = {
    Text = "The Divine Realm still awaits."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_125 = {
    Text = "Miryam jerks her head up."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_126 = {
    Text = "But... but my teacher said..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_127 = {
    Text = "The Divine Realm will not arrive until the downfall of Lemuria. All will perish in this catastrophe."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_128 = {
    Text = "My Lord, what do you mean..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_129 = {
    Text = "... But the stars once foretold me that Lemuria would be reborn."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Onyx serpents dance behind her hem. Her hand gently touches their foreheads one by one."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_130 = {
    Text = "His eyes evade Miryam. Turning back, he steps towards the throne."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_131 = {
    Text = "When the stars are right, Lemuria will end its hibernation and rise again unto the world."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_132 = {
    Text = "It is not I who will reawaken Lemuria. It is you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_133 = {Text = "?!!"},
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_134 = {
    Text = "Miryam, High Priestess of Lemuria. You will be reborn. You will bring me back, and bring Lemuria back."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_135 = {
    Text = "When that time comes, I shall raise the Divine Realm, securing Lemuria's eternity under My sovereign reign."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_136 = {
    Text = "Tulu sits back on his throne. He props up his chin, leaning tiredly"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_137 = {
    Text = "He avoids looking at the expression on Miryam, which mixes astonishment with struggle. He knows that Miryam doesn't fully believe in his words. No one can truly believe them."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_138 = {
    Text = "Which is crueler, lies or truth? He has pondered for a long time, but still couldn't find an answer."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_139 = {
    Text = "If he has made wrong choices, then let that be the end of it."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Praise unto our Lord... Praise the High Priestess!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_140 = {
    Text = "But... my Lord, what... what should I do?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_141 = {
    Text = "Wait. Walk with Lemuria to its end, until your time comes."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_142 = {
    Text = "When will Lemuria...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_143 = {
    Text = "Three days. In three days, Lemuria will meet its end."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_144 = {
    Text = "What's your plan... my Lord?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_145 = {
    Text = "A grand ritual, a lavish ceremony... let them chant prayers, calling my name. I will send all Lemurians into dreamless slumber."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_146 = {
    Text = "I will weave the most gorgeous dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_147 = {
    Text = "The former high priest said he refused to fall asleep. He wishes to witness the sinking of Lemuria with his own eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_148 = {
    Text = "How about you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_149 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Urged by her entourage, the followers bearing the blessing from the High Priestess leave with overwhelming joy."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_150 = {
    Text = "...I am willing to face the end in full lucidity, my Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_151 = {
    Text = "Miryam leaves. Tulu slumps on the throne, staring at the empty room, the squirming fish-people, and Miryam's figure, shrouded in hesitation."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_152 = {
    Text = "The conversation between the Lord and the High Priestess of Lemuria comes to an end. In the countless days and nights of the millennia to come, this will be their sole meeting."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Watching them walk away, Deborah lets out a contented sigh."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Since you became the High Priestess, Lemuria has not suffered from calamity for a long time."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You've managed our land well. Look at these believers! They truly revere you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I am merely the Lord's messenger. Lemurians should revere only the Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Several years later."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Before our Lord's ascension, I had never seen such a Lemuria. Never had I imagined that such a Lemuria could truly exist..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Miryam and Deborah stand together on the rocks by the sea. Vibrant fields and splendid cities, and the ancient grand temple they are so familiar with, combine into a spectacular scene before them."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_22 = {
    Text = "When she speaks, her voice is soft and calm, but her eyes gleam with a fervor far surpassing that of any believer."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Pray for our Lord, Deborah... We're getting closer to the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_24 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_25 = {
    Text = "\"In the distant sunless abyss, the great ancient soul slumbers...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_26 = {
    Text = "\"...His will weaves like a web of stars; in the eternal void, He waits for you to enter His dream...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Miryam kneels alone at the very foot of the statue. Prayers flow from her mouth with fluent clarity, like a brook gushing from the verdant hills."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_28 = {
    Text = "The brook swirls and trickles in the room, forming an opaque curtain that separates her from reality."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The eternal void of the spiritual dimension greets her soul. No discomfort anymore after these years, only breathtaking warmth remains."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_3 = {
    Text = "After a gentle drizzle, the sky is clear as an azure emerald. The sun spins its beam among golden sands, weaving warmth on several children playing by the shore."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Specks of light glitter in the darkness. Strings weave from the glow like tendrils."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Towards where the gleaming rivers converge, a huge bright outline sears out a region of everlasting, translucent ivory, like the pale moon burning in the empty sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Our Lord, our eternal master who reigns in dreams... May you forgive my intrusion upon your great territory."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Your prophecies have brought salvation upon Lemurians. Your majesty has expelled all calamities. On behalf of your people, please spare me the chance to convey our reverence for you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You are the Lord's envoy, the savior of Lemuria. We are willing to devote everything to the realization of prophecy and the arrival of the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_35 = {
    Text = "May you bestow your guidance. May you acknowledge the devotion of your most faithful believer..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Her consciousness drifts through the barrier of the spiritual realm, approaching the statue formed by luminous starlight. She reaches for those beams devoutly…"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_37 = {Text = "Boom!—"},
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Just before she touches the beams, the statue shatters. Beams collide, whirl, and scatter in all directions."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_39 = {
    Text = "A strong gust pushes Miryam backward, knocking her to the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_4 = {
    Text = "A few residents sit on the stone stairs overlooking the seaside, humming an ancient and joyful hymn."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Darkness dissipates. Miryam rises, dazed, her eyes veiled by swirling dust. Before she can steady herself, a colossal stone plummets from nowhere, tearing through the temple roof and crashing into the King's statue with a thunderous roar."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_41 = {
    Text = "No! May the Lord have mercy on us! This... this is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Stones that were once tentacles and the figure's head lie shattered on the ground. Only half a body remains on the throne. Raindrops drift through the gaping hole in the wall, soaking the once sacred ruins."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Miryam kneels before the remaining statue in panic."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Did... did I make some mistake? Please tell me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Cough... Cough..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_46 = {
    Text = "The cough of the old priest echoes in the prayer room. For a person at his age, a few years feel like decades. He stumbles across the grubby ruins, his fingertips trembling as he waves away the choking dust."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Teacher? Why do you come here alone...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Wish to take a walk alone today. Haven't gone out for a stroll for a long time."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_49 = {
    Text = "He approaches the destroyed statue and slowly bows in reverence."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The music rises upon the indigo water, blending with the cries of seagulls before reaching Miryam's ears."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Miryam meets his eyes. They remain sharp, yet filled with something she cannot understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Perplexing, intricate, ambivalent. A gaze resembles a newborn contemplating this strange world, or a traitor confronting his beloved homeland, or something between them."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Teacher... What is going on? An omen like this... Should we perform a grand sacrificial ceremony?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Miryam, bow to the Lord and listen to His decree."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_54 = {Text = "Yes!"},
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_55 = {
    Text = "She bows deeply to the statue in reverence, then lifts her eyes to her teacher, waiting with bated breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_56 = {
    Text = "\"The trace of God has dissipated in His dream. The land of Lemuria has been abandoned by its God.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_57 = {
    Text = "\"The final moment is at the threshold. The kingdom will sink into the deep sea. The civilization will meet its end.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_58 = {
    Text = "\"The Divine Realm will never arrive.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Teacher... what... what are you saying? These words... these blasphemous words..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Is that... Her Grace, the High Priestess?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_60 = {
    Text = "It is a test, right? Rest assured, teacher, I am wholly devoted to Him! I will assist Him! Together, we'll bring forth the Divine Realm to Lemuria..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_61 = {
    Text = "These words were spoken by the Lord Himself."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Before His ascension, He saw this in His dream and informed me... He searched for God's presence ever after, until at last, He saw the future clearly."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Our Lord cannot save Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_64 = {
    Text = "He turns around, his face stern, unwavering."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_65 = {
    Text = "He gazes at Miryam, observing the light slowly fade from her eyes. He watches her frozen there, her hands long accustomed to prayer now trembling, unsure where to rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Just as flustered as he was when first learning about these prophecies."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Miryam, do you know what the most important duty of Lemuria's High Priestess is?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Listening to His prophecies? Assisting Him in the arrival of the Divine Realm? Organizing believers for the ritual? No, none of these."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_69 = {
    Text = "The most important duty of the High Priestess is deception."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Your Grace!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_70 = {
    Text = "To deceive the people of Lemuria. To give them a glimmer of hope, so they may live with less suffering until the end…"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_71 = {
    Text = "We share this secret with our Lord. We are His spokespeople and accomplices. We are the sublime sinners of Lemuria…"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Which includes you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Teacher... you mean... heh, no... I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_74 = {
    Text = "An unconscious smile appears on Miryam's cheek."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_75 = {
    Text = "A joke? Or still some kind of test? It should be. It must be."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_76 = {
    Text = "It must be His suspicion, after He grew unsatisfied about my devotion..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_77 = {
    Text = "I must be more devoted. I only need to be more devoted..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Miryam forces herself to think so. Her hands clutch the base of the statue tightly, as if it were the only weed drifting on the stormy sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_79 = {
    Text = "The sharp edge of the broken statue slices her palm, and blood drips down unnoticed."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Spotting that purple robe, several Lemurian residents run over and gather around Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Beside her, the elder priest shakes his head slowly. His eyes, clouded with complex emotions, pierce through the shattered statue and the heavy stone slabs, fixing upon the distant sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_81 = {
    Text = "The stars foretold to me that the fate of Lemuria should be passed on to you. This was my duty. But now, this becomes your burden..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_82 = {
    Text = "It's not fair to you, kid. Not at all. But to the stars, fate, or gods... fairness is meaningless before such existence."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_83 = {
    Text = "I can offer you no fairness, and no more lessons."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_84 = {
    Text = "So, do whatever you want. As a victim of injustice and a sinner of Lemuria, you have the right."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Sharpness and sternness fade from the former high priest's eyes. Fatigue and emptiness overwhelm instead. Hunched and staggered, he walks out alone."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_86 = {
    Text = "The Lord has awakened. He is waiting for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_87 = {
    Text = "I guess you may want to meet Him."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_88 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_89 = {
    Text = "He gazes at the pool."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Shh! Don't let others find us!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Countless slippery heads loom out, then sink back down. Rise, and sink. Filthy ripples disturb the surface."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Prodigious eyeballs bulging on both sides, rolling blankly while protruding towards him. Their thin-lipped mouths open and close, murmuring inexplicable syllables, as if trying to ask him something."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Behind him, the slate doors slide open."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Praise unto our Lord... Praise unto the great King of Lemuria..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_94 = {
    Text = "I always hear this sarcasm when I meet you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Inside the gloomy room, only the crown of Lemuria still glitters. Its massive scale creates a distorted sense of proportion with His teenage body."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_96 = {
    Text = "However, the crown doesn't seem unmatched for the slightest bit, but fits perfectly as if it is part of Him."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_97 = {
    Text = "His slumbering eyes trace Miryam's face, eyebrows flickering like the exhalation of the sea. Tranquility masks his youthful face, concealing every boyish emotion."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_98 = {
    Text = "In my surmise, you may cry, may go insane, or may try to kill me."
  },
  AvgDialog_47171_Content_99 = {
    Text = "But you remain calm. I can't speculate whether this is a blessing or a curse."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_1 = {
    Text = "In the Rain"
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_10 = {
    Text = "\"Miryam... you really should concern yourself more than me. You can't keep going on like this, can you?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_100 = {
    Text = "\"The Lord has protected us. I am but a worthless wretch, yet He still chose to shelter me...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_101 = {
    Text = "\"You aren't like me, Miryam. You can become a priestess, you can be our pride. Your life is meaningful...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_102 = {
    Text = "\"You can help the Lord to save Lemuria, until the arrival of the Divine Realm...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_103 = {
    Text = "\"Father... Father!!!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_104 = {
    Text = "Blood nearly dries in his wound. Icy rain rilling with the crimson stream, stains Miryam's dress."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_105 = {
    Text = "Enos keeps his hunching posture, sheltering the unrelenting storms for his deceased daughter."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_106 = {
    Text = "His body leans down slowly, as if just to embrace his daughter, farewell the day's toil and enter the sweet slumber of the night."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_107 = {
    Text = "\"Father... I... I'm sorry... I failed...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_108 = {
    Text = "Regret and pain surge like endless, oppressive black fog, suffocating Miryam. She clutches her father's and sister's bodies tightly."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_109 = {
    Text = "The rain seems to ease up a bit. She looks up and notices a black umbrella shielding the sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_11 = {
    Text = "\"You're lucky it's just a practice session today without a priest watching, or you'd be in for another scolding.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_110 = {
    Text = "Miryam turns around. A row of guards stands behind her, with the elder priest in the holy robe standing in the middle."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_111 = {
    Text = "Spotting a lifeline, she kneels and crawls toward the old man."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_112 = {
    Text = "\"Your Grace! Your Grace, please save my father!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_113 = {
    Text = "\"Guards, take her away.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_114 = {
    Text = "\"I will confess my sins! But my father, he has always been the Lord's most pious believer... Please save him!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_115 = {
    Text = "\"You don't understand, Miryam.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_116 = {
    Text = "\"Lemuria doesn't care about a believer's life, nor does it care about your sins.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_117 = {
    Text = "\"Lemuria only cares about its future foretold in dreams—the future of Divine Realm.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_118 = {
    Text = "\"You might be a part of that future, but... it depends on your own choice.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_119 = {
    Text = "The elder priest looks up at the moribund sky. His sharp gaze seems to penetrate the clouds, holding a silent negotiation with something distant."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_12 = {
    Text = "\"Getting scolded is the least of my worries. If I were the priest, I might have expelled myself from the priest apprentices.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_120 = {
    Text = "\"Miryam, are you willing to devote to the Lord?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_121 = {
    Text = "\"I am willing to, Your Grace, I am willing to offer my devotion! I am His believer... I am willing to offer everything to Him!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_122 = {
    Text = "\"So, would you kill your father for the Lord?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_123 = {
    Text = "\"What... I...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_124 = {
    Text = "\"Miryam, are you willing to devote to Him?!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_125 = {
    Text = "The high priest suddenly approaches her, his eyes staring sharply like a blade."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_126 = {
    Text = "Miryam freezes. The sudden question and its tone almost stun her mind that she forgets to plead for her father."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_127 = {
    Text = "\"There is a way to keep your father alive.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_128 = {
    Text = "\"Your Grace?!!!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_129 = {
    Text = "\"Now, answer me. What is devotion?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_13 = {
    Text = "\"You know that, huh? How can you still be smiling! It's been almost half a year, and you still can't manage the fish-people conversion ritual a single time—it will be dangerous for you!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_130 = {
    Text = "\"I... don't know... Your Grace...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_131 = {
    Text = "\"Devotion, is where all your offerings deserve, where all your meaning clings. Devotion is the exclusion of any other impure thoughts.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_132 = {
    Text = "\"Only through devotion to the Lord can you save your father. While to arrive at such devotion, you must first kill your father.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_133 = {
    Text = "\"Your Grace... I don't understand...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_134 = {
    Text = "The High Priest walks slowly towards Miryam. His eyes fix on her face, scrutinizing every ripple of expression."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_135 = {
    Text = "\"The only chance for your father lies in the fish-people conversion ritual.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_136 = {
    Text = "\"Forget your father. Forget your family. Devote yourself to the Lord of Lemuria, praise Him, obey Him. Hear His guidance, perform the conversion ritual as every priest does.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_137 = {
    Text = "\"To save your father and atone for your sins, this is the only way.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_138 = {
    Text = "He stares directly into Miryam's frail crumbling figure on the ground. His hesitation melts with resolution, blurred by the pounding rain, as if he is contemplating a prophecy of destruction and rebirth, of abyss and hope."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_139 = {
    Text = "\"So, Miryam, are you ready to kill your father?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_14 = {
    Text = "\"You learn those complex herbal theories faster than anyone else. Why can't you handle this ritual just like that...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_15 = {
    Text = "\"Sorry, I... I can't bring myself to do them such cruelty... I just can't...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_16 = {
    Text = "\"You said you can't do such a thing with your incredible talent? Come on, just follow our High Priest's words, pray wholeheartedly for the Lord, and forget everything else. You can do it!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_17 = {
    Text = "\"Deborah, I really can't... Every time I see those prayers and those fish-like creatures, I can't help thinking of my family.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_18 = {
    Text = "\"The ones who have always been there to protect me are my family, not the Lord...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_19 = {
    Text = "\"Shh! What nonsense are you talking about?!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Several months later."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_20 = {
    Text = "\"My Lord, please forgive Miryam; her mind was completely frightened by the fish-people... Please forgive her, please forgive...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Deborah bows reverently towards the statue in the prayer room, then turns around and glares fiercely at Miryam."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_22 = {
    Text = "\"Watch your words! If He hears them, you'll be punished!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_23 = {
    Text = "\"Sorry... I shouldn't have said that...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_24 = {
    Text = "\"You shouldn't think like that! Ah, forget it. No hurry for those things. We'll take our time.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_25 = {
    Text = "\"Most Lemurians devote their mind to our Lord, but you seem to care more about your family. Yet, I've never heard you talk about them, right?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_26 = {
    Text = "\"You've been separated for half a year, you must miss them a lot... Mind to talk about them with me?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_27 = {
    Text = "\"Really? You don't mind? It might take a long time, and it's all just a jumble of little things...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_28 = {
    Text = "\"Okay, okay. We have time now, don't we?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_29 = {
    Text = "\"Let me think where to begin... Hmm, long time ago, I lived with my father, mother, and younger sister.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Miryam gazes at the half-human, half-fish creature on the stone altar, a ritual dagger in her hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_30 = {
    Text = "\"Then a terrible calamity occurred, took my mother from us. Our father raised us alone ever since. He is a great man, always firmly protecting our family under his shoulders.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_31 = {
    Text = "\"As for my sister, she is no doubt a cutie. Though sometimes a bit careless, she's smart and very considerate...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_32 = {
    Text = "\"Actually, now I can see some similarities between you and her. I really should consider taking in another little sister today... what do you think?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_33 = {
    Text = "\"Well, Miryam, you sure know how to take advantage of me!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Miryam rarely shares her family details with others. At first, her voice is choppy with shyness, her sentences intermittent. But soon, she becomes talkative."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_35 = {
    Text = "She lists her family memories with vivid details, pouring them into Deborah. A warm smile at the corner of her mouth, as if she is exhibiting her beloved treasures."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Amid the distant sound of thunder, they walk along the long and peaceful corridor, frolic sounds fill the gap of eloquent stories, delighted laughter rushes over the tranquil pools."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_37 = {
    Text = "...The day before coming here, he made me a full table of fish. I pretended to like it very much and ate all the fish on the plate he gave me. He looked so happy at that moment.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_38 = {
    Text = "\"Hahaha... If your father knew the truth, he would definitely be mad as a hornet!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_39 = {
    Text = "\"My sister and I made a pact to never let him find out. When I return home, no doubt I have to eat his fish dishes again...  Ugh, just thinking about it gives me a headache.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The growling of frantic wind and precipitous rain penetrate the thick stone walls of the sanctum. Distant thunder tosses vague echoes within the temple."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_40 = {
    Text = "\"Headache? You seem pretty happy, don't you. You're in pain but enjoying it~ You deserve that~\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Clang! Clang! Clang!—"
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_42 = {
    Text = "The noise of clashing weapons and hurried footsteps punches the inner hall abruptly. Its ominous echoes interrupt their conversation."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_43 = {Text = "\"Halt!\""},
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_44 = {
    Text = "\"Emergency! ... Calamity ... Southern Valley ... Casualties ... Recovery Team ... Mind the Plague ...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_45 = {
    Text = "A few words reach Miryam's ears as the guards hurry deeper into the inner sanctum. She suddenly stops."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_46 = {
    Text = "\"Southern Valley... Miryam, you just said your home is around there...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_47 = {
    Text = "\"Deborah, I have to go back!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Miryam nods quickly, her eyes anxiously peeping around."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_49 = {
    Text = "\"Are you crazy? It's a felony for a priest apprentice to leave the temple without permission!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_5 = {
    Text = "\"Follower of our lord, open your heart to our lord...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_50 = {
    Text = "\"Don't worry, Miryam... Your family will be fine...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_51 = {
    Text = "\"No, Deborah... The terrain in Southern Valley is treacherous... it happened to my mother before...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_52 = {
    Text = "\"I have a hunch... I need to go back!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_53 = {
    Text = "\"But... the convocation of all apprentices is about to begin, and I can't help you on that...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_54 = {
    Text = "\"Ah! Miryam... you...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_55 = {
    Text = "A strong drowsiness overwhelms her mind. It's the effect of some hypnotic herb used in sacrificial rituals. Priests always carry it with them."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_56 = {
    Text = "It helps devotees to seek tranquility. It also helps priest to alleviate their burden of sins."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_57 = {
    Text = "She has been the best at herbalism among all apprentices. Deborah always knows."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_58 = {
    Text = "\"I don't want to drag you into this. Just get some rest.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_59 = {
    Text = "\"I must go back... I'm sorry, Deborah.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_6 = {
    Text = "\"Sorry... urgh—\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_60 = {
    Text = "She gently places Deborah in an unnoticed corner. Before the guards return, she turns back and runs towards the outside."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_61 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_62 = {
    Text = "\"Listen to our Lord. Submit to our Lord.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Storm. Gusts. Thunder."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_64 = {
    Text = "\"For the devout, the Lord shall grace.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Houses collapse. Crowds submerged in rain—or tears. Stones fall from the mountainsides engulfing the town, as if toy bricks being pushed down."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_66 = {
    Text = "\"For the yearning, the Lord shall grant.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_67 = {
    Text = "The world is stained red in her eyes. The deceased scenery is blurred by stygian cries."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_68 = {
    Text = "After running in the rain for hours, she can't be sure whether the place she has arrived at is her hometown."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Why have all those familiar streets and buildings disappeared?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_7 = {
    Text = "She runs to the side of the sanctum, covering her mouth. Her stomach cramps so hard that she can barely stand by leaning against the wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Why are many of those familiar neighbors gone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_71 = {
    Text = "She has made all her effort to come here. But now her sanity screams for escape. However, her legs still drag her back home."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_72 = {
    Text = "—The home that engraves with her countless laughter and tears. The home that was battered by disaster after disaster, rebuilt again and again."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_73 = {
    Text = "The home buried in ruins under her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_74 = {
    Text = "\"For the suffering, the Lord shall mend.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Amid the ruins of sharp stones and splinters, kneels the man she always relies on."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_76 = {
    Text = "His back hunched, bending to a curve that mimics a tatty shelter against the flapping rain."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_77 = {
    Text = "But calamity hasn't spared a single scrap for that shelter. No matter how hard he tried, the ruthless rain still soaks through his tiny torso, dripping onto the lifeless body of the little girl in his arms."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_78 = {
    Text = "He can only touch her face with his rough hands over and over again, wiping the rainwater from her skin, feeling the loss of temperature and color under his trembling fingers."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_79 = {
    Text = "\"Sa... Sarah... no...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_8 = {
    Text = "\"Miryam, are you okay?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Miryam's throat clogs, her voice nearly a murmur. She moves forward, stumbles, kneels, crawls. Her hands tremble with disbelief as they touch her sister's body."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_81 = {
    Text = "\"She was asleep when it happened. You know, Sarah used to sleep soundly. Nothing can wake her up.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_82 = {
    Text = "\"She has gone in peace... no fear, no pain, no lingering... nothing left to me.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_83 = {
    Text = "\"I told myself so when your mother passed away.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_84 = {
    Text = "\"I could do nothing except tell myself so, Miryam... I couldn't protect them. I couldn't...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_85 = {
    Text = "The man thinks his tears have long since dried up, but as soon as he murmurs a few words, they mix with the rain once again. His pale lips quiver, perhaps trembling from cold and exhaustion, perhaps twitching from grief."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_86 = {
    Text = "A series of painful coughs burst out. Not until then does Miryam notice that Enos' flesh on one leg and abdomen has parted like crepe paper. The last of his blood is oozing out."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_87 = {
    Text = "\"Father! Are... are you injured?...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_88 = {
    Text = "She fumbles out a bunch of herbals. With her mind a blur of confusion, she applies them all to her father's wounds. Her gaze plunders the surrounding ruins savagely, hoping for anything useful."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_89 = {
    Text = "\"Miryam, it's meaningless.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_9 = {
    Text = "\"I'm fine... Sorry, Deborah, I've kept you waiting...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_90 = {
    Text = "\"I can save you... I can save you, Father!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_91 = {
    Text = "\"I've done everything I could, Miryam. But it was meaningless... They were still gone. Your mother, your sister...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_92 = {
    Text = "\"Someone like me is meaningless in Lemuria, whatever I do...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_93 = {
    Text = "He struggles to lift his head, gazing at the collapsed mountains, the ruins all around, and the cold, distant sky which remains indifferent after bringing such disaster upon the island."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Following his gaze, Miryam looks at the mountains on either side."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_95 = {
    Text = "\"Father, that's...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Huge rocks break apart from the mountain, completely engulf the entire town in a second."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Several enormous tentacles stretch from the ground, blocking out most of the devastating rocks."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_98 = {
    Text = "Enos lowers his head. His dimming eyes gaze upon his daughter, his sole remaining hope and pride."
  },
  AvgDialog_47172_Content_99 = {
    Text = "\"It's the Lord's manifestation...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_1 = {
    Text = "His Offering"
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I remember, Father... I always remember."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_100 = {
    Text = "If you cannot gain access to His dream, it will result in a painful death."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_101 = {
    Text = "Otherwise, put on these clothes. I will guide you to become a true priestess of Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_102 = {
    Text = "The elder priest lets out a deep sigh, leaving the prayer room. His back hunches low, as if he has accomplished a daunting task, or his soul is suffering from a heinous crime he just committed."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_103 = {
    Text = "Miryam walks to the statue mechanically and picks up the wine glass."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_104 = {
    Text = "You killed our father."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_105 = {
    Text = "A girl sits beside Miryam. She has a face that Miryam cannot be more familiar with, yet she feels an utter estrangement."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_106 = {
    Text = "Eighteen-year-old Miryam turns her head, watching her nine-year-old self staring at the statue before them."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_107 = {
    Text = "No, I saved our father... He has protected us countless times. Now, it's our turn to protect him."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_108 = {
    Text = "But father wouldn't want to see you like this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_109 = {
    Text = "He would. He will feel pain, will feel sorrow, but he will support me."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The cobblestone path here feels so similar to the one leading home."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_110 = {
    Text = "Only then can I truly assist in Lemuria's reformation, bringing the Divine Realm to him..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_111 = {
    Text = "Few can endure such an amount of hydra's blood. You're longing for death, aren't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_112 = {
    Text = "Miryam... do you believe in the Divine Realm?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_113 = {
    Text = "Miryam stares into the girl's eyes as if looking at a naive deity. An immeasurable amount of inconsolable sorrow lurks in her nine-year-old's eyes, flooding the eighteen-year-old Miryam's sight."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_114 = {
    Text = "...What else can I believe in?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_115 = {
    Text = "Miryam smiles at her, raises her glass, and gazes devoutly at the statue before her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_116 = {
    Text = "I will offer everything to you. Answer my yearnings, my Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_117 = {
    Text = "Her father's blood drips from her face, mixing with the hydra's blood in silent ripples."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_118 = {
    Text = "Without any hesitation, she tilts her head back and drinks the liquid in one gulp. Strong fishy smell surrounds her in the abyss of darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_12 = {
    Text = "My daughter has grown up now. When I'm tired, I finally have someone to lean on."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Her father, the man who used to stand before her like a guardian deity, the one who never ceases to protect her and support the whole family, now huddles beside her, aged and feeble."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_14 = {
    Text = "He is like an oyster that disguises itself as a solid stone to conceal its fragile heart—unmoving until its shell shatters into pieces."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_15 = {
    Text = "We've arrived. You can get out now."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The wagon halts. In the gloom of the ritual chamber, oil lamps burn low. The candelabrum rotates slowly, its surface etched with writhing tentacles and protruding eyes—all watching the people moving busily below."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_17 = {
    Text = "A solitary stone bed awaits in the center of a magic circle, surrounded by various ancient glyphs inscribed by blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Miryam helps her father lie on the stone altar."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Enos' vitality seems to be drained by those few steps alone. He coughs painfully, reaching the verge of fainting."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_2 = {
    Text = "This is what it looks like inside the temple..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_20 = {
    Text = "It's all right, Father, it's all right... You'll be fine soon..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You failed the ritual in here, in this room. Many times."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_22 = {
    Text = "I... I remember, Your Grace."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Your ritual will fail again unless you offer wholehearted devotion to the Lord's decrees and earn His approval."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You can give up. I will ensure his death is painless."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_25 = {Text = "I..."},
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_26 = {
    Text = "This is your destiny. Think it through, and then make your decision."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The guards place the tools and materials required for the ritual aside and leave the room with the High Priest."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_28 = {
    Text = "The dim candlelight shrouds the last two occupants of the room."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Miryam kneels by the stone altar, burying her head in her father's chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Sarah mentioned a few days ago that she missed her sister. She said she wanted to come here and have a look at her sister's residence."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_30 = {
    Text = "What should I do... Father..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You are crying, child... What makes our little Miryam so sad?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_32 = {
    Text = "A pair of hands gently touches Miryam's head, softly stroking her hair. As always. As on every occasion when sorrow found her. Always, and forever."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Miryam can't hold back her tears anymore. They fall onto Enos' clammy body as her body trembles with wracking sobs."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_34 = {
    Text = "She holds her father's hands tightly, as if her tight grip could keep him by her side."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Miryam, do you hear that? Your mother's calling us home for dinner. And Sarah by her side, waving at us..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_36 = {
    Text = "I see them... Father, I see them..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I told your mom that we'll have fish today. Dad knows it's your favorite."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Your mom doesn't know yet that our Miryam is now a priest apprentice. She will no doubt be surprised when we tell her later."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Soon, you'll become a priestess, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Enos gently strokes his little daughter's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_40 = {
    Text = "...Yes, Father, soon I will become a priestess..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_41 = {
    Text = "I know. Your talent is astonishing, and I've always known that."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Life has always been hard for the Lemurians. I never liked Lemuria, my child, yet I can't leave... because you are here, my home is here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_43 = {
    Text = "I am capable of many things: building houses, fishing for a living, cooking meals for you... but I can change nothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_44 = {
    Text = "But you're different, Miryam. You will be His closest follower, you will help Him fulfill the prophecy and raise Lemuria into the Divine Realm of legend..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_45 = {
    Text = "There will be endless feasts and mellow wine scented with blooming roses. Warm breeze ruffles through whispering rain, sunlight gleams towards the vast horizon. No calamities, and no one dies from them."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_46 = {
    Text = "We'll have a sturdy stone house... Enos, Paya, Miryam, Sarah, together as a family, we will live there happily forever..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Yes, Father... we will reunite in the Divine Realm! Our family will live together in the Divine Realm..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_48 = {
    Text = "She wipes away her tears and stands up slowly. Her hand reaches the dagger beside the bed."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_49 = {
    Text = "The blade of the dagger bends into a bizarre arc, engraved with intricate hieroglyphs that share a perplexing similarity with those in prayers."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Precious herbs have temporarily maintained his life. For the first time, this devout believer enters the sacred sanctum, coming so close to the Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Under the flickering candlelight, the blade reflects the crimson surface in the stone basin nearby. The sacred blood, which is homologous to the God ripples within, is veiled by a sombre and eerie sheen."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Severe delirium has caused Enos to lose most of his consciousness. He gazes at Miryam with curiosity, like a newborn seeing the world for the first time."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Miryam, you have become a priestess... Have you consulted the Lord? Has He told you when the Divine Realm will arrive in Lemuria?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Yes, I've prayed for His guidance... He foretold that it will be soon, very soon..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_54 = {
    Text = "A faint, pale smile forms amid the tangling tear stains. She approaches Enos, bends down, and touches his cheek."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_55 = {
    Text = "I won't let you down, Father."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_56 = {
    Text = "The Divine Realm is within sight, Father. Soon, our family will reunite..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_57 = {Text = "Puff—"},
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_58 = {
    Text = "The dagger thrusts deep into Enos's chest. A howl of burning agony bursts out. His blood sprays uncontrollably, staining Miryam's right cheek."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Miryam's eyes widen as she concentrates on the wounds where the dagger meets the flesh, as if observing a masterpiece."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Hatred for calamity, grief over the loss of his daughter, fear of death, and the joy of pilgrimage... Turbulent emotions tear at his frail body. He leans on Miryam's shoulder feebly."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Slicing across the skin, piercing the veins, separating the bones. Enos' howls never stop, like a moribund beast being torn apart."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Blood screams with distorting roars. Crimson spikes with surging violence. Spilling out, they pierce through Miryam's face and skin before stabbing into her viscera."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_63 = {
    Text = "\"Follower of our lord, open your heart to our lord...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Blood and tears wash over Miryam's twisted face. Chanting prayers, she moves her hands faster and faster."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_65 = {
    Text = "When the dagger stops, the sigils of happiness and hope are already engraved on Enos' body, amid his quivering flesh."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_66 = {
    Text = "\"For the devout, the Lord shall grace...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_67 = {
    Text = "<Big:\"For the yearning, the Lord shall grant...\">"
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_68 = {
    Text = "She lifts up the basin containing the sacred blood and pours it into the sigil-like wounds on Enos' body."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_69 = {
    Text = "The moment the sacred blood touches those sigils, it seems to gain vitality. Swirling on Enos' body like a serpent, a sense of excitement upon feeling the heat of its prey seems to spread out through its meandering traces."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_7 = {
    Text = "When you were a little girl, you used to go fishing with me. When you got tired, you would rest against me like this as we headed home."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_70 = {
    Text = "No need for Miryam's guidance; they follow the heat source, entering Enos' body through the wounds."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_71 = {
    Text = "As the blood flows in, Enos's growls become unbearably intense, while his wounds are healing at a visible speed."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Meanwhile, his features begin to degenerate; his eyes become enormous and protruding, his lips turn slimy, and his head grows flat and elongated."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_73 = {
    Text = "A gill-like organ appears on his neck. Slippery scales replace his hair, growing from various parts of his body."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_74 = {
    Text = "He still groans in pain, but his sounds gradually turn into screeches filled with the damp, stagnant air of salty water..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_75 = {
    Text = "I did it, Father... I didn't disappoint you, did I?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_76 = {
    Text = "The hissing sound stops. The half-fish, half-human monster stares at her blankly. Its enormous eyes are bulging palely, its intelligence dissolved."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Miryam approaches the stone altar, caressing the monster. The dense fishy smell occupies her nostrils, the skin under her hands sticky and slippery."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_78 = {
    Text = "That smell and feeling used to disgust her. But now she finds them more comforting than ever."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_79 = {
    Text = "I really love fish. When we reunite in the Divine Realm, I'll enjoy the fish you cook every day…"
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You'd fall asleep to the gentle sway of the boat. When you woke up, we'd already be home. Your mother was pregnant with your sister at the time, yet she still walked a long way to meet us on the shore."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Wait for me, Father."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_81 = {
    Text = "She leans down to the creature and kisses its cheek. Slimy, damp, unmistakably warm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_82 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_83 = {
    Text = "The slate door slides open. The guards part aside, making a way."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Steady footsteps pace slowly towards the room and stop behind Miryam's back."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_85 = {
    Text = "If you wish to convert into one of the fish-people and live with your father, I can assist you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Miryam gently shakes her head."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_87 = {
    Text = "For someone like you, to keep sanity would be far more painful than giving it up."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Indeed, Your Grace, but I am not afraid of pain..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_89 = {
    Text = "She kneels before the High Priest."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I insisted that she should rest at home, but she never listened... Do you remember, Miryam?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Please give me another chance... I will become the best priestess of Lemuria. Please allow me to prove it to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_91 = {
    Text = "I will join you in assisting our Lord and bringing the Divine Realm to Lemuria!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_92 = {
    Text = "So, would you kill your father for the Lord?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Yes, Your Grace. I will. I will offer everything for the Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_94 = {
    Text = "This is the only way to save my home and my father."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_95 = {
    Text = "The Lord is my father. The Lord is my home... He is the only truth in Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Half of Miryam's face is smeared crimson with her father's blood, like a gorgeous red mask that can never be washed."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_97 = {
    Text = "The High Priest's sharp gaze finally softened for a moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_98 = {
    Text = "He points to the nearby table. A wine glass and a set of clothes have been set on it."
  },
  AvgDialog_47173_Content_99 = {
    Text = "Drink the hydra's blood, chant the prayer, and pray to the Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Priestess' Ritual"
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Her story has spread into every corner of the land. People say that she witnessed the Lord's shadowy presence upon her first prayer as a priest apprentice."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_11 = {
    Text = "While other priests usually spend at least a week bedridden after drinking the hydra's blood, she was completely unaffected."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_12 = {
    Text = "So young, yet so close to the Lord and accomplishing so much for Lemuria. It's truly enviable."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_13 = {
    Text = "If I could trade places with her, I'd sacrifice anything..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Ah! Look, it's the High Priestess Ascendant!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Wind breezes through the chamber; candlelight flickers. A group of guards files out and lines up on both sides of the altar."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_16 = {
    Text = "In His dream on the throne, the King heard the divine revelation:"
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The storms of Lemuria will subside. The abyss of Lemuria will vanish."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The King shall shield his kind people, and bring forth the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Praise unto our Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Look, another heavy rain is coming soon... The weather is really getting worse."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Praise unto our Lord!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The voice seems to drift in from a vast distance, soft yet crystal clear."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Welcomed by the gazes of priest apprentices, a purple figure slowly emerges from the inner temple."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Her appearance obscured underneath the veil of pale violet mesh. Two tendrils of black mist coil behind her, like two serpents crawling without definite form."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Yet beneath that calm gaze lies an immense power. The tranquility radiating from behind her fluttering veil forces everyone's breathing to slow."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_25 = {
    Text = "His Grace has been unwell recently. I will teach the fish-people conversion ritual instead."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Bring here the pioneers."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Escorted by guards, a man and his daughter enter the chamber."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Dingy candlelight flickers on a damp candlestick. Everything seems exactly as it was three years ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The half-unconscious father is placed on the stone altar. His teenage daughter is struggling and crying under the control of guards."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_3 = {
    Text = "All sorts of disasters, big and small, have become much more frequent in recent years. Especially the one in Southern Valley three years ago, which took many lives..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Lady Priestess! Please, please have mercy on him..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_31 = {
    Text = "My father only stole a little... My mother died in calamity, and because my father had no money, he resorted to stealing..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I am willing to offer everything, please spare my father..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Willing to offer everything... So, would you kill your father for the Lord?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_34 = {
    Text = "...Lady Priestess?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The bewilderment on the girl's face feels familiar to Miryam. Everyone has to go through a stage like this. No one knows better than she does."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_36 = {
    Text = "She steps forward and gently touches the head of the girl."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid, devotee of our Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Come, come here."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_39 = {
    Text = "She holds the girl's hand, guiding her towards her father's cheek, touching it gently."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Indeed... But since the new Vice High Priestess Ascendant took office, there have also been many improvements. The renovation of followers' houses, extensive priest selections and ritual ceremonies have all been organized by her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Tell me, do you and your father long for the Divine Realm?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_41 = {
    Text = "We... we long for the Divine Realm..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Good. Lemurians should long for the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_43 = {
    Text = "There lies everything you desire. No calamities. No pain... The Divine Realm should be the first and only thing we long for."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_44 = {
    Text = "She places the ritual dagger in the girl's trembling hands and gently covers them with her own hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_45 = {
    Text = "You are not criminals. The love between you—family love—is sincere and truly praiseworthy. What you have done should not be deemed a crime."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_46 = {
    Text = "That's why you can come here. You are qualified to offer your own power for the arrival of the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_47 = {
    Text = "No... Lady Priestess, please do not punish us if we haven't been convicted of a crime... Please, we beg of you, please show your mercy..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Punish? No, my pious devotee of the Lord, this is not a punishment. This is the Lord's grace upon you—"
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_49 = {Text = "Puff—"},
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_5 = {
    Text = "And such a conversion ritual has never been held in public before today."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_50 = {Text = "Ah!!!"},
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Miryam's grip on the girl's hand tightens, forcing them to stab down. The blade of the ritual dagger sinks completely into the man's chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Blood splatters, covering the girl's face. The father's anguished screams and the daughter's shrill cries echo through the room."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_53 = {
    Text = "No need to worry, our devoted follower. The glory of conversion will come to you after your father's ritual is complete."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_54 = {
    Text = "You can still live with your father. I will pay the cost of a sober life for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_55 = {
    Text = "The dagger strolls across the father's body with her voice. Such a ritual has been held countless times over the years."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_56 = {
    Text = "A taste of happiness swells, wrapping her in ecstasy. The splattered blood and twisted expressions constitute the stairs leading to the Divine Realm. Lemurians should embrace it in uttermost happiness."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Show your devotion to the Lord like me. Wait patiently like me. Long for the approaching reunion in the Divine Realm like me."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_58 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_59 = {Text = "Plop—"},
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I heard she's from Southern Valley. Is that true?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_60 = {
    Text = "The ritual might seem long for the priest apprentices, but for Miryam, it ends quickly."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Two half-human, half-fish monsters are thrown into the pool. Miryam stops by the pool, bending down. Her hand touches their slippery skin gently."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_62 = {
    Text = "The thick stench fills her lungs, the filthy pool water soaks her dress, but she doesn't care."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_63 = {
    Text = "The conversions of those fish-people are more thorough than ever. Your ritual skill grows more and more proficient, High Priestess Ascendant."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Deborah, I've told you so many times, don't call me that."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_65 = {
    Text = "She turns around and gives a warm smile to her only friend."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Time flies. I still remember your badly frightened expression upon seeing those pioneers for the first time. Now look at you, you've become quite the big shot in Lemuria~"
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_67 = {
    Text = "The elder High Priest's health is concerning. You might become our High Priestess when our new Lord ascends!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Whoever serves there makes no difference, Deborah. The teacher will lead us, and together we will devote everything to the King. Soon, the Divine Realm will arrive."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_69 = {
    Text = "The coronation date of our new Lord is approaching. Many issues are waiting for our attention. I'm heading for the prayer room now…"
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Yes! She was just a priest apprentice three years ago. But she took less than a year to become Lemuria's youngest High Priestess Ascendant..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_70 = {Text = "Miryam..."},
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_71 = {
    Text = "She points at Miryam's garments. Miryam looks down and notices she is covered in blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Ah, sorry... I forgot that I've just finished the ritual."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Miryam, are you alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Me? I'm alright... Why do you ask?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_75 = {
    Text = "I don't know either. Maybe just my intuition, that you have changed a lot since... it happened..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_76 = {
    Text = "I haven't changed. I've grown up. People need to grow up sooner or later."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Remember our wish, Deborah? You told me that we would serve as His priestesses together and transform Lemuria into the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Of course. Back then, you were just an apprentice who couldn't even chant the prayers well~"
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_79 = {
    Text = "You see, I've kept our promises. You should be happy for me, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The High Priest's health is deteriorating, and most tasks have been entrusted to her. Perhaps soon, she will become the youngest High Priestess in Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_80 = {
    Text = "I'm genuinely happy for you every day! It's just... sometimes when I look at you, you seem so tired. I'm a bit worried..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, Deborah. I'm fine. I've never felt this good before."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_82 = {
    Text = "She pats Deborah's shoulder, smiling, then walks towards her quarters."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_83 = {
    Text = "The coronation ceremony requires extensive preparation. A busy time lies ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_84 = {
    Text = "On the way back, she glimpses the new Lord's bedchamber, which she has no right to enter."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_85 = {
    Text = "All Lemurians have heard some legends about the new Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_86 = {
    Text = "As their new Lord ascends to His throne, the arrival of the Divine Realm is nearer. Bathing in hope, she casually hands the silk handkerchief to the guard after wiping away the blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_47174_Content_9 = {
    Text = "She's only in her twenties, how astonishing..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The Coronation"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_10 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Outside the Lemuria Temple."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The new King! Our Lord!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Praise unto our Lord! Praise unto the Divine Realm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The grand Temple of Lemuria stands tall, like a mountain on the vast coast."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Followers swarm, crowding the square outside the Temple, gazing at the grand shrine glowing with gloomy light."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_16 = {
    Text = "People stand on tiptoe, looking past the clamorous congregations and clusters of guards, straining to catch a glimpse of the new king inside the shrine."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Behind the shrine, the temple's massive slate doors stand open—a rare sight for the faithful. A wind carrying the deep, cold scent of the abyss blows from within, causing the translucent veils to flutter."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Miryam stands in front of the priestly ranks outside the shrine, hands tightly clasped, eyes fixed upon the back of the veil."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_19 = {
    Text = "A vague figure leans against the throne behind the veil, seemingly asleep. The unique silhouette of the King's crown sends a jolt through Miryam, her breath coming short and fast."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Thud... Thud..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_20 = {Text = "Boom—"},
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_21 = {Text = "Ah! —"},
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The sudden thunder makes the followers stop. Fear of the calamity flows through their veins, and they look up in panic."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The sky, once veiled by clouds, grows increasingly darker. Lightning flashes, thunder roars, and the ocean surges with waves symbolizing calamity and death."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Calamity... It's a calamity! The calamity is approaching!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_25 = {
    Text = "What if it strikes the temple... How could we..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_26 = {
    Text = "How could it be now... on the day of coronation..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Could it be... our new Lord..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Ominous signs make anxiety spread quickly through the believers around the temple. Discussions, conjectures, even complaints begin to grow in the crowd."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Behind the veil, a soft sigh drifts out. A small figure rises from the throne."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A great bell tolls in the temple of Lemuria. Its low, sonorous sound echoes through the whole island like a divine decree."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_30 = {
    Text = "No calamity will arrive."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Deep in our dream, I heard the divine revelation:"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Today, Lemuria welcomes its new king."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Today, all calamities bow to my authority."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_34 = {
    Text = "That youthful voice is calm, yet it rings out clearly in everyone's ears like a bell."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Is that... the new king? It's the new king's voice!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Look! Look at the sky!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Almost as soon as Tulu finishes speaking, the clouds in the sky begin to dissipate at a perceivable speed."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The ocean's roars begin to subside, and the bright sunlight shines down, illuminating the faces of all the believers."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Miracle... This is a miracle!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The sound rolls toward the coast, echoes within the valleys, wakes people throughout cities and villages."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_40 = {
    Text = "On the curtain behind the altar, a clear silhouette is cast by the sunlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_41 = {
    Text = "A young figure arrives at the edge of the curtain and gently raises an arm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_42 = {Text = "Boom..."},
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_43 = {
    Text = "With his movements, several enormous tentacles pierce the ocean, plains, and mountains, appearing before everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Faint light emanates from the tentacles. The light gradually connects and weaves into a grand painting before all the believers."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_45 = {
    Text = "This... this is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Miryam's eyes widen as she watches the transforming scenery before her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_47 = {
    Text = "The world in her eyes changes. The mountains are no longer deformed, the sea no longer stormy. Sunlight bathes the serene island, illuminating a paradisiacal country."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_48 = {Text = "Sis!"},
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_49 = {
    Text = "The voice of a child reaches Miryam's ears. She jerks her head up, seeing that familiar figure in front of her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Lemuria's new Lord... The coronation is coming!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Sa...Sarah? How could this be..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Sister, it's been such a long time. How haven't you changed at all? Look at me, I've grown taller!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Miryam... are you doing well in the temple?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_53 = {
    Text = "It's been such a long time since we parted... Mom misses you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Mother... mom... you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Miryam is stunned upon seeing these two approaching figures, while footsteps echo behind her. She slowly turns around."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Ah, my priestess has returned!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_57 = {Text = "Father..."},
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Tears blur her vision. Language fades within her hoarse throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_59 = {
    Text = "A hand gently touches her head, softly stroking her hair."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Delightful cries join in the chorus of bells, resonating through the ears of every person in this vast kingdom."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Don't be sad, Miryam. You did it... You helped the Lord usher in the Divine Realm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Now, we have nothing to fear. Our family will live happily together in the Divine Realm. Our lives and happiness will never end..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_62 = {
    Text = "I... I did it? I did it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Her sister runs to her side and hugs her. Her mother comes to her side and hugs her. Her father touches her head by her side and hugs her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Embraces melt around her, permitting the rhythm of heartbeats. Touch of skin. Exchange of warmth. A symbol of reunion, defying parting. A feast with no absences."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Her longing fulfilled, her desire satisfied, in that single embrace. Always, and forever."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Tears burst from her eyes, streaming down her cheeks. She raises her head."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_67 = {
    Text = "The embrace is gone, the illusory radiance is melting. She returns to her position at the temple. Before her, countless believers also shed tears."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_68 = {
    Text = "The splendor of the Divine Realm, the deepest desire hidden in their hearts, now unfolds before the believers in a vivid, radiant vision."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_69 = {
    Text = "I saw it... I saw it in His glory!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Millions of Lemurians flood the streets and squares, shouting and anticipating fervently."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_70 = {
    Text = "This is the Divine Realm... This is the Divine Realm, approaching as His promise!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_71 = {
    Text = "My lord... I saw it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Miryam murmurs those words repeatedly, kneeling before the new king behind the veil."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Without a single word of command, the countless believers behind her fall to their knees. A wave of profound reverence sweeps through the crowd."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Through tear-blurred eyes, the multitude gaze at the shrine fervently, their expectations mounting up towards the small silhouette on the other side of the veil."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Witness the splendor of the Divine Realm. Homage to the majesty of our Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_76 = {
    Text = "I am old now. By the Lord's order, Miryam is here to accept His gracious favour. She will ascend as the High Priestess and assist our new Lord from today."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_77 = {Text = "My Lord."},
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_78 = {
    Text = "The former High Priest steps aside and lowers his voice."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Lemuria has seen your majesty, my Lord. Please shine your glory upon its people. Please bestow hope upon them."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Perhaps the old Lord has abdicated. Perhaps he has passed away. No one knows or cares."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_80 = {
    Text = "He bows to Tulu, making an inviting gesture."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_81 = {
    Text = "The young new king falls silent for a moment, then takes a step forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_82 = {
    Text = "I am the divine envoy. The King of Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_83 = {
    Text = "My reign... will bestow the Divine Realm for Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_84 = {
    Text = "God... May God protect Lemuria!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Our Lord! Praise unto our Lord!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Praise unto our Lord!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Thousands of believers kneel on the ground. Thousands of cheers echo between mountains and resonate with waves. Thousands of praises flourish in every corner of the kingdom."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Tulu turns around wearily."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_89 = {
    Text = "I have said the words Lemuria expects."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Exhausted by their long struggle against calamities, they have learned not to mourn the past. Instead, every heart yearns for the New King's reign—a future steeped in the Divine Realm's glory."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_90 = {
    Text = "I'm exhausted. Halt your steps."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_91 = {
    Text = "He waves his hand, stopping the guards and the High Priest from following."
  },
  AvgDialog_47175_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Amidst the fanatical shouts of the followers, the young king remains silent, walking alone into the depths of the empty temple."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_1 = {Text = "Prophecy"},
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The house has nearly collapsed entirely, its debris pinning her in a cramped crevice amidst the rubble. Torrential rain pours through the gaps between stones, soaking her to the bone."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_100 = {
    Text = "\"But—but my father is a devout believer. The King cares for his people; he would never ask me to...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_101 = {
    Text = "\"You should not become a priestess. You should not have been born in Lemuria. You should be exiled, or executed.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_102 = {
    Text = "\"Miryam, his Grace didn't mean it like that...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_103 = {
    Text = "\"Your Grace! Please forgive her, Miryam is just not very good at expressing herself... we are willing to sacrifice everything for the King!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_104 = {
    Text = "\"God has guided me here. So this must be the fate foretold by the stars... Fate. Hah.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_105 = {
    Text = "The High Priest pays no attention to Enos and Miryam's words. Without another glance, he sighs deeply and walks back into the depths of the temple."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_106 = {
    Text = "Soon, a priestess runs over, her footsteps echoing in the quiet hall."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_107 = {
    Text = "She stops before Miryam, smiles at her, and hands her a badge."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_108 = {
    Text = "\"In seven days, bring this to the temple and join the training.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_109 = {
    Text = "\"Congratulations, Miryam. You are now an apprentice priestess of Lemuria.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Above her head, massive fragments of wreckage hang—propped up only by a single, crack-riddled pillar, shuddering beneath the rain's assault."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_110 = {Text = "\"!!!\""},
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_111 = {
    Text = "\"Sister was chosen! Sister was chosen!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_112 = {
    Text = "Sarah jumps around excitedly. Enos turns towards the statue over the altar, his clasped hands trembling slightly before him."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_113 = {
    Text = "\"Thank you, Your Grace, thank you!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_114 = {
    Text = "\"The Lord has heard our voice... we give our deepest gratitude unto the Lord... gratitude... \""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_115 = {
    Text = "\"Paya, did you hear that? Our daughter has become an apprentice priestess!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_116 = {
    Text = "\"If only you could see this, you would be so happy, Paya...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_117 = {
    Text = "Miryam stands in a daze, still not fully grasping what has occurred."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_118 = {
    Text = "Her sister's unrestrained cheers, her father discreetly wiping away his tears, the mix of sincere and envious congratulations from the crowd."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_119 = {
    Text = "In her palm rests a dark badge, etched with writhing tentacles and raging tempest. It lies cold and still, indifferent to the noise around it, like an aloof prophecy."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_12 = {
    Text = "\"O... O revered King...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_120 = {
    Text = "\"You love fish—when we return, I'll prepare a whole feast of your favorite dishes!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_121 = {
    Text = "\"I'll go tell everyone; I must tell them this wonderful news!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_122 = {
    Text = "\"My Miryam is going to become a priestess of Lemuria!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_123 = {
    Text = "\"I'm still just an apprentice...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_124 = {
    Text = "\"His Grace, the High Priest himself, took special notice of you—that means our Miryam's talent is truly remarkable! I'm sure everything will be fine!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_125 = {
    Text = "Miryam still does not understand what the High Priest meant, nor does she understand why she has been granted this qualification. She looks at her father and sister. She hasn't seen such joyful expressions on their faces in a long time."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_126 = {
    Text = "Miryam strokes the badge, a smile appearing on her face."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_127 = {
    Text = "Finally, she too has brought smiles to her family, just like her father. Then, let those smiles last, she thinks. Let this joy endure."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_13 = {
    Text = "\"Please... save your faithful follower...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Her eyes fixed on the precarious rubble overhead, she curls herself deeper into the corner. Her fingers knit tightly together, pressed together at her chest as she prays to her king."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Tempests. Thunder. Earthquakes. Tsunamis."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_16 = {
    Text = "In Lemuria, the people sleep alongside calamities; thus, prayer is the first thing they learn."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_17 = {
    Text = "\"You are the Divine Envoy, the faith of the people of Lemuria... I devote to you everything that I have...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_18 = {
    Text = "\"I beg of you to help me... save me...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Her father told her that their god and their king would deliver Lemuria's people. She does not know what a god is, nor what a king is. Still, she cried out again and again."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_2 = {
    Text = "\"In His dream on the throne, the King heard the divine revelation:\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_20 = {
    Text = "God has not appeared; God has never appeared before her. And yet, apart from prayer, there is nothing she can do."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The cracks in the stone pillar widen. It can no longer bear the crushing weight above."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_22 = {
    Text = "\"O Lord... please save me...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Miryam remembers when her mother's body was dug out from under the ruins—that dirty, broken body."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_24 = {
    Text = "In those last despairing moments, had she too been this cold? This terrified? This utterly forsaken?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Her tears melt helplessly into the rain. Her voice grows weaker, trembling along with her body..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_26 = {Text = "Boom—"},
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_27 = {Text = "\"Ah!!!...\""},
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_28 = {Text = "\"Miryam!\""},
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The stone pillar shatters. Just before the massive slab can plummet, a familiar figure rushes over, pulling Miryam into his embrace."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_3 = {
    Text = "\"The storms of Lemuria will subside. The abyss of Lemuria will vanish.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_30 = {
    Text = "\"F-Father!...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Miryam slowly lowers the arm she had instinctively raised to shield her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_32 = {
    Text = "\"Waaahhhh...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_33 = {
    Text = "She clings to him, tightly embracing his familiar figure."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_34 = {
    Text = "\"Don't be afraid, Miryam. Don't be afraid. I'm here.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_35 = {
    Text = "\"Agh... careful, child... Don't touch the shoulder...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_36 = {
    Text = "\"You're bleeding?!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Stones crash, gravel sprays. He stands between her and the collapsing debris—his weather-beaten, sun-darkened skin gashed by countless new wounds from rubble and tiles."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_38 = {
    Text = "His hands, already rough from a lifetime of labor, are mangled and bloody from frantically digging through the rubble."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Rain falls, washing over the man's body; his fresh blood staining the broken ground a dark crimson."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
"The King shall shield his kind people, and bring forth the Divine Realm.
Gentle waters shall moisten every inch of earth, giving life unto every blade and every tree."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_40 = {
    Text = "\"Father... I... It's all my fault you're hurt...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_41 = {
    Text = "A broad, calloused hand gently rests on her head, softly stroking her hair."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_42 = {
    Text = "\"Silly child, what are you saying? As long as you are safe, no wounds can truly hurt me.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_43 = {
    Text = "\"Thank goodness, thank goodness... I made it in time after all... \""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_44 = {
    Text = "\"Thank you, my Lord! Thank you for protecting my family...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_45 = {
    Text = "\"But it was you, Father... you are the one who protected me...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_46 = {
    Text = "\"We of Lemuria survive the calamities by the King's grace alone. Only through devout worship of the King can one protect their family. You are still young; when you are older, you will understand.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Enos smiles, patting her gently on the head. He leads Miryam to bow devoutly toward the temple."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_48 = {
    Text = [[
"Now come, recite with me.
For the lost, the Lord shall guide..."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_49 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_5 = {Text = "Boom—"},
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_50 = {
    Text = "...For the yearning, the Lord shall grant..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_51 = {Text = "\"Miryam?\""},
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_52 = {
    Text = "...For the devout, the Lord shall grace..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_53 = {
    Text = "\"Miryam? Are you asleep?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_54 = {
    Text = "\"Ah, Father! I'm sorry... I was just thinking about something from the past...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_55 = {
    Text = "\"Miryam, are you sure you want to become an apprentice priest?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_56 = {
    Text = "\"Yes, Father.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_57 = {
    Text = "\"That's good, that's good. You seemed distant, and you seldom speak of these matters—I feared you had no interest...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_58 = {
    Text = "\"When you said you wished to contend for the priesthood the other day, I was overjoyed. My daughter has grown up...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_59 = {
    Text = "\"Since we're here, let's listen carefully to what the priest has to say. The King is the person closest to God; he sees everything. Those who lack devotion cannot receive His grace.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_6 = {Text = "\"Ah!...\""},
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_60 = {
    Text = "\"Mm... I understand, Father.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_61 = {
    Text = "<Italic:But it was never the King who watched over me>, Miryam thought, swallowing the words."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_62 = {
    Text = "\"Dad, will sister be chosen?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_63 = {
    Text = "\"Of course! The city's priests all said that your sister's spiritual talent is even greater than theirs!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_64 = {
    Text = "\"Not only can she become a priestess; she might even become the High Priestess in the future!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_65 = {
    Text = "\"A grand honor like that... If that were to happen, your mother in the other world would surely be happy for you as well...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_66 = {
    Text = "\"Ah! The priestess is coming over!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Amidst Sarah's excited shouts, everyone looks forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_68 = {
    Text = "The priestess, wearing a purple veil, moves slowly through the congregation while reciting prayers. She passes the young candidates in front, then stops before Miryam and her family."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_69 = {
    Text = "\"O Lord, please hear my devout plea. Please accept my daughter, Miryam...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Thunder cracks violently above the island. Beneath the rubble, a small form shivers."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Her father's whispered prayer, together with the solemn majesty of the priestess, kept Miryam from speaking further."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_71 = {
    Text = "She lowers her head and waits. The priestess raises her hand and places it on Miryam's forehead."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_72 = {
    Text = "\"Your Grace, may I ask if my child...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Her father looks up at the priestess humbly. She gives no reply; shows no expression. She has seen too many such stories before—the lowing of beasts no longer stirs even the faintest interest within her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Those well-maintained hands do not linger for even a moment. The priestess turned away and left with her attendants, returning to the altar."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_75 = {
    Text = "\"Not chosen, then...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_76 = {
    Text = "\"Father, I'm sorry... I still haven't been able to help our family at all...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_77 = {
    Text = "\"What are you saying, you silly child? The stars have already decided our fates. Was I not also deemed unworthy?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_78 = {
    Text = "\"As long as you can live a healthy and happy life, Dad will be content. Priestess or not, you will always be my child.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_79 = {
    Text = "\"Dad, what about me?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Not far off, the ocean rages with such fury that it nearly swallows the thunder itself. Like a helpless, withered leaf adrift upon the boundless ocean, the great isle of Lemuria trembles."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_80 = {
    Text = "\"Hahaha, both of you will always be my dear daughters!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Miryam sees the disappointment in her father's eyes, yet his rough, broad hand still rests upon her head, as gentle as always."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Ever since childhood, that hand would always appear—whenever she was afraid, whenever she was lost, whenever she was sad; that same hand would always find her, stroking her head just like this, soothing her into calm."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_83 = {
    Text = "And yet, since childhood, how many burdens has the owner of that hand endured? And what had she done to help him?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Miryam lowers her head again, trying to hide her reddened eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_85 = {
    Text = "\"Hey, sis, look! There's an old grandpa walking onto the altar!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_86 = {
    Text = "\"That clothing... a purple robe!...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_87 = {
    Text = "A follower squeezes eagerly through the crowd, standing on tiptoe beside Enos for a better view."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_88 = {
    Text = "\"Is that the High Priest? The High Priest actually left the inner sanctum?! No one said anything about this...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_89 = {
    Text = "An elderly figure emerges from the chamber behind the altar. His face is aged, but his steps remain steady; his clothes are impeccably maintained, without a single wrinkle."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Though the violent quakes had ceased, a lingering dizziness still clouds her senses."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_90 = {
    Text = "The High Priest—the sole person in Lemuria granted audience with the King. Save for the King himself, who holds the ability to commune with God, the High Priest holds the highest status in all of Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_91 = {
    Text = "The old man's stern gaze sweeps across the entire hall. Despite not saying a word, the previously noisy temple immediately quiets down under his gaze."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Soon, that gaze turns towards Miryam. Following a priestess's guidance, the old man comes before her and places his wrinkled hand upon her forehead."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_93 = {
    Text = "The previously arrogant priests now stand bowed before the old man. Everything within the temple seems to still at his presence; she finds herself breathless, unable to perceive even the flow of time."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_94 = {
    Text = "\"Would you kill your father for the King?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_95 = {
    Text = "An icy-cold voice comes from the High Priest, shattering the frozen moment like a clap of thunder."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Miryam raises her head in bewilderment, seeing the stern, imposing face of the High Priest."
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_97 = {
    Text = "\"Wh... What did you just say, Your Grace...?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_98 = {
    Text = "\"Tell me—what is faith?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47176_Content_99 = {
    Text = "\"Faith is... to offer everything to the King...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_1 = {Text = "Fish"},
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Sis, fish is so delicious. Why don't you like it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Maybe it's because I ate it too much as a child. Maybe I just can't get accustomed to that fishy smell. Or maybe..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Sarah, I never told you how Mom died, did I?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Sarah shakes her head and nestles quietly in Miryam's arms, listening."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You were just a newborn, and Mom was bedridden with illness. When rocks fell from the mountain, she couldn't get away in time."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_15 = {
    Text = "That day, the wind was fierce. Fish fell from the sky, landing all over her body."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Her eyes were wide open, protruding—just like those fish..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Miryam doesn't go on, and Sarah doesn't ask further. The younger sister snuggles tightly against her older sister, and gently pats her back."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_18 = {
    Text = "But if you hate it, why not tell Dad?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_19 = {
    Text = "When I don't like something, I just say it."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_2 = {Text = "Sizzle—"},
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_20 = {
    Text = "After Mom died, Dad raised us all on his own. He's had a tough life."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_21 = {
    Text = "And fish is the cheapest food in Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_22 = {
    Text = "I'm not capable of much... I can't really help the family. The least I can do is not be a burden..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Sarah, you have to remember—when you grow up, take good care of Dad, okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Okay! But sis, you said you wanted to become a priestess. Is that the same as you saying you enjoy eating fish?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Time to eat! My little princesses, the last dish is served!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Their father's voice comes from the kitchen, interrupting Sarah's question. Miryam smiles and changes the subject."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Sarah, you can't tell anyone else about what I've said, okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_28 = {
    Text = "I know! Sarah won't cause trouble for sis or dad either~"
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Miryam smiles and pats her little sister's head, leading her toward the kitchen to welcome the feast their father has prepared."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Fresh fish hits the pan; a delightful sizzle and fragrance waft from their modest kitchen."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Soon, various fish dishes cover their small table."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_31 = {
    Text = "While you two were out shopping, I told the folks in town. I even wrote letters to those relatives who live far away—in a few days, they'll know too."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_32 = {
    Text = "All the aunts and uncles who've watched you grow up are happy for you. They sent over so much food and drink."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_33 = {
    Text = "As for the priestess in our town, she came to talk to me after she heard that you were chosen by the High Priest. She was so polite!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_34 = {
    Text = "It's not a big deal... there's no need to tell so many people..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_35 = {
    Text = "It IS a big deal! If sis becomes a priestess, she'll earn lots and lots of money, and she can even hire someone to help me sweep the floor..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Don't say such things, Sarah. The priesthood is a sacred calling. One doesn't take it up for such reasons."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Then what does a priest do?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The duty of a priest... now that goes back a very long time. It's a story every Lemurian ought to know."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Enos picks up Sarah in his arms, places her on his lap, and softly strokes her head."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_4 = {
    Text = "These are his daughters' favorite dishes. Enos has been preparing them for over a decade—he can measure every spice perfectly even with his eyes closed."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Our country, Lemuria, boasts a glorious history and radiant civilization. In those days, the power of God protected this land, granting us everlasting happiness and peace."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_41 = {
    Text = "There were no calamities, no disease. Everyone had endless food and fine wine. Even the departed, aided by God, could reunite with the living."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_42 = {
    Text = "But at some point, our people could no longer hear the voice of God. Calamities began to strike with increasing frequency..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Our country is surrounded by boundless seas—no one has ever been able to leave. Only God can change this."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_44 = {
    Text = "And our King is the only one who can communicate with God. The King hears God's oracles, and will once more bring us His blessings."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_45 = {
    Text = "When that time comes, all calamities will cease, the departed will return to life, and we will live on this land in eternal peace... Lemuria will once again become the perfect Divine Realm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_46 = {
    Text = "His throat bobs in excitement as he retracts his hopeful gaze from the direction of the temple."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_47 = {
    Text = "However, his power is not limitless. He requires help from his people. Thus those with strong spiritual power are selected as priests, in order to convey his will and assisting him."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Mundane mortals like me have no talent for such great things... I can only watch helplessly as your mother..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Forget it, forget it. Today is a good day; let's celebrate and don't talk about that."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_5 = {Text = "Ugh—"},
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_50 = {
    Text = "He wipes the wetness from the corners of his eyes. Then, his expression melts into a deliberately warm grin as he pats both his daughters on the head."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Become a priestess, aid our Lord, bring Lemuria salvation. The greatest honor for us all."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Thank the Lord for granting our ordinary family such an opportunity..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Enos raises his cup. The turbid liquid swirls inside. Miryam can smell the sharp, pungent odor of cheap alcohol cutting through the dusty air."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_54 = {
    Text = "This is the drink favored by the poor in Lemuria. Cheap and strong. Brief solace at a low cost."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_55 = {
    Text = "The impurities in alcohol cause severe headaches the next day. But hangovers and spasms of pain are gifts for the impoverished, almost a kind of blessing."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_56 = {
    Text = "He drinks it all in one gulp."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Sarah, your father is incompetent, but your sister is the pride of our whole family!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Here, Miryam, this is your favorite fried fish fillet. Old Ona just caught it today! After telling him your good news, I asked him to set some aside for us."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Dad doesn't want to put too much stress on you. Just follow your heart. I know you can make it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Sis, is your stomach acting up again? You always feel queasy at the smell of fish..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Dad only hopes that you can take good care of yourself in the future. If anything upsets you, write to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Tomorrow, you'll be leaving home. Who knows when you'll get to taste Dad's fish again..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_62 = {
    Text = "A plate heaped with fish is placed before Miryam. The fillets are coated in a crisp, golden crust. A rich, hot aroma fills the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Her sister is smiling. Her father is smiling too, though tears well up in his eyes again. In Miryam's sight blurred by the rising steam, her mother's silhouette seems to be sitting nearby too, smiling softly."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Her clothes are ragged, her body a broken mess. Her eyes bulge wide open, bearing a haunting similarity to the eyes of the fish on her plate."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_65 = {
    Text = "I will become a priestess... I won't let you down, father."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Miryam slices a fish, takes a bite. Its flavour bursts in her mouth, forcing a smile onto her lips. Part response, part participation."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Outside the kitchen, the younger sister pats Miryam's back while shaking her head and sighing."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Miryam can't help but smile at the grandmotherly look on her ten-year-old face."
  },
  AvgDialog_47177_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I'm fine, Sarah."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Praying in the Sea"
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_10 = {Text = "Swish—"},
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_100 = {
    Text = "But neither the devotees in the sanctum nor those tremendous slate doors elude his gaze. He seems to look upon all of Lemuria, scanning its people, contemplating its civilization."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_101 = {
    Text = "The distant emotion etched in those eyes is beyond her understanding. Perhaps it's belief. Perhaps it's compassion. Perhaps it's only weariness."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_11 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Mmmrrrr!!!...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_12 = {
    Text = "A drenched creature leaps out of the water, sparse human hair hanging down from its head and covering its fish-like face."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The gills on its neck slightly open; its thin, slimy lips quiver as it emits incomprehensible, turbid syllables."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Its once-human limbs, now cluttered with scales, flail wildly on the surface, reflecting the sanctum's light with a greasy, unclean gleam."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Slap slap slap slap..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Following it, countless fish-faced creatures with identical attributes emerge from the pools, their limbs slapping the water frantically as strange noises escape between their shark-like teeth."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_17 = {
    Text = "In an instant, they crowd the pool, their slippery shiny skin rubbing against each other. Those enormous bulging eyes stare wide open at Miryam, unblinking and devoid of emotion."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_18 = {Text = "Ugh—"},
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Miryam musters all her strength to keep herself from throwing up."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A low hum, like a call from ancient times, breaks the solemn silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_20 = {
    Text = "These are..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Oh, they are the great pioneers! It's my first chance to see them face to face. So this is what they look like!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The priestess apprentice called Deborah stands beside Miryam, patting her arms excitedly—even though it's their first meeting."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Legend says our Lord received a divine revelation: before Lemuria transforms into the Divine Realm, he shall use the holy blood to transform his people, granting them the ability to withstand calamities."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_24 = {
    Text = "These pioneers bravely took this step forward for the future of Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Once we become priestesses, we'll be the ones to perform the ritual of transformation. I'll be so excited I won't be able to sleep!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Deborah greets those fish-people joyfully, gently stroking their glossy faces."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The other apprentices also bow, paying their respects to the pioneers. Miryam stands still, watching."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_28 = {
    Text = "\"The great pioneers\"... I wonder if their families would think the same, seeing them like this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The prayer room is just ahead. Everyone, follow me."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Two tremendous slate doors with intricate carvings slide open. Pure and formless darkness awaits within, devouring light from the outside."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_30 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_31 = {
    Text = "The slate doors close silently, shutting out the screams of the fish-people and the clamour outside."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Apprentices kneel at their prayer seats, gazing toward the altar and the grand statue behind it. The latter is a breathtaking artifact composed of a human, a throne, and tentacles."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Its face is somewhat indistinguishable; the humanoid body, seated between a massive throne and myriad tentacles, creates a stark contrast."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_34 = {
    Text = "This is a statue representing the Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The elder priest walks out from the right side of the statue room. With a wave of his hand, he prevents the apprentices from rising to salute."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The prayers lie before you. Read them. Chant them. And the most crucial part, believe in them."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Your Grace, if we accomplish these tasks, will we be able to assist our Lord?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The High Priest spares her a brief glance."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_39 = {
    Text = "The Lord will tell you. Now, pray."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_4 = {
    Text = "It seems to issue an invitation to anyone who meets its gaze."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_40 = {
    Text = "He leaves the room, leaving behind only one priest and some guards with the apprentices."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_41 = {
    Text = "The light in the prayer room dims. A mysterious, faint glow starts to manifest on the surface of the statue."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Miryam picks up the prayer sheet in front of her."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_43 = {Text = "Ah..."},
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_44 = {
    Text = "The texts on the paper are written in a language different from common Lemurian. Cluttered with complex hieroglyphics, it possesses more dimensions than reality space."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Miryam wonders whether those strange glyphs come from ancient inscriptions or even from another world. However, their meaning enters her mind automatically upon her reading."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Countless scriptures flood into Miryam's brain. As their connotations unravel with overwhelming vastness, her fragile mind comes to the edge of collapse."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_47 = {
    Text = "<Shake:My head... it hurts...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_48 = {
    Text = "People around keep falling to the ground. Enduring the pain, Miryam recites the prayers from the paper."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_49 = {
    Text = "\"In the distant sunless abyss, the great ancient soul slumbers...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The outer part of the temple is open to ordinary worshippers, but only those qualified to become priests are allowed to come here."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Miryam speaks these words in ordinary Lemurian, but as she speaks, the words come alive. Letters distorting like tentacles, black inks dancing in the air, until they transform into another language."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Her voice overlaps and intertwines in that single moment. Vowels hook on consonants, endings merge with beginnings, just like those symbols. What comes out from her throat forms a complex structure within a higher dimension, as if echoing from an unimaginable space-time."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_52 = {
    Text = "\"His will weaves like a web of stars; in the eternal void, He waits for you to enter His dream.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Miryam continues chanting with all her efforts."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_54 = {
    Text = "As her words resonate and stack onto themselves relentlessly, the reality surrounding her blurs, dissolves."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_55 = {
    Text = "She finds herself submerged in a deep sea. Lithe water flows in every direction, resembling an illusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_56 = {
    Text = "It glimmers with silvery light. Luminous stars scatter everywhere, drifting, flickering."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Miryam feels that she has somewhat joined the constellation. Her moth-light is being lured to a certain place. She looks towards that place."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Countless streams of light swirl with luminous foam, chasing one another towards a distant blurred silhouette. A silhouette composed of a human body, a throne, and innumerable tentacles."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Is that... the Lord?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Welcome to the inner sanctum, followers. Welcome to our Lord's house."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_60 = {Text = "Snap—"},
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_61 = {
    Text = "The silhouette jerks awake, seemingly disturbed by some voice. The entire illusionary space dims for a moment as he opens his eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_62 = {
    Text = "A vague shape of an elder man appears behind him."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_63 = {
    Text = "You have heard her voice, my Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_64 = {
    Text = "The Lord of Lemuria still reigns upon the throne, and I am but a successor. You should not address me like this."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_65 = {
    Text = "The Lord of Lemuria is not defined by who sits upon the throne. We worship the one closest to the God as our Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_66 = {
    Text = "I don't like this title."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_67 = {
    Text = "The old Lord of Lemuria has only heard a single sentence of prophecy in his life. That sentence assures his place on the throne, legitimates the worship from his people."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_68 = {
    Text = "The prophecies you have received far outnumber those granted to all the kings of Lemuria before you. And you... are still a child."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_69 = {
    Text = "You are the hope of Lemuria. The old Lord's days are numbered, and he has already made his will clear. Soon, the throne will be yours. You need to accustom yourself to this title, my Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_7 = {
    Text = "A gust of wind greets them from the obscure sanctum, carrying the thick, briny scent of the deep sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_70 = {
    Text = "The young boy leans back in his chair wearily, no longer arguing with the old man."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_71 = {
    Text = "To connect with me and glimpse my presence upon her very first prayer... Is she the one foretold by the stars?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Yes, I've verified it. Unless stars are mistaken, she... is the future of Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_73 = {
    Text = "You don't truly think so."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Enough talent, but insufficient devotion. She cannot truly serve you, my Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_75 = {
    Text = "She doesn't believe in prayers, in you, or in the future of Lemuria. She only believes in her family."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Miryam lives in reality. Such a person cannot bear the nation's fate."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Live in reality rather than illusion... that's precisely what I hope for."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Lemuria's destiny... shouldn't be placed upon anyone's shoulders."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_79 = {
    Text = "A noble wish, my Lord. However, born in Lemuria, we each have our own duties to fulfill."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_8 = {
    Text = "As the apprentices follow the priestess into the inner sanctum, the darkness strangely recedes. Light pours down from nowhere, illuminating the seemingly endless cobblestone path."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_80 = {
    Text = "She has no choice. I have no choice. And you, my Lord... have no choice either."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_81 = {
    Text = "...Boring. I wish to rest now."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_82 = {
    Text = "He waves a hand. The elder bows to him and vanishes."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Before returning to his dreams, the boy gazes upon the millions of glows and the souls devoting them to him. An evanescent sigh dissolves into the immense void, unheard, unanswered."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_84 = {Text = "Ah!"},
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Next comes a heart-stopping sensation of falling, followed by a sharp pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_86 = {
    Text = "The pain doesn't last long. Miryam leaves that spiritual space. She opens her eyes, looking around in bewilderment."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Those unable to read or chant the prayers have been ushered out. Of those remaining, some are lying on the ground in pain, while others, eyes closed in prayer, wear blissful smiles."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Deborah sits beside her, a gentle smile spreading across her face as she slowly opens her eyes. However, her expression clouds as her eyes meet with Miryam's."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Hey, Miryam? Are you alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_9 = {
    Text = "On either side of the path lie two massive pools. Miryam approaches one of them and peeks inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_90 = {
    Text = "My head hurts... things went well just a moment ago. Why was I thrown back? Something went wrong...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_91 = {
    Text = "It seems... you have failed. His dream has shut you out."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_92 = {
    Text = "But why... I certainly saw a silhouette. How did it suddenly..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Those who serve the Lord can enter His dream through the prayers. But only the most talented priests can witness His silhouette. Guess it proves you're extraordinary!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_94 = {
    Text = "I don't know what happened to you... but this is only your first try! Maybe it's just a matter of getting used to it. It'll be fine!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Thank you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_96 = {
    Text = "No need for thanks~ Keep it up! This prayer is essential for every priest or priestess. As a bridge between our mortal souls and the Lord, it is indispensable in other prayers and the fish-people conversion ritual."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_97 = {
    Text = "In the future, we will stay in the temple and serve as His priestesses, and restore Lemuria as the Divine Realm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_98 = {
    Text = "Kindness from her friend alleviates Miryam's weakness. As she prepares to leave, she takes another glance at the statue. The silhouette she saw in the spirit dimension slowly overlaps with its outline."
  },
  AvgDialog_47178_Content_99 = {
    Text = "A vague figure reclines on the throne, his face obscured by tentacles of great power."
  },
  AvgDialog_47232_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Restricted area ahead. No unauthorized personnel allowed. Please present your identification."
  },
  AvgDialog_47232_Content_10 = {
    Text = "May the Silver Key guide us."
  },
  AvgDialog_47232_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Mythag University Investigator William Delapore, Silver Key ID I-2083."
  },
  AvgDialog_47232_Content_3 = {
    Text = "%player%, K-0617."
  },
  AvgDialog_47232_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Ramona, I-3017."
  },
  AvgDialog_47232_Content_5 = {
    Text = "He looks as if he's watching someone march toward their death..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47232_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The spirit dimension in the Regional D-Effect Zone is chaotically unstable. We often need to <Yellow:face multiple spirit battles simultaneously>, and the mental DMG far exceeds the physical."
  },
  AvgDialog_47232_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Many Investigators have gone insane trying to suppress the Regional D-Effect Zone. Balance resources across battlefields to avoid the worst outcome."
  },
  AvgDialog_47232_Content_8 = {
    Text = "In the rearview mirror, the guard on duty tips his hat to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47232_Content_9 = {
    Text = "May the Silver Key light your path."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Are we really allowed to sneak in here? This is Lady Sylvia's office..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Would you like to try one?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Murphy picks up a piece of milk chocolate. She is silent, head down. The counseling room falls into a terrifying silence, sending a chill down your spine."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Uhh... D-do you not like chocolate? Are you allergic to cocoa beans?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Let's head to the school café and find something else! The chef is off, but we can try making something ourselves—hmm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Before you can react, a piece of milk chocolate is shoved into your mouth."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_15 = {
    Text = "As she pulls away, the cold pads of her fingers brush your tongue. A rich cocoa flavor explodes in your mouth, sliding down your throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I never said I don't want chocolate!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Murphy says, picking the darkest, most sugar-free chocolate from the box."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Ew...! It's so sour! Sour and bitter..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Seeing her face contort, you quickly hand her another piece of milk chocolate."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_2 = {
    Text = "No worries. Miss Sylvia said I could take the sweets from the counseling room anytime."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Th-thanks..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The counseling room is equipped with a full tea set. You brew a pot of light black tea and chat casually."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Only after Murphy finishes the last piece of milk chocolate and licks her fingers with relish do you finally glance at the wall clock."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I'm going on a mission later. Since we ate sweets past midnight, remember to brush your teeth before bed."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_24 = {
    Text = "A mission? At this hour?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_25 = {
    Text = "It's because of the Remouahe mutation. The whole university is bustling. Let's go. I'll take you back to your room first."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_26 = {
    Text = "You take a step forward, and the next moment, you are unexpectedly tripped and fall to the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Ah?! S-Sorry."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Murphy hastily helps you up. You look down and see a dark red tentacle tightly gripping your leg."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_29 = {
    Text = "This is not part of her clothing, but part of her actual \"body\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_3 = {
    Text = "If that were true, we wouldn't have needed to climb through the window, would we?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Do you... really have to leave now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Due to the influence of Remouahe's Holy River, anomalies have appeared in Domains worldwide."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The second-year Investigator team patrolled all night. We agreed to take over the East District Domain patrol at 8 AM."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Abnormality..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_34 = {
    Text = "I... I feel... I feel abnormal, too..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Are you feeling unwell? Do you have a fever?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_36 = {
    Text = "As you speak, you remove your gloves and reach out to feel her forehead. Murphy suddenly steps back, avoiding your hand—yet her tentacles remain tightly wrapped around your leg."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_37 = {
    Text = "I remember the drive to the East District only takes half an hour. There's no need to leave so early."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_38 = {
    Text = "As a reward... I will accompany you on patrol during the day..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_39 = {
    Text = "I-In short... just stay with me until dawn."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_4 = {
    Text = "...It's fine. Miss Sylvia isn't at school anyway. She formed a team with other investigators and headed to Londinium to mitigate the Remouahe Incident."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_5 = {Text = "Found it."},
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_6 = {
    Text = "From the dessert cabinet in the counseling room, you pull out an exquisite gift box."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_7 = {
    Text = "This brand of chocolate..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The gold-foil wrapping is smooth and neat, cinched with an embroidered silver ribbon, proving the chocolate's high value."
  },
  AvgDialog_47798_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The bitter aroma of cocoa spills out eagerly the moment the ribbon is untied."
  },
  AvgDialog_47803_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Heh... Mythag's little Keeper has actually graced my humble abode with their presence. My modest studio is honored by your arrival."
  },
  AvgDialog_47803_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Miss Sanga!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47803_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Shh, shh... be still and let me look."
  },
  AvgDialog_47803_Content_12 = {
    Text = "She stops twirling the knife and instead presses the tip against your cheek, rubbing it back and forth across your skin."
  },
  AvgDialog_47803_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Did you know? Every artist has a unique muse."
  },
  AvgDialog_47803_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Catullus had his Lesbia, Petrarch had his beloved Laura..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47803_Content_15 = {
    Text = "There is no trace of ferocity or violence in those unfathomable eyes; instead, they are filled with an emotion you find impossible to name."
  },
  AvgDialog_47803_Content_16 = {
    Text = "And now, my very own <Blue:Camille> is right here in front of me. Don't you agree, {Male=Mr,Female=Miss} Keeper?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47803_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You push aside the sculpting materials piled by the door, squeezing with difficulty into Sanga's studio in the West Wing."
  },
  AvgDialog_47803_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The sculptor sits atop her coral base, her carving knife dancing between her fingers. The sight is nerve-wracking—the blade is sharp enough to sever a finger with the slightest slip."
  },
  AvgDialog_47803_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Didn't you tell the investigators on duty that you wanted to see me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47803_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Awakeners enjoy absolute freedom within the school's regulations, but Sanga is the exception. Due to her past crimes at the poorhouse, she is forbidden from acting alone."
  },
  AvgDialog_47803_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Ah... quite right. You see, a total lack of inspiration has left my head feeling as if it's stuffed with coral."
  },
  AvgDialog_47803_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Please, come a little closer. Let me see your eyes once more... Let a poor soul who cannot leave this room see the world through them."
  },
  AvgDialog_47803_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Her reasoning is so grand and poetic that you find it impossible to refuse. You have no choice but to step toward her—"
  },
  AvgDialog_47803_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Sanga suddenly seizes your cloak, jerking your face down until it is inches from her own."
  },
  AvgDialog_47807_Content_1 = {
    Text = "A persistent fog shrouds the senses in slumber. The seemingly calm darkness is a facade; in truth, black waves are already surging and crashing against the ramparts of your spirit."
  },
  AvgDialog_47807_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Celeste sweeps her compass out, pinning you back against the bed."
  },
  AvgDialog_47807_Content_11 = {
    Text = "She points to the full moon hanging high outside the window, then points back at you—"
  },
  AvgDialog_47807_Content_12 = {
    Text = "...Nightmare."
  },
  AvgDialog_47807_Content_13 = {
    Text = "While I am here, nightmares will not haunt you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47807_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Your breathing gradually syncs with the soft rhythm of her smoothing the covers; every breath feels like a duet with the wind. Your consciousness begins to drift again, sinking into another dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_47807_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Another gentle, tender dream—one that sails toward a tranquil dawn."
  },
  AvgDialog_47807_Content_2 = {
    Text = "To this day, the influence of the Holy River and the Mother Tree remains coiled around you."
  },
  AvgDialog_47807_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Past memories condense into fragile bubbles within the dream. With every toss and turn, they shatter like reflections in water, vanishing at the slightest touch."
  },
  AvgDialog_47807_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Chaotic darkness drags you toward the deepest recesses of your consciousness. Just before you feel yourself plunging toward total annihilation, a faint breeze drifts into your dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_47807_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The wind seems to possess a color—impossible to ignore, yet never ostentatious. Like a frail guardian, its mere presence serves as proof that you will not lose yourself to the dark."
  },
  AvgDialog_47807_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The moment you open your eyes, you find yourself looking directly into the gaze of the \"Dream Keeper.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_47807_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Celeste... what are you doing here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47807_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The silent Awakener offers a slight nod and sits upon the edge of the bed, the mattress dipping slightly under her weight."
  },
  AvgDialog_47807_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Has something gone wrong with a mission? I'll get up right—"
  },
  AvgDialog_47808_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Faros, what are you looking at?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47808_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The light emanating from Faros flickers several times."
  },
  AvgDialog_47808_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Never. By the time I was old enough to join them, Lemuria was already besieged by calamity."
  },
  AvgDialog_47808_Content_12 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47808_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Keeper, would you stay here with me tonight?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47808_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Think of it as... listening to the stories of a madwoman. Just one night. One night is all I ask..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47808_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You spot Faros from a distance; she is far too \"brilliant\" to miss at night. In the silence of the desert sands, hers is the only light that does not belong to the stars."
  },
  AvgDialog_47808_Content_3 = {Text = "Keeper."},
  AvgDialog_47808_Content_4 = {
    Text = "With her help, you scale the dune. The desert's night wind—cold and desiccating—strikes you like the scrape of a blade across your face."
  },
  AvgDialog_47808_Content_5 = {
    Text = "As an Awakener of the Aequor Realm, Faros's garments usually carry a trace of moisture. Now, however, even her tentacles seem wilted and listless from the dryness."
  },
  AvgDialog_47808_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I am watching... this river."
  },
  AvgDialog_47808_Content_7 = {
    Text = "It reminds me of Lemuria. My homeland was once nurtured by a great river just like this."
  },
  AvgDialog_47808_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Before the catastrophes began, the youths would gather on the riverbanks every summer night... seeking lifelong companions, hoping to build new families."
  },
  AvgDialog_47808_Content_9 = {
    Text = "It sounds like it was quite lively. What about you, Faros? Did you ever attend those summer gatherings?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_1 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Now, let's get back to the topic. This operation aims to observe Miss. \"24\"'s cerebral consciousness activity, providing reference data for future treatment."
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Don't go where you shouldn't, unless you want to be trapped in someone else's head forever."
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Don't slack off, and don't fall asleep either!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_13 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Several of my companions vanished this way and it's been thousands of years and I still don't know if they're still alive or not...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_14 = {
    Text = "...I'll keep that in mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, we'll closely monitor your condition. The operation will be terminated immediately if anything goes wrong."
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Are you ready, %player%?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_17 = {
    Text = "You stare at the labyrinthine chambers before you. They expand and contract in a rhythmic pulse, their swollen sections rising and falling with each breath, evoking the vastness of an endless sea."
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_18 = {
    Text = "And you are a solitary voyager standing on the deck."
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_19 = {Text = "I'm ready."},
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You're awake now? Follow the instructions: Go straight for 100 micrometers, then turn right, then left, jump up, and enter the third ventricle..."
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Let's get started then. Miss \"24\" and us are looking forward to your results."
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Bon Voyage, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Wait, what third ventricle—<ShakeBig:UWAHH, what happened to my hands?!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You try to rub your eyes, only to find that your limbs have turned into soft synapses, gently drifting in a warm, crimson sea of flesh."
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid. Winkle has made some minor iterations to the <Yellow:Psyche Deepdive> experience. Your consciousness is now drifting in the mind of \"24\", and everything you perceive will be transmitted back to the remote terminal."
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_6 = {
    Text = "My body has turned into a cone, and there are even antennae on my head!"
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Hands off! These antennae are crucial for sensing the environment around you. On my home planet, they signify status—the longer the antennae, the higher the rank."
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I see. So did you have long antennae, Ms. Winkle?"
  },
  AvgDialog_47977_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Uh... O-Of course I did!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_1 = {Text = "!"},
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_10 = {Text = "Mmhmm!"},
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_11 = {
    Text = "After resting for a while, you notice Lily still stealing cautious glances at your chest, her face full of words she's afraid to say."
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_12 = {
    Text = "For some reason, that shimmering silver key seems to hold a strange, irresistible attraction for the child."
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_13 = {
    Text = "<Gray:It should be okay while we're at the school...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You hesitate for a moment before finally unfastening the Silver Key and tucking it into her tiny, fragile palm."
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_15 = {
    Text = "It's so cold..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Is it too chilly for you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_17 = {
    Text = "No... it's nice and cool... it feels good..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_18 = {
    Text = "A long, long time ago, when I got sick, Mommy would hold me and tell me bedtime stories..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I'll tell you one."
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Lily huddles against your chest, just like that morning when you first woke up in Daffodil's little shop."
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Once upon a time, in a tower far, far away, there lived a princess with very, very long hair..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You gently pat her back, watching as she gradually slips into a peaceful slumber."
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_22 = {Text = "Mommy..."},
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Lily lies cradled in your arms, fast asleep with soft, even breaths. You gently pull a thin blanket over her, tucking her in along with her little pustule friends."
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_24 = {
    Text = "<Gray:I'm feeling a bit sleepy too...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_25 = {
    Text = "But now, protecting her peaceful happiness comes first."
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_3 = {
    Text = "But unlike that day, her tiny frame is curled tight, and her face is flushed a deep, feverish red."
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Master... I may have a fever..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I'll take you to the infirmary."
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Lily shakes her head stubbornly. Beside her, several pustules wobble along with her movements, like a cluster of balloons bumping together in a carnival vendor's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_7 = {
    Text = "No... no boo-boo shots."
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Then... do you want to lie down and rest?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48091_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You shift to the side, making a small space for her on the bed."
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Hold on, Keeper. I have something crucial to discuss with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Doll pulls your hand directly to her waist."
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
Insufficient. I must catalyze the intensity of desire to achieve real-time localization and tracking of the invading thought.
In other words, do not cease until I register a sensation.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_12 = {
    Text = "This... feels a little inappropriate, though?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_13 = {
    Text = "There is nothing more inappropriate than permitting aberrant thought to persist in my neural network. I believe it's an interesting, novel exprerience for you, too."
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Her eyes are fixed intently on you, making you feel like a helpless rabbit cornered by a leopard."
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_15 = {
    Text = "It's just a task, it's just a task..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Convincing yourself, you press your lips to her head. The icy touch of the cranial containment unit makes your breath catch."
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Flames flicker in Doll's pupils, and you can feel her body trembling with excitation."
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Thought invasion localization complete."
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Next, we initiate the clearing procedure."
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Someone is invading my thoughts."
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_20 = {
    Text = "%player%. Do not disengage until the process is complete."
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_3 = {
    Text = "How did you find out about..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_4 = {
    Text = "We, the Alaemyces, have long abandoned physical bodies and reproductive desires. Such decayed, primitive thoughts appearing in my mind must stem from external intrusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_5 = {
    Text = "What can I do for you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Come here. Embrace me."
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_7 = {Text = "??"},
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Though feeling uneasy, you follow the instruction and hug Doll's petite body. Her soft, curled hair brushes against your nose, causing a slight, persistent itch."
  },
  AvgDialog_48092_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Can't you even perform this simple task? Move closer."
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_1 = {Text = "Kee~per~"},
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The candle in her lower abdomen burns with exceptional vigor, seemingly ready to ignite the fire in her eyes, while her slick leather whip snaps through the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_11 = {
    Text = "This is okay, right, Keeper? We are already this intimate, and I sense so much, so much—so much love from you~"
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Mmph! Pan—dia! Pthooey, calm down!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The near-frantic struggle gains you a sliver of opportunity. You hastily spit out the gag, subconsciously closing your eyes, preparing to dodge the imagined lash..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_14 = {
    Text = "But the whip merely stops gently at the tip of your nose."
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Pandia's eyes lose focus, scattering with confusion. She scratches her face, irritated and vexed."
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_16 = {
    Text = "No, no, the feeling I want isn't this~!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Do I need to whip the Keeper's face, or perhaps crush the Keeper's @3 with my foot? No, no, no, none of it is r-i-g-h-t!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The failed kidnapper is mortified and angry. The influence of the Holy River makes her agitatedly thrash the whip around."
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Why is it that when I imagine doing @2 and @2 to the Keeper, I feel absolutely none of that scorching, sweet warmth~?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Mmmph! Mmmph!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Having failed to win the struggle against the ropes, your brain completely shuts down, automatically pouring out numb, defensive jokes."
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_21 = {
    Text = "If hitting me doesn't feel right, how about I hit you instead?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Before you can swallow your tongue for saying that, Pandia's pupils suddenly dilate."
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_23 = {
    Text = "That's right! How did I not think of it? What I truly~ truly, truly desire...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Her body begins to tremble slightly from extreme excitement."
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_25 = {
    Text = "All light in the room extinguishes, save for the candle still burning fiercely within her."
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_26 = {
    Text = "In the moonlight, Pandia reverses the whip, grips the handle between her teeth, and her voice becomes thick and slurred, like frosting begging to be tasted... or some heavy, damp, chilling darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_27 = {
    Text = "With a dull thud, the ropes binding your arms fall away."
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Punish me. Whip me. Abuse me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Just like I gift it to others, bestow that sweet pain upon me~!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I'm so lonely~ So empty~ The little flame inside me keeps burning~"
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_4 = {
    Text = "It's practically burning me up completely~! Why won't you answer me~"
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_5 = {
    Text = "<Italic:(Could it possibly be because you've gagged me?!)>"
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_6 = {
    Text = "No class in Mythag's curriculum ever taught how to deal with an Awakener who is literally \"burning with passion\" in this manner."
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_7 = {
    Text = "And she is practically sitting completely on your chest, crushing you with a thigh that feels as slick as wax oil."
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_8 = {
    Text = "<Italic:(Pandia, if you don't get up, I'm going to suffocate from your weight before I suffocate from your passion.)>"
  },
  AvgDialog_48093_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You struggle to convey this complex message with your eyes, but clearly, the girl is entirely focused on anything other than improving your survival rate."
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Aigis? They say you've locked yourself in your room for three days."
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_10 = {
    Text = "It's alright, it's okay. This isn't your fault."
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You comfort her as you draw closer, your mind racing through potential solutions—"
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Don't come closer! I'll hurt you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_13 = {
    Text = "It's fine. I am the Keeper, after all. Back at the workhouse, you didn't turn me into stone. Remember?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_14 = {
    Text = "To allow the Awakeners' unstable emotions to find \"release,\" you must guide Aigis to open her eyes—"
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The young girl wavers, her eyelids fluttering open just a crack—but in the next second, a thick, sticky, amber-brown syrup begins to ooze from your exposed skin."
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Waaah!! Keeper!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Sniffle... It's all my fault... I shouldn't have opened my eyes..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_18 = {
    Text = "It's fine. See? It's just a bit of sugar. No harm done."
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Aigis blinks. Feeling a searing heat in her throat, she mumbles something under her breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You knock on her door, and an immediate crash echoes from within—the sound of something heavy, like stone, toppling and shattering into a thousand pieces."
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You're too quiet. I can't hear you."
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_21 = {Text = "Uh..."},
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_22 = {
    Text = "C-could you please find some hot chocolate for me? Just one sip and I'll be all better... That's what Miss Sarah used to tell me."
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_3 = {
    Text = "What was that? Aigis, I'm coming in."
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_4 = {
    Text = "There is no resistance as you push the door open. You glance back instinctively: the lock has been turned into thin, brittle shale, crumbling to the floor at your touch."
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_5 = {
    Text = "K-Keeper... I'm okay... Aigis is fine..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Aigis sits in the center of a room that looks like Roman ruins, her eyes squeezed shut."
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I think I have a fever... The big eye won't listen to me anymore. Whenever I open it, everything turns to stone..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_8 = {
    Text = "A fever. Another case of a mysterious fever among the Awakeners."
  },
  AvgDialog_48094_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The truth hits you: this is the fallout from the Remouahe Incident."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_1 = {
    Text = "One appendix, three cow stomachs, sixteen teeth from different species, and a large pile of broken bones..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Uvhash presents a shiny jawbone to you like a treasure. Under the moonlight, the gaps between its teeth glow with an eerie green light."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_11 = {
    Text = "How about it? Fun, right? AHAHAHA!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_12 = {
    Text = "<Shake:EEEEKKKK—!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You slap away Uvhash's hand. The jawbone falls to the ground and instantly shatters into two pieces."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_14 = {
    Text = "@3! I barely managed to buy that from that maid..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_15 = {
    Text = "A maid? Was that Karen...? How much did you spend?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I don't know her name, just some freak covered in green. Cost me about 100 Leonian Florins."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_17 = {
    Text = "She said it was a supreme treasure from the 108th Dynasty of Remouahe."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_18 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_19 = {
    Text = "You were scammed. The Remouahe Dynasty only lasted until the 30th generation, and that bone must be glued together; otherwise, it wouldn't break that easily."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You slam a bloodstained sack harshly in front of Uvhash."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_20 = {
    Text = "She dared to cheat me... Heh. Give me ten minutes; I'll kill that green freak."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Wait, Uvhash."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You pick up the fragments from the ground and gently place them in Uvhash's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Thank you for the gift. But next time, I need you to ask for my opinion before giving me anything."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Uvhash lowers his head, his towering figure blocking the moonlight behind him, resembling a docile lion."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_25 = {
    Text = "I thought you'd love it. I can clearly smell that you're my kin, especially recently—"
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Even members of the same kind won't necessarily like the exact same things. If you think that, it means we don't know each other well enough, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Uvhash frowns uneasily. This is not a familiar conversational atmosphere for him."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_28 = {
    Text = "...Oh. Okay. Then tell me one thing you like."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_29 = {
    Text = "<SmallItalic:One thing I like... Sam's Bakery on Lincoln High Street has good lemon cake. Make sure she puts extra icing and custard on it. Just don't put too much cream, or Ramona will complain...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_3 = {
    Text = "If I wasn't mistaken yesterday, you were the one who sneaked into my dorm and threw all that garbage inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_30 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Fine, I'll buy it for you. But first, I need to settle the score with that green freak who dared to mess with me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Do whatever you want, just don't kill anyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Uvhash angrily walks to the window, then he seems to suddenly remember something. He turns around with an awkward, embarassed expression."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Take care... I'll come see you tomorrow."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_35 = {
    Text = "After saying that, he leaps, and his slim figure vanishes in the moonlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_36 = {
    Text = "See you tomorrow, Uvhash."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_37 = {
    Text = "My room has a door! <Big:Please use the main entrance next time—!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Uvhash, care explaining your actions?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_5 = {Text = "...Hmph."},
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Thanks to you, no one wants to come near my dorm. I smell like rotten cabbage now."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Looks like you don't appreciate my gifts. Heh, I thought we had similar tastes..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_8 = {
    Text = "<Gray:All-Father above, what did I do to give him such an idea?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_48095_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Are you sure you won't take this jawbone? There's a surprise waiting for you tonight."
  },
  AvgDialog_48096_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Sigh... Doll went overtime again, and the next class is all the way in Building F. How am I going to make it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48096_Content_10 = {
    Text = "If I just add you in—if I factor you into everything—the Black Disaster stays far, far away. I have to stay with you, or something bad will happen. Something black and terrible..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48096_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Bright, so bright... your soul... you shine so much. It must be so safe around you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48096_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Her fragmented murmurs hiss past your ear, but you've stopped listening. Your mind is elsewhere, because—"
  },
  AvgDialog_48096_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Winkle, let go! The bell's ringing and I'm going to be late! <BigShake:Winkle!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_48096_Content_2 = {Text = "<Big:AHH!>"},
  AvgDialog_48096_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A sudden, massive force from behind sends you stumbling; you barely manage to keep your footing."
  },
  AvgDialog_48096_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Winkle? What's going on...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48096_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Sorry, sorry! I—I didn't mean it! I just... I have to be with you. I have to!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48096_Content_6 = {Text = "...Winkle?"},
  AvgDialog_48096_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I was trying to use the Formula @3 and the @1@4 Conjecture to calculate the distance between us and the Black Disaster, but I can't get it right. No matter what I do, the math is wrong..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48096_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Then I realized I was missing a variable. One single, brilliant soul—"
  },
  AvgDialog_48096_Content_9 = {
    Text = "And that's you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_1 = {Text = "—Clang."},
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_10 = {
    Text = "If you needed help, you could have just come to find me at Mythag—GAH?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_11 = {
    Text = "She seizes your throat with one hand while the slime around her morphs into sharp blades, slicing through your uniform collar. The cold edge presses against your neck, making every breath a gamble."
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Shh... quiet. These spores shouldn't be startled."
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_13 = {
    Text = "A finger presses against your lips. At her signal, you look toward the pustules pulsing behind her—"
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_14 = {
    Text = "These new ones split from my own body, but they lack self-awareness... They cannot yet serve my vengeance."
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_15 = {
    Text = "They aren't self-aware enough?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The pustules are unnaturally active. They huddle at your feet, making strange, squelching noises as they bump into one another."
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Not enough. That is why I need you."
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_18 = {Text = "Me?"},
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Helot forcefully grabs your hand, pressing it against her bare thigh. A cold, sticky sensation slides silently beneath your torn collar."
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Standing up pulls at the chains; the sound of metal clashing echoes relentlessly through the darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Hey?! Helot, what are you doing?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_21 = {
    Text = "They glide moistly over every inch of skin like water tracing a riverbed, following the contours of your muscles downward."
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Their master tightens her grip on your hand. Her crimson eyes burn with an intensity so fierce they seem on the verge of total burnout."
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I need your qualia... to grant them true \"consciousness.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You're awake. No time to waste. Let's begin."
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_4 = {
    Text = "That voice... Helot?! What are you doing? I thought we'd moved past those misunderstandings."
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Why am I tied up like this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Yes... there is no longer a conflict of interest between us."
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Helot drops to one knee before you, using the slime in her hand to corrode the chains binding your legs."
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You're free, but don't think of running. This underground tunnel was abandoned after our battle. You won't find anyone to help you here."
  },
  AvgDialog_48139_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I need a favor."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_1 = {
    Text = "It is my honor that you would grace the Church with your precious time amidst your duties. I will carry this kindness always."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
...I see.
The collapse of Remouahe's Holy Tree has subjected Awakeners across the world to intense...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Ahem... intense... uuhhh..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I see. It's the intense, abnormally heightened \"desire for proliferation\" calling to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Please forgive my lapse in decorum."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_14 = {
    Text = "...No, not at all. I... I absolve you of your sins. Is that how it's done?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_15 = {
    Text = "My oversight. I forgot you have no experience with confessions."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Salvador opens the small window of the confessional. He places both gloved hands on the sill, palms facing upward toward you."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_17 = {
    Text = "If you would... please, take my hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_18 = {
    Text = "(You reach out)"
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Even through your gloves, his unnatural warmth seeps through—like the heat of a soul ablaze, scorching your very veins with irresistible intensity."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_2 = {
    Text = "It's nothing. I'm glad to be of help."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The Silver Key at your chest grows searing hot; it strips away every polite veil until only the bare, trembling core of each of you remains."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Next, please repeat after me."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Sin is a shackle, yet upon that very shackle lies the key to absolution and salvation."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Sin is a shackle, yet upon that very shackle lies the key to absolution and salvation."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_24 = {
    Text = "His heart, consumed by the torment of virtue, has tasted its bitter fruit."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_25 = {
    Text = "His heart, consumed by the torment of virtue, has tasted its bitter fruit."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_26 = {
    Text = "A flash of insight fuses fragments in your mind into revelation. An instinct compels you to speak first before Salvador continues:"
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_27 = {
    Text = "...Merciful Father, please grant him light to walk by. Please forgive his sins."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_28 = {
    Text = "You have also heard the guidance of the All-Father..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Pale Messenger, thank you for dispelling my darkness once again."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The confessional is dim and cramped. You sit stiffly on the oak seat, but your curiosity about why you are summoned here far outweighs any discomfort."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Usually, Salvador is the one in the confessional. But the moment you arrived at the Church, he ushered you into this booth. There must be a special reason."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Please allow me to dispense with further formalities, Pale Fire, and permit me to offer my confession."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I must confess... of late, unspeakable longings have risen within me."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_7 = {
    Text = "His voice drifts like an echo from distant mountains, sinking slowly, seeping into the ancient wooden walls of the confessional. That deep, resonant timbre seems to restrain some nameless beast within, lest it trespass upon invisible, forbidden thresholds."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I have known these desires in theory, yet I've never truly felt them before, nor do I know how they could eclipse the glory of the All-Father and stain my heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_48142_Content_9 = {
    Text = "But as the healer himself sometimes requires healing, I fear even I, His Emissary, must confess to the All-Father's messenger for guidance and absolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Are you feeling any better, Liz?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_10 = {
    Text = "A slender hand extends from the stage in a graceful invitation."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Me? But I've never... Hey..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Before you could finish, her hand seizes yours and pulls you up onto the stage."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_13 = {
    Text = "...Place your hand on my waist, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I still feel reluctant to dance alone. But perhaps I can teach you those beautiful movements."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You said you'd help me deal with the Holy River's influence, remember...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The moment your hand settles at her waist, her lithe frame trembles slightly."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The pads of your fingers meet cool, slippery satin. Beneath it, the soft, firm curve of her waist rises and falls gently with every breath."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I've never tried ballet before... Is this really okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Just follow the music and move however you like."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_2 = {
    Text = "In the deserted theater, Liz shakes her head slightly. You can hear her uneven breathing, see the faint flush rising on her cheeks beneath the dim light."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Remember, the secret of ballet is the turn."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_21 = {
    Text = "From the touch of hands to the support of the waist, and through the extension of legs, the dancer leads you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Kick. Arch. Leap."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Ethereal music echoes in the empty theater, a cool beam of light tracing your silhouettes on stage."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You spin together. Liz's cheeks grow increasingly rosy, her emerald eyes glancing at you with a hint of shyness."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_25 = {
    Text = "How am I doing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Terrible. But this will be my favorite dance performance, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Shall we slow down a bit? I'm starting to feel a bit..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Her emerald eyes gently close. Cool lips press against yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Spin. And spin."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I thought the theater might calm you down and ease the influence of the Holy River."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_30 = {
    Text = "White strands of hair flow in the air; viridian flames curl around you both, burning without heat, leaping with the music. Her black-and-green costume traces swan-like arcs through the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Dizziness. That's the word you're searching for."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Liz's increasingly heavy breaths brush against your face. Instinctively, you tighten your grip around her waist; the heavy pressure makes her wince slightly. Still, you spin together."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Remember, my Keeper. The secret of ballet is the turn..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Tonight, beneath the theater's shimmering lights, a pair of dancers lose themselves in an endless pirouette."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Maybe we can do something else to distract you. Let me think..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Her emerald eyes flicker. The black hem of her dress traces a graceful arc before you as she steps nimbly onto the stage."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I thought you still hesitate about dancing..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I never said I'd dance."
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Then what—?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48238_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Let me teach you how to dance, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_1 = {
    Text = "As you turn another corner in the teaching block, the oppressive weight that has haunted you since morning intensifies, crushing the air from your lungs."
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The orb emits a faint luminescence in your hand, pulsating with a profound, rhythmic life force."
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Inside the translucent walls, branches shaped like cicada wings are folded together. They flutter irregularly, as if caught in a long, deep slumber."
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_12 = {
    Text = "What is this...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Seeing that you haven't rejected her gift, Faint lets out a long sigh of relief, a contented smile spreading across her face."
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_14 = {
    Text = "It's a newborn of my kind. Once we reach maturity, we all bear fruit like this."
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_15 = {
    Text = "For such a long, long time, I never sprouted... I really thought I'd never become a completely matured @2."
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_16 = {
    Text = "<Small:Abnormal development... more fallout from the Remouahe Incident.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_17 = {
    Text = "How are you feeling? Are there any other... unusual changes since you sprouted?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Faint shakes her head, her youthful-looking face radiant with joy."
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I feel hot... my head and my limbs feel so warm. Maybe this is what Tinct meant when she talked about becoming an adult?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You crouch against the wall for support, catching a fleeting glimpse of a familiar shadow darting past."
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_3 = {
    Text = "...Faint? Is that you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The white shadow pauses for a moment before stepping out of hiding. The white frame carrying its master drifts slowly toward you."
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_5 = {Text = "...Keeper."},
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_6 = {
    Text = "She reaches toward you as if wanting to crawl out of the \"Cradle\"—but leaving that limiter would only cause her instincts to spiral out of control."
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Realizing something is wrong, she hesitates. Pursing her lips, she twists off one of the glowing orbs from the Cradle, the one closest to her body."
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Please... accept this."
  },
  AvgDialog_48555_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You reach out. As you take the orb, your fingertips brush against her soft palm. Faint shivers instantly, curling deeper into the safety of the Cradle."
  },
  AvgDialog_48556_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Keeper, if it's convenient... could you spare a moment for me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48556_Content_10 = {
    Text = "It is no melody known to Kadath. The sound piercing your transverse temporal gyrus is as haunting as the deep cosmos, yet it shimmers with the tenderness of the morning stars."
  },
  AvgDialog_48556_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Your mind becomes a rudderless ship, drifting toward the shores of Desire under the pull of Tinct's song."
  },
  AvgDialog_48556_Content_12 = {
    Text = "A cold, moist sensation presses against your lips, and an nameless dark fire ignites in your throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_48556_Content_13 = {
    Text = "When you open your eyes again, Tinct is looking up at you, her lips appearing particularly lush and damp."
  },
  AvgDialog_48556_Content_14 = {
    Text = "An unbelievable realization sits on the tip of your tongue, but reason is quickly swept away again as the chanting returns to your lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_48556_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The song toys with your deepest, darkest cravings, blurring the boundary between reality and fantasy. You are powerless to resist, and powerless to escape."
  },
  AvgDialog_48556_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Shh... just for tonight, please stay a captive of my song..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48556_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Of course. Has something happened at school lately to upset you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48556_Content_3 = {
    Text = "No, no... it isn't that."
  },
  AvgDialog_48556_Content_4 = {
    Text = "It's just that I have a song. No matter what... I simply must sing it for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_48556_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You nod and settle back onto the lounge in the rest area—it's only a song, after all."
  },
  AvgDialog_48556_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The unease in the Awakener's eyes vanishes instantly. An unreadable smile spreads across a face so exquisite it seems otherworldly."
  },
  AvgDialog_48556_Content_7 = {
    Text = "This is a song born only of you... and it is a song I will sing only for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_48556_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The moment the music hits your ears, your consciousness is swept away, drawn deep into a blurring phantasmagoria."
  },
  AvgDialog_48556_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Tinct's voice bypasses the ramparts of reason, slipping through the cracks of the flesh to submerge the soul."
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_1 = {
    Text = "According to Erica's clues, my spare cloak was last seen outside the old Awakener's quarters..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ghost... a ghost?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Brown, let's go — what are you waiting for!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Jenkin frantically grabs your hand, trying to pull you out of the \"Witch's House\". But the unusual warmth of her palm immediately makes you sense that something is wrong."
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_13 = {
    Text = "<Small:The Influence of Remouahe...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Ignoring Jenkin's nervous expression, you stepped forward and opened the wardrobe. Various fabrics tumbled out, completely burying you underneath."
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_15 = {
    Text = "%player%?! Hey! Don't die on me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_16 = {Text = "Squeak!!!"},
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Jenkin and Brown joined forces to rescue you from beneath your missing cloak, your newly purchased shirt, your carefully stored winter blankets, and other clothes."
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_18 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_19 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_2 = {
    Text = "*Cough, cough,* it's all dust... This place seems to have been abandoned for years. Is there really anyone—?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Are you... alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Why are you stealing... why are you gathering my clothes?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Jenkin muttered something under her breath, her body poised to flee at any moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You squat down helplessly, taking a \"hostage\". Brown lets out a strange squawk, his wide eyes looking particularly innocent."
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Brown—Alright! I'll say it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Because I've entered my publicity. My sister once said that during publicity, strange thoughts might pop into my head."
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_26 = {
    Text = "It's puberty."
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_27 = {
    Text = "That's right! Puberty! For me, it manifests as a strong desire to steal your things. It's proof that I care about you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_28 = {
    Text = "You tugged her hood down, shaking your head with a smile as she exclaimed, \"Ow!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Your puberty didn't come that early. Get some rest these days, and you'll be back to normal soon."
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Two sets of footprints extend from the stairs to the room at the end. The smaller set appears to belong to a certain rodent friend."
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_30 = {
    Text = "But if you ever want to \"collect\" my things again, be sure to let me know in advance."
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_4 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You tread lightly and breathe softly, following the direction of the footprints until you push open a door deep in the hallway."
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_6 = {Text = "Squeak—!"},
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
<Shake:WOAH!>
Isn't this t-the great Keeper? What brings you here all of a sudden?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Jenkin slammed the closet shut, nearly catching Brown's tail in the chaos. The small room was instantly thrown into disarray."
  },
  AvgDialog_48596_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I should ask how you ended up here. This building has been unused for years, and I've heard that ghosts used to haunt it, so the students also call it \"Witch's House\"..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Have you calmed down now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I want to... hold you again. Just like before."
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_11 = {Text = "You nod."},
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Then, her icy torso presses against you."
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_13 = {
    Text = "During my days at the sanatorium, I never knew warmth like this. If only you could stay by my side forever..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_14 = {
    Text = "This warmth is like a different kind of poison, slowly devouring me. I often wonder... if the sea eventually pulls us apart, how lonely would that be?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You can stay here as long as you like."
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Silence lingers for a long minute until her shallow breath hitches back to a normal rhythm. Only then does she gently let you go."
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Let's go. It's time for your \"treatment.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Nymphaea takes your hand, leading you step by step into the sea's embrace. The water gently lifts her hem, cradling her as if she were a pale purple water lily slowly blooming upon the waves."
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Her hand is freezing, yet her gaze is intense enough to leave a burn."
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ah... yes. I'm sorry..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Do not worry. The sea will wash away the poison I left in your body."
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_21 = {
    Text = "As for the \"poison\" you've left in my heart... I will cherish it forever."
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Don't worry. Everyone has been affected by the flooding of the Holy River lately. A few unconventional outbursts are only to be expected."
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_4 = {
    Text = "I understand, it's just... if you get too close to me, the \"poison\" inside my body will begin to taint you."
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You look down at your palm. Where you touched Nymphaea's eerie, skeletal frame moments ago, a faint bluish-purple bruise has already begun to bloom."
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I know... I know how to cure it. Please, follow me."
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The tide roars, and a salty sea breeze catches the soft hair at Nymphaea's temples. She reaches up to steady her hat, the black silk flowers swaying with the movement."
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The toxins concentrated within this skeleton of mine will dissolve in the seawater."
  },
  AvgDialog_48597_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Since the \"antidote\" is right here before us... may I make one selfish request?"
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You recognize this place; you were once welcomed into this space by its owner during a past event."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You see the primordial essence adhering to an eerie head, piece by piece, layer by layer, twisting and outlining a face you know all too well."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Lady Daffodil..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The dimension-crossing witch reveals a cryptic smile. She lifts her head, parting her smoky violet lips away from your air-starved mouth."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I've saved you from danger once again, my sweet little guest."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Hmm... But I don't enter this Sea by accident. It was you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Shh... Listen. Listen to what the heads are saying."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_16 = {
    Text = "They crave you. Without me, darling, you'd have been devoured alive."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Well... what about you? Without your assent, these heads couldn't have pulled me here."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_18 = {
    Text = "...Of course, I want you here too."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_19 = {
    Text = "So this time, the price of our transaction... will be set by me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Lying supine on the dark, viscous water, your eyes meet the ash-white sun that hangs overhead like a dead coin. The heads around you bob and chatter, laughing, cursing one another, or mourning alone in whispers."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_3 = {
    Text = "They come in waves, knocking against your arms, nearly pitching you face-first into the water."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Here is the Sea of Primordial Essence, the Dimensional Witch's lair, Daffodil's most treasured sanctuary."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Why are you here? Is it another invitation from Daffodil? Or could this be just an absurd dream..."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Your limbs drift open, letting the Sea push you toward a nonexistent shore. Countless heads jostle in the gray waves; the sound of bones colliding is crisp, hollow, and eerie."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The primal seawater gushes through the corners of your eyes, flooding your entire body. Crushed beneath the pressing multitude of heads, you sink below the surface—and in mere moments, the sky-shrouding throng eclipses all light."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_8 = {
    Text = "—And then, the heads of chaos lean in close. Cold, wet faces graze your cheek, and lips seize yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_48598_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Cold, moist air slips into your mouth. A scent of violet exudes from all your organs, unfurling from your core outward."
  },
  AvgDialog_4870_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Tsk, this guy is such a nuisance."
  },
  AvgDialog_4870_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Casiah hasn't woken from fainting yet, so Lotan has to carry her along."
  },
  AvgDialog_4870_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Trust me with the battle!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4871_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The communicator on your chest warms slightly, and a clear female voice echoes in your mind, tinged with urgency and concern."
  },
  AvgDialog_4871_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Film and cameras are new inventions, in high demand on the market, leading to naturally high prices.
And the "film" <Yellow:processed by Mythag> is even more expensive.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4871_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Handle it? Can't the department store's film be used directly?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4871_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Silver causes film to overexpose abnormally. Only film processed by <Blue:Mythag Silver Lab> can capture the image of an Awakener."
  },
  AvgDialog_4871_Content_13 = {
    Text = "This unique prototype film in your hands can only record approximately 20 minutes of footage... So, are you finished filming?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4871_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Hmm... Probably... needs a bit more time... Everyone is... brainstorming!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4871_Content_15 = {
    Text = "True, after all, testing the camera effects is secondary — the main thing is to have fun, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4871_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Well, have a wonderful holiday, and I look forward to seeing your work."
  },
  AvgDialog_4871_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Ramona disconnected the call, leaving you ashen-faced."
  },
  AvgDialog_4871_Content_2 = {
    Text = "I sensed a fluctuation in spirit power. Did you encounter a battle? Are you injured?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4871_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Just encountered some mutants. Everyone is fine."
  },
  AvgDialog_4871_Content_4 = {
    Text = "That's good. Is everything proceeding smoothly?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4871_Content_5 = {
    Text = "It went... smoothly, I suppose."
  },
  AvgDialog_4871_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You are met with several eager faces, these young ones displaying varying degrees of fear towards the \"camera owner.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_4871_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Oh, I have something to ask you—Are camera films expensive? Aurita is curious."
  },
  AvgDialog_4871_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Aurita isn't very— mmph!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4871_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Unnoticed, Casiah climbed down from Lotan's shoulder, covered Aurita's mouth, and pulled the loud girl aside."
  },
  AvgDialog_4872_Content_1 = {
    Text = "I can smell the Exchange Shop. This way."
  },
  AvgDialog_4872_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Sniff, sniff..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4872_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Except for Brown, Aurita didn't smell anything!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4872_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The two of you are not puppies!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4873_Content_1 = {
    Text = "I know Daffodil best. She isn't the type to be interested in children's nonsense."
  },
  AvgDialog_4873_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Story. Don't you want to film your story?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4873_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
My task is to bring all of you back to school safe and sound.
Don't count on me for writing scripts or making movies.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4873_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The mutant's form vanished with the sword's swoosh. Lotan wiped the black sludge off the sword and turned her head to smile at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_4873_Content_14 = {
    Text = "This is what I'm supposed to do."
  },
  AvgDialog_4873_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Only the most intense and extreme emotions... can bring out her true smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_4873_Content_3 = {
    Text = "That's pain! She must be yearning for a story deeply buried in pain, one that leaves everyone <Red:bleeding>!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4873_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Is that really her personality beneath such a calm exterior?
Then my story... might not catch her eye.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4873_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
Don't listen to this guy's nonsense.
Daffodil may enjoy drama, but her personality isn't that malicious.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4873_Content_6 = {
    Text = "What's on your mind? Care to share?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4873_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I read that in a book. It narrates the story of a dreamer traveling with knightly aspirations in an era where knights had disappeared."
  },
  AvgDialog_4873_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I feel like I've read that book too... Lotan, what about you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4873_Content_9 = {
    Text = "What about me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4874_Content_1 = {
    Text = "This time, we can't let the magician write the story again!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4874_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Squeak Squeak Squeak!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4874_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Brown, hold on! Your turn is coming up soon!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4874_Content_12 = {
    Text = "What? You mean the enemy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4874_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Ahhh—! When did these weirdos show up?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4874_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Why not? Time, place, characters, conflict, suspense—don't my stories have all these elements? And I introduced them all at the beginning. Isn't that correct?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4874_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Rush, rush what? You spoke too fast. I didn't catch that."
  },
  AvgDialog_4874_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Oh dear, it's just so cliché! Even Aurita would find it boring."
  },
  AvgDialog_4874_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Hmm? Aurita thinks everything is fine!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4874_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You fool...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4874_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Never mind, if it were up to me, I'd definitely write \"<Blue:Londinium Midnight Knight>\"!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4874_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Squeak—Squeak Squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4874_Content_9 = {
    Text = "In the crimson hotel, under the table of the lavish restaurant, the righteous thief's hand targeted the evil tycoon's wallet..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Only special film can record Awakeners, but we just broke our only test sample..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_10 = {
    Text = "What a trick! This is magic, <Big:Magic!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Lotan, stop teasing her."
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Miss Casiah, the method you mentioned is...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Seek out Lady Nymphaea. She surely has a solution.
A woman so fond of spectacles can't ignore a <Yellow:machine that records Awakeners>.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Tsk... Do I have to deal with that woman again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Seek the help of Lady Daffodil? It's a viable solution, as long as what she wants to exchange isn't too excessive..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_16 = {
    Text = "A slight tug on your cloak catches your attention. You look down to see Lily standing on her tiptoes, pulling at it, her eyes twinkling as they meet yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Lily, do you want to visit Lady Daffodil?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Lady Narcissus... A friend of Mom's, hmm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Since Lily said so, let's go, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Miss Doll's research tests... My lord, I think we..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Ogier's face turns ashen, sharing the same pain and fear as you."
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_4 = {
    Text = "We will probably be executed."
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_5 = {
    Text = "My lord, I won't... let that... happen..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Ogier's words lacked their usual certainty, and he seemed unsure about Doll's potential anger."
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Why do both of you look so down?\nCome on—give me a smile!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_8 = {
    Text = "It's just special film. I have a way."
  },
  AvgDialog_4875_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Do you still know any tricks for fixing things?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4876_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Daughter... My daughter!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4876_Content_11 = {
    Text = "It's all my fault. I failed to protect you, and now you've been lost in the darkness!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4876_Content_12 = {
    Text = "{Male=He,Female=She} acted like a monkey with its foot stepped on."
  },
  AvgDialog_4876_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Where did you see that monkey? Londinium Zoo?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4876_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Quiet, quiet!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4876_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Calm down, Miss Casiah! Another Aberrant Body is coming!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4876_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Mother, mother, where are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4876_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry, Mother. I didn't mean to get lost. I'm sorry."
  },
  AvgDialog_4876_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Lily... I'm not a bad child, please don't abandon me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4876_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The girl's voice faded into the wind, her tears falling onto the dark soil."
  },
  AvgDialog_4876_Content_6 = {
    Text = "She wept silently in the pitch-black room, another handful of sorrowful tears watering the pure white lilies by her bedside."
  },
  AvgDialog_4876_Content_7 = {
    Text = "%player%, hurry up! It's your turn!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4876_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Don't make a fuss! Keep it down!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4876_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You straightened your collar, trying to appear grief-stricken, and limped in front of the camera."
  },
  AvgDialog_4877_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The worried expression on the girl's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_4877_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Mother...! Mother!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4877_Content_12 = {
    Text = "A small hand dug through the snow. A frail and tiny body shielded her, facing the roaring blizzard head-on—"
  },
  AvgDialog_4877_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A woman bundled in thick winter clothing trudges through the snow, her heavy load weighing down her steps and leaving deep footprints behind."
  },
  AvgDialog_4877_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Wait for me... my daughter, Mommy will be by your side soon..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4877_Content_4 = {
    Text = "From the distant snow mountain, the loud sound of something collapsing echoed."
  },
  AvgDialog_4877_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Avalanche?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4877_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Wait, the avalanche in <Yellow:Magic Mirage> isn't actually dangerous, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4877_Content_7 = {
    Text = "What is the Magic Mirage? It is the grand imagination of this lone adventurer and the masterpiece of a great magician. It embodies cold, fear, nightmares, and crises all in one!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4877_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Chased by collapsing snow blocks, the adventurer ventured deep into the snowfield. But how can frail humans overcome nature? In a moment of carelessness, she fell into a bottomless ice cave."
  },
  AvgDialog_4877_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The thick snow pressed against the adventurer's windpipe, causing their vision to blur. Memories flashed before their eyes—black wounds of disease, the heavy rain on the day of the funeral, and—"
  },
  AvgDialog_4878_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Conflict! This needs to be one of the climactic points in the story; there must be conflict!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4878_Content_2 = {
    Text = "I heard your voice, warm and humid... Mother, are you crying?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4878_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Mother... Mother? Why are you crying?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4878_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
A mother stood before a stone tablet, weeping, while the girl's cries were muffled by a mixture of soil and wood.
Though only a step apart, she could not hear her beloved daughter's pleas.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4878_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Mother, please don't cry. I'll be a good child... Please don't overlook me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4878_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Mother... I'm so exhausted... Will you find me when I wake up?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4878_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
Like a candle on the verge of burning out, her voice grew weaker and fainter.
In the end, she could no longer hear even her own voice...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4878_Content_8 = {
    Text = "As the girl falls into a deep sleep, the lurking darkness in the graveyard surges forward! It rushes toward the unsuspecting and grieving mother!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4878_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Wait! The script didn't specify a battle?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_1 = {Text = "There."},
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You and Nymphaea quietly watched the girl from afar. Her eyes were closed, but a happy and content smile graced her face."
  },
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You hesitate to disturb the peace, but the patients in the courtyard leave no room for prolonged tranquility."
  },
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Nymphaea sister... master..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry, I left your side without permission..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_14 = {
    Text = "It's all right, Lily. Would you like to stay with your mother a little longer?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Lily holds your hand, looks back at the silent door, and shakes her head firmly."
  },
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Lily knows which story to tell. Let's head back quickly."
  },
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Saying goodbye to Nymphaea, you leave the sanatorium and set off on your return journey to Londinium."
  },
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Moonlight filters through the misty air and the murky glass of the sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_19 = {
    Text = "In a corner where time stands still, a hidden light flows through the dark purple magic circle."
  },
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The girl you are looking for is sitting at the end of the corridor, leaning against a door that is all too familiar to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Intricate and mysterious patterns penetrate the door, emitting a dark purple light."
  },
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_4 = {Text = "Mother..."},
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Can you hear Lily speaking?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The cub-like murmurs received no response, perhaps because the door was too thick, or perhaps because there was no life behind it anymore."
  },
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Sorry... Lily accidentally forgot the stories that Mom and Lily told."
  },
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Lily wants to tell stories to her friends... Can Mother teach her?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4879_Content_9 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_4880_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Are you the legendary ones from Londinium —!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4880_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Yes! Roaming Londinium at night, guarding the ordinary nights of the East End, speaking for laborers, shouting for the impoverished—"
  },
  AvgDialog_4880_Content_12 = {
    Text = "We are the <Blue:Endnight Rangers> and their loyal assistants!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4880_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The Great Night Ranger leapt off the assistant's shoulder and, with a few swift movements, used its innate weapon to bite through the hemp rope!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4880_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4880_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
Brown said... *cough cough*, Night Ranger said: This rope is really tough to gnaw through!
But we made it! The light of freedom is beckoning us!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4880_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Thank you, Night Rangers and partners..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4880_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The girl paused after speaking and pointed to the riffraff attracted by the Night Ranger."
  },
  AvgDialog_4880_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Detective, I heard the sound of teeth cracking."
  },
  AvgDialog_4880_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Just a moment... Almost done..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4880_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The brave and handsome detective lay on the ground like a dog, his hands tied behind his back. Refusing to give up, he was trying to bite through the rope binding the girl's wrists."
  },
  AvgDialog_4880_Content_5 = {
    Text = "In a corner hidden from the two, a pair of fierce eyes gleam in the darkness! Something is about to pierce through the shadows, bringing the first light of dawn!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4880_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4880_Content_7 = {
    Text = "<Blue:Night Ranger> said: It suggests not biting anymore. Master Houdini's magic rope is as hard as steel."
  },
  AvgDialog_4880_Content_8 = {
    Text = "One person..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4880_Content_9 = {Text = "A Mouse..."},
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_1 = {
    Text = "We won... We won!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The assistant held the Nocturnal Ranger high, temporarily shielding the ranger's beautiful fur."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Hey!! Corpse, stop talking! Keeper! Lotan! Do something!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Lotan shook her head, a phantom of a whale-like creature appearing behind her. Just as she was about to pull everyone out of the water, a light figure plunged into it."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Water! It's water~ Aurita's favorite sea!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Make a wish to me, those in need! The ocean will respond to all your expectations!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Detective G and the Night Ranger exchanged glances and simultaneously pushed the long-silent girl in white towards the Ocean Elf."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_16 = {Text = "...?!"},
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Please, please take us away from here."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Casiah, half her body already submerged in water, curled her lips into a satisfied smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Magic illusions shift and transform with a wave of her hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The evil sorceress was defeated by the combined efforts of everyone. She collapsed to the ground, weakly reaching out her hand toward a button."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_20 = {
    Text = "In the blink of an eye, everyone was soaked in water."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_21 = {
    Text = "No one is spared."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Are you serious!?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The elf returned to the freedom of the sea, and everyone escaped Houdini's workshop. Doesn't this fulfill the girl's wish?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You have a point, but... how can this story reach the ending Lily desires?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_25 = {
    Text = "\"The girl lived happily ever after with her mother.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_26 = {
    Text = [[
"Tsk, this is the last time I'm babysitting for you.
Don't ask me to do such troublesome favors again."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Lily, officer, look! What's in the water over there?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_29 = {
    Text = "A massive spine rises from the water, a colossal beast that has dwelled in the Aequor of Kadath since the birth of the planet. It answers the call of Life, emerging through the veil of time!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
Seeing this, Lotan threw a loudspeaker to you.
She strode over to Casiah and started whispering in her ear.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_30 = {Text = "Lotan...?"},
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Are you ready to go? If not, your story will come to an end in this water."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Wow! A big fish!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Don't rush, one at a time. Miss Lotan's back is quite spacious."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Can you, a half-baked sea sprite, stop hogging the spotlight? Clearly, Bru... No, the Night Ranger and I are the real heroes here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_35 = {Text = "Um..."},
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The big fish is Aurita's companion! So Aurita must sit at the front!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_37 = {Text = "Um...!"},
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Lily, Lili... I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Can I sit in the front?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_4 = {
    Text = "What scheme are you up to now? Don't make it impossible for everyone to clean up the mess."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Considering you're younger than me... Be careful! There's no seat on the big guy's back."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Aurita wants to be with her companions!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Hey! Why are you so slippery!? If you can swim, don't climb up here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_43 = {
    Text = "The behemoth bellows through its airway, leaping out of the water with laughter and hope."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_44 = {
    Text = "The light of dawn pierces through the clouds and mist, draping the sea, colossal beasts, and adventurers in shades of red and pink."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_45 = {
    Text = "So, so high—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Detective G, the Ocean Sprite, and the assistant of the Night Ranger joined forces to catch the girl, preventing her from slipping off the back of the giant beast."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_48 = {
    Text = "A few people laughed and played, smearing water on each other's clothes."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Perhaps for these fortunate survivors, the original intended ending of the story no longer matters."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Oops, just a little test—"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_50 = {
    Text = "At this moment, the brave girl suddenly stared directly at you, seated quietly on the reef."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_51 = {
    Text = "The light flickered in her eyes, and an exceptionally radiant smile spread across her youthful face."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_52 = {
    Text = "A lily bound by time, missing its blooming period—"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_53 = {
    Text = "The moment of blooming has finally arrived."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Clap, clap, clap."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Applause echoes from beyond the set, and the scent of violets gradually fills the air. Someone gracefully approaches, dragging a flowing gown."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_56 = {Text = "Daffodil!"},
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Daffodil smiled as she removed the special film, elegantly blowing off non-existent dust."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Indeed, quite a story. I'll accept this exchange."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_59 = {
    Text = [[
Wait! You never mentioned taking the film with you.
Now we can't report to Doll.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_6 = {
    Text = "As the smile on Casiah's face slowly widens, the sound of an undercurrent enters everyone's ears."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_60 = {
    Text = "You're still as impulsive as ever, Black Swordsman.\nThink carefully about Miss Doll's task—"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_61 = {
    Text = "\"Testing modified machines\"... instead of testing special film, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_62 = {
    Text = "But I haven't seen the movie yet! It's different from the comic, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_63 = {
    Text = [[

The machine faithfully recorded your story, and the film is merely the medium of this beautiful time...
The task assigned by the "brain in a jar" has long been completed by you, hasn't it?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_64 = {
    Text = "As for the finished movie, I warmly welcome everyone to come to the Exchange Shop and enjoy it together."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Just as you were about to convince the merchant to keep the film, your communicator inconveniently buzzed."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Taking so long to answer, you must be having a great time? I hope you can be just as focused when completing your schoolwork."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Let's skip the pleasantries. I've lost something—I only handed you a box of special film when I left the research lab, correct?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Hmm... Indeed, only a camera and a roll of film."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Doll's emotionless voice flowed into the minds of all present Mythag personnel, causing the once laughing and chatting crowd to hold their breath for fear of missing any information."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Come forth, flood! Witness Master Houdini's finale — the ultimate water tank escape!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Well, since there's no outbound record from Erica, asking you is pointless."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Come back soon. You've been out long enough."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Doll abruptly ended the communication. As the current left their brains, everyone sighed in relief."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Lady Daffodil! Could the film you gave us be—"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Where is that wicked woman?! When did she disappear?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Lily watched the Grey Sea disappear around the corner of the set. Noticing your gaze, she turned and walked over to your side."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_76 = {
    Text = "What's wrong, Lily?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Lily is very happy..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_78 = {
    Text = "She tightly grips the hem of your cloak, looks up, and gives you a bright smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Thank you... \"Mother\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The water level rose rapidly, soon covering the children's feet, then their calves... Finally, it reached their thighs, making it difficult for them to move."
  },
  AvgDialog_4881_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Casiah!!! What are you doing?! Are you trying to drown us?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
The mutant let out a final shriek, scattering silver specks. 
Soon, it and its sorrow will be forgotten by the world.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I watched her wither day by day, from a sun to a lifeless pool that not even the wind could ripple."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Finally, only the black viscous liquid dripped from her fingers, merging into the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Unlike poetry, stories always come from people. Merchants and wealthy businessmen, students and soldiers, nobles and servants... they are all stories."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_13 = {
    Text = "But my approach... the sorrowful approach will only lead the story to the same ending."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Miss Horla..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Master, it isn't Miss Horla's fault, is it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_16 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_17 = {
    Text = "It's alright, little Lily, I've already accepted this situation."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_18 = {
    Text = "No, it's not your fault."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Why... do you say such a thing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The shadow of sorrow... You knew her from before, didn't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I heard the voice of the aberrant. At least the florist's breakdown has nothing to do with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_21 = {Text = "W-What?"},
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_22 = {
    Text = "From the sparse words left by the Dissolutes, I deduced that she had already exhibited Dissolution symptoms long before you applied to leave Mythag."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
Sick... I'm sick.
I can't remember things anymore, and sometimes I see strange things.
The doctor says it's phantasm, a symptom of hysteria.
Hysteria... it sounds so distant.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_24 = {
    Text = "I've heard from others that the new neighbor at the end of the street is quite talented..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_25 = {
    Text = "She bought a bouquet of flowers from me and gave me a poem. How wonderful! Mom embroidered the poem on the curtains!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_26 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
I'm getting sicker, and Mom is becoming forgetful.
What should I do? If I leave, who will take care of her? Who will look after this shop?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_28 = {
    Text = "I don't want to leave home... My family still needs me."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Death... No, I don't want to yet..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Before the visit of <Yellow:Pestilence>, Reni was the town's florist."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Her sorrow stems from the pain of parting with her family and the fear of departing from this world."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Really... has nothing to do with me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Did she... leave any message?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_33 = {
    Text = "She said..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_34 = {
    Text = "\"The new neighbor deserves the best flowers.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_35 = {
    Text = "<Italic:Once in full bloom, forever radiant...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Thank you for the message... I will compose the final poem for her story."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Horla bent down, her fingertips brushing Lily's forehead, carrying the scent of rich petals and the coolness of water."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Take her to find the stories, to the city, to nature, to her future, to her past..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Stories will find you unexpectedly."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Horla squatted beside the D-slime left by the mutant, her hand hovering over it."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Her father and brother both perished in a mining accident, but she still bravely kept the family together."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The rose solidifies in the mud, quietly blooming in her upturned palm."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_7 = {
    Text = "She inherited her grandmother's flower shop, supporting herself and her ailing mother... She deserved a happy and peaceful ending."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_8 = {
    Text = "If... she hadn't met me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4882_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Horla lowered her eyes, watching the Dissolution flower wither and fall..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Can Aurita tell stories too? Aurita has stories!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_10 = {Text = "The sea..."},
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The last time I saw the sea was on the way leaving the snowfield with my mom..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Does Lily have a story too? Aurita wants to hear yours!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Story... Before Mom got sick, she would often tell me bedtime stories."
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_14 = {
    Text = "But I... I can't remember either."
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Lily the Rascal—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You must try harder! Think carefully!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_17 = {Text = "But..."},
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Lily, that's so unfair. Are you trying to slack off?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Aurita skips class and gets double homework, while Lily skips and gets double stories!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Long—long ago, Granny said that Aurita was a child from the sea!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_20 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Well, that sounds great! You always hang out with Lotan and {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} \"Ashe\", never playing with us."
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Take this opportunity to let everyone get a taste of you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Squeak! Squeak, squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Script! Script! Lily writes the script!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Script! Script! Lily writes the script!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Aurita's parents have returned to the underwater kingdom. When Aurita grows up, she will reunite with them."
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
They must be worried about Aurita, so Aurita will bring lots and lots of friends back!
Bringing puppies, kittens, crows, Keepers... and Aurita's favorite jellyfish!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Now they know that Aurita also enjoys life on land!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_6 = {
    Text = "There seem to be many creatures that are not suited for the sea..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Am I also one of those being taken into the sea?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Yes! Yes, yes! The Keeper is Aurita's companion! Lily wants to join too!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4883_Content_9 = {Text = "...!"},
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Led by Casiah, you stop at the entrance of Londinium's largest department store, surrounded by bustling shoppers."
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Almost forgot, it's two airtight jars."
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Casiah retreats behind the group, pushing the silent Lily forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Good morning, Lady Daffodil."
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Good morning, my little guests. Let me guess... why have you come this time?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_14 = {
    Text = "\"Film that can record the images of Awakeners\"... I can indeed find such items for my guests."
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_15 = {
    Text = "How did you find out? Did you send someone to follow us again?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_16 = {
    Text = "How could I have foreseen that you would accidentally damage the precious film?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Daffodil, with a mysterious and unfathomable smile, placed what you desired on the counter."
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Processed with high-purity Silver Prime, this film can capture Awakeners' appearances normally. Very precious. Only one available in the shop."
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Wasn't it the special film from <Yellow:Doll's new research>? Where did you get it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_2 = {
    Text = "This is too lively! Why did that woman set up her shop here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
The merchant who travels across dimensions has special channels.
Don't look at me with such suspicion; it breaks my heart.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_21 = {
    Text = "How about it? If you don't need it, I'll put it away."
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Alright, we'll take it."
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Lily squeezed your hand, a hint of unease in her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Exchange Shop... Must reward the lady."
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Ah, Lily still remembers the rules here."
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Rest assured, I don't want much this time—I just want to see the \"story.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
A brilliant, complete, and regret-free story.
That's what I want to exchange.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_3 = {
    Text = "\"To hide a 6 of Diamonds, shuffle it into a deck.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_4 = {
    Text = [[
Casiah led you to the department store and pushed the door open.
A burst of purple smoke pulled everyone inside.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Welcome back to my \"Exchange Shop,\" my esteemed guests, and..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
And my lovely "employees."
How's life at Mythag? Have you learned about true emotions?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Thank you for your generosity, ma'am, but there's really nothing to learn from a blabbering mouse, a clueless single-celled organism, an arrogant brute, and a taciturn type."
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Who's making all that racket?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4884_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Am I the \"dullard\"...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4885_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Stop! Release that girl!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4885_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Oh? Could you be the famous... <Blue:Detective G of the Londinium Police Garden Division>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4885_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Y-Yes, I am the <Blue:Chief Hua of the Londinium Police Department... mmph!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_4885_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The convoluted title made the detective bite his tongue, but it won't affect his determination to save innocent citizens."
  },
  AvgDialog_4885_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I will save her from your evil schemes! Face justice, sorceress Houdini!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4886_Content_1 = {Text = "Ah...!"},
  AvgDialog_4886_Content_2 = {
    Text = "<Small:It's broken...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_4886_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Again, again! Isn't Casiah having fun too!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4886_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Rude bastard! I'll tear you to pieces! You'll have no place in the world of movies!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4886_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Shh, shh! Don't provoke Miss Casiah any further."
  },
  AvgDialog_4886_Content_6 = {
    Text = "With all attention drawn to the chaotic battle, the soft gasp went unnoticed."
  },
  AvgDialog_4886_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Lily took a deep breath and shouted with all her might."
  },
  AvgDialog_4886_Content_8 = {
    Text = "It's broken... <BigShake:The machine is out of order!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_4887_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
The orderly skillfully subdued the frenzied patient, quickly restraining their limbs with leather straps.
Only after finishing did he realize there was an outsider present, and he scratched his head, looking embarrassed.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4887_Content_10 = {
    Text = "There are large amounts of unseen D-Slime — perhaps, the source of madness."
  },
  AvgDialog_4887_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Be careful. The patients are especially unstable today. Don't let them hurt you."
  },
  AvgDialog_4887_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Collective madness? Does this happen often?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4887_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Those abandoned in the asylum have spirits as fragile as paper left in the sun for seven days and nights, shattering with the slightest breeze. Sudden outbreaks of collective madness are nothing unusual here."
  },
  AvgDialog_4887_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Let's go. The person in charge should be on this floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_4887_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Hey! Be careful!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4887_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You suddenly shoved the orderly, who staggered back a couple of steps and looked at you with a puzzled expression."
  },
  AvgDialog_4887_Content_8 = {
    Text = "There's a bit of water; let's walk along the edge of the corridor."
  },
  AvgDialog_4887_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The caretaker didn't ask much and avoided the direction you indicated. Only you secretly breathed a sigh of relief."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_1 = {
    Text = [[
Security team, assist Ms. Ellie in taking the patients from the yard back to their rooms. 
Daisy, prepare the patients' comfort items and toiletries.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Thank you for bringing a long-lost friend from afar to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Saying \"thanks\" is too formal. Let's go deal with the incident in the ward first."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The medics signaled to Nymphaea and, after receiving her nod of approval, left the office one by one."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_13 = {
    Text = "It seems that you have done well here after the Hellhound Event."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Thanks to you and Miss Ramona, the sanatorium has been able to operate smoothly."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Is there something that brought you here so late at night?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You explained to the pale-faced girl about the shooting, the script, and Lily..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
I see... You want to create a story?
I can't write poems or scripts, but I've read plenty of stories.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Nymphaea closed her eyes and spoke softly, as if chanting."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_19 = {
    Text = [[
Most importantly, it's about <Yellow:listening>, right?
Listen to the voice within, follow the flow of emotions... They will lead you to the answer.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Mr. Jackson, please... help cut the potatoes into the curry. Don't waste them."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Lily listens and thinks, trying to make sense of Nymphaea's words."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_21 = {
    Text = "In the middle of their conversation, a muffled wail came from downstairs. Lily, who had been deep in thought, was startled and bumped into Nymphaea's leg."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_22 = {
    Text = "He sounds like he's in pain..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
The patients here experience sudden, unpredictable deteriorations in their condition, but they usually recover within half a day...
Apologies for the trouble.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You can contact Mythag University for investigation assistance. Noble Dexter should have left contact information."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_25 = {
    Text = "I know the reason for the mutation, and I'm afraid it's a problem even Mythag cannot solve."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I'm going to help with the \"cleanup.\" Would you like to join me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Has anyone seen Mr. Robert? Did anyone go look for him? I remember he is in charge of the second ward tonight..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_4 = {
    Text = "I'm here, Miss Nymphaea."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
The one systematically organizing the medical work is Nymphaea, whom you've met before.
Seeing you at the sanatorium, her face shows an expression of surprise.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_6 = {
    Text = "It's you... and Lily."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Sister Nymphaea."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Why didn't you two mention earlier that you knew Miss Polonaise? I almost thought she was a scammer."
  },
  AvgDialog_4888_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Nymphaea chuckled softly and took Lily's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Perfect finale"
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_10 = {
    Text = "She visited the art exhibition, went to the zoo, took the subway and train. They even sailed down the Isis River, rushing into the vast southern ocean!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_11 = {
    Text = "After experiencing all kinds of adventures, the two began a peaceful and quiet life... However, the girl still retained her curiosity and longing for the unknown."
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Curiosity... Is it a bad thing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_13 = {
    Text = "No, no, no, it's definitely a good thing. Curiosity is the eternal driving force that propels civilization forward—"
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Unfortunately, this time, the girl became curious about a mysterious Fang..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_15 = {
    Text = "A meaningful glance at Casiah"
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You give Casiah a wink, snapping the magician out of her daze after you took the loudspeaker."
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Why do I have to be the great demon lord again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Out of support for your work—or simply to play a prank—she grumbled but still cooperated to conjure up the magical illusion again."
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The magic workshop was illuminated by an eerie and sinister light. The strange glow drained the vitality from the world of the living, making one feel as if they were in the underworld."
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_2 = {Text = "Hiss—!"},
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I am Houdini, the Grand Magician from the world of the dead. This beautiful little girl is my favorite magic prop. Brave adventurers, do you have the courage to challenge me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Miss Casiah...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Houdini! Master Magician Houdini! You should be trembling in fear, losing your mind!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Under your and Casiah's expectant gaze, Lily mechanically swallowed a few times—"
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Come, come..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Speak up! Cry out! Let me hear the fear from the depths of your soul!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Help! Someone, help me—Mother!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_3 = {
    Text = "What's that noise?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Lotan instinctively shielded the little Awakeners, gripping the sword hilt warily with both hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Sorry, it's my first time using this speaker."
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Want to play a little longer?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You shook your head, pressed the speaker switch again, and aimed the light at the center of the set."
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The brave girl and the adventuress returned to town. The adventuress treated the girl like her own, sharing countless experiences of life with her—"
  },
  AvgDialog_4889_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Lily's eyes suddenly lit up. She widened them, showing an expression of disbelief."
  },
  AvgDialog_4890_Content_1 = {
    Text = "<Change>I don't want... to leave... home..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4890_Content_2 = {
    Text = "<Change>Death... no..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4890_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A heavy emotion grips your ankles, dragging you into an unseen abyss, making even breathing difficult."
  },
  AvgDialog_4890_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Lily feels a heavy weight on her chest, and it's making her feel terrible..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4890_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Sorry for making you feel uncomfortable."
  },
  AvgDialog_4890_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Keeper, please help me defeat her."
  },
  AvgDialog_4891_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The young poet shook her head, her tone sorrowful and desolate. Unknowingly, she had withdrawn beneath the letter, revealing a trace of sadness."
  },
  AvgDialog_4891_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Shrouded in shadows of sorrow, my poetry and inspiration... might be of no use to the Keepers and Lily."
  },
  AvgDialog_4891_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A sorrowful... Shadow?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4891_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Facing Lily's puzzled expression, Horla let out a barely audible sigh."
  },
  AvgDialog_4891_Content_5 = {
    Text = "If possible, allow me to show you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4891_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Horla pushed open the door, no longer keeping the outside world at bay as thick, stagnant air surged into the room."
  },
  AvgDialog_4891_Content_7 = {
    Text = "What is \"the shadow of sorrow\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4892_Content_1 = {
    Text = "<Change>The new neighbor at the end of the street... talented..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4892_Content_2 = {
    Text = "<Change>The best flower... She..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4892_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Change>My flower... a poem..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4892_Content_4 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Renny Town once suffered from a severe Dissolution Cataclysm; perhaps the voices of the lost residents still linger here...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_4893_Content_1 = {
    Text = "<Change>I'm... I'm sick..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4893_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Who's there?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4893_Content_3 = {
    Text = "There was nothing behind, only the wind carrying a heavy mournful sound."
  },
  AvgDialog_4893_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Did you hear anything?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4893_Content_5 = {
    Text = "No... maybe a Phantasm."
  },
  AvgDialog_4894_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Useless! Incompetent! You've driven away all of Casiah's extras!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4894_Content_10 = {
    Text = "At the last moment, Ogier swung his spear, dispersing the rampaging rabbit into a blur of shadows."
  },
  AvgDialog_4894_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Annoying! Annoying! Those who don't cooperate have no place on Casiah's set!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4894_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[

It seems she won't stop her "emotional mimicking" unless she gets a beating.
This time you can't accuse me of being a "battle maniac", right?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4894_Content_13 = {
    Text = "We should let her read fewer of those miscellaneous magazines from now on..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4894_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Extras? Aurita knows, Aurita knows!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4894_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Aurita alone is like a whole troupe of actors!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4894_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You little rascal really are—"
  },
  AvgDialog_4894_Content_5 = {
    Text = "\"The 'Director' angrily waved the magic staff, causing props and cards to fly around, leaving noticeable scratches on various objects.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_4894_Content_6 = {Text = "Ah—!"},
  AvgDialog_4894_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The phantasm rabbit smashes into the set, finally locking its sights on Aurita and charging straight at her."
  },
  AvgDialog_4894_Content_8 = {Text = "Caution!"},
  AvgDialog_4895_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Most missed"
  },
  AvgDialog_4895_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Once the room is opened, the dimension dog trapped inside will break through the time seal.
The current status of Francis inside is completely unknown]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4895_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You cannot make any promises to Lily, nor do you wish to make promises that cannot be kept."
  },
  AvgDialog_4895_Content_2 = {
    Text = "It's been a while since your last visit. Though the scenery remains unchanged, the air no longer carries an aura of tension and trembling."
  },
  AvgDialog_4895_Content_3 = {
    Text = "This place, once shrouded in the shadow of \"Hellhounds\", seems to have welcomed back true peace."
  },
  AvgDialog_4895_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Lily, are you okay?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4895_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Although Lily is usually a quiet child, she hasn't said a word since entering the town of Lai."
  },
  AvgDialog_4895_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Your chest feels a wave of discomfort. Anxiety, joy, fear... A mix of emotions coursing through your nerves via the link"
  },
  AvgDialog_4895_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Master... Will Lily be able to see her mother this time?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4895_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Although Lily hasn't grown up... we've been away for so long. Will she still recognize Lily?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4895_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Looking at Lily's eyes, faintly twinkling with anticipation, you gently patted her hair, soft like silk, and led her to the other end of the railway bridge—"
  },
  AvgDialog_4896_Content_1 = {
    Text = "This guy has finally stopped being as stiff as a block of wood."
  },
  AvgDialog_4896_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The master has never been wooden, {Male=he,Female=she} is just, just a bit..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4896_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Steady? Mature? Or do you mean boring?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4896_Content_4 = {
    Text = "I never meant it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4896_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Seeing Ogier's face turn red from just a few words, Lotan laughed heartily and suddenly pushed the young knight into the spotlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_4896_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Join them now; this videotape won't be complete without you."
  },
  AvgDialog_4897_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You insulted Casiah's magic script!! Everyone... <Big:Listen to the director and cooperate with me!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_4897_Content_2 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:\"Daffodil's Guide to Dealing with Casiah\"> The first page says, Casiah has <Yellow:emotional disorder>, and all her emotional expressions are just imitations"
  },
  AvgDialog_4897_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Given that, where does her anger come from?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4897_Content_4 = {
    Text = "<Big:Try the <Red:power of Andy Johnson>!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_4897_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Andy Johnson? That name sounds familiar... Where have I heard it before..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4897_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I know this name!! It's a famous director from Oakwood in the Aglo Republic!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4897_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I heard the aunties at the market talking about him, saying he sent his photography assistant to the hospital last year!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4897_Content_8 = {
    Text = "At least now we know who she is imitating..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Finest bloom"
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Lily, you... can't read?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Lily... I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Lily lowered her head, hesitated for a moment, and finally nodded, her face full of unease."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
Writing, Mother taught me. But... Lily doesn't remember anymore.
Stories and scripts, Lily can't write them either.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_14 = {
    Text = [[
Don't be afraid; I'm not rushing you.
Let's do it together.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Lily, can you tell me what this story is about?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The story of Mother, Koom, and Lily."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_17 = {
    Text = "What event does the story begin with? Hmm... In other words, when does Lily want to start telling it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_18 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Not sure..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Lily sat at the vanity, her feet swinging back and forth, unable to reach the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Keeper, come with me for a moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Lotan yanked you to the edge of the set and looked at you disapprovingly."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_22 = {
    Text = "That child's past isn't worth reminiscing about. Having her write it into a story doesn't seem appropriate, does it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You've been sitting here for half a day without writing anything. If you ask me, why not take Lily out for a walk and find some other inspiration?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Lily's sharp ears caught her name. She jumped off the chair with a pen in hand and scurried to your side like a small animal."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Lotan ruffled the girl's hair and handed the crayon to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Go out and enjoy the scenery, let her chat with someone who can write. As for you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Just follow her and jot down her inspirations."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Master, where are we going?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_29 = {
    Text = "When it comes to \"someone who can write\"... you really should go and meet that person."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Story... Story......"
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_30 = {
    Text = "\"That person\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_31 = {
    Text = "A talented older sister. Lotan arranged for us to meet her when the bus reaches the final stop."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Lily nods innocently, holding your hand and falling silent."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_33 = {
    Text = "This is her second time on the subway. Unlike the excitement and curiosity of the first time, this time she stays close to you, obedient yet cautious, much like a small animal clinging to its mother's embrace."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_4 = {
    Text = "She muttered while holding the pen, its tip gliding and making a swishing sound against the paper."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_5 = {
    Text = "With a serious and solemn expression, the brushstrokes are strong and powerful, penetrating the paper—"
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_6 = {
    Text = "But what is shown on the paper is not text; it is merely a simple, childlike doodle."
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Is this... Koom and Francis?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_8 = {Text = "Ah...!"},
  AvgDialog_4898_Content_9 = {
    Text = "M-Master..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4899_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You and Lily knocked on an inconspicuous door at the corner of the street."
  },
  AvgDialog_4899_Content_10 = {
    Text = "No, no, Miss Horla misunderstood."
  },
  AvgDialog_4899_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You came to visit me for the script, didn't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4899_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Yes, but not really."
  },
  AvgDialog_4899_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You look down at Lily, who is almost hanging on your leg, and gently push her toward Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_4899_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<Italic:An unexpected life, blossoming beyond the boundaries of time...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_4899_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Hello, Lily."
  },
  AvgDialog_4899_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Hello, greetings to you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4899_Content_17 = {
    Text = "We would like to ask for your advice on how to create stories."
  },
  AvgDialog_4899_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Welcome from afar. My apologies for not greeting you sooner..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4899_Content_3 = {
    Text = "It was a rose fragrance with a hint of morning dew, seeping out through the crack of the open door, flowing secretly and ceaselessly."
  },
  AvgDialog_4899_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Long time no see, <Blue:Ms. Horla>."
  },
  AvgDialog_4899_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Good morning, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_4899_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Who is this little guest...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4899_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You explained to the poet about filming, the script, and Lily..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4899_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I see. To test Ms. Doll's modified camera, you need to shoot a film..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4899_Content_9 = {
    Text = "But perhaps you remember, I'm just an insignificant poet... When it comes to writing movie scripts, I'm far from being \"qualified.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Grand mirage"
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_10 = {
    Text = "What will happen otherwise?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You'll end up with bruises from crashing into the real set concealed within the illusion!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Have any of you seen the woman who is the Mythag University doctor and psychologist?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_13 = {
    Text = "That's the insidious, cunning, and evil Demon King. It is said that those who go to her injured end up being carried out on stretchers."
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Th-This part wasn't recorded, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Ogier looks at you nervously, holding the camera, and only relaxes after receiving a confirming nod."
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Miss Sylvia is always gentle with students who are accidentally injured..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Since everyone is ready, let's start filming."
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Yay—Shoot~Shoot~"
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Aurita, come over here! We don't need to be on stage for this one. Let's wait off-camera first—"
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Young actors, are you ready!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Awakeners each found places to hide off-camera. You took one last look at the \"script,\" which had only a few lines written, and headed to your scheduled spot."
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Keeper, are you ready?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Don't blink, hold your breath—actually, you can breathe now."
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Casiah's illusion magic will definitely leave you breathless—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The scenery twists and blurs. After a moment of fragmentation, the fragments reassemble into a reality you are extremely familiar with."
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_7 = {
    Text = "What... What kind of magic is this?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Squeak, squeak squeak!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4900_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Keep an eye on your thief partner. Casiah's illusions are merely tricks... Be cautious not to actually step into them, or else..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Merchant's bounty"
  },
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The black box containing the film rolled to the side, and light shone through the crack."
  },
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Doll specifically warned that the film must not be exposed to light... This is bad!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_12 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Our mission this time is to test the camera modified by Doll!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_13 = {
    Text = "That's nothing. Just buy another roll of film at the department store."
  },
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Your wallet won't be as thin as before, right, {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} \"Ashe\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You patted your poor wallet, calculating in your mind the next stipend day"
  },
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Do you think there might be a hole in your pocket? How about I try to \"get\" this weird film for you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Please, show some respect for the law."
  },
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Let's go to the department store."
  },
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_2 = {Text = "What?!"},
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Tsk, troublesome."
  },
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Lotan stopped fighting, knocked Casiah out with the sword hilt, sheathed her sword, and walked to Lily."
  },
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The machine was caught in the battle, collapsing amidst the wreckage of the set and props."
  },
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_6 = {
    Text = "What? What's wrong with the machine? Is it exhausted?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Something fell out from inside. Is it broken?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You lift up the machine. The camera appears undamaged, except for a wheel-shaped part that has fallen off."
  },
  AvgDialog_4901_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Oh no! The film!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Stop, stop! Don't run!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Who are you here to see? Visiting hours at the sanatorium are long over!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
<Small:The security provided by the Dexter Foundation is useless...>
Forget it, you can't stay here. I'll have security escort you out.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_12 = {
    Text = "After the Hellhound incident, the Dexter family generously donated to the Rye Sanatorium. In a way, it has become the professor's private property."
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I'm a student of Noble Dexter"
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I am a student of the Noble in Londinium. Passing through Laei during my travels, I hope to spend a night at the sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_15 = {
    Text = "A Noble's student? Came all the way from Londinium?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
Even if you really know Noble, given our current situation, how can we possibly accommodate anyone for an overnight stay!
Such a hassle... Fine, I'll take you to the person in charge.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I am Ramona Dexter"
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_18 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_19 = {
    Text = "You pressed Lily's shoulder, signaling her not to panic."
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The patients on the third floor are having a water fight in the yard, the ones on the first floor are playing with potatoes and curry in the kitchen, and those on the second floor are howling—Oh my gosh!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_20 = {
    Text = "I am the sole heir of the Dexter family, and it is my rightful duty to inspect our family businesses."
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_21 = {
    Text = "...I once saw Miss Dexter at a dinner party — a lady with dazzling silver hair."
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
You... never mind, never mind.
<Small:Robert, stay calm. You've seen enough lunatics here; one more won't make a difference.>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_23 = {
    Text = [[
Whether it's a visit or admission, approval from the person in charge is required.
I'll take you to see her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I quit! I'm quitting!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Alarms blare, red lights flash. The Lai Asylum is in chaos inside and out. Patients are running amok, and desperate caretakers are chasing after them."
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_5 = {Text = "...!"},
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Asylum... Mother!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Lily, don't rush, stay calm."
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Although the medical staff seemed overwhelmed, their methodical actions revealed that they were merely voicing complaints about the busy and tedious work."
  },
  AvgDialog_4902_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Hello, may I ask if something is wrong at the sanatorium?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4903_Content_1 = {
    Text = "What's going on with these mutants?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4903_Content_10 = {
    Text = "When did it go missing?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4903_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
Don't worry, this is Lily's home. She won't be in danger.
Let's clean up these mutants while we search for her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4903_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Do you remember the warrior that you and Miss Lotan defeated?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4903_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Leave her... to me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4903_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Helot... The original liberator of the Tilos, the vengeful spirit."
  },
  AvgDialog_4903_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
Exactly.
According to Dean Oswald's wishes, Ms. Helot's Link is every patient in the sanatorium.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4903_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
Her actions outside triggered anomalies at the sanatorium, which usually return to normal by morning... 
Given the chaos of this night, asking you to track her down is truly a tall order.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4903_Content_7 = {
    Text = "There exists a faint connection between same origin Awakeners. Lily might sense where Helot is. If the situation in the sanatorium worsens, please be sure to contact us immediately."
  },
  AvgDialog_4903_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Thank you for your kindness. I will... Huh?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4903_Content_9 = {Text = "Lily?"},
  AvgDialog_4904_Content_1 = {
    Text = "El@1...@4...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4904_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The patient let out a painful shriek on the bed, abruptly cut off, as if the world refused to let him make a sound."
  },
  AvgDialog_4904_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Shh, shh... Listen to the sound of the flowing sea..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4904_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Nymphaea softly consoled the patient, invisible streams entwining him. Soon, he fell silent, peacefully collapsing into Nymphaea's arms."
  },
  AvgDialog_4904_Content_5 = {Text = "This is..."},
  AvgDialog_4904_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Nymphaea made a shushing gesture, tucked the patient's blanket in, and then led you back to the hallway."
  },
  AvgDialog_4904_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, it's just a trace amount of ocean toxin. Your body will metabolize it while you sleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_4904_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Keep moving forward through this corridor. Lily might be deeper inside the sanatorium."
  },
  AvgDialog_4904_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You look at the familiar, deep passage and nod in agreement"
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Andy Johnson's Power"
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Soft footsteps came from a corner of the set. Lotan raised an eyebrow at Aurita, who immediately caught on and shone the light on that corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The bright light made the girl's eyes squint uncontrollably. She walked barefoot to the center of the set, nearly bumping into props that were piled up haphazardly several times."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_12 = {
    Text = "—\"Hellhound\"!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Gro... Awooo..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Its claws are sharper than the finest knives in a department store, its eyes brighter than the searchlights of a prison tower. Faceless, it lurks in the corners of the city, seeking sacrifices for evil..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_15 = {
    Text = "No... No, that's not it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Kum... It's not like that..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_17 = {
    Text = "*Cough, cough!*"
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_18 = {
    Text = "In short, seeking targets for an evil sacrifice..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_19 = {
    Text = "What kind of script is this? Londinium isn't that dangerous... *cough*."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A long, long time ago, a devastating flood struck the city."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Though Londinium is dangerous, there shouldn't be any hellhounds roaming the streets!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Jenkin, Miss Casiah's script is just a story..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You can't just make up the story, can you? I told you long ago that writing the script is far too important to be left to outsiders."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The Keeper too, didn't you suffer a lot under that lady? How can you trust the people she put into the school?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_24 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Alright, alright, calm down. Everyone, just calm down."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Lady Daffodil made a deal with the university's high-ranking officials. Casiah is now a temporary guest staying at Mythag."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The little mouse isn't wrong; the story of the Hellhound is captivating enough as it is, and besides..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Lotan spoke, glancing at Lily. The girl was still standing under the spotlight, her head slightly lowered, making her expression unclear."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Consider the feelings of those involved, Miss Magician."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Streets flooded, towers collapsed. From people to things, Londinium has undergone a complete \"reshuffle\"!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Hmm... Hmm hmm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_31 = {
    Text = "The shadows on the ground surged, the wires of the high top hat's brim snapped one by one, revealing a glowing gap that resembled a grinning criminal."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_32 = {
    Text = "A staff was thrown out from the crack, followed by a hand, and finally, a young girl emerged."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_33 = {
    Text = "The magician looked displeased. She got up from the ground, dusted herself off, and picked up her top hat to put it back on."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You say one thing, she says another, back and forth... <Big:You bunch of performers who lack respect for the art!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_35 = {
    Text = "In a barely noticeable corner, Casiah's \"anger\" opens Ultra Space, with familiar rustling sounds stirring in the dark..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_36 = {
    Text = "This leave from school was supposed to be just to test Doll's new invention... how did it end up in a battle?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Words are cheap. Let's get into the spirit."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_4 = {
    Text = "What is \"the Great Shuffle\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Shh, I'll explain after this scene is finished."
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_6 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_7 = {
    Text = "After the flood receded, turmoil arose again at the Isis riverbank! Misfortune arrived once more in this unlucky city!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Thick fog drifts on the Isis River, making it impossible to see even an inch ahead!
And within this thick fog, something is lying in wait...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4905_Content_9 = {
    Text = "That is the ancient legend: \"Echidna as mother, Typhon as father, with three heads, <Yellow:those hunted thrice by it, their souls destined for the underworld>\"—"
  },
  AvgDialog_4906_Content_1 = {Text = "Storyseek"},
  AvgDialog_4906_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Do you have any ideas about what kind of story we should tell, my lord?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4906_Content_11 = {Text = "Hmm..."},
  AvgDialog_4906_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Standing here staring won't help. Let's head back to the activity area and think it over along the way."
  },
  AvgDialog_4906_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Finally out. This place has such a strange smell, it's almost killing my nose."
  },
  AvgDialog_4906_Content_3 = {Text = "Squeak!"},
  AvgDialog_4906_Content_4 = {
    Text = "If she hears that, we won't be leaving here easily today."
  },
  AvgDialog_4906_Content_5 = {
    Text = "We're already 30 feet away from the shop! She doesn't have three pairs of ears, so how could she possibly hear us talking?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4906_Content_6 = {
    Text = [[
You weighed the film in your hand; it felt no different from the damaged one.
You recalled the reward Daffodil had requested...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4906_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
A brilliant, complete, and regret-free story.
That's what I want to exchange.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_4906_Content_8 = {
    Text = "This time, you can't shoot as you please; a plan is necessary."
  },
  AvgDialog_4906_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Plan~Story Plan~"
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_1 = {
    Text = "What's happening back there...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Lily pursed her lips and dragged the paper into her arms like a protective little mouse. You couldn't tell whether she was shy, scared, or sad."
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry... but when I think of my mother..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You didn't do anything wrong, after all, this ending..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_13 = {
    Text = "That's all for today. We've filmed enough. If Doll has any issues, she can come to me."
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Huh—? But Aurita hasn't appeared yet!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Weren't you backstage snacking with Brown for ages? Why do you want to be on camera now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Aurita wants to paint an oil painting too!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Your cloak is pulled with force. You look down at your leg and see Lily, her eyes filled with unease and guilt."
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The young girl refuses to recall being forced to part with her mother, and no one can blame her for it."
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_19 = {
    Text = "But is there any way to make her forget this sorrow, even if only temporarily...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Click! Click!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_20 = {
    Text = "A sketchy outline lies ahead, but thanks to the Grand Magician's excellent design skills, your nonsense is barely manageable."
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_21 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Nonsense>..."
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Casiah abruptly halts the filming; the magical illusion fades away, and she waves the script furiously."
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Why did you suddenly call it off? This time, it's not my fault. Neither Brown nor I said a word!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_5 = {
    Text = "A sketchy outline lies ahead, but thanks to the Grand Magician's excellent design skills, your nonsense is barely manageable."
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_6 = {
    Text = "But look at this Act IV script, it's not even an outline. How is Lord Casiah supposed to start writing from this!"
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Casiah throws the script at you, loose pages flying out of the binder."
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_8 = {
    Text = "A nearly blank sheet of paper dropped at everyone's feet, covered only with some childish scribbles:"
  },
  AvgDialog_4907_Content_9 = {
    Text = "\"The girl lived happily ever after with her mother.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_1 = {Text = "Thais..."},
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_10 = {
    Text = "She lifts her arm, and the immense river of stars parts around her smooth, glistening limb, yet it flows on, unhindered, ceaseless."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_11 = {
    Text = "It reminds me of you, the leaping joy, the fleeting thrill."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_12 = {
    Text = "A meteor streaks across the sky, its long tail fading into the darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Come on, let's continue..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Explore me, delve deep into me, until we reach that paradise of ecstasy..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Her heat, her burning desire consumes you—not in flames, but in the ceaseless gnawing of swarming termites, devouring your reason grain by grain."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The impact of the Holy River's overflow is too intense. I don't want... I shouldn't... do this right now..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_17 = {
    Text = "That's what you're worried about? What a good child."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Thais chuckles. Her soft sound is laced with a tantalizing charm, a knowing grace that carries just enough mischief to pierce the hull of your unspoken thoughts, sinking the little vessel of your hesitation before it ever reaches shore."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The power of the Holy River is my power. I am not ensnared by it."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Thais rises from you with lingering reluctance, a tenuous, shimmering thread still tethering you together, serving as a delicate echo of what just happened."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Every choice I make... springs from my own desire."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The river water seeps through the breach in the hull, spilling over the gunwales of your will, slowly submerging your toes, your knees, your chest, your neck, your mouth and nose..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Now, it's your turn to answer... Will you sink with me... into the endless tide of my desire?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The question hung in the air, and before you could respond, her warm lips and tongue seal yours, silencing any words."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_24 = {
    Text = "In a moment like this, words are far too pale."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Let your body... answer for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Her gaze, hazy and tumultuous, drifts over you like a slow, liquid flame, tracing every strand of your hair, your every curve, down to the very tips of your toes."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Her fingers, intertwined with yours, tighten possessively, as if fearing you might slip away. She pulls you deeper into that fevered, passionate realm where desire pools like warm honey."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Before you, the vast expanse of white dunes meets a velvet black sky ablaze with stars. You find yourself lost in this vast, radiant, dizzying splendor."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_6 = {
    Text = "What does this star-strewn expanse stir in you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Nothing. Your memories lie shattered like glass, scattered, fragmented; only the shimmering starlight reflected in Thais' pupils remains, vivid and undimmed."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_8 = {
    Text = "It reminds me of Aram."
  },
  AvgDialog_49091_Content_9 = {
    Text = "It reminds me of how the seeds of life converge into the mighty river, surging and rushing to fill every capillary of the desert."
  },
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_1 = {
    Text = "A black cloth is whisked away from your head. You blink and rub your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Now then... please enjoy Casiah's latest masterpiece: \"A Night the Keeper Shall Never Forget\"..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Her mischievous eyes sparkle in front of yours. For a fleeting second, you see this supposedly heartless great magician blush for the very first time."
  },
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_12 = {Text = "What...?"},
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Before you can react, the black cloth falls over both of you once more, shrouding you in darkness. Under the dim starlight, a warm, soft body leans into your chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Wait... Casiah, hold on..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Shh, Keeper. The show has already begun..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You try to speak, but something soft and cool presses against your lips, silencing you."
  },
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_17 = {
    Text = "You close your eyes. No stage, no audience. In this pocket of another dimension, there are only the stars, and the two of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_18 = {
    Text = "In your memory, it remains the most successful magic trick Casiah ever performed."
  },
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Where... where are we?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Another dimension, of course! Don't you recognize it, Keeper?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Hey, Casiah—I agreed to help you with the \"body displacement\" act, but I never said you could teleport me <Italic:here.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Let's just go back and finish the show. It's the best way to stabilize the Holy River's influence on you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_6 = {
    Text = "But the show is still going on! You promised to play along with my magic, and it's much too late for second thoughts."
  },
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_7 = {
    Text = "But the audience is still waiting..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The magic show for the public has already taken its final bow. This performance is a special gift, just for the Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_49092_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Casiah hops toward you, her hands tucked behind her back and her head tilted playfully."
  },
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Just blow it out, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_11 = {Text = "Woosh—"},
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_12 = {Text = "How is it?"},
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I'm feeling better; the dust seems to be gone. Let's continue."
  },
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_14 = {
    Text = "No, that's all for today."
  },
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Stop the battle training before you're fully satisfied? That's not your usual style..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Ha... thanks to Remouahe, this isn't enough to make me truly enjoy myself right now."
  },
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_17 = {
    Text = "She brushes aside the wisps of hair on your forehead, and presses a condescending kiss on your temple."
  },
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_18 = {Text = "Lotan?!"},
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Lotan pats your face, then takes your hand and pulls you up from the cold, hard ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Not enough. Still not enough!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_20 = {
    Text = [[
Don't worry. When I'm lucid, those chaotic desires can't control me.
Don't forget, I am an ancient artifact.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Now, go back to your dorm. You little rascal."
  },
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Is this your true strength? After a year of training and several missions..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The attacks rain down like a torrent, mercilessly shattering the tiles of the training ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Dust flies into your eyes, causing an involuntary reaction that makes you close them."
  },
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Lotan! Pause, I—"
  },
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The warrior forcefully pulls open your eyelids; the fabric of her gloves rubs against your sensitive, fragile skin, making you blink frequently."
  },
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Don't move."
  },
  AvgDialog_49093_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Lotan simply sets down her weapon, fixing your head with one hand, preventing your body from instinctively retreating or escaping."
  },
  AvgDialog_49094_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Nuts, bolts, iron rods... Yep, it's just like fixing a motorcycle frame."
  },
  AvgDialog_49094_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Huh? It's not broken. Then why did {Male=he,Female=she} ask me to come to the ward? Could it be that the broken thing isn't this bed?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49094_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Nautila looks up in confusion, her hands covered in grease, indicating she has perfectly completed a full mechanical inspection of the ward."
  },
  AvgDialog_49094_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Sniff... sniff sniff..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49094_Content_5 = {
    Text = "This person carries my scent..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49094_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Nautila bends over the sleeping student on the sickbed, lost in thought."
  },
  AvgDialog_49094_Content_7 = {
    Text = "{Male=He,Female=She} has distinct black stains at the corners of {Male=his,Female=her} mouth and on {Male=his,Female=her} face. Nautila instantly recognizes them as traces left by her specially formulated machine oil."
  },
  AvgDialog_49094_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Hmm... I definitely know {Male=him,Female=her}. {Male=His,Female=Her} name is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49094_Content_9 = {
    Text = "%player%... That's right, I remember now. %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You fall deeper into the dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Cease breathing. I will guide you back to reality."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Tulu?! Cough, cough..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The Awakener's presence helps clarify the situation. You eagerly call out his name, but those strange ideas instantly rush through your airways, like a tide."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_13 = {
    Text = "...I just told you: cease breathing."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The next moment, a full, cold tentacle forcefully enters your mouth, pushing aside chaotic memories and driving out those now meaningless sounds."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The real world's monsoon breeze brushes your face, and your body relaxes under unprecedented fatigue, as if about to enter a dreamless deep sleep..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Survived my dream and immediately dare to sleep again? Such courage impresses me."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_17 = {Text = "Tu-Tulu..."},
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You just said that was your dream?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_19 = {
    Text = "He turns away, a bit embarrassed."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The flood abruptly shattered the beams of the dream, filling the border between dream and reality with screams, which then turn into countless damp, dark stones."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_20 = {
    Text = "When I rest, the overflowing dreams incite the spirits' frenzy... The anomaly of my body has drawn you into the dream. This is my failing."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_21 = {
    Text = "This anomaly caused my dreams to infringe unbidden upon yours. Should you harbor any resentment, I grant you leave to feel it."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_22 = {
    Text = "R-resentment? Of course not. It was unintentional on your part. Besides, didn't you arrive just in time when the voices of Lemuria were overwhelming me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_23 = {Text = "You..."},
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Upon returning to the school, I will immediately head to the Black Pool. Perhaps the environment there can temporarily suppress the... anomaly within me."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_25 = {
    Text = "He restrains his tentacles to a corner of the carriage, glancing sideways at the deep, dark night outside the window."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_26 = {
    Text = "But the frequent glances that fall on the corner of your lips do not seem unintentional."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_3 = {
    Text = "This is not my dream... This is not mine..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You mutter, longing to wake up. Your water-filled alveoli swell like the abdomen of a terminally ill patient; your body adapts to the forgotten ocean."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_5 = {
    Text = "But the soundless current pulls your head back for a look."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Music, paintings, stories written in unknown languages—countless bizarre ideas flood into your dreams the moment you look back."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You try to speak, but only meaningless gibberish comes out—though it does carry meaning."
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_8 = {
    Text = "They are indeed meaningful. Long ago, they once were—"
  },
  AvgDialog_49095_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Do not swallow this water."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_1 = {
    Text = "My head... it hurts. What happened to me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_10 = {
    Text = "<Small:Ugh... I knew it. Someone like me is nothing but a shadow, a gutter rat in a black shirt, a dewdrop destined to vanish in the sun...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Miss Mason! Miss Mason, listen to me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You grip her shoulders and shake her, trying to snap her out of her spiraling self-doubt."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_13 = {
    Text = "No one is rejecting you. You are one of us."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_14 = {
    Text = "No one... is rejecting me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_15 = {
    Text = "She snaps her head up to look at you, her mouth twisting into a distorted, jagged grin."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_16 = {
    Text = "That's right. Then become a part of me—let us give birth to a new \"24\"!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_17 = {
    Text = "A horrific fissure splits her shoulder open, but there is no muscle or bone within. A pale gray mass throbs and swells beneath the skin, like a universe in the throes of birth."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Mucus writhes out of the crack, coiling around your fingers. The wet, slippery sensation instantly drags your mind back to the moment you first woke from your stupor."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Her pupils are dilated and unfocused. She craves you—longs to consume you, to fold you into the end of all things."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You find yourself lying on your all-too-familiar soft bed, the throbbing at the back of your skull equally familiar."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_20 = {
    Text = "No matter which Mason you are... snap out of it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You struggle to reach for the Silver Key at your chest, but before your hand can move an inch, that overwhelming force seizes you again."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Why resist? Didn't you say you'd accept all of me? The host treasures you so much... I know she craves this, too..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_23 = {
    Text = "As her icy lips press against the corner of your mouth, you realize her eyes have been entirely consumed by madness. This is not the Mason you know."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_24 = {Text = "Mmph!"},
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_25 = {
    Text = "\"24\" begins to shudder violently, her breath rattling like a broken bellows. She releases her grip on you and begins to claw frantically at her own slender neck."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Why! Why do <Italic:you> get to be fronting for this—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_27 = {
    Text = "No... no, no! Stop it, STOP IT STOP IT STOP STOP STOP—"
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_28 = {
    Text = "With a piercing shriek, her limbs contort and fold backward over her shoulders. Finally, her head drops, and a heavy silence falls."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Miss... Mason? Is it you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You brace your hands to push yourself up, only to find them sinking into a mass of damp, slippery tissue."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Keeper! I... I am so, so sorry... I don't know what happened. This new me... she seems to have developed some... unusual feelings for you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Mason frantically flails her completely dislocated arms; they swing from her shoulders like limp tresses of dough."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_32 = {
    Text = "There's no need to apologize. You're just under the influence of the Holy River."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_33 = {
    Text = "You take her hand—her human hand—and carefully guide the displaced joints back into their sockets."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_34 = {
    Text = "I'm so much trouble..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Her voice is barely a whisper, yet beneath the shame, a flicker of genuine joy passes through her tone."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Keeper... Keeper..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Seeing you awake, the young woman flushes deeply, her voice taking on a delicate, coquettish tone you have never heard from her before."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Miss M-Mason?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_7 = {
    Text = "\"Mason\" is reclining beside you, her blackened fingertips resting on your chest. Though her hands look frail, they pin you to the bed with impossible strength."
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Don't leave... why would you want to leave?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49261_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Or were all those sweet promises about accepting \"24\" just the delusions of my broken mind?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49398_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The storm intensified, the Aram soldiers cried, raged, shouted, prayed, and cursed."
  },
  AvgDialog_49398_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Countless Aram people face the direction of Thais, kneeling solemnly and devoutly."
  },
  AvgDialog_49398_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The raging sand spirit calmed under the soothing prayer, and the storm gradually subsided."
  },
  AvgDialog_49398_Content_12 = {
    Text = "It's the Queen! It's the Queen!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49398_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Thank the Queen's protection!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49398_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The Queen's eyes are still upon us!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49398_Content_15 = {
    Text = "We... have arrived!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49398_Content_2 = {
    Text = "On a nearby dune, you caught sight of that figure."
  },
  AvgDialog_49398_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You recognize the silhouette. It's Thais."
  },
  AvgDialog_49398_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Is the storm... too weak?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49398_Content_5 = {
    Text = "She chanted an unknown prayer, letting the fierce wind lift her veil, and walked slowly but steadily into the dark sandstorm."
  },
  AvgDialog_49398_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The roar is deafening, yet the chants are clearly audible, as if echoing inside your skull."
  },
  AvgDialog_49398_Content_7 = {
    Text = "In the gale that devours the sky and earth, she seemed to be calmly conversing with a desert-dwelling creature."
  },
  AvgDialog_49398_Content_8 = {
    Text = "It's the Queen! The Queen has come to save us, to save Aram!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49398_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Aram's team, which had been desperate to escape, suddenly came to a halt."
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_1 = {Text = "Storm wall"},
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_10 = {
    Text = "It... it's coming—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The moment your gaze focuses, you understand what \"Storm Wall\" means."
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_12 = {
    Text = "A gray curtain that swallows the sky and earth rolls in, shrouding everything."
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_13 = {
    Text = "It should be the tide, yet it is not. It is immense and silent, moving yet seemingly still."
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Its borders devour the land like a giant beast, swallowing the Aram line into the Mist, torn apart and digested by the storm's belly."
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Keep jumping, don't stop!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The emissary from afar has arrived. The queen will open the path to the Mother Tree for us!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_17 = {
    Text = "You notice Juliette smiling faintly beside you."
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Chief, Chief, today's storm is too intense. We cannot afford to lose so many people. Let us retreat!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_19 = {Text = "No way!"},
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_2 = {
    Text = "When Alva raised the flag, they swept their spears through the barren sands, stirring up blinding dust and chanting eerie, otherworldly songs."
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Her tone was authoritative, but her words quivered in the wind."
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The rate of deformities in the bonfire ritual is increasing. If this continues, Aram's bloodline will fade away in the river of time before the Mother Tree is discovered."
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Juliette formed a ring with her fingers and blew a loud whistle. The lingering sound was carried away by the storm, drifting into the unknown distance."
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I am the envoy Juliette. I have heard the queen's decree. Today, we will surely break through the Storm Wall!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Everyone, only advance, no retreat!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Following the envoy's orders: Only advance, no retreat!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<Small:Yeah... no way out... absolutely none...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_27 = {
    Text = [[
Wait, Keeper, a large group of Nubians is coming from behind...
Judging by the numbers... there are at least... two hundred!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Behold! This is the Queen's decree! You can only advance!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Nubia roars and charges at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Death is imminent, extinction has begun."
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The mother's skeleton is nowhere to be found; her blood and seeds drift across the earth, devoured by newborn beasts."
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The sky and the gods were shrouded in clouds until the arrival of the foreign messenger."
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree rises anew: Her roots drink deep the Holy River's flow. She crowns the fallen in light, And calls their blood back to Aram's own."
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Calls their blood back... to Aram..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The scorching sun of the desert disappeared without a trace, the sky became overcast, and the wind changed its tone."
  },
  AvgDialog_49399_Content_9 = {
    Text = "A sudden fear gripped you, causing you to lose focus for a moment, and then a scream brought you back to your senses."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Lady Alva, please allow me to say a few words to {Male=him,Female=her}."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Her expression was unusually fervent, her speech rapid, her body leaning forward involuntarily, her eyes ghostly."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Farewell, Blind Eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_12 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_13 = {
    Text = "No, this is not the end. Because that person once urged you, with the most earnest voice, to call her name."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Recalling Thais' gaze, you activated the Silver Key."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Silver threads sway, guiding and seeking..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_16 = {
    Text = "At the end of that thread, there is nothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The phenomenon called Dissolution consumed her entirely. Even you couldn't find a trace of her"
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Do you still expect her to return? The Aram people now obey me."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Thais... Thais!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You and Alva were at a stalemate when Juliette intervened."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_20 = {
    Text = "If she could appear, and if she could use her divine power to reveal the future of the Aram to Alva."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Even a single word of defense would have saved you from crossing blades with Alva."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Thais... Thais—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_23 = {
    Text = "No matter how much you shout, it's useless. Your last conversation with her ended with accusations."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_24 = {
    Text = "A being that has already been annihilated by Dissolution, with no trace of Silver contact remaining. You cannot touch her existence in the slightest."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_25 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_26 = {
    Text = "What? Has your past journey made you too proud?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Did leaving me turn you into a useless crybaby?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_28 = {
    Text = "The desert's silence was broken by a sudden gust; the sky quickly darkened as if all light had been devoured by the impending storm."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The sandstorm, like an enraged beast, roared and swept in, lifting millions of tons of fine sand, blotting out the sun and sky, obliterating both the blazing sun and the blue sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Since you insist."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Amidst this raging force of nature, a massive figure flickers in and out of sight within the swirling sandstorm."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Storm wall..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The storm wall was originally summoned through my authority."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Are you... Thais...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_34 = {
    Text = "It seems to possess endless power. As the dust storm rages, the shadow leaps and twists like an ancient desert beast hunting its prey."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Its massive and terrifying form, with a coiled head, sharp claws, and heavy hooves, is faintly visible amid the swirling dust."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_36 = {
    Text = "It's not entirely incorrect to call it that."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_37 = {
    Text = "However, I am not the queen you expected."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_38 = {
    Text = "If you wish to borrow my power, shout my sacred name aloud—"
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_39 = {
    Text = "The massive, peculiar shadow gradually fades away, and the elusive figure you've been longing for emerges from the howling sandstorm."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Guards, don't let them harm the envoy even in the slightest."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_40 = {
    Text = "The gravel swirled mercilessly around her, but it didn't slow her steps at all."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_42 = {
    Text = "The Queen! The Queen has returned!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Your Majesty, the Queen's gaze has been fixed on us!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Her gaze remained fixed on Aram, observing the past and future surging through his bloodline."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Thais... my lord..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Hear ye, all Aramites! The ancient prophecy has come true; the Mother Tree has reappeared to crown the departed!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_47 = {
    Text = "The Queen returns from the sands, reclaiming her throne!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_48 = {
    Text = "To Aram's only queen, Lady Thais—"
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Offer your loyalty and will!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_5 = {Text = "Yes!"},
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Juliette leans in, whispering to you from an arm's length away."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Returning to the Holy River is the destiny of the Aram; I merely accelerated it a little."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_8 = {
    Text = "When His gaze sweeps across all of Kadath, they will merge into a new world together with the Holy River."
  },
  AvgDialog_49400_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Isn't this your will, after all?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The mother tree's branches seem to have wills of their own, stretching out eagerly, forming the contours of human bodies within, moving clumsily and painfully"
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ramona, ignite the Mother Tree with the Silver Chip Fire! Only you can do it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Silver phantasms crashed into the roots of the Mother Tree, igniting silvery flames that instantly surged forth, transforming into a raging inferno named Destruction."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Flames slithered up the branches like silver serpents. Leaves writhed and screamed in the raging fire, emitting a piercing hiss, as if the Mother Tree was moaning and wailing in agony."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Wait, the tree is falling, and the Keeper hasn't come down yet!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Rest assured, dear child, I will definitely return {Male=him,Female=her} to you whole and hale."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Giant Tree Tremor, Earth Shaking"
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You lose your balance and fall straight down—"
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_17 = {
    Text = "How high is it here? A thousand feet? Or even higher?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Then, a warm and soft embrace enveloped you."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Good job, child."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The first being to evolve a throat let out a moan, struggled free from the Mother Tree, and fell into the Holy River."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The white jade you personally placed on her chest glows brilliantly against her skin, as smooth as silk."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Thais reaches out, picks it, and swallows it, gently biting down."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_22 = {
    Text = [[
I shall return to the sacred river, nurturing the entire land.
This is for you, a parting gift]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_23 = {
    Text = "As she fell into the raging Holy River, her lips brushed against yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Your breaths intertwine, and your souls merge."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_25 = {
    Text = "A warm, moist tongue pushed in, tender and irresistible."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The kiss carried the sweetness of love, the tang of blood, and a tiny, round object."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Seed of the Tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_28 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_29 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_3 = {Text = "...Boom!"},
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_30 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Although it's not in the form I imagined... it's over."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_32 = {
    Text = "As descendants of the Essence of Desire, the Aram are committed to perpetuating their bloodline."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_33 = {
    Text = "For this reason, we worship the mother tree, integrating her milk into our bone flesh, praying for reproductive abilities beyond those of humans."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_34 = {
    Text = "As long as one person survives the Black Apocalypse, civilization can continue into the next generation."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_35 = {
    Text = "But we were wrong."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The continuation of the Aram tribe does not depend on any particular Aram lineage. Over time, they have become slaves to the concept of \"descendants,\" excessively reliant on the desire to reproduce."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_37 = {
    Text = "During centuries of exile... it was Alva who supported the Aram in moving forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Tawil, you're right. We should believe in the will of humanity."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Even in the darkest nights, even with faint light, their unyielding spirit is what truly changes the destined future."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_4 = {Text = "Boom!"},
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Now, I have a new answer."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_41 = {
    Text = "So, could you be generous and lend me your inheritor?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_42 = {
    Text = "I am willing to trust this person before me, entrust the spark to {Male=him,Female=her}."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_43 = {
    Text = "This seed will one day take root and sprout, growing into a towering tree,"
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_44 = {
    Text = "As on the day the first Mother Tree was born."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_45 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_46 = {
    Text = "This is the last seed. I will leave it within you."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Before it spreads my bloodline across the earth, you must not die..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Always remember me. Don't forget me."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_49 = {
    Text = "The tide surges."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Thud! Thud!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_50 = {
    Text = "The warm embrace pushes you away."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_51 = {
    Text = "As you are tossed by the surging current, you see her drifting deeper into the river."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_52 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_53 = {
    Text = "A slender, white hand grabs you, the strength familiar and resolute."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_54 = {Text = "%player%!"},
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_6 = {
    Text = "One Aram after another falls."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_7 = {
    Text = "After a few seconds, several small heads struggled to surface from the water and swam toward the riverbank."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The branches beneath your feet begin to tremble."
  },
  AvgDialog_49401_Content_9 = {Text = "It's time!"},
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_1 = {Text = "Dance"},
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_10 = {
    Text = "What lies within the storm wall?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_11 = {
    Text = "What is the purpose of the mysterious messenger Juliette?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_12 = {
    Text = "What exactly is Aram's ritual about?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_13 = {
    Text = "And Thais, is the Thais before us truly trustworthy?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Ever since arriving in Remouahe, unusual incidents have not ceased. One mystery after another leaves you breathless."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You need to stay calm and think."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Don't dwell on it. You're exhausted and need some rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Turning back, only a full moon illuminates Thais' smooth and delicate face, giving it a translucent quality."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_18 = {
    Text = "On the other side of the Storm Wall... all your questions will be answered."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_19 = {
    Text = "On the other side of the Storm Wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_2 = {
    Text = "▼▼In the midst of chaos, no one knows the outcome.\nWhat I speak of is yet to come, but hearing and sight are lost,\nOnly the silent wander the land."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Juliette said the same thing. Do you really have to follow that mastermind into the storm?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Is there some mysterious force driving everyone like pilgrims, heading one after another toward the center of the storm?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Thoughts surge uncontrollably, planting seeds of doubt and anxiety in your Mindsea."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Is your heart always unable to find peace?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Close your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Thais is only a breath away from you."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Close your eyes"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Refuse to Close Eyes"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_28 = {
    Text = "What clear eyes... They haven't become clouded at all despite the bumps along the way."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Thais places her index finger on your lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You groggily open your eyes to behold an extraordinarily clear and dazzling starry sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Her face is inches away from yours, with the moonlight casting a soft glow on her skin."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You feel a breath drawing near, gentle and warm."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_32 = {
    Text = "What a nostalgic scent."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_33 = {
    Text = "How long has it been since we were so close to each other?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_34 = {
    Text = "A cool sensation on my lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_35 = {
    Text = [[
You open your eyes, and Thais presses her index finger to your lips.
Her face is close to yours, with the moonlight casting a soft glow on her skin.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Do you know? In your eyes, I see disaster, ancient embers, and the breath of the universe."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_37 = {
    Text = "You've had a long journey and must be exhausted, right? But your gaze remains as firm as ever, without a trace of fatigue."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The stars cannot change you, and the desert sands may not either."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_39 = {
    Text = "I don't understand what you mean."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_4 = {
    Text = "How did I... fall asleep?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_40 = {
    Text = "You don't need to understand this for now."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Thais rises and walks down the dune."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Under a starry sky like this, simply sitting idle feels far too unromantic."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_43 = {
    Text = "The wind lifts her sheer white veil as she drifts gracefully over the soft sand."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Let me present to you this Dance of Aram."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_45 = {
    Text = "The bell rang, and she raised an arm, swaying to start the dance."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_46 = {
    Text = "She bends and stretches, sometimes wild, sometimes subtle."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_47 = {
    Text = "I have been waiting for someone."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Her figure is as supple as boneless, and her dance resembles a slithering snake."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_49 = {
    Text = "A watcher that can lead Aram toward the \"future\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_5 = {
    Text = "After traveling in the desert for a long time, feeling tired is completely normal."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_50 = {
    Text = "She flips and swings, her afterimages radiating natural elegance and remarkable flexibility."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Isn't Alva that person?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Thais turns sideways, lowers her gaze, and the flower at her fingertips brushes past her sighing lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Alva is a good child, but she still cannot forge a new path."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Where is Juliette? Isn't she the envoy from a foreign land?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_55 = {
    Text = "You just said that the path Juliette sought for the Aram people is to leave the desert, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Thais stretches her arms, her wandering gaze fixed on the moon at her fingertips, as if bidding farewell to an invisible bird."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Those who could leave have already left. Aram never bound anyone. Whether it's an attachment to the homeland or an adaptation to desert life, those who stayed can only survive here."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Besides, that's not the answer I was hoping for."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_59 = {
    Text = "What kind of answer... are you expecting?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I still have many questions..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_60 = {
    Text = "It has long been written in the ballads."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_61 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree rises anew: Her roots drink deep the Holy River's flow. She crowns the fallen in light, And calls their blood back to Aram's own."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_62 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree rising anew is easy to understand, but who are the fallen? And how do we call their blood back to Aram?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_63 = {Text = "Shh—"},
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_64 = {
    Text = "The details are too complex; @1's prophecy cannot provide all the answers."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_65 = {
    Text = [[
All you need to do is trust me.
Trust the Queen of Aram.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_66 = {
    Text = "The desert flower blooms on a dim moonlit night. She raises her hand, spins, and steps, creating a complex and ancient rhythm in the sand."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_67 = {
    Text = "As long as you believe in me, I am your absolute, one and only, exclusive — secret weapon."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Under the moonlight, her silhouette is soft and mysterious. Her eyes shimmer, conveying unspoken emotions."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_69 = {
    Text = "If this is a dream that will eventually end—\nThe distant stars shall be their witnesses."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_7 = {
    Text = "A long dream seems to draw you away from your tense journey, with questions surfacing one after another in your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Wait, Thais, under your foot—"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_71 = {
    Text = "You call out anxiously."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_72 = {
    Text = "She stepped onto the ripples—no, black ripples spread from her toes."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_73 = {
    Text = "The edges of the white gauze flutter like swaying lotus leaves, scattering droplets, deep and rich like obsidian."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Is that... D-Slime...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_75 = {
    Text = "She danced in the pool of phantasmal dissolution, stepping onto the black surface again and again."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_76 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_77 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_78 = {
    Text = "She seems to ignore your call, dancing to an unknown rhythm."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_79 = {
    Text = "She turns to you, her posture relaxed. The necklace you personally placed on her chest shimmers brightly."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Why did the water in Ramona's pouch turn into D-Slime?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_80 = {
    Text = "She invites you to dance, and you can't help but place your hand in hers."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_81 = {
    Text = "She takes your palm and guides your fingertips to touch the jade, which seems to pulse with life."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_82 = {
    Text = [[
A meteor falls from the distant sky.
Her eyes shine brighter than the stars.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Her lips parted slightly, and the evening breeze carried her soft whispers."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Can I entrust them to you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_86 = {
    Text = "A sense of pull, akin to that night by the bonfire feast, captures you. Almost involuntarily, you murmur."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Sure, definitely."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_88 = {
    Text = "That's good."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Thais smiled."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Who is spreading Nubia?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Your friends have arrived."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Following Thais's gaze, you saw Ramona jogging towards you, with Ryker behind her. His steps were swift yet steady, exuding grace and elegance."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Don't forget, tonight is a secret that belongs only to us."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Turning back, Thais's figure had disappeared, with only the wind howling through the desert."
  },
  AvgDialog_49402_Content_94 = {
    Text = "On the sand before you, a streak of black D-Slime seeps into the quicksand, merging with the earth."
  },
  AvgDialog_49414_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Keeper, the Story Recall function has been activated. To proceed, tap your communicator and call \"Erica\" after the tone."
  },
  AvgDialog_49414_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Recall... What is this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49414_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A temporary archive of your memory records. The Story Recall function helps you revisit past investigations."
  },
  AvgDialog_49414_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Pay attention to the details you missed, connections you didn't see. Because humans learn by looking back... before we can move forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_49440_Content_1 = {
    Text = "(Huff... huff...)"
  },
  AvgDialog_49440_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Karen...? What are you doing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49440_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Your world is pitch black. Something has been tied over your eyes, blinding you."
  },
  AvgDialog_49440_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You try to lift your hands, but soft cloth strips bind your wrists, restricting you to only the slightest movements."
  },
  AvgDialog_49440_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Isn't it obvious? It's time for... spring cleaning!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49440_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Why am I being tied up for spring cleaning?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49440_Content_7 = {
    Text = "A sense of foreboding rises within you. Under the influence of the Holy River, the unpredictable whims of this elusive maid are impossible to gauge."
  },
  AvgDialog_49440_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The key to a thorough clean-up is being thorough! And that means the Keeper is part of the clean-up, too!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49440_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Here, there... every single part has to be scrubbed spotless~!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Erica, can you find which shelf Letter A-617 is on?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_10 = {Text = "Eri—"},
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Your voice is jolted back into your throat by a phantom current. The sensation where your hands meet is a shock far beyond anything a human body should endure."
  },
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_12 = {
    Text = "A brief, dazzling surge of electricity awakens every sense in your body. This impossible \"Link\" sends a pulse through your veins, stirring a strange, indescribable craving in your blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_13 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Erica blinks and finally withdraws her hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Understood. Letter A-617 is located in the restricted archives. I am leading the Keeper there now."
  },
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Without looking back, she begins walking toward the restricted area, her frame emitting a faint, rhythmic crackle of static as she moves."
  },
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_17 = {
    Text = "...Automatons aren't supposed to be affected by the Holy River anomalies, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_18 = {Text = "...Right?"},
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_2 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_3 = {Text = "Erica?"},
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The automaton stands motionless in the corner of the room. She wears her usual smile, but in this heavy silence, that frozen expression feels deeply unsettling."
  },
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You wave your hand in front of her face, but her eyes don't track the movement at all."
  },
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Strange. Erica never zones out... is there a mechanical fault?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You mutter to yourself, circling her metallic shell to check for damage."
  },
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_8 = {
    Text = "—Crackle."
  },
  AvgDialog_49441_Content_9 = {
    Text = "A faint pop of static catches your attention. You instinctively look toward the source, only to have your hand suddenly seized."
  },
  AvgDialog_49442_Content_1 = {Text = "Dream"},
  AvgDialog_49442_Content_10 = {Text = "Splash—"},
  AvgDialog_49442_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The world regained its sound and color."
  },
  AvgDialog_49442_Content_12 = {
    Text = "One by one, they resolutely leaped into the surging waters of the Holy River, stretching out their arms to embrace the withered trunk of the Mother Tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_49442_Content_13 = {
    Text = "They cried out fervently, emitting indescribable howls of madness."
  },
  AvgDialog_49442_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Their skin becomes slack, like limp mud; their bodily fluids drain, forming the rushing waters of the Holy River."
  },
  AvgDialog_49442_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Their bones softened like flesh, limbs twisted, extended, and entwined in inhuman ways, forming the Holy Tree's massive, bloated branches with their Caro."
  },
  AvgDialog_49442_Content_16 = {
    Text = "They slowly and painfully merged with the Sacred Tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_49442_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ultimately, it's an imperfect puppet that requires too much effort to control."
  },
  AvgDialog_49442_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The stronger your determination to sacrifice for Aram, the fiercer your resistance upon uncovering the truth."
  },
  AvgDialog_49442_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Good thing I anticipated this situation."
  },
  AvgDialog_49442_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Time is almost up. All of you, for your beloved Mother Tree..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49442_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Offer your Caro and life."
  },
  AvgDialog_49442_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
I opened my mouth, only to find that I couldn't make a sound.
Everything around me fell into a terrifying stillness.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49442_Content_8 = {
    Text = "No, it's not the world that is still, but my perception. Each blink feels as though a century has passed."
  },
  AvgDialog_49442_Content_9 = {
    Text = "In the stagnant and endless sequence, only my former comrades, one after another, the Aram soldiers, march toward the Holy River."
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Under the Mother Tree, a powerless Alva knelt, tears streaming down."
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_10 = {
    Text = "It's a good thing you came along; otherwise, every minute spent going back to fetch you would exhaust countless lives."
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The voice in my head... She told me... I must persevere..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
However, even if she doesn't say it...
I am %player%'s only assistant, in the most dangerous moments, I must be by {Male=his,Female=her} side.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Isn't this my duty as the sole assistant?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_14 = {
    Text = "She emphasized the word \"only.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Awakening her power in this land will intensify the effects on your body."
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_16 = {
    Text = "If there were any other way, I wouldn't resort to such a measure."
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Mythag has come to stop the ritual. I am a member of Mythag, ready to face death without hesitation!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Great! Ramona is suppressing the Essence of Desire. %player%, join me and let's completely destroy the Mother Tree!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_19 = {
    Text = "A deafening roar echoed across the sky as a silver phantom streaked through the high altitude of the desert."
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_2 = {
    Text = "I concealed the Mother Tree's body in the Holy River and endured dissolution by hosting the concealed Mother Tree's seed, all to wait for this moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_20 = {Text = "—"},
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You suddenly feel light, and the next moment, you land in front of a foul-smelling tumor."
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The Aram devoured by the Mother Tree gather here in egg form. Within translucent holes, countless faces twist and blur, while a red-black liquid flows ceaselessly, merging into the now-turbid Holy River."
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The moment of decisive battle has arrived!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_4 = {
    Text = "In the name of the essence of desire, Tiphareth Yesod, I request <Yellow:Tawil> to respond to our agreement from a thousand years ago—"
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_5 = {
    Text = "When the messenger from afar arrives, use your avatar as a guide to temporarily dispel the shadows over Lemoah for me."
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_6 = {
    Text = "A piercing wail resounds through the sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Thais opens the coffin, and out rolls Ramona, her face flushed red with fever."
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Finally... Do you need me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49443_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Hiding here and following me, you really have some nerve, little girl."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The door opens softly, and the light reflects a familiar silhouette."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_10 = {
    Text = "It seems the influence of the Holy River has reached your dimension as well... Are you all right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Can you keep me company, Keeper?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Of course, of course. It's just that I don't know how to help you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I want to take you somewhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_14 = {Text = "Where?"},
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Ramona sits beside you. The blush naturally blends with the light and her fair skin, making your breath catch."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_16 = {
    Text = "The moment she takes your hand, the space around you begins to shift. Countless images coalesce into a chaotic scene that feels eerily familiar."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_17 = {
    Text = "It looks chaotic... Am I seeing your memories?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I apologize... I have experienced the same scenarios too many times. My memories are too complex... But I believe you can see this place clearly."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Those blurry sights and smells are very familiar... Like the ruins after a massive explosion... Could this place be?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ramona? Didn't you say you have an assessment tomorrow and should go to bed early tonight?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Yes. This is Yakutsk, the place where your memories began... and where you first met me in this world."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_21 = {Text = "!!!"},
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Keeper, there are things you have long forgotten, but I still remember them all."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Here, I lost you, again and again. Every time, it is etched vividly in my memory."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Only that single time did you descend, moving toward infinite destruction, toward the only glimmer of hope... but that sole glimmer had nothing to do with me."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_25 = {
    Text = "A sharp pain pierces your heart like a blade. You extend your arms and pull her into your embrace."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_26 = {
    Text = "This time, the tranquil young woman who has fought across countless timelines does not evade."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_27 = {
    Text = "She obediently nestles in your arms, gently rubbing her head against your chest, like a cat that finally returns to its owner after being hurt."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_28 = {
    Text = "In this dimension, you have many companions by your side. Doll, Czort, Alistair... and the one who has always been with you, this world's me."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_29 = {
    Text = "I believe you will proceed smoothly and accomplish what you intend to do."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Perfect timing! Professor Dexter just told me he's making lunch at home tomorrow. We can head straight over after our assessment."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_30 = {
    Text = "I shouldn't have appeared like this. With the experience of so many timelines, I should have become more mature."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_31 = {
    Text = "But I don't want to lose you again, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Crystal-clear liquid slips from her eyepatch, flowing through her pale hair and down her flushed cheek."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Her forehead presses against yours, her hair gently rubs your cheek. Your breath stalls as you gaze through the soft eyepatch at her absent, swimming, tear-filled eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Her cool, slightly trembling voice whispers in your ear, warm breath brushing against you, like countless tender, faint murmurs from different times and spaces."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The Mythag student's uniform, damaged by countless battles, slips gently into your hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Can we just attribute this to the Holy River's influence?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Today, allow me be childish. For the last time."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_4 = {
    Text = "I would love to go, Keeper. It has been a long time since I last saw my father... However, I am afraid I am not suited to appear at his house."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The same figure, the same voice, yet devoid of any trace of naivety. What remains is a calmness tempered by countless trials, and a hint of inexplicable, dissonant unease."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Following that voice under the light appears the unforgettable eyepatch."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_7 = {Text = "It is you?"},
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Forgive me. I said I wouldn't bother you, but..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49476_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Beneath her black eyepatch, an unusual blush appears on her previously pale face."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You asked everyone: Doll, Erica, Sylvia, Czort, Hannah..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_10 = {Text = "Keeper..."},
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Ramona takes a subtle half-step back, her expression suddenly distant and guarded."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_12 = {
    Text = "I'm sorry, please don't come any closer for now, I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The disturbance of the Holy River has affected many Awakeners. I thought... I would be an exception, given I'm Tawil's..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Ramona is Ramona. That will never change."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I am who I am..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_16 = {Text = "Exactly."},
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_17 = {
    Text = "You take two firm steps forward, stand before her, then take her hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Whether in Rye or in my dreams, no matter how many times you ask me, my answer will always remain the same."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_19 = {
    Text = "An irresistible force pulls you towards Ramona. She catches you as you stumble forward, her arms wrapping around your back, her chin resting lightly on your left shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_2 = {
    Text = "They all pointed you in the same direction: cross the campus courtyard, push open the ornate iron gate at the end of the stone path."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You've calmed me down with just two simple lines... Have I been too tense recently?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_21 = {
    Text = "You're just too tired. We both are."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Your hands instinctively wrap around her waist. The world falls silent around you; all you can hear is each other's breathing, as you draw intimate warmth from the embrace."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_23 = {
    Text = "...Thank you, %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Ramona is the first to withdraw from this sheltering embrace. She holds your shoulder, wanting to say something but hesitating."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Is there anything else you want to tell me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Nothing. Nothing yet."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_27 = {
    Text = "She pats your shoulder and gestures toward the path out."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Let's go back first, alright? I promise: tomorrow you'll see the usual me again."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_29 = {
    Text = "She needs more time and space for now, and you completely understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_3 = {
    Text = "As you enter the Keygrave, the storm clouds that have been brooding overhead finally unleash their first roar. A harsh, icy flash of lightning streaks down from the sky, leaping into the distant horizon."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Ramona lets out a heavy sigh as she watches her partner's figure disappear among the stone monuments."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Her throat burns like fire; every breath akin to a patient's painful gasp—but in front of her partner, she has strained every nerve to hide her distress."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Slowly, she sinks down before a key-shaped grave. As if guided by fate, she presses her ten fingers gently against the engraved name."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_33 = {
    Text = "She tilts her head, her lips slowly approaching the cold surface of the stone tablet, feeling the chill of fate with her own warmth."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_34 = {
    Text = "%player%..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_35 = {
    Text = "This is the name she would never forget. Ever."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_4 = {
    Text = "It's about to rain... Why would she come to the Keygrave in this weather?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_5 = {
    Text = "She's always been clever—\"be prepared\" might as well be her middle name. Paying respects to her predecessors just as a downpour starts? That's just not like her."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You weave through the various key-shaped tombstones and finally spot that familiar figure in the distance."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_7 = {
    Text = [[
She stands at the center of the key-shaped tombstones cluster erected in the year A.F. 315, bowing her head before one of them.
She seems immersed in an unfamiliar emotion, unaware of your arrival.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The cold, damp wind before the rain sweeps away all sounds of life; the Keygrave is a vast, silent tomb. And Ramona stands there, her black cloak whipped tight around her body by the gale, like a solitary, mournful gravekeeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_49742_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Ramona, it's me."
  },
  AvgDialog_49825_Content_1 = {
    Text = "It wasn't the morning sun of Mythag that pulled you from sleep, but a jarring sensation surging through your very blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_49825_Content_10 = {
    Text = "<Big:How dare you talk back!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_49825_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Hmph... They say \"third time's the charm.\" Today, I'm going to make sure you learn that lesson well."
  },
  AvgDialog_49825_Content_2 = {
    Text = "It feels like a thousand needles pricking from within—or the skittering legs of arthropods crawling along the inner walls of your veins. The dense, tingling itch stings your nerves, forcing your body into uncontrollable spasms."
  },
  AvgDialog_49825_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Stop fu@2ing pretending to be asleep! I know you're awake!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49825_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You struggle to open your eyes, and the sight before you makes your breath hitch in your throat—"
  },
  AvgDialog_49825_Content_5 = {
    Text = "An endless maze, the lair of the Ashen Mistress. A young woman with double pupils reigns amidst her swarming brood."
  },
  AvgDialog_49825_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Struck dumb? I didn't think these little ones had the power to make people's brains rot."
  },
  AvgDialog_49825_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Never mind, enough with the useless chatter... Do you remember? Before today, you've already rejected me twice."
  },
  AvgDialog_49825_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You were offered the great chance to join the propagation of the Ashen Mistress... And you dared to turn me down!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49825_Content_9 = {
    Text = "This human body of mine can't exactly handle the \"torment\" of your little spiders..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49826_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Keeper, was this your doing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49826_Content_10 = {
    Text = "And I'll share it with you... You only need to ask."
  },
  AvgDialog_49826_Content_11 = {
    Text = "We can wield this power together. Join me, and embrace this transcendent evolution."
  },
  AvgDialog_49826_Content_2 = {
    Text = "My doing? Don't rush to raise your weapon against me. Whatever's happening, we can talk it through calmly..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49826_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The moment you step into the ward, Caecus eagerly rushes towards you."
  },
  AvgDialog_49826_Content_4 = {
    Text = "My dorsal fin is burning... and so are my ear fins."
  },
  AvgDialog_49826_Content_5 = {
    Text = "He seizes your wrist and guides your hand to his trembling ear fins."
  },
  AvgDialog_49826_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The gray-pink ear fins, usually covered in a hydrating mucus, should feel cold and slick to the touch, but your fingertips now sense a searing tide of heat."
  },
  AvgDialog_49826_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Are you having a fever? I'll go fetch Lady Sylvia at once... and since you're an Awakener, we should also call Doll for a diagnosis..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49826_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Before you can finish talking, Caecus slides his weapon across the doorway, barring the door behind you. His breath, now closer than ever, becomes heavy, saturated with oceanic dampness."
  },
  AvgDialog_49826_Content_9 = {
    Text = "No... This is proof that I am evolving toward the true power of Aequor."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Farewell kiss"
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_10 = {
    Text = "But countless people have sacrificed their lives for a morbid belief."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_11 = {
    Text = "This is the fate of the Aram; we are born here and raised here."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_12 = {
    Text = "So you allow them to carry out these cursed rituals, letting them fall into the Storm Wall over and over again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Thais does not answer your question."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_14 = {
    Text = "She simply leaned in and gently embraced you."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I know you're tired, angry..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
You hold a grudge against me and don't understand.
But I have my reasons too.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Let me tell you a story, a very, very long one."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Long, long ago, thousands of years before the Holocene, there was a civilization that worshipped a deity called the Mother Tree of Abundance."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_19 = {
    Text = "However, the Mother Tree's will couldn't consolidate the empire's rule, so they devised a scheme."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Night has fallen, and William has retired."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_20 = {
    Text = "They selected many girls, forcing them to drink the Mother Tree's crimson sap and bathe in its essence until they became one with the tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Since then, the puppet-like girl has embodied the will of the tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_22 = {
    Text = "No one ever heard her voice or obeyed her words. The girl had no voice of her own, nor any will. Everything she conveyed was the decree of the King of Nineveh that he ordered her to recite."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_23 = {
    Text = "A kind minister rescued her from the clutches and told her that she could be herself."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Did the girl get away?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_25 = {Text = "Escaped."},
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_26 = {
    Text = "But the story did not end there."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_27 = {
    Text = "The runaway girl blended into the crowd. Cowering in a corner and fearing others approaching, she only received a piece of bread."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_28 = {
    Text = "They gave her bread, not because she was the Empress, not because she was the Mother Tree's agent... but simply because she was a child."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_29 = {
    Text = "In that moment, the girl and the tree's wills resonated profoundly."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You take a deep breath, ready to return to the camp, only to see Thais waving at you from behind the tent."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Then, the will of the tree asked her:"
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Are you willing to become the tree's vessel, to birth its flesh and soul?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_32 = {
    Text = [[
Due to a unique soul resonance, the girl could hear the tree's voice.
That night, she learned about the <Red:Black Dusk> knowledge.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Black Apocalypse... Does it refer to Dissolution?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
The girl returned to the tree but no longer obeyed the king's commands.
No... due to the call of their bloodline, all the people will only heed the will of the tree.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The girl is the tree, and the tree is the girl. She cares more about the survival of her species than her own life, hoping they can escape the destruction of the world."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_36 = {
    Text = "When the empire fell, she led a team into the deepest part of the desert, hiding in the fiercest storms to escape the massacre and preserve the last bloodline."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Is this... the nomadic tribe, Aram?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Long, long afterward, the girl disappeared once more."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Still, no one hears her voice, and her name is no longer spoken."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Your Majesty... What do you need from me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_40 = {
    Text = "But everyone follows her will, desperately reproducing to escape the end of days..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Only to preserve the seeds of \"Abundance\" when the end of days arrives."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_42 = {
    Text = "But Aram's bloodline relies too much on the power of the Mother Tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_43 = {
    Text = "This dependency is like a fragile sand tower: it appears solid, but one wave can completely wash it away."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Perhaps you do not yet understand; the Aram had no other choice."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_45 = {
    Text = "But you will surely reach the end of this journey with them."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_46 = {
    Text = "You are momentarily at a loss for words."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_47 = {
    Text = "When the time comes... please remember to call my name."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_48 = {
    Text = [[
She gently kisses your forehead.
Your mind falters, she steps back a few paces, and you reach out, but cannot touch her.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_49 = {
    Text = "You watch her figure grow smaller and smaller, until it becomes a tiny speck like a grain of sand, vanishing in the bright moonlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_5 = {
    Text = [[
Tomorrow is the Mother Tree revival ceremony, so I came to see you.
My little monster, are you prepared?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Instead of asking if I'm ready... shouldn't Her Majesty be the one to make adequate preparations?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Or perhaps, have you made enough preparations?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Ramona's frail and sickly face appears before you, fueling the anger in your chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_49836_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I mean no harm, and I will not act against the interests of the Aramder."
  },
  AvgDialog_49837_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Convergence"
  },
  AvgDialog_49837_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The scar on his temple, said to have been burned by his deranged mother, now resembles a shallow groove, oozing crimson fluid."
  },
  AvgDialog_49837_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The Silver Key shattered on the chest, and the standard Mythag gloves were stained with blood. Ominous slime dripped freely in defiance of gravity."
  },
  AvgDialog_49837_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Behind the Swaying Nightmare —"
  },
  AvgDialog_49837_Content_14 = {
    Text = "A massive mound of flesh splits open like a Venus flytrap."
  },
  AvgDialog_49837_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The folds of the placentas and malformed infants on both sides are as vivid as the bloody imprint in your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_49837_Content_16 = {
    Text = "In the midst of bloated, twisted flesh lies the final gift he relentlessly traced and sought, presented to you as the ultimate offering for this journey."
  },
  AvgDialog_49837_Content_17 = {
    Text = "That is the truth of the Nubia Core—"
  },
  AvgDialog_49837_Content_18 = {
    Text = "A small lantern."
  },
  AvgDialog_49837_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A sudden sense of unease rises, fear hammering at your heart like a series of heavy blows."
  },
  AvgDialog_49837_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You rush towards the camp beneath the dunes."
  },
  AvgDialog_49837_Content_4 = {
    Text = "As your fingertips touch the curtain, an overwhelming wave of fear grips you."
  },
  AvgDialog_49837_Content_6 = {
    Text = "This fear is different from facing hunting dogs or fighting the sacred fetus..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49837_Content_7 = {
    Text = "It was a bone-deep, indescribable terror that could neither be confronted nor undone."
  },
  AvgDialog_49837_Content_8 = {
    Text = "It's a floating nightmare, an abnormal fantasy, and an unbearable, suffocating reality."
  },
  AvgDialog_49837_Content_9 = {
    Text = "A huge, wild monster waved its slime tendrils, and William's thin body swayed like a lone reed."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Convergence"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You take a deep breath, ready to return to the camp, only to see Thais waving at you from behind the tent."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_100 = {
    Text = "But you will surely reach the end of this journey with them."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_101 = {
    Text = "You are momentarily at a loss for words."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_102 = {
    Text = "When the time comes... please remember to call my name."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_103 = {
    Text = "She gently kisses your forehead."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_104 = {
    Text = "Your mind drifts, she steps out a few paces, you reach out your arm, but cannot touch her."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_105 = {
    Text = "You watch her figure grow smaller and smaller, until it becomes a tiny speck like a grain of sand, vanishing in the bright moonlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
The Mother Tree's revival ceremony is tomorrow.
Her Majesty the Queen is looking for me at this time... What could she want?]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_12 = {
    Text = "As soon as the words left your mouth, you realized your tone was harsh."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
I... saw it.
I'm sorry about your companion.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_14 = {
    Text = "An inevitable silence lingers between you."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_15 = {
    Text = "This has nothing to do with Aram."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_16 = {
    Text = "It's not Thais' fault, you remind yourself, but the words that come out are as cautious as a hedgehog in the dunes."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Mother Tree Revival Ritual... You must have preparations to make, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You tried to make amends, but your words still came across as a cold rejection."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Where do you think the Aram Tribe will go after the Mother Tree's rebirth?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
On this journey, you've witnessed many departures.
But never has a death been so suffocatingly downplayed.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You remain silent."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_21 = {
    Text = "I know why Mythag came to Remouahe, and I know why you have not taken action yet."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_22 = {
    Text = "I'm very grateful to you for giving Aram a chance."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_23 = {
    Text = "But this opportunity no longer exists."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Thais, did you know the Mother Tree has been contaminated by dissolution?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_25 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_26 = {
    Text = "I know, I... knew it all along."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Then you should know, Mythag won't sit idly by as Dissolution spreads."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
I will stop the Mother Tree's birth.
Thais, we are now enemies.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_29 = {
    Text = "The once refreshing desert breeze suddenly turns thick and sticky. The dust in the air seems to scratch at your throat, causing a faint soreness."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_3 = {
    Text = "That's William—\nMythag's legendary Investigator, your guide on the path of Investigation."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_30 = {
    Text = "To your surprise, Thais didn't retreat but moved closer and embraced you."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Good child, I understand your thoughts."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I mean no harm, and I will not act against the interests of the Aramder."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_33 = {
    Text = "But the Aram had no choice. Years ago, the Queen's divine power began to wane, and even protecting the Mother Tree became a difficult task."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Only by harnessing the leyline power of Remouahe can we conceal the location of the Mother Tree with a Storm Wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_35 = {
    Text = "You mean... the Storm Wall was summoned by the Queen's power?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Yes. The Storm Wall... will keep false messengers out."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_37 = {
    Text = "But every time a ritual is held, many Aram people die!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_38 = {
    Text = "As long as the power of reproduction remains, the Aramite race will not perish."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_39 = {
    Text = "So you allow them to carry out these cursed rituals, letting them fall into the Storm Wall over and over again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Who could silently kill a legendary Investigator at such close range?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_40 = {
    Text = "This is the fate of the Aram; we are born here and raised here."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Countless lives have been sacrificed for your twisted belief!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Now, it's not just your kin, but even Senior William..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Your voice trembles slightly with a hint of choking, almost unrecognizable as your own."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Tell me, Thais, you don't really mean that, do you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Thais does not answer your question."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_46 = {
    Text = "She just pulled her arms closer."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_47 = {
    Text = "I know you're tired, angry..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_48 = {
    Text = [[
You hold a grudge against me and don't understand.
But I have my reasons too.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Let me tell you a story, a very, very long one."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You stumble back weakly, bumping into a towering figure."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Long, long ago, thousands of years before the Holocene, there was a civilization that worshipped a deity called the Mother Tree of Abundance."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_51 = {
    Text = "However, the Mother Tree's will couldn't consolidate the empire's rule, so they devised a scheme."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_52 = {
    Text = "They selected many girls, forcing them to drink the Mother Tree's crimson sap and bathe in its essence until they became one with the tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Since then, the puppet-like girl has embodied the will of the tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_54 = {
    Text = "No one ever heard her voice or obeyed her words. The girl had no voice of her own, nor any will. Everything she conveyed was the decree of the King of Nineveh that he ordered her to recite."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_55 = {
    Text = "The year she spoke out in rebellion, the girl was fifteen."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Why? Why did you kill him? He was Ameyet's father!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_57 = {
    Text = "He violated the taboo, Thais. He fled from the battlefield."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_58 = {
    Text = "The battle ended in a complete rout, and he was the only survivor. There's no way he can take on so many enemies by himself!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_59 = {
    Text = "You're still too young to understand the affairs of war, Thais."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_6 = {
    Text = "I understand your struggle, but now is not the time to show fragility."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_60 = {
    Text = "He should charge forward fearlessly and die with honor."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Isn't it good that at least one person survives? As long as one person survives... Ameyet can become a warrior, Ameyet's brother can become a warrior, and even Ameyet's future children..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_62 = {
    Text = "It's pointless to say any more."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_63 = {
    Text = "By the will of the Mother Tree, sinners shall face the punishment of being devoured by insects."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_64 = {
    Text = "I didn't say that!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_65 = {
    Text = "By the will of the Mother Tree, sinners shall face the punishment of being devoured by insects."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_66 = {
    Text = "I didn't say that!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_67 = {
    Text = "By the will of the Mother Tree, sinners shall face the punishment of being devoured by insects."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_68 = {
    Text = "The girl's desperate and loud cries went unheard."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Who... who are you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_7 = {
    Text = "He... left us the crucial information."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Good kid, keep it down. Follow me quickly."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_71 = {
    Text = "You are not the first girl to be turned into a puppet of the tree. Whenever a girl resists their will, they sacrifice her to the Holy River."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_72 = {
    Text = "I was born from the Mother Tree's nectar; I am immortal!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Silly child, they're deceiving you. Anyone who jumps into the river will drown."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_74 = {Text = "I won't."},
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Who are you, anyway? I've never seen you before."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_76 = {
    Text = "I clean your garden and leave before dawn, so you have never seen me."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_77 = {
    Text = "But you know my grandson... His name is Ameyat."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Has the girl left?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_79 = {Text = "None."},
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_8 = {
    Text = [[
Behind Nubia lies the Church of the Lightbearers.
Daffodil was right; stopping the ritual seems imperative.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_80 = {
    Text = "The girl realized many things in that moment. A soiled garden doesn't clean itself, and being unable to make a sound... is so painful."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_81 = {
    Text = "She voluntarily jumped into the Holy River."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_82 = {
    Text = "In that moment, the girl and the tree's wills resonated profoundly."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Then, the will of the tree asked her:"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Are you willing to become the tree's vessel, to birth its flesh and soul?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_85 = {
    Text = [[
Due to a unique soul resonance, the girl could hear the tree's voice.
That night, she learned about the <Red:Black Dusk> knowledge.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Black Apocalypse... Does it refer to Dissolution?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_87 = {
    Text = [[
The girl returned to the tree but no longer obeyed the king's commands.
No... due to the call of their bloodline, all the people will only heed the will of the tree.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_88 = {
    Text = "The girl is the tree, and the tree is the girl. She cares more about the survival of her species than her own life, hoping they can escape the destruction of the world."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_89 = {
    Text = "When the empire fell, she led a team into the deepest part of the desert, hiding in the fiercest storms to escape the massacre and preserve the last bloodline."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_9 = {
    Text = "In the vast sky, stars twinkle. The desert night's wind finally eases your labored breathing back to normal."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Is this... the nomadic tribe, Aram?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Long, long afterward, the girl disappeared once more."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Still, no one hears her voice, and her name is no longer spoken."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_93 = {
    Text = "But everyone follows her will, desperately reproducing to escape the end of days..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Only to preserve the seeds of \"Abundance\" when the end of days arrives."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_95 = {
    Text = "But Aram's bloodline relies too much on the power of the Mother Tree."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_96 = {
    Text = "This dependency is like a fragile sand tower: it appears solid, but one wave can completely wash it away."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Even if there's only the faintest glimmer of hope, I cannot let them give up easily."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_98 = {
    Text = "I don't understand..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49838_Content_99 = {
    Text = "To make farewells less sorrowful and reunions more precious... you don't have to understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_49865_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree looms unreachable, scraping the sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_49865_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Swollen tumors breed countless offspring; myriad Nubia rip from the tree's womb, birthing forth."
  },
  AvgDialog_49865_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree... is producing Nubia."
  },
  AvgDialog_49865_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Born from Aramite flesh, with the lantern as a core... My children, my poor tainted children..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49865_Content_5 = {
    Text = "She gently strokes a feeble Nubia, tender as a mother soothing a sleeping baby."
  },
  AvgDialog_49865_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Then, the Nubia's head bursts in her grasp, splattering sludge across her cheek, adding a touch of ferocity."
  },
  AvgDialog_49865_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Return to my womb, to the Holy River—your unfinished futures... shall endure through blood to the world's end."
  },
  AvgDialog_49865_Content_8 = {
    Text = "That, I promise you all."
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_1 = {Text = "Zzz..."},
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_10 = {Text = "...?"},
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_11 = {
    Text = "MIRYAM! It must be her scheming behind my back, making me unable to... unable to..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_12 = {
    Text = "...Unable to what?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Unable to stop myself from wanting to get closer to you... and..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_14 = {
    Text = "RRRRIIIPP—!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The next second, your pajamas are torn straight down the middle."
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_16 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_17 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Oh hell, it can't be what I think it is...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Right! I want to rip your clothes off, and then..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Goliath grips your wrist tightly, his flushed face almost pressed against yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Another tranquil night. You sink deeply into the soft feather pillow, your breathing steady and peaceful."
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Scorching breath grazes your ear, tinting your cheeks a rosy hue."
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_21 = {
    Text = "There's no time left! The only remedy right now is to let me @4 you. Once we're done, tomorrow, we'll settle accounts with that woman together."
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You'll just have to make do tonight... No. You should thank me. This is your honor!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_23 = {
    Text = "@4?? Mr. Goliath, please show some restraint... don't come any closer!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_24 = {
    Text = "<Big:Ramona! Doll! HELP—!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_4 = {
    Text = "WAAAAAAGH!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_5 = {
    Text = "A heavy blade splits your little bed clean in two. You land hard on your backside, every wisp of drowsiness shattered."
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_6 = {
    Text = "What's going on?! Is is the Sculptors' Association again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_7 = {
    Text = "From the darkness comes a ragged, trembling breath. A towering silhouette looms over the splintered headboard."
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_8 = {
    Text = "So strong, and so strange... this influx of power..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49869_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Keeper, I might have been poisoned by that madwoman."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The fierce wind and heavy rain outside does not wake you from your tranquil dream; in the darkness, only your peaceful breathing echoes."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Wonderful... Amazing! Yes, just like this!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_11 = {
    Text = "A tool that's just the right consistency, soft yet firm, one that won't tear my skin. A force that's perfectly judged, one that won't leave me with unsightly marks... Exquisite, the way you bonked me on my head, it's truly exquisite."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Leigh's praise is getting so dramatic, she almost sounds like an opera singer. She doesn't even notice a trail of blood sliding down her hairline."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_13 = {
    Text = "...I'll take you to treat that wound first."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Miss Leigh's wound is not serious; it would have healed in a few more moments."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_15 = {
    Text = "But I really want..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_16 = {
    Text = "...Let her consume a moderate amount of blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Really? Is that really allowed? You are truly so, so kind—"
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_18 = {
    Text = "...Via injection transfusion. Don't spoil her."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Although she has received her beloved blood, Leigh, confined to the sickbed by the IV needle and blood bag, still looks languid, like a wilting dahlia."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A flash of pale lightning pierces the night the second before thunder explodes, illuminating the shadow by the window."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Unable to bear her eyes filled with sorrow, you finally ask."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Why did you break into my room tonight?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_22 = {
    Text = "...I... I wanted..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Leigh suddenly leaps up, the needle rips out, splashing her own blood and the blood from the bag all over her."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_24 = {
    Text = "She buries her head in your neck, her icy breath making you shiver uncontrollably."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_25 = {
    Text = "I wanted the Keeper's blood... I wanted you."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_3 = {
    Text = "It appears abruptly, moving slowly through the bedroom, utilizing the darkness. The moment it approaches your bedside, bringing a cold, fishy odor that turns your pillow damp and chilling—"
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_4 = {Text = "—Bang!"},
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You grab the desk lamp and smash it hard onto the intruder's head."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Mmm... Mm-hmm..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_7 = {Text = "Leigh?!"},
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_8 = {
    Text = "What are you doing in my room?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49870_Content_9 = {Text = "I..."},
  AvgDialog_49871_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Keeper, you must have noticed the recent disturbances on campus."
  },
  AvgDialog_49871_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Uh, I didn't really notice anything... I've been busy with the Remouahe Event report."
  },
  AvgDialog_49871_Content_3 = {
    Text = "But now that you have mentioned it, quite a few Awakeners have been sent to the infirmary lately... Did something happen?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49871_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Affected by the <Yellow:Remouahe Event>, nearly all Awakeners are exhibiting a certain kind of... emotional disturbance."
  },
  AvgDialog_49871_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Guess there's gonna be more to write about in my report... Is there anything I can do?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49871_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Most Awakeners have been affected, including Doll. Researchers are looking for ways to calm everyone down."
  },
  AvgDialog_49871_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Until the impact fully subsides, do not let your guard down around the Awakeners. They could become a <Red:source of danger>."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_1 = {
    Text = "A hand, clad in sharp nail guards, moves between your cheek and neck. Its sharp tip finally unfastens the buckle of the school uniform, pressing a fingertip against the exposed collarbone."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Wanda roughly tears off your blindfold. She squints, an unusual aura of pressure, distinct from mere brutality, flows from her."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The spine needle grazes your collarbone, rough spikes tearing the skin. Wanda closes her eyes, savoring the scent of fresh blood in the air, her expression one of utter satiety."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Shortly after killing my fourth consort, my kingdom on this planet met its demise."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Come to think of it, it's been such a long, long time since I last had a spouse."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The spine needle is raised high, sticky liquid condensing at its tip, hovering close to your exposed wound."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Now is a good time, don't you think?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Away from turmoil and plague, free of worries and responsibilities... only trustworthy people around. This truly is the best era!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Wanda, is this really what you think?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_18 = {
    Text = "What do you mean?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_19 = {
    Text = "No worries, no responsibilities..."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_2 = {
    Text = "You are... an Awakener, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Choosing to face the end with Cambrian, you never regarded responsibility as a burden."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_21 = {
    Text = "How do you know about Cambrian's —"
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Queen of the alien star, before making me your new consort, please carefully examine your own heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The influence of the Holy River Remouahe should not change you."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_24 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_25 = {
    Text = "You are right, little pet."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The enchanting atmosphere dissipates; the spine needle retracts like the receding tide, swaying restlessly behind Wanda."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You may leave now. Tonight is not the time yet."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Is this not the time?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Her undead servants swarm and push you away, while Wanda lets out a pleased snort."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Blinded by black silk, your senses are heightened to the extreme by the darkness. The sound of the nail guards sliding against your skin blends with breathing, sending a shiver from deep within your soul."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_30 = {
    Text = "A Queen will not lose her sanity or retract her words, but it is indeed too early to make you my successor."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Leave, my little pet. But be prepared — I will call you back when the time is right."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Hello? Can you understand what I'm saying?"
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_5 = {
    Text = "A light laugh comes from above. Just as you are wondering who the owner of the laugh is, a spine needle wraps around your waist."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_6 = {
    Text = "It is like a temperamental giant python: when angry, its bone spurs pierce through your body mercilessly; at times, it lazily drapes over your shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Now, it glides across your body, its tip pressing against your throat—like an animal in gentle courtship, yet also resembling a dangerous dagger."
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Wanda... it is you, right!"
  },
  AvgDialog_49880_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Hmph... It took you this long to recognize your master? What an incompetent little pet."
  },
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_1 = {
    Text = "You stare blankly at the sticky, black remains in front of you. Your comrade, who stood by your side not long ago, now lies here, forever resting on this glacier perpetually covered in snow."
  },
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You look up. Like a sun-blocking cloud, a massive shadow rises from the side of the cliff, looming above you."
  },
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_11 = {
    Text = "On the massive monster's body, a huge symbol is carved— you have seen it in your dreams."
  },
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_12 = {
    Text = "That's... the Church of the Lightbearers!!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_13 = {Text = "Boom!!!"},
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Ah—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Big %brotherorsister1%!!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_16 = {
    Text = "A colossal object hovers in the air and crashes down. With a deafening roar that tears apart the mountaintop, it pulverizes the rock beneath your feet."
  },
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_17 = {
    Text = "You missed a step and fell into the deep valley with Helot."
  },
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_18 = {
    Text = "—Amidst your horrified cries, Helot grinned and laughed for the first time."
  },
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_2 = {Text = "Ugh—"},
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Countless explorers have died on the snow mountain, but such tragic deaths and the sheer number of casualties are unprecedented for the guide."
  },
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_4 = {
    Text = "He couldn't hold on any longer, his shoulders trembling as he retched loudly."
  },
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_5 = {
    Text = "They have also been Dissolved... The Dissolution here is progressing so rapidly..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Those fleeing monsters, along with the reactions of these team members, are just too abnormal..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_7 = {
    Text = "It's just us now. We must get down the mountain quickly, or else..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_8 = {Text = "Boom—"},
  AvgDialog_50760_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Before he could finish his sentence, everything went black."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The glacier roars again, beginning to shift its stance at an extremely slow pace."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Leave... We never had the right to leave."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The obsession and madness in another \"Helot's\" eyes suddenly vanished."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_12 = {
    Text = "She gazed at Helot with an unprecedented sense of composure and calmness."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Have you forgotten the things that once harmed you, the deep-seated hatred, \"Helot\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I never forgot... I just..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You are bewildered, \"Helot.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Only with sufficient Power can we complete our revenge. Revenge is our sole purpose."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Revenge... but against whom?"
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_18 = {Text = "Fate"},
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The two calm words made Helot's body tremble violently."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_2 = {
    Text = "This time, the long-hidden Ice Lake revealed its true form. You catch a glimpse of a thin figure covered in black pustules on the lake."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_20 = {
    Text = "No matter where we are, this mountain calls to us and devours us."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_21 = {
    Text = "This is our destiny, just like the filthy things we've experienced..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_22 = {
    Text = "You knew the answer all along but chose to ignore it, didn't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Compared to the people and things you hate, fate is a far more terrifying opponent..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You coward don't deserve to be called a warrior."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Your body can't hold on any longer... You're going to die here."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Even so... what of it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_27 = {
    Text = "She turns her face towards you, revealing a pair of sly fangs with a grin."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_28 = {
    Text = "The lantern light tricked me into coming here, intending to use me to revive @3. The mountain is calling me, trying to devour me. I knew it all along, but I still came."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_29 = {
    Text = "If the mountain wishes to see me, I shall come to it."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The fissure in the ice lake is widening, like a long wound stretching across the surface beneath the endless glacier."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_30 = {
    Text = "I must thank the lantern for giving me a chance to face Him..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You're such a coward, yet you still came, didn't you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I am your future, \"Helot.\" When you have the courage to raise your sword against fate, you will become me."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_33 = {
    Text = "The black pustules multiplied, like a swarm of ravenous primal creatures, greedily engulfing her body and crawling up her cheeks."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_34 = {
    Text = "She laughed like a beast greedily tearing into raw flesh, like a king about to ascend the Throne."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Watch, \"Helot\"... I will devour Him, grow stronger, and no fate shall ever hinder me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_36 = {
    Text = "No more chains... no more... betrayal..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Black pustules spread and accumulate over her, burrowing into her tormented body, covering her face with a mix of calmness and madness..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_38 = {
    Text = "I'll... <Big:Revenge!!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_39 = {Text = "Bang—"},
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Black pustules continuously ooze out, covering another \"Helot\"."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Like a ruptured pustule, black and red fluids splatter everywhere."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_41 = {
    Text = [[
The beast's final roar still echoes through the valley.
Where she once stood, nothing remains but a puddle of liquid.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_42 = {
    Text = "\"Revenge\"... huh..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Helot raises his head in confusion, gazing at the gray-white sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Coarse snowflakes rolled off her skin, melting into small water spots."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Was she... swallowed by the mountain?"
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_46 = {Text = "@2...@3..."},
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Before Helot could speak, your question had already been answered—"
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_48 = {
    Text = "The ground beneath begins to tremble. From the depths of the mountains comes a low, filthy call..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I can feel it... more, give me more!"
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_6 = {
    Text = "These strange pustules felt her summons, buzzing excitedly, rushing to her mouth, actively seeking her devour"
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_7 = {
    Text = "They seem to relish being chopped, revere being swallowed, and yearn to be devoured."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You approach another \"Helot.\" Her body is submerged in a dark blister, her form so ethereal that it resembles a wisp of mist, easily dispersed."
  },
  AvgDialog_50761_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Leave now, while you still have the chance..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_1 = {
    Text = "No time to think. Driven by the instinct to survive, you crawl through the slime secreted by the cave, heading toward the slowly narrowing exit."
  },
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Dust mixed with snow granules disperses before your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_11 = {
    Text = "A crack tore through the pitch-black tunnel, and a dazzling white light spilled onto my shoulders."
  },
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Hold on tight, I'll get you out."
  },
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_13 = {
    Text = "She shattered the cave rocks and pulled you out from the debris."
  },
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The debt I owed you is now repaid..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_15 = {Text = "...Ah!!"},
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_16 = {Text = "Helot!!..."},
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Before she could finish her sentence, she suddenly stumbled."
  },
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_18 = {
    Text = "—The ground that was once a hillside vanished into thin air, turning into a bottomless abyss in an instant."
  },
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Almost there, just ahead —"
  },
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Big:Boom—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The entire mountain is turned upside down, the angle of the tunnel suddenly changes, and it rapidly slopes downward."
  },
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The slime beneath you is slippery, making it hard to get a grip. You struggle to approach the illuminated cave entrance as the tunnel writhes more intensely."
  },
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The warm rock slabs keep contracting, squeezing your chest and making it harder to breathe. Even Lily's body is wedged into the crevice, unable to move."
  },
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The only exit is gradually devoured by black rocks, cutting off the nearby path and plunging you into utter darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Can't... stay here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50762_Content_9 = {Text = "Boom—"},
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Helot crouches, mimicking your posture, awkwardly patting Lily's soft hair."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_10 = {
    Text = "She thrust her sword into the rock. Wet strands of hair fell before her face, quickly freezing into icicles, shaking with her trembling shoulders."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The cold wind of the snow mountain rages on, with rumbling sounds continuously echoing."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Wave after wave of sharp pain surged through her, but at this moment, the voice in her mind was crystal clear."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I have many things I don't want to do, many... things I am forced and driven to do."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<Change>Hand her... over... to me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Have you lost the ability to communicate as well?"
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_16 = {
    Text = [[
In that case, put your words and feelings into your sword.
Let me hear your anger in battle!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I've been betrayed many, many times."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Why? Why? I must see the lady!"
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Don't fool yourself. Do you still think you're the noble regent's adopted daughter?"
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Lily was half-buried in the mountain, her black tears flowing uncontrollably, her vacant eyes fixed on Helot."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Dirty bloodline, in the end, it could only produce a <Blue:traitor> like you."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_21 = {
    Text = [[
<BigShake:Answer me!>
Have I been abandoned?!]]
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Yes, but... in terms of the results..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Her trembling hand could no longer hold the hilt; the longsword emitted a metallic hum from the rock's tremors."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_24 = {
    Text = "I once thought revenge was everything to me... But today, I realize that I misunderstood its meaning and targeted the wrong opponent."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Only with sufficient Power can we complete our revenge. Revenge is our sole purpose."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_26 = {
    Text = "If the mountain wishes to see me, I shall come to it."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_27 = {
    Text = "I am your future, \"Helot.\" When you have the courage to raise your sword against fate, you will become me."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_28 = {
    Text = [[
So, you want to exact revenge on the betrayer and protect Francis, right?
But battle isn't about that.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
Not for protection, not for revenge, not for proof.
Battle is just battle.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_3 = {
    Text = "She has endured enough suffering. Let me take care of it."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Your world is too small, so you always fixate on the faint glimmers others ignite, like a moth drawn to a flame."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_31 = {
    Text = "If you get the chance, go and explore a wider world."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Let go! You won't last long."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_33 = {
    Text = "I... won't..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Let go... You'll die if this continues!"
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_35 = {
    Text = "I will never abandon any comrade, no matter what... Never!"
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_36 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Lotan said, \"Battle is just battle, neither for protection nor for revenge.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_39 = {
    Text = "I've thought long and hard, and finally understand why you and your Awakener are so powerful..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_4 = {
    Text = "No... No, it can't end like this... There must be another way..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_40 = {
    Text = "I think Lotan was wrong. Perhaps, she didn't even realize it herself."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Lotan, Lily, you... all of you have something to protect."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Guarding is my destined role."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_43 = {
    Text = "This lesson, you have taught me, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_44 = {Text = "\"Boom—\""},
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_45 = {
    Text = "The mountain shook violently once more, and the thick ice on the lake cracked inch by inch."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Beneath the shattered fragments, black pustules surge and spread like boiling soup."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Helot, I will never abandon my comrades!"
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_48 = {
    Text = "I don't like being indebted to others. You saved me, so after today, we'll be even."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_49 = {
    Text = "I can sense another \"Helot\"... She is waiting for me in the mountains. She wants to join me in avenging fate."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_5 = {
    Text = "No time left, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_50 = {
    Text = "You haven't abandoned anyone. Let's walk the rest of the way by ourselves."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_51 = {
    Text = "We are warriors. Warriors are born to fight."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_52 = {
    Text = "This is the destiny we have chosen for ourselves... This is our battle with the mountain."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Helot pulls out the black spike."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Thick clouds blanket the snow mountain, with no sunlight reaching the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Helot's body is entwined by black mucus, bound by the chains of unconscious madness, locking her in layers of shackles."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_56 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_58 = {
    Text = "With chains on her frail shoulders, she trudged forward. Her body, bound by heavy shackles, struggled to breathe and collapsed onto the snow."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_59 = {Text = "Helot..."},
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The only way for you to leave Elworth alive and not turn into monsters again in front of me is this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Endless whispers of taboos fill their ears. In the viscous, dark sound, Helot hears the resonance of mountains and heartbeats."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Thud, thud, thud..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Beneath the frozen, hard rock layer, the awakened giant hums impatiently, yearning for her."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_63 = {
    Text = "She stood atop the summit."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_64 = {
    Text = "The frenzied mountain peaks stirred, the ground trembled violently, and the fierce cold wind tore at Helot's thin clothes, but she remained unmoved."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_65 = {
    Text = "A surge of black goo flows from the top of the snow mountain, encircling her like a towering wave—"
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_66 = {
    Text = "@3Return... Destroy @2... Forget @3@2... Come... Back to @3..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_67 = {
    Text = "...Return@3"
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_68 = {
    Text = "If we win, Elworth's ice and snow will melt. Then, we will reappear together."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Wait, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_7 = {
    Text = "You will die here!"
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Helot briefly turns her head. You seem to catch a fleeting smile on her face."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_71 = {
    Text = "She turned, raising the black spike toward the eternal blue flame—"
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Battle, begin."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_74 = {
    Text = "It was both a declaration and a command. Countless black slimes suddenly fell, engulfing everything at the summit."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_75 = {
    Text = "The Elworth Mountains trembled. The continuous mountain range stirred up a milky ice mist, with rigid and clumsy masses struggling and twisting desperately, as if fighting against something."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_76 = {
    Text = "The burning clouds are swept by fierce winds, and a massive vortex engulfs the entire peak. Terrifying power erupts uncontrollably, as if tearing the sky apart..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_77 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Time passed unnoticed. The dust finally settled, and the ground beneath no longer trembled."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Lily, now back to normal, walks over and takes your hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_8 = {
    Text = "\"Even so... what of it?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Helot... is gone."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_81 = {
    Text = "The mountains breathe steadily. You raise your head and look up at the sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Coarse snowflakes fall, piling up on your head and turning your hair gray."
  },
  AvgDialog_50763_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Elworth is eerily quiet, as if nothing had ever happened."
  },
  AvgDialog_50764_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Wine and news, you'll love them both. Rest well, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_50764_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Dexter gracefully gave you a slight bow and gently closed the door."
  },
  AvgDialog_50764_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Sometimes, when facing Professor Dexter, I regret not having studied rhetoric more deeply."
  },
  AvgDialog_50764_Content_4 = {
    Text = "She picked up the newspaper that Dexter had left behind."
  },
  AvgDialog_50764_Content_5 = {
    Text = "\"Recently, a major avalanche occurred in the perpetually frozen snow mountains of Elworth. Strange signs of thawing have now begun to appear...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_50764_Content_6 = {
    Text = "You quickly turned your head and grabbed the newspaper."
  },
  AvgDialog_50764_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The blurry image printed in ink shows that the snowstorm in the mountains has stopped."
  },
  AvgDialog_50764_Content_8 = {
    Text = "A tiny dandelion pushes through the perennial snow, peeking out."
  },
  AvgDialog_50764_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Welcoming Elworth's first spring."
  },
  AvgDialog_50895_Content_1 = {
    Text = "I can't... hold out anymore..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50895_Content_10 = {
    Text = "A familiar keen rings again over Remouahe, but softer this time, like a gentle breeze."
  },
  AvgDialog_50895_Content_11 = {
    Text = "In the haze, you glimpse that familiar figure before the Gate, glancing back at you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50895_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ramona coughs blood. It hits the ground and turns pitch-black."
  },
  AvgDialog_50895_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Two sharp forces clash in her mind; silver shrieks and blood surges batter her consciousness into chaos."
  },
  AvgDialog_50895_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Is this the end...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_50895_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You pant, vision blurred by streaming blood and sweat, willpower alone keeping you upright."
  },
  AvgDialog_50895_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Is this it? You're spent, yet the Mother Tree's embryo swells, warps, breeds endlessly..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50895_Content_7 = {Text = "Click—"},
  AvgDialog_50895_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Cold, soft feathers melt into silver droplets, rolling quietly down your bloodstained cheek, leaving traces like pure silver tears."
  },
  AvgDialog_50895_Content_9 = {
    Text = "For Mythag, for humanity's future... Please hang in there a bit longer."
  },
  AvgDialog_50896_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree's massive tumor bursts from a slender sword thrust; plasma sprays, drenching you in drizzling blood rain."
  },
  AvgDialog_50896_Content_10 = {Text = "Juliette!"},
  AvgDialog_50896_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Juliette perches on a bough, sighing down from above. She strokes the Mother Tree's arm-like branches as they sway wildly, like calming a frenzied beast."
  },
  AvgDialog_50896_Content_12 = {
    Text = "O Great Mother Tree, please come forth from the flow of life."
  },
  AvgDialog_50896_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Scatter your black blessings across the desert, and build stairs to the new world."
  },
  AvgDialog_50896_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Spare no pity for sinners! Seeking redemption, the Aramites resolved long ago to offer you all they have."
  },
  AvgDialog_50896_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Crack, crack—bones snap in chorus; Aramite flesh merges visibly into branches, twitching tumors churn, dissolve, recombine."
  },
  AvgDialog_50896_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Countless offspring and flesh congeal into a deformed breeder; the shaking trunk steadies gradually."
  },
  AvgDialog_50896_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Forever may the Light shine."
  },
  AvgDialog_50896_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Cough, cough!"
  },
  AvgDialog_50896_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The wild blood rain hits Ramona harder than you; she wipes the gore from her hair, coughing violently."
  },
  AvgDialog_50896_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Ramona, you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50896_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I'm fine—I can hold on. Look at the tumor!"
  },
  AvgDialog_50896_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The ruptured tumor sags like bled-out meat; the once-proud trunk quivers, as if voicing unnatural dread and unease."
  },
  AvgDialog_50896_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree... is it collapsing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_50896_Content_8 = {
    Text = "No, not yet..."
  },
  AvgDialog_50896_Content_9 = {
    Text = "How tragic—why waste effort on such futility?"
  },
  AvgDialog_50897_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The Mother Tree is still producing Nubia...!"
  },
  AvgDialog_50897_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Forgive me—the contamination Juliette caused runs deep. Until Tawil's purification finishes, I can't control the Mother Tree's actions."
  },
  AvgDialog_50897_Content_3 = {
    Text = "As the Aeon of Desire, it is my failure. Because of that, I'll lend you my Authority."
  },
  AvgDialog_50897_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Now you have a chance to wield Tifere Yesod's power. It doesn't come by easily."
  },
  AvgDialog_50897_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Use it all you want. Don't waste a single drop, hmm?"
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_1 = {Text = "Horla?"},
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_10 = {
    Text = "These things have all appeared in my poetry collection. Everything here is just as I imagined in my poems..."
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_11 = {
    Text = "{Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} Keeper, this is not the real Cité."
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_12 = {
    Text = "This is my <Yellow:Cité in the poem>..."
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Under the starlit sky of March Street, Horla slowly spun in circles, gazing at everything described in her poems."
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Sunlight fell like a veil, illuminating her curious, sorrowful, and puzzled face."
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I see... No wonder there are so many bizarre things here."
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_16 = {
    Text = "But how did Cité end up like this..."
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_17 = {
    Text = "I don't know either... And some things here don't exactly match my poem. That painter was supposed to be a very adorable old man..."
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_18 = {
    Text = "But I think, if we want to resolve the issue here, we might need to find that poem first."
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Do you still remember the way?"
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ah, I'm sorry, {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} Keeper, I was just distracted..."
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_20 = {
    Text = "In my poetry, March Street is close to home. I always remember the way back."
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_21 = {
    Text = "She smiled in the direction of the slums."
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Let's go, {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} Keeper, we're heading to the rose garden... to where I died."
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I have a guess... No, I'm certain of it."
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_4 = {
    Text = "This isn't Cité!"
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_5 = {
    Text = "......Horla, do you even listen to what you're saying?"
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Ah, I mean, this isn't the real Cité."
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_7 = {
    Text = "This isn't the real Cité..."
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The Caterpillar Tram that requires a poem for a ticket, Madame Butterfly, only No. 99 March Street, the Painter, Daisy Stars..."
  },
  AvgDialog_51150_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I always found these things so familiar. It wasn't until just now that I finally remembered."
  },
  AvgDialog_51254_Content_1 = {
    Text = "It cleanses your soul; fatigue washes away, unyielding spirit blazes in your chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_51254_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Thank you, Tawil..."
  },
  AvgDialog_51254_Content_3 = {
    Text = [[
I'll carry your will to the end.
May the Silver Key light your path.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_51254_Content_4 = {
    Text = "May the Silver Key guide us."
  },
  AvgDialog_51998_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The Perishites' mockery echoes in the room. The Perishite captain shakes his head, grabs Thales by the hair, and takes out a dagger."
  },
  AvgDialog_51998_Content_10 = {
    Text = "\"You reminded me. I should throw away everything belonging to Goliath so as not to raise Glenn's suspicion.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_51998_Content_11 = {
    Text = "\"For this, I can make your death less painful... Oh?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_51998_Content_2 = {
    Text = "He turned to Miryam. A small statue dangled at his waist. She suddenly widened her eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_51998_Content_3 = {
    Text = "\"Where did that statue... come from?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_51998_Content_4 = {
    Text = "\"Yo... So you can talk, huh? I thought you were a fool.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_51998_Content_5 = {
    Text = "\"Statue, where did it come from?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_51998_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Philistine Captain put down his knife and looked down at the statue on his waist."
  },
  AvgDialog_51998_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The statue is made of an ancient, dull stone material, depicting a youth seated on a throne. Some strange tentacles stretch out chaotically, obscuring the youth's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_51998_Content_8 = {
    Text = "\"Heh... this? It was found by the former chief, Goliath. He rewarded me for my bravery.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_51998_Content_9 = {
    Text = "\"I risked my life for him, and this is the reward he gives me. I wonder which foolish civilization left this behind—it's completely useless.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_51999_Content_1 = {Text = "Boom—"},
  AvgDialog_51999_Content_10 = {
    Text = "\"You, too, are being pursued and hunted by a higher will—just as This One is. A soul without a master, with nowhere left to belong.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_51999_Content_11 = {
    Text = "\"The Lemurians worship merciless gods and weak kings. the Divine Realm... Hah, it's so dull.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_51999_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A muffled sound penetrates through numerous thick stone walls, echoing in the temple's bedchamber."
  },
  AvgDialog_51999_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Tulu sat on the throne, resting his chin in one hand, looking exhausted"
  },
  AvgDialog_51999_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The people of Lemuria have fallen into slumber. He used all his power to grant them a beautiful dream."
  },
  AvgDialog_51999_Content_5 = {
    Text = "\"The storm of Lemuria will subside. The abyss of Lemuria will vanish.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_51999_Content_6 = {
    Text = "\"The king will protect his good people and bring about the kingdom of the gods...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_51999_Content_7 = {
    Text = "\"How ironic. Is this your will, 'God of Lemuria'?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_51999_Content_8 = {
    Text = "He lifted his head, gazing through the slabs, rain, and clouds, into the deep starry sky and even deeper dreams"
  },
  AvgDialog_51999_Content_9 = {
    Text = "\"You're already dead. You never cared about Lemuria.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_52000_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Virtue of lies"
  },
  AvgDialog_52000_Content_10 = {
    Text = "This king, praised countless times by the Lemurians, stood before Miryam for the first time."
  },
  AvgDialog_52000_Content_11 = {
    Text = "After entering this door, some will cry, some will go mad, and some have even attempted to kill me."
  },
  AvgDialog_52000_Content_2 = {
    Text = "He gazed at the pool."
  },
  AvgDialog_52000_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Smooth skulls rise and fall in the water, creating filthy ripples in the pool."
  },
  AvgDialog_52000_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Huge eyeballs grew on either side of the murloc's head, rolling blankly and staring at him. Its lips opened and closed, uttering vague syllables as if asking him something."
  },
  AvgDialog_52000_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Behind you, the tablet gate slides open."
  },
  AvgDialog_52000_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Praise our Lord... Lemuria, the great king..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52000_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Every time I meet a head priest for the first time, I always hear this sarcastic remark."
  },
  AvgDialog_52000_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The massive crown of Lemuria reflected a faint glow from an unknown source in the room, appearing disproportionate on the boy's body, yet it didn't feel out of place on his head, as if it were naturally a part of him."
  },
  AvgDialog_52000_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Sleepy eyes gazed at Miryam, like the gently breathing Aequor. His youthful face bore no trace of boyish emotions."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_1 = {
    Text = "But it's alright, my lord understands your fear. Our friendship will not change because of these insults."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Come, pray with me, Deborah."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_11 = {
    Text = "No... Miryam... I'm begging you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Say to me: \"For all who endure suffering, my Lord will repay.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_13 = {
    Text = "For... for the suffering... no, Miryam..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Tell me. \"For all sins, my Lord shall punish.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Miryam recited her prayers and came to her side."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Let me say a word to Nord! Miryam... just let me speak to him..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_17 = {Text = "Ah!!!—"},
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Sharp pain shot through her abdomen. She looked up to see Miryam's pale, snake-like hand gripping a dagger, carving a crimson line into her belly."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Miryam couldn't hear Deborah's piercing screams or see her face twisted in fear and excruciating pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_2 = {
    Text = "She devoutly placed the statue of Tulu beside the altar and bowed to it."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The dagger moved steadily, spraying warm blood onto Miryam's face. She chanted devoutly, stepping onto the path to the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_21 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Kill Miryam! Divide the Orne family! Prosperity to our alliance! Cheers!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Glasses clink, unrestrained greed mingles with the aroma of wine and meat."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Goliath licked his lips, savoring the intoxicating flavor."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Come on, keep going. What's the matter with you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_26 = {
    Text = "You... your face..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_27 = {Text = "My face?"},
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_28 = {
    Text = "He looked at the mirror-like smooth tiles beside him and saw a face resembling a fish."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_29 = {Text = "Ah!!!"},
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Praise our Lord... Lemuria, the great king... Tonight, I shall welcome your return."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Wounds appeared on his chest as if slashed by invisible daggers. His ears and eyebrows were disappearing, while his eyeballs rapidly swelled, growing sideways."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Intense pain pierced through the haze of alcohol and adrenaline, reaching his brain. He collapsed to the ground, belatedly crying out in agony, his hands frantically clawing at his face."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Is this? Ah!!—"
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_33 = {
    Text = "One, two, three... In the luxurious banquet hall, the nobles fell to the ground one after another."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Crimson wounds appear on them one after another, with blood and flesh forming an ancient pattern on their bodies."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The wails of agony converge into a grand symphony, blood sprays, filling every goblet."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_36 = {
    Text = "This is... this is... a Murloc ritual!"
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Sure, the Murloc Ritual. You all should know about the tragedy that befell the Ornn family."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Why... Goliath?"
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_39 = {Text = "Why?"},
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Please wait patiently. The moment of star alignment is approaching..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Goliath seemed to have heard a funny joke. He stood up from his throne and picked up his knife."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_41 = {
    Text = "By working with you, I can obtain a small piece of the Ornn family's territory."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_42 = {
    Text = "By working with Miryam, I can gain unimaginable power, turn all your families into fishmen, and take control of all your wealth..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Tell me, Mr. Edmond, if you were in my position, what would you choose?"
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_44 = {
    Text = "We... we won't go down without a fight!"
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_45 = {
    Text = "That's right! Goliath, with the honor of the Enom family, we will... Ah—"
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_46 = {
    Text = "A massive blade descended vertically, splitting the young noble in two and causing him to lose his ability to prove his honor."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_47 = {
    Text = "The doors around the hall open, and countless murlocs flood in like a tide."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_48 = {
    Text = "...Where are the guards outside?"
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_49 = {
    Text = "While you were toasting and drinking, your guards had already been taken out by us."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_5 = {
    Text = "She stood up and gently walked towards Deborah. In her pale hand, a strangely shaped ceremonial dagger glimmered with a dim light."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_50 = {
    Text = "As for the troops outside the city... there's no need to try contacting them anymore."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Blood stained every corner of the hall, screams echoing off the walls like a symphony from Hell."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Those who didn't drink the poisoned wine and remained sane trembled, their bodies too weak to draw their swords or flee."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Goliath admired the bloody scene in the hall, savoring the fear on the nobles' faces. He sighed in satisfaction and lifted the massive blade."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Drink the poisoned wine and transform into a merman, or perish here. The choice is yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_55 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_56 = {Text = "Ah!!!—"},
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_57 = {
    Text = "The piercing scream hit the tablet, producing a dull echo."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_58 = {
    Text = "She wanted to struggle and escape, but her body was completely controlled by Miryam, unable to move an inch."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_59 = {
    Text = "She wanted to faint, but her mind remained painfully clear, confronting pain and fear."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_6 = {
    Text = "No! Miryam!! Please... Please... Don't do such a cruel thing..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Say to me, \"All the devout will be blessed by our Lord...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Deborah's blood splattered all over Miryam. She recalled that, many years ago, at the Temple altar, she had bid farewell to her father in the same manner."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Parting is for a better reunion, right, my lord?"
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_63 = {
    Text = "She gazed intently at Deborah's abdomen as the dagger moved to complete the final stroke of the drawing."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Come on, Deborah. Talk to me. All desires..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Miryam's hand reaches into her own belly, stirring and tearing."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Deborah's hoarse voice screams in agony, her bloodshot eyes wide open in madness, staring straight at her abdomen."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_67 = {
    Text = "\"...The Lord will grant every wish.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Miryam tore something, which should have hurt, but Deborah could no longer feel it."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Her mind has gone numb, and her emotions and senses have abandoned her."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Look at me, Deborah. Look at me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_70 = {
    Text = "She vaguely saw Miryam pulling a bloody mass from her abdomen."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Sa... Sa..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Sarah. Miryam had told her that it was her sister's name."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_73 = {
    Text = "She and Nord have agreed to name their daughter this, but she hasn't had the chance to tell Miryam yet."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Call her Sara. Deborah murmured, but she could no longer make a sound."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_75 = {
    Text = "\"My Lord, may our song traverse the Aequor and accompany you to a realm of endless peace and bliss.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Miryam kissed her goddaughter tenderly, the baby's blood staining her lips. Blood dripped from the corner of her lips as she gently closed Deborah's eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_77 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I know you're afraid. I've seen many believers, and they all fear the end of this life."
  },
  AvgDialog_52001_Content_9 = {
    Text = "But don't worry. You are one of the supreme people of the Divine Realm; all that you have endured will be repaid in the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_52002_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The stars have aligned. The King's holy embryo has been implanted in the sacred infant. Soon, the King will reappear."
  },
  AvgDialog_52002_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Amid the deafening chorus of fishmen, Miryam raises the baby high with both hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_52002_Content_11 = {
    Text = "In place of her heart, the Sacred Fetus emits a pure white glow beneath the stars."
  },
  AvgDialog_52002_Content_12 = {Text = "Whoa—"},
  AvgDialog_52002_Content_13 = {
    Text = "All fell silent. The baby, covered in blood, squirmed, and in the ancient ruins, her belated first cry echoed."
  },
  AvgDialog_52002_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The silent stars listen to the oracle-like cry. A star falls, leaving a mournful mark across the night sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_52002_Content_15 = {
    Text = "—Another story about the stars is about to begin."
  },
  AvgDialog_52002_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The king will protect his virtuous subjects, bringing forth the Divine Realm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_52002_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The Divine Realm! The Divine Realm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_52002_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The fishmen cheered and danced in madness. Miryam stood in their midst. Starlight fell on her face, streaked with blood and tears."
  },
  AvgDialog_52002_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The king's doctrine will spread throughout the world. High Priest, please give this sect a name."
  },
  AvgDialog_52002_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Cold, burning eyes slowly turn. Miryam surveys her soldiers, her people. She gives them a high priestess's smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_52002_Content_7 = {
    Text = "We set out to sea, following in the king's footsteps. We returned from the sea, bringing with us the king's domain..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52002_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The world will call us Seafarers."
  },
  AvgDialog_52002_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Seafarer! Seafarer!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_1 = {
    Text = "The king will tell you. Pray."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_10 = {
    Text = "People around kept falling. Enduring the pain, Miryam recited the prayers from the paper."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_11 = {
    Text = "\"In the distant, dim <Abyss>, ancient great <Soul>s slumber...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Miryam spoke these words in ordinary Lemurian, but as she spoke, they turned into another language."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_13 = {
    Text = "At the same moment, her voice overlapped and intertwined, resonating in a complex manner. Like words, her voice formed a high-dimensional structure, as if echoing from an unimaginable space-time."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_14 = {
    Text = "\"...His will weaves like a starry net, awaiting your dream in the eternal Illusion...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Miryam continues chanting."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_16 = {
    Text = "At some point, the world before my eyes vanished."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_17 = {
    Text = "She is in the Aequor, and from every direction, she sees only the Illusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_18 = {
    Text = "In Aequor, tiny lights scatter like stars in the cosmos."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Miryam felt like a star, her light gathering in a certain place. She looked towards that place."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The old man left the room, leaving only a Priest and some guards inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Countless beams of light converge, forming a blurred outline. It is a shape composed of a body, a throne, and tentacles."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Is that... the King?"
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_22 = {Text = "Snap—"},
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_23 = {
    Text = "It seems he was startled awake from the throne by a certain voice. As he awoke, the entire illusionary space seemed to dim for a moment."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Behind him, the vague silhouette of an elderly man appeared."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_25 = {
    Text = "You have heard her voice, my Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Is she the one revealed by the stars?"
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_27 = {
    Text = "It's her. I've verified it. If the stars do not lie, she... is the future of Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_28 = {
    Text = "You don't think so."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Talented, but distracted. She cannot offer you assistance, my lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The light in the prayer room dims, and the statue ahead flickers with a mysterious, faint glow."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_30 = {
    Text = "She doesn't believe in prayers, in you, or in the future of Lemuria. She only believes in her family."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Miryam was a person rooted in reality. Such a person could not bear the fate of Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_32 = {
    Text = "To dwell in truth, not delusion... that is This One's creed."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_33 = {
    Text = "A noble wish, my lord. However, born in Lemuria, we each have our own duties to fulfill."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_34 = {
    Text = "We have no choice. Whether it's her, me, or you, the outcome is the same."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_35 = {
    Text = "...Boring. I'm going to rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_36 = {
    Text = "He waved. The elder bowed to him and vanished into boundless Illusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Before falling asleep, he glanced at those who had given him light. An unheard sigh vanished into the boundless void."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_38 = {Text = "Ah!"},
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Next came a heart-stopping sensation of falling, followed by a sharp pain."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Miryam picked up the prayer book in front of her."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_40 = {
    Text = "The pain didn't last long. Miryam left that Illusion space, looking around."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Some who were unable to read or recite the prayers have been asked to leave the prayer room. Of those remaining, some are lying on the ground in pain, while others, eyes closed in prayer, wear blissful smiles."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Deborah sat beside her, smiling as she slowly opened her eyes. Upon seeing Miryam, she looked concerned."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_5 = {Text = "Ah..."},
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The writing on the paper is not in the common language of Lemuria, but a complex hieroglyphic with more dimensions than real space."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The symbol is ancient, perhaps even from another world. Miryam had never seen it before, but its meaning entered her mind automatically as she read it."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Each word contains a vast amount of information, countless scriptures flood into Miryam's brain, overwhelming the fragile human mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_52003_Content_9 = {
    Text = "<Shake:My head... it hurts...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_1 = {
    Text = "As long as you believe in the King, the King will respond to your faith..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
May your insight foresee calamities,
May your wisdom guide your people.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_11 = {
    Text = [[
"May your insight foresee calamity,
And your wisdom guide the people."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_12 = {
    Text = [[
The storm lies dormant, the waters undisturbed;
The tremors subside, and the earth rests in tranquility.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_13 = {
    Text = [[
In your tranquil dreams, calamity turns into nothingness.
Under your protection, we welcome the kingdom of God.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_14 = {
    Text = "\"May calamity dissolve into nothingness within your tranquil dreams!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_15 = {
    Text = [[
"In your shelter,
we welcome the Kingdom of God..."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_16 = {Text = "Boom..."},
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Amidst the roar, several giant tentacles erupted from beneath the temple."
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_18 = {
    Text = "It's the King! The King's miracle has appeared!!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Followers raised their arms, cheering in madness."
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_2 = {
    Text = "So, tell me, do you believe in the King? Are you willing to give everything to the King?"
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The tentacles sway gently in the wind and rain, and everyone in Lemuria firmly believes that these great Lemurian deities possess the power to resist all disasters."
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_21 = {
    Text = "My Lord, Tulu—"
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_22 = {
    Text = "My Lord, Tulu!! Tulu!!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_23 = {
    Text = "She turned around, gazing towards the temple's interior, and knelt down"
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_24 = {
    Text = "In eyes unseen, there is no trace of the high priest's expectations or dignity, only confusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Hear the call of your followers. Bring us the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Bring us the Divine Realm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Our Lord! The Divine Realm! Hahaha... It's arriving!"
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Amid mad shouts, the tentacles began to move, spreading the silent Aequor aura into every Lemurian's senses."
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_29 = {Text = "Boom—"},
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I believe in the King, High Priest! I am willing to offer everything to the King!"
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_30 = {
    Text = "In the rumbling thunder, cheers fade away. Lightning illuminates the lonely land of Lemuria from the sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_31 = {
    Text = "At this moment of jubilation, the believers' movements came to a halt, pausing in their praise and faith for the supreme king, as well as in their boundless aspirations and hopes for the future."
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Under the heavy rain, the people of Lemuria fall into a deep sleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_4 = {
    Text = "I am the King's most loyal follower!"
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I do! High Priest, I do!"
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Then now, join me in chanting the King's name—"
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_7 = {
    Text = "She surveyed everyone in the square."
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_8 = {
    Text = "In the raging storm, everyone knelt down, spread their arms, and looked towards the direction of the throne in the temple."
  },
  AvgDialog_52004_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Beneath the starry firmament, on the isolated island of Aequor, I offer my devout prayers to my Lord:"
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Yes, Father... we will meet again in the Divine Realm! Our family will live together in the Divine Realm..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The Divine Realm is arriving, Father. Soon, our family will reunite..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_11 = {Text = "Poof—"},
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The dagger was thrust deep into Enos's chest, causing him to let out a painful howl. Blood sprayed everywhere, staining the right side of Miryam's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Miryam's eyes widen as she intently watches the cut between the dagger and flesh, as if observing a masterpiece."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The dagger moves smoothly, slicing through skin and muscle. Enos howls in agony, like a beast being torn apart."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Roars and blood surged in the ritual, like dense spikes piercing through Miryam's face and skin, stabbing into her heart and lungs."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_17 = {
    Text = "\"Followers of our Lord, open your hearts and embrace our Lord...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Blood and tears washed over Miryam's twisted, grotesque face. She chanted prayers, her hands moving faster and faster."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Dagger halted. On Inos's body, symbols of happiness and hope were drawn with his own flesh and blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_2 = {
    Text = "She wiped away her tears, slowly stood up, and picked up the dagger beside her."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_20 = {
    Text = "\"All the devout shall be favored by our Lord...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_21 = {
    Text = "<Big:\"Whatever you wish for, my lord shall grant...\">"
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_22 = {
    Text = "She lifted the divine blood and poured it into the symbol-like wounds on Inos."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_23 = {
    Text = "The moment the divine blood touched those symbols, it became lively and excited, like a snake sensing the heat of its prey."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_24 = {
    Text = "No need for Miryam's guidance; they follow the heat source, entering Enos through the wounds."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_25 = {
    Text = "As the divine blood flowed in, Inos's screams became increasingly intense. His wounds were healing at a visible speed."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Meanwhile, his features began to degenerate; his eyes became huge and protruding, his lips turned slimy, and his head grew flat and elongated."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_27 = {
    Text = "A gill-like organ appears on his neck, and scales replace hair, growing from various parts of his body."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_28 = {
    Text = "He still groans in pain, his howls gradually turning into screeches filled with the damp, foul air of Aequor..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_29 = {
    Text = "I did it, Father... I didn't disappoint you, did I?"
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The dagger bends in a peculiar arc, engraved with intricate hieroglyphs similar to those found in prayers."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The screeching stopped. Intelligence faded, and the half-fish, half-human monster stared at her with its large, blank eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Miryam walks to the stone table, touches the monster, and senses the strong fishy smell in the air as well as the sticky feeling on her hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_32 = {
    Text = "The smell and texture used to disgust her, but now, she finds them incredibly comforting."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_33 = {
    Text = "I really love fish. When we meet again in the Divine Realm, I'll eat the fish you cook every day..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Please wait for me, Father."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_35 = {
    Text = "She bent down and kissed its slimy, wet face."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Near the dagger, the blood of the god ripples slightly in the stone basin, reflecting an eerie red-green glow from the candlelight."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Severe delirium caused Enos to lose most of his consciousness. He gazed at Miryam with curiosity, like a newborn seeing the world for the first time."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Miryam, you are now a priest... Have you asked the king? Did the king tell you when the Divine Realm will arrive in Lemuria?"
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_7 = {
    Text = "I asked, Father... The King said, soon, soon..."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Amidst the tears, a faint smile appeared. She approached Enos, bent down, and touched his face."
  },
  AvgDialog_52005_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I won't let you down, Father."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Dream of Lemuria"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The clamor swirls like a school of fish around her. Between her and the swarm flows a silent expanse of empty sea, and there, in that sunlit void, her voice rises with crystalline clarity."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_100 = {
    Text = "The rain pounds his withered body, and the wind almost blows him down. At the highest point of Lemuria, the old man gazes at the vast island."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_101 = {
    Text = "The sharpness and exhaustion in his eyes have vanished, replaced by a clarity and curiosity as pure as a newborn's, gazing intently at the scarred land."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_102 = {
    Text = "\"Hehehe... Lemuria, what a beautiful place.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_103 = {
    Text = "\"What are you thinking now, My Lord?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_104 = {
    Text = "\"You always said you had no interest in saving Lemuria, that you could only feel tired. Yet for the sake of Lemuria, you confined yourself to the throne, trapped within your own dreams.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_105 = {
    Text = "\"The God has vanished, but you still pursue... I am merely a fraud. You are Lemuria's greatest guardian.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_106 = {
    Text = "\"One last look, my lord. One last look. <Italic:Lemuria>, our <Italic:Home>...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_107 = {
    Text = "The old man raises his head, his gaze shifting from the sleeping islanders to the churning sea on the horizon, then to the relentless thunder and rain in the sky."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_108 = {
    Text = "He stands up shakily, warmth melting in his profound eyes. His beard and robe flutter in the wind, and his eyes, now sharp once more, pierce the sky like blades."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_109 = {
    Text = "\"Complicated schemes, tedious missions, solemn promises—let them all go to hell.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_11 = {
    Text = "\"...In the name of Tulu, our Lord, I swear:\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_110 = {
    Text = "He throws away his cane, spreads his arms, and embraces the storm. He roars."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_111 = {
    Text = "\"Come, Cataclysm! Come, you wretched God!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_112 = {
    Text = "\"I am your accomplice. Let's perish with Lemuria!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_113 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_114 = {Text = "Boom—"},
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_115 = {
    Text = "A muffled sound penetrates through numerous thick stone walls, echoing in the temple's bedchamber."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_116 = {
    Text = "Tulu sits on the throne, resting his chin in one hand, his eyelids heavy with exhaustion."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_117 = {
    Text = "Lemurians have fallen into eternal slumber. He has used up all his power to grant them a beautiful dream, a mirage of his promise."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_118 = {
    Text = "\"The storms of Lemuria will subside. The abyss of Lemuria will vanish.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_119 = {
    Text = "\"The King shall shield his kind people, and bring forth the Divine Realm.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_12 = {
    Text = "\"I am a servant of Lemuria. I serve at the King's right hand.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_120 = {
    Text = "\"How ironic. Is this your will, 'God of Lemuria'?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_121 = {
    Text = "He lifts his head. His gaze penetrates the roof slabs, the pounding rain and the merging clouds, reaching the deep starry sky and the deep dream of constellations."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_122 = {
    Text = "\"You left long ago... You never cared about Lemuria, did you?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_123 = {
    Text = "\"You too are chased, hunted, and abandoned by a higher will. You are an isolated lost soul bearing no difference from me.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_124 = {
    Text = "\"As for the Lemurians... the god they worship merciless, the king they revere powerless. The Divine Realm... Hah, dullest, palest.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_125 = {
    Text = "\"I'm sorry. But this time, I am truly exhausted.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_126 = {
    Text = "He slouches on the throne, maintaining the posture of one hand supporting his chin. Sound sleep enfolds him."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_127 = {
    Text = "He slips into the same dream as his people. There, the sun bathes their upturned faces in a divine glow, and the melodic fragrance of laughter ripples through the gentle breeze."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_128 = {
    Text = "He has brought the long-awaited Divine Realm to Lemuria. He has brought the long-awaited lies to Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_129 = {
    Text = "He bids farewell to his homeland with one last lie—this, as the King of Lemuria, is his final exercise of power and his ultimate act of mercy."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_13 = {
    Text = "\"I will guide Lemuria's people. I will hear His voice and obey His command.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_130 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_131 = {Text = "Snap—"},
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_132 = {
    Text = "Rubble falls from the statue. The silent statue, once grand and splendid, is now on the edge of shattering."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_133 = {
    Text = "\"Father, look... those are His tears. Our Lord is mourning for Lemuria.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_134 = {
    Text = "She holds one of the fish-people in her arms. It blinks its enormous eyes, looking around blankly."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_135 = {
    Text = "She cannot find Enos. So all the fish-people are Enos."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_136 = {
    Text = "The torrential rain bellows against the temple walls with an impatient rhythm; yet, her hands remain gentle, stroking the glistening scales of the fish-people. A thick, briny stench fills every corner of the room."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_137 = {
    Text = "\"Teacher, the Lord... It seems that they've both given up.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_138 = {
    Text = "\"But I... I won't give up... I can save Lemuria, and I can bring it back. The Lord told me so.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_139 = {
    Text = "\"Mother is gone, sister is gone, father... is gone as well.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_14 = {
    Text = "\"I, together with all believers, shall await the Divine Realm.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_140 = {
    Text = "\"I'm afraid, Miryam. I'm afraid that everything we've done will turn out to be meaningless...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_141 = {
    Text = "\"Our father was an ordinary mortal, yet he never feared or gave up, not even against such frequent calamities.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_142 = {
    Text = "\"We are the High Priestesses of Lemuria. We will never give up... This is what father taught me.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_143 = {
    Text = "She smiles, whispering softly. Tears stream down, mingling with words she isn't sure are truth or desperate hope. They drip onto the fish-people's scales, glimmering with a faint light."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_144 = {Text = "Boom—"},
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_145 = {
    Text = "The ground shakes violently beneath her. The temple pillars struggle to hold, but the roof slates begin to crumble, collapse, then shatter to the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_146 = {
    Text = "The remnants of the statue also fall to pieces in such savage power. Roars of the storm and earthquake pound against Miryam's ears like relentless war drums."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_147 = {
    Text = "She closes her eyes, kneels before the broken statue, and grips little Miryam's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_148 = {
    Text = "\"Listen to our Lord. Submit to our Lord. Praise unto our Lord.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_149 = {
    Text = [[
"For the suffering, the Lord shall mend.
For the sinful, the Lord shall judge..."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_15 = {Text = "Boom—"},
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_150 = {
    Text = "The shaking refuses to cease. Gloom gathers beneath the massive, roiling clouds, displacing the sunlight; a towering wall rises from the distant ocean, its indigo staining the sky—"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_151 = {
    Text = "The ocean rises up like a waking giant, striding toward Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_152 = {
    Text = "In front of the ocean, this glorious kingdom shivers like a withered leaf."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_153 = {
    Text = "\"For the devout, the Lord shall grace.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_154 = {
    Text = "\"For the yearning, the Lord shall grant... shall grant...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_155 = {
    Text = "Raging portentous gusts strike the temple like a scythe through weeds. It heaves up the heavy slates and tears the foundations, exposing the sepulchral soil beneath."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_156 = {
    Text = "The ocean, once hunched under the sky, now straightens to blot out the last fleck of dismal light. Amid the sombre ruins of her faith, she clutches one of the fish-people, and embraces it tightly. Shadows expand; billows fall."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_157 = {
    Text = "Stygian smells surging towards her. Tears flood her eyes before the dark water arrives."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_158 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_159 = {
    Text = "\"My lord... I offer you all my devotion, serve you until the stars extinguish in the depths of time...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_16 = {
    Text = "A bolt of lightning explodes across the skies of Lemuria."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_160 = {
    Text = "\"You didn't lie to me, the Divine Realm will arrive, right, my Lord?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_161 = {
    Text = "For the last time, she looks up, gazing desperately at where the Lord's statue once stood."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_162 = {
    Text = "There is no statue. There is no Lord."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_163 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_164 = {
    Text = "<Big:Boom—>"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_165 = {
    Text = "The ocean reaches the withered leaf."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_166 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_167 = {
    Text = "In Old Calendar Year @3, Lemuria sank into the abyss. No one survived."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The thunderous blast silences the crowd."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Calamity... Is the calamity beginning anew?"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Your Grace... Is this... the calamity approaching?"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The howling gale drives the torrential rain, drenching the people in the square."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The cataclysms have never ceased. Lemuria sleeps alongside them."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_21 = {
    Text = "But Lemuria has always endured, hasn't it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Yes... That's true..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Your Grace, when will the Divine Realm... arrive?"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Very soon, my friend."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_25 = {Text = "So soon?!"},
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Yes, very soon..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Miryam steps away from her guards and approaches the altar."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Countless hands reach out; believers surge toward her, seeking the blessing of Lemuria's High Priestess."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Her gaze is serene, a faint smile on her lips, yet it is enough to silence the raucous crowd."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_3 = {
    Text = "A downpour like this has not been seen in a long time. People's cries ring out louder and clearer, overwhelming the storm's furious roar."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_30 = {
    Text = "In the clamor of the storm, she reaches out and touches the believer's forehead."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_31 = {
    Text = "The believer clasps his hands to his chest and kneels down."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_32 = {
    Text = "As long as you believe in the King, the King will respond to your faith..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_33 = {
    Text = "So, tell me, do you believe in the King? Are you willing to give everything to the King?"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_34 = {
    Text = "I believe in the King, Your Grace! I am willing to offer everything to the King!"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_35 = {
    Text = "I am the King's most loyal follower!"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_36 = {
    Text = "I do! Your Grace, I do!"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Then now, join me in chanting the King's name—"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_38 = {
    Text = "She surveys everyone in the square."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_39 = {
    Text = "In the raging storm, everyone kneels down, spreads their arms, and looks towards the direction of the throne in the temple."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Her Grace! Her Grace is bringing the Lord's prophecy to us!"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Beneath the starry firmament, above the ancient realm of the far seas, we pray for our Lord in uttermost devotion:"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_41 = {
    Text = [[
May His insight foresee calamities,
May His wisdom guide His people.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_42 = {
    Text = [[
"May His insight foresee calamities,
May His wisdom guide His people!"]]
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_43 = {
    Text = [[
May the storms lie low, the waters grow still;
May the earthquakes cease, the land rest in peace.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_44 = {
    Text = [[
May all disasters dissipate in His tranquil dreams,
May the Divine Realm arrive under His shelter.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_45 = {
    Text = "\"May all disasters dissipate in His tranquil dreams!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_46 = {
    Text = [[
"May the Divine Realm arrive,
under His shelter..."]]
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_47 = {Text = "Boom..."},
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Several enormous tentacles stretch out from the soil beneath the temple amid the roaring echoes."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_49 = {
    Text = "It's our Lord! Our Lord's miracle has manifested!!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Praise unto our Lord! Praise the High Priestess!"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Followers raise their arms, cheering in ecstasy."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_51 = {
    Text = "The tentacles sway gently in the storm, and every soul in Lemuria knows without doubt that the great Lemurian deity holds the power to ward off all disasters."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Our Lord, Tulu—"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_53 = {
    Text = "My Lord, Tulu!! Tulu!!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_54 = {
    Text = "She turns around, gazing towards the temple's interior, and kneels down."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_55 = {
    Text = "But no one can see that in her eyes, there is no trace of the high priestess's expectations or dignity, only confusion."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Hear the call of your followers. Bring us the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Bring us the Divine Realm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_58 = {
    Text = "My Lord! Divine Realm! Hahaha... It's arriving!"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Amid the frenzied shouts, the tentacles begin to dance. The tranquil breath of the abyss spreads from the tentacles, flowing from the temple to every corner of Lemuria, seeping into the senses of every Lemurian."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Her Grace will lead us to the Divine Realm!"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_60 = {Text = "Boom—"},
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_61 = {
    Text = "In the rumbling thunder, cheers fade away. Lightning tears across the sky, illuminating Lemuria's solitary land."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_62 = {
    Text = "At this moment of jubilation, the believers' movements halt. They remain suspended in their highest praise and faith of the King, caught forever in the amber of their boundless visions and yearnings for the future."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Under the heavy rain, the people of Lemuria fall into a deep sleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_64 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_65 = {
    Text = "The slate doors close with a prolonged and heavy sound."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_66 = {
    Text = "A thick, pungent odor of fish shrouds the prayer room. The once spacious room now feels unbearably crowded."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_67 = {
    Text = "All the fish-people have been pulled out of the pool and placed on the floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_68 = {
    Text = "The guards have no idea what their High Priestess intends to do, and they will never get the chance to find out."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Miryam walks to the corner of the room, squats down, and gently strokes the nearest creature."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Zealous cheers flood towards the altar like waves."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_70 = {
    Text = "\"Father... is that you?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_71 = {
    Text = "\"I am Miryam, your daughter.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_72 = {
    Text = "\"If you can hear me, please answer me... Father...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_73 = {
    Text = "\"...Woo...Woo...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Its gills flutter, its lips quivering with meaningless whimpers, just as usual."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Miryam moves to the second one, crouches down, and touches it."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_76 = {
    Text = "\"Father, I have become the High Priestess of Lemuria, I have done better than you've imagined...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_77 = {
    Text = "\"I haven't let you down, Father... Please open your eyes and look at me...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_78 = {
    Text = "The creature's large eyes wander around this unfamiliar environment, showing no interest in the High Priestess before it."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_79 = {
    Text = "She walks towards the third one."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The surging crowd reminds Miryam of the fish-people in the pond—eyes wide and unblinking, rising and sinking."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_80 = {
    Text = "\"I saw the Lord, the Lord we devote everything to... but He told me that Lemuria is doomed.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_81 = {
    Text = "\"He said I could save Lemuria, and I could bring it back...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_82 = {
    Text = "\"I can't believe His words. But if I doubt Him, I have to accept that we've been living in a grand deception. Everything we did, everything I did to you... are meaningless.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_83 = {
    Text = "\"I don't know, I don't know... Father, what should I do?\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_84 = {
    Text = "\"Please... just open your eyes and look at me, Father... Talk to me, and touch my head, just one more time...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_85 = {
    Text = "It stares at her with blank, vacant eyes, as if gazing at a swaying strand of purple seaweed."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Miryam turns to the next one, then the next... She crouches down, stroking and kissing each of them."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Her teacher burdened her with duty; her Lord offered her a hollow hope. But the one who could listen to her fear, depression, and sorrow, the one whose rough broad hand would gently stroke her hair and comfort her... is already long lost in darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_88 = {
    Text = "She leans close to each of the fish-people, whispering her desperate longing, searching for the slightest trace of him among them."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Is her father still alive? Can the one that survived still be considered her father?"
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_9 = {
    Text = "She feels as if she were sinking into the depths; seawater seems to fill her every sense. Images blur, sounds dissolve into chaos."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_90 = {
    Text = "She doesn't know. She doesn't care."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_91 = {
    Text = "The sound of heavy rain echoes within the walls. In the vast prayer room, countless fish-people lie on the ground, twitching their limbs and fins."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_92 = {
    Text = "A purple figure moves among them, searching, unburdening."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_93 = {
    Text = "High on the broken throne sat the shattered half of the statue, gazing down at her in silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_94 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_95 = {Text = "Boom—"},
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Thunder roars above the old man's head. He ignores it and climbs the last stone step."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_97 = {
    Text = "\"Huff... huff...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_98 = {
    Text = "He is too old; climbing this mountain alone is such a difficult task for him."
  },
  AvgDialog_54067_Content_99 = {
    Text = "He collapses on the barren mountaintop, gasping for air. His lungs, like rusted bellows, wheeze out a dry, weary lament."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_1 = {Text = "Ah! —"},
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_10 = {
    Text = "There... there is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_100 = {
    Text = "That scarred hand presented a slightly damaged yet still vividly red rose to Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_101 = {
    Text = "A fine poem, Horla... In the future, I'll exchange my flowers for your poems!"
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You stand at the edge of the garden plaza. Visible D-Rifts spread upward from beneath the small building, encompassing the open space in the center of the garden."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_12 = {
    Text = "That is... our garden... no... Colette, no..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Horla lowered her head. Colette walked up to her, lifted her chin, and directed her gaze toward the center of the garden."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Do you know, Horla? Many years ago, I watched that great fire start right here."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I've transformed this place into a plaza and erected my statue here... See, I understand symbolism too."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Watch closely. See it clearly. That is where we live... That is our garden. Soon, everything there will disappear."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_17 = {
    Text = "My life truly began the day you died. Today, it will once again move towards brilliance..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The black rift spreads rapidly. Soon, the entire luxurious villa is engulfed."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Garden, ashes, doodles, poetry, memories, laughter, oaths... Everything has sunk into the endless darkness."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Your ambush successfully knocked down Colette, but as you approached, countless flower vines sprouted from the ground around her."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Tick-tock—"
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Huh? What's wrong with my eyes...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Was that... heartache just now? Why..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_23 = {
    Text = "A tear slid down Horla's face."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Tears fall to the ground, like drops into a still lake. Silent ripples spread, brushing past every pale heart in this illusory world."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_25 = {
    Text = "!! No... this feeling..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Colette noticed the change in her emotions. She looked at Horla beside her in surprise."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_27 = {
    Text = "<LightGray:Is this... Horla's ability to spread emotions?!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_28 = {
    Text = "<LightGray:This Domain is based on Horla's poetry... Her Ability might come into play!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_29 = {
    Text = "You want to kill me and use the poem to get the life you desire... No matter what you do, I've never hated you, Colette"
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The spikes on the flower vine pierced your bodies, binding you tightly."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_30 = {
    Text = "The Colette I once knew was my best friend. But if you destroy this place... only the current Colette will remain."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_31 = {
    Text = "I can't... let the Colette I once knew be erased by you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Look at yourself, Horla... What else can you do besides writing poetry?"
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_33 = {
    Text = "You're right... Apart from writing poems, I'm not good at anything else..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Cité is a city of flowers and poetry, our home... but the roses have all died, Colette..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_35 = {
    Text = "These roses are the ones you once gave me. Today, I am returning them to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_36 = {
    Text = "She takes a step forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_37 = {Text = "Horla!!!"},
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_38 = {
    Text = "A massive rose spike pierced her heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Her blood flows along the black vines."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You... got my clothes dirty..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Black flowers quickly wither on the branches."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_41 = {
    Text = "A red rose bud emerges from the branch, unfurls, and blooms."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Blood flows along the vines, like the veins of leaves, spreading to every corner of the city."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Where it passes, the dark black fades away."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_44 = {
    Text = "It restores color and emotion, flowers and poetry to Cité."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_45 = {
    Text = "So... much pain..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Heart... feels as if it's been pierced..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_47 = {
    Text = "That's... Mother! Mother..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Child... my child has been born..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_49 = {
    Text = "As the blood spreads, scenes unfold before people's eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Do you know how much this outfit cost?"
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_50 = {
    Text = "It is the newborn's rebirth, the mother's lullaby, and the lovers' farewell."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_51 = {
    Text = "That was the most precious moment in your lives."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_53 = {
    Text = "The immense pain that Horla endured spread throughout all of Cité, rippling with her blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Rose's spike pierces countless hearts. Crimson flowers blossom in everyone's heart."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Is this... the poem you wrote...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Tears washed away her delicate makeup, but she didn't care, letting them leave messy streaks on her face."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Colette couldn't remember when her tears had started to flow."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_58 = {
    Text = "—Past scenes unfold clearly before her. For the first time, she truly understood Horla's poetry. She finally realized what she truly cherished."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Not just her. Everyone in Cité understood the poems of Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Colette's anger quickly vanished. She resumed her noble and composed smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_60 = {
    Text = "The desire for power fades, emotions return. The foundation upon which this world was built has vanished in this poem."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_61 = {
    Text = "She felt her power fading. She felt defeat approaching. She summoned thorn-like blades and walked towards Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_62 = {
    Text = "\"Colette,\" victory... When the old lady's dog passed away and she gave me its name, you were right beside me."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_63 = {
    Text = "I've never changed this name, because I don't want to lose again, Horla..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Colette sobbed in pain, staggering towards Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_65 = {
    Text = "The Domain is vanishing. Your plan has failed, Colette!"
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Even if you attack her now, it won't change a thing!"
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_67 = {
    Text = "You struggle to get closer to Horla, but thorns and pain surround you, leaving you immobilized."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_68 = {
    Text = "The spike extends towards Horla's head."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_69 = {Text = "Wait!!"},
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_7 = {
    Text = "It's all right, it's all right..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_70 = {Text = "*Snap*—"},
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_71 = {
    Text = "A rose was cut. Colette took it and handed it to Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_72 = {
    Text = "A fine poem, Horla... I'll exchange my flowers for your verses..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_73 = {Text = "Bang—"},
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Perhaps the Domain's dissolution changed the gardener."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Or perhaps the gardener's transformation caused the Domain to dissolve."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_76 = {
    Text = "The Cité in the poems is gradually disappearing, and the power supporting Colette has also vanished."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Her body turned into a pool of black sludge, mixed with scattered petals, sinking into the ground in front of Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Colette, Colette, are you finished reading?"
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Hmm... I've finished reading... but I don't quite understand it."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_8 = {
    Text = "To defeat me in my garden, you need to be both brave and foolish."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Ah, is that so...? This is my first poem. It's not very good..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_81 = {
    Text = "It's not you, Horla. I can't understand anyone's poetry."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_82 = {
    Text = "I asked many people around me, and they couldn't make sense of it either."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_83 = {
    Text = "I don't quite understand... What's the point of something that no one can comprehend?"
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Hmm... I think poetry isn't just words or images; it's like a key"
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_85 = {Text = "Key?"},
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_86 = {
    Text = "Yes! A person's heart is like a box filled with many emotions. This box is locked, and these emotions are usually kept inside, hard to take out."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Poetry is the key to unlocking this chest."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Actually, poetry doesn't need to be understood, or even read."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Everyone, whether they read poetry or not, sooner or later, will find this key at some moment in their life."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You've wasted your last chance to escape... This celebration, you'll have to see it through with me."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_90 = {
    Text = "You'll surely become the best keysmith!"
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Liar... You just said you didn't get it."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_92 = {
    Text = "I don't understand what you're saying, but I trust you, Horla."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_93 = {
    Text = "This poem, \"The Abode of Roses,\" is your first piece. From today onward, I will help you treasure all your poems."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_94 = {
    Text = "I'll use pins to keep them together, and when I have money, I'll print a beautiful poetry collection!"
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_95 = {
    Text = "She extended her hand, which she had kept behind her back. The hands were covered in wounds from thorns, dark and rough, completely unrecognizable as those of a young girl."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_96 = {
    Text = "This... this is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_97 = {
    Text = "The new nobles say that Cité is a city of flowers and poetry. A good poem can earn you a bouquet of roses..."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_98 = {
    Text = "My roses bloomed today. Not many, and all were used to pay the rent and land lease."
  },
  AvgDialog_54802_Content_99 = {
    Text = "But while they weren't paying attention, I secretly left a flower..."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Due to recent abnormal Awakener incidents, the school has strengthened monitoring and scheduled regular inspections to prevent accidents."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You're thankful you won't have to deal with that woman consumed by madness."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_11 = {
    Text = "However, your investigator's intuition suddenly registers something unusual. You stop and carefully observe the candlelight."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The shadows flickering on the wall, cast by the flame, are not mere shapes, but writhing, snake-like silhouettes."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Snake-like shadows wriggle around the candlelight, attempting to seize the room's only warmth."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Miryam turns. Her face is flushed with an unusual, hypnotic blush, and her voice is soft and happy, as if she has just attained ultimate grace."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_15 = {
    Text = "It's you, Keeper. Have you come here in response to the summoning of the Divine Realm?"
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Though her pale, thin limbs are entwined with writhing snake shadows, her hands remain fixed in a praying posture, like a nun bound to an eternal mission."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Your brain screams DANGER, but retreat is too late. The cold, damp snake shadow has already slithered through the darkness, coiling tightly around your legs and climbing up your back."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Your body feels so warm..."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_19 = {
    Text = "You have clearly replaced the faint candle, becoming the primary source of heat in this room."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_2 = {
    Text = "To handle potential rampages, room checks are rotated among idle Investigators. Today, it's your turn as the dorm supervisor."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_20 = {
    Text = "No, no! This must be a misunderstanding! I didn't hear any Divine Realm summon! I'm just here for the safety check!"
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Your frantic explanation is futile. The snake shadow drags you to the prayer table, forcing you to sit beside Miryam in front of the statue with writhing tentacles."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_22 = {
    Text = "I haven't felt such joy and excitement in ages! The Divine Realm has responded to me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You want to deny the situation, but seeing her blissful expression, you wisely hold your tongue."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The Divine Realm is urging me to act. I should follow this directive."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Now, this decree has been delivered to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_26 = {
    Text = "She turns her head, her trembling fingers gently caressing your face, cupping your cheeks as if in comfort, as if in invitation."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Come, pray with me. Together, we shall offer everything for the continuation of the Divine Realm."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_28 = {
    Text = "The icy touch of the serpent's shadow makes you shiver with hypothermia. Your resistance is crushed by the tight coils, forcing your body into a posture of reverence."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_29 = {
    Text = "And that was how you and the fervent High Priestess began a ritual of prayer... to appease her God."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_3 = {
    Text = "After being harassed multiple times, you nervously knock on each door and record each student's normal status."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Finally, you knock on one door, and only silence answers. Your heart sinks, realizing, \"It has finally come.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You look at the name \"Miryam\" on the doorplate, open the door with a serious expression, and cautiously peek inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Miryam? Are you there?"
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_7 = {
    Text = "In the dark room, a single flickering candle illuminates a dim corner, casting light on a nun deep in devout prayer."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Her posture is utterly peaceful and serene, suggesting years of intense ascetic practice."
  },
  AvgDialog_56163_Content_9 = {
    Text = "So, you were just praying. Sorry to interrupt. Since you're fine, I'll continue my rounds."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_1 = {
    Text = "It's so hot..."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_10 = {
    Text = "It's hard to tell if you're asking out of genuine curiosity or simply trying to distract yourself. You look around."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The flowers are more lush, the air more sweltering, and the architecture and music more intoxicatingly beautiful than ever before."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_12 = {
    Text = "In this world conjured from text, every corner is a metaphor; every shadow is a hidden suggestion."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I'm so sorry, Keeper... I don't know why, but the lines I've been writing today... they're always... always..."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Her emotions ripple through the air like waves. Your throat tightens instinctively."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You reach out and gently lift the parchment from Horla's head."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_16 = {Text = "Ah!"},
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_17 = {
    Text = "She reacts like a startled rabbit. Though most of her form remains invisible, she is clearly restless, and the parts of her face you can see are flushed a deep crimson all the way to her ears."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Horla... I like this poem."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_19 = {
    Text = "But... but it isn't finished yet..."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_2 = {
    Text = "A wave of unexplained restlessness forces your eyes open."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Then let's finish it together."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The... the next line... what should it be..."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The sun hath sunk, and every prying eye is shrouded in the dark..."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Both sun and stars have hastened to their rest..."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_24 = {
    Text = "...Save for the roses, nestled deep in secret within her garden wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Invisible words begin to manifest around her, and the garden of the poem begins to dim into twilight."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Horla's gentle voice draws closer and closer. You hear her soft, hurried breaths; you feel the trembling warmth of her skin."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_27 = {
    Text = "—There, in the darkened garden, you learned the secret of a rose."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_3 = {Text = "!!!"},
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Wasn't I just sleeping in my dorm...? Where is this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_5 = {
    Text = "I-I'm sorry... Keeper..."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Oh, it's you... that explains it."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The power to project emotions, combined with the Holy River's influence... what a dangerous combination."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Under Horla's influence, you finally understand what it feels like to be truly affected by the Holy River."
  },
  AvgDialog_56308_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Your \"poetic world\" seems different than usual, doesn't it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_1 = {
    Text = "On your way back from a field mission, you're caught in a torrential downpour, leaving you stranded in the desolate outskirts of the city."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You stare up at a familiar face, struggling to croak out her name through the shock and the lack of air."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Ghak... He... Helot!"
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_12 = {
    Text = "The woman's brow twitches, but her crimson eyes show no warmth of reunion—only a cold, bottomless gaze."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Just when you think your life is forfeit, her lips curl into a faint smirk, and the crushing grip on your throat suddenly vanishes."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_14 = {
    Text = "So it's you. I believe I told you that if I ever saw you again, I'd tear you to pieces."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You collapse to your knees, coughing so violently you nearly heave up a lung. It takes a long minute before you can even roll onto your back."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You wouldn't... cough... because we're... friends..."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Now that you can see her clearly, you freeze. Her clothes are plastered to her body, dripping with rain. The scent of blood mingles with the damp air, and her pale face is flushed with a sickly, feverish heat."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Massive shackles are fused directly into her body; her limbs, bound by chains, pulse with an ominous blend of black and red."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_19 = {
    Text = "You remember your encounter on the snowy mountain and instinctively swallow a lump in your throat."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Fortunately, you recall an abandoned factory nearby—just enough shelter for a traveler as unlucky as yourself."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_20 = {
    Text = "It seems you've misunderstood something. Don't confuse me with that weakling."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Seeing the killing intent reignite in her eyes, you move quickly to offer a \"friend's\" concern."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_22 = {
    Text = "No, no! No matter which one you are, you're still my friend!"
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Put that aside for a second—are you hurt?"
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_24 = {
    Text = "A strange, complex flicker crosses her face: coldness, annoyance, and a trace of genuine bewilderment."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_25 = {
    Text = "The wound is nothing, but I think I've been poisoned. My body... it feels strange."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The moment of vulnerability vanishes as quickly as it appeared, replaced by a surge of raw brutality."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_27 = {
    Text = "If I find the one who did this, I'll crush their vitals, piece by piece."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Realizing she's feeling the effects of the Holy River, you decide to keep that explanation to yourself and simply nod along."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Yeah... I hear you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You lean against a corner, listening to the rain hammer rhythmically against the factory's corrugated metal roof."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Regardless, I don't have such things as \"friends.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Your pulse quickens."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_32 = {
    Text = "But your aura is clean. No malice. You don't smell like a liar."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_33 = {
    Text = "She studies you once more, seemingly deciding to grant you a sliver of her trust."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_34 = {
    Text = "She sits against the wall, taking the very spot you had just vacated."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Since you were of some use before, I'm going to rest. You... keep watch."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_36 = {
    Text = "If I catch you making a move..."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_37 = {
    Text = "You shake your head frantically, doing your best to look like the picture of loyalty."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Her eyes slowly drift shut. Her wet body curls up instinctively, like a wounded beast seeking shelter from the night."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_39 = {Text = "Wait!"},
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_4 = {
    Text = "I'd give anything to be back in my dorm right now..."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Those fierce red eyes snap open, glaring at you with lethal impatience."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_41 = {
    Text = "You pull off your coat and gently drape it over her shoulders."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_42 = {
    Text = "She looks down at the garment for a second, but she doesn't cast it aside."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_43 = {
    Text = "As she falls into a deep, exhausted sleep, the weary Helot clutches the hem of your coat. The deep-seated hatred and bloodlust on her brow finally begin to soften."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Outside, the rain begins to taper off, pattering softly against the roof."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Inside the quiet factory, there is only the sound of your breathing, falling into sync with hers."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Two lonely travelers, resting through the long, rainy night."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Just as you close your eyes to drift off, a bone-chilling creak echoes through the space. It's the sound of the rusted factory doors being forced open."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Uncertain of who—or what—has entered, you hold your breath and slowly rise to your feet."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Before you can investigate, a sharp whistle tears through the silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You dive to the side just in time. A massive spiked ball crashes into the spot where you stood, gouging a deep crater into the concrete."
  },
  AvgDialog_57563_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Before you can even process the attack, a hand fueled by pure killing intent seizes your throat, pinning you down."
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_1 = {
    Text = "When Ryker won the pants off the seventeenth student at the gambling table today, someone finally snitched, running crying to the Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Don't be so ruthless. I'll stop, I promise! But only if you play <Yellow:one> last round with me. Just one. We'll wager... the most precious thing..."
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Ryker's canine tail wags cheerfully. His wet nose nuzzles against you, sniffing eagerly, like a predator hunting the juiciest bite. He even accidentally grazes your earlobe."
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Wager what?"
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_13 = {
    Text = "You tense up into an unyielding steel plate, warily eyeing the overly excited beastman."
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_14 = {
    Text = "No one at school has managed to beat Ryker at the gambling table yet; the so-called bet is no different from outright robbery. You begin devising negotiation strategies, preparing to haggle."
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The wager, huh..."
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_16 = {
    Text = "This seems to be quite a question. Ryker circles around you, muttering something under his breath, his words barely audible."
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Ah, you really are special. I can smell it; your scent is delightful. If only I could take one bite, if only I could have a taste..."
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_18 = {Text = "Hmm?"},
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Soon, his warm breath lingers at your ear. The greedy beast bares his fangs, his voice thick with desire:"
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Ryker! Cut out your illegal gambling immediately!"
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The wager. Let's make it... a kiss."
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You slam the door open with a <Italic:BANG>, shouting like a righteous police officer."
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The large gambling table in the center of the room is crowded with dazed, trembling students. Some even have heartbroken tears streaming down their faces, as if some diabolical paw had snatched away the most important thing in their lives."
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Boring, so boring! Such paltry stakes really don't do justice to your supposed bold spirits!"
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The audacious beast pounds the table, sitting smugly amid a mountain of bizarre spoils. Clearly, he shows zero remorse whatsoever."
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Oh, it's you, my Watson! Here to play a few hands too?"
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The normally laid-back wolf's eyes suddenly blaze. The moment he sees you, he leans in close, his furry ears standing straight up with excitement."
  },
  AvgDialog_57592_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I advise you to stop now, before the school authorities arrive and seal this place off."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Recently, rumors of supernatural events have spread across campus: music frequently plays spontaneously in the empty music room late at night."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The black and white keys of the piano draw you in like a vortex."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_11 = {
    Text = "How beautiful..."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You place your hands on the keys, yielding to instinctual desire, and begin to play, relying on your mediocre musical skill."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Starting hesitantly, the melody slowly takes shape. The music, gathering from trickles, merges into a smooth current that flows through the empty music hall."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_14 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Something in the air seems to gradually congeal. You maintain your lucidity, continuing to play without expression, your demeanor solemn, like a musical pilgrim."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Finally, a sigh sounds from an unknown place, seemingly from the edge of the sky, yet right beside your ear."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_17 = {
    Text = "You played it wrong."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_18 = {
    Text = "A pair of invisible hands covers yours. It feels like an intimate grasp, yet maintains a barely-touching proximity."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_19 = {
    Text = "You feel a force gently guiding your fingers, correcting one abrupt wrong note after another."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Repeated investigations have failed to find any person, and those who enter the music room to listen to the composition have developed varying degrees of madness."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_20 = {
    Text = "A dizzying shudder spreads from your eardrums throughout your body. The near-perfect performance immediately reveals the score's complete beauty."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Your breathing instinctively stalls, as if you are drowning in a torrent of music, gradually sinking in waves that are suddenly surging like steel and then soft as cotton."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_22 = {
    Text = "It's getting a little... blurry..."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You stare at the score, the keys in your peripheral vision dancing dazzlingly, your upper body unconsciously leaning forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Streaks of blood slowly seep through the score. You feel an innate desire to see the score more clearly, to etch it into your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Your head draws closer to the score, closer and closer."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The sigh appears once more. An irresistible force grips your hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_27 = {Text = "Stop."},
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_28 = {
    Text = "A discordant clang crashes onto the keys, and all music ceases abruptly."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Sweat pours off you; you gasp ceaselessly."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Seeing that no student or teacher dares to remain in the building at night, you, bearing the last hope, finally arrive at this mysterious music room in the deep night."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_30 = {
    Text = "At some point, the pair of hands covering yours manifests physically."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_31 = {
    Text = "They are hands encased in white gloves, long and elegant."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_32 = {
    Text = "You turn your head and see the owner of those hands behind you—a flash of helplessness crosses Hameln's cold face."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_33 = {Text = "It's you!"},
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You try to stand, but a wave of dizzying vertigo stops you."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The hands wearing white gloves gently press your shoulder and draw a flute from the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_36 = {
    Text = "The flute's form is vague and difficult to discern, yet it inexplicably makes you feel safe."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Please rest. I shall keep watch over you."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Hameln brings the flute to his lips. The ethereal sound encircles your ears, like gently embracing arms."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_39 = {
    Text = "An irresistible drowsiness sweeps over you. You slump onto the piano, sinking into a deep, sweet sleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Inside the heavy soundproof door, silence reigns, as the night should be, with only your own footsteps quietly echoing."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Hameln's gaze rests on your peaceful, sleeping face. A vague murmur drifts into the quiet night, unheard by anyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Forever, and ever..."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Strange, there are no traces of Dissolution either..."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_6 = {
    Text = "After a fruitless circle of investigation, you come to the piano in the center of the room and, as if possessed, pick up a few sheets of music resting on the stand."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Did someone leave their score behind?"
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_8 = {
    Text = "This appears to be an unfinished musical score, yet the existing melody is already enough to be a historical masterpiece."
  },
  AvgDialog_57723_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Your eyes fix intently on the individual notes. Almost obsessively, you sit down."
  },
  AvgDialog_57804_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Hameln's voice can be heard"
  },
  AvgDialog_57804_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Clearly out of control! I'll lower his fusion level first!"
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Keeper... zzzz... the other \"Doll\" has broken free... Black Pool... you... danger... zzzz..."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_10 = {
    Text = "You slowly stand up and back away, struggling to ask a question."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Did you suddenly come to see me because you've seen a new future?"
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_12 = {
    Text = "\"Doll\" watches you, following your steps, closing the distance as if you are engaged in some silent, intimate dance."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_13 = {
    Text = "The future cannot be changed, but recently I've had a sudden burst of inspiration and finally figured out the quickest way to reach the end."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_14 = {
    Text = "...And what do you plan to do?"
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_15 = {
    Text = "You cooperatively inquire about her unfinished statement as you step back, until you bump into the wall behind."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Naturally... I'll eliminate the greatest variable in all of Mythag."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_17 = {
    Text = "The moment she finishes speaking, you roll to the side without hesitation, arms shielding your head, and lunge toward the window on the wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_18 = {
    Text = "The glass shatters with a crash, countless glimmering fragments reflecting your and \"Doll's\" faces. You fall to the ground in a standard buffered posture, disregard the cuts on your skin, and start running desperately."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_19 = {
    Text = "The Campus."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The sudden Silver communication flickers and fades, revealing a crisis that makes your hair stand on end."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The Corridor."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The Underground Passage."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Again and again, you narrowly avoid that pair of scythes. You stumble into walls and fall around corners, yet you never dare to stop, fleeing for your life amidst heavy, ragged breaths."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Truly my best student! Let me give you the finest practical combat lesson."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Undisguised laughter, brimming with madness, pursues you like a ghost. The murderous intent almost pierces your back as you narrowly plunge to the ground once again, hearing the scythe clang into the metal pipes behind you."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Unidentified steam leaks from the pipes, filling the narrow space with scalding vapor and obscuring your vision."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_26 = {
    Text = "You keenly sense something and immediately hide in a lab, following the direction of the pipe."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Soon, the lab's sealed door bursts open with several loud crashes, and a familiar voice gradually draws closer."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Let's end our game of hide-and-seek here. Making it this far earns you an extra ten points on your final grade."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Her scythe scrapes the ground, emitting a sharp, grating sound."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The other \"Doll\" has breached containment from the Black Pool?"
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Don't be afraid. Once I kill you, I'll preserve your body in an ice coffin as a cherished keepsake."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You'll be my most precious, my most outstanding research. We still have so much time together..."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Through the hazy smoke, she catches a glimpse of a piece of clothing next to the large machine in the center of the room, and the corner of her lips curves up faintly."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Where are you, little puppy? Let me hear you bark."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_34 = {
    Text = "The ear-piercing metallic screech suddenly vanishes, and the lab falls into a deathly silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Time nearly freezes during the agonizing wait; her voice finally reappears, quiet as a whisper."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_36 = {Text = "Found you."},
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The scythe strikes the machine with lethal force, yet all that collapses is a lightweight school uniform."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Seizing the moment the scythe is stuck in the device, you press the red button gripped tightly in your hand. The loading doors of the furnace mechanism open swiftly, revealing the infernal molten scene inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You recall those eyes filled with madness staring at you. Driven by intuition, you immediately prepare to push the door open and quickly regroup with the other Awakeners."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_40 = {
    Text = "You appear behind \"Doll\" and shove her with all your might toward the furnace."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Engulfed by the flames, \"Doll\" turns back in surprise, her eyes still holding a vague sense of appreciation and a strange, knowing smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Lowering your head with a bad feeling, you see the doll's other hand gripping your last piece of clothing."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Your hands instinctively brace against the machine's frame. The residual heat instantly sears the skin of your palms. A sizzling sound accompanies the intense pain as you grit your teeth and resist the tremendous inward pull."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_44 = {
    Text = "The outline of the doll's body blurs in the dazzling firelight, leaving only its eyes, brighter than the flames, still staring at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Mythag's faculty and students finally arrive, having been alerted by your distress signal, and hurriedly pull you away from the furnace."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Gazing through the flames, you catch the last message on her lips just before her face turns to ashes."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_47 = {
    Text = "I'll see you again... at the world's finale."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The moment your hand grips the doorknob, every hair on your body prickles and stands up in instinctive warning, and your heart pounds as you abruptly crouch down."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_7 = {
    Text = "At that same moment, a sharp gust of wind sweeps over your head, slicing through a few strands of your hair, and the dormitory door crashes down with a delayed, booming sound."
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Too bad. I didn't expect the little puppy would be lying on the ground, waiting for me. Come on, shake hands?"
  },
  AvgDialog_57813_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You look up, and those eyes overlap between memory and reality, gazing down at you with the same joyful smile as always."
  },
  AvgDialog_57890_Content_1 = {
    Text = "I will accelerate the fusion of Dark Tawil. How will you respond, Keeper?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Uninvited guest"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_10 = {
    Text = "No. What if it's already nighttime?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_11 = {
    Text = "You quickly roll off the bed, precisely locating the pen, draft paper, and eraser, and shove them into your bag."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Once everything is ready, you take a deep breath and open the dormitory door—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Huh...? This isn't the school I'm familiar with."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_14 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I see, this must be a dream! Good, I'll go back to sleep..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You quickly turn around, but the dormitory door—and indeed, the entire building—is nowhere to be found."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_17 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You had to turn around again and look at the street ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Is anyone there—Hello—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Various animals dwell here, and occasionally, some demonic entities appear."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Good morning, good afternoon, good evening—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Glug, glug!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Thank goodness, something finally responded to me!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_23 = {
    Text = "You excitedly rush toward the source of the sound, only to find a small red mailbox."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Glug glug, indigestion, help... help..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_25 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Whoa, ugh!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_26 = {
    Text = "The mailbox twitched nervously, then spat out a damp letter."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Is it for me? It looks a bit disgusting..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_28 = {
    Text = "It's a windless night. The buildings are bathed in dark red moonlight, and the tightly shut doors prevent anyone from entering."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_29 = {
    Text = "You are the only living being within a hundred miles."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Jingle-jingle—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Open the envelope"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_31 = {
    Text = "You try to ignore the sticky sensation on your fingertips as you carefully open the envelope."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_32 = {
    Text = "To the distant recipient:\n\nPlease arrive at Ferle Manor before midnight.\n<Red:Be punctual, or face the consequences (brain@2 exploded to @3)!>\nManor address: Confidential.\n\n-▼-"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_33 = {
    Text = "The Ferland Manor? I remember that's Mr. Dexter's place. Since when did he start playing pranks too...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Plus, I didn't bring my watch, so I can't even tell the time—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Tick tock. Tick tock."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_36 = {
    Text = "A huge clock appeared in the sky at some point, with its hour and minute hands stopping precisely at 11 o'clock."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_37 = {
    Text = "The thin second hand continues to move forward at a steady pace, cold and meticulous."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_38 = {
    Text = "What... is going on..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Huh, did you receive the same letter as I did?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Mm... so sleepy, don't bother me."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Who's there?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Sorry, {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} Keeper! You seemed pretty focused. I called you several times..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Don't you remember me? I'm Elsa. We took Miss Doll's Introduction to Dissolution together."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Elsa... I remember now, she was the one who often borrowed notes from Ramona."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_44 = {
    Text = "<Small:Sorry, I keep failing my courses...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Elsa lowered her head, hugging the heart-shaped pillow tightly in despair."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Don't be sad, Ms. Elsa. Failing Ms. Doll's class is a rite of passage for most investigators."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_47 = {
    Text = "By the way, you said you received the same letter. Can you see it too?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_48 = {
    Text = "You point to the giant clock hanging above the full moon."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_49 = {
    Text = "I can see it. But I'm lost, unable to find the right direction, and I have less than a minute left."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_5 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Strange, my countdown still has one hour remaining. Could it be because you entered this world first?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_51 = {
    Text = "I don't know... It's just a prank, right, {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_52 = {
    Text = "I haven't been on any field missions, so I have no experience with abnormal events..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Honestly, it's the first time I've encountered this situation as well."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Countdown ends in: <Red:5> seconds"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_55 = {
    Text = "You gently hold Elsa's hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_56 = {
    Text = "With only a minute left, not even a time machine can help. But don't be afraid."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Time until countdown ends: <Red:0> seconds"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_58 = {
    Text = "No matter what happens next, I will protect —"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_59 = {Text = "Your..."},
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Oh no, today's the Intro to Dissolution Studies exam. What time is it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Elsa's head burst into a warm mass of brain matter. The viscous liquid splattered onto your face, filling the air with the metallic smell of blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_61 = {
    Text = "%player%@2, save @3..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Dark sludge continuously oozes from the broken neck, rapidly forming another pale and unfamiliar face."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_63 = {
    Text = "<Change>Save me, save me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Miss Elsa?! What... is going on..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_66 = {
    Text = "The beast's blade cut through the air, slicing \"Elsa\" in half. Black D-slime gushed out like blood."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_67 = {
    Text = "It's futile. She lost her mind long ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Mr. Ryker?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Ryker retracted his beast claws and walked toward you with a light step."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_7 = {
    Text = "6:37, still early..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Why do you have such a tearful expression? Don't worry, this place is probably someone's Domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_71 = {Text = "Domain...?"},
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Mm. In other words, this Elsa is most likely still alive in reality."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_73 = {
    Text = "As expected of the detective, spotting it right away. What is your reasoning?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_74 = {
    Text = "It was on a night like this that I first met Elsa."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_75 = {
    Text = "At that time, she was being chased by a bunch of Dissolution monsters. I had just come out of the tavern, showed her a way, and killed the monsters chasing her."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_76 = {
    Text = "We met again just now. Same time, same place, but I gave her the wrong directions, causing her to get hurt. So that means—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_77 = {
    Text = "In other words?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_78 = {
    Text = "My good luck has disappeared! This is something that absolutely cannot happen, so I logically conclude that this isn't reality."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Or you could slap me twice to check if this is a dream? I've already slapped myself several times just now, but it didn't help."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You fumbled around and pressed the alarm switch, falling back into a deep sleep."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_80 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_81 = {
    Text = "All I know is that I don't want my head to explode, whether in the Domain or in reality."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_82 = {
    Text = "You desperately need my help! On my way, I ran into quite a few latecomers like Elsa. We'd better take the aerial route."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Ryker spoke and pointed to the roof of a nearby building."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_84 = {
    Text = "You mean to fly over from the rooftop?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_85 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I'm just an ordinary Keeper and can't join you in your acrobatic adventures—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_86 = {
    Text = "In the next second, Ryker threw you onto his back and leapt into the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Hold on tight, {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_88 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Wahhh!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_89 = {
    Text = "You grab onto Ryker's collar in fear. The crouching detective nimbly leaps across rooftops large and small, weaving through the densely packed buildings of Londinium."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_9 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_90 = {
    Text = "A man and a wolf assault under the quiet moon."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_91 = {
    Text = "You only hear the pure sound of the wind. You lower yourself and lean into the soft fur beneath you."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_92 = {
    Text = "How was it? Was it fun?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Never expected you to have this kind of ability...<Big:Slow down, request to slow down!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Ryker laughed heartily, his chest vibrating as if every cell in his body was cheering and leaping with joy."
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_95 = {
    Text = "That's what a wolf should do! I'm just returning to my old ways, understand?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_96 = {
    Text = "I told you, <BigShake:Slow Down!!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58289_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Easy there, don't mess with my fur!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Haunted house"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_10 = {
    Text = "The game at the table is in full swing, and no one pays attention to your minor question."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_11 = {
    Text = "<BigShake:Sorry to disturb your fun!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Does anyone remember we're trapped in the domain of a damn mad deity?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Correction: a mad and forgetful deity. What we need to do now is conserve our energy until He remembers the question to ask, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Straight flush, nice!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_15 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Fine, I'll conduct an investigation nearby."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_17 = {
    Text = [[
Ferland Manor
Study on the First Floor]]
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Mm... All of this guy's books are fancy hardcover editions that have never been opened. How on earth did he become a professor at Mythag?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Huh, what's this?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Ferland Manor
Two Hours Later]]
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_20 = {
    Text = "In a neglected corner, a black coffin catches your attention."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Complex patterns and symbols are painted in gold on the sides of the coffin, with dense black mist faintly seeping from the central gap."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Mm—can't push it open at all."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Looks like something in the style of Remouahe. Where did Dexter get this from?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Curiously, you reached out and gently touched the gilded patterns on the side of the coffin, but then—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_25 = {
    Text = [[
Apophis, the Black Pharaoh, is Karnak.
You honor him; he lives, he lives, he lives.]]
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Apophis, he's not dead, he's not dead, Apophis."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_27 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_28 = {
    Text = "What's wrong, Noble? Your complexion looks so pale."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I have an urgent matter to attend to. I'll be back shortly."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_3 = {
    Text = "It seems Lady Luck has not favored you tonight, Mr. Ryker."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Another one ran off, looks like I'm about to break even... Where are the robotic assistant and magician?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Mm, I just saw Miss Erica heading upstairs. As for Miss Casiah, no one has seen her since she returned."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I'm a bit tired too. I want to get some fresh air."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_33 = {
    Text = "But it's snowing heavily outside. You'll catch a cold, Lady Sorel!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_34 = {
    Text = "This is not the real world. There's no need to stick to conventions. Besides, it's nice to take a moment to enjoy the snowy scenery, isn't it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Sorel left with graceful steps, and the once lively hall instantly became quiet."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_36 = {
    Text = "<SmallShake:Boss, the card game is just a cover, right? I know you must have a plan!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_37 = {Text = "Uh..."},
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Right! Mr. Dexter's reaction was strange just now. Let's go check his bedroom."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Wow! The detective game has finally begun!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The pot has exceeded 10,000 Leo Fang. Do you want to raise?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_40 = {
    Text = [[
Ferland Manor
Stairway]]
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Boss, are you sure Mr. Dexter is in his bedroom? I thought I saw him heading towards the study."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Mm... It's hard to explain my reasoning process. You can think of it as a strange intuition."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_43 = {
    Text = "I see! This must be the legendary intuition of a famous detective!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, boss. I won't question a single word."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Hannah pats her chest, then takes out her magnifying glass to inspect the surroundings."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Investigation Operation 215 officially begins! First, the staircase carved from ebony appears before us—modest yet luxurious, detached from worldly concerns..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Thinking of a career change, Ms. Hannah? Suddenly, I feel you'd be a great fit for selling ads at <Blue:Heinz Co.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Please don't interrupt others' investigation! Lastly, there's the carved window by the stairs—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_49 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_5 = {
    Text = "...Of course."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Not far from where the lens was pointed, a shadowy figure flitted past the window."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Aah! G-g-ghost!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Speak in a way that I can understand, Miss Hannah."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_53 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Mr. Dexter's ghost! Right at the stairway! Floating up, up, and away!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Ryker stepped forward and opened the window. The wind howled, and snowflakes swirled aimlessly, drifting down in all directions."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_55 = {
    Text = "He looked up, the warm light from the second-floor room casting a faint orange glow on the snowflakes."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Interesting, more than one room has its lights on... let's go take a look."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_57 = {
    Text = [[
Ferland Manor
Second-Floor Hallway]]
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Hmm, the door is locked."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Mr. Dexter, are you in there? Are you feeling any better?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Glad to hear that, Mr. Ryker. Once we're out of the Domain, I'll have the butler send you all the bills."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_60 = {
    Text = "The room was deathly silent. After a while, Dexter's muffled voice came from inside."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I'm not feeling well. Can I take a short break?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_62 = {
    Text = "You guessed it right. He's really inside. What's the plan now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Let's retreat. This is the mansion of a noble lord; we should observe basic etiquette."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Ryker spoke while taking a few steps back."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Then he suddenly accelerated and leapt, kicking the door—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_66 = {Text = "Splash!!"},
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_67 = {
    Text = "The sturdy oak door was kicked open, leaving a large hole. Ryker reached in, easily found the handle, and calmly opened the door."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Ladies first, please —"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_69 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Send our bill to him as well, hehehe~"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_70 = {
    Text = "<Shake:What happened to etiquette and manners?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Sorry, my limited manners and etiquette only apply to humans. Open your eyes wide, what is that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Following Ryker's gaze, Hannah sees a black gramophone beside the desk. The black record is slowly spinning."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I'm not feeling well. Can I take a short break?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Sorry @2... Not feeling well... Resting..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Rest rest@2 rest..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Everyone, please leave as soon as possible and do not disturb Mr. Dexter's rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_77 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Whoa!! When did you...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_78 = {
    Text = "Miss Erica, even though that guy has turned you into an idiot, I still have to remind you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Not even a single hair of Dexter's can be found here."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Damn it! That guy N must have done something to me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Everyone, please leave as soon as possible, and do not..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Never mind her for now. What's going on with this gramophone?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Simple. Someone fabricated an alibi, but I saw through it immediately."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_83 = {
    Text = "I see. I get it! In detective novels, where there's an alibi, there's a murder—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_84 = {Text = "Bang!"},
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_85 = {
    Text = "A sudden gunshot pierces the silent night."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_86 = {
    Text = "<Shake:That was... from downstairs...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Go and take a look. The game... it might have already begun."
  },
  AvgDialog_58290_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Excuse me..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_1 = {
    Text = "None survived"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_10 = {
    Text = [[
Ferland Manor
11:45 PM]]
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Alright, alright, whatever you say—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_101 = {
    Text = "Alright, Erica will entertain you next. I still have 1124 creatures waiting to sign demonic contracts with me."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_102 = {
    Text = "Remember..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_103 = {
    Text = "<Red:The bad guy is hiding among us. Trust no one.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_104 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_105 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_106 = {
    Text = "What are you looking at? I haven't even had a chance to do anything yet!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_107 = {
    Text = "Oh? Do tell, what did you originally plan to do?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_108 = {
    Text = "Excellent, everyone! Keep up the spirit of debate. Don't let my presence hold you back!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_109 = {
    Text = "Our first rule of conduct, chaos! Second rule, chaos! Third rule..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_11 = {
    Text = "The heavy wooden door is pushed open. Ryker enters the hall, arms spread wide, with an exaggerated sense of enthusiasm."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_110 = {
    Text = "Let me guess, chaos again?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_111 = {
    Text = "Wrong! It's <Red:Endless Chaos>!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_112 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_113 = {
    Text = "So, have fun everyone~"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_114 = {
    Text = "After speaking, N vanished into thick black mist, leaving everyone staring at each other in bewilderment."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_115 = {
    Text = "%player%, where did this annoying guy come from? It seems like you know Him well."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_116 = {
    Text = "You hesitated, wondering whether to tell Hannah everything you knew. But soon realized it was unnecessary."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_117 = {
    Text = "You know nothing about N either."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_118 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I don't know much about this person either. After changing their appearance, their personality became more..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_119 = {
    Text = "You wanted to say \"lively,\" but swallowed the word."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Dexter, my old pal! It's only been a few days, and you're already inviting us to your estate for a reunion?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_120 = {
    Text = "Even more annoying."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_121 = {
    Text = "If I'm not mistaken, we need to solve the puzzle to uncover <Yellow:the final truth>, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_122 = {
    Text = "Mm... That's correct."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_123 = {
    Text = "A minor issue. This person seems to have forgotten to mention the topic."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_124 = {
    Text = "Indeed, an endless state of chaos."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_125 = {
    Text = "You gazed at the completely destroyed bridge ahead. The pitch-black valley seemed like a bottomless abyss, completely cutting you off from the distant island."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_126 = {
    Text = "Mr. Dexter, are you sure this is the only path leading to the outside world?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_127 = {
    Text = "Dexter shrugs helplessly."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_128 = {
    Text = "I chose this place because it's remote, shielding me from many pointless social interactions and attention."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_129 = {
    Text = "Things took an unexpected turn."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Of course, I have to remind you that this method of invitation is somewhat extreme."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_130 = {
    Text = "The snow fell thick and fast, quickly covering the damaged wooden bridge."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_131 = {
    Text = "Achoo! Blizzards, isolated mountain villas, and people mysteriously gathering together..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_132 = {
    Text = "I have a bad feeling."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_14 = {
    Text = "<Small:Hey, what about the ambush!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I know what you're implying — it wasn't me."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Dexter sat at the end of the long table, ruffling his messy hair impatiently."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_17 = {
    Text = "<Gray:Ramona mentioned that Mr. Dexter becomes extremely irritable when his sleep is interrupted...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_18 = {
    Text = "I was sleeping soundly at home when suddenly a group of people knocked on the door, and all the servants vanished."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_19 = {
    Text = "I still don't understand what happened."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Ferland Manor
11:30 PM]]
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_20 = {
    Text = "A group of people...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_21 = {Text = "Snap!"},
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_22 = {
    Text = "A flash of white, and the room immediately returned to its original silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Mm, still can't capture anything. This place is truly strange..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Hannah?! What are you doing here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Hmph, the title of Vice President of the Deduction Society isn't just for show! I'm the best at finding paths."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Good evening, {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%, good evening, boss!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_27 = {Text = "Mm-hmm."},
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Boss...? I didn't expect that you two knew each other."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Mr. Ryker is a renowned detective in the East District. When we team up, criminals go out of their way to avoid us!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Yoho! Successful descent~"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Cough, cough. Curb your journalistic instincts; this isn't a news report."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Ryker shrugged helplessly at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I sometimes ask her to run errands for me, and in return, she's managed to extract quite a bit of information from me. It's a mutually beneficial arrangement."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Speaking of mutual benefit, didn't another person also have close ties with Mythag?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Following Ryker's gaze, you notice a richly dressed woman holding a wine glass, smiling at you from the shadows."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_35 = {
    Text = "We meet again, {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Lady Sorel?! You, how could you also..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Too bad, I had hoped we would meet again under more formal circumstances."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_38 = {
    Text = "But here, there's only a remote mansion and an empty wine glass. What should I do to pass the time?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Of course, fill the drinks and let's drink all night~!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Are you sure Dexter lives in this dump? Has he gone bankrupt?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_40 = {
    Text = "With a cheerful female voice, the glass of wine in Sorel's hand magically refilled."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Surprising, it tastes like Chardonnay... How is that possible?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Hehe, what's this? Look at this—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Casiah gently taps the rim of the wine glass with her cane, causing fresh red roses to bloom instantly, trembling in the light."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_44 = {
    Text = "She picked the most delicate and vibrant flower and gently tucked it behind Sorel's ear."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_45 = {
    Text = "The most radiant rose, for the fairest beauty of Londinium."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Wonderful, Miss Magician! Are you interested in a court position? I must recommend you to Her Majesty the Queen."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_47 = {
    Text = "If the price is right, everything can be arranged..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Hmm, isn't this our {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} Keeper and Mr. Detective?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Casiah looks surprised, as if she has just noticed you."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Sorry, this is the most inconspicuous of his more than fifty properties."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Since we parted in Aram, I have been thinking of you every day."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_51 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_52 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Wait! I didn't kill William. Casiah is just a poor worker. You wouldn't want to cause a massacre in this gentleman's house, would you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_54 = {
    Text = "No problem, I don't mind having a good chat outside."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Hiss... Let me make this clear: I know this terrain like the back of my hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_56 = {
    Text = "If you can't win, run..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Thud—Thud—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_58 = {
    Text = "A giant clock suddenly hung above everyone, its hands pointing to midnight."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Ladies and gentlemen, good evening! Welcome to my paradise!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Hmm... I just thought of a brilliant idea—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Aah! Why doesn't this child have a face?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_61 = {
    Text = "This familiar attire and feeling... Could it be..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Congratulations to everyone for using your intelligence and cooperative spirit to successfully overcome the first challenge I set."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_63 = {
    Text = "The warm-up is over; now let's move on to the main topic—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_64 = {Text = "Bang!"},
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_65 = {
    Text = "The bullet pierced the mysterious figure's face, leaving a large hole in the middle."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Sorry, the gun accidentally went off. Are you enjoying the game of playing house, N?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_67 = {
    Text = "So it's Him..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_68 = {
    Text = "The remaining black mist on N's face kept twisting and stretching, swiftly filling the void."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_69 = {
    Text = "How boring, you all recognized me so quickly."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Just to be clear, don't even think about taking advantage of Mr. Dexter. He has no interest in any form of gambling, speculative investments, or risky ventures."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Mr. Ryker was quite delighted during the assault under the moon. Do you like the role-playing game I tailored for you?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Hah... Rather ordinary. Is this your Domain?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Of course. If you want to get out, stay in this house and solve the puzzles I've set."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Hey, this is my house. Doesn't anyone care about my opinion?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Zzz... Zzz..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_75 = {Text = "Boom!!"},
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Perfect, my little assistant has sawed off the only bridge to the outside world."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Now you can't go anywhere!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_78 = {
    Text = "What?! Hurry up and go check it out—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_79 = {
    Text = "All around is silent. You stand at the edge of the broken bridge on the cliff, speechless."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The detective, rudely interrupted, reluctantly pulled his hand back and stubbornly nodded toward the mansion in the distance."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_80 = {
    Text = "At some point, heavy snow began to fall from the sky, swirling and drifting in the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_81 = {
    Text = "You clutched the dull silver key at your chest. Since stepping onto this land, your connection with it severed"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_82 = {
    Text = "It's useless. I've severed your connection to @2. Now, you possess no special abilities beyond those of ordinary people."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_83 = {
    Text = "So it was you all along..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, even if you pop your eyeballs out, it won't help."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_85 = {
    Text = "True heroes solve problems just like ordinary people—am I right, Erica?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_86 = {Text = "Erica...?"},
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Mechanical footsteps sound from the corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Erica wields a huge chainsaw, rapidly extending her arm. The connecting cord of her prosthetic limb stretches to an extreme distance, even sawing off the bridge ahead."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_89 = {Text = "...?"},
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Cough, cough... What are you thinking? I mean we should get inside and set up an ambush to gather intelligence..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_90 = {
    Text = "This guy's mechanical arm is really interesting. I need to find a way to get it..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Erica turned off the chainsaw, walked behind N, and even bowed respectfully."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_92 = {
    Text = "Reporting to the master, the only passage from Farland to the outside world has been damaged, taking a total of 5 minutes and 40 seconds and consuming electricity..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_93 = {
    Text = "You... What have you done to Miss Erica?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_94 = {
    Text = "N lightly jumped onto Erica's shoulder, casually crossing his legs."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_95 = {
    Text = "Don't worry, I just slightly influenced her thoughts with my charisma. Let me introduce you to my new assistant, Erica."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Erica, quickly say good evening to everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Good evening. For the time being, Erica will be responsible for supervising and taking care of everyone. Please follow me back to the mansion."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_98 = {
    Text = "Just a heads-up, if anyone dares to disobey my newly hired assistant..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58291_Content_99 = {
    Text = "N gently pressed the switch of the electric saw in Erica's hand, the deafening noise causing everyone to cover their ears immediately."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_1 = {
    Text = "First meeting"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_10 = {
    Text = "But, but I've been with Mr. Ryker all along, right, boss?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_11 = {
    Text = "No one responds to Hannah's somewhat guilty call."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_12 = {
    Text = "At the other end of the house, the detective and his temporary assistant began their on-site investigation."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Both shoes are missing. There are also two grooves on the neck, strange."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_14 = {
    Text = "You carefully examine the two ligature marks on Mr. Dexter's neck with a magnifying glass. They are nearly identical, with only slight variations in angle."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_15 = {
    Text = "The patterns of the two indentations are also inconsistent. Inside is a neat diamond structure, while the outside is rougher..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Perhaps the rope snapped midway, or it got bloody, so the killer replaced it."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Regardless, both marks on the neck ran past the jawline, extended behind the ears, and gradually disappeared toward the back of the head..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_18 = {
    Text = "These are ligature marks caused by hanging."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_19 = {
    Text = "No, that's incorrect... The scratch marks near the ligature suggest a violent struggle."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Ferland Manor Study
90 minutes remaining until the case concludes <Red:90>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Or maybe they started to regret it after hanging? I've heard of similar cases."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Without that vinyl record, nine out of ten cops would have closed the case as a suicide."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_22 = {
    Text = "And I am the last of the vigilant one-tenth!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Vinyl Record?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_24 = {
    Text = "{Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} Keeper was not at the scene then! There was a vinyl record constantly looping Mr. Dexter's voice, like a ghost..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Hannah suddenly interjects, vividly describing and unable to suppress a shudder."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Boss, we searched everywhere but couldn't find Lady Sorel. Could she already be..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Ryker waved confidently."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_28 = {
    Text = "You'll find out where she is soon. This case is almost identical to the first murder case I investigated."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_29 = {
    Text = "So this is the origin of the boss's so-called \"intuition\" from earlier..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_3 = {
    Text = "I was outside the house, wandering around, looking for a way to leave."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Cough, cough. Sorry about that. Quite true."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_31 = {
    Text = "The phonograph record, the desolate mansion, the mysterious man who hanged himself... Hannah remembered too!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_32 = {
    Text = "\"Mysterious Dog-Headed Man Unravels High Society Scandal.\" I can still remember that headline!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_33 = {
    Text = "A dog head? Did you make this up? Outside, I always present myself as a gentleman of grace."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_34 = {
    Text = "At the mention of Ryker's past, you immediately become interested and pull Hannah over."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_35 = {
    Text = "<Small:Come to think of it, I've always found his status as a detective rather suspicious.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_36 = {
    Text = "<Small:You need to understand that in Londinium, the reward for solving a case is far less than what you could earn in ten minutes at the gambling table.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_37 = {
    Text = "<Small:Perhaps the identity of a detective is just a cover...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Retract your personal attack on me, Keeper %player%. Gamblers can have their own hobbies and careers too."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Huh, why is there a coffin here? Dexter's taste is truly questionable."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_4 = {
    Text = "So you're saying there's no alibi. Noted... Did you manage to find the way, Miss Casiah?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_40 = {Text = "!!!"},
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Don't touch it!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Before he could finish his words, the detective casually kicked the coffin twice. The response was a deathly silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Strange... It doesn't respond to your touch?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Oh? Then tell me, what kind of reaction should it have?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_45 = {
    Text = "You told Ryker about everything you had encountered before."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_46 = {
    Text = "I see... I understand now!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_47 = {
    Text = "There must be a mysterious, supremely powerful mummy inside!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Ryker suddenly squatted down, speaking in a \"foreign language\" you completely didn't understand."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Mudchoke! Racoonmire @3!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Use your little brain, Detective. If I had found it, would I still be standing here?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_50 = {
    Text = "...What are you saying?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_51 = {
    Text = "It's the Lemouahe language. 'Waxylaik klu, nedkesanmin zy?'"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_52 = {
    Text = "The black coffin remained solemn and silent, unperturbed by the friendly yet somewhat perplexing greetings."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Alright, enough. I've heard the ancient speech of Aram, and it doesn't sound anything like yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Tsk, how boring. Let's get back to work."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Ryker stood up, stretched lazily, and snapped his fingers twice in the air."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Alright, everyone, I know who the killer is. To save time, I'll skip the deductions and take you straight to the culprit."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_57 = {Text = "...?"},
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Pfft. If any novelist tried to push the plot forward like Mr. Ryker does, they'd probably be strung up by angry readers on lamp posts already."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Not willing to share even the smallest hint?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Uh... That makes sense."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Ryker irritably scratched his head."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Vinyl Record. Its presence likely indicates that the murderer attempted to fabricate an alibi by postponing the time of the crime."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_62 = {
    Text = "In other words, while the vinyl record was playing the victim's voice, the culprit was actually at the crime scene."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_63 = {
    Text = "A clever ploy, but unfortunately, I didn't follow the path the killer had planned. Upon hearing the sound, instead of leaving, I kicked the door open."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_64 = {
    Text = "A competent detective dismantles the alibi; an exceptional detective nips the alibi in the bud!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Did you write down that profound saying, Hannah?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Uh? Understood, boss!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_67 = {
    Text = "But boss, you just said the culprit was at the crime scene... So..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_68 = {
    Text = "Ryker pulled out a handgun and walked forward in a leisurely manner."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Now, let us introduce the young lady killer who has not appeared since the incident and could only panic in the shadows."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_7 = {
    Text = "First Floor Kitchen. The host instructed to prepare food for everyone."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_70 = {
    Text = "The detective stops in front of the wardrobe and gives two light knocks on the door."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_71 = {
    Text = "Still planning to hide until the last moment? Then I'm done being polite—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_72 = {
    Text = "The detective, looking troubled, rubs his temple with the barrel of his gun before yanking open the wardrobe door."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_73 = {Text = "Sorel..."},
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_74 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Lady Sorel!!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_76 = {
    Text = "No lame excuses, no shameful hiding, no tearful confessions."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Only Sorel's body rested quietly in the corner, the bullet hole in her forehead glaringly obvious, as if mocking the detective's pretentiousness."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_78 = {
    Text = "No... This can't be..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_79 = {
    Text = "Clang clang clang!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_8 = {
    Text = "No one went to the kitchen during this time, which means Miss Erica also lacks an alibi..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_80 = {
    Text = "It sounds like someone made an incorrect deduction!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Framing an innocent human is an unforgivable sin; it's time for punishment!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_82 = {
    Text = "N was troubled, holding his round chin. When He thinks, the fog around His face slows down."
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Punishment, punishment... Who should I kill?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58292_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Sorry, Detective. From our perspective, you, the Keeper, and Mr. Ryker are all suspicious~"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Coffin wall"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_10 = {
    Text = "This should be our final meeting, yet your heart remains unruffled."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_11 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Karnak, my name is Karnak."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_13 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Mm... what a strange dream. Why am I in this corridor... Ever since I touched that coffin, my mind has been in disarray."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Thump, thump, thump."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_16 = {
    Text = "With a flurry of hurried footsteps, you collide with a dark shadow."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Ouch! Don't block the way... Hmm, it's actually {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} Keeper!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Phew... Glad you're alright. I thought..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Why are you two here? Has something happened?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_2 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Secretly, the hunting game has begun~"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_21 = {
    Text = "A slender body moved through the darkness; Casiah landed lightly before you as if by magic."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_22 = {
    Text = "I know where the gunshot came from. Want to go check it out with me? I'm a bit scared to go alone."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Where did you come from..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_24 = {
    Text = "Casiah was sleeping on the chandelier just now. As the saying goes, the higher you stand, the farther you see..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_25 = {
    Text = "I saw everything, you know~"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Casiah gives you a playful wink and laughs cheerfully."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_27 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_28 = {
    Text = "What are you all standing around for? Don't you want to be the first to witness the crime scene?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_29 = {
    Text = [[
Ferland Manor
Study on the First Floor]]
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Let's stop here. We'll part ways now. Are you still searching for the <Yellow:Wall of Truth>?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_30 = {
    Text = "You pushed the study door open."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Th-This is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Mr. Dexter?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_33 = {
    Text = "A man hangs from the rafters by a rope, like a leaf drifting in the wind. His face is shrouded in a bluish-green pallor, and his eyes are bulging out of their sockets."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Everyone, please remain calm to avoid contaminating the crime scene."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Crime... Scene?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Don't look, this guy's completely dead. Let me guess, is this the puzzle left for us?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_37 = {
    Text = "A kind of detective and reasoning game?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Bingo! That's correct~!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_39 = {
    Text = "So who, on such a snowy night, cruelly murdered a gentleman of such refinement?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_4 = {
    Text = "\"You\" nodded."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_40 = {
    Text = "Please try to uncover the truth, dear detectives."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_41 = {
    Text = "How strange, isn't it you who should be the prime suspect, dear Mr. N?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Cough, cough, allow me to be more precise—Find the killer pretending to be one of my clones!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Right among you!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_44 = {
    Text = "A deathly silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Fear and unease quietly spread among the crowd. Eyes subtly scanned others, silently pondering the truth in N's words."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_46 = {
    Text = "What if we refuse this game?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Do you know what is most important for a game designer like me, brimming with ideals and passion?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Of course, the players' engagement! If no one is interested, I'll have to regretfully announce the end of the game!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_49 = {
    Text = "No response. Everyone is waiting for the \"but\"—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Then I won't try to persuade you. To be honest, I've never been able to figure you out... You look young, but you seem like you've lived for thousands of years."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_50 = {Text = "But!"},
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Farewell forever, poor Mr. Dexter and Miss Elsa."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_52 = {
    Text = [[
Mythag Infirmary
Meanwhile...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_53 = {
    Text = "How's the situation?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_54 = {
    Text = "The situation is not optimistic. Elsa has severe intracranial bleeding, rising CSF pressure, and her body temperature remains above 100°F."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_55 = {
    Text = "The Keeper and Hanna have fallen into a delirious state. Although they remain in a constant sleep, their physical indicators are normal."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Understood. And... what about him?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_57 = {
    Text = "The girl did not mention a name, but everyone present knew who she was referring to."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Mr. Dexter... The preliminary diagnosis is that neural pressure caused reflex cardiac arrest, similar to mechanical asphyxia."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Cardiac arrest?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Anyway, thanks. I've found a way to break the seal. Next step: head to Rome and release the beast..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Winkle nods."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Rescue failed. Breathing stopped five minutes ago. Theoretically..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_62 = {Text = "He's dead."},
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_63 = {
    Text = [[
Ferland Manor
Study on the First Floor]]
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_64 = {
    Text = "In other words, if we don't follow your rules, people who die here won't wake up in the real world either?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_65 = {
    Text = "N nodded in satisfaction."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_66 = {
    Text = "As expected, you're the one who knows me best!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_67 = {
    Text = "...Heh, I'm not proud of it at all."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_68 = {
    Text = "What if this is just a bluff? How can you prove that you're not lying?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_69 = {
    Text = "Of course I can prove it—but I don't want to, hehe."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The wizard painstakingly packed his bags, and after taking a few steps, turned back."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Or you could take a risk and end the game immediately, returning to your cute little world where nothing has changed."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_71 = {
    Text = "The warmth of the bed remains constant, exams continue as usual, and everyone stays healthy and alive."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_72 = {
    Text = "N looked at Ryker, passionately opening his small arms."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Wanna bet? This is what you're best at."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I never gamble with other people's lives."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_75 = {
    Text = "The game has just begun. Ending it now would be far too dull!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_76 = {
    Text = "Casiah straightens up and swiftly raises her right hand."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Beep beep! I vote to keep playing~!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_78 = {
    Text = "After much discussion, for different reasons, everyone surprisingly reached a consensus."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_79 = {
    Text = "I'm truly moved! Thank you all for respecting my design unconditionally!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Hey, you still haven't told me your name."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Now, I hereby declare: <Red:The second trial officially begins!>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_81 = {
    Text = "All of you have a full two hours to solve the puzzle~"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Just two hours... that's not enough."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_83 = {
    Text = "Oh ho ho, while some were doubting the great Lord N, another ten seconds slipped by."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Well then, have fun everyone~"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_85 = {
    Text = "After speaking, N turned into black smoke and vanished without a sound."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_86 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Ryker pondered for a moment before suddenly pinching your cheek."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_88 = {
    Text = "Pain... Hey, what are you doing?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Relax. Let's verify if you're a fake."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_9 = {
    Text = "The wind carried waves of golden fine sand. The ragged wizard leaned against the blue sky, a rare kindness showing on his flushed face."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_90 = {
    Text = "Mm, a moderate level of caution is necessary. So—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_91 = {
    Text = "You grabbed a handful of Ryker's fluffy fur and pulled out a few strands."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_92 = {Text = "Hiss!!"},
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_93 = {
    Text = "Sniff... It smells authentic."
  },
  AvgDialog_58293_Content_94 = {
    Text = "\"You're welcome. They're all yours. Remember to wash them, air-dry them, and store them properly.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Beneath reality"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_10 = {
    Text = "He firmly stepped forward and walked up to N."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Wrong deduction? Impossible. You must have tampered with something."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Have you completely forgotten about the two different strangulation marks and the missing shoes?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I can list dozens of possibilities right now, but do they really matter? Or is it that they wouldn't have mattered, except under your arrangement—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_14 = {
    Text = "\"Original\"? That's strange. If my task is to uncover the truth of the <Red:Domain>, then the Domain is your only current reality and reference."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Why does someone always dwell on the so-called \"past\"?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_16 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Perhaps you once solved this case brilliantly, gaining a pitiful bit of vanity and presence, and have been reminiscing about it until now."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_18 = {
    Text = "But unfortunately, you've completely botched it here, Detective."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_19 = {
    Text = "N slowly raised his hand and lightly snapped his fingers."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Who should I kill..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_20 = {Text = "...Huh?"},
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The next moment, wisps of black mist suddenly streamed out from Casiah's body, who had been watching from the side."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_22 = {
    Text = "It's decided. The punishment begins with you."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Hey... wasn't that guy supposed to fail the deduction? Why is Casiah taking the fall for him!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_24 = {
    Text = "No... It's so painful..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_25 = {
    Text = "See? Every foolish decision you make comes at a cost to someone, just like in real life."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_26 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Sniff, sniff... I haven't had enough fun yet... Why should I care..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Casiah glares at Ryker and angrily hurls the cane."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_29 = {
    Text = "It's all your fault! So stupid — ow!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_3 = {
    Text = "<Shake:So, so sorry, Mr. N!> The deduction just now was nonsense from that guy. We all disagree!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Before she could finish her words, Casiah completely disappeared in front of you, as if erased from the blueprint with an eraser."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Miss Casiah!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_32 = {
    Text = "Sniff... She promised to teach me a few magic tricks..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Alright, everyone, you have one hour left. If there are no further questions, then—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_34 = {
    Text = "...and so on."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The detective pats you on the shoulder and then steps forward."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_36 = {
    Text = "%player%, you continue the investigation. I need to have a word with this guy."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_37 = {
    Text = "...Understood."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The gathered crowd dispersed once more as viscous darkness surged forth, swiftly consuming the entire domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Alright, now we can speak freely. What do you think of my new avatar?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_4 = {
    Text = "I wanted to refute him from the very beginning, but never got the chance..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_40 = {
    Text = "I'm more used to how you are now."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_41 = {
    Text = "What a pity. Lately, I've been reflecting on whether my appearance is too fearsome, causing everyone to be afraid of me."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Trust me, you'd be more popular if you gave up those dark and twisted games—no need for head-swapping."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_43 = {
    Text = "That won't do. Would you give up breathing?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_44 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Alright, let's get back on topic."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_46 = {
    Text = "You said earlier... everyone will pay for my poor judgment, just as it would happen in the real world."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Could you explain it for me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_48 = {
    Text = "N tilted His head, and the dark mist quickly enveloped Him."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_49 = {
    Text = "In the next second, He changed form again."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Miss Hannah, I assume you also disagree with Mr. Ryker's reasoning just now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Really want to know? Just don't come crying to me later. I hate human tears!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Ryker crossed his arms, staring at N with a blank expression."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Hmph, I can't refuse you. Where should I begin... Ah, do you remember that girl named Elsa?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_53 = {
    Text = "In the story, the brave detective showed the girl the way and then helped her fend off the Dissolution monsters."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_54 = {
    Text = "But in reality, the girl followed the detective's instructions, entered a dead-end alley, and was killed by the pursuing Dissolution monster."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_55 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Shh... Quiet, listen to me. In the story, a passing gambler solves a murder in a mysterious mansion and transforms into a great detective."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_57 = {
    Text = "But in reality, the gambler wronged an innocent person, allowing the real killer to go free."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_58 = {
    Text = "I can give countless examples like this. Detective, have you ever considered that your \"good luck\" is not the reason you've made it this far, but rather the result?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_59 = {Text = "Result...?"},
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Ah... I, I don't agree either! Only a lunatic could come up with something like this!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_60 = {
    Text = "An altered outcome. The god bestows luck upon mortals, with the price being that the rest must bear the suffering on his behalf."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_61 = {
    Text = "As I said before, the Domain is your reality."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_62 = {
    Text = "You mean everything I gained through luck and the people I helped in the past... was all fake?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Hey, why the teary-eyed look? Remember, living in falsehood can also be a kind of happiness."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_64 = {
    Text = "If you don't believe me, take a look at the true form of Aram, whom you once saved—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_65 = {
    Text = "Flames lick the sky, the sound of cries and the smell of burning flesh making you dizzy."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Crimson veins of coagulated blood sprouted from the base of the Mother Tree, joyfully stretching toward the horizon that seemed to have no end."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Piles of flesh and limbs are stacked high like giant shrines beneath a dim yellow sky, devouring even the sunlight."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_68 = {
    Text = "In the shrine's center, Ryker saw his own face. It was gray and dull, with sagging eyelids, looking extremely docile."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_69 = {
    Text = "If not for half its head being cut off, exposing a brainstem crawling with maggots, this would have been a flawless face of a saint."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_7 = {
    Text = "...Madness?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_70 = {
    Text = "<Red:The True Story>: You failed to stop Casiah, and you also failed to stop Herbert. You didn't even make it to Aram's camp."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_71 = {
    Text = "The truth is, you have achieved nothing. And because of that, Aram has ended up like this."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Is this the reality you desire, my dear Mr. Gambler?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_73 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_74 = {
    Text = "\"Reality\" ebbs away, leaving Ryker alone in the dark."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Hah. So you went through all this trouble to design a game just to remind me of my failures?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_76 = {
    Text = "There's no need for that. If there's one truth this world has taught me, it's these: I am worthless. I'm sorry. What a pity."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_77 = {
    Text = "Just a small warning. I don't want to see what happened during your time in Aram happen again."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_78 = {
    Text = "If you pull another pointless stunt that puts lives at risk, more people will vanish. Got it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_79 = {Text = "...Got it."},
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_8 = {Text = "Shut up."},
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_80 = {
    Text = "\"The detective lowered his head and replied lazily.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_81 = {
    Text = "As the curtain of darkness lifted, he returned to his familiar study."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_82 = {
    Text = "Phew... Finally awake! You suddenly stood there motionless, scaring us to death!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_83 = {
    Text = "What happened, Mr. Ryker? You look terrible."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Nothing. I need some time alone. I'll be back soon."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_85 = {
    Text = "\"The detective remained calm and even gave you a warm smile.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_86 = {
    Text = "He almost left without so much as a backward glance at you all."
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Mr. Ryker...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58294_Content_9 = {
    Text = "You stomp on the detective's foot, but the fiercely competitive detective ignores your aggressive hint."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Inverse deduction"
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_10 = {
    Text = "One knock for yes, two knocks for no. Can you do that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Through the thick sandalwood board, Ryker's voice carried an unusually gentle and unreal quality."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_12 = {
    Text = "You give a light knock."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Great! Actually, it's simple. I have only three questions."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_14 = {
    Text = "First question, are you trapped inside something?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_15 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Thud.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Second question, are you one of us? By \"us,\" I mean those who entered that guy's Domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_17 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Thud.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Great, my instincts never lie. The third question..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Are you %player%?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_2 = {
    Text = "The knocking continues."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_20 = {
    Text = "You strike the coffin hard, then hear a soft chuckle."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_21 = {
    Text = "It really is you. Don't be afraid; I'll solve all the puzzles and save you. Stay here and stay safe, got it?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_22 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:Thud.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_23 = {
    Text = "Very well, my friend. Farewell."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_24 = {
    Text = "The sound of rustling clothes and footsteps gradually fading away reaches my ears."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_25 = {
    Text = "You let out a deep sigh and close your eyes. However, not long after, the sound of footsteps returns."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_26 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I actually forgot the most important question. This is crucial for my next steps."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_27 = {
    Text = "You quietly wait for that \"important question.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Do you trust me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_29 = {
    Text = "<Gray:What kind of question is that...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Hey, friend in the coffin, are you alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_30 = {
    Text = "You smile and gently touch the smooth inner surface of the coffin."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_31 = {Text = "—Thud."},
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_32 = {
    Text = "I trust you."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_33 = {
    Text = "I see. Your intuition has always been sharp."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Unfortunately...{Male=he,Female=she} is trapped by the consciousness of <Yellow:that guy>, even if you uncover the final truth, it's of no avail."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The reality is, {Male=he,Female=she} will be forever trapped in the meticulously selected consciousness of the container."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_36 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_37 = {
    Text = "You said, \"Once all the truths are revealed...\""
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_38 = {
    Text = "The slowly flowing black mist on N's face curled up comfortably, as if relishing a rare delicacy."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Heh... it's my first time seeing that expression on you. Too bad, anger won't solve anything."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_4 = {
    Text = "A light and joyful voice comes, as if imbued with magical power, instantly stopping your tears."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_40 = {
    Text = "I only promised to dissolve the Domain, not that everyone would be safe."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Say goodbye to your little friend, Detective."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_42 = {
    Text = "N raised a finger, but the next moment—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_43 = {
    Text = "<Red:The nightmare has ended. Open your eyes.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_44 = {Text = "Rumble..."},
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_45 = {
    Text = "The floor beneath suddenly cracks open, and a black king snake surges from the bottomless abyss, swiftly piercing through N's body."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_46 = {Text = "...?"},
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_47 = {
    Text = "To clarify: 80% of my body is composed of mist, and the remaining 20% is also mist. These futile tricks—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_48 = {
    Text = "The silver glimmer suddenly lights up, like the spotlight signaling the start of a performance."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_49 = {
    Text = "A student with curly hair rubbed a stiff shoulder with one hand, holding a silver key in the other, emerging from the shadows."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Sorry if I was a bit rude to you earlier."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Phew... Finally made it."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_51 = {
    Text = "As expected from the person I trust! I knew you wouldn't be trapped so easily."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Hmm, naturally."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Thanks to the new friends I met in the coffin."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_54 = {Text = "Hiss..."},
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_55 = {Text = "Snake...?"},
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_56 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Long time no see, Apophis."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_6 = {
    Text = "But I have many questions now and want to ask you about them. Are you not available to talk right now?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_7 = {
    Text = "<Change>Yes!!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_8 = {
    Text = "You gather all your strength to speak, but the words turn into incoherent murmurs."
  },
  AvgDialog_58326_Content_9 = {
    Text = "That complicates things... Oh, can you still move your hand?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_1 = {Text = "Good luck!"},
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Dexter shrugs innocently."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_11 = {
    Text = "I would also like to know. Before interrogating me, please distinguish between reality and the Domain."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_12 = {
    Text = "After all, in reality, no criminal cases have ever occurred in my family, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_13 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Has anyone seen Ryker? Elsa just woke up and is asking for his autograph."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Never expected that Mr. Ryker would have admirers... Truly astonishing."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_16 = {
    Text = "After all, I was the one who saved her from that monster. If I really have to say..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Elsa chose to study in Mythag hoping that one day she could be like Mr. Ryker—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Become a gambling addict?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Go and help others."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Mythag Campus 
 One Week Later]]
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Mr. Ryker doesn't like staying at school. As for %player%... {Male=he,Female=she} left early in the morning, saying there was something urgent."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Besides... something feels off. Did N really create this Domain just to mess with Ryker?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Maybe, maybe not. This is as difficult as the double-slit experiment. We should focus on more practical issues."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_23 = {
    Text = "For instance, what should we do about Hanna's severe cold?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_24 = {
    Text = "In an endless pitch-black cave, countless eyes slowly open and close, like flickering ghost lights in the dark."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_25 = {
    Text = "A cold wind swept through, and a faint black mist writhed in the center of the cave, barely coalescing into an ethereal humanoid shape."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_26 = {
    Text = "<Change>Ugh... Master... injured..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Long time no see, my detestable yet beloved children. It has been centuries since my last visit."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Let me see if you've grown up... Oh, sorry. I forgot that only your eyes remain."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_29 = {
    Text = "<Change>Master... Love..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_3 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Alright, save the small talk for later. I've confirmed something interesting."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_31 = {
    Text = "That Keeper can actually resonate with Karnak's consciousness... interesting."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_32 = {
    Text = "<Change>Heehee... Lalala..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Enough... My projection is injured and needs a bit of healing."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_34 = {
    Text = "All of you, shut up."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_35 = {Text = "—!!"},
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_36 = {
    Text = "With a piercing wail, all the eyes were crushed, and blood began to drip onto the ground."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_37 = {
    Text = "The black fog rapidly expanded, greedily devouring the blood mist in the air. Gradually, the once-ethereal human form finally became substantial."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Terrible taste..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
Highgate Cemetery
East Londinium, Kent]]
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Are you feeling better? Ms. Sylvia mentioned that you have a poor appetite."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_40 = {
    Text = "See that? The first unlucky guy I sent to jail is buried here."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_41 = {
    Text = "You stood in front of a lonely tombstone in the corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Based on the deductions in the Domain, you likely sent the wrong person. After all, you still can't explain the two marks and the missing shoe."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_43 = {
    Text = "I don't think so. How do you know the rope wasn't hastily replaced because it was stained with the killer's blood?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_44 = {
    Text = "As for the missing shoes—it's odd, but going barefoot at home late at night doesn't seem strange."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_45 = {
    Text = "Moreover, what strength and precision are required to hang someone from a first-floor window? Remember, besides the victim, everyone else was a woman or child that night."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Mm-hmm, I can accept that reason."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_47 = {Text = "So—"},
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Ryker patted your head with a cheerful smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_49 = {
    Text = "The real world isn't a mystery novel, Keeper. No one would kill using such convoluted methods."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Being strangled and then resurrected doesn't feel good at all. I always feel like my throat is stuffed with stones now."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Tch. Not a mystery novel, is it your luck?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Perhaps. What a coincidence that I stumbled upon these clues. Did they just grow legs?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_52 = {
    Text = "People always marvel at a mathematician's genius when they solve a problem. But genius is simply being one step ahead of the average person."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Ryker laughed and made a victory gesture towards the unseen distance."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_54 = {
    Text = "I guess you're the same as me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_55 = {
    Text = "No one responds to the detective's naive move. A gentle breeze blows, rustling the leaves, and darkness gradually descends."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_56 = {
    Text = "Boring. It looks like it's about to rain. Let's go."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_57 = {
    Text = "You and Ryker walked through the graveyard, the crunch of fallen leaves underfoot. No one spoke."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Speaking of which... We've been through so much together. Isn't it about time you shared your past with me, like in the novels?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Like where you're from, and how you fell for gambling"
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Cough, cough..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_60 = {Text = "Hey..."},
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Unfortunately, my past, like that case, is rather unremarkable. Telling it might ruin the mystery I hold in your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Heh, your self-awareness is still such a mess. That's exactly why I've always been curious."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_63 = {
    Text = "Alright, if you insist, let's find a café to talk slowly..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Laughter gradually fades, and the graveyard returns to silence."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_65 = {
    Text = "A faint black mist drifts in the air, akin to ancient, unseen particles that have been concealed for millennia."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_66 = {
    Text = "The mist watched the detective and the Keeper leave, then happily expanded for a moment before reluctantly dispersing."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_67 = {
    Text = "As if it had never appeared."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Dexter coughs exaggeratedly after speaking."
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Seems like everything's fine. So, let's talk about the main issue: what's with the coffin at your place?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58327_Content_9 = {
    Text = "If I'm correct, it belongs to the last pharaoh of Remouahe — Kanak."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Next monday, sir"
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Because he's the famous \"Lucky Detective\" from the East Side."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_11 = {
    Text = "As long as he is on the case, clues seem to appear out of thin air, and the culprit cannot escape detection for more than three days!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Some say that following Mr. Ryker for just one day can lead to finding ten Leofangs. Anyway, he is everyone's lucky charm."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_13 = {
    Text = "But his luck doesn't hold up here..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_14 = {
    Text = "I heard this case is very similar to one handled by Mr. Ryker?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Yes. Although Mr. Ryker doesn't say it, he actually cares a lot about that case."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You should know he had another nickname: <Blue:Mr. Next Monday>."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Next Monday, sir...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Hannah clears her throat and begins speaking in an exaggerated tone."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_19 = {
    Text = "\"Ryker, when will you repay your gambling debts?\" \"Next Monday!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_2 = {
    Text = [[
Ferland Manor Outside
60 minutes remaining until the case concludes <Red:60>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_20 = {
    Text = "\"Ryker, when are you planning to get a job?\" \"Next Monday!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_21 = {
    Text = "\"Ryker, when are you going to die?\" \"Next Monday!\""
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Here, like this. Back then, everyone laughed at him; the kids made faces behind his back, and the bar owner picked up a chair when he saw him..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_23 = {
    Text = "In short, no one respects him."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_24 = {
    Text = "...Until he cracked that case."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Absolutely! Ever since then, his life seemed to be charmed. Good fortune always came his way, and everyone liked him more and more."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_26 = {
    Text = "How strange. Does such magic really exist in the world?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Who knows, in these times, nothing is surprising—Wait, what's that?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_28 = {
    Text = "In the corner near the wall, a black men's leather shoe was half buried in the soft white snow."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Wow, such exquisite carvings. Looks like something I could never afford..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_3 = {
    Text = "Achoo... Achoo!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_30 = {Text = "!!!"},
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_31 = {
    Text = "It's Mr. Dexter's leather shoe."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_32 = {
    Text = "You look up. The cold, gray walls stretch skyward, and the dim lights float like lighthouses."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_33 = {
    Text = "That's where Dexter's bedroom is."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You look down; the study is right in front of you. Through the carved window, Dexter's hanging shadow silently stares back at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The two rooms are aligned vertically."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Hannah... I suddenly have a guess."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_37 = {
    Text = "You thrust the shoes into Hannah's hands."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Let's go and check the study."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_39 = {
    Text = [[
Ferland Manor Study
30 minutes remaining until the case concludes <Red:30>]]
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Hannah holds a kerosene lamp, curling up into a small ball beside you."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_40 = {
    Text = "You grabbed the doorknob and pulled the door open."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_41 = {
    Text = "What's going on? Did the two of you go shopping outside?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_42 = {
    Text = "Mr. Ryker?! You are not..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Yes, I was deeply affected just now and had a good cry in the corner."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_44 = {
    Text = "You glance at his carefree stance and suddenly pat him on the shoulder."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_45 = {
    Text = "It's good to hear that you're fine."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Tsk. What kind of disgusting expression is that..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Alright, no time for mumbling! Mr. Ryker, we've just made a major discovery downstairs!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_48 = {
    Text = "You recounted your observations from downstairs to Ryker."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_49 = {Text = "...I see."},
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Damn, not a single footprint left! We came out too late."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Ryker approached the study window, where a faint shoeprint was faintly imprinted on the white frame."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_51 = {
    Text = "He leaned out and looked up."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_52 = {Text = "Hmm..."},
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_53 = {
    Text = "If I'm not mistaken, the other shoe is most likely in this room."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_54 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_55 = {
    Text = "But before that, there's one thing I want to confirm..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_56 = {
    Text = "The detective approaches Sorel's body and carefully examines the bullet wound on her forehead."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_57 = {
    Text = "The edges have thick smoke grime and burn marks — the killer shot her face-to-face from a close distance."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Hmm... What could this mean?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_59 = {
    Text = "The detective suddenly bursts into laughter. It's the first time since entering the mansion that he has laughed so heartily."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_6 = {
    Text = "The room has been thoroughly searched. We can only try our luck outside now."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_60 = {
    Text = "All explanations are complete. Let's proceed. It's time for a deduction show."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_7 = {
    Text = "Sigh... If only Mr. Ryker were here, he would know what to do."
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_8 = {
    Text = "\"He said he wanted to be alone for a while, and then disappeared.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_58328_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Speaking of which, I only knew Mr. Ryker as a gambler. I didn't expect that he would also do well as a detective..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_1 = {Text = "A truth"},
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_10 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_11 = {
    Text = "\"You were so eager to interrupt me before I revealed the truth about Sorel's death. Don't think that your appearance will make me let my guard down against you.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_12 = {
    Text = "<Red:Dear Mr. N?>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_13 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_14 = {
    Text = "The blood stopped flowing. It turned into a pitch-black mist, enveloping \"you.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Finally, the curly-haired student disappears, and the dark mist pours into N's body."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_16 = {
    Text = "You seem to be enjoying the performance, old friend."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Just a bit of inspiration I got from you. We're two of a kind."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Interesting... very interesting. How did you manage to figure it out?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Didn't you say from the start: \"Trust no one.\" I have many flaws, but my natural suspiciousness is not something I'll change in a lifetime."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_2 = {
    Text = "No... Why..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_20 = {
    Text = "The first suspicion arose when I saw Sorel's body. She was shot in the front and had no other wounds."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_21 = {
    Text = "The bullet wound on the forehead had heavy soot and gunpowder burn marks, indicating two things."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_22 = {
    Text = "First: The killer shot her from a very close range."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_23 = {
    Text = "What about the second point?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_24 = {
    Text = "It suggests that the perpetrator is someone the victim trusted and let their guard down around. The only person here who fits that description is %player%."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_25 = {
    Text = "You are in a rush to kill her because I have uncovered the secret of the vinyl record."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_26 = {
    Text = "And you don't want the game to end early, right?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_27 = {
    Text = "N shrugged nonchalantly."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_28 = {
    Text = "It's just some unfounded suspicion, yet you had the heart to shoot the Keeper? You truly are the gambler I chose."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_29 = {
    Text = "If I were that {Male=Mr.,Female=Miss} %player%, at this moment I would shed tears for your ruthlessness."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_3 = {
    Text = "You collapse to your knees. A faint pain radiates from your chest, dark red blood soaking through your uniform jacket."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Hehe, I would never joke about %hisorher% life. There's only one reason I dared to shoot you..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_31 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:I've long known where {Male=he,Female=she} is.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_32 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Just one hour ago."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_34 = {
    Text = [[
Farlander Estate Coffin
One hour ago]]
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_35 = {
    Text = "A primal and warm chaos."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_36 = {
    Text = "You close your eyes, sinking your consciousness to the lowest level."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_37 = {
    Text = "At last, \"you\" finally arrive at the foot of the high wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_38 = {
    Text = "This is the <Yellow:Wall of Truth>. Covered by the curtain before your eyes, only a corner is unveiled during a ceremony held once every few years."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_39 = {
    Text = "It seals away the past, records the present, and foretells the future."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_4 = {
    Text = "You fool... What are you talking about..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_40 = {
    Text = "The priest speaks and kneels before you reverently."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_41 = {
    Text = "Including your arrival, Karnak."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_42 = {
    Text = "It's raining."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_43 = {
    Text = "You kneel before the vast painting, groaning like a trapped beast finally finding release. Rainwater mingles with your tears, flowing down from your eyebrows and eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_44 = {
    Text = "After thousands of years, you have finally become the Pharaoh of Remouahe."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_45 = {
    Text = "You have met your destiny."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_46 = {Text = "Later..."},
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Move aside. I'm going to tear those damn curtains to shreds!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Noble Child of Amon, you should not be here. Anyone who defies the Wall of Truth will face the arrival of death upon their head."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_49 = {
    Text = "Heh. Plague, famine, and now Apophis's army is outside the city walls. Open your eyes and see the world, blind priest — Death has already arrived."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_5 = {
    Text = "Ryker examined the finely crafted handgun in his hand and then leisurely blew on the gun barrel."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_50 = {
    Text = "I devoutly followed the Wall's instructions, but brought calamity to the people who had lived by the riverside for generations. This is the consequence of blind obedience."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_51 = {
    Text = "Be patient, young master of Remouahe. What has been done pertains to the afterlife; what will be done pertains to eternity. The afterlife is but daylight, while eternity is night."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_52 = {
    Text = "The Wall of Truth brings both honey and papyrus, as well as venom and plague."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_53 = {
    Text = "Only by following its will can our souls safely cross the night river after death, becoming eternal on the distant shore—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_54 = {
    Text = "I don't care about the \"eternity\" spouted by you lying vampires. I only see my hard-won lands vanishing overnight, my people dying one by one."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_55 = {
    Text = "Even my most trusted subordinate, <Blue:Apophis>, turned his blade against me. He is outside now, waiting to take my head and hang it high on the wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_56 = {
    Text = "I have lost everything, Priest. If this is the arrangement of my pitiful fate by the Wall of Truth, I will keep my eyes wide open and watch it die."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_57 = {
    Text = "\"You\" shoved aside the elderly priest and tore down the veil."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_58 = {
    Text = "From this point onward, the truths of the world unfold before \"you.\""
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_59 = {
    Text = "One, two..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Seeing your disheveled state, he flashed a sinister smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Countless crude smiley face graffiti, painted in brick-red, with gaping mouths, mockingly laugh at \"your\" despair."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_61 = {
    Text = "I see, this is the so-called truth. Hehe...hahahaha..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_62 = {
    Text = "Absurdity. Contempt. This is the truth of the world."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_63 = {Text = "!!!"},
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_64 = {
    Text = "In the next second, the scroll painting vanished, and darkness returned once more."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_65 = {
    Text = "No desert, no priests, and no scrolls; you are alone in a dark coffin."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_66 = {
    Text = "Your thoughts are still trapped in the memories of Karnak; an endless wave of sorrow envelops you."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Tears could no longer be held back, like an endless curtain of rain."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_68 = {
    Text = "<Change>No... I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_69 = {
    Text = "<Change>I just want to stay alive..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The reason I didn't stop you from sending Hannah away was the fear that she couldn't handle the truth. After all, she's just an ordinary student."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_70 = {
    Text = "Thud. Thud thud."
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_71 = {
    Text = "A distant knocking disrupts the eternal rhythm of this sorrowful ocean. Then, you hear a familiar voice—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_72 = {
    Text = "Hey, friend in the coffin, are you alright?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_8 = {
    Text = "And you, my friend—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58329_Content_9 = {
    Text = "I knew you wouldn't be able to resist the urge to perform. Hey, is acting fun?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Tragedy show"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_10 = {
    Text = "I have a different opinion on this point, but let's skip it for now. What happened after Mr. Dexter left?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_100 = {
    Text = "Because you haven't identified the real killer of Lady Sorel. Your deductions deliberately avoid her death, don't they?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_101 = {
    Text = "What are you afraid of?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_102 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_103 = {
    Text = "It's regrettable that you've lost another friend. Perhaps the luck in this world is finite."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_104 = {
    Text = "You gained good fortune, your life improved significantly, but others suffered great misfortune because of it."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_105 = {
    Text = "Can you really accept the invisible laws hanging over people's heads?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_106 = {
    Text = "Heh... What a load of nonsense, it's just your personal little game."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_107 = {
    Text = "Your hostility toward me remains so genuine, adorable, and yet regrettable."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_108 = {
    Text = "Although you failed to solve all the puzzles, I have always been very forgiving..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_109 = {
    Text = "N raised a finger, sending thick black mist toward you, tightly binding you."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_11 = {Text = "...!!"},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_110 = {Text = "No... Ugh!"},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_111 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_112 = {
    Text = "Mr. N, I know my actions in Aram angered you, and I sincerely apologize."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_113 = {
    Text = "You can punish me however you want, but there's no need to go after {Male=him,Female=her}."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_114 = {
    Text = "Impatient detective, hear me out. I have one last question prepared for you."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_115 = {
    Text = "...Alright, I'm listening."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_116 = {
    Text = "A simple choice: <Red:Kill %player%, and I will revive all those who have died before.>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_117 = {
    Text = "Everything will return to normal, except for this unlucky guy next to you. No one else gets hurt."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_118 = {
    Text = "Or you could choose not to kill %player%, and both of you can leave the Domain safely."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_119 = {
    Text = "Was it really that simple?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Remember the ghost I saw at the stairway earlier? Floating in mid-air, the ghost, the hanging... Could it be..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_120 = {Text = "?!"},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_121 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_122 = {
    Text = "Do you still have your handgun with you? The countdown begins now. 10."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_123 = {
    Text = "No, you can't..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_124 = {Text = "9"},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_125 = {
    Text = "Ryker looked at you in a daze, like a child who had done something wrong."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_126 = {
    Text = "Don't worry about me, cough... Maybe they'll turn me into an Awakener if I die."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_127 = {
    Text = "You strain all your facial muscles to give Ryker a strained smile."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_128 = {
    Text = "... Bring it on."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_129 = {Text = "6"},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_13 = {
    Text = "Right. The truth is: someone distracted Mr. Dexter, then slipped a noose around his neck the moment he leaned out, and yanked it tight —"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_130 = {
    Text = "Ryker slowly walked towards you, his eyes calm and unruffled."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_131 = {
    Text = "As your vision gradually blurred, you gazed into his eyes, memories of moments spent together flashing through your mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_133 = {
    Text = "There are too many memories between the two of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_134 = {
    Text = "Unbeknownst to you, Ryker was already standing before you. You couldn't see his face, but you knew that his pain was no less than yours."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_135 = {
    Text = "The next moment, he raised the pistol."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_136 = {
    Text = "Know what... I never doubted you. So—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_137 = {
    Text = "The gunshot rings out, hitting right where your heart is, dead center."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_138 = {Text = "What...?"},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_139 = {
    Text = "Ryker stood over you, a mocking smile on his lips."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_14 = {
    Text = "Ryker raised his face, pointing towards the bedroom on the second floor."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_140 = {
    Text = "I've been waiting for this moment for a long time, Keeper."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_15 = {
    Text = "<Yellow:The killer was in Mr. Dexter's bedroom.> These two rooms are in a straight line."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Brilliant! This explains the ghost event and the footprints on the window frame—it's due to Mr. Dexter's struggle after being tied up."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_17 = {
    Text = "But it needs great arm strength and angle precision, and everyone here had their abilities sealed, how"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Hannah stops mid-sentence, a guess forming in her mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_19 = {
    Text = "But... after the ghost event, we quickly went upstairs to the bedroom. We heard no other sounds during that time. The murderer must still be in the bedroom"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Achoo... Achoo!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_20 = {
    Text = "Besides that phonograph, nothing else seemed unusual... ACHOO! ACHOO!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_21 = {
    Text = "Hannah wipes away two glistening strands of snot."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Father above, how can one catch a cold even in a Domain!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_23 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_24 = {
    Text = "We've already discussed the outside. Let's hurry inside..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Think carefully. What happened after we kicked the door open?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_26 = {
    Text = "What happened..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I'm not feeling well. Can I take a short break?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Sorry @2... Not feeling well... Resting..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_29 = {
    Text = "Rest rest@2 rest..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The cooling effect of this Domain is truly impressive. Boss, can't we reason around a fireplace indoors?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_30 = {
    Text = "Everyone, please leave as soon as possible and do not disturb Mr. Dexter's rest."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_31 = {
    Text = "<Shake:Whoa!! When did you...>"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_32 = {
    Text = "So it is..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Hannah suddenly lifts her head, staring directly at Erica behind the crowd."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_34 = {
    Text = "You weren't a late arrival. You were in the room all along... Perhaps hiding behind the door, drawing our attention while we were all focused on the record player."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_35 = {
    Text = "Rejected. Erica doesn't have the ability to be in two places at once, making it impossible to explain why the deceased appeared in the study."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_36 = {
    Text = "Yes, you lack the ability to be in two places at once. So, you have an assistant."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_37 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Strangling an adult male with a retractable mechanical arm in mid-air is child's play for Miss Erica."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_39 = {
    Text = "Just like you stretched out your arm to saw through the wooden bridge before."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Rest assured, it won't take up too much of everyone's time."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_40 = {
    Text = "After Mr. Dexter stops breathing, you toss him aside, and the helper who has been waiting will drag the body into the study."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_42 = {
    Text = "The accomplice must be the only person without an alibi from the gunshot to the crime..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_43 = {
    Text = "Ryker looks towards the wardrobe in the corner of the study as he speaks."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_44 = {
    Text = "Lady Sorel."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_45 = {
    Text = "I see. I thought Mr. Dexter was strangled in midair, but I never expected there to be an accomplice."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_46 = {
    Text = "Rejected. All the above deductions are speculative and lack concrete evidence."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_47 = {
    Text = "Want evidence? That's simple enough."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_48 = {
    Text = "Remember the patterns of the two strangulation marks on the neck?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_49 = {
    Text = "The patterns of the two indentations are also inconsistent. Inside is a neat diamond structure, while the outside is rougher..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_5 = {
    Text = "First, the shoes outside. Question: Under what circumstances would shoes end up outside?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_50 = {
    Text = "Perhaps the rope snapped midway, or it got bloody, so the killer replaced it."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_51 = {Text = "!!"},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_52 = {
    Text = "Neat rhombus shapes. Miss Erica, could you extend your mechanical arm to show us the retractable link rope inside?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_53 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_54 = {
    Text = "Snaring a wary grown man on the second floor by the neck with a rope is nearly impossible."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_55 = {
    Text = "But if the rope is part of your body, then everything makes sense."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_56 = {
    Text = "So it's you, Miss Erica..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_57 = {
    Text = "Erica slowly extends her right arm. Under the light, the connecting cord between her forearm and hand gleams chillingly"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_58 = {
    Text = "Those diamond-shaped patterns are neatly arranged, like fish scales in the Aequor."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_59 = {
    Text = "Just as I expected... exactly the same..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Mm... did the deceased go out and then encounter an accident?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_60 = {
    Text = "Erica does not respond. Black mist seeps out from her, revealing another familiar figure."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_61 = {
    Text = "Excellent reasoning!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_62 = {
    Text = "So this so-called Miss Erica is your double... which means in reality, Miss Erica is safe and sound!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_63 = {
    Text = "You guys wouldn't understand the fun of role-playing games, hehe."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_64 = {
    Text = "Is the reasoning you just presented your final answer?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_65 = {Text = "......Yes."},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_66 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_67 = {
    Text = "Heh... What a pity. Just one step away."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_68 = {
    Text = "This isn't the final truth, so—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_69 = {
    Text = "N snapped His fingers, and dark mist began to seep out from Hannah's body, filling the study."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_7 = {
    Text = "It is indeed a possibility. Upon comparison, we found that the pattern on the sole of this shoe perfectly matches the footprint left on the window frame."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_70 = {
    Text = "She grabbed Ryker's coat in a panic."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_71 = {
    Text = "How could it be? Miss Erica didn't deny it either?!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_72 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_73 = {
    Text = "Tsk, tsk, tsk, your Keeper buddy is too hasty, remember to speak before {Male=he,Female=she} next time~"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_74 = {
    Text = "Sorry, Hanna. I..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_75 = {
    Text = "Save me...! I haven't heard the final truth yet, don't..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_76 = {
    Text = "In the next second, Hannah also vanished from before your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_77 = {Text = "Hanna—!"},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_78 = {
    Text = "What have I done..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_79 = {
    Text = "No, it's all my fault... I was too impatient."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_8 = {
    Text = "Would Noble Dexter, who always values etiquette, climb out of his house through a window, especially when the door lock is in perfect condition?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_80 = {
    Text = "Mm, now there are only the three of us left. As for the others, they must be suffering in the real world."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_81 = {
    Text = "Hehehe, interesting, very interesting!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_82 = {
    Text = [[
Mythag Infirmary
Meanwhile...]]
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_83 = {
    Text = "How's the situation?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_84 = {
    Text = "Miss Hannah and the Keeper are also deteriorating. Miss Hannah's internal organs have ruptured in multiple places for unknown reasons, showing signs of bleeding."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_85 = {
    Text = "The Keeper is experiencing severe asphyxiation symptoms. If we keep delaying..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_86 = {
    Text = "We've interviewed many students, and our tech team has inspected all the facilities but found no abnormalities."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_87 = {
    Text = "Making such a racket right under everyone's noses..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_88 = {Text = "...N."},
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_89 = {
    Text = "Alistair and I are in agreement. If it's Him, everything makes sense."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Did he see something outside the window and rush out?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_90 = {
    Text = "What should we do? We don't have any countermeasures..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_91 = {
    Text = "Doll touched the round head in her hand and let out a soft sigh."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_92 = {
    Text = "One thing is certain: It still doesn't seem eager to take the Keeper's life."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_93 = {
    Text = "As for the rest... I suggest you pray with me."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_94 = {
    Text = "Alright, now that the bystanders are gone, we can be honest."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_95 = {
    Text = "A chilling mist surged from N's body, layering over His face until His original appearance was completely obscured."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_96 = {
    Text = "Not only that, but the room you are in suddenly vanishes, replaced by the familiar opera house."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_97 = {
    Text = "Sorry, I'm not a fan of tight spaces."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_98 = {
    Text = "Long time no see, my old friends."
  },
  AvgDialog_58330_Content_99 = {
    Text = "What did you mean earlier? This isn't the ultimate truth...?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Now, Apophis!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ryker walked step by step towards N."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Looks like luck finally favored me."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Be careful, Detective. For an incorrigible gambler, the scariest thing in a gamble isn't losing, but winning."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_13 = {
    Text = "If you don't believe me, you might as well ask the master of this black snake."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_14 = {
    Text = "It seems you still don't know me well, but you're right about one thing."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_15 = {
    Text = "Ryker raised his gun, aiming at N's foggy face."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_16 = {
    Text = "I'm indeed a hopeless gambler. Regardless of luck, even knowing I'll lose everything, I'll still go all in."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Only those blessed by fate dare to take risks; they are ordinary people, not gamblers. When you chose me back then, wasn't it because you saw this in me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_18 = {
    Text = "Hah... Hahaha... You truly are a madman. Succumbing to your primal desires, how foolish and naive, Mr. Gambler."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Likewise. My biggest advantage over other gamblers is —"
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_2 = {
    Text = "At your command, the dark king snake darted out swiftly, piercing through N's body and coiling around it tightly."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_21 = {
    Text = "I accept my loss with honor."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_22 = {
    Text = "The trigger is gently squeezed."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_23 = {
    Text = "A gunshot rang out, and N's head gently tilted to the side."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_24 = {
    Text = "You're really in a hurry, aren't you? I was already planning to send you off."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Before I leave, let me tell you a secret—"
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_26 = {
    Text = "In fact, I never rewrote your fate. Cheating in such an interesting game wouldn't bring any joy."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_27 = {
    Text = "Farewell, Detective."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_3 = {
    Text = "The black fog emanating from the King Serpent merges with N's own black fog, gradually granting Him a physical form."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_4 = {
    Text = "Long time no see, Kanak's little pet. Is your master still upset?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_5 = {
    Text = "The master harbors no hatred toward you. His actions were sanctioned by you. We are merely following the script faithfully."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_6 = {
    Text = "Is that so... interesting. Even I didn't realize that."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_7 = {
    Text = "The king snake's slender tongue flicked, delivering its low and soothing voice to your ears."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_8 = {
    Text = "I can only trap His projection in the Domain for a while. Once the projection retreats, the Domain will be dissolved."
  },
  AvgDialog_58331_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Next... it's up to you."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Final salute"
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Like tears."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_11 = {
    Text = "What happened later? After you saw... the so-called truth."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Later... I suppressed the rebellion and transformed Apophis into a snake, coiled at my feet for eternity."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_13 = {
    Text = "I ordered the Wall of Truth to be completely sealed, and then began my own reign."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_14 = {
    Text = "No ideology, no system, no parliament... I simply draw up a list of names, exile them one by one, and confiscate their assets."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_15 = {
    Text = "I awarded medals to citizens who visited the casino more than 50 times and ordered the construction of a perpetually unfinished glass pyramid in the capital..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_16 = {
    Text = "Mocked by fate, you chose to become a tyrant. Later, were you overthrown?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_17 = {
    Text = "Quite the opposite, my nation is thriving. Do you know why?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_18 = {
    Text = "You shook your head. The black mist chuckled in delight."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_19 = {
    Text = "Even the smallest war waged by a rational tyrant costs a thousand times more than the price paid by the people for my whims."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_2 = {
    Text = "Previously..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_20 = {Text = "..."},
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_21 = {
    Text = "But you are not happy, and your people will not be satisfied with such capricious actions. What is the point?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_22 = {
    Text = "Meaning? Pursuing so-called happiness and purpose is falling into that adult's trap. I am neither happy nor sad."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_23 = {
    Text = "I'm merely faithfully playing the role that Fate requires me to play."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_24 = {Text = "It...?"},
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_25 = {
    Text = "Staring at the malicious yet somehow familiar graffiti, you suddenly understood everything."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_26 = {
    Text = "So it's you, N..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_27 = {
    Text = "So you've become a sacrifice at that person's whim. Now we're both stuck here, unable to do anything..."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_28 = {
    Text = "Did you hear that? The sound of the gunshot—your friend hasn't given up yet."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_29 = {
    Text = "While reading my memories, I also read yours. To Him, you and that detective... are different."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_3 = {Text = "Bang—!"},
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_30 = {
    Text = "So I don't mind giving Him a surprise."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_31 = {
    Text = "Dark mist swirled around Karnak, gradually coalescing into a pitch-black king cobra."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_32 = {
    Text = "You had better not be disturbing my sleep out of boredom, my old friend."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_33 = {
    Text = "Long time no see, Apophis. This is a new friend of mine, {Male=he,Female=she} needs your help."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_34 = {
    Text = "Apophis stands gracefully, neck drooping softly, emerald-colored vertical pupils quietly gazing at you."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_35 = {
    Text = "The secret to eternal life lies in forgetting. My master has forgotten you once again, just as he forgot his past in Taranto."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_36 = {
    Text = "But I know your spirit, the pale Blind Eye."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_37 = {
    Text = "Have you... met me?"
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_38 = {
    Text = "Take %player% away from here, Apophis."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_39 = {
    Text = "The black snake gently entwines your body, as mist flows into your body."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_4 = {
    Text = "The sound of gunfire seems to come from afar."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_40 = {
    Text = "You closed your eyes. Your empty body was filled with unspoken consciousness, and the glimmer of the silver key shone once again."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_41 = {
    Text = "In the next second, the coffin had already vanished, and you found yourself in the corner of the theater, facing Ryker and N at the center of the stage."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_42 = {
    Text = "A gentle and rational whisper echoes deep in my mind."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_43 = {
    Text = "I have followed my Lord's orders and brought you here."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_44 = {
    Text = "The nightmare has ended. Open your eyes."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_5 = {
    Text = "You open your eyes to see the same wall covered in distorted characters."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_6 = {
    Text = "It had started raining at some point."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_7 = {
    Text = "A black mist hovers beside you. You can't see its outline, yet you feel a strange sense of familiarity—it's Kanak."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_8 = {
    Text = "The rain continued to fall, with silence flowing between the two of you."
  },
  AvgDialog_58332_Content_9 = {
    Text = "Strange. It was raining both the first and last time I saw this wall."
  },
  AvgDialog_58879_Content_1 = {
    Text = "Now, Apophis!"
  },
  AvgDialog_58879_Content_10 = {
    Text = "Ryker walked step by step towards N."
  },
  AvgDialog_58879_Content_11 = {
    Text = "Looks like luck finally favored me."
  },
  AvgDialog_58879_Content_12 = {
    Text = "Be careful, Detective. For an incorrigible gambler, the scariest thing in a gamble isn't losing, but winning."
  },
  AvgDialog_58879_Content_13 = {
    Text = "If you don't believe me, you might as well ask the master of this black snake."
  },
  AvgDialog_58879_Content_14 = {
    Text = "It seems you still don't know me well, but you're right about one thing."
  },
